   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_26_7_10","title":"The Crystal Caves of Cindermyst","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Underground Worlds","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Lucy, Ben, and Mia were the best of friends. They loved adventures and exploring. One sunny afternoon, they wandered into the Whispering Woods. The trees whispered secrets as the wind blew.  \n\n\"Look at that!\" Lucy pointed to a shimmering light.  \n\n\"What is it?\" Ben asked, his eyes wide.  \n\nMia squinted. \"I think it\u2019s coming from behind those bushes!\"  \n\nThey tiptoed closer. Suddenly, the bushes parted, revealing a hidden entrance! The entrance was small and dark. Lucy\u2019s heart raced with excitement. \"Let\u2019s go inside!\"  \n\n\"Wait,\" Ben said, his voice shaky. \"What if it\u2019s dangerous?\"  \n\nLucy smiled. \"We\u2019re brave! We can do this together.\"  \n\nMia nodded. \"Plus, think of the treasures we might find!\"  \n\nWith a deep breath, they crawled through the entrance. As they stepped inside, they gasped. The walls sparkled with crystals of every color! Reds, blues, and greens danced in the light. It was like stepping into a dream.  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]  \n\n\"Wow!\" Mia exclaimed, her eyes shining. \"This is incredible!\"  \n\n\"Look at those markings!\" Ben pointed to ancient symbols on the walls. \"I wonder what they mean.\"  \n\nLucy waved her hand. \"Let\u2019s explore! We have to find out!\"  \n\nThey wandered deeper into the caves, admiring the beauty around them. Suddenly, they heard a rumble. Lucy stopped. \"Did you hear that?\"  \n\nBen nodded, looking worried. \"It sounded like it came from over there.\"  \n\nThey crept towards the sound. As they turned the corner, they found a large chamber filled with glittering crystals. But in the center stood a creature! It had shimmering scales and big, sad eyes.  \n\n\"Who dares to enter my home?\" it growled softly.  \n\nLucy stepped forward. \"We\u2019re just exploring! We didn\u2019t mean to disturb you.\"  \n\nThe creature\u2019s eyes softened. \"I am the Guardian of the Caves. I protect these treasures.\"  \n\nMia gasped. \"You must be so lonely!\"  \n\nThe Guardian sighed. \"I am, but I have a duty.\"  \n\nLucy frowned. \"What if we helped you?\"  \n\nThe Guardian looked surprised. \"Help me? Why would you do that?\"  \n\n\"Because treasures shouldn\u2019t be hidden away!\" Ben said. \"And maybe we can help protect them.\"  \n\nThe Guardian smiled gently. \"Then together we can face the danger that comes.\"  \n\nLucy nodded eagerly. \"What\u2019s the danger?\"  \n\nThe Guardian\u2019s expression grew serious. \"A group of thieves is coming. They want to steal the crystals.\"  \n\nMia swallowed hard. \"We can\u2019t let that happen!\"  \n\nLucy looked at her friends. \"Let\u2019s team up with the Guardian. We can save the Crystal Caves!\"  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]  \n\nThey all nodded in agreement. Adventure was calling, and they were ready to answer!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Lucy, Ben, and Mia find in the Whispering Woods?","options":["A hidden entrance","A treasure map","A giant tree","A noisy animal"],"correct_answer":"A hidden entrance"},{"question":"What is the Guardian's role in the caves?","options":["To sing songs","To protect the treasures","To scare people away","To collect crystals"],"correct_answer":"To protect the treasures"},{"question":"What do the friends want to do to help the Guardian?","options":["Steal the crystals","Help protect the caves","Leave the caves","Make a map"],"correct_answer":"Help protect the caves"},{"question":"How did the Guardian feel about being alone?","options":["Happy","Angry","Lonely","Excited"],"correct_answer":"Lonely"},{"question":"What sound did the friends hear in the caves?","options":["A growl","A rumble","A whistle","A laugh"],"correct_answer":"A rumble"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_26_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_26_ch1_img1.png","plot_26_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":434,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
