   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_26_7_10","title":"The Crystal Caves of Cindermyst","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Underground Worlds","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"The cave was alive with wonders. Lucy, Ben, and Mia walked deeper into the Crystal Caves. The walls sparkled like stars in the sky. \"Look at all these colors!\" Mia exclaimed. She pointed at a huge, shimmering blue crystal. \"It\u2019s like a giant sapphire!\"  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]  \n\n\"But we need to focus,\" Ben said. His brow furrowed with worry. \"What if those thieves come back?\"  \n\nLucy nodded. \"We need a plan. The Guardian said they might return soon!\"  \n\nAs they discussed their plan, a loud rumble echoed through the tunnels. \"What was that?\" Ben gasped. The ground shook a little.  \n\n\"Maybe it\u2019s the thieves!\" Mia said, her voice trembling. \"Or something worse!\"  \n\nLucy took a deep breath. \"Let\u2019s find the Guardian. They will know what to do.\"  \n\nThey ran down the winding path, their hearts racing. The crystals sparkled around them, but they felt more like a maze now.  \n\nSuddenly, they saw a shadow moving. \"Over there!\" Lucy whispered, pointing at a dark corner of the cave.  \n\nThe Guardian stepped into the light. Its golden eyes glimmered like the crystals. \"I heard the rumble too,\" it said softly. \"It is not the thieves... It is the caves themselves!\"  \n\n\"The caves?\" Ben asked, his eyes wide. \"What do you mean?\"  \n\n\"The crystals hold ancient magic,\" the Guardian explained. \"When they tremble, it warns us. We must hurry to protect them!\"  \n\nMia felt a rush of inspiration. \"Maybe we can use the magic to help us!\"  \n\n\"But how?\" Lucy asked, looking at the Guardian.  \n\n\"Trust in the crystals,\" it said. \"They will guide our way.\"  \n\nAs they moved deeper, they came upon a hidden chamber filled with glowing crystals. Each one pulsed softly, like a heartbeat. \"This is amazing!\" Mia shouted, her eyes sparkling.  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]  \n\nLucy smiled. \"We need to remember this place. It feels powerful.\" Just then, a loud crash echoed again. \"They\u2019re coming!\" Ben cried.  \n\nLucy turned to the Guardian. \"What do we do now?\"  \n\n\"The crystals need our help. We must protect them together!\" the Guardian said.  \n\nWith their hearts racing, the friends nodded. They were ready to face whatever challenge lay ahead.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did the friends find deeper in the caves?","options":["A treasure map","Glowing crystals","A sleeping dragon","A hidden door"],"correct_answer":"Glowing crystals"},{"question":"What is the Guardian's main role?","options":["To steal the crystals","To protect the treasures","To explore the caves","To scare the friends"],"correct_answer":"To protect the treasures"},{"question":"What warning do the caves give?","options":["A loud rumble","A bright light","A strange sound","A sudden wind"],"correct_answer":"A loud rumble"},{"question":"How do the friends feel about their discovery?","options":["Bored","Scared","Excited","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"},{"question":"What do the friends decide to do when they hear the crash?","options":["Run away","Hide","Protect the crystals","Leave the cave"],"correct_answer":"Protect the crystals"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_26_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_26_ch2_img1.png","plot_26_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":358,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
