   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_26_7_10","title":"The Crystal Caves of Cindermyst","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Underground Worlds","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Lucy, Ben, and Mia stood in the heart of the Crystal Caves. The walls sparkled with gems, glowing in all colors. \u201cWow!\u201d gasped Mia, her eyes wide. \u201cLook at all these crystals!\u201d\n\n\u201cWe should be careful,\u201d Ben warned, scratching his head. \u201cWhat if the thieves come here?\u201d\n\nLucy nodded but felt a thrill. \u201cWe must protect this place! The Guardian needs our help.\u201d\n\nSuddenly, they heard a noise. It was a rustling sound, echoing through the tunnels. The friends exchanged worried glances. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d whispered Mia.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but it came from that tunnel,\u201d Ben said, pointing. The tunnel was dark and narrow. Lucy took a deep breath. \u201cLet\u2019s go see!\u201d\n\nAs they crept forward, the sound grew louder. Then they stumbled upon a hidden chamber. Inside, the Guardian was pacing back and forth, looking worried.\n\n\u201cGuardian!\u201d Lucy called. \u201cWhat\u2019s wrong?\u201d\n\nThe Guardian turned to them with wide eyes. \u201cThe thieves are getting closer! I fear they will take the crystals!\u201d\n\nThe friends gasped. \u201cWhat can we do?\u201d Mia asked, her voice trembling.\n\n\u201cYou must help me gather the crystals and hide them,\u201d the Guardian said urgently. \u201cWe must protect this magic from falling into the wrong hands!\u201d\n\n\u201cBut what if we want to keep a few for ourselves?\u201d Ben asked, looking unsure.\n\n\u201cNo!\u201d the Guardian said firmly. \u201cThese crystals belong to the cave. They have power beyond your dreams!\u201d\n\nLucy stepped forward. \u201cWe should listen to the Guardian. We can\u2019t let the thieves win!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, they heard footsteps approaching. \u201cThey\u2019re here!\u201d Ben cried. \u201cWhat do we do?\u201d\n\n\u201cHide!\u201d shouted Lucy. They ducked behind a big, shimmering rock. The guardians of the cave\u2019s secret was strong, but now it was up to them to protect it.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe footsteps grew louder, and the friends held their breath. They peeked around the rock. A group of shadowy figures entered the chamber. They were the thieves!\n\n\u201cWe\u2019re going to take all these crystals!\u201d one thief said, grinning. \u201cAnd no one can stop us!\u201d\n\nLucy\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWe can\u2019t let them take the crystals!\u201d she whispered. \u201cBut how?\u201d\n\nMia thought quickly. \u201cI can create a distraction! If I draw their attention, you and the Guardian can hide the crystals!\u201d\n\n\u201cGreat idea!\u201d Lucy exclaimed. She felt the rush of adventure. \u201cLet\u2019s do it!\u201d\n\nMia quickly grabbed her sketchbook. She began to draw a giant crystal dragon on the cave wall. It looked magical and fierce! \u201cHey, over here!\u201d she called to the thieves, waving her arms.\n\n\u201cLook at that!\u201d one thief yelled. \u201cA dragon!\u201d\n\nAs the thieves turned to look, Lucy and the Guardian began to gather the crystals, but time was running out. Would they finish before the thieves turned back?\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cFaster!\u201d Ben urged. They stuffed crystals into their bags, but the thieves were turning back. The tension in the cave was thick. Would they get caught?\n\n\u201cQuick! We need to decide!\u201d Lucy shouted. \u201cWe can either hide the crystals or confront the thieves!\u201d\n\nThey had to make a choice. What would they do?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do the friends find in the Crystal Caves?","options":["A hidden treasure","A scary monster","Sparkling crystals","A magic portal"],"correct_answer":"Sparkling crystals"},{"question":"What is the Guardian worried about?","options":["The crystals are disappearing","The thieves are coming","The cave is collapsing","The friends are lost"],"correct_answer":"The thieves are coming"},{"question":"What does Mia draw to distract the thieves?","options":["A giant crystal","A crystal dragon","A secret map","A treasure chest"],"correct_answer":"A crystal dragon"},{"question":"What do Lucy and the Guardian decide to do?","options":["Confront the thieves","Run away","Hide the crystals","Take the crystals for themselves"],"correct_answer":"Hide the crystals"},{"question":"What do the friends hear that makes them worried?","options":["A loud explosion","Footsteps approaching","A magical song","A growling creature"],"correct_answer":"Footsteps approaching"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_26_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_26_ch3_img1.png","plot_26_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":516,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
