   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_26_7_10","title":"The Crystal Caves of Cindermyst","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Underground Worlds","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Lucy, Ben, and Mia stood in awe. The Crystal Caves sparkled like a thousand stars. Each gem shimmered in the dim light, casting colorful shadows on the walls.\n\n\u201cWow! Look at that one!\u201d Mia pointed to a crystal that sparkled like a rainbow. \n\n\u201cCan you believe this place?\u201d Ben said, his eyes wide. \u201cWe need to help the Guardian!\u201d\n\nLucy nodded. \u201cBut how? The thieves are still out there.\u201d The air felt heavy with worry.\n\nSuddenly, they heard a rumble. \u201cListen!\u201d Ben whispered. The sound echoed through the cave. \u201cIt\u2019s coming from the treasure chamber!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Lucy urged. They hurried deeper into the cave, careful not to make noise. \n\nAs they approached the chamber, they noticed strange markings on the walls. Mia traced a finger along one. \u201cThese look like stories. Maybe they tell us how to protect the Guardian!\u201d\n\n\u201cOr how to find the treasure!\u201d Ben said with a grin.\n\nLucy smiled. \u201cLet\u2019s read them!\u201d They gathered around, excited to discover what the markings could reveal about the Guardian and the treasures.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe markings glowed softly as they touched them. Lucy read aloud, \u201cThe Guardian loves the light. It will show you the way when you are bright.\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat does that mean?\u201d Mia asked.\n\n\u201cMaybe we need to be brave and smart!\u201d Lucy suggested. \u201cWe can shine a light on the thieves\u2019 plan!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, the ground shook again. A loud crash echoed from the chamber! \n\n\u201cRun!\u201d shouted Ben. They dashed toward the sound. As they reached the chamber, they saw a group of thieves. But the Guardian stood tall, ready to protect its home.\n\n\u201cStop!\u201d Lucy yelled. \u201cYou can\u2019t take these crystals!\u201d\n\nThe thieves turned, shocked. \u201cWhat do you kids want?\u201d one sneered.\n\n\u201cWe want to help!\u201d Mia said. \u201cYou can\u2019t steal from the Guardian!\u201d\n\n\u201cYeah!\u201d Ben added, standing bravely beside Mia. \u201cThese crystals belong here!\u201d\n\nThe thieves laughed. \u201cYou kids think you can stop us?\u201d\n\nLucy took a deep breath. \u201cTogether, we can!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith one courageous move, they stepped forward. The Guardian glowed brightly, filling the cave with light. The thieves squinted as the glow blinded them.\n\n\u201cWhat is happening?\u201d one thief cried.\n\n\u201cThis cave is protected!\u201d Lucy shouted, her voice strong. \u201cAnd we\u2019re its friends!\u201d\n\nThe thieves hesitated. Their plan was crumbling. \n\nWith hope in their hearts, Lucy, Ben, and Mia stood together with the Guardian, ready to face whatever came next.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Lucy, Ben, and Mia want to do in the Crystal Caves?","options":["Steal the crystals","Help the Guardian","Find treasure","Play games"],"correct_answer":"Help the Guardian"},{"question":"What do the strange markings on the walls tell them?","options":["How to leave the cave","How to protect the Guardian","How to steal the crystals","How to find treasure"],"correct_answer":"How to protect the Guardian"},{"question":"What do the friends hear that makes them hurry?","options":["A song","A rumble","A laugh","A whisper"],"correct_answer":"A rumble"},{"question":"How does the Guardian help the friends?","options":["By showing them the way","By telling them to leave","By stealing crystals","By scaring the thieves away"],"correct_answer":"By showing them the way"},{"question":"What do the friends do when they see the thieves?","options":["Run away","Stand together","Call for help","Ignore them"],"correct_answer":"Stand together"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_26_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_26_ch4_img1.png","plot_26_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":406,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
