   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_26_7_10","title":"The Crystal Caves of Cindermyst","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Underground Worlds","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Lucy, Ben, and Mia stepped deeper into the Crystal Caves. The walls sparkled with colors like a rainbow. Lucy pointed excitedly. \u201cLook at all the ancient markings! They must tell stories about the Guardian!\u201d\n\n\u201cWow!\u201d Ben exclaimed. \u201cThey\u2019re so bright! What do they mean?\u201d\n\nMia pulled out her sketchbook. \u201cI want to draw them! They might help us understand.\u201d\n\nAs they explored, they found a large chamber filled with crystals shaped like stars. The bright light bounced around, making it hard to see. \u201cThis place is amazing!\u201d Lucy said, her eyes shining with wonder.\n\nSuddenly, Mia gasped. \u201cLook! There\u2019s something written on the wall!\u201d She pointed to a symbol that looked like a heart.\n\n\u201cWhat does it say?\u201d Ben asked, stepping closer.\n\n\u201cI think it says, \u2018Only those with good hearts may enter,\u2019\u201d Mia said thoughtfully. \u201cMaybe it means we have to be brave and kind to help the Guardian.\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s keep going,\u201d Lucy urged. \u201cWe need to protect the cave!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe friends carefully walked through the chamber. They heard a noise\u2014a rustling sound. It echoed in the cave, making their hearts race. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Ben whispered.\n\n\u201cMaybe it\u2019s the Guardian!\u201d Mia suggested. \u201cWe need to find out!\u201d\n\nAs they moved forward, they saw shadows. Lucy held her breath. \u201cStay close, everyone!\u201d she said.\n\nBut then, they spotted the thieves sneaking through a narrow tunnel. \u201cThey\u2019re here!\u201d Lucy shouted. \u201cWe have to warn the Guardian!\u201d\n\nThe friends rushed back, determined to help. \u201cWe can\u2019t let them steal the crystals!\u201d Ben shouted.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s make a plan!\u201d Mia said, her eyes bright with creativity. \u201cWe can distract them!\u201d\n\nLucy nodded. \u201cI\u2019ll make a loud noise to draw them away. Ben, you and Mia create a barrier with the crystals.\u201d\n\n\u201cOkay!\u201d Ben replied, a spark of excitement in his eyes. \u201cLet\u2019s do it!\u201d\n\nThey set their plan in motion. Lucy banged two rocks together, producing a loud CLANG! The thieves turned, looking startled. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d one of them growled.\n\n\u201cNow!\u201d Mia shouted.\n\nThey quickly arranged the crystals into a sparkling wall. The thieves, confused, stumbled into the shimmering barrier. \n\n\u201cUh-oh!\u201d one thief said, slipping on a loose crystal. They fell over in a heap, tangled in crystals and giggles erupted from Lucy, Ben, and Mia.\n\n\u201cLooks like they\u2019re stuck!\u201d Lucy cheered. \u201cWe did it!\u201d\n\nThe Guardian appeared, watching with wide eyes. \u201cYou did well, brave ones!\u201d it said, its voice warm and kind. \u201cYou protected my home.\u201d\n\nThe friends grinned, feeling proud. They had learned that the treasures of the cave were not just crystals but also friendship and courage.\n\n\u201cThank you, Guardian!\u201d Mia said. \u201cWe\u2019ll always help protect this place.\u201d\n\nWith a heart full of joy, the Guardian smiled. The cave sparkled around them, a beautiful reminder of their adventure.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do the ancient markings say?","options":["They tell stories about crystals.","Only those with good hearts may enter.","They are just pretty designs.","They warn about the Guardian."],"correct_answer":"Only those with good hearts may enter."},{"question":"What plan do the friends create?","options":["To leave the cave quietly.","To steal the crystals.","To distract the thieves and protect the cave.","To hide from the Guardian."],"correct_answer":"To distract the thieves and protect the cave."},{"question":"What does Lucy do to distract the thieves?","options":["She whispers quietly.","She makes a loud noise with rocks.","She runs away.","She calls for help."],"correct_answer":"She makes a loud noise with rocks."},{"question":"How do the thieves react when they see the crystal barrier?","options":["They laugh.","They get confused and fall down.","They steal the crystals.","They run away."],"correct_answer":"They get confused and fall down."},{"question":"What lesson do the friends learn in this chapter?","options":["It\u2019s fun to steal.","Teamwork and courage are important.","Caves are scary.","Markings are not important."],"correct_answer":"Teamwork and courage are important."}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_26_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_26_ch5_img1.png","plot_26_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":476,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
