   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_27_7_10","title":"Echoes of the Forgotten City","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Underground Worlds","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Sam had always loved exploring. His room was full of old maps and books. One sunny afternoon, he decided to check the attic. Dust floated in the air like tiny stars. \n\n\u201cMaybe I\u2019ll find treasure!\u201d Sam thought with a grin. He climbed the creaky stairs and pushed open the attic door. There, in the corner, was an old chest. \n\n\u201cWow! What\u2019s inside?\u201d Sam whispered. He opened the chest with a loud creak. Inside, wrapped in a dusty cloth, was a strange map.\n\n\"Lily! Alex! Come here!\" Sam shouted. His sister, Lily, was busy fixing her gadget. She rushed over and peered at the map. \n\n\u201cIs that a treasure map?\u201d she asked, her eyes sparkling. \n\n\u201cLooks like it! There\u2019s an 'X' here!\u201d Sam pointed excitedly. Alex, their cousin, bounded up the stairs. \n\n\u201cDid someone say treasure?\u201d he said, breathing heavily. \n\n\u201cLook at this map!\u201d Sam said, waving it in the air. \n\n\u201cWhoa! This is amazing!\u201d Alex exclaimed. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThey gathered around the map. It showed an ancient city underground. \u201cWe should go find it!\u201d Sam said, full of excitement. \n\n\u201cBut how do we get there?\u201d Lily asked, tapping her chin. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s look for clues in the attic!\u201d Alex suggested. They searched everywhere. From old boxes to dusty books, they found nothing. \n\nThen, Sam noticed a strange symbol on the map. \u201cWhat does this mean?\u201d he wondered aloud. \n\n\u201cI can scan it!\u201d Lily said, pulling out her tablet. The screen beeped, and colors danced across it. \u201cThis symbol means \u2018adventure!\u2019\u201d\n\n\u201cAdventure!\u201d Sam echoed. He couldn\u2019t wait to uncover the city\u2019s secrets. \n\nBut suddenly, the attic door creaked open again. A shadowy figure stepped inside. It was a tall man with a sly smile. \u201cI heard you found a map,\u201d he said. \u201cAnd I want it.\u201d\n\nSam's heart raced. \u201cWho are you?\u201d he asked.\n\n\u201cI\u2019m Gerald, and I\u2019m a treasure hunter!\u201d the man replied. \n\n\"We're treasure hunters too!\" Sam said bravely. \n\n\u201cNot for long!\u201d Gerald sneered. \u201cI\u2019ll find the treasure first.\u201d\n\nThe trio exchanged worried glances. This was not just an adventure; it was a race against time!\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Sam declared. They raced downstairs, ready for their adventure. Excitement and fear filled the air as they stepped out into the world. The echoes of the forgotten city awaited them.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Sam find in the attic?","options":["A toy","An old map","A book","A treasure chest"],"correct_answer":"An old map"},{"question":"Who helps Sam explore the attic?","options":["His mom","Lily and Alex","The neighbor","A dog"],"correct_answer":"Lily and Alex"},{"question":"What does the map lead to?","options":["A park","An underground city","A beach","A school"],"correct_answer":"An underground city"},{"question":"What is Gerald's intention?","options":["To help them","To take the map","To play games","To tell stories"],"correct_answer":"To take the map"},{"question":"What did the symbol on the map mean?","options":["Danger","Adventure","Lost","Treasure"],"correct_answer":"Adventure"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_27_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_27_ch1_img1.png","plot_27_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":390,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
