   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_27_7_10","title":"Echoes of the Forgotten City","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Underground Worlds","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Chapter 3: The Riddle of Shadows\n\nThe underground city was dark and damp. Vines hung from the ceiling, twisting like snakes. Sam, Lily, and Alex stepped carefully over broken stones. \u201cWow, look at this place!\u201d Sam exclaimed. \u201cIt\u2019s like a lost world!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nLily pulled out her tablet. \u201cI can map our route. The map is a little fuzzy, but I will try!\u201d She tapped on the screen, and a glowing blue line appeared. \u201cThis should lead us to the first riddle!\u201d \n\nAs they walked, they heard whispers echoing around them. \u201cDo you hear that?\u201d Alex whispered. \u201cIt sounds like\u2026 voices!\u201d\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s probably just the wind,\u201d Lily said, trying to sound brave.\n\nSuddenly, they stopped in front of a tall stone wall. Symbols danced on its surface. \u201cThese look like clues!\u201d Sam pointed. \u201cLet\u2019s solve it!\u201d\n\n\u201cThis is a riddle,\u201d Alex said, studying the symbols. \u201cIt says: \u2018I speak without a mouth and hear without ears. What am I?\u2019\u201d\n\n\u201cI know!\u201d Lily shouted. \u201cIt\u2019s an echo!\u201d\n\nAs soon as she spoke the answer, the wall rumbled. A secret door opened, revealing a shimmering hallway. \u201cYes! We did it!\u201d Sam cheered. \n\nBut just then, they heard footsteps behind them. \u201cLooks like you found my shortcut!\u201d Gerald sneered. He stepped into view, a smirk on his face. \u201cYou won\u2019t get to the artifact before me!\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat do you want, Gerald?\u201d Sam asked, feeling nervous.\n\n\u201cI want the power of the artifact! And I will do anything to get it!\u201d Gerald\u2019s eyes glinted.\n\n\u201cNot if we can help it!\u201d Alex said, stepping forward bravely.\n\nGerald laughed. \u201cWe\u2019ll see about that!\u201d He dashed into the hallway, leaving the trio in shock.\n\n\u201cShould we follow him?\u201d Sam asked, his heart racing.\n\n\u201cWe have to!\u201d Lily replied, gripping her tablet. \u201cWe can\u2019t let him win!\u201d\n\nThey ran into the hallway, but it was dark and twisting. Shadows jumped around them, making it hard to see. \n\n\u201cStay close!\u201d Alex shouted. Just as they turned a corner, a loud crash echoed behind them. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Sam asked, eyes wide.\n\n\u201cI think we just triggered something!\u201d Lily gasped. \u201cWe have to move fast!\u201d\n\nWith the echoes of danger following them, they raced deeper into the forgotten city, unsure of what lay ahead.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe air was thick with mystery and tension. They had to solve the next riddle quickly, or the echoes might just swallow them whole.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Sam, Lily, and Alex find in the underground city?","options":["A treasure chest","A riddle","A magical creature","A giant door"],"correct_answer":"A riddle"},{"question":"What does the riddle say?","options":["I speak without a mouth","I fly in the sky","I am made of paper","I shine like a star"],"correct_answer":"I speak without a mouth"},{"question":"Who is their rival treasure hunter?","options":["Alex","Sam","Gerald","Lily"],"correct_answer":"Gerald"},{"question":"How does Gerald feel when he sees the trio?","options":["Happy","Angry","Surprised","Scared"],"correct_answer":"Angry"},{"question":"What do the shadows in the hallway represent?","options":["Friends","Danger","Fun","Animals"],"correct_answer":"Danger"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_27_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_27_ch3_img1.png","plot_27_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":408,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
