       [DEBUG] Checking shared image: {"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing The image captures the moment when Sam, Lily, and Alex stand in the dimly lit underground city. The ancient stone walls are adorned with fading carvings, while ghostly vines creep along the surfaces. A faint glow illuminates their faces, revealing a mix of awe and determination. The atmosphere is thick with mystery, and the tension of their discovery is palpable. Their expressions reflect the weight of their journey, each character portrayed with distinct emotionsSam with curiosity, Lily with focus, and Alex with bravery.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_27_ch4_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 20:45:19"}
