   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_27_7_10","title":"Echoes of the Forgotten City","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Underground Worlds","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Sam, Lily, and Alex stood in the heart of the underground city. Crumbling buildings towered above them, covered in bright green vines. The air felt cool and mysterious. \u201cWow,\u201d Sam said, his eyes wide. \u201cThis place is amazing!\u201d\n\nAs they explored, they spotted strange symbols on the walls. \u201cLook at that one!\u201d Lily pointed. It looked like a smiling sun. \u201cI bet it\u2019s a clue!\u201d \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find the next riddle!\u201d Alex exclaimed. They gathered around a large stone tablet. It had letters carved into it, but some were missing. \n\n\u201cWhat does it say?\u201d Sam wondered aloud. \n\nLily pulled out her tablet. \u201cI can scan it!\u201d She pressed a button. The symbols glowed and started to rearrange themselves. \n\n\u201cWhoooa! That\u2019s cool!\u201d Alex cheered, clapping his hands. \n\nSuddenly, a loud crash echoed through the city. \u201cGerald!\u201d Sam shouted. They turned just in time to see their rival treasure hunter. He was sneaking up on them! \n\n\u201cNot so fast, kids!\u201d Gerald sneered. \u201cI\u2019ll get the treasure first!\u201d \n\n\u201cNot if we can help it!\u201d Alex replied bravely. They needed to solve the riddle quickly. \n\nLily looked back at the glowing letters. \u201cWe need to fill in the blanks!\u201d \n\nWith teamwork, they shouted out letters. \u201cA, B, C!\u201d The symbols lit up brighter with each letter. \n\n\u201cAlmost there!\u201d Sam said, feeling the excitement build. \n\nFinally, they shouted the last letter together. \u201cD!\u201d The stone tablet shook, and a hidden door creaked open behind them. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nInside, a shimmering hallway glowed with colors. \u201cLook at this!\u201d Lily gasped. \n\nSuddenly, the door began to close! \u201cWe have to hurry!\u201d Sam yelled. They dashed into the hallway, hearts racing. \n\n\u201cWait!\u201d Alex shouted. \u201cI think I saw something on the wall!\u201d \n\nIn the dim light, they could see more symbols. \u201cThere\u2019s treasure ahead!\u201d Sam exclaimed. \n\nAs they ran, they heard Gerald\u2019s angry voice behind them. \u201cYou can\u2019t escape!\u201d \n\nBut the trio felt stronger together. \u201cWe\u2019ll stop him!\u201d Lily said. \n\nThey pressed on, ready for the next challenge. What secrets lay at the end of the glowing hallway? The adventure was just beginning!\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do the kids find in the underground city?","options":["A giant statue","An old map","A hidden door","A treasure chest"],"correct_answer":"A hidden door"},{"question":"Who is their rival treasure hunter?","options":["Alex","Sam","Lily","Gerald"],"correct_answer":"Gerald"},{"question":"What does Lily use to scan the stone tablet?","options":["A flashlight","A tablet","A map","A compass"],"correct_answer":"A tablet"},{"question":"What do the kids shout to fill in the riddle?","options":["A, B, C, D","1, 2, 3, 4","Up, down, left, right","Yes, no, maybe, always"],"correct_answer":"A, B, C, D"},{"question":"How do the kids feel as they run through the glowing hallway?","options":["Scared","Excited","Sad","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"}]},"images":null,"word_count":354,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
