   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_27_11_14","title":"Echoes of the Forgotten City","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Underground Worlds","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"As the echoes of distant whispers danced through the air, Sam, Lily, and Alex exchanged uneasy glances. The underground city was a labyrinth of crumbling stones and cascading vines, lit by a soft, flickering glow that seemed to pulse from the walls themselves. They stood at a fork in the path, unsure of which direction to take. \"Do you feel that?\" Lily asked, her eyes wide as she glanced around them. \"It\u2019s like the city is alive.\"\n\nSam nodded, feeling a chill run down his spine. \"We need to focus. The map says we have to find the Hall of Whispers before sunset. It\u2019s our only chance to unlock the city\u2019s secrets.\" He held the ancient parchment tightly, each riddle printed in faded ink seemed to shimmer with potential.\n\n\u201cShould we split up? It might be faster,\u201d Alex suggested, his adventurous spirit shining through even in the eerie atmosphere.\n\n\u201cNo way,\u201d Lily interjected, her voice firm. \u201cThat\u2019s how we get lost\u2014like those echoes! We need to stick together.\u201d The tension between them was palpable, but they all understood the stakes. They couldn\u2019t let Victor get to the artifact first; they had to keep moving.\n\nWith a deep breath, they chose the left path, where the air grew thicker and the whispers seemed to beckon them closer. As they walked, Sam\u2019s heart raced. Each step felt like a chapter in a story unwritten. \u201cWhat if we find something amazing?\u201d he wondered aloud. \n\n\u201cOr something terrifying,\u201d Alex replied, scanning the shadows with a wary expression. \u201cRemember the ghost stories about this place?\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a loud crash echoed behind them. A stack of ancient stones tumbled to the ground, sending dust spiraling into the air. Sam\u2019s heart dropped as he recognized the sound of hurried footsteps. \u201cIt\u2019s him,\u201d he whispered urgently. \u201cVictor\u2019s coming!\u201d\n\nThey hurried further into the city, adrenaline coursing through their veins. The walls were covered in strange symbols and vines that wrapped around them like fingers of the past. A soft light illuminated a nearby wall, revealing a carving of a gigantic key\u2014the key to the Hall of Whispers. \u201cLook!\u201d Lily said, pointing. \u201cMaybe this means something.\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe carving depicted a trio of figures holding the key, their features blurred but their determination clear. \u201cIt has to relate to us,\u201d Sam said, excitement bubbling within him. \u201cWe need to find out what this key unlocks.\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s keep moving,\u201d Alex urged, peering back nervously. \u201cWe can\u2019t let Victor catch up.\u201d \n\nAs they rounded a corner, they stumbled upon an open chamber filled with ancient artifacts\u2014glinting treasures and dusty scrolls. Sam\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cThis must be it! The Hall of Whispers!\u201d But before they could explore, a shadow fell across the entrance.\n\nVictor stood there, a sly grin on his face. \u201cLooks like I\u2019ve found you first.\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nHis eyes glinted with a dangerous ambition. \u201cHand over the map, kids. I\u2019ll let you leave\u2014if you\u2019re lucky.\u201d\n\n\u201cNo way!\u201d Alex shouted, stepping forward, his fists clenched. \u201cWe\u2019ve come too far to let you take it!\u201d \n\nThe tension hung heavy in the air. With the fate of the ancient city\u2014and their own adventure\u2014on the line, Sam felt a surge of determination. \"We\u2019ll never give up. We\u2019re not afraid of you!\"\n\nAs Victor advanced, the whispers grew louder, swirling around them like a storm. Sam, fueled by courage and the bond of family, knew they had to outsmart their rival. But how?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Sam, Lily, and Alex find carved into the wall?","options":["A giant key","A treasure chest","A map","A ghost"],"correct_answer":"A giant key"},{"question":"What does Victor want from Sam and his friends?","options":["To join him","The map","The treasure","To scare them"],"correct_answer":"The map"},{"question":"How do the characters feel when they hear the whispers?","options":["Excited","Scared","Indifferent","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Scared"},{"question":"What does Alex suggest they do to save time?","options":["Split up","Yell for help","Run away","Make a map"],"correct_answer":"Split up"},{"question":"What motivates Sam to confront Victor?","options":["Fear","Anger","Courage","Confusion"],"correct_answer":"Courage"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_27_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_27_ch4_img1.png","plot_27_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":594,"reading_level":"Builder"}
