       [DEBUG] Checking shared image: {"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A tense confrontation scene set at the entrance of the Whispering Cavern, showcasing the rival treasure hunter with a glint of metal in hand, casting a menacing shadow. The expression on Sams face shows a mix of defiance and fear, while Lily and Alex stand firm beside him, their eyes reflecting the urgency of the moment. The atmosphere is thick with suspense, the caverns behind them dark and foreboding, suggesting the depth of the challenges they are about to face.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_27_ch2_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 20:47:12"}
