     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"exploring","1":"curious","2":"pollution","image_prompts":["A vibrant underground tunnel filled with glowing mushrooms of all colors. Niko, a twelve-year-old boy with short brown hair and a blue shirt, kneels by a large mushroom. Spark, a small firefly with bright, flickering wings, buzzes excitedly above his head. The atmosphere is magical, with twinkling lights and a sweet smell in the air.","A scene depicting the Blue Bunnies gathered in a circle. They are arguing, with one big bunny wearing a tiny crown. The bunnies have bright blue fur and expressive faces. In the background, Tilly the tortoise, with wise eyes, looks on as Niko steps forward, determined to help. The environment is colorful and whimsical, filled with bioluminescent mushrooms."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A vibrant Mushroom Forest where mushrooms tower like trees, with dappled sunlight filtering through the canopy, casting playful shadows on the ground. The atmosphere is enchanting and alive, hinting at the magic hidden within, with Niko depicted at the forefront, eyes wide with awe and curiosity.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_28_ch1_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 20:43:48"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A darkened cavern illuminated by glowing mushrooms, capturing Niko, Tilly, and Spark huddled together, their expressions a mixture of fear and determination. The shadows loom large around them, suggesting the looming threats of pollution and division, while the radiant glow of the mushrooms symbolizes hope and unity.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_28_ch1_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 20:43:48"}}}
