   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_28_7_10","title":"Beneath the Mushroom Forest","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Underground Worlds","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Niko loved exploring the Mushroom Forest. The mushrooms were tall and colorful, like trees reaching for the sky. Some were bright red, while others shone in bright yellows and blues. \n\nOne sunny afternoon, Niko wandered deeper into the forest. \u201cWow! Look at that one!\u201d he exclaimed, pointing to a mushroom that sparkled like a diamond. Suddenly, he noticed a small hole at the base of the giant mushroom. Curious, he knelt down to take a closer look. \n\n\u201cHey, Niko! What are you doing?\u201d a voice chirped. It was Spark, the mischievous firefly. His little wings flickered with excitement. \n\n\u201cI found a hole! I wonder where it leads?\u201d Niko replied, his eyes shining. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find out!\u201d Spark zipped around Niko's head. \n\nNiko took a deep breath and gently crawled through the hole. To his surprise, he found a winding tunnel filled with glowing mushrooms. The air smelled sweet, like candy. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] \n\n\u201cWow! This place is amazing!\u201d Niko shouted. \n\nAs they ventured further, they heard voices. \u201cLook out! It\u2019s the Blue Bunnies!\u201d Spark whispered. \n\nNiko saw a group of bunnies arguing. Their blue fur glowed in the dim light. A big bunny, wearing a little crown, shouted, \u201cWe need more food! The surface is polluting our home!\u201d \n\nNiko stepped forward. \u201cWhat\u2019s going on?\u201d he asked. \n\nThe big bunny turned. \u201cWe are in trouble! The air is dirty, and our mushrooms are wilting!\u201d \n\nTilly, the wise old tortoise, appeared beside the bunnies. \u201cListen, everyone! We must come together to save our home,\u201d she said slowly. \n\n\u201cBut the Green Frogs won\u2019t help us!\u201d squeaked a small bunny. \n\nNiko felt a spark of courage. \u201cIf we work together, we can stop the pollution!\u201d he said. \n\nEveryone turned to look at him. Could an ordinary kid like Niko really help? \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s do it!\u201d Spark chimed in, glowing brightly. \n\nNiko knew this was just the beginning. They had a big challenge ahead. Would they be able to unite all the creatures? \n\nWith his heart racing, Niko thought, \u201cI must help these new friends.\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Niko find in the Mushroom Forest?","options":["A giant bear","A hidden tunnel","A treasure chest","A rainbow"],"correct_answer":"A hidden tunnel"},{"question":"Who is Niko\u2019s friend that helps him explore?","options":["Tilly","Spark","Bunny","Frog"],"correct_answer":"Spark"},{"question":"What color is the big bunny's fur?","options":["Green","Blue","Red","Yellow"],"correct_answer":"Blue"},{"question":"What is threatening the underground world?","options":["Rain","Pollution","Snow","Wind"],"correct_answer":"Pollution"},{"question":"What does Niko want to do?","options":["Play games","Help his new friends","Go home","Eat lunch"],"correct_answer":"Help his new friends"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_28_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_28_ch1_img1.png","plot_28_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":344,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
