   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_28_7_10","title":"Beneath the Mushroom Forest","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Underground Worlds","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Niko stood in the underground world, gazing at the glowing mushrooms. They were enormous, lighting up the tunnels like stars. \u201cWow!\u201d he whispered. \u201cThis place is amazing!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, Tilly the tortoise appeared next to him. \u201cNiko, we have a problem,\u201d she said. Her voice was calm but serious. \u201cThe pollution is spreading fast.\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat do you mean, Tilly?\u201d Niko asked, worried. \u201cHow bad is it?\u201d\n\nTilly sighed. \u201cIt\u2019s affecting the plants and animals. The River Sparkle is turning dark and murky. The Fish Flutter can\u2019t breathe!\u201d\n\nNiko\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWe have to do something!\u201d he exclaimed. \u201cBut how can we help?\u201d\n\nJust then, Spark the firefly zipped by, his tiny body glowing brightly. \u201cWe need to gather the factions!\u201d he said, buzzing with energy. \u201cThe Toads of the Glade and the Mice of the Mist fight all the time. They won\u2019t work together!\u201d\n\nNiko frowned. \u201cBut if they don\u2019t unite, they\u2019ll lose their homes! We can\u2019t let that happen!\u201d \n\nTilly nodded. \u201cYou\u2019re right, Niko. We must show them the danger of pollution. But first, we need to get to the River Sparkle.\u201d\n\nNiko took a deep breath. \u201cThen let\u2019s go!\u201d They hurried through the winding tunnels, stepping carefully on soft moss and bright fungi. As they moved, the air felt thick and heavy. \n\nSuddenly, they heard a loud splashing sound. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Niko asked, his eyes wide.\n\n\u201cLook out!\u201d Spark shouted. A giant wave of muddy water rushed toward them from the tunnel ahead. Niko jumped back, heart pounding. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cQuick, Tilly!\u201d Niko shouted, pulling her away from the rushing water. \u201cWe can\u2019t let it reach the others!\u201d\n\n\u201cWe need to warn everyone!\u201d Tilly called. Niko nodded, determination filling him. They had to save their new friends.\n\nAs they raced to find the animals, Niko felt a mix of fear and excitement. Would they unite? Would they save the River Sparkle? \n\n\u201cKeep going!\u201d Spark urged, darting ahead. \u201cWe can do this!\u201d\n\nNiko smiled. \u201cTogether!\u201d\n\nBut just then, the ground shook beneath them. \u201cUh-oh!\u201d Spark squeaked. \u201cWhat now?\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nNiko's stomach twisted. What else could go wrong? They needed to hurry before it was too late.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the main problem in this chapter?","options":["Niko found a treasure","The River Sparkle is polluted","They need to find food","The mushrooms are too big"],"correct_answer":"The River Sparkle is polluted"},{"question":"Who helps Niko in the underground world?","options":["A wise old tortoise and a firefly","A giant mushroom","A talking tree","A rabbit"],"correct_answer":"A wise old tortoise and a firefly"},{"question":"What do they need to do to save their home?","options":["Find a treasure","Gather the factions","Make a potion","Hide from the water"],"correct_answer":"Gather the factions"},{"question":"What happens when they are trying to reach the River Sparkle?","options":["They find a treasure","A wave of muddy water rushes at them","They meet a dragon","They fall asleep"],"correct_answer":"A wave of muddy water rushes at them"},{"question":"How does Niko feel about their mission?","options":["Bored","Excited and determined","Scared and confused","Happy and sleepy"],"correct_answer":"Excited and determined"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_28_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_28_ch2_img1.png","plot_28_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":368,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
