   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_28_7_10","title":"Beneath the Mushroom Forest","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Underground Worlds","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Niko stood at the edge of the River Sparkle. The water glimmered like diamonds under the glow of the bioluminescent mushrooms. Tilly, the wise tortoise, slowly waddled beside him. \u201cWe need to convince the Bickering Bunnies and Snapping Snakes to work together,\u201d she said.\n\nNiko nodded. \u201cBut how? They never agree on anything!\u201d \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s show them what\u2019s at stake. They must see the danger,\u201d Spark chimed in, buzzing around them. The little firefly danced in the air, leaving a trail of light. \n\nNiko thought hard. \u201cWhat if we host a meeting? A big gathering by the river?\u201d \n\n\u201cThat\u2019s a brilliant idea!\u201d Tilly exclaimed. \u201cThey both love the river.\u201d \n\nNiko smiled, feeling hopeful. \u201cYes! Let\u2019s invite them now!\u201d \n\nAs they prepared the meeting, Spark flew off, lighting the way. Niko gathered flowers to decorate the area. Tilly worked on a special sign: \u201cSave Our Home!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] \n\nWhen the bunnies and snakes arrived, they looked grumpy. The bunnies twitched their noses. \u201cWhy should we listen to them?\u201d one bunny said. \n\nThe snakes hissed, \u201cWe don\u2019t need their help!\u201d \n\nNiko stepped forward, heart pounding. \u201cPlease, everyone! Look at the river! It\u2019s sick because of the pollution! If we don\u2019t unite, we\u2019ll lose our home.\u201d\n\nThe bunnies and snakes exchanged glances. Spark flew in circles around them, shining bright. \u201cWe can help each other! Together, we are stronger!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a loud splash echoed from the river. A big, muddy wave hit the shore. Niko gasped. \u201cSee? The pollution is getting worse!\u201d \n\nThe creatures looked frightened. Tilly spoke softly, \u201cWe need to take action. Let\u2019s work together!\u201d \n\nThe Bickering Bunnies and Snapping Snakes finally nodded. \u201cOkay,\u201d said the brave bunny. \u201cLet\u2019s save the river!\u201d\n\nNiko felt a swell of hope. \u201cWe can do this together!\u201d \n\nBut just as they began to strategize, a dark cloud rolled in above the mushroom forest. Niko\u2019s heart sank. \u201cOh no, what now?\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What idea does Niko have to unite the factions?","options":["A race","A party","A meeting","A game"],"correct_answer":"A meeting"},{"question":"What do the creatures need to save?","options":["The Mushroom Forest","The River Sparkle","Their homes","The flowers"],"correct_answer":"The River Sparkle"},{"question":"How do the Bickering Bunnies first react to Niko?","options":["They cheer him on","They throw flowers","They are grumpy","They jump for joy"],"correct_answer":"They are grumpy"},{"question":"What does Tilly want to do at the meeting?","options":["Sing a song","Set up a sign","Tell stories","Dance"],"correct_answer":"Set up a sign"},{"question":"What happens at the end of the chapter?","options":["A party begins","A dark cloud rolls in","They find treasure","They go home"],"correct_answer":"A dark cloud rolls in"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_28_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_28_ch4_img1.png","plot_28_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":327,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
