   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_28_7_10","title":"Beneath the Mushroom Forest","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Underground Worlds","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Niko stood in front of the Great Meeting Tree. It was huge, with glowing mushrooms hanging like lanterns. Tilly was beside him, her eyes twinkling. \"This is where everyone will gather,\" she said. \n\n\"Do you think they will listen to us?\" Niko asked, feeling a flutter of nerves.\n\n\"Of course! We have a plan,\" Tilly replied with a smile. Spark buzzed around them, glowing brighter with excitement. \"Let\u2019s get everyone here before the water gets any dirtier!\" he squeaked.\n\nAs the creatures arrived, Niko noticed the grumpy Snapping Snakes and the fidgety Bickering Bunnies. They were glaring at each other. Niko stepped forward. \"Hey! Everyone! We need to talk about the River Sparkle.\"\n\nThe crowd murmured, but Niko was determined. \"If we don\u2019t work together, the river will be lost! The pollution is getting worse every day!\"\n\nTilly nodded. \"We can fix this together! I know we can!\" \n\nSuddenly, Spark zipped up into the air. \"Let\u2019s share our ideas instead of arguing!\" he shouted. The creatures paused, surprised. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nNiko took a deep breath. \"What if we create a team? Each of us has something special to offer. The Snakes can help clear the trash, and the Bunnies can plant new seeds!\"\n\nA little bunny spoke up. \"But we don\u2019t want to work with them!\" \n\nNiko raised his voice. \"If we don\u2019t, we all lose our home! Think about it. No more River Sparkle, no more food!\"\n\nThe Bickering Bunnies and the Snapping Snakes exchanged glances. Niko could see they were thinking hard. \n\nFinally, a brave bunny hopped forward, \"Okay! Let's give it a try!\" \n\nCheers erupted from the crowd! Niko felt a rush of joy. \u201cYes! Let's do it together!\u201d \n\nAs they began to form teams, Niko felt proud. It was working! He looked at Tilly and Spark. \u201cWe did it!\u201d he grinned.\n\nThen, Spark glowed excitedly. \u201cNow, it\u2019s time to save our home!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith newfound determination, the creatures set off to clean the river. Niko led the way, feeling braver than ever. They picked up trash and planted seeds, laughter filling the air. \n\nNiko realized that together, they could do anything. \n\n\u201cRemember,\u201d he shouted, \u201cwhen we work together, we\u2019re stronger!\u201d\n\nSoon, the River Sparkle shimmered brightly again. Niko beamed at his friends. They had saved their home, and it felt amazing.\n\nBut there was still more to do. The world above was still polluting. Niko knew that their adventure wasn\u2019t over yet.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Niko and his friends want to save?","options":["The River Sparkle","The Great Meeting Tree","A magical plant","Their home"],"correct_answer":"The River Sparkle"},{"question":"How do the Bickering Bunnies feel about working with the Snapping Snakes?","options":["They are excited","They are scared","They don't want to work together","They are friends"],"correct_answer":"They don't want to work together"},{"question":"What does Niko want everyone to do?","options":["Argue","Work together","Give up","Leave the river"],"correct_answer":"Work together"},{"question":"What do they do to help the River Sparkle?","options":["Plant seeds","Create a team","Pick up trash","All of the above"],"correct_answer":"All of the above"},{"question":"What does Niko learn about teamwork?","options":["It is hard","It is not important","It makes them stronger","It is for others"],"correct_answer":"It makes them stronger"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_28_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_28_ch5_img1.png","plot_28_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":415,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
