   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_29_7_10","title":"The Forgotten Train of Wonderland","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Underground Worlds","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Ella and Max loved exploring. Today, they found something very strange. In their backyard, hidden behind bushes, was a rusty door. \n\n\u201cDo you think we should open it?\u201d Ella asked, her eyes shining with excitement. \n\nMax scratched his head. \u201cWhat if it\u2019s a secret treasure?\u201d \n\nElla giggled. \u201cOr a dragon\u2019s lair!\u201d \n\nThey exchanged glances. With a deep breath, Max pushed the door open. It creaked loudly, revealing a dark staircase leading down. \n\n\u201cWow!\u201d Ella exclaimed. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d \n\nThey tiptoed down the steps, each one feeling like a tiny adventure. The air was cool and smelled like old books. At the bottom, they found themselves in a big, underground train station. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] \n\nThe station was colorful, with shimmering lights and walls painted in bright blues and greens. Old trains stood silently on the tracks. \n\n\u201cWhere are we?\u201d Max whispered, staring wide-eyed. \n\n\u201cI think it\u2019s a forgotten train station!\u201d Ella said, her imagination running wild. \n\nSuddenly, a loud whistle filled the air. A train, glowing with golden lights, appeared before them. The doors opened with a soft whoosh. \n\n\u201cWelcome!\u201d a cheerful voice called. It was the conductor! He wore a tall hat and a big smile. \u201cHop on for an adventure!\u201d \n\nElla and Max exchanged excited glances. \u201cShould we?\u201d Max asked. \n\n\u201cOf course!\u201d Ella replied, bouncing on her toes. \n\nThey climbed aboard, and the train started moving. Soon, the lights outside blurred into a swirl of colors. \n\n\u201cYour first stop is the Land of Giggles!\u201d said the conductor, grinning. \n\nMax laughed. \u201cThat sounds fun!\u201d \n\nBut then the conductor\u2019s eyes sparkled mischievously. \u201cBut beware! You must solve my riddle to return home!\u201d \n\nElla\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWhat if we can\u2019t solve it?\u201d \n\n\u201cThen you might stay here forever!\u201d he said, his voice playful yet serious. \n\nMax gulped. \u201cWe can do this, right?\u201d \n\nElla nodded, determination shining in her eyes. \u201cWe\u2019ll find a way!\u201d \n\nAs the train zoomed ahead, they could see colorful mountains and giant smiling flowers in the distance. They were ready for an adventure, but what challenges lay ahead? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2] \n\n\u201cHold on tight!\u201d the conductor shouted, and the train sped faster. \n\nWhat mystery awaited them in the Land of Giggles?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Ella and Max find in their backyard?","options":["A treasure chest","A rusty door","A dragon","A magic carpet"],"correct_answer":"A rusty door"},{"question":"What type of station do Ella and Max discover?","options":["A bus station","An underground train station","An airport","A car garage"],"correct_answer":"An underground train station"},{"question":"What is the conductor's special challenge?","options":["Solve a riddle","Find a treasure","Complete a race","Climb a mountain"],"correct_answer":"Solve a riddle"},{"question":"What is the first stop of the train?","options":["Land of Giggles","Land of Dreams","Land of Dragons","Land of Treasure"],"correct_answer":"Land of Giggles"},{"question":"How do Ella and Max feel at the beginning of their adventure?","options":["Scared","Excited","Bored","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_29_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_29_ch1_img1.png","plot_29_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":368,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
