   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_29_7_10","title":"The Forgotten Train of Wonderland","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Underground Worlds","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Ella and Max sat in the train, wide-eyed. The Land of Giggles was unlike anything they had seen. Bright colors filled their vision. Pink trees swayed gently, and fluffy clouds floated like cotton candy.\n\n\u201cLook at that!\u201d Max pointed out the window. \u201cThose trees are laughing!\u201d\n\nElla giggled. \u201cThis place is so silly! I love it!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, the train came to a screeching halt. The conductor popped his head into the cabin. \u201cTime for a riddle!\u201d he said with a twinkle in his eye.\n\n\u201cWhat if we don\u2019t know it?\u201d Ella asked, a frown on her face.\n\n\u201cThen you might stay here forever!\u201d he said, his voice playful yet serious. \n\nMax gulped. \u201cWhat\u2019s the riddle?\u201d\n\nThe conductor grinned. \u201cI\u2019ll give you a hint. I have keys but open no locks. I have space, but no room. What am I?\u201d\n\nElla thought hard. \u201cHmm, keys, no locks\u2026 Could it be a piano?\u201d\n\n\u201cGood guess!\u201d the conductor cheered. \u201cBut try again. Think about the space part!\u201d\n\nMax rubbed his chin. \u201cWhat has space but no room? I know! It\u2019s a computer!\u201d\n\nThe conductor clapped his hands. \u201cCorrect! But beware, the train is leaving!\u201d\n\nJust then, the train jolted. The cabin shook! Ella and Max clutched their seats as they zoomed forward. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cWhere do we go next?\u201d Ella shouted over the noise.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find out!\u201d Max said, trying to keep calm. But inside, he felt a twinge of worry. What if they couldn\u2019t get back home?\n\nThe train sped into a new land. It sparkled with bright lights and colorful creatures dancing everywhere. But then Max spotted something strange. A big, dark cloud loomed above. It looked scary.\n\n\u201cElla! Look!\u201d he yelled, pointing at the cloud. \u201cWhat\u2019s that?\u201d\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know! But it doesn\u2019t look friendly!\u201d Ella said, her eyes wide.\n\nJust then, the conductor appeared again, looking a bit serious. \u201cTo escape this cloud, you must solve another riddle!\u201d he said.\n\n\u201cWhat? More riddles?\u201d Max sighed, feeling a little overwhelmed.\n\n\u201cYes! But remember, together you can do anything!\u201d the conductor smiled, then vanished into thin air.\n\nElla and Max exchanged nervous looks. They had to solve the riddle quickly before the dark cloud got closer. \n\n\u201cOkay, we can do this!\u201d Ella said, taking a deep breath.\n\nMax nodded, ready to face the new challenge. \u201cLet\u2019s find a way back home!\u201d","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What riddle did the conductor give to Ella and Max?","options":["What has keys but no locks?","What is a train?","What is the Land of Giggles?","What is a cloud?"],"correct_answer":"What has keys but no locks?"},{"question":"What happens when they solve the riddle?","options":["The train stops.","They see a dark cloud.","The conductor disappears.","They find a treasure."],"correct_answer":"They see a dark cloud."},{"question":"How does Ella feel about the Land of Giggles?","options":["She thinks it's scary.","She loves it!","She wants to leave.","She is bored."],"correct_answer":"She loves it!"},{"question":"What emotion does Max feel about the challenges ahead?","options":["Excited","Nervous","Bored","Happy"],"correct_answer":"Nervous"},{"question":"What is the final challenge they face in this chapter?","options":["Finding a treasure","Solving another riddle","Meeting new friends","Going back home"],"correct_answer":"Solving another riddle"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_29_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_29_ch2_img1.png","plot_29_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":400,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
