   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_29_7_10","title":"The Forgotten Train of Wonderland","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Underground Worlds","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Ella and Max felt a tingle of excitement as they rode on the magical train. The conductor flipped his colorful hat and smiled. \"Welcome to the Land of Dark Clouds!\" he announced. \n\n\"But what about the dark cloud?\" Ella asked, her eyes wide. \n\nMax frowned. \"It looks scary. What do we do?\"\n\n\"To leave this land, you must solve the cloud riddle!\" said the conductor. \"Are you ready?\"\n\nElla and Max nodded quickly. The train slowed, and they could see the dark cloud swirling outside. It seemed to be alive! \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe landscape outside was strange. Shadows danced and strange shapes flickered in the mist. \"What does the cloud want?\" Max whispered.\n\nElla peered out. \"Look! There\u2019s a castle made of mist!\" \n\nSuddenly, a loud thunderclap echoed. Ella jumped. \"What do we do now?\"\n\n\"The riddle!\" Max reminded her. \n\nThe conductor waved his arms. \"You must listen carefully! When the cloud brings rain, what does it bring to the ground?\"\n\nElla thought hard. \"Um... water?\"\n\n\"Correct!\" boomed the conductor. \"But listen closely! The next part of the riddle is\u2026\"\n\nBefore he could finish, a giant drop of rain splashed down, soaking the train. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nElla squealed, \"Max! I think I know! Rain brings what?\"\n\n\"It brings... flowers!\" Max grinned.\n\nThe conductor clapped his hands. \"You are right! But how do you make flowers bloom in the dark?\"\n\nElla thought and thought. \"We need light!\"\n\n\"Exactly!\" said the conductor. \"But the cloud hides the light. You must find a way to bring it back!\"\n\nMax looked worried. \"How do we do that?\"\n\nThe conductor smiled mysteriously. \"You\u2019ll have to journey into the castle! But beware! The cloud has secrets.\"\n\nElla took a deep breath. \"Let's go!\"\n\nThey jumped off the train, ready for the challenge. The mist curled around them like a giant hug. The castle loomed ahead, dark and eerie. \n\n\"Do you hear that?\" Max asked, holding Ella's hand tightly. \n\nA whisper floated through the air. \"Beware the shadows! They are not what they seem!\" \n\nElla and Max exchanged nervous glances. Could they solve the riddle of the castle and bring back the light? \n\nThey stepped forward, ready to face whatever awaited them.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What land do Ella and Max travel to next?","options":["Land of Giggles","Land of Dark Clouds","Land of Sunshine","Land of Ice"],"correct_answer":"Land of Dark Clouds"},{"question":"What do the siblings need to solve?","options":["A puzzle","A riddle","A mystery","A game"],"correct_answer":"A riddle"},{"question":"What does Ella see outside the train?","options":["A bright rainbow","A castle made of mist","A garden of flowers","A river of stars"],"correct_answer":"A castle made of mist"},{"question":"What do Ella and Max need to bring back?","options":["Rain","Light","Music","Magic"],"correct_answer":"Light"},{"question":"What advice do they hear before entering the castle?","options":["Follow the light","Beware the shadows","Run away quickly","Stay together"],"correct_answer":"Beware the shadows"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_29_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_29_ch3_img1.png","plot_29_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":367,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
