   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_29_7_10","title":"The Forgotten Train of Wonderland","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Underground Worlds","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Chapter 4: The Riddle of the Dark Clouds\n\nElla and Max stepped off the train. They found themselves in the Land of Dark Clouds. The sky was gray and gloomy. Mist swirled around their feet. \n\n\"Where are we?\" Ella asked, looking up. \n\n\"I think it's a new place,\" Max said, frowning. \u201cWe need to find the castle.\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a voice echoed from the mist. \"Welcome, brave travelers!\" \n\nElla and Max jumped. The Conductor appeared, his tall hat wobbling. \"To return home, you must solve my riddle!\" \n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s the riddle?\u201d Max asked, feeling a mix of fear and excitement. \n\nThe Conductor grinned. \"Listen closely! I am not alive, but I can grow. I don\u2019t have lungs, but I need air. What am I?\" \n\nElla tapped her chin. \"Hmm... I think I know!\" \n\n\u201cShhh!\u201d Max whispered. \"Let\u2019s think this through.\"\n\nElla stared into the mist, hoping for a hint. \"Maybe it's... fire?\" she gasped. \n\nThe Conductor clapped his hands. \"Well done! But, to bring back the light, you must find the glowing gem in the castle!\"\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Ella said, feeling hopeful. They hurried toward the castle, but the clouds thickened around them.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they reached the castle gates, they saw shadows moving inside. Max gulped. \"Do we have to go in there?\" \n\n\"Yes!\" Ella said, her eyes shining with courage. \u201cWe can do this!\u201d \n\nThey entered the castle, and it was dark and cold. Suddenly, a door creaked open, and a light shone from within. \n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Max pointed. \u201cThat must be the gem!\u201d\n\nBut just then, a loud rumble shook the ground. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Ella exclaimed, clutching Max's arm.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find the gem, quickly!\u201d he urged. \n\nThey dashed toward the light, hearts racing. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nInside, they found the glowing gem on a pedestal. It sparkled like a star. Ella reached out to grab it. \n\n\u201cDo you think it will really bring back the light?\u201d Max asked, his voice hopeful.\n\n\u201cAbsolutely!\u201d Ella smiled. \n\nJust as she picked it up, the castle began to shake again. \u201cWe need to hurry!\u201d \n\nWith the gem in hand, they raced back to the exit. The clouds outside started to part. A ray of sunshine peeked through. \n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Ella shouted as they burst through the doors. \u201cWe did it!\u201d \n\nBut the train was waiting, and the conductor waved. \u201cYou must hurry! The train will leave soon!\u201d \n\n\u201cQuick, Max!\u201d Ella called. They sprinted back to the train, the light of the gem shining brightly as they stepped aboard. \n\nWhat other challenges awaited them?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What must Ella and Max do to return home?","options":["Find a glowing gem","Solve a riddle","Make a wish","Climb a mountain"],"correct_answer":"Solve a riddle"},{"question":"What is the riddle about?","options":["A plant","Fire","Water","A cloud"],"correct_answer":"Fire"},{"question":"What happens when Ella picks up the gem?","options":["The castle shakes","The sun shines","The train leaves","A door opens"],"correct_answer":"The castle shakes"},{"question":"What do Ella and Max see when they look outside the castle?","options":["A rainbow","The train leaving","The sun shining","Other travelers"],"correct_answer":"The sun shining"},{"question":"What do they need to do before the train leaves?","options":["Find the conductor","Get the gem","Hurry back","Solve another riddle"],"correct_answer":"Hurry back"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_29_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_29_ch4_img1.png","plot_29_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":423,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
