   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_29_7_10","title":"The Forgotten Train of Wonderland","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Underground Worlds","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Ella and Max hurried down the train platform, the glowing gem still warm in Ella's hand. The train was waiting for them, its door wide open. Steam puffed from its bright blue engine, making it look like it was breathing.\n\n\"Wow, the train is so magical!\" Ella exclaimed, her eyes sparkling. \n\n\"It won\u2019t wait forever,\u201d Max reminded her. \u201cWe need to solve the next riddle!\"\n\nJust then, the whimsical conductor appeared, his hat wobbling as he approached. \u201cWelcome back, explorers! Ready for your next adventure?\u201d he asked, grinning.\n\n\u201cYes! What\u2019s the next challenge?\u201d Max asked, eager to get started.\n\nThe conductor twirled dramatically. \u201cYou must journey to the Land of Shimmering Stars! There, you will find your next riddle. But first, listen carefully. You will need the gem to light your way!\u201d\n\nElla held the gem high, and it glowed brightly, casting colorful lights around them. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d she cheered.\n\nThey boarded the train, and it began to move. The world outside blurred into a swirl of colors. Max felt a tickle in his tummy as they sped along the tracks.\n\nSoon, the train came to a stop. The doors opened to a beautiful night sky filled with twinkling stars. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] \n\nElla gasped, \u201cLook at all those stars! They\u2019re so close!\u201d\n\nIn front of them stood a tall, sparkling tree. Its branches shimmered like diamonds. At the base, a wise old owl perched, waiting for them.\n\n\u201cHello, young travelers!\u201d the owl hooted. \u201cTo pass through, you must answer my riddle: What has keys but can\u2019t open locks?\u201d\n\nMax scratched his head. \u201cThat\u2019s tricky! What do you think, Ella?\u201d\n\nElla thought hard. \u201cHmm, keys\u2026 but no locks?\u201d \n\n\u201cWait!\u201d Max exclaimed. \u201cA piano! It has keys but can't open anything!\u201d\n\n\u201cCorrect!\u201d the owl said with a nod. \u201cThe stars will guide you next.\u201d \n\nJust then, a burst of sparkling lights shot from the tree, showering them with warmth and joy. Ella and Max looked at each other, smiling brightly. They had done it!\n\n\u201cNow we can find our way home!\u201d Ella said, bouncing with excitement.\n\nThe train's whistle blew again, and they hopped back inside. Max looked out of the window, excitement bubbling within him. \u201cWhat if our next stop is even more amazing?\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find out!\u201d Ella replied, her mind dancing with possibilities. The train departed, speeding into the unknown once more. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Ella and Max find in the Land of Shimmering Stars?","options":["A giant castle","A sparkling tree","A hidden cave","A colorful river"],"correct_answer":"A sparkling tree"},{"question":"What is the riddle given by the owl?","options":["What has wings?","What has keys but can\u2019t open locks?","What is the color of the sky?","What is the taste of chocolate?"],"correct_answer":"What has keys but can\u2019t open locks?"},{"question":"What answer do Ella and Max give to the riddle?","options":["A treasure chest","A piano","A map","A door"],"correct_answer":"A piano"},{"question":"What happens after they answer the riddle?","options":["They go home","The stars shine brightly","They find another gem","They meet a dragon"],"correct_answer":"The stars shine brightly"},{"question":"What do Ella and Max look forward to after solving the riddle?","options":["Going home","Their next adventure","Eating candy","Meeting new friends"],"correct_answer":"Their next adventure"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_29_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_29_ch5_img1.png","plot_29_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":401,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
