   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_29_11_14","title":"The Forgotten Train of Wonderland","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Underground Worlds","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Ella stared at the cracked walls of the abandoned underground train station, her wide brown eyes shimmering with curiosity. She brushed a stray curl behind her ear and took a hesitant step forward, her sneakers echoing on the dusty tiles. Max, her older brother, followed closely, his brow furrowed in practical concern. \u201cI don\u2019t know, Ella. This place gives me the creeps,\u201d he said, glancing at the peeling paint overhead that looked like it might fall at any moment.\n\n\u201cCreeps can be fun,\u201d Ella replied, her voice teasing. \u201cImagine what we might find down here. Maybe a hidden world or a treasure map!\u201d\n\nMax rolled his eyes, but he couldn\u2019t suppress a smile. \u201cOr maybe just a bunch of rats.\u201d\n\nAs they ventured deeper, a faint shimmer caught Ella's eye. \u201cLook!\u201d She pointed to a shimmering light at the end of the tunnel. Curiosity piqued, they hurried toward it, the light growing brighter and more inviting.\n\nWhen they reached the source, they found an ancient train sitting on rusted tracks, its silver exterior sparkling like stars against the darkened backdrop. Ella gasped, her heart racing with excitement. \u201cThis is incredible!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nMax stepped closer, feeling a mix of wonder and caution. \u201cWhat do you think happened to it?\u201d\n\n\u201cMaybe it was just forgotten,\u201d Ella mused, her fingers brushing against the cold metal. \u201cDo you think it still works?\u201d\n\nBefore Max could answer, the train's doors creaked open with a ghostly sigh. A tall figure emerged. He wore a vibrant blue coat covered in strange symbols and a top hat that seemed to defy gravity. His smile was broad, but his eyes sparkled with mischief. \u201cWelcome aboard the Forgotten Train of Wonderland!\u201d he exclaimed, bowing deeply.\n\n\u201cWho are you?\u201d Max asked, crossing his arms, skeptical.\n\n\u201cI am the Conductor,\u201d the man announced with a flourish. \u201cI guide this train through the hidden realms of imagination. But beware, young adventurers! Each stop will require courage, creativity, and\u2014most importantly\u2014your wits.\u201d\n\n\u201cWait, you mean we can go somewhere?\u201d Ella\u2019s eyes shone with enthusiasm, while Max\u2019s heart raced with uncertainty.\n\n\u201cIndeed! But there\u2019s a catch.\u201d The Conductor leaned closer, lowering his voice to a conspiratorial whisper. \u201cYou must solve the riddles I present at each stop to return home. Fail, and the train will disappear forever, and you may be lost among the wonders.\u201d\n\nMax felt a chill run down his spine. \u201cWhat kind of riddles?\u201d\n\n\u201cRiddles that will test your friendship, your identity, and your growth,\u201d the Conductor replied, a mischievous glint in his eye. \u201cAre you ready to embark on this adventure?\u201d\n\nElla nodded eagerly. Max shot her a wary glance. \u201cI don\u2019t think we have much choice,\u201d he muttered, but he stepped aboard nonetheless. The doors slid shut behind them, sealing their fate. \n\nSuddenly, the train lurched to life, and the world outside blurred into a kaleidoscope of colors. Ella clutched Max\u2019s arm, her heart pounding. \u201cWhat if we can\u2019t solve the riddles?\u201d\n\n\u201cThen we\u2019ll just have to be smart about it,\u201d Max replied, trying to sound confident. But deep down, he felt the weight of the challenge pressing upon them as they sped toward the unknown.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nJust then, the train shuddered violently. The Conductor appeared again, his voice booming over the noise. \u201cWelcome to your first challenge! Prepare yourselves, for the Realm of Enigma awaits!\u201d\n\nElla\u2019s breath quickened as she exchanged a glance with Max. They were in for the adventure of a lifetime, and there was no turning back now.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Ella and Max find in the underground train station?","options":["A hidden treasure","A magical train","A creepy monster","A secret door"],"correct_answer":"A magical train"},{"question":"What is the name of the character who guides the train?","options":["The Engineer","The Conductor","The Driver","The Captain"],"correct_answer":"The Conductor"},{"question":"What must Ella and Max do to return home?","options":["Solve riddles","Fight monsters","Find a map","Escape the train"],"correct_answer":"Solve riddles"},{"question":"How does Max feel about the train adventure at first?","options":["Excited","Worried","Angry","Disinterested"],"correct_answer":"Worried"},{"question":"What is the atmosphere like when the train departs?","options":["Calm and peaceful","Chaotic and noisy","Dark and scary","Bright and sunny"],"correct_answer":"Chaotic and noisy"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_29_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_29_ch1_img1.png","plot_29_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":595,"reading_level":"Builder"}
