   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_30_7_10","title":"The Secret Society of Shadows","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Underground Worlds","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Zoe loved the library. It was her favorite place. The smell of old books and the whisper of pages made her feel at home. One rainy afternoon, Zoe discovered something strange. \n\nAs she walked past a tall bookshelf, she noticed a shadow moving behind it. \u201cWhat\u2019s that?\u201d she whispered to herself. Curiosity sparked in her mind. She peeked around the shelf and gasped. \n\nThere was a door! It was small and wooden, with a shiny brass handle. Zoe felt a mix of excitement and fear. Should she open it? What lay behind the door? She took a deep breath and turned the handle.\n\nSuddenly, the door creaked open, revealing a dark passage. A warm breeze whispered secrets in her ear. \u201cHello?\u201d Zoe called out. The sound echoed back, bouncing off the walls. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nWith a quick glance back at the library, Zoe stepped inside. The door closed behind her with a soft thud. In front of her was a world of shadows. Shadows danced and flickered on the walls like playful spirits. Some were small and round, while others were tall and thin. Zoe felt a little scared but also very brave.\n\n\u201cWelcome to the Shadow Realm!\u201d said a cheerful voice. Zoe turned to see a little shadow creature. It had big, round eyes and a silly grin. \u201cI\u2019m Shadow! What brings you to our world?\u201d\n\n\u201cI... I found a door,\u201d Zoe stuttered, still in awe. \u201cWhat is this place?\u201d\n\n\u201cThis is where shadows come to life,\u201d Shadow explained, bouncing with excitement. \u201cWe protect the balance between light and dark. But beware! A sinister shadow wants to disrupt that balance.\u201d \n\nZoe\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWhat do you mean?\u201d\n\n\u201cThere\u2019s a shadow trying to steal all the light!\u201d Shadow said, looking worried. \u201cIf you want to join our Secret Society of Shadows, you must face your fears. Are you ready?\u201d\n\nZoe hesitated. Could she really face her fears? \u201cI\u2019ll try!\u201d she declared, feeling braver. \n\n\u201cGood!\u201d Shadow squealed. \u201cFollow me!\u201d \n\nAs they walked deeper into the Shadow Realm, Zoe felt both nervous and excited. What would she discover? What fears would she face? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nSuddenly, a loud roar echoed through the shadows. Zoe jumped, her heart pounding. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d she shouted.\n\nShadow turned pale. \u201cIt\u2019s the sinister shadow! We must hurry!\u201d\n\nZoe took a deep breath. This was just the beginning of her adventure.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Zoe discover in the library?","options":["A big book","A hidden door","A friendly cat","A treasure chest"],"correct_answer":"A hidden door"},{"question":"Who does Zoe meet in the Shadow Realm?","options":["A dragon","A shadow named Shadow","A ghost","A fairy"],"correct_answer":"A shadow named Shadow"},{"question":"What does Shadow tell Zoe about?","options":["A picnic","The Secret Society of Shadows","A treasure map","A new library book"],"correct_answer":"The Secret Society of Shadows"},{"question":"What must Zoe do to join the society?","options":["Sing a song","Face her fears","Solve a puzzle","Draw a picture"],"correct_answer":"Face her fears"},{"question":"What does Zoe hear when she walks deeper into the Shadow Realm?","options":["Music","Laughter","A loud roar","The wind"],"correct_answer":"A loud roar"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_30_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_30_ch1_img1.png","plot_30_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":400,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
