   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_30_7_10","title":"The Secret Society of Shadows","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Underground Worlds","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Zoe stood in the shadowy underground world, her heart racing. Shadow floated beside her, a small, wispy figure with a big smile. \u201cWelcome to the secret realm! Are you ready for your first challenge?\u201d\n\nZoe nodded, though she felt a flutter of fear in her stomach. \u201cWhat do I need to do?\u201d\n\nShadow pointed down a winding path. \u201cYou must gather three light crystals! They are hidden in different places. Each one will test your bravery.\u201d\n\nZoe took a deep breath. \u201cOkay! Where do I find the first crystal?\u201d\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s hidden in the Cave of Whispers,\u201d Shadow replied. \u201cBut be careful! The sinister shadow lurks nearby. It feeds on fear.\u201d\n\nZoe gulped. \u201cWhat if it finds me?\u201d\n\nShadow chuckled. \u201cJust remember, fear is just a shadow. You can face it!\u201d\n\nFeeling a little braver, Zoe walked towards the cave, the walls shimmering around her. The cave entrance was dark and mysterious. \u201cI can do this,\u201d she whispered to herself.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nInside the cave, Zoe heard soft whispers. \u201cZoe\u2026 Zoe\u2026\u201d they called. The shadows danced around her, flickering in and out of sight.\n\n\u201cWho\u2019s there?\u201d Zoe asked, trying to sound brave.\n\n\u201cJust us shadows, don\u2019t be afraid!\u201d they chimed, their voices like gentle breezes. But Zoe still felt a shiver run down her spine.\n\nSuddenly, a loud crash echoed behind her! Zoe spun around and saw a dark figure creeping closer. It was the sinister shadow! \u201cYou will never find the crystals!\u201d it growled.\n\nZoe\u2019s heart raced. \u201cI won\u2019t let you scare me!\u201d she shouted, trying to sound strong. The shadow laughed, a deep, rumbling sound. Zoe took a step back, but she remembered Shadow\u2019s words.\n\n\u201cNo! I can face this!\u201d Zoe declared.\n\nWith courage building inside her, Zoe reached out her hands, feeling the warm light of her own bravery. \u201cI am not afraid!\u201d\n\nThe sinister shadow paused. \u201cYou think you can defeat me?\u201d it hissed.\n\n\u201cYes!\u201d Zoe shouted. The shadow shrank back, surprised. This was only the beginning. She had to gather the crystals and learn to be brave.\n\nZoe took a deep breath and stepped further into the cave. \u201cI will find that crystal!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAs she moved deeper, she spotted a glimmering light. \u201cThere it is!\u201d she exclaimed. But how would she get it without the sinister shadow catching her? \n\nWith her heart pounding, Zoe knew she had to think fast. What would she do next?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What must Zoe gather to prove her bravery?","options":["Three light crystals","Five dark stones","Magic books","Shiny coins"],"correct_answer":"Three light crystals"},{"question":"Where does Zoe go to find the first crystal?","options":["The Cave of Whispers","The Forest of Light","The Mountain of Shadows","The Library of Secrets"],"correct_answer":"The Cave of Whispers"},{"question":"What does the sinister shadow try to do?","options":["Help Zoe","Sing a song","Scare Zoe","Give Zoe a crystal"],"correct_answer":"Scare Zoe"},{"question":"What does Zoe do when she sees the sinister shadow?","options":["Runs away","Laughs at it","Confronts it","Hides behind Shadow"],"correct_answer":"Confronts it"},{"question":"What does Zoe hear in the cave?","options":["A loud roar","Soft whispers","Music playing","Silence"],"correct_answer":"Soft whispers"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_30_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_30_ch2_img1.png","plot_30_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":407,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
