   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_30_7_10","title":"The Secret Society of Shadows","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Underground Worlds","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Zoe stood in the Cave of Whispers, her heart racing. The walls shimmered with faint light, but shadows danced wildly around her. Shadow floated beside her, his eyes wide with worry. \n\n\"You must find the light crystals,\" he reminded her. \"They are hidden deep in the cave.\"\n\nZoe nodded, determination filling her. \"I can do this!\" \n\n\u201cRemember, the sinister shadow is close,\u201d Shadow warned. \u201cHe feeds on fear.\u201d\n\nJust then, a chilling laugh echoed through the cave. The shadows stopped dancing and froze. \u201cThere you are, little girl! You think you can stop me?\u201d \n\nZoe's knees felt weak. She couldn\u2019t help but feel scared. \u201cI-I\u2019m not afraid of you!\u201d she shouted, though inside she was shaking. \n\n\u201cThen prove it!\u201d the sinister shadow hissed. \u201cFind the crystals, if you can!\u201d \n\nWith that, the shadow disappeared into the darkness. Zoe took a deep breath and stepped forward, her eyes scanning the cave. \n\n\u201cLook there!\u201d Shadow pointed to a glimmering spot. \u201cThat\u2019s where the first crystal is!\u201d \n\nShe hurried to the spot, her heart pounding. But as she reached for it, a thick fog rolled in, blocking her view. Zoe could feel her fear creeping back. \n\n\u201cStay strong!\u201d Shadow called. \u201cDon\u2019t let it win!\u201d\n\nZoe closed her eyes, remembering how brave she had felt before. She reached into the fog. Suddenly, her fingers brushed against something cool and smooth. \n\n\u201cIt\u2019s the crystal!\u201d she gasped. \n\nBut just then, the sinister shadow reappeared, swirling in anger. \u201cYou will never have it!\u201d \n\nZoe held up the crystal, its light shining bright. The shadows around her flickered in response. \n\n\u201cNow, let\u2019s see how brave you really are!\u201d \n\nThe shadow lunged at her, darkness swirling like a storm. Zoe took a deep breath and shouted, \u201cI will protect the light!\u201d \n\nAs she did, the crystal flared, lighting up the cave. The shadows began to retreat, but the sinister shadow was not done yet. \u201cYou may have the first crystal, but you\u2019ll never get the second!\u201d\n\nZoe felt her heart race. \u201cSecond crystal? Where is it?\u201d \n\nThe sinister shadow grinned, \u201cFind it, if you dare!\u201d \n\nZoe turned to Shadow, determination in her eyes. \u201cI won\u2019t give up!\u201d\n\nBut as she stepped forward, the cave rumbled. \u201cWhat will happen?\u201d she wondered. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cStay close!\u201d Shadow urged as they ventured deeper into the cave, the tension growing thicker with every step.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWhat awaited them in the shadows? Zoe's heart raced as she felt the presence of the sinister shadow lurking close behind. \n\nShe took a deep breath and pressed on, ready to face whatever came next.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Zoe need to find in the cave?","options":["Light crystals","Magic stones","Treasure chests","Golden keys"],"correct_answer":"Light crystals"},{"question":"What does the sinister shadow do?","options":["Helps Zoe","Disrupts the balance","Tells stories","Finds crystals for Zoe"],"correct_answer":"Disrupts the balance"},{"question":"What happens when Zoe finds the first crystal?","options":["The shadow disappears","The cave rumbles","It starts to rain","She feels tired"],"correct_answer":"The cave rumbles"},{"question":"Who encourages Zoe to stay strong?","options":["The sinister shadow","Her friends","Shadow","The librarian"],"correct_answer":"Shadow"},{"question":"What does the sinister shadow tell Zoe?","options":["She is brave","She will never find the second crystal","The cave is safe","She can leave the cave"],"correct_answer":"She will never find the second crystal"}]},"images":null,"word_count":436,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
