     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"adventure","1":"mischievous","2":"tremble","3":"riddle","4":"determination","image_prompts":["A bright, colorful illustration of Mira and Jasper standing in front of the Great Oak Tree. The tree is majestic, with lush green leaves and a golden sunset in the background. Mira is kneeling, examining a shiny key on the ground, while Jasper looks excited beside her. The magical map is spread out on the grass, glowing softly.","A dramatic scene showing Mira and Jasper running down a narrow path as a rockslide tumbles behind them. The path is surrounded by vibrant green trees and colorful flowers. Mira\u2019s face shows determination and a hint of fear, while Jasper runs happily beside her, ready for the challenge."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A sun-dappled clearing in Eldergrove forest, featuring a smooth, round stone at its center. The stone is intricately carved with a swirling galaxy of stars, illuminated by a faint, ethereal glow. The surrounding trees loom tall, casting dappled shadows, while Mira, a determined twelve-year-old girl, kneels before the stone, her expression a mix of awe and concentration. Jasper, her playful dog, stands alert, adding to the sense of anticipation.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_21_ch2_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 20:32:12"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing An intense standoff in the forest clearing between Mira and Zane. Zane, a charismatic yet antagonistic figure, leans against a tree with a smirk, while Mira stands resiliently, clutching the magical map to her chest. The atmosphere is charged with tension, as sunlight filters through the treetops, casting dramatic shadows. Miras face reflects determination, while Zanes posture oozes confidence, symbolizing the clash of their conflicting desires.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_21_ch2_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 20:32:12"}}}
