   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_21_7_10","title":"The Starlit Path","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Quest or Journey","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Mira loved the night sky. Every evening, she would sit on her porch, gazing at the stars. \u201cLook, Jasper! There\u2019s Orion!\u201d she said, pointing. \n\nJasper, her playful dog, wagged his tail. \u201cWoof!\u201d he barked back, as if he understood. Mira giggled. Sometimes, she thought Jasper was the wisest dog in the world.\n\nOne crisp evening, as Mira stared at the stars, something shiny caught her eye. It twinkled like a star fallen to the ground. \u201cWhat\u2019s that?\u201d she wondered. She jumped up and raced into the woods, Jasper bounding after her.\n\nThe ancient trees were tall and proud. Their leaves whispered secrets as the wind blew. Mira followed the shiny light deeper into the woods. Soon, she reached a small clearing. There, glowing softly in the moonlight, was an old map. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cWow! This must be magical!\u201d Mira exclaimed, picking it up. The map showed her village with strange symbols and dotted lines leading to bright stars. \u201cI wonder what it means?\u201d \n\nJust then, a voice broke through the night. \u201cHey, that\u2019s mine!\u201d It was Zane, the boy who lived down the street. He was known for being sneaky and always wanting to be first. Mira clutched the map tightly. \n\n\u201cNo way, Zane! I found it!\u201d she said, her heart racing. \n\nZane stepped closer. \u201cI\u2019m going to take it! You can\u2019t stop me!\u201d His eyes sparkled with mischief. \n\nMira took a deep breath. \u201cI will figure out these clues first!\u201d she declared. She knew this map could lead to lost stars. She could not let Zane win. \n\n\u201cCome on, Jasper!\u201d she called, adjusting the map in her hands. \n\nTogether, they began their adventure. The stars above twinkled like a million little eyes watching them. What if the stars above were actually lost treasures waiting to be found?\n\n\u201cI\u2019ll find them, just you wait,\u201d Mira said, determined. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2] \n\nZane scowled. \u201cWe\u2019ll see about that!\u201d He chased after her, making her heart race even faster. \n\nThis was just the beginning. Mira felt a thrill of excitement. Solving riddles and finding stars? She couldn\u2019t wait!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Mira love to look at every evening?","options":["Trees","Stars","Flowers","Clouds"],"correct_answer":"Stars"},{"question":"Who is Mira\u2019s loyal companion?","options":["Zane","Bella","Jasper","Max"],"correct_answer":"Jasper"},{"question":"What does Mira find in the woods?","options":["A treasure chest","A glowing map","A giant animal","A lost toy"],"correct_answer":"A glowing map"},{"question":"Who challenges Mira for the map?","options":["Her friend","Her brother","Zane","A stranger"],"correct_answer":"Zane"},{"question":"What does Mira plan to do with the map?","options":["Find hidden stars","Sell it","Throw it away","Hide it"],"correct_answer":"Find hidden stars"}]},"images":null,"word_count":352,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
