   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_21_7_10","title":"The Starlit Path","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Quest or Journey","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Mira stood in her backyard, the map clutched tightly in her hands. The sun dipped low in the sky, painting everything in warm shades of orange and pink. Jasper, her fluffy dog, wagged his tail excitedly. \n\n\u201cAre you ready, Jasper?\u201d she asked, her heart racing. \n\nHe barked happily, his eyes sparkling with joy. They were about to start an incredible adventure.\n\nMira spread the map on the grass. It glowed softly, and the lines seemed to dance in the fading light. \u201cThe first star is hidden near the Great Oak Tree,\u201d she read aloud. The tree stood tall and proud, its branches reaching for the sky. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they walked toward the tree, Mira felt a mix of excitement and nervousness. She could hear the leaves rustling in the gentle breeze. \u201cWhat if Zane finds us?\u201d she said, biting her lip. \n\nJasper looked up at her, sensing her worry. \u201cWoof!\u201d he said, as if to say, \u201cDon\u2019t worry, we can do this!\u201d\n\nWhen they reached the Great Oak Tree, Mira noticed something shiny at its base. \u201cLook, Jasper! What\u2019s that?\u201d She knelt down and picked up a small, silver key. \n\nJust then, she heard a voice behind her. \u201cWell, well, well. What do we have here?\u201d It was Zane, grinning mischievously. \n\nMira jumped to her feet, clutching the key tightly. \u201cThis is our adventure, Zane! You can\u2019t take it!\u201d \n\nHe smirked. \u201cBut I have a better map. You\u2019ll never find the star before I do!\u201d Zane stepped closer, trying to grab the key.\n\nMira held it close to her chest. \u201cYou won\u2019t win. I\u2019m going to find the lost stars!\u201d \n\nSuddenly, the ground trembled. A shadow loomed over them, blocking the last rays of sunlight. Mira looked up to see an enormous rockslide cascading down the hill. \n\n\u201cRun!\u201d she shouted, pulling Jasper along as they dashed away from the falling rocks. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThey sprinted toward a narrow path that led deeper into the woods. \u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d Mira asked, her breath coming in quick gasps.\n\n\u201cWe have to figure out the riddle,\u201d Jasper seemed to say with his eyes. Mira remembered the map. She opened it again, searching for clues.\n\n\u201cFind the star where the old tree stands, guarded by riddles and ancient lands,\u201d she read aloud. \u201cThe key must open something!\u201d \n\nZane\u2019s laughter echoed behind them. \u201cYou can\u2019t escape! I\u2019ll find you!\u201d \n\nMira\u2019s heart pounded. They needed to solve the riddle fast. What if Zane caught up with them? \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go, Jasper! We have a star to find!\u201d \n\nWith her heart full of determination, Mira raced down the path, ready to face whatever came next.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Mira find at the Great Oak Tree?","options":["A map","A silver key","A treasure","A dog"],"correct_answer":"A silver key"},{"question":"Who confronts Mira while she is at the tree?","options":["Jasper","Zane","Her mom","A stranger"],"correct_answer":"Zane"},{"question":"What happens when Zane tries to take the key?","options":["Mira gives it to him","A rockslide occurs","Jasper barks loudly","They find another map"],"correct_answer":"A rockslide occurs"},{"question":"What is the riddle that Mira must solve?","options":["Find the lost treasure","Find the star where the old tree stands","Find the hidden cave","Find Zane's map"],"correct_answer":"Find the star where the old tree stands"},{"question":"What does Mira feel when she sees the rockslide?","options":["Excited","Fearful","Happy","Calm"],"correct_answer":"Fearful"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_21_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_21_ch2_img1.png","plot_21_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":451,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
