   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_21_7_10","title":"The Starlit Path","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Quest or Journey","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Mira and Jasper stood at the edge of the Whispering Woods. The trees towered high above them, their leaves shimmering like silver in the moonlight. \u201cAre you ready for this, Jasper?\u201d Mira asked, squeezing the silver key in her pocket. \n\n\u201cWoof!\u201d Jasper barked, wagging his tail enthusiastically. He loved adventures, especially with Mira. They stepped into the woods, and the air grew cooler. Shadows danced around them, and the sound of crickets filled the night.\n\nSuddenly, Mira spotted a glowing light. \u201cLook!\u201d she whispered, pointing ahead. The light flickered like a star. They hurried towards it. \n\nAs they got closer, they saw it was an old stone pedestal. A riddle was carved into its surface. Mira took a deep breath. This was the first riddle they had to solve. \n\n\u201cWhat has many keys but can't open locks?\u201d she read aloud. \n\nJasper tilted his head. \u201cHmm\u2026 that\u2019s tricky!\u201d \n\nMira thought hard. \u201cPiano!\u201d she shouted excitedly. \u201cIt must be a piano!\u201d \n\nJust then, they heard a rustling sound behind them. Mira turned and gasped. Zane, the rival treasure seeker, stepped out from the shadows. \u201cYou think you can solve the riddle before me? Not a chance!\u201d \n\nMira\u2019s heart raced. She felt the pressure of the moment. \u201cWe\u2019ll see about that!\u201d she replied bravely. \n\nZane smirked. \u201cI\u2019ll make sure you don\u2019t reach the star first! This adventure is mine!\u201d \n\nMira stepped back, her mind racing. \u201cWhat if he tries to steal the map?\u201d she thought. \u201cWe have to hurry!\u201d \n\nJust then, the pedestal glowed brighter. The answer appeared in sparkling letters: \u201cPiano.\u201d The pedestal opened, revealing a shimmering star inside. \n\n\u201cWow!\u201d Mira gasped, reaching out. But then Zane lunged forward, trying to grab the star. \n\n\u201cNo! It\u2019s ours!\u201d Mira shouted. \n\nIn the struggle, the map slipped from Mira\u2019s hands, fluttering to the ground. \n\n\u201cGot it!\u201d Zane grinned, clutching the map. \n\n\u201cMira, we must get it back!\u201d Jasper barked, his eyes wide with determination. \n\nMira felt a rush of fear but also a spark of bravery. \u201cWe can\u2019t let him win, Jasper!\u201d she declared. \n\nAs Zane turned to leave, Mira grabbed Jasper\u2019s collar. \u201cQuick, we have to follow him!\u201d \n\nThey raced after Zane, the night sky sparkling above them. But would they catch him before he disappeared into the darkness?\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What riddle did Mira have to solve?","options":["What is a tree?","What has many keys but can't open locks?","What is a star?","What is a dog?"],"correct_answer":"What has many keys but can't open locks?"},{"question":"Who tries to steal the map?","options":["Mira","Jasper","Zane","The tree"],"correct_answer":"Zane"},{"question":"What did the pedestal reveal?","options":["A treasure chest","A glowing star","A new map","A secret door"],"correct_answer":"A glowing star"},{"question":"What does Mira feel when Zane appears?","options":["Calm","Excited","Scared and brave","Happy"],"correct_answer":"Scared and brave"},{"question":"What do Mira and Jasper decide to do at the end of the chapter?","options":["Stay where they are","Chase after Zane","Find another riddle","Go home"],"correct_answer":"Chase after Zane"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_21_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_21_ch3_img1.png","plot_21_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":389,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
