   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_21_7_10","title":"The Starlit Path","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Quest or Journey","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Mira and Jasper raced through the Whispering Woods. The tall trees swayed gently, their leaves rustling like secrets. Mira clutched her map tightly. \u201cWe have to catch Zane!\u201d she said, determination shining in her eyes.\n\nJasper barked in agreement. \u201cWoof! Let\u2019s go!\u201d His tail wagged with excitement. \n\nSuddenly, they spotted Zane ahead. He was standing near a shimmering stream. \u201cYou\u2019ll never catch me!\u201d he shouted, waving the map in the air. \n\nMira felt a twinge of anger. \u201cZane! Give it back!\u201d Her voice echoed through the trees.\n\nZane grinned. \u201cOnly if you can solve my next riddle!\u201d He stepped back, pointing at a sparkling stone in the stream. \n\nMira took a deep breath. \u201cWhat\u2019s your riddle?\u201d \n\nZane crossed his arms. \u201cI am not alive, but I grow. I don\u2019t have lungs, but I need air. What am I?\u201d \n\nMira thought hard. The answer danced in her mind. \u201cFire!\u201d she exclaimed confidently.\n\nZane\u2019s smile faded. \u201cYou\u2019re right! But that doesn\u2019t mean you\u2019ll win!\u201d He jumped onto a narrow path along the stream, darting away.\n\n\u201cCome on, Jasper! We can\u2019t let him get away!\u201d Mira yelled, following him. They dashed along the muddy trail, their feet splashing in puddles.\n\nSuddenly, Jasper stopped, sniffing the air. \u201cWait, Mira! Look!\u201d He pointed with his nose. \n\nIn the midst of the trees, a faint glow caught Mira's eye. \u201cWhat is that?\u201d she whispered in awe. \n\nThey approached carefully. The glow was a tiny, sparkling star trapped in a web of twinkling vines. \u201cIt\u2019s beautiful!\u201d Mira exclaimed. \n\nJasper wagged his tail. \u201cLet\u2019s free it!\u201d\n\nMira reached out, carefully untangling the vines. As she did, the star twinkled brighter. \u201cYou\u2019re free!\u201d she cheered.\n\nWith a burst of light, the star floated into the sky, joining its friends. \n\n\u201cZane can\u2019t take this from us,\u201d Mira said, her heart full of hope. \u201cWe can do this!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nJasper looked at her, his eyes gleaming. \u201cWe\u2019re a team, Mira! Let\u2019s find the next star!\u201d\n\nJust then, they heard Zane shout from a distance. \u201cYou might have one, but I\u2019m going to get the others!\u201d\n\nMira clenched her fists, ready for the next challenge. \u201cI won\u2019t let him win,\u201d she said firmly. \u201cLet\u2019s go find those stars!\u201d\n\nWith renewed energy, Mira and Jasper raced deeper into the woods, ready for whatever came next.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Zane wave in the air?","options":["A toy","The map","A star","A riddle"],"correct_answer":"The map"},{"question":"What is the riddle Zane gives to Mira?","options":["What is a tree?","What is fire?","What is a star?","What is a dog?"],"correct_answer":"What is fire?"},{"question":"What do Mira and Jasper find in the woods?","options":["A treasure chest","A trapped star","Another map","A hidden cave"],"correct_answer":"A trapped star"},{"question":"How does Mira feel after freeing the star?","options":["Sad","Angry","Hopeful","Scared"],"correct_answer":"Hopeful"},{"question":"What does Mira say they have to do after finding the star?","options":["Give up","Rest","Find the next star","Find Zane"],"correct_answer":"Find the next star"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_21_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_21_ch4_img1.png","plot_21_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":403,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
