   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_21_7_10","title":"The Starlit Path","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Quest or Journey","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Mira and Jasper stood at the edge of the Moonlit Lake. The water shimmered like stars scattered on the ground. \"This place feels magical,\" Mira said, her eyes wide with wonder. Jasper wagged his tail, ready for their next adventure.\n\n\"Look!\" Mira pointed to a bright light beneath the water. \"It must be the next star!\" She knelt down, hoping to catch a glimpse. The light danced, flickering like a firefly. \n\nSuddenly, a splash sent waves rippling through the lake. \"Hey! That's my star!\" Zane's voice echoed as he emerged from the bushes, soaked but grinning. Mira clenched her fists. Zane had followed them!\n\n\"Why do you want it so badly, Zane?\" Mira asked. \"It\u2019s not just a treasure. It\u2019s a star!\" \n\nZane shrugged. \"Stars are just shiny rocks! But with them, I can be the best treasure hunter!\" He lunged forward, trying to grab the light. Mira leapt in front of him. \"No! You can\u2019t take it!\"\n\nAs they struggled, Jasper barked loudly. \"Ruff! Let\u2019s work together!\" He jumped in, splashing water everywhere. Zane slipped on the wet grass and tripped, falling back into the shallow water.\n\nMira gasped. \"Now's our chance!\" She reached for the light beneath the water. With a gentle pull, the star floated up. It sparkled brightly, glowing like a miniature sun. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\"This star needs a name,\" Mira said, holding it close. \"Let\u2019s call it Lighty!\" Jasper barked in agreement, wagging his tail even faster.\n\nZane, dripping wet, looked up at them, his eyes wide. \"Wait! I didn\u2019t mean to\u2014\" \n\nMira smiled. \"You can help us, Zane. We can all be treasure hunters together!\" Zane looked surprised. \"You really mean it?\" \n\n\"Of course!\" Mira nodded. \"We can find more stars as a team.\" \n\nZane\u2019s frown turned into a grin. \"Okay! I\u2019ll help!\" \n\nThey all cheered, filled with excitement. Together, they raced along the shore, ready for their next adventure. The night sky twinkled above them, brighter than ever.\n\n\"What\u2019s next?\" Zane asked, his energy renewed. \n\nMira pulled out the magical map. \"Let\u2019s find the Star of Dreams!\" \n\nWith hearts full of hope, they set off, laughter echoing through the night.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\"Together, we can find them all!\" Mira said, her voice strong. \n\nLittle did they know, the greatest treasure was the friendship they were building.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Mira and Jasper find at Moonlit Lake?","options":["A treasure chest","A magical star","A map","A fish"],"correct_answer":"A magical star"},{"question":"What name do they give to the star they found?","options":["Twinkle","Lighty","Shiny","Dreamy"],"correct_answer":"Lighty"},{"question":"What does Zane want to do with the stars?","options":["Keep them all","Sell them","Be the best treasure hunter","Share them with everyone"],"correct_answer":"Be the best treasure hunter"},{"question":"How does Mira respond to Zane's actions?","options":["She gets angry","She invites him to join them","She runs away","She doesn't say anything"],"correct_answer":"She invites him to join them"},{"question":"What lesson do the characters learn by the end of the chapter?","options":["Winning is everything","Working alone is best","Friendship is important","Stars are just rocks"],"correct_answer":"Friendship is important"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_21_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_21_ch5_img1.png","plot_21_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":393,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
