       [DEBUG] Checking shared image: {"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing An atmospheric image of a mystical forest at dusk, with warm golden light filtering through ancient trees, illuminating a young girl holding a glowing map, her loyal golden retriever by her side. The mood is one of anticipation and magic, suggesting a sense of adventure.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_21_ch1_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 20:32:39"}
