   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_21_11_14","title":"The Starlit Path","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Quest or Journey","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Mira stood at the edge of the Whispering Woods, her heart thumping with excitement. The sun dipped low on the horizon, painting the sky in shades of purple and gold. This was no ordinary evening. Tonight was the night she would uncover the secrets of the stars. \n\n\u201cAre you ready, Jasper?\u201d she asked, glancing down at her loyal dog, a scruffy terrier with bright, curious eyes. He wagged his tail enthusiastically, as if he understood the importance of the moment. Mira reached down to scratch behind his ears. \u201cLet\u2019s find those lost constellations!\u201d\n\nAs they stepped into the woods, the air shimmered with a hint of magic. Ancient trees towered above them, their twisted branches forming a natural archway. Mira had heard the stories\u2014tales of a magical map hidden deep within these woods. A map that could lead to the lost stars of her village, which had vanished from the night sky years ago. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nMira imagined the map\u2019s intricate designs and sparkling routes, each one a doorway to adventure. But she was not the only one searching. Rumors had spread about a rival treasure seeker named Zane, a boy with a knack for getting into trouble and an eye out for anything that glittered. Mira shivered at the thought of him\u2014he was fast, cunning, and determined to claim the map for himself.\n\n\u201cStay close, Jasper. We need to be careful,\u201d she whispered, scanning their surroundings. The trees whispered secrets, their leaves rustling softly, almost as if they were warning her. \n\nSuddenly, they stumbled upon a clearing where the moonlight spilled like silver over a weathered stone pedestal. Atop it lay an old parchment, its edges frayed and curling. Mira\u2019s breath caught in her throat. This had to be it! \u201cLook, Jasper! The map!\u201d she exclaimed, racing toward it.\n\nAs she reached for the parchment, a voice interrupted her, sending chills down her spine. \u201cI wouldn\u2019t touch that if I were you,\u201d said a familiar smug voice. From the shadows emerged Zane, his arms crossed and a sly grin plastered across his face. \u201cThat map belongs to me. You\u2019re in over your head, Mira.\u201d\n\nMira\u2019s heart pounded. She had to think fast. \u201cI found it first!\u201d she declared, trying to sound braver than she felt. \u201cYou can\u2019t just take it from me!\u201d\n\nZane stepped closer, his eyes glinting with mischief. \u201cYou think you can solve the riddles? No one has ever returned with the map. You\u2019re just a kid playing pretend.\u201d\n\nMira clenched her fists, anger bubbling inside her. \u201cI may be just a kid, but I won\u2019t give up without a fight!\u201d She glanced at Jasper, who barked fiercely, as if standing guard. \n\n\u201cThen let\u2019s see who\u2019s really brave,\u201d Zane challenged, his grin widening. \u201cThe first to solve the riddle gets the map. Are you in?\u201d\n\nMira hesitated, knowing the stakes were high. If she failed, the stars might remain lost forever. But deep down, she felt a flicker of courage ignite. \u201cI\u2019m in!\u201d\n\nAs Zane stepped back to reveal the text of the riddle, Mira\u2019s mind raced. Solving it could mean the difference between restoring her village\u2019s night sky or letting Zane win. She took a deep breath, ready to face whatever challenge lay ahead.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cHere\u2019s the riddle: \u2018I am not alive, but I can grow; I don\u2019t breathe, but I need air. What am I?\u2019\u201d Zane sneered, crossing his arms again. Mira\u2019s heart raced as she considered the words. The answer could be the key to everything.\n\nShe could feel the weight of the moment pressing down on her. With Jasper at her side, she knew she had to dig deep, summoning all her bravery to solve the riddle and unlock the path to the stars.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Mira discover in the Whispering Woods?","options":["A treasure chest","A magical map","A talking tree","An ancient sword"],"correct_answer":"A magical map"},{"question":"Who is Mira's rival in the story?","options":["Jasper","Zane","Her mother","The village elder"],"correct_answer":"Zane"},{"question":"What is the first riddle Zane presents to Mira?","options":["What has keys but can't open locks?","What is always in front of you but can't be seen?","I am not alive, but I can grow; I don\u2019t breathe, but I need air. What am I?","What can travel around the world while staying in a corner?"],"correct_answer":"I am not alive, but I can grow; I don\u2019t breathe, but I need air. What am I?"},{"question":"What motivates Mira to accept Zane's challenge?","options":["Curiosity","Fear","Anger","Laziness"],"correct_answer":"Anger"},{"question":"What role does Jasper play in Mira's adventure?","options":["He is a rival","He is her friend","He is a source of trouble","He is a magical creature"],"correct_answer":"He is her friend"}]},"images":null,"word_count":641,"reading_level":"Builder"}
