   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_21_11_14","title":"The Starlit Path","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Quest or Journey","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Mira stood at the edge of the Whispering Woods, her heart racing like a drum. The trees loomed high above her, their twisted branches forming a natural archway. Jasper barked excitedly, his tail wagging as if he could sense the adventure ahead. The golden rays of the afternoon sun filtered through the leaves, casting dappled shadows on the ground. \n\n\u201cAre you ready for this, buddy?\u201d Mira asked, kneeling to scratch Jasper behind the ears. His big brown eyes sparkled with enthusiasm.\n\nAs they ventured deeper into the woods, the atmosphere shifted. A cool breeze whispered through the branches, and the air was thick with the scent of pine and earth. Mira pulled the map from her pocket, tracing the next location with her finger. \"The next star we need to find is the Celestial Wing,\" she murmured. \"It\u2019s hidden somewhere in these woods.\"\n\nSuddenly, a rustling noise caught their attention. Mira and Jasper froze, their eyes wide. Out of the bushes, Zane emerged, a triumphant smirk plastered on his face. \u201cWell, well, if it isn\u2019t the star seeker and her mutt,\u201d he taunted, crossing his arms. \u201cYou\u2019re not getting to the next star before me. I\u2019m closer than you think!\u201d\n\nMira felt a pang of fear. Zane was cunning, and she had already seen how far he was willing to go to get what he wanted. \u201cWe\u2019ll see about that,\u201d she replied, her voice steadier than she felt. With a flick of her wrist, she pointed at the map. \u201cThe Celestial Wing is guarded by a riddle. First one to solve it gets the star.\u201d\n\nZane raised an eyebrow, intrigued. \u201cA riddle? What\u2019s the point of that? I can just take the map from you,\u201d he challenged. But Mira sensed his hesitation; he needed the map, just as much as she did.\n\n\u201cMaybe you could try,\u201d she said, her voice steady, \u201cbut I\u2019m not giving up without a fight.\u201d \n\nThey both knelt near a gnarled tree stump, where the first clue inscribed in ancient script awaited them. Mira read it aloud: \u201cI have wings but cannot fly; I am a treasure in the night sky. What am I?\u201d \n\nJasper sniffed around the stump, his nose twitching as if he understood the answer just as much as Mira did. But it was Zane who shouted first, \u201cA star! It\u2019s a star!\u201d \n\n\u201cWrong,\u201d Mira replied, shaking her head. \u201cStars don\u2019t have wings.\u201d She thought for a moment and the answer clicked in her mind. \u201cA constellation! Constellations have wings... like the Celestial Wing!\u201d\n\nMira watched Zane's expression flicker from confidence to surprise. He looked down, visibly frustrated. \u201cNo fair! You\u2019re just lucky,\u201d he grumbled, but lost in his defeat, he turned and started to walk away, leaving Mira and Jasper to celebrate.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go find it, Jasper!\u201d Mira exclaimed, a rush of excitement surging through her. They followed the map, the trees parting to reveal a glimmering clearing bathed in twilight. \n\nThe Celestial Wing shimmered in the sky, a stunning formation of stars that looked like delicate feathers against the deepening night. Mira felt a swell of pride and joy. She had done this. She had solved the riddle and discovered another lost star. \n\nJasper barked happily, running in circles beneath the shining constellation. Mira looked up, her heart full. \u201cWe did it, buddy! One step closer to bringing back the night sky.\u201d \n\nAs she gazed at the stars, Mira realized that true bravery wasn't just facing Zane. It was about believing in herself and the journey ahead.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1: A wide shot of the Whispering Woods, showcasing towering trees with intricate canopies. In the foreground, Mira kneels beside Jasper, who looks up at her with excited anticipation. The dappled sunlight creates a magical atmosphere, hinting at the adventure within the woods.]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2: A close-up of Mira and Zane facing off near the ancient tree stump, with the riddle inscribed on it. Mira looks determined and confident, while Zane wears a frustrated expression. The surrounding woods add an element of mystery, with shadows dancing around them.]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What challenge does Mira propose to Zane?","options":["To race to the Celestial Wing","To solve a riddle","To find a hidden treasure","To share the map"],"correct_answer":"To solve a riddle"},{"question":"What is the answer to the riddle they encounter?","options":["A bird","A star","A constellation","A treasure"],"correct_answer":"A constellation"},{"question":"How does Mira feel after solving the riddle?","options":["Defeated","Confused","Proud and joyful","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Proud and joyful"},{"question":"What is the main setting of Chapter 5?","options":["The Old Oak","The Whispering Woods","A hidden cave","Mira's house"],"correct_answer":"The Whispering Woods"},{"question":"What does Jasper do when they discover the Celestial Wing?","options":["Barks happily","Grows quiet","Runs away","Sleeps"],"correct_answer":"Barks happily"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_21_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_21_ch5_img1.png","plot_21_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":690,"reading_level":"Builder"}
