     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"riddle","1":"vine","2":"shimmer","3":"tunnel","4":"sparkly","image_prompts":["A colorful illustration of a small blue door with gold stars, partially hidden behind thick, twisty green vines. The door should look magical and inviting, glowing softly in the sunlight.","A vibrant, magical tunnel filled with glowing flowers and twinkling lights. Leo and Ms. Tilly should be shown walking through the tunnel, looking amazed and excited, with Pippin perched on Ms. Tilly's shoulder."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A tranquil pond illuminated by moonlight, with a stone pedestal at its center. The pedestal features intricate carvings depicting scenes of friendship and courage, surrounded by lush trees that form a protective canopy overhead. The mood is serene yet mysterious, suggesting a moment of discovery and introspection.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_22_ch4_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 20:26:19"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dramatic confrontation scene where Leo and Ms. Tilly stand defiantly against the Gnome King, who looms with a mischievous grin. The atmosphere is charged with tension, with swirling mist around them, revealing the contrast between the characters determined expressions and the Gnome Kings cunning, playful demeanor.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_22_ch4_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 20:26:19"}}}
