   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_22_7_10","title":"The Secret Compass","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Quest or Journey","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Leo stood at the edge of the enchanted forest. The trees were tall and twisted, their leaves shimmering like tiny stars. \u201cThis place is amazing!\u201d he shouted, eyes wide.\n\nMs. Tilly adjusted her oversized glasses. \u201cJust wait until we see the Gnome King! He loves to play tricks.\u201d Pippin the parrot squawked, \u201cTricks! Tricks!\u201d\n\n\u201cDo you think he\u2019ll try to trick us?\u201d Leo asked nervously.\n\n\u201cOf course! But we have the compass!\u201d Ms. Tilly replied, patting the shiny compass in her pocket. \u201cLet\u2019s see where it leads us.\u201d \n\nWith a gentle nudge, the compass needle spun and pointed deeper into the forest. \u201cOnward!\u201d cried Leo, feeling braver.\n\nAs they walked, Leo noticed strange mushrooms that glowed in colors like rainbows. \u201cLook at those!\u201d he exclaimed, bending down to take a closer look. Ms. Tilly plucked one and sniffed it. \u201cThey smell like candy!\u201d\n\nJust then, a tiny voice shouted, \u201cHalt!\u201d A small gnome appeared, wearing a hat that was too big for his head. He crossed his arms and tapped his foot. \u201cYou\u2019re not allowed to be here!\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s your name?\u201d Leo asked, curiosity bubbling up.\n\n\u201cI\u2019m Gilly, the Gnome King\u2019s helper!\u201d said the gnome, puffing out his chest. \u201cAnd you must turn back! The Island of Whimsy is a secret!\u201d\n\n\u201cWhy is it a secret?\u201d Ms. Tilly asked, intrigued.\n\nGilly grinned. \u201cBecause it\u2019s full of surprises! If you want to go, you must solve my riddle!\u201d\n\nLeo and Ms. Tilly exchanged excited glances. \u201cWhat\u2019s the riddle?\u201d Leo asked eagerly.\n\nGilly\u2019s eyes twinkled. \u201cI make you laugh, I make you cry. I can be real, or just a lie. What am I?\u201d\n\nThey thought hard. \u201cIs it a joke?\u201d Leo guessed.\n\n\u201cNope!\u201d Gilly laughed. \u201cTry again!\u201d\n\nLeo scratched his head, while Ms. Tilly pondered. \u201cCould it be\u2026 a story?\u201d she finally said.\n\nGilly clapped his hands. \u201cYou got it! But now, you must pass my next challenge!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nJust then, a gust of wind blew through the trees. Leaves twirled like dancers. \u201cWhat\u2019s the next challenge?\u201d Leo asked, feeling a spark of worry.\n\n\u201cFind the key hidden under the stone!\u201d Gilly pointed to a giant, shiny rock nearby. \u201cBut beware! The Gnome King does not like intruders!\u201d\n\nLeo and Ms. Tilly ran to the rock. It was big and heavy! \u201cWe need to move it!\u201d Leo said, pushing with all his might.\n\nSuddenly, the ground trembled! \u201cHurry!\u201d Ms. Tilly shouted. \u201cWe don\u2019t have much time!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nLeo felt a rush of excitement. \u201cLet\u2019s do this together!\u201d They pushed the rock as hard as they could. \n\nWith one last heave, the rock rolled aside, revealing a sparkling key! \u201cWe did it!\u201d Leo cheered.\n\nBut a shadow loomed behind them. It was the Gnome King, his eyes sparkling with mischief. \u201cYou think you can find my island? Let\u2019s see how you do against my magic!\u201d","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the first challenge Gilly gives to Leo and Ms. Tilly?","options":["Find a hidden key","Solve a riddle","Catch a talking animal","Climb a tall tree"],"correct_answer":"Solve a riddle"},{"question":"What color are the glowing mushrooms in the forest?","options":["Green","Red","Rainbow","Blue"],"correct_answer":"Rainbow"},{"question":"Who is Gilly?","options":["A talking compass","The Gnome King's helper","A magical tree","A mischievous parrot"],"correct_answer":"The Gnome King's helper"},{"question":"What do Leo and Ms. Tilly find under the rock?","options":["A treasure map","A magical stone","A sparkling key","A talking animal"],"correct_answer":"A sparkling key"},{"question":"What does the Gnome King threaten to use against Leo and Ms. Tilly?","options":["His magic","A giant monster","A riddle","A treasure"],"correct_answer":"His magic"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_22_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_22_ch2_img1.png","plot_22_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":488,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
