   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_22_7_10","title":"The Secret Compass","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Quest or Journey","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Leo\u2019s heart raced as he stood in front of the Gnome King's tower. It loomed high above them, covered in vines and glittering stones. \"This is where he lives, right?\" Leo asked, glancing at Ms. Tilly.  \n\n\"Yes, but we must be careful,\" she replied, adjusting her colorful scarf. Pippin squawked, \u201cCareful! Careful!\u201d  \n\nJust then, the compass in Leo\u2019s hand whirred. \u201cTurn left at the big mushroom!\u201d it chimed. \u201cThe Gnome King is waiting for you!\u201d  \n\n\u201cDo you think he knows we have the key?\u201d Leo wondered. Ms. Tilly bit her lip. \u201cI hope not. We have to be quick!\u201d  \n\nThey tiptoed through the tall grass, trying to stay hidden from the Gnome King\u2019s watchful eyes. Suddenly, a loud laugh echoed. \u201cHa! You think you can sneak into my tower?\u201d  \n\nThe Gnome King appeared, his green hat oversized and floppy. \u201cWell, well, if it isn\u2019t Leo and Ms. Tilly! You\u2019re too late!\u201d  \n\n\u201cWhat do you mean?\u201d Leo shouted. \u201cWe\u2019re not going to let you keep us from the Island of Whimsy!\u201d  \n\n\u201cAh, the island!\u201d The Gnome King grinned, revealing a mischievous twinkle in his eye. \u201cI know all about it, but can you solve my riddle first? If you can\u2019t, you will never find it!\u201d  \n\nMs. Tilly stepped forward. \u201cWe\u2019re ready! What\u2019s your riddle?\u201d  \n\n\u201cVery simple!\u201d he cackled. \u201cI speak without a mouth and hear without ears. I have no body, but I come alive with wind. What am I?\u201d  \n\nLeo whispered to Ms. Tilly, \u201cWhat could it be?\u201d  \n\nPippin flapped his wings and squawked, \u201cWind! Wind!\u201d  \n\nThe Gnome King frowned. \u201cIncorrect!\u201d  \n\n\u201cNo! Wait!\u201d Leo shouted. \u201cIs it\u2026 an echo?\u201d  \n\nThe Gnome King\u2019s face turned pale. \u201cCorrect! But now you\u2019ve made me angry!\u201d  \n\nWith a flick of his wrist, he waved a sparkly wand. \u201cYou\u2019ll never reach the island now!\u201d The ground shook as a wall of vines sprang up, blocking their path.  \n\nLeo felt panic rise in his chest. \u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d he asked.  \n\n\u201cFollow the compass!\u201d Ms. Tilly cried. \u201cIt will guide us!\u201d  \n\nBut the compass had gone silent. Leo stared at it, feeling helpless. \u201cWhat if we can\u2019t find our way?\u201d  \n\nPippin landed on Leo\u2019s shoulder. \u201cBelieve! Believe!\u201d  \n\nJust then, the compass flickered back to life. \u201cFind the hidden door beneath the vines!\u201d  \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Leo shouted, determination flooding through him.  \n\nTogether, they dashed towards the wall of vines. Could they find the hidden door before the Gnome King stopped them?  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]  \n\nMs. Tilly and Leo stood at the foot of the tower, gazing up at the Gnome King\u2019s towering stronghold. The lush, vibrant forest surrounded them, with whimsical flowers and dancing butterflies brightening the scene.  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]  \n\nA moment of tension as Leo, Ms. Tilly, and Pippin rush towards the wall of thick, green vines. The Gnome King\u2019s silhouette looms in the background, casting a shadow over them. The air is charged with urgency and excitement.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What riddle does the Gnome King ask?","options":["What has legs?","What is an echo?","What can fly?","What is a riddle?"],"correct_answer":"What is an echo?"},{"question":"What does Pippin tell Leo to do?","options":["Run fast","Believe","Hide","Yell"],"correct_answer":"Believe"},{"question":"What happens when Leo solves the riddle?","options":["The Gnome King gives up","A wall of vines appears","They find the island","They get lost"],"correct_answer":"A wall of vines appears"},{"question":"Who is Ms. Tilly?","options":["A talking compass","Leo's neighbor","The Gnome King","A magical creature"],"correct_answer":"Leo's neighbor"},{"question":"What does the compass command Leo to do?","options":["Dance","Follow the Gnome King","Find the hidden door","Climb the tower"],"correct_answer":"Find the hidden door"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_22_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_22_ch3_img1.png","plot_22_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":499,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
