   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_22_7_10","title":"The Secret Compass","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Quest or Journey","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Leo peered at the wall of thick, twisty vines. \u201cHow are we going to get through this?\u201d he wondered aloud.\n\nMs. Tilly stroked her chin. \u201cThe Gnome King loves riddles. Maybe he left another clue!\u201d She pulled out her notebook, scribbling furiously.\n\nPippin squawked, \u201cRiddle! Riddle!\u201d He flapped his colorful wings excitedly.\n\nJust then, the compass chimed in. \u201cFollow your hearts, and you shall find the way! Look for the door that hides in the day.\u201d\n\n\u201cHmm, a door that hides?\u201d Leo said, scratching his head. \u201cWhat could that mean?\u201d\n\nMs. Tilly smiled brightly. \u201cMaybe it\u2019s something we can\u2019t see right away!\u201d\n\nLeo started to look closely at the vines. \u201cLet\u2019s search together!\u201d\n\nThey touched the vines, pushing and pulling. Suddenly, Pippin let out a loud squawk! \u201cLook! Over there!\u201d\n\nLeo and Ms. Tilly turned to see a shimmer in the sunlight. There, hidden behind the vines, was a small door!\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe door was painted bright blue with gold stars. It sparkled like it was waiting for them.\n\n\u201cWhat do you think is behind it?\u201d Leo asked, his heart racing with excitement.\n\n\u201cOnly one way to find out!\u201d Ms. Tilly winked. She turned the doorknob and pushed the door open. \n\nInside, they found a sparkling tunnel filled with glowing flowers and twinkling lights. It felt like a magical dream. \n\n\u201cWow! It\u2019s beautiful!\u201d Leo exclaimed. \n\nBut just then, they heard a chuckling voice. \u201cGoing somewhere?\u201d It was the Gnome King, sitting on a mushroom, grinning mischievously.\n\n\u201cYou again!\u201d Leo shouted, his fists clenched.\n\n\u201cDo you want to solve my riddle?\u201d the Gnome King asked, folding his arms. \u201cIf you do, I might just let you pass.\u201d\n\n\u201cBring it on!\u201d said Leo, feeling brave.\n\n\u201cVery well! What runs but never walks, has a mouth but never talks?\u201d the Gnome King began to cackle.\n\nLeo thought hard, and Ms. Tilly looked worried. \u201cWhat could it be?\u201d \n\nThen Leo shouted, \u201cA river! It\u2019s a river!\u201d\n\nThe Gnome King\u2019s smile faded. \u201cCorrect! You may pass. But I\u2019ll be watching you!\u201d He vanished in a puff of sparkly smoke.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Leo said, feeling proud.\n\nAs they walked deeper into the tunnel, hope blossomed in their hearts. They were closer to the Island of Whimsy than ever!\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cDo you think we will find the island soon?\u201d Leo asked eagerly.\n\n\u201cAbsolutely! With our friendship and courage, we can do anything!\u201d Ms. Tilly replied cheerfully.\n\nTogether, they ventured forth into the unknown, ready for whatever adventures awaited them.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does the compass say about finding the door?","options":["Look for the door that hides in the night","Follow your hearts, and you shall find the way","Open the door without thinking","The door is behind the Gnome King"],"correct_answer":"Follow your hearts, and you shall find the way"},{"question":"What color is the hidden door?","options":["Red","Green","Blue","Yellow"],"correct_answer":"Blue"},{"question":"What does the Gnome King ask Leo and Ms. Tilly to solve?","options":["A puzzle","A riddle","A math problem","A riddle about friendship"],"correct_answer":"A riddle"},{"question":"What is the answer to the Gnome King's riddle?","options":["A tree","A car","A river","A mountain"],"correct_answer":"A river"},{"question":"What do Leo and Ms. Tilly feel as they walk into the tunnel?","options":["Scared","Angry","Hopeful","Tired"],"correct_answer":"Hopeful"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_22_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_22_ch4_img1.png","plot_22_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":422,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
