   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_22_7_10","title":"The Secret Compass","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Quest or Journey","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Chapter 5: The Gnome King\u2019s Trick\n\nThe tunnel glittered with sparkling gems. Leo, Ms. Tilly, and Pippin stepped cautiously. \u201cWow! Look at all the colors!\u201d Leo said, wide-eyed. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cColorful, isn't it?\u201d Ms. Tilly replied, her eyes twinkling. \u201cI wonder what else we will find!\u201d Pippin squawked happily, flapping his wings. \u201cAdventure time!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, the ground began to shake. \u201cOh no! What\u2019s happening?\u201d Leo exclaimed. The walls glimmered, and a door appeared at the end of the tunnel. It looked like a giant treasure chest! \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go see!\u201d Ms. Tilly said, her heart racing.\n\nAs they approached the door, it creaked open. Inside, they saw the Gnome King lounging on a throne made of mushrooms. \u201cWell, well, if it isn\u2019t my favorite adventurers!\u201d he chuckled. \u201cDid you enjoy my riddle?\u201d\n\n\u201cIt was tricky!\u201d Leo said. \u201cBut we figured it out!\u201d\n\nThe Gnome King scratched his beard. \u201cHmm, then let\u2019s make it interesting!\u201d He snapped his fingers, and suddenly, the room spun. \u201cIf you can answer my next riddle, I\u2019ll show you the way to the Island of Whimsy!\u201d\n\n\u201cOkay! We\u2019re ready!\u201d shouted Ms. Tilly.\n\nThe Gnome King grinned. \u201cWhat has keys but can\u2019t open locks?\u201d \n\nLeo thought hard. \u201cHmm... A piano!\u201d he exclaimed.\n\nThe Gnome King smiled wide. \u201cCorrect! You three are clever indeed!\u201d With a wave of his hand, a swirling portal appeared behind him.\n\n\u201cThank you, Gnome King!\u201d Leo said, feeling brave. \n\n\u201cRemember, believe in the impossible!\u201d he replied with a wink.\n\nTogether, Leo, Ms. Tilly, and Pippin stepped through the portal. They found themselves on the shores of a beautiful island, with trees made of candy and rivers of chocolate! \n\n\u201cLook at this place!\u201d Leo gasped. \u201cWe made it!\u201d\n\nPippin chirped, \u201cAdventure awaits!\u201d Ms. Tilly laughed. \u201cLet\u2019s explore!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith hearts full of joy, they ran towards the shimmering horizon, ready for whatever else this magical island had in store.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Leo discover in the tunnel?","options":["A treasure chest","A magical portal","A talking parrot","A giant key"],"correct_answer":"A magical portal"},{"question":"What riddle does the Gnome King ask?","options":["What has keys but can't open locks?","What is made of gold?","What sings the loudest?","What flies at night?"],"correct_answer":"What has keys but can't open locks?"},{"question":"What do Leo, Ms. Tilly, and Pippin find on the Island of Whimsy?","options":["Dinosaurs","Candy trees","A castle","A dragon"],"correct_answer":"Candy trees"},{"question":"How does the Gnome King react to their answer?","options":["He gets angry","He laughs","He gives them a gift","He leaves"],"correct_answer":"He laughs"},{"question":"What do Leo and his friends do at the end of the chapter?","options":["They go home","They explore the island","They take a nap","They cry"],"correct_answer":"They explore the island"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_22_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_22_ch5_img1.png","plot_22_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":323,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
