     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"compass","1":"enchanted","2":"mischievous","3":"adventure","4":"legendary","image_prompts":["A vibrant attic filled with old boxes and cobwebs, with a shining bronze compass in the center. Leo, a twelve-year-old boy with tousled hair, looks amazed as he holds the compass, which seems to emanate a soft glow. Dust motes dance in the air, and sunlight streams through a small window, creating a magical atmosphere.","A whimsical forest scene, with colorful, singing flowers and trees that twist and turn in odd shapes. The Gnome King, a small figure with a large red hat, stands with a mischievous grin, his eyes sparkling as he leans closer to Leo and Ms. Tilly, who look both intrigued and cautious. Nimbus the parrot flutters nearby, adding to the enchanting chaos of the scene."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dimly lit attic filled with dust and shadows, showing Leo holding an ornate, gleaming compass that radiates warm light. The atmosphere is tinged with magic, and cobwebs glimmer softly in the background.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_22_ch1_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 20:28:30"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A vibrant scene of Leo and Ms. Tilly standing before a swirling portal of light, with expressions of excitement and fear. The compass glows in Leos hand, symbolizing adventure, while the attic fades into darkness behind them.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_22_ch1_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 20:28:30"}}}
