     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"mesmerized","1":"ominous","2":"whirlpool","3":"trembled","4":"domain","image_prompts":["An enchanted forest clearing with a sparkling fountain at its center, surrounded by colorful flowers and glowing mushrooms. Leo, a twelve-year-old boy with tousled hair, gazes in awe at the fountain, while Ms. Tilly, an eccentric woman with wild hair and large glasses, sketches nearby. The atmosphere is filled with soft light and the sounds of magic in the air.","A dramatic confrontation on a sandy beach, where Leo and Ms. Tilly stand defiantly against the larger-than-life Gnome King. The beach is bright and colorful, with magical creatures in the background. The Gnome King, wearing a comically oversized hat, grins mischievously as swirling sand encircles him, while Leo and Ms. Tilly share a determined look, ready to face the challenge."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing An atmospheric scene depicting the Enchanted Forest, with tall, ancient trees filtering morning light. Leo and Ms. Tilly stand at the foreground, their expressions filled with wonder and apprehension. The air shimmers with faint magical energy, and vibrant Bloomberries glow in rich colors, hinting at their otherworldly properties.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_22_ch3_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 20:27:09"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A climactic moment showcasing the Gnome King, with exaggerated features and an arrogant posture, looming over Leo and Ms. Tilly in a dramatically lit clearing. The tension is palpable, with shadows casting mysterious patterns around them, emphasizing the high stakes of the confrontation. Leos expression is one of defiance, while Ms. Tilly appears resolute, reflecting the gravity of their situation.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_22_ch3_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 20:27:09"}}}
