     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"anticipation","1":"mischievous","2":"confront","3":"determination","4":"whimsical","image_prompts":["The clearing in the enchanted forest, where Leo and Ms. Tilly stand beneath towering trees, sunlight filters through the leaves, casting dappled light on the ground. Leo holds the talking compass tightly, his face a mix of excitement and determination, while Ms. Tilly adjusts her oversized glasses, a glint of mischief in her eyes. Jasper the parrot flutters nearby, vibrant feathers catching the light.","The ethereal Bridge of Echoes emerges from swirling fog, appearing as a shimmering pathway that glows softly. Leo and Ms. Tilly stand at the entrance, hesitating as they take in the magical sight. In the background, the Gnome King\u2019s shadowy figure can be seen darting away, a sly grin on his face as he whispers spells, suggesting the tension of the moment."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A tranquil pond illuminated by moonlight, with a stone pedestal at its center. The pedestal features intricate carvings depicting scenes of friendship and courage, surrounded by lush trees that form a protective canopy overhead. The mood is serene yet mysterious, suggesting a moment of discovery and introspection.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_22_ch4_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 20:26:19"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dramatic confrontation scene where Leo and Ms. Tilly stand defiantly against the Gnome King, who looms with a mischievous grin. The atmosphere is charged with tension, with swirling mist around them, revealing the contrast between the characters determined expressions and the Gnome Kings cunning, playful demeanor.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_22_ch4_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 20:26:19"}}}
