   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_22_11_14","title":"The Secret Compass","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Quest or Journey","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"As Leo and Ms. Tilly stepped deeper into the enchanted forest, the air thickened with the sweet scent of blooming flowers and the sound of twinkling water danced in the background. Sunlight streamed through the canopy, casting golden rays that painted the ground in a patchwork of warmth. Leo could hardly believe this was the same neighborhood he\u2019d lived in all his life. With every step, the forest transformed; trees twisted into fanciful shapes, and little creatures peeked out from behind the bark.\n\n\u201cI think we\u2019re getting closer!\u201d Leo exclaimed, his eyes wide with excitement. The compass, which rested in his palm, spun frantically, its needle jittering to the east.\n\n\u201cOr maybe we\u2019re about to walk into a trap laid by those pesky gnomes!\u201d Ms. Tilly chirped, her voice a mix of playfulness and mock fear. Her parrot, Jasper, perched boldly on her shoulder, ruffled his feathers as if to add his own warnings.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, a rustle in the bushes caught Leo\u2019s attention. He turned, his heartbeat quickening. \u201cDid you hear that?\u201d\n\n\u201cProbably just a bunny,\u201d Ms. Tilly said dismissively, waving her hand. But Leo wasn\u2019t convinced. The forest felt alive, and he sensed that something lurked just beyond the thick foliage.\n\nAs they pressed on, the compass\u2019s needle started to spin wildly, like a tornado of confusion. \u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d Leo asked, gripping the compass tightly. \u201cIt\u2019s like it doesn\u2019t know where to go!\u201d\n\n\u201cGnome magic,\u201d Ms. Tilly replied, raising her eyebrows. \u201cI wouldn\u2019t be surprised if the Gnome King is trying to play tricks on us! He loves to confuse travelers.\u201d \n\nLeo frowned. \u201cI thought gnomes were supposed to be friendly.\u201d\n\n\u201cOh, some are. But the Gnome King?\u201d She shuddered dramatically. \u201cHe\u2019s more mischievous than a mischievous cat! Always looking for a laugh at someone else's expense.\u201d\n\nJust then, a small figure zipped out from behind a tree. It was a gnome, his pointy red hat wobbling as he darted back and forth. \u201cLost, are we?\u201d he cackled, a mischievous glint in his eyes. \u201cThe Island of Whimsy? You\u2019ll never find it! Not while I\u2019m around!\u201d \n\n\u201cCan\u2019t you help us?\u201d Leo pleaded, his heart pounding with both fear and determination. \u201cWe just want to find the island!\u201d\n\nThe gnome chuckled, a sound like marbles rolling on a wooden floor. \u201cHelp you? Oh, that would be too easy! Where\u2019s the fun in that?\u201d He twirled around, throwing a handful of glittering dust into the air. The sparkles danced, momentarily enchanting Leo and Ms. Tilly.\n\nJasper squawked, trying to break their trance. \u201cHey! Snap out of it!\u201d\n\nLeo shook his head, clearing his mind. \u201cWhat do we have to do?\u201d he asked, inching closer to the giggling gnome.\n\n\u201cFor every question you answer correctly, I\u2019ll give you a clue,\u201d the gnome taunted, crossing his arms. \u201cBut get one wrong, and you\u2019ll be lost forever!\u201d\n\nLeo exchanged a worried glance with Ms. Tilly. The stakes were rising, and every moment felt like a step closer to danger.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s do it!\u201d Ms. Tilly declared, her eyes sparkling with reckless courage. \u201cWe can outsmart this little rascal!\u201d\n\n\u201cRight,\u201d Leo agreed, his heart racing. \u201cWhat\u2019s your first question?\u201d\n\nThe gnome grinned wider, a devilish twinkle in his eye. \u201cWhat has keys but can\u2019t open locks?\u201d\n\nLeo furrowed his brow and glanced at Ms. Tilly, who was already tapping her chin in thought. The air crackled with tension as they both pondered the riddle, and Leo could feel the weight of the gnome\u2019s gaze, measuring their every reaction.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith a sudden flash of inspiration, Leo felt a spark of confidence. Could this be the moment that would set them on the right path? Or were they walking straight into a trap laid by the Gnome King?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does the gnome challenge Leo and Ms. Tilly to do?","options":["Help him find his hat","Answer his riddle correctly","Dance with him","Follow him to the Gnome King's castle"],"correct_answer":"Answer his riddle correctly"},{"question":"What magical element surrounds the gnome when he appears?","options":["Fireflies","Shimmering dust","Rainbows","Glowing mushrooms"],"correct_answer":"Shimmering dust"},{"question":"How does Leo feel as they encounter the gnome?","options":["Excited and confident","Terrified and confused","Bored and uninterested","Angry and upset"],"correct_answer":"Terrified and confused"},{"question":"What does Ms. Tilly suggest when the gnome challenges them?","options":["To run away","To accept his challenge","To ignore him","To negotiate for a clue"],"correct_answer":"To accept his challenge"},{"question":"What is the first riddle the gnome presents to Leo and Ms. Tilly?","options":["What has keys but can\u2019t open locks?","What runs but never walks?","What is black and white and read all over?","What has a heart that doesn't beat?"],"correct_answer":"What has keys but can\u2019t open locks?"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_22_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_22_ch2_img1.png","plot_22_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":645,"reading_level":"Builder"}
