   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_22_11_14","title":"The Secret Compass","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Quest or Journey","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"As the sun dipped below the horizon, casting a golden hue over the enchanted forest, Leo and Ms. Tilly trudged through the underbrush, the compass vibrating gently in Leo's palm. \u201cWe\u2019re getting closer, I can feel it!\u201d Leo exclaimed, his excitement bubbling over as they moved deeper into the heart of the woods. The trees whispered secrets, their leaves twinkling like stars caught in the branches, while Jasper the parrot ruffled his feathers, echoing Leo's enthusiasm.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, a rustling noise interrupted their moment of wonder. Ms. Tilly froze, her quirky hat bobbing slightly. \u201cDid you hear that?\u201d she whispered, her eyes wide with a mix of fear and curiosity. Leo nodded, feeling his heart race. \u201cIt could be the Gnome King,\u201d he replied, recalling their previous encounter, where the mischievous figure had tried to mislead them with riddles and tricks.\n\n\u201cStay close,\u201d Ms. Tilly instructed, her voice steady despite the apprehension in her eyes. Just then, from behind a particularly gnarled tree, the Gnome King emerged, his laughter echoing like chimes in the breeze. His beard, braided with twinkling beads, danced as he approached, a sly grin plastered on his face.\n\n\u201cWhy, if it isn\u2019t my favorite adventurers!\u201d he proclaimed, feigning delight. \u201cHow funny to see you on this side of the woods! Surely you don\u2019t believe you can find the Island of Whimsy?\u201d His eyes sparkled with mischief, setting Leo\u2019s nerves on edge.\n\n\u201cWe will find it!\u201d Leo declared, standing taller. \u201cAnd you won\u2019t stop us this time.\u201d \n\nThe Gnome King chuckled, scratching his chin. \u201cOh, I admire your determination, boy. But tell me\u2014are you willing to wager something precious? Perhaps your trusty compass?\u201d\n\nLeo felt a pang of fear at the thought. The compass was not just a tool; it was their guide, their connection to the island. \u201cWhat do you want?\u201d he asked, desperate to protect it.\n\nThe Gnome King leaned closer, his voice lowering to a conspiratorial whisper. \u201cA simple riddle. Solve it, and the compass stays with you. Fail, and it becomes mine!\u201d\n\nLeo exchanged a worried glance with Ms. Tilly. \u201cWhat\u2019s the riddle?\u201d she asked, her curiosity piqued despite the danger.\n\n\u201cVery well,\u201d the Gnome King said, a gleam in his eye. \u201cListen closely. I have keys but open no locks. I have space but no room. You can enter, but you can\u2019t go outside. What am I?\u201d\n\nLeo furrowed his brow, pondering. \u201cIt sounds like\u2026 a computer,\u201d he speculated. Ms. Tilly frowned, shaking her head. \u201cNo, it has to be something old-fashioned. Think, Leo!\u201d \n\nTime ticked away, the Gnome King tapping his foot impatiently. The tension in the air thickened, and Leo\u2019s mind raced. Suddenly, a light bulb flickered in his head. \u201cA book! A book has keys\u2014like a key to a story!\u201d \n\nThe Gnome King\u2019s eyes widened, and then he erupted into laughter. \u201cClever boy! You\u2019ve solved the riddle.\u201d \n\nRelief washed over Leo, and he clutched the compass tightly. \u201cWe\u2019re not giving up. We\u2019ll find that island!\u201d \n\nHe could feel the compass glowing in his hand, as if sharing in his determination. Ms. Tilly smiled, her eyes twinkling. \u201cOnward, my brave adventurer! The Island of Whimsy awaits us!\u201d \n\nAt that moment, the air shimmered, and the forest opened up, revealing a path bathed in moonlight. Leo felt a rush of excitement. This was it\u2014their journey was about to reach its climax!\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith renewed hope, Leo and Ms. Tilly stepped forward, ready to embrace whatever lay ahead. They had conquered the Gnome King's riddle and found strength in their friendship. The whispers of the forest seemed to cheer them on, urging them toward the adventure that awaited.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does the Gnome King challenge Leo and Ms. Tilly to do?","options":["Solve a riddle","Find a treasure","Fight him","Sing a song"],"correct_answer":"Solve a riddle"},{"question":"What is the answer to the Gnome King's riddle?","options":["A computer","A book","A key","A door"],"correct_answer":"A book"},{"question":"How does Leo feel when the Gnome King appears?","options":["Excited","Nervous","Confident","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Nervous"},{"question":"What does Ms. Tilly suggest Leo do when faced with the riddle?","options":["Think of something modern","Look for a clue","Think of something old-fashioned","Ignore it"],"correct_answer":"Think of something old-fashioned"},{"question":"What does the compass represent for Leo?","options":["A tool for navigation","A friend","A magical object","A connection to the island"],"correct_answer":"A connection to the island"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_22_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_22_ch5_img1.png","plot_22_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":623,"reading_level":"Builder"}
