     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"melody","1":"shadow","2":"jungle","3":"together","4":"music","image_prompts":["A bright and colorful illustration of the Jazz Jungle, filled with vibrant flowers, tall trees, and a sparkling blue pond. Clara, Amir, and Theo are seen in the clearing, laughing and watching the frogs. The frogs are colorful and animated, showing their playful singing.","An action-packed scene where Clara, Amir, and Theo are working together to create music. Clara pretends to play her flute, Amir claps his hands, and Theo hums softly. In the background, the shadowy figure of the Shadow looms, but is pushed back by their joyful music. The setting is lively and bright, contrasting the Shadow's dark form."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A vibrant scene of the Jazz Jungle with Clara, Amir, and Theo creating music together. Sunlight filters through the leafy canopy, casting colorful patterns on the forest floor. Clara is at the center, eyes closed and humming, while Amir taps a rhythm on a log, and Theo plays his flute, each characters expression reflecting passion and determination.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_23_ch4_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 20:22:06"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing The climactic moment when Clara, Amir, and Theos music confronts the Shadow, who is depicted as a dark, ominous figure with flickering shadows swirling around him. Clara is reaching toward a shimmering note that breaks through the darkness, illuminating the surrounding jungle in vibrant colors, symbolizing hope and resilience in the face of fear.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_23_ch4_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 20:22:06"}}}
