   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_23_7_10","title":"Quest for the Lost Melody","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Quest or Journey","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Clara stood on her front porch, her heart beating like a drum. Today was special. She had a secret mission! With her trusty notebook in hand, she wrote down her favorite song ideas. Clara was a budding musician. She loved to play her violin, especially the tunes her grandmother taught her. \n\n\u201cAre you ready for our adventure, Clara?\u201d her best friend Amir called out. He was always up for fun! \n\n\u201cAlmost! I just need to write down one last note,\u201d Clara replied, tapping her pencil against her chin. \u201cI can feel it! It\u2019s going to be a great day.\u201d\n\nAs they walked, the world around them filled with music. The trees swayed like they were dancing. Birds chirped in harmony. Clara smiled and said, \u201cIt feels like our town is alive with sound!\u201d\n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Amir pointed to a glimmering path. \u201cIs that\u2026 the Jazz Jungle?\u201d \n\nClara\u2019s eyes widened. The path was made of shining saxophones and trumpets! \u201cYes! But we can\u2019t go yet. We need to find Grandma\u2019s lost melody first!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cGrandma said it was an enchanting song,\u201d Amir said, his voice soft. \u201cIt can heal broken hearts. If we find it, we\u2019ll help so many people!\u201d\n\n\u201cExactly! But we need to be careful,\u201d Clara warned. \u201cJealous Shadow wants to steal it for himself. He doesn\u2019t like music at all!\u201d\n\n\u201cYikes!\u201d Amir exclaimed, looking worried. \u201cWhat if he tries to stop us?\u201d\n\n\u201cWe\u2019ll be brave!\u201d Clara smiled brightly. \u201cLet\u2019s gather all the notes we can find. They will help us complete the song!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a shadow flickered behind them. Clara turned. A figure in a dark cloak stood watching. It was the Shadow! He grinned, showing his sharp teeth.\n\n\u201cYou think you can find the melody?\u201d he sneered. \u201cIt\u2019s mine!\u201d\n\nClara felt a chill run down her spine. \u201cWe will find it!\u201d she yelled, gripping her notebook tightly. \u201cYou can\u2019t stop us!\u201d\n\n\u201cIs that so?\u201d the Shadow laughed, his voice echoing like thunder. \u201cLet the quest begin!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nClara and Amir exchanged determined looks. Together, they stepped onto the shining path of the Jazz Jungle. They couldn\u2019t turn back now. Adventure awaited!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is Clara\u2019s mission?","options":["To play a concert","To find her grandmother's lost melody","To go to a party","To make a new friend"],"correct_answer":"To find her grandmother's lost melody"},{"question":"What does Amir suggest when they see the Jazz Jungle?","options":["To turn back","To explore it","To climb a tree","To dance"],"correct_answer":"To explore it"},{"question":"Who is the jealous figure that threatens them?","options":["A friendly musician","The Shadow","Clara's grandmother","A magical creature"],"correct_answer":"The Shadow"},{"question":"How does Clara feel about the journey?","options":["Nervous","Excited","Bored","Scared"],"correct_answer":"Excited"},{"question":"What do Clara and Amir need to gather?","options":["Flowers","Notes","Friends","Instruments"],"correct_answer":"Notes"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_23_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_23_ch1_img1.png","plot_23_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":366,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
