   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_23_7_10","title":"Quest for the Lost Melody","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Quest or Journey","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Clara and Amir stepped into the Jazz Jungle. The trees swayed like dancers, their leaves clapping softly in the breeze. Bright colors surrounded them, and the air buzzed with music. \"Wow! This place is amazing!\" Clara exclaimed.\n\n\"I can already hear the jazz notes!\" Amir said, his eyes wide with excitement. They walked deeper into the jungle. Suddenly, they spotted a tall figure playing a saxophone. It was Theo! His long hair flowed like a river and his smile was warm.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cHey, you two!\u201d Theo called, stopping his music. \u201cAre you ready for your adventure?\u201d Clara nodded eagerly. \u201cWe\u2019re looking for the Lost Melody!\u201d she replied.\n\nTheo raised an eyebrow. \u201cThe Lost Melody? That\u2019s no small task. You\u2019ll need to be careful. The Shadow roams these parts.\u201d Clara felt a shiver run down her spine. \u201cWho is the Shadow?\u201d\n\nTheo sighed, looking serious. \u201cThe Shadow wants to steal all music. He\u2019ll do anything to stop you.\u201d Amir glanced at Clara. \u201cWe have to be brave, Clara. We can\u2019t let him win!\u201d\n\nAs they continued, the jungle twisted and turned. Musical notes danced around them. Suddenly, a dark figure appeared! It was the Shadow, cloaked in black, with eyes like glowing coals. \u201cYou shouldn\u2019t be here!\u201d he hissed.\n\nClara stepped forward, her heart pounding. \u201cWe\u2019re finding the Lost Melody! You can\u2019t stop us!\u201d The Shadow laughed, a cold, echoing sound. \u201cOh, but I can!\u201d He reached for the music notes floating in the air.\n\n\u201cRun!\u201d Amir shouted. They dashed through the trees, dodging branches and leaping over roots. Clara could hear the Shadow\u2019s footsteps behind them. \u201cHe\u2019s gaining on us!\u201d she cried.\n\nTheo turned back, playing a fast tune on his saxophone. The music filled the air, swirling around them. It was magical! The Shadow paused, confused by the sound. \u201cNo! Not the music!\u201d he shouted.\n\nUsing the moment, Clara grabbed Amir\u2019s hand. \u201cQuick! This way!\u201d They ran deeper into the jungle, the music guiding them. Finally, they came to a clearing. In the center was a giant, glowing music note.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cMaybe this is where we find a piece of the Lost Melody!\u201d Clara said, breathing hard. They approached the note, shining brightly like a beacon. But just then, the Shadow\u2019s voice echoed around them. \u201cYou can\u2019t escape me!\u201d\n\nWith courage, Clara shouted, \u201cWe will find the melody!\u201d The music note pulsed with energy, echoing her brave words. The Shadow shrieked, retreating into the darkness.\n\nClara, Amir, and Theo stood together, hearts racing. \u201cThat was close!\u201d Amir panted. Clara smiled, feeling stronger. \u201cBut we\u2019re not done yet. We need to find the rest of the melody!\u201d\n\nThey took a deep breath and stepped closer to the glowing note. What would they find next?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Clara and Amir enter in this chapter?","options":["The Jazz Jungle","The Classical Mountains","The Pop Forest","The Rock Desert"],"correct_answer":"The Jazz Jungle"},{"question":"Who warns Clara and Amir about the Shadow?","options":["A bird","Theo","Their teacher","A stranger"],"correct_answer":"Theo"},{"question":"What does the Shadow want to steal?","options":["Food","Music","Treasure","Friends"],"correct_answer":"Music"},{"question":"What does Clara and her friends find in the clearing?","options":["A treasure chest","A giant music note","A sleeping bear","A magical tree"],"correct_answer":"A giant music note"},{"question":"What do they do when they see the Shadow?","options":["Run away","Fight him","Play music","Hide"],"correct_answer":"Run away"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_23_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_23_ch2_img1.png","plot_23_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":470,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
