   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_23_7_10","title":"Quest for the Lost Melody","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Quest or Journey","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Chapter 3: The Threat of the Shadow\n\nClara, Amir, and Theo walked deeper into the Jazz Jungle. The trees danced like jazz musicians. Clara\u2019s heart beat fast. \u201cWhat if the Shadow comes back?\u201d she whispered.\n\n\u201cWe\u2019ll be ready!\u201d Amir said, puffing out his chest. \u201cWe have the glowing note!\u201d\n\nTheo nodded. \u201cBut the Shadow is clever. He knows many tricks.\u201d Suddenly, a loud rustle came from the bushes. The friends froze.\n\n\u201cIs it him?\u201d Clara asked, her voice shaking.\n\nJust then, a tall, dark figure stepped out. It was the Shadow! His eyes glowed like red coals. \u201cYou think you can find the Lost Melody?\u201d he sneered. \u201cIt will be mine!\u201d\n\nClara felt a chill. \u201cYou won't take it!\u201d she shouted.\n\nThe Shadow laughed. \u201cOh, but I will! I can silence all music!\u201d He reached for the glowing note in Clara\u2019s hand. \n\nIn a flash, Theo stepped forward. \u201cYou will never succeed!\u201d he declared, pulling out his silver flute. He played a quick tune. The air shimmered with music.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe trees shook and swayed, echoing Theo's notes. Clara felt a spark of courage. \u201cAmir, let\u2019s join him!\u201d \n\nAmir nodded. He began to tap his feet and clap his hands. Clara followed his lead. Together, they created a rhythm. \n\nSuddenly, the ground beneath the Shadow began to tremble. \u201cNo! What are you doing?\u201d he yelled. The music grew louder, wrapping around him like a bright ribbon.\n\nThe Shadow stumbled back, his form flickering. \u201cYou think you can stop me?\u201d he roared. \u201cYou\u2019re just kids!\u201d \n\nClara took a deep breath. \u201cWe are more than kids! We are music!\u201d \n\nBut just as they thought they were winning, the Shadow raised his hand. \u201cYou might have won this time, but I will return!\u201d With a burst of dark smoke, he vanished.\n\n\u201cWhat just happened?\u201d Amir gasped, looking around. \n\nTheo lowered his flute, panting. \u201cWe scared him away, but he will come back. He wants the melody more than anything.\u201d\n\nClara felt both brave and scared. \u201cWe need to find it before he does!\u201d \n\nThey looked at the glowing note, shining in Clara\u2019s hand. \u201cWhere do we go next?\u201d Amir asked.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s follow the music!\u201d Clara said, her eyes shining with determination. \u201cIt's the only way!\u201d\n\nAnd with that, the friends stepped deeper into the Jazz Jungle, ready for whatever came next.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThey could hear a soft melody in the distance, calling them forward. Clara\u2019s heart raced. What if they were close? \n\nBut then, they heard a dark chuckle behind them. The Shadow was back!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does the Shadow want to do?","options":["Take the glowing note","Help Clara","Make friends","Dance with them"],"correct_answer":"Take the glowing note"},{"question":"What does Theo use to fight the Shadow?","options":["A wand","A flute","A drum","His voice"],"correct_answer":"A flute"},{"question":"What do Clara and Amir do when they hear the Shadow?","options":["Run away","Clap and tap their feet","Hide behind a tree","Yell at him"],"correct_answer":"Clap and tap their feet"},{"question":"How does Clara feel after confronting the Shadow?","options":["Scared and alone","Brave and scared","Happy and relaxed","Angry and upset"],"correct_answer":"Brave and scared"},{"question":"What do the friends decide to do at the end of the chapter?","options":["Go home","Follow the music","Take a nap","Fight the Shadow again"],"correct_answer":"Follow the music"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_23_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_23_ch3_img1.png","plot_23_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":431,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
