   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_23_7_10","title":"Quest for the Lost Melody","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Quest or Journey","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"The sun shone brightly in the Jazz Jungle as Clara, Amir, and Theo caught their breath. They had just faced the Shadow. Clara felt a spark of hope inside her. \u201cWe made music together! That\u2019s powerful!\u201d she exclaimed, smiling at her friends.\n\n\u201cYeah! We can beat the Shadow if we work as a team,\u201d Amir added, his eyes shining like stars. Theo nodded, adjusting his colorful scarf. \u201cBut we must be careful. He will return.\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a soft sound floated through the trees. It was a sweet melody, like laughter on the wind. Clara looked around, eyes wide with curiosity. \u201cDo you hear that?\u201d she whispered. \n\nAmir perked up. \u201cLet\u2019s follow it!\u201d \n\nThey moved deeper into the jungle, where the trees danced gently. Bright flowers peeked out from the bushes. Clara felt the rhythm of the jungle beat in her heart. \n\nAs they walked, they stumbled upon a small clearing. In the middle stood a sparkling blue pond, its water shimmering like diamonds. A group of colorful frogs leaped around, singing a cheerful song. Clara and her friends giggled at their silly moves. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cLook at those frogs! They are like tiny musicians!\u201d Amir laughed.\n\n\u201cMaybe they know a secret about the Lost Melody!\u201d Clara said excitedly. \n\nTheo stepped forward. \u201cExcuse me, frogs! Can you help us find the Lost Melody?\u201d \n\nThe frogs croaked in unison, \u201cRibbit, ribbit! Follow the music, and you shall find! But beware of the Shadow, who lurks behind!\u201d\n\nClara shivered. \u201cThe Shadow is scary, but we have to keep going! We can\u2019t let him win!\u201d \n\nSuddenly, the ground shook. The Shadow appeared, his dark figure looming over them. \u201cYou think you can escape me? I will steal your music!\u201d \n\nClara took a deep breath. \u201cNo! We are stronger together!\u201d She began to play a tune on her imaginary flute, and Amir joined in with claps. Theo added a soft hum. \n\nThe Shadow paused, confused. The music pushed back the darkness around him. \u201cNo!\u201d he growled, but Clara\u2019s melody grew louder and brighter.\n\n\u201cKeep playing!\u201d Amir shouted, his voice filled with excitement. \n\nWith one final note, Clara played a powerful chord. The Shadow howled and vanished into thin air, leaving only a swirl of dark mist. \n\n\u201cWe did it!\u201d Theo cheered, his eyes sparkling. \n\nClara smiled broadly. \u201cTogether, we can do anything!\u201d \n\nThey celebrated, knowing they were one step closer to finding the Lost Melody.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2] \n\nThe sun began to set, painting the sky orange and pink. Clara felt the warmth of hope in her heart. \u201cLet\u2019s keep going! I can feel the melody getting closer!\u201d \n\nWith their spirits high, they ventured deeper into the magical jungle, ready for whatever adventure awaited them next.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Clara and her friends hear in the jungle?","options":["A scary noise","A sweet melody","A loud roar","A rumbling sound"],"correct_answer":"A sweet melody"},{"question":"What do the frogs do in the clearing?","options":["They jump and sing","They swim away","They hide","They dance quietly"],"correct_answer":"They jump and sing"},{"question":"What does Clara use to fend off the Shadow?","options":["A stick","Her imagination","A melody","A loud shout"],"correct_answer":"A melody"},{"question":"What do Clara and her friends decide to do after defeating the Shadow?","options":["Go home","Keep searching","Take a break","Make more music"],"correct_answer":"Keep searching"},{"question":"What emotion do Clara and her friends feel after their victory?","options":["Sadness","Fear","Hope","Anger"],"correct_answer":"Hope"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_23_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_23_ch4_img1.png","plot_23_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":455,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
