   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_23_7_10","title":"Quest for the Lost Melody","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Quest or Journey","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"The sun peeked over the Classical Mountains, painting the sky in soft pastels. Clara, Amir, and Theo stood at the edge of a sparkling river that flowed with music. \"Listen!\" Clara said, her eyes bright. \"It sounds like a gentle lullaby!\"\n\nAmir grinned. \"I love this place! It feels magical!\" He twirled around, his laughter dancing with the notes in the air.\n\nTheo nodded, his gaze serious. \"This river holds the next note we need. But beware of the Shadow. He might come back.\"\n\nJust then, a bright light shimmered on the water\u2019s surface. Clara stepped closer. \u201cWhat is that?\u201d she asked, her voice a whisper.\n\nSuddenly, a giant musical note popped out of the water! It sparkled with colors, swirling like a rainbow. Clara gasped. \"We found a note!\"\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nTheo smiled. \u201cYes! But we must play it right. Let\u2019s sing together.\u201d They joined hands and began to sing. Their voices blended beautifully, and the note danced higher into the air.\n\nBut then, out of the shadows, the dark figure of the Shadow appeared, his face twisted with jealousy. \u201cYou think you can keep the melody?\u201d he hissed. \u201cI will take it!\u201d\n\nClara's heart pounded. \u201cNo! Music belongs to everyone!\u201d she shouted, stepping in front of Amir and Theo. The Shadow\u2019s eyes narrowed.\n\n\u201cYour voices are weak!\u201d he snarled. Clara felt fear creep in, but she remembered her grandmother\u2019s words: \u201cMusic can heal.\u201d\n\n\u201cSing louder!\u201d Amir encouraged. Clara took a deep breath and sang from her heart. The melody flowed out, bright and strong. \n\nAs the music soared, the Shadow clutched his ears. \u201cNo! Stop!\u201d he shouted, stumbling back. The light of their song wrapped around him, pushing him away. \n\nFinally, the Shadow vanished into the darkness. Clara, Amir, and Theo cheered! \u201cWe did it!\u201d Amir exclaimed, jumping up and down.\n\n\u201cI felt the power of our music,\u201d Clara said, beaming. \u201cWe can do anything together!\u201d\n\nTheo smiled, looking proud. \u201cYou have grown, Clara. Your voice is strong.\u201d\n\nWith their hearts full of joy, they continued down the river. The sparkling waters sang along, guiding them closer to the Lost Melody.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find the next note!\u201d Clara said, her spirit soaring like the music around them.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAs they journeyed onward, Clara knew they were one step closer to healing hearts everywhere. Together, they would find the melody that could change the world.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Clara and her friends find in the river?","options":["A magical note","A treasure chest","A sad fish","A dark shadow"],"correct_answer":"A magical note"},{"question":"Who appears again to try and steal the melody?","options":["Theo","Amir","The Shadow","Clara's grandmother"],"correct_answer":"The Shadow"},{"question":"What does Clara use to push the Shadow away?","options":["Her magic wand","Her strong voice","A treasure map","A magic potion"],"correct_answer":"Her strong voice"},{"question":"What does Amir encourage Clara to do?","options":["Be quiet","Sing louder","Run away","Find a hiding spot"],"correct_answer":"Sing louder"},{"question":"What do Clara and her friends feel after defeating the Shadow?","options":["Sadness","Fear","Joy","Anger"],"correct_answer":"Joy"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_23_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_23_ch5_img1.png","plot_23_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":401,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
