     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"anticipation","1":"relentless","2":"pedestal","3":"united","4":"surge","image_prompts":["Clara, Amir, and Theo standing at the edge of the Classical Mountains, surrounded by rocky terrain and vibrant wildflowers. Clara's expression is one of determination, while Amir adjusts his backpack with a hint of nervousness. Theo studies a map intently, hinting at the adventure ahead. The background shows majestic mountains under a blue sky.","A dramatic scene of Clara, Amir, and Theo playing their instruments in the clearing, with vibrant musical notes swirling around them. The Shadow looms at the edge, his expression menacing, while the light from their music creates a protective barrier. The atmosphere is tense, filled with the energy of their performance and the threat of silence."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A vibrant scene of the Jazz Jungle with Clara, Amir, and Theo creating music together. Sunlight filters through the leafy canopy, casting colorful patterns on the forest floor. Clara is at the center, eyes closed and humming, while Amir taps a rhythm on a log, and Theo plays his flute, each characters expression reflecting passion and determination.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_23_ch4_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 20:22:06"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing The climactic moment when Clara, Amir, and Theos music confronts the Shadow, who is depicted as a dark, ominous figure with flickering shadows swirling around him. Clara is reaching toward a shimmering note that breaks through the darkness, illuminating the surrounding jungle in vibrant colors, symbolizing hope and resilience in the face of fear.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_23_ch4_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 20:22:06"}}}
