   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_24_7_10","title":"The Crystal Cavern","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Quest or Journey","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"In the small village of Willow Creek, legends whispered through the trees. Fourteen-year-old Finn loved these stories. They made his heart race with excitement. One morning, he found his sister, Ellie, searching through the attic.\n\n\u201cWhat are you doing up here?\u201d Finn asked, peeking over her shoulder.\n\n\u201cI\u2019m looking for treasure!\u201d Ellie grinned. She pulled out an old, dusty book. The cover had a glowing crystal on it. \u201cYou should see this!\u201d\n\nFinn leaned closer. \u201cWhat does it say?\u201d\n\n\u201cI think it talks about a hidden Crystal Cavern!\u201d Ellie replied, eyes sparkling. \u201cIt says there are treasures beyond our wildest dreams!\u201d\n\nJust then, their clever neighbor, Ravi, burst in. \u201cDid someone say treasure?\u201d His messy hair bounced as he jumped up onto a stack of boxes. \u201cI want in!\u201d\n\nFinn smiled, feeling the thrill of adventure. \u201cLet\u2019s find this cavern!\u201d\n\nThey decided to gather supplies. The trio packed sandwiches, water, and Ellie\u2019s favorite flashlight. Finn grabbed a rope, just in case. Their hearts raced with excitement as they ran to the valley outside their village. \n\nThe valley was full of tall trees and colorful flowers. The sun peeked through the leaves, making everything sparkle. Finn took a deep breath. \u201cThis is where the adventure begins!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nFinn, Ellie, and Ravi stood at the edge of the valley, looking at the majestic trees. Each tree seemed to tell a story. Birds chirped happily, and a gentle breeze rustled the leaves. \n\nAs they walked deeper into the woods, they spotted strange symbols on the ground. \u201cLook at these!\u201d Ravi exclaimed, pointing. \u201cThese could be clues!\u201d\n\nEllie knelt down, tracing the symbols with her finger. \u201cI think they lead to the cavern!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, they heard rustling in the bushes nearby. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Finn whispered, eyes wide.\n\n\u201cMaybe it\u2019s a treasure hunter!\u201d Ravi said, his voice trembling.\n\nFinn felt a chill. \u201cWe have to be careful. We can\u2019t let anyone take the cavern\u2019s treasures!\u201d\n\nDetermined, they pressed on. But the path twisted and turned, and soon they found themselves in a puzzling maze of stones. \u201cWhat now?\u201d Ellie asked, biting her lip.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s use the clues!\u201d Ravi suggested. \u201cWe can figure this out together!\u201d\n\nFinn nodded, feeling the strength of their friendship. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThey followed the symbols, excitement bubbling in their chests. But then, they heard footsteps behind them. \u201cQuick! We have to hide!\u201d Finn urged.\n\nThe adventure had only just begun, and they could feel the treasure waiting for them. But they also felt the danger. Would they find the Crystal Cavern before the treasure hunters did?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Finn, Ellie, and Ravi find in the attic?","options":["A treasure map","An old book","A toy","A chest"],"correct_answer":"An old book"},{"question":"What do they plan to look for?","options":["A lost dog","A hidden cavern","A magical tree","A secret garden"],"correct_answer":"A hidden cavern"},{"question":"What do they hear while in the valley?","options":["A waterfall","Footsteps","Birds singing","A car honking"],"correct_answer":"Footsteps"},{"question":"Who is the clever neighbor?","options":["Finn","Ellie","Ravi","A stranger"],"correct_answer":"Ravi"},{"question":"What do they feel as they continue their adventure?","options":["Bored","Excited","Tired","Scared"],"correct_answer":"Excited"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_24_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_24_ch1_img1.png","plot_24_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":437,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
