   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_24_7_10","title":"The Crystal Cavern","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Quest or Journey","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Chapter 2: The Dark Shadows\n\nFinn, Ellie, and Ravi stood at the edge of the valley. The sun shone bright, but the air felt strange. They could see old ruins scattered around. \u201cLook at those stone walls!\u201d Ellie said, pointing. \u201cThey look ancient!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cWhat if they lead us to the Crystal Cavern?\u201d Finn suggested, excitement bubbling inside him. Ravi adjusted his glasses. \u201cOr they could hide treasure hunters!\u201d he warned. \u201cWe can\u2019t let anyone find the cavern before us!\u201d\n\nAs they explored the ruins, Finn felt a shiver. \u201cDid you hear that?\u201d he asked. A low rumble echoed through the valley. The ground trembled slightly. \u201cIt\u2019s just the wind,\u201d Ellie said, but she was not so sure.\n\nSuddenly, they spotted a shadow behind a large rock. \u201cIs someone there?\u201d Ravi called out. There was no answer. They exchanged worried glances. \u201cWe need to move quickly,\u201d Finn said. \u201cLet\u2019s check out that path!\u201d \n\nThey crept towards a narrow trail snaking between the rocks. \u201cThis feels right,\u201d Finn said, his heart racing. \u201cThe cavern must be close!\u201d But just then, they heard voices. Finn\u2019s stomach dropped. \u201cTreasure hunters!\u201d he whispered fiercely.\n\n\u201cLet's hide!\u201d Ellie urged. They ducked behind some boulders, trying to stay quiet. The voices grew louder. \u201cWe\u2019re getting close to the treasure!\u201d a man shouted. \u201cWe\u2019ll be rich!\u201d \n\nFinn's mind raced. \u201cWe can\u2019t let them reach the cavern!\u201d he said. Ravi nodded, eyes wide. \u201cBut what if they find us first?\u201d \n\nEllie smiled, her eyes sparkling with mischief. \u201cI have an idea! We can make a distraction. Then, we\u2019ll sneak past them!\u201d \n\n\u201cGreat thinking, Ellie!\u201d Finn replied. \u201cBut what kind of distraction?\u201d \n\nRavi thought hard. \u201cI have some gadgets that might help!\u201d He reached into his backpack. \u201cHow about a loud noise to draw them away?\u201d \n\nFinn grinned, hope blooming in his chest. \u201cLet\u2019s do it!\u201d \n\nJust as they prepared their plan, the treasure hunters came closer. The tension was thick in the air. Would their plan work? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe group took a deep breath, ready to act. They had to protect the Crystal Cavern and their village. But the shadows of danger loomed ever closer. Would they succeed?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Finn, Ellie, and Ravi find at the ruins?","options":["A hidden cave","Treasure hunters","A treasure map","A secret tunnel"],"correct_answer":"Treasure hunters"},{"question":"What does Ellie suggest they do?","options":["Run away","Make a distraction","Find more treasure","Climb a tree"],"correct_answer":"Make a distraction"},{"question":"What does Ravi use to help with their plan?","options":["A map","A book","Gadgets","A flashlight"],"correct_answer":"Gadgets"},{"question":"How do Finn and his friends feel about the treasure hunters?","options":["Excited","Scared","Happy","Indifferent"],"correct_answer":"Scared"},{"question":"What do they hope to protect?","options":["The village","Their friendship","The Crystal Cavern","The treasure"],"correct_answer":"The Crystal Cavern"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_24_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_24_ch2_img1.png","plot_24_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":370,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
