   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_24_7_10","title":"The Crystal Cavern","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Quest or Journey","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Finn, Ellie, and Ravi stood at the edge of the valley. The sun cast long shadows over the ancient ruins. They could see the old stone walls, covered in vines. \n\n\u201cLook at that!\u201d Finn said, pointing to a crumbling tower. \u201cIt must lead to the Crystal Cavern!\u201d\n\nEllie nodded, her eyes sparkling. \u201cLet\u2019s check it out! Who knows what secrets we\u2019ll find!\u201d\n\nRavi adjusted his glasses, looking serious. \u201cBut remember, the treasure hunters are nearby. We need to be careful.\u201d \n\nAs they approached the tower, a loud rustling sound startled them. They turned quickly. A group of treasure hunters appeared, laughing and bragging. \n\n\u201cI heard there\u2019s gold in that cavern!\u201d one shouted. \n\n\u201cYeah, let\u2019s grab it before anyone else does!\u201d another added.\n\nFinn\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWe have to stop them!\u201d \n\nEllie looked around. \u201cWhat if we create a distraction? It could give us time to reach the cavern first.\u201d\n\nRavi grinned. \u201cI have an idea!\u201d He pulled out a small gadget. \u201cThis will make noise. We can set it near the river.\u201d\n\n\u201cGreat thinking, Ravi!\u201d Finn said. \u201cLet\u2019s do it!\u201d\n\nThe friends hid behind a pile of rocks as Ravi set up his gadget. Finn\u2019s hands were sweaty. He felt nervous but excited. \n\n\u201cReady?\u201d Ravi asked. \n\n\u201cReady!\u201d Ellie whispered back. \n\nWith a quick flick, they activated the gadget. Suddenly, a loud buzz echoed through the valley. The treasure hunters jumped, looking around in confusion.\n\n\u201cWhat was that?!\u201d one shouted.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go check it out!\u201d another said, running toward the noise.\n\n\u201cNow's our chance!\u201d Finn said. They dashed toward the tower. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they climbed, they reached the top of the tower. The view was amazing! Below, the valley sparkled in the sunlight. \u201cLook!\u201d Ellie pointed. \u201cThere\u2019s the entrance to the Crystal Cavern!\u201d\n\nBut just as they were about to climb down, they heard voices again. The treasure hunters were back. \u201cThey\u2019re up there!\u201d one yelled. \u201cGet them!\u201d\n\nFinn felt his heart sink. \u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d \n\n\u201cWe have to jump!\u201d Ravi said, eyes wide. \n\n\u201cJump? Are you crazy?\u201d Ellie gasped. \n\n\u201cTrust me!\u201d Ravi replied. \n\nIt was a big risk. They had to decide quickly. \n\n\u201cOkay, let\u2019s jump!\u201d Finn shouted, even though he felt scared. \n\nWith one deep breath, they leaped from the tower! [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThey landed in a soft patch of grass. But before they could celebrate, they heard the treasure hunters coming down the tower. \n\n\u201cQuick! We have to find the cavern before they catch us!\u201d Finn urged.\n\nThey ran toward the hidden path, their hearts pounding. Would they reach the cavern in time?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Finn, Ellie, and Ravi see when they reach the top of the tower?","options":["A treasure chest","The Crystal Cavern entrance","More treasure hunters","A dragon"],"correct_answer":"The Crystal Cavern entrance"},{"question":"What distraction do the friends create?","options":["A loud buzz","A fire","A song","A dance"],"correct_answer":"A loud buzz"},{"question":"What do the treasure hunters want?","options":["To build a tower","To find a hidden cavern","To capture the friends","To take the treasure"],"correct_answer":"To take the treasure"},{"question":"What choice do the friends make at the tower?","options":["Climb back down","Jump from the tower","Hide behind rocks","Run away"],"correct_answer":"Jump from the tower"},{"question":"How do the friends feel when they are about to jump?","options":["Excited and happy","Scared and nervous","Tired and sleepy","Bored and uninterested"],"correct_answer":"Scared and nervous"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_24_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_24_ch3_img1.png","plot_24_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":439,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
