   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_24_7_10","title":"The Crystal Cavern","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Quest or Journey","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Chapter 4: A Glimmer of Hope\n\nFinn, Ellie, and Ravi huddled behind a large rock. They could see the treasure hunters searching everywhere. \u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d Finn whispered. His heart raced like a drum.\n\n\u201cWe need a plan!\u201d Ellie said, scratching her head. \u201cWe can\u2019t let them find the Crystal Cavern first!\u201d\n\nRavi pulled out his gadget bag. \u201cI have just the thing!\u201d He showed them a shiny mirror. \u201cThis will reflect sunlight. We can create a distraction!\u201d\n\nFinn smiled. \u201cGreat idea! Let\u2019s do it.\u201d The sun was shining brightly as they set the mirror in place. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, a flash of light bounced across the valley. The treasure hunters squinted and turned towards the glare. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d one of them shouted. \n\n\u201cNow\u2019s our chance!\u201d Ravi yelled. The three friends dashed toward the hidden path leading to the cavern. \n\nThey climbed over rocks and ducked under branches. Finn felt a surge of hope. \u201cWe\u2019re getting closer!\u201d \n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Ellie pointed. \u201cThere\u2019s the entrance!\u201d It was a dark, glittering hole in the mountain. The walls sparkled like stars. \n\n\u201cWait!\u201d Ravi said, pulling out a flashlight. \u201cWe need light to explore.\u201d He switched it on, and they stepped inside. \n\nThe cavern was bigger than they imagined. Crystal formations hung from the ceiling like giant icicles. \u201cThis is amazing!\u201d Finn exclaimed, his eyes wide.\n\nJust then, they heard footsteps. The treasure hunters were coming! \u201cQuick, hide!\u201d Ellie urged. They ducked behind a big crystal. \n\nFinn\u2019s heart raced again. \u201cWhat do we do if they find us?\u201d \n\nRavi thought hard. \u201cWe can trick them. If we make noise over there, they will run to it.\u201d \n\nEllie nodded. \u201cLet\u2019s do it!\u201d She picked up a shiny crystal and threw it across the cavern. It clinked loudly and echoed. \n\nThe treasure hunters rushed toward the sound. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Finn said, feeling brave. They slipped out of their hiding spot and quietly moved deeper into the cavern. \n\nAs they walked, hope filled their hearts. They were working together, and the treasure felt closer than ever. \n\n\u201cI can\u2019t wait to see what more is hidden here,\u201d Ravi said, excitement bubbling in his voice. \n\n\u201cMe too!\u201d Finn said. \u201cThis treasure will help us protect our village.\u201d \n\nBut in the back of his mind, he worried about the hunters. They wouldn\u2019t give up easily. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThen, they reached a stunning chamber filled with colorful crystals. \u201cWow!\u201d Ellie gasped. \u201cLook at them all!\u201d \n\nFinn grinned. \u201cThis is it! This is our treasure!\u201d They couldn\u2019t believe their eyes. \n\nBut suddenly, they heard a loud crash behind them. The treasure hunters were close! \n\n\u201cRun!\u201d Finn shouted. They dashed deeper into the chamber, hearts pounding with excitement and fear. \n\nWhat would happen next?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Finn, Ellie, and Ravi use to distract the treasure hunters?","options":["A shiny crystal","A loud noise","A mirror","A flashlight"],"correct_answer":"A mirror"},{"question":"What does Ravi pull out of his gadget bag?","options":["A map","A crystal","A mirror","A book"],"correct_answer":"A mirror"},{"question":"What do Finn and his friends find inside the cavern?","options":["Treasure maps","Sparkling crystals","Treasure hunters","Hiding spots"],"correct_answer":"Sparkling crystals"},{"question":"What do the characters feel as they explore the cavern?","options":["Fear","Excitement","Boredom","Anger"],"correct_answer":"Excitement"},{"question":"What do the friends plan to do with the treasure?","options":["Keep it for themselves","Sell it","Protect their village","Hide it away"],"correct_answer":"Protect their village"}]},"images":null,"word_count":463,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
