   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_24_7_10","title":"The Crystal Cavern","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Quest or Journey","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"The sun shone brightly on the Crystal Cavern, sparkling like a thousand stars. Finn took a deep breath. \u201cThis is it!\u201d he said, excitement bubbling in his voice. He looked at Ellie and Ravi, who stood beside him. \u201cWe have to protect this place.\u201d\n\nEllie nodded. \u201cWe need a plan. The treasure hunters won\u2019t give up easily.\u201d She pulled her hair back, ready to think. \u201cWhat if we create a trap? Something they won\u2019t expect?\u201d\n\nRavi\u2019s eyes lit up. \u201cI can use my gadgets! I have a few tricks up my sleeve.\u201d He pulled out a small device that blinked and whirred. \u201cThis will help us!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]  \nFinn, Ellie, and Ravi stood in front of the entrance to the Crystal Cavern. The sparkling crystals glowed in the sunlight, casting colorful shadows on their faces. Finn looked brave, Ellie looked determined, and Ravi was full of ideas, holding his gadget.\n\nFinn led the way into the cavern, and they gasped at the sight. Tall crystals towered above them. \u201cIt\u2019s beautiful!\u201d Ellie exclaimed. \u201cWe have to keep this safe!\u201d \n\nSuddenly, they heard voices. \u201cThere they are! Let\u2019s grab the treasure!\u201d It was the treasure hunters! Finn\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWe have to be quick!\u201d \n\nRavi activated his gadget, and a loud noise echoed. \u201cLook over there!\u201d he shouted, pointing to a pile of rocks. The hunters turned, confused. \u201cGo, go, go!\u201d Finn urged. They dashed deeper into the cavern.\n\n\u201cNow what?\u201d Ellie asked, panting, as they found a hiding spot. \u201cWe can\u2019t let them catch us!\u201d\n\nRavi grinned. \u201cI have another idea!\u201d He pressed a button, and a colorful light flashed. It distracted the hunters, who stumbled around, trying to figure out where the light was coming from.\n\n\u201cGreat job, Ravi!\u201d Finn said, grinning too. They watched as the hunters argued and then decided to leave. \u201cThey\u2019re gone!\u201d Finn cheered. \n\nAs they stepped out of their hiding spot, they realized something important. \u201cThe real treasure isn\u2019t just the crystals,\u201d Ellie said. \u201cIt\u2019s us working together.\u201d\n\n\u201cRight!\u201d Finn agreed. \u201cWe did this as a team!\u201d They all smiled, knowing they were stronger together. The Crystal Cavern was safe for now, and their bond grew even stronger. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s explore more!\u201d Ravi exclaimed. Together, they ventured deeper into the caverns, eager to uncover more secrets and share more adventures.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Finn, Ellie, and Ravi want to protect?","options":["The treasure hunters","The Crystal Cavern","Their village","Their gadgets"],"correct_answer":"The Crystal Cavern"},{"question":"What does Ravi use to distract the treasure hunters?","options":["A map","A gadget","A crystal","A flashlight"],"correct_answer":"A gadget"},{"question":"What do the characters realize is the true treasure?","options":["Gold and jewels","Their teamwork","The crystals","The village"],"correct_answer":"Their teamwork"},{"question":"How do Finn and his friends feel at the end of the chapter?","options":["Sad","Scared","Excited","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"},{"question":"What does Ellie suggest to keep the cavern safe?","options":["We should run away","We need a plan","We should give up","We should tell everyone"],"correct_answer":"We need a plan"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_24_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_24_ch5_img1.png","plot_24_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":395,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
