     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"treasure","1":"prophecy","2":"adventure","3":"cavern","4":"stealthy","image_prompts":["The interior of Old Man Jasper\u2019s shed, filled with various items: dusty books stacked haphazardly, a rusty bicycle hanging from the ceiling, and Ellie excitedly pointing at a worn-out map spread across a cluttered table. Sunlight streams through a small window, illuminating dust motes dancing in the air, while Finn leans in, eyes wide with curiosity.","A dramatic scene where Finn, Ellie, and Ravi peer out of a window, their expressions a mix of shock and determination as they watch a group of rough-looking treasure hunters unloading heavy equipment outside. The sunlight casts an ominous shadow, and tension hangs in the air as they realize the urgency of their situation."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing Finn stands at the edge of the village square, sunlight casting a warm glow on the cobblestones. Ellie approaches with a look of determination, her wild curls illuminated by the sun. Trees line the background, their shadows merging with the golden light, symbolizing the adventure that awaits them.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_24_ch1_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 20:20:20"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing The three friends hide behind the ancient stone archway, their expressions tense yet resolute. The treasure hunters are seen in the background, rugged figures with greedy eyes. The contrast between the friends youthful determination and the hunters ominous presence creates a charged atmosphere, emphasizing the stakes of their adventure.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_24_ch1_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 20:20:20"}}}
