   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_24_11_14","title":"The Crystal Cavern","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Quest or Journey","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"As the sun dipped below the horizon, casting long shadows over the village, Finn felt the thrill of adventure buzz in his veins. Ellie stood beside him, her fingers tracing the edges of the ancient map they had found. \u201cAre you sure we should go tonight?\u201d she asked, her voice laced with excitement and a hint of apprehension. \n\nFinn nodded, pressing his lips together in a determined line. \u201cThe treasure could be hidden away forever if we wait. Plus, the treasure hunters might be out there too.\u201d He glanced at Ravi, who was fiddling with a small, intricate gadget that looked like a cross between a compass and an alarm clock.\n\n\u201cReady for this?\u201d Ravi grinned, his dark eyes sparkling with mischief. \u201cI\u2019ve modified my tracking device. It\u2019ll help us find our way and warn us if anyone approaches.\u201d\n\n\u201cJust don\u2019t set off any alarms,\u201d Ellie teased, nudging him playfully. \u201cWe don\u2019t need the entire village after us.\u201d\n\nThey gathered their supplies\u2014flashlights, a few snacks, and the map that felt like it was pulsing with secrets. As they stepped into the dense forest surrounding their village, the world transformed. The trees loomed tall and ancient, their trunks twisted like gnarled fingers reaching for the sky. A faint mist curled around their feet, lending an air of enchantment to their quest. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, a crack echoed through the silence. Finn froze, his heart pounding like a drum. \u201cDid you hear that?\u201d he whispered, scanning the shadows. \n\n\u201cProbably just a rabbit,\u201d Ravi said, but his voice wavered slightly as he adjusted his glasses. \n\n\u201cNo,\u201d Ellie said, her eyes narrowing. \u201cIt sounded like\u2014\u201d\n\nBefore she could finish, a group of rugged figures emerged from the trees, their faces obscured by shadows. The treasure hunters! Finn felt a surge of fear mixed with adrenaline. \u201cWe need to hide!\u201d he hissed. They ducked behind a large boulder, their breaths quickening as they listened intently.\n\n\u201cDid you find anything?\u201d one of the hunters asked, his voice gruff and impatient. \n\n\u201cNothing yet,\u201d replied another. \u201cBut that kid Finn\u2026 he\u2019s got the map. We need to find him before he gets to the cavern!\u201d\n\nFinn's stomach twisted. They were being hunted. He glanced at Ellie and Ravi, their faces pale but resolute. \u201cWe can\u2019t let them get to the cavern first. We have to move now!\u201d \n\nWith a shared nod, they scrambled away from their hiding spot, weaving through the trees. Finn led the way, heart racing as he navigated by the dim light of his flashlight. He felt the weight of the map in his pocket, a reminder of the adventure and the danger ahead. \n\nJust as they reached a clearing, Ravi stopped dead in his tracks, pointing. \u201cLook!\u201d he exclaimed, his voice barely above a whisper. \n\nThere, outlined against the last traces of sunlight, was the mouth of a cave\u2014dark, foreboding, and pulsating with mystery. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cWe found it!\u201d Finn shouted, but his excitement was cut short by the distant sound of shouting. The treasure hunters had spotted them! \u201cGo, go!\u201d he urged, sprinting toward the cave. \n\nAs they entered the cavern, the air chilled around them, and Finn could hear the eerie echoes of their footsteps. They were in, but the real challenge was just beginning.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Ravi modify to help them on their quest?","options":["A flashlight","A tracking device","A map","A compass"],"correct_answer":"A tracking device"},{"question":"What do the characters hear that makes them afraid?","options":["A thunderstorm","A rabbit","The treasure hunters","A bear"],"correct_answer":"The treasure hunters"},{"question":"Where do the trio ultimately find the entrance to?","options":["A castle","A secret garden","The Crystal Cavern","A treasure chest"],"correct_answer":"The Crystal Cavern"},{"question":"What does Finn feel the weight of in his pocket?","options":["A flashlight","A snack","The map","A gadget"],"correct_answer":"The map"},{"question":"What is the main conflict in Chapter 2?","options":["Finding the treasure","Avoiding the treasure hunters","Navigating the cave","Reading the map"],"correct_answer":"Avoiding the treasure hunters"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_24_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_24_ch2_img1.png","plot_24_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":551,"reading_level":"Builder"}
