   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_25_7_10","title":"Journey to the Edge of the World","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Quest or Journey","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"The sun peeked over the horizon, painting the sky in bright oranges and yellows. Sara and Max stood at the edge of their little boat, watching the endless ocean. Tully, the wise old turtle, swam beside them, his shell glimmering in the morning light.\n\n\"Today is a special day!\" Tully said, his voice calm and cheerful.\n\n\"What do you mean?\" Max asked, scratching his head.\n\n\"We are very close to the next island,\" Tully replied. \"But be careful, children! The waters can be tricky.\"\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSara\u2019s eyes sparkled with excitement. \u201cWhat\u2019s on this island?\u201d she asked, bouncing on her toes.\n\n\u201cLegend says it holds the Whispering Caves,\u201d Tully explained. \u201cThey are full of voices that share secrets.\u201d\n\nMax frowned. \u201cWhat if the secrets are scary?\u201d\n\nTully chuckled. \u201cOnly if you let your fears guide you. Remember, courage is about facing the fear, not running from it.\u201d\n\nWith Tully\u2019s words in their hearts, the trio sailed on. Soon, dark clouds rolled in, and the sea began to churn. The boat rocked violently.\n\n\u201cHold on!\u201d Sara shouted, gripping the side of the boat.\n\nMax's eyes widened. \u201cWhat\u2019s happening?!\u201d\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s a storm!\u201d Tully called, struggling against the waves. \u201cWe must reach the island quickly!\u201d\n\nThe wind howled and rain poured down. Sara fought to keep the boat steady. \u201cWe can do this, Max! Just focus!\u201d\n\nFinally, they spotted the island through the storm. It loomed like a giant shadow. \u201cThere!\u201d Sara pointed. \u201cWe have to make it!\u201d\n\nBut just as they approached, a huge wave crashed over them. The boat toppled, and they were thrown into the icy water!\n\n\u201cHelp!\u201d Max yelled, flailing his arms.\n\nSara and Tully swam towards the surface. \u201cStay together!\u201d Tully shouted. \u201cWe\u2019re strong!\u201d\n\nAs they broke through the waves, they saw the island beckoning them. \u201cWe can make it!\u201d Sara shouted, determination filling her voice.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith all their strength, they swam. The wind roared, but they pushed forward. Finally, they reached the sandy shore, gasping for breath.\n\n\u201cDid we really make it?\u201d Max panted, staring at the island.\n\n\u201cYes, but the Whispering Caves are still ahead,\u201d Tully said, looking serious. \u201cWe need to find the entrance before night falls.\u201d\n\nSara took a deep breath. \u201cI\u2019m ready.\u201d\n\nBut just then, the ground trembled beneath them. A deep rumble echoed from the caves. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Max whispered, eyes wide with fear.\n\nTully looked worried. \u201cSomething is awakening inside.\u201d\n\nSara glanced at Max and took his hand. \u201cWe have to go in. We can\u2019t turn back now.\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat if it\u2019s dangerous?\u201d Max replied, biting his lip.\n\n\u201cWe can\u2019t let fear win,\u201d Sara said firmly. \u201cLet\u2019s find those secrets!\u201d\n\nAnd with a step forward, they entered the shadowy cave, hearts pounding and courage ignited.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Tully say the island holds?","options":["Treasure","Whispering Caves","Pirate ships","Hidden monsters"],"correct_answer":"Whispering Caves"},{"question":"What happens during the storm?","options":["They find a treasure","Their boat capsizes","They meet a giant fish","They get lost"],"correct_answer":"Their boat capsizes"},{"question":"What does Sara want to do when they reach the shore?","options":["Turn back","Explore the caves","Build a sandcastle","Go home"],"correct_answer":"Explore the caves"},{"question":"How does Max feel about entering the caves?","options":["Excited","Nervous","Bored","Confused"],"correct_answer":"Nervous"},{"question":"What is the main theme of this chapter?","options":["Friendship","Facing fears","Adventure","Exploration"],"correct_answer":"Facing fears"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_25_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_25_ch3_img1.png","plot_25_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":467,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
