   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_25_7_10","title":"Journey to the Edge of the World","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Quest or Journey","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Sara and Max stood at the entrance of the Whispering Caves. The dark opening loomed like a giant mouth, ready to swallow them whole. \n\n\"Are you ready?\" Sara asked, her heart pounding.\n\nMax gulped. \"Not really. What if we get lost?\"\n\n\"Don't worry! Tully will guide us,\" Sara said, looking at their wise friend. Tully the turtle nodded slowly, his big eyes sparkling with trust.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\"Just remember, we have to stick together,\" Tully said. \"The caves can be tricky. Follow my lead.\"\n\nThey took a deep breath and stepped inside. The walls glimmered with tiny crystals, reflecting light like stars. Sara's eyes widened. \"Wow! Look at how pretty it is!\"\n\nMax smiled, feeling a little braver. \"It is nice, but I still feel nervous.\"\n\nAs they wandered deeper, they heard whispers echoing in the cave. \"What was that?\" Max asked, his voice trembling.\n\n\"It's just the wind,\" Sara reassured him. But she wasn't sure. The whispers sounded almost like voices. \n\nSuddenly, a shadow darted past them. \"What was that?\" Max squeaked, clutching Tully's shell.\n\n\"Stay close!\" Tully said firmly. They pressed on, their ears perked for any signs of danger. \n\nAfter a few turns, they stumbled upon a hidden chamber. In the center stood a glowing stone. \"It looks magical!\" Sara gasped. \n\n\"Yes, it holds the answers we seek,\" Tully explained. \"But first, we must face our fears.\"\n\nMax took a step back. \"What if we can't do it?\"\n\n\"You can!\" Sara encouraged. \"We\u2019ve come this far. We can\u2019t give up now.\"\n\nTogether, they approached the stone. As they reached out, the whispers grew louder. \"Believe in yourselves,\" they said in unison.\n\nMax squeezed Sara's hand tight. \"Okay, let\u2019s do it!\"\n\nWith a deep breath, they touched the stone. A warm light enveloped them, filling their hearts with courage. \n\n\"I feel strong!\" Max shouted, his worries melting away.\n\nSara beamed. \"Me too! We can make it to the Edge of the World!\"\n\nJust then, the glowing stone pulsed, lighting up the entire cave. The whispers turned into cheerful laughter. \n\n\"Now you know the truth,\" Tully smiled. \"The answers are within you.\"\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThey shared a joyful laugh, feeling braver than ever. \"This is just the beginning,\" Sara said, grinning at Max. \"Let\u2019s get to the Edge!\"\n\nAs they left the chamber, they felt lighter and more hopeful. The journey was far from over, but they were ready for whatever lay ahead.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Sara and Max find at the entrance of the caves?","options":["A glowing stone","A dark opening","A treasure chest","A large fish"],"correct_answer":"A dark opening"},{"question":"Who guides Sara and Max through the caves?","options":["A funny bird","A wise turtle","A big fish","An old sailor"],"correct_answer":"A wise turtle"},{"question":"What do they discover in the hidden chamber?","options":["A treasure map","A glowing stone","A scary monster","A lost sailor"],"correct_answer":"A glowing stone"},{"question":"How do Sara and Max feel after touching the stone?","options":["Scared","Hungry","Brave","Tired"],"correct_answer":"Brave"},{"question":"What do they learn about the answers they seek?","options":["They are hidden in the cave","They are with Tully","They are within themselves","They are in the ocean"],"correct_answer":"They are within themselves"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_25_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_25_ch4_img1.png","plot_25_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":408,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
