   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_25_7_10","title":"Journey to the Edge of the World","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Quest or Journey","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"The Whispering Caves echoed with strange sounds. Sara and Max stepped carefully over the rocky floor. Tully swam beside them, his wise eyes glimmering in the dim light. \n\n\u201cAre you ready?\u201d Sara asked, her heart beating fast. \n\nMax nodded slowly. \u201cSort of. I just hope we don\u2019t get lost!\u201d\n\nAs they moved deeper into the caves, the walls shimmered with colorful crystals. \u201cLook at all the colors!\u201d Sara exclaimed. \u201cIt\u2019s like a treasure!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, a whisper floated through the air. \u201cCourage\u2026 Courage\u2026\u201d it called softly. They turned to each other, wide-eyed. \n\n\u201cDid you hear that?\u201d Max asked, a tremble in his voice.\n\n\u201cMaybe it\u2019s the cave!\u201d Sara said, trying to sound brave. \u201cLet\u2019s follow it!\u201d \n\nThey walked further, and the whispers grew louder. \u201cCourage\u2026 Courage\u2026\u201d \n\n\u201cAre we really going to keep going?\u201d Max asked, hesitating. \n\n\u201cOf course! We\u2019re almost there!\u201d said Sara. \n\nJust then, they spotted a glowing stone nestled in a crevice. It sparkled with shades of blue and green. Tully swam closer, nodding. \u201cThis is it! The Stone of Courage! Take it, and you will find your strength.\u201d\n\nSara reached for the stone. \u201cI feel it pulling me in!\u201d she said as she grasped it tightly. \u201cWow! It\u2019s warm!\u201d\n\nMax stepped forward, feeling a boost of energy. \u201cI feel it too! It\u2019s like the cave is alive!\u201d \n\nTogether, they held the stone. Suddenly, a wave of warmth washed over them. The whispers turned into cheers! \u201cCourage! Courage!\u201d\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s amazing!\u201d Sara laughed. \u201cWe can do anything now!\u201d\n\nMax smiled, feeling braver than ever. \u201cLet\u2019s get to the Edge of the World!\u201d\n\nAs they turned to leave, the whispers thanked them softly. \u201cGood luck, brave explorers!\u201d\n\nThe three friends made their way back, filled with new courage. They knew their adventure was just beginning.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Sara and Max find in the Whispering Caves?","options":["A map","A treasure chest","The Stone of Courage","A mysterious creature"],"correct_answer":"The Stone of Courage"},{"question":"What do the whispers in the cave say?","options":["Help us!","Courage!","Keep going!","Turn back!"],"correct_answer":"Courage!"},{"question":"How does Max feel when they find the stone?","options":["Scared","Excited","Tired","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"},{"question":"Who helps Sara and Max on their journey?","options":["A wise monkey","A friendly dolphin","Tully the turtle","A giant bird"],"correct_answer":"Tully the turtle"},{"question":"What do Sara and Max plan to do after leaving the caves?","options":["Take a break","Go home","Continue to the Edge of the World","Look for more stones"],"correct_answer":"Continue to the Edge of the World"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_25_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_25_ch5_img1.png","plot_25_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":305,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
