       [DEBUG] Checking shared image: {"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dimly lit attic filled with dust and forgotten treasures, with a young girl holding an old leather-bound journal illuminated by a flickering candle. Her face is lit with excitement, while shadows dance around her. The storm outside is visible through a small window, adding a sense of mystery and foreboding.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_25_ch1_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 20:17:15"}
