   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_25_11_14","title":"Journey to the Edge of the World","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Quest or Journey","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"As the storm clouds rolled in from the horizon, casting a gray shadow over the sea, Sara tightened her grip on the ship's wheel. The ocean heaved beneath them, waves crashing against the sides of their small vessel, the *Sea Serpent*. Max stood by her side, eyes wide with uncertainty, his confidence wavering like the sails flapping in the wind.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t think we should have set sail in this weather,\u201d he shouted over the roar of the wind. His voice trembled, matching the choppy water. \n\n\u201cWe can\u2019t turn back now!\u201d Sara replied, her heart racing. \u201cThe Edge of the World is out there, Max! It\u2019s our chance to find the answers!\u201d\n\nMax swallowed hard, glancing at the dark sea. \u201cBut what if we don\u2019t make it? What if the storm gets worse?\u201d\n\nJust then, Tully, their wise old turtle guide, surfaced beside the boat, his shell glistening like polished jade against the tumultuous waves. \u201cFear can be a storm in itself, young ones,\u201d he said, his voice calm and steady. \u201cBut storms pass, and so do the doubts within you. Trust in yourselves.\u201d\n\nSara felt a rush of encouragement at Tully's words. She turned to Max, desperation mixing with determination in her gaze. \u201cWe\u2019ve come too far to give up. We have the journal, and we have Tully. We can do this!\u201d\n\nMax hesitated, his eyes darting between the stormy skies and Sara's fierce expression. Finally, he took a deep breath. \u201cOkay, let\u2019s keep going. But if we capsize, I\u2019m blaming you!\u201d\n\nSara laughed despite the storm, feeling a spark of courage ignite within her. \u201cDeal!\u201d\n\nAs they pressed on, the winds howled like lost spirits, whipping through their hair and sending salty sprays of ocean water over the sides of the boat. Tully led them through the churning waves, guiding their ship with the wisdom of ages. The young adventurers clung tightly to hope, but Sara could feel her worries creeping back. What if they truly failed? What if they had ventured too far and couldn\u2019t find their way back?\n\nSuddenly, a loud crack echoed above them. A bolt of lightning zigzagged through the sky, illuminating the dark clouds and creating a brief, blinding flash. Max yelped, stumbling backward. \u201cSara! Look out!\u201d \n\nBefore she could react, a massive wave surged toward the boat, threatening to engulf them. Sara instinctively steered the *Sea Serpent* away, her heart pounding like a drum in her ears. She glanced at Max, whose pale face reflected her own fear. \n\nJust then, Tully lunged toward the wave and dove under the surface. \u201cStay focused!\u201d he called out, his voice barely breaking through the chaos. \u201cYou must steer with courage, not fear!\u201d\n\nSara took a deep breath, recalling Tully's wisdom. \u201cWe can do this, Max! Hold on!\u201d\n\nWith a fierce determination, she gripped the wheel tighter, her body leaning into the turn as they narrowly avoided the wave. Max, now standing firm at her side, began shouting words of encouragement. Together, they faced the storm, riding the swell of the ocean, the Edge of the World still calling to them in the distance.\n\nAs they emerged from the chaos, a calmness settled over the water ahead. But before they could celebrate, a dark shape loomed beneath the waves, and Sara\u2019s stomach tightened with dread. \n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s that?\u201d she whispered, her voice tinged with fear.\n\nTully surfaced again, his eyes wide. \u201cPrepare yourselves! A new challenge awaits!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Tully advise Sara and Max to focus on during the storm?","options":["Their doubts","Courage","The storm","The journal"],"correct_answer":"Courage"},{"question":"What causes Max to yelp during the storm?","options":["Sara's laughter","A wave","Lightning","Tully's warning"],"correct_answer":"Lightning"},{"question":"How does Sara feel about their journey as they face challenges?","options":["Confident","Nervous","Indifferent","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Nervous"},{"question":"What is the name of their ship?","options":["The Sea Serpent","The Storm Chaser","The Brave Voyager","The Ocean Explorer"],"correct_answer":"The Sea Serpent"},{"question":"What do Sara and Max discover as they emerge from the storm?","options":["A calm sea","An island","Treasure","Other sailors"],"correct_answer":"A calm sea"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_25_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_25_ch2_img1.png","plot_25_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":584,"reading_level":"Builder"}
