   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_16_7_10","title":"The Clock Tower Conundrum","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Escape Mission","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"It was a sunny day in Maplewood when Max, Ava, Leo, and Mia went on a school trip. They were excited to explore the old clock tower in the center of town. Max, the brave leader, said, \"I can\u2019t wait to see the top!\"  \n\"Me too!\" Ava replied, adjusting her glasses. She loved puzzles and mysteries.  \nLeo, the jokester, grinned. \"I hope it\u2019s not just a boring old tower. Maybe it has ghosts!\"  \nMia, who often felt nervous, shivered. \"Ghosts? N-no thanks!\"  \n\nAs they entered the clock tower, a cool breeze greeted them. Dust danced in the sunlight. The walls were made of old stone, and the air smelled of history. They could hear the gentle ticking of the giant clock above them.  \n\n\"Whoa!\" exclaimed Ava, her eyes wide with wonder. \"Look at all those gears!\"  \n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]  \nThe gears were shiny and enormous, spinning and clicking. The friends gathered closer to admire them. Suddenly, a loud CLACK echoed through the tower. The heavy door they had just come through slammed shut!  \n\n\"Uh-oh,\" said Leo, his smile fading. \"What just happened?\"  \nMax frowned. \"I think we\u2019re locked in!\"  \n\nMia gasped. \"What if we can\u2019t get out?\"  \n\"We will get out,\" Max assured her. \"We just need to find a way.\"  \n\n\"Maybe there are clues!\" Ava suggested. She loved solving puzzles. The group looked around. The clock tower was filled with strange markings and symbols on the walls.  \n\n\"Let\u2019s split up and search!\" Max declared. \"We need to find a riddle or a key.\"  \nThe friends nodded, but Mia hesitated. \"What if we get lost?\"  \n\"Stick together!\" Max said. \"We can do this!\"  \n\nAs they explored, Ava found a strange map hanging on the wall. \"Look at this!\" she called. \"It shows rooms we can't see!\"  \n\nSuddenly, the clock struck. The sound rang loudly, making them jump. \"We have to hurry!\" Max urged. \"Time is ticking!\"  \n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]  \nThe friends gathered around the map, excitement and fear bubbling inside them. They knew they had to work together to solve the clock tower's secrets before it was too late.  \n\n\"Let\u2019s start with the first clue,\" Max said. They were ready for an adventure.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do the friends find when they enter the clock tower?","options":["A bunch of toys","Enormous gears","A ghost","A treasure chest"],"correct_answer":"Enormous gears"},{"question":"Who is the brave leader of the group?","options":["Ava","Mia","Max","Leo"],"correct_answer":"Max"},{"question":"What happens when the friends enter the tower?","options":["They find a treasure","The door locks shut","They see a ghost","They fall down"],"correct_answer":"The door locks shut"},{"question":"What does Ava like to do?","options":["Tell jokes","Solve puzzles","Draw pictures","Sing songs"],"correct_answer":"Solve puzzles"},{"question":"What do the friends need to do to escape?","options":["Read a book","Solve puzzles","Count to ten","Play a game"],"correct_answer":"Solve puzzles"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_16_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_16_ch1_img1.png","plot_16_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":367,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
