   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_16_7_10","title":"The Clock Tower Conundrum","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Escape Mission","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"The ancient clock tower creaked and groaned as Max, Ava, Leo, and Mia stood in the dusty room. The walls were covered with strange symbols. The giant clock on the wall ticked loudly, counting down their time. \n\n\u201cLook at all these gears!\u201d Max said, pointing to the shiny mechanisms. \u201cWhat do you think they do?\u201d\n\n\u201cI bet they have something to do with our escape!\u201d Ava replied, her eyes shining. She loved puzzles more than anything. \n\n\u201cMaybe it\u2019s another riddle?\u201d Leo joked, pretending to solve a riddle in a silly voice. \u201cWhy did the gear go to school? To get a little turn-ucation!\u201d \n\nMia giggled, but she felt nervous. \u201cWhat if we can\u2019t figure it out? What if we\u2019re stuck here forever?\u201d \n\n\u201cDon\u2019t worry, Mia. We\u2019re a team!\u201d Max said, putting a reassuring hand on her shoulder. \u201cWe\u2019ve already solved one riddle. We can do this!\u201d\n\nJust then, the clock chimed loudly. The sound echoed around the room, making Mia jump. \u201cOh no! What does that mean?\u201d she gasped.\n\nAva rushed to the clock face. \u201cIt\u2019s a clue! Look!\u201d She pointed to the numbers. \u201cThey\u2019re all different. What if they tell us the order of the gears?\u201d\n\nMax nodded. \u201cLet\u2019s try it! Ava, you take the lead!\u201d\n\nThey gathered around the clock, excitement bubbling. \u201cWhat\u2019s the first number?\u201d Mia asked, her heart racing.\n\n\u201cThree!\u201d shouted Leo, bouncing on his toes.\n\n\u201cOkay! Find the third gear!\u201d Ava instructed. They searched frantically. \u201cThere! That one!\u201d She pointed.\n\nAs they pulled the gear, the ground trembled. Suddenly, a hidden door swung open, revealing a dark passageway! \n\n\u201cWow! We did it!\u201d Leo cheered, but Mia was too scared to move. \n\n\u201cWhat if it\u2019s dangerous?\u201d she whispered. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s stick together,\u201d Max said firmly. \u201cWe\u2019ve come this far. We can\u2019t give up now!\u201d\n\nAs they stepped into the shadows, the door slammed shut behind them! \n\n\u201cYikes! We\u2019re really in trouble!\u201d Mia squeaked. \n\n\u201cKeep going! We need to find another riddle,\u201d Max urged, leading the way. \n\nThe passage was dim and narrow. The walls were lined with strange symbols, just like the room above. Ava traced her fingers along the symbols. \u201cMaybe they mean something!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, Leo shouted, \u201cLook! There\u2019s another clock over there!\u201d \n\nThe clock had a tiny keyhole. \u201cWe need a key!\u201d Ava exclaimed. \n\n\u201cWhat if the key is in the next riddle?\u201d Max suggested, tapping his chin. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s hope so! But we have to hurry!\u201d Mia said, glancing at the giant clock still ticking above. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they moved closer to the second clock, they realized they had to solve the next riddle to find the key. \n\n\u201cOkay, everyone. Let\u2019s think!\u201d Max said, his eyes darting around. \u201cWhat has hands but can\u2019t clap?\u201d\n\n\u201cI know, I know!\u201d Leo shouted, bouncing with excitement. \u201cA clock!\u201d\n\n\u201cRight! But what does it mean?\u201d Mia pondered, looking worried. \n\n\u201cMaybe we need to find where the clock hands lead!\u201d Ava said. \n\nJust then, the clock chimed again, louder this time. The gears began to move, and the room shook! \n\n\u201cOh no! What if it falls?\u201d Mia cried out in panic. \n\n\u201cQuick! We have to solve it!\u201d Max said urgently. \n\nThey all stood still, hearts racing, ready to solve the next puzzle and escape before it was too late.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do the friends find inside the clock tower?","options":["A hidden door","A treasure chest","A map","A telephone"],"correct_answer":"A hidden door"},{"question":"What is the riddle Max mentions?","options":["What has hands but can't clap?","What has legs but can't walk?","What has wings but can't fly?","What has a head but no body?"],"correct_answer":"What has hands but can't clap?"},{"question":"How does Mia feel in the chapter?","options":["Excited","Nervous","Angry","Happy"],"correct_answer":"Nervous"},{"question":"Who leads the group when they decide to solve the riddle?","options":["Leo","Max","Ava","Mia"],"correct_answer":"Max"},{"question":"What happens when they pull the gear?","options":["The clock stops","A door swings open","They find a key","They hear a voice"],"correct_answer":"A door swings open"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_16_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_16_ch3_img1.png","plot_16_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":561,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
