     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"glimmering","1":"intricate","2":"determination","3":"hollowed","4":"resonating","image_prompts":["A dimly lit chamber inside the clock tower, with ancient gears and shadowy alcoves. The friends, Max, Ava, Leo, and Mia, are gathered around a large pedestal, pointing at a small, glimmering crystal in Max's hand. The atmosphere is tense yet hopeful, with the clock's hands ominously ticking in the background.","The group stands at the base of a spiraling staircase that descends into darkness. The walls are covered in intricate designs, and the air is filled with a low hum. Max holds the crystal above the pedestal, casting rainbows of light across the floor. The expressions of the friends reflect a mix of excitement and apprehension as they contemplate the staircase ahead."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A vibrant depiction of the clock chamber bathed in warm golden light, revealing intricate mechanisms and swirling shadows. The four friends stand together, their expressions a mix of determination and trepidation, as the clocks gears whir to life around them, symbolizing hope and the urgency of time.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_16_ch4_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 20:11:03"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dramatic scene captures the moment just before the clocks hands move. The friends are clustered together, their faces illuminated by a flickering light, embodying resolve and tension. The mysterious figure appears faintly in the background, casting an enigmatic presence that adds to the suspense of their situation.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_16_ch4_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 20:11:03"}}}
