   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_16_11_14","title":"The Clock Tower Conundrum","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Escape Mission","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"As the echo of the guardian's chilling laughter faded, the clock tower felt more alive than ever. The rhythmic ticking of the massive clock seemed to pulse through the walls, amplifying the urgency of their situation. Max, swallowing his fear, turned to his friends. \u201cWe can\u2019t let this place break us. We need to figure out these puzzles together.\u201d \n\nAva nodded, determination sparkling in her eyes. \u201cThe riddle from the guardian mentioned something about shadows. Maybe there\u2019s a way to use light in here?\u201d She stepped closer to one of the clock's ancient gears, the metal tarnished but still gleaming in the low light.\n\nLeo grinned, his fingers fidgeting with a piece of loose brick he\u2019d discovered nearby. \u201cOr maybe we just need to make some noise! You know, distract the clock spirits or whatever.\u201d He chuckled, but Mia didn\u2019t share his humor. She was staring at the intricate designs on the floor, her brow furrowed in concentration.\n\n\u201cWhat if the patterns are clues?\u201d Mia suggested, her voice barely above a whisper. She traced the designs with her finger, her anxiety slipping momentarily as curiosity took over. \u201cLook! They kind of look like a map.\u201d\n\nMax crouched beside her, inspecting the patterns. \u201cYou might be onto something, Mia! If we follow them, maybe they\u2019ll lead us to the next riddle.\u201d \n\nWith newfound energy, the group gathered around her. They followed the lines on the floor, their hearts racing as they moved deeper into the tower. Every tick of the clock felt like a countdown, pushing them onward. Suddenly, Leo pointed excitedly at a glimmering object half-hidden beneath a loose floorboard. \u201cHey, what\u2019s that?\u201d\n\nThey knelt to examine it, revealing a small, dusty crystal. It caught the dim light spilling from the clock\u2019s face, casting tiny rainbows around them. \u201cIt must be important,\u201d Ava said, her eyes wide with wonder. \u201cMaybe it\u2019s a key to our next puzzle!\u201d\n\n\u201cOr it\u2019s just an old rock,\u201d Leo joked, but his playful tone did little to hide his awe.\n\nMax took the crystal, feeling its smooth surface cool against his palm. \u201cLet\u2019s see if it fits anywhere,\u201d he said, scanning the room. \u201cWe need to keep moving before time runs out.\u201d\n\nThe group continued their search, and as they turned a corner, they entered a small chamber filled with shadowy alcoves. In the center of the room stood a large pedestal, with a hollowed-out spot that seemed to match the shape of the crystal. \u201cIt\u2019s got to go there!\u201d Ava exclaimed, excitement bubbling in her voice.\n\nMia took a deep breath, her earlier nervousness transforming into determination. \u201cLet\u2019s do it together,\u201d she suggested. \n\nThey approached the pedestal, and Max carefully placed the crystal into the hollow. A low hum vibrated through the air, and the walls began to shift like a wave. \u201cWhoa!\u201d Leo exclaimed, nearly stumbling back. The humming grew louder, resonating through the tower as a hidden door creaked open, revealing a spiraling staircase that descended into darkness.\n\n\u201cAre we really going down there?\u201d Mia asked, her voice trembling slightly.\n\nMax turned to her, his expression serious but encouraging. \u201cWe\u2019ve come this far. Together, we can face anything.\u201d \n\nWith a deep breath, they stepped forward, ready to face whatever lay ahead. But as they descended, the ticking grew louder, echoing ominously in their ears. The clock tower was alive, and time was slipping away.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What new discovery do the friends make in this chapter?","options":["A hidden staircase","A riddle","A map","A guardian"],"correct_answer":"A hidden staircase"},{"question":"What does Mia suggest the patterns on the floor might be?","options":["A puzzle","A map","A trap","A decoration"],"correct_answer":"A map"},{"question":"How does the group feel when they find the crystal?","options":["Indifferent","Scared","Amazed","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Amazed"},{"question":"What emotion does Mia overcome in this chapter?","options":["Joy","Fear","Anger","Sadness"],"correct_answer":"Fear"},{"question":"What does Max emphasize when facing the staircase?","options":["They should run away","They can face anything together","They should leave the crystal","They are lost"],"correct_answer":"They can face anything together"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_16_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_16_ch4_img1.png","plot_16_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":579,"reading_level":"Builder"}
