   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_16_11_14","title":"The Clock Tower Conundrum","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Escape Mission","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Max steadied his breath, the dim light of the clock tower casting long shadows on the stone walls. The air was thick with anticipation as they gathered around the crystal they had discovered at the bottom of the staircase. \u201cWhat do you think it means?\u201d Mia asked, her voice barely above a whisper. \n\n\u201cI think it\u2019s a clue,\u201d Ava replied, adjusting her glasses with determination. \u201cWe need to figure out how it connects to the next puzzle. We\u2019ve got to work fast; we can\u2019t let the clock run out on us.\u201d \n\nLeo, always the comic relief, added with a grin, \u201cNo pressure, right? Just the fate of our lives hanging in the balance.\u201d\n\nMax chuckled but felt the weight of responsibility pressing down on him. \u201cOkay, let\u2019s focus. The inscription on the wall said something about time being our guide. Maybe the crystal is more than just a pretty rock.\u201d\n\nAva examined the crystal closely. \u201cLook, it\u2019s glowing in a pattern. It\u2019s like it\u2019s trying to tell us something.\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs the crystal pulsed with a gentle light, a door that had seemed like a simple wall suddenly revealed itself, creaking open to unveil a dusty room filled with old scrolls and maps. \u201cThis must be it!\u201d Ava exclaimed, rushing inside.\n\nInside the room, they found an ancient map of the clock tower itself. It was marked with strange symbols and a series of numbers. \u201cWhat are these?\u201d Max wondered aloud, tracing his finger over the mapping lines. \n\n\u201cThey look like\u2026 riddles?\u201d Mia suggested, her unease momentarily forgotten. \u201cMaybe each symbol points to a different part of the tower.\u201d \n\nJust then, an ominous clang echoed through the room. The clock hands above began to spin wildly, and the walls trembled slightly. \u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d Max shouted as the ground shook beneath their feet.\n\n\u201cQuick! We need to solve this!\u201d Ava urged, her eyes darting to the map. \u201cWe have to match the symbols with the clock\u2019s gears!\u201d \n\nLeo, always one to lighten the mood, quipped, \u201cGreat! I can barely match my socks in the morning, but let\u2019s tackle a clock tower!\u201d \n\n\u201cFocus, Leo!\u201d Max replied sharply, the urgency in his voice cutting through the tension. \u201cWe need to figure out the first symbol. What do you see, Ava?\u201d\n\n\u201cI see a gear that matches this symbol!\u201d Ava pointed to the map. \n\nJust then, the clock struck loudly, sending vibrations through the stone. \u201cWe\u2019re running out of time!\u201d Mia cried, panic rising in her voice. \n\nAs they hurried to the spot indicated on the map, Leo noticed a smaller gear above them, slightly crooked. \u201cWhat if this gear needs to be turned to unlock the next part of the puzzle?\u201d \n\nWith a collective nod, they reached for the gear. Max felt the weight of their combined determination. \u201cOn three, pull!\u201d he commanded. \u201cOne, two, three!\u201d \n\nWith a mighty heave, they turned the gear. A loud click echoed through the tower, and suddenly, a beam of light shot down from the ceiling, illuminating a hidden pathway. \n\n\u201cI think we did it!\u201d Mia exclaimed, her eyes wide with excitement. \n\nAs they stepped into the light, a feeling of hope washed over them. They weren\u2019t just fighting against time; they were learning how to trust each other and overcome their fears together. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cWhatever happens next, we can handle it,\u201d Max said, rallying his friends. \u201cLet\u2019s keep going!\u201d\n\nWith their spirits lifted, they ventured down the illuminated path, ready for whatever challenge awaited them.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do the friends discover in the hidden room?","options":["A secret passage","An ancient map","A treasure chest","A sleeping guardian"],"correct_answer":"An ancient map"},{"question":"What does the crystal do when they examine it?","options":["It cracks","It glows","It disappears","It explodes"],"correct_answer":"It glows"},{"question":"What is Max's role in the group during the chapter?","options":["The comic relief","The brave leader","The puzzle maker","The scared one"],"correct_answer":"The brave leader"},{"question":"What challenge do the friends face when they try to turn the gear?","options":["The walls shake","The clock stops","A door closes","A monster appears"],"correct_answer":"The walls shake"},{"question":"What does Max realize about their experience in the clock tower?","options":["They are lost forever","They must work together","They need to give up","The tower is haunted"],"correct_answer":"They must work together"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_16_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_16_ch5_img1.png","plot_16_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":594,"reading_level":"Builder"}
