   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_16_15_18","title":"The Clock Tower Conundrum","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Escape Mission","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"As the heavy wooden door slammed shut behind them, the echo of the lock clicking into place reverberated through the ancient clock tower. Max, still trying to process the sudden shift from adventure to confinement, glanced around the dimly lit chamber. The air felt thick with the scent of aged wood and rust, and the incessant ticking of the clock above seemed to mock their predicament. \n\n\u201cA little dramatic, don\u2019t you think?\u201d Leo quipped, his voice light despite the tension coiling in the air like a spring ready to snap. \u201cMaybe they just want to keep us from running off with their precious time.\u201d\n\nAva, her brow furrowed in concentration, squinted at the wall covered in faded engravings and cryptic symbols. \u201cFocus, guys. We need to figure out how to get out of here before we really are trapped.\u201d She stepped forward, brushing her fingers against the intricate carvings. \u201cThese markings could be clues.\u201d\n\nMia lingered in the back, her heart racing. \u201cWhat if we can\u2019t solve them? What if\u2026 what if we\u2019re stuck here forever?\u201d Her voice trembled slightly, betraying the anxiety that often held her captive. \n\nMax turned to her, his expression softening. \u201cWe won\u2019t be. We\u2019ll figure this out together. That\u2019s what friends are for, right?\u201d \n\n\u201cRight,\u201d Mia nodded slowly, though doubt still clouded her eyes. \n\nAs they fanned out around the room, a shaft of light broke through a tiny window high above, illuminating an ornate, dusty hourglass perched on a pedestal. It was unlike anything they had ever seen, its sands shimmering as if imbued with some ancient magic. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nMax approached the hourglass, brushing aside cobwebs that clung to it like forgotten memories. \u201cMaybe this is part of the puzzle,\u201d he suggested, glancing back at Ava and Leo, who had begun scrutinizing the wall for more hidden messages. \u201cWhat do you think?\u201d\n\nAva leaned in closer, her eyes sparkling with intrigue. \u201cIt could symbolize time itself. We need to find out how it relates to the rest of the room.\u201d \n\nSuddenly, a loud clang echoed from above, shaking the very foundation of the tower. The friends exchanged worried glances, aware that they could no longer afford the luxury of time or fear. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s split up,\u201d Max commanded, his voice steady. \u201cAva, you and Mia check the hourglass. Leo and I will take a look at the wall. If we find anything, we shout. Agreed?\u201d \n\n\u201cAgreed,\u201d they echoed back, and with that, the group moved into action. \n\nMax and Leo examined the wall, tracing the symbols with their fingers. \u201cLook here,\u201d Leo said, pointing to a particularly intricate design resembling a key. \u201cThis must mean something. Perhaps it\u2019s a part of the next step.\u201d \n\nMeanwhile, at the hourglass, Ava and Mia leaned closer, trying to decipher the cryptic inscriptions etched at its base. \u201cIt says something about \u2018The sands of time reveal the truth,\u2019\u201d Ava murmured, her brow furrowing. \n\n\u201cWhat does that even mean?\u201d Mia asked, biting her lip nervously. \n\nAva thought for a moment, her mind racing. \u201cMaybe we need to turn it? Isn\u2019t that what you do with an hourglass?\u201d \n\nWith a shared look of determination, they carefully flipped the hourglass, watching as the golden sand began to cascade downward\u2014time slipping away right before their eyes. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAs the last grains fell, a low rumble resonated through the tower. The ground beneath them vibrated as if the very structure of the clock tower were awakening. Suddenly, the symbols on the wall began to glow, illuminating the dark room in a soft, golden light. \n\n\u201cWhat did we just do?\u201d Max shouted, coming over to join them, his eyes wide with realization. \n\nAva and Mia exchanged glances, a mix of excitement and fear coursing through them. \u201cI think we triggered something,\u201d Ava said, her voice barely above a whisper. \n\nBefore they could process the significance of the glow, a hidden door within the wall creaked open with a slow, ominous groan, revealing a narrow passageway shrouded in shadows.\n\nMax stepped forward, adrenaline surging through him. \u201cWhatever we do, we need to go in there. It\u2019s our only option.\u201d \n\nAs they stood at the threshold of the unknown, the towering clock\u2019s hands moved forward, echoing loudly in their ears like a countdown to an inevitable fate. Nervous but resolute, they stepped into the darkness, united by a flicker of hope against the looming dread of what lay ahead.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do the characters discover after flipping the hourglass?","options":["A secret map","A hidden passage","An exit door","A treasure chest"],"correct_answer":"A hidden passage"},{"question":"What internal conflict does Mia face throughout this chapter?","options":["Doubt about her intelligence","Fear of the dark","Concern for her friends","Desire to leave the tower"],"correct_answer":"Doubt about her intelligence"},{"question":"What instruction does Max give to the group?","options":["To stay quiet","To split up and search","To leave the tower","To take a break"],"correct_answer":"To split up and search"},{"question":"How does Leo handle the tension of being trapped?","options":["By panicking","By making jokes","By staying silent","By reading a book"],"correct_answer":"By making jokes"},{"question":"What does the phrase 'The sands of time reveal the truth' suggest?","options":["Time is meaningless","Time can solve their problems","Time will lead to answers","Time should be ignored"],"correct_answer":"Time will lead to answers"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_16_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_16_ch2_img1.png","plot_16_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":746,"reading_level":"Challenger"}
