   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_17_7_10","title":"Escape from Dragon\u2019s Cave","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Escape Mission","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Emma and Jake were always looking for adventure. One sunny afternoon, they found an old map in their attic. \u201cLook at this!\u201d Emma said, her eyes sparkling with excitement. \u201cIt shows a treasure hidden in Dragon\u2019s Cave!\u201d \n\n\u201cDragon\u2019s Cave?\u201d Jake gasped. \u201cThat sounds scary!\u201d \n\n\u201cDon\u2019t be silly!\u201d Emma laughed. \u201cDragons are just stories. Let\u2019s go find the treasure!\u201d \n\nWith a nod, Jake agreed. They packed a few snacks and set off into the woods. The trees grew taller as they walked. The air became cooler, and the sunlight faded. Soon, they reached a dark, gaping cave. \n\n\u201cWow,\u201d Jake whispered, staring at the entrance. \u201cIt\u2019s really big!\u201d\n\nEmma took a deep breath. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d she said, stepping inside. \n\nInside the cave, the walls sparkled with colorful gems. Reds, blues, and greens glimmered all around. \u201cLook at all the treasure!\u201d Jake shouted, pointing at the shiny stones. \n\nBut as they wandered deeper, they heard a low rumble. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Jake squeaked. \n\n\u201cShh! Listen!\u201d Emma said, holding her finger to her lips. The rumble grew louder. Suddenly, a shadow moved across the cave. Emma and Jake froze. \n\n\u201cUh-oh,\u201d Emma said, her heart racing. \u201cThat sounds like a dragon!\u201d \n\nJust then, they spotted a huge creature sleeping on a pile of gold. It was a dragon! Its scales shimmered like jewels. \u201cWe have to get out of here!\u201d Jake exclaimed. \n\nAs they turned to leave, Emma noticed something strange. \u201cWait! Look at that!\u201d She pointed to a glimmering object on the ground. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s check it out!\u201d Jake said, curiosity sparkling in his eyes. \n\nThey tiptoed closer. The object was a golden key! \u201cWhat do you think it unlocks?\u201d Emma wondered. \n\nBefore Jake could answer, loud footsteps echoed behind them. The dragon was waking up! \n\n\u201cOh no! We have to hurry!\u201d Emma shouted. \n\nThey knew they had to escape the cave before the dragon found them. \u201cLet\u2019s be brave!\u201d Emma said, gripping the key tightly. \n\nCould they outsmart the dragon and find a way out? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Emma and Jake find in the attic?","options":["A treasure map","A dragon","A book","A toy"],"correct_answer":"A treasure map"},{"question":"What did the cave walls sparkle with?","options":["Water","Gold","Gems","Sand"],"correct_answer":"Gems"},{"question":"What was the dragon doing when Emma and Jake saw it?","options":["Eating","Sleeping","Flying","Roaring"],"correct_answer":"Sleeping"},{"question":"What object did Emma and Jake find on the ground?","options":["A sword","A key","A shield","A map"],"correct_answer":"A key"},{"question":"What did Emma say they needed to do?","options":["Stay and play","Be brave","Find more treasure","Wake the dragon"],"correct_answer":"Be brave"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_17_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_17_ch1_img1.png","plot_17_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":343,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
