   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_17_7_10","title":"Escape from Dragon\u2019s Cave","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Escape Mission","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Emma and Jake stood in the dark cave, their hearts racing. The glittering gems around them sparkled like stars in the night sky. \"Wow, look at all this treasure!\" Jake exclaimed, his eyes wide with wonder.\n\nJust then, they heard a soft rumble. Emma gulped. \"That sounds like the dragon!\" \n\n\"We need to find a way out!\" Jake shouted. They looked around the cave, searching for an escape. \n\nSuddenly, Emma spotted a shimmering door in the wall. \"Jake! Over here!\" she called. They rushed to the door, but it was locked tight. \n\n\"We still have the key!\" Jake said, holding it up proudly. Emma took the key and tried to fit it into the lock. \n\n\"Will it work?\" she wondered aloud, her hands shaking.\n\n\"Only one way to find out!\" Jake replied, bouncing on his toes. Emma turned the key, and\u2014click! The door creaked open, revealing a tunnel covered in colorful, glowing vines that pulsed like a heartbeat.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\"Wow, look at those vines!\" Jake said, pointing. \"They look alive!\"\n\nEmma nodded, excited but nervous. \"Let\u2019s be careful. We don\u2019t know what else is in here!\"\n\nAs they stepped through the door, they heard another rumble. This time, it was much louder! \n\n\"Quick! We have to keep moving!\" Emma urged. They dashed down the tunnel, the glowing vines lighting their way. But suddenly, Jake tripped over something shiny on the ground. \n\n\"Ouch!\" he yelped, rubbing his knee. When he looked down, he saw a strange, sparkling rock. \"Emma, look! This might be magic!\"\n\nEmma picked it up and examined it. \"It could help us!\" she said. Just then, a loud roar echoed behind them. The dragon was waking up!\n\n\"We need to go!\" Emma shouted, gripping Jake's hand. They sprinted down the tunnel, their hearts pounding.\n\nBut right ahead, they saw a wall of mist. \"What is that?\" Jake asked, squinting.\n\n\"It looks like a trap!\" Emma said, her voice shaky. \"We need to find a way through.\" \n\n\"Maybe the magic rock can help!\" Jake suggested. \n\nWith a determined look, Emma held the rock high. \"Let\u2019s see if it works!\" \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nJust then, the mist began to swirl and shimmer, revealing a path. Emma and Jake exchanged excited glances. \u201cIt is working!\u201d they cheered. But they knew they had to hurry. The dragon was almost free!\n\nWith their new challenge ahead, they stepped into the mist, ready to face whatever lay beyond.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Emma and Jake find in the cave?","options":["A sleeping dragon","A treasure chest","A magic wand","A giant spider"],"correct_answer":"A sleeping dragon"},{"question":"What do they discover after unlocking the door?","options":["A dark tunnel","A treasure map","A friendly knight","A giant boulder"],"correct_answer":"A dark tunnel"},{"question":"What does Jake stumble over?","options":["A treasure chest","A magic rock","A sleeping dragon","A pile of gems"],"correct_answer":"A magic rock"},{"question":"What does Emma do with the magic rock?","options":["Throws it away","Hides it","Holds it high","Gives it to Jake"],"correct_answer":"Holds it high"},{"question":"What is blocking their path in the tunnel?","options":["A wall of mist","A sleeping dragon","A treasure chest","A giant boulder"],"correct_answer":"A wall of mist"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_17_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_17_ch2_img1.png","plot_17_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":408,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
