   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_17_7_10","title":"Escape from Dragon\u2019s Cave","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Escape Mission","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Emma and Jake stood in the misty tunnel. The air felt heavy and thick. \"What do you think is in there?\" Jake whispered. \n\n\"I don't know, but we have to keep moving,\" Emma replied, trying to sound brave. They stepped forward, the glowing rocks lighting their way. Suddenly, the mist swirled around them, dancing like a playful ghost.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe siblings paused, glancing down a dark path. \u201cLook, there\u2019s a shimmering door!\u201d Jake pointed, his eyes wide with excitement. But then, a loud roar echoed from behind them. \u201cOh no, the dragon!\u201d Emma gasped.\n\n\u201cQuick, let\u2019s go!\u201d Jake shouted. They raced toward the door. Emma pushed it open just as a shadow filled the tunnel. They stumbled into a room filled with sparkling gems. But something wasn\u2019t right.\n\n\u201cEmma, look at those glowing rocks!\u201d Jake exclaimed. \"They look like the ones we found!\" \n\n\u201cYes! They must be magical!\u201d Emma said, her heart racing. But the dragon\u2019s growl grew louder, shaking the walls. They had to hurry!\n\n\u201cWait!\u201d Jake cried. \u201cWhat if these rocks can help us?\u201d He grabbed a small blue gem. Suddenly, it began to glow brighter. The mist started swirling faster around them, forming shapes.\n\n\u201cRun, Jake! We need to find a way out!\u201d Emma yelled, pulling him along. Just then, a giant illusion appeared. It was Drago, the dragon!\n\n\u201cStop!\u201d he roared, but his voice was mixed with worry. \u201cYou can\u2019t leave! The cave will collapse!\u201d \n\nEmma and Jake exchanged worried glances. \u201cWhat do we do?\u201d Jake asked. The floor trembled, and they could see cracks forming. \n\n\u201cWe need to trust Drago!\u201d Emma said. \u201cHe might know how to escape!\u201d \n\n\u201cOkay, but what if he\u2019s tricking us?\u201d Jake whispered. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find out!\u201d Emma shouted over the noise. They faced the dragon. \u201cDrago, help us!\u201d \n\nWill the dragon guide them? Or will they be trapped forever? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nJake held his breath as Drago stepped closer, his scales shimmering. \u201cI want to help you,\" Drago said softly. \u201cBut you must trust me. Follow my lead!\u201d\n\nThe siblings nodded, their hearts pounding. Could they trust the dragon to save them?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Emma and Jake find in the misty tunnel?","options":["A treasure chest","A shimmering door","A scary monster","A magic wand"],"correct_answer":"A shimmering door"},{"question":"What does the dragon, Drago, want to do?","options":["Help Emma and Jake","Chase them away","Steal their treasure","Scare them"],"correct_answer":"Help Emma and Jake"},{"question":"What happens to the cave while Emma and Jake are inside?","options":["It gets brighter","It starts to collapse","It fills with water","It gets colder"],"correct_answer":"It starts to collapse"},{"question":"What do Emma and Jake have to decide?","options":["Whether to leave","Whether to trust Drago","Whether to find more treasure","Whether to go back"],"correct_answer":"Whether to trust Drago"},{"question":"What do Jake and Emma think about the glowing rocks?","options":["They are scary","They are magical","They are useless","They are heavy"],"correct_answer":"They are magical"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_17_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_17_ch3_img1.png","plot_17_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":359,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
