   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_17_7_10","title":"Escape from Dragon\u2019s Cave","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Escape Mission","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Emma and Jake stood by the misty tunnel, their hearts racing. The cave sparkled with gems of all colors. \"This place is amazing!\" Jake exclaimed, his eyes wide. \"But we need to escape fast!\"\n\n\"I know!\" Emma said, looking at Drago. He was a big dragon, but his eyes were kind. \"Can you help us?\" she asked. Drago nodded slowly. \n\n\"We need to avoid the traps. I can guide you,\" he said. \"But you must trust me.\" \n\nEmma and Jake looked at each other. \"Do you think we can trust him?\" Jake whispered. \n\n\"Maybe,\" Emma replied. \"He seems nice.\" \n\nSuddenly, they heard a loud rumble. The cave shook again! \"We don\u2019t have much time!\" Emma shouted. \n\nDrago led them deeper into the cave. They passed glowing rocks and shimmering walls. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] The scene showed Emma, Jake, and Drago exploring the magical cave, surrounded by colorful gems and sparkling lights. \n\nAs they moved forward, they came across a large, shiny door. \"We need to open this!\" Jake said excitedly. \n\n\"But how?\" Emma asked, feeling nervous. \n\nDrago looked closely. \"You must guess the riddle,\" he said. \"If you answer wrong, the door will trap you!\" \n\n\"What\u2019s the riddle?\" Emma asked. \n\nDrago took a deep breath. \u201cI have keys but open no locks. I have space but no room. I have a face but no eyes. What am I?\u201d \n\nEmma thought hard. \u201cA\u2026 a keyboard?\u201d \n\nDrago smiled, but the door didn\u2019t budge. \u201cTry again!\u201d he encouraged. \n\nJake jumped in. \u201cA clock?\u201d \n\n\u201cNo, but close!\u201d Drago said. \n\nEmma scratched her head. \u201cA book?\u201d \n\nSuddenly, the door creaked open! \u201cYou did it!\u201d Drago cheered. \n\nEmma and Jake stepped through the door. Beyond it lay a beautiful garden filled with flowers. \u201cWe can escape through here!\u201d Emma exclaimed. \n\nBut then, they heard a deep growl. \u201cThe dragon is coming!\u201d Jake cried out. \n\nEmma took a deep breath. \u201cWe need to hurry and find a way out!\u201d \n\nFeeling brave, they dashed toward the exit, but the growl grew louder. Could they escape before Drago\u2019s misunderstood friend arrived?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Emma and Jake need to escape?","options":["A magic key","A riddle","A treasure map","A dragon's help"],"correct_answer":"A riddle"},{"question":"What does Drago help Emma and Jake with?","options":["Finding treasure","Avoiding traps","Fighting the dragon","Climbing a mountain"],"correct_answer":"Avoiding traps"},{"question":"What does Emma guess first for the riddle?","options":["A clock","A book","A keyboard","A door"],"correct_answer":"A keyboard"},{"question":"What do they find beyond the door?","options":["A dark tunnel","A treasure chest","A beautiful garden","Another dragon"],"correct_answer":"A beautiful garden"},{"question":"What motivates the siblings to hurry?","options":["They want treasure","They hear the dragon growl","They are tired","It is getting dark"],"correct_answer":"They hear the dragon growl"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_17_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_17_ch4_img1.png","plot_17_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":345,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
