   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_17_7_10","title":"Escape from Dragon\u2019s Cave","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Escape Mission","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Emma and Jake stood in the magical garden, surrounded by sparkling flowers and glowing trees. \u201cLook at all the colors!\u201d Jake exclaimed, his eyes wide with wonder. The shining gems lit up the garden, making it feel like they were in a dream.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cRemember, we need to hurry,\u201d Emma said, glancing back at the cave entrance. \u201cDrago said the dragon will be here any minute!\u201d They had to find a way to escape quickly.\n\n\u201cMaybe we can use some of these magical plants!\u201d Jake suggested. He picked a bright blue flower. Suddenly, it glowed brighter and floated into the air. \u201cWow! This could help us!\u201d\n\nEmma nodded. \u201cLet\u2019s find more! We need to make a path.\u201d They both dashed around the garden, gathering flowers and glowing leaves. Each magical plant lit up as Jake touched it, creating a shimmering trail behind them.\n\nJust then, they heard a loud roar echoing through the cave. \u201cThe dragon is coming!\u201d Emma shouted. \u201cWe need to go now!\u201d They followed the glowing path, but before they could reach the exit, a huge shadow loomed over them.\n\nDrago appeared, his scales shimmering like jewels. \u201cYou two must hurry! The dragon is near!\u201d he urged, his voice deep and firm. \u201cFollow me!\u201d\n\nAs they ran, the ground shook with every step of the approaching dragon. Emma felt brave, and she shouted, \u201cWe can do this, Jake! Just keep running!\u201d\n\nThey reached a wall covered in vines. \u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d Jake asked, panting. \u201cWe can\u2019t go back!\u201d\n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Emma shouted, pointing at the shimmering flowers. \u201cWe can climb!\u201d With Drago\u2019s help, they climbed up the vines, just as the dragon\u2019s enormous shadow passed below.\n\nAt the top, they saw a bright light. \u201cThat\u2019s the way out!\u201d Emma cheered. They scrambled through the opening, and suddenly, they were outside, bathed in sunlight.\n\nJake turned to Drago, who was smiling softly. \u201cThank you, Drago! You helped us escape!\u201d Emma added, feeling grateful. \n\nDrago nodded, his eyes twinkling. \u201cYou both showed great bravery. Remember, being brave is not just about facing danger. It\u2019s also about being kind and helping others.\u201d\n\nAs they walked away from the cave, Emma and Jake felt proud and a little bit wiser. They had made a new friend in Drago and learned that bravery comes in many forms.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go on more adventures!\u201d Jake said, grinning. \u201cJust maybe not into any more caves!\u201d Emma laughed, and they both agreed.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What magical item did Emma and Jake use to escape?","options":["A magic broom","Glowing flowers","A flying carpet","A treasure map"],"correct_answer":"Glowing flowers"},{"question":"Who helped Emma and Jake escape the cave?","options":["A fairy","A wizard","Drago the dragon","A knight"],"correct_answer":"Drago the dragon"},{"question":"What important lesson did Emma and Jake learn?","options":["To always run away","That bravery is about kindness","That treasure is the most important","To never trust dragons"],"correct_answer":"That bravery is about kindness"},{"question":"What did Jake want to do after escaping the cave?","options":["Climb more mountains","Go on more adventures","Find more treasure","Train to be a dragon"],"correct_answer":"Go on more adventures"},{"question":"What did Emma and Jake see when they escaped the cave?","options":["A dark forest","A bright light","A treasure chest","A scary monster"],"correct_answer":"A bright light"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_17_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_17_ch5_img1.png","plot_17_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":415,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
