       [DEBUG] Checking shared image: {"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dark, enchanted cave filled with sparkling gems shimmering against the walls. The light flickers from a lantern held by Emma, illuminating her determined expression and the wonder in Jakes eyes as they step cautiously into the cave, showcasing their contrasting emotions of excitement and apprehension.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_17_ch1_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 20:09:45"}
