     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"imminent","1":"pulsated","2":"intricately","3":"grounding","4":"sincerity","image_prompts":["An expansive chamber within the dragon\u2019s cave, filled with glowing crystals that emit a soft blue light. The walls are adorned with murals depicting dragons and humans in harmony, with Emma and Jake standing in the center, their expressions a mix of awe and determination. The atmosphere is magical and inviting, yet an undercurrent of tension lingers as they search for artifacts.","A dramatic confrontation scene with Drago, the dragon looming large above Emma and Jake. His scales shimmer in the dim light, casting deep shadows on the cave walls. Emma stands resolute, holding the carved box aloft, while Jake grips her hand tightly, their expressions reflecting a mix of fear and bravery. The air is thick with anticipation and the tension of unspoken possibilities."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing An expansive chamber within the dragons cave, filled with glowing crystals that emit a soft blue light. The walls are adorned with murals depicting dragons and humans in harmony, with Emma and Jake standing in the center, their expressions a mix of awe and determination. The atmosphere is magical and inviting, yet an undercurrent of tension lingers as they search for artifacts.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_17_ch4_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 20:06:54"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dramatic confrontation scene with Drago, the dragon looming large above Emma and Jake. His scales shimmer in the dim light, casting deep shadows on the cave walls. Emma stands resolute, holding the carved box aloft, while Jake grips her hand tightly, their expressions reflecting a mix of fear and bravery. The air is thick with anticipation and the tension of unspoken possibilities.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_17_ch4_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 20:06:54"}}}
