     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"adventure","1":"fear","2":"ghost","3":"friends","4":"brave","image_prompts":["A colorful scene of a grassy area in the amusement park, with bright flowers and a cheerful atmosphere. The four friends, Sara, Ben, Lily, and Tom, stand together smiling. A friendly ghost with a happy expression floats nearby, waving at them. The background shows hints of amusement rides in the distance.","A lively image of the ghost playing with the friends. The ghost is twirling in the air, creating sparkles around them. The friends are laughing and playing, showing their excitement. The backdrop includes the old roller coaster and colorful rides, suggesting a fun and adventurous atmosphere."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dimly lit funhouse room filled with warped mirrors reflecting distorted images of the characters. Shadows flicker across the floor, creating an eerie yet captivating atmosphere. The characters are shown in the foreground, with expressions of determination and fear, their reflections revealing their inner struggles.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_18_ch5_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 20:02:45"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing The group emerges from the funhouse, illuminated by a glowing exit sign. The night air is cool, and the amusement park looms behind them, less intimidating now. Their expressions are a mix of relief, joy, and newfound strength, symbolizing their growth and connection.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_18_ch5_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 20:02:45"}}}
