   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_18_7_10","title":"The Abandoned Amusement Park","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Escape Mission","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Sara, Ben, Lily, and Tom stood at the entrance of the old amusement park. The rusty gate creaked as they pushed it open. The sign above read, \"Welcome to Wonderworld!\" But now, it was dark, quiet, and spooky.\n\n\u201cAre you sure we should be here?\u201d Ben asked, peering into the shadows. His eyes were wide. \n\n\u201cCome on! It\u2019s just an old park!\u201d Sara said, shaking her head. \u201cIt\u2019s not haunted. We\u2019ll have fun!\u201d\n\n\u201cYeah, and if it is haunted, I\u2019ll crack jokes to scare the ghosts away!\u201d Tom added, making a funny face.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s start exploring!\u201d Lily said, her eyes sparkling with excitement. She loved solving puzzles, and this park looked like a mystery waiting to be solved.\n\nAs they walked further inside, they saw broken rides and faded colors. The Ferris wheel towered over them, its paint peeling away. Next, they approached a funhouse with a crooked sign. \u201cFunhouse of Frights!\u201d it read.\n\n\u201cI bet it\u2019s super creepy in there,\u201d Ben said, frowning. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go in!\u201d Sara said, her voice strong. \u201cWe can\u2019t turn back now! Who\u2019s with me?\u201d\n\n\u201cI am!\u201d shouted Tom, leaping forward. \n\n\u201cMe too!\u201d said Lily, following him.\n\nBen sighed but nodded. \u201cOkay, I\u2019ll go. But I\u2019m not scared!\u201d \n\nThey stepped inside the funhouse. Right away, the lights flickered. Shadows danced on the walls. The floor felt strange beneath their feet. Suddenly, the door slammed shut behind them! \n\n\u201cUh-oh!\u201d said Sara, looking around. \u201cI think we\u2019re trapped!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe walls began to shift and change. Mirrors reflected weird images of the kids. Tom giggled nervously. \u201cI look like a giant!\u201d\n\n\u201cThis isn\u2019t funny, Tom!\u201d Ben said, crossing his arms. \u201cWhat if we can\u2019t get out?\u201d\n\n\u201cWe have to find a way!\u201d Lily said. \u201cLet\u2019s stick together.\u201d\n\nAs they turned a corner, they saw a maze of mirrors. Each one showed something different. Lily jumped back. \u201cWhat if this funhouse is really haunted?\u201d\n\n\u201cDon\u2019t be scared!\u201d Sara encouraged. \u201cWe can face our fears together. Come on!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nJust then, the ground shook! The mirrors began to swirl around them. \u201cHold on!\u201d shouted Sara. \u201cWe need to find the exit before it changes again!\u201d\n\n\u201cRight!\u201d said Ben, determination in his voice. \u201cLet\u2019s escape this crazy funhouse!\u201d","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the name of the amusement park?","options":["Adventureland","Wonderworld","Fun City","Spooky Park"],"correct_answer":"Wonderworld"},{"question":"Who is the fearless leader of the group?","options":["Lily","Tom","Sara","Ben"],"correct_answer":"Sara"},{"question":"What happens when they enter the funhouse?","options":["They find a treasure","The door slams shut","They meet a ghost","They see other kids"],"correct_answer":"The door slams shut"},{"question":"How does Tom try to make the group feel better?","options":["By telling jokes","By being brave","By leaving","By singing"],"correct_answer":"By telling jokes"},{"question":"What does Lily suggest to do in the funhouse?","options":["Run away","Face their fears","Play games","Look for a map"],"correct_answer":"Face their fears"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_18_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_18_ch1_img1.png","plot_18_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":387,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
