   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_18_7_10","title":"The Abandoned Amusement Park","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Escape Mission","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"The funhouse door creaked as it closed behind them. Sara, Ben, Lily, and Tom looked around. Everything was dark and twisty. \n\n\u201cWelcome to the funhouse!\u201d Sara said, grinning. \u201cLet\u2019s see what it can do!\u201d\n\nBen frowned. \u201cI don\u2019t like this place. It feels\u2026 weird.\u201d\n\n\u201cStop being a chicken!\u201d Tom teased, pretending to flap his arms. \u201cWe\u2019re fine! Right, Lily?\u201d\n\n\u201cRight! Let\u2019s explore!\u201d Lily replied, her eyes sparkling with excitement.\n\nAs they stepped further inside, the walls began to shimmer. The mirrors reflected their faces in funny ways. One mirror made Tom look super tall, while another made Sara look tiny!\n\n\u201cWow! Look at me!\u201d Tom giggled, trying to reach the ceiling. \n\nSuddenly, a loud bang echoed through the funhouse. A door slammed shut, and the ground shook beneath them.\n\n\u201cWhat was that?\u201d Ben shouted, his eyes wide.\n\n\u201cMaybe it was just the funhouse playing tricks,\u201d Sara assured him, though her voice wavered.\n\n\u201cOr maybe it\u2019s a ghost!\u201d Tom said, pretending to shiver.\n\n\u201cStop it!\u201d Lily said, trying to sound brave. \u201cWe need to find a way out!\u201d\n\nJust then, the mirrors began to swirl. The walls twisted, and the funhouse changed shape. Sara felt a chill run down her spine.\n\n\u201cWe have to stick together!\u201d she called, but the dark corners of the funhouse loomed large.\n\n\u201cLook! There\u2019s a door over there!\u201d Ben pointed, trying to stay calm.\n\nThey rushed towards the door, but it vanished before they could reach it! \n\n\u201cWhat?!\u201d Lily exclaimed, her heart racing. \u201cHow do we get through?\u201d\n\nTom shrugged. \u201cMaybe we have to solve a riddle or something!\u201d\n\nJust then, a voice echoed through the funhouse. \u201cFace your fears to escape!\u201d\n\n\u201cFace our fears?\u201d Ben whispered, his hands shaking. \u201cI don\u2019t like the sound of that.\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat are you afraid of?\u201d asked Sara, trying to be brave.\n\n\u201cClowns,\u201d Ben mumbled. \n\n\u201cClowns? That\u2019s not so scary!\u201d Tom laughed. \u201cWhat about you, Sara?\u201d\n\n\u201cDarkness,\u201d Sara said quietly. The shadows flickered around them.\n\nLily stepped forward. \u201cLet\u2019s help each other! We\u2019re in this together.\u201d\n\nThe funhouse began to spin again. They had to face their fears, or they might never get out!\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe friends stood together in the funhouse, surrounded by mirrors reflecting their worried faces. The walls shimmered, adding an eerie atmosphere to the scene. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe friends reached out towards a door that suddenly vanished before their eyes. Their expressions show surprise and determination as they realize they must work together to escape.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What strange thing do the friends see in the mirrors?","options":["They see ghosts","They see each other funny","They see a monster","They see a clown"],"correct_answer":"They see each other funny"},{"question":"What sound do the friends hear that makes them worried?","options":["A laugh","A boom","A song","A whisper"],"correct_answer":"A boom"},{"question":"What does the voice in the funhouse tell them to do?","options":["Find a clue","Face their fears","Run away","Have fun"],"correct_answer":"Face their fears"},{"question":"What is Ben afraid of?","options":["Heights","Clowns","Darkness","Water"],"correct_answer":"Clowns"},{"question":"Who suggests that they should help each other?","options":["Sara","Tom","Ben","Lily"],"correct_answer":"Lily"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_18_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_18_ch2_img1.png","plot_18_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":420,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
