   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_18_7_10","title":"The Abandoned Amusement Park","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Escape Mission","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"The funhouse twisted and turned around them. Mirrors danced in the dim light. \u201cCan you see me?\u201d Sara called out, laughing. The walls shimmered like a rainbow. But soon, her laughter faded.\n\n\u201cWhere are we?\u201d Ben whispered. He sounded nervous. \u201cThis place is creepy!\u201d\n\n\u201cDon't worry!\u201d said Tom, trying to joke. \u201cIt\u2019s just a bunch of silly mirrors!\u201d But even he looked worried.\n\nSuddenly, the floor shifted beneath them. \u201cWhoa!\u201d Lily shouted. \u201cDid you feel that?\u201d The ground bounced like a trampoline. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cLook at these mirrors!\u201d Sara pointed to one with a long, wavy reflection. \u201cI look like a silly worm!\u201d She giggled. But the laughter stopped when they heard a soft whisper, \u201cRun\u2026 run\u2026\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat was that?\u201d Ben gasped, his eyes wide. \n\n\u201cMaybe it\u2019s just the wind?\u201d Tom suggested, but his voice trembled.\n\nLily stared into a mirror and gasped. \u201cLook! It\u2019s showing us our fears!\u201d Each friend saw something different. Sara saw a huge roller coaster. Ben saw a dark shadow looming. Tom saw a clown with big, scary shoes. And Lily saw herself trapped in a tiny box.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t want to see that!\u201d Ben cried. \u201cWe have to escape!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, the mirrors started to change again. The walls began to close in. \u201cQuick! We need to face our fears!\u201d Sara shouted. They huddled together.\n\n\u201cWhat if we just run?\u201d Tom suggested, but the mirrors wobbled, blocking their path. \u201cNo, we can\u2019t!\u201d Lily said. \u201cWe need to find the way out. We need to work together!\u201d\n\n\u201cOkay! Let\u2019s do it!\u201d Sara agreed. \u201cOn the count of three, we\u2019ll shout our fears!\u201d\n\n\u201cOne\u2026 two\u2026 three!\u201d they yelled. \u201cRoller coasters! Shadows! Clowns! Boxes!\u201d The funhouse began to shake. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d Ben yelled as he clung to Sara. The lights flickered wildly. And then, with a loud crash, a door appeared!\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Sara shouted, racing towards the door just as it began to close. They all dashed forward, but would they make it in time? \n\nAs they reached the door, it slammed shut, leaving them in darkness. \u201cWhat now?\u201d Tom said, his voice shaky.\n\n\u201cFind another way!\u201d Lily urged. \n\nBut as they turned around, the funhouse shifted again, and the walls began to swirl. The friends were trapped in a maze of mirrors, each twist and turn leading them deeper into the unknown. \n\n\u201cGuys, we have to keep moving!\u201d Sara said, her heart racing. What if they never escaped?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did the funhouse show in the mirrors?","options":["Their dreams","Their favorite games","Their fears","Their friends"],"correct_answer":"Their fears"},{"question":"What did Tom suggest to do when they were scared?","options":["Run away","Face their fears","Close their eyes","Climb a wall"],"correct_answer":"Run away"},{"question":"What happened when they yelled their fears?","options":["They became happy","A door appeared","The lights went out","They felt more scared"],"correct_answer":"A door appeared"},{"question":"How did the funhouse feel when they were inside?","options":["Calm and peaceful","Dark and scary","Bright and cheerful","Hot and sunny"],"correct_answer":"Dark and scary"},{"question":"What did the friends have to do to escape?","options":["Work together","Ignore each other","Split up","Call for help"],"correct_answer":"Work together"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_18_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_18_ch3_img1.png","plot_18_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":413,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
