   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_18_7_10","title":"The Abandoned Amusement Park","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Escape Mission","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Sara, Ben, Lily, and Tom stood in the dark funhouse. The walls twisted and turned. It felt like they were inside a giant maze. \n\n\u201cThis is crazy!\u201d Ben said, scratching his head. \u201cI thought we\u2019d have fun, not get lost!\u201d\n\nSara frowned. \u201cWe need to stick together. Let\u2019s keep moving.\u201d\n\nAs they walked, strange mirrors lined the walls. They saw funny reflections of themselves. Tom pointed at his big, wobbly head. \u201cHey, look at me! I\u2019m a giant marshmallow!\u201d \n\nEveryone giggled, even Ben. \u201cOkay, that\u2019s pretty funny,\u201d he admitted.\n\nSuddenly, the lights flickered. A loud sound echoed. The mirrors began to shimmer. \u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d Lily asked, her voice trembling.\n\n\u201cI think the funhouse is playing tricks!\u201d Tom joked, but he looked worried. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s not get scared,\u201d Sara said firmly. \u201cRemember our fears? We shouted them, and a door appeared. Maybe we need to face them again!\u201d\n\nThe friends nodded. \u201cI\u2019m scared of the dark!\u201d Ben blurted out. \u201cI hate not knowing what\u2019s around me!\u201d\n\n\u201cI\u2019m afraid of heights!\u201d Tom shouted. \u201cI don\u2019t want to fall!\u201d\n\n\u201cI\u2019m worried about being alone,\u201d Lily added softly.\n\nSara took a deep breath. \u201cMy fear is not being brave enough. But together, we can do this!\u201d \n\nJust then, a new door appeared! It shimmered like candy in the light. \u201cLook!\u201d Sara exclaimed. \u201cIt\u2019s our way out!\u201d\n\nThey rushed towards the door, but it began to close. \u201cNo! Wait!\u201d Lily cried out.\n\nAt that moment, the funhouse shook. \u201cQuick! Hold hands!\u201d Sara shouted. They joined hands, running together. \n\nThey felt a burst of energy. The door opened just wide enough. With a leap, they dove through! \n\nThey landed in a soft, grassy area. Tom looked back, wide-eyed. \u201cWe did it! We escaped!\u201d\n\n\u201cNot yet,\u201d Ben said, looking around. \u201cWhat if it\u2019s another trick?\u201d\n\nBut Sara smiled, feeling hopeful. \u201cWe faced our fears, and we can keep going!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe friends stood hand in hand, with the funhouse doors swirling behind them, their faces showing a mix of determination and hope.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe moment they leaped through the door, colorful lights burst around them, highlighting their joyful expressions and the grassy area they landed in.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did the friends see in the mirrors?","options":["Their real reflections","Funny reflections","Scary monsters","Nothing at all"],"correct_answer":"Funny reflections"},{"question":"What is Ben afraid of?","options":["Heights","The dark","Clowns","Being alone"],"correct_answer":"The dark"},{"question":"What did the friends do to escape?","options":["They fought the funhouse","They faced their fears","They called for help","They hid in a corner"],"correct_answer":"They faced their fears"},{"question":"What did Tom call himself when he saw his reflection?","options":["A giant marshmallow","A scary monster","A silly clown","A superhero"],"correct_answer":"A giant marshmallow"},{"question":"How did the friends feel after escaping the funhouse?","options":["Scared","Sad","Hopeful","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Hopeful"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_18_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_18_ch4_img1.png","plot_18_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":373,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
