   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_18_7_10","title":"The Abandoned Amusement Park","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Escape Mission","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"The grassy area was bright and cheerful after the wild funhouse. Sara, Ben, Lily, and Tom stood together, breathing in the fresh air. \u201cWe made it out!\u201d Sara cheered, her eyes sparkling with excitement.\n\n\u201cYes!\u201d Ben agreed, shaking his head in disbelief. \u201cI can\u2019t believe we really faced our fears.\u201d He looked at each friend. \u201cYou were all so brave!\u201d\n\nLily smiled, her mind racing with ideas. \u201cWhat if we make a plan to find the next adventure?\u201d she suggested. \u201cThis park has so many mysteries left to explore!\u201d\n\n\u201cLike what?\u201d Tom asked, scratching his head. \u201cThe Ferris wheel looks like it might fall over!\u201d\n\nLily laughed. \u201cOr the carousel! It\u2019s still here, but it looks like it hasn\u2019t moved in years.\u201d \n\nJust then, they heard a soft giggle. They turned to see a friendly ghost peeking around a tree. \u201cDon\u2019t worry! I\u2019m not scary!\u201d it said with a wave. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cWow! A ghost!\u201d Tom exclaimed. \u201cThis is the best amusement park ever!\u201d\n\nThe ghost floated closer. \u201cYou are very brave to come here. Many don\u2019t dare to enter.\u201d It twirled in the air, making sparkles around them. \n\n\u201cWhy are you here?\u201d Sara asked, curious. \n\n\u201cI keep watch over the park,\u201d the ghost replied. \u201cBut I\u2019m lonely. I want friends!\u201d\n\nBen whispered to the others, \u201cWe can be friends! Just because you\u2019re a ghost, doesn\u2019t mean you can\u2019t have friends!\u201d\n\nThe ghost clapped its hands. \u201cReally? You would be my friends?\u201d\n\n\u201cYes!\u201d they all shouted together, grinning. \n\nThe ghost smiled wider than ever. \u201cThank you! Let\u2019s have fun together!\u201d \n\nAs they played, they forgot about their fears. They laughed and raced around the park, feeling free. Finally, the ghost led them to a hidden path. \u201cThis will take you to the roller coaster!\u201d it said.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Sara yelled, and they all ran towards the path, excited for their next adventure. \n\n\u201cI hope it\u2019s not as scary as the funhouse!\u201d Lily giggled.\n\nTom stopped and grinned. \u201cCome on! Where\u2019s your sense of adventure?\u201d \n\nThey all laughed, ready to face whatever came next. Together, they could do anything!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did the friends discover after escaping the funhouse?","options":["A treasure map","A friendly ghost","A scary monster","A giant balloon"],"correct_answer":"A friendly ghost"},{"question":"How did Ben feel about their adventure?","options":["Scared","Excited","Bored","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"},{"question":"What did the ghost want?","options":["To scare the friends","To keep watch over the park","To be friends","To play games"],"correct_answer":"To be friends"},{"question":"Where did the ghost lead the friends next?","options":["To the funhouse","To the roller coaster","To the Ferris wheel","To the entrance"],"correct_answer":"To the roller coaster"},{"question":"What did Tom say about their next adventure?","options":["It would be boring","It might be scary","It would be fun","He wanted to go home"],"correct_answer":"It might be scary"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_18_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_18_ch5_img1.png","plot_18_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":362,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
