   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_18_11_14","title":"The Abandoned Amusement Park","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Escape Mission","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"The sun was setting, casting long shadows across the rusting remains of what once was a vibrant amusement park. The faded sign that read \"Wonderland Park\" creaked in the light breeze, and the air was thick with the scent of damp earth and mildew. Sara, the fearless leader of the group, stood at the entrance, her heart racing with excitement.\n\n\u201cCome on, guys! This place looks awesome!\u201d she called out, her voice echoing through the empty park.\n\nBen, her best friend and notorious skeptic, hesitated. \u201cAre you sure this is a good idea? I mean, it\u2019s abandoned for a reason. What if it\u2019s actually haunted?\u201d\n\nLily, the creative problem-solver, rolled her eyes. \u201cHaunted or not, it\u2019s an adventure! Plus, think of all the stories we\u2019ll have to tell.\u201d She tucked a wild strand of hair behind her ear, her brown eyes sparkling with mischief.\n\nTom, the jokester of the group, grinned widely. \u201cI\u2019ll just keep my phone on to record it. Who knows? Maybe we\u2019ll become famous ghost hunters!\u201d\n\nAs they stepped further into the park, the sound of crunching leaves underfoot was the only thing breaking the eerie silence. The Ferris wheel loomed overhead, its once-bright colors now dulled by years of neglect. Peeling paint and rusted metal gave the rides an ominous appearance, but the thrill of exploration was too strong to resist.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s check out that funhouse!\u201d Sara suggested, pointing toward a crooked building with a sign that read \u201cHall of Mirrors\u201d hanging precariously from a single chain.\n\n\u201cSure,\u201d Ben said, a reluctant smile tugging at his lips. \u201cWhat\u2019s the worst that could happen?\u201d\n\nThey cautiously approached the funhouse, the air inside cool and musty. The flickering lights overhead added to the unsettling atmosphere, casting strange shadows on the walls. The mirrors reflected their nervous expressions, and Sara felt a little shiver run down her spine.\n\n\u201cAlright, who\u2019s first?\u201d Sara asked, trying to sound brave. But as they stepped inside, the entrance creaked ominously behind them, sealing off their way out.\n\nTom laughed, though it faltered a bit. \u201cOkay, now I\u2019m getting a little creeped out.\u201d\n\nSuddenly, the mirrors began to shimmer, twisting the reflections of their faces into grotesque versions of themselves. Lily\u2019s nose elongated into a beak, Ben\u2019s eyes looked as if they were bulging out of his head, and Tom's hair turned into a wild tangle of spikes. \n\n\u201cGuys, this isn\u2019t funny!\u201d Ben shouted, his voice rising with panic. \u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d\n\nThe funhouse seemed to come alive, shifting its walls like a living creature. The reflections began to whisper, words echoing through their minds: \u201cFace your fears. Only then can you escape.\u201d\n\nSara felt her courage falter. \u201cWe have to stick together,\u201d she said firmly, trying to rally her friends. \u201cWhatever this place is, we can\u2019t let it get the best of us.\u201d\n\nJust then, the mirrors shimmered again, revealing a hidden door behind a false reflection. \u201cLook!\u201d Lily exclaimed, pointing to the door. \u201cThat must be the way out.\u201d\n\nWith a mix of fear and determination, the group moved toward the door, their hearts pounding. But as they stepped closer, the walls shifted again, blocking their path.\n\n\u201cGuys, we need to find a way through!\u201d Sara urged, glancing back at her friends. They had to confront the shadows of their fears, and time was running out.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the name of the amusement park the friends explore?","options":["Funland Park","Adventurous Park","Wonderland Park","Dreamland Park"],"correct_answer":"Wonderland Park"},{"question":"What is Ben's initial reaction to exploring the park?","options":["Excited","Nervous","Skeptical","Indifferent"],"correct_answer":"Skeptical"},{"question":"What strange phenomenon occurs when the friends enter the funhouse?","options":["The lights flicker","The walls shift","They hear voices","All of the above"],"correct_answer":"All of the above"},{"question":"Which character is known for providing comic relief?","options":["Sara","Ben","Lily","Tom"],"correct_answer":"Tom"},{"question":"What do the mirrors in the funhouse reveal to the friends?","options":["Their dreams","Their fears","Their strengths","Their past"],"correct_answer":"Their fears"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_18_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_18_ch1_img1.png","plot_18_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":572,"reading_level":"Builder"}
