   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_19_7_10","title":"The Secret of the Ancient Library","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Escape Mission","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Leo loved books more than anything else. He spent every Saturday in the town library. The library was his favorite place. It smelled like old paper and adventure. Rows of colorful books reached high up to the ceiling. \n\nOne sunny Saturday, Leo dashed into the library. \u201cZoe! Look what I found!\u201d he shouted, waving a book about space adventures. Zoe, his best friend, ran over with excitement. \u201cWhat is it? Are we going to explore the stars?\u201d \n\n\u201cMaybe! But first, we have to find our next adventure!\u201d Leo laughed. \n\nThey explored the library together. Suddenly, they spotted a strange door behind a tall shelf. It was small and made of dark wood. \u201cLeo, do you think it\u2019s a secret door?\u201d Zoe whispered, eyes wide. \n\nLeo nodded, his heart racing. \u201cLet\u2019s open it!\u201d\n\nThey pushed the door. It creaked loudly, swinging open to reveal a swirling mist inside. Leo and Zoe exchanged excited glances. \u201cReady?\u201d Leo asked. \n\n\u201cReady!\u201d Zoe squealed. Together, they stepped through the door, and the world around them changed.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThey found themselves in a magical library filled with glowing books. The walls shimmered like stars, and floating letters danced around them. \u201cWow! This is amazing!\u201d Zoe exclaimed.\n\nBut before they could explore, a wise old librarian appeared. Her glasses sparkled like diamonds. \u201cWelcome, young adventurers! You have entered the World of Stories,\u201d she said with a warm smile. \u201cBut be careful! The library closes soon. You must solve puzzles to find your way home!\u201d\n\nLeo\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cWhat kind of puzzles?\u201d he asked. \n\n\u201cLiterary puzzles!\u201d the librarian replied, her voice echoing. \u201cYou will meet characters from your favorite stories. You must answer their questions to escape!\u201d \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go, Zoe!\u201d Leo said, feeling brave. They were ready for an adventure unlike any other.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nJust then, a loud thud echoed. A giant book fell from a shelf, landing right beside them. \u201cYou\u2019ll need this!\u201d it boomed. Leo and Zoe looked at each other, excitement bubbling inside them. \n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s the first puzzle?\u201d Zoe asked, gripping Leo\u2019s hand. \n\n\u201cWe have to find it!\u201d Leo replied, determination shining in his eyes. The adventure had just begun!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Leo love more than anything?","options":["Space","Books","Playing outside","Video Games"],"correct_answer":"Books"},{"question":"What do Leo and Zoe find in the library?","options":["A treasure chest","A secret door","A computer","A magic wand"],"correct_answer":"A secret door"},{"question":"What world do they enter through the door?","options":["A world of candy","A world of stories","A world of games","A world of animals"],"correct_answer":"A world of stories"},{"question":"What do they need to solve to get home?","options":["Math problems","Literary puzzles","Riddles","Science questions"],"correct_answer":"Literary puzzles"},{"question":"What falls right beside them in the magical library?","options":["A giant book","A cat","A map","A toy"],"correct_answer":"A giant book"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_19_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_19_ch1_img1.png","plot_19_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":364,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
