   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_19_7_10","title":"The Secret of the Ancient Library","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Escape Mission","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Leo and Zoe stood in the tall, whispering trees of the enchanted forest. Sunlight peeked through the leaves, making everything sparkle. \u201cWe need to find the old oak tree!\u201d Zoe said, excitement in her voice. \u201cBut how?\u201d Leo scratched his head. Just then, a loud voice boomed from behind a bush. \u201cYou must answer my riddle!\u201d  \n\nOut hopped a big, green troll. He had a wide grin and twinkling eyes. \u201cI\u2019m Trollington! What gets wetter as it dries?\u201d Leo and Zoe exchanged worried glances. \u201cUm, a towel?\u201d Leo guessed. Trollington\u2019s smile grew wider. \u201cCorrect! But there\u2019s more!\u201d He pointed to a path leading deeper into the forest. \u201cFollow it to find the old oak!\u201d  \n\nAs they walked, the trees seemed to lean in, listening. \u201cDo you think they can hear us?\u201d Zoe whispered. \u201cMaybe they have secrets!\u201d Leo replied. Suddenly, they stumbled upon a shimmering pond. \u201cLook at that!\u201d Zoe exclaimed. The pond glowed with colors like a rainbow. They could see reflections of stories swirling in the water.  \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s see what stories are there!\u201d Leo suggested. They leaned closer, and images of knights, dragons, and magical castles danced before their eyes. Just then, a strange sound echoed through the air. It was a soft, sad melody that made their hearts ache. \u201cWhat is that?\u201d Zoe asked, her eyes wide.  \n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but we should find out!\u201d Leo replied, his curiosity bubbling. They followed the sound until they reached a large, ancient oak tree. It looked like it had been there for a thousand years! \u201cThis must be the tree!\u201d Zoe said, her voice full of wonder.  \n\nAs they approached, the ground shook. The tree\u2019s bark creaked, and a door appeared! \u201cWhat if it leads us to the next challenge?\u201d Leo wondered. Zoe nodded, but her eyes sparkled with fear and excitement. \u201cWe have to go inside!\u201d  \n\nJust as they were about to open the door, Trollington reappeared. \u201cWait!\u201d he said. \u201cTo enter, you must answer one more riddle!\u201d  \n\n\u201cOh no!\u201d Zoe gasped. \u201cWhat if we can\u2019t solve it?\u201d  \n\n\u201cDon\u2019t worry, we can do this!\u201d Leo said, gripping Zoe\u2019s hand tightly. \u201cWhat\u2019s the riddle?\u201d  \n\nTrollington cleared his throat. \u201cI speak without a mouth and hear without ears. I have no body, but I come alive with the wind. What am I?\u201d  \n\nLeo and Zoe stared at each other, their minds racing. \u201cAn echo!\u201d they shouted together.  \n\nTrollington nodded approvingly. \u201cYou\u2019re correct! Enter through the door and good luck!\u201d  \n\nAs they stepped inside, everything swirled around them, and the door slammed shut behind them. They were in a new world, surrounded by characters from stories they loved. \u201cWhat now?\u201d Zoe asked, her voice trembling.  \n\n\u201cStay close!\u201d Leo said, as they ventured deeper into this new adventure. They were ready to face whatever challenges lay ahead but felt a tiny bit scared.  \n\nWould they find their way home before the library closed?  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who challenges Leo and Zoe with a riddle?","options":["A dragon","Trollington","A wizard","A fairy"],"correct_answer":"Trollington"},{"question":"What do Leo and Zoe see in the shimmering pond?","options":["Fish swimming","Reflections of stories","A treasure chest","A giant frog"],"correct_answer":"Reflections of stories"},{"question":"What is one of the riddles answered in this chapter?","options":["What flies without wings?","What gets wetter as it dries?","What has keys but can't open locks?","What has a face and two hands but no arms?"],"correct_answer":"What gets wetter as it dries?"},{"question":"What do Leo and Zoe need to find to continue their adventure?","options":["A magical wand","The old oak tree","A hidden treasure","A talking book"],"correct_answer":"The old oak tree"},{"question":"What happens when they solve the final riddle?","options":["They go home","They enter a new world","They meet a dragon","They find a map"],"correct_answer":"They enter a new world"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_19_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_19_ch3_img1.png","plot_19_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":496,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
