   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_19_7_10","title":"The Secret of the Ancient Library","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Escape Mission","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Leo and Zoe stepped through the ancient oak tree's door. They blinked in surprise. They were in a bright, sunny meadow. Flowers danced in the wind. The sky was a perfect blue. \n\n\u201cWhere are we now?\u201d Leo asked, his eyes wide with wonder.\n\n\u201cI think we\u2019re in the land of stories!\u201d Zoe replied, skipping ahead. \u201cLook at all those characters!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, they heard voices. Leo and Zoe turned around. There stood a group of friendly characters from their favorite books! A brave knight in shiny armor, a clever girl with a magic wand, and a smiling bear with a honey pot.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cWelcome to Storyland!\u201d the knight exclaimed. \u201cI\u2019m Sir Cedric!\u201d\n\n\u201cI\u2019m Bella!\u201d said the girl, twirling her wand. \u201cAnd this is Benny!\u201d She pointed to the bear.\n\n\u201cWow! Can you help us?\u201d Leo asked, feeling hopeful. \u201cWe need to find a way back to our library.\u201d\n\n\u201cOf course!\u201d Sir Cedric said. \u201cBut first, you must help us solve a puzzle. There is a treasure hidden in Storyland. It will lead you home!\u201d\n\nZoe\u2019s eyes sparkled. \u201cA treasure hunt! Let\u2019s do it!\u201d\n\nThe friends followed Sir Cedric to a big tree with a sparkling door. \u201cHere is your first clue,\u201d Bella said, waving her wand. \u201cYou must find the rhyme that shines! Look for the words that sparkle and twine!\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat does that mean?\u201d Leo wondered aloud.\n\n\u201cI think we need to find a rhyme!\u201d Zoe exclaimed. \u201cLet\u2019s look for words that shine!\u201d\n\nThey searched around the tree, checking under flowers and peeking behind rocks. Suddenly, Benny the bear growled with excitement. \u201cLook! Over there!\u201d\n\nThey dashed to a bush where golden letters shimmered. \u201cTwinkle, twinkle, little star,\u201d Zoe read. \u201cHow I wonder what you are!\u201d\n\n\u201cThat's it! We found the rhyme!\u201d Leo shouted, clapping his hands.\n\nThe door to the tree creaked open. Inside, they saw a chest filled with glowing books. \u201cThese will help you!\u201d Bella said. \u201cEach book is a piece of the path home!\u201d\n\nAs they gathered the books, Leo felt a warm glow in his heart. \u201cWe\u2019re getting closer!\u201d he said with a big smile.\n\nBut the clock began to chime. \u201cWe must hurry!\u201d Zoe said, her voice filled with urgency. They knew time was running out.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d they cheered together, ready for the next adventure.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who do Leo and Zoe meet in the meadow?","options":["A dragon","Characters from their favorite books","A wizard","A giant"],"correct_answer":"Characters from their favorite books"},{"question":"What is the first clue they need to solve?","options":["A math problem","A rhyme","A riddle","A song"],"correct_answer":"A rhyme"},{"question":"What do they find inside the treasure chest?","options":["Gold coins","Magical books","A map","A key"],"correct_answer":"Magical books"},{"question":"What does Zoe suggest they should look for?","options":["Food","Words that shine","Animals","Friends"],"correct_answer":"Words that shine"},{"question":"What feeling does Leo express at the end of the chapter?","options":["Worry","Excitement","Fear","Anger"],"correct_answer":"Excitement"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_19_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_19_ch4_img1.png","plot_19_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":393,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
