   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_19_7_10","title":"The Secret of the Ancient Library","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Escape Mission","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Leo and Zoe stood in the bright meadow, surrounded by friendly faces. Sir Cedric, the valiant knight, smiled at them. \u201cWelcome back, brave adventurers! Are you ready for the next clue?\u201d \n\n\u201cYes!\u201d shouted Zoe, bouncing with excitement. Leo nodded, feeling the flutter of butterflies in his stomach. \n\n\u201cLook!\u201d said Bella, pointing to a shimmering path. \u201cThe treasure lies at the end, but it is guarded by the Book Dragon!\u201d \n\nZoe\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cA dragon? I thought we were in a happy place!\u201d \n\n\u201cDon\u2019t worry!\u201d laughed Benny, the clever rabbit. \u201cBook Dragons love stories. If we tell it a tale, it might let us pass!\u201d \n\n\u201cGreat idea!\u201d Leo said, \u201cWhat story should we tell?\u201d \n\n\u201cHow about The Three Little Pigs?\u201d suggested Zoe. \n\nNo one disagreed. They gathered around, ready to tell the story together. Leo took a deep breath and began, \u201cOnce upon a time, there were three little pigs\u2026\u201d \n\nAs they told the story, a shimmering figure appeared. It was the Book Dragon! With scales that sparkled like diamonds, it hovered above them. \u201cWhat brings you here, young storytellers?\u201d \n\n\u201cWe\u2019re looking for treasure so we can return home!\u201d Zoe explained, her voice steady. \n\nThe dragon\u2019s eyes twinkled with delight. \u201cYou are brave and clever. But first, you must answer my riddle!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe dragon curled its tail and spoke, \u201cI fly without wings. I cry without eyes. Whenever I go, darkness flies. What am I?\u201d \n\nLeo scratched his head. \u201cHmm, that\u2019s tricky!\u201d \n\nZoe smiled. \u201cI know! It\u2019s a cloud!\u201d \n\nThe dragon clapped its claws. \u201cCorrect! You may pass!\u201d \n\nThey cheered and hurried down the path, excited to find the treasure. The air sparkled around them, and they spotted a golden chest at the end. \n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Leo pointed, his eyes wide with wonder. \n\nAs they opened the chest, they found a glowing book. \u201cThis is the book of stories!\u201d Bella exclaimed. \n\n\u201cNow we can read our way home!\u201d Zoe said, her heart racing. \n\nThe wise librarian\u2019s voice echoed in their minds. \u201cRemember, every story has a way to teach us something special.\u201d \n\nLeo nodded. \u201cWe learned to work together and be brave!\u201d \n\nWith the glowing book in hand, they felt a rush of magic. The meadow began to swirl around them. \n\n\u201cHold on tight!\u201d Zoe shouted, and they were lifted into the air, ready for their next adventure.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cWhere will we go next?\u201d Leo wondered aloud, excitement bubbling inside him.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Leo and Zoe need to do to pass the Book Dragon?","options":["Tell a story","Fight the dragon","Run away","Find a map"],"correct_answer":"Tell a story"},{"question":"What is the riddle the dragon asks?","options":["What flies without wings?","What is green and bouncy?","What has four legs?","What is hot and spicy?"],"correct_answer":"What flies without wings?"},{"question":"What did they find in the treasure chest?","options":["A golden crown","A glowing book","A magic wand","A treasure map"],"correct_answer":"A glowing book"},{"question":"Who helps Leo and Zoe in the meadow?","options":["Sir Cedric","The troll","The librarian","The dragon"],"correct_answer":"Sir Cedric"},{"question":"What lesson do Leo and Zoe learn?","options":["To be quiet","To work alone","To be brave and work together","To read faster"],"correct_answer":"To be brave and work together"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_19_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_19_ch5_img1.png","plot_19_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":409,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
