     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"shimmering","1":"guardian","2":"apparent","3":"concentration","4":"ominous","image_prompts":["A vibrant illustration capturing Leo and Zoe stepping into the Forest of Fables, with towering, twisted trees, shimmering leaves glowing in a warm light, and colorful flowers that shimmer like pages. Leo's expression is one of wonder, while Zoe displays excitement, her eyes sparkling as they take in the magical surroundings.","An engaging scene showing Wisp, the tiny guardian, with a mischievous grin, standing amidst the glowing trees. He is holding a shimmering scroll, with Leo and Zoe looking anxious yet determined as they prepare to answer his riddle. The atmosphere is electric with tension, hinting at the mystery of the riddle they must solve."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dimly lit, ancient library corridor with tall shelves filled with books. The atmosphere is heavy with mystery, shadows play upon the walls, and a soft glow emanates from an open book on a pedestal. Leo and Zoe are depicted in awe, their expressions a mix of excitement and apprehension.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_19_ch2_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 20:01:10"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing An expansive, enchanted forest bathed in golden sunlight filtering through lush green leaves. In the foreground, a knight stands tall in shining armor, his expression intense and chaotic, while Leo and Zoe appear small and determined, facing the unknown. Tension is palpable in the air, enhancing the sense of adventure and urgency.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_19_ch2_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 20:01:10"}}}
