   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_19_11_14","title":"The Secret of the Ancient Library","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Escape Mission","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Leo Thompson was not your average twelve-year-old. While most kids his age were glued to their video games or racing their bikes outside, Leo found solace in the dusty corners of the Maplewood Library. The library was a treasure trove, filled with the scent of old paper and the faint sound of pages turning\u2014his favorite place in the world. As he stepped inside on an overcast Saturday, the familiar creak of the wooden door welcomed him like an old friend. \n\n\u201cHey, Leo! Over here!\u201d called Zoe Baker, his best friend and the brightest storyteller he knew. Zoe was perched atop a stack of books, her wild curls bouncing as she waved excitedly. \n\n\u201cAre you trying to get us kicked out again?\u201d Leo teased, his eyes sparkling with mischief. \u201cWe don\u2019t need another \u2018adventure\u2019 like last time.\u201d\n\nZoe laughed, her voice ringing like a bell. \u201cJust trying to get a better view! You\u2019ve got to see this.\u201d She hopped down and led him to a shadowy corner of the library that Leo had never noticed before. Dust motes danced in the light filtering through a tall window, illuminating rows of ancient tomes.\n\nThere, hidden behind a row of thick, leather-bound books, was an ornate wooden door. Its surface was engraved with swirling patterns that seemed to ripple like water. Leo\u2019s heart raced. \u201cI\u2019ve never seen this before. Have you?\u201d\n\n\u201cNope! But it looks like a portal to another world!\u201d Zoe exclaimed, her eyes wide with excitement. \u201cLet\u2019s see what\u2019s inside!\u201d\n\nLeo hesitated, a flicker of doubt crossing his mind. \u201cWhat if it leads to a secret lair of evil bookworms?\u201d he replied jokingly, but his voice trembled slightly. \n\n\u201cOr a magical realm where we can be heroes!\u201d Zoe countered, her voice rich with enthusiasm. Without waiting for Leo's response, she pushed the door open. A cool breeze rushed out, and the scent of adventure wafted into the library. \n\nAs they stepped through, the world around them shifted. Suddenly, they weren\u2019t in the library anymore. They stood in a lush, green forest, where trees towered like giants and the air shimmered with enchantment. \n\n\u201cLeo, look!\u201d Zoe pointed. \u201cThose books are floating! This is amazing!\u201d \n\nJust then, a soft rustling caught their attention. A large book with colorful illustrations fluttered open midair, revealing the text inside. \u201cFind the key,\u201d it read, \u201cto navigate the stories you hold dear.\u201d \n\n\u201cWhat does that mean?\u201d Leo asked, gripping Zoe\u2019s arm. \n\n\u201cI think we have to solve puzzles from the books we love,\u201d Zoe replied, her voice a mix of awe and determination. \u201cBut we need to hurry\u2014what if the door closes?\u201d \n\nLeo felt a rush of panic. \u201cWe can\u2019t be stuck here forever!\u201d \n\nZoe nodded, determination setting in her jaw. Just then, a figure appeared from the trees\u2014a tall, wise-looking librarian with spectacles perched on his nose. His presence radiated calmness, and Leo felt a small spark of hope.\n\n\u201cWelcome, young adventurers,\u201d he said, his voice smooth like honey. \u201cI am the Keeper of the Library. You have entered a world of stories, but to return home, you must face the tales you cherish.\u201d\n\nLeo and Zoe exchanged worried glances. The challenge ahead seemed daunting, but the thrill of adventure bubbled in their chests. \n\n\u201cAre you ready?\u201d Zoe asked, her excitement overshadowing her fear.\n\n\u201cReady as I\u2019ll ever be,\u201d Leo replied, steeling himself for what lay ahead.\n\nAs they prepared to embark on their journey, Leo whispered, \u201cLet\u2019s hope we don\u2019t meet any dragons.\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1: A vibrant illustration of Leo and Zoe in the magical forest, surrounded by tall, colorful trees and floating books, with expressions of awe and excitement.]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2: A striking image of the wise librarian standing confidently with a gentle smile, surrounded by books, with a mystical glow illuminating the forest behind him.]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is Leo's favorite place in the world?","options":["His bedroom","The park","Maplewood Library","The mall"],"correct_answer":"Maplewood Library"},{"question":"What do Leo and Zoe find in the library?","options":["A treasure map","A hidden door","A magic wand","A dragon"],"correct_answer":"A hidden door"},{"question":"Who is the wise figure they meet in the magical forest?","options":["A wizard","The Keeper of the Library","A talking animal","A famous author"],"correct_answer":"The Keeper of the Library"},{"question":"What do Leo and Zoe need to do to return home?","options":["Find a hidden treasure","Solve literary puzzles","Defeat a dragon","Read all the books"],"correct_answer":"Solve literary puzzles"},{"question":"What does Zoe suggest the hidden door could lead to?","options":["A secret lair","A magical realm","A fairy tale","A nightmare"],"correct_answer":"A magical realm"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_19_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_19_ch1_img1.png","plot_19_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":651,"reading_level":"Builder"}
