   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_20_7_10","title":"Rescue Mission: The Island of Shadows","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Escape Mission","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"The waves crashed against the rocky shore. Sophie, Ethan, Chloe, and Kai stood on the beach, soaking wet and shivering. They had just survived a wild storm on their boat. Now, they were stranded on an island!\n\n\u201cWhat a crazy storm!\u201d Sophie exclaimed, brushing her dark hair from her face. \u201cWhere are we?\u201d\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know,\u201d Ethan said, looking around with his big brown eyes. \u201cBut we need to find help!\u201d\n\nChloe knelt down to examine a bright green leaf. \u201cLook at this plant! It\u2019s so cool! But we should stay together. The forest looks spooky.\u201d \n\nKai grinned, his excitement bubbling over. \u201cSpooky? More like an adventure! Let\u2019s explore!\u201d \n\nThey walked further onto the island, the sun shining between the trees. The air smelled of salt and flowers. Suddenly, a loud rustle echoed from the bushes!\n\n\u201cWhat was that?\u201d Chloe squeaked, jumping behind Ethan.\n\n\u201cStay calm!\u201d Ethan whispered. \u201cIt might be an animal.\u201d \n\nSophie took a deep breath. \u201cLet\u2019s check it out.\u201d \n\nThey crept closer to the noise when a small, fluffy rabbit bounded out! \n\n\u201cPhew! Just a bunny!\u201d Kai laughed, and they all relaxed.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they continued walking, the trees grew taller and darker. Shadows danced on the ground, and the air felt cooler. Sophie looked up at the towering trees. \u201cThis place is amazing but kind of eerie,\u201d she said.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t like the look of those shadows,\u201d Ethan muttered, glancing nervously around. \n\nSuddenly, the ground shook! A shadowy figure rushed past them!\n\n\u201cRun!\u201d Kai shouted.\n\nThey sprinted through the trees. Branches whipped past them as they zigzagged away. \u201cWhat was that?!\u201d Chloe yelled, her heart racing.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but we need to find shelter!\u201d Sophie cried. \n\nJust then, they found a hidden cave behind some bushes. The entrance was dark and narrow. \u201cIn here!\u201d Sophie said, pushing everyone inside.\n\nWhen they were safe inside, they all caught their breath. \u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d Ethan asked, his voice trembling.\n\nSophie looked at her friends, determination shining in her eyes. \u201cWe can\u2019t stay here forever. We need to find a way off this island!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cTogether, we can do anything!\u201d Chloe said, smiling bravely. \n\nAs they gathered their courage, the shadows outside flickered. Something was watching them. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s make a plan,\u201d Kai said, glancing at the dark cave entrance. \u201cWe\u2019ll need to stick together!\u201d\n\nSophie nodded. \u201cOur adventure is just beginning!\u201d","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What happened to the friends at the start of the chapter?","options":["They found a treasure","They got stranded on an island","They went home","They saw a giant monster"],"correct_answer":"They got stranded on an island"},{"question":"What does Chloe love to explore?","options":["Animals","Plants","Caves","Mountains"],"correct_answer":"Plants"},{"question":"What do the friends find after hearing a rustle?","options":["A rabbit","A snake","A treasure chest","A scary monster"],"correct_answer":"A rabbit"},{"question":"What do the friends decide to do when they see the shadowy creature?","options":["Fight it","Run away","Talk to it","Hide forever"],"correct_answer":"Run away"},{"question":"What do the friends plan to do next?","options":["Stay in the cave","Find a way off the island","Go to sleep","Build a house"],"correct_answer":"Find a way off the island"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_20_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_20_ch1_img1.png","plot_20_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":406,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
