   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_20_7_10","title":"Rescue Mission: The Island of Shadows","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Escape Mission","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"The sun peeked through the trees, casting long shadows on the ground. Sophie, Ethan, Chloe, and Kai stood at the entrance of the cave. The air was cool, and the sound of waves crashing filled their ears. \n\n\u201cWhere do we go now?\u201d asked Ethan, looking worried. \n\nSophie took a deep breath. \u201cWe need to find a way off this island. Let\u2019s explore!\u201d\n\n\u201cMaybe we can find a boat!\u201d Chloe added, her eyes sparkling with excitement. \n\nKai jumped up. \u201cOr treasure! Let\u2019s go!\u201d He led the way, eager to discover new things.\n\nAs they walked, the forest grew thicker. Huge trees towered overhead, their leaves whispering in the wind. Bright flowers bloomed everywhere, painting the ground in color. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, a rustling noise made them stop. They turned to see a shadow dart behind a tree. \n\n\u201cDid you see that?\u201d Chloe whispered, her voice shaking.\n\n\u201cMaybe it was just a bird,\u201d Ethan said, trying to stay calm. \n\n\u201cNo way!\u201d Kai insisted. \u201cThat was something big!\u201d\n\nThe group exchanged nervous glances. Sophie decided they had to keep moving. \u201cLet\u2019s stick together. Whatever it is, we can handle it as a team!\u201d\n\nThey walked deeper into the forest, but the shadows seemed to follow them. Suddenly, they stumbled upon some ancient ruins covered in vines. \n\n\u201cLook at this!\u201d Sophie exclaimed, pointing at a stone structure. \n\n\u201cIt\u2019s like a castle!\u201d Chloe said, jumping up and down. \n\nKai climbed on top of a stone. \u201cMaybe there\u2019s treasure inside!\u201d \n\nAs they explored, they heard a low growl from behind them. The shadowy creature was closer now. \n\n\u201cWe need to hide!\u201d Ethan shouted. \n\nThey ducked behind the ruins, holding their breath. The growl grew louder. Sophie peeked around the corner. \n\n\u201cIt\u2019s looking for us!\u201d she gasped. \n\nJust then, the ground shook beneath them. A small rock fell and hit Kai on the head. \u201cOuch! Watch it!\u201d he complained.\n\nSophie shushed him. \u201cWe need a plan. If we don\u2019t move, it will find us!\u201d\n\nThey huddled together. \u201cWhat do we do?\u201d Chloe asked, her eyes wide with fear.\n\n\u201cWe need to create a distraction,\u201d suggested Ethan. \u201cSomething to lead it away.\u201d\n\n\u201cLike what?\u201d Kai wondered, looking around. \n\nSophie smiled. \u201cWe can make noise! I can throw a rock over there!\u201d She pointed to a thicket of bushes. \n\n\u201cGreat idea!\u201d Chloe cheered. \n\nWith their hearts racing, they prepared to act. But just as Sophie picked up a rock, the shadow lurked closer. \n\n\u201cOn three, we go!\u201d she whispered, ready to throw. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cONE... TWO... THREE!\u201d\n\nThe rock flew through the air, and the friends held their breath. Would their plan work?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do the friends find in the forest?","options":["A boat","Ancient ruins","A treasure chest","A cave"],"correct_answer":"Ancient ruins"},{"question":"What does Sophie suggest doing to escape the shadow?","options":["Climb a tree","Make a distraction","Run away","Hide forever"],"correct_answer":"Make a distraction"},{"question":"How does Kai react when the ground shakes?","options":["He laughs","He complains","He runs away","He climbs a tree"],"correct_answer":"He complains"},{"question":"What is Chloe's reaction to the ruins?","options":["She is scared","She is sleepy","She is excited","She wants to leave"],"correct_answer":"She is excited"},{"question":"What does Ethan think the noise could be?","options":["A bird","A tiger","A person","A monster"],"correct_answer":"A bird"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_20_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_20_ch2_img1.png","plot_20_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":441,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
