   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_20_7_10","title":"Rescue Mission: The Island of Shadows","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Escape Mission","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"The sun peeked through the trees, lighting up the ancient ruins. Sophie, Ethan, Chloe, and Kai stood in awe. The stones were covered in vines and flowers. \u201cWow! Look at this place!\u201d Chloe exclaimed. \u201cIt\u2019s like a giant jungle puzzle!\u201d\n\n\u201cCareful, everyone,\u201d Ethan warned. \u201cRemember the shadow creature?\u201d \n\n\u201cI say we explore!\u201d Kai shouted, his eyes sparkling with excitement. \u201cWho knows what we might find?\u201d \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s stick together,\u201d Sophie said firmly. \u201cWe\u2019ll make a plan first.\u201d \n\nThey walked deeper into the ruins. Suddenly, a chill ran through the air. Shadows flickered between the trees. The friends huddled closer. \n\n\u201cDid you see that?\u201d Kai whispered. \n\n\u201cMaybe it\u2019s just the wind,\u201d Chloe said, trying to sound brave. \n\nSophie pointed ahead. \u201cLook! There\u2019s a doorway! Let\u2019s check it out.\u201d \n\nAs they approached the doorway, they heard a soft growl. \n\n\u201cUh-oh,\u201d Ethan said, backing away. \u201cThat doesn\u2019t sound friendly.\u201d \n\nBefore they could turn, a shadowy figure lunged from the trees! \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe creature had glowing eyes and a misty body. \u201cRun!\u201d Sophie shouted, and they dashed through the doorway. Inside was a small room filled with strange drawings on the walls. \n\n\u201cWhat are these?\u201d Chloe asked, her voice shaky. \n\n\u201cThey look like stories,\u201d Ethan replied, studying a picture of a giant creature. \u201cMaybe it tells us about the island.\u201d \n\nKai stepped closer to the drawings. \u201cWhat if these drawings show us how to escape?\u201d \n\nJust then, the growl echoed from outside. The shadow creature was searching for them! \n\n\u201cQuick! We need to find a way out!\u201d Sophie said. \n\nThey scanned the room for clues. \u201cLook here!\u201d Chloe said, pointing to a drawing of a boat sailing away from the island. \n\n\u201cMaybe if we follow these drawings, we can find a boat!\u201d Kai suggested. \n\n\u201cThey might lead us to safety,\u201d Ethan added, feeling hope rising. \n\nBut before they could move, the door shook, and the shadow creature pushed against it! \n\n\u201cGo! Now!\u201d Sophie yelled, and they all raced toward the wall with the drawing. \n\n\u201cWe\u2019ll figure this out together!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe door creaked open behind them, and the shadow was almost there! \n\n\u201cWhich drawing do we follow?\u201d Chloe cried. \n\nSophie spotted a bright blue arrow on one of the drawings. \u201cThat way!\u201d \n\nThey dashed toward the arrow as the door burst open. \n\n\u201cCome on!\u201d Ethan shouted as they ran into the dark tunnel. \n\nWhat lay ahead? Would they escape the shadow creature? \n\nThe darkness closed in, and their hearts raced.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do the friends find in the ancient ruins?","options":["A treasure chest","A giant creature","Mysterious drawings","A boat"],"correct_answer":"Mysterious drawings"},{"question":"What does Kai want to do in the ruins?","options":["Explore","Sing","Sleep","Hide"],"correct_answer":"Explore"},{"question":"What happens when the friends approach the doorway?","options":["They find a map","They hear a growl","They see a boat","They meet a friend"],"correct_answer":"They hear a growl"},{"question":"How do the friends feel when they see the shadow creature?","options":["Happy","Scared","Excited","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Scared"},{"question":"What is the bright blue arrow supposed to guide them to?","options":["A treasure","A hiding spot","A boat","A cave"],"correct_answer":"A boat"}]},"images":null,"word_count":415,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
