   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_20_7_10","title":"Rescue Mission: The Island of Shadows","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Escape Mission","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"The sun peeked through the trees, lighting up the island. Sophie, Ethan, Chloe, and Kai stood together, ready for their next move. They had escaped the dark tunnel, but the shadow creature was still near.\n\n\u201cWe need a plan,\u201d Ethan said, adjusting his glasses. \u201cWe can\u2019t just run around.\u201d\n\nSophie nodded. \u201cLet\u2019s find a safe spot and think.\u201d\n\nChloe pointed to a large tree with wide branches. \u201cThat tree looks strong! We can climb it and see what\u2019s around.\u201d\n\n\u201cGreat idea!\u201d Kai exclaimed, grinning. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d\n\nThey ran to the tree. Sophie grabbed the lowest branch and hoisted herself up. Chloe and Kai followed, with Ethan climbing a bit slower but determined. Soon, they all sat on a sturdy branch, looking out over the island.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nFrom the tree, they spotted a shimmering lake. \u201cLook at that!\u201d Chloe said, her eyes wide. \u201cIt looks magical!\u201d\n\nSophie leaned forward. \u201cWe could check it out! Water is a good sign.\u201d\n\nEthan\u2019s brow furrowed. \u201cBut what\u2019s lurking there? The creature could be hiding.\u201d\n\n\u201cI\u2019ll go first!\u201d Kai said bravely. \u201cI\u2019ll make sure it\u2019s safe!\u201d\n\n\u201cNo! We should go together,\u201d Sophie said firmly. \u201cTeamwork is our best chance.\u201d\n\nThey climbed down carefully and made their way to the lake. The water sparkled in the sunlight. As they got closer, they noticed glowing stones around the edge.\n\n\u201cWow! Look at those!\u201d Chloe said, kneeling down to touch one. It felt warm and smooth. \u201cThese could be important!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a rustling noise made them jump. The shadow creature appeared, its dark figure looming nearby. \u201cRun!\u201d Sophie shouted.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThey dashed toward the water, the creature chasing them. Their hearts pounded. Just as they reached the lake, Chloe shouted, \u201cThe stones! They\u2019re glowing brighter!\u201d\n\nAs if answering her call, the stones lit up even more. The creature hesitated at the edge. \u201cWhat do we do?\u201d Ethan cried.\n\n\u201cJump in!\u201d Kai yelled, diving into the lake. Sophie and Chloe followed, with Ethan hesitating only for a moment before leaping in too.\n\nThey splashed into the water. The glowing stones surrounded them. The creature couldn\u2019t enter the water. It growled and faded into the shadows.\n\n\u201cDid we lose it?\u201d Chloe asked, gasping for breath.\n\n\u201cI think so!\u201d Kai grinned. \u201cWe\u2019re safe for now!\u201d\n\nBut Sophie looked at the glowing stones with hope. \u201cWe have to figure out what they mean. Maybe they can help us escape!\u201d\n\nThe friends shared determined smiles. They had faced danger, but together, they were stronger. The adventure wasn\u2019t over yet.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did the friends climb to get a better view?","options":["A rock","A tree","A hill","A building"],"correct_answer":"A tree"},{"question":"What did they find around the lake?","options":["Glowing stones","Fish","Shells","Flowers"],"correct_answer":"Glowing stones"},{"question":"What happened when the shadow creature appeared?","options":["They danced","They jumped into the lake","They sang","They hid"],"correct_answer":"They jumped into the lake"},{"question":"Who suggested they should go first to check the lake?","options":["Ethan","Kai","Chloe","Sophie"],"correct_answer":"Kai"},{"question":"What did they think the glowing stones might help them do?","options":["Play a game","Escape the island","Catch fish","Make a wish"],"correct_answer":"Escape the island"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_20_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_20_ch4_img1.png","plot_20_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":431,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
