   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_20_7_10","title":"Rescue Mission: The Island of Shadows","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Escape Mission","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Sophie, Ethan, Chloe, and Kai floated in the shimmering lake. They could see the glowing stones shining brightly beneath the surface. The water sparkled like diamonds. \n\n\"Wow! Look at those stones!\" Sophie exclaimed. \"They\u2019re beautiful!\"\n\n\"Yeah,\" said Chloe, smiling. \"Maybe they can lead us home!\"\n\nEthan looked around nervously. \"But what if the shadow creature finds us again?\"\n\nKai grinned. \"We can\u2019t let fear stop us! Let\u2019s follow the stones!\"\n\nThey swam towards the nearest glowing stone. It pulsed with a warm light. Sophie reached out and touched it. Suddenly, a map appeared in the water! It showed a path leading away from the lake.\n\n\"Look! A map!\" Ethan shouted. \"This could help us escape!\"\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThey all gathered around, eyes wide with excitement. The map had strange symbols and arrows. But before they could study it, a dark shape moved in the water. \n\n\"The shadow creature!\" Chloe gasped. \n\n\"Swim! Quick!\" Kai urged. \n\nThey dove under the water and swam fast. Sophie led the way, following the glowing stones. They could hear the shadow creature splashing behind them!\n\nThey surfaced near a small beach. The sun was setting, painting the sky orange and pink. They gasped for breath.\n\n\"We made it!\" said Kai, laughing. \"But we need to keep going.\"\n\nEthan studied the map. \"It says we need to follow the stone path to the cave of whispers.\"\n\n\"What\u2019s that?\" Chloe asked, her eyes sparkling with curiosity.\n\n\"It's a cave where secrets are told,\" Ethan explained. \"Maybe it holds the key to escaping the island!\"\n\nThey ran along the sandy beach, feeling brave. \n\nSuddenly, the shadow creature appeared! It loomed over them, dark and menacing. \n\n\"Stay together!\" Sophie shouted. \n\nThey formed a circle, holding hands. \n\n\"We can do this!\" Kai encouraged. \n\nThe creature hesitated, confused. It didn\u2019t like their unity. Then, with a loud roar, it disappeared into the shadows.\n\n\"Did we scare it away?\" Chloe asked, her voice trembling.\n\n\"I think we did!\" Ethan replied, feeling proud. \n\nThey looked at each other. They had learned to trust one another. \n\n\"Now let\u2019s find that cave!\" Sophie said, her determination stronger than ever.\n\nThey followed the glowing stones, feeling hopeful. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAs they approached the cave, the air felt different. It buzzed with magic. Together, they stepped inside. The walls sparkled with ancient drawings. These drawings seemed to tell stories of courage and friendship.\n\n\"Wow,\" Sophie whispered. \"We\u2019re part of this story now!\"\n\nTogether, they would uncover the island's secrets and find their way home.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did the friends find in the lake?","options":["A treasure chest","A magical map","A shadow creature","A boat"],"correct_answer":"A magical map"},{"question":"What did the shadow creature do when the friends held hands?","options":["It danced","It disappeared","It sang","It helped them"],"correct_answer":"It disappeared"},{"question":"What does the cave of whispers contain?","options":["Water","Secret passages","Ancient drawings","Treasure"],"correct_answer":"Ancient drawings"},{"question":"How did the friends feel as they approached the cave?","options":["Scared","Excited","Bored","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"},{"question":"What lesson did the friends learn in this chapter?","options":["To play alone","To trust each other","To hide from danger","To swim fast"],"correct_answer":"To trust each other"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_20_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_20_ch5_img1.png","plot_20_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":423,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
