     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"yawned","1":"pursuit","2":"diversion","3":"determination","4":"ancient","image_prompts":["A dark cave entrance illuminated by soft rays of morning light, revealing ancient carvings on the walls. The expressions of Sophie, Ethan, Chloe, and Kai show a mix of excitement and apprehension as they stand together, ready to explore.","An action scene showcasing Chloe creating a distraction with leaves and twigs, while the shadowy creature looms in the background, its glowing eyes reflecting menace. The broken compass lies prominently in the foreground, symbolizing hope and adventure."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A breathtaking view from a cliff overlooking a turbulent ocean, with the sun beginning to rise, casting a golden hue on the scene. Sophie stands at the edge, her expression a mixture of determination and contemplation, while Ethan looks concerned. The forest looms behind them, thick and overgrown, hinting at the secrets it holds.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_20_ch5_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:56:27"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing An emotionally charged moment as Sophie bravely approaches the shadow creature, eyes filled with empathy and understanding. The creature, a swirling mass of dark tendrils and glowing eyes, hesitates, its form flickering as the bioluminescent flowers illuminate the surroundings, casting an ethereal glow. The air is thick with tension, and the other friends watch anxiously, caught between fear and hope.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_20_ch5_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:56:27"}}}
