     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"Enchanted","1":"Adventure","2":"Magic","3":"Worthy","4":"Glade","image_prompts":["A colorful illustration of Maya and Leo standing in the lush, vibrant Enchanted Forest. Tall trees with sparkling leaves surround them. Nutty the squirrel stands in front, smiling widely, with a playful expression. The ground is covered in colorful flowers and soft green grass.","A dramatic image of the large, shadowy figure with glowing eyes in the glade. Maya stands confidently, hands on her hips, while Leo looks slightly nervous next to her. The surrounding glade is filled with magical light, enhancing the tension of the moment."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A serene view of a mystical forest at twilight, with towering trees creating a natural canopy. The ground is carpeted with soft moss, and a sparkling stream winds through the scene, illuminated by the glow of luminescent flowers. Maya and Leo stand at the edge, eyes wide with wonder. The mood is enchanting yet slightly mysterious, hinting at the unseen secrets of the forest.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_11_ch1_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:55:39"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dramatic moment as Fern, the wise owl, perches on a branch, its amber eyes reflecting the light of the moon. The background reveals the shadows of the dense forest, creating a sense of depth and intrigue. Maya and Leo look up in awe, their expressions a mix of fear and determination. This image captures the gravity of the situation and the magical atmosphere of the enchanted forest.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_11_ch1_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:55:39"}}}
