     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"worthy","1":"glade","2":"tangled","3":"bravery","4":"whispering","image_prompts":["A shimmering, silvery fox with bright blue eyes stands in a lush, green forest. Maya and Leo, a brave 12-year-old girl and her curious 8-year-old brother, look at the fox with wide eyes. The trees around them whisper, and colorful flowers bloom at their feet, creating a vibrant, magical atmosphere.","A tiny, fluffy-eared fairy named Glimmer flits joyfully in mid-air, surrounded by sparkles. Maya and Leo watch her with excitement, and the enchanted forest gleams in the background, filled with colorful plants and glowing lights. The mood is light and filled with wonder."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A mystical forest grove with sunlight filtering through the leaves, creating a warm, dappled light on the forest floor. Maya and Leo are portrayed kneeling beside a luminescent flower, their expressions a mix of awe and determination. The towering trees around them have twisted trunks, symbolizing the ancient nature of this enchanted land, while shadows hint at hidden secrets.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_11_ch2_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:54:45"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A shadowy creature emerging from the darkness of the forest, its eyes glowing ominously. The atmosphere is tense, with swirling mists around the creature, giving it an ethereal quality. Maya and Leo stand in the foreground, their expressions a mix of fear and defiance as they face this new challenge, embodying the struggle between innocence and the encroaching darkness.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_11_ch2_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:54:45"}}}
