     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"enchanted","1":"whispers","2":"cave","3":"mystery","4":"riddle","image_prompts":["A lush, colorful forest with towering trees and glowing stones leading to a dark cave entrance. Maya, a brave 12-year-old girl with curly hair, stands in front of the cave, holding her younger brother Leo's hand. Leo, an 8-year-old boy with wide eyes, looks nervous. Fern, an old, wise owl, sits on a branch, watching them with kind eyes.","Inside the Cave of Whispers, the walls glitter with sparkling crystals reflecting light. Maya and Leo stand together, looking at a glowing riddle etched into the crystal wall. Maya looks determined while Leo appears curious yet scared. The atmosphere is filled with magic and suspense."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing Maya and Leo, standing at the edge of the dark stream, their expressions a mixture of fear and determination. The ominous shadows swirl beneath the bridge, while rays of sunlight struggle to break through the canopy overhead, casting an ethereal glow around them.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_11_ch3_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:54:06"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A tense moment as the dark shadow creature lunges from the water, its shimmering eyes piercing through the dimness. The stag stands valiantly in front of Maya and Leo, his antlers glowing with a warm, protective light that contrasts against the dark ambience of the forest.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_11_ch3_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:54:06"}}}
