   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_11_7_10","title":"Echoes of the Enchanted Forest","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Lost in the Wild","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Maya and Leo were excited. They were camping with their parents in a bright green forest. The sun shone through the leaves, making the ground sparkle like stars. Maya was twelve. She was brave and loved adventures. Leo, her little brother, was only eight. He was curious and always asked questions.\n\n\u201cLook at that tall tree, Maya!\u201d Leo said, pointing. \n\n\u201cIt\u2019s huge!\u201d Maya replied. \u201cI wonder how old it is.\u201d\n\nJust then, they heard a rustling sound. Maya turned to see a bush shaking. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d she asked, her heart beating fast.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know! Let\u2019s check it out!\u201d Leo said, his eyes wide with excitement. \n\nThey walked closer, and out popped a furry squirrel. His eyes were bright and funny. \u201cHello there!\u201d the squirrel squeaked. \n\nMaya and Leo gasped. \u201cDid you just talk?\u201d Maya asked.\n\n\u201cOf course! This is the Enchanted Forest!\u201d the squirrel grinned. \u201cI\u2019m Nutty. What are you two doing here?\u201d\n\nMaya exchanged a look with Leo. \u201cWe\u2019re camping with our parents,\u201d she said. \u201cBut we didn\u2019t know this was the Enchanted Forest.\u201d\n\nNutty bounced on his little feet. \u201cYou must help us! The magic is fading! If it goes away, you might never find your way home!\u201d\n\nMaya\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWhat do we need to do?\u201d\n\n\u201cFollow me!\u201d Nutty chattered excitedly. \n\nMaya and Leo followed Nutty deeper into the forest. The trees whispered secrets and the flowers danced in the breeze. Everything felt alive and magical. \n\nSuddenly, the ground shook! A bright flash of light appeared, followed by a big puff of smoke. \n\n\u201cOh no!\u201d Nutty squeaked, jumping up and down. \u201cWe need to hurry! We have to find the Heart of the Forest before it\u2019s too late!\u201d \n\nMaya felt nervous but also brave. \u201cWe can do this, Leo!\u201d she said. \n\nLeo nodded, \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d \n\nAs they ran, leaves swirled around them like a colorful whirlwind. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe forest was vibrant and enchanting. The trees towered above them, their leaves sparkling in different shades of green. Nutty, with his bushy tail, hopped in front of Maya and Leo, leading the way. \n\n\u201cWhat is the Heart of the Forest?\u201d Maya asked as they dashed along.\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s a magical gem,\u201d Nutty explained. \u201cIt keeps everything in balance. If we don\u2019t find it, the forest will lose its magic.\u201d\n\nMaya felt a tingle in her fingers. \u201cWe can\u2019t let that happen!\u201d she said. \n\nThey arrived at a glade filled with shimmering light. It was beautiful! But then they heard a loud roar. \n\n\u201cWhat was that?!\u201d Leo squeaked.\n\n\u201cIt sounds like trouble!\u201d Nutty said, looking scared. \n\nMaya took a deep breath. \u201cWe have to face it. Come on, Leo!\u201d\n\nThey stepped into the glade, ready for anything. The mystery of the forest beckoned them. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nIn front of them stood a large, shadowy figure. It had glowing eyes and a thick, fluffy coat. \n\n\u201cWho dares enter my glade?\u201d the creature roared, shaking the ground.\n\nMaya felt her heart race. \u201cWe\u2019re here to find the Heart of the Forest!\u201d she shouted bravely. \n\nThe creature paused. \u201cThen you must prove you are worthy!\u201d \n\nMaya and Leo exchanged worried glances. What would they have to do?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What forest do Maya and Leo find themselves in?","options":["Magical Forest","Enchanted Forest","Mystery Forest","Dark Forest"],"correct_answer":"Enchanted Forest"},{"question":"Who do Maya and Leo meet in the forest?","options":["A talking bear","A friendly fox","A talking squirrel","A wise turtle"],"correct_answer":"A talking squirrel"},{"question":"What is fading in the forest?","options":["The trees","The flowers","The magic","The animals"],"correct_answer":"The magic"},{"question":"What do Maya and Leo need to find to go home?","options":["A magic portal","The Heart of the Forest","A hidden treasure","The Great Oak"],"correct_answer":"The Heart of the Forest"},{"question":"What does the creature in the glade ask Maya and Leo?","options":["To leave","What they want","To prove they are worthy","To sing a song"],"correct_answer":"To prove they are worthy"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_11_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_11_ch1_img1.png","plot_11_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":539,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
