   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_11_7_10","title":"Echoes of the Enchanted Forest","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Lost in the Wild","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Maya and Leo stood frozen in front of the mysterious creature. It was a shimmering, silvery fox with bright blue eyes. \u201cWho dares to enter my realm?\u201d it asked in a voice that was both curious and commanding.  \n\nMaya took a deep breath. \u201cWe are Maya and Leo. We want to help the forest!\u201d  \n\nThe fox tilted its head, intrigued. \u201cHelp? The forest is indeed in trouble.\u201d  \n\nLeo whispered to Maya, \u201cWhat does it want?\u201d  \n\n\u201cI think it wants to know if we\u2019re worthy,\u201d Maya replied.  \n\nThe fox's eyes sparkled. \u201cTo find the Heart of the Forest, you must first pass my test. Are you ready?\u201d  \n\nMaya nodded, and Leo bounced on his toes. \u201cYes, we are!\u201d  \n\n\u201cVery well,\u201d said the fox, \u201cI want to see if you can solve this riddle.\u201d  \n\nThe trees whispered softly around them, as if they too were listening closely. \u201cI have branches, but no leaves. I have roots, but I\u2019m not a tree. What am I?\u201d  \n\nMaya furrowed her brow. \u201cHmm, this is tricky.\u201d  \n\nLeo piped up. \u201cI know! It's a river!\u201d  \n\nThe fox smiled. \u201cCorrect! A river flows with branches of water.\u201d  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]  \n\n\u201cNow, for the second part of the test,\u201d the fox continued. \u201cYou must find the hidden glade guarded by the whispering trees. It\u2019s where the magic is strongest!\u201d  \n\nMaya and Leo exchanged excited glances. \u201cWhere do we go?\u201d Maya asked.  \n\n\u201cFollow the sound of laughter and the scent of flowers,\u201d the fox said, flicking its tail.  \n\n\u201cThank you!\u201d Leo shouted, and they began to run.  \n\nAs they dashed through the vibrant forest, colorful flowers bloomed around them. The air was filled with laughter. Suddenly, they heard a loud THWACK!  \n\n\u201cWhat was that?\u201d Maya asked, her heart racing.  \n\nThey peeked around a large tree trunk. A tiny creature, no bigger than Leo\u2019s hand, was tangled in a net! It had fluffy ears and big round eyes.  \n\n\u201cOh no! We have to help!\u201d Maya said.  \n\n\u201cWait!\u201d Leo warned. \u201cWhat if it\u2019s a trap?\u201d  \n\nBut before they could decide, the creature cried out, \u201cPlease! I\u2019m stuck!\u201d  \n\nMaya rushed forward. \u201cDon\u2019t worry! We\u2019ll help you!\u201d  \n\nJust then, the branches above them rustled loudly. Maya and Leo looked up, their eyes wide. It was the same mysterious fox!  \n\n\u201cYour bravery may lead you to more than just the glade,\u201d it said.  \n\nThe creature squeaked, \u201cThank you!\u201d as Maya carefully cut the net with a sharp stone.  \n\n\u201cBe careful!\u201d Leo shouted.  \n\nThe little creature hopped free. \u201cI\u2019m Glimmer, the fairy! Thank you!\u201d  \n\nAs Glimmer flitted in the air, a tiny sparkle followed her. \u201cYou must hurry! The magic is fading fast!\u201d  \n\nMaya\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWe will!\u201d  \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Leo cheered.  \n\nTogether, they raced deeper into the enchanted forest, ready for the next challenge.  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]  \n\n\u201cCan you hear that?\u201d Maya asked. \u201cThe laughter!\u201d  \n\n\u201cYes!\u201d Leo replied, excitement bubbling inside him.  \n\nThey ran towards the sound, ready for whatever awaited them.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does the fox ask Maya and Leo to solve?","options":["A riddle","A maze","A puzzle","A song"],"correct_answer":"A riddle"},{"question":"What is the name of the creature they rescue?","options":["Nutty","Glimmer","Whisper","Shimmer"],"correct_answer":"Glimmer"},{"question":"What do Maya and Leo hear as they search for the glade?","options":["The sound of thunder","The sound of laughter","The sound of singing","The sound of whispering"],"correct_answer":"The sound of laughter"},{"question":"What does Glimmer say about the forest's magic?","options":["It is fading fast","It is getting stronger","It is already gone","It is hidden"],"correct_answer":"It is fading fast"},{"question":"What is Maya's reaction when she sees Glimmer stuck in the net?","options":["She runs away","She helps Glimmer","She laughs","She ignores Glimmer"],"correct_answer":"She helps Glimmer"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_11_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_11_ch2_img1.png","plot_11_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":496,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
