   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_11_7_10","title":"Echoes of the Enchanted Forest","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Lost in the Wild","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"The sun was setting over the enchanted forest. Maya and Leo stood on a soft, mossy hill. They could hear the gentle rustle of leaves and the sweet songs of birds.\n\n\u201cWhere do we go next?\u201d Leo asked, looking up at Maya with wide eyes.\n\n\u201cWe need to find the Heart of the Forest,\u201d Maya said, her voice steady. \u201cFern might know.\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find Fern!\u201d Leo chirped, his excitement bubbling over.\n\nThey walked deeper into the forest. The trees grew taller, and the air sparkled with magic. Suddenly, they saw Fern perched on a branch, her wise eyes shining.\n\n\u201cMaya, Leo!\u201d she hooted. \u201cTime is running out! You must hurry!\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat do we do?\u201d Maya asked, feeling a flutter of worry.\n\nFern fluffed her feathers. \u201cThe forest is losing its magic. You must discover the truth about the Heart! It is hidden in the Cave of Whispers.\u201d\n\n\u201cA cave?\u201d Leo squeaked. \u201cThat sounds scary!\u201d\n\n\u201cIt is,\u201d Fern agreed. \u201cBut you are brave. Follow the path of the glowing stones. They will lead you there.\u201d\n\nMaya took Leo\u2019s hand. \u201cWe can do this together!\u201d\n\nAs they followed the glowing stones, shadows danced around them. The trees whispered secrets, and the wind seemed to sigh. Suddenly, a loud crack echoed through the forest. \n\n\u201cDid you hear that?\u201d Leo asked, gripping Maya\u2019s arm.\n\n\u201cYes,\u201d Maya whispered. \u201cWe need to keep going!\u201d\n\nThey turned a corner and saw the Cave of Whispers. It loomed in front of them, dark and mysterious. A chill ran down Maya\u2019s spine. \n\n\u201cMaya, I don\u2019t want to go in there!\u201d Leo said, trembling.\n\n\u201cWe have to,\u201d Maya replied, her heart racing. \u201cWhat if the Heart is inside?\u201d\n\nJust then, a flurry of colorful butterflies flew out of the cave, swirling around them. One butterfly landed on Leo\u2019s nose.\n\n\u201cHey!\u201d Leo giggled, reaching up to touch it. \n\n\u201cFocus, Leo!\u201d Maya urged. \u201cWe have to be brave!\u201d\n\nWith a deep breath, they stepped forward. Inside the cave, the walls sparkled with shimmering crystals. But then, they heard a deep growl.\n\n\u201cWho dares enter my cave?\u201d a voice boomed.\n\nMaya and Leo froze, wide-eyed. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cWhat if it\u2019s a monster?\u201d Leo whispered, trembling.\n\nMaya took a step forward. \u201cWe just want to find the Heart of the Forest!\u201d she called.\n\nThe growl faded, replaced by a low chuckle. \u201cBrave little ones, you seek the Heart? But can you face the truth?\u201d\n\nMaya felt a shiver. \u201cWhat truth?\u201d she asked.\n\n\u201cThe truth will test your hearts! Are you ready?\u201d \n\nMaya and Leo exchanged glances. They nodded, determination flickering in their eyes. \n\n\u201cTogether,\u201d Maya said firmly.\n\n\u201cTogether!\u201d Leo echoed.\n\nSuddenly, the cave lit up, revealing a riddle etched in the crystals.\n\n\u201cTo find the Heart, you must answer true. What is lost but can be found, and is never seen, just heard all around?\u201d\n\nThe cave pulsed with magic, and Maya felt the weight of the challenge. \n\n\u201cLeo, we need to think!\u201d \n\nWhat would they answer? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nMaya took a deep breath, her mind racing. Time was running out, and they had to make a decision. \n\n\u201cLeo, we can\u2019t give up now!\u201d","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Maya and Leo need to find to return home?","options":["The Heart of the Forest","A magic wand","A treasure map","A talking animal"],"correct_answer":"The Heart of the Forest"},{"question":"Who guides Maya and Leo in the forest?","options":["Glimmer","Nutty","Fern","A fairy"],"correct_answer":"Fern"},{"question":"What do Maya and Leo find at the Cave of Whispers?","options":["A treasure","A riddle","A monster","A fairy"],"correct_answer":"A riddle"},{"question":"What does the cave pulse with?","options":["Magic","Fear","Water","Wind"],"correct_answer":"Magic"},{"question":"How do Maya and Leo feel about entering the cave?","options":["Excited","Nervous","Bored","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Nervous"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_11_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_11_ch3_img1.png","plot_11_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":528,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
