   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_11_7_10","title":"Echoes of the Enchanted Forest","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Lost in the Wild","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Maya and Leo stood in the Cave of Whispers. The walls sparkled with tiny lights. They could hear soft voices echoing all around them. \n\n\u201cDo you think the riddle will help us?\u201d Maya asked, glancing at Leo. \n\n\u201cI hope so!\u201d Leo replied, looking excited. \u201cIt\u2019s like a treasure hunt!\u201d\n\nFern, the wise old owl, perched on a rock. \u201cThe Heart of the Forest is hidden. You must answer the riddle to find your way.\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s the riddle?\u201d Maya asked, her heart beating fast.\n\nFern hooted softly. \u201cListen closely. Here it is: \u2018I speak without a mouth and hear without ears. I have no body, but I come alive with the wind. What am I?\u2019\u201d\n\n\u201cHmm\u2026\u201d Maya pondered. \u201cIt must be something magical!\u201d\n\nLeo thought and thought. \u201cIs it\u2026 an echo?\u201d \n\n\u201cYes!\u201d Fern exclaimed, flapping her wings. \u201cYou\u2019ve solved it! Now, follow the sound of the wind.\u201d\n\nThey ventured deeper into the cave. The air was cool and fresh. Suddenly, they heard a soft ringing sound. \n\n\u201cThat must be the Heart of the Forest!\u201d Leo shouted, his eyes wide with wonder. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they walked, colorful lights danced around them. Maya\u2019s heart filled with hope. \u201cWe\u2019re getting closer!\u201d\n\nThey soon entered a bright glade filled with flowers. Each flower glowed softly, and the air felt warm. \n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Leo pointed. \u201cThere\u2019s a big tree in the middle!\u201d\n\nThe tree sparkled, its bark shining like gold. \u201cThis must be it!\u201d Maya said, rushing toward it.\n\nBut just then, the flowers began to dim. \u201cOh no! The magic is fading!\u201d Leo cried.\n\nFern said urgently, \u201cYou must touch the tree to awaken its heart!\u201d\n\nMaya and Leo joined hands and approached the tree. \u201cOn the count of three!\u201d Maya said. \n\n\u201cOne\u2026 two\u2026 three!\u201d They touched the tree together.\n\nSuddenly, a bright light burst from the tree. The flowers bloomed back to life, and a gentle breeze filled the air. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cMaya, look!\u201d Leo gasped. \u201cThe magic is back!\u201d\n\nFern smiled, her eyes twinkling. \u201cYou have restored the Heart of the Forest. Now, you can find your way home.\u201d\n\nMaya felt a rush of joy. \u201cWe did it, Leo!\u201d\n\nBut just then, they heard a strange noise. It sounded like a low growl. Maya frowned. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d\n\nFern\u2019s feathers ruffled. \u201cStay close! We must be careful!\u201d\n\nWith a mix of excitement and a little fear, Maya and Leo prepared for what lay ahead.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What riddle do Maya and Leo solve?","options":["What runs without water?","What is an echo?","What flies without wings?","What shines without a light?"],"correct_answer":"What is an echo?"},{"question":"What do Maya and Leo touch to awaken the magic?","options":["A flower","The ground","The tree","A rock"],"correct_answer":"The tree"},{"question":"Who helps Maya and Leo in the cave?","options":["Nutty the squirrel","Fern the owl","Glimmer the fairy","The shimmering fox"],"correct_answer":"Fern the owl"},{"question":"What happens to the flowers when Maya and Leo touch the tree?","options":["They wilt","They bloom back to life","They turn to stone","They disappear"],"correct_answer":"They bloom back to life"},{"question":"What noise do Maya and Leo hear at the end of the chapter?","options":["A singing bird","A low growl","A bubbling stream","A whispering breeze"],"correct_answer":"A low growl"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_11_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_11_ch4_img1.png","plot_11_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":408,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
