     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"glistening","1":"twisted","2":"guardian","3":"resonant","4":"awe","image_prompts":["A vibrant forest clearing with a sparkling stream winding through it. In the center stands a majestic old oak tree, with gnarled roots and branches reaching toward the sky. Maya, a brave 12-year-old girl with adventurous eyes, is twirling in delight, while her curious 8-year-old brother Leo crouches nearby, pointing at colorful wildflowers. The wise old owl, Fern, perched on a low branch, watches them with a knowing expression.","A dramatic scene capturing Maya and Leo standing before Fern, the wise owl. The trees around them are swaying slightly as if whispering secrets. Maya's expression is one of determination, while Leo looks both excited and anxious, with wide eyes as Fern explains the mystery of the Whispering Trees. The sunlight filters through the branches, creating a magical atmosphere."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A serene view of a mystical forest at twilight, with towering trees creating a natural canopy. The ground is carpeted with soft moss, and a sparkling stream winds through the scene, illuminated by the glow of luminescent flowers. Maya and Leo stand at the edge, eyes wide with wonder. The mood is enchanting yet slightly mysterious, hinting at the unseen secrets of the forest.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_11_ch1_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:55:39"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dramatic moment as Fern, the wise owl, perches on a branch, its amber eyes reflecting the light of the moon. The background reveals the shadows of the dense forest, creating a sense of depth and intrigue. Maya and Leo look up in awe, their expressions a mix of fear and determination. This image captures the gravity of the situation and the magical atmosphere of the enchanted forest.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_11_ch1_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:55:39"}}}
