   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_11_11_14","title":"Echoes of the Enchanted Forest","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Lost in the Wild","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Maya adjusted the straps of her backpack, glancing back at her little brother, Leo, who was busy trying to catch the sunlight as it streamed through the leaves. They had been hiking for hours, the scent of pine and earth filling the air, and the excitement of their camping trip was starting to bubble over. Maya was determined to make this a fantastic adventure, just like the ones in the stories she loved to read.\n\n\u201cCome on, Leo! We have to find the perfect spot before it gets dark!\u201d she called, her voice dancing with the chirping of birds above.\n\n\u201cWait! Look at this!\u201d Leo exclaimed, pointing to a cluster of wildflowers peeking out from beneath a large rock. The colors were vibrant, like a painter\u2019s palette, and Maya couldn\u2019t help but smile. Leo\u2019s curiosity always had a way of making her feel like they were embarking on a treasure hunt.\n\nAs they walked deeper into the woods, the towering trees seemed to loom closer, their branches twisting like giant fingers reaching for the sky. The sunlight filtered through the leaves, casting a magical glow upon the forest floor. Maya felt a thrill of excitement, but there was something else too\u2014an undercurrent of mystery that buzzed in the air.\n\nAfter a while, they stumbled upon a clearing that seemed to pulse with life. A bubbling stream wound through the scene, and the sound of water splashing over stones was like a soothing melody. \u201cThis is it!\u201d Maya declared, throwing her arms wide as she twirled in delight.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nIn the center of the clearing stood an ancient oak tree, its gnarled roots twisting out of the ground like the arms of an old friend. A soft rustle came from the branches, and Maya\u2019s heart raced with anticipation. Just then, a wise old owl swooped down and landed gracefully on a low branch, his feathers shimmering in the sunlight.\n\n\u201cWelcome, young adventurers!\u201d the owl hooted, his voice deep and resonant. \u201cI am Fern, guardian of this enchanted forest.\u201d\n\n\u201cDid you just talk?\u201d Leo gasped, his eyes wide with wonder.\n\n\u201cIndeed,\u201d replied Fern, tilting his head. \u201cBut beware! This forest is filled with magic, and not all of it is safe. You must find the hidden secret before the magic fades, or you may become part of this place forever.\u201d\n\nMaya\u2019s stomach knotted with tension. \u201cWhat secret?\u201d she asked, her voice steady despite the thrill of fear racing through her.\n\n\u201cThe secret of the Whispering Trees,\u201d Fern explained, his gaze piercing. \u201cFind it, and it will lead you home. But time is not on your side.\u201d\n\nBefore Maya could respond, a sudden gust of wind swirled around them, sending leaves spiraling into the air. The trees seemed to whisper secrets to each other, their voices barely audible but filled with urgency. She took a deep breath, glancing at Leo, who was staring at the owl, his face a mix of awe and confusion.\n\n\u201cAre you ready, Leo?\u201d she asked, determination flooding her heart. \u201cWe\u2019re going to uncover this secret together.\u201d\n\nLeo nodded, his small hands clenching into fists. \u201cLet\u2019s do it!\u201d\n\nAnd with that, the siblings took their first steps into the heart of the enchanted forest, unaware of the challenges that awaited them.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who do Maya and Leo meet in the enchanted forest?","options":["A rabbit","A wise old owl","A talking tree","A mystical deer"],"correct_answer":"A wise old owl"},{"question":"What do Maya and Leo need to find to return home?","options":["A hidden treasure","The secret of the Whispering Trees","A magical portal","A lost map"],"correct_answer":"The secret of the Whispering Trees"},{"question":"What does the ancient oak tree symbolize?","options":["Friendship","Wisdom","Adventure","Fear"],"correct_answer":"Wisdom"},{"question":"How does Maya feel about the adventure at the beginning?","options":["Nervous","Excited","Bored","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"},{"question":"What is the tone of the chapter?","options":["Dark and gloomy","Bright and adventurous","Confusing and chaotic","Sad and lonely"],"correct_answer":"Bright and adventurous"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_11_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_11_ch1_img1.png","plot_11_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":551,"reading_level":"Builder"}
