       [DEBUG] Checking shared image: {"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A shadowy creature emerging from the darkness of the forest, its eyes glowing ominously. The atmosphere is tense, with swirling mists around the creature, giving it an ethereal quality. Maya and Leo stand in the foreground, their expressions a mix of fear and defiance as they face this new challenge, embodying the struggle between innocence and the encroaching darkness.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_11_ch2_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:54:45"}
