   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_12_7_10","title":"The Cave of Lost Treasures","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Lost in the Wild","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Sam and Olivia were the best of friends. They loved to explore! One sunny Saturday, their hiking group decided to visit the Whispering Mountains. The mountains were famous for their tall peaks and hidden treasures.\n\n\u201cCan you believe it?\u201d Sam said, his eyes shining. \u201cWe might find a treasure today!\u201d \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s stick close to the group,\u201d Olivia replied, always the careful one. \u201cWe don\u2019t want to get lost.\u201d\n\nAs they walked, the trees whispered above them. The path was rocky and winding. Suddenly, a sparkling light caught Sam\u2019s eye. \u201cLook over there!\u201d he shouted, pointing to a shadowy entrance in the mountain.\n\n\u201cIs it a cave?\u201d Olivia asked, her heart racing. \n\n\u201cIt looks like it! Let\u2019s check it out!\u201d Sam said, bouncing on his feet.\n\nThey tiptoed toward the cave. It was dark inside, but they could see glittering rocks all around. Olivia took a deep breath. \u201cThis is a little creepy,\u201d she said.\n\nJust then, they heard a strange noise. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Sam whispered, his eyes wide.\n\n\u201cMaybe it\u2019s just a squirrel,\u201d Olivia suggested, trying to sound brave. \n\n\u201cOr a treasure guardian!\u201d Sam grinned, and they both giggled. \u201cLet\u2019s go inside!\u201d\n\nAs they stepped in, the light danced on the cave walls. \u201cWow!\u201d Sam exclaimed. \u201cThis is amazing!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe cave was filled with shiny gems and ancient artifacts. \u201cDo you think these are real?\u201d Olivia asked, touching a smooth stone. \n\n\u201cOnly one way to find out!\u201d Sam declared, moving deeper into the cave. \n\nSuddenly, they heard another noise. This time it was louder. \u201cLet\u2019s be careful,\u201d Olivia warned. \n\nJust then, a little creature with big eyes peeked out from behind a rock. \u201cHello!\u201d it squeaked. \u201cWhat are you doing here?\u201d\n\nSam and Olivia stared. \u201cAre you a treasure guardian?\u201d Sam asked.\n\n\u201cSort of!\u201d the creature replied. \u201cBut to find the treasures, you must solve my riddles!\u201d\n\n\u201cRiddles? We love riddles!\u201d Sam said, bouncing with excitement.\n\n\u201cGood! You have until nightfall to find your way out,\u201d the creature warned. \u201cAre you ready?\u201d\n\nOlivia nodded. \u201cWe\u2019re ready!\u201d she said. \n\nBut as they stepped further in, the cave grew darker. \u201cWe need to hurry,\u201d Olivia whispered, glancing at the cave entrance. \u201cWe could get lost!\u201d\n\n\u201cDon\u2019t worry! We\u2019re a team,\u201d Sam said, grinning. \u201cLet\u2019s solve these riddles and find the treasure!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThey took a deep breath and plunged deeper into the cave, not knowing what adventures awaited them.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Sam and Olivia find in the cave?","options":["A treasure map","Shiny gems","A treasure chest","A scary monster"],"correct_answer":"Shiny gems"},{"question":"What does the creature in the cave want them to do?","options":["Fight it","Sing a song","Solve riddles","Find treasure"],"correct_answer":"Solve riddles"},{"question":"What is Olivia's main concern about exploring the cave?","options":["Getting lost","The darkness","The noise","The treasure"],"correct_answer":"Getting lost"},{"question":"What did Sam and Olivia love to do?","options":["Watch movies","Play games","Explore","Ride bikes"],"correct_answer":"Explore"},{"question":"What time limit do Sam and Olivia have?","options":["One hour","Until lunchtime","Until nightfall","Until sunset"],"correct_answer":"Until nightfall"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_12_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_12_ch1_img1.png","plot_12_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":412,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
