   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_12_7_10","title":"The Cave of Lost Treasures","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Lost in the Wild","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"The cave was dark and cool. Sam and Olivia stood at the entrance, peering inside. \"Wow! Look at all those sparkling rocks!\" Sam exclaimed, his eyes wide with wonder. \n\n\"Be careful,\" Olivia replied, pulling out her flashlight. \"We don\u2019t know what\u2019s in there.\" They took a deep breath and stepped inside. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they walked, the beams of light danced off the walls. Shadows flickered, and the cave echoed their whispers. \u201cDo you think there are real treasures here?\u201d Olivia asked, her curiosity bubbling.\n\n\u201cDefinitely! But we must be smart,\u201d Sam said, glancing around. \u201cIf we want to find our way back, we need to solve the riddles!\u201d \n\nSuddenly, a soft voice echoed from the shadows. \u201cTo find the treasures, you must solve my riddle!\u201d A small, furry creature appeared. It had bright eyes and a twinkling smile. \n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s your riddle?\u201d Sam asked, excited.\n\nThe creature began, \u201cI have keys but open no locks. I have space but no room. I have a name but no voice. What am I?\u201d \n\nOlivia frowned. \u201cHmm. This sounds tricky.\u201d\n\n\u201cI think it\u2019s a piano!\u201d Sam shouted. \u201cIt has keys, space, and a name!\u201d \n\nThe creature clapped its tiny paws. \u201cCorrect! You may pass!\u201d It waved its hand, and a path lit up ahead. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s keep moving!\u201d Olivia urged, feeling pumped. They hurried along the path when suddenly, the ground shook. \n\n\u201cWhat was that?\u201d Sam shouted, looking around. \n\nA large rock tumbled from above, blocking the cave entrance! \u201cOh no! We\u2019re trapped!\u201d Olivia cried, her heart racing. \n\n\u201cDon\u2019t panic!\u201d Sam said, trying to stay calm. \u201cWe need to solve another riddle to find a way out!\u201d \n\n\u201cLook, there\u2019s a glowing rock!\u201d Olivia pointed. \u201cIt might be a clue.\u201d \n\n\u201cLet's check it out!\u201d Sam said, leading the way. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAs they approached the glowing rock, it shimmered with strange symbols. Sam and Olivia exchanged nervous glances. \u201cWhat do these mean?\u201d Olivia wondered aloud.\n\n\u201cMaybe they\u2019re part of the next riddle,\u201d Sam suggested. \u201cWe need to figure it out before it gets dark!\u201d\n\n\u201cOkay! Let\u2019s read them together,\u201d Olivia said, her determination shining bright.\n\nJust then, a low growl echoed behind them. They turned, afraid of what might be lurking in the shadows. \n\n\u201cHold on tight, Olivia! We can do this!\u201d Sam said, taking a step forward. \n\nWould they be able to solve the riddle and escape before nightfall?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Sam and Olivia find inside the cave?","options":["A monster","A treasure map","Sparkling rocks","A waterfall"],"correct_answer":"Sparkling rocks"},{"question":"What creature do they meet?","options":["A dragon","A furry riddle creature","A giant spider","A ghost"],"correct_answer":"A furry riddle creature"},{"question":"What happens when they are deep in the cave?","options":["They find a treasure chest","The ground shakes and rocks fall","They see a river","They meet other hikers"],"correct_answer":"The ground shakes and rocks fall"},{"question":"What do they need to solve to escape the cave?","options":["A riddle","A code","A treasure map","A puzzle"],"correct_answer":"A riddle"},{"question":"What do the glowing symbols represent?","options":["A warning","A treasure","Another riddle","A map"],"correct_answer":"Another riddle"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_12_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_12_ch2_img1.png","plot_12_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":405,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
