   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_12_7_10","title":"The Cave of Lost Treasures","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Lost in the Wild","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"As Sam and Olivia stared at the glowing symbols on the cave walls, their hearts raced. The cave felt alive, whispering secrets only they could hear. \u201cWhat do you think they mean?\u201d Sam asked, tracing a symbol with his finger. The glow pulsed gently, lighting up his face.\n\n\u201cI think they\u2019re a clue!\u201d Olivia said, peering closer. \u201cWe have to solve it to get out!\u201d \n\nThe cave was dark, but the colors of the symbols shimmered like stars. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] The walls sparkled with blues, greens, and golds, creating a magical atmosphere. \n\nSuddenly, a loud rumble echoed through the cave. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Sam shouted, his eyes wide. \n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but we need to hurry!\u201d Olivia replied, her voice steady despite the fear in her heart. They needed to solve the puzzle quickly. \n\nAs they studied the symbols, a strange creature appeared. It was small, with bright eyes and a fluffy tail. \u201cAnswer my riddle!\u201d it chirped. \u201cWhat has keys but can\u2019t open locks?\u201d \n\nSam scratched his head. \u201cHmm, keys but no locks. What could it be?\u201d \n\n\u201cWait!\u201d Olivia said, her eyes lighting up. \u201cA piano! It has keys!\u201d \n\n\u201cCorrect!\u201d the creature giggled. \u201cNow, find the next clue!\u201d \n\nWith renewed energy, Sam and Olivia searched the cave. They found a shimmering rock with an arrow pointing deeper into the darkness. \u201cThis way!\u201d Sam said, leading the way. \n\nBut as they ventured further, the path narrowed. \u201cUh-oh,\u201d Olivia said, glancing around. \u201cWhat if we can\u2019t get back?\u201d \n\nJust then, they heard a rustling sound. \u201cWhat is that?\u201d Sam asked, his voice shaky. \n\nBefore they could react, a strange shadow darted past them. \u201cWe have to go!\u201d Olivia urged. \u201cNow!\u201d \n\nThey ran down the narrow path, but it twisted and turned. \u201cWe\u2019re lost!\u201d Sam yelled. \n\n\u201cNo, we can\u2019t be!\u201d Olivia said, her heart pounding. \u201cWe just need to think!\u201d \n\nThen they reached a huge door covered in even more glowing symbols. \u201cDo you think this is the way out?\u201d Sam wondered. \n\n\u201cI hope so!\u201d Olivia said, biting her lip. \u201cBut how do we open it?\u201d \n\nThey stood for a moment, fear gripping their hearts. They had to find a way out before darkness fell. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s try the symbols again!\u201d Sam suggested. \u201cIf we can figure them out, we might unlock the door!\u201d \n\n\u201cOkay! Let\u2019s do it!\u201d Olivia agreed. They looked at the symbols, ready to solve the biggest puzzle yet. \n\nBut just as they began, the ground trembled again. \u201cHurry!\u201d Olivia shouted. \n\nWith the clock ticking, they needed to make a choice. Solve the puzzle or risk being trapped in the cave forever. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2] Sam took a deep breath. \u201cLet\u2019s work together!\u201d \n\nThe cave buzzed with anticipation as they began their challenge.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does the strange creature ask Sam and Olivia to solve?","options":["A math problem","A riddle","A puzzle","A song"],"correct_answer":"A riddle"},{"question":"What is the answer to the creature's riddle?","options":["A door","A car","A piano","A book"],"correct_answer":"A piano"},{"question":"What do Sam and Olivia find after solving the riddle?","options":["A treasure chest","A shimmering rock","A hidden path","A monster"],"correct_answer":"A shimmering rock"},{"question":"What do they see at the end of the chapter?","options":["A way out","A dark tunnel","A huge door","A treasure"],"correct_answer":"A huge door"},{"question":"What do Sam and Olivia decide to do at the huge door?","options":["Leave the cave","Solve the symbols","Run away","Give up"],"correct_answer":"Solve the symbols"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_12_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_12_ch3_img1.png","plot_12_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":461,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
