     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"glimmered","1":"cautious","2":"echoing","3":"guardian","4":"labyrinth","image_prompts":["A dimly lit cave interior filled with glittering crystals reflecting light. Sam, an adventurous 11-year-old with messy hair and a wide-eyed expression, explores the cave, while Olivia, practical and determined, watches him with a cautious look. The cave walls are rugged, and shadows dance around them, creating an atmosphere of mystery.","A tense moment where Sam and Olivia stand in front of a new guardian creature, illuminated by the faint light of the crystals. Sam's hand is gripping Olivia's reassuringly, while Olivia looks determined yet worried. The guardian looms large, casting an imposing shadow, with its eyes glowing eerily in the dark."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dimly lit cavern filled with glimmering rocks embedded in the walls, casting reflections that resemble stars in a night sky. In the center, a weathered stone tablet with glowing symbols, while two figures, Sam and Olivia, stand close together, their expressions a mix of awe and concern. The atmosphere is thick with moisture, creating a mystical yet tense ambiance.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_12_ch3_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:50:43"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A close-up of Sams determined face as he prepares to decipher the riddle on the stone tablet, with Olivia beside him, her brows furrowed in worry. The growling creature looms in the background, partially shrouded in shadows, its eyes glinting ominously. The contrast between Sams resolve and Olivias trepidation heightens the tension of the scene.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_12_ch3_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:50