       [DEBUG] Checking shared image: {"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A vast chamber filled with scattered ancient artifacts, glowing softly in the darkness. Olivia stands at the forefront, her expression a mix of awe and trepidation. Sam is slightly behind her, eyes wide with wonder. The cave walls are adorned with mysterious carvings, and a sense of impending danger looms as the ground trembles subtly beneath them.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_12_ch2_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:51:25"}
