       [DEBUG] Checking shared image: {"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A close-up of Sams determined face as he prepares to decipher the riddle on the stone tablet, with Olivia beside him, her brows furrowed in worry. The growling creature looms in the background, partially shrouded in shadows, its eyes glinting ominously. The contrast between Sams resolve and Olivias trepidation heightens the tension of the scene.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_12_ch3_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:50:43"}
