     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"whispers","1":"adventure","2":"treasure","3":"explore","4":"secrets","image_prompts":["A vibrant, colorful tropical island scene with Jess and Mark looking amazed at the lush trees and bright flowers. The sky is blue with fluffy clouds, and the ocean sparkles in the background. Jess is 13 with brown hair in a ponytail, and Mark is 10 with tousled blond hair. They both wear casual summer clothes.","The inside of the cave with a stunning underground waterfall shimmering in the light. The walls are rocky, and colorful crystals line the edges. Jess and Mark stand in awe, with Jess pointing at the waterfall and Mark looking excited. The mood is magical, inviting, and adventurous."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A vibrant tropical island scene with lush palm trees swaying gently in the breeze. The sky is a dramatic mix of dark clouds dispersing, allowing beams of sunlight to break through, casting an ethereal glow over the sandy beach. Jess, a 15-year-old girl with tousled hair, stands at the waters edge, looking into the dense greenery with a mixture of fear and fascination.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_13_ch1_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:48:51"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing An intense moment where Jess and Mark stand at the edge of a thicket, the atmosphere charged with tension. The trees around them seem to lean in, their leaves rustling as if whispering secrets. In the foreground, a small, lizard-like creature peeks out from behind a bush, its eyes wide with fear. The expressions on Jess and Marks faces reflect a blend of curiosity and apprehension, highlighting the mysterious nature of the island.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_13_ch1_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:48:51"}}}
