     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"whispers","1":"gem","2":"together","3":"shadows","4":"path","image_prompts":["A lush tropical landscape with tall, swaying trees. The trees have gentle smiling faces formed by the branches and leaves, with vines glowing softly in vibrant greens and yellows. Jess, a creative girl with long hair, stands beside her adventurous younger brother Mark, who has messy hair and wide eyes, both looking up in awe at the trees.","A magical clearing filled with colorful flowers in bright hues of red, blue, and yellow. In the center is a stone pedestal with a glowing gem on top, radiating warm light. Jess and Mark stand together, hand in hand, their faces filled with excitement and determination as they gaze at the gem."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A majestic, ancient tree with a twisted trunk and sprawling branches, bathed in warm morning light. The bark is etched with intricate carvings that seem to shimmer as Jess places her hand against it, her face alight with curiosity and wonder. In the background, soft beams of sunlight filter through dense foliage, creating a magical atmosphere.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_13_ch4_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:46:47"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A vibrant, luminescent bird with iridescent feathers hovering in mid-air, surrounded by a swirl of leaves caught in a gentle breeze. Jess and Mark stand in awe, their expressions a mix of wonder and determination as they prepare to follow the bird deeper into the lush, vibrant greenery of the island. The scene is dynamic, capturing the essence of their adventure and the enchanting aura of the island.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_13_ch4_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:46:47"}}}
