   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_13_7_10","title":"The Island of Whispers","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Lost in the Wild","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Jess and Mark woke up on the sandy beach. The sun was shining brightly above them. Birds chirped, and the trees around them seemed to whisper.\n\n\u201cDid you hear that?\u201d Mark asked, eyes wide.\n\nJess nodded. \u201cIt\u2019s like they\u2019re talking!\u201d\n\nThey stood up, brushing the sand off their clothes. \u201cLet\u2019s explore!\u201d Mark shouted, sprinting toward the trees. Jess followed, her heart racing with excitement.\n\nAs they walked deeper into the island, the air felt different. It was warm and sweet, like candy. \u201cLook!\u201d Jess pointed to a big tree with colorful flowers. \u201cIt\u2019s beautiful!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe tree's leaves swayed slightly, and it seemed to whisper louder. \u201cWhat do you think it\u2019s saying?\u201d Mark wondered.\n\n\u201cI think it\u2019s telling us to be careful,\u201d Jess replied. \u201cThis place feels magical!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, the ground shook again. \u201cWhoa!\u201d Mark yelled, stumbling. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know!\u201d Jess exclaimed, grabbing his arm. \u201cBut we need to find shelter!\u201d\n\nThey spotted a cave nearby, its entrance dark but inviting. \u201cLet\u2019s go in!\u201d Mark urged, his adventurous spirit shining through. They dashed toward the cave, their footsteps echoing inside.\n\nOnce in the cave, they heard the whispers even more clearly. \u201cIt sounds like\u2026 words!\u201d Jess said, listening closely.\n\n\u201cCan you understand them?\u201d Mark asked, his eyes wide with curiosity.\n\n\u201cI think they\u2019re warning us,\u201d Jess said slowly. \u201cAbout\u2026 something outside!\u201d\n\nJust then, they heard a loud crash! The cave shook again, and the ground rumbled beneath them. \u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d Mark shouted, panic in his voice.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know! We have to get back outside!\u201d Jess said, pulling him toward the cave entrance.\n\nJust as they reached the exit, a bright flash of light burst from the trees. They shielded their eyes, gasping at the sight. A glowing figure appeared, surrounded by swirling leaves.\n\n\u201cWhat is that?\u201d Mark whispered, fear and wonder mixing in his voice.\n\n\u201cI think\u2026 I think it\u2019s a guardian of the island!\u201d Jess replied in awe. \u201cWe have to learn what it wants!\u201d\n\n\u201cCan we trust it?\u201d Mark asked nervously.\n\nJess took a deep breath. \u201cWe have to try!\u201d\n\nWith that, they stepped out of the cave, ready to face whatever came next.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Jess and Mark hear when they explore the island?","options":["Birds singing","The trees whispering","Water flowing","Waves crashing"],"correct_answer":"The trees whispering"},{"question":"What do Jess and Mark find that is dark but inviting?","options":["A tree","A cave","A waterfall","A boat"],"correct_answer":"A cave"},{"question":"What does the glowing figure represent?","options":["A friend","A guardian","A monster","A tree"],"correct_answer":"A guardian"},{"question":"How does Mark feel about the glowing figure?","options":["Excited","Bored","Nervous","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Nervous"},{"question":"What do Jess and Mark decide to do at the end of the chapter?","options":["Run away","Face the guardian","Go back to the cave","Stay on the beach"],"correct_answer":"Face the guardian"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_13_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_13_ch2_img1.png","plot_13_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":373,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
