   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_13_7_10","title":"The Island of Whispers","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Lost in the Wild","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"The sun rose high over the Island of Whispers. Jess and Mark stood on the beach, their feet sinking into the warm sand. The trees around them swayed gently. \u201cDo you hear that?\u201d Jess asked, tilting her head. The leaves rustled softly, almost like they were talking.\n\n\u201cIt's just the wind,\u201d Mark said, grabbing a stick. He drew in the sand. \u201cBut I bet there are treasures in that cave we found!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go back,\u201d Jess said, her eyes sparkling. \u201cMaybe we can learn the trees' secrets!\u201d \n\nAs they walked, the trees whispered louder. \u201cCan you understand them?\u201d Jess asked.\n\nMark shrugged. \u201cI don\u2019t know. But let\u2019s find out!\u201d \n\nThey reached the mouth of the cave again. It looked dark and mysterious. \u201cWhat if there are bats?\u201d Mark said, peeking inside. \n\n\u201cI\u2019ll go first!\u201d Jess declared. She took a deep breath and stepped inside. The cave was cool and damp. The whispers became clearer. \u201cHelp us\u2026 help us\u2026\u201d\n\n\u201cDid you hear that?\u201d Mark gasped, stepping back.\n\n\u201cYes! They need help! We have to find out how,\u201d Jess replied.\n\nSuddenly, the ground shook beneath them. \u201cWhoa!\u201d Mark shouted. \u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d\n\nThe whispers turned frantic. \u201cRun! Run!\u201d they echoed. The cave walls shimmered, and shadows danced around them. Jess and Mark felt a rush of wind that pushed them toward the cave\u2019s exit.\n\nThey burst out into the sunlight, panting. \u201cThat was scary!\u201d Mark said, wide-eyed.\n\n\u201cWhat was that?\u201d Jess asked, looking back at the cave.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but I think we have to do something!\u201d Mark shouted. \u201cThe trees warned us!\u201d\n\n\u201cMaybe we can help them!\u201d Jess said, determination shining in her eyes. \u201cBut how?\u201d\n\nJust then, a bright light flickered in the bushes. \u201cFollow me!\u201d a glowing figure called, waving its hand. \n\n\u201cWho are you?\u201d Mark called, taking a step forward.\n\n\u201cI am the Keeper of the Island,\u201d the figure said, shimmering like a star. \u201cAnd the trees need your help!\u201d\n\nJess and Mark exchanged glances. This was their chance. But what should they do next? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nMark took a deep breath. \u201cWe can\u2019t be scared. We need to learn what the trees want!\u201d\n\nAnd right then, they knew they had to make a decision. Would they follow the light and face the unknown, or play it safe? \n\n\u201cI choose to follow!\u201d Jess exclaimed.\n\n\u201cMe too!\u201d Mark shouted, his heart racing.\n\nThey stepped forward, ready for whatever adventure awaited them.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Jess and Mark hear from the trees?","options":["They are singing","They are whispering","They are shouting","They are laughing"],"correct_answer":"They are whispering"},{"question":"What happens when they are in the cave?","options":["It gets very dark","The ground shakes","They find treasure","They see bats"],"correct_answer":"The ground shakes"},{"question":"Who appears to help Jess and Mark?","options":["A giant","A talking animal","The Keeper of the Island","A dragon"],"correct_answer":"The Keeper of the Island"},{"question":"What do Jess and Mark decide at the end of the chapter?","options":["To leave the island","To follow the glowing figure","To stay in the cave","To go back home"],"correct_answer":"To follow the glowing figure"},{"question":"What do the trees want from Jess and Mark?","options":["To play with them","To help them","To eat fruit","To go to sleep"],"correct_answer":"To help them"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_13_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_13_ch3_img1.png","plot_13_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":412,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
