   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_13_7_10","title":"The Island of Whispers","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Lost in the Wild","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Jess and Mark stood in the heart of the island, the whispering trees all around them. The leaves danced in the breeze, talking in soft voices. \u201cDo you hear that, Mark?\u201d Jess asked, her eyes wide. \n\n\u201cOf course, I hear it!\u201d Mark said with a grin. \u201cIt\u2019s like the trees are sharing secrets!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s try to listen better,\u201d Jess suggested, closing her eyes. \u201cMaybe they\u2019ll help us find the gem.\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a loud rustle came from behind a nearby tree. \u201c[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\u201d A big, colorful parrot flew out, squawking loudly. \n\n\u201cWhoa! It\u2019s a talking parrot!\u201d Mark exclaimed. The parrot landed on a branch, cocking its head.\n\n\u201cFind the gem,\u201d it squawked. \u201cIt\u2019s hidden near the waterfall!\u201d\n\n\u201cThank you, Mr. Parrot!\u201d Jess called, laughing. She felt a spark of hope. They could find the gem! \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Mark said, his adventurous spirit bubbling. They ran through the trees, their hearts racing. The path was bright with colorful flowers. \n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Jess pointed. \u201cOver there! I see the waterfall!\u201d \n\nThey reached the waterfall and gasped. It was beautiful! Water cascaded down shiny rocks, sparkling in the sunlight. \u201cHow do we find the gem?\u201d Mark wondered.\n\n\u201cMaybe the waterfall hides it,\u201d Jess said. \u201cWe should check behind the falling water.\u201d \n\nTaking a deep breath, Jess stepped closer. The spray from the waterfall felt cool on her face. \u201cI\u2019ll go first!\u201d Mark bravely declared. He dashed in, laughing as the water splashed. \n\n\u201cBe careful!\u201d Jess shouted, but she couldn\u2019t help smiling. Suddenly, Mark shouted, \u201cJess! I found something!\u201d \n\nHe reached into a small cave behind the waterfall. Mark pulled out a glowing gem. It sparkled with the colors of the rainbow! \u201c[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\u201d\n\n\u201cWow, Mark! You did it!\u201d Jess cheered. \u201cNow we can talk to the trees!\u201d\n\nThey held the gem together. \u201cLet\u2019s make a wish!\u201d Jess said, her voice full of excitement. \u201cI wish for a way to speak with the island!\u201d\n\nThe gem glowed brighter. Suddenly, they heard the trees whispering louder, as if saying, \u201cYou\u2019ve found the magic!\u201d\n\nJess and Mark hugged each other, feeling stronger than ever. They learned that working together was the key. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s explore more!\u201d Mark shouted, full of energy. They took off, ready for their next adventure.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What animal helps Jess and Mark find the gem?","options":["A dog","A cat","A parrot","A frog"],"correct_answer":"A parrot"},{"question":"Where do they find the gem?","options":["In a tree","Behind the waterfall","In a cave","In the sand"],"correct_answer":"Behind the waterfall"},{"question":"What do Jess and Mark realize is important?","options":["Being alone","Teamwork","Running fast","Climbing trees"],"correct_answer":"Teamwork"},{"question":"What do Jess and Mark wish for with the gem?","options":["To fly","To talk to the trees","To go home","To find treasure"],"correct_answer":"To talk to the trees"},{"question":"What do they do after finding the gem?","options":["Explore more","Build a house","Sleep","Swim away"],"correct_answer":"Explore more"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_13_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_13_ch5_img1.png","plot_13_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":381,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
