       [DEBUG] Checking shared image: {"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing An intense moment where Jess and Mark stand at the edge of a thicket, the atmosphere charged with tension. The trees around them seem to lean in, their leaves rustling as if whispering secrets. In the foreground, a small, lizard-like creature peeks out from behind a bush, its eyes wide with fear. The expressions on Jess and Marks faces reflect a blend of curiosity and apprehension, highlighting the mysterious nature of the island.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_13_ch1_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:48:51"}
