     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"adventure","1":"together","2":"sparkle","3":"trail","4":"flower","image_prompts":["A colorful scene of Mia and Ethan by a sparkling stream surrounded by bright wildflowers. Mia holds a shiny stone, while Ethan looks excited. Butterflies flutter around, and the sun shines brightly overhead.","A joyful moment of the classmates cheering together at the newly found narrow path, with smiles on their faces. The lush greenery of the forest surrounds them, and their sense of teamwork is evident in their expressions."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dramatic scene where a black bear stands amidst a sun-drenched forest. The sunlight filters through the trees, highlighting the bears thick fur, creating an ethereal ambiance. The expressions of the students in the foreground show a mixture of awe and trepidation, accentuating the tension of the moment.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_14_ch5_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:43:12"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing An atmospheric depiction of a riverbank at sunset, with students sitting together on the shore. The sky is ablaze with orange and purple hues, reflecting off the waters surface. The wildflowers line the bank, vibrant and inviting, as Mia reaches down to touch them, embodying a moment of peace and hope after a day of trials.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_14_ch5_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:43:12"}}}
