   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_14_7_10","title":"The Wildflower Trail","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Lost in the Wild","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Mia and Ethan stood still, looking around. The vibrant colors of the wildflowers danced in the gentle breeze. Bees buzzed happily, collecting nectar. The sun shone brightly above, but Mia felt a little cloud inside her.\n\n\u201cWhere did everyone go?\u201d Ethan asked, squinting into the distance.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know,\u201d Mia replied, her voice barely above a whisper. \u201cDo you think they\u2019ll find us?\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s not wait around!\u201d Ethan declared, his eyes sparkling with excitement. \u201cWe can find them! We just have to follow the trail!\u201d\n\nMia nodded, feeling a mix of fear and courage. Together, they stepped onto the narrow path lined with wildflowers. The trail twisted and turned, surrounded by tall trees that whispered secrets to each other.\n\nJust then, they heard a rustle in the bushes. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Mia asked, her heart racing.\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s probably just a squirrel,\u201d Ethan said, trying to sound brave. \u201cLet\u2019s check it out!\u201d\n\nAs they peeked through the leaves, they saw a small, fluffy rabbit nibbling on clover. Mia giggled, feeling lighter. \u201cLook! It\u2019s so cute!\u201d\n\n\u201cOkay, focus, Mia!\u201d Ethan said, grinning. \u201cWe need to get back to the group.\u201d \n\nThey continued walking, but soon the trail split into two paths. \u201cOh no! Which way should we go?\u201d Mia\u2019s voice trembled.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s try the left path,\u201d Ethan suggested. \u201cIt looks a little brighter.\u201d\n\nMia bit her lip. \u201cWhat if it\u2019s the wrong way?\u201d\n\n\u201cDon\u2019t worry! We\u2019ll figure it out together,\u201d Ethan reassured her. \u201cWe\u2019re a team!\u201d\n\nTaking a deep breath, Mia nodded. They walked along the left path, but as they moved deeper into the woods, the trees grew thicker. Shadows danced on the ground, and a cool breeze whispered through the branches.\n\nSuddenly, they heard a loud splash. \u201cDid you hear that?\u201d Mia exclaimed. \n\n\u201cYeah! It sounded like water,\u201d Ethan said, his adventurous side ignited. \u201cLet\u2019s check it out!\u201d\n\nThey hurried toward the sound, excitement bubbling inside them. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] \n\nAs they reached a small stream, they saw their classmates on the other side! \u201cHey! Over here!\u201d Ethan shouted, waving his arms.\n\nTheir classmates looked confused. \u201cHow did you get there?\u201d called out Sam, the tallest boy in the group.\n\n\u201cWe got lost!\u201d Mia yelled back. \u201cBut we\u2019re okay!\u201d\n\n\u201cCan you come this way?\u201d Sam asked. \u201cThe trail is blocked!\u201d\n\nMia felt a knot in her stomach. \u201cBlocked? How?\u201d\n\nSuddenly, they heard the crack of a branch, and a large tree branch fell right in front of them, blocking the path completely! \u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d Mia shouted, panic rising in her chest. \n\nEthan looked at Mia and then at the branch. \u201cWe need to find another way around!\u201d \n\nMia swallowed hard. \u201cBut what if we can\u2019t?\u201d \n\nEthan smiled. \u201cWe can! Let\u2019s use our heads. Together! We can do this!\u201d\n\nMia took a deep breath and nodded. \u201cOkay, let\u2019s go!\u201d\n\nThey turned to their classmates, ready to lead the way through the wildflower trail and back to safety. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cFollow us!\u201d Ethan called as they set off once more. Mia felt a spark of courage growing inside her. She was ready for the adventure ahead!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Mia and Ethan hear that makes them excited?","options":["A loud splash","A train whistle","A bird singing","A thunderstorm"],"correct_answer":"A loud splash"},{"question":"What do Mia and Ethan find on the left path?","options":["A fallen tree branch","A cute rabbit","A hidden cave","A big rock"],"correct_answer":"A cute rabbit"},{"question":"What blocks Mia and Ethan's path?","options":["A big rock","A fallen branch","A river","A mud puddle"],"correct_answer":"A fallen branch"},{"question":"What do Ethan and Mia decide to do when they get lost?","options":["Sit and wait","Call for help","Keep exploring","Give up"],"correct_answer":"Keep exploring"},{"question":"What do Mia and Ethan realize about themselves during this chapter?","options":["They are scared of everything","They can work together as a team","They don\u2019t like adventures","They want to go home"],"correct_answer":"They can work together as a team"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_14_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_14_ch2_img1.png","plot_14_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":533,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
