   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_14_7_10","title":"The Wildflower Trail","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Lost in the Wild","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Chapter 5: The Way Home\n\nAs the sun shone bright, Mia, Ethan, and their classmates gathered by the bubbling stream. The sound of water splashing filled the air. Butterflies danced around the colorful wildflowers. \n\n\u201cWow! Look at all those flowers!\u201d Ethan exclaimed, waving his arms. \u201cThis place is amazing!\u201d\n\nMia smiled. \u201cIt really is. But we need to find our way back.\u201d\n\nThey all huddled together. \u201cLet\u2019s stick together,\u201d Mia suggested, her heart racing. \u201cIf we split up, we might get lost again.\u201d\n\n\u201cGood idea,\u201d Ethan agreed. \u201cBut I think we should look for the main path. It must be nearby!\u201d\n\n\u201cI can look over there,\u201d called out Sara, a classmate with curly hair. \u201cAnd I\u2019ll check by that tall tree!\u201d shouted Jake, another friend.\n\nMia took a deep breath. \u201cOkay. But let\u2019s meet back here in fifteen minutes, alright?\u201d\n\n\u201cYes!\u201d everyone shouted, feeling excited. They began to search in different directions, but Mia felt a flutter of worry. \n\nSuddenly, Mia spotted something shiny among the flowers. \u201cEthan! Come look at this!\u201d she called out. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nEthan dashed over, his eyes wide. \u201cWhat is it?\u201d he asked, leaning closer.\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s a little stone! It sparkles in the sun!\u201d Mia picked it up carefully. \n\n\u201cThis is like the magical stone we found before!\u201d Ethan said, grinning. They both felt a spark of hope. Maybe this was a sign!\n\nAfter searching for a little while longer, they heard a loud voice. \u201cOver here! This way!\u201d It was Sara. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Ethan said, grabbing Mia\u2019s hand. They ran toward the sound. \n\nWhen they reached Sara, she was standing by a narrow path. \u201cI found it! The main trail!\u201d \n\nMia\u2019s heart soared. \u201cWe did it!\u201d she shouted. \n\nEveryone cheered. They decided to stick together and follow the path home. Together, they walked, laughing and sharing stories about their adventure. \n\n\u201cI\u2019m glad we worked together,\u201d Mia said, feeling brave. \u201cI never thought I could help find the way back.\u201d\n\n\u201cMe too!\u201d Ethan grinned. \u201cThis was the best field trip ever!\u201d\n\nAs they reached the end of the trail, the school bus came into view. They could see their teachers waiting. Mia whispered to Ethan, \u201cWe really did it.\u201d\n\n\u201cYes, we did!\u201d Ethan replied, smiling wide. \n\nWith joy in their hearts, they hopped onto the bus, ready to share their wild adventure.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Mia and Ethan find by the stream?","options":["A map","A magical stone","A flower","A bug"],"correct_answer":"A magical stone"},{"question":"What did Mia suggest they do?","options":["Split up","Stick together","Dance","Scream"],"correct_answer":"Stick together"},{"question":"Who called out that they found the main trail?","options":["Jake","Sara","Ethan","Mia"],"correct_answer":"Sara"},{"question":"How did Mia feel at the end of the chapter?","options":["Scared","Brave","Tired","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Brave"},{"question":"What did the classmates do when they found the path?","options":["Cried","Cheered","Ran away","Slept"],"correct_answer":"Cheered"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_14_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_14_ch5_img1.png","plot_14_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":394,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
