   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_15_7_10","title":"The Secret of Timberwood","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Lost in the Wild","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Tyler stood in his attic, surrounded by boxes. Dust floated in the air, dancing in the sunlight. \u201cWhat\u2019s in here?\u201d he wondered aloud. Bella, his loyal dog, wagged her tail, eager for an adventure. \n\n\u201cCome on, Bella! Let\u2019s explore!\u201d Tyler said, digging through a box. He pulled out old clothes, books, and toys. Then, he found something special. It was an old, crinkled map! \n\n\u201cWow! Look at this!\u201d Tyler exclaimed. The map was colorful, with strange symbols and a big red X. \u201cThis must lead to something amazing!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nHe pressed his fingers on the map. \u201cTimberwood,\u201d he read. \u201cA forest that grants wishes! Can you believe it, Bella?\u201d Bella barked, as if she understood.\n\nTyler's heart raced. \u201cWe have to find it! But how?\u201d He studied the map again. \u201cIt says we need to follow the river and go past the old oak tree.\u201d \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d he shouted. He packed some snacks, grabbed a flashlight, and tied the map to his belt. Bella sniffed around, ready to lead the way. \n\n\u201cAre you ready for an adventure?\u201d Tyler asked, looking at Bella. She barked, wagging her tail. \u201cLet\u2019s make some wishes come true!\u201d\n\nAs they stepped outside, the trees whispered in the wind. Tyler felt excited but a little scared. The path ahead was unknown. What if they faced something frightening? \n\n\u201cWe can do this, Bella,\u201d he said, taking a deep breath. \u201cTogether, we are brave!\u201d \n\nThey walked through the tall grass and into the woods. The trees were tall and ancient. Leaves rustled above them, and the air smelled like pine. \n\nSuddenly, they heard a strange sound. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Tyler whispered, looking around. Bella perked her ears, ready to protect her friend. \n\nThe noise grew louder. A figure appeared from behind a tree. It was a tall, mysterious creature with green skin and twinkling eyes. \n\n\u201cWho dares enter Timberwood?\u201d the creature asked with a friendly smile. \u201cI am the guardian of this forest!\u201d \n\nTyler\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWe are looking for the wishing tree!\u201d he declared, trying to sound brave. \n\nThe guardian chuckled softly. \u201cAh, but wishes come with challenges. Are you ready for the journey?\u201d \n\nTyler looked at Bella, and she looked back at him, her tail wagging. \u201cYes! We are ready!\u201d \n\n\u201cThen let the adventure begin!\u201d said the guardian, stepping aside to reveal a glowing path. \n\n\u201cWow!\u201d Tyler gasped, feeling excitement bubbling inside him. They stepped forward, ready to face whatever lay ahead. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nBut little did Tyler know, the journey would test his courage and friendship in ways he never imagined.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Tyler find in the attic?","options":["An old map","A toy","A book","A picture"],"correct_answer":"An old map"},{"question":"What is the name of the forest?","options":["Timberwood","Forest of Dreams","Magic Woods","Whispering Pines"],"correct_answer":"Timberwood"},{"question":"Who does Tyler meet in the forest?","options":["A wizard","A dragon","The forest guardian","A fairy"],"correct_answer":"The forest guardian"},{"question":"What does the guardian say about wishes?","options":["They are easy to get","They come with challenges","They are free","They are dangerous"],"correct_answer":"They come with challenges"},{"question":"Who goes on the adventure with Tyler?","options":["His friend","His sister","His dog Bella","His cousin"],"correct_answer":"His dog Bella"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_15_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_15_ch1_img1.png","plot_15_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":432,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
