   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_15_7_10","title":"The Secret of Timberwood","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Lost in the Wild","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"The sun peeked through the trees as Tyler and Bella walked deeper into the Timberwood forest. The air smelled sweet, like candy, and the leaves sparkled with a hint of magic. Tyler looked at Bella, \u201cThis place is amazing!\u201d \n\nBella wagged her tail and sniffed the ground, eager to explore. Just then, a rustling sound came from a nearby bush.\n\n\u201cWhat was that?\u201d Tyler whispered, his heart racing.\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s just a squirrel,\u201d he told himself. But the bush shook again, and out popped a tiny blue creature with big, curious eyes. It was a forest sprite!\n\n\u201cHello!\u201d the sprite squeaked. \u201cI\u2019m Sprig. What brings you to Timberwood?\u201d\n\nTyler smiled. \u201cWe\u2019re looking for the wishing tree! Do you know where it is?\u201d\n\n\u201cFollow the glowing path!\u201d Sprig said, pointing with a tiny finger. \u201cBut beware! The forest tests the brave.\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat kind of tests?\u201d Tyler asked, feeling a flutter of nerves.\n\nSprig giggled. \u201cYou\u2019ll see! But stay close to Bella. She\u2019ll help you.\u201d Tyler nodded, feeling a wave of courage wash over him. \n\nThey continued down the glowing path, surrounded by tall, ancient trees. Suddenly, the ground shook beneath their feet. A low growl echoed through the trees. Tyler froze. \n\n\u201cWhat was that?\u201d he gasped.\n\n\u201cI think it\u2019s a bear!\u201d Bella barked, her ears perked up. \n\nBefore Tyler could respond, a shadow loomed over them. It was a bear, but not just any bear. This one wore a crown of flowers and had gentle, wise eyes. \n\n\u201cWelcome, young adventurers,\u201d the bear said in a deep voice. \u201cI am the Guardian of Timberwood. You seek a wish, but first, you must prove your bravery.\u201d\n\nTyler\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWhat do we have to do?\u201d he asked, trying to sound brave.\n\n\u201cAnswer my riddle. If you succeed, the wishing tree will be yours,\u201d the bear said, his eyes twinkling. \n\nTyler exchanged a worried glance with Bella. \u201cOkay. We\u2019re ready!\u201d\n\nThe bear smiled. \u201cHere is the riddle: What has roots as nobody sees, is taller than trees, up, up it goes, and yet never grows?\u201d\n\nTyler thought hard. He looked at Bella, who seemed equally puzzled. \u201cI don\u2019t know!\u201d he said, desperation creeping into his voice.\n\n\u201cTake your time!\u201d the bear encouraged, leaning closer. \n\nTyler took a deep breath. \u201cA mountain!\u201d he shouted suddenly. \n\nThe bear clapped his paws. \u201cCorrect! You have proven your bravery. The wishing tree is yours to find!\u201d \n\nTyler felt a rush of excitement. \u201cThank you!\u201d he cheered, and Bella barked happily. They were one step closer! \n\nBut just as they began to walk again, the path split into two, each one glowing brightly. \n\n\u201cWhich way should we go?\u201d Tyler wondered aloud, looking at Sprig.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find the way together!\u201d Sprig said cheerfully, flying above the paths. Tyler felt a spark of hope. \n\nAs they stood there, Bella sniffed the ground, wagging her tail. \u201cI smell something!\u201d she said excitedly.\n\n\u201cWhat do you smell?\u201d Tyler asked. \n\n\u201cAdventure!\u201d Bella woofed, her eyes shining. \n\nThey had to choose. Left or right? \n\n\u201cWhich way, Sprig?\u201d Tyler asked, feeling nervous yet thrilled. \n\n\u201cFollow your heart!\u201d the sprite replied, circling above them. \n\nWith a determined look, Tyler pointed to the right. \u201cLet\u2019s go this way!\u201d \n\nThey stepped forward, ready for whatever came next. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What creature do Tyler and Bella meet first in the forest?","options":["A bear","A squirrel","A sprite","A tree"],"correct_answer":"A sprite"},{"question":"What does the Guardian of Timberwood ask Tyler to do?","options":["Solve a puzzle","Find a key","Answer a riddle","Dig a hole"],"correct_answer":"Answer a riddle"},{"question":"What is the riddle about?","options":["A river","A tree","A mountain","A flower"],"correct_answer":"A mountain"},{"question":"What two paths do Tyler and Bella have to choose between?","options":["Left or right","Dark or light","Wide or narrow","Long or short"],"correct_answer":"Left or right"},{"question":"What does Bella say she smells?","options":["Food","Adventure","Flowers","Magic"],"correct_answer":"Adventure"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_15_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_15_ch2_img1.png","plot_15_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":552,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
