   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_15_7_10","title":"The Secret of Timberwood","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Lost in the Wild","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Tyler and Bella stood at the start of the blue path. The trees around them were tall and twisted, their leaves sparkling in the sun. \"This must be Timberwood!\" Tyler said, his voice filled with excitement. Bella wagged her tail and sniffed the air. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThey walked deeper into the forest. Suddenly, a loud howl echoed through the trees. Tyler felt a shiver run down his spine. \"What was that?\" he whispered. Bella barked softly, as if to say, \u201cLet\u2019s find out!\u201d\n\nAs they continued, they saw a big, furry wolf sitting by a shimmering stream. His fur was a mix of gray and gold, and his eyes shone bright like stars. \"Who dares to walk my path?\" the wolf growled. \n\nTyler took a deep breath. \"I\u2019m Tyler, and this is Bella. We\u2019re searching for the heart of Timberwood!\" \n\nThe wolf narrowed his eyes. \"To find your wishes, you must face your fears. Are you brave enough?\"\n\n\"I am!\" Tyler declared, feeling a surge of courage. Bella barked in agreement. \n\n\"Then you must cross the stream,\" the wolf said. \"But beware! The stones are slippery. You will need to help each other.\"\n\nTyler looked at the stream. It sparkled invitingly, but he knew it could be tricky. \"We can do this, Bella,\" he said. Together, they stepped onto the first stone. It wobbled but held strong.\n\nOne by one, they jumped from stone to stone. Tyler giggled as Bella leaped over a big splash. \"You\u2019re doing great!\" he cheered. \n\nBut then, Bella slipped! She yelped and nearly fell into the water. Tyler quickly reached out and grabbed her collar. \"I\u2019ve got you!\" he shouted, pulling her back to safety. They both took a moment to breathe.\n\n\"Good teamwork!\" the wolf said, his voice softer now. \"You showed bravery and care for each other. That is what makes wishes come true.\"\n\nAs they reached the other side, Tyler felt proud. \"We did it, Bella! We can keep going!\" The wolf smiled and nodded. \"Remember, the journey is just as important as the wish.\"\n\nTyler looked deeper into the woods. \"What\u2019s next?\" he wondered. The wolf pointed to a path that sparkled with golden leaves. \"Follow that path, and you will find the next guardian.\"\n\nWith a grateful wave, Tyler and Bella continued on their adventure, hearts full of hope. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThey moved along the golden path, eager to see what lay ahead.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Tyler need to show to cross the stream?","options":["Bravery","Fear","Anger","Sadness"],"correct_answer":"Bravery"},{"question":"Who tests Tyler and Bella at the stream?","options":["A bear","A wolf","A sprite","A tree"],"correct_answer":"A wolf"},{"question":"What type of path do Tyler and Bella follow after the stream?","options":["A blue path","A green path","A golden path","A red path"],"correct_answer":"A golden path"},{"question":"What does Bella do when they cross the stream?","options":["She jumps in","She slips","She runs away","She hides"],"correct_answer":"She slips"},{"question":"What is the wolf's advice about the journey?","options":["It's not important","It should end quickly","It is just as important as the wish","It should be avoided"],"correct_answer":"It is just as important as the wish"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_15_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_15_ch4_img1.png","plot_15_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":409,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
