   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_15_7_10","title":"The Secret of Timberwood","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Lost in the Wild","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Tyler and Bella stood at the edge of the blue path. The trees towered above them, their leaves sparkling in the sunlight. \u201cThis is it, Bella! Timberwood is just ahead!\u201d Tyler said, his heart racing with excitement.\n\nSuddenly, they heard a rustling sound. Bella\u2019s ears perked up. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Tyler whispered, gripping the map tightly. He took a deep breath and stepped forward, looking for the source of the noise. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they moved deeper into the forest, bright flowers bloomed all around them. Colorful butterflies fluttered softly in the air. \u201cWow! Look at all these colors, Bella!\u201d Tyler exclaimed. The air smelled fresh and sweet, as if the forest was alive. \n\nHowever, not everything felt safe. A shadow moved nearby, and a low growl echoed through the trees. Tyler's heart pounded! \u201cDo you hear that?\u201d he asked, clutching Bella\u2019s collar. \u201cWe have to be brave!\u201d\n\nThey crept toward the sound, and to their surprise, they found a small, clever fox trapped in a thorny bush. \u201cHelp me, please!\u201d the fox cried. \u201cI was chasing a butterfly!\u201d\n\nTyler looked at Bella. \u201cShould we help him?\u201d Bella wagged her tail, as if to say yes. \u201cOkay, let\u2019s do it!\u201d Tyler carefully approached the fox and gently pulled away the thorns. \u201cYou\u2019re free now!\u201d he said with a smile.\n\n\u201cThank you!\u201d the fox said, shaking off the leaves. \u201cIn return, I\u2019ll show you the way to the next guardian! Follow me!\u201d \n\nThe fox led Tyler and Bella through a hidden path filled with sparkling stones. \u201cWow, this is amazing!\u201d Tyler said, laughing. He felt proud of their teamwork. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAfter walking for a while, they reached a shimmering pond. At the water's edge stood a wise-looking owl. \u201cTo enter the next part of Timberwood, you must answer a riddle!\u201d the owl hooted. \n\nTyler nodded, feeling a mix of excitement and nerves. \u201cI\u2019m ready,\u201d he said. \n\n\u201cWhat has keys but can\u2019t open locks?\u201d the owl asked, tilting its head. Tyler thought hard. \u201cA piano!\u201d he shouted. \n\n\u201cCorrect!\u201d the owl exclaimed. \u201cYou have proven your bravery and cleverness. Now, you may pass!\u201d\n\nTyler beamed with pride. \u201cWe did it, Bella! We\u2019re one step closer to finding our wish.\u201d \n\nAs they continued on their adventure, Tyler realized that every choice he made brought him closer to understanding true bravery and friendship. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go, Bella!\u201d he called, as they dashed along the path toward their next challenge.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Tyler and Bella find at the start of this chapter?","options":["A treasure chest","A giant wolf","A trapped fox","A sparkling stream"],"correct_answer":"A trapped fox"},{"question":"What did the fox promise to do?","options":["Show them the way to the next guardian","Give them a wish","Help them find a treasure","Take them home"],"correct_answer":"Show them the way to the next guardian"},{"question":"What was the riddle asked by the owl?","options":["What has wings?","What has keys but can\u2019t open locks?","What is shiny?","What is a tree?"],"correct_answer":"What has keys but can\u2019t open locks?"},{"question":"How did Tyler feel after solving the riddle?","options":["Nervous","Proud","Sad","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Proud"},{"question":"What lesson did Tyler learn during this chapter?","options":["Always run away from danger","True bravery means helping others","Maps are always correct","Friendship is not important"],"correct_answer":"True bravery means helping others"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_15_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_15_ch5_img1.png","plot_15_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":413,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
