     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"parchment","1":"determination","2":"obscured","3":"trepidation","4":"resonant","image_prompts":["A cozy attic filled with cobwebs and old treasures, sunlight pouring in through a small window. A 14-year-old boy with messy brown hair is seated on the floor, holding a crumpled map, with a golden retriever beside him, both appearing excited. The atmosphere is nostalgic, with a warm glow highlighting the dusty wooden beams.","A shadowy figure wearing a dark cloak stands in a mystical forest, surrounded by ancient trees. The forest floor is dappled with shimmering light, and a brave teenage boy stands before the figure, a look of determination on his face, with his loyal dog beside him, ready for adventure. The atmosphere is tense yet magical, hinting at the challenges ahead."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A cozy attic filled with sunlight filtering through a small window, illuminating dust motes floating in the air. Tyler, a fourteen-year-old boy with unruly hair, sits cross-legged on the worn wooden floor, a faded map spread before him. His golden retriever, Bella, gazes at him with curiosity, her ears perked up.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_15_ch1_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:42:34"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A mystical forest clearing alive with shimmering light. In the center, a tall, shadowy figure stands, their glimmering eyes reflecting wisdom and power. Tyler, looking both awestruck and apprehensive, stands before the guardian, Bella by his side, ready to take the next step in their adventure.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_15_ch1_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:42:34"}}}
