     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"legendary","1":"determination","2":"ominous","3":"ethereal","4":"melodic","image_prompts":["A vibrant scene of Timberwood at dawn, with sunlight streaming through ancient trees. Tyler, with a look of awe and determination, stands next to Bella, who looks up at him with excitement. The stream sparkles in the foreground, enhancing the magical atmosphere of the forest.","A dramatic moment where Tyler and Bella stand at the edge of the glowing path in the Misty Hollow, surrounded by swirling mist. The shadowy figure of the forest guardian looms menacingly, with an expression that conveys both authority and mystery. The tension is palpable as Tyler prepares to step forward."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A breathtaking view of a mystical forest glade with an ethereal lake at its center, surrounded by ancient trees with light filtering through the leaves. The atmosphere is peaceful yet charged with an air of anticipation, reflecting both beauty and the weight of decision. Tyler stands at the edge of the lake, his expression a blend of determination and uncertainty, while Bella sits attentively beside him.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_15_ch4_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:40:52"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing The Guardian of Timberwood, an ethereal woman with flowing hair adorned with flowers, stands in a clearing by the shimmering lake. Her presence is both calming and powerful, with the sunlight creating a halo effect around her. Tyler looks at her with wide eyes, caught between awe and trepidation, while Bella watches protectively, sensing the significance of the encounter.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_15_ch4_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19