   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_15_11_14","title":"The Secret of Timberwood","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Lost in the Wild","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"As Tyler stepped deeper into Timberwood, the air shimmered with magic. The towering trees, with their gnarled branches stretching high into the sky, seemed to whisper secrets to one another. Sunlight filtered through the leaves, creating a mosaic of light and shadow on the forest floor. Tyler kneeled to examine a patch of vibrant mushrooms, their colors almost too bright to be real. Beside him, Bella sniffed the ground, her tail wagging furiously.\n\n\u201cCan you believe this place, Bella?\u201d Tyler said breathlessly. \u201cIt feels like something out of a storybook!\u201d\n\nBella gave a soft bark, as if she agreed. The excitement bubbled inside him, but an uneasy feeling tugged at the corners of his mind. What challenges lay ahead? He remembered the guardian's warning\u2014Timberwood was not just a place of wonder but also of trials.\n\nSuddenly, the tranquility shattered. A low growl echoed through the trees, and Tyler\u2019s heart skipped a beat. Bella's ears perked up, and she stood protectively in front of him. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Tyler whispered, his voice trembling slightly.\n\nBefore he could ponder further, a creature emerged from the underbrush. It was a wolf, sleek and silver, with eyes that glowed like emeralds. Tyler froze, caught between fear and fascination. The wolf stared at them intently, and Tyler could feel its gaze piercing through him, as if it could see into his very soul.\n\n\u201cEasy, Bella,\u201d he murmured, though he could feel his dog\u2019s tension vibrating through the leash. The wolf growled again, stepping closer, its lips curling slightly, revealing sharp teeth. Tyler took a deep breath, recalling the courage he had built up in his heart. \u201cI mean you no harm,\u201d he said, his voice steadier than he felt.\n\nThe wolf paused, its growl fading to a low rumble. Then, quite unexpectedly, it tilted its head as if it were intrigued by Tyler\u2019s words. Tyler\u2019s heart raced; he felt an odd connection to this creature, as if they shared an unspoken understanding.\n\n\u201cMaybe it\u2019s a guardian too,\u201d he thought. Just then, a rustle in the bushes behind him broke the silence. Tyler turned, and Bella barked, her stance firm and alert. Out from the foliage stepped a figure\u2014tall and cloaked, the same forest guardian from before.\n\n\u201cDo not be afraid,\u201d the guardian said, their voice like the rustling leaves. \u201cThis is a test of bravery. The wolf is not here to harm you. It seeks to protect the heart of Timberwood.\u201d\n\nThe wolf lowered its head, seemingly acknowledging the guardian. Tyler felt a wave of relief wash over him, but it was quickly overshadowed by the guardian\u2019s next words. \u201cTo pass, you must demonstrate your willingness to face your fears. Only then can you continue on your quest.\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat do I need to do?\u201d Tyler asked, his voice steady despite the knot in his stomach.\n\n\u201cYou must follow the wolf deeper into the forest,\u201d the guardian instructed, gesturing towards the shimmering path beyond the trees. \u201cBut beware\u2014the heart of Timberwood holds both secrets and shadows. Are you prepared to understand the true meaning of your wish?\u201d\n\nTyler exchanged a glance with Bella. Something deep inside him stirred, a mix of trepidation and excitement. \u201cI\u2019m ready,\u201d he said, determination igniting within him.\n\nAs the wolf turned and beckoned him forward, Tyler took a deep breath, feeling the weight of the adventure ahead. With Bella by his side, he stepped into the unknown, ready to face whatever challenges lay ahead.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What creature does Tyler encounter in Timberwood?","options":["A bear","A wolf","A deer","A lion"],"correct_answer":"A wolf"},{"question":"What does the forest guardian tell Tyler he must do?","options":["Find a treasure","Follow the wolf","Defeat a monster","Climb a mountain"],"correct_answer":"Follow the wolf"},{"question":"How does Tyler initially feel when he sees the wolf?","options":["Excited","Calm","Fearful","Indifferent"],"correct_answer":"Fearful"},{"question":"What does Tyler\u2019s dog, Bella, do when they encounter the wolf?","options":["Runs away","Barks and stands protectively","Lies down","Wags her tail"],"correct_answer":"Barks and stands protectively"},{"question":"What theme is emphasized through Tyler's journey in this chapter?","options":["Friendship","Courage","Adventure","Magic"],"correct_answer":"Courage"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_15_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_15_ch2_img1.png","plot_15_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":587,"reading_level":"Builder"}
