   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_15_11_14","title":"The Secret of Timberwood","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Lost in the Wild","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"As the sun dipped low in the sky, casting a golden hue over the ancient trees, Tyler and Bella ventured deeper into Timberwood. The air was thick with the smell of damp earth and wildflowers, whispering secrets of the forest. Tyler glanced at the map, its edges frayed and worn like an old friend. \"We should be getting close,\" he said, excitement bubbling in his chest.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\"Woof!\" Bella barked, wagging her tail eagerly. Tyler couldn\u2019t help but smile. With Bella by his side, he felt braver, ready to face whatever challenges lay ahead. As they moved further in, the trees grew taller, their trunks seemingly towering to the heavens, each one a sentinel of the magic that surrounded them.\n\nSuddenly, a soft rustle in the bushes made Tyler stop in his tracks. \"Did you hear that, girl?\" he whispered. Bella's ears perked up, her eyes wide as she sniffed the air. Tyler's heart raced as he edged closer to the sound. Just then, a shimmering figure darted past\u2014something with wings, like a flicker of light.\n\n\u201cWas that a fairy?\u201d Tyler gasped, his imagination taking flight. \u201cC\u2019mon, Bella! Let\u2019s follow it!\u201d\n\nThey hurried after the glimmering light, weaving through the thick underbrush. The forest felt alive, each rustle and chirp enhancing the thrill of their chase. But then, the light vanished into a thicket of thorny bushes. Tyler skidded to a halt, frowning. \u201cWhere did it go?\u201d\n\nJust then, a low growl echoed from behind a nearby tree. Tyler stiffened. Out stepped a creature unlike any he had ever seen\u2014a large, furry beast with piercing eyes and a crown of twigs on its head. It was the guardian of Timberwood, and it seemed displeased. \u201cWhy do you trespass in my forest, boy?\u201d it rumbled, its voice deep and resonant.\n\nTyler swallowed hard. \u201cI\u2014uh\u2014I\u2019m searching for the place where wishes come true. I found a map, and I want to make a wish.\u201d A surge of fear washed over him. What if the guardian sent him away?\n\nThe creature studied him, and for a moment, the forest held its breath. \u201cWishes do not come freely,\u201d it said finally. \u201cThey require sacrifice. What are you willing to give?\u201d\n\nTyler\u2019s mind raced. He thought about his wish\u2014the one he had always dreamed of. But what would he have to lose? \u201cI\u2026I don\u2019t know,\u201d he stammered, uncertainty creeping in. Bella whined softly, sensing his distress. \n\n\u201cThink carefully,\u201d the guardian warned. \u201cFor every wish granted, a piece of your heart must remain in Timberwood forever.\u201d\n\nTyler\u2019s heart sank. A piece of his heart? The thought of leaving part of himself behind filled him with dread. He glanced at Bella, whose loyalty shone bright in her eyes. \u201cWhat if I\u2019m not ready?\u201d he murmured.\n\nSuddenly, the ground beneath him trembled, and a loud crack echoed through the forest. Tyler watched in horror as a massive branch fell from a tree, narrowly missing them both. \u201cRun!\u201d he shouted, grabbing Bella\u2019s collar as they dashed back toward the path.\n\nPanic surged through him as they stumbled through the thick underbrush. The guardian\u2019s voice boomed behind them. \u201cYour choice must be made, young one! The forest does not wait forever!\u201d\n\nTyler\u2019s chest pounded as they reached a clearing, where the sun illuminated a glimmering pool. The air felt electric, as if the very essence of wishes lingered there. He hesitated, torn between fear and his heart\u2019s desire. Would he dare to make a sacrifice for his dream?\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cStay close, Bella,\u201d he whispered, returning his gaze to the pool. \u201cWhat do I really want?\u201d \n\nJust as he began to ponder the answer, the ground beneath them shook again, sending ripples across the water\u2019s surface. The guardian\u2019s shadow loomed closer, and Tyler realized he must make a decision\u2014fast.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Tyler find in the forest that leads him to the guardian?","options":["A treasure chest","A shimmering light","A mystical creature","A talking tree"],"correct_answer":"A shimmering light"},{"question":"What must Tyler sacrifice to have his wish granted?","options":["A piece of his heart","His friendship with Bella","His favorite toy","His map"],"correct_answer":"A piece of his heart"},{"question":"How does Tyler react when faced with the guardian's challenge?","options":["He feels excited","He feels scared and uncertain","He feels confident","He ignores it"],"correct_answer":"He feels scared and uncertain"},{"question":"What event causes Tyler to realize he must make a decision quickly?","options":["A loud clap of thunder","The ground trembling","Bella barking","The guardian disappearing"],"correct_answer":"The ground trembling"},{"question":"Who is Tyler's loyal companion on this adventure?","options":["His brother","A fairy","Bella the dog","The guardian"],"correct_answer":"Bella the dog"}]},"images":null,"word_count":651,"reading_level":"Builder"}
