   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_6_7_10","title":"The Map of Forgotten Dreams","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Treasure Hunt","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Mia, Sam, and Toby stood at the edge of the Enchanted Forest. The trees towered above them like ancient giants. Sunlight streamed through the leaves, creating a sparkling dance on the ground.\n\n\u201cThis is it!\u201d Mia exclaimed, her eyes bright with excitement. \u201cOur adventure begins here!\u201d\n\nToby wagged his tail, ready to explore. Sam adjusted his backpack. \u201cWe should stick to the path,\u201d he said wisely. \u201cThe map says we need to find the Whispering Stream first.\u201d\n\nMia opened the map wide. \u201cIt looks like we go left, then right at the big oak tree.\u201d She pointed to a large tree drawn on the map. \u201cLet\u2019s move!\u201d\n\nThey took their first steps into the forest. The air smelled of pine and flowers. Birds chirped happily in the branches above. As they walked, Mia felt a tickle of nerves in her stomach. What if they met Mr. Grizzle?\n\n\u201cDon\u2019t worry, Mia,\u201d said Sam, noticing her unease. \u201cWe\u2019re a team! Plus, Toby will protect us.\u201d\n\nToby barked, as if to confirm this. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] \n\nThey followed the path, which twisted and turned. Suddenly, they heard a rustling sound. A bush nearby shook! \n\n\u201cWhat was that?\u201d Sam asked, eyes wide.\n\n\u201cMaybe it\u2019s a magical creature!\u201d Mia whispered, her heart racing with curiosity.\n\nMia tiptoed closer, and the bush shook again. A tiny rabbit with sparkling fur hopped out! It wiggled its nose at them. \n\n\u201cHello, little friend!\u201d Mia said, crouching down. \u201cDo you know where the Whispering Stream is?\u201d\n\nThe rabbit blinked and then dashed toward the right. It looked back, waiting for them to follow. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Mia shouted. They raced after the rabbit, laughter bubbling up inside them.\n\nSuddenly, they stumbled upon a beautiful stream, the water glittering like diamonds. But there was something strange. \u201cLook!\u201d Sam pointed. \u201cThere\u2019s a riddle carved on that stone!\u201d\n\nMia read aloud: \u201cTo find the treasure, you must state, the color of dreams that never wait.\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat does that mean?\u201d Toby barked, tilting his head.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know!\u201d Mia sighed, frustrated. Just then, they heard a loud noise behind them. \n\n\u201cHa! I\u2019ve found you!\u201d It was Mr. Grizzle, grinning from ear to ear. His shadow loomed over them like a dark cloud. \u201cHand over the map!\u201d\n\nTheir hearts raced. Mia clenched the map tightly. \u201cNo way! We will solve this riddle first!\u201d\n\nBut Mr. Grizzle stepped closer. \u201cYou won\u2019t have time. I will take the treasure!\u201d\n\nMia knew they had to act fast. \u201cThink, Mia! What\u2019s the color of dreams?\u201d she muttered under her breath. \n\nSuddenly, she had an idea. \u201cBlue!\u201d she shouted with confidence. \n\n\u201cWhat?\u201d Sam looked surprised. \n\n\u201cBlue! The sky, the ocean\u2026 it\u2019s calming! It\u2019s the color of dreams!\u201d \n\nMr. Grizzle scoffed, but something glimmered in the air. The stone began to glow, and they all stared in awe.\n\n\u201cQuick, let\u2019s see what happens!\u201d Mia urged.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAs the stone glowed brighter, Mia felt hope swell in her chest. They were on the right path, but Mr. Grizzle was still there, and time was running out!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Mia, Sam, and Toby find at the edge of the Enchanted Forest?","options":["A treasure chest","A riddle","An enchanted creature","A magical map"],"correct_answer":"A riddle"},{"question":"What color does Mia guess for the riddle?","options":["Red","Green","Blue","Yellow"],"correct_answer":"Blue"},{"question":"Who threatens Mia, Sam, and Toby in this chapter?","options":["A magical creature","Mr. Grizzle","The rabbit","A forest fairy"],"correct_answer":"Mr. Grizzle"},{"question":"What does the rabbit do when it first appears?","options":["It runs away","It hops towards them","It starts talking","It makes noise"],"correct_answer":"It hops towards them"},{"question":"What does the stone do when Mia answers the riddle?","options":["It disappears","It glows","It makes a sound","It turns into gold"],"correct_answer":"It glows"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_6_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_6_ch2_img1.png","plot_6_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":517,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
