   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_6_7_10","title":"The Map of Forgotten Dreams","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Treasure Hunt","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Mia, Sam, and Toby walked deeper into the Enchanted Forest. The trees were tall, their leaves shimmering like emeralds in the sunlight. \u201cThis place is amazing!\u201d Mia exclaimed, her eyes sparkling with excitement.\n\nAs they walked, they came to a clearing with a glittering stream. \u201cLook at that!\u201d Sam pointed to the water. \u201cIt\u2019s the Whispering Stream from the map!\u201d \n\nSuddenly, they heard a rustling sound. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d whispered Mia, her heart pounding. \n\n\u201cMaybe it\u2019s a magical creature!\u201d Sam said, his eyes wide with wonder. Just then, a tiny fairy with bright wings appeared above the stream. She looked worried. \n\n\u201cYou must solve the riddle to pass!\u201d the fairy said, her voice like soft bells. \n\nMia stepped forward. \u201cWhat\u2019s the riddle?\u201d\n\nThe fairy fluttered her wings. \u201cI can be cracked, made, told, and played. What am I?\u201d \n\n\u201cHmm,\u201d Mia thought hard, tapping her chin. \u201cA joke! It\u2019s a joke!\u201d \n\nThe fairy clapped her tiny hands. \u201cCorrect! You may continue!\u201d \n\nWith a whoosh, the water sparkled brighter. But then, they heard a loud crash behind them. It was Mr. Grizzle, the treasure hunter! He had found his way to the clearing, and he looked furious. \n\n\u201cGive me that map!\u201d he shouted, reaching for Mia. \n\nMia clutched the map tightly. \u201cNo way! We found it first!\u201d \n\nToby barked, standing protectively in front of Mia. \u201cWoof! Woof!\u201d \n\nMr. Grizzle glared at them. \u201cYou think you can stop me? I\u2019m going to get that treasure!\u201d \n\nWith a sudden leap, he lunged towards them. Mia stepped back, her heart racing. \u201cWe have to run!\u201d she yelled. \n\nThey dashed away from the clearing, the sound of Mr. Grizzle\u2019s angry shouts behind them. \n\n\u201cToby, lead the way!\u201d Mia shouted. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nToby raced through the trees, his tail wagging fast. Mia and Sam followed close behind, their legs pumping. \n\nAs they ran, they spotted a cave hidden behind a cluster of bushes. \u201cIn here!\u201d Sam said, diving into the darkness. \n\nThey squeezed inside, panting heavily. \u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d Mia whispered, glancing around the shadowy cave. \n\nSam looked at the map. \u201cThere\u2019s a symbol here. It looks like it leads to the cave\u2019s exit! But we have to be careful!\u201d \n\nJust then, they heard footsteps. \u201cWhere are you, kids?\u201d Mr. Grizzle called out, getting closer. \n\nMia felt a shiver run down her spine. \u201cWe can\u2019t let him find us!\u201d \n\nAs the footsteps drew nearer, Mia knew they had to make a choice. Should they stay hidden or try to find another way out? \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go for it!\u201d Sam said, determination in his eyes. \n\nMia nodded, her heart racing. \u201cOkay, let\u2019s find that exit!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThey crept deeper into the cave, hoping to escape. Would they find the exit before Mr. Grizzle caught up? \n\nTheir adventure was just beginning.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the first riddle the fairy gives Mia?","options":["What is your name?","What has keys but can't open doors?","What can be cracked, made, told, and played?","What is the treasure?"],"correct_answer":"What can be cracked, made, told, and played?"},{"question":"Who is chasing Mia and her friends?","options":["A friendly wizard","Mr. Grizzle","A kind fairy","Their parents"],"correct_answer":"Mr. Grizzle"},{"question":"What does Toby do when Mr. Grizzle appears?","options":["Runs away","Barks and stands in front of Mia","Sits quietly","Lies down"],"correct_answer":"Barks and stands in front of Mia"},{"question":"What choice do Mia and Sam face in the cave?","options":["Stay hidden or find the exit","Jump into the water","Sing a song","Build a fire"],"correct_answer":"Stay hidden or find the exit"},{"question":"What emotion do Mia and her friends feel when they hear Mr. Grizzle's footsteps?","options":["Excited","Happy","Scared","Hungry"],"correct_answer":"Scared"}]},"images":null,"word_count":475,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
