   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_6_7_10","title":"The Map of Forgotten Dreams","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Treasure Hunt","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Mia, Sam, and Toby stood at the edge of a shimmering pond. The sun danced on the water, making it sparkle like diamonds. \u201cWow! Look at that!\u201d Mia exclaimed, pointing at the colorful fish swimming below the surface.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cDo you think we should go for a swim?\u201d Sam asked, grinning. Toby wagged his tail, barking happily as he splashed at the water\u2019s edge. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s focus on finding the treasure first,\u201d Mia said, glancing at the map. They had to reach the Heart of the Forest. The treasure was close, but they could feel Mr. Grizzle\u2019s shadow lurking nearby.\n\nAs they ventured deeper, the trees began to whisper secrets. \u201cListen!\u201d Mia said. \u201cIt\u2019s like the forest is talking to us.\u201d Sam nodded, his eyes wide. \u201cI think we can trust it.\u201d\n\nSuddenly, they spotted a glimmering path leading into a grove. \u201cMaybe this is the way,\u201d Sam suggested, looking at the map. They followed the path, excitement bubbling in their chests.\n\nThen, they found a giant stone with a riddle carved into it. \u201cTo find the treasure and unlock your dreams, what flows but never leaves?\u201d Mia read aloud. \u201cHmm, what could that mean?\u201d she wondered.\n\n\u201cWater!\u201d shouted Toby, barking. \u201cLet\u2019s check the pond!\u201d \n\nThey rushed back to the shimmering water. \u201cBut how do we use the water?\u201d Sam asked, scratching his head. Mia thought hard, then smiled. \u201cWe need to make a wish!\u201d\n\nHolding hands, they knelt by the pond. \u201cOn the count of three, we wish for the treasure!\u201d Mia said. \u201cOne, two, three!\u201d Together, they closed their eyes and wished.\n\nSuddenly, the water began to swirl. A beam of light shot up from the depths! \u201cLook!\u201d Mia pointed. \u201cSomething is coming!\u201d\n\nOut of the water rose a beautiful, glowing chest. Its lid slowly opened, revealing not gold, but a swirling mist filled with colors and dreams. \u201cThis is the treasure!\u201d Mia gasped.\n\nJust then, Mr. Grizzle appeared, his eyes wide with greed. \u201cI want that treasure!\u201d he shouted, reaching for the chest.\n\n\u201cNo!\u201d Mia and Sam cried together, stepping in front of Toby. \u201cThis treasure is about dreams, not gold!\u201d \n\nMr. Grizzle paused, confused. \u201cDreams?\u201d he echoed, looking at the mist. \n\nAs the colors danced around them, Mia spoke softly. \u201cThis treasure reminds us of the dreams we forget. We should share it, not take it.\u201d\n\nThe mist enveloped Mr. Grizzle, and his eyes softened. \u201cI\u2026 I remember my dreams!\u201d he said, his voice trembling. \u201cI was once a brave adventurer too.\u201d\n\nMia smiled. \u201cThen let\u2019s all share our dreams together!\u201d \n\nThe mist floated around them, filling the air with laughter and hope. In that moment, they understood that the greatest treasure was friendship and the dreams they would chase together. \n\nWith a warm feeling in their hearts, Mia, Sam, and Toby turned back to the path. The enchanted forest was alive with possibilities!\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cWhere to next?\u201d Sam asked, his eyes sparkling. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find more adventures!\u201d Mia said, her spirit soaring. \n\nAs they walked, they felt the magic of their dreams guiding them forward, ready to uncover whatever lay ahead.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Mia, Sam, and Toby find at the pond?","options":["A glowing chest","Gold coins","A treasure map","A magical creature"],"correct_answer":"A glowing chest"},{"question":"What did the riddle ask them to find?","options":["Something that flows but never leaves","A hidden cave","A treasure hunter","A magical fish"],"correct_answer":"Something that flows but never leaves"},{"question":"What did Mr. Grizzle want?","options":["To share dreams","The glowing chest","To be friends","A magical spell"],"correct_answer":"The glowing chest"},{"question":"What lesson did Mr. Grizzle learn?","options":["To be greedy","To forget dreams","To share dreams","To leave the forest"],"correct_answer":"To share dreams"},{"question":"What did Mia and her friends decide to do next?","options":["Go home","Find more adventures","Eat lunch","Take a nap"],"correct_answer":"Find more adventures"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_6_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_6_ch5_img1.png","plot_6_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":523,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
