   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_6_11_14","title":"The Map of Forgotten Dreams","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Treasure Hunt","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Mia pushed open the creaky attic door, dust swirling in the golden sunlight that filtered through the small window. The attic was a treasure chest of forgotten memories. Old trunks, faded photographs, and yellowing books lined the walls, each whispering tales of a time long past. It was her favorite place to explore, but today felt different, as if adventure was lurking just around the corner.\n\n\"Come on, Toby!\" she called, her voice echoing in the stillness. Her loyal golden retriever bounded up the stairs behind her, tail wagging like a flag of excitement. The moment he arrived, he sniffed around, his nose twitching with curiosity. \n\nMia rummaged through a box labeled \"Grandma's Keepsakes.\" She pulled out a dusty photo album and flicked through the pages, marveling at her grandmother\u2019s youth. Just as she was about to toss it back, something shiny caught her eye. \n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s this?\u201d she murmured, reaching for an old, crumpled piece of parchment that lay hidden beneath a lace tablecloth. The moment she unfolded it, her heart raced. It was a map, but not just any map; it was drawn in vibrant colors, showing a sprawling forest with winding paths and dotted landmarks.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs she traced the lines with her fingers, the name \"The Enchanted Forest\" leaped out at her. A breathless excitement filled her. \u201cToby, look at this!\u201d she shouted, glancing at her dog, who seemed equally intrigued. \n\nJust then, Sam, her best friend, poked his head through the attic door. \u201cWhat are you doing up here, Mia?\u201d he asked, brushing a lock of hair from his eyes. \n\n\u201cLook, I found a treasure map!\u201d she exclaimed, holding it up triumphantly.\n\n\u201cA treasure map? Like, for real?\u201d Sam's eyes widened with disbelief. \u201cYou have to be kidding me. What\u2019s on it?\u201d\n\nMia\u2019s heart thumped louder. \u201cI don\u2019t know yet! But it says something about a treasure hidden deep in the Enchanted Forest. We have to go!\u201d\n\nSam grinned, his adventurous spirit ignited. \u201cLet\u2019s do it! But we should bring some supplies. Who knows what could be out there?\u201d\n\nAs they gathered ropes, snacks, and a flashlight, Mia felt a thrill rush through her. This wasn\u2019t just a map; it was an invitation to a world beyond her own, filled with potential danger and excitement. Little did they know, lurking in the shadows was a figure who overheard their plans\u2014a greedy treasure hunter with a past shrouded in mystery. Mr. Grizzle had been searching for this treasure for years, and he would stop at nothing to claim it for himself.\n\n\u201cReady?\u201d Sam asked, his eyes sparkling with anticipation.\n\n\u201cReady!\u201d Mia replied, her heart racing in her chest. She took one last look at the attic, filled with memories and dreams, before stepping out into the bright afternoon light, with Toby by her side and the map clutched tightly in her hand. They were about to embark on a journey that would change everything.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nMia took a deep breath as they stepped into the vibrant wilderness that awaited them. The trees towered like ancient giants, their leaves whispering secrets in the wind. With each step, the world seemed to come alive, and she couldn\u2019t shake the feeling that the adventure of a lifetime had just begun.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Mia discover in her grandmother's attic?","options":["A treasure chest","An old photo album","A mysterious map","A dusty book"],"correct_answer":"A mysterious map"},{"question":"Who accompanies Mia on her adventure?","options":["Her brother","Her cousin","Her dog Toby and best friend Sam","A neighbor"],"correct_answer":"Her dog Toby and best friend Sam"},{"question":"What is the name of the forest mentioned in the map?","options":["Forgotten Woods","Mystic Grove","Enchanted Forest","Lost Valley"],"correct_answer":"Enchanted Forest"},{"question":"What character is revealed as a potential antagonist?","options":["Sam","Mr. Grizzle","Mia's grandmother","Toby"],"correct_answer":"Mr. Grizzle"},{"question":"What is Mia's initial emotion when she discovers the map?","options":["Fear","Disappointment","Excitement","Indifference"],"correct_answer":"Excitement"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_6_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_6_ch1_img1.png","plot_6_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":551,"reading_level":"Builder"}
