   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_6_11_14","title":"The Map of Forgotten Dreams","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Treasure Hunt","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Mia\u2019s heart raced as she clutched the weathered map in her hands, feeling its rough texture against her fingertips. The attic was dimly lit, the golden rays of afternoon sun filtering through a small window, illuminating dust particles that danced in the air like tiny fairies. Toby, her ever-curious dog, sniffed around the boxes stacked high, his tail wagging with excitement. Sam stood beside Mia, adjusting his glasses as he scanned the strange markings drawn on the map.\n\n\u201cLook at this, Mia!\u201d he said, pointing to a large 'X' that marked the treasure\u2019s location. \u201cWe have to figure out where this forest is!\u201d\n\n\u201cIt has to be nearby,\u201d Mia replied, a spark of determination lighting up her eyes. \u201cWe\u2019ll find it. Together.\u201d\n\nAs the trio made their way to the edge of the woods that bordered Mia\u2019s backyard, the trees loomed tall and ancient, their gnarled branches twisting like hands reaching out to the sky. The forest was alive with sounds\u2014the rustling of leaves, the chirping of birds, and in the distance, the gentle trickle of a stream. Magic seemed to hang in the air, filling Mia with a sense of wonder and adventure.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cWow, it looks even more enchanting than I imagined!\u201d Sam exclaimed, stepping cautiously into the shade of the trees. \u201cDo you think there are really magical creatures here?\u201d\n\n\u201cI hope so!\u201d Mia grinned, her spirits high. But as they ventured deeper, the atmosphere shifted. A chill crept into the air, causing Mia to shiver. A thick mist began to swirl around them, twisting through the trees like a living thing.\n\n\u201cMia, wait,\u201d Sam whispered, his voice barely audible. \u201cDo you hear that?\u201d\n\nBefore she could respond, a loud crack echoed through the forest, like thunder rumbling in the distance. Suddenly, from behind a thicket of bushes, came a gruff, menacing voice.\n\n\u201cLooking for something, children?\u201d\n\nMia\u2019s heart dropped as she recognized the shadowy figure stepping forward\u2014it was Mr. Grizzle, the treacherous treasure hunter she had heard about in town. His face was scruffy, and a glint of greed sparkled in his eyes. He seemed to know exactly what they were after.\n\n\u201cWhat are you doing here?\u201d Mia asked, trying to keep her voice steady despite the fear bubbling in her stomach.\n\n\u201cOh, just enjoying a walk through the enchanted forest,\u201d he replied with a smirk. \u201cBut you three are in my way. I suggest you turn back before things get\u2026 messy.\u201d\n\nToby growled low, positioning himself protectively in front of Mia, sensing the danger that loomed. Sam stepped forward, his expression resolute. \u201cWe\u2019re not afraid of you, Mr. Grizzle. We\u2019re going to find that treasure, and you can\u2019t stop us!\u201d\n\nThe treasure hunter laughed, a low, chilling sound that echoed among the trees. \u201cBrave words, but courage won\u2019t help you solve ancient riddles or navigate the dangers of this forest. I\u2019ll be watching your every move.\u201d\n\nWith a swish of his coat, Mr. Grizzle turned and disappeared back into the mist, leaving Mia and Sam shaken. The weight of his threat hung in the air, thick and oppressive.\n\n\u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d Sam asked, his voice trembling slightly.\n\nMia took a deep breath, determination flooding back into her. \u201cWe follow the map and solve the riddles. We can\u2019t let him scare us away. This treasure isn't just about gold; it's about the dreams we\u2019ve forgotten, remember?\u201d\n\nToby barked in agreement, and together, they pressed on into the depths of the enchanted forest, ready for whatever challenges lay ahead.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Mia find in her grandmother's attic?","options":["A golden key","A treasure map","A magical book","An old photograph"],"correct_answer":"A treasure map"},{"question":"Who is Mr. Grizzle?","options":["A friendly guide","A treasure hunter","A magical creature","Mia's neighbor"],"correct_answer":"A treasure hunter"},{"question":"What do Mia and Sam resolve to find in the forest?","options":["A lost dog","The treasure","A secret cave","A hidden village"],"correct_answer":"The treasure"},{"question":"What effect does Mr. Grizzle have on Mia and Sam?","options":["They become friends","They are scared but determined","They decide to leave the forest","They forget about the treasure"],"correct_answer":"They are scared but determined"},{"question":"What theme is emphasized in Mia's determination to find the treasure?","options":["Friendship","Greed","Fear","Adventure"],"correct_answer":"Friendship"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_6_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_6_ch2_img1.png","plot_6_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":599,"reading_level":"Builder"}
