   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_7_7_10","title":"Pirates of Maplewood Cove","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Treasure Hunt","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"In the small coastal town of Maplewood, the sun sparkled on the blue waves. Jake and Lily stared at the ocean from their porch. Jake was ten and loved adventure. Lily, only eight, had a big imagination. Together, they dreamed of treasure!\n\n\u201cLook! A seagull!\u201d Lily pointed excitedly. The bird circled above them, squawking loudly. Just then, their neighbor, Captain Finn, appeared. He had a wild beard and a colorful shirt covered in seashells.\n\n\u201cAhoy, young mates!\u201d Captain Finn waved. \u201cAre you ready for an adventure?\u201d\n\nJake\u2019s eyes lit up. \u201cAre you taking us on a treasure hunt?\u201d\n\nCaptain Finn laughed. \u201cAye! I found an old pirate\u2019s journal! It speaks of buried treasure on an uncharted island!\u201d He took a dusty book from his bag and opened it. The pages were yellow and filled with strange maps.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cWow! Do you think it's real?\u201d Lily asked, her eyes wide.\n\n\u201cReal as the sea!\u201d Captain Finn said. \u201cBut beware! There are other treasure hunters out there. We must be fast!\u201d\n\nJake felt a rush of excitement. \u201cLet\u2019s build a raft! We can sail to the island!\u201d\n\n\u201cGreat idea!\u201d Lily cheered. \u201cI can help!\u201d \n\nThe three of them gathered materials. Old wood, rope, and a big sail from Captain Finn\u2019s shed. They worked all afternoon under the warm sun. Jake hammered; Lily tied knots, and Captain Finn told funny sea stories.\n\nSuddenly, a loud voice broke their laughter. \u201cHey, losers! You\u2019ll never find the treasure!\u201d It was Bella, the rival treasure hunter. She stood on the beach with her gang, arms crossed and a smirk on her face.\n\nJake frowned. \u201cWe will find it first!\u201d\n\nBella laughed. \u201cGood luck! You\u2019ll need it!\u201d She strutted away, her friends giggling behind her.\n\nLily looked scared. \u201cWhat if she finds it first?\u201d\n\n\u201cDon\u2019t worry,\u201d Jake said confidently. \u201cWe\u2019ll be prepared! Tomorrow we sail!\u201d\n\nThey finished the raft just as the sun set. The colors in the sky turned pink and orange. As they looked at their creation, Jake felt a mix of fear and excitement.\n\n\u201cReady for adventure?\u201d Captain Finn asked. They all nodded. Together, they would face the waves, and maybe even Bella. \n\n\u201cTomorrow, we sail!\u201d Jake declared. His heart raced. What mysteries awaited them on the island?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who are the main characters in the story?","options":["Jake and Lily","Captain Finn","Bella","All of the above"],"correct_answer":"Jake and Lily"},{"question":"What does Captain Finn show Jake and Lily?","options":["A treasure map","A pirate's journal","A secret island","A magic compass"],"correct_answer":"A pirate's journal"},{"question":"What does Bella call Jake and Lily?","options":["Treasure hunters","Losers","Pirates","Adventurers"],"correct_answer":"Losers"},{"question":"What do Jake and Lily plan to build?","options":["A boat","A raft","A castle","A sandcastle"],"correct_answer":"A raft"},{"question":"What is the main conflict introduced in the chapter?","options":["Finding the treasure","Building a raft","Facing Bella","Meeting Captain Finn"],"correct_answer":"Finding the treasure"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_7_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_7_ch1_img1.png","plot_7_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":383,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
