   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_7_7_10","title":"Pirates of Maplewood Cove","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Treasure Hunt","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"The sun was shining bright over Maplewood Cove. Jake and Lily stood on the beach, their homemade raft bobbing gently in the water. \u201cAre we really going to find treasure?\u201d Lily asked, her eyes sparkling with excitement.\n\n\u201cAbsolutely!\u201d Jake replied, puffing out his chest. \u201cWith Captain Finn\u2019s journal and our raft, we can do anything!\u201d\n\nJust then, Captain Finn appeared, wearing his colorful hat and a big grin. \u201cAhoy, mateys! Ready for a grand adventure?\u201d His voice was full of cheer. \n\n\u201cMore than ready!\u201d Jake shouted, waving his arms. He felt like a real pirate already.\n\nAs they climbed onto the raft, Jake noticed the tide was rising. \u201cUh-oh,\u201d he said, glancing at the waves. \u201cDo you think we can make it?\u201d\n\nCaptain Finn smiled. \u201cThe sea is tricky, but we\u2019ve got the wind in our sails!\u201d With a quick push, they set off, the raft gliding over the water.\n\nJust as they were getting the hang of it, a loud shout echoed across the waves. \u201cYou\u2019ll never find the treasure before us!\u201d It was Bella, the rival treasure hunter, standing on her flashy boat with her crew. \n\nJake\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWhat do we do?\u201d he whispered to Lily.\n\n\u201cDon\u2019t worry,\u201d she replied, trying to sound brave. \u201cWe\u2019ll just have to be faster!\u201d\n\nThey paddled harder, trying to outpace Bella. Suddenly, a huge wave crashed against their raft! [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] Water splashed everywhere, soaking Jake and Lily. They squealed with laughter and surprise. \n\n\u201cWe can\u2019t give up now!\u201d Jake yelled, his determination growing. They paddled with all their might, but Bella's boat was closing in. \n\n\u201cWhat if we find a shortcut?\u201d Lily suggested, pointing to a narrow passage between two rocks. \n\n\u201cGreat idea!\u201d Jake nodded, steering the raft towards the opening. The rocks loomed high, casting shadows over the water. \n\n\u201cBe careful!\u201d Captain Finn warned. \u201cIt\u2019s very tight!\u201d\n\nAs they squeezed through the rocks, the waves danced around them. Just when they thought they were safe, Bella\u2019s boat followed closely behind. \u201cYou\u2019ll never escape me!\u201d she shouted, waving her arms.\n\nJake felt a rush of fear but quickly shook it off. \u201cLet\u2019s go faster!\u201d he shouted. The raft moved swiftly through the narrow path, and Lily laughed with glee. \n\nWould they make it to the treasure first? Adventure was right around the corner!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who warns Jake and Lily to be careful as they go through the rocks?","options":["Bella","Their mom","Captain Finn","A seagull"],"correct_answer":"Captain Finn"},{"question":"What do Jake and Lily use to travel to the treasure?","options":["A speedboat","A jet ski","A homemade raft","A big ship"],"correct_answer":"A homemade raft"},{"question":"What does Bella shout as she chases Jake and Lily?","options":["You'll never catch me!","You can't hide!","You\u2019ll never find the treasure!","I'm the best!"],"correct_answer":"You\u2019ll never find the treasure!"},{"question":"How do Jake and Lily feel when water splashes on them?","options":["Sad","Angry","Surprised and laughing","Scared"],"correct_answer":"Surprised and laughing"},{"question":"What do Jake and Lily see as a way to escape Bella?","options":["A big wave","A narrow passage between rocks","A lighthouse","A dolphin"],"correct_answer":"A narrow passage between rocks"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_7_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_7_ch2_img1.png","plot_7_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":394,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
