   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_7_7_10","title":"Pirates of Maplewood Cove","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Treasure Hunt","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"The waves crashed against the sides of their raft as Jake and Lily steered towards the mysterious island. \"Look at that!\" Jake shouted, pointing to a rocky outcrop. \"That must be where the treasure is hidden!\" \n\nCaptain Finn nodded, his eyes sparkling. \"Aye, it could be! But we need to be careful. The tides are tricky around here.\" As they approached, dark clouds gathered above them. \n\nSuddenly, a loud voice shouted from behind. \"Hey! You slowpokes!\" It was Bella and her crew on a much larger boat. \"We\u2019re going to find the treasure before you do!\" She waved mockingly. \n\nJake's stomach twisted. \"We can\u2019t let her win! We have to hurry!\" He pushed the raft forward as fast as they could go. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nJust then, a huge wave crashed over the raft. Water splashed everywhere! Lily squealed, \u201cI\u2019m getting soaked!\u201d \n\n\u201cHold on tight!\u201d Captain Finn called. They all gripped the sides as the raft bobbed up and down. Jake spotted Bella laughing on her boat. \u201cShe\u2019s right behind us!\u201d \n\nThe wind whipped through their hair as they raced forward. Suddenly, the raft hit a patch of rough water. It swayed dangerously, and Jake almost lost his balance. \u201cLily, help me steer!\u201d \n\n\u201cI\u2019m trying!\u201d Lily replied, her eyes wide. Just then, a strange shape appeared ahead. It was a small cave on the island! \n\n\u201cMaybe we should check it out!\u201d Jake suggested. \n\n\u201cYes! It could be a hiding spot for treasure!\u201d Lily exclaimed, her face brightening. \n\nCaptain Finn frowned. \u201cIt could also be dangerous. We should be cautious.\u201d \n\nBut just as they were about to turn towards the cave, Bella\u2019s boat cut them off. \u201cYou\u2019re not going anywhere!\u201d she yelled, grinning. \n\nThe raft rocked again, and Jake felt a surge of fear. \u201cWhat should we do?\u201d he asked, looking at his sister and Captain Finn. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go into the cave!\u201d Lily said boldly. \u201cIt\u2019s our best chance!\u201d \n\nWith a deep breath, Jake nodded. \u201cOkay! Let\u2019s do it!\u201d \n\nThey steered the raft towards the cave, leaving Bella shouting behind them. As they entered the dark cave, Jake felt a chill run down his spine. \u201cWhat will we find in here?\u201d he whispered. \n\nLily grinned, her imagination running wild. \u201cMaybe a parrot! Or a treasure chest! Or a ghost!\u201d \n\n\u201cOr all three!\u201d Captain Finn chuckled, but his eyes were serious. \u201cStay close, everyone!\u201d \n\nJust then, they heard a clattering sound from deeper inside the cave. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Jake asked, his heart racing. \n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but we have to find out!\u201d Lily said, her eyes shining with excitement. \n\nAs they moved deeper into the cave, the darkness closed around them. \u201cThis is it!\u201d Jake thought. \u201cOur biggest adventure yet!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nSuddenly, a bright flash of light flickered from the end of the cave. \u201cWhat\u2019s that?\u201d Jake cried. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go see!\u201d Lily exclaimed, pulling ahead. \n\nAs they approached the light, the cave seemed to rumble. \u201cOh no,\u201d Captain Finn muttered. \u201cWe need to be careful\u2014\u201d\n\nBut it was too late. The ground shook, and rocks began to fall from above! \n\n\u201cRun!\u201d Jake shouted, and they all dashed toward the light, their hearts pounding. \n\nThe cave was collapsing! \n\nWould they find the treasure, or would they be trapped inside?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Jake and Lily see when they approach the island?","options":["A treasure chest","A rocky outcrop","A pirate ship","A lighthouse"],"correct_answer":"A rocky outcrop"},{"question":"Who is their rival in this chapter?","options":["Captain Finn","Bella","A pirate","A sea monster"],"correct_answer":"Bella"},{"question":"What happens when they enter the cave?","options":["It starts to rain","The ground shakes","They find a treasure","They meet a parrot"],"correct_answer":"The ground shakes"},{"question":"What does Captain Finn warn them about?","options":["The tides","The cave","Bella","The treasure"],"correct_answer":"The cave"},{"question":"What do Jake and Lily decide to do when Bella cuts them off?","options":["Give up","Fight back","Enter the cave","Swim back"],"correct_answer":"Enter the cave"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_7_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_7_ch3_img1.png","plot_7_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":550,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
