   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_7_7_10","title":"Pirates of Maplewood Cove","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Treasure Hunt","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Jake and Lily stared at the dark cave entrance. It loomed before them like a giant mouth ready to swallow them whole. \u201cDo you think the treasure is inside?\u201d Jake asked, excitement bubbling in his voice.  \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find out!\u201d Lily replied. She tightened her grip on the flashlight.  \n\nWith Captain Finn leading the way, they stepped into the cave. The air was cool and damp. \u201cWatch your step!\u201d Finn warned. The cave floor was rocky and uneven.  \n\nSuddenly, Jake spotted something shiny on the ground. \u201cLook, a gold coin!\u201d he shouted, bending down to pick it up. It glimmered in the dim light.  \n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]  \n\n\u201cI knew we\u2019d find something!\u201d Lily cheered, her eyes sparkling.  \n\nBut then, a loud rumble echoed through the cave. \u201cUh-oh, that doesn\u2019t sound good!\u201d Finn said, glancing around nervously.  \n\nBefore they could react, the ground shook beneath their feet. \u201cRun!\u201d Jake yelled. They dashed deeper into the cave, their hearts pounding.  \n\nBehind them, they heard the sound of falling rocks. Dust filled the air as the cave began to collapse! \u201cThis way!\u201d Finn pointed toward a narrow passage.  \n\nLily followed closely, her mind racing. \u201cWhat if we get stuck?\u201d she squeaked.  \n\n\u201cStay close, we\u2019ll be okay!\u201d Jake encouraged her.  \n\nThey squeezed through the tight opening just in time. With a final crash, the cave behind them closed up. They tumbled out into the bright sunlight.  \n\n\u201cPhew! That was close!\u201d Jake gasped, brushing dirt off his clothes.  \n\n\u201cDid we lose the treasure?\u201d Lily asked, her face worried.  \n\nFinn smiled and checked his pockets. \u201cNo way! I still have the map!\u201d He pulled it out, and they all crowded around to look.  \n\n\u201cI think we can still get to the treasure,\u201d Jake said, determination in his voice.  \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Lily shouted, her earlier fear fading away. They all felt hopeful again.  \n\nBut just then, they heard voices behind them. Bella and her crew were back, ready to chase them to the treasure. \u201cThey can\u2019t beat us!\u201d Jake declared. They took off in the direction of the x on the map, racing against time and their rivals.  \n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]  \n\nWith adventure in their hearts, they knew they had to hurry. The treasure was almost within reach, but so was Bella!  \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s show them what we\u2019ve got!\u201d Finn shouted as they raced towards their destiny.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Jake and Lily find inside the cave?","options":["A treasure map","A gold coin","A pirate","A scary monster"],"correct_answer":"A gold coin"},{"question":"What happens when they are in the cave?","options":["They make a new friend","The cave begins to collapse","They find the treasure","They meet Bella"],"correct_answer":"The cave begins to collapse"},{"question":"Who leads the way through the cave?","options":["Jake","Lily","Captain Finn","Bella"],"correct_answer":"Captain Finn"},{"question":"What do they need to do after escaping the cave?","options":["Go home","Hide","Race to the treasure","Take a nap"],"correct_answer":"Race to the treasure"},{"question":"How do Jake and Lily feel after escaping the cave?","options":["Scared and sad","Bored and tired","Hopeful and excited","Angry and confused"],"correct_answer":"Hopeful and excited"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_7_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_7_ch4_img1.png","plot_7_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":394,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
