   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_7_7_10","title":"Pirates of Maplewood Cove","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Treasure Hunt","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"As the sun rose over Maplewood Cove, Jake, Lily, and Captain Finn stood on their raft, staring at the mysterious island. The waves danced around them, sparkling in the morning light. \u201cToday\u2019s the day!\u201d Jake exclaimed, gripping the makeshift steering wheel.\n\n\u201cWe\u2019re almost there,\u201d Lily said, her eyes wide with excitement. \u201cI can\u2019t wait to find the treasure!\u201d\n\nCaptain Finn adjusted his hat and pointed ahead. \u201cThere it is! The island of secrets!\u201d His voice was full of wonder and wisdom.\n\nSuddenly, they spotted a familiar boat in the distance. \u201cOh no! It\u2019s Bella!\u201d Jake shouted, his heart racing. The rival treasure hunter was speeding toward the island in a shiny motorboat. \n\n\u201cWe have to get there first!\u201d Lily said, her voice shaky. \u201cWhat if she finds the treasure?\u201d\n\n\u201cWe won\u2019t let that happen,\u201d Jake said firmly. He started to paddle harder. They could see the island getting closer, the tall trees swaying in the breeze. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nWhen they reached the sandy beach, they jumped off the raft. \u201cWe have to find the X on the map!\u201d Jake said, pulling out the pirate\u2019s journal. \u201cIt\u2019s near those big rocks.\u201d\n\nAs they raced towards the rocks, they heard a loud splash. Bella had arrived too! \u201cYou\u2019ll never get the treasure!\u201d she shouted, pointing her finger.\n\n\u201cJust watch us!\u201d Lily yelled back. The siblings crept around the rocks, excitement bubbling inside them. Suddenly, they spotted it! A wooden chest half-buried in the sand. \n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Jake said, pointing. \u201cIt\u2019s right there!\u201d \n\nLily squealed with joy. \u201cWe found it!\u201d\n\nBut just as they reached the chest, Bella stepped in front of them. \u201cYou\u2019ll have to get past me first!\u201d she declared, crossing her arms.\n\nJake took a deep breath. \u201cWe can share the treasure, Bella. Team up with us!\u201d\n\nBella paused, looking surprised. \u201cShare?\u201d\n\n\u201cYes! Treasure is better with friends,\u201d Lily chimed in. \u201cWe could split it!\u201d\n\nBella thought for a moment. The sun sparkled on the waves behind her. \u201cOkay,\u201d she said slowly. \u201cLet\u2019s open it together!\u201d\n\nAs they all dug into the sand, they uncovered the chest. With a loud crack, it opened to reveal gold coins, jewels, and shiny trinkets. They all gasped in amazement. \n\n\u201cWow! We did it!\u201d Jake shouted, jumping up. \u201cTreasure for everyone!\u201d\n\nLily smiled, feeling proud. \u201cWe worked together. That\u2019s what made it special.\u201d\n\nCaptain Finn chuckled, his eyes twinkling. \u201cA fine day for an adventure, eh?\u201d\n\nAs the sun began to set, the friends sat together on the beach, sharing stories and treasures. They had found more than gold\u2014they had found friendship.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Jake, Lily, and Captain Finn find on the island?","options":["A map","A treasure chest","A cave","A boat"],"correct_answer":"A treasure chest"},{"question":"Who was their rival treasure hunter?","options":["Captain Finn","Bella","Jake","Lily"],"correct_answer":"Bella"},{"question":"What did they decide to do with the treasure?","options":["Keep it all for themselves","Share it with Bella","Sell it","Bury it again"],"correct_answer":"Share it with Bella"},{"question":"What did they learn by the end of the chapter?","options":["That treasure is everything","That teamwork is important","That pirates are scary","That they should go home"],"correct_answer":"That teamwork is important"},{"question":"What was the weather like when they reached the island?","options":["Rainy and cold","Sunny and bright","Windy and stormy","Foggy and dark"],"correct_answer":"Sunny and bright"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_7_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_7_ch5_img1.png","plot_7_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":442,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
