   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_7_11_14","title":"Pirates of Maplewood Cove","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Treasure Hunt","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"As Jake and Lily drifted further from Maplewood Cove, the salty wind whipped through their hair, filling their lungs with the scent of the sea. They had finally set sail, but the growing waves felt like a warning. Captain Finn, with his wild gray beard and sun-kissed skin, stood at the helm of their rickety homemade raft, squinting against the darkening sky. \n\n\u201cKeep your eyes peeled for Midnight Isle!\u201d he bellowed, his excitement barely contained. \u201cThe treasure is just beyond those clouds!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nLily looked over the edge of the raft, watching the water churn below. \u201cDo you think it\u2019s really out there?\u201d she asked, her voice a mixture of wonder and doubt. \n\nJake rubbed his chin, recalling the journal\u2019s tales of glory and danger. \u201cIt has to be. But we need to be careful. Bella and her crew won\u2019t give up easily.\u201d\n\nJust then, a clap of thunder rolled across the sky, shaking the raft beneath them. The waves grew restless, tossing the small vessel as if it were a toy. Jake's heart raced; this wasn\u2019t just any storm. \u201cHold on tight!\u201d he yelled, gripping the sides of the raft as it dipped and surged.\n\n\u201cWhy didn\u2019t we think to bring a proper sail?\u201d Lily cried, fear creeping into her voice. \n\n\u201cBecause this is an adventure!\u201d Jake responded, trying to sound brave even as his stomach twisted. \u201cRemember what Captain Finn said\u2014adventures are messy!\u201d\n\nThe clouds thickened, and before long, rain began to pelt down, turning the water into a swirling chaos. Captain Finn struggled to steer the raft as the wind howled. Suddenly, a shadow loomed over them\u2014Bella\u2019s sleek boat cut through the waves like a predator. \n\n\u201cThere they are!\u201d Bella shouted, pointing at Jake and Lily. \u201cLet\u2019s make them regret searching for that treasure!\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat do we do?\u201d Lily asked, panic rising as Bella\u2019s crew began to hoot and holler, closing in on them.\n\nJake glanced back at their neighbor, who seemed almost unfazed, his eyes gleaming with determination. \u201cWe have to outmaneuver them! Finn, can you steer us toward that rocky cove?\u201d \n\n\u201cAye!\u201d Captain Finn shouted, his voice unwavering. \u201cBut we\u2019ll need to paddle hard, or we\u2019ll be fish bait!\u201d\n\nWith renewed focus, Jake and Lily grabbed their paddles, working in sync with Finn. The raft lunged forward, skimming the surface as they aimed for the cove. But just as they thought they might escape, a wave crashed against them, sending Lily tumbling overboard.\n\n\u201cLily!\u201d Jake shouted, panic gripping his heart. He could barely see her struggling in the churning water, arms flailing. Before he could think, he dove in after her, the cold saltwater shocking him to the core.\n\nAs Jake reached Lily, he wrapped an arm around her, pulling her close. \u201cI\u2019ve got you!\u201d he gasped, his heart pounding in his ears. But just then, a sharp voice called from above. \n\n\u201cLook at them! They\u2019re nothing but a couple of scallywags!\u201d Bella laughed, her voice dripping with disdain. \n\nWith all his strength, Jake kicked toward the raft, the surface of the water swirling like a whirlpool around them. As they neared the raft, he could see Captain Finn struggling against the wind, trying to maintain control while Bella\u2019s crew closed in.\n\n\u201cHelp us!\u201d Lily yelled, her voice barely audible over the chaos.\n\nJake\u2019s heart raced as he reached for the edge of the raft, pulling Lily up beside him. \u201cGet on!\u201d he shouted, urgency fueling him. \n\nBut just as they clambered onto the raft, they heard a crack\u2014one of the supports splintering beneath them. The raft was taking on water, and they were still in Bella\u2019s sights.\n\n\u201cNow what?\u201d Jake panted, scanning the horizon for a plan. The storm was raging, and they were losing precious time.\n\n\u201cCut the ropes! We have to lighten the load!\u201d Captain Finn yelled, his eyes wide with alarm.\n\nWith no time to lose, Jake grabbed a knife from Finn\u2019s side and sliced through the ropes. Suddenly, a loud crash echoed as Bella\u2019s boat lurched to a stop, sending her crew scrambling. \n\n\u201cGet ready! We\u2019re about to sail into the unknown!\u201d Captain Finn\u2019s voice rang out over the storm, and Jake felt a mix of fear and excitement. This was their moment to escape, but would they make it before Bella caught up with them?\n\nThe raft tilted dangerously as another wave crashed against them, and Jake realized they were in deeper trouble than they had ever imagined.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cHold on tight!\u201d Jake shouted, gripping the sides of the raft as they hurtled forward, unsure of what awaited them at the edge of the storm.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What causes Jake and Lily to panic while they are on the raft?","options":["A storm brews","They see a dolphin","They find treasure","Their raft breaks down"],"correct_answer":"A storm brews"},{"question":"What does Captain Finn instruct them to do to lighten the raft?","options":["Sail faster","Cut the ropes","Jump overboard","Throw the treasure"],"correct_answer":"Cut the ropes"},{"question":"Who is Bella in the story?","options":["A friend","A rival treasure hunter","A pirate captain","A sailor"],"correct_answer":"A rival treasure hunter"},{"question":"What does Jake do when he sees Lily fall overboard?","options":["He panics and does nothing","He dives in to save her","He yells for help","He lets her swim back"],"correct_answer":"He dives in to save her"},{"question":"What is the main conflict in Chapter 3?","options":["Finding treasure","Facing a storm and Bella's crew","Building the raft","Navigating to a cove"],"correct_answer":"Facing a storm and Bella's crew"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_7_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_7_ch3_img1.png","plot_7_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":790,"reading_level":"Builder"}
