   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_7_11_14","title":"Pirates of Maplewood Cove","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Treasure Hunt","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"The morning sun broke through the receding storm clouds, casting a warm glow over Midnight Isle. Jake tightened his grip on the raft\u2019s tattered sail, his heart racing with a mix of excitement and apprehension. \u201cLily, are you ready?\u201d he called out, glancing back at his sister, who was busy checking their supplies. She nodded eagerly, her eyes sparkling with determination.  \n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]  \n\nAs they drifted closer to the island, the rocky cliffs loomed ahead, their jagged edges reminiscent of the pirate ships that once ruled these waters. Memories of Captain Finn's endless tales filled Jake's mind\u2014the stories of treasure maps and lost riches igniting his adventurous spirit. \u201cLet\u2019s find that treasure before Bella does!\u201d Jake declared, his voice resolute.  \n\n\u201cRight! But we have to be careful, Jake,\u201d Lily reminded him, her brow furrowing just slightly. \u201cWhat if the legends about ghosts are true?\u201d The thought sent a shiver down her spine. Jake laughed, trying to lighten the mood. \u201cGhosts? Only if they have a treasure map of their own!\u201d  \n\nAs they landed on the sandy shore, a new thrill surged through them. The island was exotic, with vines twisting around ancient trees and the scent of salt mingling with the sweet fragrance of wildflowers. They climbed up the hill, following the journal\u2019s hints, when suddenly, a rustling in the bushes made them freeze.  \n\n\u201cDid you hear that?\u201d Lily whispered, her eyes wide with fear. Jake nodded, his heart pounding. Just then, a figure emerged\u2014a scruffy boy with tousled hair and a confident smirk. \u201cLooking for something?\u201d he asked, hands on his hips. It was Marcus, Bella\u2019s right-hand man.  \n\nWithout waiting for a response, he darted past them, heading deeper into the island. \u201cWait!\u201d Jake shouted. \u201cWhat do you know about the treasure?\u201d But Marcus only laughed, a taunting echo that faded as he disappeared into the thick foliage.  \n\n\u201cBella can\u2019t get here first!\u201d Lily exclaimed, panic creeping into her voice. \u201cWe need to hurry!\u201d They exchanged determined glances before racing after him, fear transforming into excitement as they navigated through the dense underbrush.  \n\nWith each step, Jake\u2019s confidence grew. \u201cWe can outsmart them, Lily. We just have to stick together.\u201d Just then, they stumbled upon a clearing, revealing an old wooden chest, half-buried in the sand. \u201cIs this it?\u201d Lily gasped, her eyes wide.  \n\nAs they approached, an ominous shadow loomed over them. Bella and her crew emerged from the trees, grinning like cats that caught the canary. \u201cToo late, losers!\u201d Bella sneered. \u201cThis treasure is mine!\u201d \n\nJake's heart sank, but he felt a spark of defiance ignite within him. \u201cWe\u2019ll see about that!\u201d he shouted back, adrenaline surging through him. The rival crew scattered around the clearing, some taking positions near the chest while others surrounded Jake and Lily. Would they be able to outsmart Bella and claim the treasure first? \n\nThe tension in the air crackled like the morning sea breeze. Outside, the waves rolled in rhythm, each crash whispering secrets of adventure yet to unfold.  \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s show them what we\u2019re made of!\u201d Jake whispered to Lily, who nodded fiercely. Together, they steeled themselves for the confrontation ahead.  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]  \n\nWith a plan forming in his mind, Jake took a deep breath, ready to face Bella and her crew. This would be their moment, and they wouldn\u2019t let fear hold them back.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Jake and Lily discover on Midnight Isle?","options":["A pirate ship","A treasure chest","A cave","A rival crew"],"correct_answer":"A treasure chest"},{"question":"Who does Jake encounter in the bushes?","options":["Captain Finn","Bella","Marcus","A pirate ghost"],"correct_answer":"Marcus"},{"question":"What emotion does Lily express when she hears a rustling sound?","options":["Excitement","Fear","Joy","Anger"],"correct_answer":"Fear"},{"question":"What do Jake and Lily plan to do when they find Bella?s crew?","options":["Run away","Fight for the treasure","Negotiate","Surrender"],"correct_answer":"Fight for the treasure"},{"question":"What theme is highlighted in this chapter?","options":["Friendship","Betrayal","Adventure","Fear"],"correct_answer":"Friendship"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_7_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_7_ch4_img1.png","plot_7_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":567,"reading_level":"Builder"}
