   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_7_15_18","title":"Pirates of Maplewood Cove","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Treasure Hunt","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"The morning sun, a fiery orb rising over Maplewood Cove, cast a shimmering path across the water, beckoning Jake, Lily, and Captain Finn into the heart of adventure. Their makeshift raft bobbed on the gentle waves, its creaks and groans harmonizing with the seagulls\u2019 cries overhead. Jake squinted into the horizon, the horizon line merging with the cobalt sky, as he tightened the frayed rope securing a tarp overhead. \n\n\u201cWe\u2019re not going back empty-handed, right?\u201d he asked, glancing sideways at Lily, who was searching the pirate journal for clues, her brow furrowed in concentration.\n\nLily nodded, her heart racing with a mix of excitement and anxiety. \u201cIt says here that the treasure is hidden beneath the old lighthouse ruins on Skull Island. We just need to find the right path.\u201d \n\n\u201cPath?\u201d Finn chuckled, a roguish grin spreading across his weathered face. \u201cA pirate\u2019s path is never straight, lass. Expect tricks and traps. The sea is as cunning as any thief.\u201d \n\nJust then, a shadow passed over them, and Jake looked up to see dark clouds rolling in, clouds that seemed to shroud the sun\u2019s warmth. \u201cThat doesn\u2019t look good,\u201d he muttered, trying to suppress a growing sense of unease. \n\nWith every stroke of the oars, the waves grew more turbulent, and the raft began to sway dangerously. Jake clenched the wood tightly, wrestling with his fear. The adventure they had anticipated was swiftly turning into a test of their resolve. \n\nAs they navigated the choppy waters, they spotted a dark figure approaching in the distance\u2014a sleek black sail cutting through the waves with alarming speed. \u201cCaptain Finn, is that\u2014\u201d Lily gasped.\n\n\u201cAye, that\u2019s Bella and her crew. We need to move!\u201d Finn\u2019s voice rose above the crashing of the waves, urgency threading through his words. \n\nWith a fierce determination, Jake shouted, \u201cRow harder, Lily! We can\u2019t let them beat us to the island!\u201d \n\nBut the tide was unforgiving, and as they pushed forward, a gust of wind knocked them off balance. The raft tilted sharply, sending Lily scrambling for the edge. \u201cJake!\u201d she screamed, her voice laced with panic as water splashed over the sides. \n\nJake lunged, grabbing her wrist. \u201cI\u2019ve got you! Hold on!\u201d \n\nWith both of them bracing against the raft, Finn steered them back on course, glancing back at the rapidly approaching ship. \u201cThey\u2019re gaining on us!\u201d he warned. \n\nJust as they stabilized, the rain broke loose, drenching them in cold, sharp droplets that stung against their skin. The world around them blurred into a vortex of grey and white, the wind howling like a tempestuous spirit. \n\nThrough the storm, they finally spotted Skull Island ahead\u2014its jagged cliffs looming ominously against the sky. But Bella\u2019s ship was now dangerously close, her crew\u2019s laughter echoing ominously through the chaos.\n\n\u201cNow or never!\u201d Finn shouted, his voice barely rising above the roaring wind. \u201cWe need to beat them to the shore!\u201d \n\nAs they neared the island, Jake felt a surge of adrenaline. He had always wanted to confront danger head-on, but this was more than he had bargained for. \u201cLily, stay close to me!\u201d \n\nThe raft collided with the rocky beach, sending them tumbling forward onto the sand. They scrambled up, breathless but determined, only to see Bella and her crew already disembarking from their sleek vessel. \n\n\u201cWe\u2019ll get the treasure first, you two!\u201d Bella called out, her eyes glinting with mischief. \u201cYou should have stayed home, kids!\u201d \n\nLily felt a surge of fear but quickly quelled it, her imagination igniting. \u201cWe\u2019re not afraid of you, Bella!\u201d she shouted back. \n\nJake exchanged a glance with Finn, who nodded in agreement. They had no choice now but to forge ahead, secrets and treasures waiting to be uncovered. They sprinted toward the tangled underbrush, hearts racing, knowing that the rivalry was only just beginning. \n\nAs they ducked behind a large boulder, panting heavily, Jake felt the weight of uncertainty settle over him. \u201cWhat if we can\u2019t find it in time? What if we fail?\u201d\n\nFinn, reading the doubt in Jake\u2019s eyes, placed a reassuring hand on his shoulder. \u201cJust remember, mate; it\u2019s not just about the treasure. It\u2019s about the adventure we share.\u201d \n\nJust then, the ground beneath them trembled, and a low rumble echoed from the depths of the island. Something ancient stirred beneath their feet, and Jake\u2019s heart raced anew. \n\n\u201cDid you hear that?\u201d Lily whispered, her eyes wide with fear and wonder.\n\nSuddenly, a loud crack split the air, and the earth shook again, sending loose rocks tumbling down the cliffside. \u201cWe need to move\u2014now!\u201d Jake yelled, and they launched forward, knowing the treasure\u2014and perhaps their lives\u2014depended on it.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the primary challenge Jake, Lily, and Finn face as they approach Skull Island?","options":["A fierce storm","A lack of food","Their fear of the dark","Bella's crew"],"correct_answer":"A fierce storm"},{"question":"What does Bella threaten to do when she sees Jake and Lily?","options":["Join them in their adventure","Scare them away","Take the treasure first","Help them find the treasure"],"correct_answer":"Take the treasure first"},{"question":"How does Jake feel as they navigate the stormy seas?","options":["Excited and confident","Nervous and uncertain","Content and relaxed","Angry and frustrated"],"correct_answer":"Nervous and uncertain"},{"question":"What does Finn imply is more important than the treasure?","options":["The location of the island","The journey and adventure","Winning the race","Finding the pirate's crew"],"correct_answer":"The journey and adventure"},{"question":"What significant event occurs as they get closer to Skull Island?","options":["They meet another pirate","The ground trembles","They find a map","They discover a hidden cave"],"correct_answer":"The ground trembles"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_7_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_7_ch3_img1.png","plot_7_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":798,"reading_level":"Challenger"}
