   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_8_7_10","title":"The Crystal Key Chronicles","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Treasure Hunt","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Alex stared at the old box on the table. It was filled with trinkets at the garage sale. His eyes landed on a sparkling crystal key. It shimmered in the sunlight like a tiny rainbow. \n\n\u201cWow! Look at that!\u201d Zoe exclaimed, her voice full of excitement. She was Alex\u2019s cousin and best friend. Zoe was always up for an adventure. Her adventurous spirit made Alex feel brave. \n\n\u201cDo you think it really opens something?\u201d he asked, turning the key in his hand. It felt cool and smooth.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find out!\u201d Zoe jumped up, her brown curls bouncing. \u201cMaybe it\u2019s magic!\u201d\n\nThey rushed to the backyard. Alex\u2019s heart raced. He felt nervous and excited. What if they found something amazing?\n\nIn the backyard, they spotted a strange door hidden behind some bushes. It was old and covered in vines. The door seemed to call to them, whispering secrets of adventure. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s try the key!\u201d Zoe said, her eyes sparkling with mischief. \n\nAlex took a deep breath. \"What if it doesn\u2019t work?\"\n\n\u201cThen we\u2019ll just keep looking,\u201d Zoe said, grinning. \u201cBut it will!\u201d\n\nAlex nodded, feeling a bit braver. He stepped to the door and inserted the key. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] \n\nThe key turned smoothly. The door creaked open, revealing a bright light. It looked like the sun but brighter and more colorful. \n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s that light?\u201d Alex gasped. \n\nZoe jumped through without hesitation. \u201cCome on, Alex! It\u2019s going to be amazing!\u201d\n\nWith a deep breath, Alex followed her into the light. Suddenly, they found themselves in a magical world. Tall trees sparkled with colors he had never seen. Creatures with wings fluttered around them, singing sweet songs.\n\n\u201cThis is incredible!\u201d Zoe squealed, her face filled with wonder.\n\nBefore Alex could respond, a wise-looking fox appeared. \u201cWelcome, young adventurers! I am Ember, the guardian of this realm.\u201d\n\n\u201cGuardian? What do you mean?\u201d asked Alex, still amazed.\n\n\u201cThere is a problem,\u201d Ember said, his eyes serious. \u201cThree magical crystals must be found. A dark sorceress named Malara wants them for herself. You must help protect this world!\u201d\n\nAlex felt a flutter of fear. \u201cBut I\u2019m just a kid! How can I help?\u201d\n\n\u201cTogether you can do anything,\u201d Zoe said, squeezing his hand. \u201cRight, Alex?\u201d\n\nAlex took a deep breath. \u201cOkay! We will help!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nEmber nodded. \u201cThen your adventure begins now. Follow me!\u201d\n\nAs they walked, the colors of the world around them danced and sparkled. Alex felt a new feeling. This was his chance to be brave. \n\nWhat would they find on their quest?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Alex find at the garage sale?","options":["A book","A crystal key","A toy","A map"],"correct_answer":"A crystal key"},{"question":"Who is Zoe?","options":["Alex's sister","Alex's cousin","A neighbor","A teacher"],"correct_answer":"Alex's cousin"},{"question":"What is the name of the wise fox they meet?","options":["Max","Ember","Flick","Sparky"],"correct_answer":"Ember"},{"question":"What do they need to find in the magical world?","options":["Crystals","Coins","Keys","Maps"],"correct_answer":"Crystals"},{"question":"What is the main problem they face?","options":["Finding their way home","Collecting toys","Stopping a sorceress","Finding a treasure"],"correct_answer":"Stopping a sorceress"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_8_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_8_ch1_img1.png","plot_8_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":431,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
