   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_8_7_10","title":"The Crystal Key Chronicles","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Treasure Hunt","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"As the door creaked open, Alex and Zoe stepped into the magical world. They gasped at the sights around them. Bright flowers danced in the breeze, and trees sparkled like diamonds. \"Wow!\" Zoe exclaimed. \"Look at that rainbow!\" \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, Ember, the wise fox, appeared. \u201cWelcome to Crystalia!\u201d she said with a smile. \u201cYou must hurry! Malara is searching for the crystals. We have to find them first!\u201d \n\nAlex felt a knot in his stomach. \u201cWhat if we can\u2019t find them?\u201d he whispered. Zoe nudged him. \u201cDon\u2019t worry, Alex. We can do this together!\u201d\n\nThey walked down a path lined with glowing stones. The sun was bright and warm, but Alex felt the sweat on his forehead. \u201cWhat\u2019s our first challenge?\u201d he asked, trying to sound brave. \n\nEmber stopped and turned her ears toward a giant willow tree. \u201cThe first crystal is guarded by a riddle,\u201d she said. \u201cIt\u2019s in the Temple of Whispers.\u201d\n\n\u201cRiddles?\u201d Alex\u2019s voice trembled. \u201cWhat if I can\u2019t solve it?\u201d\n\n\u201cYou can!\u201d Zoe said, nudging him again. \u201cJust remember, we\u2019re a team.\u201d \n\nAs they approached the temple, the air grew cooler. The grand door was covered in beautiful carvings. \u201cLook!\u201d Zoe pointed at a stone tablet near the entrance. \u201cIt\u2019s the riddle!\u201d\n\nEmber stepped closer. \u201cListen carefully,\u201d she said as the wind rustled the leaves. \u201cI speak without a mouth and hear without ears. I have no body, but I come alive with the wind. What am I?\u201d\n\nZoe jumped up and down. \u201cI know this! It\u2019s\u2026 it\u2019s... an echo!\u201d \n\n\u201cAn echo?\u201d Alex said, feeling unsure. \u201cAre you sure?\u201d\n\n\u201cYes!\u201d Zoe shouted, her eyes shining. \n\nJust then, the door to the temple creaked open. \u201cYou solved it!\u201d Ember said with pride. \u201cLet's go inside!\u201d \n\nBut as they stepped into the dimly lit temple, a cold wind rushed past them. \u201cWatch out!\u201d Ember warned. Suddenly, a shadow loomed in the corner. \n\n\u201cWho dares enter my temple?\u201d a voice boomed. \n\nAlex\u2019s heart raced. \u201cIs that Malara?\u201d he whispered, clinging to Zoe's arm.\n\n\u201cWe must be careful,\u201d Ember said. \u201cStay close!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe shadow moved closer, revealing a tall figure with glowing eyes. \u201cYou will not find the crystal!\u201d it hissed. The air crackled with magic. \n\n\u201cRun!\u201d Zoe yelled. \n\nThey dashed into the temple, the door slamming shut behind them. \u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d Alex panted. \n\n\u201cWe have to find the crystal before she does!\u201d Zoe said, determination in her voice. \n\nAs they explored the dark temple, they could hear Malara\u2019s voice echoing behind them. A new challenge lay ahead.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the first challenge Alex and Zoe face?","options":["A battle with Malara","A riddle at the temple","Finding a hidden path","Crossing a river"],"correct_answer":"A riddle at the temple"},{"question":"What does Zoe believe the answer to the riddle is?","options":["A shadow","An echo","The wind","A whisper"],"correct_answer":"An echo"},{"question":"What does Ember guide Alex and Zoe to find?","options":["A hidden treasure","Three magical crystals","A safe place","A secret door"],"correct_answer":"Three magical crystals"},{"question":"How does Alex feel about the adventure at first?","options":["Excited","Brave","Nervous","Happy"],"correct_answer":"Nervous"},{"question":"What happens when they enter the temple?","options":["They find the crystal","They see Malara's shadow","They make a new friend","They leave the temple"],"correct_answer":"They see Malara's shadow"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_8_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_8_ch2_img1.png","plot_8_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":436,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
