   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_8_7_10","title":"The Crystal Key Chronicles","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Treasure Hunt","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"As the last echoes of the riddle faded, Alex and Zoe stood in the Temple of Whispers. Everything around them shimmered in shades of blue and green. The walls sparkled like the ocean under the sun. \"Look at this place!\" Zoe exclaimed, her eyes wide with wonder. \"It's amazing!\"  \n\nSuddenly, Ember, the wise fox, appeared beside them. \u201cThe first crystal is near, but beware! Malara's shadow lurks close by,\u201d he warned. Alex gulped. \u201cWhat if we can\u2019t find it?\u201d  \n\n\u201cTogether, we can do anything,\u201d Zoe said, giving his shoulder a reassuring squeeze. Alex nodded, feeling a little braver. \u201cLet\u2019s find that crystal!\u201d  \n\nThey wandered deeper into the temple, where the air was cool and filled with whispers. Strange symbols danced on the walls. \u201cWhat do they mean?\u201d Alex asked. Ember tilted his head. \u201cThey tell the story of the guardians. Each crystal has a guardian who will test you.\u201d  \n\n\u201cTest us? What kind of tests?\u201d Zoe asked, her excitement mixed with worry. \u201cClever riddles and challenges,\u201d Ember replied. \u201cIt won\u2019t be easy, but you have the spirit of adventure!\u201d  \n\nJust then, a loud crash echoed through the temple! A heavy stone door slammed shut behind them! \u201cWe\u2019re trapped!\u201d Alex shouted. Panic gripped him. \u201cCalm down!\u201d Zoe said, eyes sparkling with determination. \u201cWe need to solve a riddle to open that door.\u201d  \n\n\u201cListen!\u201d Ember said. \u201cThe riddle is the key.\u201d They all turned to the front of the temple where glowing letters formed a riddle in the air:  \n\n\"I have keys but open no locks. I have space but no room. I have a face but no eyes. What am I?\"  \n\n\u201cThis is it!\u201d Zoe shouted. \u201cIt\u2019s a piano!\u201d  \n\n\u201cNo, wait!\u201d Alex said, his heart racing. \u201cIt\u2019s a computer! Or maybe a keyboard!\u201d  \n\n\u201cThink carefully. We need to choose wisely!\u201d Ember warned. As they debated, the shadows started to swirl around them. Alex felt his heart pound. Would they guess the answer before Malara found them? Suddenly, the ground shook, and the riddle glowed brighter. \u201cMake your choice!\u201d Ember urged.  \n\n\u201cI think it\u2019s a keyboard!\u201d Zoe yelled. Alex took a deep breath. \u201cOkay! A keyboard!\u201d  \n\nThe temple shook again, and the riddle glowed fiercely. Then, just as they thought they would fall, the stone door creaked open. They stumbled outside, gasping for air.  \n\n\u201cWhere\u2019s the crystal?\u201d Alex asked, looking around. Suddenly, Ember pointed. \u201cThere! In the flower garden!\u201d  \n\nThey ran towards a sparkling crystal sitting on a rainbow flower. Just as Zoe reached out, a dark shadow loomed overhead. \u201cStop right there!\u201d a voice boomed.  \n\nIt was Malara! \u201cYou thought you could defeat me?\u201d she sneered, her eyes glinting with malice.  \n\n\u201cRun!\u201d Zoe yelled as she pulled Alex away. They dashed through the flower garden, hearts pounding. But where could they hide? The adventure was far from over, and now the greatest challenge awaited.  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What must Alex and Zoe solve to escape the temple?","options":["A riddle","A puzzle","A mystery","A game"],"correct_answer":"A riddle"},{"question":"What color is the crystal they find?","options":["Red","Blue","Sparkling","Green"],"correct_answer":"Sparkling"},{"question":"Who warns Alex and Zoe about Malara?","options":["The riddle","Ember","The crystal","Zoe"],"correct_answer":"Ember"},{"question":"What is the answer to the riddle?","options":["A piano","A keyboard","A door","A book"],"correct_answer":"A keyboard"},{"question":"What do Alex and Zoe feel when they see Malara?","options":["Excited","Fearful","Happy","Confused"],"correct_answer":"Fearful"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_8_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_8_ch3_img1.png","plot_8_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":485,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
