   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_8_7_10","title":"The Crystal Key Chronicles","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Treasure Hunt","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Alex took a deep breath. The wind rustled the leaves around them. Zoe looked at him with bright eyes. \u201cWhat do you think will happen next, Alex?\u201d she asked.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know,\u201d Alex replied, feeling a little scared. They were standing in front of the Rainbow Glade. It was a beautiful place filled with colorful flowers and twinkling lights. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nEmber, the wise fox, appeared beside them. \u201cYou two are brave adventurers,\u201d she said with a cheerful wink. \u201cThe next crystal is hidden in the Forest of Whispers.\u201d\n\n\u201cThe Forest of Whispers?\u201d Zoe exclaimed. \u201cThat sounds exciting!\u201d\n\n\u201cYes, but be careful,\u201d Ember warned. \u201cMalara has many tricks. You must listen closely to the whispers. They will guide you.\u201d\n\nAlex took another deep breath. \u201cOkay, let\u2019s go!\u201d he said, trying to sound brave. Zoe clapped her hands. \u201cYay! Adventure awaits!\u201d\n\nThey entered the Forest of Whispers. The trees swayed gently, as if they were talking to each other. \u201cCan you hear them?\u201d Zoe asked, her voice full of wonder.\n\n\u201cYeah, but it\u2019s hard to understand,\u201d Alex said. Suddenly, a soft whisper floated by. \u201cHelp us find the crystal. Follow the sparkles.\u201d\n\n\u201cDid you hear that?\u201d Zoe said, her eyes wide. \u201cLet\u2019s follow the sparkles!\u201d\n\nThey ran deeper into the forest. Sparkles danced in front of them, leading the way. But then, a shadow loomed behind them. It was Malara, her eyes glowing with anger.\n\n\u201cGive me the crystal!\u201d she demanded. \u201cYou can\u2019t stop me!\u201d\n\nAlex felt his heart race. \u201cWhat do we do, Zoe?\u201d he whispered.\n\n\u201cStay together!\u201d Zoe shouted. \u201cEmber, help us!\u201d\n\nEmber leaped in front of them. \u201cWe must outsmart her! Remember the whispers!\u201d \n\nWith quick thinking, Alex grabbed a handful of leaves and threw them at Malara. The leaves sparkled and distracted her! \u201cThis way!\u201d Zoe shouted, pointing to a path of vibrant flowers.\n\nThey raced down the path, their hearts pounding. \u201cI can\u2019t believe we did that!\u201d Alex laughed, feeling a spark of courage.\n\n\u201cKeep going! We\u2019re almost there!\u201d Ember cheered as they ran toward the bright glow. \n\nJust ahead, they saw the shimmering crystal resting on a rock. It sparkled like a star! \u201cWe found it!\u201d Zoe shouted, jumping with joy.\n\nAlex felt a rush of excitement. \u201cWe did it together!\u201d\n\nAs they reached for the crystal, a warm light surrounded them. They felt hope and strength fill their hearts. \n\nBut they knew Malara wouldn\u2019t give up easily. What awaited them next?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Where do Alex and Zoe go to find the next crystal?","options":["Rainbow Glade","Temple of Whispers","Forest of Whispers","Crystal Cave"],"correct_answer":"Forest of Whispers"},{"question":"What does Ember tell Alex and Zoe to listen for?","options":["The wind","The whispers","The birds","The flowers"],"correct_answer":"The whispers"},{"question":"How do Alex and Zoe distract Malara?","options":["By running away","By throwing leaves","By shouting loudly","By hiding"],"correct_answer":"By throwing leaves"},{"question":"What do Alex and Zoe find at the end of the chapter?","options":["A treasure chest","A magical crystal","A secret door","A talking animal"],"correct_answer":"A magical crystal"},{"question":"How does Alex feel after they find the crystal?","options":["Scared","Bored","Happy","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Happy"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_8_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_8_ch4_img1.png","plot_8_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":415,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
