   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_8_7_10","title":"The Crystal Key Chronicles","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Treasure Hunt","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Chapter 5: The Crystal of Light\n\nThe sun shone brightly over the Forest of Whispers. Alex and Zoe stood beside Ember, their wise fox friend. \u201cThe Crystal of Light is close,\u201d Ember said, his eyes sparkling with excitement. \u201cWe must be careful. Malara is near.\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s hurry!\u201d Zoe said, her adventurous spirit shining through. Alex nodded, feeling a mix of fear and courage. He took a deep breath. \u201cI can do this,\u201d he whispered to himself.\n\nThey walked deeper into the forest, where the trees seemed to whisper secrets. Suddenly, they came across a glimmering pond. The water sparkled like diamonds. \u201cLook!\u201d Zoe exclaimed, pointing at a shimmering light beneath the surface. It was the Crystal of Light!\n\nBut just as they approached, a shadow darkened the water. It was Malara! \u201cYou will not take the crystal!\u201d she yelled, her voice echoing through the trees. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe ground shook as she raised her hands, summoning swirling winds. \u201cYou are too weak, Alex!\u201d she sneered. But Alex felt a spark of bravery. \u201cI\u2019m not weak!\u201d he shouted back, surprising himself.\n\n\u201cTogether!\u201d Zoe shouted. They held hands, feeling united. Ember nodded, encouraging them. \u201cUse what you\u2019ve learned!\u201d \n\nJust then, a riddle appeared in the air. \u201cWhat shines the brightest when darkness is near?\u201d it asked. Alex thought hard. \u201cIt\u2019s the light!\u201d he cried out. \n\n\u201cCorrect!\u201d boomed the voice. Suddenly, the crystal rose from the pond, glowing fiercely. Malara shrieked in anger. The crystal floated toward Alex and Zoe. \n\n\u201cI can\u2019t believe it!\u201d Zoe gasped, as the crystal sparkled in the sunlight. \u201cWe did it!\u201d\n\n\u201cNo!\u201d Malara screamed, her shadow flickering. \u201cThis isn\u2019t over!\u201d With a flash, she disappeared into thin air.\n\nAlex and Zoe cheered, celebrating their victory. \u201cWe found the Crystal of Light!\u201d Zoe exclaimed, jumping up and down. Ember grinned. \u201cYou both showed great courage and teamwork!\u201d\n\nAs they held the crystal, Alex felt a warm glow in his heart. \u201cI can be brave,\u201d he said proudly. He looked at Zoe and Ember. \u201cWe can do anything together.\u201d\n\nWith their spirits high, they set off to find the last crystal, ready for whatever adventure awaited them next.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Alex and Zoe find in the pond?","options":["A magical fish","The Crystal of Light","A treasure chest","A sleeping dragon"],"correct_answer":"The Crystal of Light"},{"question":"What does Malara try to do when they approach the crystal?","options":["Help them","Take the crystal","Summon swirling winds","Hide the crystal"],"correct_answer":"Summon swirling winds"},{"question":"What riddle do Alex and Zoe solve?","options":["What is the largest animal?","What shines the brightest when darkness is near?","What is your favorite color?","What is the strongest metal?"],"correct_answer":"What shines the brightest when darkness is near?"},{"question":"What feeling does Alex express after getting the Crystal of Light?","options":["Fear","Anger","Bravery","Sadness"],"correct_answer":"Bravery"},{"question":"What do Alex and Zoe do at the end of the chapter?","options":["Give up","Fight Malara","Celebrate their victory","Go home"],"correct_answer":"Celebrate their victory"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_8_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_8_ch5_img1.png","plot_8_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":363,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
