   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_8_11_14","title":"The Crystal Key Chronicles","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Treasure Hunt","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Alex took a deep breath, his heart racing like a wild stallion. The vibrant colors of the new world stretched out before him, brighter than any crayon in his box. Zoe stood beside him, her eyes gleaming with excitement. \u201cThis is amazing, Alex! Just look at those trees! They look like they\u2019ve been painted by a rainbow!\u201d \n\nAs they walked forward, the ground felt soft and springy beneath their feet, like walking on a plush carpet. The air was filled with the sweet scent of blooming flowers, and Alex couldn\u2019t help but smile. For a moment, all his worries faded away. But then, he remembered the mission ahead of them.\n\n\u201cEmber said we need to find the first crystal,\u201d Alex said, his voice barely above a whisper. \u201cBut how do we know where to look?\u201d \n\nJust then, a rustling sound came from the bushes nearby. Zoe\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cMaybe it\u2019s a guardian!\u201d \n\nBefore Alex could respond, a small, clever-looking fox emerged from the foliage. Its fur shimmered in the sunlight, and its eyes sparkled with knowledge. \u201cGreetings, young adventurers!\u201d it said with a voice that was warm and welcoming. \u201cI am Ember, your guide in this realm. To find the first crystal, you must solve a riddle.\u201d\n\nAlex felt a mixture of excitement and fear. Riddles were tricky, and he wasn\u2019t sure he was ready for this challenge. \u201cWhat if we can\u2019t solve it?\u201d he asked, shifting his weight nervously.\n\nEmber tilted its head, a hint of a smile playing on its lips. \u201cFear not, young one. You have your cousin by your side. Together, you can conquer anything.\u201d \n\nZoe nudged Alex playfully. \u201cSee? We\u2019re a team! Let\u2019s hear the riddle!\u201d\n\nEmber cleared its throat. \u201cTo find the crystal you seek, answer this truth\u2014What has roots as nobody sees, is taller than trees, up, up it goes, and yet never grows?\u201d \n\nAlex felt his stomach twist. He knew this riddle. His father had told it to him once. But could he get it right? His mind raced, but all he could think of was how much he wanted to impress Zoe. \n\n\u201cUm, a mountain?\u201d Zoe offered, her brow furrowing in thought. \n\nEmber shook its head gently. \u201cClose, but not quite. Think deeper. What grows tall without growing at all?\u201d \n\nAlex closed his eyes, letting the words play in his mind like a soothing melody. \u201cI know!\u201d he exclaimed suddenly, his face lighting up. \u201cIt\u2019s a tree! Trees have roots, and they grow tall!\u201d \n\n\u201cCorrect!\u201d Ember said, its eyes shining with approval. \u201cYou have unlocked the first clue!\u201d\n\nBut before they could celebrate, a dark shadow loomed overhead, chilling Alex to his core. He looked up to see a figure gliding through the sky\u2014a woman draped in dark, swirling robes, her eyes burning with malice. \u201cYou think you can disturb my plans?\u201d she cackled, her voice echoing like thunder.\n\n\u201cWho is that?\u201d Alex whispered, fear gripping his heart.\n\n\u201cMalara,\u201d Ember said, its voice tense. \u201cShe seeks the crystals for herself. We must hurry!\u201d\n\nZoe took Alex\u2019s hand tightly. \u201cWe can do this, Alex. We\u2019re in this together!\u201d \n\nAs they sprinted through the vibrant landscape, Alex felt a surge of determination. Together, they could face anything\u2014even a sorceress.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1: A colorful, vibrant landscape filled with unusual trees and flowers. Zoe, an adventurous girl with bright clothes, stands with her hands on her hips, looking excited. Alex, a shy boy with tousled hair, stands beside her, gazing in awe at the magical realm. In the background, the wise fox Ember is visible, its fur shimmering in the sunlight.]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2: The dark figure of Malara, a menacing sorceress with swirling black robes, hovers above the colorful landscape. Her eyes glow red with anger, and her long hair flows like smoke in the wind. Alex and Zoe are shown at the bottom of the image, looking up in fear, but also with a glimmer of bravery in their eyes.]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What must Alex and Zoe solve to find the first crystal?","options":["A puzzle","A riddle","A map","A clue"],"correct_answer":"A riddle"},{"question":"Who is Ember?","options":["A sorceress","Their guide","A magical creature","A tree spirit"],"correct_answer":"Their guide"},{"question":"What is Malara's intention regarding the crystals?","options":["To protect them","To destroy them","To keep them safe","To take them for herself"],"correct_answer":"To take them for herself"},{"question":"How does Alex feel about solving the riddle?","options":["Excited and confident","Nervous and unsure","Angry and frustrated","Bored and uninterested"],"correct_answer":"Nervous and unsure"},{"question":"What does Zoe encourage Alex to embrace?","options":["His fear","Their teamwork","His anger","His shyness"],"correct_answer":"Their teamwork"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_8_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_8_ch2_img1.png","plot_8_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":674,"reading_level":"Builder"}
