   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_8_11_14","title":"The Crystal Key Chronicles","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Treasure Hunt","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Alex stood frozen, his heart pounding like a drum as he faced the towering entrance of the Ancients' Temple. The air shimmered with magic, a soft glow pulsating from the ornate carvings that spiraled up the ancient stone pillars. Zoe, her eyes shining with excitement, nudged him gently. \"Come on, Alex! This is where the first crystal is supposed to be. We can\u2019t turn back now!\"\n\nTaking a deep breath, Alex stepped forward, his fingers brushing against the rough stone. \"What if Malara is already here?\" he whispered, the fear creeping back into his voice. \n\nEmber, the wise fox, emerged from the shadows, his tail flickering with energy. \"Courage, young one. The crystal you seek is guarded by the Spirit of Riddles. Only by answering its question may you pass. But beware, it will test your heart as well as your mind.\" \n\nThey entered the temple, the darkness enveloping them like a thick fog. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] The vibrant murals depicting mythical creatures and past heroes glowed dimly, casting eerie shadows across the walls. Alex felt a swirl of emotions\u2014nervousness, excitement, and a hint of determination. He glanced at Zoe, who was already gazing at the ceiling in wonder, her adventurous spirit unshaken.\n\nAs they ventured deeper, the air grew colder, and they reached a grand chamber lit by glowing crystals embedded in the walls. In the center stood a majestic figure\u2014a tall, robed being with eyes like sapphires, shimmering with ancient wisdom. \"Welcome, seekers,\" it said, its voice echoing softly. \"To claim the crystal, you must answer my riddle.\"\n\nZoe stepped forward enthusiastically. \"We\u2019re ready!\" \n\nThe Spirit's eyes sparkled mischievously. \"Very well. Listen carefully: I can fly without wings. I can cry without eyes. Whenever I go, darkness flies. What am I?\"\n\nAlex felt a surge of panic. He glanced at Zoe, who was already deep in thought. \"Maybe it\u2019s a bird?\" she ventured. \n\n\"Or a cloud?\" Alex added hesitantly, trying to push through his doubts. \n\nThe Spirit raised an eyebrow, the tension thickening in the air. \"You have but a moment left to answer, or face the consequences!\" \n\nSuddenly, a chilling wind swept through the chamber, and the crystals flickered ominously. Alex's heart raced. \"Light!\" he shouted, surprising himself. \u201cIt\u2019s light! It can travel without wings and can disappear into darkness.\u201d\n\nThe Spirit smiled, and with a wave of its hand, the chamber brightened. \"Correct! You may now claim the crystal.\" A pedestal emerged from the ground, revealing a sparkling blue crystal that pulsed with energy. \n\nBut just as Alex reached for it, the walls trembled. Malara's laughter echoed around them, dark and menacing. \"You think you can outsmart me, little boy? I will take the crystal, and your little adventure will end here!\" \n\nThe chamber began to collapse, rocks tumbling from above. Alex\u2019s heart sank as he realized they had to escape. \"Zoe, we need to go, now!\" he shouted, panic lacing his words. \n\nAs they raced towards the exit, the path behind them crumbled. \"What about the crystal?\" Zoe cried, glancing back. \n\n\u201cThere will be other crystals! We have to focus on getting out!\u201d Alex shouted, his voice rising above the chaos. \n\nJust then, a massive stone fell, blocking their escape. Desperate, Alex looked around. He noticed a shimmering portal at the far end of the chamber, glowing brighter than anything they had seen before. \"That way!\" he yelled, pointing towards the portal.\n\nWith Malara\u2019s icy laughter ringing in their ears, they sprinted toward the light, hope burning in their chests. \"Jump!\" Zoe shouted as they reached the edge. \n\nThe world around them blurred as they leaped into the brightness, unsure of where it would take them.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the riddle that the Spirit of Riddles gives to Alex and Zoe?","options":["What can fly without wings?","What is cold as ice?","What is brighter than the sun?","What can swim without fins?"],"correct_answer":"What can fly without wings?"},{"question":"What happens when Alex answers the riddle correctly?","options":["They are trapped forever","They receive the crystal","Malara appears","The temple crumbles"],"correct_answer":"They receive the crystal"},{"question":"Who threatens Alex and Zoe in the temple?","options":["Ember","The Spirit of Riddles","Malara","A dragon"],"correct_answer":"Malara"},{"question":"What do Alex and Zoe discover as they try to escape the temple?","options":["A hidden treasure","An evil spell","A collapsing structure","A new friend"],"correct_answer":"A collapsing structure"},{"question":"What do Alex and Zoe decide to do in the face of danger?","options":["Fight Malara","Run towards a portal","Stay and solve another riddle","Call for help"],"correct_answer":"Run towards a portal"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_8_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_8_ch3_img1.png","plot_8_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":618,"reading_level":"Builder"}
