   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_9_7_10","title":"Hidden Treasures of Harmony Hill","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Treasure Hunt","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"The sun shone brightly over Harmony Hill. It was a hill like no other. Flowers bloomed in every color, and birds sang cheerful songs. Sophie, Leo, Emma, and Max stood at the bottom of the hill, their eyes sparkling with excitement.\n\n\u201cLook at that view!\u201d Sophie exclaimed, pointing up the hill. \u201cImagine what treasures are hidden beneath it!\u201d\n\n\u201cI\u2019ve heard the legend,\u201d Leo said, pulling out his tablet. \u201cIt says there are treasures buried deep below.\u201d\n\n\u201cLike gold?\u201d Emma asked, her eyes wide. She loved drawing treasure maps. \n\n\u201cOr maybe jewels!\u201d Max added, feeling a bit shy. He had just moved to town. \n\nSophie smiled warmly at him. \u201cTogether, we can find the treasure! We can use our skills.\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s split into teams,\u201d Sophie suggested. \u201cLeo, you can use your tech skills to search for clues. Emma, you can draw a map. Max and I will dig!\u201d\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know if I\u2019m good enough,\u201d Max whispered, looking down.\n\n\u201cYou are part of our team!\u201d Sophie said, patting his back. \u201cWe\u2019ll help each other.\u201d\n\nThey climbed the hill, giggling and chatting. But as they reached the top, they saw a group of older kids laughing at them.\n\n\u201cWhat are those little kids doing?\u201d one of them sneered.\n\nSophie felt her heart race. \u201cThey think we can't find the treasure!\u201d she whispered.\n\n\u201cWe will show them!\u201d Leo said, his face glowing with determination.\n\nSuddenly, they spotted a strange rock formation. \u201cLook!\u201d Emma shouted. \u201cThat could be a clue!\u201d\n\nMax grinned, finally feeling like he belonged. \u201cLet\u2019s check it out!\u201d \n\nAs they rushed over, they found something shiny peeking out from the dirt.\n\n\u201cIs it treasure?\u201d Emma gasped, her hands trembling with excitement.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nSophie knelt down and brushed off the dirt. \u201cIt looks like a box!\u201d she exclaimed. \n\n\u201cWhat if it\u2019s empty?\u201d Leo said with a frown. \u201cWhat if it\u2019s just a trick?\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s open it!\u201d Max shouted, his heart pounding.\n\nThis was just the beginning of their adventure, and they were all ready to dive in. What treasures awaited them? \n\nThe greatest treasure might just be the friendships they built along the way.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do the friends want to find under Harmony Hill?","options":["Food","Treasure","Animals","Books"],"correct_answer":"Treasure"},{"question":"Who is the leader of the group?","options":["Emma","Max","Leo","Sophie"],"correct_answer":"Sophie"},{"question":"What does Leo use to help find clues?","options":["A map","A shovel","A tablet","A flashlight"],"correct_answer":"A tablet"},{"question":"How does Max feel at the beginning of the story?","options":["Excited","Shy","Angry","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Shy"},{"question":"What do they find at the top of the hill?","options":["A cave","A box","A tree","A river"],"correct_answer":"A box"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_9_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_9_ch1_img1.png","plot_9_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":364,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
