   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_9_7_10","title":"Hidden Treasures of Harmony Hill","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Treasure Hunt","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"As the sun rose over Harmony Hill, the friends gathered at their favorite spot. The hill was green and covered in vibrant wildflowers. Sophie looked around excitedly. \u201cOkay team, let\u2019s see what\u2019s in this box!\u201d she said, holding up the mysterious box they had found.\n\n\u201cDo you think it really has treasure?\u201d Max asked, his voice a little shaky. He still felt nervous about being the new kid.\n\n\u201cOnly one way to find out!\u201d Leo replied, adjusting his glasses. He loved technology and gadgets. \u201cLet\u2019s see if my scanner can help!\u201d\n\nEmma smiled. \u201cI can decorate it with some cool drawings if we find something awesome!\u201d She loved to create things. \n\nThey gathered around as Leo pulled out his scanner. \u201cLet\u2019s see if we can unlock it,\u201d he said with a grin. He pressed buttons and the scanner beeped. Suddenly, there was a loud click!\n\nEmma gasped. \u201cDid it work?\u201d \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find out!\u201d Sophie said, lifting the lid. Inside, they found a map! It was old, with faded lines and mysterious symbols. \u201cLook! This might lead us to the treasure!\u201d Sophie exclaimed. \n\nJust then, they heard laughter nearby. Three older kids came toward them, smirking. \u201cWhat are you losers doing?\u201d one of them sneered. \n\n\u201cWe\u2019re searching for treasure!\u201d Max said, standing tall beside his friends. \n\n\u201cYeah, right! You can\u2019t even figure out a simple map.\u201d One of the older kids snatched the map from Sophie\u2019s hands. \u201cLet\u2019s see how good you really are!\u201d \n\n\u201cHey! Give that back!\u201d Leo shouted as the older kid waved the map in the air. \n\nSophie felt her heart race. \u201cWe need to get it back!\u201d she said, worried. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s work together!\u201d Emma suggested. \n\nMax took a deep breath. \u201cI might have an idea.\u201d He picked up a stick from the ground and drew some quick arrows in the dirt. \u201cWe can distract them. Leo, you grab the map while they are confused!\u201d\n\n\u201cGreat idea!\u201d Sophie nodded. \n\nAs they began to execute their plan, they felt a surge of teamwork. Would they get the map back? Would they find the treasure? They pushed forward, ready for the challenge. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do the friends find inside the mysterious box?","options":["A treasure chest","A map","A toy","A key"],"correct_answer":"A map"},{"question":"What do the older kids do when they see the friends?","options":["Help them","Steal the map","Ignore them","Join them"],"correct_answer":"Steal the map"},{"question":"What does Max suggest they do?","options":["Give up","Run away","Work together","Tell an adult"],"correct_answer":"Work together"},{"question":"How does Emma plan to help the group?","options":["By drawing","By running fast","By climbing a tree","By yelling"],"correct_answer":"By drawing"},{"question":"What feeling does Sophie have when the map is taken?","options":["Happy","Worried","Excited","Confused"],"correct_answer":"Worried"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_9_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_9_ch2_img1.png","plot_9_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":366,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
