       [DEBUG] Checking shared image: {"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dimly lit cave with Max at the center, wide-eyed and breathless, surrounded by glimmers of hidden treasures. The shadows dance ominously around him, contrasting the glint of metallic objects scattered on the ground. The cave walls are etched with ancient symbols, hinting at the secrets waiting to be uncovered, creating a sense of both wonder and trepidation.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_9_ch3_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:23:04"}
