   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_9_7_10","title":"Hidden Treasures of Harmony Hill","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Treasure Hunt","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Sophie gathered her friends near the towering oak tree at Harmony Hill. \"Okay, team, let\u2019s look at this map!\" she said, her eyes sparkling with excitement. Leo held up a flashlight, ready to shine some light on the hidden clues.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nEmma, with her sketchbook, added fun doodles to the map. \u201cThis place looks magical!\u201d she exclaimed. Max, feeling a bit nervous, wanted to help. \u201cWhat should I do?\u201d he asked, glancing at the others.\n\n\u201cJust follow along! We need all hands on deck!\u201d Sophie encouraged, smiling at him.\n\nAs they studied the map, they noticed a strange symbol near a cave. \u201cThat must be where we need to go!\u201d Leo pointed out. \u201cLet\u2019s hurry before the older kids come back!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, the sound of laughter echoed through the trees. The older kids had returned, and they looked ready to cause trouble. Max felt his stomach twist. \u201cWhat if they try to stop us again?\u201d he worried, fidgeting with his backpack.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s not let them!\u201d Sophie said firmly. \u201cWe need to stick together, no matter what.\u201d \n\nAs they approached the cave, they spotted the older kids blocking the entrance. \u201cWhat do you want, little kids?\u201d sneered Jake, the ringleader. \u201cYou think you can find treasure? Ha!\u201d\n\n\u201cWe can!\u201d Emma shouted back, her fists clenched. \u201cAnd we will!\u201d But deep down, she was scared.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s show them what we can do!\u201d Leo whispered to Sophie and Max. They nodded, determined to prove Jake wrong. \n\nSophie took a deep breath and stepped forward. \u201cWe have a map, and we\u2019re not afraid of you!\u201d she declared. \n\nJust then, a shadow shifted behind the rocks. A mysterious figure emerged. \u201cWhat\u2019s going on here?\u201d a soft voice asked, surprising everyone. \n\nThe figure was an old woman with a kind smile. \u201cI know about the treasures of Harmony Hill,\u201d she said. \u201cBut it\u2019s not what you think. Are you all ready for a true adventure?\u201d \n\nThe friends exchanged glances, excitement bubbling inside them. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cOf course!\u201d Sophie replied, feeling bold. \u201cWhat do we need to do?\u201d\n\nThe old woman smiled wider. \u201cFirst, you must learn to trust each other completely. The treasure is hidden not only in gold but in the choices you make as friends.\u201d\n\nJust then, a loud crash sounded from the direction of the other kids. \u201cThey won\u2019t let us go that easy!\u201d Max cried.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s work together!\u201d Sophie said. \u201cWe can\u2019t let them ruin this!\u201d\n\nWith hearts racing, the friends prepared to face the challenge ahead. Would they find the treasure? And what surprises awaited them in the cave? \n\nThe adventure was just beginning!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Sophie and her friends find at the oak tree?","options":["A treasure chest","A map","An animal","A picnic"],"correct_answer":"A map"},{"question":"Who is the ringleader of the older kids?","options":["Max","Leo","Jake","Emma"],"correct_answer":"Jake"},{"question":"What important lesson does the old woman teach the friends?","options":["To find gold","To play alone","To trust each other","To be quiet"],"correct_answer":"To trust each other"},{"question":"What do the friends do when they see the old woman?","options":["Run away","Ignore her","Listen to her","Laugh at her"],"correct_answer":"Listen to her"},{"question":"What happens at the end of the chapter?","options":["They find the treasure","They go home","They face a challenge","They give up"],"correct_answer":"They face a challenge"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_9_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_9_ch3_img1.png","plot_9_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":444,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
