   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_9_7_10","title":"Hidden Treasures of Harmony Hill","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Treasure Hunt","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Sophie, Leo, Emma, and Max stood at the cave entrance. The air was cool and filled with the sweet scent of wildflowers. Sunlight danced on the cave walls, making them sparkle like stars. \n\n\"Are you all ready?\" Sophie asked, her voice steady and brave. \n\nLeo adjusted his glasses. \"I\u2019m ready! I can use my flashlight to see inside!\" \n\nEmma smiled, clutching her sketchbook. \"I can draw what we find!\" \n\nMax took a deep breath. He still felt nervous. \"What if the older kids find us again?\" \n\nSophie nodded. \"We stick together. We are a team!\" \n\nThey entered the cave, excitement buzzing in the air. The walls were rough and cool under their hands. Little flickers of light bounced around like fireflies. \n\nAs they moved deeper, they came across strange carvings on the wall. \"Wow! Look at this!\" Emma exclaimed, pointing at a drawing of a treasure chest. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cThose carvings must be clues!\u201d Leo said. \u201cWe should take a picture.\u201d \n\nMax felt a spark of courage. \"Let me help!\" He stepped forward, holding the flashlight while Leo took the photo. \n\nSuddenly, they heard loud voices. The older kids were outside the cave! \u201cThey are looking for us!\u201d Max whispered, his heart racing. \n\nSophie thought fast. \u201cWe can\u2019t let them scare us away! We need to find the treasure first!\u201d \n\nThey hurried deeper into the cave, the voices growing fainter behind them. The walls narrowed, and then they spotted a small glowing light ahead. \n\n\u201cThere it is!\u201d Sophie shouted. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d \n\nThey ran towards the light and gasped. Before them was a brilliant cave filled with shimmering crystals and gold coins. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nMax couldn\u2019t believe his eyes. \u201cThis is amazing!\u201d \n\n\u201cLook at all this treasure!\u201d Emma cheered, her eyes wide with wonder. \n\nSophie laughed. \u201cWe did it, team! We found the treasure!\u201d \n\nBut then they heard the older kids laughing outside. They must have been trying to trick them again. \u201cWe can\u2019t let them ruin this moment,\u201d Leo said. \n\nSophie took a deep breath. \u201cLet\u2019s take some coins and head back. We\u2019ll show them that teamwork is more powerful than tricks!\u201d \n\nAs they filled their pockets with coins, Max smiled. He felt like he truly belonged. \n\n\u201cTogether, we are unstoppable!\u201d Sophie declared. \n\nAnd with that, they raced back through the cave, ready to share their treasure and their victory with everyone.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do the friends discover in the cave?","options":["A treasure chest","A secret map","A hidden door","A scary monster"],"correct_answer":"A treasure chest"},{"question":"What skill does Leo use in the cave?","options":["Drawing","Building","Photography","Inventing"],"correct_answer":"Photography"},{"question":"How does Max feel at the beginning of the chapter?","options":["Excited","Nervous","Angry","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Nervous"},{"question":"What do the friends decide to do when they find the treasure?","options":["Leave the cave","Fill their pockets and leave","Hide the treasure","Fight the older kids"],"correct_answer":"Fill their pockets and leave"},{"question":"What message does Sophie share at the end?","options":["Money is everything","Teamwork makes us stronger","Running away is the best choice","Treasure is only gold"],"correct_answer":"Teamwork makes us stronger"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_9_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_9_ch5_img1.png","plot_9_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":399,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
