   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_10_7_10","title":"The Time Traveler's Treasure","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Treasure Hunt","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Nate loved adventures. He dreamed of exploring new places, meeting new friends. One sunny afternoon, he found an old watch in his attic. It was dusty and strange. The watch had big, shiny buttons and a bright blue face.\n\n\"What a cool watch!\" Nate said. He slipped it onto his wrist. Suddenly, a tick-tock sound filled the room. The watch began to glow! \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nNate felt dizzy. The world around him spun like a merry-go-round. When the spinning stopped, he looked around. He was no longer in his attic. Instead, he stood in a bustling marketplace filled with colorful tents and people wearing funny clothes.\n\n\"Where am I?\" Nate wondered aloud. A girl with a long, flowing dress approached him. She had bright eyes and a friendly smile. \n\n\"Welcome to the Renaissance!\" she exclaimed. \"I'm Clara! Are you lost?\"\n\nNate nodded, amazed. \"I think I found this watch, and it took me here!\"\n\nClara's eyes widened. \"A time-traveling watch? That sounds exciting! You must help me. I need to find a treasure hidden somewhere in this city!\"\n\n\"Treasure?\" Nate\u2019s heart raced. \"I\u2019m in! But there might be trouble too.\"\n\nJust then, a shadowy figure lurked nearby. It was a tall man with a sly grin. Nate felt a chill. \n\n\"Who is that?\" he asked Clara.\n\n\"That's Vex,\" she whispered. \"He wants the treasure for himself. We must hurry!\"\n\nClara grabbed Nate's hand. \"Let\u2019s go before he sees us!\"\n\nThey dashed through the busy streets, ducking and weaving. Nate's heart pounded. He could hear Vex's footsteps behind them. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\"Keep running!\" Clara urged. They zigzagged around stalls selling shiny trinkets and colorful fabrics. Nate could see the glint of something shiny in the distance. Was it the treasure?\n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Nate shouted. \u201cThis way!\u201d\n\nBut Vex was close behind. They had to find the treasure before he did. \n\nNate took a deep breath. \u201cLet\u2019s do this!\u201d\n\nClara nodded. They raced ahead, ready for their adventure.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Nate find in his attic?","options":["A treasure map","An old watch","A toy","A book"],"correct_answer":"An old watch"},{"question":"Who does Nate meet in the Renaissance?","options":["Leo","Vex","Clara","A pirate"],"correct_answer":"Clara"},{"question":"What does Vex want?","options":["To help Nate","To find a treasure","To play a game","To go home"],"correct_answer":"To find a treasure"},{"question":"What happens when Nate puts on the watch?","options":["He travels to the future","He finds a treasure","He feels dizzy","He meets a wizard"],"correct_answer":"He feels dizzy"},{"question":"What do Nate and Clara need to do?","options":["Make a cake","Build a robot","Find the treasure","Escape from school"],"correct_answer":"Find the treasure"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_10_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_10_ch1_img1.png","plot_10_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":329,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
