   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_10_7_10","title":"The Time Traveler's Treasure","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Treasure Hunt","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Nate felt the morning sun warm his face. He stood in the middle of a busy market. People shouted and laughed around him. Colorful banners flew in the breeze. He turned to Clara. \"This is amazing! Look at all the food!\" \n\nClara smiled. \"Yes! But we need to focus on the treasure.\" She pointed to a map she held. \"It says the treasure is hidden in the castle.\"\n\nNate's eyes widened. \"A castle? Let's go!\" They started walking. Suddenly, Clara stopped. \"Wait! We must be careful. Vex could be around.\"\n\n\"Who is Vex?\" Nate asked, feeling a shiver of worry. Clara bit her lip. \"He's a time thief. He wants the treasure for himself.\"\n\nNate gulped. \"Then we need to be quick!\" They hurried through the market, weaving between stalls filled with fruits and spices. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAfter a short walk, they reached the castle. It loomed above them, tall and grand. Clara looked up, her face full of determination. \"We have to find a way inside.\"\n\nJust then, a shadow passed over them. Nate looked up and gasped. \"It's Vex!\" The time thief stood on the castle wall, grinning down at them.\n\n\"You can't escape me!\" he shouted. \"The treasure is mine!\" \n\nNate felt his heart race. \"What do we do?\" he asked.\n\nClara thought quickly. \"We have to distract him!\" She grabbed a nearby fruit and tossed it high into the air. The shiny apple flew up, catching Vex's eye.\n\n\u201cHey!\u201d Vex shouted, reaching for the apple. For a moment, Nate and Clara had the chance to slip inside the castle.\n\nThey dashed through the wide castle doors. Inside, it was dark and dusty. They could hear Vex's footsteps behind them. \"Hurry!\" Clara urged.\n\nNate wanted to peek, but he held Clara's hand tightly. \"We need to find the treasure before Vex does!\" \n\nSuddenly, they saw a glimmer of light ahead. \"Look!\" Nate pointed. \"It must be the treasure!\" \n\nBut as they rushed forward, a loud clang echoed behind them. The door slammed shut! \n\nNate and Clara exchanged worried glances. \"What now?\" Nate said, feeling nervous. They would have to find another way out, all while racing against Vex.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Nate and Clara want to find?","options":["A map","Treasure","A watch","A friend"],"correct_answer":"Treasure"},{"question":"Who is the time thief?","options":["Leo","Clara","Nate","Vex"],"correct_answer":"Vex"},{"question":"What did Clara throw to distract Vex?","options":["A rock","An apple","A piece of bread","A toy"],"correct_answer":"An apple"},{"question":"What happens when Nate and Clara enter the castle?","options":["They find the treasure","The door slams shut","They meet Vex","They see a dragon"],"correct_answer":"The door slams shut"},{"question":"What is Nate feeling when Vex appears?","options":["Excited","Nervous","Happy","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Nervous"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_10_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_10_ch2_img1.png","plot_10_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":361,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
