   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_10_7_10","title":"The Time Traveler's Treasure","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Treasure Hunt","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Nate and Clara stood in front of the grand castle. Its tall towers reached the sky. Beautiful banners waved in the wind. \u201cThis is where we\u2019ll find the treasure!\u201d Clara exclaimed, her eyes sparkling with excitement.\n\nNate nodded. \u201cBut we must be careful. Vex could be anywhere.\u201d\n\nThey tiptoed through the castle gate. Inside, the air was cool and smelled like old books. Shadows danced on the stone walls. Suddenly, a loud clang echoed through the hall. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Nate whispered.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know! Let\u2019s hide!\u201d Clara replied. They ducked behind a large tapestry. As they peered out, they saw Vex, the time thief, pacing back and forth.\n\n\u201cI must find that treasure before they do!\u201d Vex grumbled, rubbing his hands together. \u201cNo one will stop me!\u201d\n\nNate\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWe have to beat him. But how?\u201d He looked around and noticed a staircase leading up. \u201cThat way! Let\u2019s go!\u201d\n\nClara nodded, her face serious. \u201cStay quiet!\u201d They climbed the creaky stairs, each step feeling like a race against time. \n\nAs they reached the top, they found a door with a golden lock. \u201cThe treasure must be behind here!\u201d Nate said eagerly. But the lock looked complicated.\n\n\u201cI can try to pick it!\u201d Clara said confidently. She pulled out a small pin from her pocket. Just as she started to work on the lock, a loud crash came from below. Vex was coming!\n\n\u201cOh no! Hurry, Clara!\u201d Nate shouted, his voice filled with urgency. He could hear Vex's footsteps growing louder. \n\nWith shaking hands, Clara twisted the pin. The lock clicked! The door creaked open, revealing a shining room filled with golden treasures and ancient scrolls. \n\n\u201cWow!\u201d Nate gasped, stepping inside. But just then, they heard Vex yelling, \u201cYou won\u2019t get away with this!\u201d\n\nNate and Clara turned. Vex was at the bottom of the stairs, staring up at them with fiery eyes. \u201cHand over the treasure!\u201d he demanded.\n\nNate swallowed hard. \u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d \n\nClara looked around, her mind racing. \u201cWe have to make a choice! Do we fight back or try to escape?\u201d \n\nNate felt the weight of the moment. The treasure sparkled before him, but danger lurked behind. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Nate and Clara find at the top of the stairs?","options":["A secret door","Vex's treasure","A scary monster","A treasure map"],"correct_answer":"A secret door"},{"question":"What does Vex want to do?","options":["Help Nate and Clara","Take the treasure for himself","Leave the castle","Become friends"],"correct_answer":"Take the treasure for himself"},{"question":"What does Clara use to unlock the door?","options":["A key","A pin","A sword","A magic spell"],"correct_answer":"A pin"},{"question":"How does Nate feel when he hears Vex's footsteps?","options":["Excited","Happy","Nervous","Sleepy"],"correct_answer":"Nervous"},{"question":"What choice do Nate and Clara have to make?","options":["Fight or escape","Split up","Call for help","Hide forever"],"correct_answer":"Fight or escape"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_10_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_10_ch3_img1.png","plot_10_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":374,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
