   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_10_7_10","title":"The Time Traveler's Treasure","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Treasure Hunt","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Nate and Clara stepped into the grand castle. The walls were tall and covered in colorful tapestries. \u201cThis place is amazing!\u201d Nate exclaimed. \n\n\u201cIt\u2019s even better inside!\u201d Clara grinned. \u201cWe need to find the treasure room quickly!\u201d\n\nThey walked down a long hallway. The floor creaked under their feet. Suddenly, they heard a noise! \u201cDid you hear that?\u201d Nate whispered, peering around the corner.\n\n\u201cYes! It sounds like Vex!\u201d Clara replied, her eyes wide. They quickly ducked behind a statue of a knight. \n\nVex walked by, his eyes darting around. \u201cI know you\u2019re here, Nate!\u201d he shouted, his voice echoing. \u201cYou can\u2019t hide from me forever!\u201d \n\nNate and Clara held their breaths. They had to think of a plan. \u201cWhat if we trick him?\u201d Nate suggested. \u201cWe could lure him away from the treasure room!\u201d\n\nClara nodded. \u201cThat could work! Let\u2019s make some noise over there,\u201d she said, pointing to a pile of armor. \u201cIt might distract him!\u201d\n\nThey crept over to the armor. Nate picked up a helmet. He tossed it across the hall. It clanged loudly on the stone floor. \n\nVex turned sharply. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d he yelled, running towards the sound. \n\n\u201cNow\u2019s our chance!\u201d Clara said, and they sprinted down the hall. They reached a heavy door marked \u2018Treasure Room.\u2019 \n\n\u201cCan you open it?\u201d Nate asked. Clara examined the lock. \u201cI think so! I just need a minute.\u201d \n\nNate glanced back nervously. \u201cHurry!\u201d he urged. Just then, Vex shouted again. \u201cYou can\u2019t escape!\u201d \n\nClara focused on the lock. \u201cAlmost there!\u201d she said. With a final twist, the door clicked open! \n\nThey rushed inside and gasped. Gold coins sparkled like stars in the dim light. \u201cWe found it!\u201d Nate cheered, but Clara\u2019s eyes were wide with worry. \n\n\u201cVex will be here any moment! We need to grab some coins and go!\u201d \n\nSuddenly, the door creaked open. Vex stood in the doorway, a wicked smile on his face. \u201cThought you could get away that easily?\u201d he sneered. \n\nNate and Clara exchanged a frightened glance. They had to think fast. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s grab the treasure and run!\u201d Nate shouted. \n\nThey each picked up a handful of coins. But just as they turned to escape, Vex lunged for them! \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cRun!\u201d Clara yelled as they dashed past Vex. He stumbled, trying to catch them, but they were too quick. \n\nOutside the castle, they breathed a sigh of relief. \u201cWe did it!\u201d Nate said, holding his treasure tightly. \n\nBut they still had to get away from Vex. \u201cWe need to find a way to stop him once and for all,\u201d Clara said, determination in her voice. \n\nNate nodded. \u201cWe\u2019ll figure it out together!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith hope in their hearts, they looked at the wristwatch. It glimmered, ready for their next adventure. \n\n\u201cWhere to next?\u201d Nate asked. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find Leo!\u201d Clara replied. \u201cHe might have a plan to defeat Vex!\u201d","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Nate and Clara find inside the treasure room?","options":["A giant dragon","Gold coins","A magic sword","A treasure map"],"correct_answer":"Gold coins"},{"question":"What does Vex shout when he enters the treasure room?","options":["You can't escape!","I love treasure!","I'm here to help!","Where's the treasure?"],"correct_answer":"You can't escape!"},{"question":"What plan do Nate and Clara come up with to distract Vex?","options":["Making noise with armor","Hiding behind a statue","Throwing coins","Drawing a picture"],"correct_answer":"Making noise with armor"},{"question":"Who do Nate and Clara plan to find next?","options":["Leo","A dragon","A knight","Vex"],"correct_answer":"Leo"},{"question":"What do Nate and Clara feel when they escape the treasure room?","options":["Panic","Relief","Boredom","Sadness"],"correct_answer":"Relief"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_10_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_10_ch4_img1.png","plot_10_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":488,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
