   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_10_7_10","title":"The Time Traveler's Treasure","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Treasure Hunt","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"The grand castle loomed tall against the sky. Nate and Clara stood in awe at its towering walls. \u201cThis is it!\u201d Nate exclaimed. \u201cWe have to find the treasure before Vex does!\u201d\n\n\u201cRight!\u201d Clara nodded, her eyes sparkling with determination. \u201cLet\u2019s start in the Great Hall.\u201d\n\nAs they entered the hall, sunlight streamed through colorful stained glass. The colors danced on the stone floor. \u201cLook at those tapestries!\u201d Nate said, pointing to the rich, woven images. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cEach tells a story,\u201d Clara replied. \u201cBut we don\u2019t have time to admire them. Vex could be anywhere!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a loud crash echoed through the hall. \u201cDid you hear that?\u201d Nate whispered, his heart racing. Clara nodded, and they tiptoed toward the sound.\n\nAs they peeked around a corner, they saw Vex rummaging through a pile of treasure chests. \u201cWhere is it?\u201d Vex growled. \u201cI know it\u2019s here!\u201d\n\nNate and Clara exchanged worried glances. \u201cWe need a plan,\u201d Clara urged. \u201cI can distract him with a noise while you grab the treasure!\u201d\n\n\u201cGreat idea!\u201d Nate said, feeling braver. Clara picked up a small metal vase and threw it across the room. It clanged loudly, drawing Vex\u2019s attention.\n\n\u201cWho\u2019s there?\u201d Vex shouted, dashing toward the noise. Nate seized the chance. He rushed to the nearest chest, his fingers trembling with excitement.\n\n\u201cCome on, come on!\u201d he whispered to himself as he flung it open. Inside, he found a shimmering golden amulet. It sparkled brightly, illuminating his face.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cGot it!\u201d Nate shouted. But just then, Vex reappeared with a furious look. \u201cYou think you can escape with that?\u201d he sneered. \n\nNate\u2019s heart raced again. \u201cWe can\u2019t let him take it!\u201d he yelled to Clara. They quickly ran toward the door, clutching the amulet tightly. \n\nVex was close behind, his footsteps heavy. But with Clara by his side, Nate felt strong. \u201cWe can do this!\u201d he encouraged her. Together, they dashed out of the castle, the sunlight welcoming them back.\n\nOutside, they skidded to a stop, panting and laughing. \u201cWe did it!\u201d Clara cheered, holding the amulet high. \u201cWe found the treasure!\u201d\n\nNate grinned. \u201cAnd we stopped Vex!\u201d His heart swelled with pride. They were brave together, and they had learned to believe in each other.\n\n\u201cNow let\u2019s get back home!\u201d Clara said, excitement sparkling in her eyes. With the amulet safe, Nate pressed the button on his wristwatch. The world around them shimmered, ready to whisk them away to their next adventure.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Nate and Clara find in the castle?","options":["A map","A golden amulet","A sword","A painting"],"correct_answer":"A golden amulet"},{"question":"What did Clara use to distract Vex?","options":["A loud noise","A painting","A treasure chest","A jewel"],"correct_answer":"A loud noise"},{"question":"How did Nate feel when they found the treasure?","options":["Scared","Brave","Sad","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Brave"},{"question":"What did Nate do with the wristwatch at the end of the chapter?","options":["Threw it away","Gave it to Clara","Pressed a button","Lost it"],"correct_answer":"Pressed a button"},{"question":"What is Vex's role in the story?","options":["A friend","A treasure hunter","A time traveler","A villain"],"correct_answer":"A villain"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_10_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_10_ch5_img1.png","plot_10_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":418,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
