     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"ethereal","1":"trepidation","2":"cautiously","3":"symbols","4":"determination","image_prompts":["A wide shot of Nate and Clara standing at the foot of a hidden staircase inside a pyramid, illuminated by flickering torchlight. Clara looks determined with her hands on her hips, while Nate shows excitement and curiosity, gazing up the staircase. The dark, ancient walls are intricately carved, hinting at the history within.","A dramatic scene inside the treasure chamber, filled with sparkling treasures. The chest stands prominently in the center, glowing with a mysterious light as Nate and Clara work together to open it. Vex looms in the background, his expression menacing, with shadows of falling debris creating a sense of urgency and danger."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing Capture the vibrant atmosphere of the wild west marketplace. Colorful stalls filled with goods should be prominent, with a backdrop of dusty plains and rugged mountains. Nate and Clara should be depicted in the foreground, their expressions reflecting a mix of awe and determination amidst the lively chaos.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_10_ch4_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:17:40"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing Focus on the climactic encounter between Nate and Vex in the marketplace. Vex should appear arrogant and menacing, while Nate looks determined, ready to confront the thief. The chaotic background emphasizes the urgency of their situation, with Clara poised for action, showcasing their solidarity and bravery.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_10_ch4_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:17:40"}}}
