   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_10_11_14","title":"The Time Traveler's Treasure","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Treasure Hunt","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Nate Parker was not your average eleven-year-old. While other kids were glued to their video games, Nate found adventure in the dusty corners of his grandfather\u2019s attic. Today, he was searching for hidden treasures among forgotten boxes. The smell of old wood and faded paper filled the air as Nate rummaged through a pile of old maps and yellowed newspapers, imagining they might lead him to ancient pirate gold.\n\nSuddenly, his fingers brushed against something cold and metallic. He pulled out a wristwatch, its face cracked but still glimmering under the dim attic light. The watch was unlike any he had ever seen; it had strange symbols that seemed to swirl like clouds around the numbers. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cWhat have you got there?\u201d a voice startled him. It was his little sister, Emma, peeking through the attic door, her curly hair bouncing with curiosity. \n\n\u201cI think it\u2019s an old watch,\u201d Nate replied, turning it over in his hand. \u201cBut look at these symbols! They\u2019re weird.\u201d\n\nEmma wrinkled her nose. \u201cIt looks broken. What\u2019s so special about it?\u201d\n\nNate shrugged, feeling a sense of excitement bubbling inside him. \u201cI don\u2019t know yet, but I have a feeling it\u2019s more than just a watch.\u201d \n\nDetermined to figure it out, Nate slipped the watch onto his wrist. At that moment, the attic seemed to blur around him. The walls faded, and colors twisted like swirling paint. When Nate blinked, he found himself standing in the middle of a bustling marketplace. The air was filled with a chorus of voices speaking in a language he couldn\u2019t understand. Tall pyramids loomed in the background, their stones gleaming under the bright sun of ancient Egypt.\n\n\u201cWhat in the world?\u201d Nate gasped, looking around in disbelief. He touched the watch, trying to comprehend what had just happened. The strange symbols lit up, pulsing against his wrist.\n\n\u201cThere you are!\u201d a girl\u2019s voice called from behind him. Nate turned to see a girl about his age, dressed in a flowing gown with intricate patterns. Her hair was braided and adorned with flowers that danced in the breeze.\n\n\u201cI\u2019m Clara,\u201d she said, her eyes sparkling with curiosity. \u201cYou look lost. Are you from the nearby village?\u201d\n\n\u201cI\u2019m Nate,\u201d he replied, still trying to piece together how he had arrived here. \u201cI... I think I\u2019m from far away. I just found this watch, and\u2014\u201d\n\n\u201cTime! You found a timepiece!\u201d Clara interrupted, her excitement making her words tumble over one another. \u201cIt\u2019s said that the gods gifted a few with the power to travel through time. You must be one of them!\u201d\n\nJust then, a shadow flitted across the ground, and Nate felt a shiver run down his spine. He turned to see a figure lurking in the distance, cloaked in a dark cape. The figure\u2019s eyes glinted with a cunning light, and Nate\u2019s heart raced.\n\n\u201cWho is that?\u201d Nate whispered, his voice barely audible.\n\nClara\u2019s face turned serious. \u201cThat\u2019s Vex. He\u2019s a time thief, and he\u2019ll do anything to steal the watch from you. We have to get out of here!\u201d\n\nNate felt a surge of fear and adrenaline course through him. \u201cWait! I don\u2019t even know how to get back!\u201d\n\n\u201cJust follow me!\u201d Clara urged, grabbing his hand and pulling him into the crowd. As they ran, Nate\u2019s heart pounded loudly in his ears, and he couldn\u2019t help but feel that this was only the beginning of a wild adventure he had never imagined.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nNate glanced back at Vex, who was weaving through the throng with an unsettling grin. Time was slipping away, and he was determined to keep the watch\u2014and the secret it held\u2014safe.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Nate find in his grandfather's attic?","options":["A treasure map","An old book","A time-traveling wristwatch","A toy robot"],"correct_answer":"A time-traveling wristwatch"},{"question":"Who does Nate meet in ancient Egypt?","options":["Leo","Emma","Clara","Vex"],"correct_answer":"Clara"},{"question":"What is Vex's role in the story?","options":["A friendly guide","A time traveler","A time thief","A historian"],"correct_answer":"A time thief"},{"question":"How does Nate feel about his adventure in the attic?","options":["Bored","Excited","Scared","Confused"],"correct_answer":"Excited"},{"question":"What does Clara warn Nate about?","options":["The desert sun","Vex","The marketplace","His sister"],"correct_answer":"Vex"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_10_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_10_ch1_img1.png","plot_10_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":631,"reading_level":"Builder"}
