   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"adventure_10_11_14","title":"The Time Traveler's Treasure","genre":"Adventure","sub_genre":"Treasure Hunt","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"As the sun set behind the ancient pyramids, casting long shadows on the sandy terrain, Nate felt a rush of excitement and fear swirl inside him. He stood next to Clara, who looked equally bewildered. The golden hues of the sky reflected in her eyes. \u201cWe need to find that treasure before Vex does,\u201d she said, determination edging her voice. \n\nNate nodded, his heart thumping like a drum. \u201cBut how do we even start?\u201d \n\nClara pointed to the Great Sphinx looming nearby. \u201cLegend says that the treasure is hidden somewhere near the Sphinx, but we have to be cautious. Vex is clever and dangerous.\u201d\n\nJust then, Nate felt a familiar weight on his wrist\u2014the time-traveling watch. He glanced at it, and the second hand was spinning wildly, like a whirlwind drawing him into its center. \u201cWhat does it mean?\u201d he asked, feeling a hint of panic.\n\n\u201cIt means we\u2019re running out of time!\u201d Clara replied, her voice rising. \u201cWe have to move!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a sharp noise sliced through the air\u2014a rustle in the bushes nearby. They both turned their heads in unison, hearts racing. Nate could already sense Vex\u2019s presence lurking like a shadow, ready to pounce when they least expected it. \n\n\u201cQuick! Over there!\u201d Clara pointed towards a cluster of palm trees, their fronds swaying gently in the evening breeze. The two sprinted toward the trees, ducking behind them just as a figure emerged from the darkness. It was Vex, his eyes gleaming with mischief.\n\n\u201cLooking for something?\u201d he taunted, his voice dripping with mockery. The glint of a dagger caught the last rays of sunlight as he brandished it, making Nate's stomach drop. \n\nNate whispered to Clara, \u201cWhat do we do?\u201d\n\n\u201cDistract him,\u201d Clara replied, her tone steady despite the fear in her eyes. With a deep breath, she stepped out from behind the palm trees, waving her arms. \u201cHey, Vex! Over here!\u201d\n\nVex turned, intrigued but cautious. \u201cOh? You think you can distract me, little girl?\u201d\n\nNate felt a surge of bravery. \u201cClara, we can\u2019t let him get the watch!\u201d He peeked from behind the tree, his mind racing with ideas.\n\n\u201cWe\u2019ll have to split up,\u201d Clara said, glancing at the sprawling terrain. \u201cI\u2019ll draw him away. You look for clues near the Sphinx. We can meet back here!\u201d\n\nBefore Nate could respond, Clara darted off in the opposite direction, her silhouette quickly swallowed by the dusk. He felt a mix of admiration and worry. Could she really distract Vex long enough for him to find the treasure? \n\nNate took a deep breath, reminding himself of the adventure that had begun with just a simple watch. He crept towards the Sphinx, its stony gaze watching over centuries of secrets. As he approached, he noticed a glimmer in the sand. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nKneeling down, Nate brushed away the sand, revealing a small, ornate box. His heart raced as he opened it, revealing an ancient map. This was it! The path to the treasure! But just as he began to study the map, he heard footsteps behind him. \n\n\u201cNate!\u201d Clara shouted, breathless and wide-eyed as she raced back, a wild look on her face. \u201cHe\u2019s coming! We have to go\u2014now!\u201d\n\nNate quickly folded the map, slipping it into his pocket. \u201cRight behind you!\u201d But as they turned to run, Nate felt a chill run down his spine. Vex\u2019s shadow fell over them, dark and menacing. The stakes had just risen higher than ever.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cDid you really think you could escape me?\u201d Vex sneered, a smirk spreading across his face. \u201cThe treasure will be mine!\u201d\n\nNate and Clara exchanged a glance filled with determination. They couldn't let Vex win. They had to outsmart him\u2014together.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Nate and Clara discover near the Sphinx?","options":["A hidden treasure","An ancient map","A magical artifact","A secret door"],"correct_answer":"An ancient map"},{"question":"What does Vex threaten to do?","options":["Take the watch","Escape with Clara","Claim the treasure","Capture Nate"],"correct_answer":"Claim the treasure"},{"question":"How do Clara and Nate plan to outsmart Vex?","options":["By running away","By distracting him","By hiding","By fighting him"],"correct_answer":"By distracting him"},{"question":"What emotion does Nate feel when he sees the treasure map?","options":["Fear","Excitement","Confusion","Anger"],"correct_answer":"Excitement"},{"question":"What does Clara do to divert Vex's attention?","options":["Yells at him","Runs in the opposite direction","Throws sand","Hides behind a tree"],"correct_answer":"Runs in the opposite direction"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_10_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_10_ch2_img1.png","plot_10_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":627,"reading_level":"Builder"}
