   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_276_7_10","title":"The Enigma Club","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Secret Societies","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Mia loved her school library. It was a place of wonder. Rows and rows of colorful books filled the shelves. Every time she walked in, a little bell above the door jingled. \n\n\"Welcome to the adventure!\" the bell seemed to say.\n\nOne rainy day, Mia was exploring the library after school. She ran her fingers along the spines of the books. Suddenly, she noticed something strange. A small wooden door was hidden behind a tall shelf. Mia's heart raced. \n\n\"What is this?\" she whispered.\n\nShe glanced around. No one was there. \"I should check it out!\" Mia thought.\n\nAs she pushed the door open, it creaked loudly. Inside was a magical room. The walls were covered in maps and notes. A table in the center was surrounded by three students. They looked like detectives.\n\n\"Hi there! I'm Mia!\" she said, stepping inside. \n\n\"I'm Leo,\" said a boy with glasses and a backpack full of gadgets. \"And this is Ava.\" He motioned to a girl holding a big book. Her eyes sparkled with excitement.\n\n\"Welcome to the Enigma Club!\" Ava exclaimed. \"We solve mysteries!\"\n\nMia's eyes widened. \"Mysteries? Like what?\"\n\n\"Right now, we\u2019re looking for treasure hidden in the school!\" Leo replied. \n\n\"Treasure? How exciting!\" Mia exclaimed. \n\nThe three of them huddled around a big old map. \"We have clues, but we need more help,\" Ava said. \"Are you in?\"\n\n\"Absolutely!\" Mia shouted. \n\nJust then, a loud bang echoed from the hallway. Mia jumped. \"What was that?\" she asked. \n\n\"We have a rival club,\" Leo said, looking worried. \"They want the treasure too!\"\n\nMia's heart raced again. This was getting serious! She wanted to find the treasure first. \n\n\"Let\u2019s work together!\" Mia said, determination in her voice. \n\n\"Okay! Our first clue is here,\" Ava said, pointing to the map. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Leo added, pulling out a gadget that looked like a magnifying glass. \n\nMia felt a thrill. This was just the beginning of their adventure. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the name of the secret club Mia discovers?","options":["Treasure Hunters","Mystery Seekers","Enigma Club","Detective Squad"],"correct_answer":"Enigma Club"},{"question":"Who is the tech whiz in the group?","options":["Ava","Mia","Leo","Rival Club"],"correct_answer":"Leo"},{"question":"What excites Mia about joining the club?","options":["Finding a secret door","Solving mysteries","Reading books","Eating snacks"],"correct_answer":"Solving mysteries"},{"question":"What do they want to find?","options":["A new book","Treasure","A secret code","A hidden room"],"correct_answer":"Treasure"},{"question":"What does Leo pull out during their meeting?","options":["A snack","A magnifying glass","A toy","A book"],"correct_answer":"A magnifying glass"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_276_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_276_ch1_img1.png","plot_276_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":331,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
