   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_276_7_10","title":"The Enigma Club","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Secret Societies","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Mia was buzzing with excitement. She could hardly believe she had joined the Enigma Club! The library felt so different now. Old books and dusty shelves held secrets just waiting to be uncovered. \n\n\u201cWhere do we start?\u201d Mia asked, her eyes sparkling.\n\nLeo pulled out a small tablet. \u201cI can scan for clues,\u201d he said, tapping the screen. \u201cBut we need to figure out what we\u2019re looking for first.\u201d\n\nAva, who was busy flipping through a thick book, looked up. \u201cThe treasure is hidden somewhere in the school. We need to solve the first clue to find it!\u201d \n\nMia leaned closer. \u201cWhat does the clue say?\u201d \n\nAva turned the book around. \u201cIt says, \u2018Where the knowledge flows, and stories grow, look for the light\u2014where secrets glow.\u2019\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat does that even mean?\u201d Mia scratched her head. \n\nLeo grinned. \u201cI think I know! It could mean the reading nook in the library!\u201d\n\nJust then, a loud noise echoed through the library. It sounded like a crash! Mia's heart raced. \n\n\u201cWhat was that?\u201d Mia whispered. \n\nAva\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cMaybe it\u2019s the rival club! They could be trying to beat us!\u201d \n\nMia nodded. \u201cLet\u2019s check it out!\u201d\n\nThey hurried down the aisles as shadows flickered around them. Mia\u2019s pulse quickened. What if the other club was already there? \n\nAs they turned the corner, they spotted three kids from the rival club. They were laughing and holding a strange map. \n\nLeo whispered, \u201cWe need to blend in. Let\u2019s act like we\u2019re just looking for books!\u201d\n\nThe trio tried to stay calm. They pretended to browse the shelves, but Mia kept one eye on the rivals. \n\nSuddenly, one of the rival club members shouted, \u201cLook! I found something!\u201d \n\nMia's heart sank. What if they figured out the clue before the Enigma Club? \n\n\u201cQuick! We need to go to the reading nook!\u201d Mia urged her friends. \n\nThey dashed to the cozy corner filled with soft pillows and a big, bright lamp. \n\nAva pointed to the lamp. \u201cIt\u2019s glowing! Could it be the light in the clue?\u201d \n\nMia felt a tingle of excitement. \u201cLet\u2019s check it out!\u201d \n\nThey gathered around the lamp, its light warming the space. \n\nLeo\u2019s eyes widened, \u201cOh! Look at this!\u201d He found a small lever hidden behind the lamp. \n\nWith a big push, the lever clicked. The wall next to them creaked open, revealing a dark passageway! \n\n\u201cWow!\u201d Mia gasped, thrilled and scared all at once. \u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d\n\nJust then, a loud voice came from behind them. \u201cWell, well, well, if it isn\u2019t the Enigma Club!\u201d \n\nMia turned, and her heart dropped. The rival club had followed them! \n\n\u201cLooks like we\u2019re not the only ones looking for treasure!\u201d the rival leader smirked. \n\nMia knew they had to act fast. \u201cLet\u2019s get in there!\u201d she whispered. \n\nWith a deep breath, they stepped into the unknown darkness.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does the first clue say?","options":["\u2018Where the knowledge flows, and stories grow\u2019","\u2018Look for the treasure hidden in the wall\u2019","\u2018Find the secret door to the library\u2019","\u2018Follow the light in the dark\u2019"],"correct_answer":"\u2018Where the knowledge flows, and stories grow\u2019"},{"question":"Who is the tech whiz in the club?","options":["Mia","Ava","Leo","Rival Leader"],"correct_answer":"Leo"},{"question":"What do they find in the reading nook?","options":["A secret book","A glowing lamp","A hidden door","A treasure chest"],"correct_answer":"A glowing lamp"},{"question":"What do the rival club members have?","options":["A secret map","A treasure chest","A glowing lamp","An old book"],"correct_answer":"A secret map"},{"question":"What do Mia and her friends hear in the library?","options":["A loud crash","Someone singing","A door opening","A bird chirping"],"correct_answer":"A loud crash"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_276_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_276_ch2_img1.png","plot_276_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":492,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
