   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_276_7_10","title":"The Enigma Club","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Secret Societies","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Mia, Leo, and Ava stood in front of the glowing lamp. Its light flickered like a firefly. \n\n\u201cDo you see that? It looks like it\u2019s shining brighter!\u201d Mia exclaimed, her eyes wide with excitement.\n\nLeo adjusted his glasses. \u201cI think it\u2019s hiding something! Let\u2019s check it out!\u201d\n\nAva nodded, flipping her hair over her shoulder. \u201cIt could be another clue!\u201d\n\nThey approached the lamp carefully. Leo reached out and touched it. Suddenly, the lamp moved! A door creaked open behind it.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cWhat? A secret door?\u201d Ava gasped. \u201cThis is amazing!\u201d\n\nMia stepped through the door. The air was cool and smelled like old books. On the walls were strange symbols. \u201cThese could be clues!\u201d she said eagerly.\n\nLeo took out his tablet. \u201cI can take pictures of these symbols. Maybe they relate to the treasure!\u201d\n\nJust then, a loud noise echoed through the passageway. \u201cThat sounds like the other club!\u201d Mia whispered.\n\n\u201cThey must be looking for the treasure too!\u201d Ava said, her voice trembling a little.\n\nSuddenly, a shadow appeared at the end of the hall. It was the rival club\u2014Tommy and his friends.\n\n\u201cHey, Enigma Club! We\u2019re going to find the treasure first!\u201d Tommy shouted, a smirk on his face.\n\nMia felt a spark of bravery. \u201cNot if we beat you to it!\u201d she replied, crossing her arms.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s split up!\u201d Leo suggested quickly. \u201cMia and I will decode the symbols. Ava, you keep an eye on them. Signal if they get too close!\u201d\n\n\u201cGot it!\u201d Ava nodded, holding her breath.\n\nThey moved through the passageway, carefully examining the symbols. Mia traced her finger over one. \u201cThis one looks like a treasure chest!\u201d\n\nLeo squinted at his tablet. \u201cIt says here it leads to the library's oldest book. We need to find it!\u201d\n\nJust then, Ava waved her hands. \u201cThey\u2019re coming!\u201d\n\nMia\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWe need to hurry!\u201d \n\nThey sprinted down the passage, each step echoing like thunder. Just as they reached a door, they heard footsteps behind them. \n\nWhat if they were too late? \n\nThey burst through the door and into the library. The shelves loomed over them, filled with dusty books. \u201cWhere\u2019s the oldest book?\u201d Leo panted.\n\nMia looked around frantically. \u201cOver there! The big, old one!\u201d \n\nBut just as they reached for it, Tommy and his friends appeared in the doorway. \u201cWe got here first!\u201d \n\nMia felt the weight of the moment. This was their biggest challenge yet. Would they let the rival club win, or would they solve the mystery together?\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s not give up!\u201d Mia shouted, determination shining in her eyes. \n\nThe race against time had begun!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Mia, Leo, and Ava find behind the glowing lamp?","options":["A treasure chest","A secret door","A hidden book","A map"],"correct_answer":"A secret door"},{"question":"What do the symbols on the wall indicate?","options":["They are just decorations","They lead to the treasure","They are a warning","They spell out a name"],"correct_answer":"They lead to the treasure"},{"question":"Who are Mia and her friends racing against?","options":["Their teachers","The other club","Their parents","The librarian"],"correct_answer":"The other club"},{"question":"What is Mia's suggestion when they see their rivals?","options":["Hide","Scream","Run","Not to give up"],"correct_answer":"Not to give up"},{"question":"What does Leo use to take pictures of the symbols?","options":["A camera","A phone","A tablet","A notebook"],"correct_answer":"A tablet"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_276_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_276_ch3_img1.png","plot_276_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":448,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
