   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_276_7_10","title":"The Enigma Club","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Secret Societies","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Mia, Leo, and Ava stood in the dimly lit passageway. The air felt electric with excitement. They had just uncovered a new clue! \n\n\u201cLook! The symbols on the wall!\u201d Mia exclaimed, pointing to the strange shapes. \u201cThey look like the ones we found before!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s take a picture!\u201d Leo grabbed his camera, flipping it open. \u201cI\u2019ll capture them for my gadget collection!\u201d\n\nAva adjusted her glasses. \u201cWait! We need to figure out what they mean first. Look closely!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, a loud noise echoed down the hall. The kids froze. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d whispered Mia, her eyes wide.\n\n\u201cProbably Tommy and his friends,\u201d Leo said, biting his lip. \u201cThey want the treasure too!\u201d\n\n\u201cWe can\u2019t let them beat us!\u201d Ava said, her voice firm.\n\nAs they studied the symbols, Mia noticed something sparkly. \u201cHey! There\u2019s a piece of paper stuck between the stones!\u201d \n\nShe reached up and pulled it free. \u201cIt\u2019s another clue!\u201d \n\n\u201cRead it!\u201d shouted Leo, bouncing on his feet. \n\nMia unfolded the paper carefully. It read, \u201cTo find the next step, follow the light where shadows dance.\u201d \n\n\u201cWhat does that mean?\u201d Ava asked, flipping through her book of legends. \n\n\u201cMaybe it\u2019s another clue about the library!\u201d Mia suggested. \u201cWe have to go back!\u201d \n\nBut before they could turn around, Tommy and his friends appeared, blocking the way. \n\n\u201cNice try, Enigma Club! But we\u2019re taking that clue!\u201d Tommy sneered. \n\nMia felt her heart race. \u201cWe won\u2019t let you!\u201d she declared, standing tall. \n\n\u201cThen let\u2019s see who can solve it first!\u201d Tommy challenged. \n\nThe two groups stood ready, eyes locked. \n\n\u201cThis is it, guys! Let\u2019s outsmart them!\u201d Mia said, her mind racing. \n\nAs they began to solve the clue, the library felt alive with possibilities. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nMia felt hope bubbling inside her. \u201cWe can do this!\u201d \n\nWith a deep breath, they pushed forward. They would find the treasure first! \n\n\u201cReady, set, go!\u201d Mia shouted. The race was on.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Mia find stuck between the stones?","options":["A book","A piece of paper","A treasure map","A gadget"],"correct_answer":"A piece of paper"},{"question":"What does the clue say?","options":["Follow the light where shadows dance","Go to the library","Look for the treasure","Find the hidden door"],"correct_answer":"Follow the light where shadows dance"},{"question":"What are Mia, Leo, and Ava trying to do?","options":["Build a treehouse","Find a treasure","Join a club","Write a book"],"correct_answer":"Find a treasure"},{"question":"Who challenges the Enigma Club?","options":["The teachers","Tommy and his friends","A ghost","The principal"],"correct_answer":"Tommy and his friends"},{"question":"How does Mia feel before the challenge?","options":["Nervous","Excited","Sad","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_276_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_276_ch4_img1.png","plot_276_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":330,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
