   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_276_7_10","title":"The Enigma Club","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Secret Societies","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Mia, Leo, and Ava stood in front of the hidden door in the library. The air felt thick with mystery. \u201cAre you ready?\u201d Mia asked, her heart racing. She felt excitement bubbling inside her.\n\n\u201cReady!\u201d shouted Leo, holding a flashlight. His eyes sparkled with the thrill of discovery. Ava adjusted her glasses and nodded. \u201cLet\u2019s find that treasure!\u201d\n\nThey opened the door and stepped into a dimly lit room. Dust danced in the beams of light shining through the tiny windows. Old books lined the walls. Each book looked like it held a secret. \u201cThis place is amazing!\u201d Mia exclaimed, her voice echoing.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, they heard a noise. \u201cDid you hear that?\u201d whispered Ava, looking around nervously. Just then, Tommy and his friends burst through another door! \u201cWe found it first!\u201d Tommy shouted, smirking.\n\nMia clenched her fists. \u201cNot if we can help it!\u201d she declared. They needed to work fast. \u201cWhat\u2019s the next clue?\u201d she asked, scanning the room.\n\nLeo pointed to a dusty old map hanging on the wall. \u201cLook! It shows the library! And there\u2019s a mark near the old oak tree!\u201d\n\n\u201cThe oak tree!\u201d Ava cried. \u201cThat\u2019s where the last clue led us!\u201d They quickly gathered around the map, excitement swirling.\n\n\u201cWe need to get there before Tommy!\u201d Mia said, her voice steady. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d\n\nThe three friends raced out of the library. They dashed through the school hallway, the sound of their footsteps echoing. \u201cI hope we can beat them!\u201d Leo called out.\n\nAs they reached the oak tree outside, they spotted something glimmering in the grass. \u201cLook!\u201d Ava shouted, pointing. They all knelt down, hearts pounding. It was an old key!\n\n\u201cThis must be for the treasure chest!\u201d Mia said, her eyes wide with wonder. They felt proud and excited. \u201cLet\u2019s go back and find it!\u201d Mia urged.\n\nJust then, they heard footsteps behind them. It was Tommy and his friends! \u201cYou think you can win?\u201d Tommy taunted. \u201cToo late, we\u2019re ahead!\u201d\n\nBut Mia smiled confidently. \u201cNot for long!\u201d She held the key up high. \u201cWe\u2019re going to solve the mystery of the treasure first!\u201d\n\nWith a final burst of determination, the Enigma Club dashed back to the library. They were ready for the next challenge, ready to unlock the treasure that had been hidden for so long.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Mia, Leo, and Ava discover in the hidden room?","options":["A treasure chest","An old map","A secret passage","A glowing lamp"],"correct_answer":"An old map"},{"question":"What do they find at the oak tree?","options":["A clue","A treasure chest","An old key","A secret door"],"correct_answer":"An old key"},{"question":"Who are the rivals of the Enigma Club?","options":["Tommy and his friends","Leo's cousins","The teachers","The librarian"],"correct_answer":"Tommy and his friends"},{"question":"What does Mia hold up high at the oak tree?","options":["A map","A flashlight","A key","A clue"],"correct_answer":"A key"},{"question":"How do Mia, Leo, and Ava feel as they race to the library?","options":["Nervous","Excited","Tired","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Excited"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_276_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_276_ch5_img1.png","plot_276_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":394,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
