   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_276_11_14","title":"The Enigma Club","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Secret Societies","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Mia Parker had always felt that her school, Willow Creek Elementary, was a little more than just a place for learning. With its creaky wooden floors and walls adorned with faded history posters, it was a labyrinth of secrets just waiting to be uncovered. But it wasn\u2019t until one rainy afternoon that she stumbled upon the biggest mystery of all.\n\nAs the raindrops tapped rhythmically against the library windows, Mia wandered through the tall, dusty shelves, her fingers trailing over the spines of forgotten books. She loved the library, with its cozy reading nooks and the scent of old paper. It was her adventure hideaway, where she could escape into worlds of knights, aliens, and lost treasures. \n\n\u201cMia!\u201d a voice called, pulling her from her daydream. It was Ava, her best friend and a self-proclaimed bookworm. \u201cHave you seen Leo? He wanted to show us something super cool!\u201d\n\nMia shrugged, glancing around the room. \u201cNo, but I just found this\u2014\u201d She pointed to a peculiar door at the back of the library, partially hidden behind a bookshelf. Unlike the rest of the library, this door looked new, as if it had been painted yesterday.\n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s that?\u201d Ava\u2019s eyes sparkled with curiosity as she walked over, her brown curls bouncing with each step. \u201cIt looks like it doesn\u2019t belong.\u201d\n\nJust then, Leo joined them, his backpack bouncing against his back. \u201cHey, what are you two up to?\u201d He adjusted his glasses, his blue eyes wide with excitement. \u201cDid you find something?\u201d\n\nMia gestured toward the door. \u201cI think we just might have.\u201d With a swift push, she gently opened the door, revealing a narrow staircase leading down into darkness. \u201cShould we go in?\u201d\n\n\u201cAre you kidding? Of course!\u201d Leo said, already rummaging through his gadget-filled backpack. \u201cI\u2019ve got my flashlight!\u201d\n\nWith a sense of trepidation, they descended the creaky stairs. The air grew cooler, sending shivers down Mia\u2019s spine. \u201cIt feels like we\u2019re entering a cave,\u201d she whispered, her heart racing with anticipation.\n\nAt the bottom of the stairs, they entered a dimly lit room filled with old photographs and dusty trophies. A banner hung on the wall, \u201cWelcome to the Enigma Club.\u201d Mia\u2019s eyes widened as she took in the scene. Could this be a secret society? \n\n\u201cThis is amazing!\u201d Ava exclaimed, her voice echoing in the small space. \u201cI\u2019ve read about the Enigma Club in local legends! They solved mysteries all over town!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, the door creaked open behind them, and a group of older kids entered the room, their expressions unreadable. One of them, a tall boy with a smirk, crossed his arms. \u201cLooks like our little clubhouse just got invaded. You guys think you can become detectives?\u201d\n\nA shiver ran down Mia\u2019s spine. Who were these kids? The tension thickened in the air, and she felt the weight of their gazes. \n\nLeo whispered, \u201cWe have to prove ourselves. We can\u2019t let them scare us away!\u201d\n\nJust then, Mia noticed a dusty box in the corner, partially hidden beneath an old cloak. Her heart raced. What if it held clues to a mystery? She made her way over, and as she reached for the box, she felt a surge of determination. \n\n\u201cWait!\u201d Ava said, her eyes darting back to the older kids. \u201cWe need to be careful.\u201d\n\nBut before Mia could respond, she lifted the box, dust swirling around them like a mini tornado. Inside were crumpled papers and a map, the edges frayed but intact. It was a start. A start to something big.\n\n\u201cThis isn\u2019t over,\u201d Mia declared, glancing back at the taller kids. \u201cWe\u2019re going to solve the mystery of the treasure hidden in this school!\u201d\n\nAs the rival club snickered, Mia felt a spark ignite within her. The adventure had just begun.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] appears here as Mia, Ava, and Leo stand in the library, surrounded by tall bookshelves. Their expressions are a mix of excitement and curiosity as they gaze at the mysterious door, which is slightly ajar, revealing an intriguing darkness beyond. The warm light from the library casts long shadows, hinting at the secrets waiting to be uncovered.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2] appears here as Mia lifts the dusty box, surrounded by swirling dust. The box is old and worn, with a few crumpled papers spilling out. Mia\u2019s face shows determination and surprise, while Leo and Ava glance nervously at the rival club, who stand with arms crossed, smirking in the background. The room is dimly lit, enhancing the atmosphere of mystery and suspense.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Mia discover in the library?","options":["A hidden door","A treasure map","A secret passage","An old book"],"correct_answer":"A hidden door"},{"question":"Who are Mia's two friends?","options":["Leo and Ava","Leo and Sam","Ava and Emma","Mason and Ava"],"correct_answer":"Leo and Ava"},{"question":"What is the name of the secret society Mia finds?","options":["The Mystery Society","The Enigma Club","The Treasure Hunters","The Secret Club"],"correct_answer":"The Enigma Club"},{"question":"How does Mia feel when she finds the hidden door?","options":["Bored","Curious","Angry","Scared"],"correct_answer":"Curious"},{"question":"What do the rival club members do when they enter the room?","options":["Help the detectives","Leave quietly","Laugh at the newcomers","Join the Enigma Club"],"correct_answer":"Laugh at the newcomers"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_276_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_276_ch1_img1.png","plot_276_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":769,"reading_level":"Builder"}
