   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_276_11_14","title":"The Enigma Club","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Secret Societies","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Mia stood in the dimly lit library, the smell of old books swirling around her like a warm blanket. The hidden door behind the dusty shelves creaked open, revealing a narrow staircase that spiraled down into darkness. Her heart raced with excitement and a pinch of fear. \u201cAre you ready for this?\u201d she whispered to Ava and Leo, who stood beside her, their eyes wide with curiosity.\n\n\u201cReady as I\u2019ll ever be!\u201d Leo replied, adjusting his glasses. He looked at Mia, his face a mix of determination and apprehension. \u201cLet\u2019s find out what this Enigma Club is really about.\u201d\n\nAva, clutching a flashlight, nodded enthusiastically. \u201cI brought the flashlight! It\u2019ll help us see everything down there.\u201d She flicked it on, illuminating the staircase. The beam cut through the gloom, revealing cobwebs that hung like ghosts in the corners.\n\nAs they descended, Mia could feel the weight of history pressing down on them. The walls whispered secrets, and for a moment, she imagined all the adventures that had taken place in this old school. Their footsteps echoed eerily, but they pressed on, each step fueled by the promise of discovery.\n\nAt the bottom, they found themselves in a small, candlelit room filled with mismatched furniture and scattered papers. A large wooden table dominated the center, and around it sat a group of children, each wearing a badge that read \u201cEnigma Club.\u201d They looked up, startled but intrigued.\n\n\u201cWho are you?\u201d a boy with tousled hair and sharp blue eyes asked, crossing his arms defensively.\n\n\u201cMia, Leo, and Ava,\u201d Mia introduced her friends, trying to sound braver than she felt. \u201cWe found the door to your club.\u201d\n\n\u201cYeah, and we want to help!\u201d Ava added, her enthusiasm bubbling over.\n\nThe boy tilted his head. \u201cHelp? This club is for serious detectives only. We\u2019re working on a mystery.\u201d He gestured to a tattered map spread out on the table. It was marked with various locations around the school.\n\nMia leaned closer, her heart pounding with excitement. \u201cWhat mystery?\u201d\n\nThe boy smirked, glancing at the map. \u201cWe\u2019re trying to find the Lost Treasure of Maplewood Middle School. But, there\u2019s a rival club, the Sleuth Society, that\u2019s also after it.\u201d\n\nLeo\u2019s eyes lit up with interest. \u201cWhat\u2019s the treasure?\u201d\n\n\u201cLegend says it\u2019s hidden somewhere in the school, but no one knows where. There are clues, but they\u2019re tricky. Are you sure you\u2019re up for it?\u201d the boy challenged.\n\nMia exchanged glances with Leo and Ava. \u201cWe are!\u201d she declared. \u201cWe\u2019re not afraid of a little challenge.\u201d\n\nJust then, a loud crash echoed from above, making everyone jump. The door they had come through slammed shut, shaking the room. The candles flickered ominously, and the atmosphere turned tense.\n\n\u201cWe have to get out of here!\u201d Ava exclaimed, her voice trembling.\n\n\u201cNo! We have to see what that was,\u201d Mia insisted, feeling a surge of bravery. \u201cIt could be a clue!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nLeo nodded, his gadget instincts kicking in. \u201cI can use my phone to get a signal and figure out what\u2019s happening upstairs.\u201d\n\nAs he whipped out his device, the boy from the Enigma Club frowned. \u201cWe need to check the map first. If the Sleuth Society is here, we can\u2019t be caught unprepared!\u201d He pointed to a spot marked with an \u2018X\u2019 that seemed to pulse with mystery.\n\nMia felt a sense of urgency swell within her. Their quest for the treasure was about to become a race against time. \u201cLet\u2019s divide into teams. Leo and I will go check out the noise, and Ava, you study the map and figure out our next move!\u201d\n\n\u201cBe careful!\u201d Ava called as Mia and Leo crept toward the exit.\n\nWith their hearts pounding and the sound of shifting shadows behind them, they pushed through the door, ready to face whatever awaited them. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What organization do Mia and her friends discover?","options":["The Treasure Seekers","The Enigma Club","The Sleuth Society","The Mystery Guild"],"correct_answer":"The Enigma Club"},{"question":"What do the kids hope to find?","options":["A hidden door","A long-lost treasure","An old book","A secret passage"],"correct_answer":"A long-lost treasure"},{"question":"What unexpected event occurs while they are in the Enigma Club?","options":["A treasure map appears","The lights go out","A loud crash is heard","Someone knocks on the door"],"correct_answer":"A loud crash is heard"},{"question":"How does Mia feel about the challenges they face?","options":["She is afraid","She is indifferent","She feels brave","She wants to leave"],"correct_answer":"She feels brave"},{"question":"Who is the character most likely to come up with tech solutions?","options":["Mia","Leo","Ava","The boy from the Enigma Club"],"correct_answer":"Leo"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_276_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_276_ch2_img1.png","plot_276_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":654,"reading_level":"Builder"}
