   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_276_11_14","title":"The Enigma Club","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Secret Societies","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Mia stepped into the library, her heart racing with anticipation. The dim light from the tall, dusty windows danced across the room, illuminating the bookshelves that towered like ancient giants. The air smelled of old paper and mystery, a scent that always filled her with a sense of adventure. She glanced over at Ava, who was skimming through a thick volume about local legends, while Leo tinkered with his tablet, his fingers flying over the screen as he searched for clues.\n\n\u201cOkay, team!\u201d Mia said, her voice bubbling with excitement. \u201cWe need to figure out what these clues mean. We\u2019re so close to finding the treasure!\u201d\n\nAva looked up from her book, her eyes sparkling with the thrill of discovery. \u201cAccording to this legend, there are three key locations in the school where the treasure might be hidden. If we can decode the clues, we might find the first location.\u201d\n\nLeo nodded, adjusting his glasses. \u201cI\u2019ll run an analysis on our last clue. Maybe it holds more secrets than we realize.\u201d\n\nMia felt a sense of hope swell in her chest. They had faced so many challenges already, but working together made her believe they could solve anything. Just then, a loud crash echoed from the hallway, jolting her from her thoughts.\n\n\u201cWhat was that?\u201d Leo asked, looking up, his expression shifting from determination to concern.\n\nMia exchanged glances with Ava before they all rushed toward the sound. As they rounded the corner, they spotted members of the rival club, the Shadow Seekers, standing over a toppled bookshelf. A smirk crept onto the face of their leader, Dylan.\n\n\u201cLooks like you\u2019re losing your touch, Enigma Club,\u201d Dylan taunted, brushing dust off his jacket. \u201cWe found your precious clues. How about a little race? First to the treasure wins!\u201d\n\nMia clenched her fists, her determination ignited. \u201cWe\u2019ll see about that! We\u2019re not backing down.\u201d\n\nSuddenly, Ava whispered, \u201cWait! Look at the clue we have.\u201d She pulled out a crumpled piece of paper that had a riddle scrawled on it. \u201cIf we solve this, it might lead us to the first location.\u201d\n\nLeo\u2019s eyes lit up as he read the riddle aloud: \u201cIn shadows where light does not gleam, a place where the lost may dream.\u201d \n\nMia\u2019s mind raced, piecing together the words. \u201cThe art room! It\u2019s dark in there, but it\u2019s also where we keep old projects and half-finished paintings. It has to be there!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s hurry!\u201d Ava exclaimed, her excitement infectious, and the trio dashed down the hallway. \n\nAs they approached the art room, Mia felt a mix of adrenaline and fear. Would they beat the Shadow Seekers to the treasure? Would they find something significant hidden within those shadowy corners? \n\nWhen they reached the door, it swung open with an eerie creak. They stepped inside, and a shiver ran down Mia\u2019s spine. The walls were draped with canvases of brilliant colors and odd shapes, but in the dim light, something caught her eye\u2014a glint of gold peeking out from behind a stack of old easels. \n\n\u201cLook!\u201d she shouted, pointing toward the glimmer.\n\nSuddenly, a loud thud echoed from the hallway. The door slammed shut behind them, plunging the room into darkness. Mia\u2019s heart raced; they were trapped! \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe room felt alive with mystery, shadows looming over the colorful artwork. Mia and her friends stood together, tension palpable in the air, their faces illuminated by the faint glimmer of the treasure.\n\n\u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d Leo asked, glancing back at the door, which felt like a barrier to their escape.\n\n\u201cWe have to find that treasure before the Shadow Seekers catch up!\u201d Ava exclaimed, her voice a mix of fear and excitement.\n\nMia took a deep breath, her mind whirling with possibilities. They were so close to uncovering the mystery, but time was running out. \u201cLet\u2019s split up and search the room for more clues. We can do this together!\u201d\n\nAs they began to search, the anticipation thickened. Every brush of their fingers against the easels made Mia\u2019s heart race with hope\u2014what if they found not just the treasure, but also the answer to all the mysteries surrounding their school? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe door rattled ominously, and the sound of footsteps approached. They had to hurry. Mia\u2019s determination solidified; they would solve this mystery, they would find the treasure, and they would not let the Shadow Seekers win!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What clue do Mia and her friends need to solve to find the treasure?","options":["A map","A riddle","A secret code","A diary"],"correct_answer":"A riddle"},{"question":"Where do they think the treasure might be hidden?","options":["In the library","In the art room","In the cafeteria","In the gym"],"correct_answer":"In the art room"},{"question":"What happens when they enter the art room?","options":["They find the treasure immediately","They become trapped","They meet the Shadow Seekers","They find a secret passage"],"correct_answer":"They become trapped"},{"question":"Who is the leader of the rival club?","options":["Leo","Mia","Ava","Dylan"],"correct_answer":"Dylan"},{"question":"What does Mia feel as they search the art room?","options":["Fear","Hope","Anger","Boredom"],"correct_answer":"Hope"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_276_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_276_ch4_img1.png","plot_276_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":748,"reading_level":"Builder"}
