   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_276_11_14","title":"The Enigma Club","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Secret Societies","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"The air was thick with anticipation as Mia, Leo, and Ava stood huddled in the dim light of the art room. The rustling of paper and the faint smell of paint surrounded them, creating a backdrop for their next move. They had succeeded in escaping one trap but now faced an even greater challenge. The treasure was close, but so was their rival group, the Shadow Seekers.\n\n\u201cWe have to solve the riddle on the floor,\u201d Leo said, his voice barely above a whisper. He pointed at the large, faded mural covering one wall. It depicted a winding path through a dark forest, with a single golden glimmer at the end. \u201cLook! That\u2019s where the treasure is!\u201d \n\nMia squinted, her heart racing. \u201cBut how do we get there?\u201d she asked, scanning the mural for clues. The Shadow Seekers could arrive at any moment, and the pressure was mounting.\n\nSuddenly, Ava let out a gasp. \u201cWait, there\u2019s something hidden in this paint!\u201d She stepped closer, her eyes widening as she traced her finger over the mural. \u201cThese colors aren\u2019t just random. They form letters! It\u2019s a code!\u201d\n\nMia felt a surge of excitement mixed with dread. They had to decode it quickly. \u201cWhat does it say?\u201d she urged, barely able to contain her eagerness. Just as Ava began to decipher the letters, a loud crash echoed from the hallway outside. Mia\u2019s stomach dropped.\n\n\u201cThey\u2019re coming!\u201d Leo exclaimed, his eyes darting toward the door. \u201cWe have to hurry!\u201d\n\nAva\u2019s fingers flew over the letters, whispering the code as if it were a secret spell. \u201cIt says, \u2018Follow the light where shadows dance, and you will find your treasure\u2019s chance.\u2019\u201d\n\nMia\u2019s mind raced. \u201cThe light! There\u2019s that old chandelier in the center of the room. What if it\u2019s pointing us somewhere?\u201d Without wasting another moment, Mia led the way to the chandelier, its crystals glimmering faintly, casting shadows that danced across the walls.\n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Mia said, pointing up at the chandelier. The shadows formed a path leading toward a hidden door at the far end of the room. \u201cThere!\u201d\n\nThey rushed over, adrenaline propelling them forward. Just as they reached for the doorknob, the door swung open, revealing the shadowy outline of a figure. It was Felix, the leader of the Shadow Seekers. His eyes glinted with mischief, clearly ready to outwit them.\n\n\u201cGoing somewhere?\u201d he sneered, folding his arms. \n\nMia took a step forward, heart pounding. \u201cWe\u2019re not letting you stop us, Felix. We\u2019re finding the treasure first!\u201d\n\nFelix snickered, but something in Mia\u2019s voice must have struck a chord; she could see doubt flickering in his eyes. \u201cYou really think you can beat us?\u201d he challenged, but Mia stood tall, fueled by determination and confidence. Her friends flanked her, and together they formed an unbreakable wall of support.\n\n\u201cTogether, we can do anything,\u201d Leo added, his voice steady. Ava nodded, her expression resolute.\n\nThe tension hung thick in the air as the rival teams faced off. But in that moment, Mia realized something important: it wasn\u2019t just about the treasure; it was about friendship, trust, and the adventures they shared. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s work together,\u201d Mia proposed, her voice firm. \u201cWe can figure out the treasure\u2019s secret as a team.\u201d\n\nFelix hesitated, glancing at his friends. The moment stretched on, each second feeling like an eternity. Finally, he sighed. \u201cFine, but don\u2019t hold us back. We\u2019re going to find it together.\u201d \n\nMia smiled, feeling a warmth spread in her chest. As they all stepped through the hidden door, she knew they were on the brink of something extraordinary. The mysteries of their school were unraveling, and this was just the beginning.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Mia and her friends find hidden in the mural?","options":["A treasure map","Letters forming a code","A secret passage","An ancient scroll"],"correct_answer":"Letters forming a code"},{"question":"Who confronts Mia and her friends in the art room?","options":["A teacher","Felix from the Shadow Seekers","The principal","A janitor"],"correct_answer":"Felix from the Shadow Seekers"},{"question":"What key phrase does the mural\u2019s code reveal?","options":["Find the hidden door","Follow the light where shadows dance","Treasure lies beneath the floor","Unlock the secrets of the past"],"correct_answer":"Follow the light where shadows dance"},{"question":"What realization does Mia come to during the confrontation?","options":["They need to work alone","The treasure isn't important","Friendship is all that matters","They should run away"],"correct_answer":"Friendship is all that matters"},{"question":"What do Mia and Felix ultimately decide?","options":["To fight for the treasure","To work together","To give up","To split the treasure"],"correct_answer":"To work together"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_276_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_276_ch5_img1.png","plot_276_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":631,"reading_level":"Builder"}
