   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_276_15_18","title":"The Enigma Club","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Secret Societies","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Mia stood at the threshold of the old school library, an air of mystery swirling around her like the dust motes illuminated by the afternoon sun. The building, with its warped wooden floors and sagging ceilings, felt both haunted and alive, as if it held stories of countless students who had roamed its corridors. Today, however, Mia felt a spark of something different\u2014an adventure waiting to unfold.\n\n\"Are you coming or what?\" Leo called from behind her, his voice tinged with impatience. He was always the first to spot opportunities for mischief, armed with gadgets that often bordered on the ingenious. With his tousled hair and oversized glasses, he looked like a modern-day wizard, ready to unveil secrets that lay hidden in plain sight.\n\n\u201cYes, yes! Just... give me a second.\u201d Mia pushed the heavy oak door open, the creak echoing in the near-silence. The scent of old paper and polished wood enveloped her, stirring a nostalgia that clung to her heart. It was here, amidst the towering shelves and cozy nooks, that she had spent countless afternoons lost in books of fantasy and adventure. Little did she know, this was merely the prelude to her own tale.\n\nAs she walked deeper into the library, she spotted Ava, her best friend and the unofficial historian of their class, engrossed in a dusty tome. Ava\u2019s long, dark hair fell over her face as she flipped through pages filled with illustrations of local legends. \u201cMia! You won\u2019t believe this,\u201d she exclaimed, her eyes sparkling with excitement. \u201cThis book mentions a hidden treasure somewhere in the school!\u201d\n\n\u201cTreasure?\u201d Mia raised an eyebrow, an amused smile creeping onto her lips. \u201cLike, actual treasure?\u201d\n\n\u201cNot just any treasure\u2014the kind that\u2019s been lost for decades! The legend says it belongs to the founder of the school itself. We could be the ones to find it!\u201d Ava\u2019s enthusiasm was contagious, igniting a flicker of intrigue in Mia\u2019s heart.\n\nJust then, Leo strolled over, tinkering with a small device that blinked erratically. \u201cCount me in. If there\u2019s a treasure, we need to map out the possibilities. I can rig something up to detect old tunnels or hidden rooms.\u201d\n\nMia couldn\u2019t help but feel a rush of excitement. The three of them, a trio of unlikely detectives, could make this happen. But as she glanced around the library, her gaze fell upon a peculiar section of the wall. There, hidden behind a shelf, was an ornate wooden door that seemed to shimmer with a life of its own. \u201cWhat\u2019s that?\u201d she whispered, her heart racing. \n\nLeo followed her line of sight. \u201cI\u2019ve never seen that door before. Is it even part of the library?\u201d\n\nAva leaned closer, her curiosity piqued. \u201cMaybe it leads to the treasure! Or to another mystery altogether.\u201d\n\nWith a deep breath, Mia stepped forward, her heart pounding in her chest. She placed her hand on the cool doorknob, its surface surprisingly smooth against her palm. \u201cShould we open it?\u201d she asked, glancing back at her friends, who exchanged eager looks.\n\n\u201cYes!\u201d they chimed in unison, their voices filled with the thrill of the unknown.\n\nAs she turned the knob, the door creaked open to reveal a dimly lit corridor, lined with ancient stone walls that seemed to whisper secrets of long-forgotten times. The air was thick with anticipation, and a shiver of both excitement and dread coursed through Mia. This was it\u2014the beginning of their adventure, a step into the enigma of the unknown.\n\nSuddenly, the sound of footsteps echoed down the hall, jolting Mia from her thoughts. A rival group of students appeared, led by the ever-competitive Max, a boy known for his cunning and determination. \u201cWhat are you losers doing here?\u201d he sneered, his confidence radiating like a shield.\n\nLeo straightened, adjusting his glasses with a defiant glint in his eye. \u201cWe\u2019re investigating. What\u2019s it to you?\u201d\n\nMia could feel the tension rise. This was more than just a chance to find treasure; it was about proving themselves against a rival club determined to claim the glory. \u201cWe can solve this mystery first,\u201d she declared, her voice steady. \u201cLet\u2019s see who discovers the clues first!\u201d\n\nWith that challenge ringing in the air, Mia felt the weight of the moment settle upon her shoulders. The stakes were higher than she had imagined, and the thrill of competition blended seamlessly with the allure of adventure. The Enigma Club was born, and they were ready to unravel the secrets that lay hidden within the walls of their beloved school.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Mia, Leo, and Ava discover in the library?","options":["A hidden treasure","A secret passage","A rare book","A rival club"],"correct_answer":"A secret passage"},{"question":"Who is the leader of the rival group that confronts Mia's team?","options":["Leo","Max","Ava","Mia"],"correct_answer":"Max"},{"question":"What motivates Mia to open the hidden door?","options":["Curiosity","Competition","Fear","Friendship"],"correct_answer":"Curiosity"},{"question":"How does Leo contribute to the adventure?","options":["By reading books","By mapping out possibilities","By leading the group","By solving puzzles"],"correct_answer":"By mapping out possibilities"},{"question":"What is the main theme introduced in Chapter 1?","options":["Friendship","Adventure","Rivalry","All of the above"],"correct_answer":"All of the above"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_276_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_276_ch1_img1.png","plot_276_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":772,"reading_level":"Challenger"}
