   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_277_7_10","title":"The Midnight Guardians","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Secret Societies","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Jake stood in the old church, his heart racing. The musty air felt thick around him. Emma was beside him, eyes sparkling with excitement.\n\n\u201cAre you ready for this, Jake?\u201d she asked, her voice a whisper.\n\n\u201cI guess,\u201d Jake replied, scratching his head. \u201cBut what if we can\u2019t find the shadow creature?\u201d\n\nMr. Whiskers, the talking cat, leapt onto a dusty pew. \u201cDon\u2019t worry, Jake! You\u2019re a Guardian now! Guardians are brave!\u201d\n\nJake sighed. \u201cI\u2019m not sure how brave I am.\u201d \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s start with some training!\u201d Emma clapped her hands. \u201cWhat do we do first?\u201d\n\nMr. Whiskers nodded and replied, \u201cFirst, we need to find the old map. It shows the secret paths in Whispering Pines. Follow me!\u201d\n\nThey followed Mr. Whiskers down a narrow corridor hidden behind a tattered curtain. The walls were covered in cobwebs and strange symbols. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s like a treasure map!\u201d Jake exclaimed, pointing at the symbols. \u201cWhat do they mean?\u201d\n\n\u201cEach symbol represents a place where shadows gather,\u201d Mr. Whiskers explained. \u201cWe need to learn their secrets to fight them.\u201d\n\nJake felt a tingle of excitement. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d\n\nAs they turned a corner, they heard a soft rustling sound. Jake\u2019s heart pounded. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d\n\nEmma grinned, \u201cMaybe it's just a mouse!\u201d\n\nBut Mr. Whiskers frowned. \u201cNo mouse is that quiet. It could be a shadow!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a dark shape darted across the hallway. Jake gasped. \u201cDid you see that?\u201d\n\n\u201cYes!\u201d Emma shouted, her eyes wide. \u201cWhat if it\u2019s the shadow creature?\u201d\n\nMr. Whiskers\u2019 fur stood on end. \u201cStay close! We must stick together!\u201d\n\nThe shadow creature loomed closer, swirling like smoke. Jake felt a chill. \u201cWhat do we do?\u201d\n\n\u201cRemember your training!\u201d Emma yelled. \u201cWe need to protect each other!\u201d\n\nJake took a deep breath. \u201cOkay, I can do this!\u201d He stepped forward, ready to face the shadow.\n\nJust then, the shadow paused. It seemed to watch them. Jake felt like it was reading his feelings. He gulped and shouted, \u201cWe\u2019re not afraid of you!\u201d\n\nThe shadow flickered uncertainly. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cGood job!\u201d Emma cheered. \u201cKeep standing tall!\u201d\n\n\u201cBut what if it knows I\u2019m scared?\u201d Jake whispered, feeling small.\n\nMr. Whiskers nudged him. \u201cRemember, you have friends. You\u2019re not alone.\u201d\n\nJake took another steady breath. He looked at Emma and Mr. Whiskers. \u201cTogether, we can do this!\u201d\n\nAs they prepared to confront the creature, Jake felt a spark of courage growing inside him. Maybe he was worthy after all.\n\nBut the shadow creature suddenly lunged forward! Jake\u2019s heart raced. What would he do next?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Jake and Emma follow Mr. Whiskers to find?","options":["A secret treasure","The old map","The shadow creature","A hidden door"],"correct_answer":"The old map"},{"question":"What does Mr. Whiskers say about the shadow creature?","options":["It is friendly","It is not real","It could be dangerous","It is afraid of them"],"correct_answer":"It could be dangerous"},{"question":"How does Jake feel when he sees the shadow?","options":["Excited","Scared","Happy","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Scared"},{"question":"What does Emma encourage Jake to do?","options":["Run away","Keep standing tall","Close his eyes","Hide behind Mr. Whiskers"],"correct_answer":"Keep standing tall"},{"question":"What is the main challenge in this chapter?","options":["Finding the map","Facing the shadow creature","Training together","Exploring the church"],"correct_answer":"Facing the shadow creature"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_277_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_277_ch2_img1.png","plot_277_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":435,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
