   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_277_7_10","title":"The Midnight Guardians","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Secret Societies","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Jake and Emma stood outside the old church. The moon shone bright, casting shadows on the cracked stones. \u201cThis place feels different tonight,\u201d Jake said nervously. \n\nEmma nodded. \u201cThe Guardians must have sensed something! We need to be ready.\u201d \n\nThe door creaked open, revealing Mr. Whiskers. His fur glowed in the moonlight. \u201cWelcome back, young Guardians!\u201d he meowed. \u201cTonight, we practice the Shadow Shield.\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s that?\u201d Jake asked, trying not to sound scared.\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s a special magic. It can protect us from the shadow creature,\u201d Mr. Whiskers explained. \u201cBut it requires courage and teamwork.\u201d\n\nJake felt a flutter of doubt in his stomach. \u201cWhat if I can\u2019t do it?\u201d he whispered.\n\nEmma patted his shoulder. \u201cYou can! We\u2019re in this together.\u201d \n\nThey followed Mr. Whiskers inside. The church felt warm and safe, filled with the smell of old wood and candles. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nIn the center of the room, a circle of candles flickered. \u201cStand in front of me,\u201d Mr. Whiskers said. \u201cNow imagine a bright light surrounding you.\u201d \n\nJake closed his eyes, picturing a glowing bubble. But all he saw was darkness creeping in. His heart raced.\n\n\u201cJake, focus!\u201d Emma urged. \u201cThink of something happy!\u201d\n\nJake pictured his favorite memory\u2014the day he and Emma found a hidden treasure map. Suddenly, he felt warmth spreading across his body. \n\n\u201cGood! Now, hold hands,\u201d Mr. Whiskers instructed. \n\nThey joined hands, and the light grew brighter. A sound echoed outside. It was the shadow creature! Its dark shape slithered towards the church. \n\n\u201cI can\u2019t do this!\u201d Jake panicked, squeezing Emma\u2019s hand tightly.\n\n\u201cRemember the light! We can do this together!\u201d Emma shouted.\n\nThey concentrated, and a wave of light burst from their hands. The light pushed back the shadows, making the creature hiss.\n\n\u201cKeep it up!\u201d Mr. Whiskers cheered. \n\nJake felt hope fill him. \u201cWe\u2019re doing it!\u201d he yelled. \n\nThe shadow creature squeaked angrily. It retreated, swirling into the night. \n\n\u201cGreat job!\u201d Mr. Whiskers smiled. \u201cYou both showed real bravery!\u201d\n\nJake beamed, feeling proud. \u201cMaybe I can be a Guardian after all.\u201d\n\nEmma grinned. \u201cTogether, we can face anything!\u201d\n\nAs they left the church, the stars twinkled brightly above. They knew the night wasn\u2019t over yet.\n\n\u201cWhat if it comes back?\u201d Jake wondered, looking at Emma.\n\n\u201cIt will,\u201d she replied confidently. \u201cBut we\u2019ll be ready!\u201d","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What magic do Jake and Emma practice?","options":["Shadow Shield","Light Shield","Courage Shield","Magic Shield"],"correct_answer":"Shadow Shield"},{"question":"Who helps Jake and Emma during their training?","options":["Mr. Whiskers","Mr. Jones","Mrs. Smith","The Mayor"],"correct_answer":"Mr. Whiskers"},{"question":"What does Jake picture to feel brave?","options":["A scary monster","His favorite memory","A dark room","A rainy day"],"correct_answer":"His favorite memory"},{"question":"What happens when the shadow creature approaches?","options":["It runs away","It hisses","It becomes friendly","It starts dancing"],"correct_answer":"It hisses"},{"question":"How do Jake and Emma feel after their training?","options":["Scared","Proud","Angry","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Proud"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_277_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_277_ch4_img1.png","plot_277_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":392,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
