     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"courage","1":"activate","2":"shadow","3":"sanctuary","4":"whispered","image_prompts":["A dimly lit interior of the old church, featuring cracked stained glass windows that cast colorful light patterns on the ground. Jake and Emma stand together, with expressions of determination and curiosity, while Mr. Whiskers sits regally, his tail flicking, as they gaze at the ancient altar pulsing with light.","A dramatic scene where the shadow creature looms behind Jake, Emma, and Mr. Whiskers, who stand united in the center of the church. The darkness swirls around them while a faint glow from the altar begins to push back the shadows, showing their determined faces filled with resolve."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dimly lit interior of an old, abandoned church, with dust motes illuminated by moonlight filtering through cracked stained glass. Jake stands hesitantly at the entrance, while Emma rummages through ancient tomes. A shadow of Mr. Whiskers, the talking cat, can be seen perched on a stone, casting a watchful gaze over them.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_277_ch4_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:08:02"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dramatic scene depicting Jake and Emma standing defiantly with their lanterns raised against the swirling shadow creature in the church. The room is filled with blinding light emanating from their lanterns, casting the creature in stark relief. The expressions on their faces convey determination and courage as they push back against the darkness.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_277_ch4_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:08:02"}}}
