     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"palpable","1":"ominous","2":"defiance","3":"radiant","4":"dissipated","image_prompts":["A dimly lit old church interior with ornate stained glass windows casting colorful patterns on the stone floor. Jake, a shy boy with tousled hair, stands near the altar, looking apprehensive. Emma, a brave girl with sparkling eyes, stands confidently next to him. Mr. Whiskers, a fluffy black cat with expressive green eyes, is perched atop the altar, gazing intently at the shadows.","The moment of action as Jake holds the glowing amulet high, casting a bright light that pushes back the dark, shadowy figure of the creature. The creature is a swirling mass of darkness, with piercing red eyes and a menacing posture. The church is alive with swirling shadows retreating, and Jake's expression is one of determination and courage, while Emma cheers him on."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dimly lit interior of an old church with crumbling walls and cracked stained glass windows, casting colorful shadows on the dusty floor. Jake, a fourteen-year-old boy with tousled hair and a hesitant expression, stands beside Emma, who is fiercely holding a flashlight, her eyes bright with determination. Mr. Whiskers, a sleek black cat, looks on with an air of confidence, creating a feeling of camaraderie amidst the uncertainty.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_277_ch5_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:07:14"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dramatic confrontation scene in the church, where Jake and Emma stand shoulder-to-shoulder, their flashlights illuminating the terrifying shadow creature that looms before them. The creature, a mass of swirling darkness with glowing eyes, appears to recoil from the light. Jakes face is a mix of fear and determination, while Emmas expression radiates courage, reflecting their shared resolve to face the looming threat together.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_277_ch5_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 19:07:14"}}}
