   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_278_7_10","title":"The Secret Society of Scribes","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Secret Societies","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Lana sat quietly in the corner of the big town library. The smell of old books filled the air. She loved this place. It was her secret hideout. Today, it felt different.\n\n\u201cLana!\u201d a cheerful voice called. It was Ravi, her best friend. His bright orange sneakers bounced as he approached. \u201cWhat are you reading?\u201d\n\nLana glanced up from the dusty book. \u201cI\u2019m not sure yet. It\u2019s an old journal from my grandma.\u201d\n\n\u201cCan I see?\u201d Ravi asked, his eyes sparkling with curiosity. \n\n\u201cSure,\u201d Lana replied, handing him the journal. It was covered in strange symbols. \n\nRavi flipped through the pages. \u201cWow! Look at this!\u201d He pointed to a drawing of a key and a door. \u201cWhat do you think it opens?\u201d\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but it must be important,\u201d Lana said, feeling a flutter of excitement. \n\nSuddenly, Ms. Penworth, the wise librarian, appeared. Her glasses perched on her nose, and a smile lit her face. \u201cWhat have you found, dear children?\u201d\n\nLana and Ravi quickly showed her the journal. \n\n\u201cOh, the Secret Society of Scribes!\u201d Ms. Penworth exclaimed. \u201cThey protect stories from being forgotten. You must be careful. There are those who want to erase them!\u201d\n\n\u201cErase stories?\u201d Ravi asked, his voice shaking. \n\n\u201cYes,\u201d Ms. Penworth replied, her tone serious. \u201cA villain threatens to take away all tales. It is up to brave souls like you to stop them!\u201d\n\nLana\u2019s heart raced. \u201cBut how can we help? I\u2019m not brave, and I don\u2019t like speaking in front of people.\u201d\n\n\u201cYou can be brave, Lana. Remember,\u201d Ms. Penworth said, placing a gentle hand on her shoulder, \u201cevery great story starts with a hero who believes.\u201d\n\nJust then, a loud crash echoed through the library. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Ravi exclaimed. \n\n\u201cWe need to investigate!\u201d Lana said, feeling a rush of courage. They rushed toward the sound, hearts pounding.\n\nAs they turned the corner, they spotted a shadowy figure near the bookcase. \u201cStop right there!\u201d Lana shouted, surprising herself.\n\nThe figure turned and grinned. \u201cYou\u2019re too late! All stories will vanish!\u201d \n\nLana and Ravi exchanged worried glances. What should they do now? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s gather our friends!\u201d Ravi suggested. \u201cWe need help!\u201d\n\n\u201cI\u2019m not sure I can speak in front of everyone,\u201d Lana said, biting her lip.\n\n\u201cYou can do it! We\u2019ll protect our stories together!\u201d Ravi cheered. \n\nWith newfound determination, Lana nodded. \u201cOkay, let\u2019s go!\u201d \n\nThey ran out of the library, ready to tell others about the Secret Society of Scribes and the villain that threatened their beloved stories.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Lana find in the library?","options":["A magic wand","An ancient journal","A treasure map","A new book"],"correct_answer":"An ancient journal"},{"question":"Who is Lana's best friend?","options":["Ms. Penworth","The shadowy figure","Ravi","The librarian"],"correct_answer":"Ravi"},{"question":"What does Ms. Penworth warn them about?","options":["A storm","A villain erasing stories","A treasure hunt","A book fair"],"correct_answer":"A villain erasing stories"},{"question":"What does Lana feel about speaking in front of people?","options":["Excited","Brave","Fearful","Happy"],"correct_answer":"Fearful"},{"question":"What do Lana and Ravi plan to do?","options":["Go home","Gather their friends","Read more books","Find a treasure"],"correct_answer":"Gather their friends"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_278_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_278_ch1_img1.png","plot_278_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":430,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
