   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_278_7_10","title":"The Secret Society of Scribes","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Secret Societies","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Lana stood in front of the grand library, her heart racing. The tall shelves filled with colorful books sparkled in the sunlight. \u201cThis place is magical!\u201d Ravi exclaimed, bouncing on his toes. \n\n\u201cYeah,\u201d Lana replied, her voice a whisper. \u201cBut what if we can\u2019t save the stories?\u201d \n\n\u201cDon\u2019t worry! We\u2019ll figure it out!\u201d Ravi said, his eyes shining with excitement. Ms. Penworth stepped out, her gray hair in a neat bun. \u201cAh, my young scribes! Ready for your mission?\u201d \n\nLana nodded but felt a flutter of nerves in her stomach. \u201cWe need to talk to the townspeople,\u201d she said softly.\n\n\u201cExactly! We need their help!\u201d Ms. Penworth replied, smiling. \u201cStories are important to everyone!\u201d\n\nAs they walked through the library, Lana spotted a dusty old book on the shelf. It had a golden cover with a lock. \u201cWhat\u2019s that?\u201d she asked, pointing.\n\n\u201cHmm,\u201d Ms. Penworth said thoughtfully. \u201cThat\u2019s the Book of Forgotten Tales. It holds stories lost to time. We could use it!\u201d [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nRavi\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cLet\u2019s open it!\u201d \n\nBut as they tried to unlock it, a loud crash echoed from the back of the library. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Lana gasped, clutching the journal.\n\n\u201cI think it\u2019s the villain\u2019s minions!\u201d Ravi shouted. \u201cWe have to hide!\u201d \n\nThey squeezed behind a bookshelf as two shadowy figures entered the room. \u201cWe\u2019ll find the scribes and erase every story!\u201d one of them sneered. Lana felt a chill run down her spine.\n\n\u201cWhat do we do?\u201d she whispered urgently. \n\n\u201cWe need to get the townspeople to help us!\u201d Ravi said. \u201cBut how can we convince them?\u201d \n\nLana took a deep breath, trying to calm her racing heart. \u201cI-I have to speak up. But what if they don\u2019t listen?\u201d \n\n\u201cEveryone loves stories, Lana! You can do this!\u201d Ravi cheered. \n\nJust then, a loud thud echoed as one of the minions kicked over a stack of books. \u201cCome out, scribes!\u201d they called. Lana knew they had to act fast. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Ms. Penworth urged. \u201cWe must gather our courage and find help!\u201d \n\nLana nodded determinedly. \u201cOkay! We\u2019ll save the stories!\u201d \n\nBut how? The challenge felt bigger than ever. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThey stepped out from behind the shelf and hurried towards the door. With each step, Lana\u2019s heart beat louder. Would she find the courage to speak? \n\nThe adventure was just beginning, and the stakes were high.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What book do Lana and her friends find in the library?","options":["The Book of Forgotten Tales","The Secret Guide","The Magic Spellbook","The Adventure Story"],"correct_answer":"The Book of Forgotten Tales"},{"question":"What do the minions want to do?","options":["Erase every story","Protect the stories","Make new stories","Help the scribes"],"correct_answer":"Erase every story"},{"question":"How does Lana feel about speaking to the townspeople?","options":["Excited","Nervous","Angry","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Nervous"},{"question":"Who encourages Lana to speak up?","options":["Ms. Penworth","Ravi","Her grandmother","The librarian"],"correct_answer":"Ravi"},{"question":"What do the friends need to gather to help save the stories?","options":["Their toys","The townspeople's help","More books","Magic spells"],"correct_answer":"The townspeople's help"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_278_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_278_ch2_img1.png","plot_278_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":406,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
