   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_278_7_10","title":"The Secret Society of Scribes","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Secret Societies","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Lana, Ravi, and Ms. Penworth stepped into the library\u2019s hidden room. It was filled with dusty shelves and strange, glowing books. The smell of old paper and adventure filled the air. \n\n\u201cThis is where the Secret Society of Scribes kept their most precious stories,\u201d Ms. Penworth whispered. Her eyes twinkled like stars. \u201cBut we must be careful. The villain\u2019s minions might be nearby.\u201d\n\nLana nodded, her heart racing. She felt a mix of excitement and fear. \u201cWhat if they find us?\u201d she asked, her voice barely above a whisper.\n\n\u201cThen we\u2019ll outsmart them!\u201d Ravi declared, fists clenched in determination. Just then, Ms. Penworth pointed to a large, leather-bound book on a high shelf. \n\n\u201cLook! That\u2019s the Book of Forgotten Tales. It holds the key to saving the stories!\u201d \n\nSuddenly, the door creaked. Lana held her breath. The minions were here! She could see shadows creeping under the door.\n\n\u201cQuick! We have to get that book!\u201d Ravi shouted. They dashed towards the shelf. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nLana felt a rush of bravery. She climbed up a nearby stack of boxes. As she reached for the book, a loud thud echoed in the room. A minion burst through the door! \n\n\u201cStop right there!\u201d it growled, its eyes glowing. \n\n\u201cRun!\u201d Ms. Penworth shouted. They all sprinted toward the back of the room. The minion chased after them, but Lana had an idea. \n\n\u201cWe need a distraction!\u201d she said, breathing hard. \n\nJust then, she spotted a small, shiny bell on a desk. \u201cI\u2019ll ring this and draw the minion away!\u201d \n\n\u201cAre you sure, Lana?\u201d Ravi asked, worry in his voice.\n\n\u201cI have to try! We can\u2019t let them take the stories!\u201d \n\nWith a deep breath, Lana grabbed the bell and rang it loudly. The sound echoed through the library.\n\nThe minion turned. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d it growled, looking confused. \n\nLana and her friends used the distraction to sneak around the shelves. \n\n\u201cWe have to hurry! The stories need us!\u201d \n\nLana felt a spark of courage. She realized that maybe, just maybe, she could stand up and speak for the stories after all. \n\nBut just as they reached the book, the minion roared again. \u201cYou won\u2019t escape!\u201d \n\nLana and Ravi exchanged worried glances. Would they be able to save the stories in time? \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Ms. Penworth urged. The three of them grabbed the Book of Forgotten Tales, but they had to make a choice\u2014face the minion or escape through a hidden door behind the shelves.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Lana and her friends find in the hidden room?","options":["A treasure chest","The Book of Forgotten Tales","A map","A magical wand"],"correct_answer":"The Book of Forgotten Tales"},{"question":"Who urges Lana to ring the bell?","options":["Ravi","Ms. Penworth","A minion","Her grandmother"],"correct_answer":"Ms. Penworth"},{"question":"What does Lana decide to do when the minion appears?","options":["Hide under a table","Ring the bell","Fight the minion","Run away alone"],"correct_answer":"Ring the bell"},{"question":"What feeling does Lana begin to embrace in this chapter?","options":["Fear","Courage","Anger","Sadness"],"correct_answer":"Courage"},{"question":"What choice do the characters face at the end of the chapter?","options":["To fight the minion or escape","To find another book","To leave the library","To call for help"],"correct_answer":"To fight the minion or escape"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_278_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_278_ch3_img1.png","plot_278_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":419,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
