   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_278_7_10","title":"The Secret Society of Scribes","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Secret Societies","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Lana stood in the hidden room of the library. The air was filled with dust and secrets. Old books lined the shelves, each one whispering stories. \n\n\"Wow! Look at all these books!\" Ravi exclaimed, his eyes wide with excitement. \n\nMs. Penworth adjusted her glasses. \"These are the Book of Forgotten Tales. They hold stories nobody remembers.\"\n\nJust then, they heard a noise. A shadow darted across the room. Lana's heart raced. \n\n\"Did you see that?\" she whispered.\n\nRavi nodded, his adventurous spirit shining. \"Let's check it out!\"\n\nThey crept toward the shadows. Suddenly, a minion of the villain appeared! He was tall and wore a dark cloak. \n\n\"You will never save the stories!\" he shouted, pointing a bony finger at them.\n\nLana felt her knees shake. \"What do we do now?\" she asked, her voice barely a whisper.\n\nRavi stepped forward. \"We stand together! We can outsmart him!\" \n\nWith a deep breath, Lana nodded. They needed a plan. \n\n\"Ms. Penworth, do you know any spells or tricks?\" Lana asked.\n\nMs. Penworth smiled softly. \"The power lies within you, Lana. You just need to believe.\"\n\nLana felt a spark of courage. \"Okay! Let\u2019s distract him!\" \n\nRavi grinned. \"I\u2019ll make a noise to lure him away. You grab the book!\"\n\nAs the minion turned, Ravi clapped loudly. The sound echoed in the room. \n\n\"Hey! Over here!\" he shouted, waving his arms.\n\nLana quickly reached for the Book of Forgotten Tales. She pulled it off the shelf just as the minion turned back.\n\n\"Stop them!\" he yelled, rushing toward them.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nLana felt a rush of bravery. She held the book close. \"We need to read its stories to defeat him!\"\n\n\"Yes! Let\u2019s do it together!\" Ravi replied.\n\nThey opened the book, and glowing words filled the air.\n\nThe minion froze. \"No! The stories!\" he cried out in fear.\n\nWith the words swirling around them, Lana felt the hope of every story come alive. \n\n\"Together!\" they shouted, holding hands.\n\nThe minion stumbled back, overwhelmed by the magic of the tales.\n\nSuddenly, the light surrounded them, and the minion vanished with a puff of smoke.\n\n\"We did it!\" Ravi cheered, high-fiving Lana.\n\n\"We're on our way to saving the stories!\" Lana said, her heart filled with hope.\n\n\"But we have to speak to everyone in town,\" Ms. Penworth reminded them. \"They need to know about the Secret Society of Scribes.\"\n\nLana took a deep breath. \"I can do this. We can do this!\"\n\nShe looked at her friends, ready to spread the word. They would save all the stories, together.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do they find in the hidden room?","options":["A book of spells","The Book of Forgotten Tales","A treasure chest","A magical creature"],"correct_answer":"The Book of Forgotten Tales"},{"question":"Who appears to threaten them in the hidden room?","options":["A kind wizard","A villain's minion","A friendly ghost","An old librarian"],"correct_answer":"A villain's minion"},{"question":"What do Lana and her friends decide to do with the Book?","options":["Hide it away","Read its stories","Burn it","Ignore it"],"correct_answer":"Read its stories"},{"question":"What does Ms. Penworth tell Lana about her power?","options":["It lies within her","She needs a spell","She should run away","It is hidden in the book"],"correct_answer":"It lies within her"},{"question":"What is Lana's main goal in this chapter?","options":["To find treasure","To save the stories","To leave the library","To become a villain"],"correct_answer":"To save the stories"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_278_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_278_ch4_img1.png","plot_278_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":432,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
