   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_278_7_10","title":"The Secret Society of Scribes","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Secret Societies","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Lana stood in the library, her heart racing. The air smelled like old books and adventure. She looked at her friends, Ravi and Ms. Penworth. \n\n\u201cAre we ready?\u201d she asked, trying to sound brave. \n\nRavi nodded eagerly. \u201cLet\u2019s do this! We need the town\u2019s support to save the stories!\u201d \n\nMs. Penworth smiled, her eyes twinkling. \u201cRemember, you\u2019re not alone, Lana. We\u2019re all in this together.\u201d\n\nThey decided to hold a storytelling event in the town square. Lana felt butterflies in her stomach. \u201cWhat if no one comes?\u201d she whispered. \n\n\u201cDon\u2019t worry!\u201d Ravi said, waving his arms. \u201cWe\u2019ll make it fun. We\u2019ll bring snacks!\u201d\n\nTogether, they made colorful posters to hang around town. Lana drew a picture of a magical book. \u201cThis is perfect!\u201d said Ravi, his eyes shining. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, they heard a loud crash outside. Lana\u2019s heart jumped. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d she exclaimed.\n\n\u201cI think it\u2019s a minion of the villain!\u201d Ms. Penworth said, looking serious. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s check it out!\u201d Ravi shouted, pulling Lana along. They hurried outside.\n\nWhen they reached the square, they saw a minion trying to tear down their posters! \n\n\u201cStop!\u201d Lana yelled, surprising herself. \u201cYou can\u2019t erase our stories!\u201d \n\nThe minion turned, his eyes wide with surprise. \u201cYou think you can stop me?\u201d he sneered.\n\nLana took a deep breath. \u201cYes! We will save the stories! Everyone loves them!\u201d \n\nThe townspeople began to gather, curious about the commotion. \n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Ravi shouted, pointing at Lana. \u201cShe\u2019s standing up against the minion!\u201d\n\nLana felt her courage grow. \u201cJoin us!\u201d she called out. \u201cWe need your help!\u201d\n\nWith the crowd behind her, Lana found strength. They all shouted together, \u201cSave the stories!\u201d The minion, frightened by the crowd, ran away.\n\nLana turned to her friends, beaming. \u201cWe did it!\u201d\n\nMs. Penworth smiled proudly. \u201cYou faced your fear today, Lana. You\u2019re a true member of the Secret Society of Scribes!\u201d\n\nLana felt a warm glow inside. \u201cI can\u2019t wait to share our stories!\u201d\n\nAs they walked back into the library, she knew this was just the beginning of their adventure.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What event do Lana and her friends plan to hold?","options":["A picnic","A storytelling event","A book sale","A treasure hunt"],"correct_answer":"A storytelling event"},{"question":"What does Lana draw for the posters?","options":["A dragon","A magical book","A treasure chest","A castle"],"correct_answer":"A magical book"},{"question":"How does Lana feel when she yells at the minion?","options":["Scared","Brave","Angry","Confused"],"correct_answer":"Brave"},{"question":"What do the townspeople do when they hear Lana?","options":["They run away","They cheer for her","They ignore her","They laugh"],"correct_answer":"They cheer for her"},{"question":"What does Ms. Penworth tell Lana at the end of the chapter?","options":["You're a true friend","You're a true member of the Society","You need to be quieter","You should draw more"],"correct_answer":"You're a true member of the Society"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_278_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_278_ch5_img1.png","plot_278_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":356,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
