   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_279_7_10","title":"The Explorers' Fraternity","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Secret Societies","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Sam stood at the edge of the ancient forest. The trees towered high, their leaves shimmering in the sunlight. \u201cWow, look at that!\u201d he exclaimed, pointing at a huge oak tree with a twisted trunk. \n\n\u201cThis forest is so magical!\u201d Zoe said, hopping beside him. She had a knack for spotting unique plants. \u201cI can\u2019t wait to explore!\u201d \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find something cool!\u201d Oliver chimed in, adjusting his glasses. He loved bringing gadgets on their adventures. \n\nAs they stepped into the forest, the air felt different. It was fresh and filled with the scent of pine. Sam felt butterflies in his stomach. Today was the day he would prove he belonged in the Explorers' Fraternity. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe trio ventured deeper. Zoe suddenly stopped. \u201cWait! Do you hear that?\u201d \n\n\u201cWhat?\u201d Sam asked, looking around. \n\n\u201cIt\u2019s a rustling sound,\u201d she whispered. \n\n\u201cMaybe it\u2019s a rare animal!\u201d Oliver suggested, pulling out his camera. \u201cLet\u2019s go check it out!\u201d \n\nThey followed the sound, hearts racing. But instead of a rare animal, they found a patch of vibrant, colorful flowers. \u201cThese are amazing!\u201d Zoe said, bending down to look closer. \n\nBut then, Sam noticed something strange. \u201cWhere\u2019s that big purple flower? It was here yesterday!\u201d \n\nZoe frowned. \u201cYou\u2019re right. It was right in the middle.\u201d \n\nOliver took a picture. \u201cMaybe someone took it. It could be the rare healing flower!\u201d \n\nSam's heart sank. If the flower was gone, their chance to study it was lost. \u201cWe have to find it!\u201d he declared. \u201cBefore someone bad gets it!\u201d \n\nThe friends agreed. They would need to act fast. A greedy collector was rumored to be in the area. \n\n\u201cI\u2019ll use my gadgets to track its trail,\u201d Oliver said, excitement bubbling in his voice. \n\n\u201cGood idea! Let\u2019s go!\u201d Zoe added, her eyes sparkling with determination. \n\nThey began their search, knowing they had to be careful. The forest held many secrets, and they would need to solve this mystery together. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAs they searched, Sam wondered if he had what it took to be an explorer. Could he really help find the missing flower? He felt a spark of hope. This could be his moment to shine!\n\nBut just then, a loud rustle came from the bushes nearby. Sam jumped back. \u201cWhat was that?!\u201d \n\nZoe squeezed his arm. \u201cLet\u2019s find out!\u201d\n\nSam took a deep breath. \u201cTogether?\u201d \n\n\u201cTogether!\u201d they all said in unison.\n\nAnd so, their adventure truly began.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Sam want to prove?","options":["He is a great singer","He belongs in the Explorers' Fraternity","He can climb trees","He can cook well"],"correct_answer":"He belongs in the Explorers' Fraternity"},{"question":"What do they discover missing?","options":["A rare animal","A rare flower","A special rock","A treasure map"],"correct_answer":"A rare flower"},{"question":"Who is suggested to be in the area?","options":["A friendly scientist","A greedy collector","A famous explorer","A lost puppy"],"correct_answer":"A greedy collector"},{"question":"What does Oliver use to help them?","options":["His camera","A map","His gadgets","A compass"],"correct_answer":"His gadgets"},{"question":"What do the friends decide to do when they hear a rustle?","options":["Run away","Investigate together","Ignore it","Climb a tree"],"correct_answer":"Investigate together"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_279_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_279_ch1_img1.png","plot_279_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":411,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
