   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_279_7_10","title":"The Explorers' Fraternity","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Secret Societies","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"As the sun peeked through the tall trees, Sam, Zoe, and Oliver stood at the edge of the ancient forest. \u201cWow! Look at all the colors!\u201d Zoe exclaimed, pointing to the vibrant flowers. \u201cThis place is amazing!\u201d [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cI hope we find that rare flower,\u201d Sam said, adjusting his backpack. \u201cWe must hurry before that collector gets it.\u201d\n\nOliver pulled out his gadget. \u201cI can use my tracker to search for clues!\u201d He pressed a few buttons, and a small screen lit up. \u201cIf we find the flower, we can prove we\u2019re true explorers!\u201d\n\nWith a sense of excitement, the trio ventured deeper into the forest. The trees whispered secrets, and the air smelled of fresh pine. Suddenly, they stumbled upon a muddy path. \u201cThis looks tricky,\u201d Zoe said, squinting at the squishy ground.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s be careful,\u201d Sam suggested. \u201cWe don\u2019t want to get stuck!\u201d \n\nAs they tiptoed along the path, Oliver\u2019s gadget beeped. \u201cLook!\u201d he pointed at the screen. \u201cThere\u2019s movement ahead! Maybe it\u2019s the flower!\u201d\n\nThey rushed forward, hearts racing. But when they reached a clearing, they stopped in shock. A large, scruffy bear was sniffing around! \u201cOh no!\u201d Sam whispered. \u201cWhat do we do?\u201d\n\nZoe grinned. \u201cI have an idea! Bears love honey, right? What if we distract it?\u201d She quickly pointed to a nearby tree. \u201cI saw a beehive up there!\u201d\n\n\u201cGreat idea!\u201d Oliver said. \u201cI can use my drone to knock the hive down!\u201d\n\nJust then, the bear turned and stared at them with its big, curious eyes. Sam felt a rush of fear. \u201cHurry!\u201d he shouted, while Oliver launched the drone into the air. \n\nWith a buzz, the drone flew towards the hive. Would it work? Would they distract the bear? [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2] \n\nAs the drone drew closer, the bear began to move. \u201cIt\u2019s working!\u201d Zoe cheered. \u201cNow\u2019s our chance!\u201d\n\nThe three friends exchanged nervous glances, ready for the next step. They had to move fast! They knew they were on the brink of a real adventure.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Sam, Zoe, and Oliver want to find?","options":["A bear","A rare flower","A tree","A cave"],"correct_answer":"A rare flower"},{"question":"What does Oliver use to help in their adventure?","options":["A map","A drone","A telescope","A compass"],"correct_answer":"A drone"},{"question":"What does Zoe suggest to distract the bear?","options":["Throw rocks","Climb a tree","Use honey","Run away"],"correct_answer":"Use honey"},{"question":"How do Sam and his friends feel when they encounter the bear?","options":["Excited","Scared","Bored","Happy"],"correct_answer":"Scared"},{"question":"What does Sam carry with him?","options":["A net","A backpack","A basket","A stick"],"correct_answer":"A backpack"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_279_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_279_ch2_img1.png","plot_279_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":342,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
