   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_279_7_10","title":"The Explorers' Fraternity","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Secret Societies","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"The forest was thick with trees, their branches swaying in the gentle breeze. Sam, Zoe, and Oliver stood on a narrow path. \u201cThis is the deepest part of the forest,\u201d whispered Zoe, excitement dancing in her eyes. \u201cWe might find the flower here!\u201d \n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, a rustle came from the bushes nearby. Sam's heart raced. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d he asked, eyes wide. Oliver pulled out his gadget, a small drone. \u201cIt could be an animal!\u201d he said, trying to sound calm. \u201cLet\u2019s use the drone to see.\u201d\n\nAs Oliver launched the drone into the sky, the three friends watched it buzz high above the trees. \u201cLook! There\u2019s something moving!\u201d Zoe shouted. The drone\u2019s camera showed a big bear rummaging through the underbrush. \u201cOh no,\u201d Sam gasped. \u201cWe need to distract it!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s use my snack pack!\u201d said Zoe, pulling out some granola bars. \u201cBears love food!\u201d Sam nodded. \u201cGood idea! We can throw the snacks away from us.\u201d\n\nWith the plan in place, they quietly opened the granola bars and tossed them into the bushes. The bear sniffed the air, turned, and lumbered toward the snacks. \u201cQuick! Let\u2019s move!\u201d Sam shouted. They tiptoed past the bear, holding their breath. \n\nJust then, the drone started to beep loudly. \u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d Oliver cried. The drone was losing control! \u201cI can\u2019t steer it!\u201d he yelled. The drone dove down, right toward the bear! \n\n\u201cLook out!\u201d Zoe screamed. The bear turned, surprised by the buzzing drone. It swatted at it with a furry paw. The drone spun around and whirred away, leaving the bear confused. \u201cThat was close!\u201d Sam said, relieved but shaken. \n\nAs they continued their trek, they stumbled upon a hidden cave. \u201cDo you think the flower could be inside?\u201d whispered Zoe. \u201cOnly one way to find out!\u201d Sam replied, feeling brave. He led the way into the dark cave.\n\nInside, they found glowing mushrooms and sparkling rocks. \u201cIt\u2019s beautiful!\u201d Zoe marveled. But then, they heard a loud rumbling. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Oliver asked, his eyes wide. Suddenly, a shadow loomed over them. They turned to find a figure in the cave entrance. \n\n\u201cWho dares enter my cave?\u201d the figure boomed. Sam\u2019s heart sank. \u201cWe\u2019re just explorers!\u201d he stammered. \u201cWe\u2019re looking for a rare flower!\u201d \n\nThe figure stepped closer, revealing a grumpy old man. \u201cYou are too late, children! The flower is mine!\u201d he growled. Sam felt a wave of panic. \u201cWhat do we do?\u201d he whispered to Zoe and Oliver as they backed away. \n\n\u201cThink, Sam, think!\u201d Zoe urged. \u201cThis is our chance to prove ourselves!\u201d But the old man was blocking their only way out. \n\n\u201cNow what?\u201d Oliver whispered, his hands shaking. Sam took a deep breath. \u201cWe have to outsmart him,\u201d he said. \u201cLet\u2019s show him we\u2019re not afraid!\u201d \n\nBut as they formed a plan, the ground shook again. The cave was starting to crumble\u2026","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What animal do the friends encounter in the forest?","options":["A bear","A lion","A rabbit","A fox"],"correct_answer":"A bear"},{"question":"What do they use to distract the bear?","options":["A stick","A toy","Granola bars","A whistle"],"correct_answer":"Granola bars"},{"question":"What do the friends find inside the cave?","options":["A treasure","Glowing mushrooms","A waterfall","A bear"],"correct_answer":"Glowing mushrooms"},{"question":"Who claims the rare flower for himself?","options":["A young explorer","A friendly animal","A grumpy old man","A forest spirit"],"correct_answer":"A grumpy old man"},{"question":"What happens at the end of the chapter?","options":["They find the flower","The cave begins to crumble","They meet a fairy","They get lost"],"correct_answer":"The cave begins to crumble"}]},"images":null,"word_count":490,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
