   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_279_7_10","title":"The Explorers' Fraternity","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Secret Societies","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"As the cave began to tremble, Sam shouted, \u201cWe need to get out, now!\u201d Zoe nodded, her eyes wide with fear. Oliver quickly grabbed his drone, which had landed safely nearby. \u201cLet\u2019s use this to scout ahead!\u201d he said, pushing buttons with quick fingers. \n\nWith a whirring buzz, the drone lifted off. It flew out of the cave, shining its light into the trees outside. Sam peered over Oliver\u2019s shoulder. \u201cCan you see anything?\u201d\n\nThe drone zoomed forward. \u201cThere!\u201d Zoe pointed. \u201cI see a path! It looks safe!\u201d \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Sam urged. They hurried to follow the drone\u2019s path. The sun peeked through the leaves, casting warm beams of light on the forest floor. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe trio emerged from the cave, gasping for fresh air. The forest felt alive and vibrant. Tall trees danced in the gentle breeze, and colorful flowers bloomed everywhere. Sam took a deep breath. \u201cLook at this place! It\u2019s beautiful!\u201d\n\nZoe knelt down to examine a group of bright purple flowers. \u201cThese look rare too! But we need to find the healing flower first.\u201d \n\nSuddenly, Oliver frowned at his gadget. \u201cGuys, the hidden collector is close! We have to hurry!\u201d \n\nThey raced down the newly discovered path, hearts pounding. Sam tripped over a root, but Zoe quickly helped him up. \u201cStay focused!\u201d she encouraged. \n\nJust then, the drone beeped wildly. \u201cWhat\u2019s wrong?\u201d Sam asked. \n\n\u201cThere! Look!\u201d Oliver pointed. The drone showed a shadowy figure in the distance. \u201cThat must be the collector!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s sneak closer,\u201d Zoe whispered, her nature instincts kicking in. They crouched behind a bush, peeking out. \n\nThe figure was tall and wearing a big hat. He searched the ground, looking for something. \u201cI can\u2019t believe it!\u201d Sam whispered. \u201cHe\u2019s looking for the flower!\u201d\n\n\u201cWe have to find it first,\u201d Zoe said. \u201cLet\u2019s split up. I\u2019ll check the other side of the stream!\u201d \n\n\u201cI\u2019ll follow the trail into the denser part of the woods,\u201d Oliver added. Sam nodded. \u201cAnd I\u2019ll stay here and watch the collector!\u201d \n\nAs they split up, Sam felt a mix of excitement and worry. This was his chance to prove himself. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nSitting quietly, he watched the figure from behind the bush. The collector knelt down, his hands brushing through the grass. Sam held his breath. Would they find the flower before him?\n\nThe forest buzzed with life. Birds chirped, and leaves rustled. Sam felt more hopeful. \u201cWe can do this!\u201d he whispered to himself.\n\nHe just had to keep watch until his friends returned. The adventure was far from over.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Sam, Zoe, and Oliver find when they escaped the cave?","options":["A busy street","A beautiful forest","A dark tunnel","A tall building"],"correct_answer":"A beautiful forest"},{"question":"What does Oliver use to help them during their adventure?","options":["A book","A drone","A map","A flashlight"],"correct_answer":"A drone"},{"question":"What does Zoe suggest they do when they see the collector?","options":["Run away","Tell him to leave","Split up","Give him the flower"],"correct_answer":"Split up"},{"question":"How does Sam feel while watching the collector?","options":["Scared","Bored","Hopeful","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Hopeful"},{"question":"What happens to the cave at the end of Chapter 3?","options":["It becomes a park","It starts to collapse","It gets filled with water","It turns into a house"],"correct_answer":"It starts to collapse"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_279_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_279_ch4_img1.png","plot_279_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":436,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
