   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_280_7_10","title":"The Phantom Collectors","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Secret Societies","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Nia stood in front of the local museum, her heart racing. It was a huge building with tall stone walls and bright windows. Inside, it was dark and mysterious. \"The museum is like a treasure chest,\" she whispered to herself. \"I can\u2019t wait to explore!\"\n\nHer best friend, Max, bounced beside her. \"Do you think we\u2019ll find any real ghosts today?\" he asked, his eyes sparkling with excitement. Max loved inventing gadgets, and today he had a special one. It was a homemade ghost detector made from a shoebox and some shiny buttons.\n\nNia giggled. \"Ghosts? Not today! But maybe we\u2019ll find something magical!\" She pushed open the heavy door, and they stepped inside. The smell of old books and polished wood filled the air. When they entered, they noticed Zara, a girl from their school. Zara was known for her strange stories. Today, her long dark hair flowed like a shadow behind her.\n\n\"Hey, Nia! Max!\" Zara called, waving. \"Did you hear about the Phantom Collectors?\" Nia's eyes widened. \"What\u2019s that?\" she asked, curious.\n\nZara came closer, glancing around. \"It\u2019s a secret society that protects magical artifacts! They say they need new members.\" Nia\u2019s heart skipped. She had always dreamed of adventures, and this sounded perfect!\n\nSuddenly, there was a loud crash from the back of the museum. \"What was that?\" Max squeaked, clutching his ghost detector. \"Let\u2019s check it out!\" said Nia, feeling brave. They tiptoed down a dim hallway, shadows dancing on the walls.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]  \nAn illustration of Nia, Max, and Zara standing in front of the tall and mysterious museum, with bright windows and a shadowy entrance. Nia looks excited, Max holds his shoebox ghost detector, and Zara smiles mysteriously.\n\nAs they turned the corner, they found a display case shattered on the floor. Broken glass glittered everywhere. \"Oh no! The magical amulet is gone!\" Zara gasped. Nia felt a chill run down her spine. \"What if someone stole it?\"\n\nMax adjusted his glasses. \"We need to find it! The Phantom Collectors can help!\" Nia nodded, determination sparking in her eyes. But as they looked around, Nia noticed a figure in the shadows. \"Who\u2019s there?\" she called, her voice steady.\n\nThe figure slipped away, leaving behind a strange note. Nia picked it up, her heart pounding. \"We need to solve this mystery,\" she said. \"Now!\" \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]  \nAn image showing Nia holding the mysterious note with a worried expression, while Max and Zara look at her curiously. The shattered display case is visible in the background, with broken glass glinting on the floor.\n\nWhat if every artifact held a secret? What if Nia was meant to uncover them?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What secret society do Nia and her friends learn about?","options":["The Phantom Rangers","The Phantom Collectors","The Ghost Hunters","The Magical Society"],"correct_answer":"The Phantom Collectors"},{"question":"What does Max use to detect ghosts?","options":["A flashlight","A ghost detector","A magnifying glass","A map"],"correct_answer":"A ghost detector"},{"question":"Who is the mysterious girl from their school?","options":["Nia","Max","Zara","Lily"],"correct_answer":"Zara"},{"question":"What happens when they enter the museum?","options":["They find treasure","They find a ghost","They hear a crash","They see a movie"],"correct_answer":"They hear a crash"},{"question":"What do Nia and her friends decide to do after finding the broken display case?","options":["Leave the museum","Find the missing amulet","Call the police","Take a picture"],"correct_answer":"Find the missing amulet"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_280_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_280_ch1_img1.png","plot_280_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":451,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
