   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_280_7_10","title":"The Phantom Collectors","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Secret Societies","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Nia stood in front of the museum's tall doors. The moonlight glimmered off the glass, making it look magical. \u201cDo you think we\u2019ll find any clues?\u201d she asked Max, her eyes sparkling with excitement.  \n\u201cDefinitely! Let\u2019s go!\u201d Max replied, bouncing on his toes. Zara stood quietly, her gaze drifting to the shadows.  \n\nAs they stepped inside, the museum smelled old and dusty. Giant dinosaur bones hung from the ceiling. Nia felt a thrill. \u201cLook at all the treasures!\u201d she exclaimed. The paintings on the walls seemed alive, telling stories of the past.  \n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]  \n\nBut then, their excitement turned to worry. \u201cWhat if we can\u2019t find the amulet?\u201d Nia whispered, feeling a knot in her stomach.  \nZara frowned. \u201cWe must hurry. The Phantom Collectors need us.\u201d \n\nMax pulled out a small gadget he had invented. \u201cThis will help us find hidden clues!\u201d He pressed a button, and it beeped. \u201cLet\u2019s check near the ancient Egypt exhibit!\u201d  \n\nAs they raced through the museum, a loud crash echoed behind them. Nia turned. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d  \n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but we have to see!\u201d Max said, his face pale.  \n\nThey hurried back, finding a group of people in the corner. One of them was wearing a long, dark cloak. \u201cI don\u2019t trust that one,\u201d Zara said softly. \u201cThey could be from the rival society!\u201d  \n\nNia nodded. \u201cLet\u2019s sneak closer!\u201d They crept behind a giant statue, trying to listen. They heard whispers. \u201cThe amulet will be ours! No one can stop us!\u201d  \n\nNia gasped. \u201cWe have to tell the others!\u201d But when they turned around, the cloak was gone. \u201cWhere did they go?\u201d Nia asked, feeling scared.  \n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]  \n\nThen, suddenly, the lights flickered. \u201cQuick! We need to find the amulet before it\u2019s too late!\u201d Max shouted. They dashed into the next room filled with ancient artifacts. Nia felt the weight of their secret mission. Would they find the amulet in time?  \n\nAs they stepped into the darkness, shadows danced around them. The museum felt alive with secrets, and Nia was determined to uncover them all.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Nia and her friends hear in the museum?","options":["Loud music","Whispers about the amulet","A dinosaur roaring","Someone laughing"],"correct_answer":"Whispers about the amulet"},{"question":"What does Max invent to help them?","options":["A flashlight","A gadget to find clues","A robot","A map"],"correct_answer":"A gadget to find clues"},{"question":"Who suggests they sneak closer to the whispers?","options":["Nia","Max","Zara","The cloaked figure"],"correct_answer":"Zara"},{"question":"What do the children need to find before it's too late?","options":["A map","The amulet","A new friend","A treasure"],"correct_answer":"The amulet"},{"question":"What happens when they turn around after hearing the whispers?","options":["The cloaked figure is gone","They see a dinosaur","They find a treasure chest","They meet a museum guide"],"correct_answer":"The cloaked figure is gone"}]},"images":null,"word_count":350,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
