   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_280_7_10","title":"The Phantom Collectors","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Secret Societies","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Nia, Max, and Zara tiptoed through the museum\u2019s shadowy halls. The walls seemed to whisper secrets as they passed by the ancient artifacts. Nia's heart raced. \u201cDo you think the amulet is hidden here?\u201d she asked.\n\n\u201cI hope so,\u201d Max replied, adjusting his glasses. \u201cWe need to find it before the Dark Society does!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s check the enchanted room,\u201d Zara suggested. She pointed to a door marked with strange symbols. The door creaked as they pushed it open. Inside, the room glowed with the light of floating orbs.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe walls were covered in colorful paintings of magical creatures. \u201cWow! Look at that dragon!\u201d Nia exclaimed, pointing to a painting. Max took a step closer, examining everything carefully. \u201cThis place is amazing!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, Zara\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cWait! Do you hear that?\u201d \n\nThey listened. Footsteps echoed in the hallway. \u201cWe have to hide!\u201d Nia whispered. They ducked behind a large statue of a griffin. It was cold and hard, but Nia felt safer there. \n\nThe footsteps grew louder. Two members of the Dark Society stepped into the room. They were dressed in dark cloaks, their faces hidden. \u201cI heard she was here,\u201d one said. \u201cWe must find the amulet!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s look in the enchanted room,\u201d the other replied. \n\nNia\u2019s heart raced. They were close! She peered around the griffin. \u201cWhat if they find us?\u201d she squeaked. \n\n\u201cDon\u2019t worry,\u201d Max said, pulling out a small device from his backpack. \u201cI can create a distraction!\u201d He pressed a button, and a whirring noise filled the air. A small robot zoomed out from behind them, beeping loudly.\n\nThe dark figures turned, surprised. \u201cWhat is that?\u201d one yelled. \n\nNia saw her chance. \u201cNow!\u201d she shouted, and they dashed past the distraction. They raced to the exit. Nia's mind whirled with questions. Who could they trust? Was Zara really on their side? \n\nThey burst into the moonlit streets, breathless and scared. \u201cWe need to find the amulet!\u201d Nia declared. \u201cBut how do we know who is with us?\u201d\n\nMax nodded, looking at Zara. \u201cYou have to tell us everything you know, Zara.\u201d\n\nZara hesitated, her eyes looking distant. \u201cOkay. But you must promise to believe me,\u201d she finally said. \u201cThe amulet has a hidden power. If it falls into the wrong hands, it could destroy everything.\u201d\n\nWith that, the weight of their mission pressed down on Nia. A dark shadow loomed over them. The adventure was just beginning.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Nia said, determination in her eyes. She knew they had to move fast, but what would happen next?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What room do Nia, Max, and Zara explore?","options":["The enchanted room","The dark room","The treasure room","The secret room"],"correct_answer":"The enchanted room"},{"question":"What distraction does Max create?","options":["A loud noise","A robot","A light","A mirror"],"correct_answer":"A robot"},{"question":"What do the Dark Society want?","options":["The amulet","The key","The treasure","The map"],"correct_answer":"The amulet"},{"question":"What does Zara reveal about the amulet?","options":["It is lost","It can grant wishes","It has a hidden power","It is very old"],"correct_answer":"It has a hidden power"},{"question":"How do Nia, Max, and Zara feel at the end of the chapter?","options":["Excited","Confused","Scared","Determined"],"correct_answer":"Determined"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_280_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_280_ch3_img1.png","plot_280_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":432,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
