   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_280_7_10","title":"The Phantom Collectors","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Secret Societies","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Nia, Max, and Zara stood in the enchanted room, staring at the ancient chest. Sunlight spilled through the dusty windows, dancing on the walls. \u201cWhat if this chest holds the answer?\u201d Nia whispered, her heart racing.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s open it!\u201d Max said, his eyes sparkling with excitement. Zara nodded, her fingers tracing the strange symbols on the parchment. \u201cThese symbols look like they belong to a map,\u201d she said.\n\nWith a deep breath, Nia lifted the heavy lid. Dust floated in the air like tiny stars. Inside, they found a collection of odd objects: a shimmering stone, a tiny key, and a mirror that sparkled like it held a thousand secrets. \n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Max exclaimed, holding up the mirror. \u201cIt\u2019s beautiful!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nNia grabbed the parchment and laid it flat. Symbols glowed softly, illuminating the room. \u201cThis map shows the museum, but why are there X\u2019s here?\u201d she asked, pointing to two spots marked in red.\n\nZara squinted. \u201cThose spots might lead us to the amulet! But we need to hurry,\u201d she warned, looking worried. \u201cThe Dark Society could already be on their way.\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s split up,\u201d suggested Max. \u201cWe can cover more ground that way.\u201d\n\nNia nodded, feeling a mix of fear and excitement. \u201cOkay. I\u2019ll go to the first spot. Max, you take the second one. Zara, stay here and watch for any signs of trouble.\u201d \n\nMax grinned. \u201cDon\u2019t worry, I\u2019ll invent something just in case!\u201d\n\nAs they hurried off, Nia\u2019s heart pounded. She whispered to herself, \u201cI can do this. I have to find the amulet.\u201d\n\nThe first spot was a dusty corner near the dinosaur exhibit. Nia searched every inch, but found nothing. Just as she was about to give up, she felt something cold under the floorboards. \u201cWhat\u2019s this?\u201d she wondered, pulling at the wooden slats.\n\nSuddenly, she heard footsteps! Her heart raced. \u201cIs someone there?\u201d she called out, hoping it was Max or Zara. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nTo her surprise, a shadowy figure appeared. It was one of the Dark Society members! \u201cWhat are you doing here, little girl?\u201d he sneered, stepping closer. \n\nNia stood tall, holding the parchment like a shield. \u201cI\u2019m here to stop you!\u201d she declared, her voice steady. \u201cYou won\u2019t get the amulet!\u201d\n\nThe figure chuckled, but then suddenly faltered. The shimmering mirror that Max had found began to glow bright. \u201cWhat is that?\u201d he asked, panic rising in his voice.\n\nNia felt a spark of hope. \u201cThe mirror! It\u2019s magical!\u201d \n\nIn that moment, she knew she couldn\u2019t back down. With her heart full of courage, she shouted, \u201cTogether, we can stop them!\u201d \n\nJust then, Max and Zara arrived, ready to help. The three friends stood strong against the dark figure, united in their mission.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Nia, Max, and Zara find inside the chest?","options":["A magical amulet","A map and a mirror","A treasure chest","A dinosaur bone"],"correct_answer":"A map and a mirror"},{"question":"What do the symbols on the parchment lead to?","options":["The Dark Society","A hidden treasure","The museum","A secret room"],"correct_answer":"The museum"},{"question":"Who does Nia encounter at the first spot?","options":["Max","Zara","A Dark Society member","A museum guard"],"correct_answer":"A Dark Society member"},{"question":"What does Max plan to invent?","options":["A time machine","A magical potion","Something for protection","A treasure map"],"correct_answer":"Something for protection"},{"question":"What is Nia determined to do?","options":["Find the treasure","Stop the Dark Society","Join a different society","Leave the museum"],"correct_answer":"Stop the Dark Society"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_280_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_280_ch5_img1.png","plot_280_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":466,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
