     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"mystery","1":"artifact","2":"determine","3":"betrayal","4":"courage","image_prompts":["A dimly lit museum corridor filled with mysterious artifacts. Nia, a twelve-year-old girl with curly black hair, stands at the forefront, looking intrigued yet cautious. Max, her inventive friend with glasses, is beside her, holding a gadget. Zara, enigmatic and slightly aloof, stands a step back, her intense gaze focused ahead. Shadows cast across the walls, enhancing the ambiance of suspense.","An action-packed scene where Nia, Max, and Zara are running down a narrow hallway filled with ancient pottery and armor. Glass fragments from a shattered display case glisten on the floor. Nia leads the charge, determination on her face, while Max follows closely, gripping his flashlight. Zara glances back at the pursuing figures, her expression a mix of urgency and resolve. The air is thick with tension as they race against time."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dimly lit room filled with ancient artifacts, illuminated by flickering lights. Dust motes float in the air, and shadows stretch across the walls. Nia stands at the forefront, her face illuminated with curiosity and determination, while Max peers over her shoulder, eyes wide with wonder. The atmosphere is charged with the allure of secrets waiting to be uncovered.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_280_ch2_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 18:56:48"}}}
