   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_280_11_14","title":"The Phantom Collectors","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Secret Societies","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Nia stood before the towering shelves of the museum\u2019s back room, her heart pounding like a drum in a marching band. Shadowy artifacts loomed around her, each one a keeper of secrets. She could almost hear them whispering, sharing tales of their magical pasts. \"This place feels alive,\" she whispered to Max, who was busy tinkering with a small gadget he had built, his brow furrowed in concentration.\n\nMax grinned without looking up. \"More like haunted. We need to figure out what\u2019s going on with the Star of Eldoria before it ends up in the wrong hands.\" Indeed, the missing artifact felt like a dark cloud hovering over their new society. Zara, who had been silent, suddenly spoke up, her voice low and mysterious. \"We need to go deeper into the vaults. There are hidden chambers that may hold clues.\"\n\nNia nodded, feeling a mix of excitement and dread. \"Lead the way, Zara.\" As they ventured further, the dim light cast dancing shadows on the walls, making the museum feel like an enchanted labyrinth. Nia could sense an unseen presence lurking in the corners, a reminder that they weren\u2019t the only ones searching.\n\nThe trio reached an old wooden door, its surface warped with age. Zara pushed it open, revealing a tight corridor lined with dusty artifacts covered in dark cloths. \"This is it,\" she said, her eyes sparkling with determination. \"The Chamber of Echoes. It\u2019s said that whatever you seek reveals itself here.\" \n\nBefore Nia could catch her breath, a sharp noise echoed through the corridor\u2014a loud crash followed by hurried footsteps. \"We\u2019re not alone!\" Max shouted, his invention clattering to the ground. Nia\u2019s heart raced. Had the rival society found them? She glanced at Zara, whose expression had turned grave.\n\nJust as they turned to flee, Zara grabbed Nia\u2019s arm. \"Wait! We can\u2019t leave without knowing what\u2019s here!\" \n\nNia felt torn. Was the risk worth it? Just then, something caught her eye\u2014a glimmering object half-hidden under a tattered cloth. \"Look!\" she exclaimed, pulling away from Zara to reveal a small, ornate box. Intricate symbols adorned its surface, glowing faintly as if beckoning her closer. \n\nThey both leaned in, breathless. \"This could be the key!\" Zara whispered, but before Nia could respond, a shadowy figure emerged from the shadows, blocking their exit. It was tall, cloaked in darkness, and the air grew heavy with dread.\n\n\u201cAh, the little collectors,\u201d the figure sneered, his voice dripping with malice. \"You\u2019ve come to play, have you?\" \n\nMax stepped forward, eyes wide with fear but determination. \"We\u2019ll stop you!\" \n\nNia felt the weight of uncertainty weighing down on her. Could she trust Zara? The revelation of the box felt monumental, but the threat before them loomed larger. \n\nSuddenly, the figure lunged, and Nia\u2019s instincts kicked in. She grabbed the box tightly, feeling its energy pulse through her fingers. \"Run!\" she shouted, and they sprinted down the corridor, the shadowy figure's menacing laughter echoing behind them.\n\nWhat had they just uncovered? Nia looked back, adrenaline fueling her escape, but the severity of their danger loomed larger than ever. They needed to decide: would they confront the figure or dig deeper into the mystery of the box? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What chamber do Nia, Max, and Zara enter?","options":["Chamber of Secrets","Chamber of Echoes","Hall of Shadows","Vault of Wonders"],"correct_answer":"Chamber of Echoes"},{"question":"What do Nia and her friends discover in the chamber?","options":["A treasure map","A glowing orb","An ornate box","A statue of a dragon"],"correct_answer":"An ornate box"},{"question":"Who blocks their escape from the chamber?","options":["A museum guard","A rival collector","A shadowy figure","A ghost"],"correct_answer":"A shadowy figure"},{"question":"What does Nia feel upon finding the box?","options":["Excitement","Fear","Anger","Confusion"],"correct_answer":"Excitement"},{"question":"What do Nia and her friends decide to do at the end of the chapter?","options":["Confront the figure","Hide in the chamber","Run away","Call for help"],"correct_answer":"Confront the figure"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_280_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_280_ch3_img1.png","plot_280_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":550,"reading_level":"Builder"}
