   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_280_11_14","title":"The Phantom Collectors","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Secret Societies","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Nia stood at the entrance of the museum, the towering doors appearing more ominous than ever. Shadows danced along the walls, whispering secrets of the past. She took a deep breath, feeling the weight of her mission pressing down on her shoulders. Max fidgeted beside her, his fingers tapping rhythmically against the backpack filled with their makeshift gadgets. Zara, her eyes glinting with unspoken knowledge, stepped forward, her presence both reassuring and unsettling.\n\n\u201cAre you ready?\u201d Zara asked, her voice a soft melody, but Nia could sense the tension underlying her words. \n\n\u201cReady as I\u2019ll ever be,\u201d Nia replied, her heart thumping like a drum in her chest. They had uncovered a mystery, but could they trust each other enough to solve it?\n\nAs the trio ventured into the museum\u2019s depths, the glow of the overhead lights flickered, casting eerie shadows. They moved cautiously, weaving through exhibits filled with ancient artifacts. Nia was captivated by the stories each piece could tell. Here was a shield from a long-forgotten war, there a gilded statue of a forgotten goddess. But their mission gnawed at her thoughts\u2014where was the Star of Eldoria?\n\nSuddenly, a loud crash echoed from the far side of the gallery. Nia's stomach twisted. \u201cDid you hear that?\u201d she hissed, her eyes darting toward the source of the noise. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s check it out!\u201d Max whispered, his eyes wide with excitement. Nia nodded, her pulse quickening as they crept toward the sound. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they turned the corner, they stumbled upon a group of hooded figures gathered around a large, ornate box. It was the same box they had discovered in the hidden chamber! Nia felt the thrill of discovery, but it quickly transformed into dread. \u201cWhat are they doing?\u201d she murmured, hiding behind a nearby exhibit.\n\n\u201cI think they\u2019re trying to break into it,\u201d Zara replied, her voice barely above a whisper. \u201cThat box might hold the key to the Star!\u201d\n\nNia\u2019s mind raced. The rival society, the Dark Collectors, had to be behind this. But why were they here? She peeked again and saw one of the figures pull out a shimmering dagger. \u201cWhat are they planning?\u201d \n\nBefore they could process the situation, a sharp voice cut through the air. \u201cWe need that artifact! The master will not be pleased if we fail!\u201d \n\nNia felt her heart sink. She exchanged a worried glance with Max and Zara. They had to act, and fast. \u201cWe need a distraction,\u201d Nia said, her mind racing. \n\nMax's eyes lit up. \u201cI\u2019ve got just the thing!\u201d He rummaged through his backpack until he found a small device that looked like a miniature rocket. \u201cThis will create a loud bang and some smoke!\u201d \n\n\u201cAre you sure it\u2019ll work?\u201d Nia asked, her voice tight with anxiety.\n\n\u201cTrust me,\u201d Max grinned, determination sparking in his eyes.\n\nWith a shared nod, they positioned themselves behind a row of artifacts. Max counted down, and as he pressed the button, a loud explosion of noise emanated from the device, followed by a cloud of smoke. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe hooded figures shrieked in surprise, stumbling back as they lost sight of their target. \u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d one shouted, panic rising in their voices.\n\n\u201cNow!\u201d Nia shouted, and they dashed toward the box, determination fueling their steps. They had to retrieve it before the Dark Collectors realized what was happening.\n\nAs Nia reached the box, she felt a surge of hope. Perhaps this was the moment they would turn the tide in their favor. But just as she reached out to open it, a hand shot out from the smoke, gripping her wrist tightly. Nia's heart raced. Who could it be? \n\nThe world tilted on its axis as she spun around to face the person who had just appeared from the shadows...","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Nia and her friends find in the museum?","options":["A map","A powerful artifact","A treasure chest","A hidden door"],"correct_answer":"A powerful artifact"},{"question":"Who is Max?","options":["Nia's cousin","A rival collector","Her loyal friend","A museum guard"],"correct_answer":"Her loyal friend"},{"question":"What distracts the hooded figures?","options":["A loud bang and smoke","A flashlight","A loud alarm","A voice from the shadows"],"correct_answer":"A loud bang and smoke"},{"question":"What emotion does Nia feel when she sees the rival society with the box?","options":["Joy","Fear","Indifference","Curiosity"],"correct_answer":"Fear"},{"question":"What is the main conflict in Chapter 4?","options":["Nia's friendship with Max","The search for the Star of Eldoria","The confrontation with the Dark Collectors","The museum's closing hours"],"correct_answer":"The confrontation with the Dark Collectors"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_280_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_280_ch4_img1.png","plot_280_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":639,"reading_level":"Builder"}
