   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_271_7_10","title":"The Case of the Missing Goldfish","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Crime Solving","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Mia and Theo stood in the bustling hallways of Riverview Middle School. They had just left the janitor's closet. The clock ticked loudly above them. Only an hour remained until the big game.\n\n\u201cWhat if we don\u2019t find Bubbles?\u201d Mia asked, her brow furrowed with worry.\n\n\u201cWe have to try!\u201d Theo replied, his eyes bright. \u201cLet\u2019s check the science lab. Mr. Hargrove might know something.\u201d\n\nThey hurried to the lab, excitement mixed with nervousness. The door creaked as they pushed it open. The room was filled with bubbling beakers and colorful fish tanks. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cMr. Hargrove!\u201d Mia called, but there was no answer. They walked deeper into the lab. Suddenly, they spotted a sparkly item near a tank. \n\n\u201cLook! A scale!\u201d Theo exclaimed, picking it up. \u201cThis must be Bubbles\u2019!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s follow the trail,\u201d Mia said, feeling hopeful. They searched the lab for more clues. \n\nSuddenly, the door swung open. In walked some players from the rival team. They snickered at Mia and Theo. \n\n\u201cWhat are you two doing?\u201d one of them asked.\n\n\u201cWe\u2019re looking for Bubbles!\u201d Mia replied defiantly.\n\n\u201cGood luck with that!\u201d another player laughed as they left.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t like them,\u201d Theo muttered. \u201cThey always have to make fun of us.\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s not give up,\u201d Mia said. \u201cWe need to find out where that scale came from.\u201d\n\nThey searched the lab more carefully. \u201cMaybe someone in class saw something,\u201d Mia suggested.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s ask around,\u201d Theo agreed. \u201cTime is running out!\u201d\n\nWith renewed energy, they dashed to the classrooms. They needed answers fast. As they knocked on doors, they heard whispers about Bubbles. \n\n\u201cDid you hear? Someone saw him near the gym!\u201d a classmate said. \n\n\u201cGreat! That\u2019s our next stop!\u201d Mia said, excitement bubbling like a fizzy soda.\n\nAs they raced toward the gym, they felt the pressure. Would they find Bubbles before the game? [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cCome on, Mia! We can do this!\u201d Theo cheered.\n\n\u201cTogether, we can solve this mystery!\u201d Mia replied. \n\nThe gym doors loomed ahead, and the sound of cheering echoed inside. They took a deep breath. This was it!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Mia and Theo find in the science lab?","options":["A goldfish","A scale","A note","A beaker"],"correct_answer":"A scale"},{"question":"Who walked into the lab while Mia and Theo were searching?","options":["Mr. Hargrove","Their teacher","Rival players","The janitor"],"correct_answer":"Rival players"},{"question":"What did Mia suggest they do after finding the scale?","options":["Go home","Search the gym","Follow the trail","Ask Mr. Hargrove"],"correct_answer":"Follow the trail"},{"question":"What feeling did Mia and Theo have while searching?","options":["Excitement","Fear","Anger","Boredom"],"correct_answer":"Excitement"},{"question":"What was the main goal of Mia and Theo in this chapter?","options":["To win a prize","To find Bubbles","To play a game","To go home"],"correct_answer":"To find Bubbles"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_271_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_271_ch4_img1.png","plot_271_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":355,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
