   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_271_7_10","title":"The Case of the Missing Goldfish","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Crime Solving","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Mia and Theo rushed down the bustling hallway of Riverview Middle School. They could hear the sounds of laughter and excitement as students prepared for the big game. The bright banners decorated the walls, and the smell of popcorn filled the air. \n\n\u201cWe have to find Bubbles!\u201d Mia said, her eyes wide with determination. \n\n\u201cRight! We don\u2019t have much time before the game starts,\u201d Theo replied, glancing at the clock. It was ticking down to game time!\n\nThey decided to check the gym, where the cheerleaders were practicing. The excitement in the air was electric. As they approached, they saw Mr. Hargrove, the science teacher, standing by the bleachers with a clipboard. He looked a bit nervous.\n\n\u201cMr. Hargrove!\u201d Mia called out. \u201cHave you seen Bubbles anywhere?\u201d\n\nMr. Hargrove rubbed his chin. \u201cI might have a clue. I saw something shiny over by the janitor\u2019s closet earlier. It looked like a fish scale!\u201d\n\nMia held her breath. \u201cA fish scale? We need to go there!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s hurry!\u201d Theo said, and they dashed toward the closet. \n\nAs they reached the janitor\u2019s closet, they opened the door. It creaked loudly. Inside, the shelves were filled with mops, buckets, and cleaning supplies. \n\n\u201cWhoa! It\u2019s dark in here,\u201d Mia said, squinting her eyes. \n\nSuddenly, they heard a soft gurgling noise. Theo pointed. \u201cDid you hear that?\u201d \n\nMia nodded, her heart racing. \u201cIt\u2019s coming from over there!\u201d She moved closer to the sound. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nJust then, they spotted a small, shimmering object tucked behind a bucket. They pulled it out and gasped. It was a little bowl with Bubbles swimming happily inside! \n\n\u201cBubbles!\u201d they both shouted, jumping up and down. \n\nBut how did he end up here? They knew they had to get him back to the gym. \n\n\u201cWe can\u2019t just leave him here,\u201d Mia said, carefully holding the bowl. \n\nTheo grinned. \u201cLet\u2019s go, team!\u201d\n\nAs they rushed back to the gym, they felt like heroes. They arrived just in time to see the team getting ready. \n\n\u201cLook! It's Bubbles!\u201d Mia shouted. \n\nThe cheerleaders and players cheered. \u201cHooray for Mia and Theo!\u201d \n\nThey smiled at each other. They had solved the mystery and saved the day. \n\n\u201cNext time, let\u2019s keep a closer eye on him,\u201d Theo said, grinning. \n\n\u201cDeal! Now, let\u2019s enjoy the game!\u201d Mia replied, feeling proud of their adventure.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Where did Mia and Theo find Bubbles?","options":["In the gym","In the art room","In the janitor's closet","In the science lab"],"correct_answer":"In the janitor's closet"},{"question":"What did Mr. Hargrove mention seeing?","options":["A goldfish","A fish scale","A bowl","A mop"],"correct_answer":"A fish scale"},{"question":"What did Mia and Theo shout when they found Bubbles?","options":["Hooray!","Oh no!","Bubbles!","Help!"],"correct_answer":"Bubbles!"},{"question":"What did Mia and Theo feel like when they returned Bubbles?","options":["Heroes","Sad","Angry","Confused"],"correct_answer":"Heroes"},{"question":"What lesson did Mia and Theo learn?","options":["To keep secrets","To ignore clues","To keep a closer eye on Bubbles","To be quiet"],"correct_answer":"To keep a closer eye on Bubbles"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_271_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_271_ch5_img1.png","plot_271_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":397,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
