     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"mystery","1":"attic","2":"golden","3":"key","4":"whisper","image_prompts":["A colorful illustration of the dusty attic in the library, with rays of sunlight streaming through a small window. Rows of old books are stacked high, and a fluffy cat is perched on top of one, looking curious and friendly. The scene is warm and inviting, showcasing the adventure and mystery within the library.","An exciting moment where Sam and Lily, with wide eyes, look at the golden key that has just fallen out of the magical book. They are surrounded by colorful books, and the shadowy figure can be seen faintly in the background, adding a sense of suspense and adventure to the scene."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing The dimly lit reading nook in the library, with sunlight streaming through stained glass, casting colorful shadows on the floor. Sam and Lily are nestled among towering shelves, absorbed in the treasure map. Sams expression is one of determination, while Lilys eyes are wide with wonder, embodying the spirit of adventure and mystery.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_272_ch4_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 18:45:46"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dramatic moment in the library as Mrs. Knott stands in the shadows, her expression one of urgency and concern. The light from the fallen lamp flickers, illuminating her face partially and casting eerie shadows around her. The atmosphere is tense, filled with the weight of unspoken secrets and the thrill of discovery looming in the air.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_272_ch4_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 18:45:46"}}}
