   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_272_7_10","title":"The Secret of the Spooky Library","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Crime Solving","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"The old town library stood tall and creaky. Its wooden door creaked as Sam and Lily walked in. Dust danced in the sunlight that streamed through the tall windows. \"I love this place!\" Lily exclaimed. \"It feels so magical!\"  \n\n\"Shh! Remember, we're in a library,\" Sam said with a grin. He looked at the rows of books. Some were big, some were small, and some were very, very old. \"But something strange is happening here.\"  \n\nJust then, Mrs. Knott, the librarian, appeared. She had silver hair and round glasses perched on her nose. \"Hello, Sam! Hello, Lily! Are you here to read?\"  \n\n\"Actually, we want to help!\" said Sam. \"We heard about the missing books.\"  \n\n\"Oh, dear! Yes, many rare books have disappeared,\" Mrs. Knott said, her voice dropping to a whisper. \"Some say the library holds secrets.\"  \n\nLily's eyes sparkled. \"Secrets? Like treasure?\"  \n\n\"Treasure?\" Sam echoed, his heart racing. \"What kind of treasure?\"  \n\nMrs. Knott smiled mysteriously. \"You will have to find out for yourselves.\"  \n\nSam and Lily exchanged excited glances. They loved a good mystery! They rushed to the mystery section of the library. There were books about ghosts, pirates, and adventures. Then, Lily spotted something odd. A dusty book lay askew on the shelf. It looked different from the others.  \n\n\"Sam, look!\" Lily pointed. \"That book seems out of place.\"  \n\nSam pulled it from the shelf. As he opened it, a small piece of paper fluttered out. It was a map!  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]  \n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s this?\u201d Sam asked, eyes wide. The map had strange symbols and markings. \u201cIt looks like it leads somewhere in the library!\u201d  \n\nLily clapped her hands. \u201cLet\u2019s follow it! Maybe it leads to treasure!\u201d  \n\nThey began to study the map closely. Suddenly, a shadow crossed the room. A figure was lurking near the bookshelves. Sam squinted. \u201cWho is that?\u201d  \n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but they\u2019re coming this way!\u201d Lily whispered. They hid behind a tall bookshelf, holding their breath.   \n\nThe figure turned and walked away. Sam and Lily exchanged nervous glances. \u201cWe have to move fast!\u201d said Sam. \u201cLet\u2019s see where this map leads.\u201d  \n\nWith their hearts pounding, they stepped out of hiding and followed the map's path, ready for whatever adventure waited ahead.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Sam and Lily discover in the library?","options":["A missing book","A treasure map","A ghost","A secret room"],"correct_answer":"A treasure map"},{"question":"Who is the librarian?","options":["Mr. Smith","Mrs. Knott","Miss Brown","Mr. Green"],"correct_answer":"Mrs. Knott"},{"question":"What does Lily think the library holds?","options":["Magic","Monsters","Treasure","Books"],"correct_answer":"Magic"},{"question":"What do Sam and Lily do when they see the shadowy figure?","options":["Run away","Hide","Call for help","Ignore it"],"correct_answer":"Hide"},{"question":"What do Sam and Lily love?","options":["Playing games","Reading books","Mysteries","Cooking"],"correct_answer":"Mysteries"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_272_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_272_ch1_img1.png","plot_272_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":374,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
