   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_272_7_10","title":"The Secret of the Spooky Library","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Crime Solving","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Sam and Lily stood in the dusty old library. The smell of old paper filled the air. Sunlight streamed through tall, narrow windows, casting shadows on the floor. \n\n\u201cThis place is really spooky,\u201d Sam said, looking around. \n\n\u201cIt\u2019s magical!\u201d Lily replied, her eyes sparkling with excitement. \u201cLet\u2019s find out what secrets it holds!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, they heard a creak. The heavy door swung open. It was Mrs. Knott, the librarian. She had a serious look on her face.\n\n\u201cDid you two find something interesting?\u201d she asked, raising an eyebrow.\n\n\u201cYes! We found this!\u201d Sam held up the map. It looked ancient and worn. \n\nMrs. Knott\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cAh, the map of mysteries\u2026 You must be careful!\u201d\n\n\u201cCareful of what?\u201d Lily asked, her voice trembling with curiosity. \n\n\u201cThere are riddles to solve,\u201d Mrs. Knott said. \u201cAnd someone else is looking for that treasure.\u201d\n\n\u201cSomeone else?\u201d Sam repeated, feeling a chill. \n\n\u201cYes. A shadowy figure has been seen in the library,\u201d she whispered. \u201cKeep your eyes open.\u201d\n\nJust then, they heard footsteps behind them. Sam turned quickly, but there was no one there! \n\n\u201cDid you hear that?\u201d he asked, feeling uneasy.\n\n\u201cMaybe it\u2019s the ghost of the library!\u201d Lily giggled, despite her fear.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s follow the map!\u201d Sam said, trying to sound brave. \u201cIt will lead us to the treasure.\u201d\n\nCarefully, they opened the map. It had strange symbols and words. The first clue was written in a fancy script.\n\n\u201c\u2018To find the treasure, seek the place where stories begin,\u2019\u201d Sam read aloud. \n\n\u201cWhere do stories begin?\u201d Lily pondered. \u201cMaybe it\u2019s at the reading corner!\u201d\n\n\u201cYes! Let\u2019s go!\u201d Sam agreed.\n\nAs they rushed to the reading corner, they saw a silhouette at the far end of the library. It was tall and dark, watching them. \n\n\u201cWho is that?\u201d Lily whispered, clutching Sam\u2019s arm tightly. \n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but we need to hurry!\u201d Sam replied. \n\nThey dashed toward the reading corner, their hearts racing. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nIn the corner, they found a large bookshelf. It was filled with colorful books, but one book caught Lily\u2019s eye. It was glowing softly!\n\n\u201cLook! That book is different!\u201d she exclaimed, pointing.\n\nSam reached for the book. \u201cLet\u2019s see what it says!\u201d \n\nAs he pulled it off the shelf, the ground shook! They both stumbled backward. \n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d Lily cried, wide-eyed.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know! But I think we\u2019re in trouble!\u201d Sam shouted.\n\nJust then, the shadow appeared again, closer this time. \n\n\u201cGet the treasure before they do!\u201d it hissed. \n\nWith their hearts pounding, Sam and Lily prepared for their next move. They knew they had to solve the riddle quickly. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s read the book!\u201d Lily urged. \n\n\u201cRight! It might help us!\u201d Sam said, opening the glowing book. \n\nWhat would they find next? [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Sam and Lily find in the library?","options":["A new friend","A glowing book","A treasure chest","A library map"],"correct_answer":"A glowing book"},{"question":"What did Mrs. Knott warn them about?","options":["A ghost","A mysterious figure","The library rules","A hidden door"],"correct_answer":"A mysterious figure"},{"question":"Where did the first clue lead them?","options":["The reading corner","The attic","The basement","The front desk"],"correct_answer":"The reading corner"},{"question":"What happened when Sam pulled the book off the shelf?","options":["Nothing happened","The ground shook","They found a treasure","The lights went out"],"correct_answer":"The ground shook"},{"question":"How did Lily feel about the library?","options":["Scared","Excited","Bored","Tired"],"correct_answer":"Excited"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_272_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_272_ch2_img1.png","plot_272_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":471,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
