   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_272_7_10","title":"The Secret of the Spooky Library","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Crime Solving","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"As the sun began to set, the old library creaked softly. Sam and Lily stood in front of the tall shelves filled with dusty books. \u201cThis place really is spooky,\u201d Lily whispered, her eyes wide with wonder. Sam nodded, feeling both excited and a little scared. \u201cBut we\u2019re here to solve a mystery, remember?\u201d\n\nSuddenly, they heard a noise. A loud thump echoed from the attic above. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Lily squeaked, clutching her brother\u2019s arm. \u201cMaybe it\u2019s the shadowy figure!\u201d Sam said, his heart racing. They both glanced at the attic door, which seemed to beckon them.\n\n\u201cWe have to solve the riddle first,\u201d Sam reminded her. They hurried back to the reading nook where they had found the map. \u201cThe riddle says: \u2018Where the stories sleep, the treasure you\u2019ll keep.\u2019 What does that mean?\u201d\n\nLily thought for a moment. \u201cMaybe it\u2019s where the library keeps the oldest books!\u201d she exclaimed. \u201cLet\u2019s check the special collection!\u201d Sam agreed, and they headed toward the back of the library.\n\nJust then, they spotted a shadow darting by the window. \u201cDid you see that?\u201d Sam shouted, his voice echoing in the quiet library. \u201cI think someone is following us!\u201d They hurried behind the shelves, peeking out carefully. \n\n\u201cWho is it?\u201d Lily whispered. Sam squinted through the dim light. \u201cI can\u2019t tell!\u201d he said, feeling a mix of fear and determination. \u201cBut we have to find that treasure first!\u201d\n\nThey quickly reached the special collection room. Dust motes danced in the sunlight streaming through the high windows. Books lined the walls, their spines glittering like jewels. \u201cThis is it!\u201d Lily said, her eyes sparkling with excitement. \u201cThe stories are sleeping here!\u201d\n\nAs they searched through the books, Sam spotted a glint of gold. \u201cLook!\u201d he pointed. Tucked between two old tomes was a small, golden key! \u201cDo you think it opens something?\u201d Lily asked, bouncing on her toes. \n\nBefore Sam could answer, they heard footsteps approaching. The shadowy figure was getting closer! \u201cQuick! Hide!\u201d Sam whispered urgently. They ducked behind a large bookshelf, hearts pounding.\n\nThe footsteps stopped. They held their breath, waiting. Then, to their surprise, they heard a familiar voice. \u201cSam? Lily? Is that you?\u201d It was Mrs. Knott! \n\nSuddenly, the mystery deepened. \u201cWhat are you doing here?\u201d Sam asked, stepping out from behind the shelf. Mrs. Knott looked worried. \u201cYou must leave quickly! It\u2019s not safe here!\u201d \n\n\u201cWhy? What\u2019s going on?\u201d Lily asked, her voice trembling. \n\nMrs. Knott glanced over her shoulder, then lowered her voice. \u201cThere are secrets in this library that must be protected. You\u2019re in danger if you stay.\u201d \n\nJust then, the shadow moved again, and they all gasped. \u201cWhat should we do?\u201d Sam asked, feeling the tension rise. \n\n\u201cFollow me!\u201d Mrs. Knott said, her eyes filled with urgency. \n\nWith their hearts racing, Sam and Lily exchanged a glance. This adventure was becoming more dangerous than they had ever imagined!\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Sam and Lily find in the special collection?","options":["A treasure map","A golden key","A spooky ghost","A rare book"],"correct_answer":"A golden key"},{"question":"Who warns Sam and Lily that they are in danger?","options":["A librarian","A spooky ghost","Their parents","A mysterious figure"],"correct_answer":"A librarian"},{"question":"What does the riddle say?","options":["Where the stories sleep, the treasure you\u2019ll keep","Find the scariest book","Look under the table","Seek the library's heart"],"correct_answer":"Where the stories sleep, the treasure you\u2019ll keep"},{"question":"What do Sam and Lily see that makes them feel scared?","options":["A friendly cat","A shadowy figure","A pile of books","The librarian's smile"],"correct_answer":"A shadowy figure"},{"question":"What action do Sam and Lily take when they hear footsteps?","options":["They run away","They hide","They call for help","They laugh"],"correct_answer":"They hide"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_272_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_272_ch3_img1.png","plot_272_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":497,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
