   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_272_7_10","title":"The Secret of the Spooky Library","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Crime Solving","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Sam and Lily stood in the dusty library, clutching the treasure map. The air was thick with mystery. \"We need to find the golden key!\" Sam said, excitement sparkling in his eyes. \n\n\"Do you really think it\u2019s here?\" Lily asked, twirling her hair like she always did when she was curious. \n\nMrs. Knott shuffled closer, her glasses resting on the tip of her nose. \"The library holds many secrets,\" she whispered. \"But you should be careful\u2014there are things you don\u2019t yet understand.\"\n\nDetermined, Sam leaned over the map. \"The riddle says to look where the old books sleep.\" He pointed to a shadowy corner. \"That must be the attic!\"\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThey climbed the creaky stairs to the attic. Dust swirled in the sunlight like magic. Rows of old books stood tall like giants. \"Wow, look at all these!\" Lily exclaimed, her eyes wide.\n\nSuddenly, a loud bang echoed through the room. \"What was that?\" Sam jumped. \n\nA figure darted past the shelves. \"Did you see that?\" Sam whispered. \"We\u2019re not alone!\"\n\nLily nodded, her heart racing. \"We have to be brave!\" She took a deep breath and called out, \"Who\u2019s there?\"\n\nThe figure emerged from the shadows. It was a friendly-looking cat, with soft, fluffy fur. \"Meow!\" it said, as if it was guarding something special.\n\nLily giggled. \"I thought it was a ghost!\" she said, relieved. \n\nSam smiled. \"Let\u2019s search for the key! The riddle mentioned something about a \u2018hidden page.\u2019 Maybe it\u2019s in one of these books!\"\n\nThey began to pull books off the shelves. One by one, they opened them, but nothing sparkled like the treasure they imagined. Then, Lily gasped. \"What about this one? It has a golden cover!\"\n\nAs they opened the book, a small golden key fell out! \"We found it!\" Sam shouted, holding it high. \n\nBut just as they celebrated, they heard footsteps approaching. \"We need to hide!\" Lily said, pulling Sam behind a stack of books.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe footsteps came closer. Sam peeked around the corner. He saw the mysterious figure again! It was a tall shadow, lurking near the entrance of the attic. Sam's heart pounded. \n\n\"We can\u2019t let them find us!\" he whispered urgently. \n\n\"Let\u2019s sneak out the back!\" Lily suggested. With the golden key in hand, they quietly tiptoed toward the attic\u2019s hidden door. \n\nThey slipped through and closed it behind them, feeling safe for now. \"We did it!\" Sam said, grinning. \"The key is ours!\"\n\n\u201cNow we just need to solve the next part of the riddle!\u201d Lily replied, her imagination swirling with thoughts of treasure.\n\nWith hope in their hearts, they made their way back down the stairs, ready for more adventures.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Sam and Lily find in the attic?","options":["A ghost","A golden key","A treasure chest","A book"],"correct_answer":"A golden key"},{"question":"What did Lily think was in the attic at first?","options":["A cat","A ghost","A treasure","A wizard"],"correct_answer":"A ghost"},{"question":"Who was lurking near the entrance of the attic?","options":["Mrs. Knott","The librarian","A mysterious figure","The cat"],"correct_answer":"A mysterious figure"},{"question":"What did the riddle tell them to find?","options":["An old book","A treasure map","A hidden page","A golden key"],"correct_answer":"A golden key"},{"question":"What did Lily suggest they do when they heard footsteps?","options":["Celebrate","Hide","Run away","Call for help"],"correct_answer":"Hide"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_272_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_272_ch4_img1.png","plot_272_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":457,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
