   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_272_7_10","title":"The Secret of the Spooky Library","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Crime Solving","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Sam and Lily stood in the quiet library. The walls were filled with dusty books and mysterious shadows. \u201cI can\u2019t believe we have the key!\u201d said Sam, holding the shiny golden key up to the light. \n\n\u201cThis is so exciting!\u201d Lily twirled around. \u201cDo you think it will open the treasure chest?\u201d\n\n\u201cI hope so,\u201d replied Sam. He looked around. \u201cBut we need to find out where it fits first.\u201d \n\nThey decided to check the old wooden desk in the library\u2019s corner. It looked like it hadn\u2019t been touched in years. \u201cLet\u2019s start here!\u201d said Sam, eagerly. They approached the desk and began to explore.\n\nAs they brushed off the dust, Lily spotted a tiny keyhole hidden under a stack of old papers. \u201cLook, Sam! This might be it!\u201d \n\n\u201cGreat eye, Lily!\u201d Sam said, excitedly. He carefully inserted the golden key. With a gentle turn, there was a soft click. The desk drawer opened slowly, and inside was a rolled-up parchment. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s another map!\u201d Lily exclaimed, her eyes sparkling with wonder. \u201cBut this one looks different.\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s see what it says,\u201d Sam said, unfurling the parchment. It had strange symbols and a large red \u2018X\u2019 marked on it. \u201cThis must be where the treasure is!\u201d\n\nJust then, they heard a creaking noise behind them. They turned quickly. A shadowy figure was moving in the aisle! \u201cQuick, hide!\u201d whispered Sam.\n\nThey ducked behind the desk, their hearts racing. \u201cWho is that?\u201d Lily asked, her voice trembling. \u201cDo you think it\u2019s the person who has been stealing the books?\u201d\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know,\u201d Sam whispered back. \u201cBut we can\u2019t let them find us.\u201d \n\nAs they peeked out, the figure turned. It was Mrs. Knott! \u201cOh, you two scared me!\u201d she said, her eyes wide. \u201cI was looking for you! I have been wondering if you\u2019d found the treasure!\u201d\n\n\u201cMrs. Knott!\u201d Sam said, relieved. \u201cWe thought you were a stranger!\u201d\n\nMrs. Knott chuckled. \u201cI was the mysterious figure all along.\u201d She smiled. \u201cLet me help you with the next clue.\u201d \n\nTogether, they studied the map. \u201cThis looks like the park!\u201d said Lily, pointing. \n\n\u201cYes! The treasure is there!\u201d said Mrs. Knott. \n\n\u201cI think we can do this!\u201d Sam said, beaming. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go find it before anyone else does!\u201d Lily added, feeling brave. \n\nWith their hearts full of excitement, they left the library, ready for the next adventure.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Sam and Lily find in the desk?","options":["A treasure chest","Another map","A golden key","A mysterious figure"],"correct_answer":"Another map"},{"question":"Who did Sam and Lily think was the mysterious figure?","options":["A librarian","A stranger","Their friend","A ghost"],"correct_answer":"A stranger"},{"question":"Where does the new map lead them?","options":["To a cave","To the town square","To the park","To a castle"],"correct_answer":"To the park"},{"question":"How did Mrs. Knott feel when she found Sam and Lily?","options":["Angry","Excited","Scared","Tired"],"correct_answer":"Excited"},{"question":"What did Sam and Lily decide to do at the end of the chapter?","options":["Go home","Find the treasure","Read a book","Play a game"],"correct_answer":"Find the treasure"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_272_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_272_ch5_img1.png","plot_272_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":406,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
