   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_272_11_14","title":"The Secret of the Spooky Library","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Crime Solving","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Chapter 4: Whispers of Hope\n\nThe old Willow Creek Library creaked in the afternoon light, its dark wood shelves whispering secrets only Sam and Lily could hear. Dust motes floated like tiny fairies in the slanted sunlight filtering through the high windows, casting a warm glow over the treasure map that lay spread out on the table. \n\n\u201cLook,\u201d Sam said, pointing at the next riddle on the map. \u201cWe have to figure out what it means. \u2018Where the stories sigh and shadows lie, the next clue waits with an echoing cry.\u2019\u201d \n\nLily furrowed her brow, her imagination racing. \u201cWhat if it\u2019s a real place in the library? Maybe where the books are old and forgotten?\u201d \n\nJust then, Mrs. Knott appeared, her glasses perched low on her nose. \u201cAh, you two are at it again,\u201d she said with a knowing smile. \u201cThe Whispering Bookshelf isn\u2019t just a myth; it\u2019s an actual section of the library. Few dare to wander there, but I believe it holds many secrets.\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe siblings exchanged excited glances. They had heard the whispers of the Whispering Bookshelf, but standing at the edge of its mystery felt exhilarating. \u201cCan you show us where it is?\u201d Sam asked eagerly.\n\n\u201cFollow me,\u201d Mrs. Knott said, leading them deeper into the library\u2019s groaning halls. The air grew cooler as they walked further from the sunlit reading areas and into the shadowy depths. The soft thud of their footsteps echoed like a heartbeat, growing louder in the silence.\n\nThey reached a small alcove nestled between two towering shelves, and there it was: a row of books with vibrant spines that seemed to hum softly. A faint breeze fluttered the pages, and Lily gasped as she stepped closer. \u201cIt\u2019s beautiful!\u201d she exclaimed, her eyes wide with wonder.\n\nBut suddenly, a sound sliced through the quiet\u2014a soft rustling behind them. Sam spun around, his heart racing. \u201cDid you hear that?\u201d he whispered. \n\nBefore they could investigate, a figure darted past the entrance. It was cloaked in shadows, moving too quickly to catch a glimpse of its face. Lily\u2019s heart plummeted. \u201cIs that the mysterious figure from before?\u201d she gasped.\n\n\u201cWe need to find that clue before they do,\u201d Sam said, determination filling his voice. They turned back to the shelves, their eyes scanning the titles, searching for anything that matched the riddle.\n\nLily reached for a dusty book with a cracked spine. As she pulled it from the shelf, a hidden drawer slid open, revealing a small brass key. \u201cLook!\u201d she exclaimed, holding it up triumphantly. \n\nJust then, the shadowy figure reappeared at the entrance, blocking their escape. \u201cYou shouldn\u2019t have come here,\u201d it hissed, its voice low and menacing. \n\nFear surged through Sam, but he gripped Lily\u2019s arm. \u201cWe can\u2019t let them scare us. We\u2019re close to finding out what\u2019s really going on!\u201d\n\nWith a shared glance of resolve, they clutched the key tightly and took a step forward, ready to confront the unknown.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAs the figure advanced, Sam and Lily\u2019s hearts raced. Could they outsmart the mystery before it consumed them? \n\nIn that moment of uncertainty, they also felt a spark of hope. They were not just siblings on a mission; they were a team, ready to uncover the secrets hidden in the library's shadows.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the next clue Sam and Lily need to solve?","options":["A poem about the library","A treasure map","A hidden drawer","A riddle about shadows"],"correct_answer":"A riddle about shadows"},{"question":"What does Mrs. Knott reveal about the Whispering Bookshelf?","options":["It\u2019s a myth","It\u2019s a real section of the library","It\u2019s a place for lost books","It\u2019s where the librarian hides secrets"],"correct_answer":"It\u2019s a real section of the library"},{"question":"What do Sam and Lily find in the hidden drawer?","options":["A map","A scroll","A brass key","A book about mysteries"],"correct_answer":"A brass key"},{"question":"How do Sam and Lily feel when they face the shadowy figure?","options":["Excited and brave","Scared and confused","Proud and accomplished","Disappointed and angry"],"correct_answer":"Scared and confused"},{"question":"What do Sam and Lily decide to do at the end of the chapter?","options":["Run away","Confront the figure","Call for help","Leave the library"],"correct_answer":"Confront the figure"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_272_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_272_ch4_img1.png","plot_272_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":559,"reading_level":"Builder"}
