   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_272_11_14","title":"The Secret of the Spooky Library","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Crime Solving","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"As the sun dipped below the horizon, casting long shadows in the Willow Creek Library, Sam and Lily stood before the Whispering Bookshelf, its wooden shelves creaking softly like a haunted house whispering secrets. \u201cWhat do you think the riddle means?\u201d Lily asked, biting her lip in thought. She could feel the weight of the brass key in her pocket, heavier than ever. \n\n\u201cI think it\u2019s about finding the right book,\u201d Sam replied confidently, his eyes scanning the titles. \u201cMaybe there\u2019s something hidden among the pages.\u201d As he reached out to pull a book from the shelf, a chill ran down his spine. He glanced back at Lily, who was staring wide-eyed at a shadow creeping across the library floor. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe figure was cloaked, blending into the shadows, but Sam\u2019s heart raced with determination. \u201cWe need to stay focused,\u201d he urged, pushing the fear down. Together, they turned their attention back to the riddle engraved on the brass key: \u201cSeek the story that never ends, where the past and future blend.\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat if it\u2019s a specific book?\u201d Lily suggested, her imagination firing up. \u201cLike a fairy tale or a myth?\u201d \n\n\u201cThat makes sense,\u201d Sam nodded. \u201cLet\u2019s think. What books talk about time?\u201d \n\nAs they debated, the eerie silence of the library seemed to deepen. Suddenly, the mysterious figure moved again, gliding toward them. Sam felt a surge of bravery. \u201cLily, we need to find that book now!\u201d \n\nThe siblings scrambled along the shelf, casting aside dusty tomes. \u201cHow about \u2018The Chronicles of Time\u2019?\u201d Lily exclaimed, pulling out a thick volume adorned with stars. \u201cOr \u2018The Timeless Tales of Old\u2019?\u201d\n\n\u201cNo! It has to be something more classic,\u201d Sam insisted, flipping through the pages of a nearby book. And then it hit him like a lightning bolt. \u201c\u2018A Wrinkle in Time\u2019! It\u2019s perfect!\u201d \n\nWith a practiced flick, he pulled the book free, and an old, leather-bound tome slipped out from behind it. \u201cThis must be it!\u201d Sam\u2019s eyes lit up as he glanced at the cover. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nBut just as they were about to open it, the shadowy figure lunged forward, reaching for the book. \u201cStop!\u201d Sam shouted, clutching the tome tightly. The figure hesitated, a flicker of surprise crossing its hidden face. \n\n\u201cWhy are you after the treasure?\u201d Lily demanded, her voice steady despite the tremor in her hands. \n\n\u201cIt\u2019s not yours to find,\u201d the figure hissed, but Sam and Lily stood firm. \n\n\u201cMaybe it\u2019s not about the treasure at all,\u201d Sam said, his mind racing. \u201cMaybe it\u2019s about the stories we uncover and share with others.\u201d \n\nFor a moment, the figure seemed to waver, its posture shifting. \u201cStories can change the world,\u201d it murmured. \u201cBut they can also be dangerous.\u201d \n\n\u201cWe\u2019re not afraid,\u201d Lily asserted, her courage igniting like a flame. \u201cWe want to protect the stories, not hoard them.\u201d \n\nThe figure paused, and for a heartbeat, they could see the glimmer of something human in its eyes. \u201cThen you must be worthy,\u201d it whispered before retreating into the shadows. \n\nWith a rush of relief, the siblings exchanged glances filled with triumph. They had faced the figure and stood strong together, bound by their shared bravery. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s see what this book holds,\u201d Sam said, and together they opened the tome, revealing a hidden map tucked between pages filled with ancient tales. \n\nAs they studied the map, they knew this was just the beginning of their adventure\u2014a journey that would lead them not just to treasure, but to the very heart of storytelling itself.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What book do Sam and Lily discover that holds the hidden map?","options":["The Chronicles of Time","A Wrinkle in Time","The Timeless Tales of Old","The Secret of the Spooky Library"],"correct_answer":"A Wrinkle in Time"},{"question":"How do Sam and Lily feel when they confront the shadowy figure?","options":["Afraid","Excited","Determined","Indifferent"],"correct_answer":"Determined"},{"question":"What theme is emphasized when Sam declares that it's about protecting the stories?","options":["Friendship","Identity","Growth","The power of stories"],"correct_answer":"The power of stories"},{"question":"What does the shadowy figure hint at regarding stories?","options":["They can change the world","They are only for the rich","They should be kept secret","They are dangerous"],"correct_answer":"They can change the world"},{"question":"What is the primary setting of this chapter?","options":["A dark forest","A mysterious attic","Willow Creek Library","An enchanted castle"],"correct_answer":"Willow Creek Library"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_272_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_272_ch5_img1.png","plot_272_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":600,"reading_level":"Builder"}
