   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_273_7_10","title":"The Vanishing Pet Mystery","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Crime Solving","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Chapter 2: The Secret Meeting\n\nAlex and Jenna met at the park the next day. The sun shone brightly, making the grass look like a green carpet. Alex wore his favorite blue detective hat. Jenna had her laptop ready to find more clues.\n\n\u201cDo you think we can catch Mr. Davis today?\u201d Alex asked, glancing around. \n\n\u201cI hope so! I want to see this pet-swap club!\u201d Jenna replied, her eyes sparkling with excitement. \n\nThey watched as Mr. Davis walked his small, fluffy dog, Daisy. Alex squinted. \u201cLook! He\u2019s heading toward that big tree.\u201d\n\nJenna nodded. \u201cLet\u2019s follow him!\u201d\n\nThey crept quietly behind a row of blooming bushes. As they peered around, they spotted a group of kids gathered near the tree. They were excitedly chatting and holding colorful leashes. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cLook at all those pets!\u201d Jenna whispered. They saw a cat, a rabbit, and even a parrot! \n\n\u201cThis must be the secret club!\u201d Alex exclaimed. \u201cLet\u2019s get closer and listen.\u201d\n\nAs they moved in for a better look, Alex tripped over a rock. \u201cOof!\u201d He fell into the bushes, causing a loud rustling sound.\n\nJenna gasped. \u201cAlex! Be quiet!\u201d\n\nBut it was too late. The kids turned around, eyes wide. \u201cWho\u2019s there?\u201d one shouted.\n\nAlex quickly stood up, brushing leaves off his shirt. \u201cUh, hi! We were just\u2026 um, playing hide and seek!\u201d \n\nThe kids giggled, but one girl stepped forward. \u201cYou can\u2019t just spy on us! We\u2019re trading pets here!\u201d\n\nAlex\u2019s heart raced. \u201cTrading? Like a pet-swap?\u201d\n\n\u201cYes!\u201d she said, crossing her arms. \u201cBut it\u2019s a secret club. You can\u2019t tell anyone!\u201d\n\nJenna smiled, trying to charm them. \u201cWe want to help! We think some pets are missing. We think it\u2019s connected to Mr. Davis.\u201d\n\nThe kids exchanged glances, looking worried. \u201cWe saw him grabbing a dog from the park last week!\u201d one of them said.\n\n\u201cWhat if he\u2019s the reason pets are disappearing?\u201d Alex asked, feeling the mystery deepening.\n\nThe girl raised an eyebrow. \u201cYou\u2019ll need proof! Meet us here tomorrow, and we can show you everything!\u201d\n\nAlex and Jenna nodded, excitement bubbling inside them. \u201cDeal!\u201d Jenna said.\n\nAs they walked home, Alex couldn\u2019t stop thinking. \u201cWe\u2019ve got to find out what Mr. Davis is really doing!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a small voice called out from behind them. \u201cHey! Wait up!\u201d It was Daisy, Mr. Davis\u2019s dog! She wagged her tail and trotted over, looking lost.\n\n\u201cUh-oh,\u201d Alex said, his heart racing again. \u201cThis could be a big clue!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s take her back!\u201d Jenna said, grabbing Daisy\u2019s leash. \u201cBut we have to be careful. What if Mr. Davis is nearby?\u201d\n\nAlex nodded, feeling the weight of the mystery heavy on his shoulders. \u201cWe need to solve this before the pet show. Time is running out!\u201d\n\nThe two friends walked cautiously, ready for whatever surprises awaited them next.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Alex and Jenna discover in the park?","options":["A pet-swap club","A flower garden","A lost kitten","A new playground"],"correct_answer":"A pet-swap club"},{"question":"What did Alex trip over?","options":["A stick","A rock","A pet","A bush"],"correct_answer":"A rock"},{"question":"What challenge do the kids give Alex and Jenna?","options":["To find a lost pet","To gather proof","To join the club","To go home"],"correct_answer":"To gather proof"},{"question":"Who is Daisy?","options":["A cat","A rabbit","A dog","A bird"],"correct_answer":"A dog"},{"question":"What are Alex and Jenna trying to solve?","options":["A puzzle","A math problem","A mystery","A riddle"],"correct_answer":"A mystery"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_273_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_273_ch2_img1.png","plot_273_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":486,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
