   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_273_7_10","title":"The Vanishing Pet Mystery","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Crime Solving","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Alex and Jenna stood outside Mr. Davis\u2019s house. The sun was shining bright, and the air smelled like fresh grass. \"We need to figure out what's going on,\" Alex said, his eyes narrowing. \"Before the pet show, pets could vanish forever!\"\n\nJust then, Daisy, Mr. Davis's playful dog, bounded toward them. Her tail wagged like crazy. \"Daisy!\" Jenna called, bending down to pet her. \"What are you doing here?\"\n\nDaisy barked and tilted her head. She seemed to want them to follow her. \"Maybe she has a clue,\" Alex said, excited. They decided to follow Daisy down the street to the park.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAt the park, they found a gathering of kids. They were swapping pets and giggling. Jenna gasped. \"This must be the secret pet-swap club!\" \n\n\"But where are the missing pets?\" Alex wondered. They squeezed through the crowd, looking for answers. Suddenly, they heard a loud commotion. A big, fluffy cat was stuck in a tree, and everyone was panicking.\n\n\"Don't worry!\" Alex shouted. \"I can help!\" He climbed up the tree quickly, reaching for the frightened cat. \"Come here, buddy!\" he said gently. The cat hissed, but Alex was determined. \n\nJust then, Jenna spotted Mr. Davis in the crowd. His eyes were wide with surprise. \u201cWhat are you doing here?\u201d she asked. \n\n\u201cJust enjoying the show,\u201d he replied, but Jenna noticed he was acting strange. \n\n\u201cSomething isn\u2019t right,\u201d Alex whispered to Jenna as he carefully brought the cat down. \n\nJust as they reached the ground, a mysterious figure slipped away from the crowd. \u201cHey! Wait!\u201d Jenna shouted. They both ran after the figure. \n\nTheir hearts raced as they chased the shadowy person through the park. Suddenly, the figure turned and shouted, \u201cYou\u2019ll never find them!\u201d \n\nAlex and Jenna stopped in their tracks. Who was this person? What did they mean? \n\nAlex clenched his fists. \u201cWe have to catch them before it\u2019s too late!\u201d \n\nBut just as they were about to run again, they saw something glimmer on the ground. It was a shiny collar, one they recognized from a missing pet! \n\n\"This is our best clue yet!\" Jenna exclaimed. \n\nThey both looked at each other, their eyes filled with determination. They had to uncover the truth. They had to solve the Vanishing Pet Mystery!\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Alex and Jenna find at the park?","options":["A pet show","A secret pet-swap club","A dog park","A bakery"],"correct_answer":"A secret pet-swap club"},{"question":"Who helps Alex and Jenna find the way?","options":["Mr. Davis","Daisy the dog","A mysterious figure","Mr. Smith"],"correct_answer":"Daisy the dog"},{"question":"What happens when Alex climbs the tree?","options":["He finds a bird","He helps a cat stuck in a tree","He falls","He finds a treasure"],"correct_answer":"He helps a cat stuck in a tree"},{"question":"What does the mysterious figure shout?","options":["You will find them!","You will never find them!","Stop right there!","Come back!"],"correct_answer":"You will never find them!"},{"question":"What do Alex and Jenna find on the ground at the end of the chapter?","options":["A clue","A toy","A map","A pet"],"correct_answer":"A clue"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_273_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_273_ch3_img1.png","plot_273_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":384,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
