   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_273_7_10","title":"The Vanishing Pet Mystery","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Crime Solving","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Alex and Jenna stood in the park, feeling the warm sun on their faces. They were excited but nervous. \u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d Alex asked, looking around. \u201cWe need more clues!\u201d Jenna replied, tapping on her tablet. As they scanned the area, they spotted something shiny on the ground.  \n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Alex exclaimed. He ran over and picked it up. It was a collar, a blue one with sparkly stars. \u201cThis looks like Bella\u2019s collar!\u201d he said, remembering his friend Lucy\u2019s missing dog.  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]  \n\nThe collar sparkled in the sunlight. Jenna zoomed in on her tablet to take a closer look. \u201cWhat if this leads us to Bella?\u201d she said, eyes wide with hope. \u201cLet\u2019s check Lucy\u2019s house!\u201d  \n\nThey rushed to Lucy\u2019s house. Lucy was outside, looking sad. \u201cI miss Bella so much!\u201d she said. Alex held up the collar. \u201cIs this Bella\u2019s?\u201d \n\nLucy gasped. \u201cYes! Where did you find it?\"  \n\n\u201cBy the big tree in the park,\u201d Jenna replied. \u201cWe think there\u2019s a pet-swap club nearby.\u201d  \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go find her!\u201d Lucy said, her eyes brightening.  \n\nThe trio headed back to the park. Suddenly, they spotted a shadowy figure behind some bushes. \u201cWho is that?\u201d Alex whispered.  \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s sneak closer,\u201d Jenna suggested. They tiptoed, hearts racing. They peeked around the bush and gasped. It was Mr. Davis! He was holding a leash.  \n\n\u201cIs that Bella?\u201d Jenna asked. Just then, Mr. Davis turned and said, \u201cOh, I was just taking her for a walk!\u201d  \n\n\u201cWait!\u201d Alex shouted. \u201cIs that really Bella?\u201d They all ran out from behind the bush.  \n\nMr. Davis looked startled. \u201cWhat are you doing here?\u201d he asked, trying to hide the leash.  \n\n\u201cBella\u2019s missing!\u201d Lucy said. \u201cWe found her collar!\u201d  \n\nMr. Davis fidgeted. \u201cUh, I was just helping her get some exercise.\u201d  \n\n\u201cThen why do you have her collar?\u201d Alex asked, crossing his arms.  \n\nBefore Mr. Davis could answer, they heard a bark. Bella came running toward them, wagging her tail! \u201cBella!\u201d Lucy shouted, running to her.  \n\nJenna smiled at Alex. \u201cWe\u2019re getting closer!\u201d  \n\nBut just then, Jenna\u2019s tablet beeped. A message popped up. \u201cSecret Pet-Swap Club meeting tonight!\u201d  \n\n\u201cLooks like we have to go,\u201d Alex said. \u201cIt\u2019s time to solve the mystery!\u201d  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]  \n\nThey all looked at each other, excited and determined. The sun began to set, casting long shadows across the park. \u201cLet\u2019s do this!\u201d they cheered together.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Alex and Jenna find in the park?","options":["A blue collar","A dog","A toy","A book"],"correct_answer":"A blue collar"},{"question":"Who was looking for Bella?","options":["Mr. Davis","Jenna","Lucy","Alex"],"correct_answer":"Lucy"},{"question":"What did the tablet message say?","options":["Meeting at the park","Pet-swap club meeting","A new pet shop","A dog training class"],"correct_answer":"Pet-swap club meeting"},{"question":"What did Mr. Davis say when Alex confronted him?","options":["He ran away","He was just helping Bella","He knew nothing","He was scared"],"correct_answer":"He was just helping Bella"},{"question":"How did Lucy feel when she found Bella\u2019s collar?","options":["Sad","Angry","Happy","Confused"],"correct_answer":"Happy"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_273_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_273_ch4_img1.png","plot_273_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":408,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
