   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_273_7_10","title":"The Vanishing Pet Mystery","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Crime Solving","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"The sun was setting, casting a warm glow over the neighborhood. Alex, Jenna, and Lucy stood outside Mr. Davis's house, peering through the bushes. They felt nervous but excited. \u201cThis is it!\u201d Alex said, his heart racing. \u201cWe need to find out what\u2019s going on.\u201d\n\nJenna nodded, adjusting her glasses. \u201cI hope we get some answers tonight.\u201d Lucy barked softly, as if she understood the mission. \n\nBefore they could go any further, Jenna\u2019s phone buzzed. \u201cLook!\u201d she exclaimed, holding it up. \u201cThe club meeting starts in ten minutes at the park!\u201d They had to hurry.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe trio dashed through the neighborhood toward the park. They spotted colorful lights and cheerful music coming from the big oak tree. \u201cIt looks like a party!\u201d Lucy yipped happily, wagging her tail. \n\n\u201cThere! I see Bella!\u201d Alex shouted, pointing to a fluffy golden retriever near the tree. But as they got closer, they noticed something odd. A group of kids were gathered around a table, swapping pet accessories! \n\n\u201cWhy would they need Bella\u2019s collar?\u201d Jenna whispered, her eyes wide. \u201cThis doesn\u2019t feel right.\u201d \n\nSuddenly, a voice called out. \u201cHey! You can\u2019t be here!\u201d It was Tommy, the ringleader of the club. He looked tall and confident. \u201cThis is a private meeting.\u201d \n\nAlex took a deep breath, feeling brave. \u201cWe know about your pet-swap club! You can\u2019t just take pets and trade them like toys!\u201d \n\nTommy smirked. \u201cOh really? You think you can stop us?\u201d He waved his hand, and suddenly, the kids around the table laughed and gathered their pets. \n\nAlex felt a rush of determination. \u201cWe\u2019ll find a way to stop you!\u201d he declared. They had to act fast. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s gather evidence,\u201d Jenna suggested, pulling out her phone. \u201cWe can record them!\u201d \n\nWith a nod, they decided to sneak around the back of the table. As they moved quietly, Lucy noticed something shiny on the ground. It was Bella\u2019s collar! \u201cLook what I found!\u201d Lucy barked, catching everyone\u2019s attention. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nTommy turned and gasped. \u201cYou found it!\u201d he yelled. \u201cNow we have to go!\u201d The kids began to scatter, but Alex, Jenna, and Lucy were ready.\n\n\u201cStop!\u201d Alex shouted. \u201cYou can\u2019t just run away!\u201d \n\nThe kids hesitated, glancing at each other. They knew they were caught. \n\n\u201cTommy, let\u2019s just return the pets,\u201d one of the kids said, looking nervous. \u201cThis isn\u2019t cool.\u201d \n\nTommy frowned, but he nodded. \u201cFine. Let\u2019s give them back.\u201d \n\nAs the kids returned the pets, Alex felt a sense of relief. \u201cWe did it!\u201d he cheered. \u201cWe solved the mystery!\u201d Jenna smiled, her eyes sparkling. \u201cWe showed them what\u2019s right.\u201d \n\nLucy barked happily, and everyone giggled. The neighborhood was safe once more. \n\nNow, with the pet show just around the corner, Alex knew more adventures awaited.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Alex, Jenna, and Lucy discover at the park?","options":["A pet show","A pet-swap club","A treasure map","A playground"],"correct_answer":"A pet-swap club"},{"question":"What does Lucy find on the ground?","options":["A toy","A leash","Bella's collar","A ball"],"correct_answer":"Bella's collar"},{"question":"What does Alex shout to the kids when they try to run away?","options":["Don't go!","Stop!","Wait for us!","Come back!"],"correct_answer":"Stop!"},{"question":"How does Tommy react when the pets are returned?","options":["He feels happy","He gets angry","He agrees to return them","He ignores them"],"correct_answer":"He agrees to return them"},{"question":"What is the main theme of this chapter?","options":["Adventure","Mystery","Friendship","Doing the right thing"],"correct_answer":"Doing the right thing"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_273_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_273_ch5_img1.png","plot_273_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":474,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
