   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_273_11_14","title":"The Vanishing Pet Mystery","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Crime Solving","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"In the heart of Maplewood Lane, where the houses were painted in cheerful hues, and laughter echoed from backyards, 12-year-old Alex Parker set his sights on a mystery. He had always dreamed of being a detective, solving puzzles and tracking down clues like the heroes in his favorite novels. Today, however, the adventure was more real than he ever anticipated.\n\n\u201cHave you heard?\u201d Jenna whispered, her green eyes sparkling with excitement as she approached him in the park. They often met here after school, surrounded by the scent of blooming flowers and the laughter of children playing. \u201cFluffy McGee vanished last night!\u201d\n\nAlex furrowed his brow. \u201cFluffy McGee? That\u2019s Mrs. Thompson\u2019s cat, right?\u201d He remembered seeing the fluffy white creature lounging on the porch, basking in the sun like a tiny, regal queen.\n\n\u201cExactly! And she\u2019s not the only one,\u201d Jenna said, pulling out her tablet. \u201cThere have been reports of pets disappearing all over the neighborhood. It\u2019s like they\u2019re all vanishing into thin air!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe park suddenly felt different, a tingling sense of something lurking just beneath the surface of their quiet town. As they sat on the swings, Alex clenched his fists, determination brewing inside him. \u201cWe need to investigate. We can\u2019t let this go on. What if there are more pets in danger?\u201d\n\nJenna nodded, her fingers flying over the tablet screen. \u201cI\u2019ll check social media for any clues. Maybe someone saw something unusual.\u201d Her voice was filled with excitement and a hint of anxiety, perfectly matching Alex\u2019s own bubbling energy.\n\nJust as they were about to formulate a plan, a tall figure strolled by. Mr. Davis, the new neighbor with a mysterious air, walked his dog. Alex felt a shiver run down his spine. Mr. Davis always seemed too interested in the neighborhood pets, casting glances that made Alex uneasy. \u201cThere\u2019s something off about him,\u201d Alex said quietly, watching as Mr. Davis chatted with his dog, the corners of his mouth twitching into a strange smile.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s see what he knows,\u201d Jenna suggested, her eyes narrowing with curiosity. \u201cMaybe he\u2019s involved.\u201d \n\nBut before they could act, a commotion erupted nearby. A group of kids were gathered, pointing excitedly at something behind the bushes. \u201cWhat is it?\u201d Alex asked, racing toward the noise, Jenna right on his heels. \n\nAs they pushed through the crowd, their hearts raced. There, nestled among the leaves, was a small collar\u2014Fluffy McGee's collar. The shiny tag sparkled in the sunlight, and a sense of urgency gripped Alex's chest. What had happened to Fluffy?\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cSomeone\u2019s definitely behind this,\u201d Jenna whispered, her voice barely audible over the chatter of the crowd. \u201cWe need to find out who.\u201d \n\nDetermined, Alex clenched his fists. \u201cWe\u2019re solving this mystery, Jenna. We can\u2019t allow anyone to take our pets. Not now, not ever!\u201d With renewed enthusiasm, they began to piece together the clues, ready to face whatever challenges lay ahead before the local pet show, where they feared the culprits might make their big reveal.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What pet disappears first in the story?","options":["A dog","A cat","A rabbit","A bird"],"correct_answer":"A cat"},{"question":"What does Alex want to be when he grows up?","options":["An artist","A detective","A teacher","A scientist"],"correct_answer":"A detective"},{"question":"Where do Alex and Jenna meet after school?","options":["At Jenna's house","In the park","At school","At the library"],"correct_answer":"In the park"},{"question":"Who is the new neighbor that Alex finds suspicious?","options":["Mrs. Thompson","Mr. Davis","Mr. Jones","The mayor"],"correct_answer":"Mr. Davis"},{"question":"What item do Alex and Jenna find that belongs to Fluffy McGee?","options":["A toy","A photo","A collar","A leash"],"correct_answer":"A collar"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_273_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_273_ch1_img1.png","plot_273_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":516,"reading_level":"Builder"}
