   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_273_11_14","title":"The Vanishing Pet Mystery","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Crime Solving","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"As the sun dipped below the horizon, casting a warm golden glow over Maplewood Lane, Alex Parker paced back and forth in his room, his mind racing. \u201cWhat if Mr. Davis is behind all of this?\u201d he muttered to himself, rubbing his chin thoughtfully. It had only been a week since the first pet vanished\u2014a fluffy golden retriever named Max\u2014and now, three more had followed. The pet show was just days away, and Alex's detective instincts were tingling like never before.\n\nHis trusty sidekick, Jenna, was sprawled across his bed, her fingers flying over her laptop. \u201cI\u2019ll search online for any suspicious activity. Maybe we can find a forum or something,\u201d she suggested, her eyes sparkling with excitement. Jenna was a whiz at technology; if anyone could help solve this mystery, it was her. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nOutside, the neighborhood was a mixture of laughter and barking, but for Alex, the joy felt clouded by worry. They had to act fast. \u201cWhat\u2019s our first move?\u201d he asked, leaning closer to Jenna, who typed furiously. \n\nShe paused and looked up. \u201cLet\u2019s head to the park. That\u2019s where all the owners gather with their pets. If anyone has seen something unusual, it\u2019ll be there.\u201d \n\nThe park was a hub of activity, filled with colorful kites dancing in the air and children playing tag. But Alex\u2019s focus was razor-sharp, scanning every corner for clues. Just as they approached the pet area, a commotion caught their attention. A group of kids was huddled around a large sign that read \u201cPet Swap Club\u2014Join Us!\u201d \n\n\u201cWhat do you think that is?\u201d Alex asked, eyebrows furrowed. \n\n\u201cSounds suspicious,\u201d Jenna said, her voice low. \u201cLet\u2019s check it out.\u201d \n\nAs they edged closer, they overheard a kid say, \u201cIf you want a new pet, just bring yours! We promise it\u2019s safe.\u201d \n\nAlex exchanged a glance with Jenna. \u201cThis could be it. If pets are disappearing just before the show, maybe they\u2019re being swapped for a reason.\u201d \n\nSuddenly, a tall figure emerged from the crowd\u2014it was Mr. Davis. His eyes darted around nervously as he moved toward the sign. \u201cI don\u2019t think you kids understand what you\u2019re getting into,\u201d he warned, his voice grave. \n\n\u201cDid you hear that?\u201d Jenna whispered, excitement bubbling in her tone. \n\nBefore they could react, a small dog, a beagle named Daisy, darted past them, yapping wildly. \u201cCatch that dog!\u201d Alex yelled, adrenaline pumping through him. They sprinted after Daisy, who zigzagged through the crowd, leading them deeper into the park.\n\nJust when they thought they lost her, Daisy skidded to a halt near a shady tree. There, hidden among the roots, was a small, metal box. Alex's heart raced. \u201cWhat if this is a clue?\u201d he said, kneeling down. \n\nBut as he reached for the box, Jenna shouted, \u201cWait! Look out!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nBefore Alex could comprehend the warning, Mr. Davis was upon them, blocking their path. \u201cI told you kids to back off,\u201d he growled, his face darkening like a storm cloud. Alex felt a rush of fear, but he stood tall. \u201cWe\u2019re not afraid of you!\u201d he declared, determination igniting in his chest.\n\nMr. Davis's expression shifted, revealing a hint of frustration. \u201cYou have no idea what you\u2019re dealing with,\u201d he hissed, backing away slowly. \n\nAlex and Jenna exchanged glances, knowing they were on the brink of something big. They had to figure out what was in that box\u2014and what Mr. Davis was hiding\u2014before it was too late.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the main focus of Alex and Jenna's investigation?","options":["Finding new pets","Uncovering pet disappearances","Joining the Pet Swap Club","Making a video about pets"],"correct_answer":"Uncovering pet disappearances"},{"question":"What suspicious sign do Alex and Jenna find in the park?","options":["Pet Adoption","Pet Swap Club","Lost Pets","Pet Training"],"correct_answer":"Pet Swap Club"},{"question":"Who warns Alex and Jenna to back off?","options":["A police officer","Mr. Davis","Their parents","A neighbor"],"correct_answer":"Mr. Davis"},{"question":"What does Alex find hidden near the tree?","options":["A lost pet","A metal box","A treasure map","A book"],"correct_answer":"A metal box"},{"question":"What is the mood of the chapter when Alex confronts Mr. Davis?","options":["Joyful","Tense","Calm","Boring"],"correct_answer":"Tense"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_273_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_273_ch2_img1.png","plot_273_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":593,"reading_level":"Builder"}
