   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_273_11_14","title":"The Vanishing Pet Mystery","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Crime Solving","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Chapter 4: The Secret Revealed\n\nThe sun rose lazily over Maplewood Lane, casting a golden hue across the neighborhood. Alex adjusted his detective cap, feeling the familiar flutter of excitement in his stomach. Today was the day they would confront Mr. Davis again and dig deeper into the mystery of the disappearing pets. Jenna arrived at his house, her backpack overflowing with gadgets and an eager glint in her eye.\n\n\u201cReady to crack this case?\u201d she asked, her voice bubbling with enthusiasm.\n\n\u201cAbsolutely! Let\u2019s meet at the park first,\u201d Alex replied, glancing at his watch. They had one last chance to gather evidence before the pet show. \n\nAs they hurried to the park, Alex couldn\u2019t shake the feeling that they were being watched. He scanned the streets filled with kids riding bikes and dogs being walked, but everything seemed normal. Until he spotted Mr. Davis\u2019 house. There, in the backyard, was something they hadn\u2019t noticed before: a series of strange cages covered with a tarp. \n\n\u201cWhat do you think is in there?\u201d Jenna whispered, her eyes narrowing. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find out,\u201d Alex suggested, his heart racing. They quickly approached the fence separating Mr. Davis\u2019 yard from the park. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they ducked behind a bush, Alex felt a rush of determination. Peering through the leaves, he saw Mr. Davis pacing, talking animatedly on his phone. \u201cI told you, it\u2019s all set for tomorrow,\u201d he said, his voice tense. \u201cNo one will find out. Just make sure the pets are ready.\u201d \n\n\u201cWhat does that mean?\u201d Jenna whispered, her brow furrowing. \n\n\u201cI think he\u2019s planning something big at the pet show,\u201d Alex replied. They exchanged nervous glances, knowing they had to act fast. \n\nSuddenly, footsteps approached. Jenna and Alex froze, hearts pounding. It was Mr. Davis coming toward them! They crouched lower, hoping he wouldn\u2019t see them. Just then, an idea sparked in Alex\u2019s mind. \u201cWe need a distraction,\u201d he whispered urgently. \u201cCan you hack into the park\u2019s speaker system using your tablet?\u201d\n\n\u201cAbsolutely! But it\u2019ll take a second,\u201d Jenna whispered back, her fingers flying across the screen as she accessed the park\u2019s system. \n\n\u201cJust hurry!\u201d Alex urged, watching as Mr. Davis moved closer. \n\nWith a final tap, Jenna grinned. \u201cDone! Now let\u2019s see how he likes a little chaos.\u201d\n\nAs Mr. Davis reached the fence, Jenna pressed a button, and suddenly, a loud announcement blared through the park speakers: \u201cAttention, Maplewood! The pet show will start in one hour!\u201d \n\nAt that moment, chaos erupted. People rushed to gather their pets, and Mr. Davis spun around, his face contorted in anger. \u201cWhat the\u2014!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cNow\u2019s our chance!\u201d Alex shouted, darting towards the cages. They threw back the tarp, revealing a collection of colorful pet carriers, each one labeled with names of the missing animals.\n\n\u201cThere they are!\u201d Jenna gasped, her eyes wide with disbelief. \u201cWe found them!\u201d\n\nAlex felt a surge of hope. \u201cWe have to get them out before Mr. Davis catches us!\u201d They quickly began to open the cages, a rush of adrenaline fueling their actions. \n\nBut just as they freed the first pet\u2014a small tabby cat named Whiskers\u2014the sound of footsteps returned. \u201cWhat are you two doing?\u201d Mr. Davis bellowed, his voice sharp as a knife. \n\n\u201cRun!\u201d Alex shouted, grabbing Whiskers and dashing towards the park's edge, with Jenna hot on his heels. \n\nAs they sprinted away, they couldn\u2019t help but feel that they were on the brink of uncovering a much larger mystery. Would they be able to expose Mr. Davis\u2019 dark secret before the pet show? \n\nThe excitement stirred within them as they raced towards their next clue, ready to face whatever came next.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What new discovery do Alex and Jenna make about Mr. Davis?","options":["He loves pets","He has cages with missing pets","He is friendly","He plans a party"],"correct_answer":"He has cages with missing pets"},{"question":"What does Jenna use to create a distraction?","options":["A loud horn","The park\u2019s speaker system","A firecracker","Her phone"],"correct_answer":"The park\u2019s speaker system"},{"question":"How do Alex and Jenna feel when they uncover the pets?","options":["Happy and relieved","Angry","Indifferent","Scared"],"correct_answer":"Happy and relieved"},{"question":"What emotion does Alex feel when he suggests a distraction?","options":["Fear","Excitement","Sadness","Boredom"],"correct_answer":"Excitement"},{"question":"What is Mr. Davis\u2019s reaction when he sees Alex and Jenna?","options":["He is happy","He is confused","He is angry","He is scared"],"correct_answer":"He is angry"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_273_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_273_ch4_img1.png","plot_273_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":623,"reading_level":"Builder"}
