   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_274_7_10","title":"The Mystery of the Haunted Skate Park","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Crime Solving","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Ella stood at the entrance of the skate park, her heart racing with excitement. The sun shone bright, making the ramps sparkle like treasures. \u201cThis place is awesome!\u201d she shouted to her best friend, Max.\n\nMax adjusted his helmet. \u201cYeah, but did you hear the rumors?\u201d he replied, looking nervous. \u201cThey say it\u2019s haunted!\u201d\n\nElla laughed. \u201cGhosts can\u2019t skate! Let\u2019s show everyone our tricks!\u201d She zoomed forward on her skateboard, her dark hair flying behind her. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe skate park was filled with colorful graffiti. Bright blues, greens, and pinks danced on the walls. Kids were skating, cheering, and having a blast. But Ella and Max noticed something strange. \n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s that old building next door?\u201d Max asked, pointing. \u201cIt looks spooky!\u201d\n\nElla squinted at the abandoned building. \u201cMaybe that\u2019s where the ghost is hiding!\u201d \n\nJust then, their friend Zoe skated up. \u201cHey, you two! Are you ready for the race?\u201d she grinned. \n\n\u201cDefinitely!\u201d Ella shouted. But deep inside, she felt a twinge of fear. \u201cAfter the race, let\u2019s investigate the building!\u201d\n\nMax gulped. \u201cAre you sure? What if we see the ghost?\u201d\n\nElla smiled bravely. \u201cWhat if the ghost needs our help? We can\u2019t let the skate park close down!\u201d\n\nThe three friends lined up at the starting point. Ella counted down. \u201cThree... two... one... GO!\u201d They raced down the ramps, the wind rushing past them. \n\nSuddenly, a loud crash echoed from the direction of the old building. Ella skidded to a stop. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d she asked, her eyes wide.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s check it out!\u201d Zoe suggested. \n\n\u201cOkay, but be careful!\u201d Max said, looking worried. \n\nThey skated cautiously towards the building. The door creaked open, and they peeked inside. Shadows danced on the walls, making the place look alive. \n\n\u201cMaybe this was a bad idea\u2026\u201d Max whispered.\n\nElla took a deep breath. \u201cNo way! We came here to find out the truth!\u201d \n\nJust then, a flicker of light flashed inside. \u201cDid you see that?\u201d Zoe gasped. \n\n\u201cI did! Let\u2019s go!\u201d Ella urged, her heart pounding. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAs they stepped inside, they felt a chill in the air. \u201cThis is it! The mystery begins!\u201d Ella declared.\n\nThey moved deeper into the building, ready to uncover the secrets hidden within.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who is the main character of the story?","options":["Max","Zoe","Ella","Mr. Grayson"],"correct_answer":"Ella"},{"question":"What do the friends decide to investigate?","options":["The skate park","The old building","The school","The city council"],"correct_answer":"The old building"},{"question":"What do the kids hear that makes them curious?","options":["A skateboard rolling","A loud crash","A dog barking","A car honking"],"correct_answer":"A loud crash"},{"question":"What does Ella want to help the ghost do?","options":["Scare people","Skate better","Save the skate park","Find a friend"],"correct_answer":"Save the skate park"},{"question":"What is the mood when they enter the old building?","options":["Excited","Scared","Happy","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Scared"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_274_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_274_ch1_img1.png","plot_274_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":379,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
