   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_274_7_10","title":"The Mystery of the Haunted Skate Park","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Crime Solving","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"The moon shined brightly over the skate park. Ella, Max, and Sam stood at the entrance. The air was cool with a hint of excitement. \"Tonight is the night!\" Ella declared, gripping her skateboard. \"We\u2019re going to find out if the ghost is real!\"  \n\nMax rubbed his arms. \"What if it is? What if it\u2019s a scary ghost?\"  \n\nSam laughed. \"Come on, Max! It might just be someone trying to scare us!\"  \n\nElla nodded, her eyes sparkling. \"Let\u2019s stick together. We\u2019ll skate and look for clues!\"  \n\nAs they skated past the ramps, the park felt different at night. The shadows danced, and the graffiti glowed under the moonlight. Just then, they heard a strange noise coming from the back of the park.  \n\n\u201cDid you hear that?\u201d Max whispered, his eyes wide.  \n\n\u201cYes! Let\u2019s check it out!\u201d Ella replied, her heart racing. They skated faster, heading toward the sound.  \n\nSuddenly, out of the corner of her eye, Ella saw a flicker of movement. \"Over there!\" she cried. They skated towards the empty building next to the park.  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]  \n\nThe building looked even creepier at night. Graffiti covered the walls, and the windows were dark and empty. \"What if the ghost is in there?\" Max asked.  \n\n\"Then we\u2019ll meet it!\" Ella grinned bravely. Sam shivered but followed Ella. They pushed open the creaky door.  \n\nInside, the air was chilly. They saw old skateboards and helmets piled in the corner. \"These must belong to the old skaters!\" Ella said. Suddenly, a soft, glowing light appeared at the end of the room.  \n\n\u201cWha\u2014what is that?\u201d Max stammered.  \n\n\"It\u2019s our chance!\" Ella said, her eyes shining with curiosity. They moved closer to the light and gasped.  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]  \n\nIn front of them, a ghostly figure floated, holding a skateboard! It wasn\u2019t scary at all. It looked friendly, with a smile on its face. \"Hello, young skaters!\" the ghost said. \"I\u2019m here to help save the park!\"  \n\nElla could hardly believe her ears. \u201cYou\u2019re not scary at all! Why do you want to help us?\u201d  \n\nThe ghost chuckled softly. \"This park has many memories. I loved skating here long ago. I don\u2019t want to see it close.\"  \n\nElla, Max, and Sam exchanged excited glances. Maybe the ghost had more to tell. They needed to know how to help.  \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s work together!\u201d Ella shouted. The ghost nodded, and the adventure was just beginning.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Ella, Max, and Sam do at night?","options":["They went home","They skated in the park","They played video games","They went to bed"],"correct_answer":"They skated in the park"},{"question":"What did they hear that made them curious?","options":["A car honking","A strange noise","A dog barking","A person talking"],"correct_answer":"A strange noise"},{"question":"What did the ghost hold?","options":["A helmet","A skateboard","A flashlight","A toy"],"correct_answer":"A skateboard"},{"question":"Why does the ghost want to help?","options":["To scare people","To close the park","To save the park","To play games"],"correct_answer":"To save the park"},{"question":"How did Ella feel when she saw the ghost?","options":["Scared","Bored","Excited","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_274_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_274_ch4_img1.png","plot_274_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":410,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
