   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_274_7_10","title":"The Mystery of the Haunted Skate Park","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Crime Solving","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Ella, Max, and their friends stood at the edge of the skate park. The moonlight shimmered on the ramps. It was time to skate and find the truth about the ghost! \n\n\u201cWe can do this!\u201d Ella said, gripping her skateboard. \u201cLet\u2019s show that ghost we\u2019re not scared!\u201d\n\nMax looked worried. \u201cBut what if it\u2019s really scary?\u201d \n\nElla smiled. \u201cWhat if it just wants to help?\u201d \n\nAs they skated around, the park felt alive. The sounds of wheels rolling and laughter filled the air. Suddenly, they heard a soft giggle. \n\n\u201cWhat was that?\u201d whispered Max. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find out!\u201d Ella replied, feeling brave. \n\nThey skated towards the sound. There, near the old building, they saw the friendly ghost! It floated above a ramp, glowing softly. \n\n\u201cHello, skaters!\u201d the ghost said with a cheerful voice. \u201cI\u2019m Skippy! I want to help you save this park!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nElla\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cYou really want to help?\u201d \n\n\u201cYes!\u201d Skippy floated closer. \u201cThis park is special. It brings joy. But Mr. Grayson plans to close it. He thinks it\u2019s too dangerous.\u201d\n\nMax frowned. \u201cBut he loves skating!\u201d \n\n\u201cExactly!\u201d Skippy clapped his hands. \u201cHe just needs a push. Show him how fun it can be!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s do it!\u201d shouted Ella. \n\nThey skated back to the park entrance. Ella decided they should show Mr. Grayson a big skate show. \u201cIf he sees us having fun, he\u2019ll change his mind!\u201d\n\nThe next day, they gathered all their friends. \u201cWe need to skate our best!\u201d Ella told everyone. \u201cLet\u2019s show Mr. Grayson how amazing this park is!\u201d\n\nThey practiced tricks all day. Max did a cool flip. Ella nailed her jumps. The other kids cheered. \n\nWhen Mr. Grayson arrived, he looked surprised. \u201cWhat\u2019s going on here?\u201d\n\n\u201cWe\u2019re having a skate show!\u201d Ella called out. \u201cJoin us!\u201d \n\nMr. Grayson hesitated but then smiled. \u201cAlright, I\u2019ll watch.\u201d\n\nAs they skated, Skippy floated around, cheering them on. The park buzzed with excitement. Laughter filled the air. \n\nFinally, Ella landed her biggest trick. \u201cDid you see that?\u201d she yelled. \n\nMr. Grayson clapped. \u201cYou all are incredible!\u201d \n\n\u201cThat\u2019s why we love this park,\u201d Max added. \n\nMr. Grayson thought for a moment. \u201cMaybe I was wrong about closing it. This park is full of life!\u201d \n\nThe kids cheered, and Skippy danced in the air. \u201cYou did it!\u201d \n\nElla grinned. \u201cWe saved the park!\u201d \n\nAs the sun set, Ella felt proud. They had faced the mystery and found a friend in the ghost. \n\n\u201cMaybe Mr. Grayson will even skate with us one day!\u201d Max laughed. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go celebrate!\u201d Ella said. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the ghost's name?","options":["Max","Skippy","Ella","Mr. Grayson"],"correct_answer":"Skippy"},{"question":"What do Ella and her friends plan to do for Mr. Grayson?","options":["Close the park","Have a skate show","Go home","Play video games"],"correct_answer":"Have a skate show"},{"question":"How does Mr. Grayson feel at the end of the chapter?","options":["Angry","Scared","Happy","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Happy"},{"question":"What does Skippy want to help with?","options":["Closing the park","Scaring the kids","Saving the park","Building ramps"],"correct_answer":"Saving the park"},{"question":"Why do the kids love the skate park?","options":["It's dangerous","It's full of life and joy","It's quiet","It's old"],"correct_answer":"It's full of life and joy"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_274_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_274_ch5_img1.png","plot_274_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":440,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
