     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"ethereal","1":"palpable","2":"determination","3":"scowl","4":"memories","image_prompts":["A dimly lit skate park at dusk, with shadows cast by the ramps and graffiti-covered walls. Ella stands at the forefront, her expression fierce and determined. Max stands slightly behind her, nervously biting his lip, while Jake leans casually against a skateboard, wearing a smirk. The atmosphere is filled with tension and anticipation as they prepare to confront the unknown.","A close-up shot of the dusty skateboard with the yellowed note attached. The room is dark, illuminated only by a flickering light bulb, highlighting the skateboard's worn wheels and faded graphics. A shadow looms in the background, suggesting the presence of the ghost, adding an element of suspense and intrigue."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dimly lit skate park at dusk, with shadows cast by the ramps and graffiti-covered walls. Ella stands at the forefront, her expression fierce and determined. Max stands slightly behind her, nervously biting his lip, while Jake leans casually against a skateboard, wearing a smirk. The atmosphere is filled with tension and anticipation as they prepare to confront the unknown.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_274_ch5_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 18:35:16"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A close-up shot of the dusty skateboard with the yellowed note attached. The room is dark, illuminated only by a flickering light bulb, highlighting the skateboards worn wheels and faded graphics. A shadow looms in the background, suggesting the presence of the ghost, adding an element of suspense and intrigue.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_274_ch5_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 18:35:16"}}}
