   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_275_7_10","title":"The Clue in the Cookie Jar","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Crime Solving","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Lily stood in the bustling cafeteria of Maplewood School. The air smelled sweet, like chocolate and vanilla. Tables were filled with cookies, cupcakes, and pies. Excitement buzzed around her.\n\n\u201cLook at all these treats!\u201d Sarah exclaimed, her eyes sparkling. She pointed at a cupcake tower. \u201cWe need to try everything!\u201d\n\nLily smiled but remembered the empty cookie plate. \u201cFirst, we need to solve the mystery of the missing cookies!\u201d\n\nJust then, Mr. Thompson, the principal, rushed by with a big smile. He waved at the girls. \u201cHappy bake sale, everyone! Enjoy the cookies!\u201d\n\nLily frowned. \u201cMr. Thompson, do you know what happened to the cookies?\u201d\n\nHe scratched his head, \u201cHmm, I thought I saw them right here!\u201d He pointed at an empty table. \u201cBut now they\u2019re gone. So strange!\u201d\n\nLily felt a flutter in her stomach. \u201cWe have to find the thief!\u201d She grabbed Sarah\u2019s hand. \u201cLet\u2019s look for clues!\u201d\n\nThey searched the cafeteria. First, they checked the cookie table. Only crumbs remained. \u201cLook!\u201d Sarah said, pointing. \u201cThere\u2019s a note!\u201d\n\nLily picked it up. It said, \u201cThe cookies are safe with me!\u201d \u201cWhat does that mean?\u201d Sarah asked, looking worried.\n\n\u201cI think it\u2019s a clue!\u201d Lily said, her detective instincts kicking in. But then she noticed Sarah biting her lip. \u201cAre you okay?\u201d\n\n\u201cI am!\u201d Sarah replied quickly. But Lily could see her friend was nervous.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s look around for more clues,\u201d Lily suggested. They walked over to the dessert corner when suddenly, they spotted a shadow behind the cupcake tower.\n\n\u201cDid you see that?\u201d Sarah whispered, her eyes wide.\n\n\u201cYeah! Let\u2019s check it out!\u201d Lily said, feeling a mix of excitement and fear. They crept closer, holding their breaths.\n\nLily peeked around the tower. To their surprise, they found Ben, a classmate, stuffing cookies into his backpack!\n\n\u201cBen!\u201d Lily gasped. \u201cWhat are you doing?\u201d\n\nHis eyes widened. \u201cUh-oh! I, um\u2026 I was just, uh, tasting them!\u201d\n\nLily sighed. \u201cYou can\u2019t just take cookies!\u201d\n\nJust then, Sarah jumped in. \u201cWait, Ben! You\u2019re not the thief, are you?\u201d A worried expression crossed her face.\n\n\u201cI\u2019m not! I just wanted to try them first!\u201d Ben protested.\n\nLily glanced at Sarah. \u201cWhat if we all work together to find out who took the cookies?\u201d\n\n\u201cOkay!\u201d Sarah agreed, her smile returning. \u201cTeamwork!\u201d\n\nBut Lily felt a new worry. What if Sarah knew more than she was saying? Could her own best friend be hiding something?\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they formed a new plan, the cafeteria buzzed with laughter and chatter. The bake sale was in full swing, but the cookie mystery loomed over them like a cloud.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s check the kitchen next!\u201d Lily declared, her heart racing. There were so many places to search, and time was running out!\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nLily took a deep breath. Could she trust her friend? And would they solve the mystery before the bake sale ended?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Mr. Thompson think happened to the cookies?","options":["He knows who took them","He forgot where they were","He ate them","He gave them away"],"correct_answer":"He forgot where they were"},{"question":"Who do Lily and Sarah find trying to take cookies?","options":["Ben","Mr. Thompson","Sarah","A stranger"],"correct_answer":"Ben"},{"question":"What is the note Lily finds about the cookies?","options":["They are in the kitchen","The cookies are safe with someone","They are gone forever","Ben took them"],"correct_answer":"The cookies are safe with someone"},{"question":"How does Sarah feel when she sees the note?","options":["Happy","Nervous","Excited","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Nervous"},{"question":"What is Lily's new plan?","options":["To check the kitchen","To eat cookies","To go home","To tell Mr. Thompson"],"correct_answer":"To check the kitchen"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_275_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_275_ch2_img1.png","plot_275_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":489,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
