   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_275_7_10","title":"The Clue in the Cookie Jar","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Crime Solving","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Lily stood in the busy cafeteria, the sweet smell of cookies filled the air. Tables were piled high with treats. Kids laughed and chatted, excitement buzzing around them. But something was wrong. The batch of cookies was still missing!\n\n\u201cWhere could they be?\u201d Lily wondered aloud, tapping her chin. Sarah looked worried. \n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, Lily. But we need to find them before Mr. Thompson notices!\u201d she exclaimed. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s check the bake sale table again,\u201d Lily decided. They hurried over. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they approached, they noticed Ben peeking into a box. He looked around nervously. \n\n\u201cHey, Ben! What are you doing?\u201d Lily called.\n\nBen jumped, dropping a piece of paper. \u201cUh, nothing! Just\u2026 checking!\u201d \n\nLily picked it up. It was a cookie recipe! But something was written on it in big letters: \u201cFind the secret stash!\u201d\n\nSarah gasped. \u201cWhat could that mean?\u201d \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s investigate!\u201d Lily said, her heart racing. \n\nThey searched the cafeteria, looking for clues. They checked under tables, behind chairs, and even inside the supply closet. But there were no cookies anywhere!\n\n\u201cMaybe the clue is a riddle,\u201d suggested Sarah as they walked back to their friend. \n\n\u201cOr a map!\u201d Lily added, excited. They needed to decode the note.\n\nSuddenly, they heard a crash. They turned to see Ben bumping into a stack of plates. Cookies flew everywhere! \n\n\u201cOh no!\u201d Lily shouted. \n\n\u201cRun!\u201d Sarah yelled as they saw the cookies land on the ground. \n\nLily felt conflicted. Ben was a suspect, but now he looked scared. \u201cAre you alright?\u201d she asked. \n\n\u201cI didn\u2019t mean to! I just wanted to help!\u201d he said, his face red. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s not blame him yet,\u201d Lily said, glancing at Sarah. \n\nThey all needed to work together. Suddenly, the lights flickered, and the cafeteria went dark. \n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d Sarah cried. \n\n\u201cStay close,\u201d Lily whispered. \n\nThey heard footsteps and a whisper, \u201cThe cookies are safe with me!\u201d \n\nLily's heart raced. Who was that? \n\n\u201cWe need to find out!\u201d Lily decided. She felt more determined than ever.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAs the lights flickered back on, Lily glanced at Sarah and Ben. \u201cAre you ready to crack this mystery?\u201d she asked.\n\n\u201cYes!\u201d they both shouted, ready for the next clue.\n\nThe adventure was far from over.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Lily and Sarah discover in the cafeteria?","options":["A cookie recipe","A cookie jar","A cake","A riddle"],"correct_answer":"A cookie recipe"},{"question":"What happens when Ben bumps into the plates?","options":["The cookies stay safe","Cookies fly everywhere","He gets hurt","He runs away"],"correct_answer":"Cookies fly everywhere"},{"question":"What do the characters hear when the lights go out?","options":["Laughter","A voice","Footsteps","Silence"],"correct_answer":"A voice"},{"question":"What do Lily and her friends decide to do at the end of the chapter?","options":["Run away","Keep searching for clues","Give up","Eat cookies"],"correct_answer":"Keep searching for clues"},{"question":"How does Lily feel about Ben during the chapter?","options":["Angry","Confused","Determined","Happy"],"correct_answer":"Determined"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_275_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_275_ch3_img1.png","plot_275_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":376,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
