   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_275_7_10","title":"The Clue in the Cookie Jar","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Crime Solving","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Lily stood in the bustling cafeteria of Maplewood School. The air smelled sweet, filled with cookies, cupcakes, and brownies. Children rushed around, chatting and laughing. Lily's heart raced as she recalled the missing cookies. She had to solve this mystery quickly!\n\n\u201cLook, Sarah! We need to find more clues,\u201d Lily said, her eyes bright with determination. Sarah nodded, her mouth full of cookie crumbs. \u201cI\u2019m ready, but can we eat first?\u201d she giggled.\n\nAs they searched, they spotted Mr. Thompson, the cheerful principal. He was looking around with a puzzled expression. \u201cOh dear! Where did all the cookies go?\u201d he wondered aloud, scratching his head.\n\nLily approached him. \u201cMr. Thompson, have you seen anyone acting suspiciously?\u201d she asked. He waved his hands. \u201cJust the usual cookie lovers!\u201d he chuckled. \u201cBut I did see Sarah and you near the cookie table before the lights went out.\u201d\n\nLily\u2019s heart sank. \u201cBut we were only tasting cookies!\u201d she protested. \u201cWe\u2019ve got to clear her name!\u201d Lily thought. She turned to Sarah, who looked worried.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, a loud crash echoed through the cafeteria! Everyone turned to see Ben, dropping a plate of burnt cookies. \u201cOops! I was trying to bake too!\u201d he exclaimed, his face red. But Lily noticed something else\u2014Ben\u2019s shirt had crumbs all over it.\n\n\u201cBen,\u201d Lily said, squinting at him. \u201cDid you sneak some cookies?\u201d He stammered, \u201cNo! I just wanted to help!\u201d\n\nLily smiled, feeling hope. \u201cLet\u2019s check the cookie ingredients!\u201d she said excitedly. They rushed to the bake sale table. With Sarah\u2019s help, they dug through the mix of cookie recipes. \n\n\u201cHere\u2019s one with chocolate chips!\u201d Sarah said, holding it high. \u201cAnd look! This one has sprinkles!\u201d \n\n\u201cWait,\u201d Lily said, her eyes narrowing. \u201cWhat if the thief used a different recipe?\u201d \n\nJust then, she heard a whisper. \u201cCheck the back room!\u201d It was the mysterious voice from before! Could it be a clue? Lily felt a thrill of excitement.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d she whispered to Sarah. The two friends crept toward the door, ready for the next part of their adventure.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAs they reached the back room, they exchanged nervous glances. What would they find? The air was tense with mystery.\n\n\u201cOkay, on the count of three!\u201d Lily said, her heart racing. \u201cOne... two... three!\u201d \n\nThey pushed the door open, peeking in to see what secrets lay inside.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Lily want to find?","options":["The missing cookies","A new recipe","A cupcake","A friend"],"correct_answer":"The missing cookies"},{"question":"Who does Mr. Thompson think is suspicious?","options":["Ben","Sarah","Lily","Both Sarah and Lily"],"correct_answer":"Both Sarah and Lily"},{"question":"What does Ben drop in the cafeteria?","options":["A cupcake","A plate of burnt cookies","A cookie jar","A cookie recipe"],"correct_answer":"A plate of burnt cookies"},{"question":"What mysterious whisper do Lily and Sarah hear?","options":["Check the back room!","The cookies are gone!","Let's eat!","Help me!"],"correct_answer":"Check the back room!"},{"question":"What do Lily and Sarah find in the back room?","options":["More cookies","A secret recipe","A thief","Unclear, they are about to open the door."],"correct_answer":"Unclear, they are about to open the door."}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_275_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_275_ch4_img1.png","plot_275_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":401,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
