   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_266_7_10","title":"The Mystery of the Missing Music Box","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Locked Room","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"The annual school talent show was finally here! The auditorium sparkled with colorful streamers and bright balloons. Students buzzed with excitement, practicing their acts and sharing laughs.\n\nMia stood backstage with her best friend, Theo. \"Can you believe it, Theo? This is the biggest night of the year!\" she exclaimed. She was wearing a shiny purple dress that twinkled under the lights.\n\nTheo grinned, adjusting his glasses. \"And I can\u2019t wait to see everyone\u2019s performances! But we have to keep an eye out for the music box.\"\n\nMia's eyes widened. \"Oh! The special music box! It belongs to the star of the show, Lily!\" \n\nJust then, Ms. Pomeroy, their quirky drama teacher, rushed in with a flair. Her colorful scarf swirled around her neck. \"Listen up, everyone! Lily's music box is missing! It was last seen in the locked backstage room!\"\n\n\"What? How could it just disappear?\" Theo asked, scratching his head.\n\n\"It gets worse!\" Ms. Pomeroy said dramatically. \"The show starts in an hour! We need that music box back!\"\n\nMia felt her heart race. \"We have to help! But how do we get into the locked room?\"\n\nTheo pulled out his gadget-filled backpack. \"I have an idea! We can use my lock-picking tool!\"\n\nMia nodded, her mind racing. \"Let\u2019s do it! But we have to be quiet. We don't want any jealous classmates to catch us!\"\n\nWith a determined look, Mia whispered, \"If we find the music box, we\u2019ll be the heroes of the show!\" \n\nTheo smiled. \"And maybe we can solve some mysteries too!\"\n\nThey crept towards the backstage door, carefully avoiding their classmates. The air was thick with excitement and whispers. \n\nSuddenly, Mia stopped. \"Wait! We need to be sure we\u2019re not seen. What if someone knows we're looking for the music box?\" \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nTogether, they peeked around the corner. The backstage area was dimly lit, filled with tall boxes and scattered props. It was a maze of shadows and secrets.\n\n\"Look!\" Theo pointed. \"There's a note on that box!\" \n\nThey quickly moved closer. Mia reached down and picked up the note. It read: \"The key to the music box is closer than you think.\"\n\nMia and Theo exchanged glances, their eyes wide. \"What does it mean?\" Mia wondered aloud.\n\n\"I don\u2019t know, but we have to figure it out fast!\" Theo replied, looking around nervously. \n\nThe countdown to the show had begun, and they needed to act quickly. Just then, the sound of a loud cheer came from the auditorium. It was time for the first act, and they had to hurry!\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nMia clutched the note tightly. \"Let\u2019s find that key! The mystery of the missing music box starts now!\"","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What event is happening at the school?","options":["A science fair","A talent show","A sports game","A book fair"],"correct_answer":"A talent show"},{"question":"Who lost the music box?","options":["Mia","Theo","Lily","Ms. Pomeroy"],"correct_answer":"Lily"},{"question":"What do Mia and Theo plan to use to open the locked room?","options":["A magic spell","A lock-picking tool","A key","A hammer"],"correct_answer":"A lock-picking tool"},{"question":"Who is their drama teacher?","options":["Ms. Pomeroy","Mr. Johnson","Mrs. Smith","Ms. Taylor"],"correct_answer":"Ms. Pomeroy"},{"question":"What does the note say?","options":["The music box is lost","The key is hidden","The show is starting","The key is closer than you think"],"correct_answer":"The key is closer than you think"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_266_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_266_ch1_img1.png","plot_266_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":455,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
