   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_266_7_10","title":"The Mystery of the Missing Music Box","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Locked Room","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"The auditorium buzzed with excitement. Colorful decorations hung from the ceiling. Mia and Theo stood at the edge of the stage, watching students practice. \n\n\u201cLook at Lily!\u201d Mia said, pointing. \u201cShe\u2019s so nervous!\u201d\n\n\u201cYeah,\u201d Theo replied. \u201cHer music box is missing, and she\u2019s the star of the show.\u201d\n\nSuddenly, Ms. Pomeroy, their quirky drama teacher, appeared. She wore a bright purple feather boa and a big, funny hat. \u201cKids! Who\u2019s ready for a show?\u201d she sang.\n\nMia and Theo exchanged glances. They had to find the music box before the show started. \n\n\u201cIf we could just get into the backstage room, we might find clues,\u201d Mia whispered. \n\n\u201cBut it's locked!\u201d Theo said, scratching his head. \u201cI wish I had my special lock tool with me.\u201d\n\nMia thought for a moment. \u201cWhat if we distract everyone while you unlock the door?\u201d she suggested.\n\n\u201cGood idea! But how?\u201d Theo asked, eyes wide with excitement.\n\nMia spotted a group of students practicing their dance moves nearby. \u201cWe can get everyone\u2019s attention! You can sneak backstage while Ms. Pomeroy leads the group!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s do it!\u201d Theo said, grinning.\n\nMia and Theo hurried to the dance group. \u201cHey, everyone! Want to see a magic trick?\u201d Mia shouted. \n\nThe students turned, curious. \u201cMagic trick?\u201d Lily asked, her eyes brightening. \n\n\u201cYes!\u201d Mia said, flourishing her hands. \u201cBut you have to come over here!\u201d\n\nAs the students gathered, Theo tiptoed away. He reached the backstage door. It was big and old, with a shiny lock that gleamed in the light. He pulled out his multi-tool. \n\n\u201cCome on, come on,\u201d he whispered, feeling nervous. Just then, he heard footsteps. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nHe looked back. Mia was still entertaining the crowd. Theo quickly focused on the lock. With a twist and a click, he opened the door. \n\n\u201cGot it!\u201d he whispered to himself, peeking inside the dimly lit room. \n\nSuddenly, Mia called out, \u201cTheo! We need to hurry!\u201d\n\n\u201cComing!\u201d he shouted, slipping through the door. Inside, he saw piles of costumes, props, and\u2026 a glimmer!\n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s that?\u201d he wondered, moving closer. It was a shiny silver key! But where was the music box? \n\nJust then, Mia barged in. \u201cDid you find it?\u201d \n\n\u201cI found this key!\u201d Theo exclaimed, holding it up. \n\nMia\u2019s eyes sparkled. \u201cBut what does it open? We need to find the music box!\u201d\n\nJust as they were about to search more, a loud crash echoed behind them. They spun around to see the curtain swaying. \n\n\u201cOh no! We\u2019re caught!\u201d Mia gasped.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThey needed to think fast. What if the crash had scared someone away? Or worse, what if the music box was taken again? \n\nMia\u2019s heart raced. They had to figure out who was behind this before the show began!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Mia and Theo want to find?","options":["A missing book","A missing music box","A missing toy","A missing key"],"correct_answer":"A missing music box"},{"question":"Who helps Mia and Theo with the talent show?","options":["Mr. Smith","Ms. Pomeroy","Lily","Theo's dad"],"correct_answer":"Ms. Pomeroy"},{"question":"What distraction do Mia and Theo use?","options":["A song","A magic trick","A dance","A story"],"correct_answer":"A magic trick"},{"question":"What does Theo find in the backstage room?","options":["A costume","A music box","A shiny key","A dance floor"],"correct_answer":"A shiny key"},{"question":"What happens at the end of the chapter?","options":["They solve the mystery","They leave the room","They hear a loud crash","They start the show"],"correct_answer":"They hear a loud crash"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_266_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_266_ch2_img1.png","plot_266_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":464,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
