   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_266_7_10","title":"The Mystery of the Missing Music Box","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Locked Room","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Mia and Theo crouched behind the giant curtain of the auditorium. The talent show was in full swing! Colorful lights danced on the stage. Students sang, danced, and played instruments. But Mia's heart raced. They needed to find the music box.\n\n\u201cCan you see anyone watching us?\u201d whispered Mia, peeking out. \n\nTheo adjusted his glasses and scanned the room. \u201cNo one\u2019s looking! Let\u2019s go!\u201d \n\nThey tiptoed towards the backstage door. It was locked, but Theo held up the shiny key he had found. \u201cThis should work!\u201d\n\n\u201cGreat! But how do we get inside without being seen?\u201d Mia asked, biting her lip. \n\nJust then, Ms. Pomeroy appeared, waving her hands in the air. \u201cAnd now, let\u2019s welcome our next act! The Amazing Ace!\u201d she shouted. The crowd cheered! \n\nMia and Theo exchanged excited glances. \u201cThis is our chance!\u201d said Theo. \n\nThey hurried to the door and Theo inserted the key. It clicked! [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cOn three, we go in!\u201d whispered Mia. \u201cOne, two, three!\u201d\n\nThey pushed the door open. Inside was a dimly lit room filled with props and costumes. But the music box was nowhere to be seen. \n\nSuddenly, a loud crash came from the corner. A stack of boxes had tipped over! \n\n\u201cWhat was that?\u201d Mia gasped, her eyes wide.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but we need to hide!\u201d Theo whispered. They ducked behind a curtain just in time. \n\nOut from behind the fallen boxes stepped Lily, her face filled with panic. \u201cOh no, oh no! What do I do?\u201d she cried.\n\nMia could hardly believe her ears. \u201cLily! You\u2019re in here!\u201d \n\n\u201cWhat are you doing?\u201d Lily asked, surprised.\n\n\u201cWe want to help you find your music box!\u201d said Theo, stepping out from behind the curtain. \n\nLily looked worried. \u201cI can\u2019t find it! I thought I had it in my bag, but it\u2019s not there!\u201d\n\nMia frowned. \u201cWait! Did you take it out for your act?\u201d\n\nLily nodded quickly. \u201cYes! I showed it to Ms. Pomeroy!\u201d\n\nTheo's eyes sparkled with an idea. \u201cWhat if Ms. Pomeroy knows where it is?\u201d \n\n\u201cWe have to find her before the show ends!\u201d Mia exclaimed. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d\n\nBut just then, the auditorium lights flickered. The curtains began to close, and the audience gasped! \u201cWhat is happening?\u201d Mia shouted.\n\n\u201cWe can\u2019t get caught!\u201d Theo said, looking around. \n\nThey had to make a decision fast. Should they stay and search the room or rush back to the stage? \n\nMia breathed deeply. \u201cLet\u2019s find Ms. Pomeroy!\u201d \n\n\u201cOkay, but we have to be quick!\u201d Theo agreed. \n\nThey raced toward the exit, hearts pounding. What if they were too late?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Mia and Theo want to find?","options":["A costume","The music box","A snack","A stage light"],"correct_answer":"The music box"},{"question":"Who is panicking in the backstage room?","options":["Ms. Pomeroy","Mia","Theo","Lily"],"correct_answer":"Lily"},{"question":"What do they hear that makes them hide?","options":["A song","A loud crash","A laugh","A cheer"],"correct_answer":"A loud crash"},{"question":"What do Mia and Theo decide to do at the end of the chapter?","options":["Leave the talent show","Find Ms. Pomeroy","Go home","Look for the music box"],"correct_answer":"Find Ms. Pomeroy"},{"question":"What is the setting of this chapter?","options":["A park","A classroom","A backstage room","A library"],"correct_answer":"A backstage room"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_266_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_266_ch3_img1.png","plot_266_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":441,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
