   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_266_7_10","title":"The Mystery of the Missing Music Box","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Locked Room","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Mia and Theo stood backstage, the smell of popcorn swirling around them. The auditorium was filled with lights and laughter. They could hear the talent show going on in front of the curtain. \n\n\u201cWhere\u2019s Ms. Pomeroy?\u201d Mia asked, looking around. \n\nTheo shrugged. \u201cShe must be somewhere nearby. Let\u2019s find her!\u201d \n\nJust then, they heard a commotion. A group of students gathered, whispering and pointing at something. \n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Theo said. \u201cThey must be talking about the music box!\u201d \n\nMia\u2019s heart raced. \u201cLet\u2019s check it out!\u201d \n\nThe friends tiptoed over. In the middle of the crowd stood Lily, her eyes wide with worry. \u201cI can\u2019t perform without my music box!\u201d she exclaimed. \n\nMia stepped forward. \u201cWe\u2019re going to help you, Lily! We just need to find Ms. Pomeroy.\u201d \n\nSuddenly, they heard a funny noise. It was Ms. Pomeroy, trying to untangle a cluster of glittery ribbons. \u201cOh dear!\u201d she chuckled, \u201cI seem to have gotten myself stuck!\u201d \n\nMia and Theo giggled. \u201cMs. Pomeroy, we need your help!\u201d they shouted. \n\nThe drama teacher emerged, ribbons flying like confetti. \u201cWhat\u2019s the matter?\u201d she asked, brushing her hands on her colorful dress. \n\n\u201cThe music box is missing!\u201d shouted Theo. \n\nMs. Pomeroy gasped. \u201cOh no! We must find it before the show ends!\u201d \n\nMia\u2019s mind buzzed with ideas. \u201cWe should check the backstage room! Maybe there are clues!\u201d \n\n\u201cGood thinking!\u201d said Theo. \u201cBut how do we get in? It\u2019s locked!\u201d \n\nMs. Pomeroy scratched her head. \u201cHmm. I do have an extra key, but...\u201d \n\n\u201cBut what?\u201d Mia asked eagerly. \n\n\u201cI lost it!\u201d Ms. Pomeroy admitted. \n\nTheo sighed. \u201cThis is like a puzzle! We need to figure out a way to open the door!\u201d \n\nSuddenly, Theo\u2019s eyes lit up. \u201cWhat if we use the old toolbox in the prop room? I saw it earlier!\u201d \n\n\u201cGreat idea!\u201d Mia exclaimed. \u201cLet\u2019s hurry!\u201d \n\nThey dashed to the prop room, excitement bubbling inside them. It was filled with costumes and shiny props. \n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Mia pointed to a rusty toolbox in the corner. \u201cThat could help!\u201d \n\nTheo opened it, revealing old tools inside. \u201cThis might work!\u201d \n\nJust then, they heard footsteps. \u201cQuick! Hide!\u201d Mia whispered. \n\nThey ducked behind a big curtain, hearts pounding. They peeked out and saw a student named Jake rummaging through the prop box. \n\n\u201cHey! What are you doing?\u201d Theo whispered loudly. \n\nJake jumped, dropping a sparkly hat. \u201cI was just\u2026 uh, looking for my costume!\u201d \n\n\u201cRight!\u201d Mia said, rolling her eyes. \u201cYou mean the one you already have on?\u201d \n\nJake blushed. \u201cOkay, okay! I was looking for the music box!\u201d \n\nMia and Theo exchanged glances. \u201cWe\u2019re on the same side!\u201d said Mia, stepping out. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s work together!\u201d Theo added. \u201cWe need to get into that backstage room!\u201d \n\nThey nodded, forming an unlikely team. \n\n\u201cAlright, let\u2019s go find that key!\u201d Mia said, feeling a spark of hope. Would they solve the mystery in time?\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] shows Mia and Theo standing backstage, surrounded by colorful decorations and excited students. They are looking determined, with the bright lights of the auditorium shining behind them.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2] depicts the group hiding behind a big curtain, peeking out to see Jake looking through the prop box. Their expressions are a mix of surprise and excitement, with sparkly hats and costumes scattered around.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Mia and Theo need to find?","options":["A music box","A costume","A key","A hat"],"correct_answer":"A key"},{"question":"Who helps Mia and Theo with the mystery?","options":["Lily","Jake","Ms. Pomeroy","All of the above"],"correct_answer":"All of the above"},{"question":"Where do Mia and Theo find the toolbox?","options":["In the auditorium","In the prop room","Backstage","In the classroom"],"correct_answer":"In the prop room"},{"question":"What does Ms. Pomeroy get stuck in?","options":["Ribbons","Costumes","Props","Lights"],"correct_answer":"Ribbons"},{"question":"What do they plan to do with the toolbox?","options":["Fix costumes","Find the key","Make props","Play music"],"correct_answer":"Find the key"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_266_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_266_ch4_img1.png","plot_266_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":557,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
