   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_266_7_10","title":"The Mystery of the Missing Music Box","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Locked Room","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"The auditorium buzzed with excitement. Mia and Theo stood backstage, ready to solve the mystery. They needed a plan to enter the locked room. \n\n\u201cWe have to find a way in without getting caught,\u201d Mia whispered. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s check if Ms. Pomeroy has any ideas,\u201d Theo suggested, adjusting his glasses. \n\nThey tiptoed through the backstage area, peeking around corners. Colorful costumes hung from hooks, and the smell of popcorn filled the air. \n\nSuddenly, they spotted Ms. Pomeroy at the edge of the stage. \u201cMs. Pomeroy!\u201d they called. She turned, her flowing scarf dancing like a colorful bird.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nMs. Pomeroy grinned. \u201cHello, my talented detectives! What brings you here?\u201d \n\n\u201cWe need to get into the locked room! Lily\u2019s music box is missing!\u201d Mia exclaimed.\n\n\u201cMissing? Oh dear! That is quite the drama!\u201d Ms. Pomeroy laughed. \u201cI remember locking it up. I lost the key while juggling my scripts!\u201d \n\n\u201cJuggling scripts? That sounds fun!\u201d said Theo, his eyes wide.\n\n\u201cYes, but not helpful right now!\u201d laughed Ms. Pomeroy. \u201cWe need to be clever.\u201d\n\nMia had an idea. \u201cWhat if we use your juggling skills? You could distract everyone while we search!\u201d \n\n\u201cGreat idea! Let\u2019s make a show of it,\u201d Ms. Pomeroy replied, her eyes twinkling. \n\nAs the curtain rose, Ms. Pomeroy juggled brightly colored balls. The audience cheered and laughed. Mia and Theo seized the moment. They darted to the locked door, their hearts racing.\n\n\u201cHere goes nothing!\u201d Mia whispered, searching her pockets for tools. \u201cDo you think the lock is tricky?\u201d\n\nTheo pulled out a hairpin. \u201cLet\u2019s see if I can pick it!\u201d He knelt down, focusing hard. \n\n\u201cBe quick! The show won\u2019t wait forever!\u201d Mia said, looking back at the stage.\n\nWith a soft click, the lock opened! \u201cWe did it!\u201d Theo grinned.\n\nInside, they spotted the music box gleaming on a shelf. \u201cThere it is!\u201d Mia shouted, rushing forward.\n\nSuddenly, a shadow appeared. It was Lily\u2019s jealous classmate, Sam. \u201cYou won\u2019t get away with that!\u201d he hissed.\n\nMia quickly said, \u201cWe just wanted to help Lily! She needs her music box for the show!\u201d \n\nSam paused, looking at the music box and then at Mia and Theo. \u201cOkay, I suppose\u2026 But only if you promise to let me help too!\u201d \n\n\u201cOf course!\u201d Mia smiled. \n\nTogether, they hurried back to the stage. The audience clapped as the music box chimed a lovely tune. \u201cLet\u2019s get Lily back her dreams!\u201d \n\nAs the curtain fell, Mia, Theo, and Sam took a bow, proud of their teamwork and friendship.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Mia and Theo need to unlock?","options":["A treasure chest","A backstage door","A treasure map","A music box"],"correct_answer":"A backstage door"},{"question":"Who helped Mia and Theo with their plan?","options":["Lily","Ms. Pomeroy","Sam","Mr. Jenkins"],"correct_answer":"Ms. Pomeroy"},{"question":"What did Sam want when he found Mia and Theo?","options":["To take the music box","To help them","To join the show","To juggle balls"],"correct_answer":"To help them"},{"question":"What did the music box do?","options":["It played music","It was broken","It glowed","It disappeared"],"correct_answer":"It played music"},{"question":"What was Mia's idea to enter the locked room?","options":["To break down the door","To use a key","To distract everyone","To wait for the show to end"],"correct_answer":"To distract everyone"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_266_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_266_ch5_img1.png","plot_266_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":425,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
