   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_266_11_14","title":"The Mystery of the Missing Music Box","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Locked Room","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"The auditorium buzzed with excitement, a kaleidoscope of colors swirling around Mia as she stepped inside. Streamers hung from the ceiling like ribbons of joy, while students darted to and fro, clutching props and practicing lines. It was the annual school talent show, and Mia could feel the eager energy electrifying the air. She adjusted her ponytail, her heart racing not just from the thrill of the show but from the mystery that was about to unfold.\n\n\u201cHey, Mia! Are you ready for the big night?\u201d Theo\u2019s voice broke through the din, his smile brightening the crowded space. He was in his element, wearing a gadget-laden belt that jangled with every movement. Theo was the tech whiz of the duo, with an impressive collection of tools that made him feel like a superhero. \n\n\u201cReady as I\u2019ll ever be!\u201d Mia replied, her eyes scanning the bustling room. \u201cBut have you seen Lila? She\u2019s supposed to be rehearsing her solo right now.\u201d\n\nBefore Theo could answer, Ms. Pomeroy, their quirky drama teacher, burst through the stage door, her wild curly hair bouncing like a springy cloud. \u201cListen up, everyone! This is the moment we\u2019ve all been waiting for! Lila is our star tonight, and it\u2019s time for her to shine!\u201d\n\nThe crowd cheered, but Mia\u2019s heart sank. She remembered the precious music box, which Lila said had been her lucky charm, locked safely in the backstage room. \u201cBut Ms. Pomeroy, what about the music box?\u201d Mia asked, her voice laced with concern. \u201cCan we get it for Lila?\u201d\n\nMs. Pomeroy\u2019s brow furrowed. \u201cOh dear, I thought I left the key right here. It must be in the backstage room, but that door is always kept locked. We can\u2019t risk anyone snooping around back there.\u201d\n\nMia felt a knot tighten in her stomach. The music box, a delicate creation with swirling designs, held sentimental value for Lila. It was said to bring good fortune, and without it, Lila\u2019s confidence might wane. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find a way to get in,\u201d Theo whispered, his eyes sparkling with mischief. \n\n\u201cWhat do you have in mind?\u201d she asked, intrigued. \n\n\u201cWe could use my lock-picking set,\u201d Theo suggested, his voice dropping to a conspiratorial whisper. \u201cBut we need to be careful. If anyone sees us\u2026\u201d\n\nJust then, a loud bang echoed from backstage, causing the students to jump. Mia and Theo exchanged worried glances. \u201cDid you hear that?\u201d Mia said, her heart racing. \u201cWhat could it be?\u201d \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s check it out,\u201d Theo replied, pointing toward the dimly lit backstage area. He adjusted his glasses, his expression turning serious. \u201cBut we have to be quiet.\u201d \n\nAs they inched closer to the backstage door, a voice drifted through the cracks, sounding frantic. \u201cWhere\u2019s my music box? It was right here!\u201d It was Lila, her panic unmistakable. \n\nMia felt a surge of determination. They couldn\u2019t let Lila down. \u201cThis is it, Theo! We have to get in there and find out what happened.\u201d \n\nWith a steadying breath, they crept toward the door, their hearts racing with anticipation. Mia glanced at Theo, then pushed down the handle, only to find it unyielding. \u201cLocked tight,\u201d she muttered, frustration bubbling inside her. \n\n\u201cLet me try something,\u201d Theo said, pulling out a small gadget resembling a key in his pocket. \u201cI think I can bypass the lock.\u201d \n\nJust as he began to work on the door, a shadow passed by, and both friends froze. The last thing they wanted was to get caught in the act. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]  \n\nThe scene captures Mia and Theo at the entrance of the backstage area, looking anxious yet determined. The dim light from the backstage casts long shadows, hinting at the secrets lurking just out of sight. Mia\u2019s eyes are wide with anticipation, while Theo focuses intently on his gadget, the tension palpable in the air. \n\nMia whispered, \u201cHurry!\u201d Her heart raced, not just from the thrill of the moment but from the realization that they were about to dive deep into a mystery that could change everything for Lila and the talent show. \n\nFinally, with a click, the lock gave way, and the door creaked open, revealing darkness beyond. They exchanged a glance filled with excitement and fear, ready to uncover the truth. \n\n\u201cReady?\u201d Theo asked, his voice barely above a whisper. \n\n\u201cReady,\u201d Mia affirmed, stepping into the unknown. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]  \n\nThe image shows Mia and Theo stepping cautiously into the dimly lit backstage area, lit by a faint glow from a nearby light. The room is cluttered with props and costumes, hinting at the chaos and creativity of the talent show preparations. Their expressions convey a mix of determination and apprehension, emphasizing the mystery they are about to uncover.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What event is taking place in the auditorium?","options":["A science fair","An art exhibition","A talent show","A sports competition"],"correct_answer":"A talent show"},{"question":"Who is the star performer of the show?","options":["Mia","Theo","Lila","Ms. Pomeroy"],"correct_answer":"Lila"},{"question":"What item is missing that is important for Lila?","options":["A costume","A microphone","A music box","A script"],"correct_answer":"A music box"},{"question":"What is Theo's special skill?","options":["Acting","Singing","Tech gadgets","Dancing"],"correct_answer":"Tech gadgets"},{"question":"What do Mia and Theo decide to do about the locked backstage room?","options":["Ask for the key","Break the door down","Investigate the mystery","Leave it alone"],"correct_answer":"Investigate the mystery"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_266_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_266_ch1_img1.png","plot_266_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":795,"reading_level":"Builder"}
