   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_266_11_14","title":"The Mystery of the Missing Music Box","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Locked Room","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"The auditorium buzzed with excitement as Mia and Theo made their way through the throng of students, the smell of popcorn wafting through the air. Banners draped from the ceiling, each decorated with sparkles and bright colors, creating a festive atmosphere that made Mia\u2019s heart race. She could hardly wait to see Lila perform with her beloved music box, the one that had enchanted everyone with its delicate tunes.\n\n\u201cCan you believe it?\u201d Theo said, adjusting his glasses. \u201cLila\u2019s going to win this year for sure. That music box is magical!\u201d\n\n\u201cYeah, it\u2019s like it has a life of its own,\u201d Mia replied, her mind racing with the possibilities. \u201cBut\u2026 what if something happens to it?\u201d Her stomach twisted at the thought. \n\nJust then, the auditorium lights dimmed, and the announcer\u2019s voice echoed through the room, \u201cWelcome to the annual talent show!\u201d Mia\u2019s excitement was punctuated by a pang of concern\u2014what if Lila couldn\u2019t find her music box? \n\nAs the first act took the stage, Mia stole a glance toward the backstage door. It stood ominously locked, the brass handle gleaming under the stage lights. \u201cWe need to find a way to get in there,\u201d Mia whispered to Theo, urgency creeping into her voice.\n\n\u201cAre you serious?\u201d Theo raised an eyebrow. \u201cWhat if we get caught? Ms. Pomeroy will freak out.\u201d\n\n\u201cLook, if we don\u2019t, the show will end, and Lila will be heartbroken. We can\u2019t let that happen!\u201d Mia retorted, determination shining in her eyes.\n\nJust then, Ms. Pomeroy, their quirky drama teacher, bustled past them, her bright red lipstick smudged slightly. \u201cOh, dearies! Are you two enjoying the show? It\u2019s going splendidly!\u201d \n\n\u201cMs. Pomeroy!\u201d Mia called, rushing to catch her attention. \u201cHave you seen Lila\u2019s music box? It\u2019s really important!\u201d\n\nMs. Pomeroy\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cOh dear! I did see it earlier, but I thought it was in the backstage room. But it\u2019s locked!\u201d She flashed an exaggerated gasp. \u201cWhat a mystery!\u201d\n\nTheo and Mia exchanged glances, their hearts racing with the thrill of the chase. \u201cWe need to get in there!\u201d Theo said, his mind already spinning with ideas. \n\n\u201cOkay, but we need a plan,\u201d Mia said, her creativity kicking in. \u201cWhat about distractions?\u201d\n\n\u201cDistractions? Like what?\u201d Theo looked intrigued.\n\n\u201cRemember when you rigged that fake spider for Halloween? We could use something like that!\u201d Mia suggested with a grin.\n\nTheo chuckled, \u201cYou mean my genius invention? I might have a few gadgets that could help. But we\u2019ll have to be stealthy.\u201d\n\nAs the next act started, Mia\u2019s mind raced with possibilities. She felt a rush of adrenaline course through her veins. With the talent show underway, they had to act fast. But just as they plotted, a loud crash echoed from the direction of the backstage area, freezing them in their tracks.\n\n\u201cWhat was that?\u201d Mia\u2019s eyes widened in alarm. \n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but it didn\u2019t sound good,\u201d Theo said, his voice barely a whisper. They both turned towards the backstage door, now shrouded in an ominous shadow. \n\nMia took a deep breath, her heart pounding. \u201cWe have to check it out. It could be a clue!\u201d\n\nAs they approached, the door loomed before them like a giant secret waiting to be uncovered. Suddenly, they heard footsteps approaching from the other side. \u201cQuick, hide!\u201d Theo urged, pulling Mia behind a nearby curtain just as the footsteps stopped. The suspense was electric as they held their breath, trying not to make a sound.\n\n\u201cWhat if they\u2019re the thief?\u201d Mia whispered, fear and excitement swirling inside her. Who was behind the door? What would they discover?\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Mia and Theo plan to do about the locked backstage room?","options":["Leave it alone","Create distractions","Tell Ms. Pomeroy","Ignore it"],"correct_answer":"Create distractions"},{"question":"What causes Mia to worry during the talent show?","options":["The decorations","Lila losing her music box","The performances","Ms. Pomeroy\u2019s lipstick"],"correct_answer":"Lila losing her music box"},{"question":"Who is Ms. Pomeroy?","options":["The principal","Lila\u2019s mother","Their drama teacher","The janitor"],"correct_answer":"Their drama teacher"},{"question":"What do Mia and Theo hear while plotting their plan?","options":["Students cheering","A loud crash","The principal talking","An announcement"],"correct_answer":"A loud crash"},{"question":"How do Mia and Theo feel as they approach the backstage door?","options":["Confident","Bored","Scared","Excited"],"correct_answer":"Excited"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_266_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_266_ch2_img1.png","plot_266_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":621,"reading_level":"Builder"}
