   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_266_11_14","title":"The Mystery of the Missing Music Box","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Locked Room","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"As the final act of the talent show thundered to a close, the auditorium erupted in applause. Mia and Theo stood at the edge of the stage, their hearts racing. The sound of clapping faded into the background as they locked eyes, a shared understanding passing between them. They had to get into that backstage room, and fast.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s sneak around the back,\u201d Mia whispered, her voice nearly drowned out by the cheers. They slipped through the crowd, excitement and anxiety mingling in their stomachs. The backstage area loomed ahead, dimly lit and filled with shadows. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThey ducked behind a stack of props, peering into the backstage chaos. Ms. Pomeroy was frantically organizing the stage crew, her vibrant scarf flapping like a flag as she gestured animatedly. \u201cWe need to keep the flow going! Lila, where\u2019s your next act?\u201d she called out. \n\n\u201cMs. Pomeroy!\u201d Lila\u2019s voice rang out, thick with panic. \u201cI can\u2019t find my music box! What if it\u2019s really gone?\u201d \n\nMia\u2019s heart sank. Lila had practiced for months, pouring her feelings into that performance. Theo nudged her, pulling her back to focus. \u201cWe need a plan to get in there,\u201d he said, glancing at the locked door. \n\nMia considered the padlock. \u201cWhat if we find something to open it?\u201d \n\nTheo raised an eyebrow, his mind already racing through possibilities. \u201cI might have an idea.\u201d He pulled out his trusty toolkit, a gadget-laden backpack always at his side. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s be quick,\u201d Mia urged, casting a wary glance toward the bustling crew. They didn\u2019t have much time before the show would end, and the crowd would disperse into chaos. \n\nThey crept closer to the door, and Theo examined the lock with intense concentration. \u201cIf I could just\u2026maybe if I use this\u2014\u201d He fumbled with a tiny screwdriver, his hands moving swiftly as Mia kept watch.\n\nJust then, a noise startled them. Mia whirled around. \u201cDid you hear that?\u201d she hissed. \n\nTheo nodded, eyes wide. \u201cIt\u2019s probably just the crew, but we can\u2019t take any chances.\u201d \n\nWith a final twist, the lock clicked open, and the door creaked ajar. Hope surged in Mia\u2019s chest. They were so close now! \n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s inside?\u201d Mia whispered, peering into the darkness beyond the doorway. \n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but we\u2019re about to find out,\u201d Theo replied, stepping forward, the light from the auditorium spilling into the room. \n\nTheir hearts raced as they crossed the threshold, the air thick with anticipation. Inside, they found a jumble of forgotten costumes and a pile of props that looked like they hadn\u2019t seen the light of day for years. Mia felt a thrill run down her spine. \u201cIt\u2019s like a treasure chest of mysteries!\u201d she exclaimed, her eyes sparkling.\n\nAs they sorted through the clutter, Mia spotted something shiny peeking out from beneath an old stage curtain. \u201cTheo! Over there!\u201d \n\nThey rushed toward it, uncovering a small silver object. Theo\u2019s face lit up as he recognized it instantly. \u201cIt\u2019s the handle from Lila\u2019s music box! But what\u2019s it doing here?\u201d \n\nJust then, a shuffling noise echoed from the corner. They froze, hearts pounding in their chests. Someone else was in the room. \n\nMia exchanged a worried glance with Theo. \u201cWe should hide!\u201d she urged, instinctively pulling him behind a pile of costumes. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThey held their breath, straining to see through the gaps. A shadow moved closer, and the tension in the air thickened. Who would come here at this hour, and what would they find?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Mia and Theo find inside the backstage room?","options":["A treasure chest","Lila's music box","A piece of the music box handle","A hidden costume"],"correct_answer":"A piece of the music box handle"},{"question":"What does Mia suggest they do when they hear a noise?","options":["Run away","Hide","Call for help","Ignore it"],"correct_answer":"Hide"},{"question":"What item does Theo use to unlock the backstage door?","options":["A key","A screwdriver","A crowbar","A paper clip"],"correct_answer":"A screwdriver"},{"question":"How do Mia and Theo feel as they sneak backstage?","options":["Excited and anxious","Bored and tired","Angry and upset","Calm and relaxed"],"correct_answer":"Excited and anxious"},{"question":"What did Mia think the backstage room was like?","options":["A scary place","A treasure chest of mysteries","An empty room","A place to hide"],"correct_answer":"A treasure chest of mysteries"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_266_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_266_ch4_img1.png","plot_266_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":600,"reading_level":"Builder"}
