   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_266_11_14","title":"The Mystery of the Missing Music Box","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Locked Room","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Chapter 5: The Secret Unveiled\n\nAs the lights of the auditorium twinkled overhead, Mia felt a surge of adrenaline rush through her. She and Theo stood in front of the ominous backstage door, their hearts pounding like drums in a marching band. The sound of laughter and applause echoed from the stage, but all Mia could think about was Lila\u2019s face when she realized her music box was missing. \n\n\u201cWe need to be quick,\u201d Theo whispered, glancing around to make sure no one was watching. He pulled out a small toolkit from his backpack, a little gadget-filled treasure chest that always amazed Mia. \u201cIf we can get this door open, we might find a clue before the show ends.\u201d\n\nMia nodded, her mind racing with possibilities. What if they stumbled upon the thief? What if there were more secrets hiding behind that door? She watched as Theo carefully picked at the lock, his brows furrowed in concentration. \n\nSuddenly, with a satisfying *click*, the door creaked open, revealing a dimly lit room filled with old costumes and props that seemed to hold their breath in the shadows. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nMia stepped inside cautiously, the musty smell of forgotten memories filling her nose. The room was cluttered with colorful costumes hanging on hooks, and the walls were adorned with faded posters from past talent shows. \u201cLook here!\u201d Theo exclaimed, pointing towards a pile of discarded props. \n\nAs they sifted through the costumes, Mia\u2019s fingers brushed against something smooth and cold. She pulled it out, her heart racing. It was a delicate, ornate piece of the music box\u2014the ballerina figurine, frozen mid-twirl. \u201cThis has to be it! But why would it be here?\u201d she asked, excitement bubbling inside her.\n\nBut before they could examine it further, they heard footsteps echoing down the hallway. Panic washed over Mia like a tidal wave. \u201cWe have to hide!\u201d she hissed, tugging at Theo\u2019s arm. They ducked behind a curtain just as the door swung open. \n\nA shadowy figure entered the room\u2014a classmate, Sam, who was known for being a bit of a troublemaker. He looked around suspiciously before heading straight for the prop table, his movements swift and deliberate. Mia held her breath, her heart thudding loudly in her chest. What was he doing? \n\n\u201cDid he take it?\u201d Theo whispered, his voice barely audible. \n\nMia could see Sam\u2019s hands moving quickly, rifling through the items on the table. She wanted to confront him, but a voice in her head urged her to stay quiet. Instead, they watched as Sam pulled out a glittering object from his pocket and slipped it into a bag.\n\nAs he turned to leave, Mia steeled herself. \u201cWe need to follow him,\u201d she whispered, her determination hardening. \u201cThis might be our chance to find out who took the music box.\u201d \n\nWith her heart racing, Mia exchanged a look with Theo. Together, they crept out from behind the curtain, ready to uncover the truth.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe chase led them back into the bustling auditorium, where the excitement of the talent show simmered in the air. The stage was alive with performers, but Mia and Theo were focused solely on Sam. They weaved through the crowd, their hearts pounding with anticipation.\n\n\u201cWhatever happens,\u201d Theo said, his voice steady despite their racing feet, \u201cwe stick together.\u201d\n\n\u201cAlways,\u201d Mia replied, her eyes locked on their target. The mystery was thickening, and they were ready to unravel it.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Mia and Theo find in the backstage room?","options":["A locked box","A piece of the music box","A costume","A hidden door"],"correct_answer":"A piece of the music box"},{"question":"Who did Mia and Theo see in the backstage room?","options":["Lila","Sam","Ms. Pomeroy","A teacher"],"correct_answer":"Sam"},{"question":"What was Mia\u2019s reaction when they heard footsteps?","options":["Excitement","Panic","Joy","Indifference"],"correct_answer":"Panic"},{"question":"What do Mia and Theo decide to do after seeing Sam?","options":["Confront him","Leave the room","Follow him","Call for help"],"correct_answer":"Follow him"},{"question":"What theme is highlighted in Mia and Theo's friendship during this chapter?","options":["Jealousy","Teamwork","Competition","Fear"],"correct_answer":"Teamwork"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_266_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_266_ch5_img1.png","plot_266_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":577,"reading_level":"Builder"}
