   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_266_15_18","title":"The Mystery of the Missing Music Box","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Locked Room","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"The auditorium buzzed with a frenetic energy as students darted around, adjusting their costumes and practicing their lines. Laughter mingled with the sharp clinks of metal props being set in place. Mia stood at the edge of the stage, a bright smile on her face, but inside, her heart raced with anxiety. The talent show was the pinnacle of their school year, but the shadow of the missing music box loomed over the festivities like a heavy curtain. \n\n\u201cCan you believe that music box is still missing?\u201d Theo's logical voice broke through her thoughts, pulling her back to reality. Dressed in a t-shirt adorned with circuit board patterns, he adjusted his glasses and scanned the bustling crowd. \u201cIf we don\u2019t figure this out soon, the show will end, and we\u2019ll lose our chance.\u201d\n\nMia nodded, biting her lip. \u201cWe have to find a way into that backstage room. The music box was last seen there, and without the key... it feels like we\u2019re chasing shadows.\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s think this through,\u201d Theo replied, pulling out his phone. \u201cIf we can\u2019t get in through the front, maybe we can find another way. You mentioned something about a side entrance?\u201d\n\n\u201cYes, but it\u2019s usually locked, especially during the show,\u201d Mia said, her eyes scanning the area. \u201cAnd Ms. Pomeroy will definitely notice if we\u2019re gone too long.\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nIn that moment, the bright lights of the stage illuminated the auditorium, casting a warm glow over the excited faces of their peers. Mia felt a pang of longing\u2014she knew that this show was important to everyone, especially to the performers. But the thrill of the mystery ignited a spark within her. She wanted to solve this puzzle, not just for the music box, but for the potential chaos it could unleash.\n\nAs they strategized, a commotion erupted near the entrance. Mia's head snapped to the side as a group of students burst into the room, their laughter cutting through the tension. Among them was Lila, the star of the show, her frustration evident as she clutched her clipboard. Mia could see the determination in Lila's eyes; she was desperate to make this performance a success.\n\n\u201cDid you hear? Lila lost her lucky charm right before her act!\u201d one of the students exclaimed, their voice laced with a bout of insincere sympathy. \u201cAnd now, she\u2019s just a bundle of nerves!\u201d\n\n\u201cGreat,\u201d Theo murmured, glancing at Mia. \u201cMore chaos. It\u2019s like a soap opera back there.\u201d\n\nMia sighed, her mind racing. \u201cWe can use this to our advantage. If Lila is distracted, maybe we can slip away unnoticed. But we have to be quick.\"\n\nThey navigated through the crowd, weaving between students practicing their routines and teachers fussing over the set pieces. Every step felt like a countdown. As they approached the backstage door, Mia could feel her pulse quicken. \u201cLet\u2019s just check if it\u2019s unlocked,\u201d she whispered, her fingers grazing the cool metal of the doorknob.\n\n\u201cWait,\u201d Theo warned, glancing at the nearby troupe of dancers. \u201cWhat if someone sees us?\u201d\n\nBut as Mia turned the knob, it clicked ominously. The door creaked open slightly, revealing a dimly lit corridor. \n\n\u201cMia!\u201d Theo hissed, his eyes wide. \u201cWhat if Ms. Pomeroy catches us?\u201d\n\n\u201cDon\u2019t you want to know what\u2019s inside?\u201d She shot back, her curiosity igniting her bravery. But just as she began to step through, a loud voice echoed from behind them.\n\n\u201cHey! What are you two doing?\u201d It was Lila, her expression a mix of annoyance and concern. \n\n\u201cOh no,\u201d Theo whispered, panic flashing across his face. \u201cWhat do we say?\u201d\n\nMia\u2019s mind raced. \u201cWe just need a good excuse,\u201d she whispered back. \u201cMaybe we can say we were looking for the restroom?\u201d\n\nLila crossed her arms, a skeptical smile playing on her lips. \u201cYou two? Looking for the restroom? Is the show that stressful?\u201d \n\nIn that moment of hesitation, the door swung open wider, revealing the dim backstage area, setting the stage for a confrontation that could change everything. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cWhat are you hiding?\u201d Lila demanded, stepping closer. \u201cIf you think sneaking around is going to help you find the music box, think again. Everyone\u2019s on edge tonight, and that includes me.\u201d\n\nMia felt her heart drop. \u201cWe\u2019re not hiding anything! We\u2019re trying to help!\u201d\n\n\u201cHelp?\u201d Lila scoffed, raising an eyebrow. \u201cYou think you can just waltz back here and play detectives? This is my moment, and I won\u2019t let anyone ruin it!\u201d \n\nThe tension crackled in the air, each second stretching into an eternity. Mia and Theo exchanged glances, uncertainty swirling between them like the shadows deepening in the backstage area. They had to find a way to prove their intentions, but time was slipping through their fingers like sand.\n\n\u201cMaybe we\u2019ll have to think of a different plan,\u201d Theo whispered, a hint of defeat lacing his voice. \n\n\u201cOr maybe\u2026\u201d Mia hesitated, her gaze shifting from the growing crowd in the auditorium to Lila\u2019s frustrated expression. \u201cMaybe we\u2019ll have to show her that we\u2019re more than just friends\u2014we\u2019re a team, and we can figure this out together.\u201d\n\nThe stakes had never felt higher.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is Mia and Theo\u2019s main objective in this chapter?","options":["To practice for the talent show","To find a way into the locked backstage room","To perform on stage","To confront Lila"],"correct_answer":"To find a way into the locked backstage room"},{"question":"What unexpected obstacle do Mia and Theo encounter?","options":["They can't find the key","Lila confronts them","Ms. Pomeroy catches them","The door is locked"],"correct_answer":"Lila confronts them"},{"question":"Which character expresses skepticism about Mia and Theo's intentions?","options":["Theo","Ms. Pomeroy","Lila","One of the dancers"],"correct_answer":"Lila"},{"question":"What does the backstage area symbolize in the story?","options":["A place of friendship","A hidden world filled with secrets","The main stage for the performance","A doorway to escape"],"correct_answer":"A hidden world filled with secrets"},{"question":"How do Mia and Theo plan to distract Lila?","options":["By pretending to be performers","By saying they need the restroom","By asking for her help","By creating a diversion"],"correct_answer":"By saying they need the restroom"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_266_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_266_ch2_img1.png","plot_266_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":877,"reading_level":"Challenger"}
