   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_266_15_18","title":"The Mystery of the Missing Music Box","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Locked Room","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"The vibrant atmosphere of the school auditorium buzzed with an electric energy fuelled by excitement and nerves. Mia stood at the edge of the stage, her heart racing as she absorbed the colorful decorations that adorned the walls. Students, dressed in an array of costumes, flitted about like butterflies, each one vying for the spotlight. Yet, amidst the joyous chaos, a dark cloud loomed over Mia's thoughts: the missing music box.\n\n\u201cWhat if we can\u2019t find it?\u201d Theo\u2019s voice broke through her reverie, bringing her back to their pressing predicament. He fiddled with the small device he had managed to smuggle from his father\u2019s workshop\u2014a high-tech lock picker. \u201cWe need to get into that backstage room before Lila goes on. She\u2019s a disaster waiting to happen without her lucky charm.\u201d\n\nMia nodded, her mind racing through potential scenarios. \u201cIf we could just figure out a way to distract everyone\u2026\u201d Her voice trailed off as she spotted Ms. Pomeroy, their eccentric drama teacher, sprinting across the floor, her wild hair bouncing in rhythm to her animated gestures. \n\n\u201cMs. Pomeroy!\u201d she called out, beckoning her over. \n\nThe teacher approached, a curious look on her face. \u201cWhat\u2019s the matter, my dear detectives?\u201d \n\n\u201cWe need your help. The music box is behind that locked door, and we think someone might have taken it.\u201d \n\nMs. Pomeroy\u2019s eyes gleamed, a mixture of intrigue and mischief dancing within them. \u201cA mystery, you say? How thrilling!\u201d She leaned in closer, her voice dropping to a conspiratorial whisper. \u201cYou know, I once had a hidden stash of glitter backstage that went missing during our production of \u2018A Midsummer Night\u2019s Dream.\u2019 Turns out, it was a prank from the seniors.\u201d \n\nAs she spoke, Mia\u2019s mind wandered to the list of suspects they had compiled. Jealousy ran rampant in their school, and Lila was a target for many. But who would stoop so low as to steal something so precious, especially during a show that mattered to so many?\n\n\u201cListen,\u201d Theo interjected, his voice steady despite the rising tension. \u201cWe need to get back there, but we can\u2019t draw attention to ourselves.\u201d \n\nMia\u2019s eyes sparkled with determination. \u201cLet\u2019s create a diversion. What about the props? If we make it seem like one of the sets is falling apart, everyone will rush back there.\u201d\n\nMs. Pomeroy clapped her hands, eyes wide with approval. \u201cBrilliant! I\u2019ll help you orchestrate the scene. Just say the word, and I\u2019ll make it as dramatic as possible.\u201d\n\nAs they hurried off to set their plan in motion, Mia felt a flutter of hope. Perhaps they could turn the tide in their favor. The auditorium hummed with anticipation, the stage lights casting a soft glow as the first act was about to begin. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe scene shifted as Mia and Theo set up their diversion. A backdrop was precariously propped against the wall, a crucial part of the show. With a quick glance around, Mia nudged it just enough. The fabric slowly tipped, and with it, they hoped to create the chaos they needed. \n\nSuddenly, a loud crash echoed through the auditorium. Gasps erupted from the audience as their plan unfurled. \u201cNow!\u201d Theo shouted, pulling Mia towards the backstage entrance, where they could see the stage manager rushing to assess the situation.\n\nThe backstage area was dimly lit and chaotic, a stark contrast to the lively atmosphere of the audience. The air was thick with tension as other students scrambled to help. \u201cWe need to find that door!\u201d Mia urged, scanning the room filled with costumes and equipment.\n\n\u201cOver there!\u201d Theo pointed toward a door at the far end, slightly ajar. They slipped through, adrenaline pumping. \n\nInside was a small, cluttered room, filled with old props and dusty instruments. But the music box was nowhere in sight. \u201cThis has to be it,\u201d Mia whispered, feeling an unsettling chill in the air. \u201cBut where is the box?\u201d\n\nJust then, a sudden noise jolted them. A shadow shifted in the corner. \u201cWho\u2019s there?\u201d A voice intercepted their stealth.\n\nMia and Theo exchanged panicked glances before instinctively moving to hide behind an old curtain. They held their breaths, hearts pounding.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s make a deal,\u201d the voice continued, filled with arrogance. \u201cThe music box is mine now, and if you want it back, you\u2019ll have to play by my rules.\u201d\n\nMia\u2019s pulse raced as she recognized the voice\u2014it belonged to Ava, a known troublemaker with a penchant for drama. The realization sent a wave of dread washing over her. They were not just racing against time; there was a deeper game at play.\n\n\u201cShh!\u201d Theo hissed as they waited, the weight of the moment pressing down on them like the heavy curtain fabric nearby. \n\nWhat were Ava\u2019s rules? What did she want? And how would they possibly outsmart her?\n\nAs the tension reached its peak, Mia knew they were at a critical juncture. They had to act quickly and wisely.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith a deep breath, Mia steeled herself, ready to confront the unexpected twist in their investigation.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What plan do Mia and Theo devise to distract the audience?","options":["Create a scene with falling props","Start a song performance","Pretend to faint","Call the principal"],"correct_answer":"Create a scene with falling props"},{"question":"Who is the voice that Mia and Theo overhear in the backstage room?","options":["Lila","Ms. Pomeroy","Ava","Theo"],"correct_answer":"Ava"},{"question":"What character trait does Ms. Pomeroy display when helping Mia and Theo?","options":["Indifference","Excitement","Disapproval","Fear"],"correct_answer":"Excitement"},{"question":"What emotion does Mia feel as they plan their diversion?","options":["Hope","Despair","Anger","Fear"],"correct_answer":"Hope"},{"question":"What does the music box symbolize in the story?","options":["Friendship","Jealousy","Victory","Dreams"],"correct_answer":"Dreams"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_266_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_266_ch3_img1.png","plot_266_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":857,"reading_level":"Challenger"}
