       [DEBUG] Checking shared image: {"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing Ava stands in the dimly lit backstage area, flanked by two classmates, her expression a mix of arrogance and defiance. The shadows create a dramatic contrast on her face, accentuating her smirk as she boasts about the music box. The backstage clutter, filled with old props and costumes, adds a layer of mystery and tension to the scene as she looks toward the stage with a calculating gaze.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_266_ch5_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 18:25:54"}
