   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_267_7_10","title":"The Enchanted Library Lockdown","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Locked Room","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"The sky was dark and gray. Rain poured down on the small town of Willow Creek. Inside the town\u2019s ancient library, three friends were about to have an adventure.\n\nOliver was the first to arrive. He loved books. They were his best friends. He could spend hours in the library, lost in stories. Today, he wore his favorite red hoodie. \"Hey, Zoe! Are you coming?\" he called.\n\nZoe, with her wild curls and bright yellow raincoat, bounced in just then. \"I wouldn\u2019t miss it! Let\u2019s find some exciting books!\" she said, her eyes sparkling with excitement.\n\nLeo rushed in last, shaking off rain like a puppy. \"I bet I can find the biggest, scariest book here!\" he laughed. \"Just watch!\" \n\nThe three friends wandered through the library. Towering shelves filled with colorful books surrounded them. Some books looked old and dusty, while others sparkled like new. A big sign hung above them: \"Welcome to the Enchanted Library!\"\n\nJust then, a loud CLAP of thunder echoed outside. The lights flickered. Oliver jumped. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d he asked nervously.\n\n\u201cJust thunder!\u201d Zoe said cheerfully. \u201cLet\u2019s keep exploring!\u201d \n\nSuddenly, the front doors slammed shut! The echoes of the slamming door sent shivers down their spines. \u201cWhat happened?\u201d Leo exclaimed, eyes wide.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but we\u2019re trapped!\u201d Oliver said, trying to stay calm. \n\nZoe pointed to a book that glowed softly on a nearby shelf. \u201cLook at that one! It\u2019s shining!\u201d \n\nThey hurried over. The book was thick and ancient. Its cover was blue with golden stars. \"The Magical Book of Stories,\" it read. \n\nOliver opened the book slowly. Instantly, a bright light filled the room. Words danced off the page! \u201cWow!\u201d Zoe shouted, stepping back in awe.\n\nJust then, the pages flipped wildly. A riddle appeared:  \n**To leave this place, you must solve my rhyme.  \nFind the key in a tale of time!**\n\n\u201cRiddles? We can solve it together!\u201d Leo cheered.\n\n\u201cWe need to hurry,\u201d Oliver said, glancing at a giant clock on the wall. The hands were moving fast. \u201cWe have until midnight!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s do it!\u201d Zoe said, determination in her voice.\n\nThey stared at the riddle, ready to start their adventure. To escape the library, they had to face magical characters and solve the mystery. What would they find? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe clock ticked loudly, and their hearts raced. They had to work as a team and uncover the secrets of the enchanted library. \n\n\u201cReady?\u201d Zoe asked, her eyes glinting with excitement. \n\n\u201cReady!\u201d Oliver and Leo replied. \n\nThis was just the beginning of their magical journey!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What happens at the library during the storm?","options":["The lights go out","The doors slam shut","Books fall off shelves","The windows break"],"correct_answer":"The doors slam shut"},{"question":"What is the title of the magical book they find?","options":["The Enchanted Library","The Magical Book of Stories","The Adventure Book","The Book of Riddles"],"correct_answer":"The Magical Book of Stories"},{"question":"What do the friends need to solve to escape?","options":["A puzzle","A riddle","A math problem","A maze"],"correct_answer":"A riddle"},{"question":"What does Oliver love the most?","options":["Playing outside","Reading books","Playing video games","Watching TV"],"correct_answer":"Reading books"},{"question":"What time do they need to escape by?","options":["Midnight","Noon","Morning","Dusk"],"correct_answer":"Midnight"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_267_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_267_ch1_img1.png","plot_267_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":436,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
