   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_267_7_10","title":"The Enchanted Library Lockdown","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Locked Room","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Oliver, Zoe, and Leo stood in front of the Echo Guardians. They looked like tall shadows made of mist. The guardians' voices echoed throughout the library.\n\n\u201cWho dares to enter our realm?\u201d boomed one guardian. Its eyes glowed like lanterns. \n\n\u201cWe do! We want to escape!\u201d shouted Zoe bravely. \n\n\u201cThen answer our riddle!\u201d said the second guardian. \u201cWhat has keys but can\u2019t open locks?\u201d \n\nOliver\u2019s heart raced. He thought hard. \u201cA piano!\u201d he exclaimed.\n\nThe guardians swirled around them and clapped. \u201cCorrect! But there are more challenges ahead.\u201d \n\nSuddenly, the library shook. A glowing book floated down from the shelf beside them. It was the Magical Book! \n\n\u201cYay!\u201d Leo cheered. \u201cMaybe it can help us!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s open it!\u201d Zoe said, her eyes shining with excitement. The pages flipped wildly and landed on a page with a giant key. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cLook! It says, \u2018To unlock your way, find the key to the story. It hides where dreams can fly and laughter is never shy!\u2019\u201d \n\n\u201cWhat does that mean?\u201d Oliver asked, scratching his head. \n\n\u201cMaybe it\u2019s in the story section!\u201d Leo suggested, bouncing on his toes.\n\nThey rushed to the story section. The shelves were filled with colorful books. \u201cLet\u2019s look for a book about dreams!\u201d Zoe said.\n\nOliver scanned the shelves. \u201cHere! \u2018The Dreamy Adventures of Fluffy the Flying Cat!\u2019\u201d \n\nThey pulled the book out. Suddenly, a small, fluffy cat popped out of the pages, wearing a tiny pilot hat! \n\n\u201cMeow! I\u2019m Fluffy!\u201d it said with a wink. \n\n\u201cWow! Can you help us?\u201d asked Leo, grinning.\n\n\u201cOf course!\u201d Fluffy replied. \u201cBut first, you must make me laugh!\u201d\n\nLeo quickly pulled a funny face, sticking his tongue out. Zoe giggled. Oliver couldn\u2019t help but chuckle. \n\nFluffy laughed and jumped in the air. \u201cYou did it! Follow me to find the key!\u201d \n\nFluffy led them through the library, hopping along. They entered a room filled with giant pillows. \n\n\u201cJump!\u201d Fluffy said, bouncing joyfully. \n\nThey leaped onto the pillows, laughing as they soared through the air. \n\n\u201cLook, I can fly!\u201d Zoe squealed, soaring high above the pillows. \n\nSuddenly, Fluffy landed and pointed to a shiny key on a shelf. \u201cThere it is! Grab it!\u201d \n\nLeo reached up and snatched the key. As he did, the room gleamed brightly. \n\n\u201cThis must be the key to our escape!\u201d Oliver shouted with hope.\n\nFluffy smiled. \u201cNow, you must hurry! Midnight is near!\u201d \n\nWith the key in hand, the friends raced back to the Echo Guardians. \n\n\u201cWhat will you do now?\u201d one guardian asked, its voice echoing.\n\n\u201cWe have the key to unlock our way!\u201d Zoe said, holding it up proudly.\n\n\u201cThen you may leave,\u201d the guardians replied, their forms beginning to fade. \n\n\u201cThank you!\u201d they cheered together. \n\nBut just as they turned to leave, the clock in the library began to chime. \u201cTick, tock, tick!\u201d \n\n\u201cRun!\u201d shouted Oliver as the sound echoed loudly. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThey dashed towards the door, hearts pounding. Could they escape before time ran out? The adventure was almost over, but they still had one last challenge ahead.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What riddle do the Echo Guardians ask?","options":["What has keys but can\u2019t open locks?","What is fluffy and flies?","What makes you laugh?","What is a book?"],"correct_answer":"What has keys but can\u2019t open locks?"},{"question":"What book do they find that leads to Fluffy?","options":["The Dreamy Adventures of Fluffy the Flying Cat","The Adventures of Oliver and Zoe","Leo's Funny Faces","The Magical Book of Secrets"],"correct_answer":"The Dreamy Adventures of Fluffy the Flying Cat"},{"question":"What must Leo do to make Fluffy laugh?","options":["Tell a joke","Do a funny face","Sing a song","Dance around"],"correct_answer":"Do a funny face"},{"question":"What do the kids need to escape the library?","options":["A map","A key","A magic spell","A secret door"],"correct_answer":"A key"},{"question":"What happens when the clock strikes midnight?","options":["They get a prize","They escape","They turn into books","They must leave the library"],"correct_answer":"They turn into books"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_267_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_267_ch4_img1.png","plot_267_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":513,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
