   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_267_7_10","title":"The Enchanted Library Lockdown","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Locked Room","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"The storm howled outside like a pack of wolves. Inside the library, Oliver, Zoe, Leo, and Fluffy the cat huddled together. The shelves towered high, filled with colorful books. Fluffy\u2019s soft fur brushed against Oliver\u2019s hand, making him smile. \n\n\u201cFluffy, do you think you can help us?\u201d Zoe asked. The fluffy cat purred, as if to say yes.\n\nSuddenly, they heard a loud crash! A book fell from a nearby shelf. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Leo whispered, his eyes wide. They all turned to see what had happened. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s check it out!\u201d Zoe exclaimed, leading the way. They tiptoed to the fallen book. To their surprise, it was the magical book that had brought them to life. \n\n\u201cWait! Look at this!\u201d Oliver pointed. There was a riddle written on the first page. \n\n\u201cTo find your key, listen to me! In the shelves, I hide so free. A tale of bravery tells my story, just open a book to find my glory.\u201d \n\n\u201cWhat does it mean?\u201d Leo scratched his head. \n\n\u201cIt must be about a brave character!\u201d Zoe said. \u201cLet\u2019s search for stories!\u201d\n\nThey moved quickly through the library, searching for books about heroes. Suddenly, Fluffy jumped onto a shelf. \u201cMeow!\u201d The cat knocked over a shiny key. \n\n\u201cWhoa! Fluffy found something!\u201d Oliver said, reaching for the key. \n\nJust then, shadows danced around them. Whimsical characters from the books peeked out. A knight in shiny armor waved. \u201cYou need to be brave to escape!\u201d\n\n\u201cBrave?\u201d Leo frowned. \u201cI\u2019m not sure I can be brave!\u201d\n\n\u201cOf course you can!\u201d Zoe encouraged. \u201cWe are all in this together!\u201d\n\nWith the key in hand, they faced the characters. \u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d Oliver asked. The knight smiled. \n\n\u201cBelieve in each other! That\u2019s the way!\u201d \n\n\u201cOkay!\u201d they cheered. They felt a rush of courage. \n\nThey opened the book again, and the characters guided them. \u201cFind the door of stories!\u201d they shouted. \n\nOliver, Zoe, Leo, and Fluffy raced to a hidden door at the back of the library. The key fit perfectly! With a click, the door creaked open, revealing a bright glowing light.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Zoe yelled. They all held hands and jumped through together. \n\nAs they landed outside, the storm had stopped and the moon shone bright. \n\n\u201cWe did it!\u201d Leo laughed. \n\n\u201cYes, and we did it together!\u201d Oliver grinned. \n\n\u201cNow, let\u2019s read more adventures!\u201d Zoe said, and they dashed back to the library, ready for more tales.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\nThe ancient library filled with towering shelves and a cozy reading nook, bathed in warm light. Fluffy the cat is sitting on a shelf, looking curiously at Oliver, Zoe, and Leo, who are gazing at the magical book.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\nThe moment the knight in shiny armor waves at Oliver, Zoe, and Leo, with colorful characters peeking from behind the shelves, creating a lively scene filled with excitement and encouragement.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who helps the kids find the key?","options":["A knight","Fluffy the cat","A mouse","A dragon"],"correct_answer":"Fluffy the cat"},{"question":"What do the characters tell the kids they need to be?","options":["Brave","Quiet","Fast","Silly"],"correct_answer":"Brave"},{"question":"What do the kids find that gives them a riddle?","options":["A map","A magical book","A treasure chest","A painting"],"correct_answer":"A magical book"},{"question":"What do the kids hold when they jump through the door?","options":["A book","A cat","A key","A sword"],"correct_answer":"A key"},{"question":"What does Zoe suggest they do after escaping?","options":["Go home","Read more adventures","Play outside","Visit a friend"],"correct_answer":"Read more adventures"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_267_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_267_ch5_img1.png","plot_267_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":484,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
