   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_268_7_10","title":"Secrets of the Clock Tower","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Locked Room","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"The bright sun shone down on the little town of Ticktock Hollow. At the center stood the tall clock tower. It was old and worn, with bricks that looked like they had stories to tell. Every hour, the clock chimed loudly, and everyone would smile. But today, it was silent.\n\n\"Why isn\u2019t it ringing?\" Sam asked, scratching his head. He was the brave leader of the group. His brown hair ruffled in the breeze.\n\nJenna, who loved history, pointed up. \"The hands aren\u2019t moving at all! Something must be wrong.\" Her eyes sparkled with curiosity. She loved finding out what happened in the past.\n\nMax, the tech whiz, frowned. \"Maybe the gears inside are stuck,\" he said. He wore glasses that always slid down his nose. \"We could fix it if we get inside!\"\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe friends gathered around the clock tower. It was their favorite place to hang out. But today felt different. They all agreed they needed to investigate. The annual town festival was just days away! Everyone needed the clock to work.\n\nThey approached the big wooden door at the base of the tower. It was locked tight. Sam pulled on the rusty handle. \"Ugh! It's locked!\" he said.\n\n\"Maybe there\u2019s a way to get in through the top,\" Max suggested, his eyes lighting up. He loved a good challenge.\n\n\"But how do we get up there?\" Jenna asked, looking worried. \"What if the old caretaker sees us?\"\n\nSam clenched his fists. \"We can\u2019t let anything stop us! We need to find the key!\" The three friends shared determined looks. The festival depended on them!\n\nAs they walked around the tower, they spotted an old ladder leaning against the side. It looked rickety but strong enough to hold them. \"We can climb up!\" said Max, excitement bubbling in his voice.\n\n\"Let\u2019s do it!\" Sam agreed, and they started to climb. The ladder creaked under their feet, but they didn\u2019t look down. They had a secret to uncover!\n\nSuddenly, they reached a window near the top. Peeking inside, they saw strange blueprints and big gears. But there was one big problem. The room was locked! \n\n\"What if the key is hidden inside?\" Jenna whispered, her heart racing. They all looked at each other, ready for a new challenge. How could they get in?\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nJust then, they heard footsteps below. It was the old caretaker! \"You kids best not be up to any mischief!\" he shouted, shaking his fist. His eyes were sharp, but they held a hint of a smile.\n\nSam gulped. \"We need to think fast!\" He whispered, \u201cLet\u2019s hide!\u201d\n\nThey ducked behind the ladder, holding their breath. If they wanted to uncover the secrets of the clock tower, they had to be brave!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the main problem in this chapter?","options":["The clock is broken","The caretaker is angry","The friends are hungry","The ladder is missing"],"correct_answer":"The clock is broken"},{"question":"Who is the brave leader of the group?","options":["Jenna","Max","Sam","The caretaker"],"correct_answer":"Sam"},{"question":"What do the friends want to find?","options":["A hidden treasure","A secret key","A new friend","A lost pet"],"correct_answer":"A secret key"},{"question":"What does Jenna love studying?","options":["Science","History","Art","Math"],"correct_answer":"History"},{"question":"What do they decide to use to climb up?","options":["A rope","A ladder","A tree","A fire escape"],"correct_answer":"A ladder"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_268_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_268_ch1_img1.png","plot_268_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":467,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
