   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_268_7_10","title":"Secrets of the Clock Tower","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Locked Room","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"As Sam, Jenna, and Max crawled through the small window, they landed in a dusty room. The tower's walls were tall and filled with old gears. \"Wow! Look at all this!\" Jenna exclaimed, pointing to the giant clock face overhead. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nMax nodded, his eyes sparkling. \"I bet we can find out why the clock stopped!\" \n\nBut just then, they heard a loud creaking noise. The door swung open, and there stood Mr. Gloom, his face like a thundercloud. \"What are you kids doing here?\" he boomed. \n\nSam stepped forward, trying to sound brave. \"We want to help the clock!\" \n\nMr. Gloom's eyebrows shot up. \"This clock holds secrets you cannot understand!\"\n\nJenna whispered to Sam, \"Maybe we can learn those secrets!\" \n\nSam replied, \"Let\u2019s stick together and find a way to learn more.\" \n\nMax grinned. \"I have my tablet with me. I can check for any hidden clues in this room!\" He pulled out his tablet and started tapping away. \n\nSuddenly, a strange whirring sound filled the air. The gears began to move! \"Look!\" Jenna shouted, pointing at the gears that were now spinning slowly. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nBut Mr. Gloom frowned and rushed to the clock. \"Stop! You have no idea what you're messing with!\" He began to push buttons and pull levers furiously. \n\n\"Wait!\" Sam said. \"We can help you! We just need to understand!\" \n\nBut Mr. Gloom shook his head. \"Some things are better left alone!\" \n\nThe friends exchanged worried glances. They had to find a way to stop Mr. Gloom from sabotaging their chance to restart the clock. \n\n\"Maybe we can distract him?\" Jenna suggested. \n\nSam nodded. \"Let\u2019s do it! Max, you keep hacking. Jenna and I will create a diversion!\" \n\nAs they made their plan, the clock's hands ticked closer to the festival starting time. Would they be able to restart the clock before it was too late?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Sam, Jenna, and Max want to do in the clock tower?","options":["Play games","Help the clock","Find treasure","Visit Mr. Gloom"],"correct_answer":"Help the clock"},{"question":"What does Mr. Gloom warn the kids about?","options":["The clock is broken","The secrets are dangerous","There are ghosts","They shouldn't be here"],"correct_answer":"The secrets are dangerous"},{"question":"What does Max use to look for clues?","options":["A map","A flashlight","His tablet","A notebook"],"correct_answer":"His tablet"},{"question":"What do Sam and Jenna plan to do to help Max?","options":["Run away","Create a diversion","Stay quiet","Call for help"],"correct_answer":"Create a diversion"},{"question":"What happens to the clock's gears during the chapter?","options":["They break","They start to move","They stop","They fall down"],"correct_answer":"They start to move"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_268_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_268_ch3_img1.png","plot_268_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":316,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
