   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_268_7_10","title":"Secrets of the Clock Tower","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Locked Room","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Chapter 4: The Key to the Past\n\nThe air inside the clock tower was filled with excitement. Sam, Jenna, and Max stood at the bottom of the spiral staircase. The old gears creaked softly above them. \"We need to find a way to get into that locked room,\" Sam said, his eyes shining with determination.\n\n\"Maybe there\u2019s a clue somewhere,\" Jenna suggested. She loved history and believed every old place had secrets to share. Max nodded. \"I can check the control panel again. It might have a way to open the door.\"\n\nThey climbed the stairs one step at a time. As they reached the landing, they spotted an old map hanging on the wall. It showed the clock tower and its many rooms. \u201cLook at this!\u201d Jenna exclaimed. \u201cThere\u2019s a room marked \u2018Archives.\u2019 It must have information about the clock!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s check it out!\u201d Sam said, pointing to a door across the hall. They hurried over, excitement bubbling inside them. Just then, they heard a loud thud. It was Mr. Gloom! He was coming up the stairs!\n\n\u201cWe have to hurry!\u201d Max whispered urgently. They creaked open the door to the Archives just in time. Inside, they found dusty books and faded blueprints. The room smelled like old paper and adventure. \n\n\u201cWow!\u201d Jenna said, running her fingers over a large blueprint. \u201cThis shows the clock\u2019s inner workings! It looks like there\u2019s a special lever we can pull to start it again!\u201d Sam's heart raced. \u201cBut how do we reach it?\u201d\n\nSuddenly, Max shouted, \u201cLook at this!\u201d He was pointing at a wooden crate in the corner. \u201cIf we stack these books, we might be able to reach the blueprint.\u201d \n\nThey quickly stacked the books, giggling as they balanced them. Finally, Max was high enough to see the blueprints clearly. \u201cAha! Here it is\u2014a lever that needs to be pulled! But there\u2019s a lock on the door to the gears.\u201d\n\n\u201cDon\u2019t worry!\u201d Sam said. \u201cWe\u2019ll distract Mr. Gloom again. Max, can you hack into the lock?\u201d\n\n\u201cI can try!\u201d Max replied, adjusting his glasses with a grin. They carefully listened for Mr. Gloom as they plotted their next move.\n\nJust then, they heard a loud crash from the staircase. Sam jumped. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d \n\n\u201cI think he\u2019s coming!\u201d Jenna squeaked. They held their breath, eyes wide with fear. \n\nThen the sound of gears whirring filled the air. Max grinned. \u201cI think it\u2019s working!\u201d \n\nAs they focused on the sound, they felt a surge of hope. \u201cLet\u2019s do this!\u201d Sam shouted, ready to face their next challenge. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]: A colorful illustration of Sam, Jenna, and Max standing at the bottom of the spiral staircase, looking up with excitement. The clock tower's gears are visible in the background, and the old map on the wall shows the layout of the clock tower, filled with vibrant details.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]: An action-packed image of Max climbing a stack of books, trying to see the blueprint. Sam and Jenna are cheering him on, with a look of determination on their faces. The dusty room is filled with old books and blueprints, creating a thrilling atmosphere.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What room do the friends find in the clock tower?","options":["Bathroom","Archives","Kitchen","Library"],"correct_answer":"Archives"},{"question":"What does the blueprint show?","options":["Where to find food","How to start the clock","Mr. Gloom's secret","A treasure map"],"correct_answer":"How to start the clock"},{"question":"Who suggests stacking the books?","options":["Jenna","Max","Sam","Mr. Gloom"],"correct_answer":"Max"},{"question":"What sound do the friends hear that gives them hope?","options":["The clock ticking","Gears whirring","Mr. Gloom's footsteps","A door creaking"],"correct_answer":"Gears whirring"},{"question":"What does Sam shout as they get ready to face the challenge?","options":["Let's hide!","Let's do this!","Run away!","Stay quiet!"],"correct_answer":"Let's do this!"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_268_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_268_ch4_img1.png","plot_268_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":536,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
