   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_268_7_10","title":"Secrets of the Clock Tower","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Locked Room","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Chapter 5: The Key to Time\n\nThe clock tower loomed above them, casting a long shadow. Sam, Jenna, and Max stood at the foot of the winding stairs. \"We can do this,\" Sam said, his eyes sparkling with determination. \"We have the blueprint! We know what we need to find.\"\n\nJenna nodded, holding the old paper tightly. \"It says the key is hidden in the gears. We just have to figure out how to reach them.\" \n\nAs they climbed the stairs, the air grew colder. The sound of old wood creaking filled their ears. They reached the door at the top, but it was locked tight. Sam turned the handle. \"It's not opening! What do we do now?\"\n\nMax grinned, pulling out his tablet. \"I can hack the lock! Just give me a second.\" He began tapping on the screen with quick fingers. \n\nSuddenly, the door creaked open, and a cloud of dust burst out. \"Whoa! That was amazing!\" Jenna exclaimed. \n\nInside, the room was filled with ancient gears and dusty blueprints. It looked like a treasure trove of secrets. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nIn the center of the room, a large gear was shining under the dim light. \"That must be the key!\" shouted Max, pointing. \"If we can turn that gear, the clock will start!\" \n\nBut just then, they heard footsteps. Mr. Gloom! \"What are you children doing here?\" he boomed, his voice echoing against the walls. \n\n\"We're here to fix the clock!\" shouted Sam, standing tall. \"The festival depends on it!\" \n\nMr. Gloom paused, looking surprised. \"You really think you can do it?\" \n\n\"Yes, we can!\" Jenna said confidently. \"We believe in the magic of this tower!\" \n\nMr. Gloom's stern face softened a bit. \"Maybe... maybe it's time for a change.\"\n\nWith a nod from Mr. Gloom, the friends rushed to the gear. Together, they pulled and pushed with all their might. The gear began to turn, slowly at first, then faster! \n\nSuddenly, the clock chimed, loud and clear. The hands of the clock started to move again! \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\"This is amazing!\" Max cheered. \n\nMr. Gloom smiled for the first time. \"You did it, kids! You've brought life back to the clock tower.\" \n\nSam grinned. \"Now the festival can happen!\" \n\nAs they descended the stairs, Sam, Jenna, and Max felt proud. They had faced fear, learned about teamwork, and discovered that even the oldest secrets can be shared. \n\n\"We did it together!\" Jenna said, her voice full of excitement. \n\n\"Next stop, the festival!\" Sam replied, and they rushed out of the tower, ready for their adventure.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Sam, Jenna, and Max find in the secret room?","options":["A treasure chest","Ancient gears","A secret map","A magic wand"],"correct_answer":"Ancient gears"},{"question":"Who helps the kids turn the gear?","options":["Mr. Gloom","The town mayor","A stranger","The clock itself"],"correct_answer":"Mr. Gloom"},{"question":"What happens when they turn the gear?","options":["The clock stops","The clock starts ticking","They find a new secret","They get locked in"],"correct_answer":"The clock starts ticking"},{"question":"What is the main goal of the characters in this chapter?","options":["To find a map","To restart the clock","To explore the town","To meet Mr. Gloom"],"correct_answer":"To restart the clock"},{"question":"How does Mr. Gloom feel by the end of the chapter?","options":["Angry","Happy","Confused","Sad"],"correct_answer":"Happy"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_268_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_268_ch5_img1.png","plot_268_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":427,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
