   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_269_7_10","title":"The Case of the Cranky Cat","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Locked Room","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"It was a bright Saturday morning at \"Paws and Claws Pet Shop.\" Colorful balloons floated everywhere. The shop was full of laughter and excitement. Today was the big charity event for shelter animals!\n\nLucy, a pint-sized detective, adjusted her magnifying glass. \"Benny, are you ready?\" she asked, her eyes sparkling with curiosity. \n\nBenny, her best friend, nodded eagerly. He loved animals and was always up for an adventure. \"Let\u2019s find the crankiest cat in town!\" \n\nLucy pointed to the center of the shop. There was a fancy pet carrier. It belonged to Mr. Whiskers, the famous grumpy cat. He was the star of the event, and everyone wanted to meet him. People were buzzing with excitement. \n\nSuddenly, the lights dimmed. A spotlight shone on the pet carrier. But when the curtain opened, Mr. Whiskers was gone! \n\nLucy gasped. \"Where did he go? He was just here!\" \n\nBenny looked worried. \"What if someone took him?\" \n\nLucy clenched her fists. \"We have to solve this mystery! Let\u2019s check the locked room where he was last seen.\" \n\nShe rushed to the door. It was locked tight. \"Oh no! We can\u2019t get in!\" \n\nBenny scratched his head. \"Maybe someone has the key?\" \n\nJust then, a loud shout came from the crowd. \"Who took Mr. Whiskers?\" \n\nLucy turned to see a group of guests looking confused and upset. \"We need to ask everyone!\" she said. \n\nAs they approached the guests, Lucy noticed something shiny on the floor. \"Wait, Benny!\" \n\nBenny looked down. \"What is it?\" \n\nLucy picked up a silver bell. \"This must belong to someone! Let\u2019s find out who!\" \n\nThey rushed back to the crowd, determined to uncover the mystery. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]  \nLucy and Benny are standing in the colorful pet shop, surrounded by excited guests and balloons. A spotlight is shining on a fancy pet carrier. The mood is lively, and playful animals can be seen in their cages, some peeking out with curiosity.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]  \nBenny and Lucy are examining a shiny silver bell on the floor. Guests in the background look worried, and Lucy has a determined expression. The pet shop is filled with colorful toys and animals, creating a vibrant atmosphere.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the name of the pet shop?","options":["Paws and Claws Pet Shop","Benny\u2019s Pet Store","Lucy\u2019s Pet Shop","Mr. Whiskers\u2019 Place"],"correct_answer":"Paws and Claws Pet Shop"},{"question":"Who is the famous cat?","options":["Fluffy","Mr. Whiskers","Benny","Lucy"],"correct_answer":"Mr. Whiskers"},{"question":"What did Lucy find on the floor?","options":["A toy","A bell","A cat treat","A key"],"correct_answer":"A bell"},{"question":"Who is Lucy\u2019s best friend?","options":["Mr. Whiskers","Benny","The cat","A guest"],"correct_answer":"Benny"},{"question":"What did Lucy want to do after Mr. Whiskers disappeared?","options":["Eat lunch","Solve the mystery","Go home","Play with toys"],"correct_answer":"Solve the mystery"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_269_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_269_ch1_img1.png","plot_269_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":365,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
