   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_269_7_10","title":"The Case of the Cranky Cat","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Locked Room","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Lucy and Benny stood in front of the mysterious room. The colorful pet shop was filled with the sounds of barking puppies and chirping birds. \u201cMr. Whiskers must be in there!\u201d Lucy exclaimed, her eyes sparkling with determination. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s check!\u201d Benny replied, his voice a mix of excitement and worry. They pushed the door slightly, and it creaked open just a little. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nInside, the room was dark. Shadows danced across the walls, and the air smelled faintly of catnip. \u201cMr. Whiskers!\u201d Lucy called out. \u201cAre you in there?\u201d \n\nA soft, grumpy meow came from the corner. \u201cThere he is!\u201d shouted Benny. They stepped inside, holding their breath. But then, they noticed something strange. \n\n\u201cLook at this!\u201d Lucy knelt down by a pile of colorful yarn. \u201cIt\u2019s all tangled. Did Mr. Whiskers get caught in it?\u201d \n\nBenny scratched his head. \u201cBut how did he get out? The door was closed!\u201d \n\nSuddenly, they heard a loud thud from behind the shelves. Lucy jumped. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d \n\n\u201cMaybe a clue!\u201d Benny whispered, his eyes wide. He pushed aside some toys, and they both gasped. A shiny collar lay on the floor. \n\n\u201cThis isn\u2019t Mr. Whiskers\u2019s collar!\u201d Lucy exclaimed. \u201cWhose could it be?\u201d \n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but we need to find out!\u201d Benny said. They hurried back to the main shop, searching for answers. \n\nAs they stepped into the bustling pet shop, they saw a group of guests whispering. \u201cI bet one of them knows something,\u201d Lucy said, eyeing the crowd. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s ask them!\u201d Benny replied bravely. \n\nBut when they approached, the guests looked nervous. \u201cWe don\u2019t know anything!\u201d one lady said, her eyes darting away. \n\nLucy frowned. \u201cWhy is everyone acting so strange?\u201d she wondered aloud. \n\nJust then, the lights flickered, and the shop grew dark! Lucy felt her heart race. \u201cBenny! What if Mr. Whiskers is in danger?\u201d \n\nBenny nodded. \u201cWe must find him fast!\u201d \n\nThey sprinted back towards the locked room. But as they reached the door, they heard a soft purring again. \u201cIt\u2019s coming from behind the shelves!\u201d Lucy shouted. \n\nThey quickly moved the shelves, and there, in a corner, was a small hatch! \u201cCould he be hiding in there?\u201d Benny asked, excitement bubbling in his voice. \n\nLucy took a deep breath. \u201cThere\u2019s only one way to find out!\u201d \n\nShould they open the hatch? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith a determined look, Lucy nodded. \u201cWe have to see what\u2019s inside!\u201d \n\nBut just then, the lights flickered back on. A shadow loomed behind them. A tall figure stepped forward, frowning. \u201cWhat are you kids doing here?\u201d \n\n\u201cOh no! Who is it?\u201d Lucy thought, her heart pounding.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Lucy and Benny find tangled in the room?","options":["A pile of yarn","Mr. Whiskers","A dog toy","A collar"],"correct_answer":"A pile of yarn"},{"question":"What did Lucy hear when she called for Mr. Whiskers?","options":["A bark","A soft meow","A loud thud","A purr"],"correct_answer":"A soft meow"},{"question":"How did the guests react when Lucy and Benny asked them questions?","options":["They were friendly","They answered quickly","They looked nervous","They sang a song"],"correct_answer":"They looked nervous"},{"question":"What was the last thing Lucy and Benny discovered?","options":["A hidden hatch","A new pet","A dog","A missing collar"],"correct_answer":"A hidden hatch"},{"question":"Who appeared just as they were about to open the hatch?","options":["A tall figure","Mr. Whiskers","A dog","A little girl"],"correct_answer":"A tall figure"}]},"images":null,"word_count":445,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
