   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_269_7_10","title":"The Case of the Cranky Cat","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Locked Room","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Lucy and Benny stood in the cozy pet shop, surrounded by playful puppies and chirping birds. Bright toys hung from shelves, and the smell of fresh pet treats filled the air. They were determined to find Mr. Whiskers.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s start by asking Mrs. Paws for help!\u201d said Lucy, her eyes sparkling with excitement. Benny nodded, his tail wagging. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThey hurried over to Mrs. Paws, a kind lady with fluffy white hair. She looked worried, her fingers twisting the collar of her sweater.\n\n\u201cDo you think you can help us?\u201d Lucy asked. \n\n\u201cI hope so,\u201d Mrs. Paws replied. \u201cMy cat has been missing for days, too! His name is Mr. Paws.\u201d\n\nBenny's ears perked up. \u201cWhat does he look like?\u201d \n\n\u201cHe's fluffy and orange, just like the sunset!\u201d she said. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s search together!\u201d Lucy suggested. The three of them formed a team. \n\nThey searched the pet shop, peeking under cages and behind shelves. Suddenly, Benny sniffed the air. \u201cI smell something!\u201d he exclaimed, leading them to a pile of plush toys.\n\n\u201cIs it a clue?\u201d Lucy wondered. They looked closely and found a tiny tuft of orange fur!\n\n\u201cThis must belong to Mr. Paws!\u201d Mrs. Paws cried out, her eyes wide with hope.\n\n\u201cWe\u2019re close!\u201d Lucy cheered. \u201cLet\u2019s keep looking.\u201d\n\nThey moved to the back of the pet shop, where the light flickered. Lucy\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWhat if Mr. Whiskers is hiding somewhere dark?\u201d she whispered.\n\nJust then, they heard a loud meow. It came from the locked room!\n\n\u201cDid you hear that?\u201d Benny said, bouncing with excitement. \u201cIt\u2019s Mr. Whiskers!\u201d\n\n\u201cBut how do we unlock the door?\u201d Lucy asked, looking around. Suddenly, she spotted a shiny key hanging from a nail on the wall.\n\n\u201cLook! The key!\u201d she shouted. She grabbed it and rushed to the door. With a deep breath, she slid the key into the lock and turned it. Click!\n\nThe door creaked open, and inside, they saw Mr. Whiskers perched on a shelf, looking very cranky.\n\n\u201cThere you are!\u201d Lucy exclaimed. Mr. Whiskers huffed, his tail flicking. \n\n\u201cCome here, you silly cat!\u201d Benny called gently. Slowly, Mr. Whiskers jumped down. \n\n\u201cHe looks just like my Mr. Paws!\u201d Mrs. Paws said, pointing. And to their surprise, Mr. Whiskers had Mr. Paws\u2019 collar around his neck!\n\nLucy grinned. \u201cLooks like Mr. Whiskers borrowed it!\u201d \n\nMrs. Paws laughed. \u201cYou two are amazing detectives! Thank you for finding my friend.\u201d\n\nLucy and Benny high-fived. They felt proud. They had solved the mystery and helped their furry friends. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s celebrate with some pet treats!\u201d Lucy suggested. They all cheered together!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who do Lucy and Benny ask for help?","options":["Mr. Whiskers","Mrs. Paws","The puppies","The birds"],"correct_answer":"Mrs. Paws"},{"question":"What color is Mr. Paws?","options":["Fluffy and white","Fluffy and orange","Gray","Black"],"correct_answer":"Fluffy and orange"},{"question":"What do they find that belongs to Mr. Paws?","options":["A collar","A toy","A tuft of fur","A bowl"],"correct_answer":"A tuft of fur"},{"question":"Who does Lucy turn to unlock the door?","options":["Benny","Mrs. Paws","The key","Mr. Whiskers"],"correct_answer":"The key"},{"question":"What do they do to celebrate after finding Mr. Whiskers?","options":["Go home","Have a party","Eat pet treats","Take a picture"],"correct_answer":"Eat pet treats"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_269_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_269_ch5_img1.png","plot_269_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":437,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
