   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_269_11_14","title":"The Case of the Cranky Cat","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Locked Room","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"As the moonlight spilled through the window, Lucy found herself staring at the locked door, her heart racing like a drum in a parade. Benny stood beside her, his brow furrowed in concern. \"What do we do now?\" he whispered, glancing around the mysterious room filled with shelves of pet supplies and the faint scent of catnip lingering in the air.\n\n\"We need to find Mr. Whiskers before the event ends,\" Lucy replied, determination flickering in her eyes. \"This room might hold the key.\" She scanned the shelves, filled with plush toys and colorful collars, feeling a swell of excitement mixed with dread. She couldn't shake the feeling that they were being watched. \n\nAs they crept further into the room, Lucy noticed a small window high above them. \"Look!\" she exclaimed, pointing. \"If we can get up there, we might see something outside.\" Benny nodded eagerly and began to stack a pile of pet blankets. With a boost from Benny, Lucy climbed up, her fingertips grazing the window. \n\nJust as she peered outside, a loud crash rang out in the pet shop. Startled, Lucy nearly tumbled off the stack. \"What was that?!\" Benny gasped, his eyes wide with alarm. They exchanged worried glances, a silent agreement passing between them: they had to investigate.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nCarefully, Lucy climbed down, her heart racing. They slipped out of the room, creeping toward the source of the noise. The pet shop was now eerily quiet, the cheerful music from earlier drowned in the tension that hung in the air. Suddenly, the door to the main room burst open, and a group of guests rushed in, their faces pale. \n\n\"Did you see him?\" one woman exclaimed, her voice shaking. \"Mr. Whiskers is gone! Someone must have taken him!\" Panic rippled through the crowd. Lucy's mind raced. What if the cranky cat had been kidnapped? \n\n\"We'll find him,\" Benny said, squeezing her arm. \"We have to.\" The two friends exchanged a resolute nod, fueled by the shared mission to locate Mr. Whiskers, but uncertainty clouded Lucy's mind. How could they solve this mystery with so many nervous guests around? \n\nAs they moved back toward the locked room, Lucy spotted a glimmer on the floor. She bent down, her heart quickening as she picked up a small silver key. \"Benny, look!\" she said, holding it up. \"This might unlock something.\" \n\nBut just as they turned to sprint back, a shadow loomed in the doorway. It was the shop owner, Mrs. Peachtree, her expression a mix of anger and fear. \"What are you two doing in there?\" she demanded, stepping forward. \"You\u2019re not supposed to be in that room!\" \n\nLucy felt the weight of Mrs. Peachtree's gaze, heavy with suspicion. \"We were\u2014\"\n\nBefore she could explain, the lights flickered, and the power went out, plunging them into darkness. Lucy's heart raced. \"Now what?\" she whispered, clutching the key tightly. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nIn that moment, Lucy knew they had to make a choice: reveal their discovery to the guests or follow the mystery deeper into the shadows of the pet shop. With Benny by her side, she took a deep breath. \"We need to keep looking,\" she said firmly, her voice steady despite the chaos. \u201cMr. Whiskers is counting on us.\u201d","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Lucy and Benny find in the locked room?","options":["A hiding pet","A silver key","A map","A note"],"correct_answer":"A silver key"},{"question":"How do the guests react to Mr. Whiskers' disappearance?","options":["They are calm","They are angry","They panic","They leave"],"correct_answer":"They panic"},{"question":"What happens when the lights go out?","options":["Everyone leaves","Lucy discovers a clue","Lucy and Benny have to make a choice","The party continues"],"correct_answer":"Lucy and Benny have to make a choice"},{"question":"What does Lucy feel when Mrs. Peachtree confronts them?","options":["Relief","Fear","Joy","Indifference"],"correct_answer":"Fear"},{"question":"What is the main goal of Lucy and Benny in this chapter?","options":["To play with pets","To find Mr. Whiskers","To comfort guests","To close the shop"],"correct_answer":"To find Mr. Whiskers"}]},"images":null,"word_count":544,"reading_level":"Builder"}
