   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_270_7_10","title":"The Adventure of the Secret Room","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Locked Room","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Emma and Jake stood in front of the old mansion. It loomed over them like a giant from a fairy tale. The sun was setting, casting shadows that danced along its cracked walls. \u201cThis place is creepy!\u201d Jake exclaimed, his eyes wide. \u201cBut it\u2019s also cool!\u201d \n\nEmma rolled her eyes. \u201cYou always think everything is cool, Jake. Look at those windows!\u201d They were dusty and dark, like sleepy eyes. \u201cWhat if there are ghosts?\u201d \n\n\u201cGhosts? No way!\u201d Jake laughed. \u201cMaybe there are treasures!\u201d \n\nThe siblings were at a weekend campout with their group. Mr. Gibbons, their camp leader, was already setting up the campfire. He was tall and wore colorful socks with sandals. \u201cGather \u2018round, campers! This mansion has many secrets!\u201d he called out. Emma and Jake hurried over.\n\n\u201cSecrets?\u201d Emma whispered to Jake, her curiosity bubbling. \u201cWhat kind of secrets?\u201d \n\nAs the fire crackled, Mr. Gibbons shared stories about the mansion. \u201cThis place belonged to a strange inventor,\u201d he said. \u201cHe loved puzzles and hid many things inside.\u201d \n\nSuddenly, Emma heard a soft whisper. \u201cDid you hear that?\u201d she asked, looking around. Jake shook his head. \u201cIt\u2019s probably just the wind.\u201d\n\nBut Emma felt something different. \u201cNo, it came from the walls!\u201d she insisted. She peered closer, trying to discover the source. \n\nJust then, she noticed something strange. \u201cJake, look!\u201d She pointed to a small door, half-hidden behind an old bookshelf. It was locked tight. \u201cWhat do you think is inside?\u201d \n\n\u201cTreasure, for sure!\u201d Jake said, bouncing on his toes. \u201cWe should try to open it!\u201d \n\n\u201cMaybe there are clues!\u201d Emma added, her eyes sparkling. \u201cBut we need to find a key.\u201d \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s explore!\u201d Jake shouted, his excitement bubbling over. \n\n\u201cWait!\u201d Emma said, spinning around. \u201cWhat if it's dangerous? We should be careful.\u201d \n\n\u201cDangerous? Or fun?\u201d Jake grinned, his imagination running wild. \n\nEmma sighed but smiled at her brother's enthusiasm. \u201cOkay, but we stick together. No wandering off!\u201d \n\nThey ventured deeper into the mansion. The air felt thick with mystery, and shadows whispered all around them. Every corner held a new surprise. \n\nSuddenly, they heard a loud creak. Emma jumped. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d \n\nJake giggled nervously. \u201cMaybe it\u2019s a ghost!\u201d\n\nThen, they spotted an old map hanging on the wall. It had strange symbols and drawings. \u201cThis could help us!\u201d Emma said, reaching for it. \n\nAs she pulled it down, the ground shook slightly. \u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d Jake yelled. \n\nBut Emma was already intrigued by the map. \u201cI think this leads to the key!\u201d \n\nBefore they could look closer, a strange shadow moved past them. \u201cLet\u2019s hurry!\u201d Emma said, clutching the map tightly. \n\nThey raced back towards the hidden door. What secrets lay beyond? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe siblings stood in front of the old mansion, looking up at its tall, eerie structure, with shadows cast by the setting sun. Mr. Gibbons could be seen in the background, preparing the campfire.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nEmma and Jake are holding the old map in front of the strange shadow they just saw, their expressions a mix of fear and excitement. The map shows mysterious symbols and drawings, hinting at adventures to come.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What type of place is Emma and Jake visiting?","options":["A park","An old mansion","A school","A zoo"],"correct_answer":"An old mansion"},{"question":"Who is their camp leader?","options":["Mr. Gibbons","Mr. Thompson","Ms. Lee","Ms. Adams"],"correct_answer":"Mr. Gibbons"},{"question":"What do Emma and Jake find that is locked?","options":["A treasure chest","A hidden door","A secret passage","A window"],"correct_answer":"A hidden door"},{"question":"What does Emma hear coming from the walls?","options":["A song","Whispers","Laughter","Yelling"],"correct_answer":"Whispers"},{"question":"What do they discover that might help them?","options":["A flashlight","An old map","A key","A book"],"correct_answer":"An old map"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_270_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_270_ch1_img1.png","plot_270_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":525,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
