   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_270_7_10","title":"The Adventure of the Secret Room","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Locked Room","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"The sun dipped below the tall trees, and shadows danced across the old mansion. Emma and Jake stood in front of the hidden door. Jake rubbed his hands together. \u201cI think it\u2019s a secret treasure room!\u201d he exclaimed, his eyes sparkling with excitement. \n\nEmma frowned. \u201cBut we don\u2019t even know how to open it!\u201d She glanced back at the campfire, where Mr. Gibbons was telling ghost stories. \u201cWe need to find a way.\u201d\n\nJake pulled the old map from his pocket. \u201cLook! It shows other rooms. Maybe one of them has clues!\u201d He pointed to a spot near the door that looked like a strange drawing.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s check it out!\u201d Emma said, feeling a rush of hope. They tiptoed down the dim hallway. The wooden floor creaked under their feet. \n\nSuddenly, they heard a loud bang! Both siblings jumped and looked at each other wide-eyed. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Jake whispered, clutching the map tightly.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but we have to keep moving,\u201d Emma said, trying to be brave. She felt a chill run down her spine.\n\nThey reached the first room marked on the map. It was filled with dusty furniture and old books. \u201cWow! Look at all this stuff!\u201d Jake exclaimed, his voice echoing. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nEmma picked up an ancient-looking book. \u201cMaybe this has something to do with the hidden room!\u201d She opened it carefully. Dust floated into the air, and she coughed. Inside, strange symbols danced across the pages.\n\nJust then, Emma noticed something shiny under a table. She bent down and pulled out a small, silver key. \u201cJake! Look at this!\u201d she shouted, holding it high.\n\n\u201cCould it be for the secret door?\u201d Jake asked, bouncing on his feet. \n\n\u201cThat\u2019s what I\u2019m hoping!\u201d Emma replied, running back towards the hidden door. \n\nBut as they approached, they heard another noise\u2014a low growl. \u201cDid you hear that?\u201d Jake asked, his voice shaking.\n\nEmma nodded, gripping the key tightly. \u201cWe need to be careful.\u201d Just as she reached for the doorknob, the growl grew louder. The siblings exchanged worried glances. \n\n\u201cShould we turn back?\u201d Jake asked, his heart racing.\n\n\u201cNo! We\u2019re so close,\u201d Emma replied, determination shining in her eyes. \u201cI\u2019m not giving up now!\u201d \n\nWith a deep breath, she turned the key in the lock. The door creaked open slowly, revealing darkness inside. \n\n\u201cReady?\u201d Emma whispered.\n\n\u201cReady!\u201d Jake replied, even though he felt a flutter of fear in his stomach. \n\nTogether, they stepped into the unknown.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Emma and Jake find in the dusty room?","options":["A treasure chest","A shiny key","A ghost","A map"],"correct_answer":"A shiny key"},{"question":"What does the old map lead them to?","options":["A garden","A treasure","The secret door","A ghost story"],"correct_answer":"The secret door"},{"question":"How does Emma feel when she finds the key?","options":["Scared","Excited","Angry","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Excited"},{"question":"What sound do Emma and Jake hear as they approach the hidden door?","options":["Thunder","Birds","Growling","Laughter"],"correct_answer":"Growling"},{"question":"What does Emma decide to do at the end of the chapter?","options":["Leave the mansion","Open the door","Close the door","Cry"],"correct_answer":"Open the door"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_270_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_270_ch2_img1.png","plot_270_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":418,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
