   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_270_7_10","title":"The Adventure of the Secret Room","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Locked Room","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"The mansion creaked around Emma and Jake as they stood in the dusty room. The air was thick with the smell of old wood and secrets. \u201cThis place is so mysterious!\u201d Emma said, her eyes sparkling with curiosity. \n\n\u201cYeah! I can almost hear the ghosts talking!\u201d Jake replied, pretending to shiver. He pointed at the cobwebs in the corners. \u201cWhat do you think they\u2019re saying?\u201d\n\nEmma rolled her eyes. \u201cLet\u2019s focus. We need to find the key from the map!\u201d She glanced around the room, spotting a small chest on a dusty shelf. \u201cLook, Jake! That might have something in it!\u201d\n\nThey hurried over to the shelf, their hearts racing. Emma opened the chest. Inside was a shiny key! \n\n\u201cWow! Do you think this is it?\u201d Jake exclaimed, his eyes wide with excitement. \n\n\u201cI think it might be!\u201d Emma said, holding the key up to the light. Just then, they heard a strange noise behind them\u2014a soft whisper. \n\n\u201cDid you hear that?\u201d Jake asked, his voice trembling.\n\nEmma nodded, eyes darting around. \u201cIt\u2019s coming from the door!\u201d She pointed to the hidden door, now more mysterious than ever. \n\nThey took a deep breath and approached the door. Emma turned the key in her hand. \u201cWhat if we unlock it and find something amazing?\u201d \n\n\u201cOr something scary!\u201d Jake added, biting his lip. \n\n\u201cTogether, we can face anything!\u201d Emma said, feeling determined. Just as she was about to insert the key, the floor creaked loudly. They both jumped back, startled.\n\n\u201cWhat was that?\u201d Jake whispered, clutching Emma\u2019s arm.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but we need to hurry. I want to know what\u2019s behind this door!\u201d With a deep breath, Emma slid the key into the lock. \n\nSuddenly, the door shook and rattled. \u201cWhat if it\u2019s trapped?\u201d Jake yelped, pulling Emma back. \n\n\u201cWe have to try!\u201d Emma insisted. Just then, the door swung open with a loud bang. Dark shapes loomed inside, and a chill ran down their spines. \n\n\u201cWhat is that?\u201d Jake gasped. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find out!\u201d Emma said boldly. She stepped inside, and Jake followed, his heart pounding. \n\nThey entered a room filled with strange, glowing objects. There were dusty books, old paintings, and a big map on the wall. \u201cLook at all this stuff!\u201d Emma shouted, her voice echoing. \n\nThen, from the corner, they heard the whisper again. \u201cHelp us\u2026\u201d it said. \n\nEmma and Jake exchanged nervous glances. \u201cWho is that?\u201d Jake asked, his imagination running wild. \n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but we need to figure it out!\u201d Emma replied, feeling the tension rise. \n\nThey stepped deeper into the room, ready to uncover the mystery. But suddenly, the door slammed shut behind them! \n\n\u201cWhat just happened?\u201d Jake cried. \n\n\u201cWe\u2019re locked in!\u201d Emma gasped, eyes wide with fear. \u201cWe have to find the clues fast!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Emma and Jake find in the chest?","options":["A map","A shiny key","A toy","A ghost"],"correct_answer":"A shiny key"},{"question":"What do they hear coming from the door?","options":["A loud noise","A cat meowing","A soft whisper","A song"],"correct_answer":"A soft whisper"},{"question":"What happens when Emma unlocks the door?","options":["It opens slowly","It stays locked","It slams shut","It disappears"],"correct_answer":"It opens slowly"},{"question":"What do they see inside the secret room?","options":["A treasure chest","A big map","A giant monster","A party"],"correct_answer":"A big map"},{"question":"What happens to the door after they enter the secret room?","options":["It opens again","It turns into a wall","It locks shut","It vanishes"],"correct_answer":"It locks shut"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_270_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_270_ch3_img1.png","plot_270_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":476,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
