   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_270_7_10","title":"The Adventure of the Secret Room","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Locked Room","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Emma and Jake stood in the dim light of the secret room. Dust floated in the air, sparkled like tiny stars. \u201cWow, this place is amazing!\u201d Jake exclaimed, his eyes wide with wonder. \n\nSuddenly, they heard the whispering again. It was soft and sad. \u201cHelp us\u2026 help\u2026\u201d Emma shivered. \u201cDid you hear that?\u201d \n\nJake nodded, biting his lip. \u201cMaybe it\u2019s a ghost! Or maybe it\u2019s treasure!\u201d His imagination was running wild. \n\n\u201cFocus, Jake! We need to find a way out,\u201d Emma said, trying to sound brave. They turned to look around. The walls were covered in strange symbols. \n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Jake pointed to an old, dusty table. \u201cThere might be clues!\u201d \n\nEmma hurried over, brushing off the dust. She picked up an old book. The cover was cracked, but the title was still readable: \u201cSecrets of the Mansion.\u201d \n\n\u201cThis could help us!\u201d she said, flipping through the pages. Suddenly, a shiny object caught her eye. \u201cJake, look!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nOn the table lay a small, golden key. \u201cDo you think it opens the door?\u201d Jake asked, his voice full of excitement.\n\n\u201cIt has to!\u201d Emma said, clutching the key tightly. \u201cLet\u2019s hurry!\u201d\n\nThey approached the door, their hearts pounding. Emma inserted the key into the lock, took a deep breath, and turned it. Click! \n\nBut as the door creaked open, the whispering grew louder. \u201cHelp us\u2026\u201d It sounded like a plea. \n\n\u201cOh no!\u201d Emma gasped. \u201cWhat if we\u2019re not alone?\u201d \n\nJust then, the door swung wide open, and a rush of wind blew through the room. Papers flew everywhere, swirling like a mini tornado. Jake laughed. \u201cThis is just like an adventure movie!\u201d\n\n\u201cStay focused!\u201d Emma shouted over the noise. They stepped inside the room, their hearts racing. \n\nInside, they found old toys, dusty books, and a chest. \u201cWe did it!\u201d Jake cheered. \u201cWe unlocked the secret room!\u201d \n\nThey began to search through the treasures. Each item held a story, a piece of the family mystery. Emma picked up a toy soldier. \u201cI wonder who owned this?\u201d \n\n\u201cI bet it belonged to a brave hero!\u201d Jake said, pretending to be a knight.\n\nThen, they heard the whisper one last time, \u201cThank you.\u201d Emma looked at Jake, her eyes wide. \u201cDid you hear that?\u201d \n\n\u201cYeah! This is getting cooler by the minute!\u201d Jake grinned. \n\nEmma smiled back. \u201cLet\u2019s keep finding clues. We\u2019re getting closer to solving this mystery!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith renewed energy, they began to explore the room, eager to uncover more secrets. \n\n\u201cWho knows what we\u2019ll find next?\u201d Emma said, her heart full of hope.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Emma and Jake find on the table in the secret room?","options":["A treasure map","A shiny key","A toy soldier","A broken clock"],"correct_answer":"A shiny key"},{"question":"What do they hear when they open the door?","options":["A loud bang","A sad whisper","A happy song","A friendly laugh"],"correct_answer":"A sad whisper"},{"question":"How does Jake feel about the adventure?","options":["Scared","Bored","Excited","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"},{"question":"What does Emma want to do with the items they find?","options":["Throw them away","Sell them","Explore the stories","Hide them"],"correct_answer":"Explore the stories"},{"question":"What is the main goal for Emma and Jake in this chapter?","options":["To play outside","To solve a mystery","To eat snacks","To go home"],"correct_answer":"To solve a mystery"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_270_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_270_ch4_img1.png","plot_270_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":432,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
