   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_270_7_10","title":"The Adventure of the Secret Room","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Locked Room","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"As the sun dipped behind the trees, shadows danced along the walls of the secret room. Emma and Jake stood wide-eyed, holding the golden key. \u201cThis is it!\u201d Emma said, her voice a whisper. \u201cWe\u2019re about to unlock the mystery!\u201d\n\n\u201cDo you think it will be spooky?\u201d Jake asked, bouncing on his toes. \u201cMaybe there are ghosts!\u201d He grinned, imagining friendly spirits.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find out!\u201d Emma said. She turned the key in the old lock. With a soft click, the door creaked open, revealing a room filled with dusty treasures. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe air smelled like old books and adventure. A large wooden chest sat in the corner. \u201cWhat\u2019s inside?\u201d Jake wondered aloud. Emma rushed over to the chest, excitement bubbling in her stomach.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s see!\u201d Emma pulled the heavy lid. It creaked and groaned, revealing an assortment of strange objects: an antique compass, a faded photograph, and a sparkling necklace. \u201cThese must be clues!\u201d she exclaimed.\n\n\u201cBut clues to what?\u201d Jake asked, his eyes shining with curiosity.\n\nEmma picked up the photograph. \u201cLook! It\u2019s our great-grandparents! They were standing in front of this mansion!\u201d Jake leaned closer, peering at the faces. \u201cThey look nice. Do you think they left us a treasure map?\u201d\n\n\u201cMaybe they wanted us to find something special,\u201d Emma said, a thoughtful frown on her face. \u201cBut how do we figure it out?\u201d\n\nJust then, they heard the whispering again. \u201cHelp us,\u201d it seemed to say. The siblings exchanged glances. \u201cIt\u2019s coming from that wall!\u201d Jake pointed.\n\nEmma bit her lip. \u201cMaybe it\u2019s another clue. We need to work together to solve this!\u201d\n\nJake nodded eagerly. \u201cOkay! Let\u2019s do it!\u201d They began to push against the wall, searching for a secret mechanism. \n\nSuddenly, a hidden panel slid open, revealing a tiny compartment. Inside was an old map, yellowed with age. \u201cLook at this!\u201d Emma shouted, holding it up triumphantly. \u201cIt shows more secret rooms!\u201d\n\n\u201cWow!\u201d Jake exclaimed. \u201cThis mansion is like a giant puzzle!\u201d They were both grinning now, their previous rivalry forgotten. They had become a team!\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s explore more,\u201d Emma said, her eyes sparkling with determination. \u201cTogether, we can uncover every mystery!\u201d\n\nAs they readied themselves for another adventure, the sun set completely, leaving the room glowing with the last rays of light. Their hearts raced with excitement and a little bit of fear. What other secrets awaited them in the mansion?\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cReady?\u201d Emma asked, looking at Jake.\n\n\u201cReady!\u201d he replied, bouncing again. Together, they stepped into the unknown, hand in hand.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Emma and Jake find in the secret room?","options":["A treasure map","An old bed","A spooky ghost","A book"],"correct_answer":"A treasure map"},{"question":"Who do the children see in the photograph?","options":["Their parents","Their great-grandparents","Mr. Gibbons","A ghost"],"correct_answer":"Their great-grandparents"},{"question":"What do Emma and Jake decide to do together?","options":["Fight","Leave the mansion","Work together to explore","Take a nap"],"correct_answer":"Work together to explore"},{"question":"What do they hear while in the secret room?","options":["A loud crash","A soft whisper","A song","A knock on the door"],"correct_answer":"A soft whisper"},{"question":"How do Emma and Jake feel at the end of the chapter?","options":["Scared","Bored","Excited","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"}]},"images":null,"word_count":429,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
