   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_270_11_14","title":"The Adventure of the Secret Room","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Locked Room","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"As the fire crackled and the shadows danced around them, Emma and Jake decided to make a plan. They had spent their evening flipping through dusty tomes in the mansion\u2019s library, but the whispers from the walls still echoed in Emma's mind. \u201cWe have to find out where that noise is coming from,\u201d she said, her eyes sparkling with determination. \n\nJake, clutching a flashlight, peered over his sister\u2019s shoulder at the old books. \u201cWhat if it\u2019s a ghost?\u201d he whispered, his voice barely above a breath. \u201cOr maybe a secret passageway! Like the ones in adventure films!\u201d\n\nEmma rolled her eyes, but a smile tugged at her lips. \u201cOr it could just be the wind. But either way, I want to check it out. You in?\u201d\n\n\u201cOf course!\u201d Jake exclaimed, bouncing on his toes. He had always admired Emma\u2019s courage, and the thought of discovering a real secret filled him with excitement.\n\nWith hearts racing and shadows flickering, they crept from the library into the dimly lit hallway. The walls seemed to close in around them, the air thick with mystery. \u201cYou know,\u201d Jake said, adjusting his grip on the flashlight, \u201cI think this mansion has been waiting for someone to uncover its secrets. Like us!\u201d\n\nEmma laughed softly. \u201cThat\u2019s a little dramatic, even for you, Jake. But I\u2019d love to think we\u2019re the ones destined to find something amazing.\u201d\n\nThey reached a narrow hallway where the whispers grew louder, swirling like the autumn leaves outside. \u201cIt\u2019s coming from there!\u201d Emma pointed toward an old door, its wood splintered and ancient, marked with strange carvings. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nJake stepped closer, intrigued. \u201cDo you think it\u2019s the door to the locked room?\u201d he asked, his eyes wide with wonder.\n\n\u201cOnly one way to find out!\u201d Emma replied, her fingers trembled slightly as she reached for the handle. It was ice-cold. She pulled, but the door didn\u2019t budge. \u201cIt\u2019s locked,\u201d she sighed, disappointment creeping in like the shadows around them.\n\n\u201cMaybe we can find a clue in the library,\u201d Jake suggested, his imagination already racing. \u201cWhat if there\u2019s something in one of the books that tells us how to open it?\u201d\n\nEmma nodded, feeling a renewed sense of purpose. \u201cLet\u2019s go back and look. But we need to hurry. I don\u2019t want to be here alone if those whispers get louder.\u201d \n\nAs they retraced their steps, the whispers became a low hum, echoing off the walls and creeping into their thoughts. Back in the library, they searched through the pages of old books, their fingers trembling with anticipation. \n\nSuddenly, Jake shouted, \u201cLook! This book has a drawing of the mansion!\u201d He pointed to a page showing a blueprint. \u201cAnd there\u2019s a note! It says something about a hidden lever in the main hall!\u201d\n\nExcitedly, Emma leaned over the book, her heart racing. \u201cThat could be what unlocks the door!\u201d \n\nBut just then, a loud creaking sound echoed through the mansion, followed by a crash. The lights flickered ominously, plunging them into darkness for a brief moment. \n\n\u201cDid you hear that?\u201d Jake whispered, his voice wavering.\n\n\u201cYes, and it came from the main hall,\u201d Emma replied, her eyes wide. \u201cWe need to see what that was!\u201d\n\nAs they gathered their courage, they exchanged a look filled with newfound determination. They were no longer just siblings on an adventure; they were detectives on the brink of uncovering a long-buried secret.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith their flashlight beam guiding them, they stepped into the unknown, ready for whatever mysteries the mansion had yet to reveal.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Emma and Jake hear that intrigues them?","options":["A ghost story","Whispers from the walls","A loud crash","A song from the library"],"correct_answer":"Whispers from the walls"},{"question":"What do Emma and Jake find in the library?","options":["A ghost","A locked door","A treasure map","An old coin"],"correct_answer":"A locked door"},{"question":"What is the purpose of the hidden lever mentioned in the book?","options":["To unlock a secret passage","To trap intruders","To make the lights flicker","To open a locked door"],"correct_answer":"To open a locked door"},{"question":"How does Jake feel about the adventure?","options":["Bored","Fearful","Excited","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"},{"question":"What happens at the end of the chapter?","options":["They leave the mansion","They find the treasure","They hear a loud crash","They solve the mystery"],"correct_answer":"They hear a loud crash"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_270_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_270_ch2_img1.png","plot_270_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":604,"reading_level":"Builder"}
