   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_270_11_14","title":"The Adventure of the Secret Room","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Locked Room","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"As night cloaked Windmere Mansion, the shadows danced ominously along the walls, whispering secrets only the brave dared to uncover. Emma and Jake huddled close to the flickering campfire, the crackling wood a comforting backdrop to their growing curiosity about the mansion. \u201cDid you hear that?\u201d Emma whispered, her eyes wide, scanning the room for the source of the faint echoes. \n\n\u201cWhat? The fire? It\u2019s just crackling,\u201d Jake replied, though he felt a shiver race down his spine. He had always believed in the impossible, but this place felt different\u2014alive with mystery. \n\n\u201cNo, not the fire! The whispers,\u201d Emma insisted, her tone urgent. \u201cIt\u2019s coming from the walls.\u201d\n\nThe flickering light illuminated the grand library, revealing towering shelves stacked high with dust-covered books. Each tome seemed to hold a story, and each shadow loomed with the promise of secrets. Emma\u2019s heart raced with excitement, but a twinge of trepidation held her back. \n\nJust then, Mr. Gibbons, the camp leader with his wild hair and equally wild stories, entered the room. \u201cAh, my curious campers! Ready for your next adventure?\u201d he exclaimed, a twinkle in his eye. \n\nEmma and Jake exchanged knowing glances. \u201cWe found a locked door,\u201d Emma blurted out. \n\n\u201cA locked door, you say?\u201d he mused, his voice lowering to a dramatic whisper. \u201cLegends say Windmere has many secrets, my dear explorers. Some are better left undiscovered\u2026\u201d \n\nJake\u2019s imagination soared. \u201cWhat if it leads to treasure?\u201d he asked, his eyes sparkling with excitement. \n\n\u201cOr danger,\u201d Emma countered, her brow furrowing. \n\nWith Mr. Gibbons\u2019s encouragement, they gathered their courage and decided to investigate. They retraced their steps to the library, where their discovery awaited. As they approached the door, Jake noticed a faint glimmer on the floorboards. \u201cEmma, look!\u201d he pointed. \n\nBending down, Emma brushed away the dust to reveal a small, ornate keyhole hidden behind a loose floorboard. \u201cWhat do you think it opens?\u201d she wondered aloud, her heart racing.\n\n\u201cIf we only had a key\u2026\u201d Jake mused, but before he could finish, a loud crash echoed through the mansion. The sound came from the dark hallway beyond the library, sending both siblings jumping back. \n\n\u201cWhat was that?\u201d Emma gasped, her pulse quickening.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but we have to check it out,\u201d Jake said, a mix of fear and thrill igniting his adventurous spirit. \n\n\u201cAre you serious? What if it\u2019s a ghost?\u201d Emma asked, fighting down her own fear. Yet, the allure of the hidden room pushed her forward. \n\n\u201cTogether,\u201d Jake reminded her, his voice steady. \u201cWe can face anything if we stick together.\u201d\n\nThey exchanged a determined glance before tiptoeing toward the hallway, the air thick with suspense. Suddenly, a gust of wind blew through the open window, rattling the panes and raising the hairs on the back of Emma\u2019s neck. \n\n\u201cDid you feel that?\u201d she whispered, her voice trembling.\n\nBefore Jake could respond, they heard another crash, louder this time, reverberating through the dark corridor. \u201cWe have to find out what\u2019s happening!\u201d Jake urged, gripping Emma\u2019s arm. \n\nTaking a deep breath, Emma nodded, and they stepped into the darkness, the shadows swirling around them like a living thing. Suddenly, they were engulfed in a world of secrets and peril, where every choice could lead to wonder or danger. \n\nAs they ventured further, an eerie glow caught their attention. They stumbled upon a strange mural on the wall, depicting a family tree with names they recognized\u2014names from their own family. And one branch led directly to the locked room. \n\n\u201cEmma, look! This must be our family!\u201d Jake exclaimed, pointing at the elaborately painted names. \n\n\u201cBut why does it lead to that room?\u201d Emma wondered, her mind racing. Just then, the ground beneath them trembled, and they exchanged terrified glances, the weight of the mansion's secrets pressing down on them. \n\nThey had stumbled upon something much bigger than they had imagined, and now they stood on the edge of a decision that could change everything. Should they continue into the unknown or retreat to safety? \n\nWith hearts pounding, they took a step closer to the glowing mural, unaware that the mansion was watching, waiting for their choice. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\nA dimly lit library filled with towering shelves of dusty books, shadows flickering in the candlelight. Emma stands with a determined look, pointing toward the mysterious locked door, while Jake looks on with wide-eyed wonder, a hint of fear etched on his face.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\nEmma and Jake in the dark hallway, illuminated by the glow from the strange mural on the wall. Emma\u2019s expression is a mix of curiosity and apprehension, while Jake points excitedly at the family tree, his eyes wide with discovery. The atmosphere is thick with suspense.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What discovery do Emma and Jake make in the library?","options":["A hidden treasure map","A locked door","A ghost","An old diary"],"correct_answer":"A locked door"},{"question":"What does Mr. Gibbons suggest about the mansion?","options":["It has many secrets","It is haunted","It is a safe place","It's a museum"],"correct_answer":"It has many secrets"},{"question":"What do Emma and Jake find that connects to their family?","options":["An old photograph","A family tree mural","A treasure chest","A secret diary"],"correct_answer":"A family tree mural"},{"question":"What do the siblings hear that raises the tension in the chapter?","options":["The sound of laughter","Whispers from the walls","A loud crash","Music playing"],"correct_answer":"A loud crash"},{"question":"What decision do Emma and Jake face at the end of the chapter?","options":["To leave the mansion","To explore the locked room","To return to camp","To find Mr. Gibbons"],"correct_answer":"To explore the locked room"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_270_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_270_ch3_img1.png","plot_270_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":795,"reading_level":"Builder"}
