   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_261_7_10","title":"The Vanishing Act","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Missing Person","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Mia loved the magic festival. This year, the town was full of bright tents and colorful balloons. The air buzzed with laughter and excitement. \n\n\"Look, Mia! There\u2019s a magician!\" shouted Zoe, her best friend. Zoe\u2019s eyes sparkled like the fairy lights hanging by the stage.\n\n\"Let\u2019s go see!\" Mia replied, pulling Zoe through the crowd. They jumped over a juggler's balls and dodged a dancing clown. \n\nThe stage was magnificent. A magician in a long coat waved his wand. \u201cWelcome to the magic festival!\u201d he boomed. \u201cPrepare to be amazed!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nMia and Zoe clapped as the magician made a rabbit appear from his hat. The crowd cheered, and the two friends shared an excited glance. \n\nSuddenly, Zoe whispered, \u201cI have to find the hidden clues! They say there are secrets in every corner!\u201d \n\nMia giggled. \u201cWhat secrets? You\u2019re always looking for something mysterious!\u201d\n\nZoe shrugged, her eyes shining. \u201cJust imagine if we find something magical!\u201d\n\nThe friends wandered through the festival. They passed colorful stalls filled with candy and toys. Mia pointed at a booth. \u201cLook! Magic cards!\u201d \n\nZoe grabbed one. \u201cLet\u2019s see if we can find a clue!\u201d But as Mia turned to grab a card too, she noticed something strange.\n\n\u201cZoe?\u201d Mia called, but her friend was nowhere to be seen. Panic bubbled in Mia\u2019s stomach. \u201cZoe! Where are you?\u201d\n\nShe searched through the crowd but only saw the magician waving his wand. Mia felt a lump in her throat. \u201cWhat if Zoe got lost?\u201d \n\nThen, she spotted something on the ground where Zoe had stood. It was a small, shiny object. Mia picked it up\u2014it was a keychain with a tiny magic wand! \u201cZoe must have dropped this!\u201d \n\nJust then, Mr. Finch, the quirky neighbor who lived next door, appeared. \u201cWhat\u2019s all this fuss about?\u201d he asked, adjusting his thick glasses. \n\n\u201cMy friend Zoe disappeared!\u201d Mia exclaimed. \u201cAnd she left this behind!\u201d \n\nMr. Finch squinted at the keychain. \u201cA wand? How peculiar! This could be a clue!\u201d \n\nMia\u2019s heart raced. \u201cDo you think Zoe is in trouble?\u201d \n\nMr. Finch scratched his head. \u201cWell, my dear, let\u2019s find out! All magic has a trick, and so does a mystery!\u201d \n\nMia nodded, determination shining in her eyes. They would solve this together. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s see if we can find more clues before the festival ends!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith that, Mia and Mr. Finch set off, searching for Zoe. What about the hidden secrets? Mia wondered. Were they really magical?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What festival do Mia and Zoe attend?","options":["Music Festival","Magic Festival","Food Festival","Art Festival"],"correct_answer":"Magic Festival"},{"question":"What does Zoe want to find at the festival?","options":["Candy","Hidden clues","Games","Animals"],"correct_answer":"Hidden clues"},{"question":"What does Mia find after Zoe disappears?","options":["A balloon","A keychain","A candy","A toy"],"correct_answer":"A keychain"},{"question":"Who helps Mia look for Zoe?","options":["Mr. Finch","The magician","A clown","A juggler"],"correct_answer":"Mr. Finch"},{"question":"What is Mia's feeling when Zoe disappears?","options":["Happy","Confused","Panicked","Excited"],"correct_answer":"Panicked"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_261_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_261_ch1_img1.png","plot_261_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":422,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
