   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_261_7_10","title":"The Vanishing Act","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Missing Person","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Mia and Mr. Finch hurried through the colorful tents at the magic festival. The air was filled with laughter and the smell of popcorn. \"Where do you think Zoe could be?\" Mia asked, her heart racing.\n\n\u201cI think we should head to the old oak tree,\u201d Mr. Finch suggested. \"It\u2019s the next clue in the riddle.\"\n\nMia nodded, gripping the golden key tightly in her hand. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d They weaved through the crowd, past jugglers and magicians, until they reached the old oak tree by the river. The tree was tall and wide, its branches swaying gently in the breeze.\n\nSuddenly, Mia spotted something shiny near the tree's roots. \u201cLook!\u201d she shouted, pointing. \u201cOver there!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nMr. Finch bent down to inspect what Mia found. It was a silver locket! \u201cThis must belong to Zoe!\u201d he exclaimed. \u201cIt\u2019s a clue!\u201d Mia opened it carefully. Inside, there was a tiny scroll. It read: \"From the shadows, find the light. In your heart, hold tight.\"\n\n\u201cWhat does that mean?\u201d Mia wondered aloud, scratching her head. \n\nMr. Finch adjusted his glasses. \u201cShadows and light... it sounds like a riddle. Perhaps it means we need to look for something hidden.\u201d\n\nJust then, a loud crash echoed through the festival. Mia jumped. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d \n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but we should check it out!\u201d Mr. Finch said, looking worried. They raced back toward the sound. \n\nAs they arrived, they saw a magician\u2019s stage. A crowd had gathered, eyes wide. \u201cLook!\u201d someone shouted. \u201cIt\u2019s a giant disappearing act!\u201d\n\nMia's breath caught in her throat. \u201cWhat if Zoe is part of this? We need to find her!\u201d They pushed through the crowd, but the stage was blocked. \n\nThen Mia saw a side door. \u201cWe can sneak in this way!\u201d she said, pulling Mr. Finch along. \n\n\u201cBe careful!\u201d he whispered. They slipped inside just as the curtain fell. \n\nThe backstage area was dark and mysterious. \u201cZoe?!\u201d Mia called. Her voice echoed. \n\nSuddenly, they heard a soft giggle. \u201cMia! Mr. Finch!\u201d It was Zoe! But then, a shadow darted past them, and the giggling stopped. \n\n\u201cWhat was that?\u201d Mia gasped. \n\nBefore they could react, the lights flickered and went out! \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nMia felt her heart pound. \u201cWe have to find Zoe before it\u2019s too late!\u201d \n\nBut where had the giggle gone? They were in the dark, and time was running out!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What clue do Mia and Mr. Finch find at the old oak tree?","options":["A golden key","A silver locket","A magic wand","A playing card"],"correct_answer":"A silver locket"},{"question":"What does the riddle inside the locket say?","options":["From the shadows, find the light.","Magic is real and so is Zoe.","The key is under the tree.","Follow the rainbow to the treasure."],"correct_answer":"From the shadows, find the light."},{"question":"What causes Mia to jump while at the oak tree?","options":["A loud crash","A sudden storm","A disappearing act","A magical spell"],"correct_answer":"A loud crash"},{"question":"Where do Mia and Mr. Finch sneak into?","options":["The magician's tent","The audience seats","Backstage","The main stage"],"correct_answer":"Backstage"},{"question":"What happens just as they spot Zoe?","options":["The lights go out","Zoe disappears again","A magician appears","A rabbit jumps out"],"correct_answer":"The lights go out"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_261_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_261_ch3_img1.png","plot_261_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":401,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
