   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_261_7_10","title":"The Vanishing Act","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Missing Person","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"The lights flickered back on, revealing a magical scene. Mia and Mr. Finch stood backstage, surrounded by shimmering costumes and colorful props. The air buzzed with excitement, though Mia felt a twinge of fear. \"What if Zoe is lost in here?\" she whispered.\n\nMr. Finch scratched his head, his eyes shining with curiosity. \"We must be brave, Mia! Let\u2019s look for more clues.\" They crept quietly through the backstage area. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, they heard a giggle. It sounded just like Zoe! \"Do you hear that, Mr. Finch?\" Mia's heart raced. \"It\u2019s coming from over there!\"\n\nThey rushed towards the sound. A curtain fluttered, and they peeked behind it. There was a small door with shiny stars painted on it. \"This must be it!\" Mia exclaimed. She grabbed the doorknob, but it wouldn\u2019t budge. \n\nMr. Finch pulled out a shiny, old key from his pocket. \"What if this key opens the door?\" he suggested. Mia's eyes widened with hope. \"Try it!\" \n\nWith a turn and a click, the door swung open. Bright light spilled into the room. Inside, they saw a shimmering mirror and a swirling cloud of sparkles. \"Is Zoe in there?\" Mia asked, her voice shaking with excitement.\n\nJust then, they heard more giggles. \"Mia! Mr. Finch, come in!\" It was Zoe! She was in the mirror, smiling and laughing. \"I found a magic trick! But you have to come closer to see it!\"\n\nMia felt a rush of joy. \"Zoe! We\u2019re coming!\" But as they stepped closer, the mirror began to shimmer and swirl. \"Wait! What\u2019s happening?\" Mr. Finch shouted. \n\nBefore they could react, the shimmering cloud pulled them into the mirror. They felt a whoosh, and suddenly, they were inside a colorful world of magic! \n\n\"Look at all the colors!\" Mia gasped. \"This is amazing!\" Zoe laughed, spinning in a circle. \"I knew you would find me!\" \n\nMia and Mr. Finch exchanged smiles, ready for their next adventure. But they still had to find a way to return home. \"What do we do now?\" Mia asked. \n\nZoe pointed to a glowing path. \"Follow me! I think the way back is down this road!\" \n\nWith hope in their hearts, they dashed down the path, ready to solve the next mystery.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Where do Mia and Mr. Finch find Zoe?","options":["In a mirror","In a box","Under a tent","At the river"],"correct_answer":"In a mirror"},{"question":"What does Mr. Finch use to open the small door?","options":["A shiny key","A magic wand","A crowbar","A flashlight"],"correct_answer":"A shiny key"},{"question":"What happens when they step closer to the mirror?","options":["They find more clues","They are pulled into the mirror","They wake up","They meet a magician"],"correct_answer":"They are pulled into the mirror"},{"question":"What does Zoe say when they find her?","options":["I want to go home","I found a magic trick","Help me!","Let's play a game"],"correct_answer":"I found a magic trick"},{"question":"What do they see when they enter the magical world?","options":["A dark forest","A colorful world","A quiet village","A scary monster"],"correct_answer":"A colorful world"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_261_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_261_ch4_img1.png","plot_261_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":378,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
