   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_261_7_10","title":"The Vanishing Act","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Missing Person","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Mia stood in front of the magical mirror, her heart racing. \"Zoe! Are you okay?\" she called. Zoe\u2019s face appeared in the glass, bright and smiling. \"I\u2019m fine, Mia! But we have to hurry!\"  \n\nThe world behind the mirror was full of colors. Bright pinks, blues, and yellows danced around them. Mia took a deep breath. \"What do we do next?\" she asked. Mr. Finch rubbed his chin, his eyes twinkling. \"Let\u2019s look for clues!\"  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]  \n\nThey stepped through the mirror together. Suddenly, they were in a bustling market filled with magicians and performers. A magician in a tall hat juggled sparkling balls. Mia laughed. \u201cLook at him go!\u201d  \n\n\"Stay focused!\" Mr. Finch reminded them. \"We need to find Zoe's next clue.\" They walked past colorful tents, each filled with wonders. Mia spotted a sign that read, \"Follow the Trail of Stars.\" \"That sounds like a clue!\" she exclaimed.  \n\nThey followed the sparkling trail. It twisted and turned, leading them to a giant star-shaped fountain. Water sparkled like diamonds in the sun. Zoe pointed excitedly. \"There's something shiny in the fountain!\"  \n\nMia leaned over and reached in. Her fingers brushed against a smooth, shiny object. \"It\u2019s a star pendant!\" she shouted. \"I think it belongs to you, Zoe!\"  \n\nZoe's face lit up. \"Yes! I wore it to the festival!\"  \n\nJust then, a shadow loomed behind them. \"Not so fast!\" a voice boomed. It was the magician from the market! He stepped forward, his eyes narrowed. \"You\u2019re not supposed to be here!\"  \n\nMia felt a chill. \"We\u2019re just trying to find our friend!\" she said bravely. Zoe nodded. \"Please, let us go!\"  \n\nThe magician frowned but then smiled. \"Very well. But you must solve my riddle first!\" He held out his hands, sparkling with magic. Mia and Zoe exchanged glances.  \n\n\"Okay, what\u2019s the riddle?\" Mia asked.  \n\nThe magician cleared his throat. \"I can be cracked, made, told, and played. What am I?\"  \n\nMia thought hard. \"A joke!\" she shouted. The magician clapped his hands. \"Correct! You may pass!\"  \n\nWith that, the shadows melted away, and the path opened. They rushed forward, hearts pounding with excitement. \"We did it!\" Zoe cheered.  \n\nBut as they ran, Mia felt the magic pull at her. \"We have to hurry back before the festival ends!\" She grasped Zoe\u2019s hand. \"Let\u2019s find our way home!\"  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]  \n\nTogether, they raced toward the exit, ready for whatever magic came next.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What clue do Mia and Zoe find in the fountain?","options":["A magic wand","A star pendant","A map","A coin"],"correct_answer":"A star pendant"},{"question":"What does the magician ask them to solve?","options":["A puzzle","A riddle","A game","A trick"],"correct_answer":"A riddle"},{"question":"What is the answer to the magician's riddle?","options":["A song","A joke","A riddle","A magic trick"],"correct_answer":"A joke"},{"question":"What do Mia and Zoe need to do as the festival ends?","options":["Find more clues","Return home","Help the magician","Dance at the festival"],"correct_answer":"Return home"},{"question":"Who helps Mia in her adventure?","options":["Her mom","Mr. Finch","A talking cat","The magician"],"correct_answer":"Mr. Finch"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_261_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_261_ch5_img1.png","plot_261_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":412,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
