   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_261_11_14","title":"The Vanishing Act","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Missing Person","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"The sun dipped low in the sky, casting a golden hue over the bustling festival grounds. Mia took a deep breath, absorbing the scents of caramel apples and popcorn intertwined with the faint smell of magic. Colorful tents fluttered in the breeze, and performers dazzled the crowd with their tricks. This was the same place where Zoe had vanished, and now, it felt like a labyrinth of mysteries.\n\n\u201cLook over there!\u201d Mr. Finch exclaimed, his wild hair bouncing as he pointed toward a tent adorned with shimmering fabrics. \u201cThat\u2019s the Enchanted Tent! They say it holds secrets.\u201d\n\nMia nodded, determination flooding her veins. She couldn\u2019t shake the feeling that Zoe had left something behind in that very spot. The pair made their way through the crowd, weaving past magicians and illusionists performing tricks that made Mia\u2019s heart race with anticipation.\n\nAs they reached the tent, a sign read, \u201cEnter at Your Own Risk!\u201d Mia shot Mr. Finch a nervous glance, but his eyes sparkled with excitement. \u201cCome on, Mia. We must see what awaits us inside.\u201d\n\nInside, the tent was dimly lit, with strings of fairy lights twinkling overhead. An air of mystery wrapped around them like a cozy blanket. Mia's heart pounded as she stepped forward, her eyes scanning the room. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cDo you see anything?\u201d Mr. Finch asked, his voice barely above a whisper.\n\n\u201cJust shadows\u2026 and a lot of glitter.\u201d Then, out of the corner of her eye, Mia spotted something\u2014a glimmer beneath a tablecloth. She crouched down, her fingers brushing against a small, silver pendant shaped like a star. \u201cMr. Finch! Look at this!\u201d\n\nHe rushed over, his excitement palpable. \u201cThat\u2019s no ordinary pendant! It looks like it could be part of a magical display.\u201d As he reached for it, a loud crash echoed from the back of the tent.\n\nMia jumped, clutching the pendant tightly. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d \n\nSuddenly, an illusionist burst through a curtain, eyes wide and wild. \u201cHelp! The Magic Mirror has gone rogue!\u201d he shouted, panic gripping his voice. \u201cIt\u2019s showing visions of the past and the future, and it keeps getting things wrong!\u201d\n\nMia exchanged a worried glance with Mr. Finch. \u201cThe Magic Mirror\u2026 could that be tied to Zoe's disappearance?\u201d\n\n\u201cPossibly,\u201d Mr. Finch said, his brow furrowing. \u201cMirrors can be portals to other worlds.\u201d\n\nWithout hesitating, Mia rushed toward the source of the noise. The mirror shimmered ominously in the corner, surrounded by a crowd of onlookers. As she drew closer, the mirror\u2019s surface rippled, revealing flashes of Zoe standing in a dark place, calling out for help.\n\n\u201cZoe!\u201d Mia yelled, her heart racing. The image flickered, and she could see Zoe\u2019s scarf fluttering in the wind\u2014a scarf she recognized from the festival. \u201cShe\u2019s close! We have to find her!\u201d\n\n\u201cWait!\u201d Mr. Finch cautioned, gripping her shoulder. \u201cWe must be careful. Mirrors can deceive.\u201d\n\nMia took a deep breath, her mind racing. She looked at the silver pendant in her hand and realized it matched the one around the mirror's frame. \u201cThis must be a key! It has to unlock something.\u201d\n\nWith newfound determination, she approached the mirror, ready to dive into the mystery, while the crowd gasped at the enchanting scene unfolding before them. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s hope this leads us to Zoe,\u201d Mia whispered, clutching the pendant tightly as the mirror shimmered and pulsed with a mysterious energy.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Mia discover in the Enchanted Tent?","options":["A magic wand","A silver pendant","A hidden door","A treasure map"],"correct_answer":"A silver pendant"},{"question":"What causes chaos in the tent?","options":["A fire","A rogue Magic Mirror","A disappearing act","A magician's mistake"],"correct_answer":"A rogue Magic Mirror"},{"question":"What does the mirror show Mia?","options":["A reflection of herself","Zoe in distress","Mr. Finch's past","A hidden clue"],"correct_answer":"Zoe in distress"},{"question":"What does Mr. Finch warn Mia about mirrors?","options":["They are magical","They can lie","They are portals","They are dangerous"],"correct_answer":"They can lie"},{"question":"What motivates Mia to confront the mirror?","options":["Her curiosity","The pendant","Zoe's vision","Mr. Finch's encouragement"],"correct_answer":"Zoe's vision"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_261_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_261_ch5_img1.png","plot_261_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":572,"reading_level":"Builder"}
