   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_262_7_10","title":"The Secret of Pine Hollow","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Missing Person","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Oliver, Lily, and Jake walked deeper into Pine Hollow. The trees towered over them, their leaves whispering secrets. \"I can\u2019t believe Clara was here,\" Oliver said, clutching the bracelet. It sparkled in the dappled sunlight.\n\nSuddenly, a rustling sound came from behind a bush. \"Did you hear that?\" Lily whispered. Oliver nodded, his heart racing. \u201cWhat if it\u2019s a monster?\u201d\n\n\u201cOr a friendly creature!\u201d Jake said, trying to sound brave. \u201cLet\u2019s find out!\u201d\n\nThey tiptoed closer to the bush. As they peeked behind it, a cute, fluffy creature with big eyes stared back at them. It had long ears and a tiny nose. \u201cHello!\u201d it squeaked. \u201cI\u2019m Pip! What are you doing in my woods?\u201d\n\nOliver felt a mix of surprise and relief. \u201cWe\u2019re looking for my sister, Clara.\u201d\n\nPip\u2019s ears perked up. \u201cI saw her! She was following a shimmering light. It led toward the ancient tree!\u201d\n\n\u201cCan you show us?\u201d Oliver asked eagerly.\n\nPip nodded. \"But beware! The path is tricky. You\u2019ll need to be brave!\u201d\n\nJust then, a loud snap echoed through the woods. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Jake exclaimed, wide-eyed.\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s just the forest talking,\u201d Pip said cheerfully. \u201cBut we must hurry!\u201d\n\nThey followed Pip down a narrow path, surrounded by tall grass and colorful flowers. Suddenly, the ground shook, and a huge rock tumbled down, blocking their way. \u201cOh no! What do we do?\u201d Lily cried.\n\n\u201cThere\u2019s another way!\u201d Pip said, pointing to a small gap in the bushes. \u201cBut it\u2019s dark and spooky.\u201d\n\nOliver took a deep breath. \u201cI can do this. For Clara!\u201d\n\nLily and Jake nodded, their eyes shining with determination. Together, they squeezed through the gap. On the other side, they found a hidden glade with glowing mushrooms all around. \u201cWow!\u201d Jake said, amazed.\n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Oliver pointed ahead. A faint, shimmering light flickered in the distance. \u201cThat must be the light Clara followed!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nPip smiled. \u201cThat\u2019s it! But we need to be careful. The woods are full of surprises.\u201d\n\nThe group crept closer to the light, their hearts racing. Suddenly, a shadow passed over them. It was large and dark. They all froze, holding their breath.\n\n\u201cWhat if it\u2019s dangerous?\u201d Lily whispered, trembling.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know,\u201d Oliver said quietly. \u201cBut we have to find Clara!\u201d\n\nWith courage in their hearts, they stepped forward into the unknown. The adventure was just beginning.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What creature do Oliver and his friends meet?","options":["A dragon","A puppy","A fluffy creature named Pip","A bear"],"correct_answer":"A fluffy creature named Pip"},{"question":"Where did Clara go?","options":["To the city","To the park","Following a shimmering light","Into a cave"],"correct_answer":"Following a shimmering light"},{"question":"What blocks their path?","options":["A big tree","A large rock","A river","A bunch of flowers"],"correct_answer":"A large rock"},{"question":"What do they find in the hidden glade?","options":["Fireflies","Glowing mushrooms","A treasure chest","A waterfall"],"correct_answer":"Glowing mushrooms"},{"question":"What do the characters feel when they see the shadow?","options":["Excited","Brave","Nervous","Happy"],"correct_answer":"Nervous"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_262_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_262_ch2_img1.png","plot_262_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":406,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
