   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_262_7_10","title":"The Secret of Pine Hollow","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Missing Person","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"The ground shook again, making Oliver's heart race. \"What if we fall?\" he cried. Jake grabbed his arm. \"We won't! We have to keep moving!\"\n\nLily pointed to the trees. \"Look! That big oak tree has a face!\" It did! The tree's bark twisted into eyes and a smile. \"Hello, young adventurers!\" the tree boomed. \"I can help you find your sister, but you must solve my riddle first.\"\n\nOliver took a deep breath. \"What's the riddle?\"\n\nThe tree's smile grew wider. \"I have keys but open no locks. I have space but no room. I have you, but you can't see me. What am I?\"\n\nLily whispered, \"It must be a keyboard!\"\n\n\u201cGreat idea!\u201d Oliver said, feeling a spark of hope. \u201cLet\u2019s tell the tree!\u201d\n\nThe tree nodded. \"You are clever! The answer is indeed a keyboard. The path to your sister lies ahead, but beware of the shadows!\"\n\nAs the ground settled, the friends hurried past the tree. They followed a narrow path that twisted and turned. Suddenly, they heard a soft whimper. \"Do you hear that?\" Jake asked, stopping. \n\n\"I do!\" said Lily, her eyes wide. They approached a bush and peeked inside. There, they found a small creature with big, round eyes and fluffy ears. \"Please, help me!\" it squeaked. \"I lost my way, too!\"\n\nOliver knelt down. \"What\u2019s your name?\"\n\n\"I\u2019m Fizz! I was exploring when I got lost,\" the creature replied, trembling. \"I can help you find Clara!\"\n\n\u201cCan you really?\u201d Oliver asked, hopeful.\n\n\u201cAbsolutely! Follow me!\u201d Fizz hopped out, leading them deeper into the woods.\n\nAs they walked, the trees whispered secrets. Oliver felt a rush of courage. He was getting closer to Clara. But suddenly, the shadows danced around them. \u201cIt\u2019s getting dark!\u201d Jake exclaimed.\n\n\u201cStay close!\u201d Lily said, holding Oliver\u2019s hand tightly. Just then, Fizz squeaked loudly. \u201cThis way! We can hide in the cave!\u201d\n\nThe friends ducked into the cave just as the shadows loomed closer. Inside, it was warm and filled with sparkling stones. They took a moment to catch their breath.\n\n\u201cLook at these!\u201d Oliver said, picking up a glowing stone. \u201cThey\u2019re beautiful!\u201d\n\n\u201cMaybe they can help us find Clara!\u201d said Jake, lighting up with excitement. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s keep searching!\u201d Oliver declared, feeling braver than ever.\n\nOutside, the shadows crept away, leaving behind a faint glow from the cave. They knew they were one step closer to unlocking the secret of Pine Hollow.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] shows a magical clearing in Pine Hollow. The clearing is surrounded by tall, ancient trees, and in the center stands a giant oak tree with a friendly, smiling face carved into its bark. Oliver, Lily, Jake, and Fizz are gathered around, staring in awe at the tree. Bright colors fill the scene, with sunlight filtering through the leaves, creating a warm and enchanting atmosphere.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2] depicts the inside of the cave where Oliver, Lily, Jake, and Fizz are taking a breath after hiding from the shadows. The cave is filled with sparkling stones that glow in various colors. The friends look amazed and curious, holding the glowing stones as they explore. The mood is magical and hopeful, suggesting that they are on the right path to finding Clara.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does the tree ask Oliver and his friends to solve?","options":["A math problem","A riddle","A puzzle","A song"],"correct_answer":"A riddle"},{"question":"What does Fizz look like?","options":["A cat","A bird","A small creature with big eyes","A dog"],"correct_answer":"A small creature with big eyes"},{"question":"What do the friends find in the cave?","options":["A treasure chest","Glowing stones","A scary monster","A map"],"correct_answer":"Glowing stones"},{"question":"What feeling do Oliver and his friends have as they explore the cave?","options":["Excitement","Fear","Anger","Sadness"],"correct_answer":"Excitement"},{"question":"What do the shadows do when the friends hide in the cave?","options":["They disappear","They come closer","They sing","They dance"],"correct_answer":"They disappear"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_262_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_262_ch4_img1.png","plot_262_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":546,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
