   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_262_7_10","title":"The Secret of Pine Hollow","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Missing Person","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"The next day, Oliver, Lily, Jake, and Fizz stood at the entrance of the cave. The glowing stones sparkled around them like little stars. \u201cWhat do you think they mean?\u201d Oliver asked, feeling excited.\n\n\u201cI think they might show us the way!\u201d Fizz chirped, fluttering his tiny wings. \u201cLet\u2019s follow the glow!\u201d \n\n\u201cGood idea!\u201d Jake said, his eyes bright. They took a step forward, and the stones shone even brighter.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they moved deeper into the cave, the walls glimmered with strange symbols. \u201cWhat are those?\u201d Lily wondered. \u201cThey look like letters!\u201d \n\nOliver squinted. \u201cI think they\u2019re clues! Maybe they can help us find Clara!\u201d The friends gathered around the walls, tracing the symbols with their fingers.\n\n\u201cAll together now!\u201d Oliver said, feeling brave. \u201cLet\u2019s read them!\u201d They read out loud, \u201cFollow the light where shadows dance, through the trees, take a chance.\u201d\n\n\u201cThat sounds like an adventure!\u201d Jake exclaimed, clapping his hands.\n\nSuddenly, a loud rustling echoed through the cave. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Lily gasped, her eyes wide. They all turned to see a shadowy figure at the entrance.\n\n\u201cStay together!\u201d Fizz squeaked. The figure stepped forward, revealing itself to be a friendly deer with shimmering antlers. \u201cI\u2019m Soren,\u201d the deer said softly. \u201cI\u2019ve been watching over the woods. Clara is in trouble. You must hurry!\u201d\n\n\u201cTrouble?\u201d Oliver repeated, his heart racing. \u201cWhere is she?\u201d\n\n\u201cShe wandered too far. Follow me, quickly!\u201d Soren turned and dashed into the shadows, glowing stones lighting the way. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Jake shouted, and they all ran after Soren. The cave grew brighter, and Oliver felt his fears start to melt away. He knew they were getting closer.\n\nAs they reached the cave\u2019s exit, Oliver took a deep breath. \u201cWe\u2019ll find Clara,\u201d he promised. \u201cWe\u2019re brave together!\u201d\n\nLily smiled, her spirit lifting. \u201cAnd we have Soren as a friend!\u201d\n\n\u201cOnward to Pine Hollow!\u201d Fizz cheered, fluttering above them.\n\nWith renewed hope, the group stepped out into the magical woods, ready to uncover the next clue that would lead them to Clara.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Oliver and his friends find in the cave?","options":["A treasure chest","Glowing stones","A hidden door","A scary monster"],"correct_answer":"Glowing stones"},{"question":"Who did the group meet in the cave?","options":["A talking tree","A friendly deer","A magical creature","A shadowy figure"],"correct_answer":"A friendly deer"},{"question":"What did the glowing stones do?","options":["They sang songs","They glowed brighter as they walked","They told stories","They led the way"],"correct_answer":"They led the way"},{"question":"What did Oliver promise his friends?","options":["To give up on finding Clara","That they would find Clara together","To go home","To be scared"],"correct_answer":"That they would find Clara together"},{"question":"What is the main goal of Oliver and his friends?","options":["To explore the woods","To find Clara","To collect stones","To scare away creatures"],"correct_answer":"To find Clara"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_262_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_262_ch5_img1.png","plot_262_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":348,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
