   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_262_11_14","title":"The Secret of Pine Hollow","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Missing Person","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"As Oliver picked himself up from the damp ground, the chill of the air wrapped around him like a shroud. Pine Hollow woods whispered secrets in the rustling leaves, but all he could think about was Clara. The locket he found lay cool against his palm, its silver surface shimmering under the faint light filtering through the thick branches above. \u201cI have to find her,\u201d he murmured, determination mixing with panic.\n\n\u201cOliver! Are you okay?\u201d Jake\u2019s voice echoed through the trees, sounding distant yet familiar.\n\n\u201cYeah, just... I fell.\u201d Oliver dusted off his clothes, trying to mask the fear that bubbled within. Panic surged as he realized he was completely alone. \u201cGuys?\u201d he called out, his voice trembling slightly. There was no answer.\n\nThe pit he had fallen into was hidden by overgrown ferns, and the walls were steep, glistening with damp moss. He took a moment to think, letting the sounds of the forest fill his ears. Suddenly, a soft rustling nearby caught his attention. Oliver squinted into the shadows, his heart racing. \u201cClara?\u201d he whispered, hope flickering within him.\n\nThen, a flicker of movement caught his eye. From behind a thick tree trunk, Nibbles appeared, his eyes wide and glimmering like small lanterns in the dark. \u201cYou need to hurry!\u201d Nibbles said, his tiny voice filled with urgency. \u201cYour friends are in trouble!\u201d\n\nOliver's heart sank. \u201cWhat do you mean? Where are they?\u201d He felt a surge of adrenaline. He couldn\u2019t stay here in the pit any longer; he needed to find Jake and Lily. \n\n\u201cFollow me!\u201d Nibbles darted off, and Oliver scrambled to his feet, clambering up the sides of the pit with newfound resolve. As he reached the top, he spotted Nibbles disappearing between the trees.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nWith every step, the woods seemed to pulse with life. The trees stood tall like ancient giants, their gnarled branches stretching like arms, urging Oliver to move faster. He ran after Nibbles\u2019 flickering form, his mind racing with thoughts of Clara. The whispers of the woods seemed to echo her name, intertwining with the rustling leaves.\n\nSuddenly, a loud crash rang out through the forest, followed by Jake\u2019s frantic shout. \u201cOliver! Help!\u201d The urgency in Jake\u2019s voice sent a shiver down Oliver\u2019s spine. He sprinted toward the sound, heart pounding as he burst into a small clearing.\n\nThere, tangled in a thicket of brambles, were Jake and Lily, struggling to free themselves. \u201cWhat happened?\u201d Oliver gasped, rushing to their side.\n\n\u201cWe heard something strange\u2014like a low growl,\u201d Lily explained, her eyes wide with fear. \u201cAnd then the thorns just... grabbed us!\u201d\n\nNibbles hopped onto Oliver's shoulder, his tiny heart beating quickly. \u201cThere\u2019s no time! We have to get out of here!\u201d \n\nWith a burst of energy, Oliver began tearing at the brambles, while Jake helped from the other side. \u201cDon\u2019t worry, I\u2019ve got you!\u201d he said, his voice steady. Hope surged as he felt Lily loosen her grip on the thorny vines, and with a final tug, they pulled her free.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAs they regrouped, the growl rumbled again, closer this time, reverberating through the ground beneath their feet. Oliver\u2019s heart pounded in his chest, but he couldn\u2019t show fear. \u201cWe need to find Clara. She\u2019s out there somewhere!\u201d he said, determination fueling his words.\n\nLily nodded, her face set with resolve. \u201cWe can\u2019t give up now, Oliver. We\u2019re stronger together.\u201d \n\nWith Nibbles leading the way, they plunged deeper into the forest, the mystery of Pine Hollow unfolding before them like a dark, enchanting tapestry. As they moved further, Oliver felt a flicker of hope. Clara was out there, and they would find her\u2014together.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Oliver find in the woods that belongs to Clara?","options":["A map","A locket","A note","A ring"],"correct_answer":"A locket"},{"question":"Who warns Oliver that his friends are in trouble?","options":["A bear","Nibbles","Clara","A tree"],"correct_answer":"Nibbles"},{"question":"What happens when Oliver, Jake, and Lily hear a strange growl?","options":["They run away","They investigate further","They get trapped in brambles","They find Clara"],"correct_answer":"They get trapped in brambles"},{"question":"What emotion primarily drives Oliver's actions throughout this chapter?","options":["Fear","Hope","Anger","Indifference"],"correct_answer":"Hope"},{"question":"What do Oliver and his friends decide to do at the end of the chapter?","options":["Give up","Search for food","Continue searching for Clara","Build a shelter"],"correct_answer":"Continue searching for Clara"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_262_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_262_ch4_img1.png","plot_262_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":622,"reading_level":"Builder"}
