   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_263_7_10","title":"The Case of the Lost Treasure","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Missing Person","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Ella, Sam, and Maya met in front of the school. The sun shined brightly as they gathered under the tall oak tree. \u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d Sam asked, scratching his head.\n\n\u201cI think we should look for more clues,\u201d Maya said, her eyes sparkling with excitement. \u201cMr. Lopez wouldn\u2019t just disappear!\u201d\n\nElla nodded. \u201cRight! The treasure hunt started with a clue. Let\u2019s check the school library. It\u2019s full of history!\u201d\n\nThey rushed to the library. Dust motes danced in the sunlight streaming through the windows. Rows of books lined the shelves. \u201cLook!\u201d Maya pointed to a book about hidden treasures.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cMaybe there\u2019s something inside,\u201d Ella suggested, pulling the book from the shelf. It felt heavy and mysterious. They opened it together. Inside, they found a folded piece of paper.\n\n\u201cIs this a clue?\u201d Sam asked as he unwrapped it carefully. The note read: \u201cBeneath the statue of a brave explorer, the next clue lies waiting.\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Maya said, already heading for the door. \u201cI know where that statue is!\u201d\n\nOutside, they raced to the town square. The statue of Captain Braveheart stood proudly with an eyepatch and a sword. \u201cHe looks cool!\u201d Sam exclaimed, but Ella frowned.\n\n\u201cFocus, Sam! We need to find the next clue!\u201d \n\nThey circled the statue, looking closely. Ella spotted a glint under Captain Braveheart's foot. \u201cThere!\u201d she shouted. \n\nAs she bent down, a man in a dark coat appeared. \u201cWhat are you kids doing?\u201d he asked with a narrow-eyed stare. \n\n\u201cUh, just looking at the statue!\u201d Sam said, stepping in front of Ella.\n\n\u201cYeah, just admiring,\u201d Maya added, feeling a shiver. The man frowned, then walked away.\n\n\u201cThat was weird,\u201d Sam said, crossing his arms. \u201cDo you think he knows something?\u201d\n\n\u201cMaybe he\u2019s after the treasure too!\u201d Ella whispered, her heart racing. They quickly dug under the statue. A small box emerged from the dirt. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nMaya opened it with excitement. Inside, they found a map! \u201cThis must lead us to the treasure!\u201d she exclaimed.\n\n\u201cOr to Mr. Lopez!\u201d Ella said, her voice filled with hope. They had to hurry. The treasure wasn\u2019t the only thing at stake.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s follow this map!\u201d Sam shouted, looking more determined than ever.\n\nWith a new challenge ahead, they set off, unsure of what lay in wait.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Where do Ella, Sam, and Maya go to look for clues?","options":["The school library","The playground","The gym","The cafeteria"],"correct_answer":"The school library"},{"question":"What do they find inside the book?","options":["A treasure map","A photograph","A folded paper","A drawing"],"correct_answer":"A folded paper"},{"question":"What does the clue mention?","options":["A hidden treasure","A brave explorer","A secret code","A treasure chest"],"correct_answer":"A brave explorer"},{"question":"What does the strange man do?","options":["Helps the kids","Walks away","Joins them","Takes the treasure"],"correct_answer":"Walks away"},{"question":"What do they find under the statue?","options":["A treasure chest","A box","A rock","A clue"],"correct_answer":"A box"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_263_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_263_ch2_img1.png","plot_263_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":391,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
