     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"ornate","1":"skeptical","2":"ventured","3":"revelations","4":"determination","image_prompts":["A cozy but dimly-lit library filled with tall shelves of colorful books. Ella, Sam, and Maya are gathered around an ornate, antique box open on a table, their expressions a mix of excitement and curiosity. Dust particles dance in the air, illuminated by a single beam of sunlight filtering through a window.","A dark, ominous room with cobwebs in the corners and a wooden table in the center. An old treasure map is spread out on the table, partially illuminated by a flickering light. The three friends stand in the doorway, their faces showing a mixture of determination and fear, peering into the unknown."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dim library filled with shelves of ancient books, light filtering through dusty windows casting a golden hue on a marble statue at the center. The statue is intricately carved, depicting a historical figure with a look of benevolence. Three teenagers stand in front of it, their expressions reflective and intense, with one girl running her fingers along the statues surface.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_263_ch4_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 17:55:44"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A darkened forest with twisted trees and long shadows stretching across the ground. Three silhouettes of teenagers stand at the forests edge, their faces filled with resolve and trepidation. The atmosphere is thick with tension, with a crow perched ominously on a branch, cawing as if warning them of the challenges that lie ahead.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_263_ch4_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 17:55:44"}}}
