     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"gnarled","1":"ornate","2":"trembling","3":"camaraderie","4":"unfurl","image_prompts":["A vibrant scene of Ella, Sam, and Maya gathered around a large, gnarled oak tree in Willow Creek Park, with sunlight dappling through the leaves. The characters show expressions of excitement and determination as they dig in the dirt, with the weathered map spread open before them, hinting at the adventure ahead.","A dramatic moment where Mr. Lopez stands before Ella, Sam, and Maya, revealing the treasure chest filled with gold coins and jewels. The background shows the shadowy figures of treasure hunters approaching, while the children's faces display a mix of awe and urgency, highlighting the tension and excitement of the discovery."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A moody, atmospheric scene of the old clock tower at sunset, casting long shadows over the courtyard. Ella stands at the forefront, her expression a blend of determination and vulnerability, with Sam and Maya in the background, engaged in discussion. The fading light creates a sense of urgency, symbolizing the passage of time in their quest.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_263_ch5_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 17:54:58"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing An intense moment within the old fort, where the group finds the locket. Mr. Lopez stands illuminated by a flashlight beam, his face a mix of relief and surprise. The surrounding darkness contrasts with the glimmer of the locket, representing the intersection of mystery and revelation. Tension hangs in the air as they process the unexpected turn of events.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_263_ch5_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 17:54:58"}}}
