   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_263_11_14","title":"The Case of the Lost Treasure","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Missing Person","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"It was a bright Monday morning at Willow Creek Middle School, and the hallways buzzed with excitement. Ella Thompson, an eleven-year-old with a wild mane of curly hair and bright green eyes, could hardly contain her enthusiasm. Today was the day her favorite history teacher, Mr. Lopez, promised a surprise. Rumors of a treasure hunt had spread like wildfire, igniting imaginations among the seventh graders.\n\n\u201cAre you sure it\u2019s real?\u201d Sam Martinez, the class skeptic, leaned against the lockers, arms crossed. His athletic frame was relaxed, but his brow furrowed with doubt. \u201cI mean, a treasure hunt? Sounds like something from a movie.\u201d\n\nElla rolled her eyes. \u201cCome on, Sam! It\u2019s Mr. Lopez! He loves history\u2014what better way to teach us than through a treasure hunt?\u201d She punched him lightly on the arm, her confidence shining through.\n\nMaya Patel, the tech-savvy genius of the group, joined them. \u201cI heard he\u2019s hiding clues around the historical landmarks in town,\u201d she said, her eyes sparkling with excitement. \u201cAnd I can use my phone to map out the locations! Imagine finding real treasure!\u201d\n\nElla\u2019s heart raced at the thought. She loved puzzles, and the idea of working together with her friends made her feel alive. Just then, the bell rang, and they hurried to class. \n\nAs they settled into their seats, Mr. Lopez entered the room, a broad smile stretching across his face. His brown hair, speckled with gray, matched his warm, inviting gaze. \u201cGood morning, class! Today, I have an announcement.\u201d The room fell silent, anticipation hanging in the air like the scent of freshly baked cookies. \u201cWe will embark on a treasure hunt to discover some hidden gems from our town's history!\u201d\n\nThe class erupted in cheers, but Sam remained skeptical. \u201cWhat if it\u2019s just a joke?\u201d he whispered to Maya, who shrugged, equally excited. \n\nMr. Lopez began to explain the rules, his voice steady and confident. \u201cYou\u2019ll be split into teams, and each team will follow a series of clues leading to different locations. But be warned\u2014there\u2019s a twist. I might not be the only one searching for the treasure.\u201d\n\nConfusion rippled through the class. \u201cWhat do you mean?\u201d Ella asked, her curiosity piqued.\n\n\u201cMore on that later!\u201d Mr. Lopez winked. \u201cNow, let\u2019s get to the fun part: the first clue!\u201d\n\nJust then, the lights flickered, and a loud bang echoed from the hallway. Conversations stopped abruptly. Mr. Lopez\u2019s expression shifted from excitement to concern. \u201cStay here!\u201d he commanded, rushing out of the classroom.\n\n\u201cDid you hear that?\u201d Sam\u2019s voice was barely above a whisper. The students exchanged worried glances. Something was off.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s follow him,\u201d Ella suggested, her heart pounding. The three friends exchanged glances, and without another word, they hurried after their teacher.\n\nAs they stepped into the hallway, they found it empty, the air thick with an unsettling silence. Maya pulled out her phone, ready to record. \u201cThis isn\u2019t normal,\u201d she muttered, her fingers shaking. \n\nSuddenly, a loud crash echoed from the teachers\u2019 lounge. The three friends exchanged a look of determination. They couldn\u2019t just stand by. They needed to find Mr. Lopez\u2014and fast.\n\nIn that moment, they knew they were more than just classmates; they were a team. Together, they would unravel the mystery of the missing treasure and their beloved teacher.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cWhat was that?\u201d Ella gasped, her heart racing as they moved cautiously toward the sound.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nSam turned to face them, his face pale. \u201cWe have to be careful,\u201d he said, determination etched across his features. \u201cIf something\u2019s happened to Mr. Lopez, we need to find him before it\u2019s too late.\u201d \n\nAnd with that, the adventure of their lives began.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What event is Mr. Lopez announcing?","options":["A test","A treasure hunt","A field trip","A sports day"],"correct_answer":"A treasure hunt"},{"question":"What is Sam's initial reaction to the treasure hunt?","options":["Excited","Skeptical","Indifferent","Confused"],"correct_answer":"Skeptical"},{"question":"What unexpected event occurs during Mr. Lopez's announcement?","options":["The fire alarm rings","A loud bang echoes","The lights go out","Someone shouts"],"correct_answer":"A loud bang echoes"},{"question":"What does Maya plan to do during the treasure hunt?","options":["Solve puzzles","Map out the locations","Lead the class","Make a video"],"correct_answer":"Map out the locations"},{"question":"How do Ella, Sam, and Maya feel about working together?","options":["Reluctant","Excited","Nervous","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_263_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_263_ch1_img1.png","plot_263_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":627,"reading_level":"Builder"}
