   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_263_11_14","title":"The Case of the Lost Treasure","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Missing Person","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Ella, Sam, and Maya stood in front of the old oak tree, its gnarled branches stretching toward the sky like skeletal fingers. The breeze rustled the leaves, creating a whisper that seemed to echo their excitement and anxiety. They had finally deciphered the clue from Mr. Lopez\u2019s journal, leading them here\u2014the heart of Willow Creek Park, a spot known for its hidden history and rumors of buried treasure.\n\n\u201cI can\u2019t believe we\u2019re actually doing this!\u201d Ella exclaimed, her eyes sparkling with determination. With a deep breath, she opened the weathered map, tracing the lines with her finger. \u201cAccording to this, we need to dig near the roots.\u201d \n\nSam, crossing his arms, looked skeptical. \u201cAnd what if we find nothing? Or worse, what if someone else beats us to it? Think about it; treasure hunters are everywhere.\u201d\n\nMaya, tapping away at her tablet, looked up and offered a reassuring smile. \u201cWe won\u2019t let that happen. We\u2019re a team. And besides, we have to find Mr. Lopez.\u201d Her voice was steady, but a hint of worry crept into her expression. \n\nWith a shared nod of resolve, the trio began to dig. The rich soil felt cool against their hands, but with each shovelful, their excitement grew. However, the further they dug, the more tension filled the air. A chilling thought crept into Ella's mind\u2014what if they were too late?\n\nSuddenly, as Sam thrust his shovel into the ground, a metallic clang echoed through the park, sending a shiver down their spines. \u201cDid you hear that?\u201d he shouted, his heart racing. \n\nElla and Maya exchanged wide-eyed glances, both feeling the pulse of adrenaline. \u201cIt has to be the treasure!\u201d Ella cried, her voice a mix of hope and fear.\n\nWith renewed vigor, they cleared the dirt frantically until they uncovered a rusty, old chest. It was small, but ornate, emblazoned with strange symbols that seemed to tell a story of their own. They shared another glance, this time filled with awe, before working together to lift the lid.\n\nAs it creaked open, [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] revealed a trove of shimmering gold coins, sparkling jewels, and an ancient scroll that unfurled like a secret waiting to be told. \u201cThis\u2026 this is incredible!\u201d Maya gasped, her hands trembling with excitement.\n\nBut before they could fully appreciate their discovery, they heard a rustling in the bushes nearby, and a shadowy figure emerged. The figure\u2019s face was obscured, but the glint of a familiar badge caught Ella\u2019s eye. \u201cWhat are you kids doing here?\u201d the figure demanded in a stern voice.\n\nWith a jolt, Ella recognized the voice. \u201cMr. Lopez!\u201d she exclaimed, relief flooding her.\n\nMr. Lopez stepped forward, his expression a blend of surprise and joy. \u201cI was hoping you\u2019d find this! But we need to leave quickly; we\u2019re not alone.\u201d \n\nThe trio exchanged puzzled looks, then turned to see a group of treasure hunters emerging from the trees, their eyes darting toward the chest. \u201cRun!\u201d Sam yelled, grabbing Maya\u2019s hand as they sprinted toward Mr. Lopez, who led them through the trees.\n\nBreathless, they finally reached the edge of the park, where Mr. Lopez halted, turning to face his students. \u201cYou risked everything to find me. I\u2019m proud of you. But this treasure is more than gold; it holds a part of our town\u2019s history.\u201d \n\nElla\u2019s heart swelled with pride. \u201cWe didn\u2019t just find treasure; we found you!\u201d\n\nWith a sense of accomplishment and camaraderie, the friends realized that together, they could overcome any obstacle. As they stood side by side, an unbreakable bond formed between them, a reminder that friendship and bravery were the true treasures of their adventure.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cNow, let\u2019s get this treasure back to the school and share its story,\u201d Mr. Lopez said with a twinkle in his eye, leading them away from danger and toward new beginnings.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Ella, Sam, and Maya find in the old oak tree?","options":["A diary","A treasure chest","A map","A clue"],"correct_answer":"A treasure chest"},{"question":"Who do the kids discover lurking in the bushes?","options":["A police officer","Mr. Lopez","A treasure hunter","A ghost"],"correct_answer":"Mr. Lopez"},{"question":"What emotion do the characters primarily feel when they uncover the treasure?","options":["Fear","Joy","Sadness","Anger"],"correct_answer":"Joy"},{"question":"What lesson do the characters learn through their adventure?","options":["To work alone","The importance of teamwork","To ignore history","To be afraid of treasure hunters"],"correct_answer":"The importance of teamwork"},{"question":"What does Mr. Lopez say about the treasure?","options":["It is worthless","It holds part of the town's history","It belongs to someone else","It should be hidden away"],"correct_answer":"It holds part of the town's history"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_263_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_263_ch5_img1.png","plot_263_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":654,"reading_level":"Builder"}
