   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_264_7_10","title":"The Whispers in the Wind","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Missing Person","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"The sun peeked through the tall trees, casting playful shadows on the forest floor. Leo took a deep breath, smelling pine and fresh earth. \"Tess, do you think we can find Grandma?\" he asked, glancing at his sister. \n\nTess was busy poking a stick into a pile of leaves. \"Of course! The wind will help us! Right, wind?\" She waved her arms dramatically. Leo chuckled. \"Uh-huh, just like in a fairy tale.\"\n\nAs they walked deeper into the forest, the whispering wind grew louder, swirling around them. \"Do you hear that?\" Leo asked, stopping in his tracks. \n\nTess nodded, her eyes wide. \"It's like the wind is talking to us!\" \n\n\"We have to follow it,\" Leo said, determination filling his voice. Just then, a strong gust of wind blew by, rustling the leaves. It felt almost like a gentle push. Leo followed the sound, and Tess hurried after him.\n\nSuddenly, they reached a small clearing. Bright flowers bloomed everywhere, and the wind danced through them, making the petals twirl. Leo smiled, feeling excited. \"This must be a magical place,\" he said. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nIn the center of the clearing stood a large, old tree. Its trunk was wide, and its branches spread like arms. Leo walked closer, feeling a strange warmth. \"What do you think is inside?\" he wondered aloud.\n\n\"I don\u2019t know! But it looks like a good place to hide something!\" Tess exclaimed, her adventurous spirit shining.\n\nJust then, they heard a soft whisper. \"Leo\u2026Tess\u2026\" It felt like Grandma Rose was calling them! The siblings exchanged glances, eyes wide with hope. \"Did you hear that?\" Leo whispered, his heart racing.\n\n\"I did! Let\u2019s see!\" Tess jumped, eager as always.\n\nThey stepped closer to the tree. Suddenly, a low rumble echoed through the ground. \"What was that?\" Tess squeaked, clutching Leo's arm. \n\n\"I don\u2019t know, but we need to be careful,\" Leo replied, a little nervous now. \n\nAs they reached the tree, a branch creaked loudly, and a small door appeared at its base! Leo gasped, \"Look, Tess! We have to see what\u2019s inside.\" \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nJust then, the wind picked up again, swirling leaves around them. \"It\u2019s getting stronger!\" Tess shouted, trying to keep her balance. \n\n\"Hold on tight!\" Leo yelled. What could be inside the tree? Was it a clue about Grandma? \n\nThey took a deep breath and pushed the door open together, hearts pounding with excitement and fear. \n\n\"Are you ready?\" Leo asked. \n\nTess nodded, her eyes sparkling with curiosity. \"Let\u2019s go!\"","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Leo and Tess hear in the forest?","options":["A bird singing","Their grandma calling","A thunderstorm","A dog barking"],"correct_answer":"Their grandma calling"},{"question":"What do the siblings find in the clearing?","options":["A picnic table","A magical tree","A river","A tent"],"correct_answer":"A magical tree"},{"question":"How does Tess feel about the adventure?","options":["Bored","Nervous","Excited","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"},{"question":"What happens when they get close to the tree?","options":["The tree glows","A storm begins","A door appears","They find a treasure"],"correct_answer":"A door appears"},{"question":"What does Leo want to do at the end of the chapter?","options":["Run away","Climb the tree","Open the door","Play a game"],"correct_answer":"Open the door"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_264_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_264_ch2_img1.png","plot_264_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":423,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
