   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_264_7_10","title":"The Whispers in the Wind","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Missing Person","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"The sunlight peeked through the tall trees as Leo and Tess stood at the edge of the magical clearing. The gentle rustling of leaves filled the air, and the whispers grew clearer. \u201cWe have to find Grandma Rose, Tess!\u201d Leo said, glancing around. \u201cDo you hear that?\u201d\n\n\u201cI do!\u201d Tess replied, bouncing on her toes. \u201cIt\u2019s like the wind is talking! Where do we go?\u201d\n\nSuddenly, they noticed a large tree at the center of the clearing. Its trunk was wide and gnarled, and at its base was a small, wooden door. Leo knelt down to inspect it. \u201cLook, Tess! A door! What do you think it leads to?\u201d\n\n\u201cMaybe it\u2019s a secret treasure!\u201d Tess exclaimed, her eyes gleaming.\n\n\u201cOr maybe it\u2019s a way to find Grandma,\u201d Leo said seriously. He felt a flutter in his stomach. They had to know what was inside.\n\nAs Leo reached for the door, a strong gust of wind rushed through the clearing. \u201cHold on tight!\u201d Tess squealed, her hair blowing everywhere. The whispers grew louder, swirling around them like a dance. \u201cLeo! I think we should open it!\u201d\n\nWith a deep breath, Leo turned the handle. The door creaked open, revealing a dark tunnel. \u201cIt\u2019s going to be okay,\u201d he told Tess, but his heart raced. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d\n\nThey stepped into the tunnel, and the door slammed shut behind them. The darkness enveloped them, but then the whispers turned into soft giggles. \u201cWhat is that?\u201d Tess shivered.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but we have to keep moving,\u201d Leo said bravely. Just then, they stumbled into a small room filled with glowing crystals. The light flickered, casting colorful shadows on the walls.\n\n\u201cWow! Look at all the colors!\u201d Tess squealed, her fear forgotten for a moment. \u201cIt\u2019s like a rainbow in here!\u201d\n\nLeo marveled at the crystals, but his mind was racing. \u201cDo you think Grandma is here?\u201d he asked, searching the room. Just then, a crystal on the ground shimmered brightly and a soft voice floated through the air. \u201cFollow the whispers, dear ones. Find the truth.\u201d\n\nAt that moment, the giggles turned into loud laughter, echoing around them. \u201cTess, we need to go!\u201d Leo said, pulling her hand. They raced back to the door, but it wouldn\u2019t budge. \u201cOh no! We\u2019re trapped!\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat do we do?\u201d Tess asked, her eyes wide with fear. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s listen to the whispers again,\u201d Leo suggested. \u201cMaybe they can help us.\u201d They both closed their eyes, focusing on the strange sounds around them. \n\n\u201cQuick! We need to decide! Should we knock or call for help?\u201d Leo shouted. Just then, the laughter grew louder, and the whispers became urgent. \u201cMake a choice, hurry!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Leo and Tess find in the magical clearing?","options":["A treasure chest","A large tree with a door","A group of animals","A hidden pond"],"correct_answer":"A large tree with a door"},{"question":"What happens when they open the door?","options":["They see Grandma Rose","They enter a dark tunnel","They find a map","They meet a wizard"],"correct_answer":"They enter a dark tunnel"},{"question":"What do they find inside the tunnel?","options":["A spooky ghost","Glowing crystals","A giant spider","A treasure map"],"correct_answer":"Glowing crystals"},{"question":"What do the whispers tell Leo and Tess?","options":["To leave immediately","To find a treasure","To follow the whispers and find the truth","To call for help"],"correct_answer":"To follow the whispers and find the truth"},{"question":"What major decision do Leo and Tess have to make?","options":["Whether to knock or call for help","Whether to go back outside","Whether to split up","Whether to stay in the dark"],"correct_answer":"Whether to knock or call for help"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_264_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_264_ch3_img1.png","plot_264_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":458,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
