   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_264_7_10","title":"The Whispers in the Wind","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Missing Person","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"The tunnel shimmered with bright crystals. Leo and Tess stood together, holding hands tightly. \u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d Tess whispered, her eyes wide with wonder.\n\n\u201cI think we need to follow the whispers again,\u201d Leo said, hoping the wind would help them. He took a deep breath and listened carefully. The soft whispers danced around them like a gentle breeze.\n\nSuddenly, a gust of wind swirled through the tunnel, making the crystals sparkle even more. \u201cLook! It\u2019s pointing that way!\u201d Tess exclaimed, pointing to a path that opened up ahead. \n\nThe siblings moved forward, following the whispers. The air felt warm and inviting. \u201cI hope we find Grandma Rose soon!\u201d Tess said, bouncing on her toes.\n\nJust then, they reached a small chamber filled with glowing blue crystals. \u201cWow! This place is magical!\u201d Leo marveled. He stepped closer to touch one of the crystals. It felt smooth and cool under his fingers.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cLeo! Look at that!\u201d Tess pointed across the chamber. On a stone pedestal stood an old, dusty book. Its cover was covered in vines. \u201cShould we open it?\u201d she asked, her eyes sparkling with excitement.\n\n\u201cYes, but let\u2019s be careful,\u201d Leo replied. He approached the book slowly. With a gentle tug, he opened it. Pages fluttered like butterflies. \u201cI think it\u2019s a journal!\u201d he said, reading the words out loud. \u201cThis belonged to Grandma Rose!\u201d\n\nTess leaned in closer. \u201cWhat does it say?\u201d \n\n\u201cIt talks about the forest\u2026 and the whispers,\u201d Leo replied with a smile. \u201cGrandma Rose wrote about her adventures here when she was young!\u201d\n\nThe whispers grew louder and clearer. Leo felt a wave of hope wash over him. \u201cThis could lead us to her!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s keep reading!\u201d Tess urged, her eyes bright with excitement.\n\nAs they flipped through the pages, they saw sketches of magical creatures and hidden paths. Each picture told a story of adventure. They were learning more about their grandmother\u2019s secret life. \n\n\u201cThis is amazing!\u201d Tess squealed. \n\n\u201cYeah! Look! Here\u2019s a map!\u201d Leo pointed. It showed a path leading deeper into the forest. \u201cIf we follow this, we might find her!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Tess cheered, bouncing on her feet. They closed the book and tucked it under Leo\u2019s arm. With renewed energy, they left the chamber, ready for the next part of their adventure. \n\nAs they stepped back into the tunnel, the wind whispered, guiding them forward. \u201cWe\u2019re getting closer!\u201d Leo said, feeling brave. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith each step, they could almost hear Grandma Rose\u2019s laughter in the distance. The adventure was only beginning!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Leo and Tess find in the chamber?","options":["A glowing crystal","An old journal","A treasure chest","A magical door"],"correct_answer":"An old journal"},{"question":"What does the journal talk about?","options":["A recipe","Grandma's adventures","A fairy tale","A secret code"],"correct_answer":"Grandma's adventures"},{"question":"What did Leo hope the whispers would help them find?","options":["A map","Their parents","Grandma Rose","A picnic spot"],"correct_answer":"Grandma Rose"},{"question":"What did the whispers seem to guide Leo and Tess toward?","options":["A hidden treasure","A magical portal","A path deeper into the forest","A campsite"],"correct_answer":"A path deeper into the forest"},{"question":"How did Tess feel when they found the journal?","options":["Scared","Bored","Excited","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_264_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_264_ch4_img1.png","plot_264_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":436,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
