   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_264_7_10","title":"The Whispers in the Wind","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Missing Person","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"The tunnel was dark and cool. Leo held the glowing journal close. Tess stood beside him, her eyes wide with wonder. \u201cDo you think Grandma is close?\u201d she asked, her voice a whisper.\n\n\u201cI hope so,\u201d Leo replied. \u201cLet\u2019s follow the map. It shows a path to the Whispering Glen.\u201d \n\nThey stepped deeper into the tunnel, and the whispers grew louder. \u201cListen!\u201d Leo said, tilting his head. The wind seemed to call their names, swirling around them like a soft song.\n\nSuddenly, they reached a wooden door. It was painted bright green, with flowers carved all over. \u201cThis must lead to the Glen!\u201d Tess exclaimed, bouncing on her feet. \u201cLet\u2019s see what\u2019s on the other side!\u201d\n\nLeo pushed the door open. A burst of sunlight flooded in, brightening the space. They stepped outside, and their eyes widened in amazement. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nBefore them stretched the Whispering Glen. Tall trees surrounded a sparkling pond, and colorful flowers danced in the breeze. The whispers in the wind sang even louder here, like a gentle choir. \n\n\u201cWow!\u201d Tess shouted. \u201cIt\u2019s beautiful! Is Grandma here?\u201d\n\nLeo took a deep breath. \u201cWe need to look for clues,\u201d he said. They walked around the pond, scanning the ground. Suddenly, Leo spotted something shiny near a bush. \u201cLook, Tess!\u201d he called. He rushed over and picked up a silver locket. \n\n\u201cIt\u2019s Grandma\u2019s!\u201d Tess cried. \u201cWhat does it say?\u201d \n\nLeo opened it carefully. Inside was a picture of Grandma Rose and a note that read, \u201cTrust the whispers of the wind.\u201d \n\n\u201cWhat does that mean?\u201d Tess asked, tilting her head.\n\n\u201cI think it means we should listen closely,\u201d Leo said. \u201cLet\u2019s follow the whispers to find her.\u201d \n\nThey closed their eyes, focusing on the sound around them. The wind swirled like a gentle breeze, guiding them past the pond. \u201cThis way!\u201d Leo shouted, pointing to a path leading into the trees.\n\nThey ran, excitement bubbling inside them. The whispers seemed to grow stronger as they ventured deeper. Suddenly, they heard someone calling their names! \u201cLeo! Tess!\u201d\n\n\u201cGrandma!\u201d they shouted together. \n\nThey rushed toward the sound, hearts racing. The whispers led them to a clearing filled with sunlight. And there, sitting on a log, was Grandma Rose!\n\n\u201cLeo! Tess! You found me!\u201d she exclaimed, her eyes sparkling with joy. \n\nTess jumped into Grandma\u2019s arms. \u201cWe were so worried!\u201d\n\n\u201cI\u2019m sorry for disappearing,\u201d Grandma said. \u201cI was following the whispers, too. They were leading me to discover something special.\u201d\n\nLeo smiled. \u201cWhat did you find?\u201d\n\nGrandma chuckled. \u201cThe magic of this forest. And the magic of family.\u201d \n\nThey all hugged tightly, feeling relief wash over them. The whispers in the wind had brought them back together. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAs they sat on the log, Grandma told them stories about the forest. Leo and Tess listened, aware that the adventure had changed them. They learned that sometimes, listening to the world around them can lead to wonderful surprises.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s promise to explore more together,\u201d Leo said, grinning.\n\n\u201cAbsolutely!\u201d Grandma laughed. \u201cThe forest is full of secrets. And we will uncover them, one whisper at a time.\u201d","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Leo and Tess find in the Whispering Glen?","options":["A treasure chest","Grandma Rose","A hidden map","A magical creature"],"correct_answer":"Grandma Rose"},{"question":"What is the Whispering Glen full of?","options":["Snow","Danger","Secrets","Monsters"],"correct_answer":"Secrets"},{"question":"What did the silver locket contain?","options":["A treasure","A picture and a note","A key","A flower"],"correct_answer":"A picture and a note"},{"question":"What did Grandma Rose say about the whispers?","options":["They are scary","They lead you to danger","They hold magic","They should be ignored"],"correct_answer":"They hold magic"},{"question":"What did Leo promise at the end of the chapter?","options":["To leave the forest","To explore together","To never return","To stay quiet"],"correct_answer":"To explore together"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_264_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_264_ch5_img1.png","plot_264_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":525,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
