     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"clearing","1":"whispers","2":"glistening","3":"determination","4":"mysterious","image_prompts":["A serene forest clearing with a large oak tree in the center, its gnarled branches reaching outwards. The sun sets, casting golden light through the leaves, while two children\u2014an older boy and a younger girl\u2014stand in awe, looking at the tree and the surrounding whispering wind. Their expressions show a mix of curiosity and adventure.","A shadowy figure resembling a woman, partially obscured by the trees, with a gentle but urgent expression. The wind swirls around her, creating an ethereal atmosphere. Leo and Tess stand in the foreground, their faces a mix of fear and hope as they grasp the charm bracelet, hinting at the emotional weight of the moment."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A serene forest at twilight, with towering trees casting long shadows. In the foreground, Leo and Tess stand together, their expressions a mix of curiosity and apprehension. The wind rustles the leaves above, creating a sense of anticipation. The atmosphere is imbued with a mystical quality, hinting at the secrets that lie within the woods.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_264_ch5_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 17:50:28"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A magical glade illuminated by a soft, silvery light, with Grandma Rose standing at its center. She has a gentle smile, her eyes reflecting wisdom and warmth. Leo and Tess approach her, expressions of joy and relief on their faces. The surrounding wildflowers glow subtly, enhancing the enchanting atmosphere, while the whispering wind swirls around them, symbolizing connection and discovery.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_264_ch5_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 17:50:28"}}}
