       [DEBUG] Checking shared image: {"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A serene forest clearing with sunlight filtering through the leaves, illuminating a bubbling stream. Leo, a 13-year-old boy with a thoughtful expression, kneels beside the water while Tess, his 8-year-old sister, stands beside him with a curious look, her ponytail bouncing as she gazes at the wildflowers swaying gently in the breeze. The mood is peaceful but tinged with an underlying tension, hinting at the mystery that lies ahead.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_264_ch3_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 17:52:33"}
