   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_265_7_10","title":"The Hidden Clue","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Missing Person","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Ava and Lily stood in the library, the smell of old books surrounding them. Sunlight streamed through the tall windows. The library felt like a treasure chest, filled with stories waiting to be explored. \n\n\u201cWhat do you think this key opens?\u201d Ava asked, holding the shiny key up to the light. It sparkled like a star.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but it must be important!\u201d Lily said, her eyes wide with excitement. \u201cLet\u2019s look at the journal again.\u201d\n\nThey sat at a big wooden table. The journal lay open, pages filled with Ben\u2019s neat handwriting. Some pages had strange drawings. \u201cLook at this!\u201d Ava pointed to a sketch of the school\u2019s old basement.\n\n\u201cMaybe Ben went there!\u201d Lily exclaimed. \u201cWe have to check it out.\u201d\n\nJust then, they heard footsteps. A teacher was coming! Ava quickly hid the journal under her backpack. \u201cShh! We can\u2019t get caught!\u201d she whispered.\n\nThey waited until the teacher passed. Then, they rushed to the basement door. The key felt heavy in Ava\u2019s pocket. \u201cWhat if it doesn\u2019t work?\u201d Ava asked, biting her lip.\n\n\u201cDon\u2019t worry. We can do this!\u201d Lily encouraged her. They stood in front of the door, heartbeats racing.\n\nAva took a deep breath and inserted the key into the lock. It turned with a satisfying click! The door creaked open, revealing a dark staircase. \u201cReady?\u201d Ava asked, glancing at Lily.\n\n\u201cReady!\u201d Lily replied, determination shining in her eyes.\n\nAs they descended, the air became cooler. Ava felt a shiver of excitement. \u201cWhat if we find a clue down here?\u201d she said, her voice echoing.\n\nThey reached the bottom and found a small room filled with dusty boxes. \u201cIt looks like nobody has been here in ages!\u201d Lily said, her voice filled with awe.\n\nSuddenly, Ava spotted something glittering under a box. She rushed over and pulled it out. It was a silver bracelet! \u201cLook at this, Lily!\u201d she shouted, holding it up high. \n\n\u201cWow! Do you think it belongs to Ben?\u201d Lily asked, her eyes wide with hope. \n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but it\u2019s definitely a clue!\u201d Ava grinned, feeling more confident. They tucked the bracelet into Lily\u2019s backpack. \n\n\u201cWe need to go back and figure this out,\u201d Ava said, excitement bubbling inside her. \u201cMaybe it will lead us to Ben.\u201d\n\nAs they turned to leave, they heard a noise from the shadows. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Lily gasped, clutching Ava\u2019s arm.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know! Let\u2019s hurry!\u201d Ava said, her heart racing. They dashed back up the stairs, the mystery deepening.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Ava and Lily find in the basement?","options":["A book","A silver bracelet","A key","A map"],"correct_answer":"A silver bracelet"},{"question":"What is Ava worried about?","options":["Their missing homework","Ben going missing","The teacher finding them","Getting lost"],"correct_answer":"Ben going missing"},{"question":"What does the key unlock?","options":["A treasure chest","The library door","The basement door","A classroom door"],"correct_answer":"The basement door"},{"question":"How do Ava and Lily feel when they find the bracelet?","options":["Sad","Excited","Angry","Confused"],"correct_answer":"Excited"},{"question":"What noise do Ava and Lily hear at the end of the chapter?","options":["Footsteps","A cat meowing","A door creaking","A whisper"],"correct_answer":"Footsteps"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_265_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_265_ch4_img1.png","plot_265_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":435,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
