   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_265_15_18","title":"The Hidden Clue","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Missing Person","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"As the morning light filtered through the dusty windows of the school library, Ava felt a sense of urgency thrumming in her chest. She and Lily had spent every lunch hour for the past week rifling through old books and papers, seeking answers hidden among the stacks. The journal had revealed tantalizing glimpses into Ben's world\u2014his doodles of the school, notes about friendships, and strange notations that hinted at something deeper. \n\n\"Look at this,\" Lily said, her voice barely a whisper as she pointed to a passage in the journal where Ben had mentioned a \"secret meeting\" in the \"old science lab.\" Ava's heart raced. They had already discovered that room was more than just a relic of the past; it was shrouded in rumors and whispers, a place where students dared not go. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAva's gaze shifted around the library, taking in the dimly lit corners filled with forgotten stories and abandoned dreams. She could almost feel the weight of the secrets they were about to uncover pressing down on her. \"What do you think he meant?\" Ava asked, leaning closer. \n\nLily shrugged, her brow furrowed in thought. \"Maybe he was part of something he didn't want us to know about. Or maybe it was just a way to meet in secret away from the prying eyes of Marcus and his gang.\" \n\nAva nodded, remembering the way Marcus had glared at them the last time they were in the hall. They were running out of time, and they both knew it. Ben had been missing for too long, and the thought of him alone, scared, or worse, sent a chill down her spine. \n\n\"Let\u2019s go to the old science lab,\" Ava suggested, her voice steady despite the turmoil inside her. \n\nLily hesitated, her eyes wide with fear. \"What if Marcus and his friends are there? They won't let us in.\" \n\n\"We have to try. We can't let fear stop us, especially when Ben needs us.\" \n\nWith a shared look of determination, they slipped out of the library, navigating through the maze of lockers and crowded hallways. As they approached the old science lab, the atmosphere shifted. The laughter of students faded into a distant echo, replaced by a heavy silence that seemed to envelop them.\n\n\"Here we are,\" Ava whispered, standing before the door. It was faded, the paint peeling, and the doorknob was cold to the touch. With a deep breath, she pushed the door open, the creaking sound piercing the stillness. \n\nInside, the room was a time capsule\u2014old microscopes sat abandoned on dusty tables, and the air was thick with the scent of decay. Ava's heart raced as she scanned the room, her eyes landing on a series of drawers along the far wall. \n\n\"Lily, over here!\" she called, rushing towards them. They began to pull open the drawers, their excitement mingling with trepidation. \n\nSuddenly, a loud bang echoed outside the door, and they froze. The unmistakable sound of footsteps approached, and panic surged through Ava. \"Hide!\" she hissed, and they ducked behind a large cabinet, holding their breath as the door creaked open.\n\nA group of students entered, their voices muffled but clearly familiar. \u201cWe shouldn\u2019t be here,\u201d one said nervously. \u201cWhat if someone catches us?\u201d \n\nAva exchanged a worried glance with Lily. The intruders were Ben's former friends\u2014people who had drifted away when the rumors about his disappearance began to swirl. They were too afraid to stand up to Marcus, and now they were cutting themselves off from their own friends. \n\nAs the group began to skulk around the room, Ava caught sight of a scrap of paper half-hidden under the cabinet. With a flicker of hope, she reached for it, her fingers brushing against the brittle edge. Just then, one of the students turned, catching sight of her hand. \n\n\u201cWhat are you doing here?\u201d he barked, eyes narrowing. \n\nWithout thinking, Ava yanked the paper free and dashed toward the door, Lily close behind. They burst into the hallway, hearts pounding, the scrap of paper clutched tightly in Ava's hand. \n\nThey stopped to catch their breath, leaning against the cool wall. \n\n\"What did you find?\" Lily asked, eyes wide with anticipation.\n\nAva unfolded the paper, revealing a hastily scribbled note that read: \u201cMeet at the Oak Tree. Midnight. Come alone.\u201d \n\nThe weight of the words settled over them like a heavy shroud, but beneath it, Ava felt a flicker of hope. \u201cThis could be it, Lily. This could lead us to Ben.\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThey stood in silence for a moment, staring at the note, knowing that their next move was crucial. As night began to fall, determination flooded Ava\u2019s veins. They weren\u2019t just searching for Ben anymore; they were stepping into his world, ready to confront whatever secrets lay ahead.\n\nWith a new resolve, they began to plan their next steps, the thrill of possibility igniting their spirits. They would find Ben, no matter the cost.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Ava and Lily discover in the old science lab?","options":["A book of spells","A map of the school","A note leading to the Oak Tree","A lost science project"],"correct_answer":"A note leading to the Oak Tree"},{"question":"What is the atmosphere like in the school library?","options":["Bright and cheerful","Dim and mysterious","Noisy and chaotic","Empty and abandoned"],"correct_answer":"Dim and mysterious"},{"question":"What motivates Ava to push for action despite Lily's fears?","options":["Her love for reading","Her strong friendship with Lily","Her determination to find Ben","Her rivalry with Marcus"],"correct_answer":"Her determination to find Ben"},{"question":"How do Ava and Lily feel after finding the note?","options":["Disappointed and scared","Hopeful and determined","Confused and lost","Angry and frustrated"],"correct_answer":"Hopeful and determined"},{"question":"What is the significance of the meeting at the Oak Tree?","options":["It is a place for students to hang out","It may lead to finding Ben","It is where the school dance will be held","It is a secret club location"],"correct_answer":"It may lead to finding Ben"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_265_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_265_ch4_img1.png","plot_265_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":830,"reading_level":"Challenger"}
