   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_256_7_10","title":"The Case of the Missing Homework","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Detective","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Ava and Leo stood in front of the closed auditorium door. The sun streamed through the windows, casting long shadows on the floor. Ava took a deep breath. \u201cWhat do you think is behind that door?\u201d she asked. \n\n\u201cI don't know, but it feels like a treasure chest waiting to be opened!\u201d Leo replied, his eyes sparkling with excitement.\n\nThey both pushed on the door, but it wouldn\u2019t budge. \u201cIt\u2019s locked!\u201d Ava said, frowning. \u201cWe need to find a way inside.\u201d\n\nJust then, they heard a soft noise. \u201cDid you hear that?\u201d Leo whispered, his face turning serious. Ava nodded, her heart racing. \u201cWhat if it\u2019s the shadow we saw?\u201d\n\n\u201cOr maybe it's a friendly ghost!\u201d Leo said with a grin. \u201cLet\u2019s check it out!\u201d\n\nThey tiptoed to the side of the door and peeked through a small window. Inside, they saw a bunch of boxes stacked high. \u201cLook! What if my homework is in there?\u201d Ava exclaimed, her hope rising.\n\n\u201cWe need to find a way to get in,\u201d Leo said. \u201cMaybe Ms. Thompson has a key!\u201d\n\nAva agreed. \u201cLet\u2019s hurry! We don\u2019t have much time until the fair starts!\u201d \n\nThey dashed through the hallways of Sunnyvale Middle School. The walls were decorated with colorful science fair posters. Bright drawings of planets, flowers, and robots filled the space. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAva and Leo ran to Ms. Thompson\u2019s classroom. The door was open, and they rushed inside. Ms. Thompson was at her desk, surrounded by stacks of papers. \u201cMs. Thompson! We need your help!\u201d Ava shouted.\n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s the matter, my budding detectives?\u201d Ms. Thompson asked, tilting her head with a curious smile.\n\n\u201cMy homework is missing! We saw a riddle that led us to the auditorium, but the door is locked!\u201d Ava explained.\n\n\u201cHmm, a mystery!\u201d Ms. Thompson said, her eyes lighting up. \u201cYou know, sometimes the answers are right in front of us. Have you checked the supply closet?\u201d\n\n\u201cThe supply closet?\u201d Leo asked, scratching his head. \u201cWhat\u2019s that got to do with it?\u201d\n\n\u201cEvery mystery needs supplies!\u201d Ms. Thompson chuckled. \u201cSometimes the best clues can be found in the most unexpected places. Go check it out!\u201d\n\nAva and Leo thanked Ms. Thompson and raced out of the classroom. They found the supply closet at the end of the hall. The door was slightly ajar, and they peeked inside. \n\n\u201cWhat if it\u2019s full of science junk?\u201d Leo said, wrinkling his nose.\n\n\u201cOr what if it has a treasure map?\u201d Ava replied with a smile.\n\nThey pushed the door open wider and gasped. Inside were all sorts of amazing things! There were beakers, colorful paper, and even a glittery poster board.\n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Ava pointed. \u201cWhat\u2019s that shiny thing?\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nLeo reached for the shiny object. \u201cIt\u2019s a key!\u201d he exclaimed. \u201cDo you think it opens the auditorium door?\u201d\n\n\u201cOnly one way to find out!\u201d Ava said, her heart pounding with excitement.\n\nThey hurried back to the auditorium, the key clutched tightly in Leo's hand. \u201cHere goes nothing!\u201d Leo said, inserting the key into the lock. \n\nWith a click, the door swung open.\n\n\u201cWhat will we find inside?\u201d Ava wondered, her eyes wide with anticipation.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Ava and Leo want to unlock?","options":["A secret passage","The classroom","The auditorium door","The supply closet"],"correct_answer":"The auditorium door"},{"question":"Who helps Ava and Leo find the key?","options":["Leo","Ms. Thompson","Their classmates","The janitor"],"correct_answer":"Ms. Thompson"},{"question":"What do they find in the supply closet?","options":["Their homework","A treasure map","A key","A ghost"],"correct_answer":"A key"},{"question":"What does Leo think the shiny object might be?","options":["A treasure map","An alien gadget","A key","A science experiment"],"correct_answer":"A key"},{"question":"What do Ava and Leo feel as they approach the auditorium?","options":["Excitement","Fear","Boredom","Hunger"],"correct_answer":"Excitement"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_256_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_256_ch4_img1.png","plot_256_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":537,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
