   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_256_7_10","title":"The Case of the Missing Homework","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Detective","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Ava and Leo stood in front of the locked auditorium door. It loomed tall and dark, like a giant\u2019s mouth waiting to swallow them whole. \u201cThis is it, Leo!\u201d Ava exclaimed, gripping the key tightly. \u201cOur big chance to find my homework!\u201d\n\nLeo scratched his head. \u201cDo you think there\u2019s a secret passage in there?\u201d He peeked through the keyhole, squinting. \u201cOr maybe a hidden treasure?\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s focus on the homework first,\u201d Ava replied, rolling her eyes but smiling. She inserted the key slowly, and with a satisfying *click*, the door swung open. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nInside, the auditorium was dim but filled with the smell of fresh paint. Colorful posters for the science fair decorated the walls. \u201cLook at all this space!\u201d Leo shouted, his voice echoing. \u201cIt\u2019s like a cave of wonders!\u201d\n\nAva pointed at the stage. \u201cLeo! The spotlight is shining over there!\u201d They hurried to the stage, where a strange pile of boxes sat. \u201cWhat do you think is in there?\u201d Leo asked, his eyes wide with excitement.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find out!\u201d Ava answered. They climbed onto the stage, and Leo began to dig through the boxes. \u201cIt\u2019s just old props,\u201d he grumbled, tossing aside a feather boa and some cardboard cutouts. \n\nThen, Leo gasped. \u201cAva! Look!\u201d He held up a glittery science fair trophy, but it was empty. \u201cI bet someone took your homework and hid it here!\u201d\n\nAva\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWe need to find clues!\u201d She searched the boxes while Leo checked under the stage. Suddenly, he shouted, \u201cI found something!\u201d \n\nAva rushed over. Leo held up a crumpled piece of paper. It was a note with a riddle! \n\n\u201c\u2018To find what you seek, look high and low, where the stars are bright and the whispers flow,\u2019\u201d Leo read aloud. \u201cWhat does it mean?\u201d\n\nAva thought hard. \u201cCould it be\u2026 the library? There are stars on the ceiling!\u201d\n\n\u201cYes!\u201d Leo cheered. \u201cLet\u2019s hurry!\u201d They dashed out of the auditorium, excitement bubbling in their chests. \n\nAs they ran, Ava felt a warm rush of hope. \u201cWe\u2019re going to find it, Leo! I just know it!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith each step, they grew more determined. Ava learned that sometimes, mysteries need a good friend by your side. And with Leo\u2019s clumsy charm, they were unstoppable!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Ava find in the auditorium?","options":["A trophy","Her homework","A key","A book"],"correct_answer":"A trophy"},{"question":"What is the first clue they find?","options":["A picture","A note","A key","A book"],"correct_answer":"A note"},{"question":"Where do Ava and Leo think the next clue leads them?","options":["The gym","The library","The cafeteria","The office"],"correct_answer":"The library"},{"question":"What is the mood inside the auditorium?","options":["Scary","Excited","Sad","Boring"],"correct_answer":"Excited"},{"question":"What lesson does Ava learn in this chapter?","options":["To work alone","To give up","The importance of friendship","To be quiet"],"correct_answer":"The importance of friendship"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_256_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_256_ch5_img1.png","plot_256_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":387,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
