   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_256_15_18","title":"The Case of the Missing Homework","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Detective","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"As the pale sunlight streamed through the narrow windows of Sunnyvale Middle School, Ava felt a tightening knot in her stomach. She glanced at Leo, who was rummaging in his own backpack, oblivious to the urgency of their predicament. Their science teacher, Ms. Thompson, had set a high bar for the upcoming science fair, and Ava had worked tirelessly on her project: an innovative model of the solar system that showcased her dedication and passion for astronomy. But now, with her prized project missing, a sense of dread washed over her.\n\n\u201cLeo, I can\u2019t believe it\u2019s gone! It was right here!\u201d Ava exclaimed, her voice trembling slightly. The chaos of students hustling around them seemed to fade into the background, replaced by the drumbeat of her racing heart.\n\n\u201cDon\u2019t panic, Ava. There has to be a logical explanation,\u201d Leo replied, adjusting his glasses as he tried to think logically while his hands continued to flail about inside his bag. \u201cMaybe you just misplaced it? What if it\u2019s at home?\u201d \n\nAva shook her head vigorously. \u201cNo, I remember double-checking before I left. It was there! Someone must have taken it.\u201d \n\nAva\u2019s mind raced with possibilities. She thought of her classmates\u2014who could be desperate enough to sabotage her project? As she shifted her gaze around the crowded hallway, she noticed a group of students gathered near the bulletin board, their laughter a sharp contrast to her growing anxiety. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s retrace your steps,\u201d Leo suggested, snapping her attention back. \u201cWe can start at the lab. Did anyone see you when you left?\u201d \n\n\u201cI was in the lab during lunch,\u201d Ava recalled, biting her lip. \u201cBut we need to hurry. The fair is in\u2026\u201d She glanced at the clock\u2014only two hours left! \n\nThe two friends dashed down the hallway, weaving through the throngs of students. The halls of Sunnyvale were alive with chatter and excitement, but for Ava, it felt like they were moving in slow motion. She could envision her classmates setting up their projects, the judges arriving, and the inevitable taunts she would face if her project remained missing.\n\nAs they reached the science lab, Leo pushed the door open, revealing the familiar chaos of their shared workspace. It was cluttered with half-finished projects and scattered papers, remnants of the various experiments carried out by Ms. Thompson\u2019s class. \u201cNow, where could it be?\u201d Leo mumbled to himself, scanning the room.\n\nAva\u2019s eyes darted around the lab, searching for anything that might provide a clue. Suddenly, she spotted a series of strange footprints leading towards the back of the room, where the storage closet was located. \u201cLeo, look!\u201d she pointed, her heart racing with a mix of hope and dread. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cFootprints?\u201d Leo squinted, stepping closer. \u201cDo they look like they lead to the closet?\u201d\n\n\u201cI think so,\u201d Ava replied, her fingers trembling slightly as she took a step toward the footprints. \u201cBut why would anyone go into the storage closet? It\u2019s just filled with old equipment.\u201d\n\n\u201cOld equipment, or maybe something worth hiding?\u201d Leo suggested, excitement creeping into his voice. \n\nRealizing they had to investigate, Ava pushed the door open with a creak, revealing a dimly lit space filled with dusty boxes and outdated science projects. Their eyes adjusted to the gloom, and as they stepped inside, the air felt thick with anticipation.\n\n\u201cDo you really think we\u2019ll find anything?\u201d Ava asked, her voice barely above a whisper as she peered into the shadows.\n\n\u201cOnly one way to find out,\u201d Leo replied, moving deeper into the closet. \u201cIf we can find the project, we can expose whoever took it. It\u2019ll be a great mystery to solve!\u201d \n\nJust as they began to search through the boxes, a loud crash echoed from the front of the lab, jolting them into action. Ava and Leo exchanged panicked glances, their hearts racing. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Ava gasped.\n\n\u201cOnly one way to find out,\u201d Leo said again, more seriously this time. \n\nThey rushed back out to the main lab area, where students had gathered around a laboratory table. A tall student named Jake was sprawled on the floor, his project\u2014a makeshift volcano\u2014had erupted, showering the area in a mess of baking soda and vinegar. The laughter of the crowd rang in Ava\u2019s ears, and for a moment, she felt a pang of envy mixed with resentment.\n\n\u201cLook at this disaster!\u201d Jake shouted, trying to reclaim his dignity. \u201cThis was supposed to be a showstopper!\u201d\n\nAva felt her frustration bubbling to the surface. This was supposed to be her moment, her time to shine, but instead, it felt like another obstacle in her path. \u201cWe need to get back to the search,\u201d she whispered to Leo, who nodded in agreement, his eyes darting toward the mess.\n\nAs they turned back to the storage closet, Ava\u2019s determination reignited. \u201cWe can\u2019t let anything distract us. My project is in there, and I\u2019m not giving up.\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith renewed focus, they plunged back into the storage closet, determined to find the missing homework before Ava\u2019s dreams vanished along with it.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Ava realize is missing from her backpack?","options":["Her lunch","Her homework","A book","Her science kit"],"correct_answer":"Her homework"},{"question":"Who does Ava team up with to solve the mystery?","options":["Jake","Ms. Thompson","Leo","Emily"],"correct_answer":"Leo"},{"question":"What do Ava and Leo find that leads them to investigate the storage closet?","options":["Strange footprints","A secret map","A mysterious note","A broken window"],"correct_answer":"Strange footprints"},{"question":"What significant event is Ava preparing for?","options":["A math competition","The science fair","A school play","A basketball game"],"correct_answer":"The science fair"},{"question":"What is the atmosphere like in the school as Ava searches for her homework?","options":["Quiet and calm","Chaotic and busy","Dark and gloomy","Empty and silent"],"correct_answer":"Chaotic and busy"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_256_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_256_ch2_img1.png","plot_256_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":861,"reading_level":"Challenger"}
