   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_257_7_10","title":"The Secret of the Haunted Library","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Detective","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Emily stood outside the old town library, its tall windows glowing in the twilight. The library looked mysterious, with its creaky floors and dusty bookshelves. \u201cI can\u2019t believe I\u2019m finally here,\u201d she whispered to Max, her furry sidekick. Max wagged his tail, sniffing the air. \n\nSuddenly, a loud thud echoed from inside. \u201cDid you hear that, Max?\u201d Emily asked, her heart racing. \u201cIt\u2019s time to uncover the truth about this haunted place!\u201d \n\nWith a deep breath, Emily pushed open the heavy wooden door. It creaked loudly, making her jump. Inside, the library was dark but cozy. The smell of old books filled the air. Shadows danced on the walls, and Emily felt a shiver run down her spine. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs she walked further in, a flickering light caught her eye. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d she said, squinting into the dim light. Max barked softly, sensing her nervousness. They rounded a corner, and a book suddenly tumbled off a shelf, landing with a soft thump on the floor. \n\n\u201cOkay, that was weird,\u201d Emily said, her voice shaky. \u201cWe need to find out what\u2019s going on.\u201d \n\nJust then, Mr. Jenkins, the librarian, appeared from behind a towering stack of books. His glasses perched on the tip of his nose made him look quite serious. \u201cEmily! Max! What are you doing here?\u201d he inquired, his tone curious yet cautious. \n\n\u201cWe want to solve the mystery of the haunted library!\u201d Emily declared boldly. \n\nMr. Jenkins chuckled softly, \u201cAh, many have tried! But if you\u2019re brave enough, I might have something for you.\u201d He led them to a hidden room at the back of the library. The door creaked open, revealing shelves crammed with dusty books. \n\nThen, Mr. Jenkins pointed to an old, leather-bound book. \u201cInside this book, you might just find a clue.\u201d \n\nWith shaking hands, Emily opened the book. As she flipped the pages, something shiny slipped out and fell to the floor. It was a treasure map! \n\n\u201cMax, look!\u201d she exclaimed, her eyes wide with excitement. \u201cThis could lead us to the library's long-lost secrets!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nEmily felt her fears fade away. \u201cWe have to follow the clues to save the library!\u201d she said with determination. Max barked happily, ready for the adventure ahead. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Emily shouted, grabbing the map. \n\nThe adventure was just beginning!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Emily want to uncover?","options":["A treasure","The truth about the haunted library","A new book","A secret room"],"correct_answer":"The truth about the haunted library"},{"question":"Who is Max?","options":["Emily's best friend","A cat","Emily's dog","A librarian"],"correct_answer":"Emily's dog"},{"question":"What falls off the shelf?","options":["A treasure map","A shiny stone","A book","A toy"],"correct_answer":"A book"},{"question":"Who helps Emily and Max in the library?","options":["A ghost","Mr. Jenkins","A fairy","A wizard"],"correct_answer":"Mr. Jenkins"},{"question":"What do Emily and Max find in the old book?","options":["A recipe","A treasure map","A story","A picture"],"correct_answer":"A treasure map"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_257_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_257_ch1_img1.png","plot_257_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":391,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
