   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_257_7_10","title":"The Secret of the Haunted Library","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Detective","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Emily and Max crept back to the treasure chest hidden behind the old, dusty curtains. The library was quiet, but the air felt heavy with secrets. \u201cDo you think Mr. Jenkins will come back?\u201d Emily whispered. Max tilted his head, his ears perked up, listening for any sounds.\n\nSuddenly, there was a loud bang from the shelves! Emily jumped. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d she asked, clutching Max's collar. Max barked softly, his nose twitching. \u201cLet\u2019s check it out!\u201d Emily said, her heart racing. They tiptoed toward the noise, careful not to make a sound.\n\nAs they rounded the corner, they spotted a book lying open on the floor. \u201cLook at this!\u201d Emily exclaimed. The pages fluttered as if a breeze blew through the library, but the windows were closed tight. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe book had strange symbols and drawings that resembled the map they found earlier. \u201cThis must be a clue!\u201d Emily said excitedly. She traced the symbols with her finger. \u201cIf we can figure this out, it might lead us to the treasure!\u201d\n\nJust then, the lights flickered again, and shadows danced across the room. Emily felt a cold shiver run down her spine. \u201cI don\u2019t like this, Max,\u201d she admitted, but she took a deep breath. \u201cWe can\u2019t give up now!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, the lights went out completely, plunging them into darkness. \u201cEmily!\u201d Max whined, nudging her leg. \u201cI\u2019m here, buddy,\u201d she said, trying to sound brave. \u201cLet\u2019s find a flashlight!\u201d\n\nThey stumbled through the dark, feeling their way around the shelves. \u201cWhere could it be?\u201d Emily wondered aloud. \u201cMaybe Mr. Jenkins has one?\u201d she suggested, remembering the librarian\u2019s office. \n\nJust as they reached the door, a loud crash echoed behind them. Emily gasped. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d she whispered, her heart pounding. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d she urged Max. They pushed open the door to the office, hoping for safety inside.\n\nBut what they found made Emily gasp. \u201cThe office is a mess!\u201d Papers were scattered everywhere, and the old globe in the corner was spinning. \u201cThis is weird,\u201d she said, feeling uneasy.\n\nThere, on the desk, was another piece of the treasure map! \u201cLook, Max! This could lead us to the treasure!\u201d she shouted, but before they could grab it, the door slammed shut behind them! \n\n\u201cWe\u2019re trapped!\u201d Emily cried, pulling on the handle. \u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nMax barked and scratched at the door, but it wouldn\u2019t budge. Emily\u2019s mind raced. \u201cWe have to solve the mystery and get out of here!\u201d With renewed determination, she turned back to the map. \u201cWe can\u2019t let fear stop us!\u201d\n\nWith the flickering lights casting shadows on the walls, Emily felt that they were closer than ever to uncovering the secret of the haunted library. She took a deep breath, ready for whatever came next.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Emily and Max find in the library?","options":["A treasure chest","A magical book","A piece of a treasure map","A scary ghost"],"correct_answer":"A piece of a treasure map"},{"question":"What happens when the lights go out?","options":["They find a hidden door","They get trapped in the office","They meet Mr. Jenkins","They find the treasure"],"correct_answer":"They get trapped in the office"},{"question":"Why does Emily feel uneasy in the library?","options":["The lights are flickering","Max is barking","The books are scary","Mr. Jenkins is there"],"correct_answer":"The lights are flickering"},{"question":"What does Max do when the door slams shut?","options":["He howls","He scratches at the door","He runs away","He goes to sleep"],"correct_answer":"He scratches at the door"},{"question":"What does Emily decide to do in the office?","options":["Leave quickly","Solve the mystery","Call for help","Hide under the desk"],"correct_answer":"Solve the mystery"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_257_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_257_ch3_img1.png","plot_257_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":476,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
