     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"mysterious","1":"echoing","2":"treasures","3":"uncertainty","4":"anticipation","image_prompts":["A dimly lit library interior with tall, dusty bookshelves. Emily, a brave girl with short brown hair and a determined expression, stands beside her excited dog Max, who has perked ears and a wagging tail. She is examining an old, yellowed map spread out on a wooden table, surrounded by flickering candlelight and shadows looming in the background.","A dark, cobweb-covered room within the library, filled with ancient artifacts and books. The air is heavy with dust, and a mysterious, glowing object sits on a pedestal at the end of the room. Emily stands in the doorway, wide-eyed with curiosity and apprehension, while Max sniffs the air, poised to enter. Shadows dance along the walls, enhancing the suspenseful atmosphere."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing Emily kneels beside Max, engrossed in the discovery of the leather-bound diary. The atmosphere is a blend of curiosity and tension, with light filtering through the dusty air, highlighting the textures of the old book and their expressions of intrigue and determination.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_257_ch2_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 17:38:50"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing The scene is charged with intensity as the library is plunged into darkness, Emilys silhouette standing protectively in front of Max while Mr. Jenkins looks anxious and conflicted. The dim light casts dramatic shadows, enhancing the sense of mystery and the unknown that surrounds them.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_257_ch2_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 17:38:50"}}}
