   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_257_11_14","title":"The Secret of the Haunted Library","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Detective","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Emily stood at the entrance of the old town library, her heart racing with a mix of excitement and trepidation. The library loomed above her like a giant, shadowy guardian, its stone walls covered in ivy and its windows darkened by years of dust. She had always loved books, but the whispers of the townspeople had turned this place from a sanctuary into a source of spine-chilling stories. Flickering lights and strange noises had sent patrons running for the door, leaving only echoes of fear behind.\n\n\u201cReady, Max?\u201d she whispered, glancing down at her loyal dog, a golden retriever with bright eyes that seemed to sparkle with curiosity. Max wagged his tail, his ears perked up, as if he understood the adventure that lay ahead. Emily took a deep breath and pushed open the heavy wooden door, the creak of the hinges sounding like a ghostly greeting.\n\nAs they stepped inside, Emily\u2019s eyes widened. The library was filled with towering shelves of dusty books, their spines cracked and faded, waiting to tell their forgotten tales. A musty scent, reminiscent of old paper and mystery, enveloped them. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] \n\nJust as she began to take in the surroundings, a loud thud echoed from the far corner of the room. Emily\u2019s heart skipped a beat. \u201cDid you hear that, Max?\u201d she asked, her voice barely above a whisper. Max tilted his head, then dashed toward the source of the noise, tail wagging in unwavering loyalty. \n\nEmily followed, her pulse quickening with each step. As she approached the shelves, she noticed a book had toppled to the floor\u2014a heavy, leather-bound volume titled \u201cLegends of the Lost.\u201d Picking it up, she brushed off the dust and opened it gingerly. Inside, an old map slipped out, curling at the edges as if it had been waiting for years to be discovered. \n\n\u201cLook at this!\u201d Emily exclaimed, excitement bubbling within her. The map depicted the library and the surrounding areas, marked with strange symbols. \u201cThis could lead us to something amazing, Max!\u201d \n\nBut just then, the lights flickered again, casting eerie shadows across the walls. Emily could feel the air grow colder, sending a chill down her spine. \u201cWe have to find out what\u2019s going on before this library closes for good,\u201d she declared, determination replacing her initial fear. As she glanced around, she spotted Mr. Jenkins, the mysterious librarian, watching them from the shadows. His eyes glinted with an unreadable expression.\n\n\u201cAh, I see you\u2019ve found something interesting,\u201d he said, stepping closer, his voice smooth but laced with an unsettling edge. Emily and Max exchanged a glance, a silent agreement passing between them. Together, they would uncover the truth behind the haunted library, and nothing could stand in their way. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s start solving this mystery,\u201d Emily said, folding the map carefully. \u201cIt\u2019s time to uncover the truth about this haunted place!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2] \n\nWith newfound resolve, Emily led Max deeper into the library, unaware of the challenges\u2014and perhaps dangers\u2014that awaited them.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Emily find when she enters the library?","options":["A friendly librarian","A treasure map","A new book","A scary ghost"],"correct_answer":"A treasure map"},{"question":"Who is Emily's loyal companion?","options":["A cat","Her brother","Her friend","Her dog"],"correct_answer":"Her dog"},{"question":"What do the townspeople say about the library?","options":["It has a great selection of books","It is haunted","It is always crowded","It has a cafe"],"correct_answer":"It is haunted"},{"question":"What is the reaction of Emily when she hears the thud?","options":["She runs away","She feels excited","She feels scared","She ignores it"],"correct_answer":"She feels scared"},{"question":"What does Emily decide to do at the end of the chapter?","options":["Leave the library","Call for help","Start solving the mystery","Go home"],"correct_answer":"Start solving the mystery"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_257_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_257_ch1_img1.png","plot_257_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":505,"reading_level":"Builder"}
