   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_257_11_14","title":"The Secret of the Haunted Library","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Detective","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"As Emily and Max climbed the creaky stairs of the old observatory, the air felt thicker, charged with the mysteries waiting to be uncovered. The wind howled outside, rattling the shutters like ghosts in a restless slumber. Max sniffed the air, his ears perked up as if hearing something that Emily could not. \u201cStay close, buddy,\u201d she whispered, her heart racing with a mix of excitement and fear. \n\nReaching the top, they stepped into a small room lined with dusty telescopes and old star charts. A large window overlooked the library, dimly lit by the streetlights below. It was a small sanctuary of forgotten dreams and celestial wonders. Emily took a deep breath and carefully placed the golden key on a nearby table, its surface covered in cobwebs. \u201cThis must be the place,\u201d she murmured, scanning the room for clues.\n\nSuddenly, the lights flickered ominously. Emily jumped, gripping the edge of the table. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Max growled softly, his instincts kicking in. Then, out of the corner of her eye, she noticed a glimmer on the floor. It was a small, intricately carved box, half-hidden beneath a telescope. She bent down to pick it up. Just as her fingers brushed against it, the lights went out completely, plunging them into darkness.\n\n\u201cMax! Can you see anything?\u201d she whispered, panic rising in her throat.\n\nMax whimpered softly but didn\u2019t abandon her side. She felt a surge of determination as she fumbled for her flashlight, illuminating the room just enough to see the box clearly. With trembling hands, she opened it, revealing a collection of old photographs and a tattered diary.\n\n\u201cWhat do you think, Max? Could this be part of the treasure?\u201d Emily asked, her voice a mix of hope and curiosity. She flipped through the photographs, marveling at the black-and-white images of the library\u2019s founders. But then, something caught her eye\u2014a photograph of a hidden room within the library, marked with an \u201cX.\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cThis must be it! The secret room,\u201d she exclaimed, her heart racing with the thrill of discovery. \u201cWe have to go back!\u201d \n\nJust then, the lights flickered back on, brighter than before. But the sudden brightness revealed something far more shocking: Mr. Jenkins was standing in the doorway, his expression a mix of surprise and concern. \u201cEmily! You shouldn\u2019t be here! It\u2019s dangerous!\u201d \n\n\u201cDangerous? But we found something!\u201d she insisted, holding up the diary. \u201cThis belongs to the library, doesn\u2019t it?\u201d \n\nMr. Jenkins stepped closer, his frown deepening. \u201cIt does, but some secrets are meant to stay buried.\u201d \n\n\u201cBut what if it leads to something amazing? We could save the library!\u201d Emily pressed, her determination unwavering.\n\nHe sighed, his shoulders slumping as if the weight of the world rested upon them. \u201cPerhaps it\u2019s time to reveal the truth, then. We can\u2019t let fear control us any longer.\u201d\n\nMax wagged his tail, sensing the shift in the room. Emily felt a rush of hope. Together, they would unveil the legacy of the library, its haunting past transforming into a bright future. \n\nAs they gathered the photographs and diary, Emily knew their adventure was just beginning. There were still mysteries to unravel, and she was ready for whatever lay ahead.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Emily find in the observatory?","options":["A treasure map","A hidden diary","A telescope","An old book"],"correct_answer":"A hidden diary"},{"question":"How does Max react when the lights go out?","options":["He barks loudly","He whimpers softly","He runs away","He growls fiercely"],"correct_answer":"He whimpers softly"},{"question":"What does Mr. Jenkins initially think about Emily being in the observatory?","options":["He is glad to see her","He thinks it's dangerous","He wants to help her","He agrees with her"],"correct_answer":"He thinks it's dangerous"},{"question":"What does Emily want to do with the information she found?","options":["Keep it a secret","Sell it","Reveal it to save the library","Throw it away"],"correct_answer":"Reveal it to save the library"},{"question":"How does the chapter end?","options":["With Emily feeling defeated","With a promise to unveil secrets","With the library being closed","With Max running away"],"correct_answer":"With a promise to unveil secrets"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_257_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_257_ch5_img1.png","plot_257_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":544,"reading_level":"Builder"}
