   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_258_7_10","title":"The Great Chocolate Caper","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Detective","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"The sun shone brightly on the bustling town square. Colorful banners danced in the gentle breeze. It was the day of the annual Chocolate Festival! Mia and her younger brother, Jake, could hardly contain their excitement. \n\n\u201cLook, Mia! Chocolate everywhere!\u201d Jake exclaimed, pointing at the stalls piled high with sweet treats.\n\nMia grinned. \u201cI can smell the chocolate from here! Let\u2019s go!\u201d\n\nAs they ran toward the main square, they saw chocolatiers setting up their stands. There was Ms. Choco, the town\u2019s most famous chocolatier. She wore a bright purple hat adorned with candy sprinkles. Her stall was filled with towering chocolate sculptures, all glistening in the sunlight. \n\n\u201cThis is my favorite festival!\u201d Mia said, her eyes wide. \n\nSuddenly, the town mayor stepped up to the podium. He smiled at the crowd, holding a shiny ribbon. \u201cWelcome, everyone! Today, we reveal the grand prize chocolate sculpture!\u201d\n\nThe crowd buzzed with excitement. Mia and Jake could hardly wait. But as the mayor unveiled the sculpture, gasps filled the air. \n\n\u201cWhere is it?\u201d someone shouted. The pedestal was empty! \n\nMia\u2019s heart raced. \u201cLooks like it\u2019s time for a chocolate mystery!\u201d she said with a determined smile.\n\nJake\u2019s eyes sparkled. \u201cLet\u2019s find out who took it!\u201d\n\nJust then, the townsfolk began to crowd around. Some whispered. Others looked worried. Mia and Jake exchanged glances. They knew they had to act fast.\n\n\u201cWe need clues!\u201d Mia declared. \u201cLet\u2019s start with Ms. Choco!\u201d\n\nThey dashed over to her stall. Ms. Choco was busy arranging her chocolates, but she looked up when she saw them.\n\n\u201cHello, my little detectives!\u201d she said, winking. \u201cWhat brings you here?\u201d\n\n\u201cWe need your help!\u201d Jake said, bouncing on his toes. \u201cThe grand prize sculpture is missing!\u201d\n\nMs. Choco clutched her apron. \u201cOh dear! This is terrible!\u201d \n\nMia noticed something shiny on the ground by Ms. Choco\u2019s feet. She pointed. \u201cWhat\u2019s that?\u201d\n\nMs. Choco leaned down. \u201cHmm, it looks like a piece of chocolate!\u201d \n\nMia picked it up, examining it closely. \u201cBut it\u2019s not just any chocolate! It has a special swirl pattern.\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find out where it came from!\u201d Jake said, eyes wide with excitement.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nJust then, a loud commotion broke out. \u201cThe chocolates are missing!\u201d cried another chocolatier, waving his arms. \n\nMia and Jake looked at each other. This was getting serious! \n\n\u201cMore detectives are needed! We must solve this mystery before the festival ends!\u201d Mia said, feeling a rush of determination.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Jake shouted, and off they ran, ready for their delicious adventure.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What event is happening in the town square?","options":["Sports Day","Chocolate Festival","Art Fair","Music Festival"],"correct_answer":"Chocolate Festival"},{"question":"Who is the famous chocolatier mentioned in the chapter?","options":["Mr. Sweet","Ms. Choco","Mrs. Candy","Mr. Brownie"],"correct_answer":"Ms. Choco"},{"question":"What do Mia and Jake plan to do?","options":["Eat chocolate","Paint a picture","Become detectives","Play games"],"correct_answer":"Become detectives"},{"question":"What do they find near Ms. Choco's feet?","options":["A candy wrapper","A piece of chocolate","A toy","A clue"],"correct_answer":"A piece of chocolate"},{"question":"What does Mia say when the sculpture is missing?","options":["It's lost forever!","Let's eat more chocolate!","Looks like it's time for a chocolate mystery!","I give up!"],"correct_answer":"Looks like it's time for a chocolate mystery!"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_258_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_258_ch1_img1.png","plot_258_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":430,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
