   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_258_7_10","title":"The Great Chocolate Caper","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Detective","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Mia and Jake stood in the bustling town square, their eyes wide with excitement. The air smelled sweet, like melted chocolate and candy. Everywhere they looked, colorful stalls were filled with treats. People laughed and enjoyed the festival. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cLook at that giant chocolate fountain!\u201d Mia pointed. \u201cWe should investigate more around here!\u201d \n\n\u201cYeah! And maybe we can find some clues!\u201d Jake added, bouncing on his toes.\n\nThey made their way through the crowd and headed to Ms. Choco\u2019s stand. She was busy wrapping chocolate bars in bright foil. \u201cMia! Jake! You\u2019re just in time for my special chocolate tasting!\u201d she exclaimed, her eyes sparkling.\n\nThe siblings grinned. \u201cThanks, Ms. Choco! We need your help!\u201d said Mia. \u201cThe grand prize sculpture is missing!\u201d\n\nMs. Choco gasped. \u201cOh no! That sculpture was the highlight of the festival! It must be found!\u201d She quickly turned serious. \u201cBut, there could be clues nearby. Let\u2019s think of what we know.\u201d\n\n\u201cMaybe someone saw something,\u201d Jake suggested, looking around. \n\nMia nodded. \u201cLet\u2019s ask the chocolatiers!\u201d They rushed to the next stall, where Mr. Sweet was busy making chocolate-covered strawberries.\n\n\u201cMr. Sweet! Did you see anyone suspicious?\u201d Mia asked.\n\nHe scratched his head. \u201cI did see a shadow near the sculpture last night. It was quick, like a rabbit! But I couldn\u2019t make out who it was.\u201d\n\n\u201cA rabbit?\u201d Jake giggled. \u201cThat sounds funny!\u201d\n\n\u201cNot a real rabbit! I mean, someone sneaky!\u201d Mr. Sweet chuckled. \u201cBut I saw something shiny in the bushes too. Maybe you two should check there!\u201d\n\nExcitedly, Mia and Jake ran to the bushes. What could they find? Suddenly, Jake stopped. \u201cWait! Do you hear that?\u201d\n\nA soft rustling noise came from the bushes. Mia held her breath. \u201cWhat if it\u2019s the thief?\u201d \n\nBut before they could decide, out jumped a fluffy chocolate-brown rabbit! It looked at them with big, curious eyes.\n\n\u201cNot the thief!\u201d Jake laughed, relieved. But then he noticed something glimmering next to the rabbit. \u201cLook, Mia! What\u2019s that?\u201d\n\nThey both leaned closer. There, half-buried in the leaves, was a small, shiny chocolate mold. \u201cThis could be a clue!\u201d Mia whispered, her heart racing with excitement.\n\nThey quickly took the mold and headed back to Ms. Choco. \u201cWe found this! Do you think it\u2019s important?\u201d Mia asked, holding it up.\n\nMs. Choco\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cThis mold belongs to someone who makes chocolate sculptures! We must find out who!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go ask more chocolatiers!\u201d Jake shouted, bouncing with energy.\n\nMia smiled. \u201cThe mystery is getting sweeter!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nBut as they turned to leave, a sudden loud bang echoed through the festival. Everyone gasped and turned to the source of the noise. \u201cWhat now?\u201d Jake worried.\n\nMia stood tall. \u201cLooks like our next clue is waiting!\u201d","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Mia and Jake find in the bushes?","options":["A chocolate bunny","A chocolate mold","A chocolate cake","A chocolate bar"],"correct_answer":"A chocolate mold"},{"question":"Who did Mia and Jake visit for help at the festival?","options":["Mr. Sweet","Mr. Candy","Ms. Choco","Ms. Sugar"],"correct_answer":"Ms. Choco"},{"question":"What did Mr. Sweet see near the sculpture?","options":["A rabbit","A shadow","A bird","A chocolate bar"],"correct_answer":"A shadow"},{"question":"What noise did Mia and Jake hear in the bushes?","options":["A bang","A laugh","A rustle","A cheer"],"correct_answer":"A rustle"},{"question":"What does Mia say at the end of the chapter?","options":["Let\u2019s go home!","The mystery is getting sweeter!","I\u2019m hungry!","Where's the chocolate?"],"correct_answer":"The mystery is getting sweeter!"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_258_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_258_ch2_img1.png","plot_258_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":467,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
