   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_258_7_10","title":"The Great Chocolate Caper","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Detective","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Mia and Jake stood in the bustling town square. Colorful stalls lined the streets. The smell of chocolate filled the air. It was the Chocolate Festival, and everyone was excited. But something was wrong. The grand prize chocolate sculpture was missing!\n\n\u201cDid you hear that bang?\u201d Mia asked. \u201cIt came from the chocolate shop!\u201d \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Jake replied, his eyes wide with excitement.\n\nThey rushed to Ms. Choco\u2019s shop. She was the town\u2019s most famous chocolatier. Her shop was filled with sweet treats and delicious smells. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] \n\n\u201cMia! Jake!\u201d Ms. Choco exclaimed, her hat askew. \u201cDid you hear the bang? I dropped my special chocolate mold!\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s the mold for?\u201d Jake asked, peering at the shiny chocolate form on the floor.\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s for the giant chocolate bunny! But I was working on a new recipe.\u201d Ms. Choco\u2019s eyes sparkled with secrets. \u201cDo you want to help me?\u201d\n\n\u201cOf course!\u201d Mia said. \u201cBut first, we need to find out who took the sculpture!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, they heard whispers outside. \u201cDid you see the frosting footprints?\u201d one voice said.\n\n\u201cWhat frosting footprints?\u201d Mia asked, her detective instincts kicking in. \u201cLet\u2019s check it out!\u201d\n\nThey hurried outside. Sure enough, there were glistening footprints leading away from the pedestal. \u201cLook!\u201d Jake shouted, pointing. The footprints stopped at a tall booth decorated with chocolate stars.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s follow them!\u201d Mia said. \n\nThey crept up to the booth. A man in a chocolate-covered cape was handing out samples. \u201cYummy!\u201d Jake exclaimed, but Mia pulled him back.\n\n\u201cWait! We can\u2019t eat right now. What if he's involved?\u201d she whispered.\n\nJust then, the man turned. \u201cAh, little detectives! Are you looking for something sweet?\u201d His smile was wide and a little suspicious.\n\nMia and Jake exchanged glances. They had to find out more. But before they could speak, the man waved his hand. \u201cDon\u2019t worry! No need to be afraid. Just a little chocolate fun.\u201d\n\n\u201cFun?\u201d Mia asked. \u201cOr trouble?\u201d\n\nJust then, they heard another loud bang. This time it was a crash! The chocolate booth shook, and candy wrappers flew everywhere. \n\n\u201cUh-oh! What was that?\u201d Jake gasped.\n\n\u201cWe need to hide!\u201d Mia said. They ducked behind a nearby stall, their hearts racing. \n\n\u201cWho would do such a thing?\u201d whispered Jake. \n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know,\u201d Mia said, peering around the stall. \u201cBut we need to find out before the festival ends. We can\u2019t let the thief win!\u201d\n\nAs the chaos continued, Mia\u2019s mind raced. \u201cWhat if the thief is trying to distract us? We must keep our eyes open!\u201d\n\nBut just then, a familiar face appeared in the crowd\u2014Ms. Choco! She looked worried. \u201cThere\u2019s more at stake than just chocolate!\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat do you mean?\u201d Mia asked, puzzled.\n\n\u201cMeet me after the festival. I\u2019ll tell you the secret!\u201d Ms. Choco called out before disappearing into the crowd.\n\nMia\u2019s heart raced. What secret did Ms. Choco have? They needed answers, and fast. But how? \n\n\u201cJake, we need to make a plan!\u201d she said, determination shining in her eyes. \n\n\u201cRight! Let\u2019s catch the thief!\u201d Jake replied, his excitement bubbling over.\n\nThe festival continued, but Mia could feel the tension in the air. They had a mystery to solve, and time was running out.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Mia and Jake hear before going to Ms. Choco's shop?","options":["A loud bang","A sweet melody","Children laughing","A chocolate fountain"],"correct_answer":"A loud bang"},{"question":"What did Ms. Choco drop?","options":["A chocolate bar","A special chocolate mold","A candy cane","A chocolate sculpture"],"correct_answer":"A special chocolate mold"},{"question":"What did Mia and Jake find outside the festival?","options":["Chocolate footprints","Candy wrappers","A lost dog","A chocolate fountain"],"correct_answer":"Chocolate footprints"},{"question":"What did the man in the chocolate cape do?","options":["Told jokes","Handed out samples","Played music","Sang songs"],"correct_answer":"Handed out samples"},{"question":"What secret does Ms. Choco have?","options":["A new recipe","Where the sculpture is","A hidden treasure","How to make chocolate"],"correct_answer":"Where the sculpture is"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_258_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_258_ch3_img1.png","plot_258_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":548,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
