   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_258_7_10","title":"The Great Chocolate Caper","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Detective","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Mia and Jake stood in the bustling town square. Colorful stalls lined the streets, each filled with luscious chocolate treats. The air was sweet and rich, making their mouths water.\n\n\u201cLook at all the chocolate!\u201d Jake exclaimed, his eyes wide. \u201cI can smell brownies and fudge!\u201d\n\nMia grinned. \u201cAnd we still have time to solve the mystery! Let\u2019s visit Ms. Choco again. She might know more.\u201d\n\nAs they walked, the brothers spotted Ms. Choco at her stall, arranging tiny chocolate animals. She wore a bright purple apron and her hair was a fluffy cloud of white.\n\n\u201cMs. Choco!\u201d Mia called, waving. \u201cWe need your help!\u201d\n\nMs. Choco looked up, her eyes sparkling with curiosity. \u201cWhat brings the youngest detectives to my chocolate kingdom?\u201d\n\n\u201cThe grand prize sculpture is missing!\u201d Jake said, pointing to the empty pedestal. \u201cWe think it might be stolen!\u201d\n\n\u201cOh dear!\u201d Ms. Choco gasped, her hands flying to her cheeks. \u201cThat\u2019s terrible! But I do have a secret recipe. It might lead to clues! Who knows what you\u2019ll find.\u201d\n\nMia\u2019s eyes brightened. \u201cWhat\u2019s in the recipe?\u201d\n\n\u201cChocolate, of course!\u201d Ms. Choco winked. \u201cBut there\u2019s also a hidden ingredient. One that will help you find the thief.\u201d\n\nJust then, a loud crash echoed from behind the stall. Mia and Jake turned to see a chocolate fountain topple over! Streams of chocolate splashed everywhere. Jake laughed, \u201cChocolate shower!\u201d\n\nMia pointed. \u201cLook! There\u2019s frosting on the ground! Let\u2019s follow it!\u201d \n\nThey dashed toward the trail of frosting. It led them to a nearby alley where they found a half-open door. \n\n\u201cShould we go in?\u201d Jake asked, looking a little nervous.\n\n\u201cTogether, right?\u201d Mia responded, feeling brave. They grabbed hands and tiptoed inside. \n\nInside, they found a room filled with chocolate molds and trays. In the corner, a shadowy figure was hunched over, working quickly. \n\n\u201cWho\u2019s there?\u201d the figure demanded, startled. \n\nMia felt her heart race. \u201cUm, we\u2019re investigators! What are you doing?\u201d\n\nThe figure turned around, revealing a familiar face. It was Mr. Cacao, the town\u2019s other chocolatier! \n\n\u201cI\u2019m just\u2026 uh\u2026\u201d he stammered, glancing at the mess around him. \u201cI was experimenting with a new recipe!\u201d \n\nMia exchanged a glance with Jake. \u201cA new recipe?\u201d she asked. \u201cIs that for the festival?\u201d \n\n\u201cYes! But it\u2019s a secret,\u201d Mr. Cacao replied, nervously. \n\nJust then, a piece of chocolate fell from the table, revealing a tiny golden key. Mia\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cLook, Jake! A key!\u201d\n\nJake picked it up, amazed. \u201cWhat does it open?\u201d \n\nMr. Cacao licked his lips nervously. \u201cI don\u2019t know. But I think you should find out.\u201d\n\nExcitement bubbled in their bellies. They had some progress! \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go back to Ms. Choco,\u201d Mia suggested. \u201cShe might know what this key is for!\u201d\n\nWith the key in hand, the siblings felt hopeful. They were getting closer to finding the missing sculpture!\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who helps Mia and Jake in their mystery?","options":["Mr. Cacao","Ms. Choco","Jake","The Mayor"],"correct_answer":"Ms. Choco"},{"question":"What do Mia and Jake follow to find clues?","options":["Chocolate bars","Frosting","Candy canes","Brownies"],"correct_answer":"Frosting"},{"question":"What does Mr. Cacao drop that is important?","options":["A chocolate bar","A golden key","A recipe","A chocolate mold"],"correct_answer":"A golden key"},{"question":"What emotion do Mia and Jake feel after finding the key?","options":["Sad","Scared","Hopeful","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Hopeful"},{"question":"What is the main goal of Mia and Jake?","options":["To eat chocolate","To find the missing sculpture","To bake cookies","To win a prize"],"correct_answer":"To find the missing sculpture"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_258_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_258_ch4_img1.png","plot_258_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":491,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
