   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_258_7_10","title":"The Great Chocolate Caper","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Detective","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Mia and Jake stood in the bustling town square, surrounded by colorful stalls and cheerful festival-goers. The sweet aroma of chocolate filled the air. Everywhere they looked, there were chocolate fountains, giant chocolate bars, and even chocolate-covered strawberries. \u201cThis place is amazing!\u201d Jake exclaimed, his eyes wide with excitement.\n\nSuddenly, Mia\u2019s eyes caught something shiny on the ground. \u201cLook, Jake!\u201d she shouted, bending down to pick it up. It was the mysterious key they found at Mr. Cacao\u2019s shop. \u201cThis must be the key to unlocking the mystery!\u201d \n\nJust then, a loud gasp echoed through the crowd. \u201cWhat is happening?\u201d Mia asked, running toward the sound. They quickly followed the noise and saw a group of townsfolk gathered around an empty pedestal. The grand prize chocolate sculpture had vanished!\n\n\u201cLooks like it\u2019s time for a chocolate mystery!\u201d Mia grinned, her determination shining through. Jake nodded, his adventurous spirit ignited. They both knew they had to solve this mystery before the festival began.\n\nAs they searched for clues, they spotted Ms. Choco, the eccentric chocolatier, stirring a giant pot of chocolate. \u201cMs. Choco!\u201d called Mia. \u201cDid you see anything suspicious?\u201d\n\nMs. Choco turned around, her wild hair bouncing. \u201cOh, Mia, dear! I saw a shadow by the pedestal just before it went missing!\u201d \n\n\u201cA shadow?\u201d Jake asked, his curiosity piqued. \u201cCould it have been the man we saw at your shop?\u201d\n\n\u201cPossibly!\u201d Ms. Choco exclaimed. \u201cHe had a strange look in his eyes.\u201d \n\nMia and Jake exchanged glances. \u201cWe need to find that man!\u201d Jake said, feeling bold. \n\nThey searched high and low, dodging chocolate-covered children and sticky fingers. Finally, they spotted a figure slipping behind a stall. \u201cThere he is!\u201d Mia pointed. They crept closer, their hearts racing.\n\nSuddenly, the figure turned around. It was the suspicious man, holding a giant chocolate bar! \u201cWhat are you two doing here?\u201d he asked with a sly grin.\n\nMia stepped forward. \u201cWe\u2019re looking for the stolen sculpture!\u201d\n\nThe man laughed, but it sounded nervous. \u201cWhy would I know about that?\u201d \n\nJust then, Jake noticed something on the ground behind him. \u201cLook, Mia! It\u2019s chocolate frosting!\u201d They followed the trail, leading back to the man.\n\n\u201cHey! Get back here!\u201d Mia shouted. They chased after him, laughter mixing with excitement as they dashed around the stalls. \n\nFinally, they caught up with him. \u201cStop right there!\u201d Mia said, putting her hands on her hips. \u201cWe know you have the sculpture!\u201d\n\nThe man sighed, looking defeated. \u201cAlright, you caught me. I just wanted a piece of the prize before it left!\u201d \n\nMia smiled. \u201cWe can share some chocolate, but you have to return the sculpture!\u201d \n\nWith a reluctant nod, the man agreed. They rushed back to the pedestal, where the townsfolk gasped in surprise as the grand prize sculpture was placed back in its spot. Cheers erupted in the square!\n\nMia and Jake beamed with pride. \u201cWe did it!\u201d Jake shouted. \n\nAs the festival began, they shared chocolate treats with everyone. The mystery was solved, and they learned that sharing is even sweeter than chocolate!\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Mia and Jake find on the ground?","options":["A chocolate bar","A mysterious key","A chocolate sculpture","A piece of candy"],"correct_answer":"A mysterious key"},{"question":"Who did they talk to about the missing sculpture?","options":["Mr. Cacao","Ms. Choco","The suspicious man","The mayor"],"correct_answer":"Ms. Choco"},{"question":"What did the suspicious man want from the sculpture?","options":["To eat it","To sell it","To take it home","To hide it"],"correct_answer":"To eat it"},{"question":"What did Mia and Jake learn at the end of the chapter?","options":["To solve mysteries","To share chocolate","To eat more sweets","To catch thieves"],"correct_answer":"To share chocolate"},{"question":"What did Mia shout when they found the sculpture?","options":["We did it!","Chocolate!","Look out!","Help!"],"correct_answer":"We did it!"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_258_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_258_ch5_img1.png","plot_258_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":517,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
