   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_258_11_14","title":"The Great Chocolate Caper","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Detective","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"The sun shone brightly over the bustling town square, casting a warm glow on the vibrant stalls that lined the cobblestone streets. Colorful banners fluttered in the gentle breeze, each one proclaiming the arrival of the annual Chocolate Festival. Everywhere Mia and Jake looked, there were delightful sights and smells\u2014rich, velvety chocolate cascading down fountains, and the sweet aroma of caramel wafting through the air. \n\n\u201cCan you believe it\u2019s finally here?\u201d Mia exclaimed, her brown curls bouncing as she skipped ahead, pulling her younger brother Jake along. \u201cThis year\u2019s chocolate sculpture is going to be the biggest one yet!\u201d\n\nJake, always eager for an adventure, nodded enthusiastically. \u201cAnd I heard Ms. Choco is bringing her secret recipe for dark chocolate truffles! We\u2019ve got to find her first!\u201d \n\nAs they navigated through the crowd, children laughed and ran with sticky fingers, while parents chatted excitedly, clutching bags filled with tasty treats. The square was alive with energy, each corner revealing a new wonder. Mia felt a thrill of excitement; this was her favorite day of the year. \n\nJust as they reached the center of the square, the crowd suddenly hushed. The mayor, a plump man with a twinkling eye, stood at the podium, ready to unveil the grand prize chocolate sculpture. Mia and Jake squeezed through the throng of people, desperate to catch a glimpse. \n\nThen, gasps rippled through the crowd like a wave. The pedestal stood empty. \n\n\u201cWhat? Where\u2019s the sculpture?\u201d Jake whispered, wide-eyed. \n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know!\u201d Mia replied, her heart racing. She could feel the tension in the air, thick enough to taste, like melted chocolate on the tongue. \u201cThis is\u2026 it\u2019s a disaster!\u201d\n\nThe mayor cleared his throat, his face turning bright red. \u201cLadies and gentlemen, I regret to inform you that the grand prize sculpture has gone missing!\u201d\n\nMia\u2019s mind raced. \u201cThis isn't just a mishap\u2014this is a mystery!\u201d She glanced at Jake, who was bouncing on his toes with excitement. \u201cLooks like it\u2019s time for a chocolate mystery!\u201d\n\nJust then, Ms. Choco appeared, her apron splattered with chocolate as she rushed forward. Her wild hair seemed to bounce with each step, and her eyes sparkled with urgency. \u201cI can\u2019t believe this! That sculpture was my masterpiece, crafted from the finest chocolate in town!\u201d\n\nMia stepped forward, feeling a surge of determination. \u201cMs. Choco, we can help! We\u2019ll find it before the festival ends!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] \n\nMs. Choco looked down at Mia and Jake, her eyes narrowing as if weighing their resolve. \u201cAre you sure you\u2019re up for this? It could be dangerous!\u201d\n\n\u201cWe\u2019re not scared of a little adventure!\u201d Jake declared, chest puffed out. \n\n\u201cVery well,\u201d Ms. Choco said, a smile creeping onto her face. \u201cIf anyone can uncover the truth, it\u2019s you two. But remember\u2014chocolate can be both delightful and deceiving.\u201d \n\nJust then, Mia spotted something shiny near the base of the empty pedestal. She knelt to get a closer look, her heart pounding with intrigue. \u201cJake, look! Over here!\u201d \n\n\u201cWhat did you find?\u201d he asked, peering over her shoulder. \n\n\u201cIt\u2019s a chocolate wrapper,\u201d Mia said, holding it up. \u201cBut it\u2019s not like any I\u2019ve seen before.\u201d \n\nJust then, a gust of wind whisked through the square, sending the wrapper fluttering away. Mia\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cIt\u2019s a clue! We have to catch it!\u201d \n\nThey sprinted after the wrapper, weaving through festival-goers, the excitement of the chase igniting their spirits. Who had stolen the sculpture? And what other surprises awaited them? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nMia felt a rush of adrenaline. This was just the beginning of their great chocolate caper.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What event is happening in the town square?","options":["A chocolate eating contest","The annual Chocolate Festival","A sculpture competition","A magic show"],"correct_answer":"The annual Chocolate Festival"},{"question":"What happens to the grand prize chocolate sculpture?","options":["It melts in the sun","It gets stolen","It is never made","It is eaten by children"],"correct_answer":"It gets stolen"},{"question":"Who do Mia and Jake meet at the festival?","options":["The mayor","Ms. Choco","Their friends","A chocolate thief"],"correct_answer":"Ms. Choco"},{"question":"What does Mia declare when she finds out the sculpture is missing?","options":["It's time for a chocolate mystery","Let's eat chocolate instead","We should go home","This is unfair"],"correct_answer":"It's time for a chocolate mystery"},{"question":"What clue do Mia and Jake find near the pedestal?","options":["A chocolate bar","A chocolate wrapper","A chocolate mold","A note"],"correct_answer":"A chocolate wrapper"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_258_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_258_ch1_img1.png","plot_258_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":614,"reading_level":"Builder"}
