   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_258_11_14","title":"The Great Chocolate Caper","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Detective","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"As the sun dipped low in the sky, casting a golden glow over the bustling town square, Mia and Jake stood with their arms crossed, staring at the empty pedestal where the grand prize chocolate sculpture should have been. The air was filled with the sweet aroma of melting chocolate and caramelized sugar, but instead of delight, Mia felt a pang of urgency. \u201cLooks like it\u2019s time for a chocolate mystery!\u201d she declared, her determination shining through her initial frustration.\n\n\u201cDo you think we\u2019ll find it before the festival ends?\u201d Jake asked, his voice a mix of excitement and worry. His chocolate-covered fingers fidgeted with the edges of the notepad they had been using to jot down clues.\n\n\u201cAbsolutely! We just need to follow the leads we have.\u201d Mia scanned the crowd, trying to catch sight of Ms. Choco or Mr. Bitterman. \u201cLet\u2019s head to Ms. Choco\u2019s stall first; she might have seen something.\u201d\n\nThey weaved through the throngs of festival-goers, the vibrant colors of candy wrappers and the cheerful laughter of children creating a lively backdrop. The cheerful tunes from a nearby band drummed in the air, but the siblings had only one thing on their minds\u2014solving the mystery. \n\nWhen they reached Ms. Choco\u2019s stall, the whimsical chocolatier was busy arranging her chocolate truffles into a heart-shaped display. Her round glasses perched on her nose, she didn\u2019t notice them at first. \n\n\u201cMs. Choco!\u201d Mia called out, and the chocolatier turned, her eyes sparkling with mischief. \u201cWe need your help! The grand prize sculpture has been stolen!\u201d\n\nMs. Choco gasped, her hands momentarily stilling in their work. \u201cWhat? No! That\u2019s terrible!\u201d Her voice echoed the collective shock of the townsfolk. \u201cI saw Mr. Bitterman earlier. He seemed\u2026 frazzled. Maybe he knows something.\u201d\n\nJake\u2019s eyes lit up. \u201cLet\u2019s go talk to him then!\u201d\n\nJust as they turned to leave, a loud clatter echoed from behind the stall. Mia and Jake exchanged worried glances, and before they could react, a shadow darted past them. \n\n\u201cDid you see that?\u201d Mia whispered, her heart racing. \n\n\u201cYeah! Let\u2019s follow it!\u201d Jake urged, his adventurous spirit ignited.\n\nThe siblings sprinted around the stall, weaving past the towering chocolate fountains and tables laden with decadent sweets. They spotted a shadowy figure slipping into a dark alleyway nearby. It was now or never. \n\n\u201cWait!\u201d Mia called, but the figure was already disappearing into the shadows. Without hesitating, she grabbed Jake\u2019s arm and dashed after the figure, their hearts pounding like drums.\n\nAs they entered the alley, the sweet scent of chocolate began to fade, replaced by an eerie silence. They slowed down, peering around, their breaths coming in quick bursts. The alley was narrow, lined with towering brick walls that seemed to close in on them.\n\nSuddenly, they stumbled upon a small door slightly ajar at the end of the alley. A flicker of light peeked through the gap. \u201cShould we go in?\u201d Jake\u2019s voice trembled with a mix of fear and eagerness.\n\nMia nodded, her detective instincts kicking in. \u201cYes, but quietly!\u201d\n\nThey crept toward the door, their hearts thudding in their chests like chocolate being poured into molds. Just as they reached for the handle, the door swung open, revealing none other than Mr. Bitterman, his face a mask of surprise and indignation.\n\n\u201cWhat are you two doing here?\u201d he barked, his eyes narrowing suspiciously.\n\nBefore Mia could respond, Jake blurted out, \u201cWe\u2019re investigating the chocolate sculpture theft!\u201d\n\nMr. Bitterman laughed, a harsh sound that echoed off the brick walls. \u201cAnd what makes you think I\u2019d tell you anything?\u201d \n\nMia stood her ground, her voice steady. \u201cBecause we know you were acting suspiciously today. If you didn\u2019t take it, you could help us find the real thief!\u201d\n\nFor a long moment, Mr. Bitterman glared at them, but then his expression softened. \u201cFine. I didn\u2019t take it, but I saw someone sneaking around earlier\u2014someone with a very particular talent for chocolate.\u201d\n\nMia felt a rush of hope. \u201cWho? Tell us!\u201d\n\nMr. Bitterman hesitated, then leaned closer, his voice dropping to a conspiratorial whisper. \u201cIt was someone you wouldn\u2019t expect\u2026 someone who is part of the festival.\u201d\n\nMia\u2019s mind raced, piecing together the new information. \u201cDo you mean\u2014\u201d\n\nJust then, the sound of footsteps echoed behind them, and they turned just in time to see a familiar figure approaching. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nMia\u2019s heart skipped a beat. Could this person hold the key to the mystery? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cLooks like we\u2019re not the only ones searching for answers\u2026\u201d Mia said, her brow furrowing.\n\nThey would have to act fast. The festival was still going strong, but the mystery was far from solved.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Mia declare at the beginning of the chapter?","options":["It\u2019s time for a chocolate mystery!","We need more chocolates!","Let\u2019s give up!","Where is the sculpture?"],"correct_answer":"It\u2019s time for a chocolate mystery!"},{"question":"Who does Ms. Choco suggest might have seen something suspicious?","options":["Mr. Bitterman","Jake","A festival-goer","Mia"],"correct_answer":"Mr. Bitterman"},{"question":"What do Mia and Jake find in the alley?","options":["A secret chocolate recipe","A mysterious figure","A lost dog","A broken chocolate statue"],"correct_answer":"A mysterious figure"},{"question":"What does Mr. Bitterman reveal to Mia and Jake?","options":["He stole the sculpture","He knows who the thief is","He's leaving the festival","He's giving up on chocolate"],"correct_answer":"He knows who the thief is"},{"question":"How does the chapter end?","options":["With Mia and Jake giving up","With a clue about the thief","With Mr. Bitterman leaving","With a chocolate fight"],"correct_answer":"With a clue about the thief"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_258_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_258_ch4_img1.png","plot_258_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":795,"reading_level":"Builder"}
