   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_259_7_10","title":"The Mystery of the Stolen Star","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Detective","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"The sun was setting in the small town of Starville. Leo and Lila were excited. Tonight was the annual stargazing event! They raced toward the planetarium. The building looked like a giant spaceship, shining under the colorful lights.\n\n\u201cI can\u2019t wait to see the celestial star map!\u201d Leo said, bouncing on his toes. He loved astronomy. Lila laughed, \u201cAnd I can\u2019t wait to solve some puzzles! Let\u2019s get a good spot!\u201d\n\nAs they entered, the smell of popcorn filled the air. Kids were running around with glowing star wands. Lila spotted their friend, Mr. Cosmos, the local astronomer. He was tall with wild, curly hair and a huge smile.\n\n\u201cHello, Leo and Lila!\u201d he called out. \u201cAre you ready for the stars?\u201d \n\n\u201cYes!\u201d they shouted together. Mr. Cosmos winked. \u201cTonight is special. The star map shows constellations that tell stories.\u201d \n\nSuddenly, a loud gasp echoed through the room. \u201cWhere\u2019s the star map?\u201d a voice shouted. Everyone turned to see Mrs. Twinkle, the event organizer, looking very worried.\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s gone!\u201d she cried. \u201cWithout it, the stargazing event is ruined!\u201d\n\nLeo turned to Lila, his eyes sparkling with curiosity. \u201cThe stars have a story to tell, and we need to find out what it is!\u201d \n\nLila nodded. \u201cLet\u2019s investigate! We can talk to everyone here!\u201d They quickly made a list of suspects. \n\n\u201cWho could have taken it?\u201d Leo wondered. \n\nThey decided to start with Mr. Cosmos. \u201cDid you see anyone suspicious?\u201d Lila asked. Mr. Cosmos scratched his head. \u201cWell, I did see someone near the star map earlier\u2026\u201d \n\nJust then, Leo pointed at something shiny on the floor. \u201cLook!\u201d he exclaimed. \u201cWhat\u2019s that?\u201d \n\nThey rushed over to investigate. It was a small, silver key! \n\n\u201cThat might be a clue!\u201d Lila said, her eyes shining with excitement. \n\nLeo smiled, \u201cLet\u2019s find out what it unlocks!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, the lights flickered above them, and the excitement in the room grew. The kids were buzzing with ideas.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s check the storage room!\u201d Lila said. \u201cMaybe it has something to do with the key.\u201d \n\nLeo agreed, \u201cYes! But we need to hurry before the stars come out!\u201d \n\nThey dashed through the planetarium, ready for their first big adventure. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAs they approached the door, Leo whispered, \u201cWhat if we find the thief?\u201d \n\n\u201cWe will!\u201d Lila replied confidently. \u201cWe\u2019re the best detective team in Starville!\u201d \n\nThey took a deep breath and pulled the door open, ready to face whatever mystery awaited them.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What event are Leo and Lila excited about?","options":["A birthday party","A stargazing event","A science fair","A picnic"],"correct_answer":"A stargazing event"},{"question":"Who is the local astronomer?","options":["Mrs. Twinkle","Mr. Cosmos","Leo","Lila"],"correct_answer":"Mr. Cosmos"},{"question":"What is missing from the planetarium?","options":["A star map","A telescope","A book","A planet"],"correct_answer":"A star map"},{"question":"What did Leo and Lila find on the floor?","options":["A star wand","A silver key","A map","A telescope"],"correct_answer":"A silver key"},{"question":"Where do Leo and Lila decide to go next?","options":["The library","The storage room","The park","Home"],"correct_answer":"The storage room"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_259_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_259_ch1_img1.png","plot_259_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":417,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
