   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_259_7_10","title":"The Mystery of the Stolen Star","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Detective","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"The moon was bright, and the stars twinkled like gems in the sky. Leo and Lila stood outside the Starville Planetarium. They could hear the buzz of excitement from the crowd inside. \n\n\u201cLook at all those telescopes!\u201d Leo exclaimed, his eyes sparkling. \u201cWe need to find out who took the star map and why!\u201d\n\nLila nodded, tapping her chin. \u201cLet\u2019s start asking questions! Maybe someone saw something unusual.\u201d\n\nThey stepped into the planetarium. Inside, it was warm and cozy. The walls were painted dark blue, and colorful stars shone all around. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cMr. Cosmos will know if anyone is acting strange,\u201d said Lila.\n\nLeo agreed. \u201cLet\u2019s find him!\u201d\n\nThey searched the room and finally spotted Mr. Cosmos. He was adjusting a telescope. His glasses slid down his nose as he focused on the stars.\n\n\u201cMr. Cosmos!\u201d Leo shouted. \u201cHave you seen anyone acting suspiciously?\u201d\n\nMr. Cosmos looked up, startled. \u201cSuspicious? Oh dear! Just a moment, children!\" \n\nHe took a deep breath and leaned closer. \u201cEarlier, I noticed Miss Stella looking around nervously. She seemed very interested in the star map.\u201d\n\nLila\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cMiss Stella? The lady who collects stars?\u201d\n\n\u201cYes,\u201d Mr. Cosmos replied. \u201cShe came here earlier than anyone else.\u201d\n\nLeo frowned. \u201cWe need to talk to her!\u201d\n\nThey dashed outside, searching for Miss Stella among the crowd. Suddenly, they heard a commotion. A group of kids were pointing at the sky. \n\n\u201cLook! A shooting star!\u201d someone yelled. \n\nLila and Leo followed the noise. They squeezed through the crowd. \u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d Lila asked.\n\n\u201cOver there!\u201d a kid shouted, pointing. A bright streak of light zipped across the sky. \n\n\u201cWow!\u201d Leo said, his heart racing. \u201cBut we can\u2019t forget about the star map!\u201d\n\nThen, they spotted Miss Stella sitting on a bench, sketching something in her notebook. She looked worried. \u201cOh no! Where\u2019s my pencil?\u201d she muttered. \n\nLila approached her. \u201cMiss Stella, can we ask you a few questions?\u201d\n\nMiss Stella jumped. \u201cQuestions? About what?\u201d\n\n\u201cAbout the missing star map,\u201d Leo said. \u201cDid you see anyone take it?\u201d\n\nMiss Stella hesitated. \u201cI... I didn\u2019t see anyone, but I think I heard a noise by the telescope earlier.\u201d \n\n\u201cA noise?\u201d Lila asked eagerly. \n\n\u201cYes! It sounded like... a key dropping!\u201d Miss Stella replied.\n\nLeo and Lila exchanged glances. A key! Could it be the silver key they found earlier? \n\n\u201cThank you, Miss Stella!\u201d Lila smiled. \u201cWe\u2019ll investigate!\u201d\n\nAs they turned to leave, a loud crash echoed from across the park. The twins gasped and ran toward the sound. \n\n\u201cWhat now?\u201d Leo said, his heart pounding. \n\nThey had to find out! \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who did Leo and Lila decide to ask about the star map?","options":["Mr. Cosmos","Miss Stella","The other kids","The stars"],"correct_answer":"Mr. Cosmos"},{"question":"What sound did Miss Stella hear near the telescope?","options":["A crash","A key dropping","A star falling","A voice calling"],"correct_answer":"A key dropping"},{"question":"What did Leo and Lila see in the sky?","options":["A balloon","A shooting star","A big bird","A cloud"],"correct_answer":"A shooting star"},{"question":"Where did Leo and Lila find Miss Stella?","options":["At the planetarium","On a bench","In the park","By the telescope"],"correct_answer":"On a bench"},{"question":"What interrupted Leo and Lila's investigation?","options":["A loud crash","A phone ringing","A dog barking","A car honking"],"correct_answer":"A loud crash"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_259_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_259_ch2_img1.png","plot_259_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":440,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
