   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_259_7_10","title":"The Mystery of the Stolen Star","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Detective","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Chapter 3: The Missing Clue\n\nLeo and Lila stood in the planetarium, their hearts racing. The crash had come from the telescope room! \"What if someone is trying to stop us?\" Lila whispered, her eyes wide. \n\n\"We have to check it out,\" Leo said, gripping the silver key tightly. They pushed open the door to the telescope room. \n\nInside, they found Miss Stella, the librarian, frantically picking up books from the floor. \"Oh dear! I'm so sorry! I was just trying to reach this!\" She held up a heavy astronomy book. \n\n\"Miss Stella!\" Lila exclaimed. \"Did you see anyone suspicious around here?\" \n\nMiss Stella paused, her brow furrowing. \"Actually, I did! Just before the crash, I saw Mr. Cosmos sneaking out of the storage room with something shiny!\" \n\n\"Shiny?\" Leo's eyes lit up. \"Do you think it was the star map?\" \n\n\"I don't know, but he looked worried,\" Miss Stella replied. \n\n\"Thanks, Miss Stella! We need to find him!\" Leo said. They hurried out of the room, but their hearts sank when they saw Mr. Cosmos standing by the exit, looking even more worried than before. \n\n\"Uh-oh,\" Lila said. \"What if he thinks we know too much?\" \n\nLeo took a deep breath. \"We have to ask him!\" \n\nThey approached Mr. Cosmos. \"Mr. Cosmos, did you take the star map?\" Lila asked, her voice steady. \n\nMr. Cosmos jumped. \"What? No! I would never! But\u2014\" He glanced around nervously. \"I did see someone else near the map before it went missing.\" \n\n\"Who?\" Leo pressed. \n\nMr. Cosmos leaned closer. \"The answer is in the stars, but you must hurry! The stargazing event will begin soon!\" \n\nSuddenly, another loud crash echoed through the planetarium! [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\"What was that?\" Leo gasped. \n\nThey rushed toward the sound, their feet racing. They arrived at the observatory just in time to see a flash of silver disappear behind a curtain. \n\n\"Did you see that?\" Lila pointed. \n\n\"Yes! We can't let whoever it is escape!\" Leo shouted. He dashed forward, the silver key clinking in his pocket. \n\nAs they pulled back the curtain, they gasped. A strange figure stood there, holding something glimmering in the light. It was the star map! \n\n\"Stop!\" Lila yelled. \n\nBut the figure turned and sprinted away. Leo and Lila exchanged looks. \"We have to catch them!\" \n\nThey dashed out of the planetarium, their hearts pounding with excitement. They had to find the thief before the stargazing event was ruined! \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\"Leo, do you think it could be Mr. Cosmos?\" Lila asked, her eyes wide. \n\n\"I don\u2019t know, but we need to find out!\" Leo replied, determination in his voice. \n\nWith the stars shining above them, they took off into the night, ready for a chase that would lead them into the heart of the mystery!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who did Miss Stella see near the star map?","options":["Leo","Lila","Mr. Cosmos","The librarian"],"correct_answer":"Mr. Cosmos"},{"question":"What did Leo and Lila hear that made them concerned?","options":["A laugh","A crash","A song","A whisper"],"correct_answer":"A crash"},{"question":"What did the strange figure hold?","options":["A telescope","A book","The star map","A silver key"],"correct_answer":"The star map"},{"question":"What do Leo and Lila need to find out?","options":["Where the pizza is","Who stole the star map","What time it is","When to leave"],"correct_answer":"Who stole the star map"},{"question":"What did Mr. Cosmos say about the answer?","options":["It's hidden in a book","It's in the stars","It's on the moon","It's a secret"],"correct_answer":"It's in the stars"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_259_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_259_ch3_img1.png","plot_259_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":463,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
