   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_259_7_10","title":"The Mystery of the Stolen Star","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Detective","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Leo and Lila stood in front of the planetarium. The bright lights of the stargazing event sparkled around them. \u201cWe need to find that star map!\u201d Leo exclaimed, his eyes shining with determination. \u201cLet\u2019s think about what we know so far.\u201d\n\nLila nodded. \u201cWe have the silver key and the information about Mr. Cosmos and Miss Stella. It\u2019s time to put the pieces together!\u201d\n\nThey pulled out their notebook. Lila wrote down everything they had learned. Then, they decided to visit Mr. Cosmos again. After all, he might have more answers.\n\nAs they walked to the planetarium, Lila asked, \u201cWhat if he\u2019s hiding something? What if he really did take the star map?\u201d \n\nLeo frowned. \u201cWe can\u2019t jump to conclusions. We have to be careful!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe planetarium door swung open. Inside, they saw Mr. Cosmos looking through a huge telescope. \u201cAh, welcome, my young astronomers!\u201d he said, smiling. \u201cWhat brings you back?\u201d\n\n\u201cMr. Cosmos, we need your help,\u201d Leo said. \u201cThe star map is missing! We think you might know something.\u201d\n\nMr. Cosmos looked serious. \u201cHmm, stolen star maps are no joke. What do you think happened?\u201d\n\n\u201cWe found a silver key,\u201d Lila added, \u201cand we heard there was a strange figure last night near the stargazing area.\u201d\n\nMr. Cosmos\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cA silver key? Interesting! It could be connected to the star map. Let\u2019s check my old star charts!\u201d\n\nThey gathered around the telescope, excitement bubbling in the air. Suddenly, Lila pointed at a chart. \u201cLook at this!\u201d she said, her finger resting on a constellation. \u201cThat star looks like it\u2019s pointing to something!\u201d\n\n\u201cWait,\u201d Leo said, \u201cthat\u2019s the North Star! It\u2019s always been the guide to treasures!\u201d\n\nWith newfound hope, they searched the chart for clues. \u201cIf we follow the North Star, maybe it will help us find the map!\u201d Lila suggested.\n\nMr. Cosmos nodded. \u201cYou two are quite clever. Let\u2019s look outside and see what the stars might tell us!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nExcitedly, they rushed outside. The stars twinkled like diamonds against the dark sky. Every star felt alive, whispering secrets. \u201cThe stars have a story to tell!\u201d Leo shouted. \n\nAs they gazed up, Lila spotted something glimmering on the ground. \u201cLook! Over there!\u201d She dashed to it, her heart racing. \n\nIt was a tiny piece of parchment! \u201cWhat is it?\u201d Leo asked, bending down beside her. \n\nLila opened it carefully. \u201cIt looks like a riddle!\u201d\n\n\u201cRead it!\u201d Leo urged, his voice full of excitement.\n\nLila read aloud, \u201cTo find what you seek, look where the old oak stands. The stars will guide you through the sands.\u201d \n\n\u201cAn old oak!\u201d Leo exclaimed. \u201cThat\u2019s at the park! We have to go!\u201d\n\nWith a mix of hope and determination, they rushed toward the park, ready to uncover the final mystery. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find that star map!\u201d Lila cheered.\n\n\u201cBefore it\u2019s too late!\u201d Leo added, as they sprinted away under the glowing stars.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Leo and Lila find at the planetarium?","options":["A star map","A silver key","A riddle","A telescope"],"correct_answer":"A riddle"},{"question":"What does the silver key connect to?","options":["Star charts","The stargazing event","The missing star map","Mr. Cosmos"],"correct_answer":"The missing star map"},{"question":"What does the North Star guide Leo and Lila to?","options":["The park","The planetarium","The old oak","The telescopes"],"correct_answer":"The old oak"},{"question":"Who is Mr. Cosmos?","options":["The town mayor","An astronaut","The local astronomer","A teacher"],"correct_answer":"The local astronomer"},{"question":"What is Leo's passion?","options":["Dancing","Cooking","Astronomy","Drawing"],"correct_answer":"Astronomy"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_259_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_259_ch4_img1.png","plot_259_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":497,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
