   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_259_11_14","title":"The Mystery of the Stolen Star","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Detective","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"The annual stargazing event was a highlight in the small town of Celestia. Each year, the townsfolk gathered at the planetarium, their eyes filled with wonder as they peered through telescopes to catch a glimpse of the stars. This year, however, something was amiss. \n\nLeo and Lila, twelve-year-old twins with a shared passion for the cosmos, stood in front of the planetarium's entrance, their excitement palpable. The warm evening air sparkled with anticipation, and the sky above was a vast canvas of dark blue, dotted with twinkling stars. \n\n\u201cThe stars have a story to tell,\u201d Leo said, adjusting his glasses. His eyes sparkled with the same brightness as the stars overhead. \u201cAnd we need to find out what it is!\u201d\n\nLila, always quick on her feet, smirked. \u201cWe should write our own story. Starting with an adventure!\u201d\n\nJust then, the town's astronomer, Mr. Cosmos, appeared, his silver hair glowing under the soft lights of the planetarium. His eyes were wide as he gestured frantically. \u201cThe celestial star map! It's gone!\u201d \n\n\u201cWhat?!\u201d gasped Lila, her heart racing. \u201cIt\u2019s the centerpiece of the entire event!\u201d\n\nThe twins exchanged worried glances. The star map was no ordinary piece of paper; it was a detailed guide to the stars and constellations, crafted by Mr. Cosmos himself. Without it, the stargazing event would be ruined.\n\n\"We have to find it,\" Leo declared, determination etched on his face. \"We can't let the townsfolk down.\"\n\nWith their minds set, the twins began to interrogate the townsfolk. Their first stop was Mrs. Pippin, the sweet old lady who ran the town bakery. As they entered, the smell of freshly baked cookies enveloped them. \n\n\u201cHave you seen the star map, Mrs. Pippin?\u201d Lila asked, her voice a mix of curiosity and urgency. \n\nMrs. Pippin paused, her flour-dusted hands trembling slightly. \u201cI did see Mr. Cosmos pacing outside earlier. He looked worried.\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe twins exchanged glances, their minds buzzing with possibilities. Could Mr. Cosmos be involved? \n\n\u201cThanks, Mrs. Pippin! We\u2019ll investigate!\u201d Leo replied, trying to keep his enthusiasm. They hurried outside, the stars twinkling down at them as if urging them on. \n\nThey decided to head over to the park where Mr. Cosmos had last been seen. The park was filled with families setting up blankets and telescopes, laughter echoing in the air. But amid the joy, a tense energy settled over Leo and Lila as they searched for clues.\n\nSuddenly, Lila spotted something glinting under a nearby bench. \u201cLeo, look!\u201d she exclaimed. They rushed over, hearts pounding. It was a small piece of parchment, crumpled and dusty.\n\n\u201cCould this be a clue?\u201d Leo wondered aloud, carefully unrolling it. \n\nAs they deciphered the message, a chill swept through Lila. \u201cIt\u2019s a star chart\u2026 but it\u2019s incomplete.\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cI think it leads us to another clue!\u201d Leo said, his excitement growing. \u201cWe must follow it!\u201d\n\n\u201cThen let\u2019s get to work.\u201d Lila grinned, her adventurous spirit ignited. The night was just beginning, and the twins were determined to uncover the truth behind the stolen star map before it was too late.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What event is happening in Celestia?","options":["Annual Race","Stargazing Event","Book Fair","Music Festival"],"correct_answer":"Stargazing Event"},{"question":"Who is the local astronomer?","options":["Leo","Lila","Mrs. Pippin","Mr. Cosmos"],"correct_answer":"Mr. Cosmos"},{"question":"What do Leo and Lila find that may be a clue?","options":["A star map","A telescope","A piece of parchment","A cookie"],"correct_answer":"A piece of parchment"},{"question":"How do Leo and Lila feel about solving the mystery?","options":["Disinterested","Excited","Nervous","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"},{"question":"What does Lila suggest they do as their next step?","options":["Go home","Follow the clue","Talk to more people","Give up"],"correct_answer":"Follow the clue"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_259_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_259_ch1_img1.png","plot_259_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":517,"reading_level":"Builder"}
