   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_259_11_14","title":"The Mystery of the Stolen Star","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Detective","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"As the dusk settled over Celestia, the park surrounding the planetarium sparkled with lights strung across trees, illuminating the path to the entrance. Leo and Lila stood together, the excitement in their eyes rivaling the twinkling stars above. \"The stars have a story to tell, and we need to find out what it is!\" Leo proclaimed, his voice steady with determination.\n\nInside, the planetarium bustled with townsfolk preparing for the stargazing event. Telescopes were being set up, and laughter echoed off the walls. Yet, a shadow loomed over the gathering\u2014without the star map, the event could be a total disaster. Lila glanced at Leo, and they both knew they needed to act fast.\n\n\u201cFirst, we should check the telescope area,\u201d Lila suggested, her mind racing with possibilities. \u201cMr. Cosmos mentioned something about how the stars might help us.\u201d\n\nThey made their way to the back of the planetarium where the telescopes pointed towards the night sky. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] The view was breathtaking\u2014thousands of stars glittered like diamonds against the deep blue canvas. Leo adjusted the lens on one of the telescopes, peering through it. \u201cLook, Lila! You can see the constellation Orion so clearly!\u201d\n\n\u201cOrion,\u201d she mused, tapping her chin thoughtfully. \u201cIsn\u2019t he the hunter? What does he have to do with our mystery?\u201d \n\nJust then, a figure emerged from the shadows\u2014Mr. Cosmos, his face drawn tight with worry. \u201cLeo, Lila! You must be careful,\u201d he warned, glancing around as if someone might be listening. \u201cThere\u2019s more to this map than meets the eye. The stars hold secrets.\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat kind of secrets?\u201d Lila asked, her heart racing with intrigue.\n\n\u201cThe old legends say the map can reveal hidden paths in the sky\u2014paths that lead to treasures. But if someone wants the map for themselves\u2026\u201d His voice trailed off, and Leo felt a chill run down his spine.\n\nSuddenly, Lila\u2019s eyes lit up. \u201cWhat if we looked for clues in the constellations? You said the stars might reveal something!\u201d She turned to Mr. Cosmos eagerly.\n\nWith a hesitant nod, he replied, \u201cYes, but be cautious. The thief might be closer than you think.\u201d \n\nLeo and Lila exchanged glances, a silent agreement passing between them. They turned their attention back to the telescope. \u201cLet\u2019s mark the constellations and see if we can find any clues,\u201d Leo suggested, excitement bubbling in his chest.\n\nAs they focused intently on the stars, Lila spotted something unusual. \u201cLook at that one! It seems different from the others.\u201d She pointed. Leo squinted through the lens, heart racing. \u201cIt\u2019s\u2026 it\u2019s not a star at all! It\u2019s a balloon!\u201d \n\n\u201cWhat? A balloon?\u201d Lila exclaimed. \u201cThat\u2019s odd.\u201d\n\n\u201cMaybe it fell from someone nearby?\u201d Leo wondered aloud, his mind racing with the possibilities. Just then, they heard a commotion from the entrance. \n\nLila\u2019s brow furrowed. \u201cLet\u2019s check it out. It could be important.\u201d They dashed toward the sounds, their hearts pounding with both fear and excitement.\n\nAs they approached the entrance, a group of children gathered around a woman frantically waving a glowing object. \u201cMy star map!\u201d she cried, tears of relief shining in her eyes. \u201cI thought I\u2019d lost it forever!\u201d\n\nLeo and Lila exchanged glances, their hearts soaring. Perhaps the mystery was closer to resolution than they thought. \u201cWait,\u201d Lila said, stepping forward. \u201cHow did you find it?\u201d\n\nThe woman looked confused. \u201cI dropped it while setting up my telescope. But I found it under the bench!\u201d\n\nLeo and Lila shared a smile, the mystery unfolding before them like the night sky above. They had uncovered the truth, but they couldn\u2019t shake the feeling that the adventure was far from over. \n\n\u201cMaybe the stars do have a story to tell after all,\u201d Leo said, a grin spreading across his face. \n\nAs they turned back to the glowing sky, they felt a renewed sense of purpose. \u201cLet\u2019s keep searching, Leo. There\u2019s still something out there waiting for us.\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What unusual object did Lila and Leo discover while looking through the telescope?","options":["A shooting star","A balloon","A comet","An alien spacecraft"],"correct_answer":"A balloon"},{"question":"Who warned Leo and Lila to be cautious during their investigation?","options":["The mayor","Mr. Cosmos","Their parents","The librarian"],"correct_answer":"Mr. Cosmos"},{"question":"What did the woman frantically wave around?","options":["A telescope","A piece of paper","The star map","A flag"],"correct_answer":"The star map"},{"question":"What did Leo and Lila decide to do after the woman found her star map?","options":["Celebrate with everyone","Keep searching for more clues","Go home","Watch a movie"],"correct_answer":"Keep searching for more clues"},{"question":"What did Lila suggest as a way to solve the mystery?","options":["Ask the townsfolk","Look for clues in the constellations","Draw a map","Ignore it"],"correct_answer":"Look for clues in the constellations"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_259_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_259_ch5_img1.png","plot_259_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":668,"reading_level":"Builder"}
