   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_260_7_10","title":"The Case of the Disappearing Dog Treats","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Detective","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Mia loved solving mysteries. She was a young detective in a small, friendly neighborhood. Her partner was Buddy, her playful dog. They spent every day exploring.\n\nOne sunny morning, Mia and Buddy were at the local dog park. The grass was bright green, and birds chirped happily. Mia held a bag of dog treats. \"Look, Buddy! We have the best snacks for our friends today!\" she said, smiling. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, Mia noticed something strange. \"Uh-oh! Where are all the dog treats?\" she exclaimed, looking around. She could see other dogs sniffing the ground, wagging their tails, but no treats in sight.\n\nBuddy tilted his head. \"Woof!\" he barked, as if to say, \"Let\u2019s find them!\" Mia had an idea. \"Looks like it\u2019s time to sniff out the truth behind these disappearing treats!\"\n\nThey raced around the park. Mia asked her friends, \"Have you seen any missing dog treats?\" First, they talked to Bella the beagle. She was digging in the dirt. \n\n\"Not today, Mia,\" Bella said, shaking dirt from her fur. \"But I did see Mr. Whiskers sneaking around.\"\n\nMia's eyes widened. \"Mr. Whiskers? The sneaky cat?\" she wondered. She and Buddy hurried to find him. They followed Bella's paw prints to a small yard. \n\n\"Mia! Buddy! Over here!\" called Mr. Whiskers. He was perched on a fence, licking his paws. \"I saw some treats disappear. Follow me!\u201d \n\nMia and Buddy exchanged excited glances. \"Let's go!\" Mia said. \n\nThey followed Mr. Whiskers as he led them down a narrow path. Suddenly, they spotted a shiny trail of crumbs scattered on the ground. \n\n\"Look, Buddy! A trail!\" Mia pointed. \"We\u2019re getting closer!\" \n\nJust then, Buddy barked loudly. \"Woof! Woof!\" He raced ahead, following the crumbs. Mia chased after him, laughing. \"Wait for me, Buddy!\" \n\nThey entered the next yard and saw a gathering of animals. Birds, rabbits, and more dogs were munching on the dog treats! Mia was surprised. \"What\u2019s going on here?\" \n\nMr. Whiskers twitched his tail. \"They couldn\u2019t resist the treats. They just appeared out of nowhere!\" \n\nMia frowned. \"We need to find out who is behind this mystery!\" \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith a determined look, Mia said, \"Let\u2019s gather more clues before the fundraiser starts!\" Buddy wagged his tail. Together, they were ready to uncover the truth.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who is Mia's dog?","options":["Buddy","Bella","Mr. Whiskers","Rex"],"correct_answer":"Buddy"},{"question":"What do Mia and Buddy investigate?","options":["Missing treats","A lost toy","A cat","A bird"],"correct_answer":"Missing treats"},{"question":"Who did Bella the beagle suggest Mia talk to?","options":["Rex","Mr. Whiskers","Buddy","Mia"],"correct_answer":"Mr. Whiskers"},{"question":"What do Mia and Buddy find on the ground?","options":["A toy","A trail of crumbs","A bone","A ball"],"correct_answer":"A trail of crumbs"},{"question":"What does Mia want to do before the fundraiser?","options":["Play fetch","Gather more clues","Go home","Take a nap"],"correct_answer":"Gather more clues"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_260_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_260_ch1_img1.png","plot_260_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":385,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
