   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_260_7_10","title":"The Case of the Disappearing Dog Treats","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Detective","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Mia and Buddy were excited. The sun shone brightly over their cozy neighborhood. Mia wore her favorite detective hat, and Buddy wagged his tail. \"Ready to find those missing treats?\" Mia asked. Buddy barked happily in response.\n\nThey started at the dog park. Mia looked around. \u201cLet\u2019s ask Bella the beagle. She knows everything!\u201d They walked over to where Bella was sniffing the ground.\n\n\u201cBella!\u201d Mia called. \u201cHave you seen any missing dog treats?\u201d\n\nBella perked up her ears. \u201cI saw some crumbs near the park bench earlier! But they disappeared fast!\u201d \n\n\u201cCrumbs?\u201d Mia\u2019s eyes lit up. \u201cLet\u2019s go check!\u201d \n\nAs they ran toward the bench, Mia spotted something shiny. \u201cWhat\u2019s that?\u201d she wondered aloud. It was a small silver tag! She picked it up and read, \u201cProperty of Mr. Whiskers.\u201d \n\n\u201cMr. Whiskers?\u201d Buddy sniffed the ground. \u201cMaybe he knows more!\u201d\n\nThey hurried to Mr. Whiskers\u2019 favorite sunny spot under the big oak tree. \n\n\u201cMr. Whiskers!\u201d Mia called. The sneaky cat stretched and yawned. \u201cI found this tag. Do you know anything about it?\u201d \n\nMr. Whiskers blinked lazily. \u201cOh, that old thing? I might have seen it near the fence where the treats were last spotted.\u201d \n\n\u201cWhere?\u201d Mia asked, eager for more clues.\n\n\u201cFollow the trail of crumbs,\u201d he purred, flicking his tail towards the fence. \u201cBut watch out. There might be surprises!\u201d \n\nMia smiled. \u201cSurprises? We love surprises!\u201d \n\nJust then, a sudden rustle came from the bushes. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Mia whispered, gripping Buddy\u2019s leash tighter. \n\n\u201cI think it\u2019s a squirrel!\u201d Buddy growled softly, ready to chase. Mia held him back. \u201cWait! We need to be smart detectives.\u201d \n\nAs they approached the bushes, a flash of fur darted out, sending Mia and Buddy tumbling back. \u201cOof!\u201d Mia exclaimed, trying to steady herself. \n\n\u201cWho\u2019s there?\u201d she shouted. The bushes shook again. \n\n\u201cDon\u2019t worry! It\u2019s just me!\u201d squeaked a little chipmunk, popping his head out. \u201cI saw the treats! They were taken by a group of squirrels!\u201d \n\n\u201cThank you!\u201d Mia said, feeling a mix of excitement and worry. \u201cWe need to hurry to the fundraiser!\u201d \n\nBuddy barked again, ready for action. \u201cLooks like we need to follow those squirrels now!\u201d \n\nWith renewed determination, Mia and Buddy raced toward the tree line, hearts racing. \u201cLet\u2019s sniff out the truth!\u201d Mia shouted, feeling the thrill of the mystery.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Mia find that belonged to Mr. Whiskers?","options":["A shiny silver tag","A dog treat","A bone","A collar"],"correct_answer":"A shiny silver tag"},{"question":"Who did Mia and Buddy talk to at the dog park?","options":["Mr. Whiskers","Bella the beagle","A squirrel","A chipmunk"],"correct_answer":"Bella the beagle"},{"question":"What did the chipmunk say about the treats?","options":["Squirrels took them","They are hidden","They are gone forever","Dogs ate them"],"correct_answer":"Squirrels took them"},{"question":"What did Mia and Buddy see that startled them?","options":["A big dog","A squirrel","A flying bird","A rustling bush"],"correct_answer":"A rustling bush"},{"question":"What is Mia\u2019s goal in the story?","options":["To eat dog treats","To solve the mystery","To find a cat","To play in the park"],"correct_answer":"To solve the mystery"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_260_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_260_ch2_img1.png","plot_260_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":399,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
