   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_260_7_10","title":"The Case of the Disappearing Dog Treats","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Detective","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Mia and Buddy dashed into the sunny dog park. The grass was bright green, and the flowers bloomed in cheerful colors. Mia pulled out her notebook. \u201cWe need to find that sneaky squirrel!\u201d she said, her voice full of excitement.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cDo you think he\u2019s hiding nearby?\u201d Buddy barked, wagging his tail. He loved adventures, especially ones that involved treats. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s ask Mr. Whiskers if he saw anything,\u201d Mia suggested. They hurried over to the shady tree where Mr. Whiskers liked to lounge. \n\n\u201cHey, Mr. Whiskers!\u201d Mia called. The fluffy gray cat stretched and opened one eye lazily. \u201cDid you see a squirrel stealing dog treats?\u201d\n\nMr. Whiskers yawned. \u201cOh, sure! That squirrel is always up to no good. He was here just yesterday, munching on something crunchy.\u201d\n\n\u201cCrunchy?\u201d Mia\u2019s eyes sparkled. \u201cThat sounds like a clue! Where did he go?\u201d\n\n\u201cHe scurried toward the old oak tree,\u201d Mr. Whiskers replied, flicking his tail. \u201cYou can find him if you hurry!\u201d\n\n\u201cThanks, Mr. Whiskers! Let\u2019s go, Buddy!\u201d Mia shouted. They raced toward the oak tree, hoping to catch the squirrel in the act. \n\nAs they got closer, they saw a little bush moving. \u201cMaybe that\u2019s him!\u201d Mia whispered. They tiptoed carefully. Suddenly, a fluffy tail darted out, and there was the squirrel!\n\n\u201cHey, you!\u201d Mia yelled, as the squirrel froze. \u201cWhy are you stealing all the dog treats?\u201d \n\nThe squirrel looked up, wide-eyed. \u201cI didn\u2019t mean to! I just wanted to help. The dog shelter needs treats for the fundraiser!\u201d \n\nMia scratched her head. \u201cHelp? You were stealing them!\u201d\n\n\u201cI was gathering them for my friends at the shelter. They need snacks to stay happy, just like the dogs,\u201d the squirrel explained, his voice shaky.\n\nMia felt a pang of sympathy. \u201cOkay, but you can\u2019t just take them! Let\u2019s find a better way.\u201d\n\nBuddy wagged his tail in agreement. \u201cMaybe we can share some treats!\u201d he barked happily.\n\nMia smiled. \u201cThat\u2019s a great idea! Let\u2019s work together for the shelter.\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith newfound hope, Mia and the squirrel devised a plan. They would gather treats from all the neighbors and fill a big basket for the shelter.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s get to work!\u201d Mia said, and off they went, determined to make everything right before the fundraiser.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Mia want to find?","options":["A lost toy","The squirrel stealing treats","A new pet","A magic spell"],"correct_answer":"The squirrel stealing treats"},{"question":"Who does Mia talk to for help?","options":["A dog","A cat","A bird","A fish"],"correct_answer":"A cat"},{"question":"What does the squirrel want to do with the treats?","options":["Eat them all","Share them with his friends at the shelter","Hide them","Make a nest"],"correct_answer":"Share them with his friends at the shelter"},{"question":"How does Buddy feel about the squirrel's plan?","options":["He is angry","He agrees with it","He doesn\u2019t care","He wants to chase the squirrel"],"correct_answer":"He agrees with it"},{"question":"What do Mia and the squirrel decide to do?","options":["Gather more treats for the shelter","Go home","Play a game","Find a new mystery"],"correct_answer":"Gather more treats for the shelter"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_260_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_260_ch4_img1.png","plot_260_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":388,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
