   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_260_7_10","title":"The Case of the Disappearing Dog Treats","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Detective","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"As the sun rose over the neighborhood, Mia and Buddy were ready for their big day. They had a plan! A plan to help the dog shelter by gathering treats. \u201cWe can do this, Buddy!\u201d Mia exclaimed, tying her shoes tightly. Buddy wagged his tail, ready for adventure.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThey headed to the dog park to meet Mr. Whiskers and Bella. \u201cWe need your help!\u201d Mia said, excitement bubbling in her voice. \u201cThe dog shelter is counting on us!\u201d Bella the beagle perked up. \u201cI know where we can find more treats!\u201d she barked. Mr. Whiskers flicked his tail and said, \u201cFollow me!\u201d\n\nThe trio followed Mr. Whiskers through the park. They passed barking dogs, children playing, and fresh flowers. Mia felt the thrill of the chase. Suddenly, they spotted a pile of shiny wrappers under a bush! \u201cLook!\u201d Mia shouted. \u201cMore clues!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nMia bent down to examine the wrappers. \u201cThese are from the treats we were missing!\u201d she said, her eyes wide. \u201cDo you think the squirrel is still around?\u201d Buddy sniffed the air, his nose twitching. \u201cLet\u2019s track him down!\u201d he barked.\n\nThey followed a trail of crumbs, leading them to a tall tree. \u201cHe must be up there!\u201d Mia pointed. With a deep breath, she called, \u201cSquirrel! We\u2019re not mad! We just want to help!\u201d To her surprise, the squirrel peeked out from a branch.\n\n\u201cI didn\u2019t mean to take them all,\u201d the squirrel squeaked. \u201cI was just trying to save enough for the shelter. I didn\u2019t know how to ask.\u201d Mia smiled. \u201cWe can work together! Let\u2019s gather treats for everyone!\u201d\n\nWith the squirrel's help, they collected food from all over the park. Soon, they had a mountain of treats! Mia and her friends cheered. \u201cThe shelter will be so happy!\u201d Buddy barked joyfully, wagging his tail.\n\nAt the end of the day, they headed to the dog shelter. Mia felt proud. They had solved the mystery of the disappearing treats and helped the animals in need. \u201cTeamwork makes us strong!\u201d Mia declared. \u201cLet\u2019s always help each other!\u201d\n\nThe sun set behind them, and the sky turned golden. Mia knew this was just the beginning of many adventures to come.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Mia and her friends find under the bush?","options":["A pile of shiny wrappers","A squirrel's nest","A lost dog","A treasure chest"],"correct_answer":"A pile of shiny wrappers"},{"question":"What did the squirrel say about the treats?","options":["He wanted to keep them all","He didn't know how to ask for help","He found them in the trash","He ate them all"],"correct_answer":"He didn't know how to ask for help"},{"question":"What was the main goal of Mia and her friends?","options":["To find the squirrel","To gather treats for the shelter","To play in the park","To chase after dogs"],"correct_answer":"To gather treats for the shelter"},{"question":"How did Mia feel at the end of the day?","options":["Sad","Angry","Proud","Tired"],"correct_answer":"Proud"},{"question":"What did Mia learn about teamwork?","options":["It's important to work alone","It's not needed","Teamwork makes them strong","It's boring"],"correct_answer":"Teamwork makes them strong"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_260_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_260_ch5_img1.png","plot_260_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":373,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
