   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_260_11_14","title":"The Case of the Disappearing Dog Treats","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Detective","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Mia knelt beside Buddy, who was wagging his tail excitedly, his nose twitching as he sniffed the air. The scent of the missing dog treats still lingered, but it was faint. \"We have to be smart about this,\" she said, her voice a mix of determination and enthusiasm. \"Let\u2019s head to the park first. If the treats are anywhere, they might be there.\" \n\nAs they entered the bustling dog park, the cheerful barks and playful yips of dogs filled the air. Mia spotted her friends\u2014Emily and Jake\u2014playing fetch with their dogs, Luna and Max. The park was alive, with dogs racing from one end to the other, their tails wagging like flags in the wind. \n\n\"Hey, Mia!\" called out Emily, waving her arm. \"What\u2019s up? You look like you\u2019re on a mission!\"\n\nMia grinned, her heart racing with excitement. \"I am! The dog treats at the shelter have disappeared, and I need to figure out who\u2014or what\u2014took them!\"\n\n\"Sounds like a detective job for sure!\" Jake chimed in, his eyes sparkling with curiosity. \"Can we help?\"\n\n\"Absolutely! The more, the merrier,\" Mia replied, her spirits lifting. She felt a surge of appreciation for her friends. \"Let\u2019s split up and ask around. Maybe some of the dogs saw something suspicious.\"\n\nThey agreed to meet back at the big oak tree in thirty minutes. As Mia and Buddy began their investigation, she noticed Mr. Whiskers lounging lazily on a fence post, his green eyes glinting in the sunlight. \"Hey, Mr. Whiskers!\" she called out. \"Have you seen anything unusual around here? Like someone sneaking away with dog treats?\"\n\nThe cat stretched and yawned, acting as if he were far too important for such inquiries. But then, with a flick of his tail, he replied, \"Why should I tell you anything? You humans are always in such a hurry.\" \n\nMia frowned slightly. \"Please, Mr. Whiskers. This is important! The shelter needs those treats for the fundraiser tomorrow. We can\u2019t let the dogs down.\"\n\nThe feline\u2019s expression softened just a little. \"Alright, alright. I did see a flash of white fur darting through the bushes earlier. It looked like a little rascal.\" \n\nMia\u2019s ears perked up. \"Did you see where it went?\"\n\nMr. Whiskers licked his paw nonchalantly. \"Into that thicket over there. But be careful. I can smell trouble.\"\n\n\"Thanks, Mr. Whiskers!\" Mia replied, her heart pounding with anticipation. With Buddy leading the way, they cautiously approached the thicket, where the rustling leaves whispered secrets that sent shivers down her spine. \n\nSuddenly, they stumbled upon a pile of bright, colorful wrappers scattered on the ground. Mia gasped, her eyes wide. \"These are from the dog treats!\" she exclaimed. \"But why would someone leave them here?\" \n\nJust then, a flash of movement caught her eye. A tiny white dog peeked out from behind a bush, wagging its tail furiously. \"Is that you?\" Mia asked, bewildered. \"Are you the thief?\"\n\nThe little dog barked twice, almost as if it were trying to communicate. Mia knelt down and extended her hand. \"Hey there, little buddy. What\u2019s your name?\"\n\nBefore she could get an answer, a sudden noise erupted from the thicket, making her jump. Mia and Buddy exchanged worried glances, sensing the tension in the air. \n\n\"What was that?\" Mia whispered, looking around. \n\n\"Could it be\u2026?\" she started, but her thoughts were interrupted by a loud crash further inside the bushes. \n\nBuddy barked instinctively, and Mia stood up, heart racing. \"Looks like we\u2019ve found ourselves in the middle of something big! Let\u2019s check it out, Buddy!\" \n\nAs they crept closer, the mystery deepened, and Mia felt a mixture of fear and excitement. What would they discover next?\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Mia discover at the dog park that indicated the treats had been there?","options":["A pile of wrappers","A note","A suspicious cat","Buddy's paw prints"],"correct_answer":"A pile of wrappers"},{"question":"Who does Mia enlist to help her investigate the missing treats?","options":["Mr. Whiskers","Emily and Jake","A police officer","The shelter manager"],"correct_answer":"Emily and Jake"},{"question":"What does Mr. Whiskers reveal to Mia?","options":["He saw a suspicious dog","He took the treats","He lost his collar","He needs food"],"correct_answer":"He saw a suspicious dog"},{"question":"What unexpected sound interrupts Mia\u2019s investigation?","options":["A dog barking","A loud crash","A cat meowing","A child laughing"],"correct_answer":"A loud crash"},{"question":"What does Mia feel when she sees the little white dog?","options":["Fear","Excitement","Indifference","Anger"],"correct_answer":"Excitement"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_260_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_260_ch2_img1.png","plot_260_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":629,"reading_level":"Builder"}
