   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_260_11_14","title":"The Case of the Disappearing Dog Treats","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Detective","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Mia and Buddy set off from the dog park, the warm afternoon sun casting playful shadows on the sidewalk. As they trotted home, Mia's mind buzzed with what she\u2019d learned from Mr. Whiskers. The information churned in her head like a puzzle waiting to be solved. \u201cSo, a tiny white dog has been spotted near the shelter, and it seems to have a knack for sneaking treats,\u201d she mused aloud, glancing down at Buddy, who wagged his tail in agreement.\n\nJust as they turned the corner, something glinted in the grass. Mia knelt down, her heart racing. It was a shiny dog tag, engraved with the name \u201cFluffy.\u201d \u201cDo you think this belongs to our mystery pup?\u201d she asked Buddy, who sniffed the tag curiously. \u201cLet\u2019s find out!\u201d \n\nThey hurried to the shelter, where Mia knew the staff could help identify Fluffy. The familiar blue building loomed ahead, bustling with volunteers and dogs barking excitedly. Mia felt a rush of determination; they were one step closer to solving the case.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nInside, Mia approached Mrs. Jenkins, the shelter manager. \u201cExcuse me! Do you know a dog named Fluffy?\u201d she asked, holding up the tag. Mrs. Jenkins squinted at it, recognition dawning on her face. \u201cYes, Fluffy\u2019s been here before! He was adopted but returned because he kept escaping,\u201d she explained, her brow furrowing. \u201cHe\u2019s a clever little guy.\u201d\n\nMia\u2019s heart sank. \u201cDo you think he could be the one taking the treats?\u201d she questioned, urgency in her voice. \u201cIt\u2019s possible,\u201d Mrs. Jenkins replied, \u201cbut Fluffy\u2019s very friendly. He wouldn\u2019t take treats without a reason.\u201d \n\nMia nodded, contemplating the implications. If Fluffy wasn\u2019t stealing the treats, who was? Just then, a loud crash echoed from the back of the shelter. Mia jumped, her detective instincts flaring. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d \n\nBefore anyone could answer, Buddy darted off toward the noise, tail in the air. \u201cBuddy, wait!\u201d Mia called, racing after him. They skidded to a halt in front of the supply room, where half-open doors revealed toppled boxes and scattered dog food. \n\nMia\u2019s eyes widened as she spotted a fluffy tail disappearing around the corner. \u201cThere! It\u2019s Fluffy!\u201d she exclaimed, charging after the little dog. But as they rounded the corner, Fluffy was gone, leaving behind a trail of scattered kibble.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cWhere could he have gone?\u201d Mia wondered aloud, feeling the tension build inside her. \u201cHe couldn\u2019t have gotten far!\u201d Buddy sniffed the ground, his nose twitching as he picked up the scent. \n\n\u201cCome on, boy! Let\u2019s find Fluffy!\u201d They followed the trail through the shelter, past barking dogs and startled volunteers. Mia\u2019s heart raced with the thrill of the chase, but just as they reached the back door, a sudden thought struck her. What if they weren\u2019t the only ones after Fluffy? What if someone else wanted something from him?\n\n\u201cBuddy, we need to be careful. We don\u2019t know who else is involved,\u201d she whispered, the weight of the mystery pressing down on her. With the shelter fundraiser just days away, they had to crack the case before it was too late. \n\nAs they stepped outside, a chilling wind swept through the yard, carrying the faint sound of barking. But it didn\u2019t sound like Fluffy. \u201cWhat if there\u2019s more to this than just disappearing treats?\u201d Mia pondered, determination sparking in her eyes. \u201cWe have to find out what\u2019s really going on.\u201d\n\nAnd with that, they took off in the direction of the sound, ready to face whatever secrets awaited them.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Mia find in the grass?","options":["A dog treat","A dog tag","A ball","A leash"],"correct_answer":"A dog tag"},{"question":"Why was Fluffy returned to the shelter?","options":["He was too noisy","He kept escaping","He didn't get along with other dogs","He was too small"],"correct_answer":"He kept escaping"},{"question":"What sound interrupts Mia and Buddy's investigation?","options":["A barking dog","A loud crash","A siren","A cat meowing"],"correct_answer":"A loud crash"},{"question":"What does Mia realize about the mystery?","options":["It's a simple case","She needs more help","Others may be involved","It's about Fluffy's disappearance"],"correct_answer":"Others may be involved"},{"question":"What is Mia's main goal in this chapter?","options":["To play with dogs","To find Fluffy","To take a nap","To eat dog treats"],"correct_answer":"To find Fluffy"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_260_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_260_ch3_img1.png","plot_260_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":601,"reading_level":"Builder"}
