   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"mystery_260_11_14","title":"The Case of the Disappearing Dog Treats","genre":"Mystery","sub_genre":"Detective","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Chapter 4: The Twists of Truth\n\nMia adjusted her detective hat as she entered the familiar grounds of the local dog shelter. The air was filled with the cheerful barks of dogs and the smell of freshly baked treats. She glanced down at Buddy, who wagged his tail enthusiastically, eager to investigate. \u201cLet\u2019s see what we can find, Buddy!\u201d she exclaimed, determination shining in her eyes. \n\nAs they walked past rows of dog kennels, Mia's heart raced. She felt a thrill of excitement, like a detective in a thrilling novel. Every corner could hold a clue. Suddenly, she spotted a small, white tag on the ground. It glittered in the sunlight, and she recognized it instantly. \u201cFluffy\u2019s tag!\u201d she cried out, lifting it triumphantly. \u201cThis must mean we\u2019re getting closer!\u201d\n\nJust then, her phone buzzed in her pocket. It was a message from Mr. Whiskers. \u201cMeet me by the old oak tree, near the park. I have something important to tell you,\u201d it read. Mia exchanged a glance with Buddy, who seemed to sense the urgency. \u201cLooks like our next stop is the park,\u201d she said. \n\nAs they made their way there, Mia couldn\u2019t shake the feeling that they were on the verge of a breakthrough. The old oak tree stood majestically in the park, its branches spreading wide like welcoming arms. When they arrived, Mr. Whiskers was lounging on a low branch, his emerald eyes watching them closely. \n\n\u201cAh, Mia! You made it,\u201d he purred, his voice smooth like honey. \u201cI\u2019ve seen Fluffy sneaking around the neighborhood. There\u2019s more than meets the eye with that little pup.\u201d \n\nMia\u2019s curiosity piqued. \u201cWhat do you mean? Is Fluffy involved in the missing treats?\u201d\n\nMr. Whiskers flicked his tail, a sly grin forming on his face. \u201cLet\u2019s just say, Fluffy has a knack for finding what others lose. And I think he might have some friends helping him.\u201d \n\nAt that moment, a commotion erupted from the nearby bushes. The sound of yapping filled the air as Fluffy, the tiny white dog, darted out, followed closely by a handful of eager puppies. They bounded toward Mia and Buddy, their tails wagging like flags. \n\n\u201cWho let the pups out?\u201d Mia laughed, crouching down to greet them. \u201cLooks like we\u2019ve got some playful culprits in our midst!\u201d \n\nBut as Mia observed Fluffy, she noticed something strange. The little dog was clutching a half-eaten bag of dog treats in his mouth, crumbs trailing behind him like a breadcrumb path. Mia\u2019s heart raced. \u201cCould this be the key to the mystery?\u201d she wondered aloud. \n\n\u201cHey, Fluffy!\u201d she called, extending her hand. \u201cDid you find those treats? Where did you get them?\u201d The puppies paused, tilting their heads at her, as if understanding her plea. \n\nSuddenly, Fluffy dropped the bag and took off running toward the shelter, the playful puppies following him like a parade. \u201cWait!\u201d Mia shouted, her mind racing. \u201cWe need to follow them!\u201d\n\nAs they took off after the mischievous gang, the thrill of the chase filled Mia with hope. It felt like every clue was leading her closer to the truth. \u201cLet\u2019s go, Buddy!\u201d she encouraged, her heart pounding with excitement. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nMia and Buddy sprinted through the park, the sun shining down and illuminating the path ahead. The vibrant colors of the flowers blurred by as they ran, their laughter mingling with the sounds of the playful puppies. \n\nWhen they reached the shelter, Fluffy and the puppies suddenly stopped, their eyes wide as they gathered around the entrance. Mia took a breath, the anticipation bubbling inside her. \u201cWhat do you have for us, little ones?\u201d she asked, kneeling down. \n\nBut before she could get closer, a loud crash echoed from inside the shelter, sending a wave of panic through her. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Mia exclaimed, looking at Buddy with wide eyes. \n\n\u201cI think we might have just uncovered something big,\u201d Mr. Whiskers whispered, his gaze fixed on the door. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nMia\u2019s mind raced. She could feel the mystery tightening like a spring, ready to unravel. Whatever was behind that door could either be the solution they needed or another twist in this already tangled tale. With her heart pounding, she stepped closer, ready to face whatever awaited them inside.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Mia find that belongs to Fluffy?","options":["A collar","A tag","A ball","A leash"],"correct_answer":"A tag"},{"question":"Where does Mr. Whiskers ask Mia to meet him?","options":["By the fountain","Near the park","At the shelter","In her backyard"],"correct_answer":"Near the park"},{"question":"What does Fluffy bring with him when he appears?","options":["A bone","A ball","A bag of treats","A toy"],"correct_answer":"A bag of treats"},{"question":"What does Mia feel when she sees the puppies?","options":["Fear","Excitement","Anger","Sadness"],"correct_answer":"Excitement"},{"question":"What happens at the end of the chapter?","options":["Mia finds Fluffy's owner","A loud crash occurs","They find the missing treats","They leave the park"],"correct_answer":"A loud crash occurs"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_260_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_260_ch4_img1.png","plot_260_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":719,"reading_level":"Builder"}
