   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_176_7_10","title":"The Crystal Alley Chronicles","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Urban Fantasy","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Mia was a curious girl. She loved exploring her busy city. One sunny afternoon, she wandered into a narrow alley that looked different from the rest. The walls sparkled like diamonds in the sunlight. \n\n\u201cWhat is this place?\u201d Mia whispered, her eyes wide with wonder. She stepped forward, her heart racing. \n\nSuddenly, a tiny voice squeaked, \u201cHey! Watch where you\u2019re stepping!\u201d \n\nMia jumped back. \u201cWho said that?\u201d \n\nA little pixie with bright green wings fluttered in front of her face. \u201cI\u2019m Theo!\u201d he exclaimed, grinning. \u201cYou\u2019re in Crystal Alley! It\u2019s filled with magic!\u201d \n\nMia gasped. She had never seen anything like it. Colorful shops lined the alley, each with a glowing sign. One shop had a sign that read \u201cWands and Wonders,\u201d another said \u201cPotions and Puzzles.\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s a wand?\u201d Mia asked, pointing at the shop. \n\n\u201cIt\u2019s for magic!\u201d Theo replied, doing a little flip in the air. \u201cBut we need to be careful. A dark sorcerer is after the magic here!\u201d \n\nMia frowned. \u201cA sorcerer? Why?\u201d \n\n\u201cHe wants to drain all the magic from Crystal Alley! We must stop him!\u201d Theo said, his voice serious. \n\n\u201cOkay! What can I do?\u201d Mia asked, feeling brave. \n\n\u201cYou have magic in you, too!\u201d Theo flew in circles around her. \u201cWe need to find Mr. Glimmer. He knows how to fight the sorcerer!\u201d \n\nTogether, they hurried deeper into the alley. The air was cool and smelled of sweet candies. Suddenly, they heard a loud crash! \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d shouted Theo, darting toward the noise. \n\nMia sprinted after him, her heart pounding. They turned a corner and found Mr. Glimmer, the shopkeeper, surrounded by shimmering crystals. \n\n\u201cHelp!\u201d he cried, looking worried. \u201cThe sorcerer is near!\u201d \n\nMia felt a chill run down her spine. \u201cWhat do we do?\u201d \n\n\u201cStay close!\u201d Mr. Glimmer shouted. \u201cAnd don\u2019t be afraid to use your magic!\u201d \n\nMia took a deep breath. She felt something warm inside her. \u201cI\u2019m ready!\u201d she said. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nBut just then, a shadow loomed over them. The sorcerer had arrived! \n\n\u201cGive me your magic!\u201d he roared, his eyes sparkling like ice. \n\nMia\u2019s heart raced. She took a step forward. \u201cNo! You can\u2019t have it!\u201d \n\nWould Mia\u2019s bravery be enough to save Crystal Alley?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the name of the hidden alley Mia discovers?","options":["Crystal Alley","Magic Lane","Wonder Street","Mystery Avenue"],"correct_answer":"Crystal Alley"},{"question":"Who is the mischievous pixie that Mia meets?","options":["Mr. Glimmer","Theo","The Sorcerer","Mia's Friend"],"correct_answer":"Theo"},{"question":"What does the dark sorcerer want to steal?","options":["Crystals","Magic","Shops","Friends"],"correct_answer":"Magic"},{"question":"What does Mr. Glimmer need help with?","options":["Finding Mia","Singing a song","Fighting the sorcerer","Making potions"],"correct_answer":"Fighting the sorcerer"},{"question":"How does Mia feel at the end of the chapter?","options":["Scared","Excited","Bored","Hungry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_176_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_176_ch1_img1.png","plot_176_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":381,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
