   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_176_7_10","title":"The Crystal Alley Chronicles","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Urban Fantasy","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Mia stood at the entrance of Crystal Alley. It sparkled with colors she had never seen. The air was filled with the sweet smell of candy and the sound of laughter. \u201cWow, this place is amazing!\u201d she exclaimed as she stepped inside.\n\n\u201cWelcome to my alley!\u201d said Theo, flying around Mia\u2019s head. His wings shimmered like rainbows. \u201cBut we have a problem. The dark sorcerer is planning something!\u201d\n\n\u201cSomething bad?\u201d Mia asked, her heart racing.\n\n\u201cVery bad!\u201d Theo flitted over to a shop called \"Glimmer's Curiosities.\" \u201cMr. Glimmer knows about the sorcerer. He can help us!\u201d\n\nMia hesitated. Mr. Glimmer had seemed grumpy. \u201cWhat if he doesn\u2019t want to help?\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find out!\u201d Theo zoomed toward the door. Mia followed, pushing the door open. The shop was filled with strange and wonderful things. There were glowing crystals, jars of colorful potions, and odd-looking trinkets.\n\n\u201cAh, visitors!\u201d Mr. Glimmer grumbled from behind the counter. \u201cWhat do you want?\u201d\n\n\u201cWe need your help!\u201d Mia said, her voice steady. \u201cThe sorcerer is coming to steal the magic from this alley.\u201d\n\nMr. Glimmer raised an eyebrow. \u201cAnd why should I help a couple of kids?\u201d\n\n\u201cBecause we\u2019re not just kids!\u201d Theo declared, puffing out his chest. \u201cWe can stop him!\u201d\n\nMr. Glimmer sighed, rubbing his temples. \u201cFine. But first, you must prove you\u2019re worthy.\u201d \n\n\u201cWorthy? How?\u201d Mia asked, feeling nervous.\n\n\u201cFind the Crystal Heart,\u201d he said, pointing to a dusty old book on the shelf. \u201cIt\u2019s hidden somewhere in the alley. Only someone with true courage can find it!\u201d\n\nMia\u2019s heart thumped loudly. \u201cI\u2019ll do it! But what if I can\u2019t?\u201d\n\nTheo floated up beside her. \u201cYou can do it, Mia! You\u2019re brave!\u201d\n\n\u201cBut what if the sorcerer finds me first?\u201d Mia bit her lip.\n\n\u201cThen we\u2019ll be ready!\u201d Theo said confidently. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d\n\nMia took a deep breath. \u201cOkay, let\u2019s find the Crystal Heart!\u201d \n\nAs they stepped outside, she could feel the magic of the alley buzzing around her. But then, a dark shadow loomed overhead. Mia looked up. A figure in a dark cloak was watching them from the end of the alley. \n\n\u201cUh-oh,\u201d Theo whispered. \u201cI think the sorcerer is closer than we thought!\u201d\n\nMia\u2019s heart raced as the shadow grew larger. They had to hurry. \u201cCome on, Theo! We need to find that heart, fast!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What must Mia find to prove her courage?","options":["The Dark Cloak","The Crystal Heart","Theo's Wand","Mr. Glimmer's Secret"],"correct_answer":"The Crystal Heart"},{"question":"Who helps Mia understand the sorcerer's plan?","options":["Mr. Glimmer","A Cat","Theo","A Dog"],"correct_answer":"Theo"},{"question":"What does Mr. Glimmer want from Mia before he helps her?","options":["A potion","A map","To find the Crystal Heart","A treasure"],"correct_answer":"To find the Crystal Heart"},{"question":"What does the dark shadow represent?","options":["A friendly creature","A dark sorcerer","A magical shop","A rainbow"],"correct_answer":"A dark sorcerer"},{"question":"How does Mia feel about finding the Crystal Heart?","options":["Excited","Worried","Bored","Scared"],"correct_answer":"Worried"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_176_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_176_ch2_img1.png","plot_176_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":403,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
