   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_176_7_10","title":"The Crystal Alley Chronicles","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Urban Fantasy","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Mia stood in the heart of Crystal Alley, feeling the warm glow of the Crystal Heart in her hands. \"This is it!\" she exclaimed, glancing at Theo and Mr. Glimmer. \"This is how we can protect our magic!\"\n\nTheo fluttered excitedly around her. \"Yes! The Crystal Heart is super strong! It can keep the sorcerer away!\" His tiny wings sparkled in the sunlight. \n\nMr. Glimmer stroked his beard thoughtfully. \"But you must use it wisely, Mia. The sorcerer is clever. He'll try to trick you.\" \n\nMia nodded, determination shining in her eyes. \"I won\u2019t let him win! We have to face him together!\" \n\nAs they prepared, Mia felt a tingling in her fingers. \"Maybe I have magic too,\" she whispered, practicing little sparkles of light. She giggled as they danced in the air. Just then, she heard a loud cackle echoing through the alley.\n\n\u201cIs that him?\u201d Mia whispered, gripping the Crystal Heart tightly. \n\nTheo looked worried. \u201cIt sounds like him! We need to hurry!\u201d \n\nMia took a deep breath and led the way, her heart racing. They raced past colorful shops and whimsical creatures, their feet barely touching the ground. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThey stopped at a tall, twisted tree where the sorcerer often lurked. The leaves shivered in the breeze, almost as if they were scared. \u201cStay close!\u201d Mia warned. She felt the magic of the Crystal Heart humming in her hands. \n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Theo pointed. There was the dark sorcerer, casting a shadow across the path. He wore a long black cloak and had eyes like glowing coals. \n\n\u201cAh, Mia!\u201d he sneered. \u201cYou think you can protect that heart? It will only bring you trouble!\u201d \n\nMia felt a chill run down her spine, but she stood her ground. \u201cYou won\u2019t take it!\u201d She raised the Crystal Heart high, and a warm light burst forth. \n\nThe sorcerer shielded his eyes. \u201cNo! You\u2019re stronger than I thought!\u201d \n\n\u201cTogether!\u201d Mia shouted, and her friends joined her, their magic swirling around them. The alley lit up with colors, chasing away the darkness. \n\nWith a final flash of light, the sorcerer was pushed back. \u201cI\u2019ll be back!\u201d he yelled, disappearing into the shadows.\n\nMia and her friends cheered. They had done it! \u201cWe protected the magic!\u201d Mia laughed, feeling proud. \n\nMr. Glimmer smiled, his eyes twinkling. \u201cYou have learned to use your magic wisely, Mia. You are a true hero!\u201d \n\nMia beamed. \u201cWe did it together!\u201d she said. \n\nAnd from that day on, Crystal Alley flourished with magic, thanks to Mia and her friends.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Mia hold to protect magic?","options":["A wand","The Crystal Heart","A spell book","A potion"],"correct_answer":"The Crystal Heart"},{"question":"What color are the sorcerer's eyes?","options":["Blue","Green","Brown","Glowing coal"],"correct_answer":"Glowing coal"},{"question":"What do Mia, Theo, and Mr. Glimmer do to confront the sorcerer?","options":["Run away","Make spells","Use the Crystal Heart","Hide in a shop"],"correct_answer":"Use the Crystal Heart"},{"question":"What does Mr. Glimmer call Mia after they face the sorcerer?","options":["A true hero","A brave friend","A wise girl","A powerful witch"],"correct_answer":"A true hero"},{"question":"What happens to the sorcerer at the end of the chapter?","options":["He becomes friends with Mia","He disappears into the shadows","He takes the Crystal Heart","He runs away laughing"],"correct_answer":"He disappears into the shadows"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_176_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_176_ch5_img1.png","plot_176_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":424,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
