     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"curiosities","1":"shimmering","2":"whirlwind","3":"enchantment","4":"urgency","image_prompts":["A vibrant magical shop filled with glowing crystals and peculiar artifacts. Shelves are crowded with colorful potions, and strange creatures peek from behind jars. Mia stands in awe, her wide eyes reflecting the shimmering light. The grumpy shopkeeper, Mr. Glimmer, with wild white hair and crossed arms, is in the foreground, looking skeptically at Mia.","A dramatic scene as the shop trembles and a shadow looms outside. Mia stands determined, a spark of courage in her eyes, while Theo the pixie flutters beside her, wings shimmering. Mr. Glimmer looks alarmed, glancing towards the window, creating an atmosphere of urgency and tension."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A vibrant, mystical alley filled with colorful shops, illuminated by enchanted lanterns. Each shop displays whimsical symbols, and the atmosphere conveys a sense of wonder and anticipation. Mia stands at the entrance, taking in the magical surroundings, with Theo hovering excitedly nearby.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_176_ch1_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 17:22:38"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dark sorcerer, cloaked in black, stands menacingly at the entrance of Mr. Glimmers shop, shadows swirling around him. The light from the crystals flickers in response to his presence, casting eerie shapes. Mia stands frozen, her eyes wide with a mix of fear and determination, while Theos wings shimmer uncertainly.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_176_ch1_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 17:22:38"}}}
