     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"conspiratorial","1":"engulfed","2":"recoil","3":"tendrils","4":"legacy","image_prompts":["A vibrant scene of Crystal Alley with colorful magical shops, where Mia and Theo stand amidst the magic, showcasing a dynamic atmosphere. The shops glimmer under the sunlight, and various magical creatures peek out, curious about the commotion.","A dramatic moment with Mia facing the swirling shadows, her hand glowing fiercely as she confronts the darkness. The expressions of both fear and determination on Mia\u2019s face contrast with the sinister shadows that lurch away from her light."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing An atmospheric depiction of a magical shop interior filled with glowing orbs and shelves of artifacts, casting soft lights and shadows. Mia stands in the foreground, her expression a blend of awe and determination, while Mr. Glimmer looks on disapprovingly but with a hint of intrigue.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_176_ch2_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 17:21:39"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dramatic moment capturing the confrontation between Mia and the dark sorcerer. The room is illuminated by an explosion of light from Mia, casting both her and Theo in a heroic light. The sorcerer appears threatening in the shadows, his teeth sharp and eyes glinting, creating a stark contrast between good and evil.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_176_ch2_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 17:21:39"}}}
