     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"legacy","1":"infiltrated","2":"surge","3":"tendrils","4":"unleashed","image_prompts":["A colorful and chaotic interior of \"Glimmering Goods,\" with shelves overflowing with bizarre trinkets and glittering crystals. Mr. Glimmer, an elderly man with a bushy beard, stands behind the counter looking both worried and determined. Mia, a twelve-year-old girl with wavy brown hair, appears curious yet anxious, and Theo, a small pixie with iridescent wings, is perched on her shoulder, gazing around with wide eyes.","A tense confrontation within the shop, with the dark sorcerer looming menacingly in the doorway, cloaked in shadows. His grin is sinister, and the atmosphere is charged with dark energy. Mia stands in front of Mr. Glimmer, a determined expression on her face, as swirling shadows close in around them. Theo flutters beside Mia, his wings buzzing, conveying urgency and fear."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dimly lit magical bookshop filled with towering shelves of dusty spellbooks and swirling shadows. The air is thick with mystery, as beams of soft, golden light filter through the high windows, illuminating an eager Mia and her mischievous pixie friend, Theo, surrounded by a sense of wonder and looming secrets.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_176_ch3_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 17:20:57"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing An intense scene where Mia stands confidently, her fingers glowing with blue light as she confronts the dark sorcerer. The room is filled with swirling shadows and a palpable tension the sorcerers shocked expression contrasts with Mias fierce determination, embodying the clash between light and darkness.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_176_ch3_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 17:20:57"}}}
