     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"confront","1":"anticipation","2":"legacy","3":"tendril","4":"imbued","image_prompts":["A vibrant scene of Crystal Alley, showcasing its magical shops with glowing signs and enchanting displays. Mia stands at the entrance, wide-eyed with wonder, while Theo flutters around her, leaving a trail of sparkles. The alley is alive with colors and the faint shimmer of magic in the air, inviting the viewer into this mysterious world.","A dramatic moment as Mia stands defiantly against the dark sorcerer, her hands raised as a brilliant light emanates from her necklace. Shadowy tendrils swirl around the sorcerer, who looms menacingly in the background. Theo darts beside Mia, his expression a mix of fear and determination, while the alley glows brightly, symbolizing magic being restored."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A vibrant scene of Crystal Alley at twilight, with magical shops brightly lit and casting playful shadows on the cobblestones. Mia stands at the entrance, her expression a mixture of determination and uncertainty, with Theo hovering beside her, his wings shimmering. The gnarled oak tree looms in the background, hinting at the adventure that awaits.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_176_ch5_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 17:18:57"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing An intense, atmospheric moment during the climactic battle between Mia and the dark sorcerer. Mia is surrounded by a radiant light, her face determined and fierce, as she channels her magical energy. The sorcerers dark figure looms ominously, his shadows twisting around him. The background is filled with swirling dark clouds, contrasting with the light radiating from Mia, capturing the essence of the struggle between good and evil.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_176_ch5_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 17:18:57"}}}
