   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_177_7_10","title":"The Whispering City","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Urban Fantasy","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"In the heart of a lively metropolis, twelve-year-old Sam loved to explore. The tall skyscrapers stretched up like ancient giants, and they whispered secrets to each other in the wind. Sam often listened closely, hoping to catch a funny story or a bit of wisdom.\n\nOne sunny afternoon, Sam walked through the bustling streets. \u201cHey, Sam!\u201d called a cheerful voice. It was Gus, the oldest skyscraper in the city. Gus was rusty and worn, but he had a kind smile. \u201cWhat brings you here today?\u201d\n\n\u201cI\u2019m looking for adventure, Gus!\u201d Sam replied, grinning. \u201cMaybe I can find a hidden treasure!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cTreasure?\u201d Gus chuckled. \u201cThe greatest treasure is right under your feet! Buildings like me have stories to tell. Just listen, and you might hear something amazing.\u201d\n\nCurious, Sam pressed his ear against Gus\u2019 cool metal side. He could hear the faint sound of laughter. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d he asked, excited.\n\n\u201cThat, my young friend, is the sound of memories,\u201d Gus explained. \u201cBut there\u2019s trouble brewing. A greedy developer wants to tear down our city to build tall, shiny towers.\u201d\n\nSam\u2019s heart sank. \u201cWhat? You can\u2019t let that happen! We have to do something!\u201d\n\n\u201cWe must rally the citizens!\u201d Gus urged. \u201cBut they must believe in us first.\u201d\n\nSam nodded, determined. \u201cLet\u2019s start with Lila. She loves the magic of this city!\u201d\n\nJust then, a loud voice echoed from the street. \u201cAttention, everyone! We are going to build a new shopping center here!\u201d A man in a suit waved his arms. \u201cAll these old buildings will be torn down!\u201d\n\nSam\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cWe have to act fast!\u201d He turned to Gus, \u201cWhat do we do?\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find Lila and gather the people!\u201d Gus said with urgency, his voice echoing through the air. \n\nJust then, a gust of wind swept through the streets. The buildings seemed to shudder, as if they were scared. Sam felt a chill. He knew he had to save them before it was too late.\n\nWith a determined heart, Sam dashed down the street, ready to take on the challenge. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find Lila!\u201d he shouted, racing toward the park where she often played. \n\n\u201cTogether, we can save our city!\u201d he declared, excitement bubbling inside him. \n\nBut could they convince the adults to listen? Only time would tell.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who does Sam meet in the city?","options":["A developer","A wise old skyscraper","A talking dog","A magic wizard"],"correct_answer":"A wise old skyscraper"},{"question":"What does Gus say the buildings have?","options":["Treasure","Stories","Secrets","Noise"],"correct_answer":"Stories"},{"question":"What does the greedy developer want to build?","options":["A park","A new shopping center","More houses","A playground"],"correct_answer":"A new shopping center"},{"question":"What is Sam's first plan?","options":["To find Lila","To talk to the developer","To build a tower","To hide from Gus"],"correct_answer":"To find Lila"},{"question":"How does Sam feel about saving the buildings?","options":["Scared","Excited","Bored","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_177_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_177_ch1_img1.png","plot_177_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":391,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
