   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_177_7_10","title":"The Whispering City","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Urban Fantasy","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Sam dashed down the busy street, excitement bubbling in his chest. The sunlight glinted off the glass windows of the skyscrapers. He could hear them whispering, sharing secrets of the city. \u201cGus, where are you?\u201d he called out. \n\nSuddenly, a deep voice rumbled from above. \u201cRight here, Sam!\u201d Gus the skyscraper leaned down, his tall form casting a shadow over Sam. \u201cHave you found Lila?\u201d\n\n\u201cI\u2019m on my way to get her!\u201d Sam replied. \u201cBut what if it\u2019s too late? What if the developer starts tearing buildings down before we can stop him?\u201d\n\nGus sighed. \u201cEvery minute counts. We must act and rally the citizens. They might not believe you, though.\u201d\n\nSam frowned. \u201cYou think they won\u2019t listen to a kid?\u201d\n\n\u201cSometimes adults forget how to listen,\u201d Gus replied wisely. \u201cBut if you show them, they might hear.\u201d\n\nAs Sam approached Lila's favorite park, he saw her swinging high in the air. \u201cLila! You have to help me!\u201d he shouted, waving his arms. She jumped off the swing and ran over, her brown hair flying behind her.\n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s wrong?\u201d Lila asked, her eyes wide with concern.\n\n\u201cGus told me about the developer! We need to save the buildings!\u201d Sam explained, breathless. \u201cWill you help me talk to the others?\u201d\n\n\u201cOf course!\u201d Lila\u2019s spirit shone bright. \u201cLet\u2019s gather everyone in the park and tell them what\u2019s happening!\u201d\n\nThey quickly rounded up their friends. As they gathered, the excitement in the air grew. \u201cListen up, everyone!\u201d Sam shouted, feeling brave. \u201cThe skyscrapers can talk! They need our help!\u201d\n\nSudden laughter burst from a group of kids. \u201cYou\u2019re joking, right?\u201d one boy sneered. \u201cBuildings can\u2019t talk!\u201d\n\nGus, overhearing, leaned in closer. \u201cOh, but we can! We have stories, dreams, and we need you to help us!\u201d The crowd gasped, eyes wide.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSam smiled. \u201cSee? They believe us! We just need to show the adults!\u201d\n\n\u201cBut what if they don\u2019t believe us?\u201d Lila asked, worry creeping into her voice.\n\n\u201cThen we\u2019ll make them believe!\u201d Sam replied. \u201cLet\u2019s show them how important the skyscrapers are!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a loud noise echoed through the park. A giant truck rumbled down the street, its engine roaring. Sam\u2019s heart sank. \u201cThat must be the developer!\u201d he cried. \u201cWe need a plan! Quick!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s make signs!\u201d Lila shouted. \u201cWe\u2019ll make our voices heard!\u201d \n\nExcitement bubbled up again. They dashed to gather materials for their signs. As they worked, Sam felt a spark of hope. Together, they could save their city. But would it be enough?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Sam find out about the skyscrapers?","options":["They are being torn down","They can talk","They are very tall","They are old"],"correct_answer":"They can talk"},{"question":"Who does Sam ask for help?","options":["His mom","Lila","The mayor","A teacher"],"correct_answer":"Lila"},{"question":"What do Sam and Lila want to do?","options":["Play games","Make signs","Go home","Find Gus"],"correct_answer":"Make signs"},{"question":"What do the children hear that worries them?","options":["A dog barking","A loud truck","Thunder rumbling","A loud party"],"correct_answer":"A loud truck"},{"question":"What does Gus say to the crowd?","options":["You can\u2019t see me","I need help","We have stories","I am a building"],"correct_answer":"We have stories"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_177_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_177_ch2_img1.png","plot_177_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":434,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
