   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_177_7_10","title":"The Whispering City","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Urban Fantasy","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"The sun shone bright over the Whispering City. Sam and Lila stood in the bustling square, surrounded by talking buildings. Gus towered above them, his windows sparkling like happy eyes. \n\n\u201cLook at all these people!\u201d Lila exclaimed. \u201cThey need to hear our plan!\u201d\n\nGus leaned down. \u201cYou\u2019re right, Lila. The city needs to know how special we are!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a loud voice boomed from the crowd. It was Mr. Greed, the developer. \u201cListen up, everyone! These buildings are just bricks and mortar. They don\u2019t matter!\u201d\n\nSam stepped forward, his heart pounding. \u201cBut they do matter! They have stories! They have feelings!\u201d\n\nThe crowd murmured. Some people looked confused, while others nodded. Gus whispered, \u201cUse your heart, Sam. Speak for us!\u201d\n\nSam took a deep breath. \u201cGus has been a part of this city for over a hundred years! He remembers when children played in the park below. He remembers when families lived in his warm embrace. We can\u2019t let Mr. Greed take that away!\u201d\n\nThe crowd grew silent. Sam saw hope in their eyes. They wanted to believe.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, a small boy shouted, \u201cI love Gus! He\u2019s my friend!\u201d His mother smiled and added, \u201cWe can\u2019t lose our homes!\u201d\n\nMr. Greed frowned. \u201cYou\u2019re all being silly! Think about the money! Think about progress!\u201d\n\nSam raised his voice. \u201cBut progress can still mean keeping our stories! We can make this city better without taking away our past!\u201d\n\nLila jumped in. \u201cWe have to protect our friends! The buildings need us!\u201d\n\nThe crowd began to cheer. \u201cYes! We will save them!\u201d \n\nSam felt a rush of hope. He could see people talking to each other, sharing memories of their favorite buildings. He turned to Lila, her eyes sparkling with excitement. \u201cWe\u2019re making a difference!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nBut Mr. Greed was not finished. He shouted, \u201cI will not be stopped! I will make this city mine!\u201d\n\nGus rumbled softly, \u201cWe must be brave, Sam. This is just the beginning.\u201d\n\nThe crowd was buzzing with energy. They began to chant, \u201cSave our city! Save our stories!\u201d\n\nWith determination, Sam knew they had a chance. Together, they would fight for their homes. The whispering buildings were not finished yet!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who is trying to convince the crowd that the buildings don't matter?","options":["Sam","Lila","Mr. Greed","Gus"],"correct_answer":"Mr. Greed"},{"question":"What does Sam say Gus remembers?","options":["Money","Stories","Buildings","Progress"],"correct_answer":"Stories"},{"question":"What do the people in the crowd start to chant?","options":["Save our money!","Save our city!","Save our stories!","Save our buildings!"],"correct_answer":"Save our city!"},{"question":"How does Lila feel about the buildings?","options":["Bored","Sad","Excited","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"},{"question":"What do Sam and Lila want to protect?","options":["The grass","The buildings","The cars","The money"],"correct_answer":"The buildings"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_177_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_177_ch4_img1.png","plot_177_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":373,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
