rs in the background shimmer with life, their windows glowing as they resonate with support for Sams cause. The sky is darkening, emphasizing the tension in the air, as if the city itself is holding its breath.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_177_ch3_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 17:16:41"}}}
