     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"metropolis","1":"gather","2":"determination","3":"progress","image_prompts":["A vibrant city scene at dusk with various buildings depicted as characters, some leaning toward each other as if whispering secrets. Sam and Lila stand in the foreground, excited expressions on their faces, the glowing lights of Gus in the background casting soft shadows.","A dramatic confrontation scene between Sam and Mr. Garrison, with a tense atmosphere. Sam stands tall and defiant, while Garrison looms over him, smirking. The surrounding buildings look concerned, their windows reflecting the tension of the moment, hinting at their personalities."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A bustling urban square filled with diverse townspeople, a towering, weathered skyscraper (Gus) standing proudly in the background. Sunlight filters through the morning haze, casting a warm glow over the gathering. The expressions of the crowd convey a mix of determination and apprehension, highlighting the communitys resolve to protect their historical buildings.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_177_ch4_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 17:15:32"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A tense moment in the square as the workers from Kanes development crew approach with heavy machinery. Sam stands at the forefront of the crowd, his expression fierce and defiant, while Lila beside him embodies a spirit of courage. The atmosphere is charged, with whispers of the buildings around them echoing in unity, symbolizing the impending clash between progress and preservation.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_177_ch4_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 17:15:32"}}}
