   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_178_7_10","title":"The Forgotten Forest in the City","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Urban Fantasy","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Leo loved exploring the city. He rode his bike through busy streets. Tall buildings towered over him like giants. But one day, something magical happened.  \n\nAs he pedaled down a narrow alley, he spotted something strange. A flicker of green caught his eye. \"What is that?\" he wondered. Curious, he leaned forward.  \n\nThe alley opened up, and before Leo was a hidden forest! Lush trees swayed in the breeze. Bright flowers bloomed everywhere. Leo gasped, \u201cWow! It\u2019s beautiful!\u201d  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]  \n\nIn the middle of the forest, Leo saw a tiny figure. It was a forest sprite! She had sparkling wings and bright green hair. \u201cHello!\u201d she chirped. \u201cI\u2019m Elowen! Welcome to the Forgotten Forest!\u201d  \n\nLeo smiled. \u201cI\u2019m Leo! This place is amazing!\u201d  \n\nElowen flew in circles around him. \u201cThank you! But we need your help!\u201d Her voice trembled. \u201cThe forest is in danger!\u201d  \n\n\u201cWhat do you mean?\u201d Leo asked, frowning.  \n\n\u201cA construction company wants to tear down our home,\u201d Elowen explained. \u201cThey don\u2019t know how special it is.\u201d  \n\nLeo felt a surge of determination. \u201cWe can\u2019t let them do that!\u201d  \n\nElowen nodded. \u201cWe need to show them how important the forest is. But I have a secret. You can help us, Leo!\u201d  \n\n\u201cMe? How?\u201d he asked.  \n\n\u201cYou have powers hidden inside you,\u201d Elowen said, clapping her hands. \u201cTogether, we can protect the forest!\u201d  \n\nLeo\u2019s heart raced. \u201cOkay! Let\u2019s do it!\u201d  \n\nSuddenly, Leo heard a loud noise. A truck rumbled nearby. It was big and noisy. Elowen gasped. \u201cThey\u2019re coming!\u201d  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]  \n\n\u201cWhat do we do?\u201d Leo shouted.  \n\n\u201cFollow me!\u201d Elowen zipped through the trees. Leo pedaled as fast as he could. He didn\u2019t want to lose her. They raced deeper into the forest, the truck\u2019s engine roaring behind them.  \n\nThe trees grew thicker as they ran. Leo felt excitement and fear. He had to find a way to save the forest!  \n\nWould he learn to use his powers? Could they stop the construction? Leo\u2019s adventure was just beginning!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Leo discover in the alley?","options":["A playground","A hidden forest","A tall building","A construction site"],"correct_answer":"A hidden forest"},{"question":"Who does Leo meet in the forest?","options":["A talking animal","A giant","A forest sprite","A wizard"],"correct_answer":"A forest sprite"},{"question":"What is the threat to the forest?","options":["A storm","A construction company","A fire","A flood"],"correct_answer":"A construction company"},{"question":"What does Elowen want Leo to help with?","options":["Building a house","Finding treasure","Protecting the forest","Going on a picnic"],"correct_answer":"Protecting the forest"},{"question":"How does Leo feel about helping the forest?","options":["Sad","Excited","Bored","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_178_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_178_ch1_img1.png","plot_178_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":339,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
