   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_178_7_10","title":"The Forgotten Forest in the City","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Urban Fantasy","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Leo stood in the heart of the forest, feeling its magic. The sun peeked through the leaves, casting dancing shadows on the ground. \u201cThis place is incredible!\u201d he exclaimed. Elowen nodded excitedly, her wings fluttering like vibrant petals. \n\n\u201cIt\u2019s my home, Leo! But it\u2019s in trouble,\u201d she said, her voice trembling. \u201cMr. Clay\u2019s construction team is coming soon. They want to chop down the trees!\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat? That\u2019s awful!\u201d Leo shouted. He could already imagine the forest losing its beauty. \u201cWe have to stop them.\u201d\n\nElowen looked worried. \u201cI don\u2019t know how. The trees are weak, and the creatures are scared. You\u2019re the only one who can help.\u201d\n\nLeo took a deep breath. \u201cOkay, Elowen. What do we do first?\u201d \n\nSuddenly, a loud noise echoed through the trees. Leo and Elowen jumped. \u201cThat must be the construction team!\u201d Leo said, his heart racing. He felt a strange tingle in his fingers. \u201cLet\u2019s see what they\u2019re doing!\u201d\n\nThe duo hurried through the underbrush. They peered through the tall grass and gasped at what they saw. Big machines were parked nearby, ready to tear down the trees. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cLook at those machines!\u201d Leo whispered, wide-eyed. \u201cThey look like giant monsters!\u201d\n\n\u201cMonsters that want to eat the forest!\u201d Elowen replied, her voice shaking. \u201cIf they start, there will be no forest left!\u201d\n\nLeo felt a surge of courage. \u201cWe need to think of a plan. But how?\u201d\n\nElowen tapped her chin. \u201cYou have powers now, Leo! Maybe you can use them to help us.\u201d\n\nJust then, Mr. Clay appeared, pointing at the trees. \u201cWe\u2019ll clear this place in no time!\u201d he shouted, a grin on his face. \u201cNothing will stand in our way!\u201d\n\nLeo\u2019s heart sank. \u201cHe doesn\u2019t care about the forest! We have to do something!\u201d \n\nElowen nodded. \u201cBut we need to be sneaky. They can\u2019t find us!\u201d\n\nAs they crept back behind a bush, Leo remembered something. \u201cI can make the forest glow! It might distract them!\u201d \n\n\u201cGreat idea!\u201d Elowen cheered. \u201cBut remember, it takes focus!\u201d\n\nLeo closed his eyes and felt the energy swirling inside him. \u201cHere goes nothing!\u201d \n\nHe focused hard, and suddenly, the trees shimmered with a bright green light. The glow bounced off the leaves, creating a magical sight! \n\n\u201cWow!\u201d Elowen gasped. \u201cThat\u2019s amazing! But hurry! They\u2019ll notice soon!\u201d\n\nJust then, a loud rumble echoed as the machines started to move. Leo\u2019s stomach dropped. They needed to act fast!\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cWe have to save our home!\u201d Elowen shouted, her eyes sparkling with determination. \n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s our next step?\u201d Leo asked, feeling the weight of the forest on his shoulders. \n\n\u201cWe need to find the Ancient Oak Tree! It\u2019s the heart of the forest and has special powers,\u201d Elowen explained. \u201cBut it\u2019s deep within the woods. We must hurry before it\u2019s too late!\u201d\n\nWith newfound determination, Leo and Elowen raced deeper into the forest, ready to face whatever challenge came next.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Leo discover about the construction team?","options":["They want to help the forest","They want to destroy the forest","They are afraid of the forest","They want to play in the forest"],"correct_answer":"They want to destroy the forest"},{"question":"What special powers does Leo have?","options":["He can fly","He can make the forest glow","He can talk to animals","He can build machines"],"correct_answer":"He can make the forest glow"},{"question":"What is the heart of the forest called?","options":["The Great Oak Tree","The Ancient Oak Tree","The Magic Tree","The Tallest Tree"],"correct_answer":"The Ancient Oak Tree"},{"question":"How does Elowen feel about the construction team?","options":["Excited","Worried","Happy","Indifferent"],"correct_answer":"Worried"},{"question":"What do Leo and Elowen plan to do next?","options":["Run away","Find the Ancient Oak Tree","Build a treehouse","Talk to Mr. Clay"],"correct_answer":"Find the Ancient Oak Tree"}]},"images":null,"word_count":502,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
