   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_178_7_10","title":"The Forgotten Forest in the City","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Urban Fantasy","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Leo and Elowen stood at the edge of the hidden forest. The trees swayed gently, their leaves sparkling like emeralds. \u201cThis forest is so beautiful,\u201d Leo said, taking a deep breath of fresh air. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nElowen smiled. \u201cIt\u2019s alive with magic! But we must hurry. Mr. Clay will come for the trees soon!\u201d \n\n\u201cDo you really think we can find the Ancient Oak Tree?\u201d Leo asked, his heart pounding with excitement.\n\nElowen nodded, her wings shimmering in the sunlight. \u201cYes! It\u2019s the oldest tree. It holds the power to protect the forest. But we must be careful.\u201d\n\nThey walked deeper into the forest. Suddenly, Leo felt a tingling in his fingers. \u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d he exclaimed.\n\n\u201cI think you\u2019re awakening your powers!\u201d Elowen chirped. \u201cTry to focus!\u201d\n\nLeo closed his eyes and thought of the forest. He imagined glowing flowers and colorful butterflies. Opening his eyes, he gasped. Tiny sparks danced around his hands!\n\n\u201cWow! I can do magic!\u201d he shouted.\n\nJust then, a loud rumble shook the ground. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Leo cried, looking around.\n\n\u201cI think it\u2019s Mr. Clay\u2019s machines!\u201d Elowen squeaked. \u201cWe need to hurry!\u201d\n\nThey dashed through the trees. Suddenly, they stumbled upon a clearing. In the center stood a massive oak tree, its trunk wide and gnarled. \u201cThe Ancient Oak Tree!\u201d Elowen gasped.\n\nJust as they approached, a shadow crossed the sun. A huge construction vehicle loomed behind them. \u201cWhat are you kids doing here?\u201d Mr. Clay\u2019s voice boomed. \u201cThis forest is mine!\u201d\n\nLeo\u2019s heart raced. \u201cNo! We have to protect it!\u201d he shouted defiantly.\n\n\u201cProtect it? It\u2019s just a bunch of old trees!\u201d Mr. Clay laughed. But Elowen glared at him. \u201cYou don\u2019t understand! This forest is alive!\u201d\n\nLeo felt the magic swirl in his hands. \u201cI can stop you!\u201d he declared. \n\nBut Mr. Clay smirked, \u201cYou think a child can stop me?\u201d \n\nAt that moment, Leo made a decision. He would fight for the forest, no matter what. \u201cWatch me!\u201d he yelled, raising his hands.\n\nThe air sparkled with energy. Would it be enough to stop Mr. Clay and save the forest? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nLeo took a deep breath, ready to unleash his magic.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Leo and Elowen discover in the forest?","options":["A hidden treasure","The Ancient Oak Tree","A giant monster","A magic portal"],"correct_answer":"The Ancient Oak Tree"},{"question":"Who threatens to destroy the forest?","options":["Mr. Clay","A dragon","Leo's friend","A wizard"],"correct_answer":"Mr. Clay"},{"question":"What happens when Leo focuses on the forest?","options":["He falls asleep","He gains magical powers","He disappears","He finds a map"],"correct_answer":"He gains magical powers"},{"question":"What does Elowen help Leo do?","options":["Find a way home","Awaken his powers","Catch a butterfly","Plant a tree"],"correct_answer":"Awaken his powers"},{"question":"At the end of the chapter, what does Leo decide to do?","options":["Run away","Fight for the forest","Ignore Mr. Clay","Call for help"],"correct_answer":"Fight for the forest"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_178_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_178_ch3_img1.png","plot_178_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":371,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
