   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_178_7_10","title":"The Forgotten Forest in the City","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Urban Fantasy","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Leo gazed up at the Ancient Oak Tree. Its massive trunk twisted like a giant arm reaching for the sky. Leaves shimmered in shades of emerald and gold. \u201cWow, Elowen! It\u2019s so big!\u201d Leo exclaimed, his eyes wide with wonder.\n\nElowen danced around the tree. \u201cThis tree is special, Leo. It\u2019s the heart of the forest. We need its magic to protect our home!\u201d She twirled with delight, her wings sparkling under the warm sun. \n\nLeo took a deep breath. \u201cBut how do we use its magic?\u201d \n\nElowen landed softly on a branch. \u201cWe must ask the tree for help. Close your eyes and listen.\u201d \n\nLeo closed his eyes tight. He heard whispers, like the gentle rustle of leaves in the wind. \u201cWhat do you hear?\u201d Elowen asked. \n\n\u201cIt\u2019s like the tree is talking to me!\u201d Leo replied, feeling a warm glow in his chest. \n\nSuddenly, a loud sound broke through the calm. \u201cThud! Thud!\u201d It was Mr. Clay and his workers! They were using heavy machines to chop down trees near the forest. Leo\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWe have to stop them, Elowen!\u201d \n\n\u201cYes! Let\u2019s use the magic!\u201d Elowen cheered. Leo opened his eyes, and the glow in his chest grew brighter. He raised his hands, thinking of the tree\u2019s strength. \u201cAncient Oak, help us!\u201d he shouted.\n\nAs if the tree heard him, leaves swirled around Leo. Bright lights danced in the air. The ground trembled, and roots from the Ancient Oak shot up like long fingers, blocking the path of the machines. \n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d Mr. Clay shouted in disbelief. \n\nLeo and Elowen shared a glance; hope sparkled in their eyes. \u201cWe did it!\u201d Leo shouted. But the machines still roared, and the workers looked confused. \n\nElowen fluttered her wings. \u201cWe need to show them how important this forest is!\u201d \n\n\u201cRight! Let\u2019s make them see!\u201d Leo nodded, feeling braver than ever. \n\nTogether, they raced toward the workers, ready to show them the magic of the forest. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cHey, stop!\u201d Leo shouted, waving his arms. \u201cYou have to see what you\u2019re about to destroy!\u201d \n\nThe workers stopped and turned. They looked at the swirling leaves and the Ancient Oak standing tall. Leo felt a surge of confidence. \u201cThis forest is alive! You can\u2019t just take it away!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nMr. Clay stepped forward, his face puzzled. \u201cWhy does it matter? It\u2019s just a bunch of trees!\u201d \n\nLeo took a deep breath. \u201cNo, it\u2019s not! It\u2019s a home. It\u2019s magic! It can help us all!\u201d \n\nThe workers exchanged glances. Maybe they could see it too.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Leo and Elowen find at the center of the forest?","options":["A river","An Ancient Oak Tree","A cave","A house"],"correct_answer":"An Ancient Oak Tree"},{"question":"What does Leo feel in his chest when he listens to the tree?","options":["A cold breeze","A warm glow","A rumble","A tickle"],"correct_answer":"A warm glow"},{"question":"What do the roots of the Ancient Oak do?","options":["Dance","Block the machines","Fly","Grow flowers"],"correct_answer":"Block the machines"},{"question":"What does Mr. Clay think about the trees?","options":["They are pretty","They are alive","They are just a bunch of trees","They are magical"],"correct_answer":"They are just a bunch of trees"},{"question":"What do Leo and Elowen want to show the workers?","options":["The machines","The magic of the forest","Their friendship","The city"],"correct_answer":"The magic of the forest"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_178_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_178_ch4_img1.png","plot_178_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":438,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
