   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_178_7_10","title":"The Forgotten Forest in the City","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Urban Fantasy","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Leo stood before the Ancient Oak Tree, its thick trunk twisting towards the sky. Elowen hovered beside him, her wings shimmering like sunlight through leaves. \u201cThis tree is special, Leo!\u201d she exclaimed, her voice a melody. \u201cIt holds the magic of the forest.\u201d\n\nLeo reached out to touch the rough bark. He felt a warm glow travel up his fingers. \u201cI can feel it!\u201d he said, his eyes wide with wonder. Just then, the wind rustled through the branches, a whisper of the forest\u2019s secrets.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cNow, we need to stop Mr. Clay!\u201d Elowen said, determination lighting up her eyes. \u201cHe doesn\u2019t understand how important this forest is.\u201d \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s show him!\u201d Leo replied, feeling brave. He closed his eyes and pictured the forest, bright and full of life. Suddenly, he felt a surge of energy. \u201cI think I can help!\u201d\n\nThey raced through the forest, past sparkling streams and colorful flowers, until they reached the edge where the construction machines waited. Mr. Clay was standing there, looking at his plans. \u201cThis forest is just a pile of old trees!\u201d he scoffed.\n\nLeo took a deep breath. \u201cMr. Clay!\u201d he shouted. \u201cWait! You\u2019re about to make a big mistake!\u201d\n\nMr. Clay turned, surprised. \u201cAnd who are you?\u201d he asked, raising an eyebrow.\n\n\u201cLeo! And this forest is alive! It needs protection!\u201d With that, Leo raised his hands towards the Ancient Oak Tree. He concentrated, feeling the magic flow through him. The air shimmered, and suddenly, bright flowers began to bloom around Mr. Clay\u2019s machines.\n\n\u201cWhoa!\u201d Mr. Clay stepped back, astonished. \u201cWhat is happening?\u201d\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s the Ancient Oak!\u201d Elowen said, her voice full of excitement. \u201cLook at what it can do!\u201d\n\nThe flowers swirled around Mr. Clay, wrapping around his legs playfully. The vibrant colors filled the air with joy. \u201cThese flowers are beautiful!\u201d he exclaimed, finally seeing the forest\u2019s magic.\n\n\u201cSee, Mr. Clay?\u201d Leo said, his voice steady. \u201cThe forest isn\u2019t just trees. It\u2019s a home for creatures and plants. It brings happiness!\u201d\n\nMr. Clay\u2019s expression softened. \u201cI never realized,\u201d he murmured. \u201cI\u2019m sorry. I didn\u2019t mean to hurt it.\u201d\n\nElowen fluttered closer. \u201cWill you help us keep it safe?\u201d \n\n\u201cYes!\u201d Mr. Clay nodded firmly. \u201cI will! Together, we can protect this magical place.\u201d \n\nLeo\u2019s heart soared. They had done it! The forest was safe. He smiled at Elowen, who danced in delight. \u201cWe did it!\u201d \n\n\u201cYes, we did!\u201d Elowen cheered. \u201cTogether!\u201d","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Leo discover about the Ancient Oak Tree?","options":["It is a pile of old wood.","It has special magic.","It is just a tree.","It is not important."],"correct_answer":"It has special magic."},{"question":"Who was trying to destroy the forest?","options":["Mr. Clay","Elowen","Leo","A magical creature"],"correct_answer":"Mr. Clay"},{"question":"What did Leo use to show Mr. Clay the magic of the forest?","options":["His voice","The Ancient Oak Tree's magic","A book","A song"],"correct_answer":"The Ancient Oak Tree's magic"},{"question":"What did Mr. Clay feel when he saw the flowers?","options":["Anger","Happiness","Surprise","Fear"],"correct_answer":"Surprise"},{"question":"What do Leo and Elowen ask Mr. Clay at the end?","options":["To destroy the forest","To leave the city","To help protect the forest","To build more machines"],"correct_answer":"To help protect the forest"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_178_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_178_ch5_img1.png","plot_178_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":415,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
