   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_178_11_14","title":"The Forgotten Forest in the City","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Urban Fantasy","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Leo stood at the edge of the hidden forest, the sunlight filtering through emerald leaves like a warm embrace. He looked up at the towering buildings surrounding them, feeling like a tiny speck in a vast, cold world. \"I can't believe this place is real,\" he whispered, his heart racing with excitement.\n\nElowen hovered beside him, her wings sparkling in the sunlight. \"It\u2019s more than real; it's alive! But we must hurry. The construction crew is coming soon!\" Her voice was tinged with urgency, her eyes wide with worry. \n\nLeo felt the weight of her words settle in his stomach like a stone. He had only just discovered this magical place, and now it could be in danger. \"What do we do, Elowen?\" he asked, determination hardening his voice.\n\n\"We need to gather the creatures and warn them. They\u2019ll help us think of a way to protect our home,\" she replied, zipping ahead into the forest. Leo followed, his feet barely making a sound on the soft earth. The air was rich with the scent of flowers and earth, a stark contrast to the gray drizzle of the city streets he was used to.\n\nAs they ventured deeper, they stumbled upon a clearing filled with vibrant flowers that danced in the gentle breeze. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] The colors were so vivid that Leo felt like he was inside a painting. Tiny creatures flitted about\u2014some with wings like butterflies, others with fur that shimmered like precious gems. \n\nElowen clapped her hands to gather everyone\u2019s attention. \u201cFriends, listen! We have a crisis! The humans are coming to take our home!\u201d \n\nA hush fell over the gathering. Leo recognized a small creature with a bushy tail and bright, curious eyes, who stepped forward. \"But what can we do? They have machines and big trucks!\" His voice trembled with fear.\n\nLeo took a step forward, trying to sound brave. \u201cMaybe I can help. I\u2019ve never faced a problem like this before, but we can\u2019t just let them destroy everything.\u201d \n\nElowen's gaze softened as she looked at him. \u201cYou\u2019re much braver than you think, Leo. You have a spark inside you that can help us.\u201d \n\nSuddenly, from the edge of the forest, a loud roar of a distant machine shattered the air, making everyone jump. Leo's heart raced. \u201cIt\u2019s them! We don\u2019t have much time!\u201d \n\n\u201cEveryone, scatter! We need to figure out a plan!\u201d Elowen shouted, and chaos erupted. Creatures began to fly and scurry in every direction. Leo felt a surge of panic, but he knew he had to stay focused.\n\nHe spotted Elowen darting around, rallying the forest inhabitants, but he felt a heavy weight pressing at the back of his mind. How could a mere boy make a difference against the looming threat of machines and the construction company led by Mr. Clay, a man who seemed only interested in profits?\n\nAs he gathered his thoughts, Leo noticed a glimmering object half-buried in the roots of an ancient tree. He knelt down to inspect it. \u201cWhat\u2019s this?\u201d he murmured. \n\nBefore he could pull it free, he heard Elowen calling from a distance, her voice filled with urgency. \u201cLeo! We need you!\u201d \n\nHe hesitated, torn between the mysterious object and the call for help. The split second he spent pondering felt like an eternity. Finally, he decided. The forest was counting on him. He stood up and rushed toward Elowen, ready to face whatever came next. \n\nAs they regrouped, Leo couldn\u2019t shake the feeling that the glimmering object held the key to their survival. But what was it, and what would it reveal?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What urgent news does Elowen share with the forest creatures?","options":["A storm is coming","The humans are coming to take their home","They found a treasure","They are having a celebration"],"correct_answer":"The humans are coming to take their home"},{"question":"How does Leo feel about the danger facing the forest?","options":["Excited","Indifferent","Determined","Scared"],"correct_answer":"Determined"},{"question":"What does Leo discover in the roots of the ancient tree?","options":["A magical creature","A hidden path","A glimmering object","A treasure chest"],"correct_answer":"A glimmering object"},{"question":"What do the creatures do when they hear the machines approaching?","options":["They cheer","They scatter","They hide","They confront the machines"],"correct_answer":"They scatter"},{"question":"What does Elowen believe about Leo's potential?","options":["He is just a boy","He has a spark inside him that can help","He is too scared","He should leave the forest"],"correct_answer":"He has a spark inside him that can help"}]},"images":null,"word_count":610,"reading_level":"Builder"}
