   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_179_7_10","title":"The Shadow Market","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Urban Fantasy","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Zara peered down the narrow alley, her heart racing. She had heard whispers about the Shadow Market, a hidden place full of treasures and trouble. Today, she was determined to find it.\n\n\u201cAre you sure about this?\u201d Finn asked, his eyes wide. He was Zara's best friend, always ready for an adventure, but even he looked nervous. \n\n\u201cOf course!\u201d Zara replied, grinning. \u201cJust think of all the magical things we might see!\u201d Finn shrugged, but he followed her anyway.\n\nAs they stepped into the alley, the air shimmered with excitement. Dim lights twinkled in the distance. Zara could see colorful stalls filled with strange items. There were glowing crystals, flying carpets, and jars of shimmering liquid. She couldn't wait to explore! \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, a loud crash echoed from a nearby stall. A tall, shady figure was arguing with a vendor. Zara and Finn froze. \n\n\u201cLeave that cursed artifact alone!\u201d the vendor shouted. \n\n\u201cCursed?\u201d Zara whispered, her curiosity piqued. \u201cWhat\u2019s that?\u201d\n\nFinn tugged at her sleeve. \u201cMaybe we should go! This feels dangerous.\u201d\n\nBut Zara was already moving forward. She wanted to know more. As they crept closer, they heard the trader's smooth voice. \u201cI can handle anything. It\u2019s a simple trade.\u201d\n\nThen, the vendor shouted again, \u201cIf you take it, someone will get hurt!\u201d\n\nZara felt a chill. What if this artifact was causing trouble? Just then, Finn gasped. \u201cZara! Look!\u201d\n\nIn the shadows, a boy lay on the ground, clutching his arm. Zara ran to him. \u201cAre you okay?\u201d \n\nHe shook his head. \u201cI touched the artifact, and now I can\u2019t move!\u201d\n\nPanic flared in Zara\u2019s chest. They had to help him. \u201cWe need to find out what the curse is,\u201d she said, looking at Finn. \u201cBut how?\u201d\n\nFinn nodded, his expression serious. \u201cWe need to talk to that trader. He might know more.\u201d\n\nBut the trader had already begun to slip away into the crowd. \u201cWait!\u201d Zara called.\n\nThey chased after him, determination fueling their steps. The adventure had just begun, and Zara knew they had to uncover the truth before it was too late.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the Shadow Market?","options":["A school for magic","A hidden market for magical items","A treasure hunt","A restaurant"],"correct_answer":"A hidden market for magical items"},{"question":"What happens to the boy in the market?","options":["He loses his hat","He gets hurt by a cursed artifact","He finds a treasure","He leaves the market"],"correct_answer":"He gets hurt by a cursed artifact"},{"question":"How does Zara feel about the adventure?","options":["Excited and curious","Bored","Scared","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited and curious"},{"question":"Who is Zara's best friend?","options":["Kaden","Finn","Jake","Leo"],"correct_answer":"Finn"},{"question":"What does Finn think about going to the Shadow Market?","options":["He is excited","He is nervous","He doesn't care","He wants to leave"],"correct_answer":"He is nervous"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_179_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_179_ch1_img1.png","plot_179_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":352,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
