   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_179_7_10","title":"The Shadow Market","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Urban Fantasy","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Zara and Finn stepped deeper into the Shadow Market. The air buzzed with excitement and mystery. Bright lights flickered, casting shadows on the strange wares around them.\n\n\u201cLook at that!\u201d Finn pointed to a shelf filled with glowing potions. \u201cDo you think they really work?\u201d\n\n\u201cOnly one way to find out,\u201d Zara grinned. She was eager to explore, but something weighed heavily on her mind. What if they didn\u2019t find a way to help the boy they had seen?\n\nJust then, a voice called out, \u201cYou look lost!\u201d A tall boy with messy hair and a sly smile approached them. \u201cI\u2019m Kaden. I know my way around here.\u201d\n\n\u201cCan you help us?\u201d Zara asked, her eyes narrowing. \u201cWe need to find the cursed artifact that hurt that boy.\u201d\n\nKaden\u2019s smile widened. \u201cCursed artifacts, huh? Dangerous stuff. But I might know where to look\u2014if you\u2019re willing to trade.\u201d \n\nZara exchanged a worried glance with Finn. \u201cWhat do you want in return?\u201d \n\nKaden leaned in closer. \u201cLet\u2019s just say\u2026 I have a few questions about your family.\u201d \n\nZara felt a chill run down her back. What did he know? \u201cThat\u2019s not a fair trade!\u201d Finn shouted. \u201cWe\u2019re not playing your games!\u201d\n\n\u201cSuit yourself,\u201d Kaden shrugged, but his eyes twinkled with mischief. \u201cJust remember, time is running out for your friend.\u201d\n\nZara\u2019s heart raced. They had to act fast. \u201cWe\u2019ll find the artifact!\u201d she declared. \u201cLead the way!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThey ventured deeper into the market, where strange creatures roamed. An owl, dressed in a tiny cloak, squawked as it flew by. Zara laughed. \u201cDid that owl just wink at us?\u201d\n\nSuddenly, they stopped. A heavy door stood before them. Kaden knocked, and it creaked open. Inside, a room filled with dusty books and ancient scrolls awaited them. \n\n\u201cWelcome to the Chamber of Secrets,\u201d Kaden said, his voice low. \u201cHere lies knowledge\u2026and danger.\u201d\n\nThey stepped in, but Zara felt uneasy. What if they couldn\u2019t find the right book? What if it was too late for Finn\u2019s friend?\n\n\u201cLook at this one!\u201d Finn shouted, pointing to a scroll glowing softly. \u201cIt\u2019s about curses!\u201d\n\nKaden snatched it up. \u201cThis could be helpful, but it comes with a price.\u201d He grinned.\n\nZara took a deep breath. \u201cNo more games, Kaden. What do you really want?\u201d\n\nKaden leaned against a shelf, a thoughtful look on his face. \u201cI want to know why you\u2019re so special, Zara. Your family has secrets, and I want to uncover them.\u201d\n\nZara\u2019s stomach twisted. She needed to focus on Finn\u2019s friend, but Kaden was getting too close to the truth. \u201cWe\u2019ll trade with you, but only for the scroll,\u201d she insisted.\n\nKaden laughed. \u201cGet ready for a real challenge then!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAs the tension grew, Zara knew they were in for the adventure of a lifetime. They had a scroll, but at what cost? \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s hurry!\u201d Finn urged. \u201cWe have to find a way to break the curse before it\u2019s too late!\u201d\n\nZara nodded, determination rising in her chest. They couldn\u2019t let Kaden\u2019s games distract them. They had to save their friend, and time was running out.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who do Zara and Finn meet in the Shadow Market?","options":["A wizard","Kaden","A monster","An owl"],"correct_answer":"Kaden"},{"question":"What does Kaden want in exchange for help?","options":["A scroll","A magical item","Secrets about Zara's family","A favor"],"correct_answer":"Secrets about Zara's family"},{"question":"What do Zara and Finn find in the Chamber of Secrets?","options":["A treasure chest","A glowing scroll","A magical creature","A map"],"correct_answer":"A glowing scroll"},{"question":"How does Zara feel about Kaden's demands?","options":["Excited","Nervous","Indifferent","Happy"],"correct_answer":"Nervous"},{"question":"What do Zara and Finn need to do quickly?","options":["Find a map","Break the curse","Make a new friend","Leave the market"],"correct_answer":"Break the curse"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_179_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_179_ch2_img1.png","plot_179_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":538,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
