   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_179_7_10","title":"The Shadow Market","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Urban Fantasy","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Zara and Finn stepped deeper into the Shadow Market. The air was thick with magic and mystery. Colorful stalls lined the stone walls. Brightly glowing items floated above tables, casting strange shadows.\n\n\u201cWow! Look at that!\u201d Finn pointed to a crystal that changed colors. \u201cDo you think it\u2019s really magic?\u201d\n\nZara smiled. \u201cIt must be! But we need to stay focused. Kaden said we had to find the right item to help Finn.\u201d\n\nThey walked past a stall filled with shimmering potions. A grumpy old trader grunted at them. \u201cNo peeking! You\u2019ll get cursed!\u201d\n\nZara whispered, \u201cWe should find Kaden. He knows more about the curse on the artifact.\u201d\n\nAs they turned the corner, they saw Kaden talking to a tall figure cloaked in shadows. Zara's heart raced. What were they planning?\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s listen,\u201d Finn said, pulling Zara behind a stack of old books.\n\n\u201cI have the item,\u201d Kaden said, his voice low. \u201cBut you must pay the price.\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat price?\u201d the cloaked figure hissed.\n\n\u201cSomething precious,\u201d Kaden replied. \u201cA secret or a heart\u2019s desire. Choose wisely.\u201d\n\nZara felt a chill. What could Kaden mean? They needed to hurry before it was too late!\n\nJust then, a loud crash echoed through the market. Zara peeked around the books. A table had toppled over, spilling magical gadgets everywhere. \n\n\u201cLook! Finn! The traders are distracted!\u201d Zara shouted, excitement bubbling in her chest. \n\n\u201cThat\u2019s our chance!\u201d Finn agreed, darting forward.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThey dashed toward Kaden, but he noticed them. \u201cYou two shouldn\u2019t be here! Go back!\u201d He waved his arms, but they pressed on.\n\nSuddenly, the dark figure turned. \u201cWho are you?\u201d It pointed a long, bony finger at Zara. \u201cYou shouldn\u2019t have come!\u201d\n\nZara\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWe\u2019re here to help our friend!\u201d\n\n\u201cYour friend is cursed by something that belongs to you,\u201d the figure said, stepping closer. \u201cDo you want to know the truth?\u201d\n\nZara swallowed hard. \u201cYes! Please!\u201d\n\nThe figure smirked. \u201cThen you must trade. But beware, the truth may be darker than you imagine.\u201d\n\nZara felt the weight of the choice. What would she need to give up to save Finn? \n\nFinn looked worried. \u201cZara, what if we can\u2019t trust them?\u201d\n\n\u201cWe have to try,\u201d Zara said. \u201cI won\u2019t lose you, Finn.\u201d\n\nWith determination, Zara approached the figure. \u201cI\u2019ll trade. What do you want?\u201d\n\nThe cloaked figure smiled. \u201cOnly a secret from your family\u2019s past. What will it be?\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nZara hesitated. Could she reveal the truth about her family? The stakes were high, and the air was electric with tension. \n\n\u201cChoose wisely,\u201d the figure hissed. \u201cOne secret could change everything!\u201d","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Zara and Finn need to find in the Shadow Market?","options":["A potion","A magical item","A cursed artifact","A treasure map"],"correct_answer":"A magical item"},{"question":"Who do Zara and Finn overhear talking to Kaden?","options":["A tall figure in shadows","An old woman","A friendly merchant","A wizard"],"correct_answer":"A tall figure in shadows"},{"question":"What does the cloaked figure ask Zara to trade?","options":["A magical item","A family secret","A potion","Finn's friendship"],"correct_answer":"A family secret"},{"question":"How does Zara feel about trading a secret?","options":["Excited","Scared","Happy","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Scared"},{"question":"What does Zara want to save?","options":["The market","Her family","Finn","Kaden"],"correct_answer":"Finn"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_179_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_179_ch3_img1.png","plot_179_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":446,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
