   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_179_7_10","title":"The Shadow Market","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Urban Fantasy","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Zara and Finn stood in the lively Shadow Market. Colorful stalls filled the space, each one brimming with magical items. A faint glow illuminated the dark corners. \n\n\u201cLook at that!\u201d Finn exclaimed, pointing at a sparkling necklace that twinkled like stars. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s beautiful!\u201d Zara replied, her eyes wide with wonder. But they had no time to admire. They needed to find Kaden. \n\n\u201cWhere do you think he is?\u201d Finn asked, scanning the crowd.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s check by the potion stand,\u201d Zara suggested. They hurried through the bustling market, the scent of strange spices in the air.\n\nAs they approached the potion stand, they heard Kaden\u2019s voice. He was arguing with a tall man in a dark cloak. \n\n\u201cI\u2019ll give you the amulet, but you must promise not to double-cross me,\u201d Kaden said. \n\nZara and Finn exchanged worried glances. What if Kaden was making a bad deal? \n\n\u201cWe need to speak with him!\u201d Finn whispered.\n\nThey waited until Kaden finished his deal. When the man left, Zara called out, \u201cKaden!\u201d\n\nKaden turned, a sly smile on his face. \u201cWell, well! If it isn\u2019t my favorite customers. Did you come for more magical treasures?\u201d \n\n\u201cWe need your help!\u201d Zara said, her voice shaking with urgency. \u201cFinn is in danger. He\u2019s cursed because of an artifact!\u201d\n\nKaden raised an eyebrow. \u201cCursed? That\u2019s serious. You\u2019ll need something powerful to break that curse.\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat do we need?\u201d Finn asked, his heart pounding.\n\nKaden leaned closer. \u201cYou\u2019ll have to trade something precious. But be careful. The Shadow Market is full of tricks.\u201d \n\nSuddenly, a shadowy figure appeared behind Kaden. \u201cYou shouldn\u2019t be here,\u201d the figure hissed. \n\nZara felt a chill run down her spine. \u201cWho are you?\u201d she demanded.\n\n\u201cI am the Keeper of Secrets!\u201d the figure announced. \u201cIf you seek help, you must answer my riddle.\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat riddle?\u201d Zara asked, her stomach knotting. \n\n\u201cAnswer me this: What has keys but can\u2019t open locks?\u201d the Keeper said, smirking.\n\nZara thought hard. \u201cA piano!\u201d she exclaimed.\n\nThe Keeper\u2019s eyes glimmered. \u201cYou are clever, girl. You may proceed. But tread carefully.\u201d\n\nZara sighed in relief. \u201cThank you! Now, what can we trade for Finn\u2019s safety?\u201d\n\nKaden scratched his chin. \u201cI might have just the thing, but it won\u2019t come cheap.\u201d\n\nFinn looked at Zara, hope flickering in his eyes. \u201cWhat is it?\u201d\n\nKaden grinned, revealing a small, glowing vial. \u201cThis potion can break any curse. But you\u2019ll need to give me something that truly matters to you.\u201d\n\nZara took a deep breath. \u201cWhat if we trade the necklace you wanted?\u201d \n\n\u201cDeal!\u201d Kaden replied, his smile growing wider. \n\nFinn smiled, too. \u201cWe can find a way to get it back later.\u201d\n\nAs they made the trade, Zara felt a surge of hope. Maybe they could save Finn after all!\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nBut just as Kaden handed them the vial, the market shook. A loud rumble echoed through the stalls. Zara grabbed Finn\u2019s arm. \u201cWe need to get out of here!\u201d\n\nTogether, they raced toward the exit, hearts pounding. What lay ahead was still a mystery, but Zara knew they would face it together.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Zara and Finn need from Kaden?","options":["A necklace","A potion","A riddle","A magical creature"],"correct_answer":"A potion"},{"question":"What does the Keeper of Secrets ask Zara?","options":["A question","A riddle","A trade","A favor"],"correct_answer":"A riddle"},{"question":"What is Zara's answer to the riddle?","options":["A lock","A treasure","A piano","A key"],"correct_answer":"A piano"},{"question":"What do Zara and Finn trade for the potion?","options":["A book","A necklace","A magic wand","A secret"],"correct_answer":"A necklace"},{"question":"What happens at the end of the chapter?","options":["They find treasure","The market shakes","They meet a dragon","They win a prize"],"correct_answer":"The market shakes"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_179_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_179_ch4_img1.png","plot_179_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":531,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
