   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_179_7_10","title":"The Shadow Market","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Urban Fantasy","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Zara and Finn stood in the Shadow Market, their hearts racing. The air was thick with mystery. Everywhere they looked, stalls overflowed with magical items. Zara spotted a shimmering blue potion on a nearby table.\n\n\"Do you think that potion can help me?\" Finn asked, rubbing his arm. He still felt the sting of the curse.\n\nZara nodded. \"We have to trade something for it. Let\u2019s find Kaden!\" \n\nThey searched through the bustling market. Kaden was hard to find, but they finally spotted him near a stall filled with twinkling crystals.\n\n\"Hey, Kaden!\" Zara called. \"We need your help!\"\n\nKaden smirked. \"What do you want now, Zara?\"\n\n\"We need that potion,\" Zara said, pointing. \"Finn\u2019s in trouble!\"\n\nKaden looked thoughtful. \"Hmm\u2026 I might be able to help. But first, what do you have to trade?\"\n\nZara glanced at Finn. They both knew they had to think fast. \"We can trade the magical compass we found. It led us here!\"\n\nKaden\u2019s eyes sparkled. \"Deal! But watch this.\" He waved his hand, and the potion glowed brighter. \n\nSuddenly, the market shook! Items rattled on their shelves. Zara gasped, \"What\u2019s happening?\"\n\nKaden shrugged, but his face turned serious. \"It\u2019s the curse! If you want the potion, you need it now!\" \n\n\"Finn, hold on!\" Zara shouted as she grabbed the potion and held it up.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nZara quickly poured the potion over Finn\u2019s arm. It sparkled like stars and swirled with colors. Finn gasped as the curse faded away, and he smiled. \"I feel better! Thank you, Zara!\"\n\nJust then, a figure emerged from the shadows. \"You tricked me, Kaden!\" a voice hissed. It was the mysterious riddle master. \"You owe me a favor now!\"\n\nZara frowned, thinking quickly. \"You can't take anything from us! We saved Finn!\"\n\nThe riddle master laughed, but Zara stood tall. \"If you want something, let\u2019s make a fair trade! How about Kaden\u2019s secrets for Finn\u2019s freedom?\"\n\nKaden looked surprised but nodded. \"Alright!\"\n\nThe riddle master considered this. \"Fine! But remember, secrets come at a price!\"\n\nIn that moment, a bright light burst around them. Zara felt a warm glow of victory. They had outsmarted the curse and saved Finn! \n\n\"Let\u2019s go home, Finn,\" Zara said, relieved. They left the Shadow Market behind, ready for new adventures.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Zara and Finn trade for the potion?","options":["A magical compass","A crystal","A riddle","A spell"],"correct_answer":"A magical compass"},{"question":"What was the effect of the potion on Finn?","options":["It made him sleepy","It broke the curse","It made him dance","It turned him invisible"],"correct_answer":"It broke the curse"},{"question":"Who did they negotiate with at the end of the chapter?","options":["A wizard","The riddle master","Kaden","A friendly dragon"],"correct_answer":"The riddle master"},{"question":"How did Zara feel when she poured the potion on Finn?","options":["Excited","Nervous","Angry","Happy"],"correct_answer":"Nervous"},{"question":"What lesson did Zara and Finn learn in this chapter?","options":["Always trust strangers","Bravery and cleverness can solve problems","Potions are dangerous","Trading is easy"],"correct_answer":"Bravery and cleverness can solve problems"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_179_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_179_ch5_img1.png","plot_179_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":391,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
