     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"mischievous","1":"sprites","2":"quill","3":"adventure","4":"invention","image_prompts":["A bright, colorful park with green grass and blooming flowers. Ben, a boy with messy brown hair, and Maria, a girl with pigtails, are looking up at a large tree with golden leaves. Surrounding them are small, sparkling sprites with colorful wings, giggling and swirling around in the air.","Da Vinci\u2019s workshop filled with sketches, wooden inventions, and pots of paint. Ben and Maria stand in awe, holding the sparkling quill. Da Vinci, an elderly man with a long beard and a warm smile, is handing them a piece of parchment with a flying machine design on it. The atmosphere is bright and lively, filled with creativity."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dimly lit library filled with towering bookshelves, bathed in soft sunlight. Ben and Maria are at the center, surrounded by floating dust motes. Bens fingers touch a leather-bound book, his face filled with wonder, while Maria holds an ancient text, determination in her eyes.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_180_ch5_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 17:00:14"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A chaotic scene inside the library, with ethereal sprites swirling around in vibrant colors. Ben and Maria stand firm, reading from an ancient book with an intense focus. A shimmering barrier of light surrounds them, illustrating the magic binding the sprites, while books and papers whirl in the background, depicting the chaos theyve just contained.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_180_ch5_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 17:00:14"}}}
