   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_180_7_10","title":"The Timekeeper's Challenge","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Urban Fantasy","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Ben stood at the edge of the thrift store, a curious smile on his face. It was a bright Saturday morning. The sun shone down, casting warm light on the colorful sign that read, \u201cTreasures Await!\u201d \n\n\u201cCome on! Let\u2019s go in!\u201d Maria pulled on his arm. She loved old things. \u201cYou never know what you might find!\u201d\n\nInside, the store smelled like old books and forgotten toys. Shelves were packed with everything from dusty lamps to mismatched plates. Ben wandered to a corner filled with strange gadgets. \u201cLook at this!\u201d He picked up a shiny watch. It was old-fashioned, with a big blue face. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cAwesome! Can I try it on?\u201d Maria asked, her eyes sparkling with excitement. Ben handed her the watch. She fastened it around her wrist. \u201cWow, it fits perfectly!\u201d\n\nJust then, a soft tick-tock filled the air. Maria frowned. \u201cUh, is it supposed to make noise?\u201d \n\nBefore Ben could answer, the watch began to glow. \u201cWhoa!\u201d he shouted. The room around them shimmered like a mirage. Suddenly, they were no longer in the thrift store. They stood in a busy marketplace from a long time ago! \n\nShops were everywhere, and people were dressed in funny clothes. \u201cBen! What did you do?\u201d Maria exclaimed. \n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know! The watch!\u201d He looked around, wide-eyed. A tiny sprite with bright green hair zoomed past them, giggling. \n\n\u201cTime sprites!\u201d Maria said, pointing. \u201cThey\u2019re known for messing with history. We have to fix this!\u201d \n\n\u201cBut how?\u201d Ben asked, feeling a little scared. \n\n\u201cWe need to find out what they changed. We might have to go to different times!\u201d Maria replied with determination.\n\nJust then, the glowing watch beeped again. It showed a map filled with strange symbols. \u201cLook, it\u2019s leading us to our first stop!\u201d Ben exclaimed. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe sprite flew back, whispering, \u201cCatch me if you can!\u201d It darted toward a big clock tower in the distance.\n\n\u201cAre you ready?\u201d Ben asked, his heart racing.\n\n\u201cReady as I\u2019ll ever be!\u201d Maria grinned. They took off, chasing the sprite. \n\nLittle did they know, fixing history was going to be trickier than they ever imagined!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Where do Ben and Maria find the watch?","options":["In the park","At the thrift store","At school","In a museum"],"correct_answer":"At the thrift store"},{"question":"What do the time sprites like to do?","options":["Help people","Create chaos","Be quiet","Make friends"],"correct_answer":"Create chaos"},{"question":"What do Ben and Maria need to do?","options":["Fix history","Find treasure","Go to school","Have a picnic"],"correct_answer":"Fix history"},{"question":"What is Ben\u2019s best friend\u2019s name?","options":["Lucy","Maria","Sarah","Emily"],"correct_answer":"Maria"},{"question":"What happens to them when they activate the watch?","options":["They get stuck","They travel through time","They fall asleep","They find treasure"],"correct_answer":"They travel through time"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_180_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_180_ch1_img1.png","plot_180_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":360,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
