   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_180_7_10","title":"The Timekeeper's Challenge","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Urban Fantasy","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Ben and Maria looked around the bustling marketplace. Bright colors danced in their eyes. Stalls overflowed with fruits, fabrics, and funny-looking trinkets. Maria pointed to a stall with a sign that read, \u201cWonders of the Past.\u201d \n\n\u201cThis place is amazing!\u201d Ben exclaimed. \u201cBut how do we fix history?\u201d \n\nSuddenly, a loud giggle echoed through the air. \u201cThat\u2019s easy! Just follow us!\u201d \n\nBen and Maria turned to see two tiny figures darting between the stalls. They were the time sprites, with bright blue and green hair, their laughter ringing like silver bells. \n\n\u201cWait!\u201d shouted Maria. \u201cWhat do you mean?\u201d\n\n\u201cDon\u2019t worry! We\u2019ll show you!\u201d the sprites chimed in unison, zipping around them. \n\n\u201cGreat! Lead the way!\u201d Ben said, feeling hopeful. The sprites zipped off, and they followed, dodging shoppers and stalls. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThey ran down a narrow path and suddenly stopped in front of a huge clock. The clock had hands that spun wildly. \u201cThis is the Clock of Changes!\u201d said one sprite. \u201cIt controls the timeline! But it\u2019s broken now!\u201d\n\nMaria frowned. \u201cHow do we fix it?\u201d\n\nThe sprites giggled again. \u201cA riddle! Solve it, and the clock will tick right!\u201d \n\nBen scratched his head. \u201cWhat\u2019s the riddle?\u201d\n\n\u201cTime flies like a bird. With a tick-tock, it\u2019s heard. Find the hour that\u2019s gone to fix the wrong!\u201d \n\nBen and Maria exchanged worried glances. \u201cWhat hour?\u201d Ben asked.\n\nBefore they could answer, the clock went \u201cBONG!\u201d and the hands began spinning faster. Suddenly, the marketplace shook. \n\n\u201cOh no! The sprites are making it worse!\u201d cried Maria. \n\nAs the ground trembled, a pile of apples toppled over, rolling in every direction. \u201cWatch out!\u201d yelled Ben, leaping to catch them as they rolled away. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nMaria darted after the sprites, trying to grab one. \u201cHey, wait! You can\u2019t just leave us like this!\u201d \n\nThe sprites giggled and zoomed around her. \u201cFix the hour, or we\u2019ll have more chaos! Keep trying!\u201d \n\nBen grabbed Maria\u2019s arm. \u201cWe need to think! What hour could it be?\u201d\n\nSuddenly, Maria\u2019s eyes lit up. \u201cI remember! There was that famous event with the big storm! It happened at two o\u2019clock!\u201d \n\n\u201cYes! The storm in history!\u201d Ben shouted. \u201cThat\u2019s it!\u201d\n\nBut before they could make a plan, everything went black. \n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d Ben cried. \n\n\u201cHold on tight!\u201d Maria yelled, her voice barely heard over the chaos. \n\nThey had to act fast. The clock was ticking, and history was in their hands!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Ben and Maria find in the marketplace?","options":["A treasure chest","A clock","A time machine","A magic book"],"correct_answer":"A clock"},{"question":"What do the time sprites ask Ben and Maria to solve?","options":["A puzzle","A riddle","A game","A mystery"],"correct_answer":"A riddle"},{"question":"What hour do Ben and Maria think they need to fix?","options":["One o'clock","Three o'clock","Two o'clock","Four o'clock"],"correct_answer":"Two o'clock"},{"question":"What happens when the clock starts spinning faster?","options":["It stops time","The marketplace shakes","It shows the future","It opens a portal"],"correct_answer":"The marketplace shakes"},{"question":"How do Ben and Maria feel about the challenge ahead?","options":["Excited","Scared","Bored","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_180_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_180_ch2_img1.png","plot_180_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":417,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
