   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_171_7_10","title":"The Whispering Willows","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Prophecies","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"In the village of Eldergrove, the trees whispered secrets. The wind danced through the leaves, and the sun peeked shyly through the branches. Talia loved this magical place. She felt it was her home, but part of her always felt different. \n\n\u201cTalia! Come on!\u201d called Finn, her best friend. He was waiting by the shimmering stream. His bright blue eyes sparkled with excitement. \n\n\u201cWait up, Finn!\u201d Talia shouted. She caught up to him, brushing her long, dark hair out of her eyes. They often played near the Whispering Willows. The trees were old and wise, and many believed they had the power to talk.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cDo you think the Willows can really speak?\u201d Talia asked, gazing at the tall trees with their swaying branches.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know! But I heard Elder Maelis say they know secrets,\u201d Finn replied with a grin. \"Maybe they know why you're so special.\"\n\nTalia frowned. \u201cSpecial? I feel more like a shadow.\u201d She looked down at her feet. \u201cI don\u2019t understand my powers.\u201d\n\nJust then, a gust of wind rushed past. The branches of the Willows rustled loudly. \u201cTalia! Talia!\u201d they seemed to whisper. Talia shivered. \n\n\u201cDid you hear that?\u201d she asked, wide-eyed.\n\n\u201cHear what?\u201d Finn looked puzzled.\n\n\u201cThe trees! They said my name!\u201d Talia felt a tingle of fear. What did it mean? She wanted to run, but something pulled her back. \n\nSuddenly, a dark cloud appeared in the sky. The villagers below looked worried. \u201cThat\u2019s not good!\u201d Finn exclaimed. \u201cWe need to help!\u201d\n\nTalia nodded. \u201cBut how? They won\u2019t believe in me.\u201d Doubt crept into her heart. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s talk to Elder Maelis! She\u2019ll know what to do!\u201d Finn said, his voice steady.\n\nTalia took a deep breath. \u201cOkay! Together, we can figure this out.\u201d \n\nWith Finn by her side, Talia felt a spark of courage. They raced toward the village, ready to face whatever lay ahead. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cJust remember, Talia,\u201d Finn said, glancing back at her. \u201cYou\u2019re stronger than you think.\u201d\n\nAs they approached the village square, Talia\u2019s heart raced. Would they believe her? The dark clouds loomed, and she knew they had to hurry. \n\n\u201cHere we go!\u201d Talia whispered.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do the trees in Eldergrove do?","options":["They sing songs","They whisper secrets","They take naps","They dance"],"correct_answer":"They whisper secrets"},{"question":"What does Talia feel about her powers?","options":["Excited","Confused","Happy","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Confused"},{"question":"Who is Talia's best friend?","options":["Elder Maelis","Finn","The Whispering Willows","A villager"],"correct_answer":"Finn"},{"question":"What do Talia and Finn decide to do?","options":["Hide from the clouds","Visit the Whispering Willows","Talk to Elder Maelis","Climb a tree"],"correct_answer":"Talk to Elder Maelis"},{"question":"What color are Finn's eyes?","options":["Brown","Green","Blue","Black"],"correct_answer":"Blue"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_171_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_171_ch1_img1.png","plot_171_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":367,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
