   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_171_7_10","title":"The Whispering Willows","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Prophecies","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Talia stood at the edge of Eldergrove. The sun shone brightly on the cobblestone path. Flowers bloomed in every color. But in her heart, Talia felt a shadow.\n\n\u201cFinn, do you think Elder Maelis will help us?\u201d she asked, fidgeting with her hair.\n\nFinn grinned. \u201cOf course! She knows everything! If anyone can help with your powers, it\u2019s her.\u201d\n\nTalia smiled weakly. \u201cBut what if she thinks I\u2019m a failure?\u201d\n\n\u201cNever! You\u2019re my best friend!\u201d Finn declared. \u201cYou\u2019ll be amazing.\u201d\n\nJust then, they heard a rustling in the bushes. Talia jumped. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d\n\n\u201cMaybe a squirrel?\u201d Finn suggested. But his eyes were wide.\n\nAs they walked deeper into the forest, the trees seemed to whisper. Talia shivered. \u201cDo you hear that?\u201d\n\nFinn nodded. \u201cIt\u2019s like they want to tell us something.\u201d\n\nSuddenly, the ground shook! Talia lost her balance and fell. She landed on a patch of soft moss. \u201cOuch! What was that?\u201d she yelled.\n\nFinn helped her up. \u201cLook!\u201d He pointed to the sky. Dark clouds rolled in quickly. They swirled above Eldergrove, casting strange shadows.\n\n\u201cWhat if the darkness is coming for us?\u201d Talia asked, her voice trembling.\n\n\u201cWe need to hurry!\u201d Finn said, pulling her toward Elder Maelis\u2019s hut. They ran through the trees, dodging branches.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they reached Elder Maelis\u2019s home, they saw her sitting outside. Her long silver hair glimmered in the dim light. \u201cTalia, Finn! I felt your arrival,\u201d she said, her voice calm and warm.\n\n\u201cTalia has powers!\u201d Finn exclaimed. \u201cBut she\u2019s scared!\u201d\n\nElder Maelis nodded. \u201cThe prophecy speaks of a child of light and shadow. You must learn to control your gifts, Talia.\u201d\n\nTalia took a deep breath. \u201cBut what if I can\u2019t?\u201d\n\n\u201cBelieve in yourself,\u201d Elder Maelis said kindly. \u201cThe powers within you are strong. But we must act quickly!\u201d\n\nJust then, the ground shook again. Dark tendrils of shadow crept closer, wrapping around the trees.\n\n\u201cTalia, it\u2019s time to show your light!\u201d Elder Maelis urged.\n\nTalia\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWhat do I do?\u201d\n\n\u201cFeel the light within you!\u201d Elder Maelis shouted.\n\nTalia closed her eyes, focusing hard. She could feel something warm blooming inside her. But just as she tried to reach for it, a loud roar echoed through the forest.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cWhat was that?\u201d Finn gasped, his eyes wide with fear.\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s coming from the Mountains of Despair!\u201d Elder Maelis said.\n\nTalia opened her eyes. \u201cWe have to go! We can\u2019t let the darkness win!\u201d\n\n\u201cTogether, we can do this!\u201d Finn said, gripping her hand tightly.\n\nThe three of them stood ready for the challenge ahead. Talia could feel her heart pounding, but she also felt a spark of hope. \n\nWas this the moment she was meant to embrace her powers?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Talia fear about her powers?","options":["That they will help her","That she is a failure","That they are too strong","That Finn will leave her"],"correct_answer":"That she is a failure"},{"question":"Who helps Talia and Finn understand her powers?","options":["Elder Maelis","A squirrel","The Whispering Willows","The clouds"],"correct_answer":"Elder Maelis"},{"question":"What happens when they reach Elder Maelis?","options":["They find treasure","Dark shadows approach","They get lost","They meet a dragon"],"correct_answer":"Dark shadows approach"},{"question":"What does Elder Maelis tell Talia to do?","options":["Run away","Feel the light within her","Ignore her powers","Ask Finn for help"],"correct_answer":"Feel the light within her"},{"question":"Who does Talia run with to face the darkness?","options":["Elder Maelis","Finn","The villagers","The animals"],"correct_answer":"Finn"}]},"images":null,"word_count":468,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
