   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_171_7_10","title":"The Whispering Willows","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Prophecies","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Talia and Finn stood at the edge of Eldergrove, staring at the dark clouds swirling above. The shadows seemed to creep closer, whispering secrets of fear. Talia took a deep breath. \u201cWe have to find the Temple of Truth, Finn. It\u2019s our only hope.\u201d\n\nFinn nodded, his eyes wide with determination. \u201cBut where do we start?\u201d He looked around at the tall, whispering willows that surrounded them. Their branches swayed gently, as if beckoning the two friends forward.\n\n\u201cMaybe Elder Maelis knows more about the temple's location,\u201d Talia suggested. \u201cLet\u2019s go back to her!\u201d\n\nAs they rushed back, each step felt heavier. The air grew colder, and Talia\u2019s heart raced. \u201cI can feel the darkness,\u201d she whispered. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe village square was empty when they arrived. Talia and Finn ran to Elder Maelis\u2019s cottage. The door creaked open, revealing the wise seer. She looked worried. \u201cYou must hurry! The dark forces are near!\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat do we do?\u201d Finn asked, panic in his voice. Talia felt a surge of energy. She knew she needed to act. \u201cWe need to embrace our powers. I have both light and shadow inside me!\u201d\n\n\u201cBut what if you can\u2019t control it?\u201d Maelis cautioned. \n\n\u201cI have to try!\u201d Talia exclaimed. \u201cI can\u2019t let my village down.\u201d \n\nJust then, a loud crack echoed outside. The ground shook beneath their feet. \u201cIt\u2019s here!\u201d Talia cried. Dark figures appeared, swirling around the village. \n\n\u201cStay close!\u201d Elder Maelis instructed. She handed Talia a glowing stone. \u201cThis will help you focus your powers.\u201d\n\nTalia grasped the stone tightly. Light flickered from it, filling her with warmth. \u201cI can do this!\u201d she shouted. \u201cFinn, let\u2019s stand together!\u201d\n\nThey faced the darkness, hearts pounding. Talia closed her eyes and focused. She felt the light within her, pushing back against the shadows. But suddenly, the darkness surged, and she stumbled. \u201cTalia!\u201d Finn shouted. \u201cYou can\u2019t give up!\u201d\n\nJust then, a shadow lunged at them. Talia opened her eyes wide. \u201cI have to use my shadow powers too!\u201d she thought. She reached deep inside, feeling the coolness of shadows swirling around her.\n\nSuddenly, the dark figure halted. Talia\u2019s heart raced. She had to decide\u2014would she fight it with light or trust her shadow? \n\n\u201cTogether!\u201d Finn yelled, ready at her side. Talia took a deep breath, feeling ready. But the darkness was stronger than she imagined. \n\nWith a flash, the shadows engulfed her, and everything went black.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Talia and Finn need to find?","options":["The Temple of Truth","The Whispering Willows","Elder Maelis's cottage","A dark figure"],"correct_answer":"The Temple of Truth"},{"question":"What does Elder Maelis give Talia?","options":["A book","A glowing stone","A map","A sword"],"correct_answer":"A glowing stone"},{"question":"What does Talia feel inside her?","options":["Fear","Happiness","Light and shadow","Anger"],"correct_answer":"Light and shadow"},{"question":"What happens as dark figures appear?","options":["The sun comes out","The ground shakes","A storm begins","A rainbow appears"],"correct_answer":"The ground shakes"},{"question":"What does Talia decide to do in the face of danger?","options":["Give up","Run away","Use both her powers","Call for help"],"correct_answer":"Use both her powers"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_171_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_171_ch3_img1.png","plot_171_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":413,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
