   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_171_7_10","title":"The Whispering Willows","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Prophecies","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Talia stood at the edge of Eldergrove, her heart racing. The sun peeked through the trees, casting warm light on the path ahead. \u201cAre you ready, Finn?\u201d she asked, gripping the glowing stone.\n\nFinn grinned. \u201cOf course! Let\u2019s find the Temple of Truth!\u201d He jumped over a small log, his enthusiasm infectious.\n\nAs they made their way through the Whispering Willows, the trees swayed gently. Their leaves shimmered, whispering secrets. \u201cDo you think they know where the Temple is?\u201d Talia wondered aloud.\n\n\u201cMaybe!\u201d Finn replied. \u201cLet\u2019s listen.\u201d They stopped and closed their eyes. The soft whispers sounded like music. Talia felt warmth spreading from the stone in her hand. It pulsed, guiding her. \n\nSuddenly, a shadow flickered behind them. Talia spun around. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d \n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know,\u201d Finn said, his voice low. They looked back. Nothing was there, but the air felt heavy. \u201cLet\u2019s keep moving,\u201d he urged.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nTalia could see the outline of the Mountains of Despair in the distance. \u201cThere\u2019s the mountain!\u201d she shouted, pointing. \u201cWe\u2019re getting closer!\u201d\n\nAs they walked, Talia\u2019s confidence grew. She knew she had powers, but controlling them was tough. \u201cElder Maelis said I could use my light to push away shadows,\u201d she reminded herself.\n\nA sudden rustling made Talia jump. \u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d she gasped. A dark figure emerged, blocking their path. It was tall, with a swirling cloak that seemed to absorb the light.\n\n\u201cStay behind me!\u201d Finn shouted, stepping in front of Talia. \n\n\u201cI can do this!\u201d Talia said, gripping the glowing stone tightly. She took a deep breath. \u201cLight, come to me!\u201d She focused on the warmth in her heart. The stone glowed brighter. \n\nWith a burst of light, she sent a beam toward the shadow. The dark figure shrieked and stumbled back. \u201cWhat are you?\u201d it hissed.\n\n\u201cJust a girl with light!\u201d Talia declared, standing tall. The shadow recoiled, and Talia felt a rush of power. \n\n\u201cWe can do this, Talia!\u201d Finn cheered, his eyes wide with awe.\n\nThe shadow retreated further into the trees, disappearing into the darkness. Talia and Finn exchanged excited glances. \n\n\u201cMaybe we really can find the Temple!\u201d Finn said, bouncing on his heels.\n\n\u201cTogether, we can face anything!\u201d Talia replied. They continued on the path, encouraged by their progress. \n\nThe sun was setting, painting the sky with oranges and purples. Talia felt hope in her heart. \u201cWe\u2019re almost there,\u201d she whispered, determination shining in her eyes. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nJust as they rounded the bend, they spotted a grand archway covered in vines. \u201cThe Temple!\u201d they exclaimed in unison. Talia felt a thrill of excitement and fear. \u201cWhat will we find inside?\u201d\n\n\u201cI guess we\u2019ll have to find out!\u201d Finn said with a grin, stepping forward. Talia took a deep breath, ready to embrace whatever awaited them.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Talia and Finn seek in the mountains?","options":["A treasure","The Temple of Truth","A dragon","A secret garden"],"correct_answer":"The Temple of Truth"},{"question":"What does Talia learn to control in this chapter?","options":["Her fear","Her powers","Her voice","Her friends"],"correct_answer":"Her powers"},{"question":"Who encourages Talia during the encounter with the shadow?","options":["Elder Maelis","Finn","The villagers","The Whispering Willows"],"correct_answer":"Finn"},{"question":"What does Talia grip tightly during the confrontation?","options":["A sword","A glowing stone","A shield","A book"],"correct_answer":"A glowing stone"},{"question":"What do Talia and Finn feel as they approach the Temple?","options":["Fear","Excitement","Anger","Sadness"],"correct_answer":"Excitement"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_171_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_171_ch4_img1.png","plot_171_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":474,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
