   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_171_7_10","title":"The Whispering Willows","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Prophecies","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Talia and Finn stood before the ancient Temple of Truth. The temple shimmered with bright lights and shadows dancing around it. \u201cThis is it, Finn! We\u2019re here!\u201d Talia exclaimed, her heart racing with excitement. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they approached, the doors creaked open. A warm breeze welcomed them. \u201cIt feels alive,\u201d Finn whispered, glancing around. Inside, the walls were covered with shining symbols that pulsed like a heartbeat.\n\n\u201cTalia, look!\u201d Finn pointed to a large symbol in the center. It was a swirling mix of light and dark. \u201cThat must be your power,\u201d he said.\n\nTalia stepped closer. \u201cI can feel it,\u201d she said, her voice trembling. \u201cBut what do I do?\u201d \n\nSuddenly, shadows swept across the room. They twisted and turned, forming into dark figures. \u201cWe\u2019ll protect the realm!\u201d one shadow hissed. Talia felt her heart thump loudly. \n\n\u201cRemember what Elder Maelis said,\u201d Finn urged. \u201cYou must embrace both powers!\u201d \n\nTaking a deep breath, Talia reached deep within herself. She focused on the light, bright and warm, and on the shadows, cool and mysterious. \u201cI am both light and shadow!\u201d she shouted, her voice echoing off the walls.\n\nLight burst from her palms, illuminating the temple. The shadows screeched and shrank back. Talia felt a surge of energy flow through her. \u201cGo away!\u201d she commanded, and the dark figures dissolved into nothingness.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nFinn cheered, \u201cYou did it, Talia! You really did it!\u201d \n\nTalia smiled, feeling stronger than ever. \u201cWe can save Eldergrove!\u201d \n\nThey turned to the swirling symbol, now glowing brighter. \u201cThis is the key,\u201d Talia said. \u201cWe have to unlock the truth to save our village.\u201d \n\n\u201cWhat does that mean?\u201d Finn asked, still buzzing with excitement. \n\n\u201cIt means we need to trust in our powers. We need to work together!\u201d Talia replied, confidence shining in her eyes. \n\nWith Finn by her side, Talia placed her hands on the symbol. \u201cLet\u2019s do this!\u201d \n\nAs they focused together, the temple lit up with colors of every hue, filling the air with hope. \n\n\u201cTogether!\u201d they shouted, and the symbol began to glow ever more brightly. \n\nTheir adventure was just beginning.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Talia and Finn find at the Temple of Truth?","options":["A treasure chest","A warm breeze","Dark figures","A big key"],"correct_answer":"A warm breeze"},{"question":"What does Talia learn to do in this chapter?","options":["Dance","Fly","Embrace her powers","Cook"],"correct_answer":"Embrace her powers"},{"question":"What does Finn cheer Talia for?","options":["Finding the temple","Cooking dinner","Driving away dark figures","Climbing a tree"],"correct_answer":"Driving away dark figures"},{"question":"What do Talia and Finn decide to do together?","options":["Play a game","Go home","Unlock the truth","Explore the village"],"correct_answer":"Unlock the truth"},{"question":"What feeling does Talia experience at the temple?","options":["Fear","Joy","Confusion","Sadness"],"correct_answer":"Joy"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_171_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_171_ch5_img1.png","plot_171_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":354,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
