   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_172_7_10","title":"The Prophecy of the Forgotten Crown","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Prophecies","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Leo and Maya were playing in the attic. Dust danced in the sunlight. They loved to explore their old house. \n\n\u201cLook at this!\u201d Maya shouted. She held up a rolled-up scroll. It was tied with a faded ribbon. \n\n\u201cWhat is it?\u201d Leo asked, his eyes wide. \n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but it looks important!\u201d Maya replied. \n\nThey carefully unrolled the scroll. The letters were fancy and swirly. \u201cIt\u2019s a prophecy!\u201d Leo exclaimed. \u201cIt talks about a forgotten crown!\u201d \n\nMaya squinted at the words. \u201cWhat\u2019s a crown going to do?\u201d \n\n\u201cIt says it can unite the four magical kingdoms!\u201d Leo said, bouncing on his toes. \n\n\u201cFour kingdoms?\u201d Maya\u2019s eyes sparkled. \u201cLike Earth, Water, Fire, and Air?\u201d \n\n\u201cExactly!\u201d Leo grinned. \u201cWe need to find this crown!\u201d \n\nJust then, the scroll shimmered. A tiny sprite appeared! She had glowing wings and a cheeky smile. \u201cI\u2019m Cora, the sprite! I can help you!\u201d \n\nMaya giggled. \u201cA real sprite! This is amazing!\u201d \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Leo said, full of excitement. They grabbed their backpacks. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nCora flitted around them. \u201cBut be careful! There are treasure hunters looking for the crown, too!\u201d \n\n\u201cTreasure hunters?\u201d Maya gasped. \u201cWhat if they find it first?\u201d \n\n\u201cWe\u2019ll have to be quick and clever!\u201d Leo said, determination in his voice. \n\nCora nodded. \u201cFirst, you must travel through the Earth Kingdom. It\u2019s full of hidden caves and tricky paths!\u201d \n\n\u201cI love caves!\u201d Maya said, bouncing. \n\n\u201cMe too!\u201d Leo added. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d \n\nThey stepped out of the attic and into the yard. The world felt different. Colors were brighter, and the air was filled with magic. \n\n\u201cLook at that!\u201d Maya pointed. A path shimmered in front of them. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s follow it!\u201d Leo said, taking a deep breath. \n\nAs they walked, they heard rustling in the bushes. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Maya whispered. \n\nJust then, a creature jumped out! It was small and furry, with big, curious eyes. \n\n\u201cCora, what is it?\u201d Leo asked, ready to jump back. \n\n\u201cIt\u2019s a friendly critter,\u201d Cora said, giggling. \n\nSuddenly, the critter spoke. \u201cI\u2019m Pip! Are you looking for the crown?\u201d \n\n\u201cYes!\u201d Maya replied, excited. \u201cCan you help us?\u201d \n\nPip nodded. \u201cFollow me! I know the way!\u201d \n\nLeo and Maya exchanged glances. \u201cThis adventure is just beginning!\u201d Leo said. \n\nWith hearts racing, they followed Pip down the path. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWhat lay ahead was unknown. Would they find the crown? Or would the treasure hunters catch them first?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Leo and Maya find in the attic?","options":["A treasure map","An ancient scroll","A magical book","A crown"],"correct_answer":"An ancient scroll"},{"question":"Who is Cora?","options":["A treasure hunter","A magical sprite","A cave explorer","A friendly critter"],"correct_answer":"A magical sprite"},{"question":"What must Leo and Maya find?","options":["A hidden cave","A lost puppy","A forgotten crown","A treasure chest"],"correct_answer":"A forgotten crown"},{"question":"What does Pip help them with?","options":["Finding food","Crossing the river","Finding the crown","Escaping treasure hunters"],"correct_answer":"Finding the crown"},{"question":"What is the main conflict of the story?","options":["Leo and Maya are lost","Treasure hunters are chasing them","They can\u2019t find their way home","They need to save a kingdom"],"correct_answer":"Treasure hunters are chasing them"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_172_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_172_ch1_img1.png","plot_172_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":410,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
