   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_172_7_10","title":"The Prophecy of the Forgotten Crown","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Prophecies","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Leo and Maya stood in their backyard. The sun shone brightly, casting shadows on the grass. \"What do we do now?\" Maya asked, her eyes wide with excitement. \n\n\"First, we need to read the scroll more closely,\" Leo said, pacing back and forth. Cora, the tiny sprite, hovered nearby. \"The prophecy mentions a path to the crown. We must find it!\"\n\nPip the creature wiggled his ears. \"I can help you! I know these lands well!\" He jumped up and down, eager to join their adventure.\n\n\"Great! But we have to be careful. Other treasure hunters are searching for the crown too,\" Leo warned. He felt a shiver of doubt. \"What if we can\u2019t find it first?\"\n\nCora flitted to Leo's side. \"Don\u2019t worry! We\u2019ll use our wits!\" She smiled, showing her twinkling wings. \"Maya, you\u2019re the clever one! What do you think we should do first?\"\n\nMaya thought hard. \"We should start at the Whispering Woods. The trees there have secrets that could guide us!\" \n\n\"Then let\u2019s go!\" Leo exclaimed, pumping his fist in the air. They hurried down the path, hearts racing with anticipation.\n\nAs they entered the Whispering Woods, tall trees loomed above them. Leaves rustled, and a gentle breeze blew. Suddenly, a chilling sound echoed through the trees. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Maya whispered, clutching Leo\u2019s arm.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know! But we should keep moving,\u201d Leo said, trying to sound brave. \n\nThen, out of the shadows, a figure appeared. It was a rival treasure hunter! \u201cLooking for the crown, are we?\u201d he sneered, crossing his arms. \n\n\u201cWho are you?\u201d Maya asked, her voice shaking.\n\n\u201cI\u2019m Axel, and I\u2019ll get that crown before you do!\u201d He laughed, a cold, harsh sound that made the hairs on the back of Maya\u2019s neck stand up. \n\n\u201cWe can\u2019t let him win!\u201d Leo declared. \u201cWe need a plan!\u201d \n\nCora flitted around them. \u201cI know a way! Follow me!\u201d She darted deeper into the woods. With a shared glance, Leo and Maya raced after her. \n\nSuddenly, they stumbled upon a hidden glade. In the center was an ancient stone pedestal. \u201cLook!\u201d Maya pointed. \u201cThere\u2019s a riddle carved into the stone!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s read it,\u201d Leo said, stepping closer. The letters shimmered. \u201cTo find the crown, answer me this: What can you hold without using your hands?\u201d\n\nMaya furrowed her brow. \u201cWhat can it be?\u201d\n\nCora chimed in, \u201cI know! It\u2019s your breath!\u201d \n\n\u201cYour breath?\u201d Axel sneered from behind them. \u201cThat\u2019s too easy! I\u2019ll answer it first!\u201d \n\nLeo and Maya exchanged worried glances. They weren\u2019t sure he would play fair. \n\nSuddenly, a loud snap echoed through the trees. A branch had broken! They turned to see a group of lurking creatures. \u201cOh no! We have to get out of here!\u201d Leo shouted, heart racing.\n\n\u201cQuick! To the pedestal!\u201d Maya urged. They all dashed toward it. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nJust then, Axel shouted, \u201cI won\u2019t let you escape!\u201d \n\nLeo and Maya had to think fast. How would they outsmart Axel and the lurking creatures? What did the riddle really mean? \n\nThe next challenge awaited them!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who do Leo and Maya meet in the Whispering Woods?","options":["A friendly animal","Cora the sprite","Axel the treasure hunter","Their parents"],"correct_answer":"Axel the treasure hunter"},{"question":"What riddle do Leo and Maya find?","options":["What is your name?","What can you hold without using your hands?","What is the color of the sky?","What is a treasure?"],"correct_answer":"What can you hold without using your hands?"},{"question":"What does Cora suggest the answer to the riddle is?","options":["A treasure","Your breath","A secret","A dream"],"correct_answer":"Your breath"},{"question":"What do the siblings feel when they encounter Axel?","options":["Happy","Excited","Worried","Calm"],"correct_answer":"Worried"},{"question":"What happens at the end of the chapter?","options":["They find the crown","They meet more treasure hunters","They face lurking creatures","They go home"],"correct_answer":"They face lurking creatures"}]},"images":null,"word_count":528,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
