   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_172_7_10","title":"The Prophecy of the Forgotten Crown","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Prophecies","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Leo and Maya stood at the edge of the Whispering Woods. The trees loomed tall, their leaves shimmering like emeralds. Cora fluttered beside them, her wings sparkling in the sunlight.\n\n\u201cAre you ready?\u201d Cora asked with a grin. \u201cThe riddle leads to the next clue!\u201d\n\n\u201cReady as we\u2019ll ever be!\u201d Leo replied, adjusting his backpack. Maya felt a flutter of butterflies in her stomach. \n\nThey stepped into the woods. The air was cool, and soft sounds whispering all around them made it feel magical. As they walked, the path twisted and turned. Suddenly, they spotted a sparkling fountain. Crystals hung from branches, dripping with water.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cThis is it! The Fountain of Echoes!\u201d Cora exclaimed. \u201cThe riddle says we must ask a question to hear the truth.\u201d\n\nMaya frowned. \u201cWhat should we ask?\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s ask about the crown!\u201d Leo suggested. They approached the fountain, and Leo leaned in. \u201cWhat can you tell us about the forgotten crown?\u201d\n\nThe water bubbled and swirled. Suddenly, a voice echoed back, \u201cOnly the worthy shall wear the crown. Seek the heart of Fire, where the shadows dance. Trust in each other, and you shall find your way.\u201d\n\n\u201cDid you hear that?\u201d Maya gasped. \u201cWe have to find the heart of Fire!\u201d\n\nBut just then, Axel, the treasure hunter, emerged from the trees with a smirk. \u201cNice try, kids! That crown is mine!\u201d He had a group of sneaky friends behind him. They looked tough and ready for a fight.\n\n\u201cUh-oh, what do we do?\u201d Maya whispered, her eyes wide.\n\nLeo clenched his fists. \u201cWe won\u2019t let him take it! Cora, what do we do?\u201d\n\nCora zipped around them nervously. \u201cWe need to distract them. I can create a spark!\u201d\n\n\u201cDo it!\u201d Leo shouted. Cora focused, and suddenly, a burst of colorful sparks flew into the air.\n\n\u201cWhoa! What\u2019s that?\u201d Axel cried, looking up in surprise. The treasure hunters all turned to watch the dazzling show.\n\n\u201cNow!\u201d Maya yelled, and they dashed away from the fountain. They ran deeper into the woods, laughter and fear mixing in their hearts.\n\nThey reached a clearing, breathing hard. \u201cThat was close!\u201d Leo said, his eyes shining with excitement. \u201cBut what does \u2018heart of Fire\u2019 mean?\u201d\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know,\u201d Maya said, biting her lip. \u201cBut we have to figure it out. The crown depends on it!\u201d\n\nJust then, they heard rustling behind them. They turned to see Axel and his friends charging towards them!\n\n\u201cRun!\u201d Leo shouted, and they raced into the trees, their minds racing with thoughts of the prophecy. \n\n\u201cWhere do we go now?\u201d Maya asked, panic rising.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know! We have to find safety!\u201d Leo replied, glancing back. The tension grew as they sprinted through the forest, the shadows closing in.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cWe can\u2019t let them catch us!\u201d Maya cried. \u201cWe have to make a choice. Do we keep running or try to fight?\u201d\n\nLeo hesitated, his heart pounding. \u201cI\u2026I don\u2019t know! Cora, what should we do?\u201d\n\nCora looked at them, her eyes glinting. \u201cRemember, trust in each other. Let\u2019s find that heart!\u201d\n\nJust then, they spotted a path leading to a glowing cave. \u201cThere!\u201d Maya pointed. \u201cWe can hide in there!\u201d\n\nThey bolted towards the cave, but Axel was right behind them. Would they make it before it was too late?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did the Fountain of Echoes tell Leo and Maya?","options":["The crown is hidden in the air.","Only the worthy shall wear the crown.","The crown is lost forever.","The crown is in the water."],"correct_answer":"Only the worthy shall wear the crown."},{"question":"Who are the treasure hunters chasing Leo and Maya?","options":["Cora and Pip","Axel and his friends","The kingdom guards","The magical creatures"],"correct_answer":"Axel and his friends"},{"question":"What did Cora create to distract the treasure hunters?","options":["A song","A spark","A riddle","A map"],"correct_answer":"A spark"},{"question":"What choice do Leo and Maya have to make at the end of the chapter?","options":["Whether to fight or hide","Whether to eat or sleep","Whether to go home or stay","Whether to trust Cora or not"],"correct_answer":"Whether to fight or hide"},{"question":"What is the glowing cave a symbol of for Leo and Maya?","options":["Safety and danger","Happiness and joy","Food and water","Friendship and love"],"correct_answer":"Safety and danger"}]},"images":null,"word_count":559,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
