   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_172_7_10","title":"The Prophecy of the Forgotten Crown","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Prophecies","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Leo and Maya stood on the edge of the Fire Kingdom. The skies were bright orange and red, like a sunset stuck in time. \u201cWow!\u201d Maya exclaimed, her eyes wide. \u201cIt looks like the sky is on fire!\u201d  \n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]  \n\nCora fluttered her sparkly wings. \u201cWe need to find the Flame Gem! It\u2019s the key to the crown!\u201d she said, bouncing with excitement. Leo nodded. \u201cBut how do we find it?\u201d  \n\nSuddenly, a rumble came from the ground. \u201cLook!\u201d Maya pointed. \u201cIs that a volcano?\u201d  \n\u201cYep!\u201d said Cora. \u201cAnd it\u2019s our way in. But watch out for Axel and his friends!\u201d  \n\nThey hurried toward the volcano. As they got closer, the ground shook again. \u201cI think we should hurry!\u201d Leo shouted. \u201cAxel might be right behind us!\u201d  \n\nJust then, they saw a glowing light at the volcano\u2019s entrance. \u201cThere it is!\u201d Maya shouted. \u201cThe Flame Gem!\u201d  \n\nLeo glanced around nervously. \u201cLet\u2019s grab it and go!\u201d They rushed inside. The air was hot and smoky. Suddenly, a loud voice boomed, \u201cStop right there!\u201d  \n\nAxel stood at the entrance, grinning. \u201cYou thought you could sneak past me?\u201d  \n\nMaya bravely stepped forward. \u201cWe will find the crown before you do, Axel!\u201d  \nCora flew above them, glowing brightly. \u201cLet\u2019s show him what we\u2019ve got!\u201d  \n\nTogether, they ran deeper into the volcano. Bright flames flickered all around them. As they turned a corner, they stumbled upon a gigantic flame statue. \u201cThat statue is amazing!\u201d Leo said.  \n\nCora landed on a rock. \u201cWe need to solve the riddle to get the Flame Gem!\u201d  \n\n\u201cRiddle?\u201d Maya asked, eyes bright with curiosity.  \n\u201cListen carefully,\u201d Cora said, \u201cWhat burns but is not alive?\u201d  \n\nLeo scratched his head. \u201cFire?\u201d  \n\u201cNo, no! It\u2019s not alive,\u201d Maya chimed in. \u201cIt\u2019s the sun!\u201d  \n\nThe statue lit up with a warm glow. \u201cCorrect!\u201d it echoed. The ground shook, and the Flame Gem appeared in front of them!  \n\n\u201cWow,\u201d Leo gasped. \u201cWe did it!\u201d  \n\nBut just as they reached for it, Axel shouted, \u201cThat gem is mine!\u201d He lunged forward, but Cora flew in front of him. \u201cYou\u2019ll have to get through me first!\u201d  \n\nWith quick thinking, Maya whispered, \u201cLet\u2019s trap him in the flames!\u201d  \nThe three of them worked together, creating a small wall of fire. Axel stopped, shocked. \u201cUh-oh!\u201d  \n\nThey grabbed the Flame Gem and dashed out of the volcano. \u201cWe did it!\u201d Leo cheered. \u201cNow we can unite the kingdoms!\u201d  \n\nMaya smiled at her brother. \u201cWe\u2019re closer to the crown!\u201d  \n\nWith their spirits high, they set out toward the next kingdom, ready for whatever adventure lay ahead.  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What kingdom do Leo and Maya visit in this chapter?","options":["Water Kingdom","Fire Kingdom","Earth Kingdom","Air Kingdom"],"correct_answer":"Fire Kingdom"},{"question":"What do they need to find in the Fire Kingdom?","options":["The crown","The Flame Gem","A riddle","A treasure map"],"correct_answer":"The Flame Gem"},{"question":"What is the riddle they need to solve?","options":["What is alive?","What burns but is not alive?","What flies?","What shines?"],"correct_answer":"What burns but is not alive?"},{"question":"Who tries to stop them from getting the Flame Gem?","options":["Cora","Axel","Leo","Maya"],"correct_answer":"Axel"},{"question":"What do Leo and Maya use to trap Axel?","options":["Water","Fire","Air","Earth"],"correct_answer":"Fire"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_172_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_172_ch4_img1.png","plot_172_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":438,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
