   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_172_7_10","title":"The Prophecy of the Forgotten Crown","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Prophecies","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Leo and Maya stood at the edge of the Fire Kingdom. The air was warm and smelled like roasted marshmallows. Flames danced in the distance, lighting up the sky with bright oranges and reds. \n\n\"Look, Maya! The Flame Gem is glowing!\" Leo pointed to a shiny red stone in a cave.\n\nCora fluttered beside them, her tiny wings sparkling. \"We need to be careful! Axel and his treasure hunters could be nearby!\"\n\nSuddenly, they heard laughter. It was Axel, with his gang of treasure hunters, sneaking closer. \"You think you can get the crown before us? Think again!\"\n\nMaya's heart raced. \"We have to find the Flame Gem first! It\u2019s the key to the crown!\"\n\nThey dashed into the cave. Inside, the walls were hot and glowed like the sun. Leo and Maya searched everywhere. \n\n\"Over here!\" Maya yelled, pointing to a pedestal. On it rested the Flame Gem, glowing brighter than ever.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nTogether, they approached the pedestal. Leo reached out, but just then, Axel burst in, blocking their way. \"Not so fast, kids!\"\n\nMaya quickly thought of a plan. \"Cora, can you distract them?\" \n\n\"Of course!\" Cora zoomed around Axel, teasing him. \"Catch me if you can!\"\n\nWhile Axel chased after Cora, Leo grabbed the Flame Gem. \"We've got it, Maya!\" he shouted.\n\nThey ran back outside, but Axel was fast. He caught up with them, a wicked smile on his face. \"You think you can escape with that?\"\n\nLeo stood tall. \"We're not just kids. We're here to save the kingdoms!\" \n\nMaya nodded. \"And we\u2019ll never give up!\"\n\nAxel sneered, but suddenly, the Flame Gem began to glow brighter. A beam of light shot up into the sky, warming the air. \n\n\"What's happening?\" Axel gasped.\n\nThe ground shook, and the gem sent out fiery sparks. \"It\u2019s the power of the Flame Gem!\" Leo shouted. They stood strong, feeling the warmth wrap around them like a blanket.\n\nThe light grew, and Axel squinted. \u201cNo! This can\u2019t be!\u201d\n\nWith a final burst, the Flame Gem exploded into a shower of light. Axel and his gang stumbled back, blinded. Leo and Maya took their chance to run!\n\nAs they dashed away, Maya held the Flame Gem tightly. \u201cWe did it, Leo! We really did it!\u201d\n\nLeo grinned, feeling proud. \u201cNow, we can find the rest of the gems and fulfill the prophecy!\u201d\n\nCora flew in circles, cheering. \u201cLet\u2019s go save the kingdoms!\u201d\n\nThe siblings laughed, feeling stronger and braver than ever. They were ready for the next adventure, the next kingdom, and the next challenge. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith hope in their hearts, they left the Fire Kingdom behind, racing toward the unknown.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Leo and Maya find in the cave?","options":["A treasure map","The Flame Gem","A magic wand","A sleeping dragon"],"correct_answer":"The Flame Gem"},{"question":"Who helped distract Axel?","options":["Leo","Maya","Cora","The Flame Gem"],"correct_answer":"Cora"},{"question":"How did Leo and Maya feel after they got the Flame Gem?","options":["Scared","Confused","Stronger and braver","Tired"],"correct_answer":"Stronger and braver"},{"question":"What did the Flame Gem do when they held it?","options":["It exploded","It turned blue","It sang a song","It put them to sleep"],"correct_answer":"It exploded"},{"question":"What is Leo's role in the story?","options":["The clever sister","The adventurous brother","The mischievous sprite","The treasure hunter"],"correct_answer":"The adventurous brother"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_172_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_172_ch5_img1.png","plot_172_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":448,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
