   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_173_7_10","title":"The Dragon's Last Wish","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Prophecies","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"In the heart of Dragonheart Valley, the sun peeked through the tall trees. The valley was filled with colorful flowers and chirping birds. But something was missing. The great dragons who once soared above the valley had vanished.\n\nYoung Ash sat on a rock by the river. He kicked a pebble into the water. \u201cI wish I could see a dragon,\u201d he sighed. \u201cBut they\u2019re all gone.\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a soft voice spoke. \u201cYou\u2019re wrong, young one.\u201d Ash jumped and turned. A glowing dragon with shimmering scales hovered above him. \u201cI am Ember. And I need your help.\u201d\n\nAsh's eyes widened. \u201cHelp? Me? But I\u2019m just a boy!\u201d \n\nEmber landed gracefully beside him. \u201cYou are the last hope. The prophecy says you can save the dragons.\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat prophecy?\u201d Ash asked, his heart racing.\n\n\u201cLong ago, it was said a brave soul would find the Dragonstone. It can restore our magic. But the sorceress will try to stop you,\u201d Ember warned.\n\nJust then, a rustle in the bushes made Ash jump. Out stepped Zara, a brave warrior girl with a determined look. \u201cWhat\u2019s going on here?\u201d she asked, hands on her hips. \n\n\u201cI\u2019m\u2014\u201d Ash started but Ember interrupted. \u201cThis is Zara. She can help you on your quest.\u201d\n\n\u201cQuest?\u201d Zara exclaimed. \u201cI love quests! Are there dragons involved?\u201d\n\nAsh nodded, his heart pounding. \u201cYes! But we have to be careful. There\u2019s a sorceress who wants to capture the dragons.\u201d\n\nZara grinned. \u201cThen let\u2019s find that Dragonstone! We\u2019ll show that sorceress!\u201d \n\nAs they spoke, a bright light flickered from Ember. \u201cWe don\u2019t have much time. The dragons are fading. If you\u2019re going to help, we must start now!\u201d\n\nAsh took a deep breath. \u201cOkay. I\u2019ll help. But what if I fail?\u201d\n\nEmber smiled gently. \u201cYou can\u2019t fail if you believe in yourself.\u201d\n\nAsh felt a spark of hope. He nodded, ready to face whatever lay ahead. \u201cLet\u2019s do it!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, Ember\u2019s wings spread wide. \u201cThe journey begins here, in Dragonheart Valley.\u201d The valley sparkled in the sunlight, full of magic and adventure.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith a burst of courage, Ash ran toward the forest. Zara followed close behind, her sword ready. \u201cThis will be the greatest quest ever!\u201d\n\nBut as they entered the forest, shadows danced around them. A voice whispered, \u201cTurn back, or face the darkness!\u201d\n\nAsh looked at Zara, fear creeping in. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d\n\n\u201cJust the start of our adventure,\u201d Zara replied, eyes shining. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d\n\nThey moved deeper into the forest, ready to face the unknown.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Ash wish to see?","options":["A dragon","A knight","A castle","A treasure"],"correct_answer":"A dragon"},{"question":"Who is Ember?","options":["A warrior","A wise dragon","A sorceress","A king"],"correct_answer":"A wise dragon"},{"question":"What is the main problem in this chapter?","options":["Finding a treasure","Saving the dragons","Building a castle","Defeating a knight"],"correct_answer":"Saving the dragons"},{"question":"Who joins Ash on his quest?","options":["A wizard","A girl named Zara","A dragon","A thief"],"correct_answer":"A girl named Zara"},{"question":"What does Ember say about the journey?","options":["It begins in the cave","It is full of danger","It begins in Dragonheart Valley","It will be easy"],"correct_answer":"It begins in Dragonheart Valley"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_173_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_173_ch1_img1.png","plot_173_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":434,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
