   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_173_7_10","title":"The Dragon's Last Wish","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Prophecies","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"The Shimmering Grove was alive with colors. Green leaves danced in the gentle breeze. The sun peeked through the branches, casting golden light everywhere. Ash felt a flutter of excitement. \u201cThis place is amazing!\u201d he exclaimed.\n\n\u201cYou haven\u2019t seen anything yet,\u201d Ember said, her voice warm like a cozy blanket. \u201cBut we must hurry. The sorceress is close!\u201d\n\n\u201cRight!\u201d Ash nodded, his heart beating fast. Zara gripped her sword tightly and glanced around. \u201cWe need to find the Dragonstone before she does.\u201d\n\nSuddenly, shadows moved through the trees. Ash froze, his bravado fading. \u201cWhat if she catches us?\u201d he whispered.\n\n\u201cWe have each other,\u201d Zara said with a brave smile. \u201cTogether, we can face anything!\u201d Ash took a deep breath. He looked at Ember, who nodded encouragingly.\n\nJust then, they heard a loud crack! From behind a tree, the dark sorceress stepped out, her eyes glinting like sharp ice. \u201cYou think you can find the Dragonstone before me?\u201d she sneered. \u201cYou\u2019re just a boy and a dragon with fading light!\u201d\n\nAsh gulped. His heart raced. \u201cWe\u2019re not afraid of you!\u201d he shouted, trying to sound brave. But deep down, he felt very small.\n\n\u201cIs that so?\u201d The sorceress raised her hand, and dark magic swirled around her fingers. \u201cLet\u2019s see if you can escape my magic!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a bright light exploded in front of them! Ember leaped forward, her scales glowing fiercely. \u201cYou will not harm them!\u201d she roared. Ash felt a surge of hope. \u201cEmber, can you fight her?\u201d he asked.\n\n\u201cI can try,\u201d Ember said, her voice steady. \u201cBut I need your help, Ash!\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat do I do?\u201d Ash asked, panic creeping in.\n\n\u201cBelieve in yourself! Focus on the Dragonstone!\u201d Ember said fiercely. Ash closed his eyes, remembering the prophecy. \u201cI am the last hope,\u201d he whispered to himself.\n\nJust then, Zara shouted, \u201cLook out!\u201d The sorceress hurled a bolt of dark energy toward them. Ash opened his eyes just in time. \u201cNo!\u201d he yelled, reaching out his hand. \u201cI won\u2019t let you take our magic!\u201d\n\nA surprising warmth came from his palm. A golden light burst forth, pushing back the darkness. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] \n\n\u201cWhat is happening?\u201d the sorceress exclaimed, eyes wide with shock. Ash felt strong, like the magic was flowing from him. \n\n\u201cNow, Ash!\u201d Zara yelled. \u201cRun!\u201d\n\nBut Ash stood firm, feeling the power growing within him. \u201cYou\u2019ll never capture the Dragonstone!\u201d he shouted. \u201cI will protect the dragons!\u201d\n\nThe sorceress hissed and stepped back. \u201cYou\u2019re just a child! You\u2019re nothing!\u201d \n\nBut in that moment, Ash knew he was more than he believed. \u201cI am the last hope!\u201d he declared.\n\nThe sorceress's laughter filled the grove, but Ash felt ready. He looked at Ember and Zara, who both nodded at him. Together, they would find the Dragonstone. But first, they had to escape the sorceress's trap.\n\n\u201cGo, go, go!\u201d Zara urged, pushing Ash forward. They ran deeper into the grove, shadows chasing behind them. Would they reach the Dragonstone in time?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Ash discover about himself in this chapter?","options":["He is afraid of the sorceress","He has magical powers","He wants to give up","He cannot help Ember"],"correct_answer":"He has magical powers"},{"question":"Who helps Ash when he feels scared?","options":["The sorceress","Ember and Zara","The trees","No one"],"correct_answer":"Ember and Zara"},{"question":"What does the sorceress want to take?","options":["The Dragonstone","Ash's sword","Ember's light","Zara's courage"],"correct_answer":"The Dragonstone"},{"question":"What does Ash yell to the sorceress?","options":["I am afraid!","You cannot catch me!","I will protect the dragons!","I will run away!"],"correct_answer":"I will protect the dragons!"},{"question":"What happens when Ash stands up to the sorceress?","options":["He runs away","He gets captured","He feels powerful","He feels weak"],"correct_answer":"He feels powerful"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_173_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_173_ch3_img1.png","plot_173_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":503,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
