   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_173_7_10","title":"The Dragon's Last Wish","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Prophecies","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"The morning sun peeked over the mountains, casting sparkles on the dew-kissed grass. Ash, Ember, and Zara stood at the edge of the Shimmering Grove. The air buzzed with magic, but Ash felt a small flutter of fear in his chest. \n\n\u201cToday is the day we find the Dragonstone!\u201d Zara said, her eyes shining with excitement. \u201cI can feel it!\u201d \n\nEmber nodded, her wings stretching wide. \u201cWe must be brave, Ash. The Dragonstone is our only hope.\u201d \n\n\u201cI know,\u201d Ash replied, trying to sound confident. \u201cBut what if the sorceress finds us first?\u201d \n\nEmber lowered her head, her wise eyes meeting Ash\u2019s. \u201cYou have more power than you realize. Trust yourself.\u201d \n\nWith a deep breath, Ash stepped forward. They walked deeper into the grove, where shimmering lights danced among the trees. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, a loud crack echoed through the grove. \u201cLook out!\u201d Zara shouted, pulling Ash to the side. A massive branch fell, barely missing them. \n\nAs the dust settled, Ash spotted a glowing stone nestled in the roots of a nearby tree. \u201cIs that the Dragonstone?\u201d he asked, his heart racing. \n\n\u201cYes! But we must hurry!\u201d Ember urged, her voice urgent.\n\nThey raced towards the stone, but just as Ash reached for it, a dark shadow loomed over them. It was the sorceress, her eyes glowing with malice. \n\n\u201cDid you think you could take the Dragonstone so easily?\u201d she sneered. \n\n\u201cI won\u2019t let you take it!\u201d Ash shouted, feeling a spark of bravery. \n\nWith a roar of determination, Ember unfurled her wings. \u201cWe will protect the magic of the dragons!\u201d\n\nThe sorceress let out a fierce laugh. \u201cYou think you can stop me?\u201d\n\nWith courage swelling inside, Ash took a step forward. \u201cYes! We believe in each other and that\u2019s what makes us strong!\u201d \n\nThe sorceress\u2019s eyes narrowed, but Ash could see doubt flicker across her face. Just then, Zara picked up a fallen branch and waved it like a sword. \u201cStay back! We are not afraid of you!\u201d\n\n\u201cTogether, we can do this!\u201d Ash yelled, his voice steady now. \n\nThe sorceress hesitated, and in that moment, Ash knew they had a chance.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith a flick of her hand, the sorceress cast a wave of darkness. But Ash felt the warmth of Ember\u2019s light beside him. \u201cNow! Grab the Dragonstone!\u201d she urged.\n\nAs Ash lunged for the stone, he felt a surge of magic wash over him. He grasped it tightly, feeling its energy surge through him like a river of hope.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Zara shouted, and they dashed back toward the grove's entrance, leaving the sorceress behind.\n\nThey had the Dragonstone! But what would it take to use it? Ash\u2019s heart raced as they escaped, knowing the real battle was just beginning.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Ash, Ember, and Zara find in the grove?","options":["A giant tree","The Dragonstone","A treasure chest","A magic potion"],"correct_answer":"The Dragonstone"},{"question":"What does the sorceress try to do?","options":["Help them","Steal the Dragonstone","Hide from them","Make a potion"],"correct_answer":"Steal the Dragonstone"},{"question":"How does Ash feel when they confront the sorceress?","options":["Scared","Happy","Confident","Excited"],"correct_answer":"Scared"},{"question":"Who encourages Ash to be brave?","options":["Zara","Ember","The sorceress","A tree"],"correct_answer":"Ember"},{"question":"What do Ash and his friends do at the end of the chapter?","options":["Celebrate","Fight the sorceress","Escape with the Dragonstone","Go home"],"correct_answer":"Escape with the Dragonstone"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_173_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_173_ch4_img1.png","plot_173_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":464,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
