   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_173_11_14","title":"The Dragon's Last Wish","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Prophecies","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"In the heart of Dragonheart Valley, where the air shimmered with magic and mystery, a boy named Ash stood at the edge of the Whispering Woods. The trees loomed tall, their branches swaying like ancient guardians. Despite the beauty around him, Ash felt a heavy weight in his chest, a familiar shadow of self-doubt. Today was the day he would finally confront his fear of exploring the woods, where tales told of the last dragons hiding from the world.\n\n\u201cCome on, Ash! We\u2019re going to be late!\u201d called Zara, her voice echoing as she raced down the grassy slope. With her fiery hair and determined spirit, Zara was the bravest person Ash knew. She was also his closest friend, fiercely protective and undeterred by the tales of old.\n\n\u201cI\u2026 I\u2019m coming!\u201d Ash replied, trying to sound confident as he took a hesitant step forward. He could hear the rustling of leaves, the whispers of legends he never quite believed. But Zara believed in him. That was something, at least.\n\nAs they reached the clearing, the sunlight broke through the clouds, illuminating the vibrant colors of Dragonheart Valley. Ash\u2019s eyes widened as he gazed at the breathtaking view. The valley stretched endlessly, hills rolling like the waves of an emerald sea. But the beauty felt tainted by the knowledge that dragons were disappearing, one by one. He brushed his fingers through his messy brown hair and sighed. \n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Zara suddenly exclaimed, pointing toward a distant mountain peak where a plume of smoke curled into the sky. \u201cThat\u2019s where they say the last dragon lives! The stories say it\u2019s sacred.\u201d\n\nAsh\u2019s heart raced. \u201cBut what if it\u2019s just a story? What if we find nothing?\u201d \n\nZara turned, her blue eyes blazing with determination. \u201cWe\u2019ll find something, Ash. We can\u2019t let the dragons vanish without a fight. Besides, you\u2019re not just any boy\u2014you might be the one to save them!\u201d\n\nJust then, an unexpected gust of wind swept through the clearing, carrying with it a soft, melodic voice. \u201cOnly the chosen can awaken the magic,\u201d it whispered. \n\nAsh and Zara exchanged bewildered glances. \u201cDid you hear that?\u201d Ash asked nervously, his heart thudding in his chest.\n\nBefore Zara could respond, a brilliant flash of red and gold surged above them. A massive dragon appeared, its scales glittering in the sunlight. Ash\u2019s breath caught in his throat as he stared at Ember, the wise dragon of legend. Her wings unfurled majestically, casting shadows over the valley below. \n\n\u201cDo not fear, young ones,\u201d Ember said, her deep voice resonating like distant thunder. \u201cI have come to seek you, Ash. You are the last hope.\u201d\n\n\u201cMe?\u201d Ash stammered, his doubts creeping back like a dark fog. \u201cWhy me?\u201d\n\n\u201cThe prophecy speaks of a boy who will unlock the Dragonstone\u2019s power. Time is running out, and you must embark on a quest to save us before it\u2019s too late!\u201d\n\nAsh felt something shift within him. With Zara at his side and Ember\u2019s expectant gaze upon him, he realized this was about more than just dragons. It was about finding strength he didn\u2019t know he had. \n\n\u201cAlright,\u201d he said, steeling himself. \u201cWhere do we start?\u201d\n\n\u201cFollow me,\u201d Ember commanded, her wings casting a warm glow as she soared ahead, leading them into the unknown.\n\nAs Ash and Zara chased after the dragon, a sense of adventure ignited within him. Perhaps this was his chance to prove himself, to discover the hero hidden deep down. But lurking within the shadows of the valley, the sorceress watched, her intentions as dark as the storm clouds gathering above. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the main setting of the story?","options":["An enchanted forest","A bustling city","Dragonheart Valley","A dark cave"],"correct_answer":"Dragonheart Valley"},{"question":"What does Ember reveal to Ash?","options":["He is a prince","He is the last hope to save the dragons","He can fly","He is a warrior"],"correct_answer":"He is the last hope to save the dragons"},{"question":"Who is Ash's closest friend?","options":["Ember","Zara","The sorceress","A dragon"],"correct_answer":"Zara"},{"question":"What emotion does Ash primarily feel at the beginning of the chapter?","options":["Excitement","Joy","Fear","Anger"],"correct_answer":"Fear"},{"question":"What does Zara believe Ash can do?","options":["Become a dragon","Save the dragons","Fly like a bird","Defeat the sorceress"],"correct_answer":"Save the dragons"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_173_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_173_ch1_img1.png","plot_173_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":617,"reading_level":"Builder"}
