   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_173_11_14","title":"The Dragon's Last Wish","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Prophecies","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"As the first rays of dawn broke over Dragonheart Valley, Ash stood at the edge of a shimmering lake, its surface reflecting the vibrant colors of the sky. He could hear the distant whisper of the trees, their leaves rustling like secrets being shared. Zara joined him, her auburn hair catching the light as she approached.\n\n\u201cDo you think Ember will really help us?\u201d Ash asked, a knot tightening in his stomach. Doubt gnawed at him. Could he truly be the hero everyone spoke of?\n\nZara placed a reassuring hand on his shoulder. \u201cOf course! She\u2019s been waiting for someone like you. Just think of all the dragons who need our help.\u201d\n\nTheir conversation was interrupted by a sudden roar that echoed through the valley, sending shivers down Ash\u2019s spine. The sound was deep and powerful, like thunder rolling across the sky. He exchanged a worried glance with Zara.\n\n\u201cShould we check it out?\u201d she suggested, her eyes sparkling with determination.\n\nBefore he could respond, Ember\u2019s massive form emerged from the swirling mists of the valley, her scales glimmering like molten gold. She landed gracefully, causing the ground to tremble beneath their feet. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cDo not be afraid, young ones,\u201d Ember said, her voice a soothing melody. \u201cThe time has come for you to understand the true weight of your quest.\u201d\n\nAsh gulped. \u201cWhat do you mean?\u201d\n\n\u201cThe Dragonstone lies within the Caves of Echoes, guarded by shadows of the past,\u201d Ember explained. \u201cBut beware, for the sorceress, Morgath, seeks it as well. She wishes to harness the power of the dragons for her own dark desires.\u201d\n\nZara clenched her fists, her expression fierce. \u201cWe won\u2019t let her. We\u2019ll find the Dragonstone first!\u201d\n\nEmber\u2019s eyes narrowed, a flicker of concern passing through them. \u201cIt won\u2019t be easy. You will face trials that test your courage and your bond. Only by trusting each other can you hope to succeed.\u201d\n\nAsh nodded, feeling a surge of determination. \u201cI\u2019m ready to try.\u201d\n\nBut just as Ember was about to guide them, a chilling wind swept through the valley, causing the trees to shudder. The air crackled with magic, and Ash felt his heart race. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d he whispered, fear creeping back.\n\nSuddenly, a figure stepped from the shadows\u2014Morgath, her dark cloak blending with the mist, her eyes glowing with malicious intent. \u201cYou foolish children think you can stop me?\u201d she hissed, her voice as sinister as the cold wind. \u201cThe dragons will be mine!\u201d\n\nZara stepped in front of Ash, her stance defiant. \u201cWe won\u2019t let you!\u201d\n\nAs the tension in the air thickened, Ash\u2019s heart pounded in his chest. He could feel Morgath\u2019s power swirling around them, threatening to steal away their hope. The moment felt like standing at the edge of a storm, and he knew they had to act quickly. \n\n\u201cWe need to find that Dragonstone\u2014now!\u201d Ash shouted, his voice breaking through the fear. He grabbed Zara\u2019s hand, determination flooding through him. They had to reach the caves before Morgath did.\n\nEmber nodded solemnly, her light flickering like a candle in the wind. \u201cThen go, brave ones. Your journey begins now.\u201d\n\nWith hearts pounding and courage ignited, Ash and Zara raced towards the heart of the valley, ready to face whatever dangers lay ahead.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What task does Ember assign to Ash and Zara?","options":["Find the Dragonstone","Defeat Morgath","Rescue the dragons","Explore the valley"],"correct_answer":"Find the Dragonstone"},{"question":"Who is Morgath?","options":["A wise dragon","A fierce warrior","A powerful sorceress","A magical creature"],"correct_answer":"A powerful sorceress"},{"question":"What emotion does Ash struggle with throughout this chapter?","options":["Confidence","Happiness","Anger","Fear"],"correct_answer":"Confidence"},{"question":"What does Zara do when confronted by Morgath?","options":["Runs away","Hides behind Ash","Steps in front of Ash","Neglects to react"],"correct_answer":"Steps in front of Ash"},{"question":"What do Ash and Zara need to do quickly?","options":["Find Morgath","Reach the Caves of Echoes","Gather supplies","Prepare for battle"],"correct_answer":"Reach the Caves of Echoes"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_173_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_173_ch2_img1.png","plot_173_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":560,"reading_level":"Builder"}
