   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_174_7_10","title":"The Clockmaker's Prophecy","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Prophecies","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"In the bustling city of Gearhaven, the air was filled with the sound of ticking clocks. Gears whirred and clanked, while steam puffed from chimneys. Bella loved this place. Her grandfather's clock shop was filled with fascinating treasures.\n\n\"Look at this one!\" Bella exclaimed, holding up a tiny, silver pocket watch. It sparkled in the sunlight. \"It looks like it has a story to tell.\"\n\nTheo, her best friend, adjusted his goggles and peered at the watch. \"Maybe it can take us on an adventure!\" he said, his eyes gleaming with excitement.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe clock shop was cozy and warm. Wooden shelves lined the walls, filled with clocks of all shapes and sizes. Bella's grandfather, Mr. Pendleton, was busy winding a large grandfather clock in the corner.\n\n\"Do you think we'll ever run out of time?\" Bella asked her grandfather.\n\nMr. Pendleton smiled and chuckled. \"Time is like a river, my dear. It flows, but we can always find a way to navigate it.\"\n\nJust then, the front door swung open. A gust of wind rushed in, and an old man stepped inside. He wore a long coat covered in pockets filled with strange gadgets. \n\n\u201cGreetings!\u201d he said, bowing slightly. \u201cI am Mr. Pendergast, the timekeeper. I have come to speak of a prophecy.\u201d\n\nBella and Theo exchanged curious glances. \u201cA prophecy?\u201d Bella asked eagerly.\n\n\u201cIndeed,\u201d said Mr. Pendergast, his eyes twinkling. \u201cIt involves you, young Bella, and that very pocket watch you\u2019re holding.\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat does it say?\u201d Theo asked, bouncing on his toes.\n\n\u201cIt foretells a time-twisting adventure that can save your grandfather\u2019s shop!\u201d Mr. Pendergast exclaimed. \u201cBut beware! Every choice you make will change the future.\u201d\n\nBella's heart raced. She felt a thrill of excitement mixed with fear. \u201cWhat do we have to do?\u201d\n\n\u201cFind the secrets of Gearhaven\u2019s past,\u201d said Mr. Pendergast. \u201cAnd remember, time is precious.\u201d\n\nBella nodded, determination sparkling in her eyes. \u201cWe\u2019ll do it together!\u201d\n\nTheo grinned. \u201cAdventure awaits, Bella!\u201d\n\nAs they held hands, the pocket watch began to glow. Suddenly, a whirlwind of colors surrounded them. Bella couldn\u2019t believe it. They were about to begin their time-twisting journey!\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\"Hold on tight!\" Theo shouted, and with a flash, they were off into the unknown.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What city does Bella live in?","options":["Gearhaven","Springfield","Clocktown","Wonderland"],"correct_answer":"Gearhaven"},{"question":"What does the pocket watch do?","options":["Makes noise","Shows the time","Unlocks a prophecy","Is a decoration"],"correct_answer":"Unlocks a prophecy"},{"question":"Who is Mr. Pendergast?","options":["Bella's grandfather","A timekeeper","A shop owner","A clock maker"],"correct_answer":"A timekeeper"},{"question":"What does Bella feel when she holds the watch?","options":["Bored","Excited","Scared","Hungry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"},{"question":"What do Bella and Theo have to find?","options":["Secrets of the future","Secrets of Gearhaven's past","A treasure map","More clocks"],"correct_answer":"Secrets of Gearhaven's past"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_174_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_174_ch1_img1.png","plot_174_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":378,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
