   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_174_7_10","title":"The Clockmaker's Prophecy","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Prophecies","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Bella stood in the heart of Gearhaven. The city buzzed with energy. Gears whirred and clock towers chimed. She held the pocket watch tightly. \"Theo, this is it! This is how we save my grandfather's shop!\" \n\nTheo\u2019s eyes sparkled. \"But how do we start?\" he asked, bouncing on his toes.\n\nBella took a deep breath. \"The prophecy says we must travel back in time. We need to find the first clockmaker of Gearhaven!\"\n\nJust then, the pocket watch began to glow. A soft ticking sound filled the air. Bella and Theo exchanged wide-eyed looks. \u201cIt\u2019s working!\u201d Bella exclaimed. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs the watch ticked faster, the world around them shimmered. Suddenly, they found themselves in a cobblestone street, much older than their own. \"Look at those shops!\" Theo shouted, pointing to signs that read \"Clockmaker's Workshop\" and \"Gadget Emporium.\" \n\nThey walked cautiously. People in long coats and hats hurried by. \u201cWe need to find the clockmaker,\u201d Bella said, peering into a shop window.\n\nInside, an old man tinkered with a large clock. His white beard was as fluffy as a cloud. \"Excuse me!\" Bella called, stepping inside. \"Are you the clockmaker?\"\n\nThe man glanced up, a frown creasing his forehead. \"Aye, I am. But what do you want, young ones?\"\n\n\"We need to know how you built your first clock!\" Theo said eagerly. \n\nThe clockmaker shook his head. \u201cThat knowledge is hard to come by. Time is not a simple thing.\u201d\n\nBella frowned. \u201cBut our future is at stake! My grandfather's shop might close!\u201d\n\nThe clockmaker stroked his beard. \u201cVery well. But you must complete a challenge first. You need to fix this broken clock.\u201d He pointed to a dusty clock on the shelf. \n\nBella's heart raced. \u201cWe can do it!\u201d she said, glancing at Theo. \n\n\u201cRight! Let\u2019s figure it out,\u201d Theo replied, looking excited. \n\nAs they worked, they faced many tricky gears and springs. Time began to slip away. Suddenly, the clock's hands began to spin wildly! \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cUh-oh!\u201d Bella shouted. \u201cWhat did we do?\u201d\n\nThe clockmaker laughed softly. \u201cYou must be careful, young ones. Your actions here will change things in your time!\u201d\n\nBella gulped. \u201cThen we need to fix it fast!\u201d \n\nBut the clock's spinning grew faster. Would they be able to save their future?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Bella and Theo need to find?","options":["The first clockmaker","A new pocket watch","A special clock","A hidden treasure"],"correct_answer":"The first clockmaker"},{"question":"What challenge does the clockmaker give Bella and Theo?","options":["To build a new clock","To fix a broken clock","To travel to the future","To find a hidden gem"],"correct_answer":"To fix a broken clock"},{"question":"What happens to the clock while they try to fix it?","options":["It breaks completely","It starts ticking slowly","Its hands spin wildly","It turns into gold"],"correct_answer":"Its hands spin wildly"},{"question":"Why is it important for Bella and Theo to be careful?","options":["They might get lost","They could break something","Their actions will change the future","They need more time"],"correct_answer":"Their actions will change the future"},{"question":"What is Bella's main goal?","options":["To explore Gearhaven","To save her grandfather's shop","To meet a famous inventor","To collect gadgets"],"correct_answer":"To save her grandfather's shop"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_174_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_174_ch2_img1.png","plot_174_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":382,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
