   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_174_7_10","title":"The Clockmaker's Prophecy","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Prophecies","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Bella and Theo stood in the heart of Gearhaven, the city alive with sounds of whirring gears and chimes. The marketplace bustled with people, all hurrying past colorful stalls. \"Look at that clock tower!\" Bella exclaimed, pointing at its spinning cogs. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s amazing!\u201d Theo replied, his eyes sparkling with excitement. \u201cBut we need to focus on the prophecy. Do you remember what it said?\u201d Bella nodded, remembering the words swirling in her mind like a clock\u2019s hands ticking away.\n\n\u201cWe must fix the past to save the future,\u201d she whispered. Suddenly, a loud bang echoed through the square. The ground shook, and a dark cloud appeared above the clock tower. \n\n\u201cWhat was that?\u201d Theo shouted, grabbing Bella\u2019s arm. \u201cIt came from the tower! We should check it out!\u201d They rushed toward the tower, their hearts racing.\n\nAs they reached the base, they saw Mr. Pendergast, the timekeeper, standing with a worried look. \u201cYou\u2019re here! You must help!\u201d He pointed to the clock\u2019s face, where a large crack had formed. \u201cIf it isn\u2019t fixed, time will break forever!\u201d \n\n\u201cThat\u2019s bad!\u201d Bella gasped. \u201cWhat do we do?\u201d \n\nMr. Pendergast sighed. \u201cYou must travel to the moment the clock was created. But beware! Any mistake could ruin everything!\u201d \n\n\u201cThen let\u2019s go!\u201d Theo declared, pulling the pocket watch from his pocket. Bella took a deep breath. Together, they turned the watch's hands backward. With a flash, they were whisked away, time swirling around them.\n\nSuddenly, they landed with a thud. Bella and Theo found themselves in a dusty workshop filled with tools and old clock pieces. \u201cLook at all this stuff!\u201d Theo exclaimed. \u201cIt\u2019s amazing!\u201d\n\nBut something felt off. The walls were covered in shadows. \u201cWe need to find the clockmaker,\u201d Bella whispered. \u201cHe has to be here!\u201d Just then, they heard footsteps. A tall figure appeared, and it was the first clockmaker! \n\n\u201cWho are you?\u201d he demanded, peering at them through thick glasses. \u201cYou shouldn\u2019t be here!\u201d \n\nBella stepped forward. \u201cWe\u2019re here to help fix your clock! The future depends on it!\u201d \n\nThe clockmaker frowned, his brow furrowing. \u201cFix my clock? But I cannot do it alone!\u201d \n\n\u201cThen we\u2019ll help!\u201d Theo offered. \u201cTell us what to do!\u201d \n\nThe clockmaker hesitated. \u201cVery well, but time is short!\u201d \n\nSuddenly, a loud crack echoed through the workshop, and the ground began to shake again! \u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d Bella yelled, fear creeping into her voice. \n\n\u201cTime is collapsing!\u201d the clockmaker cried. \u201cWe need to hurry!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nBella felt her heart pounding. They had to fix the clock fast! But how? The shadows grew darker. \u201cWhat if we work together?\u201d Bella suggested, looking at Theo and the clockmaker. \u201cWe can do it if we believe!\u201d \n\n\u201cBelieve?\u201d the clockmaker repeated, scratching his chin. \u201cPerhaps you\u2019re right, young one. Let\u2019s save time!\u201d \n\nBut just as they began to work, a loud rumble filled the air. Would they fix the clock in time? Bella looked at Theo, determination sparkling in her eyes. \n\n\u201cWe can do this!\u201d she shouted. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d \n\nBut as they reached for the gears, the shadows loomed closer. The workshop felt like it was fading away. Bella felt a surge of fear. Would they be trapped in the past forever?\n\nWhat would happen next?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Bella and Theo need to fix?","options":["A clock","A watch","A door","A tower"],"correct_answer":"A clock"},{"question":"Who do Bella and Theo meet in the workshop?","options":["Mr. Pendergast","The clockmaker","A robot","A time traveler"],"correct_answer":"The clockmaker"},{"question":"What do the shadows in the workshop symbolize?","options":["Time collapsing","Sunlight","Joy","Mirrors"],"correct_answer":"Time collapsing"},{"question":"What do Bella and Theo use to travel back in time?","options":["A magical book","A pocket watch","A time machine","A compass"],"correct_answer":"A pocket watch"},{"question":"What does Bella suggest to the clockmaker?","options":["To run away","To hide","To work together","To give up"],"correct_answer":"To work together"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_174_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_174_ch3_img1.png","plot_174_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":554,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
