   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_174_7_10","title":"The Clockmaker's Prophecy","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Prophecies","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Bella and Theo stood in the heart of Gearhaven. The air was filled with the sound of ticking clocks and the smell of fresh gears. Bella clutched the magical pocket watch tightly. \n\n\"We need to fix the clock before it collapses!\" she said, her eyes wide. Theo nodded, his tousled hair bouncing as he ran to a workbench. \n\n\"We can do it, Bella! Remember the prophecy? We have to save the past to save the future!\" \n\nBella felt a spark of hope. They needed to find the right gear, the one that had been missing for years. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe clock tower loomed above them, its golden hands ticking down. \"Look!\" Theo exclaimed. \"The old map of Gearhaven!\" He pointed to a dusty scroll on the wall. \n\nThey unrolled the map, revealing a hidden path to the first clockmaker's workshop. \"If we find that gear, we can fix the clock!\" Bella said excitedly. \n\n\"But how do we get there?\" Theo asked, scratching his head.\n\n\"Mr. Pendergast said we can use the time pocket!\" Bella remembered. She opened the pocket watch, and a swirl of golden light surrounded them. \n\nSuddenly, they found themselves in a workshop filled with shining gears and ticking clocks. \"Wow!\" Theo gasped. \"Look at all the inventions!\"\n\nBut the joyful moment was interrupted by a loud crash. A large clock fell over, its gears spilling everywhere. \"Oh no! We need to help!\" Bella shouted. \n\nThey rushed to collect the gears. Just then, a kind old man appeared. \"You must be the clockmaker's helpers!\" he said with a warm smile. \"I can show you where the missing gear is.\"\n\n\"Thank you, sir!\" Bella replied. Together, they followed the old man through the bustling workshop, filled with the sounds of tinkering and laughter.\n\nAs they searched, Bella felt excitement bubbling inside her. \"This is it, Theo! We're making progress!\"\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThey finally found the gear tucked away in a corner. It sparkled in the light. \"We did it!\" Theo cheered. They placed it in Bella's pocket watch and felt a rush of energy. \n\n\"Now, let\u2019s go back and fix the clock!\" Bella said. They activated the watch, and the world spun around them. \n\nBack in Gearhaven, the clock tower stood still, but they were ready. The adventure was just beginning.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Bella and Theo find in the workshop?","options":["A hidden clock","A missing gear","A map of the city","A time machine"],"correct_answer":"A missing gear"},{"question":"Who helps Bella and Theo in the workshop?","options":["Mr. Pendergast","An old man","The clockmaker","A friendly cat"],"correct_answer":"An old man"},{"question":"What is the main goal in this chapter?","options":["To destroy a clock","To fix the clock","To travel through time","To find a treasure"],"correct_answer":"To fix the clock"},{"question":"What does Bella feel as they make progress?","options":["Sadness","Excitement","Fear","Anger"],"correct_answer":"Excitement"},{"question":"What happens when they activate the pocket watch?","options":["They find a treasure","The world spins around them","They are lost in time","They meet a dragon"],"correct_answer":"The world spins around them"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_174_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_174_ch4_img1.png","plot_174_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":383,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
