   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_174_7_10","title":"The Clockmaker's Prophecy","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Prophecies","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Bella and Theo stood in the shadow of the Great Clock Tower. The gears clicked and clacked, filling the air with a rhythm of time. \"This is it, Theo! We need to fix the clock!\" Bella said, her eyes shining with determination.\n\n\"Right!\" Theo replied, adjusting his goggles. \"According to the map, the hidden gear is inside the clock tower!\" They hurried inside, the scent of oil and metal greeting them. The walls were lined with shelves of clocks, each ticking away.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe inside of the clock tower was like a treasure chest. Old clocks of all shapes and sizes filled the room. Bella pointed to an old, dusty clock on the wall. \"Do you think it could help us?\" she asked.\n\nTheo shrugged. \"Maybe! Let\u2019s see!\" He reached up and touched the clock's face. Suddenly, it hummed and glowed. \"Look, Bella! It\u2019s alive!\" he shouted with excitement.\n\n\"Wow!\" Bella gasped. \"What if it shows us the way to the hidden gear?\" They watched as the clock\u2019s hands spun wildly. With a loud click, a small door opened in the clock's base. \n\n\"Let\u2019s go!\" Theo said, winking at Bella. They crawled through the door and found themselves in a dark, dusty room filled with enormous gears.\n\n\"This must be the heart of the clock!\" Bella exclaimed. \"But where\u2019s the hidden gear?\" \n\nTheo squinted in the dim light. \"There!\" he yelled, pointing at a shiny gear nestled in the corner. \u201cWe need to get it out!\u201d\n\nThey rushed over, but the gear was stuck tight. \"Pull on three!\" Theo said. \"One... two... three!\" They pulled with all their might. The gear squeaked and popped free! \n\nSuddenly, the room began to shake. \"What\u2019s happening?\" Bella shouted. \n\n\"I think we activated something!\" Theo yelled back. They stumbled as the ground vibrated under them. \n\nWith a loud boom, the room lit up! A swirling portal appeared. \"Bella, let\u2019s jump!\" Theo said. They joined hands and leaped into the portal together.\n\nThey landed back in Gearhaven, the sun shining bright. \"Did we do it?\" Bella asked, breathless. \n\n\"I think so!\" Theo said, smiling. They looked around, and the clock shop was still there, with people bustling in and out. \n\n\"Mr. Pendergast told us that our actions would change the future,\" Bella said softly. \"And I think it worked!\"\n\n\u201cThat means we saved the shop!\u201d Theo cheered. They high-fived, excitement bubbling in their chests.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s tell Grandpa!\u201d Bella said, running toward the clock shop.\n\nAs they stepped inside, the smell of fresh wood and clock oil surrounded them. Grandpa was repairing a clock. \u201cBella! Theo! You\u2019re back!\u201d he said, looking surprised. \n\n\u201cWe did it!\u201d they shouted together. \u201cThe clock is saved!\u201d\n\nGrandpa beamed. \u201cI knew you could do it. You both are true clockmakers now!\u201d The shop rang with laughter and hope.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Bella and Theo find inside the clock tower?","options":["A hidden gear","A treasure chest","A magical creature","A giant clock"],"correct_answer":"A hidden gear"},{"question":"What happens when they pull on the gear?","options":["The clock explodes","The room shakes","They find a secret passage","The clock stops ticking"],"correct_answer":"The room shakes"},{"question":"Who do Bella and Theo share their success with?","options":["Mr. Pendergast","The townspeople","Bella's grandfather","Their parents"],"correct_answer":"Bella's grandfather"},{"question":"What do Bella and Theo feel when they return to Gearhaven?","options":["Sadness","Excitement","Confusion","Fear"],"correct_answer":"Excitement"},{"question":"What lesson do Bella and Theo learn?","options":["Time is unchangeable","They are true clockmakers","Adventure is scary","Gears are heavy"],"correct_answer":"They are true clockmakers"}]},"images":null,"word_count":477,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
