   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_174_11_14","title":"The Clockmaker's Prophecy","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Prophecies","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"The sun peeked over the rooftops of Gearhaven, casting a golden glow on the multitude of gears and clock faces that adorned the city. Bella, with her wild curls bouncing around her shoulders, sprinted down the cobblestone streets toward her grandfather's clock shop, known as \"Pendergast & Son.\" The shop's sign, swinging gently in the morning breeze, was a patchwork of wood and brass, a testament to the timeworn craftsmanship that had kept it in business for generations.\n\nAs she entered, the familiar scent of polished wood and the rhythmic ticking of countless clocks welcomed her. The shop was a labyrinth of clock towers, pendulums, and intricate mechanisms, each telling a story of its own. Bella\u2019s grandfather, Mr. Pendergast, was bent over a grandfather clock, his fingers deftly adjusting a tiny gear. \n\n\u201cGood morning, Grandpa!\u201d Bella chirped, her voice filling the cozy space. \n\n\u201cAh, Bella! Just in time! I found something intriguing yesterday while rummaging through the attic,\u201d he said, straightening up with a twinkle in his eye. \n\nHe beckoned her to follow him to a dusty corner piled high with old clock parts. There, beneath a moth-eaten blanket, lay a shimmering pocket watch, adorned with delicate engravings that sparkled in the light.\n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s this?\u201d Bella gasped, reaching for the watch. As her fingers brushed against it, a strange warmth enveloped her. \n\n\u201cThat, my dear, is not just any pocket watch. It belonged to our family long ago,\u201d Mr. Pendergast explained, a hint of mystery in his voice. \u201cIt\u2019s said to hold a prophecy about time. But be careful; it\u2019s delicate, and its secrets are not for the faint of heart.\u201d\n\nJust then, the bell above the shop door jingled, interrupting their moment. Theo burst in, his glasses slightly askew and a wild grin plastered across his face. \u201cBella! You won\u2019t believe what I just heard! There\u2019s a rumor that the Clockmaker\u2019s Guild is planning something big!\u201d\n\nBella exchanged a glance with her grandfather, then back at Theo. \u201cWhat do you mean?\u201d\n\n\u201cLike a takeover! They want to shut down all the independent shops in Gearhaven, including yours!\u201d\n\nMr. Pendergast frowned, his brow furrowing deeply. \u201cNot if we can help it. This shop has been in our family for generations. We can\u2019t let them close it down.\u201d \n\nBella felt a surge of determination. She opened her palm, revealing the pocket watch. \u201cThis watch\u2026 it might hold the key to saving the shop! Maybe we can look into the past and find a way to prevent the guild\u2019s plans.\u201d\n\nTheo\u2019s eyes sparkled with excitement, but also a hint of worry. \u201cAre you sure? What if it\u2019s dangerous?\u201d\n\n\u201cEverything in life has its risks, Theo,\u201d Bella replied, clenching her fist around the watch. \u201cBut if we don\u2019t try, we might lose everything we love.\u201d\n\nSuddenly, the watch began to glow, its surface pulsing with a blue light that filled the room. Bella and Theo gasped, stepping back as the air around them crackled with energy. \n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d Theo shouted, his voice laced with fear and awe.\n\nBefore Bella could answer, a shimmering vortex appeared, swirling with colors and gears, pulling them both towards it. \n\n\u201cWe have to jump!\u201d Bella cried, grabbing Theo\u2019s hand.\n\nAnd then, in a flash of light and sound, they were gone.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the name of Bella's grandfather's clock shop?","options":["Pendergast & Son","The Clockmaker's Guild","Gearhaven Creations","The Timekeeper's Shop"],"correct_answer":"Pendergast & Son"},{"question":"What does the pocket watch symbolize?","options":["Friendship","Time travel","Adventure","All of the above"],"correct_answer":"All of the above"},{"question":"What threat does Bella and her grandfather face?","options":["A natural disaster","The Clockmaker's Guild","A rival shop","An ancient curse"],"correct_answer":"The Clockmaker's Guild"},{"question":"How does Bella feel about the watch when she first touches it?","options":["Nervous","Excited","Indifferent","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"},{"question":"What happens to Bella and Theo at the end of the chapter?","options":["They find the past","They are pulled into a vortex","They get lost in the city","They meet the Clockmaker"],"correct_answer":"They are pulled into a vortex"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_174_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_174_ch1_img1.png","plot_174_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":560,"reading_level":"Builder"}
