   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_174_11_14","title":"The Clockmaker's Prophecy","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Prophecies","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"The sun dipped low over Gearhaven, casting long shadows that danced across the cobbled streets. Bella and Theo stood at the edge of the marketplace, the clamor of vendors hawking their wares swirling around them. \u201cWe have to find out more about the Clockmaker's Guild,\u201d Bella said, her voice a mixture of excitement and trepidation. \u201cIf we can prove they\u2019re being sabotaged, we might save Grandpa\u2019s shop.\u201d\n\nTheo fiddled with his goggles, an habitual gesture that helped him focus. \u201cI heard some folks say there\u2019s an old clock tower on the outskirts of town. Maybe it has records of past guild meetings?\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Bella replied, determination igniting within her. The two friends weaved through the bustling crowd, dodging steam-powered carriages and catching snippets of conversation. They were a blur of motion, a whirlwind of hope and purpose. \n\nAs they approached the old clock tower, its rusted gears creaked ominously, like a giant whispering secrets of the past. The door stood ajar, inviting yet daunting. Bella glanced at Theo, uncertainty flickering in her eyes. \u201cWhat if the conspirators are already here?\u201d\n\n\u201cWe\u2019ll have to be careful,\u201d he replied, his voice steady, though Bella could see a spark of fear in his eyes as well. They stepped inside, the air thick with dust and the smell of forgotten time. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nInside, the tower was a labyrinth of winding stairs and shadowy corners. Bella\u2019s heart raced as she climbed, each step echoing like a countdown to an unknown fate. When they reached the top, they found themselves in a cramped room filled with old clocks, their ticking creating a symphony of time.\n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Theo exclaimed, pointing to a stack of yellowed papers on a rickety table. \u201cThese must be records from the guild meetings!\u201d \n\nAs Bella sifted through the documents, her heart sank. \u201cThese notes detail a plan to undermine the guild! If they succeed, it would mean the end of our family\u2019s legacy.\u201d She looked up, panic in her voice. \u201cWe need to tell someone!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, the door creaked open, and Mr. Pendergast stepped inside, his cloak swirling like a storm cloud. \u201cI see you\u2019ve found our little secret,\u201d he said, his voice low and dark. \u201cCuriosity can be dangerous, especially when meddling with time.\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat do you want from us?\u201d Theo challenged, stepping in front of Bella protectively.\n\n\u201cOnly to warn you,\u201d Mr. Pendergast replied, his eyes glinting. \u201cThe past is not a place for children to play. Every action has consequences\u2014consequences that can ripple through time.\u201d \n\nBefore Bella could respond, the ground shook, and the clocks around them began to spin wildly. \u201cWe have to escape!\u201d Bella shouted, heart pounding as she grabbed the pocket watch from her pocket. She pressed the ornate button, and the air shimmered around them.\n\nWith a blinding flash, they were enveloped in light, leaving the looming threat of Mr. Pendergast and the conspirators behind. \n\nAs the world warped and twisted, Bella felt a surge of hope. They had a plan now. If they could gather enough information, they could save her grandfather\u2019s shop and protect the legacy of the Clockmaker's Guild.\n\nBut as the light faded, Bella realized they had been transported to a different time\u2014one that might hold even more secrets than the last.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Bella and Theo discover in the old clock tower?","options":["A magical clock","Documents detailing a conspiracy","An ancient spell","A treasure map"],"correct_answer":"Documents detailing a conspiracy"},{"question":"Who warns Bella and Theo about the dangers of meddling with time?","options":["Their grandfather","Mr. Pendergast","A local vendor","Theo's father"],"correct_answer":"Mr. Pendergast"},{"question":"What happens when Bella presses the button on the pocket watch?","options":["They travel to a different dimension","They return home","They escape to another time period","They are captured by the conspirators"],"correct_answer":"They escape to another time period"},{"question":"What is the main goal of Bella and Theo in this chapter?","options":["To defeat the conspirators","To gather information about the guild","To find a hidden treasure","To talk to Mr. Pendergast"],"correct_answer":"To gather information about the guild"},{"question":"How does Bella feel when she discovers the conspiracy?","options":["Indifferent","Relieved","Panicked","Excited"],"correct_answer":"Panicked"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_174_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_174_ch4_img1.png","plot_174_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":554,"reading_level":"Builder"}
