   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_174_11_14","title":"The Clockmaker's Prophecy","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Prophecies","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"The streets of Gearhaven buzzed with the whirring of gears and the cheerful chatter of market vendors, yet Bella and Theo felt a weight in the air as they stepped out of the old clock tower. The pocket watch nestled in Bella\u2019s hand ticked in a steady rhythm, almost urging them forward. \u201cWe have to find the truth before it\u2019s too late,\u201d Bella said, glancing at Theo, who was already sketching ideas in his notebook.\n\n\u201cI just wish we knew more about what Mr. Pendergast meant,\u201d Theo replied, his brow furrowed in thought. \u201cHe spoke about time and choices like they were intertwined, yet we don\u2019t know how our next move could change everything.\u201d\n\nWith renewed determination, they headed toward the marketplace, where the vibrant colors of trinkets and curiosities called to them like a vivid painting. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they navigated through the throng, Bella felt a sudden chill. \u201cTheo, do you see that?\u201d she pointed to a shadowy figure lurking beneath an archway, seemingly observing them. \n\n\u201cWho is that?\u201d Theo whispered, his heart racing. \n\n\u201cIt\u2019s one of the conspirators! I\u2019m sure of it!\u201d Bella declared, her adrenaline kicking in. They decided to follow the figure, weaving through stalls filled with ornate clocks and cogs that sparkled in the sunlight.\n\nJust as they rounded a corner, the figure slipped into a narrow alley. Bella shot a glance at Theo, whose eyes sparkled with a mix of fear and excitement. \u201cAre you ready?\u201d she asked, her voice steady despite the butterflies in her stomach.\n\n\u201cAlways!\u201d Theo replied, gripping Bella\u2019s hand tightly.\n\nThey dashed into the alley, their footsteps echoing off the cobblestone walls. The figure paused, glancing back, and Bella's heart raced. It was a woman, her features obscured by a wide-brimmed hat. \u201cYou shouldn\u2019t be here,\u201d she hissed, revealing a glint of metal in her hand\u2014a small, intricate clockwork device.\n\n\u201cWhat do you know about the Clockmaker\u2019s Guild?\u201d Bella demanded, her voice stronger than she felt.\n\n\u201cMore than you can imagine,\u201d the woman said, her voice low and haunting. \u201cYou\u2019ve meddled with time, and time is a fickle friend.\u201d \n\n\u201cWhat do you mean?\u201d Theo chimed in, his curiosity outweighing his fear.\n\nThe woman stepped forward, her eyes narrowing. \u201cYou think you can change the past without consequences? Your grandfather\u2019s shop is just the beginning.\u201d \n\nBefore Bella could respond, the device in the woman\u2019s hand whirred to life, glowing with a strange light. With a swift motion, she activated it, and a shimmering portal opened behind her. \u201cIf you want to understand, follow me. But be warned\u2014time can twist your fate beyond recognition!\u201d\n\nWith that, she vanished into the portal. Bella exchanged a glance with Theo, her heart pounding. \u201cShould we go?\u201d \n\n\u201cAbsolutely!\u201d Theo exclaimed. \u201cWe have to know what she means!\u201d\n\nTaking a deep breath, they stepped into the dazzling light, feeling the air swirl around them as they were pulled into an adventure that could change everything.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Bella find in the old clock tower?","options":["A glowing orb","A pocket watch","A map","A treasure chest"],"correct_answer":"A pocket watch"},{"question":"Who do Bella and Theo confront in the alley?","options":["Mr. Pendergast","A shadowy figure","A vendor","A clockmaker"],"correct_answer":"A shadowy figure"},{"question":"What does the woman reveal to Bella and Theo?","options":["The location of the Clockmaker's Guild","A secret about time","Her true identity","A treasure location"],"correct_answer":"A secret about time"},{"question":"What emotion drives Bella and Theo as they pursue the figure?","options":["Fear","Confusion","Curiosity","Boredom"],"correct_answer":"Curiosity"},{"question":"What is the main theme in this chapter?","options":["Friendship","Adventure","Time travel","All of the above"],"correct_answer":"All of the above"}]},"images":null,"word_count":502,"reading_level":"Builder"}
