   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_175_7_10","title":"The Starflower Prophecy","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Prophecies","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"In the magical realm of Luminara, a forest glimmered with light. This was the Wishing Woods. Trees twisted high into the sky. Their leaves sparkled like diamonds in the sun. Nia, an eleven-year-old girl, stood at the forest\u2019s edge. She looked in with wide eyes.\n\n\u201cWhy do I feel so small?\u201d Nia whispered to herself. She had always felt like an outsider. Her heart raced as she took a step forward. What if this was the place where she would finally belong?\n\nJust then, a voice interrupted her thoughts. \u201cAre you lost, child?\u201d \n\nNia jumped. Standing before her was Grumble, the old wizard. He looked grumpy with his long white beard and pointy hat, but his eyes twinkled with wisdom. \n\n\u201cI-I\u2019m not lost. I\u2019m looking for something!\u201d Nia stammered.\n\n\u201cWhat are you looking for?\u201d Grumble asked, raising an eyebrow.\n\n\u201cThe Dream Crystal,\u201d she replied, her voice shaking. \u201cIt\u2019s supposed to bloom the Starflower.\u201d\n\nGrumble sighed. \u201cThat crystal is not easy to find. Do you even know what you\u2019re searching for?\u201d\n\nNia shook her head. \u201cBut I need to find it! The prophecy says it will bring hope back to our land.\u201d\n\n\u201cHope? Ha!\u201d Grumble chuckled. \u201cBut you have to be willing to work for it, girl.\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a tiny voice piped up. \u201cI can help!\u201d A bright fairy zipped around Nia\u2019s head. It was Luna, with her sparkling wings and cheerful smile.\n\n\u201cNia, we can do this together!\u201d Luna said, doing a little flip in the air. \u201cDon\u2019t doubt yourself!\u201d\n\nNia smiled for the first time. \u201cOkay! Let\u2019s find the Dream Crystal!\u201d\n\nGrumble grumbled but nodded. \u201cFine. Follow me, but watch out for the mischievous creatures. They love to play tricks.\u201d\n\nAs they stepped into the Wishing Woods, the air shimmered with magic. Nia could feel her heart racing. She was excited, but also scared. What if she wasn\u2019t brave enough? \n\nSuddenly, a rustle in the bushes caught their attention. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Nia asked, her voice trembling.\n\n\u201cStay close!\u201d Grumble warned. \u201cIt could be a trickster.\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nNia took a deep breath. She needed to be brave. As they moved forward, Nia felt a flicker of hope. Maybe she was meant for something great. \n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Luna pointed to a patch of glowing flowers. \u201cThe Starflower meadow is not far from here!\u201d\n\nNia\u2019s heart leaped! Could they really find the flowers? But as they approached, they heard a loud growl. \n\n\u201cUh-oh,\u201d said Grumble, frowning. \u201cLooks like we have company!\u201d\n\nNia swallowed hard. Would she be able to face whatever was ahead? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cRemember, Nia,\u201d Luna said, her voice steady. \u201cYou are braver than you think.\u201d\n\nWith a nod, Nia prepared for the adventure ahead. She took a step forward, her heart pounding. The journey had just begun.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Nia feel like at the beginning of the chapter?","options":["A hero","An outsider","A wizard","A fairy"],"correct_answer":"An outsider"},{"question":"Who is Grumble?","options":["A fairy","A grumpy wizard","A dragon","A tree"],"correct_answer":"A grumpy wizard"},{"question":"What do Nia, Grumble, and Luna need to find?","options":["The Starflower","The Dream Crystal","A treasure","A map"],"correct_answer":"The Dream Crystal"},{"question":"How does Luna help Nia?","options":["By giving her food","By making her laugh","By encouraging her","By leaving her alone"],"correct_answer":"By encouraging her"},{"question":"What noise do they hear in the woods?","options":["A song","A laugh","A growl","A cheer"],"correct_answer":"A growl"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_175_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_175_ch1_img1.png","plot_175_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":469,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
