   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_175_7_10","title":"The Starflower Prophecy","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Prophecies","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"As Nia stepped deeper into the Wishing Woods, the air sparkled around her. Tiny lights danced like fireflies, and the trees whispered secrets in a gentle breeze. \u201cWow, it\u2019s beautiful!\u201d she gasped. \n\n\u201cNo time for dawdling!\u201d Grumble huffed, adjusting his pointy hat. \u201cWe need to find the Dream Crystal before it\u2019s too late!\u201d \n\nNia nodded. She felt a mix of excitement and worry. What if she wasn\u2019t brave enough? What if she failed? \n\nLuna fluttered above, her wings shimmering in the light. \u201cDon\u2019t worry, Nia! You\u2019re special. The woods will help you!\u201d \n\nJust then, a rustling sound came from a nearby bush. Nia jumped, her heart racing. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d \n\n\u201cProbably just a squirrel,\u201d Grumble muttered, though he sounded unsure. \n\nSuddenly, a small creature popped out! It was a bunny, but not just any bunny. This one had glittering fur that sparkled in every color. \u201cHello! I\u2019m Boggle!\u201d it said in a squeaky voice. \u201cDo you need help?\u201d \n\n\u201cYes! We\u2019re looking for the Dream Crystal!\u201d Nia exclaimed, feeling hopeful. \n\nBoggle\u2019s ears perked up. \u201cI know where it is! But\u2026 it\u2019s guarded by the Trickster Gnome.\u201d \n\n\u201cThe Trickster Gnome?\u201d Nia\u2019s stomach fluttered. \u201cWhat does he do?\u201d \n\n\u201cHe loves to play tricks and make things very tricky!\u201d Boggle said, giggling. \n\nGrumble frowned. \u201cThat sounds troublesome. We need to be careful.\u201d \n\n\u201cDon\u2019t worry! I\u2019m here!\u201d Luna cheered, doing a loop in the air. \n\n\u201cOkay,\u201d Nia said, determined. \u201cLet\u2019s go find this gnome!\u201d \n\nThe three of them walked deeper into the woods. The trees grew taller, and the path became twisted. Suddenly, they arrived at a clearing. \n\nNia gasped. Before them was a big sign that read: \u201cWelcome to Gnome\u2019s Mischief!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nBoggle pointed. \u201cThe gnome lives in that tree!\u201d \n\nNia looked at the massive tree with wide eyes. It had a door carved into the trunk. Bright colors swirled around it, like a rainbow. \n\n\u201cWe should knock,\u201d said Luna, flapping her wings. \n\n\u201cKnocking could be a bad idea\u2026\u201d Grumble warned. \n\nBut before anyone could stop her, Nia took a deep breath and knocked on the door. \n\nTap, tap, tap! \n\nA loud laugh echoed from inside. \u201cWho dares knock on my door?\u201d \n\nThe door swung open, and a tiny gnome appeared, wearing a mischievous grin. \u201cWelcome! Who wants to play?\u201d \n\nNia swallowed hard. She could feel her heart pounding. This was it. The gnome looked tricky, and she didn\u2019t know what to do. \n\n\u201cUmm\u2026 we\u2019re here for the Dream Crystal,\u201d Nia said, her voice shaking. \n\nThe gnome\u2019s eyes twinkled. \u201cAha! But first, a riddle!\u201d \n\nNia took a deep breath. She was nervous, but she had to try. She needed to be brave. \n\n\u201cAre you ready?\u201d the gnome asked, smirking. \n\n\u201cYes!\u201d Nia replied, her heart racing with excitement and fear. \n\n\u201cWhat walks on four legs in the morning, two in the afternoon, and three in the evening?\u201d \n\nNia felt her mind racing. The gnome was smiling. She had to think fast! \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWhat if she could solve the riddle? What if it was the key to finding the Dream Crystal?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What creature helps Nia, Grumble, and Luna?","options":["A cat","A bunny","A dragon","A bird"],"correct_answer":"A bunny"},{"question":"What must they do to find the Dream Crystal?","options":["Climb a mountain","Solve a riddle","Swim across a river","Dance"],"correct_answer":"Solve a riddle"},{"question":"Where do they enter in the Wishing Woods?","options":["A cave","A tree","A house","A fountain"],"correct_answer":"A tree"},{"question":"What does the Trickster Gnome love to do?","options":["Sing","Cook","Play tricks","Sleep"],"correct_answer":"Play tricks"},{"question":"How does Nia feel about being brave?","options":["Happy","Nervous","Angry","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Nervous"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_175_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_175_ch2_img1.png","plot_175_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":524,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
