   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_175_7_10","title":"The Starflower Prophecy","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Prophecies","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"As Nia, Grumble, and Luna ventured deeper into the Wishing Woods, the trees grew taller and the air shimmered with magic. Nia felt a tingle in her fingers as they passed glowing flowers and twinkling fireflies. The woods were alive with whispers and giggles.\n\n\u201cDo you hear that?\u201d Nia asked, her eyes wide with excitement.\n\nLuna fluttered her wings, leaving a trail of sparkles. \u201cIt\u2019s the magic of the woods! They love to play!\u201d\n\nGrumble grunted. \u201cYes, but let\u2019s not get too distracted. We have a gnome to outsmart.\u201d He looked grumpy, but Nia could see a hint of a smile beneath his bushy beard.\n\nSuddenly, they came upon a sparkling pond. In the middle floated a crystal lily pad. \u201cLook!\u201d Nia pointed. \u201cCould that be the Dream Crystal?\u201d\n\nBut just then, a voice rang out, deep and mischievous. \u201cNot so fast, young ones!\u201d\n\nOut hopped the Trickster Gnome, his eyes twinkling with mischief. \u201cTo get the crystal, you must answer my riddle!\u201d He grinned, revealing sharp little teeth.\n\nNia swallowed hard. \u201cWhat\u2019s the riddle?\u201d\n\nThe gnome crossed his arms. \u201cI have wings but never fly. I have a tail but am not a lizard. What am I?\u201d\n\nNia thought hard. She could feel her heart racing. \u201cIs it\u2026 a kite?\u201d\n\nThe gnome shook his head, laughing. \u201cWrong! Try again!\u201d\n\nNia felt a wave of doubt wash over her. \u201cI\u2019m not good at riddles,\u201d she whispered.\n\nGrumble put a comforting hand on her shoulder. \u201cYou can do this, Nia. Remember, think of what you love.\u201d\n\nLuna chimed in, \u201cYou got this! Take a deep breath!\u201d\n\nNia closed her eyes. She thought of the colorful butterflies she loved. \u201cA butterfly!\u201d she exclaimed.\n\nThe gnome paused. \u201cCorrect! You may take the crystal.\u201d He stepped aside, revealing the Dream Crystal glowing brightly on the lily pad.\n\nNia smiled but then hesitated. \u201cWait, what\u2019s the catch?\u201d\n\nThe gnome\u2019s eyes sparkled. \u201cYou must claim it, but beware! It will test your heart!\u201d\n\nJust as Nia reached for the crystal, the ground shook! Roots and vines snaked around her feet. \u201cHelp!\u201d she cried, panic rising.\n\n\u201cHold on, Nia!\u201d Grumble shouted, trying to pull her back. Luna fluttered above, sprinkling magic dust, but it was too late. The roots tightened.\n\nNia felt a surge of fear. \u201cI can\u2019t do this!\u201d\n\n\u201cYes, you can!\u201d Grumble yelled. \u201cBelieve in yourself!\u201d\n\nNia took a deep breath, feeling the warmth of her friends nearby. \u201cOkay! I can do this!\u201d She closed her eyes again and focused on the kindness in her heart.\n\nSuddenly, a brilliant light burst from her chest. The roots released her! The Dream Crystal floated toward her, glowing brighter than ever.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cIs this what you wanted, Nia?\u201d Grumble asked, his voice full of hope.\n\n\u201cYes!\u201d she shouted, reaching out.\n\nBut before she could grab it, the gnome laughed again. \u201cAh, but now you face your greatest challenge!\u201d\n\nNia frowned. \u201cWhat do you mean?\u201d\n\nThe gnome chuckled. \u201cYou must decide! Will you keep the crystal, or share its magic with Luminara?\u201d\n\nNia\u2019s heart raced. This was her moment. What would she choose? She looked at Grumble and Luna. They believed in her. But could she believe in herself?\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nNia took a deep breath and prepared to make her choice. This was not just about her anymore.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What must Nia do to get the Dream Crystal?","options":["Answer a riddle","Dance","Sing a song","Find a key"],"correct_answer":"Answer a riddle"},{"question":"What does the gnome say will happen when Nia reaches for the crystal?","options":["It will disappear","She will face a challenge","It will glow brighter","She will become a fairy"],"correct_answer":"She will face a challenge"},{"question":"How does Nia feel when she first hears the riddle?","options":["Excited","Confident","Panicked","Indifferent"],"correct_answer":"Panicked"},{"question":"What advice does Grumble give Nia?","options":["To run away","To believe in herself","To ignore the gnome","To give up"],"correct_answer":"To believe in herself"},{"question":"What does Nia have to decide at the end of the chapter?","options":["To keep the crystal or share its magic","To leave the woods","To fight the gnome","To make a wish"],"correct_answer":"To keep the crystal or share its magic"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_175_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_175_ch3_img1.png","plot_175_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":559,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
