   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_175_7_10","title":"The Starflower Prophecy","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Prophecies","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Nia stood in the Starflower meadow, surrounded by dazzling blooms. Each flower shimmered like a tiny star in the daylight. \u201cWow! It's so beautiful!\u201d she exclaimed, her eyes wide with wonder.\n\nGrumble adjusted his glasses and peered around. \u201cYes, yes, but we must find the Dream Crystal. It could be anywhere!\u201d \n\nLuna fluttered around, her wings sparkling in the sunlight. \u201cI can sense the magic! It\u2019s strong here!\u201d She zipped to a nearby flower, landing softly on a petal. \u201cBut we need to be careful. The gnome said the crystal is hidden, not lost. That means it might be right in front of us!\u201d\n\nNia nodded, feeling a spark of hope. \u201cLet\u2019s look closely. Maybe we can find clues!\u201d She bent down to examine a nearby Starflower. Suddenly, a soft glow emitted from beneath its petals!\n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Nia shouted, pointing. \u201cSomething is glowing!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nGrumble hurried over. \u201cIt could be the Dream Crystal!\u201d He reached out to touch the flower. As he did, the petals opened wider, revealing a tiny, glimmering crystal inside. It sparkled like the night sky.\n\n\u201cThat\u2019s it!\u201d Luna cheered. \u201cWe found it!\u201d\n\nNia\u2019s heart raced with excitement. \u201cBut wait! What if the gnome's trick is still here?\u201d She remembered the riddle and felt her stomach churn. What if they lost everything now?\n\nJust then, the Trickster Gnome appeared, grinning widely. \u201cWell done, little ones! But do you have what it takes to keep it safe?\u201d \n\nNia took a deep breath. \u201cWe can handle it together!\u201d \n\nGrumble nodded. \u201cYes, we\u2019ve come too far to give up now.\u201d \n\nThe gnome chuckled. \u201cVery well! To keep the crystal, you must face one last challenge!\u201d \n\nNia felt a rush of courage. \u201cWhat is it?\u201d\n\nThe gnome clapped his hands, and a shimmering path of light appeared. \u201cFollow this path and answer my final riddle. Only then will the Dream Crystal be yours!\u201d\n\nNia gazed at her friends. \u201cAre you ready?\u201d\n\n\u201cYes!\u201d Luna said, her wings buzzing with excitement.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s do it!\u201d Grumble grumbled, but a smile tugged at his lips.\n\nTogether, they stepped onto the glowing path, ready to face whatever lay ahead.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cRemember,\u201d Luna whispered, \u201cwe have each other! And that\u2019s the most powerful magic of all!\u201d\n\nNia felt her heart swell. She was ready to embrace her worthiness and save Luminara.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Nia and her friends find in the Starflower meadow?","options":["A treasure chest","The Dream Crystal","A magical map","A talking animal"],"correct_answer":"The Dream Crystal"},{"question":"What does the Trickster Gnome ask Nia and her friends to do?","options":["Dance","Answer a riddle","Find more flowers","Sing a song"],"correct_answer":"Answer a riddle"},{"question":"What feeling does Nia experience when she finds the crystal?","options":["Fear","Sadness","Excitement","Anger"],"correct_answer":"Excitement"},{"question":"What does Luna say to encourage Nia?","options":["We have to leave","We can do this together","I\u2019m scared","Let\u2019s go home"],"correct_answer":"We can do this together"},{"question":"What does Nia feel she must embrace?","options":["Fear","Worry","Worthiness","Hunger"],"correct_answer":"Worthiness"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_175_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_175_ch5_img1.png","plot_175_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":393,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
