     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"apprentice","1":"banner","2":"kingdom","3":"faction","4":"quest","image_prompts":["A vibrant market scene in the kingdom of Liora, with colorful stalls selling fruits and fabrics. Young Elara, a girl with curly brown hair, excitedly rushes through the market, her bag bouncing by her side. The castles loom in the background, one white and one blue, under a bright blue sky.","A tense moment in the forest where Elara, a determined girl, stands with Flick, her clever fox. They spot Kian, a boy with a mischievous grin, standing in the shadows. The trees are tall and the light filters through, creating an atmosphere of mystery and excitement."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A vibrant workshop filled with colorful threads and delicate banners. The golden light of the setting sun filters through the windows, casting intricate patterns on the wooden floor. The expressions of Elara and Fernia are filled with passion and concern as they examine a nearly finished banner, showcasing the intricate details of the lion crest.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_166_ch1_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 16:38:54"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A tense scene at the western edge of the forest, where soldiers gather beneath a crimson sky. Kian stands at the forefront, clad in gleaming armor with a determined expression, as shadows of uncertainty loom over the assembled ranks. The atmosphere is charged with anticipation, showcasing the potential for conflict as Elara and Flick watch from the underbrush, their faces a mix of fear and determination.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_166_ch1_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 16:38:54"}}}
