     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"apprentice","1":"faction","2":"whispering","3":"determination","4":"cautiously","image_prompts":["A bright and colorful forest scene with tall trees and vibrant flowers. Elara, a young girl with braided hair, is crouching beside Kian, a boy with tousled hair and a determined expression. Flick, a clever-looking fox, peers out from behind a bush. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting playful shadows.","Inside the dark cave, Elara, Kian, and Flick are peering towards a shadowy figure. The cave walls are jagged and uneven, with glimmers of light reflecting off crystals embedded in the stone. Tension fills the air as the figure stands in front of the cave entrance, arms crossed and a wicked grin on their face."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dimly lit interior of the Whispering Ruins, showcasing ancient stone walls covered in moss and intricate symbols. The atmosphere is thick with mist, casting a haunting glow, as Elara and Kian stand together, their expressions a mix of determination and apprehension. Shadows flicker ominously, hinting at the secrets held within the ruins.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_166_ch3_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 16:36:53"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing An intense moment where Elara gazes into a shimmering silver mirror held by a cloaked figure. The mirror reflects not only her image but swirling shadows of doubt and fear. The figures enigmatic presence looms behind her, creating a sense of foreboding as the ground begins to tremble. The contrast between light and shadow symbolizes the inner conflict she faces.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_166_ch3_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 16:36:53"}}}
