   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_166_7_10","title":"The Stolen Banner","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Warring Kingdoms","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"In the heart of the kingdom of Liora, lush forests danced in the gentle breeze. Bright flowers bloomed under the warm sun, painting the land with colors. The air was filled with laughter and the sweet sound of chimes. In this peaceful kingdom, there stood two tall castles, one made of shining white stone and the other a deep, rich blue.\n\nElara, a young girl with curly brown hair and big, curious eyes, rushed through the market. She was on her way to her mentor's workshop. Elara was not just any girl; she was a banner weaver's apprentice! \u201cI can\u2019t wait to see the new designs today!\u201d she exclaimed, skipping along the cobbled path.\n\nAs she entered the workshop, her mentor, Master Alden, smiled. \u201cWelcome, Elara! Today we will weave the royal banner! It must be perfect!\u201d Elara's heart skipped a beat. The royal banner was the symbol of peace for all of Liora. \n\nJust as they began to work, a commotion erupted outside. \u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d Elara asked, her brow furrowing. She quickly peeked out the window. People were shouting, and guards were running towards the castle.\n\n\u201cThe banner! It's gone!\u201d someone cried. Elara gasped. How could this happen? \n\n\u201cWe need to find it!\u201d Elara shouted, her mind racing. Master Alden nodded gravely. \u201cIf the banner is stolen, it could start a war between the factions.\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nElara\u2019s heart raced. She had to act. \u201cI will find it!\u201d she declared. Master Alden looked concerned. \u201cIt\u2019s dangerous, Elara. You will face the rival faction.\u201d\n\nBut Elara felt a spark of bravery. \u201cI can\u2019t let my kingdom fall into chaos!\u201d She grabbed her bag and waved goodbye to Master Alden. Outside, she spotted her loyal companion, Flick, a clever fox with a bushy tail.\n\n\u201cFlick! We need to help!\u201d she called. Flick\u2019s ears perked up, and he scampered over. \u201cWhat\u2019s the plan?\u201d he asked, his eyes shining with excitement.\n\n\u201cWe must follow the trail towards the mountains,\u201d Elara decided. The mountains were where the rival faction lived. Together, they dashed towards the forest, determination in their hearts.\n\nSuddenly, they spotted a shadowy figure darting between the trees. \u201cCould it be the thief?\u201d Elara whispered. Flick nodded, his nose twitching. \u201cLet\u2019s be careful!\u201d \n\nAs they crept closer, Elara felt her heart thumping. What if they were caught? But she knew she had to be brave. The fate of Liora depended on her.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe figure turned, and Elara gasped. It was a boy with a mischievous grin. \u201cLooking for something?\u201d he asked, with a sparkle in his eye.\n\n\u201cAre you the thief?\u201d Elara asked, hands on her hips. \u201cWe need the banner back!\u201d\n\n\u201cI\u2019m Kian, and I might know where it is,\u201d he replied with a smirk. Elara had a choice to make. Could she trust him?\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find out!\u201d she said, stepping forward. She felt a new spark of hope. The adventure was just beginning.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is Elara's job in the kingdom?","options":["Banner weaver's apprentice","Royal guard","Market seller","Castle painter"],"correct_answer":"Banner weaver's apprentice"},{"question":"What is the royal banner a symbol of?","options":["War","Peace","Adventure","Treasure"],"correct_answer":"Peace"},{"question":"Who is Elara's animal companion?","options":["A rabbit","A cat","A clever fox named Flick","A dog"],"correct_answer":"A clever fox named Flick"},{"question":"What does Kian say when he first meets Elara?","options":["I'm a prince!","Looking for something?","Where is the banner?","I am the thief!"],"correct_answer":"Looking for something?"},{"question":"What does Elara decide to do after the banner is stolen?","options":["Hide in the castle","Go home","Embark on a quest to find it","Call for help"],"correct_answer":"Embark on a quest to find it"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_166_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_166_ch1_img1.png","plot_166_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":495,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
