   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_166_7_10","title":"The Stolen Banner","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Warring Kingdoms","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Elara stood at the edge of the lush forest, her heart racing. Flick, her clever fox, darted back and forth. \u201cAre you ready for this, Flick?\u201d she whispered. The trees around them rustled as if answering her question. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cThe banner is somewhere ahead, I can feel it,\u201d Elara said, her eyes sparkling with determination. Flick tilted his head, his ears perked up. \u201cLet\u2019s go before those rival factions catch wind of our quest!\u201d\n\nAs they ventured deeper, the trees grew taller and the shadows longer. Elara\u2019s thoughts swirled. \u201cWhat if Kian is waiting for us?\u201d she asked. Flick sniffed the air. \u201cHe might be trouble, but we need his help!\u201d \n\nSuddenly, a loud crash echoed through the trees. \u201cWhat was that?!\u201d Elara gasped, clutching Flick close. They crept forward, peeking around the trunk of a grand oak. \n\nBefore them stood Kian, the rogue prince, tangled in vines. \u201cHelp! I didn\u2019t mean to get stuck!\u201d he exclaimed, his voice a mix of frustration and laughter. \n\nElara chuckled. \u201cYou got yourself in quite the mess, didn\u2019t you?\u201d She stepped forward, ready to untangle him. Flick was cautious but curious. \u201cCan we trust him?\u201d\n\nKian\u2019s eyes sparkled with mischief as Elara worked to free him. \u201cI can help you find the banner! Just let me out!\u201d \n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s in it for you?\u201d Elara asked, raising an eyebrow. \u201cI want to prove I can be a hero, just like you!\u201d Kian replied, his face earnest. \n\nFinally, with one last tug, Kian was free. \u201cThank you!\u201d he breathed, brushing off dirt and vines. \u201cI saw the banner last night! It\u2019s hidden beyond the mountains.\u201d \n\nElara\u2019s heart raced. \u201cBeyond the mountains? But that\u2019s where the rival faction is!\u201d \n\nKian nodded, looking serious for the first time. \u201cExactly. We must hurry! They\u2019ll be looking for it.\u201d \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s do this!\u201d Elara said, her voice strong. Flick let out a playful bark, ready for the adventure. \n\nBut just as they prepared to move, a group of shadowy figures emerged from the trees. \u201cStop right there!\u201d a voice called out, firm and commanding. \n\nElara\u2019s heart raced. Were they too late? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d Flick whispered, his eyes wide.\n\n\u201cStand tall,\u201d Kian said, stepping forward. \u201cWe can\u2019t let them stop us!\u201d\n\nWith courage swelling in her chest, Elara took a deep breath. \u201cWe will get that banner back!\u201d","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who does Elara meet in the forest?","options":["A wise wizard","A rogue prince","A friendly giant","A talking tree"],"correct_answer":"A rogue prince"},{"question":"What problem does Kian face in the forest?","options":["He is lost","He is stuck in vines","He is looking for a treasure","He is chasing a monster"],"correct_answer":"He is stuck in vines"},{"question":"What does Kian want to prove?","options":["He can fly","He can be a hero","He can run fast","He can cook"],"correct_answer":"He can be a hero"},{"question":"What do they discover at the end of the chapter?","options":["A treasure map","A hidden cave","Shadowy figures appear","A magical creature"],"correct_answer":"Shadowy figures appear"},{"question":"What animal is Flick?","options":["A dog","A cat","A fox","A rabbit"],"correct_answer":"A fox"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_166_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_166_ch2_img1.png","plot_166_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":405,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
