   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_166_7_10","title":"The Stolen Banner","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Warring Kingdoms","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Elara and Kian pushed deeper into the Whispering Woods. Flick darted ahead, his bushy tail flicking with excitement. \u201cThis place feels alive!\u201d Elara said, looking around at the towering trees. Bright flowers bloomed everywhere, painting the forest in reds, yellows, and blues.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, they heard rustling in the bushes. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Kian whispered. \u201cMaybe it\u2019s the thief!\u201d Flick sniffed the air. \u201cOr maybe it\u2019s more guards,\u201d he added, his clever eyes looking serious.\n\n\u201cWe need to be careful,\u201d Elara said, her heart racing. They crouched behind a large rock and peered out. Sure enough, a group of soldiers from the rival faction marched by, their armor shining in the sunlight. \u201cThey are searching for us!\u201d Kian said, biting his lip.\n\nElara nodded. \u201cWe can\u2019t let them find us here. We must move quickly!\u201d They waited until the soldiers were far away before continuing their journey. The shadows grew longer as they walked, and Elara felt a knot tighten in her stomach. What if they never found the banner? \n\nAs they reached a clearing, Flick stopped suddenly. \u201cLook!\u201d he pointed with his paw. There, in the center of the clearing, lay a piece of fabric. Elara rushed forward. \u201cIt\u2019s the same color as the royal banner!\u201d she exclaimed.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s see where it leads,\u201d Kian suggested, his eyes glimmering with hope. The three of them followed the trail of fabric, which led them to a hidden cave. Elara felt a shiver run down her spine. \u201cWhat if the thief is inside?\u201d \n\n\u201cOnly one way to find out,\u201d Kian replied, determination in his voice. Just then, a loud noise echoed from the cave. It sounded like someone was arguing!\n\nThey exchanged worried glances. \u201cShould we go in?\u201d Elara asked. Flick nodded, his ears perked up. \u201cWe can\u2019t turn back now!\u201d\n\nCautiously, they stepped inside the cave. The darkness surrounded them, but Elara\u2019s heart raced with excitement. \u201cLet\u2019s find out who is fighting,\u201d she whispered. As they crept closer, they heard familiar voices. It was the leaders of both factions!\n\n\u201cWhat do we do?\u201d Kian whispered. \u201cIf they see us, it could be dangerous!\u201d \n\nElara took a deep breath. \u201cWe have to listen and find out more!\u201d \n\nBut just then, a loud crash came from behind them. They turned to see a shadowy figure blocking their way out. \u201cCaught you!\u201d the figure sneered, grinning wickedly.\n\nElara\u2019s heart thumped loudly in her chest. What were they going to do now?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Elara, Kian, and Flick find in the clearing?","options":["A treasure chest","A piece of fabric","A hidden door","A sleeping bear"],"correct_answer":"A piece of fabric"},{"question":"What is the main conflict in this chapter?","options":["Finding treasure","Listening to leaders argue","Avoiding soldiers","Catching a thief"],"correct_answer":"Avoiding soldiers"},{"question":"Where do Elara and her friends find the leaders arguing?","options":["In the forest","In a cave","At the castle","By the river"],"correct_answer":"In a cave"},{"question":"What does Elara feel as they enter the cave?","options":["Excitement","Fear","Happiness","Boredom"],"correct_answer":"Fear"},{"question":"Who surprises Elara, Kian, and Flick at the end of the chapter?","options":["A friendly giant","A shadowy figure","A lost traveler","A talking bird"],"correct_answer":"A shadowy figure"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_166_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_166_ch3_img1.png","plot_166_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":417,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
