   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_166_7_10","title":"The Stolen Banner","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Warring Kingdoms","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"The cave was dark and damp. Elara, Kian, and Flick huddled together, trying to stay quiet. They had just overheard a plan that made Elara\u2019s heart race. The rival faction leaders wanted to start a war! \n\n\u201cWe need to find that banner before it\u2019s too late!\u201d Elara said, her eyes shining with determination.\n\nKian nodded. \u201cBut how? We\u2019re trapped in this cave!\u201d \n\nFlick, the clever fox, perked up his ears. \u201cI can smell the way out!\u201d he declared, his nose twitching with excitement. \n\n\u201cLead the way, Flick!\u201d Elara said, feeling a spark of hope.\n\nThe little fox darted towards a narrow crevice. Elara and Kian followed closely behind. As they squeezed through, they could hear the distant sounds of the forest. The sun peeked through the trees, lighting their path.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nElara gasped as they emerged from the cave. The beautiful Whispering Woods were alive with colors! Bright green leaves rustled in the gentle breeze, and colorful flowers bloomed everywhere. \n\n\u201cWow!\u201d Kian exclaimed. \u201cIt\u2019s like a hidden treasure!\u201d\n\nFlick danced around in circles, his fluffy tail wagging. \u201cLet\u2019s hurry! We must get to the castle before they attack!\u201d \n\nElara took a deep breath. \u201cWe can do this together,\u201d she said. \n\nSuddenly, they heard a noise behind them. A shadowy figure appeared! \n\n\u201cStop right there!\u201d the stranger demanded. \u201cWhat are you doing here?\u201d\n\nKian stepped forward. \u201cWe are on a quest to retrieve the royal banner!\u201d \n\nThe figure blinked in surprise. \u201cYou? A girl and a fox? You think you can save Liora?\u201d\n\n\u201cYes!\u201d Elara replied boldly, her heart pounding. \u201cYou don\u2019t need to join the war. Let\u2019s find the banner together!\u201d\n\nThe shadowy figure paused. \u201cMaybe you\u2019re right. I\u2019ve seen too much fighting. Let\u2019s make peace instead.\u201d\n\nElara could hardly believe her ears. \u201cReally? You\u2019ll help us?\u201d\n\nThe figure nodded slowly, a hopeful smile spreading across their face. \u201cYes! Together we can return Liora\u2019s banner and stop the war!\u201d\n\nElara felt a surge of excitement. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d \n\nWith their new ally by their side, they raced through the forest, ready to face whatever challenges lay ahead.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe path to the castle was filled with lush trees and singing birds. Elara felt a warm glow inside her. They were making progress! \n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Kian pointed to a flag waving in the distance. \u201cThat\u2019s the royal castle!\u201d \n\nElara\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWe\u2019re almost there!\u201d\n\nBut suddenly, a loud horn blast echoed through the trees. \u201cThey\u2019re starting the battle!\u201d Kian shouted, his eyes wide with fear.\n\n\u201cWe have to move faster!\u201d Elara said, determination burning in her heart.\n\nAs they dashed through the trees, Elara knew they were getting closer to the truth and the banner. Time was running out, but she refused to give up.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Elara and her friends want to retrieve?","options":["A magic wand","The royal banner","A treasure map","A lost pet"],"correct_answer":"The royal banner"},{"question":"Who leads the group out of the cave?","options":["Kian","Flick","Elara","The shadowy figure"],"correct_answer":"Flick"},{"question":"What does the shadowy figure decide to do?","options":["Join the war","Help Elara and Kian","Run away","Steal the banner"],"correct_answer":"Help Elara and Kian"},{"question":"Where do they see the castle?","options":["In the cave","In the distance","Behind a tree","On a mountain"],"correct_answer":"In the distance"},{"question":"What makes Elara feel hopeful?","options":["Finding food","Meeting a stranger","The beautiful forest","Making a plan"],"correct_answer":"The beautiful forest"}]},"images":null,"word_count":471,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
