   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_167_7_10","title":"The Dragon's Peace","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Warring Kingdoms","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"In the land of Dracos, where fiery volcanoes erupted like great dragons breathing fire, a young dragon named Zazra soared through the sky. Her scales sparkled in the sunlight, shining bright like polished emeralds. Zazra loved the thrill of flying over the vast mountains and valleys, feeling the warm wind rush past her.\n\nOne sunny morning, Zazra spotted something unusual below. It was a knight in shining armor! He was practicing his sword swings by a bubbling brook. Curious, Zazra flew closer.\n\n\u201cHello there!\u201d she called, landing gracefully on a nearby rock. \n\nThe knight looked up, surprised. \u201cA talking dragon! I\u2019ve never seen that before!\u201d \n\n\u201cMy name is Zazra. What\u2019s yours?\u201d she asked, her tail flicking excitedly.\n\n\u201cI\u2019m Arlen, a knight of Dracos. What brings you here?\u201d he replied, sheathing his sword.\n\n\u201cI was just flying around,\u201d Zazra said. \u201cBut I\u2019m worried about something!\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat troubles you?\u201d Arlen asked, his brow furrowing.\n\nZazra took a deep breath. \u201cI heard whispers of a prophecy. It says that only a dragon, a knight, and a sorceress can bring peace to Dracos and Eldoria.\u201d\n\n\u201cDracos and Eldoria? They\u2019ve been fighting forever!\u201d Arlen exclaimed, shaking his head. \u201cWho would believe a dragon\u2019s prophecy?\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a flash of light appeared beside them. A figure emerged, her hair shimmering like starlight. It was Mira, the clever sorceress. \u201cDid someone say prophecy?\u201d she grinned, her eyes sparkling with mischief. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cZazra, you\u2019re right! We must find a way to unite our kingdoms,\u201d she declared.\n\nBut Zazra felt a twinge of worry. \u201cWhat if they don\u2019t listen to us? What if they betray us instead?\u201d\n\n\u201cThen we must show them the truth!\u201d Arlen said, clenching his fist. \u201cI believe in you, Zazra.\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s gather our courage!\u201d Mira said, clapping her hands. \u201cThe adventure begins now!\u201d\n\nWith newfound determination, Zazra took to the sky again, Arlen and Mira by her side. Together, they would face the challenges ahead. But dark clouds loomed in the distance, and Zazra couldn\u2019t shake the feeling that time was running out.\n\n\u201cCan we really unite the kingdoms?\u201d Zazra wondered aloud, looking at her friends.\n\n\u201cWe can!\u201d Arlen replied, his voice strong. \u201cTogether, we can make a difference!\u201d\n\nWith that, the three friends set off toward the unknown, ready to uncover the truth of the prophecy and save their kingdoms.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the name of the young dragon?","options":["Mira","Zazra","Arlen","Eldoria"],"correct_answer":"Zazra"},{"question":"Who is the knight?","options":["Mira","Zazra","Arlen","The King"],"correct_answer":"Arlen"},{"question":"What do Zazra and her friends want to achieve?","options":["Find treasure","Bring peace","Fight dragons","Fly to Eldoria"],"correct_answer":"Bring peace"},{"question":"What does Mira's hair shimmer like?","options":["Sunlight","Starlight","Fire","Water"],"correct_answer":"Starlight"},{"question":"What worries Zazra about uniting the kingdoms?","options":["They might be late","They might betray them","They might not listen","Both B and C"],"correct_answer":"Both B and C"}]},"images":null,"word_count":396,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
