   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_167_7_10","title":"The Dragon's Peace","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Warring Kingdoms","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Zazra soared high above the rolling hills of Dracos. The sun glinted off her shimmering scales as she flew. Below her, the vibrant colors of the kingdom sparkled like jewels. \"Look at all that beauty!\" Zazra exclaimed, her heart racing with excitement.\n\nArlen stood on a hill, waving at her. \"Zazra! Come down! We need to talk!\" His armor glinted in the sunlight, and his friendly smile made Zazra feel at home. She landed softly beside him. \n\n\"What's the matter, Arlen?\" Zazra asked, tilting her head curiously. \n\n\"It's about the prophecy,\" Arlen replied, his voice serious. \"Not everyone believes us. Some think we are just trying to trick them into peace.\" \n\nZazra\u2019s heart sank. \"But we aren\u2019t! We want to stop the fighting!\"\n\nJust then, Mira appeared, twirling a sparkly wand. \"Did I hear someone mention trickery? Ha! They\u2019ll have to believe us when I show them my magic!\" She grinned, but Zazra could see worry in her eyes.\n\n\"Magic is great, Mira, but we need more than tricks,\" Arlen said gently. \"We need a plan.\"\n\nSuddenly, Zazra had an idea. \"What if we show them the enemy?\" she suggested. \"If they see the danger, they might join us.\"\n\nArlen nodded slowly. \"That could work! But how do we find this enemy?\"\n\nMira jumped up and down. \"I can use my magic to look for them! Let's hurry!\" \n\nAs they made their way to the enchanted forest, Zazra felt a rush of hope. But soon, a loud roar echoed around them. \"Oh no! What was that?\" Mira gasped.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nZazra clutched her friends. \u201cSomething big is coming! We should hide!\u201d \n\nThey ducked behind a large tree just in time. A huge shadow passed overhead. Zazra peered out and gasped. It was a giant beast, with fiery eyes and sharp claws! \n\n\u201cStay quiet!\u201d Arlen whispered, gripping his sword. \n\nThe beast landed with a thud, sending leaves flying everywhere. \u201cThe kingdoms will fall!\u201d it growled. \u201cI will bring chaos!\u201d\n\nZazra felt fear wash over her. \u201cWe have to move now! This is our chance to show the kingdoms what we\u2019re up against!\u201d\n\nAs the beast roared again, Zazra and her friends sprang into action. They didn't have much time. Would they find the courage to face this new threat?\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Zazra, Arlen, and Mira want to do?","options":["Trick the kingdoms","Show the enemy","Start a fight","Hide forever"],"correct_answer":"Show the enemy"},{"question":"What does Mira use to help find the enemy?","options":["A map","A crystal ball","Her magic","A sword"],"correct_answer":"Her magic"},{"question":"What kind of creature appears in the forest?","options":["A friendly dragon","A giant beast","A magical fairy","A talking tree"],"correct_answer":"A giant beast"},{"question":"How does Zazra feel when she sees the beast?","options":["Excited","Bored","Fearful","Happy"],"correct_answer":"Fearful"},{"question":"What do they do when the beast roars?","options":["Run away","Hide","Fight it","Clap"],"correct_answer":"Hide"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_167_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_167_ch2_img1.png","plot_167_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":384,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
