   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_167_7_10","title":"The Dragon's Peace","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Warring Kingdoms","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"The sun rose high over the mountains of Dracos, shining brightly on Zazra, Arlen, and Mira. They stood on the edge of a fiery cliff, looking out over the kingdom. Zazra spread her wings wide. \u201cToday, we must find the Hidden Cave of Secrets!\u201d she declared, her voice full of excitement. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cWhat secrets could it have?\u201d asked Arlen, adjusting his shiny armor. \u201cDo you think it can help us?\u201d\n\n\u201cI hope so!\u201d Mira replied, her eyes sparkling with mischief. \u201cLegends say it holds the answers to the prophecy!\u201d\n\nThey flew off together, Zazra soaring gracefully, Arlen hopping along the rocky path, and Mira casting a little spell to keep them safe. As they traveled, they talked about the prophecy, their voices filled with hope.\n\nBut soon, a shadow fell over them. A giant figure appeared on the horizon. It was the fearsome beast they had faced before! Its scales glimmered like dark thunderclouds, and its eyes burned bright with anger.\n\n\u201cWhy are you back?\u201d it roared, shaking the ground beneath their feet.\n\n\u201cWe seek peace!\u201d shouted Zazra, flapping her wings. \u201cWe want to unite our kingdoms!\u201d\n\n\u201cFoolish dragon!\u201d the beast hissed. \u201cYou will never succeed!\u201d \n\nMira whispered to Zazra, \u201cWe need to distract it. I have an idea!\u201d She waved her wand, creating a swirl of colorful lights. The beast\u2019s eyes widened.\n\n\u201cWhat is that?\u201d it growled, mesmerized by the sparkles.\n\n\u201cNow, Zazra!\u201d Arlen cried. \n\nZazra took a deep breath and blasted a stream of fire into the air. The flames twirled and danced, forming the shape of a heart. \n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Arlen yelled. \u201cIt\u2019s beautiful!\u201d\n\nThe beast stared, caught in the moment. But just as they thought they could escape, the ground shook violently. A huge crack opened beneath them!\n\n\u201cRun!\u201d Mira shouted. \n\nThey rushed towards the Hidden Cave, fear pounding in their hearts. But the beast was right behind them, furious and hungry for revenge. \n\n\u201cWill they make it to the cave?\u201d Zazra thought, her heart racing. \u201cOr will we be caught?\u201d \n\nThey dashed into the cave, breathless and scared. The entrance collapsed behind them. \n\n\u201cWhat now?\u201d Arlen panted. \n\nMira looked around. \u201cWe need to find the truth about the prophecy!\u201d \n\nZazra took a deep breath, ready to face whatever was inside. \u201cLet\u2019s uncover the secrets once and for all!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nSuddenly, they heard a low rumble. A voice echoed in the darkness. \u201cYou have come to seek the truth, but are you ready for what you\u2019ll find?\u201d","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Zazra, Arlen, and Mira seek in the cave?","options":["Treasure","The truth about the prophecy","A new friend","A magical creature"],"correct_answer":"The truth about the prophecy"},{"question":"What does Zazra create with her fire?","options":["A dragon","A heart","A castle","A tree"],"correct_answer":"A heart"},{"question":"What does Mira use to create colorful lights?","options":["A wand","A sword","A book","A crystal"],"correct_answer":"A wand"},{"question":"What happens when they enter the cave?","options":["They find treasure","The entrance collapses","They meet a friend","They see a dragon"],"correct_answer":"The entrance collapses"},{"question":"Who do they face again in this chapter?","options":["A wizard","A king","A beast","A fairy"],"correct_answer":"A beast"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_167_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_167_ch3_img1.png","plot_167_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":416,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
