   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_167_7_10","title":"The Dragon's Peace","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Warring Kingdoms","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"As dawn broke over the land of Dracos, Zazra soared high in the sky. Her scales shimmered like jewels in the morning sun. Below her, Arlen and Mira stood at the edge of the Hidden Cave of Secrets.\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s time to read the prophecy,\u201d Zazra called down. \u201cWe must find a way to unite Dracos and Eldoria!\u201d\n\nArlen nodded, gripping his sword. \u201cLet\u2019s do this, Zazra! We can\u2019t let the beast stop us.\u201d\n\nMira giggled, her eyes sparkling with mischief. \u201cAnd if it tries, I\u2019ve got a few tricks up my sleeve!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nZazra landed gracefully beside her friends. The cave\u2019s entrance was dark and mysterious, but inside, it glowed with ancient symbols. They stepped forward, their hearts racing with hope.\n\n\u201cWhat do the symbols say?\u201d Arlen asked, peering closely.\n\nMira studied the glowing words. \u201cIt speaks of a great danger, and how only together can peace be achieved. But we need the Kings to believe us!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a low growl echoed through the cave. Zazra\u2019s wings flared open. \u201cThe beast is back!\u201d\n\n\u201cNo time to be scared!\u201d shouted Arlen. \u201cWe must protect the prophecy!\u201d\n\nWith a swish of her tail, Zazra rushed toward the sound. \u201cStay close! We can\u2019t let it ruin our chance!\u201d\n\nThe cave trembled as the beast appeared, its eyes glowing like fire. \u201cYou dare to enter my domain?\u201d it roared.\n\nMira stepped forward, casting a small spell. \u201cWe\u2019re not afraid of you! We seek peace!\u201d\n\nWith a flash of light, the beast hesitated. \u201cPeace? Why should I care?\u201d\n\n\u201cBecause,\u201d Zazra said bravely, \u201cif you help us, you will be part of a new story\u2014a story of friendship!\u201d\n\nThe beast paused, its fiery eyes softening. \u201cA story?\u201d\n\n\u201cYes!\u201d Arlen added eagerly. \u201cTogether, we can protect our lands from danger. Join us!\u201d\n\nThe beast's growl turned to a whisper. \u201cI have long been alone. Perhaps\u2026 I could help.\u201d\n\nHope filled the air. Zazra, Arlen, and Mira exchanged excited glances. Could they truly unite everyone at last?\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cWe will find the Kings,\u201d Zazra declared, her heart pounding with joy. \u201cTogether, we\u2019ll show them the truth!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Arlen cheered, raising his sword high. \n\nWith their new ally beside them, Zazra felt a spark of hope. They were on the right path to peace. But would the Kings believe them?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Zazra, Arlen, and Mira seek in the Hidden Cave?","options":["Treasure","The prophecy","A magic spell","A place to hide"],"correct_answer":"The prophecy"},{"question":"What does the beast say when it first appears?","options":["You dare to enter my domain?","I want to be friends!","Who are you?","Go away!"],"correct_answer":"You dare to enter my domain?"},{"question":"What does Zazra suggest to the beast?","options":["To leave them alone","To join in the fight","To help them achieve peace","To go back home"],"correct_answer":"To help them achieve peace"},{"question":"How do Arlen and Mira feel about the beast's hesitation?","options":["They are scared","They feel sad","They feel hopeful","They are angry"],"correct_answer":"They feel hopeful"},{"question":"What do Zazra, Arlen, and Mira plan to do after talking to the beast?","options":["Leave the cave","Find the Kings","Fight the beast","Celebrate their victory"],"correct_answer":"Find the Kings"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_167_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_167_ch4_img1.png","plot_167_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":395,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
