     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"prophecy","1":"artifact","2":"alliance","3":"wrath","4":"contemplate","image_prompts":["A breathtaking view of the valley in Dracos at dusk, with the sun setting behind the jagged mountains. Zazra, a young dragon with shimmering golden scales, perches on a rocky ledge, while Arlen, a knight in shining armor, stands protectively in front of Mira, a sorceress with dark hair and a mischievous expression. The atmosphere is tense yet hopeful, with shadows stretching across the landscape.","A dramatic scene of Draxis, a towering dragon with midnight-dark scales, landing menacingly before Zazra and her friends. Lightning strikes in the background, illuminating the determination and fear on Zazra's face, while Arlen stands bravely in front, sword drawn. Mira looks on with a clever expression, ready to negotiate. The scene is charged with energy, highlighting the stakes of their encounter."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A breathtaking view of Eldorias grand hall, featuring intricate stained glass windows that cast colorful patterns on the stone floors. The chamber is filled with the Eldorian elders, their expressions a mix of skepticism and intrigue. The atmosphere is tense, illuminated by soft, warm light, evoking a sense of both beauty and foreboding.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_167_ch4_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 16:32:48"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing An intense scene depicting Zazra standing fiercely before the dark dragon, her wings slightly unfurled, embodying courage. The dark dragon looms in the doorway, ominous and imposing, with his glowing eyes reflecting chaos. The backdrop is filled with the startled faces of the Eldorian elders, embodying a moment of confrontation between fear and unity.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_167_ch4_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 16:32:48"}}}
