   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_168_7_10","title":"The Hidden Kingdom","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Warring Kingdoms","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Leo and Mia were no ordinary siblings. They loved to explore! One sunny afternoon, they wandered into the attic. Dust floated in the air as they searched for treasures. \n\n\"Look at this!\" Mia exclaimed. She held up an ancient map. It was old and crinkly, with strange symbols and drawings. \n\n\u201cWow! Where do you think it leads?\u201d Leo asked, his eyes sparkling with excitement. \n\n\u201cMaybe to a treasure!\u201d Mia replied, her voice filled with wonder. \n\nThey spread the map on the floor. It showed a hidden kingdom nestled within the enchanted mountains. The mountains were tall and green, with colorful flowers peeking out of the rocks. Leo pointed to a spot marked with a star. \u201cLet\u2019s go there!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nMia grinned. \u201cBut what if it\u2019s dangerous?\u201d \n\nLeo shrugged. \u201cWe can handle it together!\u201d \n\nWith courage in their hearts, they packed some snacks and set off. \n\nAs they walked, the trees whispered secrets, and the birds sang cheerful songs. They followed the map carefully. Suddenly, they reached a sparkling stream. \n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Mia cried. \u201cThere are strange creatures over there!\u201d \n\nShe pointed to tiny fairies flitting about. They had shimmering wings and glowing smiles. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s ask them for help!\u201d Leo suggested. \n\nBut as they approached, the fairies flew away, giggling. \u201cThey\u2019re shy!\u201d Mia said, laughing. \n\nFeeling a little embarrassed, they continued walking. Soon, they reached the base of the enchanted mountains. \n\n\u201cDo you hear that?\u201d Leo asked. \n\nA loud roar echoed through the air. Mia\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d \n\nBefore they could think, a giant creature appeared from behind the rocks. It had bright blue scales and huge, curious eyes. \n\n\u201cWho dares to enter my territory?\u201d it boomed. \n\nLeo and Mia froze, unsure of what to say. \n\n\u201cWe\u2019re... we\u2019re looking for the hidden kingdom!\u201d Leo stuttered. \n\nThe creature\u2019s eyes narrowed. \u201cMany have tried. Few have succeeded.\u201d \n\nMia took a deep breath. \u201cWe just want to help! Please let us through!\u201d \n\nThe creature stared at them. \u201cProve your bravery, and I will let you pass.\u201d \n\nWith their hearts racing, Leo and Mia knew their adventure was just beginning. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s do it!\u201d Leo said, fists clenched with determination.\n\n\u201cWhat do we have to do?\u201d Mia asked, her voice shaking a little. \n\nThe creature grinned. \u201cYou must solve my riddle!\u201d \n\nLeo and Mia exchanged glances. This was going to be tougher than they thought!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Leo and Mia find in the attic?","options":["A treasure chest","An ancient map","A toy","A book"],"correct_answer":"An ancient map"},{"question":"What do the enchanted mountains look like?","options":["Tall and green","Flat and sandy","Cold and icy","Dark and scary"],"correct_answer":"Tall and green"},{"question":"What do Leo and Mia encounter by the stream?","options":["A giant","A dragon","Fairies","A wizard"],"correct_answer":"Fairies"},{"question":"What does the giant creature ask Leo and Mia to prove?","options":["Their knowledge","Their strength","Their bravery","Their wisdom"],"correct_answer":"Their bravery"},{"question":"What do Leo and Mia need to solve to continue their quest?","options":["A puzzle","A riddle","A maze","A treasure map"],"correct_answer":"A riddle"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_168_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_168_ch1_img1.png","plot_168_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":402,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
