   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_168_7_10","title":"The Hidden Kingdom","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Warring Kingdoms","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Leo and Mia stood at the entrance of the hidden kingdom. They gazed in awe at the lush gardens and sparkling waterfalls. The air buzzed with magic. \"Wow! Look at that!\" Mia exclaimed, pointing to a rainbow-colored bird. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe siblings walked deeper into the kingdom. Suddenly, they spotted a group of creatures arguing near the ancient ruins. One creature was a fuzzy, tall giant with bright blue fur. \"You don\u2019t understand! The outsiders will destroy our homes!\" it shouted, shaking its furry fists.\n\nLeo stepped forward. \"What\u2019s happening?\" he asked, curious. \n\nMia's heart sank. \"Are we too late?\" she whispered to Leo. \n\nThe giant turned, his eyes wide. \"We need your help! If the outsiders invade, everything will be lost!\" \n\nLeo and Mia exchanged glances. They felt a mix of fear and excitement. \"What can we do?\" Mia asked bravely. \n\n\"You must gain the trust of Eldrin,\" the giant replied. \"He is the leader of our kingdom.\" \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go find him!\u201d Leo declared. The siblings followed the giant through the vibrant, twinkling paths of flowers. \n\nAs they walked, the ground shook suddenly. A loud crash echoed nearby. \"What was that?\" Mia gasped, clutching Leo's arm. \n\n\"I don't know! Let\u2019s hurry!\" Leo urged. They dashed toward the sound, hearts racing. \n\nWhen they reached a clearing, they saw a massive boulder blocking the path. \"Oh no! We can't go back now!\" Leo yelled. \n\nJust then, a shimmering figure appeared. It was Eldrin, glowing with light. \"Brave children, fear not. Trust in your strengths!\" \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nEldrin waved his hand, and the boulder began to roll aside. \"You have a great adventure ahead. But challenges will come.\" \n\nMia took a deep breath. \"We can help!\" she shouted, feeling brave. \n\nLeo nodded. \"Let\u2019s find a way to stop the war!\" \n\nEldrin smiled. \"Then your journey begins. Choose wisely, for the fate of both worlds rests in your hands.\"","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Leo and Mia find in the hidden kingdom?","options":["A playground","A giant","A treasure","A castle"],"correct_answer":"A giant"},{"question":"Who is the leader of the hidden kingdom?","options":["Leo","Mia","The giant","Eldrin"],"correct_answer":"Eldrin"},{"question":"What is the big problem in the kingdom?","options":["A party","A war","A game","A festival"],"correct_answer":"A war"},{"question":"What does Eldrin tell Leo and Mia?","options":["To be scared","To trust their strengths","To leave","To play a game"],"correct_answer":"To trust their strengths"},{"question":"What do they see blocking their path?","options":["A wall","A river","A boulder","A garden"],"correct_answer":"A boulder"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_168_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_168_ch2_img1.png","plot_168_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":321,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
