   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_168_7_10","title":"The Hidden Kingdom","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Warring Kingdoms","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Chapter 3: The Gathering Storm\n\nThe sun rose over the hidden kingdom, bathing the gardens in golden light. Leo and Mia walked through the vibrant flowers, their colors dancing in the breeze. \"Look at that, Mia! It\u2019s like a rainbow!\" Leo exclaimed, pointing to a patch of bright blue and purple blossoms. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, they heard a loud crash! The ground shook. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Mia asked, her eyes wide with fear. \u201cLet\u2019s go see!\u201d Leo said, excitement bubbling inside him.\n\nThey rushed toward the sound, dodging colorful flowers and fluttering butterflies. Soon, they reached the old stone tower. Pieces of rock lay scattered around. Eldrin stood there, looking worried. \u201cThe outsiders are getting closer,\u201d he said, his voice heavy. \u201cWe must prepare for their attack.\u201d\n\n\u201cBut how can we help?\u201d Mia asked. \u201cWe\u2019ve just arrived!\u201d\n\nEldrin smiled softly. \u201cYour courage and cleverness are what we need. We must gather the creatures of the kingdom to unite against the invaders. They trust you.\u201d\n\nLeo took a deep breath. \u201cLet\u2019s do it, Mia! We can rally everyone together!\u201d \n\nThey raced off to find the magical creatures. They first met a friendly dragon named Fizz. \u201cI heard the noise too!\u201d Fizz said, flames dancing from his nostrils. \u201cI\u2019ll help you! But we need the unicorns and the fairies too!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Mia said, excited. They climbed onto Fizz\u2019s back, soaring through the sky. The kingdom looked beautiful from above. \u201cThere\u2019s the fairy tree!\u201d Leo shouted. \u201cLet\u2019s land there!\u201d\n\nThey landed softly, and the fairies flitted around them. \u201cWhat\u2019s the trouble?\u201d one tiny fairy asked, her wings sparkling in the sunlight.\n\n\u201cThe outsiders are coming!\u201d Mia said. \u201cWe need everyone to join us!\u201d\n\nJust then, a loud roar echoed through the air. A group of outsiders marched toward the kingdom. They were big and scary, with armor glinting in the sunlight. Leo felt a shiver run down his spine. \u201cThey\u2019re here!\u201d he cried.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe fairies gasped. Fizz growled low, ready to protect his friends. \u201cWe can\u2019t let them take our home!\u201d Leo shouted. \u201cWe have to stand together!\u201d \n\nBut as the outsiders drew closer, Leo and Mia felt uncertainty. Would they be able to unite the kingdom in time? \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s gather everyone!\u201d Mia called, her voice steady. \u201cWe can do this together!\u201d \n\nLeo nodded. The siblings took a deep breath, ready to face the biggest challenge yet. The fate of the kingdom rested in their hands.\n\n\u201cAre you ready?\u201d Leo asked Mia, his heart pounding.\n\n\u201cI am!\u201d she said, determination lighting her eyes. But as they turned to gather their friends, the loud thud of the outsider\u2019s boots grew closer. \n\nWhat would happen next?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Leo and Mia find in the garden?","options":["A treasure chest","A rainbow","A dragon","A giant"],"correct_answer":"A rainbow"},{"question":"Who do Leo and Mia meet first to help them?","options":["A unicorn","A dragon","A fairy","A giant"],"correct_answer":"A dragon"},{"question":"What do the outsiders do as Leo and Mia gather their friends?","options":["Dance around","March toward the kingdom","Fly into the sky","Leave the kingdom"],"correct_answer":"March toward the kingdom"},{"question":"How does Mia feel when they prepare for the battle?","options":["Scared","Excited","Bored","Sleepy"],"correct_answer":"Excited"},{"question":"What is the main challenge in this chapter?","options":["Finding a treasure","Rallying the kingdom's creatures","Making friends","Writing a map"],"correct_answer":"Rallying the kingdom's creatures"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_168_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_168_ch3_img1.png","plot_168_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":457,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
