   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_168_7_10","title":"The Hidden Kingdom","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Warring Kingdoms","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Chapter 4: The Gathering of Allies\n\nThe sun rose high over the Hidden Kingdom. Leo and Mia stood with Eldrin in the lush garden, where flowers bloomed in every color. \u201cWe need to gather more allies,\u201d Eldrin said, his voice steady. \u201cThe outsiders will arrive soon.\u201d\n\n\u201cWe can help!\u201d Mia exclaimed, her eyes sparkling with determination. \u201cBut how?\u201d\n\nEldrin smiled. \u201cWe must reach the three magical creatures: Thistle the Unicorn, Bubbles the Mermaid, and Flint the Firebird. Each has a different power that can protect the kingdom.\u201d \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s start with Thistle!\u201d Leo said. He felt a rush of excitement. \u201cI know where to find her!\u201d\n\nThey dashed through the garden, running past ancient trees that whispered secrets. \u201cCan you hear them?\u201d Mia asked, giggling. \u201cThey sound like they\u2019re cheering us on!\u201d\n\nAs they reached a sparkling stream, they spotted Thistle, the beautiful unicorn. Her coat shimmered like silver in the sunlight. \u201cThistle!\u201d called Leo. \u201cWe need your help!\u201d\n\nThistle looked up, her big eyes soft and friendly. \u201cI will help you,\u201d she said, \u201cbut you must prove your bravery first.\u201d \n\n\u201cWhat do we need to do?\u201d asked Mia, feeling nervous but excited. \n\n\u201cCross the stream without falling in. The water is enchanted,\u201d Thistle warned. \n\nLeo took a deep breath. \u201cWe can do this together!\u201d \n\nThey stepped onto the narrow stones. Leo jumped first, landing safely. \u201cSee? Easy!\u201d he said with a grin. But as Mia followed, she wobbled and almost slipped. \n\n\u201cHold on, Mia! You can do it!\u201d Leo cheered. \n\nWith a steadying breath, Mia focused and hopped carefully. She made it across and squealed with joy. \u201cI did it!\u201d \n\nThistle nodded. \u201cYou have proven your teamwork and courage. I will join your cause.\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nNext, they needed to find Bubbles the Mermaid. Eldrin led them to the edge of the lake, where the water sparkled like a million stars. \u201cBubbles loves to play, but she\u2019s also wise,\u201d he explained.\n\n\u201cBubbles! Where are you?\u201d Leo called. Suddenly, a splash echoed, and Bubbles emerged, her hair flowing like seaweed. \u201cDid someone call for a splash-tastic adventure?\u201d\n\nMia giggled. \u201cWe need your help to stop the outsiders!\u201d \n\nBubbles flipped her tail. \u201cOf course! But first, let\u2019s have a race!\u201d \n\n\u201cRace to the big rock!\u201d Leo shouted. They all dove into the water, laughing and splashing. Mia swam with all her might. \n\nAs they reached the rock, Bubbles smiled. \u201cYou\u2019re fast! I\u2019ll join you in this battle.\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nFinally, they set off to find Flint the Firebird. The sky began to turn orange as the sun began to set. \u201cFlint lives high in the mountain,\u201d Eldrin said. \u201cHe loves to soar.\u201d\n\nThe climb was steep and rocky. \u201cWe can do this!\u201d Leo encouraged Mia, who was now a bit tired. \n\nWhen they reached the top, Flint glided down, his feathers a fiery red. \u201cWhy have you come?\u201d he asked, his voice deep and majestic. \n\n\u201cWe need your power to protect the kingdom!\u201d Mia said, her heart racing. \n\n\u201cShow me your courage,\u201d Flint replied. \u201cYou must face the wind.\u201d \n\nThe wind roared, trying to push them back. Leo held onto Mia. \u201cTogether!\u201d he shouted. They leaned forward, steadying themselves against the wind. \n\nWith a final push, they stood strong. Flint nodded in approval. \u201cYou have proven your bravery. I will fight alongside you.\u201d \n\nWith Thistle, Bubbles, and Flint now on their side, Leo and Mia felt hope blooming in their hearts. \u201cWe can do this!\u201d Leo cheered. \u201cWe will save the kingdom!\u201d \n\nBut in the distance, dark clouds gathered. The outsiders were approaching.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who do Leo and Mia first meet in the garden?","options":["Bubbles the Mermaid","Thistle the Unicorn","Flint the Firebird","Eldrin"],"correct_answer":"Thistle the Unicorn"},{"question":"What must Leo and Mia do to prove their bravery to Thistle?","options":["Swim fast","Cross a stream","Climb a mountain","Race Bubbles"],"correct_answer":"Cross a stream"},{"question":"What powers does Bubbles the Mermaid offer?","options":["Flying","Swimming","Magic","Fire"],"correct_answer":"Swimming"},{"question":"Which creature helps them face the wind?","options":["Thistle","Bubbles","Flint","Eldrin"],"correct_answer":"Flint"},{"question":"What feeling do Leo and Mia have at the end of the chapter?","options":["Fear","Sadness","Hope","Anger"],"correct_answer":"Hope"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_168_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_168_ch4_img1.png","plot_168_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":596,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
