   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_168_7_10","title":"The Hidden Kingdom","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Warring Kingdoms","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Leo and Mia stood at the edge of the lush garden, filled with bright flowers and vibrant colors. \u201cLook at all this magic, Mia!\u201d Leo exclaimed, his eyes sparkling. \u201cI can\u2019t believe we\u2019re really here!\u201d  \n\u201cMe too!\u201d Mia twirled around, taking in the beauty. \u201cDo you think our friends will join us?\u201d  \nJust then, Eldrin appeared, his long robes flowing like a gentle breeze. \u201cThey will be here soon,\u201d he said with a wise smile. \u201cYou have proven yourselves brave.\u201d  \n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]  \n\nA rustling sound came from the bushes, and out popped Thistle the tiny fairy. She had sparkling wings and a mischievous grin. \u201cDid someone say brave? I love brave! Count me in!\u201d  \nFlint the friendly dragon landed nearby with a whoosh. \u201cI\u2019m ready to protect the kingdom! Just tell me what to do.\u201d  \nBubbles, the cheerful water sprite, splashed in from the nearby pond. \u201cAnd I\u2019ll help with my magic water!\u201d  \n\nLeo felt a rush of pride. \u201cTogether, we can stop the outsiders!\u201d  \n\u201cRight!\u201d Mia added, her heart full of hope. \u201cWe can make a plan!\u201d  \n\nAs they gathered in a circle, dark clouds loomed in the sky. \u201cThey\u2019re coming!\u201d Thistle squeaked nervously.  \nEldrin held up his hand. \u201cStay calm! We must work together. Each of you has a special gift. Use it!\u201d  \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s split into teams,\u201d Leo suggested. \u201cThistle and I can distract the invaders. Mia, you can tell Flint and Bubbles to prepare the magic.\u201d  \n\u201cGreat idea!\u201d Mia shouted. \u201cLet\u2019s show them our strength!\u201d  \n\nThey quickly formed their teams and moved into action. The air buzzed with excitement and a little fear. Suddenly, a loud roar echoed through the valley. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Bubbles asked, her eyes wide.  \n\u201cThat\u2019s Flint!\u201d Leo shouted above the noise. \u201cHe\u2019s ready to help us!\u201d  \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Mia rallied, her heart beating fast. Together, they darted towards the source of the noise, ready to face whatever was coming. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]  \n\nThey saw a group of outsiders at the edge of the kingdom. They looked big and angry. \u201cWe can\u2019t let them through!\u201d Leo said.  \n\u201cBut we have each other,\u201d Mia whispered, her eyes shining with determination. \u201cAnd that makes us strong!\u201d  \n\nWith a deep breath, they stepped forward, united and fearless. The hidden kingdom was their home, and they would protect it together.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Leo and Mia plan to do with their friends?","options":["Hide from the outsiders","Prepare to fight the outsiders","Leave the kingdom","Find more magical creatures"],"correct_answer":"Prepare to fight the outsiders"},{"question":"Who is the tiny fairy that joins them?","options":["Bubbles","Mia","Thistle","Flint"],"correct_answer":"Thistle"},{"question":"What does Eldrin tell them to stay calm about?","options":["The dark clouds","The outsiders","The magic","The garden"],"correct_answer":"The outsiders"},{"question":"What does Mia say makes them strong?","options":["Their magic","Their friendship","The garden","The dark clouds"],"correct_answer":"Their friendship"},{"question":"What does Flint do to help?","options":["He distracts the outsiders","He hides from danger","He prepares food","He flies into battle"],"correct_answer":"He flies into battle"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_168_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_168_ch5_img1.png","plot_168_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":393,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
