   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_168_11_14","title":"The Hidden Kingdom","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Warring Kingdoms","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"As dawn broke over the Enchanted Mountains, the golden light illuminated the hidden kingdom like a treasure waiting to be discovered. Leo and Mia stood at the edge of an ancient garden, where statues of mythical creatures peered down at them from overgrown vines. The air smelled of blooming flowers, sweet and intoxicating, but a sense of urgency stirred within Mia\u2019s chest. \n\n\u201cDo you think Eldrin can really help us?\u201d she asked, her voice barely above a whisper. Leo shrugged, his adventurous spirit ignited by the vibrant surroundings. \n\n\u201cHe has to. This place is amazing! But we need to convince the others too,\u201d he replied, scanning the garden for any sign of their allies. \n\nJust then, a rustle in the bushes caught their attention. A small creature with shimmering scales and bright, curious eyes emerged\u2014a Spriggan. Its delicate wings glimmered in the sunlight like a stained glass window. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cWho are you?\u201d it chirped, tilting its head. \u201cYou smell of humans but look different.\u201d \n\n\u201cWe\u2019re Leo and Mia,\u201d Leo introduced himself, kneeling down to the creature\u2019s level. \u201cWe want to help the kingdom. We know there's trouble coming.\u201d \n\nThe Spriggan\u2019s eyes widened, and it flapped its wings nervously. \u201cHelp? The outside world is dangerous. The Wraiths are coming! They want to take our magic!\u201d \n\nMia\u2019s heart raced at the mention of the Wraiths. \u201cWe heard about them from Eldrin. What do we need to do?\u201d \n\nThe Spriggan hesitated, glancing around, then whispered, \u201cIf you want to earn trust, you must retrieve the Crystal of Harmony from the Ruins of Solara. Only then can you prove yourselves.\u201d \n\n\u201cWhere are the ruins?\u201d Leo asked, his determination unwavering.\n\n\u201cFollow the river until you hear the wind whispering secrets,\u201d the Spriggan instructed before flitting away, leaving a trail of sparkles in the air.\n\nThe siblings exchanged glances, adrenaline coursing through them. \u201cWe can do this,\u201d Mia encouraged, her eyes shining with resolve. \n\nThey set off down a narrow path, where the sound of rushing water filled their ears. But as they neared the river, a low growl echoed through the trees. From the shadows, a group of Wraiths emerged, their dark figures cloaked in shadows, eyes glowing like embers. \n\n\u201cStop right there!\u201d one hissed, pointing a skeletal finger. \u201cYou\u2019re not going anywhere!\u201d \n\nLeo stepped protectively in front of Mia, his heart pounding. \u201cWe just want to help the kingdom! We\u2019re not your enemies!\u201d \n\n\u201cHelp?\u201d the Wraith scoffed, advancing menacingly. \u201cYou\u2019re just children in a world far too dangerous for you.\u201d \n\nMia felt a surge of fear but also a spark of courage. \u201cWe may be children, but we\u2019re not helpless! We can unite the kingdom!\u201d \n\nThe Wraiths chuckled darkly. \u201cYou think you can change anything? You\u2019ll learn the hard way,\u201d it sneered, as they advanced closer, their presence suffocating the air around them.\n\nJust as the tension reached its peak, the ground beneath Leo and Mia began to tremble. They exchanged a terrified glance, realizing they were in deeper than they had ever imagined. \n\n\u201cWhat do we do?\u201d Mia whispered, panic rising in her chest.\n\nLeo\u2019s mind raced. \u201cWe have to stick together! We can\u2019t let them separate us!\u201d \n\nSuddenly, a blinding light erupted from the river, momentarily distracting the Wraiths. \u201cRun!\u201d Leo shouted, grabbing Mia\u2019s hand as they dashed down the riverbank, hearts pounding and breathless. \n\nWith the Wraiths hot on their heels, they had only one choice left: to seek the Crystal of Harmony and unlock the power that could save the hidden kingdom\u2014or face the darkness that threatened to consume them both.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What creature do Leo and Mia first encounter in the garden?","options":["A Wraith","A Spriggan","A Pixie","A Gnome"],"correct_answer":"A Spriggan"},{"question":"What must Leo and Mia retrieve to prove themselves?","options":["The Crystal of Harmony","The Sword of Light","The Amulet of Power","The Shield of Strength"],"correct_answer":"The Crystal of Harmony"},{"question":"Who threatens Leo and Mia as they head to the river?","options":["The Elders","The Wraiths","The Spriggans","The Shadows"],"correct_answer":"The Wraiths"},{"question":"What do the Wraiths think of Leo and Mia?","options":["They are allies","They are too weak","They are lost","They are spies"],"correct_answer":"They are too weak"},{"question":"What happens when the siblings flee from the Wraiths?","options":["They fall into a trap","The ground trembles","They meet Eldrin again","They find the Crystal"],"correct_answer":"The ground trembles"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_168_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_168_ch3_img1.png","plot_168_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":607,"reading_level":"Builder"}
