     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"unite","1":"elemental","2":"shadow","3":"battle","4":"gather","image_prompts":["A colorful scene depicting the grand stone circle surrounded by trees. The fire clan members with flickering hair, water clan members in blue robes, earth clan members looking strong, and air clan members floating. The mood is tense yet hopeful as they prepare to listen to Sienna.","A dramatic moment showing Sienna standing strong with her arms raised. The swirling elements of fire, water, earth, and air surround her as the dark Shadow Spirit looms in the background. The clans are united behind her, looking determined and ready to fight."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A breathtaking view of Emberstone at sunset, with the fiery peaks of Aetheria in the background. The silhouettes of young mages from various clans are seen against the vibrant orange and purple sky. Sienna stands confidently in the foreground, her outstretched arm symbolizing her desire for unity, while Kai and Lira stand beside her, their expressions a mix of wariness and hope.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_169_ch4_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 16:25:08"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing The Harbinger of Shadows stands ominously against a backdrop of swirling winds and darkened skies. His cloak billows dramatically, contrasting with the vibrant elemental energies swirling around Sienna and the clans behind her. His eyes glint with malevolence, while Sienna stands determined, flames, water, earth, and air manifesting around her as she prepares to confront him, representing the fragile but fierce alliance of the clans.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_169_ch4_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 16:25:08"}}}
