   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_169_7_10","title":"The Elemental War","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Warring Kingdoms","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"In the kingdom of Aetheria, the sun shone brightly over the four elemental clans. There were fiery mountains, flowing rivers, dense forests, and gusty skies. But the clans were divided. Each clan thought they were the best. \n\nSienna stood on a hill, looking down at the land. She was different. She had no clan. \u201cWhy can\u2019t I have a clan?\u201d she sighed. She felt a spark of energy inside her. \n\n\u201cHey, Sienna! What are you doing?\u201d called a voice. It was Kai, a boy from the fire clan. His hair flickered like flames. \u201cStill dreaming about fitting in?\u201d \n\n\u201cI just want to find my place,\u201d Sienna replied. \u201cI can feel something inside me.\u201d \n\n\u201cSomething? Or nothing?\u201d Kai smirked, crossing his arms. \u201cYou should join us in the fire clan. You could be our torchbearer!\u201d \n\nSienna shook her head. \u201cI don\u2019t think that\u2019s it. I feel all the elements.\u201d \n\n\u201cYeah right,\u201d Kai laughed. \u201cYou can\u2019t be a fire mage and a water mage at the same time!\u201d \n\nSienna frowned. She took a deep breath and closed her eyes. Suddenly, the air around her began to swirl. The wind picked up, and leaves danced around her. \u201cLook!\u201d she shouted, her voice filled with joy. \u201cI can do it! I can use air!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nA colorful scene appeared in the sky. Gusts of wind twirled around Sienna, lifting her hair like a soft breeze. The trees swayed, and Kai\u2019s eyes grew wide. \n\n\u201cOkay, maybe that\u2019s something,\u201d he admitted, surprised. \u201cBut can you do fire?\u201d \n\nBefore Sienna could answer, a loud roar echoed through the valley. Dark clouds rolled in, blocking the sun. \u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d cried Kai, his bravery fading. \n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know!\u201d Sienna shouted. \u201cBut we need to warn the clans!\u201d \n\nThey raced down the hill, Sienna\u2019s heart pounding. She knew that if the clans didn\u2019t unite, Aetheria might be in danger. As they dashed toward the village, Sienna felt the fire inside her burning brighter. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d she yelled. \u201cWe must stop this!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nTogether, they charged forward to face the unknown danger ahead. The fate of Aetheria rested on Sienna\u2019s shoulders, and she was ready to embrace her power.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What kingdom do Sienna and Kai live in?","options":["Aetheria","Atlantis","Narnia","Middle Earth"],"correct_answer":"Aetheria"},{"question":"What element can Sienna control?","options":["Fire","Water","Air","Earth"],"correct_answer":"Air"},{"question":"What is Kai's clan?","options":["Water clan","Earth clan","Fire clan","Air clan"],"correct_answer":"Fire clan"},{"question":"What happens when Sienna uses her powers?","options":["She starts a fire","Leaves dance around her","It rains","She vanishes"],"correct_answer":"Leaves dance around her"},{"question":"What do Sienna and Kai hear that worries them?","options":["A loud roar","A bell ringing","Someone singing","The wind howling"],"correct_answer":"A loud roar"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_169_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_169_ch1_img1.png","plot_169_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":372,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
