   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_169_7_10","title":"The Elemental War","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Warring Kingdoms","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Sienna stood at the edge of the Whispering Woods. Tall trees stretched high above her. Leaves danced in the breeze, and sunlight peeked through the branches. She took a deep breath, feeling both excited and nervous.\n\n\"Do you really think you can unite the clans?\" Kai said, crossing his arms. His fiery red hair glimmered like embers. \"They won\u2019t listen to a girl without a clan.\"\n\nSienna turned to him, determination bright in her eyes. \"I have to try! If we don\u2019t work together, the dark clouds will take everything from us.\"\n\nSuddenly, a gust of wind swirled around them. Sienna gasped as she felt the air flow through her fingers. \"Look! I can control the air!\" she exclaimed.\n\nBut Kai frowned. \"That\u2019s just a trick. You need fire, water, and earth too.\"\n\nJust then, Lira, the wise water clan leader, appeared. She glided toward them, her long blue gown flowing like a river. \"Sienna,\" she said softly, \"I believe in your power.\"\n\nSienna smiled, but doubt crept in her heart. \"What if the clans don\u2019t believe me?\"\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\"Then you must show them,\" Lira replied. \"We need to gather the clans before it\u2019s too late.\"\n\nAs they walked deeper into the woods, shadows flickered around them. Sienna\u2019s heart raced. \"What was that?\" she whispered. A dark figure loomed behind a tree.\n\nKai stepped forward, fists clenched. \"I\u2019ll handle it!\"\n\nBefore anyone could say anything, Kai charged at the figure. Sienna called out, \"Wait!\" But it was too late.\n\nThe figure turned, revealing a creature with eyes like burning coals. It snarled, \"You\u2019ll never unite the clans!\" \n\nSienna stepped back, fear bubbling in her chest. But then she felt the air swirl around her again. Could she do this?\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\"Stay back!\" she shouted, focusing hard. The wind picked up, swirling around her like a protective shield. \"Leave us alone!\"\n\nThe creature hissed, but Sienna held her ground. \"I will unite the clans! And you can\u2019t stop me!\"\n\nThe creature roared in anger, and Sienna knew they had to move quickly. They couldn\u2019t let fear win.\n\n\"Let\u2019s go!\" Kai yelled, grabbing Sienna's hand. They ran deeper into the woods, the creature\u2019s growl echoing behind them. Sienna\u2019s heart pounded. What would they face next?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Sienna want to do?","options":["Join the fire clan","Unite the clans","Fight the creature","Leave Aetheria"],"correct_answer":"Unite the clans"},{"question":"Who is Lira?","options":["A fire clan member","A water clan leader","Sienna's friend","A dark creature"],"correct_answer":"A water clan leader"},{"question":"What does Sienna discover she can control?","options":["Fire","Water","Earth","Air"],"correct_answer":"Air"},{"question":"What does the dark creature say?","options":["You\u2019ll never unite the clans!","You can\u2019t stop me!","I will help you!","Leave the woods!"],"correct_answer":"You\u2019ll never unite the clans!"},{"question":"What do Sienna and Kai do at the end of the chapter?","options":["They run deeper into the woods","They fight the creature","They meet more clans","They find a hiding place"],"correct_answer":"They run deeper into the woods"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_169_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_169_ch2_img1.png","plot_169_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":388,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
