   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_169_7_10","title":"The Elemental War","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Warring Kingdoms","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"The sun rose brightly over the Valley of Elements. Sienna stood tall, with Kai and Lira beside her. \"Today is the day we unite the clans!\" she declared, feeling a spark of hope.\n\n\"Do you really think they will listen?\" Kai asked, crossing his arms. He looked worried.\n\n\"We have to try,\" Lira replied calmly. \"If we work together, we can defeat the Shadow Spirit!\"\n\nSienna took a deep breath. She could feel the warmth of fire, the coolness of water, the strength of earth, and the freedom of air swirling inside her. \"Let\u2019s go!\" she shouted. They headed to the meeting place, a grand stone circle surrounded by trees.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe clans began to arrive. First, the fire clan marched in, their hair flickering like flames. Next, the water clan flowed in gracefully, their blue robes rippling like waves. The earth clan stomped in, strong and sturdy, while the air clan floated in like soft clouds.\n\nBut Sienna noticed something troubling. The clans stood apart, glaring at each other. She felt a flutter of fear in her stomach. \"This isn\u2019t good,\" she whispered.\n\nAs the leaders began to argue, Sienna stepped forward. \"Everyone! Please listen!\" she called. \"We are stronger together!\"\n\nKai shouted, \u201cBut how can we trust each other? You all blame us for the darkness!\u201d\n\nLira nodded. \"Sienna is right. We need to find common ground.\"\n\nJust then, a gust of wind howled, and the Shadow Spirit appeared! It swirled in the air, dark and menacing. Sienna felt her heart race. \"We can\u2019t let it destroy us!\" she yelled.\n\n\u201cTogether!\u201d Sienna shouted, raising her hands. Bright flames, flowing water, solid earth, and gentle air swirled around her. The clans gasped in awe.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe Shadow Spirit roared, but Sienna stood firm. \"We can defeat it!\" she urged. \"Fire, water, earth, and air\u2014let\u2019s unite our powers!\"\n\nThe clans looked at each other, then back at Sienna. Slowly, they nodded. Together, they gathered their elemental powers. It felt powerful and hopeful.\n\nWith a mighty shout, they unleashed their magic at the Shadow Spirit. It flickered and crackled, and for the first time, Sienna felt that maybe, just maybe, they could win.\n\nBut the battle was not over. The Shadow Spirit hissed and writhed. \"You cannot defeat me!\" it screeched.\n\nSienna frowned. \"But we can try!\"\n\nAnd so, the battle began.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Sienna want the clans to do?","options":["Argue more","Unite together","Leave the valley","Fight each other"],"correct_answer":"Unite together"},{"question":"Who is the leader of the water clan?","options":["Kai","Lira","Sienna","The Shadow Spirit"],"correct_answer":"Lira"},{"question":"What does the Shadow Spirit do when it appears?","options":["Sings a song","Gives gifts","Roars and threatens","Dances"],"correct_answer":"Roars and threatens"},{"question":"What do the clans use to fight the Shadow Spirit?","options":["Their voices","Magical powers","Flowers","Food"],"correct_answer":"Magical powers"},{"question":"How does Sienna feel about the clans at first?","options":["Nervous","Excited","Indifferent","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Nervous"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_169_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_169_ch4_img1.png","plot_169_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":398,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
