ter, earth, and air intertwining. Lira stands resolute, water forming a protective shield, while dark figures are repelled by the force of Siennas magic. The image should capture the intensity of the moment, highlighting Siennas inner strength and the looming threat of darkness.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_169_ch2_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 16:26:37"}}}
