     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"determination","1":"courage","2":"battle","3":"strength","4":"leader","image_prompts":["A vibrant scene of Aiden standing with Jora and Thalia in the rebel camp, surrounded by trees and fellow rebels. The sun is shining through the leaves, illuminating their faces filled with hope and determination. Aiden holds a sword, looking confident as he gestures to the group. The atmosphere is energetic and lively, filled with colorful banners and weapons.","An action-packed moment showing Aiden leading the charge into battle. He is at the forefront with his sword raised high, surrounded by brave rebels who are rallying behind him. The background shows the looming figures of Lord Draven\u2019s soldiers approaching. The scene is filled with excitement and courage, with bright colors and dynamic movement."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A vibrant forest clearing bathed in soft sunlight, where young rebels gather around Aiden, anticipation on their faces. Tattered banners flutter in the gentle breeze, and the mood is a mix of hope and uncertainty, reflecting their resolve to unite against adversity.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_170_ch5_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 16:18:44"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A tense battlefield scene with Aiden standing at the forefront, his expression a blend of determination and fear. The rebel fighters line up behind him, preparing for the approaching enemy, with clouds of dust rising in the distance, symbolizing the impending conflict and their commitment to defend their homeland.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_170_ch5_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 16:18:44"}}}
