   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_170_7_10","title":"The Last Heir of Ivalis","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Warring Kingdoms","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Aiden stood in the middle of the forest, surrounded by trees that seemed to whisper secrets. The leaves danced in the breeze, and sunlight filtered through the branches, making the place feel magical. He had never imagined he would be here, hiding with rebels. \n\n\u201cIs this really where we\u2019ll plan our next move?\u201d Aiden asked, glancing at Jora. \n\nJora, with her fierce eyes and wild hair, nodded. \u201cYes, Aiden. This is our secret hideout. Here, we are safe.\u201d \n\nSuddenly, the sound of footsteps crunched on the forest floor. Aiden jumped. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d \n\n\u201cStay close!\u201d Jora commanded, her voice low but urgent. \n\nThalia emerged from the shadows, her cloak billowing as she moved. \u201cAiden, we have a problem,\u201d she said, her face serious. \u201cThe rival factions are moving faster than we thought. They know you\u2019re the heir.\u201d \n\nAiden\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWhat do you mean? They know I\u2019m here?\u201d \n\n\u201cYes,\u201d Thalia replied, her eyes piercing into Aiden\u2019s. \u201cAnd they want to stop you. You must be careful.\u201d \n\nAiden felt a weight on his shoulders. \u201cBut I don\u2019t want to be a king! I just want to help!\u201d \n\nJora placed a hand on his shoulder. \u201cYou have to believe in yourself, Aiden. You are stronger than you think.\u201d \n\nAiden nodded but felt unsure. \n\nJust then, a loud crash echoed from deeper in the woods. Aiden\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d \n\n\u201cIt\u2019s them! They\u2019ve found us!\u201d Jora shouted. \u201cWe need to move!\u201d \n\nThe rebels quickly grabbed their gear. Aiden felt a mix of fear and excitement. He wanted to be brave, but what if he failed? \n\n\u201cFollow me!\u201d Jora urged, leading them down a narrow path. Aiden followed, his heart pounding. He could hear shouting in the distance. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they ran, Aiden looked around, taking in the beauty of the forest despite the danger. The flowers glowed brightly, and the sunlight painted everything in gold. But he couldn\u2019t stop thinking about what lay ahead. \n\n\u201cKeep up, Aiden!\u201d Thalia called, her voice cutting through his thoughts. \n\nSuddenly, a rebel tripped, falling to the ground. \u201cHelp! They\u2019re coming!\u201d \n\nWithout thinking, Aiden rushed back to help. \u201cGet up! We need to go!\u201d \n\nJust then, shadows appeared among the trees. Aiden could see the figures of the rival faction closing in. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cAiden! Get down!\u201d Jora shouted as they all ducked behind a large bush. \n\nAiden\u2019s heart thudded in his chest. \u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d \n\nJora\u2019s eyes sparkled with determination. \u201cWe fight! We show them we won't back down!\u201d \n\nAiden took a deep breath. Maybe being a leader didn\u2019t mean being perfect. It meant being brave, even when you were scared. \n\n\u201cOkay,\u201d he whispered. \u201cLet\u2019s do this!\u201d \n\nWith a newfound courage, Aiden prepared to face the challenge ahead. The fate of Ivalis was in his hands.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What secret do the rebels share with Aiden?","options":["They are going to fight","They want to run away","They are searching for treasure","They have a pet dragon"],"correct_answer":"They are going to fight"},{"question":"Who warns Aiden about the factions knowing his identity?","options":["Jora","Thalia","Aiden","The rebels"],"correct_answer":"Thalia"},{"question":"What does Aiden feel when he learns about the approaching factions?","options":["Happy","Confused","Excited","Scared"],"correct_answer":"Scared"},{"question":"Where do Aiden and the rebels hide?","options":["In a castle","In a cave","In a forest","In a village"],"correct_answer":"In a forest"},{"question":"What does Jora tell Aiden to do when they are in danger?","options":["Run away","Fight!","Hide","Climb a tree"],"correct_answer":"Fight!"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_170_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_170_ch2_img1.png","plot_170_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":478,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
