   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_170_7_10","title":"The Last Heir of Ivalis","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Warring Kingdoms","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"The sun shone through the trees, casting shadows over the rebel camp. Aiden stood beside Jora, taking in the sights around him. He watched as the rebels sharpened their swords and studied maps. Aiden felt a flutter of excitement. This was his new world.\n\n\u201cAre you ready for the meeting?\u201d Jora asked, her voice steady. \u201cWe need everyone to be united.\u201d\n\nAiden swallowed hard. \u201cWhat if they don\u2019t listen to me? I\u2019m not really a prince.\u201d\n\nJora knelt down to his level. \u201cYou are the last heir of Ivalis. They will listen if you show them your heart.\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs the rebels gathered, Aiden took a deep breath. He stepped into the circle and looked around. Faces of all ages stared back at him, filled with hope and fear.\n\n\u201cFellow rebels!\u201d Aiden began, his voice shaky. \u201cI am Aiden, the last heir to the throne of Ivalis. We must work together!\u201d\n\nBut just then, a loud crash erupted from the edge of the camp. Aiden jumped back, heart racing. \n\n\u201cJora! What was that?\u201d he shouted.\n\n\u201cStay here!\u201d she commanded, rushing toward the noise. Aiden watched as she darted into the trees. \n\nMoments later, Jora returned with a worried look. \u201cScouts report an army approaching! They belong to Lord Draven!\u201d\n\nAiden\u2019s heart sank. Lord Draven was the most powerful rival in the kingdom. \u201cWhat do we do?\u201d he asked, panic creeping in.\n\n\u201cWe fight!\u201d Jora said, fire in her eyes. \u201cBut we need a plan.\u201d\n\nSuddenly, Thalia appeared, her cloak flowing behind her. \u201cAiden, listen carefully. You must choose. Do you want to run, or do you want to stand and lead?\u201d\n\nAiden felt the weight of her words. He took a deep breath. \u201cI want to lead!\u201d he declared, his voice stronger now.\n\n\u201cThen we must prepare!\u201d Thalia announced. \u201cGather everyone and make sure they are ready.\u201d\n\nBut just as they turned to rally the rebels, a voice boomed from the trees. \u201cSurrender now, Aiden! The kingdom belongs to Lord Draven!\u201d\n\nAiden\u2019s heart raced. This was it. The moment of truth! \n\n\u201cJora!\u201d he called, clutching her arm. \u201cWhat do we do? I can\u2019t let them take what\u2019s left of Ivalis!\u201d\n\n\u201cThen we fight together!\u201d Jora rallied, her spirit unyielding.\n\nWith a surge of courage, Aiden knew this was just the beginning of his journey. He faced the approaching army, ready to protect his kingdom, ready to be a leader. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nHe felt the power of the rebels behind him. Aiden took a deep breath, ready to embrace his destiny.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who is approaching the rebel camp?","options":["A band of travelers","Lord Draven's army","The royal guards","A group of villagers"],"correct_answer":"Lord Draven's army"},{"question":"What does Aiden decide to do when faced with danger?","options":["Run away","Fight with the rebels","Hide in the trees","Surrender"],"correct_answer":"Fight with the rebels"},{"question":"What does Jora help Aiden with?","options":["Finding treasure","Getting food","Leading the rebels","Building a shelter"],"correct_answer":"Leading the rebels"},{"question":"What do the rebels do when they hear the loud crash?","options":["They ignore it","They run away","They investigate","They start singing"],"correct_answer":"They investigate"},{"question":"What does Thalia ask Aiden?","options":["To run away","To surrender now","To choose to lead or run","To find a secret weapon"],"correct_answer":"To choose to lead or run"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_170_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_170_ch3_img1.png","plot_170_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":427,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
