   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_170_7_10","title":"The Last Heir of Ivalis","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Warring Kingdoms","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Aiden stood tall in the rebel camp, surrounded by the bright greens of the forest. Sunlight filtered through the leaves, casting playful shadows on the ground. The air buzzed with excitement. \n\n\u201cToday is the day we plan our attack!\u201d Jora announced, her voice strong and clear. Aiden felt his heart race. He was ready to lead, but doubt tickled at the edges of his mind. \n\n\u201cWhat if they don\u2019t follow me?\u201d he whispered to Thalia, who stood beside him. Her eyes sparkled with wisdom. \u201cYou have the heart of a true leader, Aiden. Trust them, and they will trust you.\u201d \n\nSuddenly, a loud rustling came from the bushes. The rebels turned in unison, eyes wide with surprise. A small rabbit hopped into the clearing, its nose twitching. Laughter erupted as the tension lifted.\n\n\u201cSee?\u201d Thalia smiled. \u201cEven the forest believes in you.\u201d They all chuckled, feeling lighter.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAiden took a deep breath. \u201cAlright, everyone! We need to gather our resources. We must be ready!\u201d He felt a surge of confidence. His voice rang out, louder than before. \u201cFor Ivalis!\u201d\n\nThe rebels cheered, their spirits lifted. They began to gather supplies: food, ropes, and weapons. Aiden moved among them, offering help and encouragement. It felt good to be part of something bigger.\n\nAs the sun began to set, painting the sky in hues of orange and pink, Jora called everyone to gather. \u201cTonight, we will share stories. They remind us why we fight.\u201d The rebels sat in a circle, and Aiden felt warmth and camaraderie wash over him.\n\nAiden listened as each person shared. They spoke of their families and dreams. When it was his turn, Aiden opened his mouth, but no words came. \u201cI\u2014\u201d he stammered, feeling unsure.\n\n\u201cYou\u2019re doing great, Aiden! Just speak from your heart!\u201d Jora encouraged him. Taking a deep breath, he said, \u201cI want to unite our kingdom and bring peace!\u201d The rebels clapped, and Aiden felt hope bloom inside him like a flower.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe mood shifted suddenly as a shadow loomed on the edge of the camp. A scout rushed in, breathless. \u201cLord Draven\u2019s army is approaching!\u201d Panic spread. Aiden's heart sank. \n\n\u201cEveryone, listen!\u201d Aiden shouted, finding strength deep within. \u201cWe can do this! Stay calm and prepare!\u201d He felt the weight of their eyes on him. \u201cWe will protect Ivalis together!\u201d \n\nNods of agreement spread through the crowd. Aiden knew they were ready to fight. They stood as one, united against the threat. \n\nAs the stars twinkled above, Aiden felt a spark of determination. He was not just a boy anymore; he was a leader. Together, they would face whatever came next.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Aiden learn to do in this chapter?","options":["Build a castle","Lead the rebels","Find treasure","Ride a dragon"],"correct_answer":"Lead the rebels"},{"question":"Who encourages Aiden to speak from his heart?","options":["Lord Draven","Thalia","A rabbit","Jora"],"correct_answer":"Jora"},{"question":"What does the scout report?","options":["A storm is coming","Lord Draven's army is approaching","A new leader has arrived","The forest is safe"],"correct_answer":"Lord Draven's army is approaching"},{"question":"What does Aiden feel when he speaks to the rebels?","options":["Fear","Excitement","Sadness","Confidence"],"correct_answer":"Confidence"},{"question":"What is the mood of the rebels at the end of the chapter?","options":["Sad","Calm","Panicked","United"],"correct_answer":"United"}]},"images":null,"word_count":445,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
