   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_161_7_10","title":"The Last Flamekeeper","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Dragons & Creatures","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Once upon a time, in a bright village called Emberwood, there lived a girl named Lilith. She had wild, curly hair and sparkling green eyes that twinkled with mischief. Lilith loved adventures and exploring the lush forests near her home.\n\nOne sunny morning, Lilith ran outside. \u201cSparky! Where are you?\u201d she called. Sparky was her best friend and a small, cheeky dragon. He had shiny, blue scales and a tiny, playful grin. \n\nSuddenly, Sparky flew down from a tree. \u201cI\u2019m here, Lilith!\u201d he chirped, circling her head like a little comet. \u201cLet\u2019s go explore the Whispering Woods!\u201d\n\nLilith giggled, her heart racing with excitement. \u201cYes! I want to see the ancient trees!\u201d\n\nAs they entered the woods, the trees loomed tall and proud. Their leaves whispered secrets in the gentle breeze. Sunlight streamed through the branches, dancing on the forest floor. \u201cLook over there!\u201d Lilith pointed to a glimmering light. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nIt sparkled like a thousand stars. \u201cWhat is that?\u201d Sparky asked, eyes wide with wonder. \n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know!\u201d Lilith replied. \u201cLet\u2019s find out!\u201d\n\nThey tiptoed closer, curiosity bubbling inside them. Suddenly, the light zipped away, revealing a path leading deeper into the woods. \u201cShould we follow it?\u201d Sparky asked, his wings buzzing with energy.\n\n\u201cYes!\u201d Lilith exclaimed. \u201cIt could lead us to something amazing!\u201d\n\nAs they followed the path, the trees grew darker, and shadows danced around them. Then, a deep voice echoed. \u201cWho dares to enter my domain?\u201d \n\nLilith froze. \u201cWho are you?\u201d she asked, her voice shaking.\n\n\u201cI am Malakar, the sorcerer,\u201d the voice answered. \u201cI am searching for the last dragon egg. And you, little girl, will help me find it!\u201d\n\nLilith felt a chill run down her spine. \u201cNo! I won\u2019t help you!\u201d she shouted, standing tall. \n\n\u201cThen, the darkness will come for your village!\u201d Malakar sneered. \n\nLilith\u2019s heart raced. She had to stop him. \u201cI will find the egg first,\u201d she declared. \u201cAnd I will awaken its guardian!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith determination in her eyes, Lilith turned to Sparky. \u201cWe can do this together!\u201d\n\n\u201cOf course!\u201d Sparky said, puffing out his chest. \u201cLet\u2019s save Emberwood!\u201d\n\nThey took a deep breath and prepared for their quest. Little did they know, the adventure was just beginning.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the name of Lilith's dragon friend?","options":["Sparky","Malakar","Ember","Whisper"],"correct_answer":"Sparky"},{"question":"What does Malakar want to find?","options":["A treasure","The last dragon egg","A magic wand","A special book"],"correct_answer":"The last dragon egg"},{"question":"Where do Lilith and Sparky explore?","options":["The Whispering Woods","The Dark Cave","The Tall Mountains","The Bright Meadow"],"correct_answer":"The Whispering Woods"},{"question":"What does Lilith decide to do?","options":["Help Malakar","Run away","Find the dragon egg","Climb a tree"],"correct_answer":"Find the dragon egg"},{"question":"How does Lilith feel when facing Malakar?","options":["Scared","Brave","Happy","Tired"],"correct_answer":"Brave"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_161_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_161_ch1_img1.png","plot_161_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":378,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
