   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_161_7_10","title":"The Last Flamekeeper","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Dragons & Creatures","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Lilith stood at the edge of the Whispering Woods. The trees towered high, their leaves glimmering like emeralds under the sun. \u201cWe need to be careful, Sparky,\u201d she said, glancing at her dragon friend.\n\nSparky flapped his tiny wings, his scales sparkling. \u201cI can\u2019t wait to see the dragon egg!\u201d he said with a grin. \u201cLet\u2019s hurry!\u201d \n\nWith each step, the forest grew darker. Shadows danced between the trees. Lilith\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWhat if Malakar is nearby?\u201d she whispered. \n\nAs they moved deeper into the woods, a chilling wind blew. \u201cI feel something strange,\u201d Lilith said, looking around. Suddenly, they heard a rustling in the bushes. \n\n\u201cWhat was that?\u201d Sparky squeaked, eyes wide. \n\nLilith raised her hand. \u201cShh! Let\u2019s listen.\u201d \n\nFrom the bushes, a small creature with big, round eyes popped out. \u201cHello! I\u2019m Flit, the forest sprite! I can help you!\u201d \n\nLilith smiled. \u201cWe\u2019re looking for the last dragon egg. Have you seen it?\u201d \n\nFlit nodded quickly. \u201cYes! But it\u2019s guarded by a fierce beast. Malakar is trying to find it too!\u201d \n\nLilith\u2019s stomach sank. \u201cWe have to hurry! We can\u2019t let him get the egg first!\u201d \n\nJust then, a loud roar echoed through the forest. The ground shook beneath their feet. \u201cThat\u2019s the beast!\u201d Flit exclaimed. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Lilith shouted, determination filling her heart. \n\nThey raced through the trees, Sparky flying close behind. Suddenly, a huge shadow loomed above them. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nA monstrous creature appeared, its scales shimmering like dark jewels. \u201cYou shall not pass!\u201d it growled, blocking their path. \n\nLilith took a deep breath. \u201cWe can\u2019t back down now!\u201d she said fiercely. \u201cFlit, do you have a plan?\u201d \n\nFlit looked nervously at the beast. \u201cUm, I can distract it! You two can sneak around!\u201d \n\n\u201cGood idea!\u201d Lilith replied. \u201cSparky, are you ready?\u201d \n\n\u201cReady!\u201d Sparky said, his eyes sparkling with excitement. \n\nWith a wave of her hand, Flit flew towards the beast, waving her arms wildly. \u201cHey, over here!\u201d \n\nThe creature turned, confused. Lilith and Sparky slipped past, hearts pounding. \n\nBut just as they thought they were safe, Malakar appeared, laughing wickedly. \u201cYou\u2019re too late, Flamekeeper! The egg is mine!\u201d \n\n\u201cNot if we can help it!\u201d Lilith shouted back. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cGet ready, Sparky! We\u2019ll need all our courage!\u201d \n\nWith that, they prepared to face the dark sorcerer, their adventure just beginning.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who helps Lilith and Sparky in the forest?","options":["A dragon","A sprite","A sorcerer","A beast"],"correct_answer":"A sprite"},{"question":"What does Flit say is guarding the dragon egg?","options":["A sorcerer","A beast","A dragon","A tree"],"correct_answer":"A beast"},{"question":"What does Malakar want?","options":["To help Lilith","To find the dragon egg","To leave the forest","To play with Sparky"],"correct_answer":"To find the dragon egg"},{"question":"How does Lilith feel when they hear the roar?","options":["Happy","Excited","Scared","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Scared"},{"question":"What is the main goal of Lilith and Sparky?","options":["To play in the woods","To find treasure","To save their village","To meet Malakar"],"correct_answer":"To save their village"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_161_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_161_ch2_img1.png","plot_161_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":399,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
