   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_161_7_10","title":"The Last Flamekeeper","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Dragons & Creatures","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Chapter 3: The Beast of the Cave\n\nLilith and Sparky stood at the edge of the Whispering Woods. The trees loomed tall and thick. Their leaves rustled like whispers of ancient secrets. \n\n\u201cWe\u2019re close, Sparky!\u201d Lilith said, her heart racing with excitement. \u201cThe dragon egg must be in that cave!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe cave entrance was dark and shadowy. A strange glow flickered from inside. \u201cDo you see that?\u201d Lilith whispered. Sparky nodded, his eyes wide. \u201cIt looks magical!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a low growl echoed from within the cave. Lilith\u2019s stomach twisted. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d she asked, gripping Sparky tightly.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but it doesn\u2019t sound friendly!\u201d Sparky squeaked, his wings fluttering nervously.\n\nAs they crept closer, a massive shape emerged from the shadows. It was a fierce beast, covered in shimmering scales. Its eyes glowed like emeralds, and its teeth were sharp as daggers.\n\n\u201cLeave this place!\u201d the beast roared. \u201cThe egg belongs to me!\u201d\n\nLilith took a deep breath. \u201cWe need that egg to save our village!\u201d she shouted bravely. \u201cPlease, let us have it!\u201d\n\nThe beast narrowed its eyes. \u201cOnly if you can answer my riddle!\u201d \n\nLilith and Sparky exchanged glances. \u201cWe can do that!\u201d Sparky said confidently.\n\n\u201cListen carefully,\u201d the beast growled. \u201cI have no feet, but I run. I have no mouth, but I can speak. What am I?\u201d\n\nLilith thought hard. \u201cWhat runs without feet?\u201d she muttered to herself. \u201cA river! It must be a river!\u201d\n\n\u201cThe answer is a river!\u201d she declared.\n\nThe beast blinked in surprise. \u201cCorrect! You may enter.\u201d \n\nIt stepped aside, revealing the shimmering dragon egg nestled in a bed of golden moss. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nLilith gasped. \u201cIt\u2019s beautiful!\u201d The egg pulsed with warmth. She reached out to touch it, but a dark shadow fell over her. \n\nMalakar had returned, his eyes glinting with wicked intent. \u201cYou thought you could get away, little girl?\u201d he sneered. \u201cThat egg is mine!\u201d\n\nLilith felt a surge of fear. \u201cNo! We need it to awaken the dragon!\u201d But Malakar raised his hand, and dark magic crackled in the air.\n\n\u201cMake your choice, Flamekeeper!\u201d he shouted. \u201cWill you fight me for the egg, or will you flee?\u201d\n\nLilith\u2019s heart raced. She had a decision to make.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Lilith and Sparky find in the cave?","options":["A treasure chest","A dragon egg","A giant spider","A magic wand"],"correct_answer":"A dragon egg"},{"question":"What does the beast want before letting them pass?","options":["A song","A riddle","A dance","A gift"],"correct_answer":"A riddle"},{"question":"What is the answer to the beast's riddle?","options":["A tree","A river","A cloud","A star"],"correct_answer":"A river"},{"question":"Who threatens Lilith at the end of the chapter?","options":["Flit","The beast","Malakar","Sparky"],"correct_answer":"Malakar"},{"question":"What choice does Lilith have to make?","options":["To run away","To fight or flee","To sing a song","To solve another riddle"],"correct_answer":"To fight or flee"}]},"images":null,"word_count":377,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
