   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_161_7_10","title":"The Last Flamekeeper","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Dragons & Creatures","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"The sun peeked through the tall trees of the Whispering Woods. Lilith and Sparky stood beside a large rock, panting after their encounter with Malakar. \n\n\u201cWe need to find that egg before Malakar does,\u201d Lilith said, determination shining in her eyes.\n\nSparky nodded, his tiny wings buzzing excitedly. \u201cLet\u2019s go! But we must be careful. The beast is still out there!\u201d\n\nAs they walked deeper into the woods, the air grew thick with magic. Glowing flowers lit up the ground, and the leaves rustled like whispers of ancient secrets. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, a loud roar echoed through the trees. The ground shook beneath their feet. \u201cThat\u2019s the beast!\u201d Lilith exclaimed. She felt a shiver run down her spine. \u201cWhat if it\u2019s too strong?\u201d\n\nBut Sparky puffed out his chest. \u201cWe can do this together! Remember, you\u2019re the Flamekeeper!\u201d\n\nThey crept closer to a clearing, where they saw the beast. It was a giant, furry creature with shimmering scales along its back. It looked fierce, but its eyes sparkled with curiosity.\n\n\u201cWho dares approach?\u201d the beast thundered, its voice booming like a drum.\n\nLilith stepped forward, her heart racing. \u201cWe\u2019re not here to harm you! We seek the dragon egg!\u201d\n\nThe beast tilted its head, a flicker of interest in its eyes. \u201cTo find the egg, you must answer a riddle. Are you ready?\u201d\n\n\u201cYes!\u201d Lilith shouted, her voice steady.\n\n\u201cVery well,\u201d the beast growled. \u201cWhat has wings but cannot fly? What can light the dark but is not a star?\u201d\n\nLilith thought hard. \u201cA candle!\u201d she shouted. \n\nThe beast blinked in surprise. \u201cCorrect! You may pass.\u201d It stepped aside, revealing a glittering egg nestled in a bed of moss.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith excitement bubbling inside her, Lilith rushed to the egg. \u201cWe found it, Sparky! We can save the dragons!\u201d \n\nBut just then, Malakar appeared from the shadows, his eyes glinting with malice. \u201cNot so fast, Flamekeeper! That egg belongs to me!\u201d\n\nLilith and Sparky stood ready, a wave of courage washing over them. They would not let Malakar take their hope.\n\n\u201cGet ready, Sparky!\u201d Lilith whispered, her heart pounding.\n\nThe battle for the future had just begun.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Lilith and Sparky need to find?","options":["A buried treasure","The last dragon egg","A magic wand","A lost book"],"correct_answer":"The last dragon egg"},{"question":"What does the beast ask Lilith and Sparky?","options":["A question about dragons","A riddle","To leave the forest","To fight him"],"correct_answer":"A riddle"},{"question":"What is Lilith's special ability?","options":["To fly","To talk to dragons","To sing","To read minds"],"correct_answer":"To talk to dragons"},{"question":"Who threatens Lilith and Sparky at the end of the chapter?","options":["A friendly sprite","Malakar the sorcerer","A farmer","A knight"],"correct_answer":"Malakar the sorcerer"},{"question":"What emotion do Lilith and Sparky feel when they discover the egg?","options":["Fear","Hopelessness","Excitement","Anger"],"correct_answer":"Excitement"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_161_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_161_ch4_img1.png","plot_161_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":363,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
