   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_161_7_10","title":"The Last Flamekeeper","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Dragons & Creatures","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Lilith stood at the edge of the Rocky Cliffs, her heart racing. The wind whipped through her hair. She could see the sun setting, painting the sky in shades of orange and pink. \"This is it, Sparky!\" she exclaimed. \"The last dragon egg is just beyond these cliffs!\"\n\nSparky flapped his tiny wings excitedly. \"Let\u2019s go! But remember what Flit said. We need to be careful of Malakar!\"\n\nAs they crept closer, the shadows grew longer. The air felt heavy with magic. Lilith could sense something was waiting for them. Just then, a rumble echoed from above. Lilith looked up, wide-eyed. There, perched on a rock, was Malakar!\n\n\"Well, well, well,\" Malakar sneered. \"You shouldn\u2019t have come here, little girl!\" \n\nLilith\u2019s heart pounded. \"I\u2019m not afraid of you!\" she shouted, trying to sound brave. Sparky puffed up his chest. \"You will not take the egg!\"\n\nMalakar laughed. \"You think you can stop me? I have the power of darkness!\" With a wave of his hand, shadows twisted around him.\n\nSuddenly, a bright light burst from Sparky. \"Let\u2019s combine our powers, Lilith!\" he said. Lilith nodded, feeling the magic swirl around her. Together, they raised their hands, channeling their courage.\n\n\u201cBright flame, shine so true,\u201d Lilith called out. \u201cProtect the egg and light our way through!\u201d \n\nA dazzling light erupted, pushing back the shadows. Malakar stumbled back, his face twisted in disbelief. \"No! This can't be happening!\" \n\nJust then, they heard a soft crack. Lilith turned her head and gasped. The dragon egg was glowing! As the light poured forth, a gentle roar filled the air. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nFrom the egg emerged a magnificent baby dragon. It had shimmering scales of gold and eyes that sparkled like stars. \"I am Ember!\" it said, flapping its tiny wings. \u201cThank you for freeing me!\u201d\n\nLilith couldn\u2019t believe her eyes. \u201cYou\u2019re beautiful!\u201d she exclaimed. \"Together, we can stop Malakar!\"\n\nThe baby dragon nodded, and they joined forces. With a powerful roar, Ember unleashed a wave of fire that danced through the air. Malakar shrieked as the flames surrounded him, driving him away. \u201cThis isn\u2019t over!\u201d he yelled as he vanished into the shadows.\n\nLilith hugged Sparky tight. \u201cWe did it! We saved the egg and found Ember!\u201d Sparky did a little happy dance. \u201cThis is just the beginning, Lilith. We can bring back the dragons!\u201d\n\nWith newfound hope, the three of them set off to brighten the world again, ready for whatever adventures lay ahead. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nLilith smiled up at her new friends. \u201cTogether, we are unstoppable!\u201d","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who does Lilith confront at the Rocky Cliffs?","options":["A giant","Malakar","Sparky","Flit"],"correct_answer":"Malakar"},{"question":"What is the name of the baby dragon?","options":["Sparky","Flit","Ember","Malakar"],"correct_answer":"Ember"},{"question":"What power do Lilith and Sparky combine?","options":["Darkness","Shadows","Light","Fire"],"correct_answer":"Light"},{"question":"How does Malakar react when he is confronted?","options":["He laughs","He runs away","He gets mad","He helps them"],"correct_answer":"He gets mad"},{"question":"What do Lilith and her friends hope to do now?","options":["Find more dragons","Destroy Ember","Join Malakar","Leave the village"],"correct_answer":"Find more dragons"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_161_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_161_ch5_img1.png","plot_161_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":432,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
