     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"destiny","1":"tendrils","2":"emboldened","3":"malice","4":"guardian","image_prompts":["A panoramic view of the Elder Mountains at sunset, the sky ablaze with gold and orange hues. Lilith stands at the cliff's edge, her expression a mixture of determination and anxiety. Beside her, Sparky, a small dragon with vibrant, jewel-like scales, flaps his wings, eager to dive into the adventure ahead. The forest below is thick with ancient trees, shadows creeping in as the light fades.","An intense moment captured within the cave, glowing crystals lining the walls reflecting the fierce clash between Lilith, Sparky, and Malakar. Lilith, with fiery determination in her eyes, stands firm, channeling light towards the dark sorcerer, who is engulfed in swirling shadows, his face a mask of fury. The atmosphere is charged with tension and magic, illuminating the scene with a dramatic contrast of light and dark."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A panoramic view of the Elder Mountains at sunset, the sky ablaze with gold and orange hues. Lilith stands at the cliffs edge, her expression a mixture of determination and anxiety. Beside her, Sparky, a small dragon with vibrant, jewel-like scales, flaps his wings, eager to dive into the adventure ahead. The forest below is thick with ancient trees, shadows creeping in as the light fades.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_161_ch5_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 16:14:28"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing An intense moment captured within the cave, glowing crystals lining the walls reflecting the fierce clash between Lilith, Sparky, and Malakar. Lilith, with fiery determination in her eyes, stands firm, channeling light towards the dark sorcerer, who is engulfed in swirling shadows, his face a mask of fury. The atmosphere is charged with tension and magic, illuminating the scene with a dramatic contrast of light and dark.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_161_ch5_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 16:14:28"}}}
