   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_162_7_10","title":"The Dragon's Silver Feather","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Dragons & Creatures","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Amir lived in a small village at the edge of a magical forest. The forest was filled with tall trees that touched the sky. People whispered about the wonders hidden inside. \n\nOne sunny morning, Amir decided to explore. He wanted to find something amazing. \u201cMaybe I\u2019ll find a treasure!\u201d he said, skipping along the path. The air was fresh, and the birds chirped cheerfully.\n\nSuddenly, Amir spotted something shiny on the ground. He bent down and picked it up. It was a silver feather, glowing like a star! \u201cWow! A feather?\u201d he exclaimed, turning it over in his hands. It sparkled in the sunlight.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs Amir admired the feather, a soft voice startled him. \u201cThat\u2019s not just any feather!\u201d said a friendly dragon. Amir looked up to see a magnificent dragon with bright blue scales and big, wise eyes.  \n\n\u201cI\u2019m Zephyr,\u201d the dragon said, grinning. \u201cThat feather belongs to me! It grants the power to fly!\u201d \n\nAmir\u2019s heart raced with excitement. \u201cFly? Really? But I\u2019m afraid of heights!\u201d \n\nZephyr nodded, his eyes sparkling. \u201cYou must be brave, Amir! Together, we can find ancient artifacts to restore my magic!\u201d \n\n\u201cAncient artifacts?\u201d Amir asked, curious. \n\n\u201cYes! They hold great power,\u201d Zephyr explained. \u201cBut we must be careful! A greedy treasure hunter named Rolf wants that feather too!\u201d \n\nAmir gasped. \u201cRolf? But he\u2019s always trying to take things that don\u2019t belong to him!\u201d \n\n\u201cExactly,\u201d said Zephyr. \u201cWe must hurry! Will you help me?\u201d \n\nAmir took a deep breath. \u201cYes! I want to fly and help you!\u201d \n\nThey soared into the sky, and Amir felt the wind rush past him. \u201cThis is amazing!\u201d he shouted. But then he looked down. The ground seemed so far away!\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cI\u2019m scared!\u201d he yelled. \n\n\u201cHold on tight!\u201d Zephyr said with a laugh. \u201cYou can do it!\u201d \n\nAmir closed his eyes, took a deep breath, and felt the thrill of flying. But he knew Rolf was still out there, watching them.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find those artifacts and keep the feather safe!\u201d Amir said, feeling braver. \n\nWith a determined spirit, they flew off into the bright blue sky, ready for their adventure.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Amir find in the forest?","options":["A silver feather","A golden coin","A magic wand","A treasure map"],"correct_answer":"A silver feather"},{"question":"Who is the dragon Amir meets?","options":["Rolf","Zephyr","Amir","A treasure hunter"],"correct_answer":"Zephyr"},{"question":"What does the feather grant the power to do?","options":["Swim","Fly","Run fast","Become invisible"],"correct_answer":"Fly"},{"question":"What is Amir afraid of?","options":["Darkness","Heights","Monsters","Water"],"correct_answer":"Heights"},{"question":"Who wants to take the feather from Amir?","options":["Zephyr","Amir's friends","Rolf","His parents"],"correct_answer":"Rolf"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_162_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_162_ch1_img1.png","plot_162_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":364,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
