   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_162_7_10","title":"The Dragon's Silver Feather","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Dragons & Creatures","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Amir stood on the edge of a floating island, watching the clouds drift by. The sun shone bright, and he felt the warm breeze on his face. \"This place is magical, Zephyr!\" he exclaimed, looking for his new friend.\n\nZephyr, a sleek dragon with shimmering scales, landed softly beside him. \"It is indeed, Amir! But we have work to do!\" His voice was wise but playful.\n\nAmir's excitement bubbled inside him. \"What do we need to find first?\" \n\nZephyr thought for a moment. \"We must collect the Crystal of Courage. It lies deep in the Misty Forest. But there's a twist!\" \n\nAmir's heart raced. \"What\u2019s the twist?\"\n\n\"There\u2019s a greedy treasure hunter named Rolf. He wants the feather too!\" Zephyr warned, his eyes narrowing. Amir gulped. \"I\u2019ll face him! I must be brave!\" \n\nAs they prepared to leave, Amir felt a flutter of fear in his stomach. Heights were scary! \"I wish I wasn't afraid of flying,\" he mumbled.\n\nZephyr nudged him gently. \"You will be fine! Trust the feather. It will guide you!\"\n\nWith a determined nod, Amir held the feather tightly. \"Okay, let\u2019s go!\" \n\nThey soared off the island, the wind whistling past them. Amir felt the thrill rush through him\u2014this was flying! [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] \n\nBut suddenly, a loud voice echoed below. \u201cStop! That's mine!\u201d Rolf shouted, waving his arms as he spotted them. He was a tall man, with a greedy grin and a map in his hand.\n\nAmir's heart sank. \"What do we do now?\" \n\nZephyr roared confidently, \u201cHold on tight!\u201d \n\nThey dodged Rolf's grasp as they flew higher. \u201cYou can\u2019t escape me!\u201d Rolf yelled, chasing them on a small, clunky airship.\n\nAmir\u2019s mind raced. \u201cWe need to lose him!\u201d \n\n\u201cFollow me!\u201d Zephyr said, spiraling through the clouds.\n\nAmir squeezed his eyes shut, then opened them to the beautiful blue sky. \u201cI can do this!\u201d he shouted, feeling the wind lift him. With a burst of courage, he looked back. Rolf was getting closer!\n\n\u201cFaster!\u201d Amir cried. Zephyr pushed forward, and the airship grew smaller. \n\nBut just then, a dark storm cloud loomed ahead. \u201cWe have to go through!\u201d Amir said, his voice shaky. \n\n\u201cTrust in the feather!\u201d Zephyr encouraged. \u201cTogether, we can do it!\u201d\n\nAmir took a deep breath. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d \n\nAs they entered the storm, lightning flashed around them. The winds howled loudly. Amir gripped Zephyr tighter. \n\nWould they make it through? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Amir and Zephyr need to find first?","options":["The Feather of Flight","The Crystal of Courage","The Golden Treasure","The Book of Magic"],"correct_answer":"The Crystal of Courage"},{"question":"Who is the greedy treasure hunter?","options":["Amir","Zephyr","Rolf","The Wizard"],"correct_answer":"Rolf"},{"question":"What does Amir feel as they prepare to fly?","options":["Excitement","Boredom","Anger","Sleepiness"],"correct_answer":"Excitement"},{"question":"What is the first obstacle they face?","options":["A mountain","A storm","Rolf","A river"],"correct_answer":"A storm"},{"question":"What does Zephyr encourage Amir to trust?","options":["Himself","The feather","The map","The wind"],"correct_answer":"The feather"}]},"images":null,"word_count":408,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
