   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_162_7_10","title":"The Dragon's Silver Feather","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Dragons & Creatures","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Amir stood at the edge of a floating island. The wind danced around him, making his hair flutter. Zephyr, the wise dragon, looked at Amir with bright, curious eyes.\n\n\u201cAre you ready for our adventure?\u201d Zephyr asked, his voice smooth like honey.\n\n\u201cI think so,\u201d Amir replied, feeling a flutter of nerves in his stomach. \u201cBut what if we see Rolf?\u201d\n\n\u201cDon\u2019t worry, together we are strong!\u201d Zephyr reassured him. \u201cWe must find the Crystal of Courage.\u201d\n\nAs they soared into the sky, the clouds felt soft beneath them. The view was breathtaking! Amir saw waterfalls glittering in the sunlight and forests filled with sparkling trees. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, dark clouds gathered. A loud boom of thunder rolled through the air. Amir gasped. \u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d\n\n\u201cA storm is coming!\u201d Zephyr warned. \u201cHold on tight!\u201d\n\nThe wind whipped around them, making it hard to fly straight. Amir felt his heart race. \u201cI\u2019m scared, Zephyr!\u201d\n\n\u201cJust think of the crystal!\u201d Zephyr encouraged. \u201cWe need it to restore my magic!\u201d\n\nAs they flew deeper into the storm, Amir spotted a flash of light. \u201cThere!\u201d he shouted, pointing to the bright glow.\n\nBut from below, a shadow raced upward. It was Rolf, the greedy treasure hunter! \u201cYou won\u2019t get the crystal!\u201d he laughed, his eyes glinting with mischief.\n\n\u201cAmir, we have to be brave!\u201d Zephyr said. \u201cWe can\u2019t let him take it!\u201d\n\nWith a mighty flap of his wings, Zephyr dove to the shimmering light. Rolf followed closely, determined to snatch the feather.\n\n\u201cFaster, Zephyr!\u201d Amir cried. \u201cWe can\u2019t let him win!\u201d\n\nAs they neared the crystal\u2019s light, a huge gust of wind tossed them sideways. Amir clutched the silver feather tightly. \u201cI can\u2019t do this!\u201d he shouted.\n\n\u201cBelieve in yourself, Amir!\u201d Zephyr urged. Just then, a brilliant flash of lightning struck nearby. It lit up the dark sky, revealing a path to the crystal.\n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Amir pointed. \u201cWe can go that way!\u201d\n\nWith a rush of courage, Amir and Zephyr veered toward the light. But Rolf was right behind them! Would they reach the crystal in time?\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cHold on!\u201d Zephyr shouted as they raced forward. The storm roared around them, but Amir felt a spark of bravery growing inside. This was it! They were almost there!\n\nWould Amir find the courage he needed? Or would Rolf snatch the silver feather away from them?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Amir find at the edge of the island?","options":["A treasure","A storm","A crystal","A silver feather"],"correct_answer":"A silver feather"},{"question":"Who is chasing Amir and Zephyr?","options":["A friendly wizard","Rolf the treasure hunter","A giant bird","A magical creature"],"correct_answer":"Rolf the treasure hunter"},{"question":"What does Amir need to overcome?","options":["His fear of heights","His love for treasure","His dislike for storms","His hunger"],"correct_answer":"His fear of heights"},{"question":"What does Zephyr tell Amir to believe in?","options":["The treasure","Himself","The storm","The feather"],"correct_answer":"Himself"},{"question":"What do Amir and Zephyr see that guides them?","options":["A rainbow","A bright glow","A dragon","A mountain"],"correct_answer":"A bright glow"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_162_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_162_ch3_img1.png","plot_162_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":400,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
