   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_162_7_10","title":"The Dragon's Silver Feather","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Dragons & Creatures","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Amir and Zephyr soared above the clouds. The wind ruffled their hair and feathers. Below them, floating islands sparkled like jewels. \n\n\u201cLook, Amir! The Crystal of Courage is just ahead!\u201d Zephyr said, pointing with his long, shiny tail.\n\nAmir squinted. \u201cI see it! It\u2019s glowing blue and purple!\u201d His heart raced with excitement. They flew closer, but suddenly, dark clouds rolled in.\n\n\u201cHold on!\u201d shouted Zephyr as he veered to the side. The storm howled, shaking them. Amir\u2019s stomach flipped.\n\n\u201cI-I don\u2019t like this!\u201d Amir yelled, his voice lost in the wind. \n\n\u201cRemember, you have the feather! You can fly!\u201d Zephyr encouraged, his voice steady.\n\nAmir took a deep breath. \u201cI can do this!\u201d He gripped the silver feather tightly. With each beat of his heart, his confidence grew.\n\nAs they broke through the clouds, the land below sparkled again. They spotted a cave at the edge of the island. \u201cLet\u2019s check inside!\u201d said Zephyr.\n\nAmir nodded, his fear fading. Together, they landed near the cave entrance. It was dark and mysterious. \u201cWhat if Rolf is inside?\u201d Amir whispered.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s be brave!\u201d Zephyr said, his eyes twinkling. \u201cWe need that crystal!\u201d\n\nThey crept in, the cave echoing their footsteps. Just then, Amir spotted something shiny on the ground. \u201cLook!\u201d he exclaimed. It was a small, golden key!\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cWhat does it open?\u201d Amir wondered, holding the key up to the light.\n\n\u201cPerhaps it unlocks a treasure!\u201d Zephyr said, his voice full of wonder. \u201cOr maybe the Crystal of Courage itself!\u201d\n\nBut before they could explore further, they heard a loud crash behind them. \n\n\u201cHa! There you are!\u201d Rolf sneered, stepping into the cave. \u201cI\u2019ve been looking for you! Hand over the feather!\u201d\n\nAmir felt a shiver run down his spine. \u201cWhat do you want with it?\u201d he asked, trying to sound brave.\n\n\u201cI want to take its power! With it, I will be the richest treasure hunter in the land!\u201d Rolf declared, rubbing his hands together greedily.\n\n\u201cNo!\u201d shouted Zephyr, stepping protectively in front of Amir. \u201cYou can\u2019t have it!\u201d\n\nAmir felt a surge of courage. \u201cWe\u2019ll stop you, Rolf!\u201d he said, standing tall beside Zephyr.\n\nRolf laughed. \u201cYou think you can stop me? Let\u2019s see how brave you really are!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cTogether,\u201d whispered Amir to Zephyr, \u201cwe can do this!\u201d\n\nWith the silver feather in hand, Amir felt ready. The adventure was far from over. They would find the Crystal of Courage, and they would face Rolf together!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Amir and Zephyr discover in the cave?","options":["A silver feather","A golden key","A treasure map","A dragon egg"],"correct_answer":"A golden key"},{"question":"What does Rolf want to do with the feather?","options":["Make friends","Take its power","Fly with it","Hide it away"],"correct_answer":"Take its power"},{"question":"How does Amir feel about flying at the beginning of the chapter?","options":["Excited","Scared","Bored","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Scared"},{"question":"What do Amir and Zephyr plan to find next?","options":["A new feather","The Crystal of Courage","A treasure chest","A magic wand"],"correct_answer":"The Crystal of Courage"},{"question":"What does Amir grip tightly in the chapter?","options":["A treasure map","A sword","The silver feather","A book"],"correct_answer":"The silver feather"}]},"images":null,"word_count":420,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
