   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_162_7_10","title":"The Dragon's Silver Feather","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Dragons & Creatures","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Amir stood at the edge of the floating island, heart racing. The sun shone bright in the sky, and the air felt crisp. \"Zephyr, are you sure we can find the Crystal of Courage here?\" he asked, glancing at the wise dragon.\n\n\"Absolutely!\" Zephyr replied, his scales shimmering with excitement. \"The crystal is hidden deep in the Misty Cavern, just below us. But first, you must trust your wings, Amir.\"\n\nAmir looked down at the swirling clouds below. \"But what if I fall?\"\n\n\"Remember the feather, my friend,\" Zephyr said with a wink. \"It will catch you! Just take a deep breath and believe you can fly.\"\n\nTaking a deep breath, Amir nodded. He spread his arms wide and stepped forward. Suddenly, whoosh! The silver feather glowed bright, and Amir felt a rush of wind beneath him.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nWith a leap, Amir soared into the sky. It felt amazing! He laughed and twirled, feeling free like a bird. \"This is incredible, Zephyr!\" he shouted.\n\n\u201cYes! Now, let\u2019s head to the cavern!\u201d Zephyr was right behind him, his wings flapping gracefully. They flew through sparkling clouds and over lush green forests.\n\nBut then, they spotted a shadow below. It was Rolf, the greedy treasure hunter! \u201cStop right there!\u201d he called up to them. \u201cThat feather belongs to me!\u201d\n\nAmir's heart pounded. \u201cWhat do we do?\u201d he whispered to Zephyr.\n\n\u201cRemember your courage, Amir! We can outsmart him!\u201d Zephyr said. They turned sharply, leading Rolf away from the cavern.\n\nAs they dived into the Misty Cavern, Amir felt a rush of energy. \u201cWe can do this!\u201d he yelled. Rolf followed, but he was clumsy in the dark.\n\nSuddenly, they reached a sparkling pool. At its center, the Crystal of Courage glimmered like a star. \"There it is!\" Amir shouted. He flew down, reaching for the crystal.\n\nBut Rolf caught up! \u201cI won\u2019t let you take it!\u201d he growled.\n\n\u201cThen you\u2019ll have to catch us!\u201d Zephyr teased. With a flap of his wings, he lifted Amir up again, and they zoomed back into the air.\n\nAs Rolf tried to grab them, he slipped and fell into the pool with a big splash! Amir and Zephyr laughed. \u201cGoodbye, Rolf!\u201d Amir shouted. \u201cYou should learn to be nice!\u201d\n\nWith the crystal in hand, Amir felt brave. \u201cWe did it, Zephyr! We proved our courage!\u201d\n\n\u201cYes, we did! Now let\u2019s restore my magic!\u201d Zephyr grinned, and they flew off into the sunset, ready for their next adventure.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Amir need to find in the Misty Cavern?","options":["A magic feather","The Crystal of Courage","A treasure map","A friendly dragon"],"correct_answer":"The Crystal of Courage"},{"question":"Who is chasing Amir and Zephyr?","options":["Rolf","The king","A wizard","A giant"],"correct_answer":"Rolf"},{"question":"What does Amir learn to overcome in this chapter?","options":["His fear of flying","His fear of dark caves","His fear of treasure","His fear of dragons"],"correct_answer":"His fear of flying"},{"question":"What happens to Rolf at the end of the chapter?","options":["He finds the treasure","He falls into the water","He flies away","He gets lost"],"correct_answer":"He falls into the water"},{"question":"What do Amir and Zephyr plan to do next?","options":["Restore Zephyr's magic","Find more treasure","Go home","Build a castle"],"correct_answer":"Restore Zephyr's magic"}]},"images":null,"word_count":416,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
