       [DEBUG] Checking shared image: {"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing An underground lake bursting with energy, the water shimmering like silver under the glow of bioluminescent fungi. In the center, a radiant Heartstone rests on a pedestal, pulsing with light. Amir and Zephyr are foregrounded, poised in a moment of tension as Rolf steps out of the shadows, his expression greedy and menacing.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_162_ch3_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 16:11:55"}
