   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_163_7_10","title":"The Guardian of the Hidden Grove","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Dragons & Creatures","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Mei loved to explore. Every day, she went on adventures in the woods behind her house. One sunny morning, she found a hidden path. It twisted and turned, leading her to a magical place.\n\nAt the end of the path, Mei stepped into the Hidden Grove. The grove shimmered with colors. Bright flowers bloomed everywhere, and trees whispered secrets to each other. Mei gasped in wonder. \u201cWow! It\u2019s beautiful here!\u201d \n\nAs she walked deeper, she heard a soft voice. \u201cWho goes there?\u201d it asked. \n\nMei turned around and saw a small dragon perched on a rock. It was vivid green with sparkling golden eyes. \u201cI\u2019m Mei! Who are you?\u201d\n\n\u201cI am Taro, the guardian of this grove,\u201d the dragon replied with a grin. \u201cBut I need your help!\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat do you need help with, Taro?\u201d asked Mei, curious.\n\nTaro looked worried. \u201cThere is a bad army led by King Rion. They want to destroy our home!\u201d\n\nMei\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWe must stop them! But how?\u201d\n\nTaro flapped his wings. \u201cI need you to help me gather the creatures. They are afraid. They need to unite!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a loud rumble echoed through the grove. Mei and Taro looked at each other, wide-eyed.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Taro shouted. \u201cWe don\u2019t have much time!\u201d\n\nThey raced towards the center of the grove. Mei felt excitement and fear. Would the creatures listen to her? Would they fight together?\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nIn the heart of the grove, Mei spotted a group of creatures. There were fairies, talking animals, and even a giant tree that looked like it could walk! \u201cEveryone!\u201d she called out. \u201cWe need to work together!\u201d\n\nBut the creatures began to argue. \u201cI don\u2019t trust the others!\u201d shouted a squirrel.\n\n\u201cThey are too small!\u201d said a big bear. \n\nMei felt a wave of determination wash over her. \u201cIf we don\u2019t join forces, we will lose our home!\u201d\n\nJust then, Taro transformed! He grew bigger and turned into a magnificent dragon with shimmering scales. \u201cListen to Mei!\u201d he boomed. \u201cTogether, we are strong!\u201d\n\nThe creatures gasped. \u201cA dragon!\u201d they whispered in awe.\n\nMei smiled. Maybe they had a chance after all.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s unite!\u201d she shouted. \u201cWe can protect the grove!\u201d\n\nThe creatures looked at each other, then nodded. Hope sparked in their eyes. \n\nBut time was running out. The army was coming.\n\n\u201cAre you ready?\u201d Taro asked Mei, his eyes shining bright.\n\n\u201cI am!\u201d she replied, ready to face the challenge ahead.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What magical creature does Mei meet in the Hidden Grove?","options":["A unicorn","A dragon","A fairy","A giant"],"correct_answer":"A dragon"},{"question":"What does Taro need help with?","options":["Finding food","Gathering magical creatures","Building a house","Flying higher"],"correct_answer":"Gathering magical creatures"},{"question":"Who is the leader of the invading army?","options":["King Rion","Queen Zara","Prince Leo","Captain Bob"],"correct_answer":"King Rion"},{"question":"What do the creatures initially do when Mei asks for help?","options":["They cheer","They argue","They laugh","They ignore her"],"correct_answer":"They argue"},{"question":"What shape does Taro take to inspire the creatures?","options":["A rabbit","A small dragon","A giant dragon","A butterfly"],"correct_answer":"A giant dragon"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_163_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_163_ch1_img1.png","plot_163_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":417,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
