   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_163_7_10","title":"The Guardian of the Hidden Grove","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Dragons & Creatures","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Mei stood in the Hidden Grove, her heart racing. The trees whispered around her, their leaves shimmering in the light. \u201cTaro, we must do something!\u201d she exclaimed.\n\nTaro, who had transformed into a small, friendly dragon, looked worried. \u201cI know, Mei. King Rion's army is coming! We need to warn the other creatures,\u201d he said, his voice serious.\n\n\u201cBut they won\u2019t listen!\u201d Mei replied, biting her lip. \u201cThe fairies and the elves are always arguing. How can we unite them?\u201d\n\n\u201cWe have to try!\u201d Taro flapped his wings, causing sparkles to dance around them. \u201cLet\u2019s start with the fairies. They live by the sparkling stream.\u201d\n\nThey hurried to the stream, where the fairies flitted about, their wings glimmering like tiny rainbows. But when Mei spoke, the fairies giggled and whispered to each other. \n\n\u201cI\u2019m serious!\u201d Mei shouted. \u201cYour home is in danger! King Rion wants to destroy the grove!\u201d\n\nThe fairies stopped laughing. One fairy with bright blue wings flew closer. \u201cWhat do you mean?\u201d she asked, her voice soft and curious.\n\nTaro stepped forward. \u201cWe need your help! Together, we can protect the grove!\u201d\n\nJust then, a loud crash echoed through the grove. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] The ground shook, and Mei gasped. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d\n\nA huge shadow loomed above them. It was a giant rock creature, stomping its way through the trees! The fairies shrieked and scattered. \n\n\u201cStay back!\u201d Taro shouted, transforming into a mighty dragon. He flew high, circling the rock creature. \u201cMei, we need to work together!\u201d\n\nMei felt a surge of courage. \u201cYes! Fairies, we can distract it while Taro attacks! Are you with us?\u201d\n\nThe fairies nodded, their eyes wide with excitement. They flew in circles, creating a colorful whirlwind around the creature. \n\n\u201cNow, Taro!\u201d Mei yelled, pointing. Taro swooped down, breathing fire that danced around the creature\u2019s feet.\n\nThe rock creature stumbled and fell, shaking the ground. \u201cWe did it!\u201d Mei cheered. Taro landed beside her, his scales glimmering in the sunlight.\n\n\u201cNot yet,\u201d Taro said, looking serious. \u201cThis is just the beginning. King Rion\u2019s army is still coming.\u201d\n\nMei felt her stomach twist. \u201cWe have to gather all the creatures now. If we don\u2019t, we won\u2019t stand a chance!\u201d\n\nTaro nodded, determination in his eyes. \u201cLet\u2019s go rally the elves next!\u201d\n\nWith newfound hope, Mei and Taro raced deeper into the grove, ready to face the next challenge.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Taro transform into during the fight?","options":["A small dragon","A giant rock","A fairy","A bird"],"correct_answer":"A small dragon"},{"question":"What danger does Mei warn the fairies about?","options":["A storm","King Rion's army","A fire","A flood"],"correct_answer":"King Rion's army"},{"question":"Where do Mei and Taro go first to gather help?","options":["The mountains","The sparkling stream","The ocean","The dark cave"],"correct_answer":"The sparkling stream"},{"question":"How do the fairies respond to Mei's warning?","options":["They ignore her","They laugh","They get scared","They help her"],"correct_answer":"They laugh"},{"question":"What do Mei and the fairies do to distract the rock creature?","options":["Fly away","Sing a song","Create a whirlwind","Hide behind trees"],"correct_answer":"Create a whirlwind"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_163_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_163_ch2_img1.png","plot_163_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":403,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
