   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_163_7_10","title":"The Guardian of the Hidden Grove","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Dragons & Creatures","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Mei stood in the Hidden Grove, her heart racing. The sun peeked through the ancient trees, casting golden rays on the shimmering leaves. \u201cWe need to find the others, Taro!\u201d she shouted, her voice echoing through the magical air. \n\nTaro, in his dragon form, nodded. \u201cYes, but the fairies are scared. We must make them believe.\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a rustling noise came from the bushes. Mei and Taro jumped back. Out popped a tiny fairy with bright blue wings. \u201cWhat are you doing here?\u201d she squeaked. \u201cYou shouldn\u2019t be here! The Rock Creature is angry!\u201d\n\n\u201cAngry? Why?\u201d Mei asked, her eyes wide. \u201cWe need your help to save the grove!\u201d\n\nThe fairy fluttered closer, her wings shimmering. \u201cI saw King Rion's army! They plan to attack at dusk! We have to warn the others!\u201d \n\n\u201cThen let\u2019s hurry!\u201d Mei said, feeling a surge of determination. She grabbed Taro\u2019s claw and they dashed deeper into the grove. \n\nAs they ran, glowing plants lit their way, illuminating the path ahead. They soon reached a clearing filled with creatures of all shapes and sizes. But they were arguing!\n\n\u201cLeave us alone, Taro!\u201d shouted a squirrel with a fluffy tail. \u201cWe don\u2019t want to fight!\u201d\n\nMei stepped forward, her heart pounding. \u201cListen! If we don\u2019t unite, King Rion will destroy our home!\u201d\n\nThe creatures stopped and stared. Taro transformed into a wise old owl, his eyes gleaming. \u201cMei is right! We must band together!\u201d\n\nJust then, the ground shook! Mei fell to her knees. She could see smoke in the distance. \u201cIt\u2019s the army! They\u2019re coming!\u201d \n\nPanic spread through the crowd. \u201cWhat can we do?\u201d a timid rabbit asked, shaking with fear.\n\n\u201cWe can fight!\u201d shouted Mei, standing tall. \u201cTogether! We can protect our home!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe creatures murmured among themselves, unsure. Taro looked at Mei and nodded. \u201cTell them about the Whispering Trees.\u201d\n\n\u201cRight!\u201d Mei exclaimed, her voice strong. \u201cThe Whispering Trees can help us! They know the secrets of the grove!\u201d\n\n\u201cBut what if the army gets here first?\u201d a fox cried out, his eyes wide with worry.\n\n\u201cWe need to act fast!\u201d Taro replied. Suddenly, he transformed into a huge dragon, his scales glimmering in the sunlight. \u201cWe must go to the Whispering Trees now!\u201d\n\nThe crowd gasped, and for a moment, they looked hopeful. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d shouted Mei, her spirit brightening. \n\nAs they raced toward the trees, Mei felt the weight of the world on her shoulders. Could she unite them all in time? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nSuddenly, a loud roar echoed through the grove. It was King Rion\u2019s army! Mei froze, her heart pounding. This was it. They had to choose: run away or stand and fight.\n\n\u201cFight!\u201d Mei shouted, her voice filled with courage. \u201cFor the Hidden Grove!\u201d","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Mei shout to gather the creatures?","options":["Run away!","Fight for the grove!","Hide!","Play a game!"],"correct_answer":"Fight for the grove!"},{"question":"What form does Taro take to inspire the creatures?","options":["A squirrel","An owl","A dragon","A rabbit"],"correct_answer":"A dragon"},{"question":"What is threatening the grove?","options":["A storm","An invading army","A giant bird","A wizard"],"correct_answer":"An invading army"},{"question":"What did the fairy warn Mei about?","options":["The Rock Creature's anger","The magic flowers","The sun setting","A treasure hunt"],"correct_answer":"The Rock Creature's anger"},{"question":"What do the Whispering Trees know?","options":["Secrets of the grove","How to sing","Where to hide","Magic spells"],"correct_answer":"Secrets of the grove"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_163_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_163_ch3_img1.png","plot_163_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":467,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
