   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_163_7_10","title":"The Guardian of the Hidden Grove","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Dragons & Creatures","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Mei stood in the Hidden Grove, her heart racing. The air was filled with the sweet scent of blooming flowers. Taro, her dragon friend, flapped his wings excitedly. \u201cWe need to gather everyone!\u201d he said, his eyes sparkling like jewels.\n\n\u201cRight!\u201d Mei nodded. \u201cBut where do we start?\u201d \n\nThey walked to the Great Oak, the oldest tree in the grove. It towered above them, its branches stretching wide. \u201cAll the creatures meet here when it\u2019s serious,\u201d Taro explained. \n\nJust then, a tiny fairy zoomed by. Her wings shimmered like rainbows. \u201cMei! Taro!\u201d she shouted. \u201cThe creatures are scared. They won\u2019t unite!\u201d \n\nMei felt a chill in her spine. \u201cWe have to help them! We can\u2019t let King Rion win!\u201d \n\n\u201cWe need a plan,\u201d Taro said, transforming into a wise old owl. \u201cLet\u2019s speak to the creatures one by one.\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nMei and Taro split up. Mei found a group of rabbits, their noses twitching with worry. \u201cPlease, listen!\u201d she pleaded. \u201cWe need your help to protect the grove!\u201d\n\n\u201cBut we\u2019re too small,\u201d said a shy rabbit. \n\n\u201cYou can be brave,\u201d Mei encouraged. \u201cTogether, we are strong!\u201d \n\nThe rabbits looked at each other. \u201cOkay! We will help!\u201d they squeaked.\n\nNext, Mei approached a family of deer. \u201cWe need you!\u201d she said. \u201cKing Rion is coming for our home!\u201d \n\nThe deer nodded, their eyes wide. \u201cWe will stand with you!\u201d said the biggest deer, stepping forward.\n\nAs the sun began to set, Mei and Taro gathered everyone near the Great Oak. The creatures were buzzing with energy. \n\n\u201cListen!\u201d Taro said, returning to his dragon form. \u201cWe are stronger together! Let me show you!\u201d \n\nWith a mighty roar, Taro breathed a stream of fire that danced like bright stars across the sky. The creatures gasped in awe. \n\n\u201cWow!\u201d said the rabbits, their fears melting away. \n\nMei smiled, feeling hope rise in her heart. \u201cWe can do this! Together, we can defend our home!\u201d\n\nJust then, a loud thud echoed through the grove. The ground shook. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Mei gasped.\n\nThe creatures looked frightened. \u201cIt\u2019s King Rion\u2019s army!\u201d cried the fairy. \u201cThey\u2019re coming!\u201d\n\nTaro narrowed his eyes. \u201cWe must be ready to fight!\u201d \n\nMei took a deep breath. \u201cLet\u2019s unite and protect the Hidden Grove!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe creatures cheered, their spirits lifting. They were ready to stand together. Hope blossomed in Mei\u2019s heart. The battle was coming, but they would face it together.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Mei and Taro need to do in this chapter?","options":["Defend the grove","Gather the creatures","Fly away","Hide from King Rion"],"correct_answer":"Gather the creatures"},{"question":"What animal does Taro turn into when they gather the creatures?","options":["A rabbit","An owl","A deer","A fairy"],"correct_answer":"An owl"},{"question":"What do the rabbits initially think they are?","options":["Too small","Too big","Too tired","Too brave"],"correct_answer":"Too small"},{"question":"What do the creatures do when Taro shows his fire?","options":["Run away","Fight each other","Cheer and feel inspired","Ignore him"],"correct_answer":"Cheer and feel inspired"},{"question":"What does Mei feel when the creatures unite?","options":["Sadness","Fear","Hope","Anger"],"correct_answer":"Hope"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_163_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_163_ch4_img1.png","plot_163_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":412,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
