   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_163_7_10","title":"The Guardian of the Hidden Grove","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Dragons & Creatures","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"The sun began to set over the Hidden Grove, painting the sky orange and pink. Mei gathered the magical creatures around her. \u201cWe must unite!\u201d she shouted, her voice full of hope. Taro, in his dragon form, flew above them, his scales shining like jewels.\n\n\u201cTogether, we are strong!\u201d Taro roared. \u201cBut we must act quickly!\u201d \n\nThe fairies flitted around nervously. \u201cWhat if King Rion finds us?\u201d one fairy asked, her wings trembling. \n\n\u201cWe\u2019ll be ready for him!\u201d Mei replied, her eyes sparkling with determination. \u201cLet\u2019s hide the grove\u2019s treasures and create a plan to defend it!\u201d\n\nAs they worked together, Mei felt a warm glow in her heart. The creatures buzzed with excitement. They formed teams\u2014some to hide the plants, others to set up defenses. The grove was alive with energy. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, Taro sniffed the air and growled. \u201cI smell something! The army is near!\u201d \n\n\u201cQuick! Everyone, take your places!\u201d Mei shouted. The creatures scrambled, hiding behind trees and bushes.\n\nJust then, a loud crash echoed through the grove. The ground shook. Mei\u2019s heart raced. \u201cThey\u2019re here!\u201d she cried.\n\nThe creatures huddled close, fear in their eyes. \u201cWhat do we do?\u201d a tiny voice squeaked. \n\n\u201cRemember why we fight!\u201d Mei exclaimed. \u201cThis is our home! We can\u2019t let them take it!\u201d\n\nWith one loud cheer, the creatures rallied. \u201cWe are brave! We are strong!\u201d they chanted. Taro soared into the sky, breathing a shimmer of light. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s show them the magic of the grove!\u201d he roared, and the creatures felt a surge of courage. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nMei stood tall. \u201cTogether, we will protect the Hidden Grove!\u201d \n\nAs the first soldiers from King Rion\u2019s army entered the grove, they stopped in their tracks. The enchanted creatures, shining with courage, stood ready to defend their home. \n\nThe battle for the grove was about to begin!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Mei and Taro need to do to protect the grove?","options":["Hide by themselves","Unite the creatures","Fly away","Make a loud noise"],"correct_answer":"Unite the creatures"},{"question":"What do the creatures chant to show their bravery?","options":["We are friends!","We are strong!","We are fast!","We are hidden!"],"correct_answer":"We are strong!"},{"question":"What happens when the army arrives?","options":["They run away","They find nothing","The creatures are ready","They start dancing"],"correct_answer":"The creatures are ready"},{"question":"How does Taro help the creatures?","options":["He hides them","He flies above them","He makes them disappear","He tells them to run"],"correct_answer":"He flies above them"},{"question":"What does Mei feel in her heart while they work together?","options":["Sadness","Anger","Warm glow","Fear"],"correct_answer":"Warm glow"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_163_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_163_ch5_img1.png","plot_163_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":315,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
