     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"forest","1":"courage","2":"friendship","3":"adventure","4":"magic","image_prompts":["A vibrant illustration of Jamie and Ember standing at the entrance of the enchanted forest. Jamie, a small boy with messy hair, looks excited yet nervous. Ember, a gentle dragon with shimmering scales, flutters her wings. Tall trees surround them, with bright flowers and birds visible in the background.","A colorful scene of Jamie and the townsfolk climbing the mountain. Dragons circle above, and the full moon shines brightly in the sky. Jamie laughs with joy, and the townsfolk cheer, showing their excitement and newfound bravery. The landscape is filled with vibrant colors, creating a magical atmosphere."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A serene image of Jamie and Ember standing at the edge of a vibrant enchanted forest, with soft sunlight filtering through the leaves, casting a golden hue on them. Jamie looks determined and hopeful, while Embers scales glimmer, reflecting the light like a gentle aurora.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_164_ch5_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 16:02:14"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing An intense scene depicting the townsfolk in a state of panic, some holding spears and others with fearful expressions, while Jamie stands protectively in front of Ember, who looks vulnerable yet resolute. The backdrop of the enchanted forest looms ominously, adding to the tension of the moment.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_164_ch5_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 16:02:14"}}}
