   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_164_7_10","title":"Beneath the Starlit Scales","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Dragons & Creatures","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Jamie lived in a small town called Willow Creek. It was a cozy place with colorful houses, blooming gardens, and friendly neighbors. But Jamie was shy. He often felt like a shadow, watching others play.\n\nOne sunny afternoon, Jamie walked home from school. As he passed the edge of the enchanted forest, he heard a loud crash. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Jamie wondered. He peeked through the trees and gasped. \n\nThere, in the clearing, was a dragon! Her scales shimmered like stars. She had bright orange eyes and wings that sparkled in the sunlight. \u201cOh no! I\u2019m in trouble!\u201d the dragon said, flapping her wings nervously. \n\n\u201cAre you okay?\u201d Jamie asked, stepping closer. \u201cI\u2019m Jamie.\u201d \n\n\u201cI\u2019m Ember,\u201d the dragon replied softly. \u201cI accidentally landed here. Now I can\u2019t find my way home!\u201d \n\nJamie\u2019s heart raced. He had always dreamed of meeting a dragon. But he also felt scared. \u201cWhere is your home?\u201d \n\n\u201cBeneath the Starlit Cave,\u201d Ember said, looking worried. \u201cI need to get there before the full moon rises tonight.\u201d \n\nJamie looked at the sky. The sun was starting to set. \u201cI can help you!\u201d he said, surprising himself. \u201cBut the townsfolk might see you. They won\u2019t understand!\u201d\n\n\u201cThat\u2019s okay,\u201d Ember said with a gentle smile. \u201cYou\u2019re not afraid, are you?\u201d \n\n\u201cUm, a little,\u201d Jamie admitted, scratching his head. \u201cBut I want to help.\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, they heard voices in the distance. \u201cDid you hear that crash?\u201d someone shouted. \u201cIt\u2019s dangerous!\u201d \n\n\u201cOh no! We must hurry!\u201d Ember said, flapping her wings. \n\n\u201cWait!\u201d Jamie said, feeling a rush of courage. \u201cWe can\u2019t let them see you!\u201d \n\nThey hid behind a large tree as the townsfolk came closer. Jamie\u2019s heart thumped loudly in his chest. \n\n\u201cWhat if they think you\u2019re a monster?\u201d Jamie whispered. \n\n\u201cI\u2019m not a monster!\u201d Ember replied, her eyes sparkling. \u201cI\u2019m just a lost dragon.\u201d\n\n\u201cOkay,\u201d Jamie said, breathing deeply. \u201cLet\u2019s find a way to get you home.\u201d \n\nAs the sun dipped below the horizon, Jamie felt the magic of friendship blooming. Together, they could face anything. But time was running out. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Jamie said with determination.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the name of the town where Jamie lives?","options":["Willow Creek","Sunnydale","Dragon's Nest","Forest Town"],"correct_answer":"Willow Creek"},{"question":"What is the name of the dragon?","options":["Sparkle","Ember","Flame","Glitter"],"correct_answer":"Ember"},{"question":"What does Ember need to find?","options":["A new friend","Food","Her way home","A place to sleep"],"correct_answer":"Her way home"},{"question":"What is Jamie's biggest challenge?","options":["Climbing a mountain","Facing the townsfolk","Finding food","Making a new friend"],"correct_answer":"Facing the townsfolk"},{"question":"How does Jamie feel about Ember at first?","options":["Excited","Scared","Angry","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Scared"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_164_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_164_ch1_img1.png","plot_164_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":368,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
