   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_164_7_10","title":"Beneath the Starlit Scales","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Dragons & Creatures","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Chapter 3: The Town's Fear\n\nJamie and Ember stood at the edge of the enchanted forest. The sunlight peeked through the leaves, casting dappled shadows on the ground. \u201cWe need to go through the town,\u201d Jamie said, his voice trembling. \u201cBut the townsfolk are scared of dragons!\u201d\n\n\u201cThey don\u2019t know me,\u201d Ember replied, her bright eyes shining. \u201cI\u2019m not dangerous!\u201d\n\nJust then, Jamie heard voices nearby. \u201cDid you see that? A dragon! It could burn down the whole town!\u201d shouted a man.\n\nJamie\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWe have to hurry!\u201d he urged. They crept forward, sticking to the trees. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, a loud crash echoed from the town square. Jamie peered through the bushes. A crowd had gathered, pointing and shouting. Mrs. Hargrove stood at the front, her hands on her hips. \u201cThat beast must be stopped! It\u2019s a threat!\u201d \n\nJamie felt the weight of fear on his chest. \u201cWhat if they hurt her?\u201d he whispered. Ember flicked her tail nervously. \n\n\u201cI can\u2019t let them do that,\u201d Ember said softly. \u201cBut how?\u201d\n\nJamie thought hard. \u201cMaybe if we show them you\u2019re friendly, they\u2019ll understand.\u201d\n\n\u201cOkay!\u201d Ember nodded, determination filling her eyes. \u201cLet\u2019s do this!\u201d\n\nThey stepped into the open. The townsfolk gasped. \u201cLook! There it is!\u201d a boy cried out. \n\nMrs. Hargrove frowned. \u201cGet back! It\u2019s dangerous!\u201d \n\nBut Jamie took a deep breath. \u201cWait! Ember is not dangerous! She just wants to go home!\u201d \n\nThe crowd murmured, some looking unsure. Jamie took a step forward. \u201cShe saved me! She helped me fly over a tree!\u201d \n\n\u201cWhat if she burns down our homes?\u201d someone yelled.\n\n\u201cShe won\u2019t!\u201d Jamie shouted back. \u201cEmber is gentle! Please, give her a chance!\u201d \n\nJust then, Ember let out a small puff of sparkly smoke. It floated into the air, shimmering in the sunlight. The townsfolk gasped, eyes wide with wonder. \n\n\u201cSee? Look how beautiful it is!\u201d Jamie said, hoping to win them over. But Mrs. Hargrove stepped forward, her face hard. \n\n\u201cI don\u2019t believe you, boy. Dragons can\u2019t be trusted!\u201d \n\nJamie felt his heart sink. \u201cBut she\u2019s my friend!\u201d he cried. \u201cWe need to help her!\u201d\n\nTension hung in the air. Would they listen? Would they help Ember? Jamie\u2019s hopes hung by a thread as he faced the crowd. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe full moon was rising. Time was running out.\n\n\u201cPlease!\u201d Jamie begged. \u201cWe have to help her get home before nightfall!\u201d\n\nThe crowd stared, unsure, as the first stars began to twinkle above.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Jamie want the townsfolk to see about Ember?","options":["She is dangerous","She can fly","She is friendly","She is lost"],"correct_answer":"She is friendly"},{"question":"Who is leading the crowd against Ember?","options":["A boy","A man","Mrs. Hargrove","A dragon"],"correct_answer":"Mrs. Hargrove"},{"question":"What happens when Ember puffs out sparkly smoke?","options":["It scares the townsfolk","It makes everyone laugh","It creates wonder","It turns Jamie into a dragon"],"correct_answer":"It creates wonder"},{"question":"What does Jamie feel when he faces the townsfolk?","options":["Bravery","Happiness","Fear","Excitement"],"correct_answer":"Bravery"},{"question":"What is happening as Jamie talks to the crowd?","options":["The sun is setting","The full moon is rising","It starts to rain","More dragons arrive"],"correct_answer":"The full moon is rising"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_164_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_164_ch3_img1.png","plot_164_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":421,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
