   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_164_7_10","title":"Beneath the Starlit Scales","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Dragons & Creatures","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Jamie took a deep breath. The enchanted forest loomed ahead, tall trees reaching for the sky. Ember fluttered her wings, shimmering in the dappled sunlight. \n\n\"Are you ready, Ember?\" Jamie asked nervously.\n\n\"Ready as I'll ever be!\" Ember replied, her voice soft and warm. \n\nThe townsfolk stood close behind them. Mrs. Hargrove stepped forward. \"We can do this, Jamie. We are stronger together!\" \n\nWith a smile, Jamie nodded. The group ventured into the forest, filled with excitement and a touch of fear.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThey walked deeper into the woods. Jamie pointed out the sparkling flowers and singing birds. \"Look at that!\" he said, his heart racing with joy. \n\n\"Wow! It\u2019s beautiful!\" Ember gasped, her eyes sparkling like the stars above.\n\nSuddenly, a rustle echoed from the bushes. Jamie jumped. The townsfolk looked worried. \"What was that?\" one of them whispered.\n\n\"It\u2019s okay!\" Jamie shouted. \"We\u2019re all together. Let\u2019s find out!\" \n\nSlowly, a little rabbit hopped out from the bushes. It twitched its nose and stared at them with big, curious eyes.\n\n\"See? Nothing to fear,\" Jamie chuckled, feeling braver.\n\nAfter a while, they reached a clearing. The full moon shone brightly, lighting everything in silver. \"We need to hurry!\" Jamie said, glancing at Ember. \n\nThe townsfolk nodded, determined to help. Just then, they heard a loud roar. It was a group of dragons! Ember's eyes widened with surprise. \n\n\"Are they here to help us?\" she asked, a mix of excitement and fear in her voice.\n\n\"Let\u2019s find out!\" Jamie responded, stepping forward. \n\nAs the dragons landed gracefully, Jamie shouted, \"We need to return Ember to her cave before moonrise!\"\n\nThe lead dragon lowered his head. \"We will help you, little boy.\"\n\nWith newfound courage, Jamie felt ready. Together, they raced toward the mountain, the townsfolk and dragons united for Ember. \n\n\"I never knew I could be this brave,\" Jamie thought, feeling proud. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAs they climbed higher, Jamie laughed. \"This is the best adventure ever!\" The townsfolk cheered, their fears melted away.\n\nAt last, they reached Ember's Starlit Cave. It sparkled with dazzling colors, just like Ember herself. \"Thank you, Jamie,\" she said, her voice filled with joy. \n\n\"You showed us the magic of friendship,\" a townsfolk exclaimed, smiling at Jamie.\n\nJamie beamed. \"And together, we can face anything!\"\n\nAs the moon hung high in the sky, Jamie knew he could always be brave, especially with friends by his side.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Jamie and Ember find in the forest?","options":["A scary monster","A little rabbit","A treasure chest","A lost bird"],"correct_answer":"A little rabbit"},{"question":"Who stepped forward to encourage Jamie?","options":["Mr. Smith","Mrs. Hargrove","The mayor","A dragon"],"correct_answer":"Mrs. Hargrove"},{"question":"What did Jamie feel as they climbed higher?","options":["Scared","Bored","Brave","Sleepy"],"correct_answer":"Brave"},{"question":"What did the lead dragon say to Jamie?","options":["We won\u2019t help you","We will help you","Stay back","Go home"],"correct_answer":"We will help you"},{"question":"What was Jamie's final feeling about bravery?","options":["He didn't like it","He was always afraid","He felt proud","He forgot about it"],"correct_answer":"He felt proud"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_164_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_164_ch5_img1.png","plot_164_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":407,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
