     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"courage","1":"glimmering","2":"resonant","3":"skepticism","4":"flutter","image_prompts":["A picturesque view of a quaint town bordered by an enchanted forest, with Jamie, a shy boy with tousled hair and wide eyes, standing on the porch, gazing up at the magnificent red dragon Ember. The dragon\u2019s wings are spread, shimmering scales catch the sunlight, and the sky is filled with the golden hues of a late afternoon.","Jamie standing at the edge of the field, glancing back towards the town as the sounds of the festival grow louder. Ember, with her vibrant scales, is crouched low, looking concerned. The sun is setting behind them, casting long shadows, and the excitement of the townsfolk can be felt in the air, creating a tense yet magical atmosphere."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A serene view of the quaint town of Eldergrove at dusk with the Misty Mountains in the background. A young boy, Jamie, stands at his open window, gazing outside as golden sunlight fades into a deep indigo sky. His expression is one of wonder and curiosity, hinting at the adventure that awaits him.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_164_ch1_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 16:05:26"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dramatic scene as Ember, the dragon, stands amidst the enchanted forest, her scales shimmering under the moonlight. Jamie stands beside her, his face a mix of determination and fear. The surrounding trees create an almost magical atmosphere, with beams of moonlight illuminating their path forward, capturing the tension and excitement of their escape.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_164_ch1_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 16:05:26"}}}
