     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"empathy","1":"courage","2":"awe","3":"determination","4":"united","image_prompts":["A sweeping view of the quaint town of Willow Creek at dusk, with Jamie standing alongside Ember in his backyard. Ember, a dragon with iridescent scales, is curled up protectively. The warm glow from the sunset reflects off her scales, creating a magical atmosphere. Jamie gazes up at her, filled with determination and hope.","A dynamic scene of Ember soaring through the twilight sky, her wings spread wide and scales shimmering with colors. Jamie stands below in the town square, looking up with awe as the townspeople watch in amazement. The mix of fear and wonder on their faces creates a moment of tension and discovery."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A serene forest clearing bathed in soft golden morning light, with Jamie standing confidently beside Ember, the gentle dragon. The sunlight filters through the leaves, casting dappled patterns on the ground. Jamies expression is one of determination, while Embers eyes reflect warmth and gentleness. In the background, Mrs. Hargrove is silhouetted, confronting the unexpected scene before her.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_164_ch4_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 16:03:10"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A moment of tension in the forest as Embers head turns sharply towards a rustling noise in the bushes. The atmosphere is thick with anticipation, the sunlight illuminating the clearing while shadows flicker beneath the trees. Jamies body language shows alertness, eyes wide with a mix of fear and resolve, while Embers posture is protective and poised for action, hinting at an impending revelation or conflict.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filen