   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_165_7_10","title":"The Dragon's Apprentice","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Dragons & Creatures","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Elara stood at the edge of the Great Dragon Arena. It was huge! Bright banners flapped in the wind. Excited crowds filled the stands, cheering for their favorite dragons. \n\n\u201cLook at all those people!\u201d Elara said to Vortex. \u201cThis is amazing!\u201d\n\nVortex folded his wings and snorted. \u201cWhat if I trip over my own feet?\u201d he asked, his voice full of doubt.\n\nElara placed her hand on his shiny blue scales. \u201cYou won\u2019t trip! We\u2019re a team, remember?\u201d\n\nJust then, Kael, the rival apprentice, strutted by. His dragon, a sleek black beast named Shadow, glared at them. Kael smirked and said, \u201cGood luck, Elara. You\u2019ll need it!\u201d\n\nElara felt her heart race. \u201cWhat does he mean by that?\u201d she wondered. Vortex growled softly. \u201cDon\u2019t worry about him. We\u2019ll show him what we can do!\u201d\n\nAs they practiced their moves, Vortex struggled. He flapped his wings and soared into the sky, but then he wobbled and almost fell. Elara gasped. \u201cVortex! Pull up!\u201d \n\nHe barely caught himself. \u201cThat was close,\u201d he said, panting. \u201cI\u2019m not ready for the Games.\u201d\n\nElara shook her head. \u201cWe can do this. We just need to practice more.\u201d \n\nJust then, a loud horn blared. \u201cTime for the first challenge!\u201d the announcer boomed. Elara felt a rush of nerves. \u201cWhat will it be?\u201d she asked.\n\nVortex rumbled, \u201cI hope it\u2019s something easy.\u201d \n\nThe announcer continued, \u201cAll apprentices must show their best flight tricks! The crowd will decide who moves on!\u201d\n\nElara\u2019s stomach twisted. She wanted to impress everyone, especially Vortex. \u201cWhat if we mess up?\u201d she whispered.\n\nVortex looked into her eyes. \u201cWe won\u2019t. Remember, we\u2019re partners.\u201d\n\nWith a determined nod, they took their positions. Suddenly, a shadow darkened the sky. A giant bird swooped down, flapping its wings wildly. \n\n\u201cWatch out!\u201d Elara cried. The crowd gasped. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nVortex spread his wings wide. \u201cWe can\u2019t let it distract us! Focus, Elara!\u201d\n\nElara nodded. \u201cLet\u2019s show them our best!\u201d \n\nAs the bird circled above, Vortex took a deep breath. He soared into the air, twisting and turning. Elara clung to his back tightly. They had to impress the crowd!\n\nBut the bird swooped low again, flapping wildly. \u201cLook out!\u201d Elara shouted. They needed to dodge! \n\nVortex glanced back. \u201cHold on!\u201d With a sudden dive, they dodged the bird, performing a perfect roll.\n\nThe crowd roared with applause! Elara felt excitement fill her heart. \u201cWe did it, Vortex!\u201d she cheered.\n\nBut just then, Kael\u2019s voice rang out, \u201cNot bad, but you\u2019ll have to do better than that!\u201d \n\nElara\u2019s smile faded. They had a long way to go. What other challenges awaited them?\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What challenge do Elara and Vortex face first?","options":["A flying race","Flight tricks","A treasure hunt","A dance contest"],"correct_answer":"Flight tricks"},{"question":"What does Kael say to Elara?","options":["Good luck!","You\u2019ll need it!","You\u2019re amazing!","Watch out!"],"correct_answer":"You\u2019ll need it!"},{"question":"What animal distracts Elara and Vortex during their performance?","options":["A dragon","A giant bird","A cat","A squirrel"],"correct_answer":"A giant bird"},{"question":"How does Vortex feel about the challenge at first?","options":["Excited","Nervous","Angry","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Nervous"},{"question":"How does Elara encourage Vortex?","options":["By laughing","By saying they are a team","By telling him to fly faster","By ignoring him"],"correct_answer":"By saying they are a team"}]},"images":null,"word_count":451,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
