   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_165_7_10","title":"The Dragon's Apprentice","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Dragons & Creatures","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Elara stood at the edge of the Great Dragon Arena. The sun shone brightly, making the colorful flags flutter in the wind. Vortex was by her side, his scales glimmering like jewels. Today was a new day, and they were ready to train harder than ever.\n\n\u201cAre you ready, Vortex?\u201d Elara asked, her heart racing with excitement.\n\nVortex puffed out a small cloud of smoke. \u201cReady as I\u2019ll ever be! But let\u2019s not fall into any more traps this time.\u201d\n\nElara laughed. \u201cNo traps! Just teamwork!\u201d\n\nThey began their training, practicing their take-off and landing. Elara climbed onto Vortex\u2019s back. \u201cLet\u2019s show everyone what we can do!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nWith a powerful flap of his wings, Vortex took off. The wind rushed past them, and Elara felt free. They soared above the arena, diving and gliding. Elara shouted with joy, \u201cLook at us, Vortex! We\u2019re amazing!\u201d\n\nBut suddenly, Vortex hesitated. \u201cWhat if we mess up again? What if I fail?\u201d he asked, his voice trembling.\n\nElara looked into his deep, worried eyes. \u201cWe won\u2019t! We are a team. Remember what we found in the Rocky Peaks? That shiny object is our lucky charm!\u201d\n\nVortex nodded slowly, but doubt lingered in his heart. They landed to take a break, and Elara pulled out the shiny object. It sparkled in the sunlight, filling them with hope.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s keep this close,\u201d Elara said. \u201cIt reminds us that we can do anything together.\u201d\n\nAs they trained, Kael approached with a sly grin. \u201cYou two think you can win the Games? You\u2019re just a girl and a loser dragon!\u201d\n\nElara felt a surge of anger. \u201cWe\u2019ll show you! We\u2019re not afraid of you!\u201d\n\n\u201cGood luck, then!\u201d Kael laughed as he walked away, leaving Elara and Vortex feeling more determined.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s work harder, Vortex!\u201d Elara said, her voice full of fire.\n\nThey practiced their moves again and again. Elara felt herself growing stronger, and Vortex began to trust himself more. They were ready to face any challenge.\n\nAs the sun set, they knew they had each other, and that was enough. They looked toward the sky, filled with colors of orange and pink.\n\n\u201cTomorrow, we will shine!\u201d Elara declared. \n\n\u201cTomorrow!\u201d Vortex echoed, their spirits high.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nBut the shadow of Kael and the Games loomed ahead. Elara wrapped her arms around Vortex, ready for the adventure that awaited them.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Elara and Vortex practice in the arena?","options":["Taking photos","Take-off and landing","Flying kites","Building nests"],"correct_answer":"Take-off and landing"},{"question":"What special object do Elara and Vortex find in the Rocky Peaks?","options":["A shiny rock","A feather","A lucky charm","A map"],"correct_answer":"A lucky charm"},{"question":"Who challenges Elara and Vortex?","options":["A friendly dragon","Kael","The judges","Their trainer"],"correct_answer":"Kael"},{"question":"What does Vortex struggle with during training?","options":["His size","His strength","His confidence","His speed"],"correct_answer":"His confidence"},{"question":"What do Elara and Vortex decide to do to prepare for the Games?","options":["Give up","Work harder together","Practice alone","Fly away"],"correct_answer":"Work harder together"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_165_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_165_ch4_img1.png","plot_165_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":405,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
