   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_165_7_10","title":"The Dragon's Apprentice","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Dragons & Creatures","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Elara and Vortex stood at the edge of the Great Dragon Games arena. It was a bright, sunny day, and the colorful flags fluttered in the wind. Elara felt a mix of excitement and nerves. \"Look at all those people!\" she exclaimed, her eyes wide. Vortex puffed out his chest. \"Let\u2019s show them what we can do!\" \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they practiced their first maneuver, the crowd cheered. Elara climbed onto Vortex\u2019s back. \u201cReady?\u201d she shouted. Vortex nodded, determined to make their practice perfect. They soared into the sky, twisting and diving through fluffy clouds. \u201cThis is amazing!\u201d Elara laughed as the wind whipped through her hair.\n\nBut then, they noticed Kael below. He was practicing with his dragon, Shadow, and he smirked at them. \u201cYou think you can win? You\u2019re just a beginner!\u201d Kael taunted. Elara felt a shiver of doubt. Could they really compete with seasoned apprentices like Kael?\n\nVortex sensed her worry. \u201cDon\u2019t listen to him, Elara. We just need to work together,\u201d he said, his voice strong. \u201cWe are a team!\u201d \n\nElara took a deep breath. \u201cYou\u2019re right! Let\u2019s do this!\u201d They practiced more, focusing on their teamwork. Each time they flew, they felt a little stronger together. \n\nAs the sun began to set, it was time for the final practice round. \u201cThis is our moment, Vortex!\u201d Elara cried. \u201cLet\u2019s show everyone who we are!\u201d \n\nWith confidence, they launched into the air. They spun and twirled, weaving through the shimmering lakes. Just then, Vortex spotted a large rock formation ahead. \u201cElara, hold tight!\u201d he roared, dodging the rocks with a swoop. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThey landed safely, both panting but thrilled. \u201cWe did it!\u201d Elara shouted. \u201cThat was incredible!\u201d Vortex smiled, no longer feeling insecure. \u201cWe can do this, Elara. Together!\u201d\n\nAs the sun sank below the horizon, the arena glowed with excitement for the Great Dragon Games. Elara felt ready. They had faced their fears and come out stronger. \u201cTomorrow, we\u2019ll show everyone what we can do!\u201d she declared with a grin.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Elara and Vortex practice in this chapter?","options":["Flying maneuvers","Cooking","Cleaning","Swimming"],"correct_answer":"Flying maneuvers"},{"question":"Who is their rival in the story?","options":["Kael","Zara","Milo","Brock"],"correct_answer":"Kael"},{"question":"What does Vortex do to help Elara feel better?","options":["Ignore her","Encourage her","Scold her","Leave her alone"],"correct_answer":"Encourage her"},{"question":"What happens when they practice their flying?","options":["They crash into a rock","They feel stronger together","They get lost","They fall asleep"],"correct_answer":"They feel stronger together"},{"question":"How does Elara feel at the end of the chapter?","options":["Nervous","Excited","Bored","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"}]},"images":null,"word_count":344,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
