   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_156_7_10","title":"The Wishing Tree Academy","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Magic School","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Mira stood at the edge of the Enchanted Forest. The trees were tall and twisted, their leaves glowing in shades of green and gold. It was here that she found the Wishing Tree Academy. \n\n\u201cAre you ready, Mira?\u201d Lila asked, her eyes sparkling with excitement.\n\n\u201cMore than ready!\u201d Mira replied. She felt a flutter in her stomach. Today was the day she would learn about magic.\n\nAs they walked towards the academy, Felix zipped past them, giggling. \u201cLast one there has to clean the potion lab!\u201d he shouted, his brown hair flying in the breeze.\n\nMira and Lila exchanged looks. \u201cOh no, he\u2019s not getting away that easily!\u201d Mira exclaimed. They ran after him, laughing and weaving through the trees.\n\nThe Wishing Tree Academy was a sight to behold. It was made of wooden beams and colorful stones. Vines climbed up the walls, and flowers bloomed everywhere. A giant tree stood proudly in the center, its branches heavy with shimmering fruits. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cWow!\u201d Lila said, gazing at the tree. \u201cDo you think it really grants wishes?\u201d\n\nMira nodded, her heart racing. \u201cI hope so! I have so many wishes!\u201d\n\nWhen they reached the entrance, a kind-looking woman greeted them. \u201cWelcome to the Wishing Tree Academy! I\u2019m Headmistress Willow. Here, you will learn to communicate with magical creatures and harness the power of wishes.\u201d\n\nMira felt a warm glow inside her. This was where she belonged! \n\nBut as they walked inside, a strange feeling settled in her chest. \u201cWhat if something goes wrong?\u201d she whispered to Lila.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s just focus on having fun!\u201d Lila replied, her smile brightening the room.\n\nSuddenly, Felix popped up behind them. \u201cI bet I can make a wish that goes wrong!\u201d he challenged with a mischievous grin.\n\nMira frowned. \u201cDon\u2019t you dare, Felix!\u201d\n\nBut Felix was already running towards the Wishing Tree. \u201cI wish for a million bouncing puppies!\u201d he shouted.\n\nWith a flash, the ground shook. A swirl of magic surrounded Felix, and soon, puppies began to bounce everywhere! [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nMira gasped. \u201cOh no! This could get out of control!\u201d\n\nLila laughed, but Mira knew they had to find a way to fix it. Wishes were serious business!\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s help Felix!\u201d Mira said, her determination rising. \u201cWe need to learn how to control this magic before it gets wild!\u201d\n\nWith that, the three friends jumped into action, ready to save their school and each other.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Felix wish for?","options":["A million bouncing puppies","A million kittens","A magic wand","A giant cake"],"correct_answer":"A million bouncing puppies"},{"question":"Who is the Headmistress of the Wishing Tree Academy?","options":["Miss Maple","Mrs. Willow","Ms. Rose","Ms. Daisy"],"correct_answer":"Mrs. Willow"},{"question":"How does Mira feel about learning magic?","options":["Nervous","Excited","Angry","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Excited"},{"question":"What does Lila suggest they focus on?","options":["Having fun","Learning spells","Making wishes","Finding Felix"],"correct_answer":"Having fun"},{"question":"What kind of tree is at the center of the academy?","options":["A wishing tree","An apple tree","A cherry tree","A pine tree"],"correct_answer":"A wishing tree"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_156_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_156_ch1_img1.png","plot_156_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":407,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
