   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_156_7_10","title":"The Wishing Tree Academy","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Magic School","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Mira stood at the entrance of the Wishing Tree Academy, her eyes wide with wonder. The tall, twisted trees curled around the school, their leaves shimmering with a golden glow. She could hear the soft whispers of magic in the air.\n\n\u201cLook at that!\u201d Mira pointed to a group of students gathered by a sparkling fountain. \u201cWhat are they doing?\u201d\n\nLila, her best friend, bounced on her toes. \u201cLet\u2019s go see!\u201d \n\nAs they approached, Felix appeared out of nowhere, wearing a big grin. \u201cI just wished for a sea of puppies! It worked!\u201d He pointed proudly to the rolling, wagging puppies bouncing around the courtyard.\n\n\u201cOh no! Puppies everywhere!\u201d Mira gasped, watching the chaos unfold. Some puppies chased their tails while others tried to climb the fountain.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cFelix, what were you thinking?\u201d Lila asked, trying to catch a puppy with big floppy ears. \u201cThis is going to be a mess!\u201d\n\nFelix shrugged. \u201cIt\u2019s just a bit of fun!\u201d\n\nMira frowned. \u201cBut what if someone gets hurt? We need to manage our wishes better!\u201d\n\nJust then, a loud bark echoed from the fountain. A puppy jumped into the air, splashing water all over Felix. Mira couldn\u2019t help but giggle. \u201cLooks like you\u2019re the one who\u2019s wet now!\u201d\n\nFelix laughed too, but then his laughter turned serious. \u201cOkay, okay! I\u2019ll help. Let\u2019s gather the puppies!\u201d\n\nThey started rounding up the bouncing puppies, but as they worked, Mira noticed something strange. A shadow flitted between the trees. It didn\u2019t look like a puppy or a student.\n\n\u201cDid you see that?\u201d Mira whispered, her heart racing. \u201cSomething\u2019s watching us.\u201d\n\nLila\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cWhat if it\u2019s a creature from the stories?\u201d\n\nFelix rolled his eyes. \u201cYou\u2019re just scared!\u201d\n\n\u201cNo, I\u2019m serious! We need to find out what it is,\u201d Mira said, determination in her voice. She knew they had to protect their school and the magic of the Wishing Tree.\n\n\u201cBut how?\u201d Lila asked, clutching a puppy close to her chest.\n\nMira took a deep breath. \u201cWe\u2019ll follow it. Together.\u201d\n\nJust as they turned to follow the shadow, the puppies began to bark in a frenzy. Mira\u2019s heart raced. \u201cThis is going to be harder than I thought!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nFelix nodded. \u201cBut we can do it! Let\u2019s go!\u201d\n\nThey dashed toward the trees, chasing the shadow and hoping to uncover the mystery waiting for them.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Felix wish for?","options":["A sea of puppies","A flying dragon","A magic wand","A treasure chest"],"correct_answer":"A sea of puppies"},{"question":"What does Mira notice while rounding up the puppies?","options":["A cat watching them","A shadow moving in the trees","A rainbow in the sky","A bird singing"],"correct_answer":"A shadow moving in the trees"},{"question":"How does Lila respond to the chaos?","options":["She wants to leave","She tries to catch a puppy","She starts crying","She makes a wish"],"correct_answer":"She tries to catch a puppy"},{"question":"What is Mira determined to do?","options":["Make more wishes","Find out what the shadow is","Eat lunch","Go home"],"correct_answer":"Find out what the shadow is"},{"question":"What happens to Felix during the puppy chaos?","options":["He falls asleep","He gets wet","He finds a treasure","He loses a puppy"],"correct_answer":"He gets wet"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_156_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_156_ch2_img1.png","plot_156_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":409,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
