   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_156_7_10","title":"The Wishing Tree Academy","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Magic School","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Mira stood in the courtyard of the Wishing Tree Academy. The sun peeked through fluffy clouds, making the leaves sparkle. She felt excitement bubbling inside her. \u201cToday is the day!\u201d she declared. Lila and Felix hopped around her, their faces full of hope.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s practice our wishes!\u201d Lila said, pulling out her potion-making kit. She had a special potion that helped wishes come true. \u201cI made this just for you, Mira!\u201d \n\n\u201cThanks, Lila!\u201d Mira replied. She was ready to try again. But Felix smirked, \u201cWhat if we make an even bigger wish? Like... a kingdom of puppies!\u201d\n\n\u201cFelix!\u201d Mira gasped. \u201cWe need to be careful!\u201d But Felix was already pouring his potion. Suddenly, a loud BANG echoed through the courtyard. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nIn an instant, a whirlwind of puppies burst forth, barking and tumbling everywhere. \u201cOh no! Not again!\u201d Mira shouted, chasing after them. \n\nLila giggled, \u201cThis is a bit chaotic, don\u2019t you think?\u201d \n\nFelix dodged a puppy leaping his way. \u201cThis is the best kind of chaos!\u201d he laughed.\n\nBut then, Mira saw something shadowy flit between the trees. Her heart raced. \u201cDid you see that?\u201d she asked, pointing. \n\n\u201cWhat?\u201d Lila squinted. \u201cI didn\u2019t see anything.\u201d\n\n\u201cYes, there was something!\u201d Mira insisted. Suddenly, the ground shook beneath them, and the puppies barked louder than ever. \n\nMira\u2019s hands trembled. \u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d \n\nFelix panicked, \u201cI think the tree doesn\u2019t like our wishes!\u201d \n\nJust then, the shadow reappeared, growing larger and darker. It loomed over them, whispering softly, \u201cYour wishes have consequences\u2026\u201d\n\nMira felt a chill. \u201cWe need to stop making wishes!\u201d she shouted. \u201cWe have to find out who that is!\u201d \n\nBut Felix was still trying to catch the puppies. \u201cI can\u2019t just let them go!\u201d\n\n\u201cFelix, listen!\u201d Mira said urgently. \u201cWe\u2019re in danger! We have to work together!\u201d \n\nLila nodded, \u201cLet\u2019s go investigate. We can\u2019t let the tree suffer because of our mistakes.\u201d\n\nThe shadow flickered again, darting behind the tree. They had to follow it. With courage, Mira took a step forward. \u201cWe\u2019ll find out what\u2019s going on. Together!\u201d\n\nAs they moved closer to the tree, the shadow disappeared into the thick branches. \u201cWhere did it go?\u201d Felix asked, looking worried.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know,\u201d Mira whispered. \u201cBut we can\u2019t turn back now.\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWhat if their next wish was their last?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Mira, Lila, and Felix try to practice at the academy?","options":["Making potions","Making wishes","Catching puppies","Playing games"],"correct_answer":"Making wishes"},{"question":"What does Felix wish for this time?","options":["A kingdom of puppies","A treasure chest","A flying carpet","A magic wand"],"correct_answer":"A kingdom of puppies"},{"question":"What do Mira and her friends see that scares them?","options":["A dragon","A shadow","A giant puppy","A fairy"],"correct_answer":"A shadow"},{"question":"What do they decide to do when the shadow appears?","options":["Run away","Ignore it","Follow it","Make another wish"],"correct_answer":"Follow it"},{"question":"What feeling does Mira experience when the ground shakes?","options":["Happiness","Excitement","Fear","Sleepiness"],"correct_answer":"Fear"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_156_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_156_ch3_img1.png","plot_156_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":397,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
