   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_156_7_10","title":"The Wishing Tree Academy","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Magic School","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Mira, Lila, and Felix gathered in the cozy library of the Wishing Tree Academy. The sun streamed through the tall windows, casting golden light on the bookshelves. Mira's heart raced. They needed to find a way to fix the wishes gone wrong.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s think!\u201d Mira said, tapping her chin. \u201cWhat do we know about the tree?\u201d\n\nLila flipped through a thick book. \u201cIt says the Wishing Tree has a secret. But the secret is hidden.\u201d\n\nFelix leaned back in his chair, grinning. \u201cMaybe we can wish for a hint! Wait\u2014no! That might go wrong!\u201d\n\nMira giggled. \u201cGood call, Felix. We need to be careful.\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a rustle came from behind the shelves. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] A small, furry creature peeked out. It had big eyes and a fluffy tail.\n\n\u201cIs that a Wish Sprout?\u201d Felix asked, eyes wide.\n\n\u201cYes! They help the tree share its magic,\u201d Lila said. \u201cMaybe it knows something!\u201d\n\nThe Wish Sprout hopped closer, bouncing with excitement. \u201cWish away, friends! But be wise!\u201d\n\n\u201cDo you know the tree's secret?\u201d Mira asked, kneeling down.\n\nThe Wish Sprout nodded, its tail twitching. \u201cThe tree was hurt long ago. One wish turned dark.\u201d\n\nMira gasped. \u201cA dark wish? What happened?\u201d\n\n\u201cIt caused shadows!\u201d the Wish Sprout squeaked. \u201cSome wishers turned mean! You must be careful!\u201d\n\nMira exchanged worried looks with her friends. \u201cWe have to stop the dark wishes. But how?\u201d\n\nJust then, a cold breeze swept through the library. The lights flickered. \u201cI think we\u2019re not alone,\u201d Lila whispered.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go outside!\u201d Felix suggested, trying to sound brave. \u201cWe\u2019ll figure it out there!\u201d\n\nThey hurried outside, feeling the fresh air on their faces. The Wishing Tree towered nearby, its branches swaying gently. Mira felt a spark of hope. \u201cMaybe we can heal the tree!\u201d\n\nJust then, the ground shook. A shadow loomed over them. \u201cYou\u2019re too late!\u201d a voice growled.\n\nMira's heart raced. \u201cWho are you?\u201d she shouted.\n\n\u201cI am the shadow of the past,\u201d it sneered. \u201cThis magic is mine!\u201d\n\n\u201cNot if we can help it!\u201d Lila said, her hands ready with potions.\n\nFelix grinned, his eyes shining. \u201cLet\u2019s show this shadow what we can do!\u201d\n\nWith determination, they stepped forward, ready to face the challenge ahead. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2] \n\nTogether, they would find a way to protect the Wishing Tree and their school.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did the Wish Sprout say about the tree?","options":["It gives endless wishes","It has a dark past","It is a friendly creature","It can fly"],"correct_answer":"It has a dark past"},{"question":"What did Mira want to learn about?","options":["The history of the academy","How to make potions","The tree's secret","How to wish better"],"correct_answer":"The tree's secret"},{"question":"What happened when they were outside?","options":["They found treasure","A shadow appeared","They made a wish","They saw a dragon"],"correct_answer":"A shadow appeared"},{"question":"Who thought of going outside?","options":["Lila","Felix","Mira","The Wish Sprout"],"correct_answer":"Felix"},{"question":"What emotion did Mira feel when the shadow appeared?","options":["Happy","Excited","Worried","Confused"],"correct_answer":"Worried"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_156_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_156_ch4_img1.png","plot_156_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":391,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
