   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_156_7_10","title":"The Wishing Tree Academy","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Magic School","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Mira, Lila, and Felix stood in front of the Wishing Tree. Its branches swayed gently, whispering secrets. The air was filled with a sweet, floral scent. \n\n\u201cI think we need to make our final wish,\u201d Mira said, her voice steady. \u201cWe can\u2019t let the shadow control the tree.\u201d\n\n\u201cI agree!\u201d Lila added, her eyes bright with determination. \u201cWe must protect our home!\u201d\n\nFelix grinned mischievously. \u201cI hope this one doesn\u2019t bring any more puppies!\u201d \n\nThey laughed, but fear lurked in their hearts. They had learned about the tree\u2019s past. The shadow was a wish gone wrong, created by someone who wanted power. \n\n\u201cWe should wish for the shadow to go away and bring back the tree's magic!\u201d Mira suggested.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s gather around,\u201d said Lila, holding out her potion bottle. It sparkled in the sunlight. \u201cWe can mix our energies!\u201d\n\nThey formed a circle. Mira closed her eyes tightly. \u201cI wish for the shadow to disappear!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, the wind howled. The shadow loomed larger, swirling around them. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cStay strong!\u201d Felix shouted. \u201cWe can do this together!\u201d \n\nAs they held hands, the air shimmered with magic. The tree glowed brighter, its leaves sparkling like stars. \n\n\u201cFeel the magic!\u201d Lila cried. \u201cIt\u2019s working!\u201d\n\nWith one final push, the shadow screamed, \u201cNo!\u201d It started to shrink. \n\nThe trio felt warmth spread through them. The tree's branches danced wildly, and the shadow vanished with a puff of smoke. They opened their eyes, and the garden was filled with light. \n\n\u201cDid we do it?\u201d Mira whispered, her heart racing.\n\n\u201cYes!\u201d Lila cheered, bouncing on her toes. \u201cThe tree is safe!\u201d\n\nFelix winked. \u201cAnd no more puppy surprises!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, the tree spoke, its voice soft and wise. \u201cThank you, brave friends. You have saved me. The wishes you made came from your hearts. It is not the wishes that are wrong, but how they are used.\u201d\n\nMira smiled, understanding the lesson. \u201cTogether, we can use our wishes for good!\u201d\n\nThey hugged, feeling proud and happy. The Wishing Tree Academy was now a place of hope and magic again.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s celebrate!\u201d Felix suggested. \u201cI\u2019ll make banana muffins!\u201d \n\n\u201cYum!\u201d Lila exclaimed, clapping her hands. \n\nMira laughed. \u201cI wish for a party!\u201d\n\nAs they cheered, Mira knew this was just the beginning of their adventures. \n\n\u201cTogether, we can wish for anything!\u201d she said, excitement bubbling inside her. \n\nAnd with that, they skipped toward the school, ready for whatever came next.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Mira, Lila, and Felix wish for?","options":["More puppies","To make a cake","To banish the shadow","To go home"],"correct_answer":"To banish the shadow"},{"question":"What does the shadow represent?","options":["A wish gone wrong","A friendly creature","A tree","A potion"],"correct_answer":"A wish gone wrong"},{"question":"What does the tree teach Mira and her friends?","options":["Wishes should be used for fun","Wishes can be dangerous","Wishes can only be made once","Wishes are always bad"],"correct_answer":"Wishes can be dangerous"},{"question":"What do they plan to do to celebrate?","options":["Have a picnic","Make banana muffins","Go for a walk","Play with puppies"],"correct_answer":"Make banana muffins"},{"question":"How do they feel at the end of the chapter?","options":["Sad","Angry","Scared","Happy"],"correct_answer":"Happy"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_156_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_156_ch5_img1.png","plot_156_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":411,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
