   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_156_11_14","title":"The Wishing Tree Academy","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Magic School","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"As dawn broke over the Wishing Tree Academy, Mira, Lila, and Felix stood in awe of the colossal tree that towered above the schoolyard. Its gnarled branches seemed to stretch out like welcoming arms, adorned with shimmering leaves that sparkled in the morning sun. The air was thick with the scent of wildflowers and a hint of magic. Mira's pulse quickened\u2014this was the heart of their new home, a place where dreams could blossom.\n\n\u201cCan you believe we\u2019re actually here?\u201d Lila exclaimed, her eyes wide with wonder. She had always been fascinated by potions and enchantments, and this place felt like a dream come true. \n\nFelix, ever the trickster, grinned mischievously. \u201cI hope this place has a good sense of humor. I\u2019ve got a few tricks up my sleeve!\u201d He pulled a series of small, glimmering stones from his pocket. Mira rolled her eyes but couldn\u2019t help but smile\u2014his antics always lightened the mood.\n\nJust as they began to explore the academy grounds, a soft rustling caught Mira\u2019s attention. She turned to see a cluster of mysterious figures lurking behind the bushes at the edge of the clearing. Shadows flickered, and as they moved closer, Mira felt a shiver run down her spine.\n\n\u201cMira, what\u2019s wrong?\u201d Lila asked, noticing her friend\u2019s sudden stillness.\n\n\u201cDo you see those people?\u201d Mira whispered, pointing toward the shadows. She felt a knot tightening in her stomach. \u201cThere are too many of them.\u201d\n\nFelix leaned in closer, squinting his eyes. \u201cAre they students? Or... something else?\u201d\n\nBefore Mira could answer, one of the figures stepped into the light. He wore a cloak that shimmered ominously, and his eyes glinted like shards of ice. \u201cWe\u2019re not here to play nice, tree-huggers,\u201d he sneered, his voice dripping with contempt.\n\nMira\u2019s heart raced. Who was this person? What did he want with the tree? Just then, a sharp cracking sound echoed through the air, and the ground trembled beneath their feet. The Wishing Tree shuddered as if sensing danger. Its leaves rustled urgently, and Mira instinctively reached out toward it, feeling a surge of energy flow through her fingertips.\n\n\u201cStay back!\u201d she shouted, stepping protectively in front of Lila and Felix. \u201cYou don\u2019t want to mess with the Wishing Tree!\u201d\n\nThe cloaked figure laughed, a sound that sent chills down Mira's spine. \u201cOh, but I do. The wishes of this tree are powerful, and I intend to make them mine.\u201d \n\nSuddenly, Mira\u2019s mind raced with possibilities. What had she done with her first wish? Was it already in jeopardy? She had to figure out what this stranger wanted and how to protect her friends and the tree.\n\nFelix glanced at Mira, his usual bravado replaced with concern. \u201cWe need a plan, and we need it fast.\u201d\n\nMira nodded, her determination solidifying. \u201cWe\u2019ll uncover this secret together. I won\u2019t let anyone take the tree\u2019s magic.\u201d \n\nJust then, the air grew thick with an unsettling tension, and the cloaked figure raised a hand, casting a spell that crackled with dark energy. Mira felt her heart pounding in her chest. This was only the beginning of their fight, and she had to prepare herself for whatever lay ahead.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] shows Mira, Lila, and Felix standing in awe beneath the magnificent Wishing Tree, with sunlight filtering through its branches, illuminating their expressions of wonder and excitement as they begin their adventure at the academy.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2] captures the moment of suspense as the cloaked figure steps forward, his icy eyes glinting menacingly, while Mira stands protectively in front of her friends, her determination shining through as she faces the unknown threat.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Mira and her friends discover as they explore the academy?","options":["A hidden treasure","A mysterious figure","A secret potion","An old book"],"correct_answer":"A mysterious figure"},{"question":"How does Mira feel when she sees the cloaked figure?","options":["Excited","Nervous","Indifferent","Happy"],"correct_answer":"Nervous"},{"question":"What does the cloaked figure want?","options":["To help the tree","To take the tree's magic","To befriend Mira","To leave the academy"],"correct_answer":"To take the tree's magic"},{"question":"What does Felix usually enjoy doing?","options":["Reading books","Bending the rules","Making potions","Hiding from danger"],"correct_answer":"Bending the rules"},{"question":"What theme is developing in this chapter regarding Mira?","options":["Fear of the unknown","Desire for power","Importance of friendship","Love for nature"],"correct_answer":"Fear of the unknown"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_156_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_156_ch2_img1.png","plot_156_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":619,"reading_level":"Builder"}
