   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_156_11_14","title":"The Wishing Tree Academy","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Magic School","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Mira stood at the edge of the Enchanted Grove, the vibrant colors of the Wishing Tree Academy fading into the distance. The grove shimmered under the soft glow of twilight, and the air was thick with the scent of blooming jasmine. She felt her heart race as she recalled the encounter with the cloaked figure. Her fingers brushed the rough bark of the wishing tree, its presence as comforting as a warm blanket.\n\n\"Do you think that was really the enemy?\" Lila asked, her voice trembling slightly. She mixed a few crushed herbs in her palm, an anxious habit she had when faced with uncertainty.\n\nFelix, ever the trickster, sidestepped a cluster of glowing mushrooms. \u201cRelax! It was probably just someone lost in the woods. We\u2019ll be fine.\u201d Yet, his eyes darted around, betraying his bravado. \n\nJust then, a rustle echoed from the shadows of the trees. Mira's heart thudded. \"Did you hear that?\" \n\n\u201cYeah,\u201d Felix replied, his voice low, \u201cbut it could be anything. A squirrel or\u2014\u201d\n\nAnother sound pierced the quiet, deeper and more sinister this time. Lila\u2019s face paled. \u201cWhat if it\u2019s them?\u201d\n\n\u201cWe need to find out,\u201d Mira said, clenching her fists. She stepped forward, determination flooding her veins. \"If we're going to protect the tree and our wishes, we have to face whatever this is.\"\n\nAs they crept closer to the source of the sound, a figure slowly emerged from the shadows. It was cloaked in dark fabric, the hood casting a shadow over its face. Mira's pulse quickened, and she exchanged terrified glances with her friends. \n\n\u201cWho are you?\u201d Mira called out, trying to sound braver than she felt.\n\nThe figure raised a hand, revealing a glinting amulet that shimmered eerily even in the dim light. \u201cYou shouldn\u2019t be here, child. The magic of the Wishing Tree belongs to those who know how to wield it properly.\u201d\n\nMira felt a chill run down her spine, but she refused to back down. \u201cAnd who decides that? You?\u201d \n\nThe figure laughed, a sound that sent shivers through the air. \u201cFoolish girl. This tree has a dark history, one you have yet to uncover. Your wishes can either save or destroy.\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a wave of energy surged through the grove, making the leaves tremble like the flutter of frightened wings. Mira stumbled backward, her mind racing. What did that mean? She had already wished for more than she could understand.\n\n\u201cRun!\u201d Lila shouted, her eyes wide with fear.\n\nMira\u2019s instincts kicked in, but she felt the ground beneath her shift, as if it were alive. She turned to grab Lila's hand, but Felix was already sprinting back toward the academy. Panic bubbled in her chest. \u201cWait! We can\u2019t leave without figuring this out!\u201d\n\nThen, with a sudden crack, the ground opened up slightly between them and the cloaked figure. The tree's roots began to weave around, forming a barrier. \n\n\u201cMake your choice!\u201d The figure shouted, their voice echoing ominously. \u201cWill you seek the truth, or will you run away?\u201d\n\nMira hesitated, heart pounding. She could sense the power in the air, a choice that could change everything. \n\nBefore she could decide, the figure unleashed a wave of dark energy, sending Mira sprawling to the ground as her surroundings blurred. In that moment, she understood that her wishes had consequences, and their very existence at the Wishing Tree Academy was at stake.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs Mira braced herself against the roots of the Wishing Tree, she felt the power radiating from it. The tree\u2019s leaves glimmered softly, almost as if they were alive, whispering secrets only she could hear.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe cloaked figure loomed over Mira, the amulet glowing ominously in the twilight. Shadows danced around them, and Mira's face reflected a mix of fear and determination, ready to confront the unknown.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does the cloaked figure reveal about the Wishing Tree?","options":["It has no magic","It belongs to those who wield it properly","It protects everyone","It is just a tree"],"correct_answer":"It belongs to those who wield it properly"},{"question":"How does Mira respond to the threat of the cloaked figure?","options":["She runs away immediately","She stands her ground","She hides behind Felix","She starts wishing more"],"correct_answer":"She stands her ground"},{"question":"What happens when the cloaked figure unleashes dark energy?","options":["Mira flies away","Mira falls to the ground","The tree disappears","Everyone is safe"],"correct_answer":"Mira falls to the ground"},{"question":"What does Lila do when the figure appears?","options":["She runs towards the figure","She mixes herbs","She shouts at the figure","She screams and runs"],"correct_answer":"She screams and runs"},{"question":"What does the figure say about making a choice?","options":["They can wish anything","They will find the truth","They can run away","They must confront their fears"],"correct_answer":"They must confront their fears"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_156_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_156_ch3_img1.png","plot_156_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":642,"reading_level":"Builder"}
