   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_156_11_14","title":"The Wishing Tree Academy","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Magic School","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Mira stood at the edge of the Wishing Tree Academy\u2019s enchanted grove, her heart a whirlwind of determination and dread. The sun filtered through the leaves, casting dappled shadows across the ground, while the air buzzed with whispers of magic. It felt as if the trees themselves were holding their breath, waiting for her next move. She glanced back at Lila and Felix, who were deep in discussion, their faces etched with concern.\n\n\u201cMira, we can\u2019t let that cloaked figure get to the tree again,\u201d Lila said, her voice steady yet urgent. \u201cIf they\u2019re trying to exploit its magic, we have to stop them.\u201d\n\nFelix nodded, his usual playful grin replaced by a serious expression. \u201cBut how? We don\u2019t know who they are or what they want.\u201d\n\nMira took a deep breath, her fingers brushing against the bark of the Wishing Tree. It felt warm, as though it recognized her presence. \u201cWe need to find out more about the tree\u2019s history. Maybe there\u2019s something in the Academy\u2019s library that can help us.\u201d\n\nAs they made their way towards the library, the path twisted like a winding river through the forest. Colorful blossoms danced in the gentle breeze, creating a whimsical atmosphere that belied the gravity of their mission. They arrived at the library, a towering structure made of ancient wood, its walls covered in vines that seemed to shimmer with magic.\n\nOnce inside, the scent of old parchment filled the air. Shelves stretched toward the ceiling, overflowing with books on spells, potions, and the history of magical creatures. Mira approached a dusty tome titled \"Legends of the Wishing Tree.\" She opened it carefully, and words leaped off the pages like fireflies, illuminating their path.\n\n\u201cLook!\u201d she exclaimed, pointing at an illustration of the tree surrounded by a circle of enchanted creatures. \u201cIt says here that the tree has a guardian spirit, who protects its magic. But if someone tries to misuse it, that spirit can turn dark.\u201d\n\nLila\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cSo, if someone is trying to exploit the tree, it could lead to a battle between the spirit and whoever\u2019s trying to take its power!\u201d\n\nFelix leaned in closer, scanning the text. \u201cBut how do we find this guardian? Maybe they can help us.\u201d\n\nAs if on cue, a gust of wind swept through the library, sending papers flying. One particular parchment landed at Mira\u2019s feet, its words glowing. \u201cThe guardian can only be summoned at the twilight hour. Seek the path where shadows meet light.\u201d\n\nMira\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWe have to go tonight! It\u2019s the perfect opportunity.\u201d\n\nLila and Felix exchanged glances, a spark of hope igniting in their eyes. \u201cLet\u2019s prepare some potions and gather what we need,\u201d Lila suggested.\n\nAs they left the library, Mira felt a surge of confidence. They might not have all the answers yet, but they were one step closer to unraveling the mystery. The sun dipped lower in the sky, painting the world in shades of orange and purple.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, a sound echoed through the grove\u2014a soft, haunting melody that seemed to call out to them. \u201cDid you hear that?\u201d Mira whispered, her heart pounding.\n\n\u201cSounds like it\u2019s coming from the Wishing Tree,\u201d Felix replied, his eyes wide with curiosity. \u201cLet\u2019s check it out!\u201d\n\nThey rushed back towards the tree, the melody growing louder. As they approached, the cloaked figure emerged from behind it, their face hidden in shadows. Mira\u2019s stomach twisted in knots. \u201cWhat do you want?\u201d she demanded.\n\nThe figure laughed, a chilling sound that sent shivers down Mira\u2019s spine. \u201cWhat I want, dear child, is the magic that belongs to me.\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nMira felt an icy grip on her heart. She had to act fast. \u201cWe won\u2019t let you take it!\u201d she shouted, stepping protectively in front of her friends.\n\n\u201cThen you\u2019ll have to face the consequences,\u201d the figure hissed, raising a hand, dark energy crackling at their fingertips.\n\nMira\u2019s mind raced\u2014this was the moment she had to confront her fears. \u201cNo! The Wishing Tree\u2019s magic is meant to help, not harm!\u201d she cried, drawing strength from her friends and the tree.\n\nWith the night sky as their backdrop, they stood united against the figure, ready to protect their home.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Mira, Lila, and Felix search for in the Academy's library?","options":["A spell to defeat the cloaked figure","History of the Wishing Tree","Instructions for potion-making","A map of the forest"],"correct_answer":"History of the Wishing Tree"},{"question":"What happens when Mira opens the book about the Wishing Tree?","options":["It bursts into flames","Words illuminate the pages","A creature appears","It becomes a portal"],"correct_answer":"Words illuminate the pages"},{"question":"What does the cloaked figure want from the Wishing Tree?","options":["To protect it","To take its magic","To become its guardian","To destroy it"],"correct_answer":"To take its magic"},{"question":"How do Mira and her friends feel as they prepare for their confrontation?","options":["Nervous and frightened","Excited and hopeful","Confident and united","Indifferent and bored"],"correct_answer":"Confident and united"},{"question":"What does the parchment found by Mira indicate?","options":["A treasure map","A warning about the figure","Instructions to summon the guardian","A riddle about the forest"],"correct_answer":"Instructions to summon the guardian"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_156_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_156_ch4_img1.png","plot_156_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":727,"reading_level":"Builder"}
