   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_156_15_18","title":"The Wishing Tree Academy","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Magic School","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Mira stood before the towering gates of the Wishing Tree Academy, her heart racing with a mix of anxiety and exhilaration. The wrought iron gates, entwined with vines that glimmered as if dusted with starlight, awaited her push. It was her first day, and the air hummed with the promise of magic and mystery. She could almost feel the whispers of the ancient trees surrounding the campus, their secrets waiting to be uncovered. \n\n\u201cAre you ready for this?\u201d Lila, her best friend, asked, her eyes sparkling with excitement. Lila had always been the brave one, her spirit as unyielding as the potions she brewed\u2014each one a concoction of courage, laughter, and a touch of mischief.\n\n\u201cNot really,\u201d Mira admitted, her palms sweating. \u201cWhat if I can\u2019t control my wishes? What if I mess up?\u201d\n\n\u201cThen we\u2019ll just have to clean up your mess,\u201d Felix interjected, stepping into view with a sly grin. His tousled hair and twinkling eyes gave him an air of effortless charm, but there was a shadow of something deeper lurking beneath. \u201cBesides, what\u2019s the worst that could happen? A little chaos never hurt anyone\u2026 right?\u201d\n\nMira forced a smile, though anxiety gnawed at her stomach. \u201cRight,\u201d she echoed, but the words felt hollow.\n\nWith a deep breath, she pushed open the gate, which creaked ominously, as if protesting against her entry. The academy sprawled before her like a living tapestry; vines draped over ancient stone arches, and flower beds bloomed with colors that defied description. Magical creatures darted between the trees, their laughter mingling with the rustle of leaves. But beneath the surface beauty, Mira sensed an undercurrent of tension, a whispered warning carried by the wind.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nInside the academy, Mira felt a surge of determination. She could communicate with the tree\u2014the heart of the academy. It had granted her wish to attend, weaving her dreams into reality. But as she walked through the hallways adorned with shimmering murals of past students and their wishes granted, a lingering doubt settled in her mind. What if her wishes had consequences she couldn\u2019t foresee?\n\nThe day unfolded in a blur of classes and laughter, but an unsettling feeling clung to her. Lila excelled in potion-making, concocting a shimmering elixir that caused their teacher, Madame Thistlewood, to nearly float off her chair in delight. Felix, ever the trickster, turned a boring lecture into a dazzling display of illusions, much to the chagrin of their classmates. Mira watched, a mix of admiration and jealousy bubbling within her. She had to find her own strengths quickly, or risk being overshadowed.\n\nAs the sun dipped below the horizon, casting golden light through the grand windows, the atmosphere shifted. A chill crept into the air, and the laughter faded into whispers. Mira felt it\u2014the tree was restless. It beckoned her, its branches swaying as if urging her to approach. \n\n\u201cMira, are you coming?\u201d Lila called, her voice laced with concern. \n\n\u201cI\u2019ll be right there,\u201d Mira replied, her instincts pulling her toward the window. She glanced outside, where the ancient tree stood illuminated in the twilight, its bark dark and twisted, like a gnarled hand reaching out. Something felt wrong. \n\nMira took a step toward the door, but a sudden crash echoed through the hall. A heavy book fell from the shelf, landing open at her feet. The page fluttered, revealing a haunting illustration of their tree. The accompanying text spoke of wishes gone awry, of dreams that twisted into nightmares. \n\n\u201cMira!\u201d Lila's voice sliced through the tension, panic rising. \u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d\n\nBefore she could answer, the lights flickered, and the shadow of a figure darted past the door. Mira\u2019s heart raced. There was more to this academy than met the eye, and she could feel it\u2014something dark was lurking, waiting to exploit the magic of the tree. \n\n\u201cStay close!\u201d Mira shouted, her instincts sharpening. She knew that she had to confront whatever it was that threatened her friends and the academy. As they stepped into the hallway, a sudden gust of wind swept through, whispering secrets that only Mira could understand.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cWhatever happens, we can face it together,\u201d Lila said, determination shining in her eyes.\n\nMira nodded, feeling the weight of her wishes and their potential. They were stepping into a web of magic and danger, and the only way out was to unravel the truth. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find out what\u2019s going on,\u201d she declared, her voice steadier than before. \u201cWe have to protect the tree.\u201d","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the name of the academy Mira attends?","options":["Mystic Grove Academy","Wishing Tree Academy","Enchanted Forest Academy","Magic Pine Academy"],"correct_answer":"Wishing Tree Academy"},{"question":"Who is Mira's best friend known for her potion-making skills?","options":["Felix","Madame Thistlewood","Lila","Aria"],"correct_answer":"Lila"},{"question":"What unsettling feeling does Mira experience during her first day?","options":["Joy and excitement","Nostalgia","Anxiety and doubt","Overconfidence"],"correct_answer":"Anxiety and doubt"},{"question":"What event causes panic among the students?","options":["A magical duel","A heavy book falling","A potion explosion","A creature attack"],"correct_answer":"A heavy book falling"},{"question":"What does Mira resolve to do at the end of the chapter?","options":["Protect the tree","Leave the academy","Ignore the warnings","Find a new friend"],"correct_answer":"Protect the tree"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_156_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_156_ch1_img1.png","plot_156_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":759,"reading_level":"Challenger"}
