   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_156_15_18","title":"The Wishing Tree Academy","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Magic School","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"The Wishing Tree Academy buzzed with anticipation as Mira stepped onto the sun-dappled grounds, the scent of wildflowers mingling with the crisp, earthy aroma of the forest. This was her sanctuary, a place where she felt empowered\u2014yet today, a heaviness lingered in the air, a reminder of the confrontation they had narrowly escaped. Felix and Lila flanked her, their expressions a blend of determination and apprehension.\n\n\"We need to figure out what the sprite meant,\" Mira said, her voice steady despite the quiver in her heart. \"If that cloaked figure is targeting the heart of the tree, we might not have much time.\"\n\nFelix, ever the provocateur, grinned mischievously. \"Why not wish for a crystal ball? Then we can see what\u2019s coming.\"\n\nLila shot him a disapproving glance, her potion-making bag slung over her shoulder. \"Felix, this isn\u2019t a game! Wishing got us into this mess. We need a plan, not more chaos.\"\n\nMira nodded, feeling the weight of their trust on her shoulders. \"Let\u2019s head to the library. If we can learn more about the tree's history, maybe we can find clues on how to protect it.\"\n\nAs they made their way through the twisting paths of the academy, vibrant leaves danced overhead, casting playful shadows that flickered across the ground. Each step felt like an echo of the past, a reminder of the power she wielded\u2014power that could either save her friends or plunge them into darkness. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe library loomed ahead, its ancient wooden doors carved with intricate depictions of mythical creatures and flora. Inside, the air was thick with the scent of parchment and ink, and towering shelves lined with books beckoned them closer. Mira\u2019s heart raced as she scanned the titles, searching for anything that might illuminate the mystery.\n\n\u201cWhat about this?\u201d Lila called from the far corner, holding a dusty tome aloft. \u201cThe Chronicles of the Wishing Tree?\u201d\n\nMira hurried over, peering at the book\u2019s spine adorned with shimmering gold. \"Yes! Let\u2019s see what it says.\"\n\nAs they gathered around a table, Felix flicked through the pages, his fingers tracing the ornate illustrations that depicted the Wishing Tree\u2019s origins. \"It says here that the tree was born from a wish made during a great calamity. But it also warns that its heart can be corrupted by greed or fear.\"\n\n\u201cGreed\u2026 or fear,\u201d Mira murmured, the words sinking deep into her consciousness. \"What if the cloaked figure is trying to exploit the tree's magic for themselves?\"\n\nBefore she could dwell on that thought, the library door creaked open, and an ominous chill swept through the room. A shadow fell across their table, and Mira looked up to see a figure cloaked in black, a familiar silhouette that sent a jolt of recognition through her. \n\n\u201cDid you really think you could hide from me?\u201d the figure hissed, their voice dripping with malice. \u201cThe heart of the tree belongs to those who deserve it, not to children playing with magic.\u201d\n\nMira's pulse quickened. \u201cWho are you?\u201d she demanded, standing tall despite her fear.\n\nThe figure stepped closer, revealing a face twisted with resentment. \"I was once the guardian of the tree, until it was taken from me by unworthy hands. You may have been granted a gift, but gifts come with burdens, and I intend to reclaim what was lost.\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nFelix glanced at Mira, his eyes wide with alarm. \u201cWe can\u2019t let them near the tree! We have to protect it!\u201d\n\nIn that instant, Mira felt a surge of power coursing through her, an instinctive response to the threat before them. She reached out to the Wishing Tree, calling on its essence. \u201cI wish for the strength to protect what is right!\u201d\n\nA shimmering light enveloped her, amplifying her resolve as she stood before the cloaked figure. \u201cYou won\u2019t take anything from us!\u201d\n\nWith a flick of her wrist, a shield of luminescent energy erupted around her friends, pushing back the dark presence. The figure stumbled, a look of shock mingling with fury. \u201cYou think you can stop me? This isn\u2019t over!\u201d\n\nWith that, they vanished, leaving only a swirling mist\u2014a stark reminder of the battle they had narrowly won. Mira turned to her friends, adrenaline still coursing through her.\n\n\u201cWe did it,\u201d she breathed, a mix of triumph and exhaustion washing over her. \u201cBut we need to be ready. This is only the beginning.\u201d\n\nLila placed a reassuring hand on her shoulder. \u201cTogether, we can face anything.\u201d\n\nAs they stepped out into the sunlight, the Wishing Tree stood tall and proud, a beacon of hope amidst the chaos. For the first time, Mira felt a sense of purpose beyond her wishes\u2014she was a guardian of something greater, and she would fight for it.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Mira and her friends discover about the history of the Wishing Tree?","options":["It was created for entertainment.","It can only grant wishes once a year.","It was born from a wish made during a calamity.","It has no magical properties."],"correct_answer":"It was born from a wish made during a calamity."},{"question":"What threat does the cloaked figure pose?","options":["They want to befriend Mira.","They wish to exploit the heart of the tree.","They want to leave the academy.","They are searching for lost treasure."],"correct_answer":"They wish to exploit the heart of the tree."},{"question":"What does Mira wish for during the confrontation?","options":["To flee from danger.","To have more wishes granted.","For the strength to protect what is right.","To become the guardian of the academy."],"correct_answer":"For the strength to protect what is right."},{"question":"How does Mira feel at the end of the chapter?","options":["Defeated and scared.","Relieved and apathetic.","Confident and purposeful.","Uncaring about the outcome."],"correct_answer":"Confident and purposeful."},{"question":"What is the main theme explored in this chapter?","options":["The importance of friendship.","The burden of power and responsibility.","The joy of wishes.","The need for solitude."],"correct_answer":"The burden of power and responsibility."}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_156_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_156_ch5_img1.png","plot_156_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":804,"reading_level":"Challenger"}
