   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_157_7_10","title":"The Curious Case of Class 7-B","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Magic School","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"In the heart of the Magic School for Unconventional Wizards, Class 7-B buzzed with excitement. This was no ordinary school; it had floating books and walls that changed colors! Dax, a clever boy with wild curls, sat in the back. He often felt shy but loved magic. \n\n\u201cToday we practice our special spells!\u201d Sofia, the confident leader, announced. Her long hair sparkled in the sunlight. \u201cGet ready, everyone!\u201d\n\n\u201cCan we use my new gadget?\u201d Jaden asked, bouncing in his chair. He wore glasses that were always slipping down his nose. \u201cIt can mix spells like a smoothie!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s start with the levitation spell!\u201d Sofia said, waving her wand. The classroom filled with laughter as a feather floated up, up, and away! \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nDax raised his hand. \u201cI want to try too!\u201d He whispered a spell and, to his surprise, his pencil lifted off the desk! \u201cLook, I did it!\u201d \n\nBut then, the room fell silent. A strange shadow flickered at the edge of the classroom. \u201cDid you see that?\u201d whispered Jaden, his eyes wide. \n\n\u201cMaybe it\u2019s just a trick of the light?\u201d Sofia suggested, though her voice trembled a little. \n\nSuddenly, the spell jars on the shelves began to rattle! \u201cUh-oh!\u201d Dax pointed. \u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d\n\n\u201cEveryone, stay calm!\u201d Sofia shouted. But it was too late. A dark cloud of magic swirled around the room. \n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d Jaden cried, clutching his gadget tightly. \n\nThen, as quickly as it had started, the magic stopped. But when the students looked around, they noticed something strange. The spell jars were missing!\n\n\u201cOh no!\u201d Dax gasped. \u201cAll our spells are gone!\u201d\n\nSofia stepped forward, her hands on her hips. \u201cWe need to find out who took them. We can\u2019t let this ruin the showcase!\u201d\n\nJaden nodded, his eyes bright with ideas. \u201cLet\u2019s work together! We\u2019re a team!\u201d\n\nAs the three friends looked around the classroom, they realized they had a mystery to solve, and time was running out. Who could be the thief? \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s start investigating,\u201d Sofia said, a determined look on her face. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nDax felt a spark of courage. \u201cI\u2019m in!\u201d he said. \u201cLet\u2019s find our spells and save the showcase!\u201d\n\nWith that, Class 7-B began their exciting quest. Little did they know, the thief could be closer than they thought!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the name of the class in the story?","options":["Class 7-A","Class 7-B","Class 8-B","Class 6-B"],"correct_answer":"Class 7-B"},{"question":"Who is the confident leader of the class?","options":["Dax","Sofia","Jaden","Gadget"],"correct_answer":"Sofia"},{"question":"What special spell did they practice first?","options":["Invisibility","Levitation","Transformation","Fireball"],"correct_answer":"Levitation"},{"question":"What happened to the spell jars?","options":["They broke","They disappeared","They floated away","They melted"],"correct_answer":"They disappeared"},{"question":"What do the friends decide to do?","options":["Play games","Investigate the mystery","Leave the school","Tell a teacher"],"correct_answer":"Investigate the mystery"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_157_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_157_ch1_img1.png","plot_157_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":390,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
