   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_157_7_10","title":"The Curious Case of Class 7-B","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Magic School","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"In the colorful halls of the Magic School for Unconventional Wizards, Class 7-B was buzzing. Laughter mixed with the sound of spells popping and fizzing. Dax, with his untidy brown hair, felt a flutter of nerves. \u201cWhat if we don\u2019t find our spells?\u201d he whispered to Sofia.\n\n\u201cDon\u2019t worry!\u201d Sofia replied, her dark hair bouncing as she waved her wand. \u201cWe will solve this mystery together!\u201d She looked around the classroom, where gadgets and magical books were scattered everywhere. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nJaden, the quirky inventor, held up a gadget that sparkled like a rainbow. \u201cThis is my Spell Sniffer! It can track where the spells went!\u201d He grinned, showing off his invention. \u201cLet\u2019s start looking!\u201d\n\nThe three friends stood together, determined, but then a loud crash echoed from the next room. They exchanged worried glances. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Dax asked, his heart racing.\n\n\u201cThere\u2019s only one way to find out!\u201d Sofia said, leading the way. They tiptoed toward the sound, peeking into the room. It was full of magical items and strange creatures.\n\nSuddenly, a big, fluffy creature jumped out! \u201cWhoa!\u201d Jaden exclaimed, stumbling backward. \u201cIs that a Fuzzy Wumpus?\u201d \n\n\u201cYes!\u201d Sofia said, her eyes wide. \u201cThey\u2019re curious but can be a little clumsy.\u201d The Fuzzy Wumpus wobbled around the room, knocking over a shelf of potions. \n\nDax noticed something shiny under the mess. \u201cLook! What\u2019s that?\u201d He reached down, pulling out a glimmering spellbook. \u201cThis doesn\u2019t belong to us!\u201d\n\nJust then, the Fuzzy Wumpus sneezed, sending colorful smoke everywhere. The room filled with giggles and sneezes as they tried to avoid the magical mess. \u201cWe need to clean this up!\u201d Jaden shouted, waving his Spell Sniffer.\n\nAs they worked together, Dax remembered their main mission. \u201cWhat if the thief took our spells and used them here?\u201d he wondered aloud. \n\n\u201cWe can\u2019t let that happen!\u201d Sofia said, her voice steady. \u201cLet\u2019s find the clues!\u201d Just then, a note floated down from the shelves. It had a strange spell written on it. \n\n\u201cWhat does it say?\u201d Jaden asked, his eyes wide. \n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but it looks important,\u201d Sofia replied, frowning. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s take it back to class,\u201d Dax suggested. \u201cWe can figure it out together.\u201d\n\nAs they left the messy room, the Fuzzy Wumpus followed them. It seemed to want to help. \u201cMaybe it knows something!\u201d Jaden said, watching the creature bounce behind them.\n\nBut just then, the lights flickered, and the classroom doors slammed shut! \u201cUh-oh!\u201d Dax said, feeling a chill. \u201cNow what do we do?\u201d","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What gadget does Jaden create to help find the spells?","options":["Spell Sniffer","Magic Finder","Potion Tracker","Wand Wiz"],"correct_answer":"Spell Sniffer"},{"question":"What creature jumps out from the next room?","options":["Fuzzy Wumpus","Mystic Cat","Sparkle Dragon","Whirling Pixie"],"correct_answer":"Fuzzy Wumpus"},{"question":"What do Dax, Sofia, and Jaden discover under the mess?","options":["A spellbook","A wand","A potion","A hat"],"correct_answer":"A spellbook"},{"question":"What happens when the Fuzzy Wumpus sneezes?","options":["It makes a loud noise","It sends colorful smoke","It flies away","It becomes smaller"],"correct_answer":"It sends colorful smoke"},{"question":"What happens at the end of the chapter?","options":["The doors slam shut","They find the thief","They win a prize","They cast a spell"],"correct_answer":"The doors slam shut"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_157_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_157_ch2_img1.png","plot_157_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":427,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
