   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_157_7_10","title":"The Curious Case of Class 7-B","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Magic School","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Dax, Sofia, and Jaden stood in the dark classroom. The Fuzzy Wumpus had disappeared into a corner, but the door was still locked tight. \"What do we do now?\" Dax whispered. His heart raced.  \n\n\"We have to find a way out!\" Sofia said, her eyes sparkling with determination. \"And we need to find our spells!\"  \n\nSuddenly, a loud crash echoed behind them. The Fuzzy Wumpus had knocked over a stack of spell books! \"Uh-oh!\" Jaden yelled. He ran to help. \"That could be the key!\"  \n\nAs they picked up the books, Dax noticed something shiny under the teacher's desk. \"What's that?\" he asked, pointing. The others gathered around, their eyes wide with curiosity.  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]  \n\nIt was a glittery silver pen. \"This is no ordinary pen!\" Sofia exclaimed, holding it up. \"It must be enchanted!\"  \n\n\"Do you think it could help us?\" Jaden asked. \"Maybe it can write spells!\"  \n\n\"Only one way to find out!\" Dax said. He grabbed the pen and closed his eyes. He thought hard about the missing spells. Suddenly, the pen glowed brightly!  \n\n\"Look!\" Sofia gasped. \"It's writing!\" Words appeared on the floor in shimmering letters. \"Reveal the thief!\"  \n\nBut just then, the classroom walls began to shake. \"What's happening?!\" Jaden shouted. The words stopped glowing as the room trembled.  \n\n\"We need to get out now!\" Sofia yelled. The door rattled, but it wouldn\u2019t budge.  \n\n\"We can\u2019t leave without knowing who the thief is!\" Dax cried. But the shaking grew worse. \u201cWhat if we don\u2019t have enough time?\u201d  \n\nJust then, a loud bang echoed as the door finally swung open. They rushed outside, hearts pounding.  \n\n\"Did you see that?\" Jaden exclaimed. \"We need to regroup!\"  \n\nSofia nodded. \"Yes! We need a plan, and we need to find out who else has been acting strange.\"  \n\nAs they hurried down the hall, they overheard whispers. \"Did you see the way Dax looked at the pen?\" one voice said. \"I think he knows something!\"  \n\nDax\u2019s face turned red. \u201cWhat? I didn\u2019t do anything!\u201d  \n\nBut now they had more questions than answers. Could it be someone in Class 7-B? The mystery deepened, and so did their worries. They had to uncover the truth before it was too late.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]  \n\nThe three friends exchanged glances. \u201cWe need to stick together,\u201d Sofia urged. \u201cNo secrets! If we\u2019re going to solve this, we need to trust each other.\u201d  \n\n\"Right!\" Dax nodded. They all agreed, but the suspicion hung thick in the air. Who could they really trust?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Dax, Sofia, and Jaden find under the teacher's desk?","options":["A shiny silver pen","A magic wand","A spell book","A Fuzzy Wumpus"],"correct_answer":"A shiny silver pen"},{"question":"What happens when Dax uses the pen?","options":["It writes spells","It disappears","It turns into a frog","It flies away"],"correct_answer":"It writes spells"},{"question":"What do the characters hear in the hallway?","options":["A loud crash","Whispers","Laughter","A song"],"correct_answer":"Whispers"},{"question":"What is Sofia's main plan?","options":["To find the thief","To go home","To study spells","To play games"],"correct_answer":"To find the thief"},{"question":"What happens to the classroom during their adventure?","options":["It fills with water","It starts shaking","It disappears","It turns into a dragon"],"correct_answer":"It starts shaking"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_157_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_157_ch3_img1.png","plot_157_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":421,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
