   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_157_7_10","title":"The Curious Case of Class 7-B","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Magic School","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"In the colorful halls of the Magic School for Unconventional Wizards, Class 7-B was buzzing with energy. Dax, Sofia, and Jaden stood by the spell lab, their minds racing. \u201cWhat if we use the enchanted pen to find the missing spells?\u201d Dax suggested, his voice barely above a whisper.\n\nSofia nodded, her eyes sparkling. \u201cThat\u2019s a great idea, Dax! Let\u2019s gather the others.\u201d\n\n\u201cRight! Everyone!\u201d Sofia called. \u201cWe need to team up and track down our spells!\u201d\n\nThe classroom filled with chatter as their classmates gathered around. Jaden rummaged through his bag, pulling out strange gadgets. \u201cI made a Spell Finder! It beeps when there\u2019s magic nearby. Let\u2019s give it a try!\u201d [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nExcitement filled the room as Jaden\u2019s gadget buzzed to life. \u201cThis is amazing!\u201d shouted a student. Jaden grinned, but just then, the Spell Finder began to beep wildly.\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s working!\u201d Jaden exclaimed. \u201cFollow me!\u201d\n\nThey all hurried out of the classroom, following the sound. They dashed through twisting hallways and past shifting walls. The Magic School was never dull, and today was no different!\n\nSuddenly, they stopped in front of the library. \u201cThe beeping is louder here!\u201d Dax said, his heart racing. They peeked inside. Books floated in mid-air, creating a colorful whirlwind.\n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Sofia pointed at a pile of books. \u201cThere\u2019s something bright under there!\u201d The group rushed over, pushing the books aside, and found a glowing, sparkly spellbook! \u201cThis must be one of the stolen books!\u201d Dax said, his eyes wide.\n\nBut just as they cheered, a loud CRASH echoed through the library! A figure darted out from behind a shelf. \u201cStop right there!\u201d Sofia shouted. They all gasped in surprise. \n\nWho was this mysterious figure? Could they be the thief? Dax felt a mix of fear and determination. \u201cWe need to find out!\u201d he said.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nDax took a deep breath. \u201cOkay, let\u2019s work together! We can catch them!\u201d \n\nSofia nodded. \u201cWith teamwork, we can solve this mystery!\u201d\n\nAs they prepared to chase the figure, hope surged through them. They were closer than ever to solving the mystery of the disappearing spells. But what would happen next?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Dax suggest to find the missing spells?","options":["Use a crystal ball","Ask the teacher","Use the enchanted pen","Use a Spell Finder"],"correct_answer":"Use the enchanted pen"},{"question":"What does Jaden create?","options":["A magic wand","A Spell Finder","A potion","A flying broomstick"],"correct_answer":"A Spell Finder"},{"question":"Where do the students find the glowing spellbook?","options":["In the garden","In the classroom","In the library","In the cafeteria"],"correct_answer":"In the library"},{"question":"What happens when they find the spellbook?","options":["A loud crash occurs","It starts floating","They lose it","It disappears"],"correct_answer":"A loud crash occurs"},{"question":"What do the students decide to do at the end of the chapter?","options":["Give up","Work together to catch the thief","Hide from the figure","Run away"],"correct_answer":"Work together to catch the thief"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_157_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_157_ch4_img1.png","plot_157_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":363,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
