     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"peculiar","1":"concentration","2":"suspect","3":"incantations","4":"defiance","image_prompts":["A vibrant scene inside the common room of Class 7-B, with colorful banners hanging from the ceiling, students gathered around a table. Dax, looking shy and contemplative, sits at the table's edge, while Sofia stands confidently beside him, and Jaden fiddles with his Spell Sniffer gadget. The room is filled with magical energy and excitement.","A tense moment in the dimly lit restricted section of the library, where Dax, Sofia, and Jaden hide behind stacks of ancient books. The hooded figure, identified as Zara, stands at a table cluttered with scrolls and magical items, looking surprised and defensive as she faces the trio. The atmosphere is thick with suspense, illuminated by flickering candlelight."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A richly atmospheric depiction of the potion lab within the Magic School for Unconventional Wizards. The room is dimly lit by flickering candles, with shadows dancing against the walls. Dax, Sofia, and Jaden are actively engaged in creating spells, their faces illuminated with determination and a hint of anxiety, surrounded by bubbling potions and scattered potion ingredients.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_157_ch4_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 15:51:00"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing An emotionally charged scene of Luna standing at the entrance of the potion lab, her expression a mixture of regret and defiance. The candlelight creates a warm glow against the darkness surrounding her, capturing the tension in the air as she prepares to reveal the truth. The atmosphere is thick with anticipation, embodying the themes of trust and betrayal.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_157_ch4_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 15:51:00"}}}
