   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_157_11_14","title":"The Curious Case of Class 7-B","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Magic School","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"In the heart of the colorful and chaotic Magic School for Unconventional Wizards, the air buzzed with energy. Classrooms shifted like clouds, their walls painted in vibrant hues that seemed to dance with the light. In one particular room, 7-B, a mix of spellbooks and potion ingredients spread across the desks, creating a landscape of organized chaos. It was here that the students, each gifted with peculiar talents, gathered to learn the art of magic.\n\nDax sat at the back, his fingers tracing the cover of his favorite spellbook, \"Conjurings of the Curious.\" He preferred the company of stories over people, but today felt different. Today, the class was abuzz with excitement, eager to prepare for the year-end showcase. \u201cWe need to practice our group spells,\u201d Sofia announced, her confident voice cutting through the chatter. She stood at the front, her brown hair tied back, eyes sparkling like enchanted gems. \u201cWe can\u2019t let those last-minute surprises ruin our performance!\u201d\n\n\u201cLike the time Jaden turned his broomstick into a giant marshmallow?\u201d Dax muttered, a small smile creeping onto his face. Jaden, always full of quirky ideas, gave a dramatic gasp from his desk. \u201cThat was a masterpiece! Who wouldn\u2019t want to ride a marshmallow?\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe classroom erupted in laughter, with Sofia shaking her head at Jaden\u2019s antics. \u201cFocus, everyone! We need to figure out our routine.\u201d But as the laughter faded, an uneasy silence settled over the room. Sofia glanced around, noticing the scattered expressions of her classmates. \u201cWhat\u2019s wrong, Dax?\u201d she asked, her brow furrowed with concern.\n\nDax shifted uncomfortably. \u201cIt\u2019s just\u2026 have you noticed that some of our spells have gone missing? I can\u2019t find my Invisibility Charm. It just\u2026 vanished.\u201d The room fell silent again, the weight of his words hanging in the air like a thick fog. \n\nJaden\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cYou\u2019re right! My Gadget Glove was here yesterday, but now it\u2019s gone!\u201d He started rummaging through his backpack, searching for something that wasn\u2019t there. \u201cWhat if someone is stealing our spells?\u201d\n\nSofia crossed her arms, determination flickering in her gaze. \u201cThen we need to find out who it is. If we don\u2019t, the showcase will be a disaster!\u201d The thought sent a shiver down Dax\u2019s spine, and he felt the pressure of his classmates\u2019 expectant looks. They needed to work together, but how could they trust each other if one of them might be the thief?\n\n\u201cOkay, let\u2019s divide into teams,\u201d Sofia suggested. \u201cDax, you can help me investigate the classrooms. Jaden, you check the potion lab for any clues.\u201d \n\nDax nodded, a new sense of purpose filling him. \u201cWe\u2019ll meet back here in an hour,\u201d he said, feeling a spark of confidence he didn\u2019t know he had. With a wave of her wand, Sofia created a small map of the school, marking where each team would go.\n\nAs they dispersed, Dax\u2019s heart raced. Each step echoed with a mix of excitement and unease. Could they really uncover the thief among them? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith his mind swirling in thought, Dax headed toward the library, a long corridor lined with towering shelves of dusty books. Shadows danced along the walls, and the quiet was almost deafening. Suddenly, a flicker of movement caught his eye. Dax turned just in time to see a figure slip between the shelves. \n\n\u201cHey! Wait!\u201d he called out, chasing after the shadow. As he rounded the corner, he felt a surge of determination. Whoever it was, they might have the answers he sought.\n\n---","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is Class 7-B preparing for?","options":["A field trip","A year-end showcase","A sports competition","A magical duel"],"correct_answer":"A year-end showcase"},{"question":"What peculiar talent does Jaden have?","options":["He can fly","He invents gadgets","He tells jokes","He brews potions"],"correct_answer":"He invents gadgets"},{"question":"What goes missing that creates conflict within the class?","options":["Books","Spells","Broomsticks","Potions"],"correct_answer":"Spells"},{"question":"How does Sofia suggest they handle the missing spells?","options":["Ignore it","Ask the teachers","Divide into teams to investigate","Wait for the thief to return them"],"correct_answer":"Divide into teams to investigate"},{"question":"What does Dax feel as he heads to the library?","options":["Excitement and anxiety","Boredom","Anger","Fear of failing"],"correct_answer":"Excitement and anxiety"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_157_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_157_ch1_img1.png","plot_157_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":599,"reading_level":"Builder"}
