   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_157_11_14","title":"The Curious Case of Class 7-B","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Magic School","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"As the sun rose over the Magic School for Unconventional Wizards, the colorful rooftops shimmered like a box of crayons spilled across the landscape. Dax stood outside Class 7-B, his heart thumping like a drum in a marching band. The air was thick with an electric buzz; students hurried past him, their laughter and chatter mixing with the scent of bubbling potions wafting from the nearby labs.\n\n\u201cHey, Dax! You coming in or what?\u201d Sofia's voice broke through his thoughts. She stood at the door, her arms crossed and a teasing smile on her face. Today was important. It was the day they would finally unveil their hard work for the year-end showcase. \n\n\u201cYeah, just... thinking,\u201d Dax replied, rubbing the back of his neck. He wished he didn\u2019t feel so shy around his classmates, especially Sofia, the confident leader who always seemed to have everything under control.\n\nAs they entered the classroom, Dax noticed Jaden tinkering with a peculiar gadget that whirred and whistled like a caffeinated chipmunk. \u201cLook at my newest creation! The Spell Sniffer 3000!\u201d Jaden exclaimed, holding it up proudly. The device was a jumble of gears and glowing crystals, and Dax couldn\u2019t help but be fascinated.\n\n\u201cDoes it actually work?\u201d Dax asked, stepping closer. He could see the shimmer of excitement in Jaden's eyes.\n\n\u201cOf course! It sniffs out lost spells! But it's best used when spells are actually missing,\u201d Jaden added, his brow furrowing. \u201cLike right now.\u201d\n\nThe realization hit them like a sudden storm. \u201cWhat if the thief is still around?\u201d Sofia said, her voice dropping to a whisper. A shiver ran down Dax\u2019s spine as he recalled the missing spells.\n\nJust then, a loud crash echoed through the hall, followed by a flurry of panic. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Jaden exclaimed, his gadget clattering to the floor. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s check it out!\u201d Sofia declared, her determination igniting a spark in Dax. They rushed towards the source of the noise, hoping to find answers. \n\nAs they turned the corner, they stumbled upon a chaotic scene: broken potion bottles scattered across the floor, their colorful contents pooling like a rainbow puddle. In the center of the mess stood Zara, a classmate known for her knack for mischief. Her face was a mixture of surprise and confusion.\n\n\u201cI didn\u2019t mean to!\u201d Zara exclaimed, her hands raised in surrender. \u201cIt just... exploded!\u201d \n\nDax exchanged glances with Sofia and Jaden. Something felt off. \u201cZara, did you see anyone else around?\u201d Dax asked, his voice steady despite the chaos.\n\nShe frowned, running a hand through her tangled hair. \u201cNo, but I heard whispering just before it happened. It sounded sneaky.\u201d\n\nAs Zara spoke, Dax felt the tension in the air thicken. They needed to figure out who was behind the spell thefts, but now they had a new complication. Who could they trust?\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe trio moved closer to Zara, their expressions a mix of concern and curiosity, the shattered potion bottles casting colorful shadows around them.\n\n\u201cGreat, now we have to deal with this mess too,\u201d Sofia said, glancing at the spilled potions with a raised eyebrow. \u201cWhat if this was part of the distraction?\u201d\n\nSuddenly, Jaden\u2019s Spell Sniffer emitted a series of beeps and whirrs, drawing their attention. \u201cIt\u2019s going off! There must be something nearby!\u201d he exclaimed, excitement bubbling in his voice.\n\n\u201cWhere?\u201d Dax asked, looking around frantically. \n\n\u201cIt\u2019s pointing right towards you, Zara!\u201d Jaden exclaimed, pointing the gadget at her. \n\nZara's eyes widened in surprise, and she took a step back. \u201cWait! I didn\u2019t do anything!\u201d \n\nDax\u2019s heart raced. Was Zara involved? Or was there someone else lurking in the shadows of their school? As the mystery deepened, they knew their time was running out. The showcase was just days away, and they had to uncover the truth before everything fell apart.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith their hearts pounding and the stakes higher than ever, Dax, Sofia, and Jaden knew they had to work together to solve this curious case. The real question now was: who among them was the magical thief?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the name of Jaden's invention?","options":["Spell Finder 2000","Potion Mixer","Spell Sniffer 3000","Magic Locator"],"correct_answer":"Spell Sniffer 3000"},{"question":"What unexpected event occurs as the students are discussing the missing spells?","options":["A loud crash","A sudden explosion","A magical creature appears","The lights go out"],"correct_answer":"A loud crash"},{"question":"Which classmate is found in the chaotic scene?","options":["Liam","Zara","Mia","Oliver"],"correct_answer":"Zara"},{"question":"What does Jaden\u2019s Spell Sniffer detect?","options":["A lost spell nearby","A magical creature","A potion recipe","A hidden treasure"],"correct_answer":"A lost spell nearby"},{"question":"What do Dax, Sofia, and Jaden decide to do after encountering Zara?","options":["Ignore her","Accuse her immediately","Investigate further","Run away"],"correct_answer":"Investigate further"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_157_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_157_ch2_img1.png","plot_157_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":684,"reading_level":"Builder"}
