   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_157_15_18","title":"The Curious Case of Class 7-B","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Magic School","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"As the first rays of sunlight filtered through the kaleidoscopic glass of the Magic School for Unconventional Wizards, Dax stood in the bustling hallway, his heart racing. The vibrant colors swirling in the glass seemed almost mocking, reflecting the chaos around him. Students darted between rooms, laughter and shouts echoing off the walls, yet Dax felt an unshakeable weight pressing down on him. He glanced nervously at his classmates, each one abuzz with excitement for the impending showcase. \n\n\u201cHey, Dax!\u201d Sofia called, her bright smile cutting through the tension. She was a beacon of confidence, her hair catching the light like spun gold. \u201cYou ready to brainstorm some ideas?\u201d \n\n\u201cUh, sure,\u201d Dax replied, his voice barely above a whisper. He followed her to a corner where Jaden was tinkering with a small device that blinked erratically, a fusion of gears and shimmering crystal. \u201cWhat\u2019s that supposed to do?\u201d\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s a spell detector,\u201d Jaden said, adjusting his oversized goggles. \u201cI thought it might help us find out who\u2019s stealing our spells. If we can track the magic trail, maybe we can catch the thief in the act.\u201d \n\nSofia nodded approvingly. \u201cThat\u2019s brilliant, Jaden! But we need a plan to gather everyone and figure out who\u2019s been acting suspiciously.\u201d Her eyes sparkled with determination, drawing Dax into the orbit of her enthusiasm.\n\nAs the three plotted, a sudden hush enveloped the hallway\u2014a sign that something was amiss. Murmurs swelled into panicked whispers as students began to notice a peculiar shadow hovering in the distance, flickering in and out of visibility. \n\n\u201cIs that\u2026?\u201d Dax started, his voice trailing off. \n\nSofia narrowed her eyes. \u201cIt looks like someone\u2019s invisibility spell is malfunctioning.\u201d \n\n\u201cOr worse,\u201d Jaden interjected, his voice laced with unease. \u201cWhat if it\u2019s the thief? We should investigate.\u201d \n\nWith trepidation, they approached the shadow, which seemed to pulse with an eerie light. As they neared, Dax could feel the hairs on his arms stand on end. \u201cThis is a bad idea,\u201d he muttered, but Sofia\u2019s fierce determination pushed him forward.\n\nSuddenly, the shadow flickered out, revealing a small, shimmering orb hovering in mid-air. It radiated an unsettling energy, crackling with suppressed magic. Dax\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWhat is that?\u201d\n\nBefore anyone could reply, the orb burst forth with a blinding flash, enveloping them in a whirlwind of light. Dax felt himself being pulled into the center of the chaos, his surroundings distorting as he was yanked into a vision. \n\nIn that moment, fragments of memories flooded his mind\u2014snippets of laughter, whispered secrets, and faces that shifted like shadows. A voice echoed, familiar yet distant, \u201cTrust is fragile\u2026 and betrayal lurks where you least expect it.\u201d Dax gasped, struggling against the tide of images that threatened to overwhelm him.\n\nAs the vision receded, the orb imploded, collapsing into a spiraling mass of energy before dissipating entirely. Dax stumbled back, disoriented. \u201cDid you see that?\u201d he breathed, wide-eyed. \n\nSofia steadied him, her expression a mixture of concern and intrigue. \u201cYes, but what does it mean?\u201d \n\nJaden furrowed his brow, his mind racing with possibilities. \u201cThe thief is using powerful magic\u2014but why would they want us to see that?\u201d \n\nDax\u2019s thoughts spiraled, uncertainty gnawing at him. \u201cMaybe they want to sow distrust among us,\u201d he suggested, his voice trembling. \u201cIf we\u2019re divided, they can steal whatever they want.\u201d \n\nA new sense of urgency filled the air. \u201cWe can\u2019t let that happen,\u201d Sofia declared, her features set with resolve. \u201cWe need to confront the class, but carefully. We can\u2019t accuse anyone without proof.\u201d \n\nJust then, the school bell rang out, signaling the start of their first class. A daunting reality settled over them; the showcase was just days away, and the urgency of their mission loomed larger than ever. \n\nAs they moved to their classroom, Dax couldn\u2019t shake the feeling that they were running out of time. A shadow flitted past the door, and he shivered involuntarily. Could the thief really be hiding in plain sight? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe vibrant classroom of Class 7-B, a kaleidoscope of colors and textures, containing spell books floating lazily in mid-air, enchanted plants swaying to unheard music, and students bustling about, each absorbed in their magical pursuits. Sofia stands at the front, radiating authority as she gestures toward a chalkboard filled with intricate spell diagrams. Dax and Jaden sit in the front row, each with expressions of determination, anxiety, and curiosity as they engage with their environment.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe moment of chaos as the orb bursts into a blinding flash, sending Dax and his friends reeling back in shock. The air is thick with swirling energy, colors blending into a vivid spectacle. Dax\u2019s face is illuminated by the light, revealing a mixture of fear and awe. Sofia reaches out, her expression one of both fear and determination, as Jaden shields his eyes with one hand, the other still gripping his gadget, caught in a moment of tension and discovery.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What device does Jaden create to help find the thief?","options":["Spell detector","Invisibility cloak","Time-turner","Magic mirror"],"correct_answer":"Spell detector"},{"question":"What do Dax and his classmates see when they approach the shadow?","options":["A ghost","A shimmering orb","A portal","A spellbook"],"correct_answer":"A shimmering orb"},{"question":"What unsettling message does Dax hear during his vision?","options":["Friendship is magic","Trust is fragile","Power corrupts","Knowledge is power"],"correct_answer":"Trust is fragile"},{"question":"What is Sofia\u2019s reaction to the orb and its implications?","options":["Excited","Indifferent","Angry","Determined"],"correct_answer":"Determined"},{"question":"What is the main conflict introduced in this chapter?","options":["The showcase preparations","The trust issues within the class","Jaden\u2019s gadget malfunctioning","Dax\u2019s fear of spells"],"correct_answer":"The trust issues within the class"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_157_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_157_ch2_img1.png","plot_157_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":836,"reading_level":"Challenger"}
