   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_158_7_10","title":"The Elemental Trials","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Magic School","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"At the top of Misty Peak, Elemental Academy sparkled like a jewel. The school had four towers, each shining with the colors of its element. Blue for Water House, red for Fire House, green for Earth House, and white for Air House. \n\nKaia, a water mage, stood by the big fountain in the courtyard. Water danced around her like silver ribbons. \"Come on, everyone! Let\u2019s practice!\" she called out. \n\nJust then, Leo from Fire House stomped over, his hair crackling like flames. \"Why should we listen to you, Kaia? Fire is the strongest element!\" He crossed his arms, a fierce look on his face.\n\nKaia frowned. \"It\u2019s not about strength, Leo. We need to work together!\" \n\n\"You think your water can match my fire? Ha!\" Leo laughed, and the students gathered around them began to murmur. \n\nSuddenly, Zara from Earth House stepped forward. Her dark hair flowed like a waterfall. \"Listen! The storm is coming! We must prepare!\" \n\nA loud rumble echoed from the sky. Dark clouds swirled above the school, and a crack of lightning lit up the valley below. The students gasped. \n\n\"We can\u2019t let the storm destroy our home!\" Kaia shouted. \"We need to unite our powers!\" \n\nJust then, a huge gust of wind blew through the courtyard. Everyone stumbled back, surprised. \"What\u2019s happening?\" Zara cried. \n\nKaia pointed to the sky. \"The elements are turning against us!\" \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nKaia\u2019s heart raced. \"We must complete the Elemental Trials! It\u2019s the only way to restore balance!\" \n\n\"Trials?\" Leo said, his fiery bravado fading. \"But... what if we fail?\" \n\n\"We won\u2019t!\" Kaia replied, determination shining in her eyes. \"Together, we can do anything!\" \n\nLeo nodded slowly. \"Okay, I\u2019ll help. But don\u2019t think I\u2019ll go easy on you!\" \n\nZara smiled. \"That\u2019s the spirit! We\u2019ll need all our strengths.\" \n\nThe wind howled louder, and lightning cracked again. They had no time to waste. The Elemental Trials awaited them!\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\"Let\u2019s go!\" Kaia yelled, leading the way. The three students hurried toward the first trial. \n\nThe storm loomed closer, its energy crackling in the air. They needed to unite their powers\u2014before it was too late!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What mage is Kaia?","options":["Fire mage","Earth mage","Water mage","Air mage"],"correct_answer":"Water mage"},{"question":"Who is the fiery character from Fire House?","options":["Zara","Leo","Kaia","The storm"],"correct_answer":"Leo"},{"question":"What do they need to complete to restore balance?","options":["Elemental Trials","Rivalry Games","Water Challenges","Fire Fights"],"correct_answer":"Elemental Trials"},{"question":"What does the storm do in the chapter?","options":["Makes everyone happy","Turns against the students","Creates a dance party","Grows flowers"],"correct_answer":"Turns against the students"},{"question":"What does Kaia want everyone to do?","options":["Argue","Work together","Leave the academy","Take a nap"],"correct_answer":"Work together"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_158_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_158_ch1_img1.png","plot_158_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":368,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
