   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_158_7_10","title":"The Elemental Trials","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Magic School","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"As the storm clouds gathered, Kaia stood on the balcony of Elemental Academy. The majestic peaks loomed around her, each one representing a different element. Kaia's heart raced. She could feel the power of water swirling within her. \u201cWe need to act fast!\u201d she shouted, turning to Leo and Zara.\n\nLeo crossed his arms, his fiery red hair blowing in the wind. \u201cI don\u2019t like working with you two,\u201d he grumbled. \u201cWater and earth? What good can they do?\u201d\n\nZara, ever calm, replied, \u201cIf we don\u2019t unite, we\u2019ll face the storm alone. We must complete the Elemental Trials together.\u201d \n\nKaia nodded. \u201cZara\u2019s right. The first trial tests our teamwork. We can\u2019t let rivalry stop us.\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a crack of thunder echoed. Rain began to pour, and the wind howled. Kaia pointed. \u201cLook! The first challenge is the Stone Bridge!\u201d\n\nThe trio hurried to the edge of the cliff. Below them, a massive stone bridge stretched over a deep chasm. It shimmered with magic but looked unstable. \u201cWe need to cross it,\u201d Kaia said, her voice steady despite the storm.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe bridge was decorated with swirling patterns of water, fire, earth, and air. Kaia imagined what it would be like to cross. \u201cI\u2019ll go first!\u201d she declared. She concentrated, summoning a wave of water to stabilize the bridge.\n\nAs her magic flowed, Leo shouted, \u201cWait! We need fire too!\u201d He stepped beside her, flames dancing in his hands. Together, they created a warm glow over the bridge.\n\nZara placed her hands on the ground. \u201cI\u2019ll help too!\u201d she said, channeling the strength of the earth. The bridge began to pulse with energy. \n\nBut suddenly, a gust of wind swept through, shaking the bridge! Kaia gasped, \u201cHold on!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe bridge rocked back and forth. \u201cWe can do this!\u201d Leo yelled, his voice rising above the wind. \u201cJust a little more!\u201d\n\nWith one last push, the bridge stabilized. The trio cheered. \u201cWe did it!\u201d Kaia shouted, laughing with relief. But just then, they heard a rumbling noise. A shadow loomed ahead.\n\n\u201cWhat is that?\u201d Zara whispered, eyes wide.\n\n\u201cI think it\u2019s our next challenge!\u201d Kaia replied, her heart pounding. \u201cWe must stick together!\u201d\n\nThe storm raged on. They needed to be ready for whatever came next.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Kaia, Leo, and Zara have to cross?","options":["A river","A stone bridge","A mountain","A fire pit"],"correct_answer":"A stone bridge"},{"question":"What does Kaia use to help stabilize the bridge?","options":["Earth magic","Fire magic","Water magic","Air magic"],"correct_answer":"Water magic"},{"question":"What does Leo contribute to the bridge?","options":["Water","Earth","Fire","Wind"],"correct_answer":"Fire"},{"question":"What do Zara and Kaia say about working together?","options":["It\u2019s boring","We can\u2019t do it","We have to unite","It\u2019s too hard"],"correct_answer":"We have to unite"},{"question":"What appears at the end of the chapter?","options":["A dragon","A shadow","A rainbow","A castle"],"correct_answer":"A shadow"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_158_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_158_ch2_img1.png","plot_158_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":385,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
