   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_158_7_10","title":"The Elemental Trials","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Magic School","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Kaia stood at the edge of the Elemental Academy, her heart racing. The storm clouds swirled overhead, dark and angry. Lightning flashed, illuminating the majestic peaks around her. \u201cWe have to hurry!\u201d she shouted to Leo and Zara. \n\nLeo crossed his arms, a fiery glare in his eyes. \u201cWe\u2019re not ready for the next trial. I need to practice my fire spells!\u201d\n\nZara frowned. \u201cWe don\u2019t have time! The storm will destroy the Academy!\u201d She looked at Kaia, who nodded. \u201cWe need to work together.\u201d\n\nAs they climbed the steep path, the wind howled. Kaia felt droplets of water on her skin. \u201cLook!\u201d she pointed. \u201cThe storm is getting worse!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe path twisted ahead, leading to a clearing. Large stones surrounded a shimmering pool of water. \u201cThis is the Trial of the Elements,\u201d Zara explained, her voice steady. \u201cWe must connect with our magic here.\u201d\n\nLeo scoffed, \u201cWater? How can that help us? Fire is what we need!\u201d \n\nKaia took a deep breath. \u201cEach element is important. We must learn from each other.\u201d \n\nSuddenly, the ground trembled. Rocks began to roll toward them! \u201cRun!\u201d Kaia shouted, her heart pounding. \n\nThey dashed towards the pool as the stones crashed down around them. Kaia felt a surge of power. \u201cWe can do this!\u201d she yelled. \u201cFocus on your magic!\u201d\n\nLeo\u2019s hands glowed with flames, and Zara\u2019s feet sank into the earth, rooting her in place. \u201cTogether!\u201d Kaia cried, raising her arms.\n\nA burst of water shot from the pool, mixing with the fire and earth. The storm above roared louder. Kaia\u2019s heart raced as she realized their elements were combining! \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nSuddenly, a shadowy figure appeared in the storm. \u201cFoolish mages!\u201d it cackled. \u201cYou think you can stop me? The elements are mine to control!\u201d \n\nKaia shivered. \u201cWe can\u2019t let it win! We must unite!\u201d \n\nBut just then, the ground began to crack beneath them. \u201cWhat do we do?\u201d Leo yelled, panic in his voice.\n\n\u201cTrust each other!\u201d Kaia shouted. \u201cWe have to finish the Trial!\u201d \n\nThe shadow loomed closer, and Kaia knew this was their biggest challenge yet. Would they overcome their rivalry and work together? Or would they be lost in the storm forever?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the next trial they face?","options":["Trial of the Elements","Trial of Fire","Trial of Water","Trial of Earth"],"correct_answer":"Trial of the Elements"},{"question":"Who is the hotheaded character from Fire House?","options":["Kaia","Zara","Leo","Storm"],"correct_answer":"Leo"},{"question":"What does Kaia shout to encourage her friends?","options":["Run!","Trust each other!","We can\u2019t win!","Focus on fire!"],"correct_answer":"Trust each other!"},{"question":"What type of storm threatens Elemental Academy?","options":["A sunny day","A powerful storm","A snowstorm","A windstorm"],"correct_answer":"A powerful storm"},{"question":"What happens when they try to combine their magic?","options":["Nothing happens","They get lost","They create a burst of magic","They fight each other"],"correct_answer":"They create a burst of magic"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_158_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_158_ch3_img1.png","plot_158_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":373,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
