   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_158_7_10","title":"The Elemental Trials","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Magic School","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Chapter 4: The Teamwork Spell\n\nKaia stood at the foot of the tallest peak of Elemental Academy. The winds howled around her, swirling with magic. She felt a tingle in her fingers. \u201cWe need to work together,\u201d Kaia said, looking at Leo and Zara. \u201cThe storm is getting stronger!\u201d\n\n\u201cI know!\u201d Leo exclaimed, his fiery hair flickering like a flame. \u201cBut how can we trust each other? We\u2019re from different houses!\u201d\n\nZara stepped forward, her earth-toned robes swaying. \u201cMaybe we can find a way to blend our powers. Together, we can create something new!\u201d\n\n\u201cLike a teamwork spell?\u201d Kaia suggested, her eyes sparkling with hope. \u201cYes! Let\u2019s try it!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they gathered, each mage focused on their element. Kaia pulled water from the air, Leo summoned sparks of fire, and Zara grounded them with stones from the mountain. They began to chant, their voices mixing like a beautiful melody.\n\n\u201cWater and fire, earth and air, let us unite, we can share!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a loud crack echoed through the valley. The storm darkened, and the shadows loomed closer. \u201cWe have to hurry!\u201d Leo shouted. \u201cIt\u2019s getting worse!\u201d\n\nKaia, feeling a rush of determination, spoke louder. \u201cRemember, we can do this together! Let\u2019s focus!\u201d\n\nThey chanted again, this time with more energy. The air shimmered with their combined magic. The shadows swirled around them, but they stood strong. As they joined forces, a bright light burst forth. It pushed back the shadows, illuminating the dark storm clouds.\n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Zara cheered, pointing at the sky. \u201cIt\u2019s working! The storm is starting to clear!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cOur teamwork is powerful!\u201d Kaia smiled. She felt warmth spread through her heart. The storm began to fade, and hope blossomed in the air. \n\n\u201cTogether, we can finish the trials!\u201d Leo exclaimed, grinning. \u201cLet\u2019s keep going!\u201d\n\nWith their spirits high, they prepared for the next challenge. Kaia knew they were on the right path. But what lay ahead? The trials were far from over.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Kaia, Leo, and Zara decide to create together?","options":["A potion","A spell","A bridge","A storm"],"correct_answer":"A spell"},{"question":"What elements do they combine?","options":["Water, fire, earth, and air","Wind, earth, light, and dark","Fire, ice, water, and metal","Sun, moon, stars, and clouds"],"correct_answer":"Water, fire, earth, and air"},{"question":"What happens when they cast their spell?","options":["The storm gets worse","The shadows disappear","They fall asleep","They get lost"],"correct_answer":"The shadows disappear"},{"question":"How does Kaia feel about their teamwork?","options":["Nervous","Bored","Hopeful","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Hopeful"},{"question":"What do they prepare for at the end of the chapter?","options":["A feast","The next challenge","A game","A nap"],"correct_answer":"The next challenge"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_158_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_158_ch4_img1.png","plot_158_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":333,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
