   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_159_7_10","title":"The Mysterious Artifact","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Magic School","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"In the heart of a lush forest stood Crescent Moon Academy. It was a grand castle with tall towers and shimmering windows. The gardens were filled with colorful flowers that danced in the breeze. Today was special. A mysterious artifact had been found!\n\n\"Did you hear about the artifact, Anna?\" Ben asked, his eyes wide with curiosity.\n\n\"Of course! I can't wait to see it!\" Anna replied. She had a knack for sensing magic, and today felt like something big was about to happen.\n\nAs they walked through the castle\u2019s heavy wooden doors, the air buzzed with excitement. Students gathered in the great hall, all chattering about the discovery. There, on a shining pedestal, was the artifact\u2014a glowing crystal surrounded by swirling mist.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAnna stared at the crystal. \"It's beautiful! I feel something... like it wants to tell us a secret.\"\n\nBen crossed his arms. \"It\u2019s just a rock, Anna.\"\n\nBut before Anna could reply, a voice echoed through the hall. \"Attention, students!\" It was Elder Yara, the wise guardian of the academy. She had silver hair and a kind smile.\n\n\"This artifact holds great power,\" she explained. \"It must be protected at all costs.\"\n\nSuddenly, the crystal flickered, and the mist began to swirl faster. A riddle appeared in the air, glowing brightly.\n\n\"What has keys but cannot open locks?\" it asked.\n\nAnna\u2019s heart raced. \"I know! It\u2019s a piano!\" she shouted.\n\nBut the riddle was not finished. The mist wrapped around the crystal, and it pulsed with energy. Students gasped, and Ben looked worried.\n\n\u201cWhat if someone tries to steal it?\u201d he whispered.\n\nElder Yara nodded gravely. \"You must work together to keep it safe. Magical guardians will protect it, but you will face challenges. Solve the riddles, and you may unlock your hidden abilities.\"\n\nAnna's eyes sparkled with excitement. \"We can do this, Ben! Are you with me?\"\n\nBen sighed but smiled. \"I guess so, but I still think it\u2019s just a rock.\"\n\nThe crowd began to disperse, but Anna felt a pull towards the artifact. She whispered to Ben, \"What if we uncover its secrets?\"\n\nBen shrugged, still skeptical. \"Alright, but let\u2019s not get into too much trouble.\"\n\nWith a determined look, Anna nodded. \"Let\u2019s start our adventure!\"\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThey approached the pedestal again. The crystal shimmered, and Anna could almost hear it whispering. \u201cThis is just the beginning,\u201d she thought. But she had no idea what was in store.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is Crescent Moon Academy?","options":["A big castle","A magical shop","A forest","A school"],"correct_answer":"A school"},{"question":"What did Anna feel about the artifact?","options":["It was boring","It was a secret","It was just a rock","It was beautiful"],"correct_answer":"It was beautiful"},{"question":"Who is Elder Yara?","options":["A student","A teacher","A guardian","A gardener"],"correct_answer":"A guardian"},{"question":"What was the first riddle about?","options":["A book","A key","A piano","A door"],"correct_answer":"A piano"},{"question":"What do Anna and Ben plan to do?","options":["Ignore the artifact","Keep it safe","Sell it","Break it"],"correct_answer":"Keep it safe"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_159_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_159_ch1_img1.png","plot_159_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":415,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
