   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_159_7_10","title":"The Mysterious Artifact","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Magic School","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Anna and Ben stepped quietly into the dark hall of Crescent Moon Academy. The walls were covered in shimmering vines. Each step echoed like a soft whisper. \n\n\"Do you really think this place is magical?\" Ben asked, raising an eyebrow. \n\nAnna smiled wide. \"Of course! Just look at these walls!\" She reached out to touch a vine, and it glowed. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, a loud crash came from the next room. Anna jumped, and Ben clutched her arm. \"What was that?\" he whispered.\n\n\"I don't know, but we should check it out!\" Anna said with excitement. \n\nCautiously, they tiptoed to the doorway. As they peeked inside, they saw a shimmering light. A figure was dancing around the artifact! \n\n\"Is that Elder Yara?\" Ben asked, squinting.\n\n\"No, it looks like... a magical guardian!\" Anna exclaimed, her eyes wide. The guardian was tall and cloaked in bright colors, spinning around the artifact. \n\nThey watched in awe as the guardian pointed at the artifact. \u201cTo protect the magic, you must solve the riddle,\u201d it said in a deep, echoing voice.\n\nBen looked worried. \"A riddle? I\u2019m terrible at those!\"\n\nAnna nudged him. \u201cDon\u2019t worry! We can do this together.\u201d \n\nThe guardian continued, \u201cListen closely! What has keys but can\u2019t open locks?\u201d \n\n\u201cI know!\u201d Anna shouted. \u201cA piano!\u201d\n\nThe guardian nodded. \u201cCorrect! You may pass.\u201d \n\nJust as they thought they were safe, the floor began to shake! \n\n\u201cRun!\u201d Ben yelled, pulling Anna away. \n\nThey dashed through the doorway just as a wall of light blocked their path. \u201cNow what?\u201d Ben panted, looking back at the swirling light. \n\nAnna thought quickly. \u201cMaybe we need to answer another riddle!\u201d \n\nThe guardian\u2019s voice boomed again, \u201cYou have one chance! What flies without wings?\u201d \n\nAnna closed her eyes. \u201cTime! It flies without wings!\u201d \n\nThe wall flickered and dissolved. They gasped in surprise. \n\n\u201cWow, Anna! You did it!\u201d Ben cheered. \n\nAs they stepped through, the guardian vanished. They stood in a new room filled with strange artifacts. \n\n\u201cLook at all this magic!\u201d Anna said, pointing to a glowing crystal. \n\nBut Ben frowned. \u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d \n\nJust then, a shadow moved behind them. \n\n\u201cWho\u2019s there?\u201d Anna called nervously. \n\nThe shadow stepped into the light. \u201cI\u2019ve come for the artifact,\u201d a mysterious voice said. \n\nAnna and Ben exchanged worried glances. Their adventure was just beginning.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Anna and Ben discover in the academy?","options":["A hidden treasure","A magical artifact","A secret door","A talking animal"],"correct_answer":"A magical artifact"},{"question":"What is the first riddle they solve?","options":["What has keys but can\u2019t open locks?","What flies without wings?","What is a magical creature?","What is the color of magic?"],"correct_answer":"What has keys but can\u2019t open locks?"},{"question":"Who appears after they solve the riddle?","options":["Elder Yara","A magical guardian","A teacher","A ghost"],"correct_answer":"A magical guardian"},{"question":"What does Ben think about riddles?","options":["He loves them","He is very good at them","He thinks they are fun","He is terrible at them"],"correct_answer":"He is terrible at them"},{"question":"What happens after they answer the riddle?","options":["The guardian disappears","The artifact breaks","They find another riddle","They are trapped"],"correct_answer":"The guardian disappears"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_159_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_159_ch2_img1.png","plot_159_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":392,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
