   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_159_7_10","title":"The Mysterious Artifact","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Magic School","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Chapter 3: The Shadow\u2019s Challenge\n\nAnna and Ben stood in the grand hall of Crescent Moon Academy. The walls shimmered in the soft light of floating orbs. They could see the beautiful tapestries hanging, telling stories of magic. Anna grinned at Ben, her eyes sparkling with excitement. \u201cThis is where it all begins!\u201d \n\nSuddenly, a cold breeze swept through the hall. The air crackled with magic. \u201cDo you feel that?\u201d Ben asked, his skepticism fading. Anna nodded. \u201cYes! Something is coming.\u201d\n\nJust then, Elder Yara appeared behind them, her robes flowing like mist. \u201cYou must be ready. The shadow seeks the artifact.\u201d Her voice was serious, but her eyes twinkled. \u201cYou have to solve the next riddle to move on.\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat is the riddle?\u201d Ben asked, his heart racing. Anna leaned closer, eager to hear.\n\nElder Yara cleared her throat. \u201cI am not alive, yet I can grow. I don\u2019t have lungs, but I need air. What am I?\u201d \n\nBen scratched his head. \u201cThis is tricky!\u201d Anna thought hard. \u201cI know! It\u2019s a fire!\u201d \n\nElder Yara smiled. \u201cCorrect! Now, you must face the shadow.\u201d \n\nBefore they could react, a dark figure emerged from the corner. It was the shadow! The air turned chilly. \u201cGive me the artifact!\u201d it demanded, its voice a low growl. \n\n\u201cNever!\u201d Anna shouted, stepping in front of Ben. \u201cWe will protect it!\u201d \n\nThe shadow laughed, moving closer. \u201cYou think you can stop me? I will test your bravery!\u201d \n\nSuddenly, the shadow waved its hand. A swirling mist surrounded them. \u201cFind the hidden door, or be lost in darkness forever!\u201d \n\nAnna and Ben looked around, panic in their eyes. \u201cWhere is the door?\u201d Ben whispered.\n\n\u201cWe have to think!\u201d Anna exclaimed, trying to stay calm. \u201cThe riddle helped us before; maybe there's another clue here!\u201d \n\nJust then, they spotted a glowing symbol on the wall. It looked like a key! \u201cThere!\u201d Anna pointed. \n\nAs they rushed towards it, the shadow laughed menacingly. \u201cYou have only moments left!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe glowing symbol sparkled, illuminating the dark corners of the hall. Anna and Ben felt a warm energy. \u201cWe can do this!\u201d Anna shouted. \n\nThey reached the symbol at the same time. \u201cWhat do we do?\u201d Ben asked, looking at Anna. \n\n\u201cTouch it! Maybe it will open the door!\u201d \n\nThey both placed their hands on the symbol. A bright light exploded around them. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe shadow screamed, \u201cNo! You cannot escape!\u201d But the light grew brighter, pushing the shadow away. \n\nAs the mist faded, a hidden door appeared. \u201cWe found it!\u201d Ben cheered, relief washing over him. \u201cBut we have to hurry!\u201d\n\nTaking a deep breath, Anna opened the door. What lay behind it? Was it safety, or more danger? They were ready to find out, but time was running out.\n\n\u201cAre you ready?\u201d Anna asked, her heart racing. \n\n\u201cAlways!\u201d Ben replied bravely.\n\nThey stepped through the door, not knowing what awaited them.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Elder Yara ask Anna and Ben to solve?","options":["A riddle","A puzzle","A quiz","A riddle contest"],"correct_answer":"A riddle"},{"question":"What does the shadow want?","options":["A snack","The artifact","A friend","A riddle"],"correct_answer":"The artifact"},{"question":"What did Anna and Ben discover on the wall?","options":["A door","A key symbol","A picture","A window"],"correct_answer":"A key symbol"},{"question":"What did Anna encourage Ben to do?","options":["Run away","Touch the symbol","Hide","Give up"],"correct_answer":"Touch the symbol"},{"question":"How does the chapter end?","options":["With a party","With a cliffhanger","With a riddle","With a celebration"],"correct_answer":"With a cliffhanger"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_159_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_159_ch3_img1.png","plot_159_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":488,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
