   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_159_7_10","title":"The Mysterious Artifact","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Magic School","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"The hidden door creaked open, revealing a narrow staircase. Anna and Ben exchanged nervous glances. \u201cAre you ready?\u201d Anna asked, her eyes sparkling with excitement. \n\nBen shrugged. \u201cReady as I\u2019ll ever be. But what if we run into that shadowy figure again?\u201d \n\n\u201cThen we\u2019ll outsmart them!\u201d Anna said confidently. They took a deep breath and stepped into the darkness.\n\nAs they descended, the walls glowed with soft, shimmering lights. \u201cWow! Look at that!\u201d Ben exclaimed, pointing to swirling patterns that danced along the stone walls. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThey reached the bottom of the stairs and found themselves in a circular room. In the center stood a pedestal with the artifact resting on it. It sparkled like a star in the night sky. \n\n\u201cI can feel its magic!\u201d Anna whispered, reaching out a hand. Suddenly, the air shifted. A gentle breeze swirled around them, lifting Anna's hair like magic. \n\n\u201cWait!\u201d Ben shouted. \u201cWhat if it\u2019s a trap?\u201d \n\nBut Anna was already closer. \u201cIt feels warm, Ben. It\u2019s safe!\u201d \n\nJust then, a voice echoed through the chamber. \u201cWho dares enter the Circle of Secrets?\u201d A tall figure appeared, draped in silver robes. It was Elder Yara!\n\n\u201cElder Yara!\u201d Anna and Ben both shouted. \n\n\u201cI sensed you were in danger,\u201d she said with a kind smile. \u201cBut you have shown great courage. Now, you must face the final riddle to protect the artifact.\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s the riddle?\u201d Ben asked, his voice shaking a little.\n\nElder Yara raised her hand. \u201cListen carefully. \u2018I can be cracked, made, told, and played. What am I?\u2019\u201d\n\nAnna thought hard. She loved riddles! \u201cAn egg?\u201d she guessed.\n\n\u201cNo,\u201d Ben said, shaking his head. \u201cIt\u2019s not that.\u201d\n\n\u201cI know!\u201d Anna exclaimed. \u201cIt\u2019s a joke!\u201d\n\nElder Yara nodded. \u201cCorrect! You have proven your cleverness.\u201d \n\nThe artifact glowed brighter, and a path opened behind Elder Yara. \u201cNow, you must hurry. The shadowy figure is closer than you think.\u201d\n\nAnna and Ben looked at each other, determination shining in their eyes. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d they said together.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThey dashed through the passage, ready for whatever lay ahead, knowing they had each other and Elder Yara's wisdom. \n\n\u201cAdventure awaits!\u201d Anna shouted, her heart racing with excitement.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Anna and Ben discover at the bottom of the stairs?","options":["A treasure chest","A magical artifact","A hidden book","A shadowy figure"],"correct_answer":"A magical artifact"},{"question":"Who do Anna and Ben meet in the circular room?","options":["Elder Yara","A shadowy figure","A dragon","A ghost"],"correct_answer":"Elder Yara"},{"question":"What is the riddle Elder Yara gives to Anna and Ben?","options":["What am I?","I can be cracked, made, told, and played. What am I?","I am something that flies.","I am a shape."],"correct_answer":"I can be cracked, made, told, and played. What am I?"},{"question":"How do Anna and Ben feel as they prepare to face the next challenge?","options":["Scared","Excited","Tired","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Excited"},{"question":"What does Anna shout at the end of the chapter?","options":["Let's go!","This is scary!","Help me!","I need a snack!"],"correct_answer":"Let's go!"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_159_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_159_ch4_img1.png","plot_159_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":371,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
