   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_159_7_10","title":"The Mysterious Artifact","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Magic School","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"As Anna and Ben stepped through the hidden door, they found themselves in a magical room. The walls sparkled with colors, and the air smelled sweet like candy. \u201cWow! This place is amazing!\u201d Anna exclaimed, her eyes wide. \n\n\u201cYeah, but where is Elder Yara?\u201d Ben asked, looking around. Just then, a warm light glowed in the center of the room. Elder Yara appeared, her long silver hair shimmering. \n\n\u201cWelcome, young ones,\u201d she said with a kind smile. \u201cYou\u2019ve come far, but your journey isn\u2019t over yet.\u201d \n\n\u201cWhat do we need to do next?\u201d Anna asked, eager to help. \n\nElder Yara held up an ancient book. \u201cThe artifact must be protected with knowledge. You will solve one final riddle.\u201d \n\n\u201cBring it on!\u201d Ben said, his confidence growing. \n\nElder Yara\u2019s eyes twinkled. \u201cListen closely. Here is your riddle: 'I have keys but open no locks. I have space but no room. I have a face but no eyes. What am I?'\u201d \n\nAnna and Ben whispered to each other, thinking hard. \u201cThis is tricky,\u201d Ben said, scratching his head. \u201cWhat has keys but can\u2019t open doors?\u201d \n\nAnna thought about it. \u201cA piano! It has keys!\u201d she shouted suddenly. \n\n\u201cYes! A piano!\u201d Ben agreed, smiling brightly. \n\nElder Yara nodded and clapped her hands. \u201cYou are correct! The artifact is safe. You two are true protectors of magic.\u201d \n\nSuddenly, the room filled with bright light, and the artifact glowed brightly. Anna and Ben exchanged excited looks. \u201cWe did it!\u201d they cheered together.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs the light faded, a beautiful figure appeared in the glow. \u201cThank you, brave ones. The artifact will always be safe with you.\u201d \n\nWith a final wave, Elder Yara vanished. \n\n\u201cCan you believe it?\u201d Ben said, still buzzing with excitement. \u201cWe\u2019re magical protectors!\u201d \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s tell everyone at the academy!\u201d Anna suggested. \n\nThey raced back through the hidden door, ready for their next adventure.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What kind of room do Anna and Ben enter?","options":["A dark cave","A magical room","A classroom","A library"],"correct_answer":"A magical room"},{"question":"Who do Anna and Ben meet in the magical room?","options":["A shadowy figure","Elder Yara","Their teacher","A dragon"],"correct_answer":"Elder Yara"},{"question":"What is the riddle about?","options":["A car","A piano","A book","A door"],"correct_answer":"A piano"},{"question":"What happens when they solve the riddle?","options":["They get lost","The artifact is safe","A monster appears","They leave the academy"],"correct_answer":"The artifact is safe"},{"question":"What do Anna and Ben plan to do after their adventure?","options":["Tell everyone at the academy","Go home","Take a nap","Hide the artifact"],"correct_answer":"Tell everyone at the academy"}]},"images":null,"word_count":321,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
