     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"ethereal","1":"ominous","2":"pulsating","3":"intricate","4":"destiny","image_prompts":["A dimly lit corridor inside Crescent Moon Academy, featuring ancient stone walls adorned with mystical carvings. Anna, a curious young girl with bright eyes and flowing hair, stands before a heavy door, her hand poised to push it open. Ben, her skeptical best friend with tousled hair and an uncertain expression, stands beside her, glancing nervously down the hall.","Inside the magical chamber, a swirling mist envelops Anna and Ben as they face Zathar, a menacing cloaked figure with glowing eyes. The vibrant orb lies on the pedestal, casting colorful light across the room. Runes float ominously around them, creating a sense of tension and urgency, with Anna looking determined and Ben appearing anxious."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dimly lit scene within an ancient library, showcasing towering bookshelves filled with dusty tomes. The atmosphere is magical, with spectral moonlight streaming through ornate windows, illuminating Annas enthralled expression as she reads a glowing book. Ben stands beside her, a mix of skepticism and curiosity on his face, as the shadows seem to swirl around them.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_159_ch3_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 15:43:22"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dynamic and intense scene in a vast underground chamber filled with glowing runes. Ethereal guardians emerge from the shadows, their shimmering forms exuding a sense of power and mystery. Anna and Ben stand together, their expressions a potent blend of fear and determination, ready to face the formidable challenge before them.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_159_ch