     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"trepidation","1":"resonating","2":"intone","3":"exhilaration","4":"resolve","image_prompts":["A serene scene in an enchanted garden at night, illuminated by the moonlight. Anna and Ben stand side by side, their expressions resolute as they prepare for their adventure. Lush greenery surrounds them, with glimpses of ethereal creatures peering through the leaves, embodying the magic of the academy.","A dramatic confrontation at the grand archway, filled with swirling mist and glowing runes. The dark guardian stands imposingly, while Anna faces it with fierce determination, her hand gripping Ben\u2019s tightly. The atmosphere is charged with tension, symbolizing their unity against the challenges ahead."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A serene scene in an enchanted garden at night, illuminated by the moonlight. Anna and Ben stand side by side, their expressions resolute as they prepare for their adventure. Lush greenery surrounds them, with glimpses of ethereal creatures peering through the leaves, embodying the magic of the academy.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_159_ch4_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 15:42:34"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dramatic confrontation at the grand archway, filled with swirling mist and glowing runes. The dark guardian stands imposingly, while Anna faces it with fierce determination, her hand gripping Bens tightly. The atmosphere is charged with tension, symbolizing their unity against the challenges ahead.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_159_ch4_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 15:42:34"}}}
