     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"potion","1":"cauldron","2":"ingredients","3":"courage","4":"mist","image_prompts":["A vibrant, colorful workshop filled with bubbling cauldrons, jars of ingredients, and sparkling lights. Lila, a young girl with bright eyes and messy hair, stands beside Sam, an adventurous boy with a big smile, both looking excited and ready to create magic.","A swirling rainbow mist fills the air, sparkling with colors as Lila and Sam celebrate their success. Master Eldrin stands in the background with a surprised expression, his arms crossed but a smile breaking through. The atmosphere is joyful and magical."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A bustling potion workshop filled with shelves of glass jars, vibrant herbs, and bubbling cauldrons. Lila stands in front of a chaotic workbench, looking focused yet nervous, while Master Eldrin observes her from the doorway, arms crossed, with a grumpy but curious expression.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_160_ch5_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 15:37:38"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing Lila, with determination on her face, pours a glowing golden powder into a large cauldron swirling with vivid colors. The room is filled with a warm light, and Sam watches in awe, his eyes wide with admiration as Master Eldrin stands nearby, surprised and impressed.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_160_ch5_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 15:37:38"}}}
