   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_160_7_10","title":"The Potion Master's Apprentice","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Magic School","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Lila stood at the entrance of the Potion Master\u2019s workshop. The door creaked open, revealing a world full of wonders. Glass jars lined the walls, each filled with colorful ingredients. Some glowed, while others bubbled softly in cauldrons. Lila\u2019s heart raced. \n\n\u201cWow, it\u2019s amazing!\u201d she whispered. She had dreamed of this day for so long.\n\n\u201cDon\u2019t just stand there, Lila!\u201d called Sam, her adventurous friend. He peeked into a giant cauldron that gurgled like a happy monster. \u201cCome see what I found!\u201d\n\nLila stepped inside, her eyes wide. A strong smell of herbs filled the air. \u201cWhat if we break something?\u201d she asked, biting her lip.\n\n\u201cRelax! It\u2019s just a potion,\u201d Sam said with a grin. \u201cWhat\u2019s the worst that could happen?\u201d \n\nLila giggled, her fears melting away. She felt excited. Today, she would learn from the great Master Eldrin!\n\nSuddenly, a loud voice echoed through the room. \u201cWho dares to enter my workshop?\u201d Master Eldrin appeared, his white beard wild and his eyes sharp. He looked grumpy, but Lila felt a spark of curiosity. \n\n\u201cUm, it\u2019s just us!\u201d Sam replied, raising his hands. \u201cWe came to learn!\u201d\n\nMaster Eldrin frowned. \u201cLearning is serious work. Are you ready for the challenge?\u201d\n\n\u201cYes!\u201d Lila exclaimed, surprising herself. She nodded eagerly, no longer feeling shy.\n\n\u201cThen let\u2019s begin!\u201d he said, waving them closer. \u201cToday, you will brew a simple potion.\u201d\n\nLila\u2019s heart danced with joy. She took a deep breath, ready for this adventure. But what if she made a mistake? What if it was the wrong potion?\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nLila cautiously picked up a jar labeled \u201cMoonlight Dust.\u201d It shimmered like stars. \u201cThis will make our potion glow!\u201d she said with excitement. Sam grabbed a jar of \u201cDragon\u2019s Breath\u201d and poured it into the cauldron.\n\nThe potion bubbled and fizzed. \u201cLook! It\u2019s working!\u201d Sam shouted.\n\n\u201cNot too fast!\u201d Master Eldrin warned, raising his hand. \u201cFollow the steps carefully!\u201d \n\nBut Sam was already stirring the cauldron, his eyes wide with wonder. \u201cLet\u2019s make it bubble like a volcano!\u201d \n\n\u201cWait, Sam!\u201d Lila cried. But it was too late. The potion exploded in a colorful splash, filling the workshop with a bright glow. \n\nLila gasped, her heart pounding. \u201cOh no! What have we done?\u201d \n\nMaster Eldrin\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cQuick! We must fix this before it creates chaos!\u201d \n\nThe workshop sparkled with colors as Lila and Sam exchanged worried looks. Would they be able to solve the potion\u2019s problem before it was too late?\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Lila want to become?","options":["A Potion Master","A teacher","A dragon","A knight"],"correct_answer":"A Potion Master"},{"question":"Who is Lila's friend?","options":["Master Eldrin","Sam","A dragon","A potion"],"correct_answer":"Sam"},{"question":"What happens when Sam stirs the cauldron too fast?","options":["It smells nice","It bubbles quietly","It explodes","It glows"],"correct_answer":"It explodes"},{"question":"How does Master Eldrin feel when he first sees Lila and Sam?","options":["Happy","Grumpy","Excited","Surprised"],"correct_answer":"Grumpy"},{"question":"What is in the jar labeled 'Moonlight Dust'?","options":["Water","Stars","Dust","Glowing powder"],"correct_answer":"Glowing powder"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_160_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_160_ch1_img1.png","plot_160_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":425,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
