   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_160_7_10","title":"The Potion Master's Apprentice","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Magic School","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Lila stood nervously in Master Eldrin's workshop. The room was filled with the smell of herbs and the sound of bubbling potions. It was a magical place, with shelves of colorful jars and strange ingredients. Lila's heart raced as she thought about her first potion.\n\n\u201cAre we really going to fix this?\u201d Lila asked Sam, who was examining a bright purple liquid in a jar.\n\n\u201cOf course! We just need to follow the recipe carefully,\u201d Sam replied, grinning. \u201cWhat could go wrong?\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a loud bang echoed through the workshop. Lila jumped. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d\n\nMaster Eldrin stomped into the room, his eyebrows furrowed. \u201cWhat is all this noise? You two are making a mess!\u201d\n\nLila gulped. She stared at the splattered ingredients all over the floor. \u201cWe... we accidentally mixed the wrong potions,\u201d she said softly.\n\n\u201cAccidentally? You must focus, Lila! Potion-making is serious!\u201d Master Eldrin scolded, shaking his head.\n\nLila felt her cheeks burn. She wanted to disappear.\n\n\u201cDon\u2019t worry, Lila. We can clean this up,\u201d Sam said, trying to cheer her up. \u201cLet\u2019s start over with the potion!\u201d\n\nMaster Eldrin sighed. \u201cVery well. But you must be careful. The potion must be perfect. Or else\u2026\u201d\n\nLila shivered at the thought. \u201cOr else what?\u201d she whispered.\n\n\u201cOr else there could be\u2026 consequences,\u201d Master Eldrin replied cryptically, his eyes glinting.\n\n\u201cLike turning into a frog?\u201d Sam joked, making Lila giggle. But she didn\u2019t want to think of the real consequences.\n\nThey began to gather their ingredients again. Lila picked up a jar of sparkling dust. \u201cThis should help!\u201d she said, hoping it would make the potion better.\n\n\u201cCareful with the sparkliness!\u201d Sam winked. \u201cWe don\u2019t want another explosion!\u201d\n\nJust then, the jar slipped from Lila\u2019s fingers. Time seemed to slow as she watched it tumble. It hit the floor and shattered, sending sparkling dust everywhere! \n\nLila gasped, her eyes wide. \u201cOh no! What will Master Eldrin say now?\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe room filled with twinkling light, making it look like a fairyland. Lila gasped again, lost in the beauty for a moment. But then, she noticed the dust swirling around Sam, who was laughing and spinning.\n\n\u201cLook, Lila! I\u2019m magical!\u201d Sam exclaimed, before sneezing glitter.\n\n\u201cSam, stop fooling around!\u201d Lila shouted, her heart racing. \n\nMaster Eldrin marched over, his eyes narrowing. \u201cWhat is going on here?\u201d\n\nLila tried to explain. \u201cIt was an accident! We\u2014\u201d\n\n\u201cEnough!\u201d he interrupted. \u201cYou two must fix this mess. Now!\u201d\n\nLila nodded, determination filling her. \u201cWe can do it! I won\u2019t let Master Eldrin down.\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s brew the right potion this time,\u201d Sam encouraged, clapping her on the back. \u201cTogether!\u201d\n\nLila took a deep breath. \u201cTogether!\u201d she echoed, ready to face the challenge ahead.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Lila and Sam accidentally mix?","options":["The wrong potions","The right potions","Some flowers","A treasure map"],"correct_answer":"The wrong potions"},{"question":"What happens when Lila drops the jar?","options":["It disappears","It shatters","It turns into a frog","It makes a new potion"],"correct_answer":"It shatters"},{"question":"What is Master Eldrin's reaction to the mess?","options":["He laughs","He is angry","He sings a song","He leaves the room"],"correct_answer":"He is angry"},{"question":"What do Lila and Sam decide to do at the end of the chapter?","options":["Run away","Try again to brew the potion","Make a different potion","Have a party"],"correct_answer":"Try again to brew the potion"},{"question":"Who encourages Lila to take risks?","options":["Master Eldrin","The other students","Sam","The potions themselves"],"correct_answer":"Sam"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_160_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_160_ch2_img1.png","plot_160_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":460,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
