   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_160_7_10","title":"The Potion Master's Apprentice","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Magic School","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Lila looked up at the towering shelves in Master Eldrin's workshop. Each shelf was filled with jars of colorful ingredients. Some sparkled like stars, while others glowed in bright shades of green and blue. Lila's heart raced with excitement. This was where all the magic happened!\n\n\"Are you ready, Lila?\" Sam asked, bouncing on his toes. His eyes sparkled with mischief. \"Today is the day we brew something amazing!\"  \n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]  \n\nLila took a deep breath. \"I hope so, Sam. But what if Master Eldrin doesn\u2019t like it?\"  \n\"He will if we make it right! Let's choose something fun!\" Sam pointed to a jar labeled \u201cGlimmering Grape Essence.\u201d The label promised it would make anyone feel light as a feather.  \n\nLila felt a flutter of hope. \"Okay, let\u2019s do it!\" They gathered the ingredients and focused on the cauldron. Lila poured the essence in, and the potion turned a dazzling shade of purple.  \n\nThen came a loud crack! A piece of glass from the shelf fell and smashed beside them. \"What was that?\" Lila squeaked.  \n\"I don\u2019t know! But we have to hurry!\" Sam grabbed a handful of sparkling dust. \"Add this!\"  \n\nAs Lila mixed the potion, bubbles began to rise. The cauldron bubbled and gurgled, sending out a sweet scent. Suddenly, the potion started glowing! It lit up the dark corners of the workshop. \"Look at it!\" Sam cheered.  \n\nBut then, the potion erupted! A cloud of purple mist filled the air. Lila and Sam coughed, waving their arms to clear it away. \"Oh no! What have we done?\" Lila gasped.  \n\nJust then, Master Eldrin appeared, his eyebrows raised in surprise. \"What is going on here?\" He looked furious, but Lila saw a spark of worry in his eyes. \"You can\u2019t just brew potions without understanding them!\"  \n\n\"We thought it would be fun!\" Sam shouted, trying to defend them.  \n\"It is fun,\" Master Eldrin replied, \"but it\u2019s also dangerous!\" He stepped closer, examining the mist. Lila's stomach twisted.  \n\n\"What do we do now? It looks like a storm in here!\" she said, feeling the pressure build.  \n\"We need to contain the potion before it spreads!\" Master Eldrin said, his voice firm.  \n\nLila's heart raced. She could feel the weight of their mistake. They needed to act fast. \u201cI think I know how to fix it, but it will be risky!\u201d Lila said, feeling both scared and brave.  \n\nSam nodded. \"Then let\u2019s do it, Lila! We can\u2019t let it go out of control!\"  \n\nLila took a deep breath. \"Okay, we need to mix in the counter potion from the secret recipe book!\" She pointed to the old book on the table. But as she reached for it, she hesitated. Could she really do this?  \n\n\"Time is running out!\" Master Eldrin shouted. \"Make a choice now!\"  \n\nLila felt the weight of her decision. Would she take the risk to save the day?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What potion did Lila and Sam decide to brew?","options":["Glimmering Grape Essence","Shimmering Strawberry Juice","Bubbling Blue Potion","Dazzling Dragon Brew"],"correct_answer":"Glimmering Grape Essence"},{"question":"What happened when they tried to brew the potion?","options":["It glowed but was fine","It exploded into mist","It turned into a fruit salad","It disappeared"],"correct_answer":"It exploded into mist"},{"question":"How did Master Eldrin react to the mess?","options":["He was pleased","He was angry but worried","He laughed","He ignored it"],"correct_answer":"He was angry but worried"},{"question":"What did Lila feel she needed to do?","options":["Give up","Take a nap","Fix the potion","Hide"],"correct_answer":"Fix the potion"},{"question":"What does Sam encourage Lila to do?","options":["Run away","Take risks","Ignore Master Eldrin","Make a different potion"],"correct_answer":"Take risks"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_160_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_160_ch3_img1.png","plot_160_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":488,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
