   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_160_7_10","title":"The Potion Master's Apprentice","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Magic School","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Lila stood in the Potion Master's workshop, surrounded by jars of colorful ingredients. The air was thick with the scent of herbs and magic. She gazed at the bubbling cauldrons, her heart racing with excitement and fear. \n\n\"Today is the day!\" Lila whispered to herself. She had to fix the potion before it caused more trouble. Master Eldrin was counting on her.\n\n\"Are you ready, Lila?\" Sam asked, bouncing on his toes. His eyes sparkled with mischief. \n\n\"I think so,\" Lila said, her voice barely above a whisper. \"But what if I mess up again?\"\n\n\"You won\u2019t! Just remember what we learned!\" Sam grinned, handing her a jar of shimmering blue crystals. \n\nLila took a deep breath and nodded. They had gathered all the ingredients they needed: dragon scale dust, moonflower petals, and a drop of laughter. The potion was tricky, but it was their only hope to stop the purple smoke.\n\nTogether, they approached the bubbling cauldron. Lila poured in the dragon scale dust. The potion sizzled happily. \u201cNext, the moonflower petals!\u201d Sam called excitedly.\n\nAs Lila added the petals, a warm glow filled the room. She smiled. Maybe this would work after all! \n\nSuddenly, the cauldron began to bubble wildly. \u201cUh-oh!\u201d Sam shouted. \u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d\n\nLila\u2019s heart raced. \u201cI don\u2019t know! We need to add the laughter!\u201d She quickly poured in a drop of laughter. The cauldron erupted with a bright flash of light. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe workshop was filled with sparkles and giggles that danced in the air. Lila and Sam looked at each other, wide-eyed and amazed. The potion had transformed! Instead of chaos, it created a beautiful rainbow mist that swirled around them.\n\n\u201cLila! You did it!\u201d Sam cheered. \u201cThe potion is perfect!\u201d\n\nJust then, Master Eldrin walked in, his grumpy expression softening as he gazed at the swirling colors. \u201cWhat have you two done?\u201d he asked, eyes wide in surprise.\n\n\u201cWe fixed the potion, Master Eldrin!\u201d Lila said proudly. \u201cAnd look at the rainbow mist!\u201d\n\nMaster Eldrin rubbed his chin, a small smile creeping onto his face. \u201cVery well, Lila. You have shown great courage today. You are learning to be a true potion-maker.\u201d\n\nLila\u2019s heart swelled with pride. \u201cThank you, Master Eldrin!\u201d She felt lighter, like she could float on the rainbow mist.\n\n\u201cNow, let\u2019s see what else you can create,\u201d he said, his eyes twinkling with a hint of mischief. \n\nLila and Sam exchanged excited glances. What new adventures lay ahead? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s brew!\u201d Sam shouted, and Lila laughed. They were ready for anything.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is Lila trying to fix?","options":["A broken cauldron","A potion","A spell","A broom"],"correct_answer":"A potion"},{"question":"What does Sam give to Lila to help her?","options":["A jar of water","Shimmering blue crystals","A magic wand","A book"],"correct_answer":"Shimmering blue crystals"},{"question":"What happens when Lila adds the laughter to the potion?","options":["It explodes","It turns into a rainbow mist","It disappears","It becomes sticky"],"correct_answer":"It turns into a rainbow mist"},{"question":"How does Master Eldrin react to the rainbow mist?","options":["He is angry","He is surprised","He ignores it","He leaves the room"],"correct_answer":"He is surprised"},{"question":"What do Lila and Sam decide to do next?","options":["Go home","Take a nap","Brew more potions","Leave the workshop"],"correct_answer":"Brew more potions"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_160_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_160_ch5_img1.png","plot_160_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":430,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
