   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"fantasy_160_11_14","title":"The Potion Master's Apprentice","genre":"Fantasy","sub_genre":"Magic School","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Lila stood in the Potion Master\u2019s workshop, surrounded by towering shelves crammed with jars of ingredients: dried dragonfly wings, powdered moonstone, and glistening pixie dust. The air was thick with the scent of herbs and bubbling liquids, sending her heart racing. She could hardly believe she was here, in this mystical place\u2014yet, a wave of anxiety washed over her. What if she messed up again?\n\n\u201cLila, focus!\u201d Master Eldrin\u2019s gruff voice broke her reverie. He glared at her from behind a cauldron, his eyebrows knitted together like two storm clouds. \u201cWe have a lot of work to do, and no time for daydreaming!\u201d\n\n\u201cYes, Master,\u201d Lila murmured, trying to steady her trembling hands. She watched as Eldrin\u2019s practiced fingers measured shimmering liquids with precision. If only she could be as confident as he was. \n\nAs she prepared to mix her first potion of the day\u2014a soothing draught for anxiety\u2014Sam burst into the workshop, his face flushed with excitement. \u201cLila! You won\u2019t believe what I found!\u201d \n\n\u201cNot now, Sam. I need to concentrate,\u201d Lila replied, her eyes darting between her ingredients and the bubbling cauldron. But Sam, undeterred, traipsed closer, a mischievous grin plastered on his face.\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s a map! It shows where the hidden ingredients are kept!\u201d he exclaimed, waving a crumpled piece of parchment in front of her. Lila\u2019s curiosity piqued. The academy was filled with secret places\u2014the kind of locations that could hold powerful items or rare potions.\n\n\u201cReally?\u201d she asked, caught between her duty and her interest. \u201cWhere did you find it?\u201d\n\n\u201cNear the old library! We could explore it after class!\u201d He leaned closer, egging her on. \u201cJust imagine what we could discover!\u201d\n\nBefore Lila could respond, a strange hissing sound filled the air, and she whipped around to see a vibrant purple smoke rising from her cauldron. \u201cOh no!\u201d Panic surged through her. She had forgotten a crucial ingredient, and now her potion was turning into a swirling disaster.\n\n\u201cLila!\u201d Master Eldrin bellowed, moving quickly to contain the situation. \u201cGet the antidote! Now!\u201d\n\nHeart pounding, Lila scrambled for the right jar but bumped into a shelf, sending a cascade of glass jars crashing to the floor. The sound echoed through the workshop like thunder, and she felt a rush of embarrassment wash over her. She could feel Eldrin\u2019s disapproval piercing through the air.\n\n\u201cThis is exactly what I\u2019m talking about!\u201d he raged. \u201cYou need to be more careful!\u201d\n\n\u201cBut I\u2014\u201d Lila stammered, her voice barely above a whisper. She felt small and insignificant, as if the walls of the workshop were closing in on her. Sam stepped forward, determination glinting in his eyes.\n\n\u201cMaster Eldrin, she was just distracted. We can fix this together, can\u2019t we?\u201d he said, trying to diffuse the tension. Lila looked at Sam, a mixture of gratitude and worry in her heart. \n\nEldrin paused, his expression softening ever so slightly. \u201cVery well. But work quickly. We don\u2019t have much time before the potion explodes.\u201d\n\nWith a nod from Sam, Lila gathered her courage. She raced to grab the antidote, her thoughts swirling like the potion gone wrong. As she poured the sparkling liquid into the cauldron, she felt a surge of determination. Maybe she could conquer her fears after all.\n\nJust as the cauldron began to simmer down, a loud bang erupted, and Lila stumbled backward, nearly losing her balance. The potion had transformed into something unexpected\u2014a curious, shimmering jelly that bubbled and wobbled like a living creature. \n\n\u201cWhat is that?\u201d Sam gasped, wide-eyed.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know,\u201d Lila admitted, her heart racing. \u201cBut we need to figure it out before it causes more chaos!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1: An interior view of the Potion Master\u2019s workshop, filled with shelves of jars labeled with mysterious ingredients. Lila is seen nervously adjusting her potion ingredients, while Master Eldrin stands behind her, frowning in concentration. The atmosphere is filled with colorful potions and the steam from bubbling cauldrons.]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2: A dynamic scene illustrating the moment when the cauldron erupts with vibrant purple smoke. Lila stumbles backward, surprised and wide-eyed, while Sam watches in awe, both excited and apprehensive. The workshop is chaotic, with jars spilling and the strange jelly bubbling dangerously in the foreground.]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What potion was Lila trying to create?","options":["A healing potion","A soothing draught for anxiety","An explosive potion","A love potion"],"correct_answer":"A soothing draught for anxiety"},{"question":"What did Sam bring to Lila during her potion-making?","options":["A new potion recipe","A map to hidden ingredients","An antidote","A warning about Master Eldrin"],"correct_answer":"A map to hidden ingredients"},{"question":"How did Master Eldrin react to Lila's mistake?","options":["He praised her for creativity","He was angry and disappointed","He laughed it off","He helped her fix it immediately"],"correct_answer":"He was angry and disappointed"},{"question":"What unexpected result occurred when Lila added the antidote?","options":["The potion exploded","It turned into a shimmering jelly","It stopped bubbling","It glowed in the dark"],"correct_answer":"It turned into a shimmering jelly"},{"question":"What theme is prominent in this chapter?","options":["Teamwork and friendship","Betrayal and revenge","Isolation and loneliness","Fear of the unknown"],"correct_answer":"Teamwork and friendship"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_160_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_160_ch2_img1.png","plot_160_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":720,"reading_level":"Builder"}
