     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"grove","1":"scavengers","2":"distraction","3":"magic","4":"seeds","image_prompts":["A vibrant grove filled with colorful flowers, towering trees, and a bright blue sky. Mia, a twelve-year-old girl with brown hair in a ponytail, stands next to her friend Sam, who wears goggles and holds a blinking gadget. Both look excited and curious, surrounded by friendly, talking plants.","An action-packed scene where Mia and Sam are running through the grove, with bright green leaves flying around them. The scavengers, startled, point in the direction of Mia and Sam. The mood is tense but colorful, with plants cheering them on in the background."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A vibrant grove filled with lush trees and colorful flowers, sunlight filtering through the leaves. In the foreground, Mia and Sam are crouched together, a look of determination on their faces as they prepare to distract the scavengers. The scene captures the juxtaposition of natures beauty and humanitys threat, with shadows playing on the ground and the rich colors of the plants symbolizing hope.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_326_ch4_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 15:33:59"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dynamic scene where the roots of the trees spring to life, wrapping around the legs of startled scavengers. The background shows Mia and Sam standing resolutely, their expressions a mix of awe and determination. The lighting is dramatic, emphasizing the chaos of the moment, with the roots acting as a visual metaphor for natures protective force.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_326_ch4_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 15:33:59"}}}
