     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"glow","1":"gadget","2":"escape","3":"whisper","4":"courage","image_prompts":["A bright, magical grove with Mia and Sam standing under a large willow tree. Mia, a brave girl, has bright eyes and a determined expression. Sam, clever with glasses, is adjusting a gadget. The trees around them are lush and vibrant, with colorful flowers blooming everywhere, creating a friendly and enchanting atmosphere.","Mia and Sam flying high on a leaf glider, surrounded by sparkling seeds that glow like stars. The grove below is a mix of bright greens and colorful blooms, with the sun shining through. The scavenger can be seen in the distance, looking confused, as the plants bloom magically around Mia and Sam, creating a sense of excitement and adventure."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A lush, vibrant grove filled with colorful plants that appear to be alive. The sunlight filters through the leaves, creating a magical ambiance. Mia stands in awe, her expression a mixture of determination and wonder, as she gazes up at the towering Elder Fern, whose enormous fronds seem to glow with wisdom.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_326_ch5_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 15:33:13"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dramatic scene where Mia confronts the Scavengers Leader beneath a crumbling overpass, the tension palpable. The leader, cloaked in tattered fabric, looks both intimidating and intrigued. The background is shadowy, contrasting with the warm colors of the sunset, symbolizing the clash between destruction and growth. Mia stands firm, her expression resolute, embodying courage in the face of adversity.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_326_ch5_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 15:33:13"}}}
