   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_326_7_10","title":"Whispers of the Green","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Post-Apocalyptic","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Mia woke up to a warm, sunny morning. She rubbed her eyes and stretched. Outside her window, the city looked different. Trees climbed up skyscrapers, and flowers bloomed everywhere. Nature had taken over.\n\n\u201cWow!\u201d Mia said, rushing outside. \u201cThis is amazing!\u201d \n\nHer friend Sam joined her. He wore his favorite goggles and had a tool belt filled with gadgets. \u201cDid you see the giant sunflower?\u201d he asked, pointing excitedly.\n\nMia nodded. \u201cLet\u2019s explore!\u201d \n\nThey ran down the street. Bright green vines hung from rooftops. Birds chirped happily in the branches. Everything smelled fresh and alive. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nMia and Sam climbed over an old car covered in flowers. \u201cLook at this place!\u201d Sam exclaimed. They stumbled upon a hidden grove. It was surrounded by tall trees. The air was full of magic. \n\nSuddenly, a voice called out. \u201cWho goes there?\u201d \n\nMia jumped back. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d \n\nA big, colorful plant with wide leaves appeared. \u201cI am Fern, guardian of this grove!\u201d it said. \u201cWelcome!\u201d \n\nSam grinned. \u201cTalking plants? This is the best day ever!\u201d \n\n\u201cBut we must be careful,\u201d Fern warned, swaying gently. \u201cScavengers are coming. They want to destroy the grove!\u201d \n\nMia\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWe can\u2019t let that happen!\u201d\n\nSam pulled out his gadget. \u201cI can make a trap! We can catch them!\u201d \n\nFern nodded. \u201cTogether, we can protect our home.\u201d \n\nMia looked around. \u201cWhat else can we do?\u201d \n\nFern smiled. \u201cListen close. Nature has secrets to share.\u201d \n\nMia felt excitement bubble inside her. They had a big adventure ahead. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s get ready!\u201d Sam declared. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nMia and Sam worked with the plants, gathering leaves and sticks. They crafted a clever trap. With every twist and turn, they learned more about the grove. The plants whispered their secrets.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s hide,\u201d Mia whispered. \n\nThey crouched behind a bush. Suddenly, they saw shadows approaching. The scavengers were near! \n\nMia and Sam held their breath. This was just the beginning. \n\nWhat would happen next?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Mia discover outside her window?","options":["A talking cat","A giant sunflower","A city transformed by nature","A spaceship"],"correct_answer":"A city transformed by nature"},{"question":"Who is Fern?","options":["A scavenger","A talking plant","Mia's pet","Sam's brother"],"correct_answer":"A talking plant"},{"question":"What did Sam want to make to catch the scavengers?","options":["A trap","A spaceship","A fort","A robot"],"correct_answer":"A trap"},{"question":"What did Mia and Sam find in the grove?","options":["A treasure map","Talking plants","A secret door","A waterfall"],"correct_answer":"Talking plants"},{"question":"What did Mia feel as she looked around the grove?","options":["Scared","Bored","Excited","Tired"],"correct_answer":"Excited"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_326_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_326_ch1_img1.png","plot_326_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":328,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
