   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_326_7_10","title":"Whispers of the Green","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Post-Apocalyptic","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Mia and Sam stood at the edge of the grove, their hearts racing. The trees whispered secrets above them. \u201cWhat if the scavengers come here?\u201d Sam asked, his brow furrowed. \n\nFern, the wise plant, rustled his leaves. \u201cYou must protect this place, children. The scavengers want to take everything!\u201d \n\nMia nodded. \u201cWe have to come up with a plan. But how?\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a loud crash echoed from the city. They turned to see a group of scavengers tearing through the vines. \u201cThere they are!\u201d Mia gasped. \n\n\u201cQuick! We need to hide!\u201d Sam shouted. They ducked behind a giant sunflower. The sunflower leaned down. \u201cDon\u2019t worry! I\u2019ll keep you safe!\u201d it said cheerfully.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nMia peeked around the sunflower. \u201cLook! They\u2019re coming this way!\u201d \n\nThe scavengers were tall and rough-looking. One of them kicked a small plant. \u201cUgh! These weeds are everywhere!\u201d he grumbled. \n\nMia felt her heart pound. \u201cWe can\u2019t let them destroy the grove,\u201d she whispered. \n\nSam pulled out his gadget bag. \u201cI have some tricks up my sleeve! I can build something to distract them!\u201d \n\nMia smiled, feeling brave. \u201cLet\u2019s do it! We need to be quick!\u201d\n\nAs Sam rummaged through his bag, he found a shiny object. \u201cThis is it! A noise maker!\u201d He quickly assembled the pieces. \u201cWhen I press this button, it will make a loud sound over there.\u201d \n\nMia nodded. \u201cThat\u2019s perfect! They\u2019ll go investigate, and we can keep the grove safe!\u201d \n\nWith a deep breath, Sam pressed the button. A loud honking noise filled the air. The scavengers turned, startled. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d one shouted. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go see!\u201d another said, running off. \n\nMia and Sam exchanged excited looks. \u201cIt worked!\u201d they whispered. \n\nBut just then, the sunflower spoke again. \u201cWatch out! There\u2019s more coming!\u201d \n\nMia and Sam\u2019s eyes widened. They had to think fast. \u201cWe need another plan!\u201d Mia exclaimed, feeling the weight of their secret mission. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cOkay,\u201d Sam said, his mind racing. \u201cWe need to lure them away even more. Maybe we can use the flowers to help!\u201d \n\n\u201cYes! They can create a beautiful scent!\u201d Mia agreed. \n\nTogether, they whispered their new idea to the flowers, and the grove began to bloom brightly. \n\nWhat would happen next? Would they be able to save their magical home?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Mia and Sam see that makes them worried?","options":["A loud noise","The scavengers","Talking flowers","A big tree"],"correct_answer":"The scavengers"},{"question":"What gadget does Sam use to distract the scavengers?","options":["A noise maker","A flashlight","A toy","A plant"],"correct_answer":"A noise maker"},{"question":"How do the scavengers react to the noise?","options":["They run away","They ignore it","They get scared","They laugh"],"correct_answer":"They run away"},{"question":"What do Mia and Sam decide to do next?","options":["Hide in the trees","Make the flowers bloom","Climb a building","Run home"],"correct_answer":"Make the flowers bloom"},{"question":"Who helps Mia and Sam hide?","options":["Fern","The sunflower","A tree","A weed"],"correct_answer":"The sunflower"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_326_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_326_ch2_img1.png","plot_326_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":387,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
