   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_326_7_10","title":"Whispers of the Green","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Post-Apocalyptic","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"The lush grove seemed brighter than ever as Mia and Sam stood beneath the twisted trees. Fern, the wise plant, swayed gently in the breeze. \u201cWe need to protect our home!\u201d she cried. \u201cThe scavengers are getting closer.\u201d\n\nMia\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWhat if they find the grove today?\u201d \n\n\u201cWe have to be ready,\u201d Sam said, adjusting his glasses. He pulled out a small gadget made from old metal and wires. \u201cThis is a noise maker! It will help us distract them.\u201d\n\nFern nodded. \u201cGood thinking, Sam!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a rustling sound echoed from the edge of the grove. The leaves trembled, and Mia\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cThey\u2019re coming! We need to hide!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nMia and Sam quickly ducked behind a big, leafy plant. They watched as a group of scavengers entered the grove, their eyes scanning the area. \u201cWhere are those plants?\u201d one of the scavengers grumbled.\n\nMia whispered, \u201cWe have to make the noise maker work fast!\u201d \n\nSam pressed a button on his gadget. A loud, squeaky sound filled the air. The scavengers jumped, confused. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d \n\nMia smiled. \u201cIt worked! Now, let\u2019s go!\u201d \n\nThey tiptoed through the grove, careful not to make a sound. But just as they thought they were safe, a scavenger spotted them! \u201cHey! There they are!\u201d he shouted.\n\nMia felt a rush of panic. \u201cRun!\u201d she shouted. They dashed deeper into the grove, the sound of footsteps chasing after them.\n\n\u201cFern, help us!\u201d Sam cried. \u201cWe need a way to stop them!\u201d\n\nFern's leaves rustled wildly. \u201cFollow me! I know a secret path!\u201d \n\nMia and Sam sprinted after Fern, who led them through thick vines and colorful flowers. But the scavengers were close behind. Just when they thought they might escape, they reached a dead end with a giant tree blocking the path.\n\n\u201cThis is it!\u201d Mia gasped. \u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d \n\n\u201cClimb!\u201d shouted Sam. \u201cWe can go over!\u201d \n\nThey scrambled up the tree, feeling the rough bark beneath their hands. They peeked over to see the scavengers looking around. \u201cThey can\u2019t find us here,\u201d Mia said, holding her breath.\n\nSuddenly, the ground shook, and the tree trembled. \u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d Sam yelled. \n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know!\u201d Mia cried, gripping the branch tightly. \n\nJust then, they spotted a glowing root snaking toward the tree, pulsing with bright green energy. \u201cIt\u2019s the magic of the grove!\u201d Fern exclaimed. \u201cBut it\u2019s fading!\u201d\n\nMia felt a chill. \u201cIf it fades, the grove will be in danger!\u201d \n\nThey needed to act fast. \u201cWe have to protect it!\u201d Sam said. \u201cBut how?\u201d \n\nMia looked from the glowing root to the path down below. \u201cWe need to get down there and stop the scavengers!\u201d \n\nBut was it too late?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Mia and Sam use to distract the scavengers?","options":["A whistle","A noise maker","A flashlight","A ball"],"correct_answer":"A noise maker"},{"question":"What happens when the scavengers spot Mia and Sam?","options":["They run away","They chase after them","They start dancing","They climb the tree"],"correct_answer":"They chase after them"},{"question":"What do Mia and Sam find at the dead end?","options":["A hidden door","A giant tree","A river","A cave"],"correct_answer":"A giant tree"},{"question":"What is glowing and pulsing with energy?","options":["A flower","The tree","A root","The sky"],"correct_answer":"A root"},{"question":"What do Mia and Sam decide to do when the tree shakes?","options":["Climb down","Stay still","Get down and stop the scavengers","Call for help"],"correct_answer":"Get down and stop the scavengers"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_326_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_326_ch3_img1.png","plot_326_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":457,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
