   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_326_7_10","title":"Whispers of the Green","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Post-Apocalyptic","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Mia and Sam stood at the edge of the grove. The air smelled sweet, like blooming flowers. \"I can\u2019t believe we made it back!\" Mia said, her eyes wide with wonder. \n\n\"We have to keep it safe,\" Sam replied, adjusting his goggles. He held a small device that flickered with lights. \"This can help us find the scavengers.\"\n\nSuddenly, a rustling sound came from the bushes. Mia jumped. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find out!\u201d Sam said, moving closer. They peeked through the leaves and saw the wise old plant, Elder Fern.\n\n\u201cAh! Young adventurers!\u201d Elder Fern called, his voice deep and warm. \u201cI sensed your worry. The magic is fading, but hope is not lost!\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat can we do?\u201d Mia asked, her heart racing.\n\n\u201cYou must gather the lost seeds,\u201d Elder Fern explained. \u201cThese seeds hold the grove\u2019s magic. Without them, we cannot restore balance.\u201d\n\n\u201cBut the scavengers are everywhere!\u201d Mia said, biting her lip.\n\n\u201cThen we must be clever!\u201d Sam exclaimed. He grinned, pulling out a gadget with spinning gears. \u201cI can create a distraction!\u201d\n\nElder Fern nodded. \u201cYes! Use your inventions, Sam. The plants will assist you. We can do this together!\u201d\n\nMia felt a spark of hope. \"Let\u2019s go, Sam!\"\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThey dashed through the grove, the vibrant colors swirling around them. Bright orange flowers waved as they passed, whispering encouragement. \u201cYou can do it!\u201d they cheered.\n\n\u201cThis way!\u201d Sam said, leading Mia toward the edge of the grove where the scavengers often lurked.\n\nSuddenly, they spotted a group of scavengers digging near the old city wall. Their bags were full of strange tools and broken gadgets. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s sneak closer,\u201d Mia whispered. They crouched behind a tall sunflower that towered over them. \n\n\u201cI\u2019ll create a noise!\u201d Sam said, his eyes sparkling with mischief. He pressed a button on his gadget, and a loud \u201cBEEP!\u201d echoed through the air.\n\nThe scavengers jumped. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d one of them shouted.\n\n\u201cHere!\u201d another said, pointing in the opposite direction. \n\nMia and Sam exchanged glances, grinning. They were on the right track!\n\n\u201cWe\u2019re doing it!\u201d Mia whispered excitedly.\n\n\u201cYes! Let\u2019s find those seeds!\u201d Sam replied. They moved quietly, staying hidden behind the plants.\n\nAs they crept forward, Mia felt the grove\u2019s magic buzzing around her. \u201cWe can save it! We will save it!\u201d she thought.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nBut just then, a scavenger turned and spotted them! \u201cHey! There they are!\u201d he yelled, pointing at Mia and Sam.\n\n\u201cRun!\u201d Mia shouted, and they bolted, their hearts pounding.\n\nWith the grove\u2019s colors surrounding them, they knew they had to be brave. The adventure was just beginning.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Mia and Sam need to gather to save the grove?","options":["Lost maps","Old toys","Lost seeds","Treasure chests"],"correct_answer":"Lost seeds"},{"question":"Who helps Mia and Sam understand their mission?","options":["A talking dog","Elder Fern","A wise wizard","A clever cat"],"correct_answer":"Elder Fern"},{"question":"What does Sam use to create a distraction?","options":["A loud drum","A flashing light","A gadget","A whistle"],"correct_answer":"A gadget"},{"question":"What happens when the scavengers see Mia and Sam?","options":["They hide","They run away","They chase after them","They help them"],"correct_answer":"They chase after them"},{"question":"What do the plants in the grove do as Mia and Sam run?","options":["They shout","They whisper","They cheer","They sleep"],"correct_answer":"They cheer"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_326_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_326_ch4_img1.png","plot_326_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":444,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
