   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_326_11_14","title":"Whispers of the Green","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Post-Apocalyptic","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Mia woke up to the sound of chirping leaves, the sunlight streaming through her window painted in shades of green. It had been three years since the Great Change, and the city had transformed from steel and concrete to a wild tapestry of vines and flowers. Skyscrapers, once ominous towers of industry, stood intertwined with massive trees, their bark as rough as the city had once been. \n\nAs she pushed her window open, a whiff of fresh earth and blooming flowers flooded her senses. She leaned out, taking a deep breath. This was her world now, a world where nature had claimed its victory. \"Can you believe it, Mia?\" Sam's voice called up from the ground below. He was perched on an old rusted car, his dark hair tousled by the wind, and his eyes sparkled with excitement. \n\n\"Believe what?\" she replied, grinning back at him.\n\n\"The wildflowers! They\u2019re blooming all over the park!\" he shouted, bouncing on his feet. \n\nMia scrambled to grab her backpack and a few gadgets Sam had cobbled together. Together, they ventured through the jungle-like streets, alive with the sounds of rustling leaves and distant animal calls. Nature had reclaimed the city, yes, but it was not without its mysteries\u2014and dangers. \n\nAs they entered the park, Mia spotted the vibrant colors of the wildflowers dancing in the breeze. But it was not just the flowers that caught her attention. In the center of the park lay a hidden grove, unlike anything she had seen before. Towering plants glowed with hues of emerald and sapphire, their leaves shimmering like jewels in the sunlight. \n\n\u201cSam, look at that!\u201d Mia pointed, her heart racing with excitement. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cWhat do you think it is?\u201d Sam asked, awe written on his face.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but it feels... special,\u201d she whispered, instinctively stepping closer to the grove. \n\nJust then, a soft rustling broke the air. Mia and Sam turned to see a gigantic sunflower bobbing its head, its yellow petals shimmering brightly. \u201cWelcome, young explorers!\u201d it boomed, surprising them both.\n\n\u201cWait, did that\u2014did that flower just talk?\u201d Sam stammered, his inventor mind racing with possibilities.\n\nMia felt a rush of joy and wonder. \u201cIt did! What\u2019s your name?\u201d she asked, stepping forward boldly.\n\n\u201cI am Sunflare,\u201d the sunflower replied, radiating warmth. \u201cAnd you are in the Grove of Whispers, a sanctuary for the plants and a secret from the world outside.\u201d \n\nBefore they could ask more, the ground vibrated beneath them. From behind a cluster of thick roots, a group of figures emerged, clad in tattered clothing, their eyes sharp and hungry. \n\n\u201cMia! Sam! Run!\u201d Sunflare shouted, its voice booming with urgency. \n\nAdrenaline surged as they turned to flee, but their hearts raced not just from fear. They were determined to protect the wondrous grove they just discovered. As they sprinted through the park, Mia glanced back to see the scavengers drawing closer. The thrill of adventure surged through her veins. Together, they would fight for this magical place.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cStick together!\u201d Mia called out, her mind racing with plans. What did these scavengers want? And how could they save the grove? \n\nMia\u2019s heart beat in rhythm with the lush world around her. This was just the beginning of something extraordinary.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What transformed the city into a jungle?","options":["The Great Change","A natural disaster","An alien invasion","A magical spell"],"correct_answer":"The Great Change"},{"question":"What is the name of the talking sunflower?","options":["Sunny","Sunshine","Sunflare","Flare"],"correct_answer":"Sunflare"},{"question":"What do Mia and Sam need to protect?","options":["Their home","A treasure","The grove","The scavengers"],"correct_answer":"The grove"},{"question":"How does Mia feel about the grove?","options":["Indifferent","Curious","Fearful","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Curious"},{"question":"What prompts Mia and Sam to run?","options":["A storm","A talking flower","Scavengers","A loud noise"],"correct_answer":"Scavengers"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_326_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_326_ch1_img1.png","plot_326_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":549,"reading_level":"Builder"}
