       [DEBUG] Checking shared image: {"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dramatic scene unfolding as Mia is held by a scavenger, his menacing expression contrasting with the protective vines of the grove that are wrapping around him. The tension is palpable, with dark clouds gathering above, casting ominous shadows over the grove. Mias face reflects a mix of fear and resolve, while the plants resonate with energy, ready to fight for their home.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_326_ch3_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 15:35:07"}
