   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_327_7_10","title":"The Last Library","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Post-Apocalyptic","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"In a world where the sun barely peeked through thick clouds, Leo wandered through the ruins of his city. Old buildings stood like tired giants, their walls covered in vines and dust. He could feel the weight of silence around him, broken only by the crunch of glass underfoot.\n\n\u201cLeo! Wait up!\u201d Clara called, her voice bright and cheerful. She raced to catch up with her brother. Clara\u2019s hair flew behind her like a wild kite. She loved exploring the old city, dreaming of treasures hidden in the ruins.\n\n\u201cDo you think we\u2019ll find anything today?\u201d Leo asked, his eyes scanning the horizon. The crumbling towers looked like they held secrets from the past.\n\n\u201cDefinitely! Maybe a treasure map or even a robot!\u201d Clara giggled. She always believed that adventure awaited around every corner.\n\nAs they turned a corner, they stumbled upon a large door, half-buried in the ground. \u201cWhat\u2019s this?\u201d Leo wondered aloud, brushing dirt off the door\u2019s surface. \u201cIt looks like it hasn\u2019t been opened in ages.\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s open it!\u201d Clara exclaimed, her eyes sparkling with excitement.\n\nLeo hesitated. \u201cWhat if it\u2019s locked?\u201d\n\n\u201cThen we\u2019ll find a way!\u201d Clara replied, determination in her voice. Together, they pushed against the heavy door, and it creaked open. Dust swirled in the air, and a warm glow spilled out.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nInside, they found shelves filled with books! Books everywhere! Leo\u2019s heart raced. \u201cLook at all these!\u201d he shouted. Clara rushed forward, her fingers tracing the spines of forgotten stories.\n\n\u201cThis is amazing!\u201d Clara said, her voice echoing. \u201cDo you think they still have magic in them?\u201d\n\nBefore Leo could answer, a sound echoed down the hall. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d he asked, a shiver running down his spine. \n\nSuddenly, two figures appeared at the entrance. They wore dark cloaks and had sharp eyes. \u201cLooks like we found some little treasure hunters,\u201d one of them sneered. \n\n\u201cRun, Clara!\u201d Leo shouted, grabbing her hand. They raced deeper into the library, their hearts pounding. The book hunters followed, and Leo felt the thrill of danger in the air.\n\n\u201cWhere do we go?\u201d Clara asked, panting. \n\n\u201cAnywhere but here!\u201d Leo replied, glancing back. The book hunters were getting closer.\n\nThey dashed around a corner and found a small room filled with books. \u201cWe have to protect these!\u201d Clara said, her voice strong. \u201cThese books can help our world!\u201d\n\nLeo nodded. \u201cWe\u2019ll gather them and keep them safe!\u201d\n\nBut could they really protect the last library from those who wanted to control it?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Leo and Clara find in the old city?","options":["A treasure map","A hidden library","A robot","A secret door"],"correct_answer":"A hidden library"},{"question":"Who are the characters exploring the city?","options":["Leo and Clara","Leo and Max","Clara and Mia","Leo and his dad"],"correct_answer":"Leo and Clara"},{"question":"What do the book hunters want?","options":["To help Leo and Clara","To control the knowledge","To take the books away","To close the library"],"correct_answer":"To control the knowledge"},{"question":"What does Clara believe about the books?","options":["They are boring","They have magic","They are useless","They are broken"],"correct_answer":"They have magic"},{"question":"What feeling do Leo and Clara experience when they see the library?","options":["Fear","Boredom","Excitement","Anger"],"correct_answer":"Excitement"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_327_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_327_ch1_img1.png","plot_327_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":427,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
