   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_327_7_10","title":"The Last Library","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Post-Apocalyptic","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Chapter 2: The Book Hunters\n\nLeo and Clara stood in the dusty library. Sunlight peeked through cracked windows, making the golden dust dance. \u201cCan you believe this place?\u201d Leo asked, his eyes wide. \n\n\u201cIt's magical!\u201d Clara replied, spinning in circles. \u201cWe have to protect it!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a loud crash echoed from outside. Clara jumped and grabbed Leo's arm. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know!\u201d Leo said, his heart racing. They hurried to the door, peering outside. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nIn the abandoned street, they saw shadows moving. A group of tall figures was rummaging through the debris. \u201cThose must be the book hunters!\u201d Clara exclaimed. \u201cThey want the stories for themselves!\u201d\n\n\u201cWe can\u2019t let them take our books!\u201d Leo said, determination in his voice.\n\nThe book hunters were more intimidating than Leo thought. They wore tattered clothes, and their eyes glinted with greed. \u201cLet\u2019s sneak past them,\u201d Clara suggested. \u201cWe need to find more books!\u201d\n\nThey quietly slipped through the back of the library, their hearts pounding. As they crept along the alley, they spotted a crumbling old bookstore. \u201cLook!\u201d Leo whispered, pointing at the sign above the door. \u201cWe should check it out!\u201d\n\n\u201cGood idea!\u201d Clara said, excitement bubbling inside her.\n\nThey entered the bookstore, filled with old maps and forgotten tales. \u201cMaybe we can find books and hide them,\u201d Leo said. \u201cThen the hunters can\u2019t get them.\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a loud thud shook the shelves! \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Clara squeaked.\n\n\u201cMaybe it\u2019s the book hunters!\u201d Leo whispered. They crouched behind a shelf, peeking out. \n\nTwo book hunters burst through the door! \u201cSearch everywhere!\u201d one shouted. \u201cThose kids are here somewhere!\u201d\n\nLeo and Clara exchanged worried glances. \u201cWe have to find a way out!\u201d Clara said, her voice shaking. \n\nJust then, they spotted a small opening behind a pile of dusty boxes. \u201cQuick!\u201d Leo urged. They squeezed through, just as the hunters began to search the shelves.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nOutside, they breathed a sigh of relief. \u201cThat was too close!\u201d Clara giggled nervously. \u201cWhat if they find us?\u201d\n\n\u201cI won\u2019t let them take our library!\u201d Leo said fiercely. \u201cWe have to find more books before they do!\u201d\n\nWith renewed energy, they set off into the wasteland, determined to protect the stories that could save their world.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Leo and Clara find in the library?","options":["Old toys","Books","Food","Clothes"],"correct_answer":"Books"},{"question":"Who are the people outside the library?","options":["Friends","Book hunters","Animals","Teachers"],"correct_answer":"Book hunters"},{"question":"What do Leo and Clara plan to do with the books?","options":["Burn them","Hide them","Sell them","None of the above"],"correct_answer":"Hide them"},{"question":"What do the book hunters want?","options":["To play games","To control the knowledge","To be friends","To eat food"],"correct_answer":"To control the knowledge"},{"question":"What do Leo and Clara feel after escaping the bookstore?","options":["Sad","Bored","Scared","Relieved"],"correct_answer":"Relieved"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_327_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_327_ch2_img1.png","plot_327_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":380,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
