   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_327_7_10","title":"The Last Library","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Post-Apocalyptic","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Chapter 4: The Gathering Storm\n\nLeo and Clara stood inside the hidden library. Dust danced in the sunlight streaming through cracked windows. \"Look at all these books!\" Leo exclaimed, his eyes wide with wonder. Clara clutched a tattered book with a picture of a dragon on the cover. \"I can\u2019t wait to read this one!\" \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, a loud crash echoed outside. Startled, they rushed to the window. A group of book hunters was approaching. \"We have to protect the library!\" Clara whispered fiercely. Leo nodded, feeling a flutter of fear in his stomach. He couldn\u2019t let the hunters take the books.\n\n\"We need a plan!\" Leo said. They scanned the room. Clara pointed at a row of old maps on a dusty table. \"What if we use these to find more hidden books?\" \n\n\"Great idea!\" Leo grinned. Together, they spread the maps across the table. Clara traced a path with her finger. \"Look, there\u2019s a library in the North District! We can go there now!\" \n\nLeo felt a rush of excitement. \"Yes! But we must be quick before the hunters get here.\" They grabbed their backpacks and filled them with the best books from the library. Each book felt like a treasure.\n\nAs they made their way to the door, a shadow loomed outside. It was the librarian! \"You must hurry. The hunters are closing in,\" she said, her voice urgent. Clara took a deep breath. \"We\u2019re ready! We can do this!\"\n\nLeo and Clara dashed out of the library, clutching their precious books. The air was thick with tension. They ran down the dusty street, the hunters\u2019 shouts echoing behind them. They turned a corner and spotted a narrow alley. \n\n\"This way!\" Leo shouted, leading Clara down the alley. They squeezed through the narrow opening just as the hunters rounded the corner. Clara giggled nervously. \"That was close!\" \n\nSuddenly, they heard a soft whimper. Leo looked down and saw a small robot. It was rusted and half-broken. \"Help me!\" it pleaded. Clara\u2019s eyes lit up. \"We can fix it! It could help us!\"\n\nLeo nodded. \"Let\u2019s do it!\" As they got to work, hope swelled in their hearts. Maybe, just maybe, they were beginning to unlock the magic of stories\u2014and friendship.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith the robot\u2019s help, they could find even more books and protect their library. Leo smiled, feeling a new sense of purpose. \"We will show everyone that stories matter!\" he declared. Clara beamed. \"Together, we can save the world!\"\n\nThe sun began to set, casting a golden glow over the city. The two siblings looked at each other, ready for the adventure ahead. \n\n\"Let\u2019s go!\" Leo shouted, and together, they ran into the unknown.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Leo and Clara find in the hidden library?","options":["Toys","Books","Food","Tools"],"correct_answer":"Books"},{"question":"What do the hunters want to do?","options":["Help Leo and Clara","Take the books","Play games","Make friends"],"correct_answer":"Take the books"},{"question":"What idea does Clara have to gather more books?","options":["Go home","Use maps","Make a movie","Buy new books"],"correct_answer":"Use maps"},{"question":"What do Leo and Clara hear when they are leaving the library?","options":["A loud crash","A dog barking","Music playing","Children laughing"],"correct_answer":"A loud crash"},{"question":"What do Leo and Clara find in the alley?","options":["A treasure chest","A small robot","Another library","A hidden door"],"correct_answer":"A small robot"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_327_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_327_ch4_img1.png","plot_327_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":458,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
