   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_327_7_10","title":"The Last Library","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Post-Apocalyptic","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Leo and Clara stood in the hidden library, surrounded by books and dust. The sun peeked through a cracked window, casting light on a sea of stories. \u201cThis place is amazing!\u201d Clara exclaimed, twirling around. \n\n\u201cWe need to protect it,\u201d Leo said, his eyes serious. \u201cThe book hunters will try to take the books again.\u201d \n\nSuddenly, a soft whirring sound interrupted their conversation. They turned to find the small robot buzzing nearby. \u201cHello! My name is Zippy!\u201d it squeaked. \n\n\u201cZippy? Can you help us?\u201d Clara asked, her face lighting up. \n\n\u201cOf course! I can find hidden books,\u201d Zippy replied, zipping around excitedly. \n\nJust then, they heard a loud crash outside. Leo\u2019s heart raced. \u201cThat sounds like the book hunters!\u201d \n\nClara looked worried. \u201cWhat do we do?\u201d \n\n\u201cWe need to hide the books!\u201d Leo shouted. They quickly grabbed their favorite stories and placed them behind a dusty old shelf. \n\n\u201cQuick, Zippy, can you distract them?\u201d Clara suggested. \n\n\u201cZippy is on the case!\u201d the robot exclaimed, zooming out the door. \n\nLeo and Clara waited, listening. They heard Zippy beeping and distracting the hunters just outside. \u201cLook over here!\u201d Zippy called. \n\nThe hunters, confused by the noise, chased after the little robot. Leo and Clara shared a glance. \u201cWe have to act fast!\u201d \n\nThey rushed to gather more books and stack them in a safe corner, ready to protect their treasure. \n\nJust then, Zippy zipped back through the door, panting. \u201cThey\u2019re gone! You did it!\u201d Clara cheered. \n\n\u201cWe saved the books!\u201d Leo laughed, feeling proud. \n\nClara hugged Zippy tightly. \u201cYou\u2019re our hero!\u201d \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s keep searching for more books!\u201d she added, her eyes sparkling with excitement. \n\nLeo nodded. \u201cTogether, we\u2019ll bring stories back to everyone.\u201d \n\nWith renewed energy, they set off again, the hope of stories guiding their way. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Zippy do to help Leo and Clara?","options":["He hides the books","He distracts the hunters","He calls for help","He leaves the library"],"correct_answer":"He distracts the hunters"},{"question":"What are Leo and Clara trying to protect?","options":["The library","Zippy","Their home","Their toys"],"correct_answer":"The library"},{"question":"What does Clara do when Zippy distracts the hunters?","options":["She laughs","She hides the books","She runs away","She cries"],"correct_answer":"She hides the books"},{"question":"What feeling do Leo and Clara have at the end of the chapter?","options":["Sadness","Fear","Pride","Anger"],"correct_answer":"Pride"},{"question":"What is the main goal of Leo and Clara?","options":["To find food","To play games","To gather books","To build a shelter"],"correct_answer":"To gather books"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_327_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_327_ch5_img1.png","plot_327_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":304,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
