     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"burdened","1":"treasure","2":"cascade","3":"inspire","4":"confront","image_prompts":["A dusty reading room filled with towering shelves, some leaning, and a few old chairs scattered around. Sunlight filters through broken windows, casting soft shadows. Leo, a fourteen-year-old boy with tousled hair and bright eyes, is kneeling by a pile of newspapers, his expression one of surprise as he uncovers a leather-bound book.","A dramatic scene in the basement where Clara stands over a toppled bookshelf, dust swirling around her as she reaches for a colorful book wedged on the ground. In the background, a shadowy figure of the book hunter looms in the doorway, creating a tense atmosphere of confrontation and urgency."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A hidden room filled with ornate books, illuminated by a beam of sunlight coming through a broken window. Dust motes dance in the air, creating a mystical atmosphere. Leo and Clara stand in awe, their faces reflecting a mix of excitement and reverence as they gaze at the treasures before them.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_327_ch4_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 15:29:46"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing Leo and Clara on the rooftop, the wind whipping through their hair as they look out over the desolate cityscape. The horizon glows faintly in the distance, symbolizing hope and possibility. Their expressions are determined and resolute, embodying the spirit of adventure and the fight for knowledge.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_327_ch4_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 15:29:46"}}}
