   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_328_7_10","title":"Skyward: The Floating Village","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Post-Apocalyptic","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Ava stood on the wooden balcony of her floating village. Below her, swirling clouds danced like fluffy cotton candy. She loved her home up in the sky. It was bright and colorful, filled with friendly faces. \n\n\"Look, Ava!\" shouted Finn, her best friend. He pointed to the horizon. Dark clouds were rolling in. \n\n\"Those don't look good,\" Ava said, squinting. The village was built on large wooden platforms. It floated high above the toxic world below. The ground was no place for people anymore. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe floating village looked like a fairy tale. Houses were made of wood and metal, with bright flowers hanging from every balcony. Colorful kites flew above, twisting in the wind. \n\n\"Do you think the storm will reach us?\" Finn asked, his voice shaking a little. \n\n\u201cI hope not! But we should be ready,\u201d Ava replied. She loved adventure and wanted to explore beyond the clouds. \n\nSuddenly, the wind picked up. Ava's heart raced. The storm seemed to be coming faster than she thought. \u201cWe need to find out what\u2019s causing this!\u201d she declared.\n\n\"Maybe the elder knows something!\" Finn suggested. The elder was wise and knew the village's secrets. \n\nAs they rushed to the elder's home, they passed other villagers. They looked worried. \u201cStay safe!\u201d shouted Mrs. Poppy, who was hanging laundry. \n\nAva and Finn reached the elder\u2019s wooden door. It was covered in silver vines. Ava knocked loudly. \n\n\"Come in!\" called a soft voice. \n\nInside, the elder sat by a glowing lantern. Her hair was silver, and her eyes sparkled like stars. \u201cAh, Ava and Finn. I sense you have come with questions.\u201d \n\n\"The storm is coming! What do we do?\" Finn exclaimed. \n\nThe elder sighed deeply. \u201cThis storm is not normal. It holds mysteries of the past. You must seek the truth before it is too late.\u201d \n\n\"What truth?\" Ava asked, feeling a spark of excitement. \n\n\"The truth that lies in the ruins of the old world, below the clouds.\" \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAva felt her heart skip a beat. \"The ruins? But they are dangerous!\" \n\nFinn nodded. \"And we could meet rival sky-dwellers!\" \n\nThe elder smiled. \u201cYou are brave. But bravery comes with risk. Will you take the challenge?\u201d \n\nAva looked at Finn, and he nodded back. \u201cYes! We will save our village!\u201d \n\n\"Then go, my young adventurers,\" the elder said. \u201cAnd remember, the sky is full of wonders.\u201d \n\nAva and Finn left the elder\u2019s home. The storm loomed closer. They had to hurry!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is Ava's favorite thing about her home?","options":["It floats above clouds","It is very big","It is underground","It is dark"],"correct_answer":"It floats above clouds"},{"question":"Who does Ava and Finn go to for help?","options":["A teacher","A doctor","The elder","A shopkeeper"],"correct_answer":"The elder"},{"question":"What do the dark clouds signify?","options":["A party","A storm","A picnic","A game"],"correct_answer":"A storm"},{"question":"What does the elder tell Ava and Finn they must uncover?","options":["The truth about the storm","A treasure map","A new game","A secret recipe"],"correct_answer":"The truth about the storm"},{"question":"What do Ava and Finn decide to do?","options":["Stay inside","Go dancing","Seek adventure","Take a nap"],"correct_answer":"Seek adventure"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_328_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_328_ch1_img1.png","plot_328_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":415,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
