   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_328_7_10","title":"Skyward: The Floating Village","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Post-Apocalyptic","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Ava stood on the edge of the floating village, the wind tousling her hair. Below her, thick clouds swirled like a wild dance. \"Do you think the storm will reach us?\" she asked Finn, who was fiddling with his flying goggles.\n\nFinn shrugged, his blue eyes wide. \"I hope not, but the elder said it's unlike any storm we've seen before.\" He adjusted his goggles, ready for anything.\n\nSuddenly, a loud crack echoed through the sky. Ava gasped. \"What was that?!\"\n\nFinn pointed upward. \"Look! The sky is changing color!\" It was true. The bright blue was washing away, replaced by ominous gray.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAva felt a chill run down her spine. \"We need to find the elder again. He might know what's happening.\"\n\nThey rushed to the center of the village, where villagers were gathering. Some were worried, while others were trying to prepare for the storm. Ava and Finn pushed through the crowd, searching for the elder.\n\n\"There he is!\" Finn shouted, pointing to a tall figure with a long beard. The elder was talking to a group of villagers, his face serious.\n\n\u201cA storm like this,\u201d the elder said, \u201chas a source, a hidden power beneath the clouds. We must uncover it, or our village will be in great danger.\u201d\n\nAva's heart raced. \"What can we do?\" she asked. \n\n\"The wind will grow stronger,\" the elder warned. \"You must find the storm's source. But beware of the rival sky-dwellers. They will try to stop you.\"\n\n\"But how will we find it?\" Finn asked.\n\nThe elder smiled. \u201cFollow the storm\u2019s path. And remember, strength lies in unity. Gather your friends.\u201d\n\nAs Ava and Finn ran back, they spotted their friends, Mia and Oliver, flying an air scooter nearby. \"We need your help!\" Ava yelled.\n\nMia leaped off the scooter. \"Why? What's happening?\"\n\n\"The storm! The elder says we must find its source!\" Ava explained.\n\nOliver's eyes sparkled with excitement. \"An adventure! Count me in!\"\n\nThey all hopped on the air scooter, Finn in the pilot seat. The wind picked up, rattling the scooter. \u201cHold on tight!\u201d Finn shouted.\n\nSuddenly, the scooter jolted. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Mia cried.\n\nFinn looked back. \u201cIt\u2019s the rival sky-dwellers!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAva\u2019s heart pounded. \u201cWe have to out-fly them!\u201d \n\nThe scooter zipped forward, leaving the rivals behind. But the storm loomed closer, dark and swirling. They had to find the source before it was too late.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who do Ava and Finn go to for help?","options":["The mayor","The elder","Mia","A rival sky-dweller"],"correct_answer":"The elder"},{"question":"What color does the sky change to?","options":["Blue","Green","Gray","Red"],"correct_answer":"Gray"},{"question":"What do they need to find?","options":["The storm's source","A new home","Treasure","A hidden village"],"correct_answer":"The storm's source"},{"question":"Who joins Ava and Finn on the air scooter?","options":["The elder","Oliver and Mia","The rivals","A flying creature"],"correct_answer":"Oliver and Mia"},{"question":"What does the elder warn them about?","options":["The storm will pass","They will get lost","Rival sky-dwellers will try to stop them","They need more supplies"],"correct_answer":"Rival sky-dwellers will try to stop them"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_328_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_328_ch2_img1.png","plot_328_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":407,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
