   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_328_7_10","title":"Skyward: The Floating Village","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Post-Apocalyptic","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Ava stood at the edge of the Sky Tower, the wind swirling around her. The clouds danced below, thick and gray. \u201cWe have to figure this out,\u201d she said, determination shining in her eyes. Finn nodded. \u201cWhat if we talk to the rival sky-dweller? Maybe they can help us!\u201d\n\nMia and Oliver exchanged glances. \u201cDo you think they\u2019ll listen?\u201d Mia asked, biting her lip. \u201cThey seemed really angry.\u201d \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s try!\u201d Ava replied. With a deep breath, they climbed down the tower. The village buzzed with worry. People were checking ropes and securing their homes. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThey made their way to the edge of the village, where they spotted the rival sky-dweller\u2019s ship. It was sleek and shiny, glimmering in the sunlight. Ava felt a flutter of hope. \u201cIf we can just talk to them\u2026\u201d \n\nAs they approached, the rival sky-dweller, a girl with bright green hair, noticed them. \u201cWhat do you want?\u201d she called, crossing her arms. \n\n\u201cWe need your help!\u201d Ava shouted back. The wind carried her voice. \u201cThere\u2019s a storm coming and it could destroy both our homes!\u201d\n\nThe girl\u2019s eyes softened. \u201cI know. Our ship has been damaged by the storm too.\u201d She looked past Ava at her friends. \u201cWe can work together.\u201d\n\nFinn stepped forward. \u201cWhat\u2019s causing the storm?\u201d \n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know,\u201d the girl admitted, \u201cbut I saw something strange in the clouds.\u201d\n\n\u201cThen let\u2019s find out!\u201d Oliver cheered. \u201cWe can fix your ship and then investigate together!\u201d \n\nThe girl nodded slowly. \u201cOkay. Let\u2019s go.\u201d They all climbed aboard the rival ship, excitement buzzing in the air. \n\nSuddenly, a loud crack echoed through the sky. Ava gasped as dark clouds swirled angrily above. \u201cWe need to hurry!\u201d \n\nThe rivals and friends worked side by side, fixing the ship. Ava spotted something hidden in the clouds. \u201cLook over there! A strange light!\u201d \n\nThey all turned to see a beam shining down from a dark gray cloud. \u201cThat must be it!\u201d Mia exclaimed. \n\nFinn adjusted the ship\u2019s controls. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d \n\nAs they soared toward the light, hope filled Ava\u2019s heart. Together, they could save their homes. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cHold on!\u201d Finn shouted as the ship rocked. The storm raged around them, but they were not alone. They had each other.\n\nWith determination, they flew closer to the light, ready to uncover the mystery waiting in the clouds.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Ava and her friends want to do?","options":["Fight the storm","Find the storm's source","Build a new village","Hide from the storm"],"correct_answer":"Find the storm's source"},{"question":"Who do they decide to work with?","options":["Another group of friends","A rival sky-dweller","A wise elder","A flying creature"],"correct_answer":"A rival sky-dweller"},{"question":"What do they see in the clouds?","options":["A rainbow","A strange light","A giant bird","A falling star"],"correct_answer":"A strange light"},{"question":"What happens when they try to fly toward the light?","options":["The ship breaks down","A storm rocks the ship","They fly smoothly","They get lost"],"correct_answer":"A storm rocks the ship"},{"question":"How do Ava and her friends feel about their mission?","options":["Scared","Hopeful","Bored","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Hopeful"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_328_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_328_ch4_img1.png","plot_328_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":402,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
