   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_328_7_10","title":"Skyward: The Floating Village","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Post-Apocalyptic","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Ava stood on the deck of the repaired ship, looking out over the wispy clouds. The sun painted the sky in shades of orange and pink. Finn adjusted the controls, a big grin on his face. \u201cReady for adventure?\u201d he asked, his eyes sparkling.\n\n\u201cAlways!\u201d Ava replied, feeling her heart race. Mia and Oliver joined them, standing behind Finn. \u201cLet\u2019s find that strange light!\u201d shouted Mia, her excitement bubbling over.\n\nThey soared higher, the wind rushing through their hair. Below them, the floating village shimmered like a jewel. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, the ship shook. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Oliver exclaimed, gripping the edge of the ship tightly.\n\n\u201cHold on!\u201d Finn yelled, pulling the controls. They tilted sideways, but Finn was a great pilot. \u201cI\u2019ve got this!\u201d he said, steadying the ship.\n\nAs they climbed above the clouds, the light grew brighter. It flickered like a beacon. \u201cWhat if it\u2019s the source of the storm?\u201d Ava wondered, her eyes wide with curiosity.\n\n\u201cIt has to be!\u201d Mia shouted, pointing. \u201cLet\u2019s get closer!\u201d They flew towards the light, feeling a mix of fear and excitement.\n\nBut then, dark shadows swooped in from above. The rival sky-dwellers were back! \u201cYou won\u2019t stop us!\u201d shouted their leader, a tall boy with a fierce look. He signaled his friends, and they surrounded Ava and her friends.\n\n\u201cWe need to work together!\u201d Ava shouted over the noise. \u201cThe storm is a threat to us all!\u201d\n\n\u201cWhy should we trust you?\u201d the leader replied, crossing his arms.\n\n\u201cBecause we can save our homes!\u201d Finn chimed in. \u201cHelp us find the light!\u201d\n\nThe leader hesitated, but then nodded. \u201cFine! Let\u2019s go!\u201d The rivals formed a circle around Ava, Finn, Mia, and Oliver. Together, they flew toward the glowing light.\n\nAs they reached it, they saw a massive cloud, swirling and crackling with energy. \u201cThis is it!\u201d Ava exclaimed. \n\nThe leader looked at Ava and said, \u201cLet\u2019s see what we can do.\u201d They all worked together, using their skills to calm the storm. With a massive push, they combined their efforts, and the cloud began to settle.\n\nWith a final burst of light, the storm disappeared. The sky turned blue, and the sun shined brightly. Everyone cheered, feeling a sense of victory. \u201cWe did it!\u201d Ava shouted, hugging Finn, Mia, and Oliver.\n\nIn that moment, they learned that working together always brings brighter days. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s head back!\u201d said Mia. \u201cOur village needs us!\u201d They turned the ship around, their hearts full of hope and joy. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAs they flew back, Ava smiled, knowing they had saved their home. \u201cNow, who\u2019s ready for a celebration?\u201d she asked. Laughter filled the air as they sailed among the clouds, ready for new adventures ahead.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Ava and her friends find in the clouds?","options":["A storm","A treasure","A floating island","A giant bird"],"correct_answer":"A storm"},{"question":"Who helped Ava and her friends during the adventure?","options":["Their pets","Rival sky-dwellers","A mysterious wizard","The village elder"],"correct_answer":"Rival sky-dwellers"},{"question":"What did they work together to calm?","options":["A fire","A storm","A giant monster","An angry bird"],"correct_answer":"A storm"},{"question":"What was the mood when they realized they could save their home?","options":["Sad","Excited","Angry","Scared"],"correct_answer":"Excited"},{"question":"What did they plan to do after calming the storm?","options":["Go home","Find a spaceship","Have a celebration","Fight the storm again"],"correct_answer":"Have a celebration"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_328_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_328_ch5_img1.png","plot_328_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":461,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
