   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_328_11_14","title":"Skyward: The Floating Village","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Post-Apocalyptic","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Ava stood at the edge of Skyhaven, her heart racing as she gazed out over the sprawling clouds that surrounded the floating village. The wooden and metal structures of Skyhaven were a marvel, each building tethered securely to the others by thick ropes and glowing energy conduits. Above, the sun painted the clouds in shades of gold and lavender, casting a magical glow over their home. \n\n\u201cCan you believe it?\u201d Finn exclaimed, his eyes sparkling with excitement. \u201cWe\u2019re finally going to explore the upper winds today!\u201d\n\n\u201cYes, but remember the last time we flew too high?\u201d Ava replied, her voice tinged with worry. \u201cThe winds caught us off guard and\u2014\u201d\n\n\u201c\u2014and we made it back!\u201d Finn interrupted, grinning. \u201cBesides, today is different. The skies are calm, and we have the new gliders.\u201d\n\nAva bit her lip, the memory of their last adventure still fresh in her mind. They had narrowly escaped a storm that had raged beyond the safety of Skyhaven. She wanted to fly, to feel the wind whip through her hair, but a lingering unease settled in her stomach. \n\n\u201cAlright, let\u2019s do it,\u201d Ava finally agreed, trying to mask her apprehension with a smile. Together, they sprinted towards the glider launch area, where other children from the village were preparing for the day\u2019s adventure. \n\nAt the launch site, Ava\u2019s other friends joined them: Lila, who was always eager to take the lead, and Tarek, who had a love for inventing gadgets. \u201cDid you hear about the storm brewing below?\u201d Lila asked, her voice serious as she adjusted her goggles. \u201cSome say it might come up this way.\u201d\n\nA chill ran through Ava. \u201cGreat, just what we need,\u201d she murmured. \n\n\u201cI don\u2019t believe it,\u201d Tarek scoffed, fiddling with a small device he had created. \u201cStorms don\u2019t travel that far up. We\u2019ll be fine.\u201d \n\nJust then, a gust of wind swept through the launch area, sending a shiver down Ava\u2019s spine. She glanced toward the horizon, where dark clouds began to gather ominously. \n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Finn shouted, pointing. The clouds twisted in the distance, forming a swirling mass that danced in the sky, almost as if they had a mind of their own. \n\nAva stared, her heart pounding in her chest. \u201cWe need to warn everyone. If that storm comes here\u2026\u201d \n\nBefore she could finish her sentence, the ground trembled, and an unsettling roar echoed through the air. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cWhat was that?\u201d Lila shrieked, her eyes wide with fright. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s get to our gliders\u2014now!\u201d Finn shouted, his voice cutting through the rising panic. They climbed into their gliders, adrenaline coursing through their veins. Ava took a deep breath, her fingers gripping the controls tightly. \n\nAs they soared into the sky, the world below seemed to fade away. But the storm was closer than they thought, swirling with a ferocity that sent chills down Ava\u2019s spine. The winds howled, and dark tendrils of cloud began to reach up toward them. \n\n\u201cWe have to get to the Elder!\u201d Ava shouted, remembering the village\u2019s wise leader who knew the secrets of the storms past. \u201cHe might know what to do!\u201d\n\nFinn nodded, determination etched on his face. But they weren\u2019t the only ones in the skies\u2014shadows of rival sky-dwellers darted around them, eyes glinting with mischief. \n\nAs the first drops of rain began to fall, Ava knew they were in for the fight of their lives. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cHold on tight!\u201d she yelled as the storm threatened to swallow them whole.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Ava dream of doing?","options":["Flying beyond the clouds","Building machines","Living on the ground","Leading the village"],"correct_answer":"Flying beyond the clouds"},{"question":"What new equipment are the friends excited to use for flying?","options":["Balloon kites","Gliders","Jetpacks","Wingsuits"],"correct_answer":"Gliders"},{"question":"What warning does Lila give the group?","options":["A storm is brewing below","They might crash","They are running out of fuel","They should turn back"],"correct_answer":"A storm is brewing below"},{"question":"Who do Ava and her friends plan to warn about the storm?","options":["The Elder","The council","Their parents","The rival sky-dwellers"],"correct_answer":"The Elder"},{"question":"How does Ava feel about flying in the chapter?","options":["Excited and fearless","Nervous but willing","Indifferent","Confident and ready"],"correct_answer":"Nervous but willing"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_328_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_328_ch1_img1.png","plot_328_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":592,"reading_level":"Builder"}
