   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_328_11_14","title":"Skyward: The Floating Village","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Post-Apocalyptic","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"As the heavy clouds loomed closer, Ava's heart raced like a wild windstorm. She stood at the edge of Skyhaven, the floating village built from weathered wood and shimmering metal. The air crackled with tension, and her friends, Finn and Lila, gathered beside her, their faces a mix of concern and determination. \n\n\u201cLook at that,\u201d Finn pointed toward the dark horizon, where the clouds curled and twisted like angry dragons. \u201cWe need to find the Elder. She\u2019ll know what to do.\u201d \n\nAva nodded, her mind racing. She had always been captivated by tales of the Elder\u2019s wisdom, the secrets she held about the world below. As they raced through the narrow paths of Skyhaven, the village felt different, almost alive, responding to the threat looming overhead. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe villagers moved in a flurry, securing their homes against the fierce winds. A dog barked, its fur bristling as it darted past. Ava felt a knot tight in her stomach. \u201cWhat if the storm is worse than we think?\u201d\n\n\u201cDon\u2019t worry,\u201d Lila said, her voice steady despite the fear in her eyes. \u201cWe\u2019ll figure it out together.\u201d \n\nWhen they reached the Elder\u2019s dwelling, a small cabin adorned with intricate carvings of the stars, they found the door ajar. \u201cElder? Are you in there?\u201d Ava called, her voice trembling.\n\nSilence hung in the air, thick as the dark clouds above. Finn stepped forward and pushed the door open wider. Inside, the room was dim, lit only by the flickering light of a single lantern. The Elder sat at a wooden table, her silver hair cascading like waterfalls over her shoulders.\n\n\u201cAva, Finn, Lila,\u201d she greeted them, her voice smooth yet filled with worry. \u201cI sensed you would come. The storm is not just any storm. It is angry, driven by forces long forgotten.\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat do you mean?\u201d Ava asked, leaning closer. \u201cIs there something we can do?\u201d\n\nThe Elder\u2019s eyes sparkled with a mix of fear and knowledge. \u201cYears ago, we sealed a rift in the sky to protect our village. But it seems the rift has stirred, and the storm is its calling.\u201d\n\n\u201cWhere is this rift?\u201d Lila questioned, her hands clenched into fists.\n\n\u201cYou will need to fly beyond the clouds\u2014into the Tempest Zone,\u201d the Elder whispered, her expression grave. \u201cBut beware of the rival sky-dwellers. They\u2019ll do anything to stop you.\u201d\n\nFinn\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cBut how do we even get there?\u201d\n\n\u201cI will give you a guide\u2014a map that holds the path,\u201d she replied, rising slowly. \u201cBut I warn you, the sky is full of dangers.\u201d\n\nJust then, a loud crash echoed outside, shaking the walls of the cabin. Ava\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s started,\u201d the Elder said, her voice barely a whisper.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cQuick! We need to get out!\u201d Ava shouted, adrenaline surging through her. They rushed to the door, but a flash of light blinded them for a moment. As they emerged, they saw dark shapes flitting in the sky, rival sky-dwellers with menacing glints in their eyes, circling the village like vultures.\n\n\u201cStay together!\u201d Finn shouted, pulling Ava and Lila close. The storm raged around them, but they were determined. They could save Skyhaven. They had to.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Ava yelled, her voice cutting through the chaos. With fear and excitement gripping her heart, she realized that this was only the beginning of their adventure.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does the Elder warn Ava and her friends about the storm?","options":["It is just a regular storm.","It is caused by a rift in the sky.","It will bring new villagers.","It is harmless."],"correct_answer":"It is caused by a rift in the sky."},{"question":"What do Ava and her friends need to do to save Skyhaven?","options":["Find the Elder.","Seal the rift in the sky.","Hide from the storm.","Leave Skyhaven."],"correct_answer":"Seal the rift in the sky."},{"question":"Who will face them in their quest?","options":["Other villagers.","Rival sky-dwellers.","Animals from below.","Merchants."],"correct_answer":"Rival sky-dwellers."},{"question":"How does Ava feel when she sees the storm gathering?","options":["Excited.","Calm.","Nervous.","Confident."],"correct_answer":"Nervous."},{"question":"What does the Elder give to Ava and her friends?","options":["A map.","A weapon.","A potion.","A charm."],"correct_answer":"A map."}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_328_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_328_ch2_img1.png","plot_328_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":575,"reading_level":"Builder"}
