   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_328_11_14","title":"Skyward: The Floating Village","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Post-Apocalyptic","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Chapter 4: The Heart of the Storm\n\nThe winds howled fiercely as Ava, Finn, and Lila steered their glider through the turbulent skies. Above the floating village of Skyhaven, dark clouds churned like a boiling cauldron, threatening to consume everything in their path. Ava gripped the handles tightly, her heart racing with both fear and excitement. This was their chance to discover the truth behind the storm, and she wouldn\u2019t let it slip away.\n\n\"Look!\" Lila shouted, pointing ahead. \"There\u2019s a break in the clouds! We can see what's below!\" \n\nFinn adjusted the glider\u2019s altitude, maneuvering them closer to the mysterious rift. The air crackled with energy, and Ava\u2019s skin tingled as they approached the swirling mass. \"We need to be careful,\" she warned. \"If we get too close, we could be sucked in!\"\n\nJust then, a figure darted through the clouds, barely visible against the backdrop of grey. Ava squinted, trying to focus. \"What was that?\" \n\nFinn gasped. \"It looked like a ship! But... it was different. More angular and sharp.\" \n\nAva's curiosity piqued. \"Do you think it belongs to the rival sky-dwellers?\" \n\nLila shook her head, her brow furrowed. \"I don\u2019t know, but we need to find out. If they\u2019re the ones causing this storm, we have to stop them!\" \n\nAs they glided closer, the storm raged around them. The glider shook violently, and Ava felt the adrenaline surge. \u201cHold on tight!\u201d she yelled, steering sharply to avoid a bolt of lightning that illuminated the sky like a flash of a giant camera. \n\nThey burst through the clouds and gasped as they emerged into a hollow space above the storm\u2014a hidden enclave surrounded by towering rock formations. The sight was breathtaking; vibrant bioluminescent plants illuminated the cavern, casting a mesmerizing glow against the harshness of the storm outside. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cWow\u2026\u201d Lila breathed, her eyes wide with wonder. \u201cIt\u2019s beautiful! But what is this place?\u201d \n\n\u201cIt looks like it could be one of the old bases,\u201d Finn said, studying the walls encrusted with metallic remnants. \u201cMaybe the storm is connected to this hidden spot!\u201d \n\nAva felt a rush of hope. \u201cIf we can find a way to harness the energy here, we might just be able to calm the storm!\u201d \n\nJust then, a loud crack echoed through the enclave, shaking the ground beneath them. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Ava yelled, her heart pounding. \n\nA dark figure emerged from the shadows, cloaked in tattered fabric. The elder from the village\u2014the one who had warned them about the storm\u2014stood before them, his eyes gleaming with a mix of urgency and wisdom. \u201cYou should not have come here!\u201d he warned, his voice steady yet filled with tension. \u201cThe storm is not just a natural occurrence. It is a reflection of the past\u2014of the mistakes we made!\u201d \n\nAva felt a chill run down her spine. \"What do you mean? Can we stop it?\" \n\nThe elder stepped closer, revealing a small, glowing orb in his hand. \u201cThis is the key. It holds the power to mend the rift. But it will require great courage and sacrifice.\u201d \n\nFinn exchanged a glance with Ava and Lila, determination lighting their faces. \u201cWe\u2019re ready,\u201d Finn declared, his voice resolute.\n\nAva nodded, her heart swelling with a sense of purpose. Together, they would uncover the secrets of the storm and save their home. But as the elder\u2019s words hung in the air, they all knew the journey ahead would be their greatest challenge yet.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAva took a deep breath, gathering her thoughts. \u201cLet\u2019s do this!\u201d \n\nThey clasped hands, forming a circle of solidarity. With every heartbeat, the storm outside raged, but inside the hollow, they felt a flicker of hope. They were on the brink of discovery, and with it, the power to change their fate.\n\nAs they prepared to face what lay ahead, the storm rumbled ominously, a warning of the greater trials to come.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Ava and her friends discover in the hidden enclave?","options":["A storm shelter","Bioluminescent plants","A rival sky-dweller ship","A treasure chest"],"correct_answer":"Bioluminescent plants"},{"question":"Who warns Ava and her friends about the dangers of the enclave?","options":["Finn","The elder","Lila","A mysterious figure"],"correct_answer":"The elder"},{"question":"What is the elder holding that is significant to their mission?","options":["A map","A glowing orb","An old book","A weapon"],"correct_answer":"A glowing orb"},{"question":"How does Ava feel when she first sees the hidden enclave?","options":["Fearful","Bored","Amazed","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Amazed"},{"question":"What does Finn declare at the end of the chapter?","options":["I'm scared!","We can't do this!","We're ready!","Let's go home!"],"correct_answer":"We're ready!"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_328_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_328_ch4_img1.png","plot_328_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":662,"reading_level":"Builder"}
