   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_329_7_10","title":"Echoes of the Past","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Post-Apocalyptic","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Jax stood on the edge of the dusty hill, gazing at the ruins below. This was the heart of their village, a place filled with stories. But now, it was quiet and lonely. The sky was a bright blue, a stark contrast to the gray buildings that had once been alive with laughter.\n\n\u201cLook at that!\u201d Lila pointed at a half-buried machine, its metal glinting in the sunlight. \u201cDo you think it still works?\u201d\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know,\u201d Jax replied. \u201cBut we have to check it out!\u201d He felt a thrill of adventure rush through him.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThey scrambled down the hill, their feet kicking up puffs of dust. Jax reached the machine first. It was tall and strange, with buttons and lights that flickered. \u201cWhat do you think it is?\u201d he wondered aloud.\n\n\u201cMaybe it\u2019s a memory machine!\u201d Lila said, her eyes sparkling with excitement.\n\n\u201cA memory machine?\u201d Jax echoed. \u201cWhat\u2019s that?\u201d\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s a machine that can hold memories! Like a treasure chest for thoughts!\u201d Lila explained, bouncing on her toes.\n\nJax's curiosity grew. \u201cWhat if we could find memories of our ancestors? What if we could learn about the past?\u201d\n\nJust then, they heard footsteps behind them. It was Old Man Riven, the village\u2019s elder. \u201cWhat are you two doing here?\u201d he asked, his voice gruff.\n\n\u201cWe found this machine!\u201d Lila said, pointing proudly.\n\nOld Man Riven frowned. \u201cYou shouldn\u2019t tamper with things from the past. They\u2019re better left alone.\u201d\n\n\u201cBut what if there are important memories?\u201d Jax argued. \u201cWhat if we can help our village?\u201d\n\nOld Man Riven shook his head. \u201cSome truths are too painful. Forget about this machine.\u201d\n\nJax felt a lump in his throat. \u201cBut we need to know! Our village is stuck. We need hope!\u201d\n\nOld Man Riven softened a bit. \u201cKnowledge can be a weight. Be careful what you wish for.\u201d\n\nAs the elder turned to leave, Jax felt a spark of determination. He glanced at Lila. \u201cWe have to try! If there are memories in there, we can help everyone.\u201d\n\nLila nodded. \u201cLet\u2019s do it. But we have to be brave!\u201d\n\nTogether, they approached the machine, hearts racing. What could they discover? What memories lay hidden inside? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nJax reached out and pressed a glowing button. A soft hum filled the air, and lights began to flash. The machine whirred, and Jax and Lila held their breath, ready for the adventure of a lifetime.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Jax and Lila discover?","options":["A hidden treasure","A memory machine","A talking animal","A spaceship"],"correct_answer":"A memory machine"},{"question":"Who warns Jax and Lila about the machine?","options":["A friend","Old Man Riven","A teacher","A neighbor"],"correct_answer":"Old Man Riven"},{"question":"What does Lila think the machine might be?","options":["A food maker","A memory machine","A robot","A time capsule"],"correct_answer":"A memory machine"},{"question":"Why do Jax and Lila want to use the machine?","options":["To find treasure","To learn about the past","To scare the villagers","To play games"],"correct_answer":"To learn about the past"},{"question":"What feeling does Jax have when he approaches the machine?","options":["Fear","Excitement","Boredom","Anger"],"correct_answer":"Excitement"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_329_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_329_ch1_img1.png","plot_329_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":412,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
