   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_329_7_10","title":"Echoes of the Past","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Post-Apocalyptic","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Chapter 2: The Hidden Truth\n\nJax and Lila stared at the strange machine. It hummed softly, like a sleeping dragon. \u201cWhat does it do?\u201d Lila asked, her eyes wide with excitement.\n\n\u201cI think it holds memories,\u201d Jax replied, leaning closer. \u201cMemories of our ancestors!\u201d He reached out to touch the shiny surface. \n\nSuddenly, a loud clang echoed through the ruins. Jax jumped back. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d he whispered. Lila looked around, her heart racing. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nIn the background, old metal structures crumbled under the weight of time. Bright flowers peeped through the cracks. The sun streamed through the broken roof, lighting up their faces.\n\n\u201cWe have to find out!\u201d Jax shouted. \u201cLet\u2019s turn it on!\u201d \n\nLila hesitated. \u201cBut what if Old Man Riven finds us?\u201d \n\n\u201cHe can\u2019t stop us forever!\u201d Jax exclaimed. \u201cWe need to know what happened to our village!\u201d \n\nWith a determined nod, Lila helped Jax.\n\nThey pressed a button, and the machine whirred to life. A swirl of colors and sounds filled the air. Images flickered before their eyes: a bustling village, laughter, and then\u2014darkness. \n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d Lila shouted, her voice trembling. \n\n\u201cKeep watching!\u201d Jax encouraged. They saw a woman with a kind smile and a man holding a child. Then, a loud explosion echoed through the memories. \n\nLila gasped. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d \n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know,\u201d Jax said. \u201cBut I want to find out!\u201d\n\nJust then, they heard footsteps. Old Man Riven\u2019s voice boomed in the distance. \u201cYou two better not be messing with things you don\u2019t understand!\u201d \n\nPanic shot through Jax. \u201cWe have to hide!\u201d \n\nThey scrambled behind a pile of broken machines. Lila peered out. \u201cHe\u2019s coming!\u201d \n\nJax held his breath. Old Man Riven came closer, shaking his head. \u201cThe past is best left buried,\u201d he mumbled. \n\nJax exchanged a worried glance with Lila. \u201cWhat if he\u2019s hiding something? What if he knows more than he\u2019s telling us?\u201d \n\nThey knew they couldn\u2019t let fear stop them. The truth was out there, and they needed to find it.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAs Riven walked away, Jax turned to Lila. \u201cWe have to go back! We have to see more memories!\u201d \n\nLila nodded, her fear turning into excitement. \u201cLet\u2019s do it!\u201d \n\nThey took a deep breath and prepared to dive back into the swirling colors. The adventure was just beginning!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Jax and Lila discover in the ruins?","options":["A treasure","A memory machine","A spaceship","A secret door"],"correct_answer":"A memory machine"},{"question":"Who warns Jax and Lila about the machine?","options":["Their parents","Old Man Riven","A robot","A stranger"],"correct_answer":"Old Man Riven"},{"question":"What happens when they activate the machine?","options":["It explodes","It shows memories","It breaks down","It flies away"],"correct_answer":"It shows memories"},{"question":"What emotion does Lila feel when they see the memories?","options":["Happiness","Fear","Anger","Boredom"],"correct_answer":"Fear"},{"question":"What do Jax and Lila decide to do at the end of the chapter?","options":["Run away","Tell Old Man Riven","Dive back into the memories","Destroy the machine"],"correct_answer":"Dive back into the memories"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_329_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_329_ch2_img1.png","plot_329_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":394,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
