   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_329_7_10","title":"Echoes of the Past","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Post-Apocalyptic","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Jax and Lila stood in the dusty ruins, their hearts racing. The air was thick with mystery. Jax wiped his brow, excitement building inside him. \u201cWhat do you think we\u2019ll see?\u201d he asked, glancing at Lila.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know,\u201d she replied, her eyes shining. \u201cBut I can\u2019t wait to find out!\u201d\n\nThey activated the machine, and a colorful swirl of light enveloped them. Suddenly, memories filled the air like sparkles. Each memory showed a piece of their village's past. Lila gasped. \u201cLook, Jax! That\u2019s the old town square!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe scene flickered. Children played in the square, their laughter echoing through the air. Jax smiled but then frowned. \u201cWhat happened to it?\u201d\n\nLila\u2019s voice shook a little. \u201cMaybe we should stop. Old Man Riven said it was dangerous.\u201d\n\n\u201cI can\u2019t,\u201d Jax said, determination shining in his eyes. \u201cWe need to know the truth.\u201d \n\nJust then, a loud crash broke their focus. They turned, and there stood Old Man Riven, his face twisted with anger. \u201cWhat are you doing here?\u201d he yelled.\n\nJax\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWe\u2026 we just wanted to see what happened to our village.\u201d\n\nRiven stepped closer, his eyes narrowing. \u201cSome memories are better left forgotten, Jax. You can\u2019t change the past!\u201d\n\nLila grabbed Jax\u2019s arm. \u201cWe should go. He\u2019s right!\u201d\n\nBut Jax shook his head. \u201cI can\u2019t! What if our village was destroyed because of a mistake? What if we can fix it?\u201d\n\nRiven\u2019s expression softened for just a moment. \u201cYou\u2019re playing with fire, boy. Those memories may haunt you.\u201d\n\n\u201cIt can\u2019t be worse than what we already live through!\u201d Jax shouted back. His voice echoed in the empty room.\n\nRiven turned away, frustration bubbling inside him. \u201cYou don\u2019t understand. There are things even I can\u2019t protect you from.\u201d\n\nAs Riven walked away, Jax felt a mix of fear and bravery. \u201cWe can\u2019t stop now, Lila. We\u2019re close to finding out what really happened!\u201d\n\nLila nodded but looked worried. \u201cOkay, but we need to be careful. What if Riven tells everyone?\u201d\n\nThey exchanged glances, and Jax took a deep breath. \u201cThen we\u2019ll just have to find the truth before he does!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, the machine whirred loudly, lights flashing. They both stepped back, startled. What was happening now?\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe memories swirled faster, and Jax felt a strange pull. He grabbed Lila\u2019s hand. \u201cHold on!\u201d\n\nWith a sudden jolt, they were sucked into a new memory, one that looked dark and chaotic. Jax\u2019s heart pounded. \u201cWhat is this? It feels\u2026 scary.\u201d\n\nLila squeezed his hand tighter. \u201cI don\u2019t know, but we need to be brave!\u201d\n\nThe memory flickered, and Jax saw a glimpse of a huge explosion. It was terrifying! \u201cWhat was that?\u201d he whispered, fear creeping in.\n\n\u201cI think we\u2019re about to find out,\u201d Lila said, her voice barely above a whisper.\n\nAs they watched, the scene changed, and they were surrounded by people running, yelling. Jax felt a chill in the air. This was a memory they had to understand.\n\nBut just then, the memory began to fade. \u201cNo! Don\u2019t go!\u201d Jax shouted.\n\nAnd in that moment, he realized they had to make a choice. \u201cDo we go deeper, Lila? Or do we run before it\u2019s too late?\u201d","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Jax and Lila discover in the ruins?","options":["A hidden treasure","A machine that shows memories","A secret door","An old map"],"correct_answer":"A machine that shows memories"},{"question":"What does Old Man Riven warn them about?","options":["The machine is broken","The memories are dangerous","They might get lost","They can't come back"],"correct_answer":"The memories are dangerous"},{"question":"What do Jax and Lila see in the chaotic memory?","options":["A celebration","A peaceful village","An explosion","A garden"],"correct_answer":"An explosion"},{"question":"What choice do Jax and Lila face at the end of the chapter?","options":["To tell Riven everything","To run away","To go deeper into the memories","To leave the machine alone"],"correct_answer":"To go deeper into the memories"},{"question":"How does Jax feel about uncovering the truth?","options":["Scared","Excited","Indifferent","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_329_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_329_ch3_img1.png","plot_329_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":558,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
