   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_329_7_10","title":"Echoes of the Past","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Post-Apocalyptic","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Jax and Lila stood in the dim light of the memory chamber. Dust danced in the air, sparkling like stars. \u201cThis place feels alive,\u201d Jax said, his eyes wide. \u201cLike it has stories to tell!\u201d \n\n\u201cI can almost hear the whispers of the past,\u201d Lila replied, peering closer at the machine. She touched a button, and the screen flickered to life. Memories flashed like a movie. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, they were surrounded by images of a vibrant village. Children laughed and played in the sun. The colors were bright, and the smiles were warm. \u201cLook at them, Jax! They\u2019re so happy!\u201d Lila exclaimed.\n\n\u201cYes,\u201d Jax said, feeling a mix of joy and sadness. \u201cThis is what we\u2019ve lost.\u201d\n\nOld Man Riven appeared behind them, his shadow long and serious. \u201cYou must not do this, children!\u201d he warned. \u201cThese memories are not yours to see!\u201d\n\nJax turned to Riven. \u201cBut we need to know the truth! How can we heal if we don\u2019t understand what happened?\u201d\n\nRiven sighed, his eyes softening. \u201cThe truth can be a heavy burden, Jax. Some things are better left in the past.\u201d\n\nDetermined, Jax replied, \u201cBut if we can unlock the secrets, we can help everyone! We can restore hope!\u201d\n\nWith a reluctant nod, Riven stepped aside. \u201cThen see what you must. But be ready for what you find.\u201d\n\nLila pressed another button, and the screen shimmered again. They saw a storm approaching the village, dark clouds swirling ominously. \u201cThis must be the catastrophe!\u201d Jax said, his heart racing. \n\nThen, a blinding flash filled the screen. Jax gasped. They witnessed people running, panic spreading like wildfire. \u201cWe have to do something!\u201d Lila shouted, her voice filled with urgency.\n\nJax clenched his fists. \u201cWe will! We will find a way to remember and rebuild.\u201d He took a deep breath, feeling hope ignite within him.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAs the memory faded, Jax and Lila looked at each other. \u201cWe have the answers now,\u201d Jax said. \u201cWe can tell everyone the truth!\u201d\n\nRiven nodded slowly, his expression thoughtful. \u201cMaybe it\u2019s time to face the past.\u201d\n\nTogether, they set out to share their discoveries. Excitement bubbled inside Jax. They would bring hope back to the village, one memory at a time.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go, Lila!\u201d he said, determination in his voice.\n\n\u201cTogether,\u201d Lila agreed, her eyes sparkling with courage. \n\nThe three of them walked out into the light, ready to change the future.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Jax and Lila discover in the memory chamber?","options":["A hidden treasure","Lost memories of their ancestors","A secret door to another world","A map of the village"],"correct_answer":"Lost memories of their ancestors"},{"question":"What is Old Man Riven's concern?","options":["He wants to join them","He fears the truth of the past","He believes in adventure","He loves to tell stories"],"correct_answer":"He fears the truth of the past"},{"question":"What event do Jax and Lila see in the memories?","options":["A festival in the village","A peaceful day at the park","A storm approaching the village","A day at school"],"correct_answer":"A storm approaching the village"},{"question":"How do Jax and Lila feel after seeing the memories?","options":["Happy and carefree","Determined to bring back hope","Scared and confused","Bored and tired"],"correct_answer":"Determined to bring back hope"},{"question":"What do Jax and Lila plan to do after discovering the memories?","options":["Keep it a secret","Help everyone remember the truth","Run away to another village","Forget about the past"],"correct_answer":"Help everyone remember the truth"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_329_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_329_ch4_img1.png","plot_329_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":407,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
