   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_329_7_10","title":"Echoes of the Past","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Post-Apocalyptic","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Jax and Lila stood before the hidden machine. It hummed softly, like a sleepy animal. The air was thick with excitement. \u201cWe need to share what we learned!\u201d Jax said, his eyes bright. \n\n\u201cBut what about Old Man Riven?\u201d Lila asked, biting her lip. \u201cHe warned us not to dig too deep.\u201d \n\n\u201cI know,\u201d Jax replied. \u201cBut the village deserves to know the truth.\u201d He took a deep breath. \u201cWe can\u2019t let fear stop us.\u201d\n\nThey decided to gather their friends. Jax felt a rush of energy. \"Let's meet at the old oak tree!\" he suggested. They hurried to the tree, its branches reaching high like arms welcoming them.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they reached the tree, a small crowd had gathered. Friends watched with curious eyes. \u201cWhat\u2019s going on?\u201d asked Mia, her face lighting up.\n\nJax stepped forward. \u201cWe found something amazing! Memories from our ancestors! They show us how we can heal our village!\u201d\n\nLila nodded, her voice steady. \u201cBut they also show the truth. We can\u2019t hide anymore. We need to face our past to build a better future.\u201d\n\nSome faces frowned, worried about what this meant. Old Man Riven approached, his steps slow. \u201cYou must be careful, children. The past can be painful.\u201d\n\n\u201cBut it can also bring hope!\u201d Jax insisted. \u201cWe can learn from it!\u201d \n\nSuddenly, a spark of light burst from the machine, illuminating the area. \u201cLook!\u201d Lila shouted, pointing. The memories danced around them like fireflies, lighting up their faces. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe crowd gasped, seeing visions of laughter and joy from their history. \u201cThis is beautiful!\u201d someone exclaimed. Jax smiled, feeling the energy shift. \n\nOld Man Riven softened. \u201cPerhaps\u2026 perhaps you are right.\u201d His voice was quieter now. \u201cMaybe the truth will guide us.\u201d\n\nOne by one, the villagers nodded. \u201cWe want to know!\u201d said Mia bravely. \u201cLet\u2019s learn together!\u201d \n\nJax felt a wave of relief wash over him. \u201cWe can start a new chapter! Together, we can rebuild!\u201d\n\nThe crowd cheered, their voices blending together, creating a melody of hope. Jax grinned at Lila. \u201cWe did it!\u201d\n\nAs the sun set, they all sat under the oak tree. The stars twinkled above, a promise of new beginnings. Jax knew that together, they could face anything.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Jax and Lila decide to do with their discovery?","options":["Keep it a secret","Share it with their friends","Forget about it","Hide from Old Man Riven"],"correct_answer":"Share it with their friends"},{"question":"Who warned Jax and Lila about the past?","options":["Mia","Old Man Riven","Their parents","The villagers"],"correct_answer":"Old Man Riven"},{"question":"What did the villagers see when the memories burst from the machine?","options":["Dark shadows","Fireflies","Animals","Old machines"],"correct_answer":"Fireflies"},{"question":"What did Jax feel when the villagers agreed to learn the truth?","options":["Anger","Fear","Relief","Sadness"],"correct_answer":"Relief"},{"question":"What did Jax think they could do by facing the past?","options":["Build a better future","Travel to the past","Ignore their memories","Leave the village"],"correct_answer":"Build a better future"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_329_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_329_ch5_img1.png","plot_329_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":377,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
