     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"rejuvenate","1":"barren","2":"mysterious","3":"determination","4":"exclaim","image_prompts":["A vibrant scene showing Zuri, Milo, and Ashy in the ash-covered landscape. Zuri stands confidently with her hands outstretched, green sprouts emerging from the ground. Milo looks amazed, while Ashy bounces nearby, filled with energy and excitement. The background features a gray landscape, with a broken wall and swirling ash.","An intense moment where Zuri and Milo stand determined against the mysterious figures. Zuri, with glowing hands, faces the dark figures who loom closer. The ground shows cracks, hinting at the impending danger. The atmosphere is tense but filled with the hope of the flowers blooming around them."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dimly lit interior of the community center, with Zuri standing at the forefront, her expression a mix of determination and fear. Ashy flits around her, casting playful shadows, while an array of murals depicting vibrant landscapes contrasts starkly with the ashen environment. The light flickers, creating a tense atmosphere that hints at an impending confrontation.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_330_ch3_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 15:19:14"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dramatic action scene within the community center, as Zuris vibrant light clashes with the dark forms of shadowy creatures. The room is illuminated by Zuris glow, highlighting the expressions of awe and fear on Milos and Ashys faces. The shadows writhe and reach toward them, creating a sense of chaos and urgency.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_330_ch3_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 15:19:14"}}}
