     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"rejuvenate","1":"determination","2":"bloom","3":"confident","4":"journey","image_prompts":["Zuri standing in a gray landscape, surrounded by ash and ruins. She has a determined expression, while Milo looks nervous beside her. Ashy is bouncing around, ready to help. The background shows a blustery wind with ash clouds swirling.","A vibrant patch of flowers blooming in the ash, with colors like yellow, red, and blue. Zuri is happily raising her hands, while Milo and Ashy cheer beside her. The mysterious figures can be seen in the background, looking confused and hesitant."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing The parks remnants stand amidst a landscape of gray ash. In the foreground, Zuri kneels, her hands touching the barren ground, a look of intense concentration on her face as the first green shoots emerge. The sky is a canvas of oranges and purples, contrasting the desolation around her, symbolizing hope and resilience.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_330_ch4_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 15:18:29"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing In a dramatic scene, Zuri stands tall amidst the newly sprouted plants, illuminated by the moonlight cutting through clouds. Shadows loom in the background, revealing Mira and other figures watching with a mix of fear and awe. Zuri embodies determination and strength, her gaze fierce as she confronts the darkness, surrounded by the beginnings of life she has created.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_330_ch4_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 15:18:29"}}}
