     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"rejuvenate","1":"beautiful","2":"believe","3":"dangerous","4":"victorious","image_prompts":["A vibrant garden bursting with colorful flowers in a clearing of gray ash. Zuri stands proudly with her arms open, Milo looks amazed, and Ashy dances joyfully nearby, surrounded by green plants and bright colors.","A scene showing Zuri surrounded by blooming flowers, with the mysterious figures in the background stepping back in surprise. The sunlight breaks through the clouds, illuminating their faces. Zuri looks determined, while Milo cheers beside her, and Ashy is bouncing with excitement."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A somber park scene at dusk, filled with crumbling playground equipment and gray ash covering the ground. Zuri, a twelve-year-old girl with determination in her eyes, kneels at a decaying tree stump, her hands glowing with green energy. Ashy, a whimsical ash creature, flutters around her, radiating excitement, while Milo stands nearby, arms crossed, his expression a mix of skepticism and hope.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_330_ch5_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 15:17:25"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing An intense moment of confrontation in the park, illuminated by a bright emerald light emanating from Zuris hands as she stands defiantly against a shadowy, cloaked figure. The figures face shows anger and disbelief as the surrounding area bursts with vibrant green shoots, defying the surrounding ash. The tension in the air is palpable, reflecting the struggle between light and darkness.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_330_ch5_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 15:17:25"}}}
