   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_330_7_10","title":"The Bright Side of Ashes","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Post-Apocalyptic","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Once, there was a world filled with color and life. But now, everything was gray. Ash covered the land like a thick blanket. This was Zuri\u2019s world. She was twelve years old and had bright, curious eyes. Today, she was exploring the ashy field behind her home.\n\n\u201cUgh, it\u2019s so dull here!\u201d Zuri sighed, kicking a pile of ash. \u201cI wish something exciting would happen!\u201d\n\nJust then, her friend Milo appeared. \u201cZuri, what are you doing?\u201d he asked, wrinkling his nose at the ash.\n\n\u201cI\u2019m searching for something green!\u201d Zuri replied, waving her arms. \u201cThere has to be something alive out here!\u201d\n\nMilo rolled his eyes. \u201cYou\u2019re dreaming. There\u2019s nothing but ash.\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a puff of ash swirled around them. From the cloud, a small creature formed. It was round, with big eyes and a goofy smile. \u201cHello! I\u2019m Ashy!\u201d it chirped, bouncing on a pile of ash.\n\nZuri gasped. \u201cA talking ash creature? This is amazing!\u201d She laughed, her heart racing with joy. Milo looked skeptical. \u201cIs this a prank?\u201d\n\n\u201cNo prank!\u201d Ashy declared, spinning like a top. \u201cI\u2019m real! And I can help you!\u201d\n\nZuri turned to Milo, eyes sparkling. \u201cLook! Something wonderful has happened!\u201d\n\nMilo scratched his head. \u201cI don\u2019t know\u2026 It\u2019s just ash, right?\u201d\n\nJust then, Zuri felt a tingle in her fingers. She knelt down and touched the ashy ground. To Milo\u2019s shock, a tiny green sprout peeked through the ashes. \u201cWhoa! How did you do that?\u201d he gasped.\n\n\u201cI...I don\u2019t know!\u201d Zuri stammered, pulling her hand back. \u201cBut it feels good!\u201d\n\n\u201cThat\u2019s cool, but\u2026\u201d Milo hesitated, \u201cWhat if someone sees you? What if they want to use your magic for bad things?\u201d\n\nZuri frowned. \u201cI just want to help. We can bring the world back to life!\u201d\n\nAshy jumped up and down. \u201cLet\u2019s go on an adventure! We\u2019ll find more plants!\u201d\n\nMilo sighed, but a small smile crept onto his face. \u201cAlright, but if we get caught, it\u2019s on you!\u201d\n\nZuri laughed, feeling brave. \u201cTogether, we can do anything!\u201d\n\nThe three friends set off, ready for adventure. But as they walked, shadows loomed behind them, watching. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who is Zuri's friend?","options":["Ashy","Milo","A shadow","The ash"],"correct_answer":"Milo"},{"question":"What does Zuri want to find?","options":["Something green","More ash","A treasure","A creature"],"correct_answer":"Something green"},{"question":"What does Ashy say when it first appears?","options":["I\u2019m a prank","Hello! I\u2019m Ashy!","Look out!","Help me!"],"correct_answer":"Hello! I\u2019m Ashy!"},{"question":"What does Zuri discover when she touches the ground?","options":["A flower","A sprout","A tree","More ash"],"correct_answer":"A sprout"},{"question":"What do shadows represent in the story?","options":["Hope","Friendship","Challenges","Fun"],"correct_answer":"Challenges"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_330_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_330_ch1_img1.png","plot_330_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":370,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
