       [DEBUG] Checking shared image: {"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A scene filled with tension, as Zuris glowing hands illuminate the dusty room amidst a whirlwind of ash and debris. Her expression is one of fierce determination mixed with fear, while Milo looks on in wide-eyed astonishment. The ash creature, Ashy, dances protectively around them, its tendrils swirling dynamically. Shadows loom ominously in the background, hinting at the lurking danger that has been awakened.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_330_ch2_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 15:20:01"}
