   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_330_7_10","title":"The Bright Side of Ashes","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Post-Apocalyptic","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Zuri woke up to the same gray sky. The ash swirled around her like a hazy fog. \"Another day in the ashland,\" she sighed. She looked at Ashy, who was bouncing happily beside her. His little eyes sparkled in the dull light.\n\n\"Let\u2019s see if we can find a spot to bring back life!\" Zuri said, her heart racing with excitement. \"Maybe we can make a beautiful garden today!\"\n\n\"Or maybe not,\" Milo grumbled, crossing his arms. He didn\u2019t believe Zuri\u2019s powers would work. But he still followed her because he was curious. \n\nThey walked past piles of charred wood and broken bricks. The land was so still. It felt like a forgotten world. Zuri paused, feeling the weight of the ash under her feet. \u201cLook, Ashy! Over there!\u201d She pointed to a tiny patch of earth peeking through the gray. It looked lonely and sad.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s try it!\u201d Zuri knelt down. She remembered what Ashy taught her. \u201cClose your eyes and think of green!\u201d she whispered. She placed her hands on the ground and felt a warm glow start from her fingertips.\n\nSuddenly, the earth began to rumble! Zuri opened her eyes, and to her surprise, tiny sprouts began poking through the ash. Green leaves unfurled, reaching for the sky. \u201cIt\u2019s working!\u201d she shouted.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nBut then, a loud noise shattered the moment. Zuri turned to see dark shapes in the distance. \"What is that?\" Milo gasped. \n\n\"They look like... people?\" Ashy asked, his voice shaky.\n\n\u201cThey must have seen us!\u201d Zuri said, fear creeping into her heart. The figures got closer, their faces hidden in shadows. Zuri could feel Milo\u2019s tension beside her. \u201cWe need to hide!\u201d she whispered urgently.\n\nBut just as they turned to find cover, one of the figures shouted, \u201cStop! Don\u2019t run! We want to see what you\u2019re doing!\u201d \n\nZuri hesitated. Should they run, or should they talk? She took a deep breath and decided to stay. \u201cWe\u2019re trying to help the world,\u201d she called out. \u201cWe can bring back life!\u201d\n\nThe leader stepped forward, a tall figure with a ragged coat. \u201cBring back life?\u201d he echoed. \u201cYou have a power that could change everything. But\u2026 what do you want in return?\u201d\n\nZuri\u2019s heart raced. She had no idea what to say. \u201cWe just want to help!\u201d she declared, trying to sound brave.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cHelp, huh?\u201d the leader grinned. \u201cWe\u2019ll see about that. Maybe we can use your talent for ourselves\u2026\u201d\n\nZuri\u2019s heart sank. This could be trouble. She glanced at Milo, who looked just as worried. What if these newcomers were not friendly? They needed a plan, and fast!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Zuri want to do with her powers?","options":["Bring back life","Hide from others","Play games","Collect ashes"],"correct_answer":"Bring back life"},{"question":"Who is with Zuri on her journey?","options":["Milo and Ashy","Her family","A giant","A bird"],"correct_answer":"Milo and Ashy"},{"question":"What interrupts Zuri's moment of success?","options":["A loud noise","Rain","A rainbow","A bird flying by"],"correct_answer":"A loud noise"},{"question":"What do the shadowy figures want from Zuri?","options":["To help her","To take her powers","To play","To leave"],"correct_answer":"To take her powers"},{"question":"How does Zuri feel about the shadowy figures?","options":["Excited","Curious","Worried","Happy"],"correct_answer":"Worried"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_330_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_330_ch2_img1.png","plot_330_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":450,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
