   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_330_7_10","title":"The Bright Side of Ashes","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Post-Apocalyptic","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"The wind howled through the craggy remains of what had once been a bustling village. Zuri stood in the middle of the gray landscape, her heart racing. She could feel the magic inside her, ready to burst forth. Milo shuffled beside her, glancing nervously at the ash clouds swirling above.\n\n\"Are you sure this is a good idea?\" he asked, wringing his hands. \n\n\"We have to try, Milo! We can\u2019t let those figures take my powers. And we can bring life back to this place!\" Zuri replied, determination shining in her eyes. \n\nAshy, their playful ash creature, bounced around them. \"Let\u2019s make some green! Whoosh! Zuri, you can do it!\"\n\nZuri took a deep breath. She closed her eyes and focused. As she raised her hands, a warm glow sparked in her palms. \n\nSuddenly, the ground beneath her began to tremble! Zuri opened her eyes in surprise. \"What is happening?\"\n\nJust then, a burst of green shoots emerged from the ashes, surprising everyone. Bright flowers bloomed where her magic touched the ground. \"I did it!\" Zuri shouted, jumping up and down. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe field sparkled with colors\u2014yellows, reds, and blues. Milo stared, his mouth open wide. \"You really did it, Zuri! You can bring it back!\" \n\nBut their joy was short-lived. From the shadows, the mysterious figures emerged again. \"Stop right there!\" one shouted. They wore cloaks that blended with the ash, their faces hidden. \n\nZuri took a step back, heart pounding. \"We won\u2019t let you take anything from us!\" \n\nMilo moved beside her, his eyes fierce. \"We\u2019re not scared of you!\"\n\nAshy giggled and darted around the figures, causing them to stumble. \"Watch out! Ashy in action!\" \n\nThe figures looked confused. Zuri seized the chance. \"Let\u2019s show them the power of friendship!\" With a wave of her hand, she made more flowers bloom, filling the air with sweet scents. \n\nThe figures hesitated, glancing at each other. \"This\u2026 this can\u2019t be real!\" one whispered. \n\n\"It is real!\" Zuri shouted. \"It\u2019s just the beginning!\" \n\nThe colorful flowers danced in the breeze, lighting up the dreary world around them. Zuri felt stronger and more confident. \"We can make this place beautiful again, together!\"\n\nAs the figures backed away, Zuri, Milo, and Ashy shared a smile. They had made progress, but their journey was far from over. They needed to stay strong.\n\n\"Let\u2019s go find more places to help. We can do it, together!\" Zuri exclaimed. \n\nWith renewed hope, they set off, ready for whatever came next. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe sun peeked through the ash clouds, shining brightly. Zuri felt a spark in her heart. They were on the right path.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Zuri discover she can do?","options":["Make flowers bloom","Fly high in the sky","Turn ash into gold","Create fire"],"correct_answer":"Make flowers bloom"},{"question":"What do the mysterious figures want?","options":["To help Zuri","To take Zuri's powers","To play with Ashy","To leave the ash land"],"correct_answer":"To take Zuri's powers"},{"question":"How does Milo feel at the beginning of the chapter?","options":["Excited","Nervous","Angry","Happy"],"correct_answer":"Nervous"},{"question":"What does Ashy do during the confrontation?","options":["Runs away","Bounces around and distracts the figures","Turns into a rock","Goes to sleep"],"correct_answer":"Bounces around and distracts the figures"},{"question":"What do Zuri, Milo, and Ashy plan to do next?","options":["Find food","Make more flowers bloom","Go home","Leave the ash land"],"correct_answer":"Make more flowers bloom"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_330_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_330_ch4_img1.png","plot_330_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":448,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
