   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_330_7_10","title":"The Bright Side of Ashes","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Post-Apocalyptic","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"The sun peeked through the thick clouds, casting a soft light over the ash-covered land. Zuri, Milo, and Ashy stood in a small clearing where Zuri had created a patch of blooming flowers. The colors were bright against the gray, and the flowers swayed gently in the breeze.\n\n\u201cLook at that! You made a garden!\u201d Milo exclaimed, his eyes wide with wonder. \u201cIt\u2019s beautiful, Zuri!\u201d\n\nZuri beamed with pride. \u201cI can feel the magic inside me! I just need to believe in it.\u201d\n\nAshy, the quirky ash creature, did a little dance. \u201cAshy like flowers! Ashy love flowers! Can we make more?\u201d\n\nZuri nodded eagerly. \u201cYes! Let\u2019s spread hope everywhere!\u201d [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they were about to start, a shadow loomed over them. The mysterious figures were back! Zuri's heart raced as she clutched her hands. \u201cMilo, we have to stand together!\u201d\n\nOne of the figures stepped forward, a tall person with a hood. \u201cYou think you can change this wasteland? You\u2019re just a girl!\u201d\n\nZuri held her head high. \u201cI can! I believe in my power!\u201d She closed her eyes and felt the warmth inside her. Suddenly, the ground began to tremble, and small green sprouts burst from beneath the ash!\n\n\u201cZuri! Look!\u201d Milo shouted, pointing to the sprouts. They turned into bright green plants, spreading like a wave. \n\nAshy jumped up and down. \u201cMore! More!\u201d [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nBut the figures were not happy. They pointed at Zuri. \u201cStop this! You are dangerous! We will take your power!\u201d\n\nZuri took a deep breath. \u201cNo! I will not let you take what is mine! I use my power to help others! You can\u2019t stop me!\u201d\n\nWith a final push of her magic, the flowers grew higher, and the air filled with sweet scents. The figures stepped back, surprised. One by one, they turned and fled into the ash, leaving Zuri, Milo, and Ashy victorious.\n\nMilo cheered, \u201cYou did it, Zuri! You showed them what you can do!\u201d\n\nZuri smiled, feeling stronger than ever. \u201cWe can bring this world back to life. Together, we can make it bright again!\u201d\n\nAs the sun broke through the clouds, they looked at their blooming garden. Hope had returned to their hearts, and they knew their adventure was just beginning.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Zuri create in the clearing?","options":["A garden","A castle","A spaceship","A wall"],"correct_answer":"A garden"},{"question":"What do the mysterious figures want to do?","options":["Help Zuri","Take her power","Join Zuri","Scare Zuri"],"correct_answer":"Take her power"},{"question":"How does Zuri feel when she uses her powers?","options":["Scared","Proud","Angry","Sad"],"correct_answer":"Proud"},{"question":"Who supports Zuri during the challenge?","options":["Her mother","Milo and Ashy","The figures","No one"],"correct_answer":"Milo and Ashy"},{"question":"What is the mood at the end of the chapter?","options":["Fearful","Joyful","Angry","Sad"],"correct_answer":"Joyful"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_330_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_330_ch5_img1.png","plot_330_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":379,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
