     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"maze","1":"puzzle","2":"together","3":"symbols","4":"determination","image_prompts":["A vibrant, pixelated maze with bright colors\u2014pink trees and blue rivers. Leo, a twelve-year-old boy with sandy brown hair, looks excited. Pixel, a quirky avatar with green hair and a playful outfit, jumps with joy. Sam, a tech-savvy boy with glasses, gazes thoughtfully at a glowing symbol on the wall. The mood is adventurous and cheerful.","A dramatic confrontation scene with the Glitch. He appears as a twisted, flickering figure with dark colors. Leo stands in front, looking determined. Pixel and Sam are beside him, ready for action. The maze backdrop is colorful but filled with tension, hinting at the excitement of the showdown."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A vibrant pixelated forest clearing under the sunlight, where three characters (Leo, Pixel, and Sam) stand together, expressing a mix of determination and hope. The trees around them are colorful and whimsical, with dappled light filtering through the leaves, casting playful shadows.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_321_ch4_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 15:13:43"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing An intense moment of battle in the Maze of Reflections, with the Glitch looming ominously in front of Leo and his friends. The surroundings are a chaotic mix of shifting walls and fragmented reflections, showing distorted images of the characters. Leo stands in a heroic pose, determination in his eyes, ready to confront his fears.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_321_ch4_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 15:13:43"}}}
