   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_321_7_10","title":"Quest of the Pixel Warriors","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Virtual Reality","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Leo sat in his room, staring at his favorite VR game. The colorful screen glowed like a rainbow. \u201cJust one more level!\u201d he said to himself. Leo was twelve and loved puzzles. He often played for hours, solving tricky challenges. But today felt different.  \n\nHe grabbed his VR headset and put it on. \u201cHere we go!\u201d he shouted as he entered the game. Suddenly, he found himself in a vibrant digital world. Floating islands floated above a sparkling river. Trees shimmered with bright colors. Leo couldn\u2019t believe his eyes.  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]  \n\n\u201cWow! This place is amazing!\u201d he exclaimed. Just then, a quirky avatar named Pixel zoomed up to him. Pixel had wild blue hair and big, round glasses. \u201cHey there! You\u2019re new, aren\u2019t you?\u201d she said with a cheerful grin.  \n\n\u201cUm, yeah. I just found a hidden level,\u201d Leo replied, feeling a bit shy.  \n\n\u201cLucky you! I\u2019m Pixel, and this is the land of Puzzlevania!\u201d she announced proudly. \u201cBut we have a problem. The Glitch is coming! He wants to erase our world!\u201d  \n\nLeo felt a shiver. \u201cThe Glitch? Who is he?\u201d  \n\nPixel looked serious. \u201cHe\u2019s a bad guy who messes up everything! If we don\u2019t stop him, Puzzlevania will be lost!\u201d  \n\nJust then, Sam, Leo\u2019s tech-savvy friend, appeared on a floating platform. He was wearing a virtual helmet and holding a glowing tablet. \u201cLeo! I can track the Glitch! We need to gather the Pixel Warriors!\u201d  \n\nLeo\u2019s heart raced. \u201cPixel Warriors? Who are they?\u201d  \n\n\u201cThey\u2019re the bravest avatars around. Together, we can stop the Glitch!\u201d Sam said, glancing at Pixel.  \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Pixel cheered. \u201cBut first, we need to cross the Maze of Memories!\u201d  \n\nLeo felt unsure. \u201cWhat if I can\u2019t do it?\u201d  \n\nPixel smiled. \u201cYou can! Remember, we\u2019re a team. Trust us!\u201d  \n\nLeo took a deep breath. \u201cOkay, let\u2019s do it!\u201d  \n\nAs they approached the maze, Leo felt a mix of excitement and fear. He knew he had to face his worries. \u201cI can do this!\u201d he whispered to himself.  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]  \n\nThe maze loomed ahead, twisting and turning. \u201cStay close!\u201d Sam instructed. \u201cFollow me!\u201d  \n\nLeo followed his friends, his heart racing. Would he be able to help save Puzzlevania?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the name of the digital world Leo enters?","options":["Puzzlevania","Pixel Land","Glitch World","Maze City"],"correct_answer":"Puzzlevania"},{"question":"Who is the quirky avatar Leo meets first?","options":["Leo","Sam","Pixel","Glitch"],"correct_answer":"Pixel"},{"question":"What does the Glitch want to do?","options":["Help everyone","Erase the world","Play games","Make friends"],"correct_answer":"Erase the world"},{"question":"What challenge do Leo and his friends need to cross?","options":["Bridge of Dreams","Maze of Memories","River of Lights","Mountain of Challenges"],"correct_answer":"Maze of Memories"},{"question":"How does Leo feel about facing the challenge?","options":["Excited and happy","Nervous and unsure","Angry and upset","Bored and tired"],"correct_answer":"Nervous and unsure"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_321_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_321_ch1_img1.png","plot_321_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":375,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
