   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_321_7_10","title":"Quest of the Pixel Warriors","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Virtual Reality","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Leo, Pixel, and Sam stood at the entrance of the Maze of Memories. The walls sparkled like diamonds. \u201cIt\u2019s beautiful!\u201d Leo gasped. \n\n\u201cJust wait until we go inside!\u201d Pixel exclaimed, bouncing on her toes. \u201cThis maze will test our teamwork.\u201d\n\n\u201cI hope we can solve it,\u201d Leo said softly. He felt a flutter of worry in his stomach. What if he messed up?\n\n\u201cDon\u2019t worry! We\u2019ll help each other,\u201d Sam smiled. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d \n\nThey entered the maze. Instantly, the paths shifted and changed. Bright colors swirled around them. Leo felt dizzy but excited. \u201cWhere do we start?\u201d he asked.\n\n\u201cThis way!\u201d Pixel pointed to a path filled with dancing lights. They followed her, weaving through the maze. Suddenly, they heard a strange noise. \n\n\u201cDid you hear that?\u201d Leo whispered. \n\nBefore Sam could answer, a wall of pixels rose up behind them. \u201cOh no! We\u2019re trapped!\u201d he shouted. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cStay calm!\u201d Pixel said. \u201cWe can solve this!\u201d \n\nLeo looked at the wall. It was covered in symbols. \u201cMaybe it\u2019s a puzzle?\u201d he suggested. \n\n\u201cGreat idea!\u201d Sam said. \u201cWe need to find the right symbols to open the wall.\u201d\n\nTogether, they examined the symbols. Some looked like stars. Others were shapes Leo recognized. \u201cI see a triangle!\u201d he pointed. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s press it!\u201d Pixel said. They pressed the triangle together. \n\nA sound like a magical chime rang out! The wall shimmered and began to fade. \n\n\u201cLook! It\u2019s working!\u201d Leo cheered. \n\nBut just then, a shadow loomed over them. The Glitch appeared, his eyes glowing red. \u201cYou think you can escape?\u201d he sneered. \u201cThis maze will be your end!\u201d\n\nLeo\u2019s heart raced. He had to face the Glitch. \u201cWe can do this!\u201d he shouted to his friends. \n\nThe wall had vanished, but the path ahead seemed darker. \u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d Pixel asked, eyes wide.\n\n\u201cWe keep going!\u201d Leo said, determination in his voice. \u201cTogether, we can defeat him!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThey stepped forward, ready for whatever came next. A new challenge awaited them, and Leo felt stronger with his friends by his side.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the Maze of Memories?","options":["A place to sleep","A puzzle-filled maze","A game store","A battle arena"],"correct_answer":"A puzzle-filled maze"},{"question":"Who is the character that points out the path to follow?","options":["Leo","Sam","Pixel","The Glitch"],"correct_answer":"Pixel"},{"question":"What happens when they press the triangle symbol?","options":["They fall asleep","They get trapped","The wall disappears","They find treasure"],"correct_answer":"The wall disappears"},{"question":"What does the Glitch look like?","options":["A friendly creature","A glowing ball","A giant robot","A shadowy figure with glowing red eyes"],"correct_answer":"A shadowy figure with glowing red eyes"},{"question":"What does Leo feel as they face the Glitch?","options":["Excitement","Fear","Anger","Happiness"],"correct_answer":"Fear"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_321_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_321_ch2_img1.png","plot_321_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":351,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
