   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_321_7_10","title":"Quest of the Pixel Warriors","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Virtual Reality","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"As Leo, Pixel, and Sam stood in the Maze of Memories, the air buzzed with tension. The walls shimmered, reflecting their fears. \"What if we can't find the way out?\" Leo whispered. \n\n\"Don't worry, Leo! We can do this together!\" Pixel said, jumping with excitement. \"We just need to trust each other.\" \n\nThey took a deep breath and moved forward. Each step felt heavier than the last. Suddenly, a loud rumble echoed. The Glitch appeared, swirling like a storm cloud. \n\n\"Give up now!\" it howled, sending sparks flying. \"This world will be mine!\"\n\nLeo's heart raced. \"What do we do?\" he shouted, panic creeping in. \n\n\"We need to solve the Wall of Worries!\" Sam exclaimed. \"It's the only way to move past the Glitch!\" \n\nBefore they could talk more, the wall before them lit up with puzzle pieces. Each piece showed something Leo feared: failing a test, losing a game, and being alone. \n\n\"Each piece is a memory,\" Pixel explained, \"We must face them!\" \n\nLeo gulped, staring at the first piece. \"But what if I fail again?\" \n\n\"You won\u2019t!\" Pixel encouraged. \"You\u2019ve already made it this far!\" \n\nLeo nodded. He stepped toward the puzzle piece. It shimmered and sparkled like stars. He touched it. Memories flooded his mind.\n\nSuddenly, the Maze shifted! Walls twisted and turned. \"We need to hurry!\" Sam urged. \n\nAs they raced through the maze, Leo began to feel the weight of his fears lift. \u201cI won\u2019t let the Glitch win!\u201d he declared, determination filling his voice. \n\nJust then, the Glitch launched a wave of energy. Leo gasped. \u201cLook out!\u201d he shouted, as the wave raced toward them. \n\nPixel leaped in front of Leo. \u201cI won\u2019t let you hurt my friends!\u201d With a burst of color, she blocked the wave. \n\n\u201cPixel!\u201d Leo cried. Just then, a bright light illuminated the maze. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe wall shifted again, revealing a hidden path. \u201cThis way!\u201d Sam yelled, pulling Leo along. \n\nAs they ran, Leo\u2019s heart raced. He realized that he had to believe in himself and his friends. Together, they could defeat the Glitch! \n\nBut just as they reached the end of the path, the Glitch appeared again, bigger and angrier. \u201cYou think you can escape?!\u201d it bellowed. \n\nLeo stood tall. \u201cWe can do this together!\u201d he shouted, ready to face the biggest challenge yet. \n\n\u201cReady or not, here I come!\u201d the Glitch roared, and darkness swirled around them. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWhat would happen next?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Leo, Pixel, and Sam need to solve to move past the Glitch?","options":["The Wall of Worries","The Door of Secrets","The Tunnel of Fears","The Puzzle of Dreams"],"correct_answer":"The Wall of Worries"},{"question":"What does Leo face in the puzzle pieces?","options":["His favorite game","His fears","His friends","His dreams"],"correct_answer":"His fears"},{"question":"Who jumps in front of Leo to protect him?","options":["Sam","The Glitch","Pixel","Leo"],"correct_answer":"Pixel"},{"question":"What happens as they try to escape the maze?","options":["The maze disappears","The maze shifts and changes","They find treasure","They meet more friends"],"correct_answer":"The maze shifts and changes"},{"question":"What does Leo realize he must do to defeat the Glitch?","options":["Run away","Believe in himself and his friends","Cry","Give up"],"correct_answer":"Believe in himself and his friends"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_321_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_321_ch3_img1.png","plot_321_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":411,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
