   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_321_7_10","title":"Quest of the Pixel Warriors","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Virtual Reality","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Leo stood at the entrance of the Maze of Memories. The walls shimmered like stars in the night sky. \u201cWe made it!\u201d he said, feeling a rush of excitement. \n\nPixel bounced up and down. \u201cNow we can solve the next puzzle! I can feel it!\u201d \n\nSam adjusted his glasses. \u201cRemember, we need to work together. The Glitch won\u2019t stop until he erases everything!\u201d \n\nSuddenly, the maze shifted. The walls moved and twisted like a roller coaster. Leo's heart raced. \u201cWhat if we get lost?\u201d \n\nPixel grinned. \u201cDon\u2019t worry! I\u2019ve got a plan! Follow me!\u201d \n\nThey entered the maze. Bright colors surrounded them: pink trees, blue rivers, and yellow flowers. Leo couldn't help but smile. This place was amazing! \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they ventured deeper, they found a wall covered in strange symbols. \u201cWhat does this mean?\u201d Leo asked. \n\n\u201cIt looks like a puzzle!\u201d Sam exclaimed. \u201cWe need to figure it out to get through.\u201d \n\nPixel pointed to a glowing symbol. \u201cThis one is different! Maybe we should press it!\u201d \n\nLeo hesitated. \u201cWhat if we fail?\u201d \n\nPixel looked at him with wide, encouraging eyes. \u201cWe won\u2019t! We\u2019re a team!\u201d \n\nTaking a deep breath, Leo pressed the symbol. The wall sparkled and shifted. It opened a doorway! \n\n\u201cSee? You did it!\u201d Pixel cheered, hopping with joy. \n\nJust then, a loud crack echoed through the maze. The Glitch appeared, his twisted figure flickering like a broken screen. \u201cYou think you can stop me?\u201d he sneered. \n\nLeo felt his stomach drop. \u201cNo! We can\u2019t let him win!\u201d \n\n\u201cStay calm!\u201d Sam shouted. \u201cWe need to solve the next puzzle to get to him!\u201d \n\nPixel raised her fist. \u201cTogether, we can do this!\u201d \n\nLeo nodded, his fear fading. They were ready. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d he said, determination shining in his eyes.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThey ran toward the Glitch, ready to face the biggest challenge yet. Leo felt a spark of hope. Together, they could save Puzzlevania!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Leo, Pixel, and Sam need to solve to get through the maze?","options":["A riddle","A puzzle","A secret code","A map"],"correct_answer":"A puzzle"},{"question":"What does Pixel encourage Leo to do?","options":["Run away","Take a nap","Press the symbol","Give up"],"correct_answer":"Press the symbol"},{"question":"What appears when Leo presses the symbol?","options":["A monster","A doorway","A treasure","A warning"],"correct_answer":"A doorway"},{"question":"How does Leo feel when he decides to face the Glitch?","options":["Scared","Excited","Nervous","Determined"],"correct_answer":"Determined"},{"question":"What is the main challenge they face in this chapter?","options":["Finding a treasure","Solving a puzzle","Running away from the Glitch","Building a bridge"],"correct_answer":"Solving a puzzle"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_321_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_321_ch4_img1.png","plot_321_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":326,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
