   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_321_7_10","title":"Quest of the Pixel Warriors","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Virtual Reality","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Leo, Pixel, and Sam stood at the edge of the Maze of Memories. Colorful trees waved their pixelated branches. Bright flowers danced in the breeze. Leo could hear the chatter of cheerful avatars nearby.\n\n\u201cThis is it!\u201d Pixel said, her eyes sparkling with excitement. \u201cThe final puzzle is just ahead!\u201d\n\n\u201cAre you ready, Leo?\u201d Sam asked. \u201cWe need to trust each other if we\u2019re going to defeat the Glitch.\u201d\n\nLeo took a deep breath. He felt a flutter in his stomach. \u201cI\u2019m ready. I trust you both!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThey walked together through the maze. The walls shifted and changed, creating new paths. Suddenly, a loud crack echoed through the air. The Glitch appeared, looking even more chaotic than before. \u201cYou think you can stop me?\u201d it cackled.\n\n\u201cNot if we work together!\u201d Pixel shouted. She pulled out a glowing puzzle piece. \u201cThis is a Memory Fragment! We need to put it in the right spot!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s do it!\u201d Sam cheered. They searched for the right spot. \n\nLeo\u2019s heart raced. \u201cLook! That wall has a glowing outline!\u201d He pointed. \n\nThe Glitch roared in anger. \u201cYou\u2019ll never solve it!\u201d It sent glitchy sparks flying at them.\n\n\u201cDuck!\u201d Sam yelled. They all crouched down just in time. The sparks fizzled against the walls.\n\nLeo felt a rush of courage. \u201cPixel, you keep the Glitch busy. Sam and I will place the fragment!\u201d\n\nPixel nodded. \u201cI\u2019ll distract it with my flashy moves!\u201d She twirled and jumped, dazzling the Glitch with her bright colors.\n\nLeo and Sam rushed to the wall. They fitted the Memory Fragment into the glowing outline. The wall lit up! The ground shook, and pieces of the maze rearranged themselves.\n\n\u201cNow, Leo!\u201d Sam cried. \u201cPress the button!\u201d\n\nWith shaky hands, Leo hit the button. A wave of energy burst from the wall. The Glitch screeched, \u201cNo! This can\u2019t be happening!\u201d It began to fade away, pixel by pixel.\n\nThey did it! The Maze of Memories shimmered and glowed with new life. Leo felt proud. \n\n\u201cWe can do anything together!\u201d Pixel cheered. \n\nLeo smiled. \u201cYeah! I\u2019m really glad I met you both.\u201d\n\nWith the Glitch gone, they stepped forward, ready for the next adventure. \n\n\u201cWhere to next?\u201d Sam asked, excitement in his voice.\n\nLeo grinned. \u201cI can\u2019t wait to find out!\u201d","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do they need to place to defeat the Glitch?","options":["A Memory Fragment","A secret code","A magic spell","A power-up"],"correct_answer":"A Memory Fragment"},{"question":"How does Leo feel when they confront the Glitch?","options":["Fearful","Excited","Brave","Confused"],"correct_answer":"Brave"},{"question":"What does Pixel do to distract the Glitch?","options":["Runs away","Uses a spell","Performs flashy moves","Calls for help"],"correct_answer":"Performs flashy moves"},{"question":"What happens when the Memory Fragment is placed?","options":["The maze disappears","The Glitch wins","The Glitch fades away","They find a treasure"],"correct_answer":"The Glitch fades away"},{"question":"What do the characters feel after defeating the Glitch?","options":["Sad","Angry","Proud","Scared"],"correct_answer":"Proud"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_321_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_321_ch5_img1.png","plot_321_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":389,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
