   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_321_11_14","title":"Quest of the Pixel Warriors","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Virtual Reality","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"In the corner of his dimly lit room, twelve-year-old Leo sat cross-legged on the floor, his eyes glued to the screen. The flickering glow of his gaming console illuminated his face, revealing a mix of excitement and concentration. Leo loved video games more than anything else. They were his escape, a way to dive into worlds where he could be anyone \u2014 even a hero. But today felt different. He was on the verge of discovering something extraordinary.\n\nAs the familiar music of \"Pixel Quest\" filled the air, Leo navigated his character, a nimble little avatar named Zippy, through a vibrant landscape dotted with colorful trees and floating islands. Suddenly, he noticed a shimmering portal in the distance. Leo\u2019s heart raced with curiosity. What could it be? He had played this game countless times, yet he had never seen this hidden level before.\n\nWithout thinking, he guided Zippy towards the portal. The moment he stepped through, a rush of wind enveloped him. Everything around him blurred, and in a blink, he was no longer in his room. Instead, he stood at the edge of an enchanted forest, the colors more vivid than any video game he had ever played. The tall trees sparkled with pixelated leaves, and the ground pulsated with a rhythm that felt alive.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cWelcome to Pixelia!\u201d a cheerful voice called out. Leo turned to see a quirky avatar with a wild tuft of green hair bouncing towards him. \u201cI\u2019m Pixel! You\u2019re just in time. We need your help!\u201d\n\n\u201cHelp?\u201d Leo stammered, still processing the fact that he was truly in the game. \u201cWhat do you mean?\u201d\n\n\u201cThe Glitch is back!\u201d Pixel exclaimed, eyes wide with urgency. \u201cIt\u2019s disrupting our world, and if we don\u2019t stop it, we\u2019ll be erased! You\u2019re the only one who can help. You have the skills!\u201d\n\n\u201cI\u2014I\u2019m not sure I can,\u201d Leo admitted, feeling a knot of anxiety form in his stomach. What if he failed?\n\n\u201cTrust me! You\u2019ve already done amazing things in the game,\u201d Pixel insisted, bouncing on the balls of his feet. \u201cPlus, we all have our own battles to fight. Let\u2019s gather our team!\u201d\n\nAs they ventured deeper into the forest, Leo couldn\u2019t help but feel a swirl of emotions. He had always been shy, often feeling like the outsider at school, but here, surrounded by vibrant colors and adventure, it felt different. Perhaps this was his chance to prove himself.\n\nThey entered a clearing where two more avatars awaited: a tall, muscular warrior named Rex and a clever, tech-savvy girl called Sam. Rex had a fierce look, but his eyes softened as he caught sight of Leo.\n\n\u201cNew recruit?\u201d Rex asked, crossing his arms. \u201cWe could use a brain like yours.\u201d\n\nSam stepped forward, her glasses glinting in the sunlight. \u201cLeo, I\u2019ve seen your high scores! If we work together, we might stand a chance against the Glitch.\u201d \n\nLeo felt a spark of determination. \u201cOkay, let\u2019s do it!\u201d he said, surprising himself. The fear still lingered, but now it shared space with excitement. \n\nSuddenly, a loud crack echoed through the trees. The ground trembled, and from the shadows emerged a swirling mass of distortion. The Glitch had arrived.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cRun!\u201d Pixel shouted, and chaos erupted as the team dashed away. Leo\u2019s heart pounded in his chest. It was real. This was no longer just a game; it was a battle for survival.\n\n\u201cStick together!\u201d Sam yelled, pulling her friends closer. \u201cWe can\u2019t let it separate us!\u201d\n\nWith every step, Leo felt the weight of his fears pressing down, but he also felt the warmth of newfound friendships igniting his courage. The journey ahead was uncertain, but he was ready to face the unknown.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What hidden feature does Leo discover in 'Pixel Quest'?","options":["A new character","A secret level","A bonus game","A glitch"],"correct_answer":"A secret level"},{"question":"Who is the first avatar Leo meets in Pixelia?","options":["Rex","Sam","Pixel","The Glitch"],"correct_answer":"Pixel"},{"question":"What is threatening the world of Pixelia?","options":["A new game update","The Glitch","A rival team","A lost treasure"],"correct_answer":"The Glitch"},{"question":"How does Leo feel about joining the team initially?","options":["Confident","Excited","Fearful","Indifferent"],"correct_answer":"Fearful"},{"question":"What does Sam encourage Leo to do?","options":["Stay back","Run away","Trust his skills","Leave the team"],"correct_answer":"Trust his skills"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_321_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_321_ch1_img1.png","plot_321_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":633,"reading_level":"Builder"}
