   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_322_7_10","title":"The Time-Traveler's Headset","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Virtual Reality","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Sofia loved her attic. It was a treasure chest of old things. One sunny Saturday, she decided to explore it. She climbed the rickety stairs and opened the creaky door. Dust danced in the air like tiny fairies.\n\n\u201cWow! Look at all this stuff!\u201d Sofia shouted. She saw old books, dusty toys, and even a bicycle with a flat tire. But one thing caught her eye. It was an old VR headset, covered in dust. \n\n\u201cWhat is this?\u201d Sofia wondered. She picked it up, wiping off the dirt. Just then, her best friend Max peeked in. \n\n\u201cHey, Sofia! What did you find?\u201d Max asked, his eyes wide with excitement. \n\n\u201cThis!\u201d Sofia replied, holding up the headset. \n\n\u201cCan we try it?\u201d he asked eagerly.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s do it!\u201d Sofia laughed. \n\nThey sat down on the attic floor. Sofia put the headset on. The world around her vanished. Suddenly, she was standing in a grand hallway filled with colorful paintings. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cWhoa! This is amazing!\u201d Sofia exclaimed. \n\n\u201cWhere are we?\u201d Max asked, his voice echoing in the hallway. \n\n\u201cThis must be the Renaissance!\u201d Sofia said. \u201cLook at those paintings! They\u2019re by Leonardo da Vinci!\u201d \n\nJust then, a voice called out, \u201cCan you help me?\u201d A young man stood in front of them. He wore a tunic and had messy hair. \n\n\u201cI\u2019m Leonardo!\u201d he said, waving his hands. \u201cI need someone to help me with my painting. I\u2019m running out of time!\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat should we do?\u201d Max whispered to Sofia. \n\n\u201cWe should help him!\u201d Sofia said. \u201cBut what if we mess something up?\u201d \n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but we can\u2019t leave him hanging!\u201d Max said. \n\nSofia nodded. They both agreed to help Leonardo. They rushed to his side, ready for an adventure. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s make this painting the best ever!\u201d Sofia said. \n\n\u201cYeah! Let\u2019s do it!\u201d Max cheered. \n\nBut as they started to paint, things began to swirl around them. Colors splashed everywhere, and suddenly, they felt dizzy. \n\n\u201cOh no! What\u2019s happening?\u201d Sofia cried. \n\nThe painting started to glow, and Sofia realized something. If they didn\u2019t finish the painting, they might change history! \n\n\u201cQuick, we have to fix this before it\u2019s too late!\u201d she shouted. \n\nSofia and Max exchanged worried glances. They had to race against time, not just for Leonardo, but for their own future!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Sofia find in the attic?","options":["A bicycle","An old VR headset","A treasure chest","A ladder"],"correct_answer":"An old VR headset"},{"question":"Who is the young man they meet?","options":["Max","Sofia","Leonardo","The painter"],"correct_answer":"Leonardo"},{"question":"What does Leonardo need help with?","options":["Fixing a bicycle","Painting","Writing a book","Finding treasure"],"correct_answer":"Painting"},{"question":"What happens when they start to paint?","options":["They finish the painting","Colors splash everywhere","They get lost","They meet more friends"],"correct_answer":"Colors splash everywhere"},{"question":"What must Sofia and Max do quickly?","options":["Play a game","Finish the painting","Leave the attic","Find a book"],"correct_answer":"Finish the painting"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_322_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_322_ch1_img1.png","plot_322_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":394,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
