   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_322_7_10","title":"The Time-Traveler's Headset","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Virtual Reality","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Sofia and Max stared at the painting. It was big and beautiful, but it was not finished! \n\n\u201cDa Vinci needs our help,\u201d Sofia said excitedly. \u201cLet\u2019s paint!\u201d\n\nMax nodded. \u201cBut how do we help? I can\u2019t paint like him!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s just do our best!\u201d Sofia said. She picked up a brush and dipped it into bright red paint. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they started to paint, Sofia felt a tickle of excitement. \u201cLook at the flowers!\u201d she said. \u201cThey are coming to life!\u201d\n\nMax grinned. \u201cThey are like magic flowers!\u201d\n\nBut then, something strange happened. The colors began to swirl. The painting shook. A loud crack echoed in the room. \n\n\u201cUh-oh,\u201d Max squeaked. \u201cWhat did we do?\u201d\n\nThe painting turned black and white. \u201cWe can\u2019t let this happen!\u201d Sofia exclaimed. \u201cWe need to fix it faster!\u201d\n\nDa Vinci looked worried. \u201cYou must finish the painting before time runs out. If not, my future will be lost!\u201d\n\nSofia felt her heart race. \u201cWe have to hurry!\u201d\n\nShe and Max worked side by side. They painted bright colors and added shiny stars. But the more they painted, the more the room spun. \n\n\u201cHold on!\u201d Max shouted. \n\nSofia grabbed his arm. \u201cThis is like a roller coaster!\u201d Just then, a cloud of glitter burst from the painting. It sparkled everywhere!\n\n\u201cWow!\u201d Max gasped. \u201cIt\u2019s beautiful!\u201d\n\nBut the sparkle began to fade. \u201cNo! We need to finish before it\u2019s too late!\u201d shouted Sofia.\n\nThey painted furiously. \u201cLet\u2019s add a big sun!\u201d Sofia said. \n\n\u201cGood idea!\u201d Max replied. \u201cI\u2019ll paint the sun\u2019s rays!\u201d\n\nAs they added the final touches, the colors brightened. The painting came to life! \n\nSuddenly, the room stopped spinning. Da Vinci smiled wide. \u201cYou did it! My painting is saved!\u201d\n\nBut Sofia felt a twinge of worry. \u201cWhat if we change something else?\u201d\n\n\u201cTime is like a river,\u201d Da Vinci explained. \u201cEven a little splash can make waves.\u201d\n\nSofia\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cWhat does that mean for us?\u201d\n\n\u201cWe must move quickly to the next moment in time!\u201d Da Vinci said. \u201cYour next adventure awaits!\u201d\n\nSofia and Max took a deep breath. \u201cReady?\u201d Max asked. \n\n\u201cReady!\u201d Sofia said.\n\nAnd with that, they stepped into the painting, ready for their next adventure. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nBut little did they know, danger was just around the corner\u2026","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Sofia and Max help Leonardo da Vinci with?","options":["A book","A painting","A sculpture","A song"],"correct_answer":"A painting"},{"question":"What happens when they paint?","options":["The painting breaks","The colors swirl","They fall asleep","They get lost"],"correct_answer":"The colors swirl"},{"question":"What does Da Vinci say about time?","options":["It is like a river","It goes fast","It can be stopped","It is a circle"],"correct_answer":"It is like a river"},{"question":"What do Sofia and Max add to the painting?","options":["A tree","A sun","A city","A boat"],"correct_answer":"A sun"},{"question":"What do Sofia and Max feel after completing the painting?","options":["Tired","Excited","Scared","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Excited"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_322_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_322_ch2_img1.png","plot_322_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":390,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
