   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_322_7_10","title":"The Time-Traveler's Headset","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Virtual Reality","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Sofia and Max stood in Leonardo\u2019s vibrant workshop. The air was filled with the smell of paint and wood. Bright colors splashed everywhere. \n\n\u201cWow, Leonardo! This place is amazing!\u201d Sofia squealed, her eyes wide. \n\n\u201cThank you! But I need your help!\u201d Leonardo looked worried. \u201cI must finish my painting of the Mona Lisa by sunset! If I don\u2019t, history will change!\u201d\n\nMax jumped into action. \u201cLet\u2019s do it! How can we help?\u201d \n\nLeonardo pointed to the canvas. \u201cI need the perfect smile for her face. Can you help me find it?\u201d \n\nSofia nodded. \u201cWe can try! What do we do first?\u201d \n\n\u201cFirst, let\u2019s mix the colors!\u201d said Leonardo. Together, they swirled bright paints. \n\nSuddenly, a loud crash echoed through the workshop. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Sofia gasped. \n\nA shadowy figure slipped through the door, sneaking up to the painting. \u201cStop right there!\u201d Max shouted, jumping in front of the canvas. \n\nThe figure froze. It was a sly art thief! \n\n\u201cWhy do you want the painting?\u201d Sofia asked, her heart racing. \n\nThe thief smirked. \u201cBecause once I have it, I can change the world!\u201d He lunged at the painting, but Leonardo grabbed a paintbrush. \n\n\u201cNot on my watch!\u201d he yelled. \n\nJust then, a swirl of colors burst from the canvas. Light wrapped around the room. Sofia felt dizzy. \u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d she cried. \n\n\u201cStay close!\u201d shouted Max as they dodged the thief. \n\nWith a huge whoosh, Sofia grabbed the brush from Leonardo. \u201cLet\u2019s finish the painting! We can trap him in here!\u201d \n\n\u201cGreat idea!\u201d Leonard exclaimed, his eyes lighting up. \n\nThey quickly painted the Mona Lisa\u2019s smile. \n\n\u201cPerfect!\u201d Sofia shouted. \n\nJust as the thief lunged again, the painting sparkled. A beam of light shot out, catching the thief and dragging him into the artwork! \n\n\u201cIs it over?\u201d Max asked, panting. \n\nSofia sighed. \u201cNot yet. We still have to make sure history stays the same.\u201d \n\nLeonardo nodded. \u201cWe need to finish this painting before the sun sets!\u201d \n\nThey raced to add the final touches. The sun was setting fast outside. \n\nAs they added the last stroke, Sofia\u2019s heart raced. Would they finish on time? Would they make it back home? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cAlmost there!\u201d Leonardo exclaimed, stepping back to admire their work. Sofia and Max looked at the vibrant colors and the now perfect smile. \n\nJust then, a loud crack echoed. The painting shimmered and began to glow. \n\n\u201cLook out!\u201d Max shouted. \n\nThe glow brightened until everything around them turned white. Sofia felt a pull. \u201cAre we going home?\u201d she asked, her voice trembling. \n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know!\u201d Max shouted as they vanished into the light.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWhen the light faded, they found themselves in a new place. It didn\u2019t feel like the Renaissance anymore. \u201cWhere are we?\u201d Max asked, looking around. \n\nIn front of them stood a great wall with strange writing. They had landed in ancient Egypt! \n\nSofia gasped. \u201cOh no! We might have changed history again!\u201d \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find a way to fix it!\u201d Max said. \n\nSofia nodded, determination filling her eyes. \u201cWe have to hurry!\u201d","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who needs help finishing the painting?","options":["Max","Sofia","Leonardo","The thief"],"correct_answer":"Leonardo"},{"question":"What does the thief want to do with the painting?","options":["Keep it for himself","Change the world","Give it back","Destroy it"],"correct_answer":"Change the world"},{"question":"What happens when they finish the painting?","options":["It glows","It falls","It disappears","It breaks"],"correct_answer":"It glows"},{"question":"Where do Sofia and Max end up after the painting?","options":["The Renaissance","Ancient Egypt","A museum","Their house"],"correct_answer":"Ancient Egypt"},{"question":"What do they need to do in ancient Egypt?","options":["Fix history","Paint more","Find Leonardo","Run away"],"correct_answer":"Fix history"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_322_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_322_ch3_img1.png","plot_322_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":515,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
