   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_322_7_10","title":"The Time-Traveler's Headset","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Virtual Reality","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Sofia and Max stood in the middle of the busy marketplace in ancient Egypt. Brightly colored tents surrounded them. There were so many smells! The air was filled with spices, fruits, and baked bread. \n\n\u201cWow! This place is amazing!\u201d Max said, his eyes wide. \n\n\u201cLook over there!\u201d Sofia pointed to a group of people. \u201cI think that\u2019s Cleopatra!\u201d\n\nThey rushed over to see a young girl wearing a beautiful dress. Cleopatra was surrounded by her friends, laughing and talking. Sofia thought she looked like a queen already!\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they approached, Sofia felt a bit nervous. \u201cWhat if she doesn\u2019t like us?\u201d she whispered to Max.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s just say hello!\u201d Max encouraged. \n\n\u201cHi! I\u2019m Sofia, and this is Max,\u201d Sofia said, smiling.\n\nCleopatra turned to them, her eyes sparkling. \u201cHello! Are you from far away?\u201d she asked.\n\n\u201cYes! We came through a special VR headset,\u201d Max explained. \n\nCleopatra raised an eyebrow. \u201cA headset? That sounds interesting!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a loud crash echoed through the market. A man stumbled, and a bag of precious jewels fell at Cleopatra\u2019s feet. \n\n\u201cOh no! The thief!\u201d Sofia gasped.\n\n\u201cWe have to catch him!\u201d Max shouted.\n\nSofia nodded. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d They ran after the thief, weaving through the crowds. \n\nAs they chased him, they spotted Leonardo da Vinci! He was there, painting a scene of the marketplace. \u201cSofia! Max! Help me!\u201d he yelled, pointing to the thief.\n\n\u201cLeonardo!\u201d Sofia called, \u201cWe need your help to stop him!\u201d\n\nTogether, they raced forward. The thief was clever and fast, but not fast enough. Just ahead, the thief stumbled over a basket of oranges. The fruit flew everywhere!\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s grab him!\u201d Max shouted, while Sofia picked up an orange. The thief slipped on the oranges and fell! \n\nSofia and Max quickly surrounded him. \u201cGot you!\u201d said Sofia, breathing hard.\n\nLeonardo painted the scene, capturing the moment. \u201cThis is a great story!\u201d he laughed.\n\nCleopatra smiled at them. \u201cThank you for saving my jewels! What can I do for you?\u201d\n\nSofia felt hope bloom in her chest. \u201cCan you help us fix history?\u201d she asked.\n\n\u201cOf course! We can work together,\u201d Cleopatra replied. \n\nSofia, Max, and Cleopatra began to plan. They knew they had to return the jewels and set everything right. But time was ticking, and they needed a solution fast!\n\nAs they gathered ideas, Sofia felt excitement building. They were on the edge of a great adventure, ready to change the past!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who do Sofia and Max meet in ancient Egypt?","options":["Leonardo da Vinci","Cleopatra","A thief","An artist"],"correct_answer":"Cleopatra"},{"question":"What do Sofia and Max help Cleopatra recover?","options":["A painting","A book","Jewels","A crown"],"correct_answer":"Jewels"},{"question":"What happens when the thief tries to escape?","options":["He runs away","He gets caught","He finds a horse","He climbs a tree"],"correct_answer":"He gets caught"},{"question":"What do Sofia and Max use to catch the thief?","options":["A net","Oranges","A rope","Their hands"],"correct_answer":"Oranges"},{"question":"What do they plan to do after catching the thief?","options":["Go home","Fix history","Have a feast","Meet a pharaoh"],"correct_answer":"Fix history"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_322_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_322_ch4_img1.png","plot_322_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":414,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
