   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_322_7_10","title":"The Time-Traveler's Headset","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Virtual Reality","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Sofia looked around the warm, sunny landscape of ancient Egypt. The golden sand stretched for miles, sparkling like treasure. \"Wow! Look at those pyramids!\" she exclaimed, pointing at the towering structures in the distance.\n\n\"These are amazing!\" Max replied, his eyes wide with wonder. Just then, a shimmering figure approached them. It was Cleopatra, wearing a beautiful dress with golden details. \n\n\"Welcome, brave travelers!\" she said with a smile. \"I hear you are here to help me catch a thief!\"\n\nSofia nodded eagerly. \"Yes, we need to stop him before he changes history!\"\n\nCleopatra raised an eyebrow. \"Then let us hurry! We must find the thief before sunset.\"\n\nTogether, they dashed through the bustling market. Colorful stalls filled with fruits, spices, and jewelry surrounded them. The air was sweet with the smell of fresh dates. Suddenly, they spotted a figure wearing a dark cloak, slipping away with a bag. \n\n\"There he is!\" Sofia shouted. \"Let\u2019s go!\"\n\nThey sprinted after the thief, weaving through the crowd. \"Don\u2019t let him get away!\" Max yelled. Just as they reached him, he turned and threw the bag. It landed with a thud, spilling gold coins everywhere.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSofia gasped. \"Look at all that gold!\" \n\n\"Quick! Help me gather it!\" Cleopatra said. They worked together, scooping up the coins. But the thief was not done yet. He dashed toward the entrance of the market, his laughter echoing behind him.\n\n\"We can't let him escape!\" Max shouted, determination in his voice. \"Sofia, what should we do?\"\n\nSofia thought quickly. \"We have to block his path!\" She spotted some crates nearby. \"If we stack those, we can cut him off!\"\n\nThey hurriedly piled the crates, and just as the thief approached, he stumbled over them. \"Oof!\" he cried, losing his balance. They rushed forward, catching him by the arms.\n\n\"Gotcha!\" said Cleopatra, grinning. \n\n\"You won\u2019t change history today!\" Sofia declared, proud of their teamwork. \n\nWith the thief caught, the three friends returned the gold to its rightful place. Cleopatra smiled warmly at Sofia and Max. \"You have saved my kingdom, brave heroes. Thank you!\"\n\nSofia beamed. \"We couldn\u2019t have done it without you!\"\n\nMax nodded. \"Let\u2019s not forget about the headset! We should go back home!\"\n\nCleopatra waved goodbye as Sofia and Max put on the headset. \"Remember, history is precious!\"\n\nWith that, they vanished, ready for their next adventure.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who do Sofia and Max meet in ancient Egypt?","options":["Leonardo da Vinci","A thief","Cleopatra","An artist"],"correct_answer":"Cleopatra"},{"question":"What do Sofia and Max help Cleopatra recover?","options":["A painting","Gold coins","A magic wand","A treasure map"],"correct_answer":"Gold coins"},{"question":"What do Sofia and Max use to block the thief's path?","options":["Wooden sticks","Crates","Ropes","Baskets"],"correct_answer":"Crates"},{"question":"What is the main theme of this chapter?","options":["Adventure","Teamwork","Friendship","Magic"],"correct_answer":"Teamwork"},{"question":"What happens at the end of the chapter?","options":["They get lost","They catch the thief","They find a treasure","They meet a pharaoh"],"correct_answer":"They catch the thief"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_322_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_322_ch5_img1.png","plot_322_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":399,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
