   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_322_11_14","title":"The Time-Traveler's Headset","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Virtual Reality","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Sofia climbed the creaky attic stairs, each step echoing in the silence of her family's old house. Dust motes danced in the beams of sunlight that filtered through the small window, illuminating forgotten treasures of the past. Boxes piled high, their labels faded and curling, spoke of memories long tucked away. She had always loved exploring this hidden kingdom, where every corner held a story waiting to be told.\n\n\"Hey, Max! You won\u2019t believe what I found!\" Sofia shouted, her voice bouncing off the walls. She had invited her best friend over, knowing he shared her curiosity about the past. Max appeared at the top of the stairs, his glasses slightly askew, face alight with excitement.\n\n\"What is it? Is it an ancient scroll? A pirate's treasure?!\" he asked, bouncing on his toes.\n\nSofia chuckled, her brown curls bouncing with her laughter. \"Better! Look!\" She revealed an old VR headset, its surface scratched and dusty but still gleaming with a hint of mystery.\n\nMax raised an eyebrow as he approached, inspecting the headset. \"That looks\u2026 ancient. What\u2019s it doing up here?\"\n\n\"I don\u2019t know, but it must be important. Let\u2019s try it!\" Sofia exclaimed, her heart racing at the thought of adventure. They plugged the headset into her tablet, the screen flickering to life with vibrant colors and swirling patterns.\n\n\"Do you think it actually works?\" Max asked, a mix of skepticism and hope in his voice. \n\n\"Only one way to find out!\" Sofia grinned, slipping the headset over her eyes. \n\nIn an instant, the attic faded away, replaced by the golden sands of ancient Egypt under a brilliant sun. She gasped as she stepped forward, the warm air swirling around her like a soft embrace. Tall pyramids loomed in the distance, and the sound of bustling cities filled her ears. She could almost taste the richness of the history that surrounded her.\n\nSofia looked down at her clothes, now transformed into a flowing linen dress. \"Max, this is incredible!\" she shouted, excitement bubbling inside her.\n\nSuddenly, the ground trembled, and a voice echoed from the shadows of the pyramid. \"Who dares disturb my realm?\"\n\nStartled, Sofia turned to see a young girl with striking features and an air of authority walking towards her\u2014it was Cleopatra! \"What do you want, traveler from afar?\"\n\n\"I\u2014I\u2019m just exploring!\" Sofia stammered, her heart racing. \"I didn\u2019t mean to intrude!\"\n\nThe queen's eyes narrowed, a hint of curiosity sparking within them. \"Exploring can change the course of history, you know. Are you prepared for the consequences?\"\n\nBefore Sofia could respond, a blinding flash engulfed her, and she found herself back in her attic, panting and wide-eyed. \"Max! Did you see that? We were in ancient Egypt!\" \n\nMax stared at her, his expression a mix of awe and concern. \"But something\u2019s not right. You disappeared for a moment! What if the headset\u2026?\"\n\nSofia\u2019s heart sank. \"What if I changed something? What if I got stuck in the past?\" \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nJust then, they heard a strange sound\u2014a mechanical whirring. Both friends turned to the headset, now glowing ominously, as if alive. \n\n\"What did you do, Sofia?\" Max whispered, eyes wide. \u201cWe need to figure this out. Fast!\u201d\n\nSofia nodded, determination surging through her. This was only the beginning, and she couldn't let history unravel on her watch. They had to go back and set things right before it was too late.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Sofia find in the attic?","options":["An ancient scroll","A VR headset","A pirate's treasure","A dusty book"],"correct_answer":"A VR headset"},{"question":"Who does Sofia meet in ancient Egypt?","options":["Queen Elizabeth","Cleopatra","Marie Curie","Julius Caesar"],"correct_answer":"Cleopatra"},{"question":"What emotion does Sofia feel when she first tries the headset?","options":["Fear","Excitement","Boredom","Anger"],"correct_answer":"Excitement"},{"question":"What does Cleopatra warn Sofia about?","options":["Changing history","Falling into the sand","Getting lost","Time travel consequences"],"correct_answer":"Changing history"},{"question":"What is the main challenge Sofia faces?","options":["Finding treasure","Solving a mystery","Fixing altered history","Meeting famous people"],"correct_answer":"Fixing altered history"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_322_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_322_ch1_img1.png","plot_322_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":579,"reading_level":"Builder"}
