   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_322_11_14","title":"The Time-Traveler's Headset","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Virtual Reality","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Sofia stood in the heart of ancient Egypt, the hot sun beating down on her as she adjusted the VR headset. The golden sands stretched endlessly, dotted with palm trees swaying softly in the warm breeze. She felt exhilarated yet apprehensive, remembering the warning Cleopatra had given her. \u201cBe careful, Sofia. History is delicate.\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find the time gem,\u201d Max said, his excitement bubbling over. He had his own headset on, eyes gleaming behind the lenses. \u201cIf we can locate it and return it, we might save history from changing forever!\u201d\n\nAs they ventured deeper into the bustling market of ancient Thebes, vibrant colors and sounds surrounded them. Merchants shouted, selling everything from spices to intricate jewelry. The air was thick with the scent of dates and incense. Max pointed to a stall overflowing with shimmering trinkets. \u201cWhat if the time gem is here?\u201d he asked.\n\nSofia nodded but felt a nagging sense of urgency. \u201cDo you really think it\u2019s that easy? We\u2019re in a time where every choice counts.\u201d \n\nSuddenly, a commotion erupted nearby, drawing their attention. A group of guards were arguing with a young boy who clutched a small, glowing object tightly in his hands. Sofia's heart raced. \u201cThat has to be it!\u201d she whispered, her eyes darting between Max and the boy. She started moving towards the scene, feeling the weight of her decision. \n\nAs they approached, the guards noticed them, their stern faces turning toward Sofia and Max. \u201cHalt!\u201d one of them commanded, waving his hand. \u201cWhat do you want?\u201d\n\nMax stepped forward, trying to appear confident. \u201cWe\u2019re just travelers. We mean no harm.\u201d \n\nBut before they could say more, the boy dashed away, weaving through the crowd. \u201cFollow him!\u201d Sofia yelled, determination igniting her spirit. They took off, weaving through the throng of people, the guards hot on their heels. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSofia\u2019s heart pounded like a drum as they sprinted down narrow alleyways, the boy always just out of reach. \u201cWhy is he so fast?\u201d Max puffed, glancing over his shoulder. \n\n\u201cFocus!\u201d Sofia shouted. \u201cWe can\u2019t let him escape!\u201d \n\nAs they turned a corner, they found themselves at the edge of the Nile River, the shimmering water glistening in the sun. The boy stood on a small boat, the time gem glowing brighter than ever in his hand. With a mischievous grin, he jumped aboard and pushed off. \n\n\u201cNo!\u201d Sofia cried, taking a step forward, but it was too late. The boat glided away, and the boy waved teasingly. \u201cYou\u2019ll never catch me!\u201d he called out, laughter ringing across the water.\n\nDespair surged through Sofia, the weight of her mission pressing down on her shoulders. \u201cWe can\u2019t lose him, Max,\u201d she said, panic in her voice. \u201cIf he gets away with that gem, everything could change!\u201d\n\n\u201cMaybe I can swim!\u201d Max suggested, but Sofia shook her head. \u201cNo time for that! We need another way.\u201d \n\nSofia\u2019s mind raced. What if they could use the headset to track the boy? \u201cPut on your headset!\u201d she yelled, her voice rippling with urgency. \u201cMaybe we can see where he goes!\u201d\n\nMax quickly complied. \u201cLet\u2019s do it!\u201d\n\nWith the headsets on, the world around them transformed. An overlay of glowing lines appeared in their vision, revealing the boy's path as if it were a glowing thread through time. \u201cThere!\u201d Sofia pointed as the thread twisted and turned, leading into the history-laden depths of the river. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go before it\u2019s too late!\u201d Max exclaimed, and they plunged into the adventure once more, racing against a ticking clock and uncertain fate.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What object are Sofia and Max trying to retrieve?","options":["A time gem","A crown","A scroll","A map"],"correct_answer":"A time gem"},{"question":"What happens when the boy gets away?","options":["He disappears","He laughs","He becomes a guard","He gives up the gem"],"correct_answer":"He laughs"},{"question":"Why does Sofia feel a sense of urgency?","options":["She is hungry","She wants to go home","She knows history is delicate","She is tired"],"correct_answer":"She knows history is delicate"},{"question":"What do Sofia and Max use to track the boy?","options":["A map","Their gadgets","The VR headsets","The guards' help"],"correct_answer":"The VR headsets"},{"question":"What is Max's suggestion to catch the boy?","options":["To climb a tree","To swim after him","To hide","To call for help"],"correct_answer":"To swim after him"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_322_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_322_ch2_img1.png","plot_322_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":606,"reading_level":"Builder"}
