   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_323_7_10","title":"The VR Playground","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Virtual Reality","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Maya stood at the edge of the park, her eyes sparkling with excitement. \u201cGuys, you won\u2019t believe what I found!\u201d she called to her friends. \n\nAaron, with his messy hair and glasses, ran over. \u201cWhat is it?\u201d he asked, bouncing on his toes. \n\nZoe followed closely, her face lit up with curiosity. \u201cIs it a new game? A cool ride?\u201d \n\nMaya grinned and pointed at a shimmering building. It looked magical, with neon lights and swirling colors. \u201cIt\u2019s the VR Playground! We can create our own worlds!\u201d \n\n\u201cWow!\u201d Zoe gasped. \u201cLet\u2019s go! I want to fly to the moon!\u201d \n\n\u201cOr swim with dolphins!\u201d Aaron added, his mind racing with ideas.\n\nThe three friends raced towards the entrance, hearts pounding with joy. They stepped inside and gasped. The playground was HUGE! There were gravity-defying rides that twisted and turned, magical forests filled with glowing creatures, and even an ocean where you could surf on waves made of candy!\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they explored, Aaron pointed to a booth with colorful buttons. \u201cLook! We can customize our own rides!\u201d \n\nZoe was already pressing buttons. \u201cI want a roller coaster that loops and spins!\u201d \n\nMaya smiled. \u201cLet\u2019s make it the wildest ride ever!\u201d \n\nSuddenly, the cheerful atmosphere shifted. A group of kids entered. They wore matching shirts with a fancy logo. Jake, the tallest one, smirked. \u201cThis place is ours now!\u201d \n\n\u201cWhat do you mean?\u201d Maya asked, frowning. \n\nJake laughed. \u201cWe\u2019re taking over the VR Playground. You can\u2019t stop us!\u201d \n\nAaron's eyes widened. \u201cWe have to protect our playground!\u201d \n\nMaya nodded. \u201cRight! Let\u2019s show them what we can create together!\u201d \n\nZoe clenched her fists. \u201cThey won\u2019t take it away from us!\u201d \n\nAs Jake and his friends laughed, Maya, Aaron, and Zoe exchanged determined glances. They had to outsmart the rival group and defend their magical space!\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s start by building the craziest ride ever!\u201d Maya said, her voice full of enthusiasm. \n\n\u201cWhat if we add a giant slide with water balloons?\u201d Aaron suggested, grinning. \n\nZoe jumped with excitement. \u201cYes! And flying dolphins!\u201d \n\nThe friends got to work, using their imagination and teamwork to build a fantastic ride. They couldn\u2019t let Jake and his gang steal their fun!\n\nBut little did they know, Jake was watching closely. This was just the beginning of the adventure!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Maya find?","options":["A new game","A magical book","The VR Playground","A treasure map"],"correct_answer":"The VR Playground"},{"question":"What do Maya, Aaron, and Zoe want to create?","options":["A simple ride","A magical forest","The wildest ride ever","A quiet place"],"correct_answer":"The wildest ride ever"},{"question":"Who is the rival leader?","options":["Aaron","Zoe","Jake","Maya"],"correct_answer":"Jake"},{"question":"What did Zoe want to do at the playground?","options":["Fly to the moon","Build a castle","Swim with dolphins","Make friends"],"correct_answer":"Swim with dolphins"},{"question":"What do the friends decide to do?","options":["Give up","Let Jake win","Protect their playground","Leave the playground"],"correct_answer":"Protect their playground"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_323_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_323_ch1_img1.png","plot_323_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":393,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
