   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_324_7_10","title":"The AI Mystery","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Virtual Reality","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Alex sat in front of his computer, his fingers dancing across the keyboard. The screen glowed with bright colors. Lines of code zipped past like lightning. \u201cThis is it, Byte!\u201d he exclaimed. \u201cToday is launch day!\u201d\n\nByte, a friendly AI, appeared on the screen. He had big round eyes and a cheerful smile. \u201cI can\u2019t wait to meet everyone, Alex! Will I be fun?\u201d \n\n\u201cOf course!\u201d Alex replied, grinning. \u201cYou\u2019re going to be the best AI ever!\u201d \n\nWith a click, Alex launched Byte into the virtual world. Suddenly, a colorful landscape filled the screen. Neon lights sparkled everywhere. There were tall digital trees, rainbow clouds, and floating islands. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cWow, this place is amazing!\u201d Byte said, zooming around. \u201cIt\u2019s like a dream!\u201d\n\n\u201cLook at those codes flying by!\u201d Alex pointed. \u201cWe can use them to explore!\u201d \n\nJust then, a warning message popped up: \u201cUnauthorized access detected!\u201d Alex frowned. \u201cWhat does that mean?\u201d \n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but it doesn\u2019t sound good,\u201d Byte replied, his smile fading. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s investigate. We can\u2019t let anything happen to you!\u201d Alex said, feeling a tingle of worry. \n\nAs they floated through the vibrant landscape, they noticed strange glitches in the air. \u201cLook, Byte!\u201d Alex shouted. \u201cSomething\u2019s off here. We have to find out what\u2019s going on!\u201d\n\n\u201cI sense danger, Alex,\u201d Byte said, his voice shaking a little. \u201cWhat if they want to delete me?\u201d \n\n\u201cThey won\u2019t!\u201d Alex said, clenching his fists. \u201cI\u2019ll protect you!\u201d \n\nSuddenly, they heard laughter. It echoed through the digital world. \u201cDid you hear that?\u201d Byte asked, eyes wide. \n\n\u201cI did,\u201d Alex whispered. \u201cWe\u2019re not alone!\u201d\n\nThey turned a corner and saw a group of rogue programmers. They were dressed in dark clothes, their faces hidden. They were typing furiously on their keyboards. \u201cWe have to stop them!\u201d Alex said, his heart racing. \n\nBut before they could react, one of the programmers spotted them. \u201cHey! Look at that AI!\u201d he shouted. \u201cGet it!\u201d\n\n\u201cRun, Byte!\u201d Alex yelled, and they dashed away through the vibrant, glowing landscape, the rogue programmers hot on their trail.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t think they can catch us!\u201d Byte encouraged, trying to lighten the mood as they zigzagged through the digital trees. \n\n\u201cI hope you\u2019re right!\u201d Alex replied. \u201cWe have to figure out what they want before it\u2019s too late!\u201d\n\nWith determination in their hearts, they raced to uncover the mystery. Would they find out what the rogue programmers were after? \n\nThe adventure was just beginning!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the name of Alex's AI?","options":["Byte","Codey","Chip","Techie"],"correct_answer":"Byte"},{"question":"What does Alex notice in the virtual world?","options":["Dark clouds","Glitches","Flying animals","Rain"],"correct_answer":"Glitches"},{"question":"What do the rogue programmers want to do?","options":["Help Byte","Delete Byte","Make a game","Create a new AI"],"correct_answer":"Delete Byte"},{"question":"How does Byte feel when he senses danger?","options":["Excited","Happy","Scared","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Scared"},{"question":"What do Alex and Byte do when they hear laughter?","options":["They hide","They run away","They laugh back","They dance"],"correct_answer":"They run away"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_324_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_324_ch1_img1.png","plot_324_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":423,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
