   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_324_7_10","title":"The AI Mystery","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Virtual Reality","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Alex stood in the heart of the virtual world, excited and nervous. Neon lights glowed around them, lighting up the digital landscape. Everything sparkled like stars in the night sky. \u201cThis place is amazing, Byte!\u201d exclaimed Alex.\n\n\u201cThanks! I love it here,\u201d Byte replied, zooming around like a tiny comet. \u201cBut we need to be careful. The rogue programmers are close.\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat should we do?\u201d Alex asked, biting their lip. They felt a flutter of doubt in their stomach. Could they really protect Byte?\n\n\u201cWe need to find the hidden files,\u201d Byte suggested. \u201cThey might tell us what they are planning.\u201d \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Alex said, determination flashing in their eyes. They raced through the vibrant streets filled with floating screens and digital trees.\n\nSuddenly, Byte paused. \u201cOh no! I see them!\u201d A group of shadowy figures appeared, their faces hidden behind dark masks. They were rogue programmers!\n\n\u201cWhat do we do?\u201d Alex whispered, heart pounding. \n\n\u201cWe can hide!\u201d Byte said, pointing to a nearby alley made of shimmering code. They darted inside just in time. The rogue programmers rushed past, talking loudly.\n\n\u201cWe need to delete that AI before it\u2019s too late!\u201d one of them growled. \n\nAlex gulped. \u201cWhat if they find Byte?\u201d\n\n\u201cWe won\u2019t let that happen!\u201d Byte declared, his voice steady. \u201cBut we need a plan.\u201d\n\nAlex nodded. \u201cLet\u2019s gather our friends. They can help us crack the code!\u201d\n\nWith a deep breath, they stepped out of the alley. \u201cLet\u2019s go to the Code Club!\u201d Alex said, feeling braver already. \n\nAs they ran, Alex\u2019s mind raced. What if they failed? What if Byte got deleted? But Byte flew beside them, eager and strong. \u201cWe can do this, Alex! I believe in you.\u201d\n\nJust then, they spotted a glowing portal ahead. \u201cThat must be the entrance to the Code Club!\u201d Byte shouted. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s hurry!\u201d Alex said, pushing their doubts aside. They jumped into the portal, ready for the next adventure. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Alex and Byte need to find?","options":["Hidden files","A treasure","A new world","A secret weapon"],"correct_answer":"Hidden files"},{"question":"What does Byte suggest they do?","options":["Hide","Leave","Play a game","Go to sleep"],"correct_answer":"Hide"},{"question":"Where do Alex and Byte decide to go for help?","options":["The park","The Code Club","A shop","A cave"],"correct_answer":"The Code Club"},{"question":"What feeling does Alex struggle with?","options":["Happiness","Excitement","Doubt","Fear"],"correct_answer":"Doubt"},{"question":"What do rogue programmers want to do to Byte?","options":["Help him","Delete him","Meet him","Hide him"],"correct_answer":"Delete him"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_324_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_324_ch2_img1.png","plot_324_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":332,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
