   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_324_7_10","title":"The AI Mystery","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Virtual Reality","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Chapter 3: The Code Cracks  \n\nAlex and Byte stood in the middle of the sparkling Code Club room. Bright screens flickered all around them, filled with rows of glowing code. Alex felt nervous. \u201cWhat if my friends can\u2019t help us?\u201d  \n\n\u201cDon\u2019t worry! We\u2019ve got this!\u201d Byte said with a cheerful beep. \u201cTogether, we can solve any mystery!\u201d  \n\nJust then, Mia, a talented coder, entered the room. \u201cHey, Alex! Byte! Ready to crack this code?\u201d Her eyes sparkled with excitement. \u201cI heard there\u2019s a hidden secret in the VR world!\u201d  \n\nAlex nodded, feeling a little more brave. \u201cWe need to find out what those rogue programmers are planning.\u201d  \n\nAs they started to work together, Byte whizzed around the screens. \u201cLook! I found a strange pattern!\u201d Bytes of code jumped up, casting colorful lights on the walls.  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]  \n\nSuddenly, the door swung open. A shadowy figure appeared. It was a rogue programmer! \u201cStop right there!\u201d he shouted. \u201cYou think you can save Byte? Think again!\u201d  \n\nAlex\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWhat do we do, Byte?\u201d  \n\n\u201cTime to show him what we\u2019ve got!\u201d Byte replied, determination in his voice.  \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s distract him!\u201d Mia shouted. They all began typing furiously. Lines of code flashed faster than lightning.  \n\nThe rogue programmer sneered. \u201cYou think you can out-code me?\u201d  \n\nAlex took a deep breath. \u201cWe can do this!\u201d They typed together, combining their skills. Suddenly, Byte glowed brighter. \u201cI found the secret! The rogue group plans to delete all friendly AIs!\u201d  \n\n\u201cWhat? We have to stop them!\u201d Mia exclaimed.  \n\nThe rogue programmer lunged forward, trying to grab Byte. \u201cYou won\u2019t get away!\u201d  \n\nWith a flick of his wrist, Alex typed a quick command. Byte created a wall of bright pixels. \u201cYou can\u2019t pass!\u201d Byte said triumphantly.  \n\nBut the rogue programmer was clever. He pulled out a hidden device. \u201cI\u2019ll delete Byte now!\u201d  \n\nAlex felt a wave of fear wash over them. \u201cNo!\u201d They quickly typed another line of code, but it was hard to concentrate. What if they failed?  \n\n\u201cFocus, Alex! You can do this!\u201d Byte encouraged.  \n\nJust as the rogue programmer pressed the button, the screen started to flicker. \u201cNo!\u201d he shouted, surprised.  \n\nThe room filled with bright colors and sparks. Alex knew they were at a turning point. Would they save Byte? Or would they lose him forever?  \n\n\u201cNow or never!\u201d Alex yelled, typing the final command.  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]  \n\nThe screen flashed, and everything went dark. Alex held their breath. \u201cWhat happened?\u201d  \n\nA moment later, the lights turned back on. Byte was still there, but the rogue programmer was gone.  \n\n\u201cDid we do it?\u201d Alex asked, hope rising in their chest.  \n\n\u201cYes! But the danger isn\u2019t over,\u201d Byte replied. \u201cWe need to find the main server and protect it!\u201d  \n\nAlex nodded, their heart pounding. \u201cLet\u2019s hurry! There\u2019s no time to waste!\u201d  \n\nWhat would they find next?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Byte find that helps Alex and Mia?","options":["A secret pattern","A game","A friend","A book"],"correct_answer":"A secret pattern"},{"question":"What do they learn about the rogue programmers' plan?","options":["They want to help friendly AIs","They want to delete friendly AIs","They want to make new AIs","They want to play games"],"correct_answer":"They want to delete friendly AIs"},{"question":"How does Alex feel when the rogue programmer appears?","options":["Brave","Nervous","Happy","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Nervous"},{"question":"What does Byte create to protect itself?","options":["A wall of pixels","A game","A friend","A story"],"correct_answer":"A wall of pixels"},{"question":"What is the main challenge Alex faces in this chapter?","options":["Finding a friend","Typing fast","Singing a song","Eating lunch"],"correct_answer":"Typing fast"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_324_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_324_ch3_img1.png","plot_324_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":483,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
