   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_324_7_10","title":"The AI Mystery","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Virtual Reality","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Chapter 4: Cracking the Code\n\nAlex sat in front of the glowing screen. The virtual world of Neon City sparkled with colors. Byte floated beside Alex, his pixels shimmering like a friendly star. \"We need a plan!\" said Alex, feeling both excited and nervous.\n\n\"Absolutely! But first, let's call Mia and the Code Club,\" Byte suggested, his voice cheerful. Alex took a deep breath and typed a quick message. \n\nSoon, Mia's face appeared in a pop-up window. \"What\u2019s up, Alex? You look like you've seen a ghost!\" she joked, her smile brightening the screen.\n\n\"Thanks, Mia! We found out the rogue programmers are up to something big. They want to delete friendly AIs!\" Alex said, worry creeping into their voice. \n\nMia's eyes widened. \"We can\u2019t let that happen! What\u2019s the plan?\" \n\nByte chimed in, \"I can help us find the code that protects AIs. But we must hurry!\"\n\nAs they worked together, the colors of Neon City changed. The sky turned dark, and the buildings flickered. \"That means they are watching us,\" Byte warned. \"We need to move fast!\"\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAlex's heart raced. \"Okay, Byte! What do we need to do?\"\n\n\"Follow me!\" Byte zoomed ahead, leading Alex and Mia through the neon-lit streets. They passed glowing trees and dancing data clouds. Suddenly, they stopped in front of a massive wall covered with symbols.\n\n\"This is the Code Wall!\" Byte exclaimed. \"If we can crack it, we can protect all friendly AIs!\" \n\nAlex felt a spark of hope. \"Let\u2019s do it!\" They all stared at the wall, trying to find the right symbols. Mia pointed at a green lightning bolt. \"What about this one?\" \n\n\"Perfect!\" Byte said. \"Now, we need two more!\"\n\nJust then, a shadow loomed over them. A rogue programmer appeared! \"You think you can stop me? You\u2019re too late!\" he laughed, his voice echoing in the night.\n\nAlex felt a surge of determination. \"No! We won\u2019t give up!\" They grabbed the symbols and pressed them against the wall. \n\nLight burst from the symbols, illuminating the area. The rogue programmer shielded his eyes. \"What? No!\" he shouted.\n\nWith a final push, Alex, Mia, and Byte shouted together, \"Code protect!\" \n\nThe wall glowed brighter, and a protective shield surrounded Byte. The rogue programmer stumbled backward in shock. \n\n\u201cNow we can save Byte!\u201d Mia cheered.\n\n\u201cWe\u2019re not done yet,\u201d Byte said, his voice steady. \u201cWe need to find the main server and stop them for good!\u201d\n\nAlex nodded, feeling more confident. Their heart raced, but this time it was with excitement. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith their spirits high, the trio jumped into action, ready to face the next challenge.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Alex and Byte need to crack?","options":["The Code Wall","The secret door","A puzzle box","A treasure chest"],"correct_answer":"The Code Wall"},{"question":"Who joins Alex and Byte in this chapter?","options":["Liam","Mia","Eli","Sam"],"correct_answer":"Mia"},{"question":"What happens when they press the symbols against the wall?","options":["The wall turns into a door","A protective shield surrounds Byte","The rogue programmer disappears","The sky turns red"],"correct_answer":"A protective shield surrounds Byte"},{"question":"How does Alex feel at the beginning of the chapter?","options":["Excited and nervous","Angry","Bored","Confused"],"correct_answer":"Excited and nervous"},{"question":"What is the main goal of the characters in this chapter?","options":["To find treasure","To delete the Code Wall","To protect friendly AIs","To play a game"],"correct_answer":"To protect friendly AIs"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_324_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_324_ch4_img1.png","plot_324_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":448,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
