   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_325_7_10","title":"Escape from DreamWorld","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Virtual Reality","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Mia sat on her bed, staring at her VR headset. Her heart raced with excitement. Today was the day! She was going to explore DreamWorld, a place where dreams came alive. \n\n\u201cAre you ready, Mia?\u201d her little brother, Leo, asked. He had his own headset on, bouncing with joy.\n\n\u201cReady as I\u2019ll ever be!\u201d Mia replied, smiling. She put on the headset and pressed the button. \n\nIn an instant, everything changed. Mia found herself in a colorful land. The sky was bright purple, and puffy clouds floated like cotton candy. Funny creatures danced around her. A rabbit in a top hat waved at her. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cWelcome to DreamWorld!\u201d a bubbly voice called out. Mia turned to see a quirky guide. He had rainbow-colored hair and wore mismatched shoes.\n\n\u201cI\u2019m Dreamy!\u201d he said, twirling. \u201cI\u2019ll show you all the wonders here!\u201d\n\nMia\u2019s eyes sparkled with curiosity. \u201cWhat can we see?\u201d \n\n\u201cWe can fly with the birds, swim in chocolate rivers, or ride unicorns!\u201d Dreamy twirled again. \n\n\u201cWow! Let\u2019s fly with birds!\u201d Mia shouted.\n\nAs they soared through the air, Mia felt free. The wind whipped through her hair. But suddenly, dark clouds appeared. They rolled in like shadows, twisting the colorful sky into gray.\n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d Mia gasped, her joy turning to fear.\n\n\u201cUh-oh,\u201d Dreamy said, frowning. \u201cThat\u2019s the Shadow! He feeds on fear. If he catches you, you might get stuck here forever!\u201d\n\nMia\u2019s heart sank. She didn\u2019t want to be trapped! \u201cWhat do I do?\u201d she asked, panic rising in her chest.\n\n\u201cStay brave!\u201d Dreamy called. \u201cFace your fears, and you can escape!\u201d\n\nMia took a deep breath. She remembered the times she felt scared\u2014like when she had to give a presentation at school. \u201cI can do this,\u201d she whispered to herself.\n\nSuddenly, the Shadow loomed closer, his dark figure stretching like a nightmarish monster. \u201cYou will never escape!\u201d he growled.\n\nMia clenched her fists. \u201cNo! I will escape!\u201d She thought of her dreams, her hopes, and her friends. \u201cI am not afraid!\u201d\n\nWith Dreamy by her side, Mia raced away. She could feel the Shadow behind her. But she wouldn\u2019t give in. Not today.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cWhere do we go?\u201d Mia shouted over the wind.\n\n\u201cFollow me!\u201d Dreamy shouted. \u201cWe need to find the Dream Gate! It\u2019s the only way home!\u201d\n\nMia\u2019s heart raced. Would they make it in time? The chase had just begun.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the name of the dream guide?","options":["Mia","Leo","Dreamy","Shadow"],"correct_answer":"Dreamy"},{"question":"What does the Shadow represent?","options":["Joy","Fear","Adventure","Creativity"],"correct_answer":"Fear"},{"question":"What does Mia want to do in DreamWorld?","options":["Fly with birds","Build a house","Explore a cave","Catch a fish"],"correct_answer":"Fly with birds"},{"question":"What color is the sky in DreamWorld?","options":["Blue","Purple","Green","Red"],"correct_answer":"Purple"},{"question":"What does Mia need to find to escape?","options":["A map","The Dream Gate","A key","A book"],"correct_answer":"The Dream Gate"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_325_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_325_ch1_img1.png","plot_325_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":411,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
