   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_325_7_10","title":"Escape from DreamWorld","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Virtual Reality","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Mia stood at the edge of a swirling, colorful forest. The trees sparkled like they were made of candy. \u201cWow! This is amazing!\u201d she exclaimed, looking around. \n\n\u201cWelcome to DreamWorld!\u201d Dreamy twirled in the air, his fluffy wings fluttering. \u201cHere, your imagination can run wild!\u201d \n\nMia felt excitement bubbling inside her. But then she remembered the Shadow. \u201cWhat if it comes back?\u201d she asked nervously.\n\nDreamy\u2019s smile faded. \u201cYou must be brave, Mia. The Shadow loves fear. If it finds you, it will grow stronger.\u201d\n\nMia gulped. \u201cBut how can I be brave?\u201d \n\n\u201cYou have to face your fears. Find what makes you smile!\u201d Dreamy said, his voice cheerful again. \n\nSuddenly, the colors shifted and dark clouds rolled in. \u201cLook!\u201d Dreamy pointed. \u201cIt\u2019s the Shadow!\u201d\n\nMia\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWhat do we do?\u201d \n\n\u201cRun! We need to get to the Dream Gate!\u201d Dreamy shouted. \n\nThey dashed through the forest, weaving between trees that giggled as they moved. Mia\u2019s legs felt heavy, but she pushed on. The Shadow loomed behind them, its dark shape growing larger. \n\nJust then, they reached a clearing filled with flowers that danced in the wind. \u201cWe must hide!\u201d Dreamy whispered, diving behind a giant sunflower.\n\nMia crouched down, her heart thumping loud. \u201cWhat if it finds us?\u201d \n\nDreamy waved his hand. \u201cThink of something happy, Mia! It will help you.\u201d \n\nMia closed her eyes and thought of her favorite memory: a sunny day at the beach, building sandcastles with her friends. Suddenly, a soft glow surrounded her. The shadows retreated.\n\nThe Shadow\u2019s voice echoed with a chilling laugh. \u201cYou can\u2019t hide forever, little girl!\u201d \n\nMia opened her eyes, feeling stronger. \u201cWe need to keep moving, Dreamy!\u201d she said. The flowers seemed to cheer her on. \n\nWith renewed courage, they ran toward a sparkling river. A bridge made of rainbow light shimmered ahead. \u201cThat must be the way!\u201d Mia exclaimed, pointing. \n\n\u201cJump! We can make it!\u201d Dreamy cheered. \n\nAs they jumped onto the bridge, the Shadow screeched, \u201cYou can\u2019t escape!\u201d \n\nMia and Dreamy raced across the bridge, laughter bubbling in their chests. But the bridge began to sway, and Mia felt a drop in her stomach. \n\n\u201cKeep going!\u201d Dreamy urged, his eyes wide. \n\nThey inched closer to the other side, but the bridge trembled beneath them. \n\n\u201cWe\u2019re almost there!\u201d Mia shouted, heart pounding. \n\nJust as they reached the end, the bridge snapped! Mia fell, but Dreamy caught her. \u201cHold on tight!\u201d he yelled.\n\nMia gasped as they swung back to safety. \u201cThat was close!\u201d \n\n\u201cToo close! But we must hurry. The Dream Gate is just ahead!\u201d Dreamy pointed to a glowing arch that sparkled with stars.\n\nMia took a deep breath. She felt the Shadow close behind them, dark and looming. \u201cLet\u2019s go, Dreamy! We have to reach the gate!\u201d\n\nTogether, they sprinted toward the Dream Gate, ready to face whatever awaited them.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Dreamy represent?","options":["Fear","Courage","Creativity","Darkness"],"correct_answer":"Creativity"},{"question":"What does the Shadow feed on?","options":["Happiness","Fear","Dreams","Imagination"],"correct_answer":"Fear"},{"question":"What do Mia and Dreamy need to find?","options":["The Dream Gate","A treasure","A friend","A map"],"correct_answer":"The Dream Gate"},{"question":"What helps Mia feel stronger?","options":["Running fast","Thinking of something happy","Hiding","Singing"],"correct_answer":"Thinking of something happy"},{"question":"What happens to the bridge at the end of the chapter?","options":["It breaks","It glows","It disappears","It grows"],"correct_answer":"It breaks"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_325_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_325_ch2_img1.png","plot_325_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":488,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
