   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_325_7_10","title":"Escape from DreamWorld","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Virtual Reality","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Mia floated in the colorful skies of DreamWorld. Bubbles of all sizes danced around her, sparkling like stars. \u201cThis is amazing!\u201d she exclaimed.\n\nDreamy, her guide, twirled in the air. \u201cWelcome to the Bubble Forest! It\u2019s a place of imagination and fun!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, the cheerful bubbles darkened. Mia felt a chill in the air. \u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d she asked, her voice trembling.\n\n\u201cThe Shadow is near,\u201d Dreamy replied. \u201cHe feeds on fear. We must hurry!\u201d\n\nThey dashed through the Bubble Forest, dodging shadows that flickered like ghosts. Mia\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWhat if he catches us?\u201d she worried.\n\n\u201cRemember your happy memories!\u201d Dreamy shouted. \u201cUse them to fight back!\u201d\n\nMia thought of her puppy, Max, wagging his tail. She remembered the time they played in the park. The sun was bright, and laughter filled the air. \u201cMax!\u201d she shouted. \u201cHelp me!\u201d\n\nHer joyful memory created a small bubble that floated beside her. It shimmered with warmth. \u201cYes! Keep going!\u201d Dreamy cheered.\n\nAs they approached the edge of the forest, the Shadow appeared. He loomed tall and dark, blocking their path. His voice was cold like ice. \u201cYou cannot escape!\u201d\n\nMia\u2019s heart sank. \u201cWhat do we do?\u201d she whispered.\n\nDreamy took a deep breath. \u201cWe need to be brave. You can do this, Mia! Use your imagination!\u201d\n\nMia closed her eyes, remembering more happy moments. She remembered her birthday party, the cake, and her friends singing. \u201cI can do this!\u201d she declared.\n\nSuddenly, her memories burst into bright colors, filling the air around her. Each memory created a swirl of light. \u201cLook, Dreamy!\u201d she shouted, pointing. \u201cIt\u2019s working!\u201d\n\nBut the Shadow laughed. \u201cYou think your memories will save you?\u201d He reached for them, dark fingers stretching.\n\nJust then, Mia had an idea. \u201cLet\u2019s create something new! Together!\u201d She grabbed Dreamy\u2019s hand.\n\nWith a whoosh, they spun in circles, mixing their bright memories. Colors swirled around them, forming a brilliant rainbow. It shot toward the Shadow, and he shrieked as the light hit him.\n\n\u201cNo!\u201d he howled. \u201cI will not be defeated!\u201d\n\nThe colors brightened, and Mia felt a surge of confidence. Just as the Shadow was about to attack, the rainbow burst, scattering colors everywhere. Mia and Dreamy stood tall, holding hands.\n\n\u201cNow!\u201d Dreamy shouted. \u201cLet\u2019s get to the Dream Gate before he can recover!\u201d\n\nBut as they started to run, Mia realized she didn\u2019t know which way to go. \u201cDreamy, which way?\u201d she panicked.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cWe\u2019ll figure it out!\u201d Dreamy replied, his eyes sparkling with courage. \u201cTrust yourself!\u201d\n\nMia felt her heart pounding. She had to make a choice. Go left toward the misty hills or right into the glowing fields. She glanced back. The Shadow was coming!\n\n\u201cMia, hurry!\u201d Dreamy urged. \u201cThe Dream Gate is waiting!\u201d\n\nMia took a deep breath. \u201cI choose... right!\u201d \n\nAs they raced into the glowing fields, the Shadow\u2019s voice echoed behind them. \u201cYou cannot escape your fears!\u201d\n\nWith courage burning in her heart, Mia ran faster. The Dream Gate was close. But could they reach it in time?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What forest do Mia and Dreamy explore?","options":["Bubble Forest","Candy Forest","Mystery Forest","Shadow Forest"],"correct_answer":"Bubble Forest"},{"question":"What does the Shadow feed on?","options":["Joy","Laughter","Fear","Imagination"],"correct_answer":"Fear"},{"question":"What does Mia use to help fight the Shadow?","options":["Her fears","Happy memories","A magic wand","A sword"],"correct_answer":"Happy memories"},{"question":"What does Dreamy encourage Mia to do?","options":["To be scared","To be brave","To hide","To run away"],"correct_answer":"To be brave"},{"question":"Which direction does Mia decide to go at the end?","options":["Left","Right","Up","Down"],"correct_answer":"Right"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_325_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_325_ch3_img1.png","plot_325_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":514,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
