   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_325_7_10","title":"Escape from DreamWorld","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Virtual Reality","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Mia and Dreamy stood at the edge of the Sparkling Sea. The water glimmered like diamonds under a rainbow sky. \"This is where we begin!\" Dreamy said, bouncing with excitement. \n\nMia took a deep breath. \"But how do we find the Dream Gate?\" \n\n\u201cSimple!\u201d Dreamy replied. \u201cWe follow the Trail of Wishes. It will lead us there.\u201d \n\nMia nodded, her heart racing. They stepped onto the shimmering path. Each step sparkled like stardust. \n\nSuddenly, the Shadow appeared. \u201cYou think you can escape?\u201d it sneered. \u201cYou will never find the Dream Gate!\u201d \n\nMia felt a chill creep up her spine. But she remembered her happy memories. \u201cWe can do this, Dreamy!\u201d she shouted. \n\nWith newfound courage, they raced down the Trail of Wishes. Bright flowers and friendly creatures came alive around them. A butterfly landed on Mia's nose, making her giggle. \n\n\u201cLook at that!\u201d Dreamy pointed to a giant tree with glowing branches. \u201cIt\u2019s the Tree of Dreams! We can ask it for help!\u201d \n\nMia ran to the tree. \u201cExcuse me, Mr. Tree!\u201d she called out. \u201cCan you help us find the Dream Gate?\u201d \n\nThe tree swayed gently. \u201cOf course, dear Mia. But first, you must face your fears!\u201d \n\nMia felt her heart flutter. \u201cWhat do I have to do?\u201d \n\n\u201cTo find the Dream Gate, you must believe in yourself!\u201d the tree replied with a twinkling smile. \n\nMia took a deep breath. \u201cI believe!\u201d \n\nSuddenly, the Shadow roared, shaking the ground. \u201cNo! You can\u2019t believe! You\u2019re afraid!\u201d \n\nMia stood tall. \u201cI am not afraid!\u201d \n\nThe ground rumbled as the tree glowed brighter. \u201cShow me your courage!\u201d \n\nMia took a step forward. \u201cDreamy, let\u2019s show it!\u201d \n\nTogether, they faced the Shadow, shining with hope. The Shadow screeched but began to shrink. \n\nMia and Dreamy cheered. \u201cWe can do this! Let\u2019s keep going!\u201d \n\nJust then, a spark of light burst from the tree, revealing a glowing map to the Dream Gate. \n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Dreamy exclaimed. \n\nMia\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cIt\u2019s beautiful!\u201d \n\nThey picked up the map, ready for their next adventure. \n\n\u201cThis way!\u201d Dreamy said, pointing down a colorful path. \n\nMia followed him, excitement bubbling inside her. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThey raced forward, ready for whatever lay ahead. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cI can feel it, Dreamy!\u201d Mia said, her heart pounding. \u201cWe are getting closer!\u201d \n\nThe Shadow\u2019s dark laugh echoed behind them. \u201cYou can\u2019t escape!\u201d \n\nBut Mia was filled with hope. She wouldn\u2019t give up. They were almost there!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Mia and Dreamy follow to find the Dream Gate?","options":["The Trail of Wishes","The Sparkling Sea","The Shadow","The Tree of Dreams"],"correct_answer":"The Trail of Wishes"},{"question":"What does the Tree of Dreams ask Mia to do?","options":["Face her fears","Run away","Give up","Cry"],"correct_answer":"Face her fears"},{"question":"What does Mia feel inside when she stands up to the Shadow?","options":["Fear","Courage","Sadness","Anger"],"correct_answer":"Courage"},{"question":"What do they find that helps them get closer to the Dream Gate?","options":["A glowing map","A scary monster","A big rock","A lost toy"],"correct_answer":"A glowing map"},{"question":"How does the Shadow react when Mia believes in herself?","options":["It grows bigger","It disappears","It laughs","It shrinks"],"correct_answer":"It shrinks"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_325_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_325_ch4_img1.png","plot_325_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":412,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
