   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_325_7_10","title":"Escape from DreamWorld","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Virtual Reality","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Mia and Dreamy stood at the edge of the Sparkling Sea. The waves shimmered like diamonds under a bright sun. \u201cLook at that!\u201d Dreamy exclaimed, pointing to the water. \u201cIt\u2019s beautiful!\u201d\n\n\u201cYeah! But we need to hurry!\u201d Mia replied. She felt the Shadow lurking behind them, always watching. \n\nAs they walked, a giant Tree of Dreams appeared. Its leaves fluttered like colorful butterflies. \u201cWe should ask the Tree for help,\u201d Dreamy suggested.\n\nMia nodded and approached the tree. \u201cHello, Tree of Dreams! Can you help us find the Dream Gate?\u201d \n\nThe tree\u2019s face smiled kindly. \u201cOf course! But first, you must face your fears. What is your biggest fear, Mia?\u201d \n\nMia took a deep breath. \u201cI\u2019m scared of failing. I don\u2019t want to lose my dreams!\u201d \n\nThe tree rustled its leaves. \u201cRemember, fears can be transformed into strength.\u201d \n\nSuddenly, the Shadow emerged from behind the tree. \u201cYou will never escape!\u201d it growled. \n\nMia\u2019s heart raced. \u201cNo! I am not afraid anymore!\u201d \n\nAs she spoke, the colors of the world brightened. Dreamy cheered, \u201cYou can do this, Mia!\u201d\n\nMia focused on a happy memory\u2014playing with her friends. She reached deep inside and felt a warm glow. \u201cYou don\u2019t scare me, Shadow! I am brave!\u201d \n\nWith those words, a brilliant light burst from Mia. The Shadow recoiled, its dark form flickering. \u201cNo! This can\u2019t be!\u201d it shrieked. \n\nMia felt powerful. \u201cYou are just a part of me. I can change you!\u201d \n\nAnd with a wave of her hand, the Shadow transformed into a friendly creature. It smiled at Mia, no longer dark and scary. \n\n\u201cThank you for helping me find my courage,\u201d Mia said. \n\nThe Tree of Dreams nodded. \u201cNow, here is the map to the Dream Gate.\u201d It handed Mia a glowing scroll. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Dreamy shouted, bouncing with excitement. \n\nThey followed the map, feeling lighter and braver. The landscape shifted, and the Dream Gate appeared in the distance. \n\n\u201cWe did it, Mia!\u201d Dreamy exclaimed, clapping his hands. \n\nMia beamed. \u201cWe\u2019re almost home!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they raced towards the gate, Mia felt a sense of joy. She had faced her fears and found strength from within. \n\n\u201cRemember, Mia,\u201d Dreamy said, \u201cYou can always overcome your fears with love and creativity.\u201d \n\nMia nodded, ready to step into the next adventure. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith one last look at DreamWorld, Mia and Dreamy dashed through the Dream Gate together. \n\n\u201cSee you again, DreamWorld!\u201d Mia shouted, filled with hope.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Mia confront in this chapter?","options":["A giant monster","The Shadow","A wizard","A dragon"],"correct_answer":"The Shadow"},{"question":"What does the Tree of Dreams tell Mia she must face?","options":["Her friends","Her fears","The Dream Gate","The sea"],"correct_answer":"Her fears"},{"question":"What memory does Mia focus on to find her courage?","options":["A scary dream","Playing with friends","A sad moment","A lost toy"],"correct_answer":"Playing with friends"},{"question":"What does the Shadow become at the end of the chapter?","options":["A cloud","A friendly creature","A tree","A monster"],"correct_answer":"A friendly creature"},{"question":"What do Mia and Dreamy receive from the Tree of Dreams?","options":["A magic wand","A glowing scroll","A treasure chest","A new friend"],"correct_answer":"A glowing scroll"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_325_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_325_ch5_img1.png","plot_325_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":415,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
