   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_325_11_14","title":"Escape from DreamWorld","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Virtual Reality","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Mia stood on the edge of the shimmering DreamCloud, where the night sky swirled with colors that felt alive. Stars danced like fireflies, and clouds drifted lazily, transforming into whimsical shapes\u2014a dragon here, a castle there. This was no ordinary dream; this was DreamWorld, a virtual realm where her imagination could run wild. Yet, as much as she loved this place, a nagging feeling twisted in her stomach.\n\n\u201cCome on, Mia! You promised we\u2019d explore the Crystal Forest today!\u201d piped up Dreamy, her quirky guide with hair that sparkled like confetti. His mismatched socks peeked out from beneath a neon green jumpsuit that seemed to change colors with his mood.\n\n\u201cI know, but...\u201d Mia hesitated, glancing at the shadowy corner of DreamWorld where the colors faded into darkness. \u201cWhat if we run into the Shadow again?\u201d\n\nDreamy\u2019s smile faded just a touch. \u201cYou can\u2019t let fear hold you back! Remember, you\u2019re the one who created this world. You have the power to change it!\u201d\n\nWith a deep breath, Mia nodded, steeling herself against the fluttering unease in her chest. She had built this dreamscape from the corners of her mind, filling it with wonders that reflected her hopes\u2014bright and vivid. But lurking in the shadows was the Shadow, a dark figure that seemed to absorb the light and joy, a representation of her deepest anxieties and fears. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Mia declared, trying to mask her fear with determination. Dreamy cheered, and together they leaped from the edge of the DreamCloud, swirling into the luminous air. \n\nAs they soared through the skies, Mia felt like a bird, weightless and free, until the delectable aroma of sugary clouds and sweet breezes was suddenly replaced by the metallic scent of dread. The glittering landscape shifted beneath her, colors fading into ominous shades of gray and black, and the cheerful sounds of DreamWorld turned into a haunting silence.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nIt was then that they landed in a clearing surrounded by trees that looked like giant hands reaching for the sky. \u201cWelcome to the Crystal Forest,\u201d Dreamy announced, his voice echoing off the walls of the trees. \u201cBut be careful, you know the Shadow likes to lurk here.\u201d\n\nMia shivered. \u201cI can\u2019t keep running from it, can I?\u201d\n\nBefore Dreamy could answer, a chilling wind rustled through the trees, and the shadows elongated, dancing sinisterly. Moments later, a figure emerged\u2014a tall, dark silhouette with piercing eyes that glowed like embers. The Shadow was here, and it seemed to feed off Mia\u2019s fear, growing taller and more menacing.\n\n\u201cWhy are you so afraid, Mia?\u201d it hissed, its voice like the crackling of dried leaves. \u201cYou think you can escape me?\u201d\n\nMia\u2019s heart raced as she stepped backward, but Dreamy stood firm beside her, his eyes sparkling with encouragement. \u201cYou can face this, Mia! Remember what you love, what you dream of!\u201d\n\nTaking a deep breath, she replied, \u201cI\u2014 I want to be brave! I want to create!\u201d\n\nWith that declaration, something shifted inside Mia. A bright light flickered in her chest, pushing back the darkness of the Shadow. \u201cYou don\u2019t scare me!\u201d she shouted, surprising even herself.\n\nThe Shadow recoiled, momentarily stunned, and as it did, a glimmering doorway appeared behind it, beckoning Mia to step forward. \n\n\u201cNow\u2019s your chance!\u201d Dreamy urged, eyes wide with excitement.\n\nWith every ounce of courage, Mia ran toward the doorway, knowing that facing her fears was the only way to escape this world she had crafted and find her way back to reality.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d she shouted, dashing toward the light, ready to unlock the hidden parts of her imagination.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is DreamWorld?","options":["A place where dreams are lived out","A video game","A school for wizards","A haunted house"],"correct_answer":"A place where dreams are lived out"},{"question":"Who is Mia's guide in DreamWorld?","options":["The Shadow","Her friend","Dreamy","A talking animal"],"correct_answer":"Dreamy"},{"question":"What does the Shadow represent?","options":["Joy and happiness","Mia's creativity","Mia's deepest fears","A magical creature"],"correct_answer":"Mia's deepest fears"},{"question":"What does Mia need to face to escape DreamWorld?","options":["Her friends","Her fears","A monster","A puzzle"],"correct_answer":"Her fears"},{"question":"What does Mia declare to confront the Shadow?","options":["I want to be brave!","Leave me alone!","I'm scared!","I will hide!"],"correct_answer":"I want to be brave!"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_325_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_325_ch1_img1.png","plot_325_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":617,"reading_level":"Builder"}
