   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_316_7_10","title":"The Time-Traveling Treasure Map","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Time Travel","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Mia stood on the deck of the pirate ship, the \"Sea Serpent.\" The sun sparkled on the water like diamonds. She felt the salty breeze in her hair. \"Wow, Lily! This place is amazing!\" she exclaimed. \n\nLily giggled. \"Wait until you see the treasure!\" \n\nJust then, a loud voice boomed from the helm. \"Ahoy, crew! Gather 'round!\" It was Captain Blackbeard, his face shadowed by a hat as big as a sail. He had a long beard and a twinkle in his eye.\n\nMia's heart raced. She knew Blackbeard was the pirate she had to outsmart. \"What do you think he wants?\" she whispered to Lily.\n\n\"I don't know, but we should listen!\" Lily replied, eyes wide with excitement.\n\nCaptain Blackbeard pointed to a distant island. \"The treasure is hidden on Skull Island! But beware! Other pirates are after it too!\" He looked straight at Mia. \"And I can\u2019t have any sneaky stowaways!\" \n\nMia's stomach fluttered. \"Did he just call me sneaky?\" she asked, worried.\n\nLily rolled her eyes. \"Don't worry! We just need to find the treasure first.\"\n\nAs they set sail, Mia noticed a ship in the distance. It was flying a black flag. \"Lily, look!\" she shouted, pointing. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\"That's Captain Fang\u2019s ship! He\u2019s the worst pirate around!\" Lily gasped. \n\nMia swallowed hard. \"What if he tries to take the treasure first?\"\n\nLily\u2019s face turned serious. \"We must think fast! We need a plan!\" \n\nSuddenly, the ship rocked. A loud crash came from below decks. \"What was that?\" Mia yelled.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s check it out!\u201d Lily urged, and they rushed inside. \n\nAs they opened the door to the treasure room, they gasped. The treasure map glowed! \"Look at that!\" Mia pointed. \n\nBut then, they heard footsteps. \"We\u2019re not alone!\" Lily whispered. \n\nThey peered around the corner. It was Captain Fang and his crew! They were searching for the treasure too! \n\n\u201cQuick, hide!\u201d Mia said, her heart pounding. \n\nThey squeezed behind a barrel, holding their breath. Would they be caught? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nMia\u2019s mind raced. \"We can\u2019t let them find the treasure! We need to get it first!\" \n\nBut how? Time was ticking, and danger was close.\n\n\"Let\u2019s be brave, Mia,\" Lily said quietly. \"Together, we can outsmart them!\" \n\nMia nodded, feeling strong with Lily by her side. They had to come up with a clever plan. \n\nAs they listened to Captain Fang\u2019s crew grumble, a new challenge awaited. What would they do next?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Captain Blackbeard announce?","options":["The treasure is missing","The treasure is on Skull Island","The treasure is in the attic","The treasure is lost at sea"],"correct_answer":"The treasure is on Skull Island"},{"question":"What ship does Mia see in the distance?","options":["The Sea Serpent","Captain Fang\u2019s ship","A merchant ship","A fishing boat"],"correct_answer":"Captain Fang\u2019s ship"},{"question":"What do Mia and Lily do when they hear Captain Fang's crew?","options":["They run away","They hide behind a barrel","They fight them","They call for help"],"correct_answer":"They hide behind a barrel"},{"question":"What do Mia and Lily need to find before Captain Fang?","options":["A map","A treasure","A key","A ship"],"correct_answer":"A treasure"},{"question":"How does Mia feel about Captain Blackbeard at first?","options":["Excited","Scared","Angry","Happy"],"correct_answer":"Scared"}]},"images":null,"word_count":416,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
