   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_316_7_10","title":"The Time-Traveling Treasure Map","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Time Travel","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Mia stood on the deck of the pirate ship, The Sea Serpent. The sun sparkled on the turquoise waves, and the salty breeze tousled her hair. She felt like a true pirate. \n\n\u201cLook over there!\u201d Lily shouted, pointing to a distant island. \u201cThat\u2019s where Captain Fang\u2019s crew is hiding! We need to hurry!\u201d\n\nMia\u2019s heart raced. \u201cDo you think they have the treasure map too?\u201d\n\n\u201cProbably!\u201d Lily replied, her green eyes wide. \u201cWe have to be quicker than them!\u201d\n\nAs they sailed closer, Mia saw a dark ship with tattered sails. Blackbeard leaned on the ship\u2019s railing, a mischievous grin on his face.\n\n\u201cArrr, mateys! Are you ready for a pirate adventure?\u201d he laughed.\n\nMia nodded, feeling both excited and worried. They had to find the treasure first, or Fang would win!\n\nSuddenly, a loud crash echoed from the other ship. Mia gasped. A cannonball whizzed past them! \n\n\u201cDuck!\u201d shouted Blackbeard, pulling Mia down. \n\nThe crew scrambled to their feet. \u201cWe need to fight back!\u201d yelled Lily, her eyes determined.\n\nJust then, Mia spotted a shiny object on the pirate ship. \u201cLook! There\u2019s a secret treasure chest!\u201d she exclaimed. \n\n\u201cWe need to get to it before Fang does!\u201d Blackbeard said, jumping up. \n\nMia felt a surge of courage. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d \n\nThey rushed towards the chest, but Captain Fang\u2019s crew was already there. Fang himself stood in front of them, a wicked smile on his face.\n\n\u201cToo late, girls!\u201d he sneered. \u201cThe treasure belongs to me!\u201d\n\nMia\u2019s heart thumped. She had to think fast. \u201cMaybe we can make a deal!\u201d she shouted, hoping to outsmart him.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cDeal?\u201d Fang frowned, crossing his arms. \u201cWhat could you possibly offer?\u201d\n\n\u201cWe\u2019ll race you to the treasure!\u201d Mia declared, her mind racing. \u201cIf we win, we get part of it!\u201d\n\nLily whispered, \u201cAre you sure about this?\u201d\n\n\u201cYes!\u201d Mia replied, feeling brave. \u201cWe can do it together!\u201d\n\nFang chuckled. \u201cAlright! But if I win, you\u2019ll be my crew forever!\u201d \n\nMia gulped but nodded. This was it! They had to win. \n\nAs they lined up at the edge of the ship, Mia took a deep breath. The race was about to begin.\n\n\u201cOn my count! Three\u2026 two\u2026 one\u2026 GO!\u201d \n\nMia sprinted, her legs moving as fast as they could. The wind whipped through her hair, her heart pounding like a drum. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThey dashed off the ship, leaping onto the beach. Mia saw the treasure glimmering in the distance. They were so close!\n\nBut then, she heard Captain Fang\u2019s men behind them, yelling and charging forward. \u201cGet them!\u201d they shouted. \n\nMia\u2019s mind raced. Would they reach the treasure first? Would they escape Fang\u2019s crew? \n\nAs they raced toward the treasure, Mia knew she had to be brave and clever. What would she do next?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What ship do Mia and Lily sail on?","options":["The Flying Dutchman","The Sea Serpent","The Black Pearl","The Treasure Hunter"],"correct_answer":"The Sea Serpent"},{"question":"Who challenges Mia and Lily to a race?","options":["Captain Blackbeard","Captain Fang","Lily","The Sea Serpent"],"correct_answer":"Captain Fang"},{"question":"What do Mia and Lily see on the pirate ship?","options":["A treasure chest","A cannon","A pirate flag","A map"],"correct_answer":"A treasure chest"},{"question":"What do Mia and Lily have to do to get the treasure?","options":["Fight Captain Fang","Make a deal","Run away","Hide in a cave"],"correct_answer":"Make a deal"},{"question":"What did Mia feel at the beginning of the chapter?","options":["Bored","Excited","Scared","Hungry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"}]},"images":null,"word_count":474,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
