   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_316_7_10","title":"The Time-Traveling Treasure Map","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Time Travel","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Mia stood on the deck of Captain Blackbeard\u2019s ship, the Sea Serpent. The sun sparkled in the clear blue sea. \u201cLook at all the islands!\u201d she exclaimed, her eyes wide with wonder.\n\nLily grinned at her. \u201cEach one has its own secrets! We should check the map again.\u201d Mia pulled out the treasure map. The ancient parchment felt rough beneath her fingers.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s see. It says we need to find the \u2018Cave of Whispers\u2019 first. That\u2019s where the treasure is hidden!\u201d Mia said, excitement bubbling inside her.\n\n\u201cCave of Whispers? Sounds spooky!\u201d Lily laughed, flipping her curly hair. \u201cBut we\u2019re pirates! We can handle spooky!\u201d\n\nJust then, Captain Blackbeard joined them. \u201cAye, me hearties! We must hurry! Captain Fang is on our trail!\u201d His voice was deep and filled with urgency. Mia shivered at the thought of the scheming pirate.\n\n\u201cWho is Captain Fang?\u201d Mia asked, her heart racing.\n\n\u201cHe\u2019s clever and sneaky,\u201d Blackbeard replied. \u201cHe\u2019ll stop at nothing to steal the treasure from us!\u201d\n\nLily clenched her fists. \u201cThen we must find the treasure first! We can\u2019t let him win!\u201d\n\nThe ship sailed closer to the first island. Tall palm trees swayed in the breeze. Mia took a deep breath. \u201cLet\u2019s look for clues, and we can outsmart Captain Fang!\u201d \n\nThey hopped off the ship and onto the soft sand. As they walked, the sound of waves crashing filled the air. Suddenly, they heard a rustle behind the bushes. \n\n\u201cWhat was that?\u201d Mia whispered, her heart pounding.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s investigate!\u201d Lily said boldly.\n\nThey crept closer, careful not to make a sound. As they parted the leaves, they found a hidden entrance to a cave! \n\n\u201cWow! The Cave of Whispers!\u201d Mia gasped.\n\nJust as they stepped inside, a figure appeared. It was Captain Fang! \u201cWell, well, well, what do we have here?\u201d he sneered, blocking their way.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nMia felt a rush of fear but stood tall. \u201cWe\u2019re here for the treasure, Fang! You can\u2019t stop us!\u201d\n\nFang laughed. \u201cOh, but I can! You think you can find the treasure before me? Not a chance!\u201d\n\nMia and Lily exchanged determined looks. They had to think fast. With teamwork and courage, they could outsmart him. \n\n\u201cReady for a treasure hunt?\u201d Mia asked Lily. \n\n\u201cAlways!\u201d Lily replied with a grin. \n\nThey took a deep breath and dashed into the cave, ready for the adventure ahead.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the name of Captain Blackbeard's ship?","options":["The Sea Dragon","The Sea Serpent","The Pirate's Cove","The Whispering Wave"],"correct_answer":"The Sea Serpent"},{"question":"Who do Mia and Lily need to outsmart?","options":["Captain Blackbeard","Captain Fang","A ghost","A sea monster"],"correct_answer":"Captain Fang"},{"question":"What do Mia and Lily find when they enter the cave?","options":["A treasure chest","Captain Fang","A shipwreck","A ghost"],"correct_answer":"Captain Fang"},{"question":"What do Mia and Lily need to find first?","options":["The map","The treasure","The Cave of Whispers","A pirate ship"],"correct_answer":"The Cave of Whispers"},{"question":"How does Mia feel about facing Captain Fang?","options":["Excited","Afraid","Bored","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Afraid"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_316_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_316_ch4_img1.png","plot_316_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":407,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
