   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_316_7_10","title":"The Time-Traveling Treasure Map","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Time Travel","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Mia and Lily stood at the entrance of the Cave of Whispers. The cave loomed large, its dark mouth gaping like a hungry monster. \u201cAre you ready?\u201d Lily asked, her voice trembling a little.\n\nMia nodded, determination shining in her eyes. \u201cWe have to find the treasure before Captain Fang does!\u201d They took a deep breath and stepped inside. \n\nAs they walked, the cave was filled with strange sounds. Whispers echoed around them, as if the stones were telling secrets. \u201cIt\u2019s kind of spooky in here,\u201d Mia said, trying to smile. \u201cBut we can do this!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, they heard heavy footsteps behind them. \u201cLooks like the pirates are here!\u201d whispered Lily, her eyes wide. They quickly ducked behind a large rock.\n\n\u201cWhere\u2019s that treasure?\u201d bellowed Captain Fang, his voice booming through the cave. \u201cWe\u2019ll find it first!\u201d \n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Mia said, pointing to a glimmering light deep within the cave. \u201cThat must be it!\u201d \n\nThey crept closer, careful to stay quiet. As they approached the light, they saw a huge chest covered in golden coins. \u201cWow!\u201d Lily gasped. \u201cBut we need to be careful. Fang could catch us!\u201d\n\nMia agreed. \u201cWe have to distract him first.\u201d She thought for a moment. \u201cWhat if we make a noise on the other side of the cave?\u201d \n\n\u201cGreat idea!\u201d Lily replied. \u201cOn three!\u201d \n\nThey counted together, \u201cOne, two, three!\u201d Mia threw a small rock. It clattered against the wall, making a loud noise. \n\nFang turned, shouting, \u201cWhat was that?\u201d He stormed off in the other direction. \n\n\u201cThis is our chance!\u201d Mia said, racing toward the treasure. They reached the chest and opened it wide. Inside, they found sparkling jewels and shiny gold coins.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nMia and Lily cheered, jumping up and down. \u201cWe did it!\u201d Mia shouted. \u201cWe found the treasure!\u201d\n\nBut then, they heard Fang\u2019s voice returning. \u201cYou little thieves! Give me that treasure!\u201d \n\nMia and Lily looked at each other, fear in their eyes. \u201cWe have to think fast!\u201d Lily said. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s hide!\u201d Mia suggested. They quickly ducked behind the treasure chest. Fang burst into the room, his face twisted in anger. \n\n\u201cWhere are you?\u201d He scanned the room. Mia held her breath, her heart racing. \n\nAfter a moment, Fang turned and stomped away, muttering to himself. \u201cI\u2019ll find you!\u201d \n\nMia and Lily peeked out. \u201cThat was close!\u201d Mia said, relieved. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s take some treasure and get out of here!\u201d Lily said, her eyes sparkling with excitement. \n\nMia nodded. They filled their bags with coins and jewels. As they made their way out of the cave, Mia realized how brave she had become. She had faced danger and made a true friend.\n\n\u201cThank you for being by my side, Lily,\u201d Mia said, smiling. \n\n\u201cAlways!\u201d Lily replied. \n\nAs they stepped back into the sunlight, Mia felt a warm glow inside. They had found treasure, but their friendship was the greatest prize of all. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThey stood hand in hand, ready for their next adventure.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Mia and Lily find inside the cave?","options":["A treasure chest","A pirate ship","A secret passage","A magical creature"],"correct_answer":"A treasure chest"},{"question":"How do Mia and Lily distract Captain Fang?","options":["By singing loudly","By making a noise with a rock","By running away","By hiding behind the treasure"],"correct_answer":"By making a noise with a rock"},{"question":"What do Mia and Lily realize is their greatest prize?","options":["The treasure","The adventure","Their friendship","The pirate ship"],"correct_answer":"Their friendship"},{"question":"What do Mia and Lily do after finding the treasure?","options":["They leave immediately","They tell Captain Fang","They dance with joy","They hide in the cave"],"correct_answer":"They leave immediately"},{"question":"How do Mia and Lily feel at the end of the chapter?","options":["Scared","Bored","Happy","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Happy"}]},"images":null,"word_count":500,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
