     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"cursed","1":"jagged","2":"determination","3":"exhilarated","image_prompts":["The scene depicts the *Sea Serpent* anchored near a rugged shoreline of Skull Island, with Mia at the helm, looking confident, and Lily beside her, both gazing eagerly at the island. The sky is painted with sunset colors, and the pirate crew is bustling about, tying ropes and preparing to disembark.","A dramatic moment showcasing Mia and Lily confronting Captain Flint in the dense jungle, with tension in the air. Flint stands defiantly, holding a torn piece of the treasure map, while Mia and Lily charge at him, their expressions fierce and determined. The lush greenery surrounds them, adding to the suspense of the scene."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing An atmospheric illustration of the Caribbean sea at sunset, with golden hues reflecting on the water. Mia stands at the forefront, holding a tattered treasure map, with Captain Blackbeard and Lily by her side. The towering cliffs loom in the background, casting shadows that hint at danger while the warm light suggests hope and adventure.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_316_ch5_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 14:52:41"}}}
