   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_316_11_14","title":"The Time-Traveling Treasure Map","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Time Travel","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Mia loved exploring her grandmother\u2019s old attic. It was a treasure trove of forgotten items: dusty trunks, faded photographs, and ancient books filled with stories that whispered secrets of the past. Today felt different, though. The air buzzed with an electric excitement, urging her to dig deeper. As she rummaged through a pile of old quilts, her fingers brushed against something hard and smooth.\n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s this?\u201d she wondered aloud, pulling out a rolled parchment. It was tied with a frayed ribbon, the ink faded but still legible. The words \u201cTreasure Map\u201d danced across the top. Mia\u2019s heart raced as she carefully unraveled it, revealing a map adorned with strange symbols and markings. She could almost hear the distant call of the ocean, the wind whispering promises of adventure.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe map depicted a series of islands nestled in a blue sea, with a large \u201cX\u201d marking a spot labeled \u201cThe Isle of Gold.\u201d Mia\u2019s imagination soared. She could picture pirates sailing the waters, their ships cutting through the waves like knives. But as her eyes traced the faded lines of the map, she noticed a peculiar illustration in the corner. It looked like a swirling whirlpool. \u201cWhat does it mean?\u201d she murmured, curiosity bubbling inside her.\n\nJust then, a chilling breeze swept through the attic, rustling the papers around her. A flash of light erupted from the map, momentarily blinding her. When the light faded, Mia found herself standing not in her attic, but on a sandy beach under a brilliant blue sky. Waves crashed against the shore, and nearby, a ship bobbed gently in the water, its sails billowing like clouds.\n\n\u201cWhere am I?\u201d she gasped, her heart pounding in her chest. Suddenly, a group of figures emerged from the trees, their faces hidden beneath wide-brimmed hats. They moved with purpose, and she instinctively stepped back, feeling both fear and intrigue.\n\n\u201cAhoy there! What brings a lass like you to our domain?\u201d one of them shouted, revealing a bearded face that was both charming and intimidating. \u201cI be Captain Blackbeard, and you\u2019re trespassing on our shores!\u201d\n\nMia\u2019s mouth went dry. \u201cI\u2014I\u2019m just looking for treasure,\u201d she stammered, the words tumbling out before she could think. \u201cI found this map!\u201d She held it out, praying for understanding.\n\nCaptain Blackbeard\u2019s eyes narrowed as he inspected the parchment. \u201cA treasure map, you say? If it\u2019s true, then we\u2019ll be needing you on our crew.\u201d He smiled, revealing a gold tooth that gleamed in the sunlight. \u201cBut there be dangers ahead, lass. The sea is no place for the faint-hearted.\u201d\n\n\u201cI\u2019m not afraid,\u201d Mia replied, determination coursing through her veins. \u201cI\u2019ll help you find the treasure.\u201d\n\n\u201cThen welcome aboard!\u201d he chuckled, but Mia could feel the tension in the air. Just as she began to feel a glimmer of hope, the sound of another ship\u2019s cannon fired in the distance, shattering the moment. \u201cAh, we\u2019ve got company!\u201d Blackbeard growled. \u201cPrepare to defend the ship!\u201d\n\nHer stomach flipped. Could she really trust these pirates? Mia took a deep breath, glancing at the map once more. The treasure could slip away before she even had the chance to find it.\n\n\u201cMia!\u201d a voice called. A girl with wild hair and a quick smile darted toward her. \u201cYou\u2019re in for quite the adventure! I\u2019m Lily, and we\u2019ll need every hand to outsmart Captain Steele. He\u2019s not the type to share treasure!\u201d\n\nMia felt a flicker of connection\u2014a friendship that could navigate these treacherous waters. \u201cLet\u2019s do this,\u201d she said, her heart racing with excitement and fear.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAs the shot of cannon fire echoed across the beach, Mia grasped her map tightly. It was time to embark on this journey, but what awaited her could change everything she thought she knew about friendship and bravery.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Mia find in her grandmother's attic?","options":["A dusty trunk","A treasure map","A photograph","A pirate hat"],"correct_answer":"A treasure map"},{"question":"Who is the notorious pirate Mia meets on the beach?","options":["Captain Steele","Captain Blackbeard","Captain Hook","Captain Morgan"],"correct_answer":"Captain Blackbeard"},{"question":"What does the map lead Mia to believe she will find?","options":["A secret island","A hidden treasure","A pirate ship","A treasure chest"],"correct_answer":"A hidden treasure"},{"question":"Who does Mia team up with to find the treasure?","options":["Captain Steele","Lily","Her grandmother","A talking parrot"],"correct_answer":"Lily"},{"question":"What does Captain Blackbeard mean when he says, 'The sea is no place for the faint-hearted'?","options":["It's a dangerous place","It's a fun place","It's a calm place","It's a boring place"],"correct_answer":"It's a dangerous place"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_316_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_316_ch1_img1.png","plot_316_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":652,"reading_level":"Builder"}
