   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_316_11_14","title":"The Time-Traveling Treasure Map","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Time Travel","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"As dawn broke over the horizon, golden rays of sunlight danced on the waves of the Caribbean Sea, illuminating the *Black Pearl*'s sails. Mia stood on the deck, her heart racing. The salty breeze ruffled her hair, and the taste of adventure lingered on her lips. \u201cToday\u2019s the day,\" she whispered to herself, determined to outsmart Captain Flint and claim the treasure before it disappeared into legend. \n\nCaptain Blackbeard, leaning against the ship's railing, caught her eye. His dark hair flowed like a river of shadows, and his mischievous grin was infectious. \u201cFeeling brave, lass?\u201d he chuckled, his voice as deep as the ocean itself.\n\n\u201cMore than ever,\u201d Mia replied, her fists clenched with excitement. She felt a sense of belonging among these pirates, especially with Lily by her side, who had been digging through the treasure map with her.\n\nLily approached, her eyes sparkling. \u201cI think I\u2019ve figured out the next clue! It\u2019s hidden in the cave on Skull Island,\u201d she announced, holding up the map that gleamed faintly in the sunlight. Just then, the wind shifted, carrying the ominous sound of cannon fire in the distance. \n\n\u201cFlint!\u201d Blackbeard's voice boomed. \u201cHe\u2019s not giving up easily!\u201d \n\nMia\u2019s pulse quickened. They had to hurry. She felt a mixture of fear and excitement bubbling inside her. \u201cWhat\u2019s the plan?\u201d she asked, glancing between Blackbeard and Lily.\n\n\u201cWe sail toward Skull Island,\u201d Blackbeard replied, his expression fierce. \u201cWe'll get there first, and then we\u2019ll figure out how to deal with Flint.\u201d \n\nAs they adjusted their sails, Mia felt a rush of hope. Maybe they could outsmart Flint after all. But just as they turned the ship, the *Crimson Shark* appeared on the horizon, its black sails billowing like storm clouds. \n\n\u201cFull speed ahead!\u201d Blackbeard commanded, and the crew scrambled to obey. The ship surged forward, cutting through the waves with a roar. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nMia's heart raced as she clutched the railing. The *Crimson Shark* was gaining on them, its cannons gleaming with deadly intent. \u201cThey\u2019ll catch us if we don\u2019t do something!\u201d she shouted over the din.\n\nLily\u2019s eyes narrowed. \u201cWe could set a trap! If we can lure them into the narrow channel near the island, we might have a chance.\u201d \n\n\u201cBrilliant!\u201d Mia exclaimed, her mind whirling with possibilities. \u201cLet\u2019s do it!\u201d \n\nAs they approached the rocky coastline, the water grew choppy, and Mia\u2019s excitement mixed with anxiety. \u201cIs everyone ready?\u201d she called, her voice steady despite the storm inside her. \n\nBut before anyone could answer, a loud boom echoed through the air, and a cannonball whistled past them, splashing water onto the deck. \u201cThey\u2019re firing!\u201d Mia screamed. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nIn that moment, everything seemed to slow down. She saw the determination in Blackbeard\u2019s eyes and the bravery in Lily\u2019s stance. They were in this together. Just then, a brilliant idea struck Mia. \u201cIf we can reach that cave on the shore, we can hide and ambush them!\u201d\n\n\u201cThen let\u2019s make it happen!\u201d Blackbeard shouted, steering the ship toward the channel. \n\nWith every ounce of courage, they navigated the treacherous waters. The sound of the *Crimson Shark*\u2019s cannons echoed behind them, but Mia felt a surge of confidence. Maybe this treasure hunt was about more than gold; it was about loyalty and friendship\u2014and she was ready to fight for it.\n\nAs they sailed closer to the cave, anticipation filled the air, and Mia knew they were on the brink of something monumental.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Where is Mia trying to reach in this chapter?","options":["Treasure Island","Skull Island","Treasure Cove","Pirate Bay"],"correct_answer":"Skull Island"},{"question":"What does Mia suggest to do when they are pursued by the *Crimson Shark*?","options":["Set a trap","Surrender","Fight back","Change course"],"correct_answer":"Set a trap"},{"question":"What emotion does Mia feel as they prepare to confront Flint?","options":["Fear and excitement","Joy and happiness","Anger and frustration","Sadness and confusion"],"correct_answer":"Fear and excitement"},{"question":"What motivates Mia throughout her adventure?","options":["The treasure alone","Her friendship with the pirates","Fame and glory","The thrill of sailing"],"correct_answer":"Her friendship with the pirates"},{"question":"What does Blackbeard do when Flint's ship appears?","options":["He hides","He runs away","He prepares to fight","He surrenders"],"correct_answer":"He prepares to fight"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_316_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_316_ch4_img1.png","plot_316_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":591,"reading_level":"Builder"}
