   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_317_7_10","title":"The Clockwork Chronicles","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Time Travel","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Oliver stood in front of his time machine, excited yet nervous. His classroom was buzzing around him. Today was field trip day! They were going to the Future Fair, a huge event filled with amazing inventions. \n\n\u201cAre you sure it will work this time, Oliver?\u201d Ava asked, her bright eyes shining with curiosity. She loved robots and gadgets more than anyone.\n\nOliver scratched his head. \u201cOf course! I just need to press this button, and we\u2019ll be off!\u201d \n\nEveryone gathered around. Theo, the class clown, grinned. \u201cCan\u2019t wait to see flying cars. I hope we don\u2019t land on an alien planet!\u201d\n\nOliver chuckled. \u201cLet\u2019s find out!\u201d \n\nHe pressed a shiny blue button. The machine whirred, lights flashing all around. Suddenly, the room began to spin! [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe world outside turned into a blur. Then, with a loud pop, everything stopped. The kids gasped. \n\n\u201cWhoa! Where are we?\u201d Theo shouted, looking around. \n\nThey stood in a bustling city filled with flying cars, shiny robots, and glowing buildings. The sky was a brilliant blue. \n\n\u201cI think we\u2019re in the year 3023!\u201d Oliver exclaimed, his eyes wide. \n\nAva pulled out her tablet. \u201cLook at all this technology! We\u2019re really here!\u201d\n\nBut then, a loud voice interrupted. \u201cYou kids shouldn\u2019t be here!\u201d A tall man in a shiny suit marched toward them. His badge read \u201cTime Enforcement Officer.\u201d \n\nOliver\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWe need to fix the machine and get back!\u201d \n\nThe officer pointed a finger. \u201cYou\u2019re coming with me!\u201d \n\nThe kids looked at each other. Oliver swallowed hard. They had to work together to escape! \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d he shouted. Ava and Theo nodded, ready for adventure. \n\nThey dashed through the streets filled with wonders, but the officer was right behind them. They had to find a way to fix the time machine before it was too late!\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cQuick! We need to get to the Future Fair!\u201d Oliver yelled, leading the way.\n\n\u201cAre we going to build a new time machine?\u201d Ava asked, her excitement bubbling. \n\n\u201cYes! We can do this together!\u201d Oliver replied. \n\nBut the officer was still chasing them. Would they find a way home?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the name of the main character?","options":["Ava","Theo","Oliver","Officer"],"correct_answer":"Oliver"},{"question":"What happens when Oliver presses the blue button?","options":["They teleport to the future","They go to the past","They break the machine","They go to an alien planet"],"correct_answer":"They teleport to the future"},{"question":"Who chases after the kids?","options":["A robot","A teacher","A Time Enforcement Officer","An alien"],"correct_answer":"A Time Enforcement Officer"},{"question":"What does Ava love?","options":["Flying cars","Robots","Time travel","Classes"],"correct_answer":"Robots"},{"question":"What do the kids need to do?","options":["Build a robot","Fix the time machine","Go to school","Play games"],"correct_answer":"Fix the time machine"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_317_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_317_ch1_img1.png","plot_317_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":364,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
