   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_317_7_10","title":"The Clockwork Chronicles","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Time Travel","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"The bright city of 3023 was like nothing Oliver had ever seen. Flying cars zipped through the air, and robots with shiny surfaces walked along the streets. \"This is amazing!\" Ava exclaimed, her eyes wide. \"Look at that robot!\" \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]  \n\n\"Whoa! I want to see everything!\" said Theo, bouncing on his toes. But Oliver frowned. \"We need to fix the time machine first.\" \n\nAs they wandered further, a loud siren blared. Everyone stopped. A giant screen lit up above them. A robotic voice announced, \"Attention! Time Enforcement Officer on the loose! Stay indoors!\" \n\n\"Uh-oh,\" said Oliver. \"That sounds bad.\" \n\nAva pointed. \"Look! There\u2019s the time machine!\" \n\nThey ran toward a small alley. But as they entered, they found the machine surrounded by strange wires and blinking lights. \n\n\"I can fix this!\" Oliver said. He leaned forward, but suddenly, a shadow loomed over him. \n\n\"It's you!\" Theo gasped. A tall, stern-looking officer stood behind them. \"You kids are not allowed to be here!\" \n\nThey froze. The officer's eyes scanned their faces. \"Come with me!\" he ordered. \n\nAva whispered, \"What do we do?\" \n\n\"We run!\" Oliver shouted. They turned and dashed down the alley. \n\nThe officer chased them, his heavy boots thudding against the ground. \"Stop! You can't escape!\" \n\nOliver, Ava, and Theo raced through the streets. Suddenly, they spotted a park filled with colorful trees and glowing flowers. \"This way!\" Oliver yelled, leading them into the park. \n\n\"Look at those flowers!\" Theo said, slowing down to touch one. \"They\u2019re glowing!\" \n\n\"Focus, Theo!\" Ava shouted, tugging on his arm. \"We need to keep moving!\" \n\nJust then, the officer burst into the park. \"You can\u2019t hide from me!\" he yelled. \n\nOliver took a deep breath. \"We have to work together!\" He scanned the park for an idea. A sign read, \"Puzzle Garden: Solve to Escape!\" \n\n\"This is our chance!\" Oliver pointed. \"Let\u2019s solve the puzzle to get away!\" \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]  \n\nThey hurried to a giant puzzle in the center of the garden. The pieces floated in the air, waiting for them. \"What if we can't solve it?\" Theo worried. \n\n\"We can do it! We have to!\" Ava said, confident. \n\nOliver nodded. Together, they began to fit the pieces together. Would they solve the puzzle in time?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Where do Oliver and his classmates explore in this chapter?","options":["A park","A school","A spaceship","A museum"],"correct_answer":"A park"},{"question":"What does the Time Enforcement Officer want?","options":["To help the kids","To capture the kids","To play with the kids","To send them back"],"correct_answer":"To capture the kids"},{"question":"What do the kids find in the park?","options":["A spaceship","A puzzle","A robot","A time machine"],"correct_answer":"A puzzle"},{"question":"How does Oliver feel about fixing the time machine?","options":["Excited","Bored","Angry","Nervous"],"correct_answer":"Excited"},{"question":"What does Theo touch that glows?","options":["A flower","A robot","A puzzle piece","A car"],"correct_answer":"A flower"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_317_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_317_ch2_img1.png","plot_317_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":377,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
