   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_317_7_10","title":"The Clockwork Chronicles","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Time Travel","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"The sun shone brightly over the futuristic city of 3023. Oliver and his classmates stared wide-eyed at flying cars zooming past. \"Look at those!\" Ava exclaimed, pointing at a bright blue hovercar. \"They look like giant dragonflies!\"\n\nAs they walked, Theo tugged on Oliver's sleeve. \"Do you think we'll ever get back home? I miss pizza!\" he said, his voice full of worry. Suddenly, a voice crackled over a loudspeaker. \n\n\u201cAttention! Time Enforcement Officer on the move.\u201d A picture of a tall figure with a shiny badge appeared in the sky. The officer was searching for the kids! \n\nOliver gulped. \u201cWe need to hurry! We have to fix the time machine before he finds us!\u201d \n\nThe group dashed into a nearby alley, filled with strange gadgets and blinking lights. \u201cWhat\u2019s this?\u201d Theo asked, picking up a small robot. \u201cCan he help us?\u201d \n\nAva took the robot. \u201cI can try! Let\u2019s see if he knows anything.\u201d She pressed a button on its head. The robot whirred to life and spoke, \"To fix your time machine, you need a key from the Sky Tower!\" \n\n\u201cSky Tower?\u201d Oliver echoed, his heart racing. \u201cThat\u2019s where the Time Enforcement Officer works! We can\u2019t go there!\u201d \n\n\u201cBut we have to!\u201d Ava said, determination in her eyes. \u201cIt\u2019s our only chance!\u201d \n\nThe robot beeped again. \u201cWarning: Time Enforcement Officer approaching!\u201d \n\nOliver felt panic rise in his chest. \u201cWe have to make a plan!\u201d Just then, the alley's entrance darkened. The officer was right outside! \n\n\u201cQuick! Hide!\u201d cried Theo, diving behind a stack of glowing boxes. The others followed, their hearts pounding like drums. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they crouched in the shadows, Oliver whispered, \u201cWhat do we do now? He\u2019ll find us if we stay here!\" \n\nAva thought hard. \u201cWe can create a distraction! Theo, do you still have that funny noise maker from your backpack?\u201d \n\n\u201cOf course!\u201d Theo grinned and pulled out a small device. \u201cThis will make the silliest sounds ever!\u201d \n\n\u201cPerfect! We\u2019ll throw it down the street,\u201d Ava said. \u201cThe officer will chase after the noise!\u201d \n\nOliver nodded, his brain buzzing with ideas. \u201cOkay, on three! One\u2026 two\u2026 three!\u201d \n\nTheo tossed the noise maker into the street. It began to screech like a million birds! \n\nThe officer turned and ran. \u201cWhat in the future is that noise?\u201d \n\n\u201cNow\u2019s our chance!\u201d Oliver shouted. They sprinted down the alley, hearts racing. \n\nBut just as they reached the street, a loud shout rang out. \u201cStop right there!\u201d The Time Enforcement Officer was back and angrier than before! \n\nOliver stared at his friends. \u201cDo we take the risk and go to Sky Tower, or do we hide?\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe decision loomed over them like a storm cloud.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does the robot tell the kids they need?","options":["A key from the Sky Tower","A magic potion","A spaceship","A pizza"],"correct_answer":"A key from the Sky Tower"},{"question":"Who is chasing Oliver and his classmates?","options":["A Time Enforcement Officer","A robot","A teacher","A dog"],"correct_answer":"A Time Enforcement Officer"},{"question":"What does Theo use to create a distraction?","options":["A noise maker","A toy","A robot","A balloon"],"correct_answer":"A noise maker"},{"question":"Where do the kids need to go to find the key?","options":["Sky Tower","The library","The park","Their school"],"correct_answer":"Sky Tower"},{"question":"What do the kids decide to do when the officer is near?","options":["Hide and then create a distraction","Run straight to Sky Tower","Turn around","Give up"],"correct_answer":"Hide and then create a distraction"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_317_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_317_ch3_img1.png","plot_317_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":456,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
