   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_317_7_10","title":"The Clockwork Chronicles","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Time Travel","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Chapter 4: The Key to the Future\n\nThe Sky Tower loomed high above them. It sparkled with lights and looked like a giant crystal. Oliver, Ava, and Theo stood together, staring up. \n\n\"Wow!\" Ava exclaimed. \"Look at all those flying cars! This place is amazing!\" \n\n\"Yeah, but we need to get that key,\" Oliver said, adjusting his glasses. \"If we don't, we'll be stuck here forever!\"\n\nTheo scratched his head. \"How do we even get inside that tower? It looks super tall!\"\n\nOliver took a deep breath. \"We need to find a way in. There has to be an entrance.\" \n\nJust then, a friendly robot named Zippy zoomed by. \"Need help, kids?\" it chirped.\n\n\"Yes, please!\" shouted Theo. \"We need to find the entrance to the Sky Tower.\"\n\nZippy's eyes lit up. \"Follow me! I know a shortcut!\" With that, Zippy led them through a bustling crowd of people and robots. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe streets were filled with colorful shops and floating billboards. Oliver and his friends marveled at the sights around them. There were ice cream robots, singing flowers, and even a giant screen showing a dancing cat!\n\nAfter a short walk, they reached a tall door. Zippy pointed. \"This is the back entrance. But it needs a special key to open!\"\n\nOliver frowned. \"How do we get the key?\"\n\n\"There's a puzzle inside,\" Zippy said. \"Solve it, and the key will come to you!\"\n\nAva clapped her hands. \"We can do this together! Let's go!\"\n\nAs they entered, they found a room full of colorful lights and strange buttons. \"Wow, look at all this tech!\" Theo said, bouncing with excitement.\n\nBut suddenly, they heard a loud bang! The Time Enforcement Officer was outside, searching for them! \n\n\"Quick! We have to hurry!\" shouted Oliver. \n\nThey gathered around the central screen. It showed a riddle: \"I am tall when I\u2019m young, and short when I\u2019m old. What am I?\" \n\nTheo grinned. \"That's a candle! I know the answer!\"\n\n\"Great job, Theo!\" Ava said. She pressed the button for 'CANDLE'. \n\nThe room filled with light, and a key appeared! \n\n\"Yes!\" Oliver cheered. \"We did it!\"\n\nBut they had no time to celebrate. The door shook as the Time Enforcement Officer pounded on it. \"They're in there! I can hear them!\" \n\n\"Run!\" Ava yelled, grabbing the key.\n\nThey dashed out the back door, just as the officer burst through. \"You can't escape!\" he shouted. \n\nWith the key in their hands, they raced back to the time machine. They had made progress, but they knew the biggest challenge was still ahead.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\"Let\u2019s fix the time machine and get home!\" Oliver declared. Hope sparked in their hearts as they hurried to the machine, ready for the next adventure.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Oliver and his friends need to get from the Sky Tower?","options":["A robot","A time machine","A key","An ice cream"],"correct_answer":"A key"},{"question":"What does Zippy help Oliver and his friends find?","options":["A shortcut","An ice cream shop","A time portal","A game"],"correct_answer":"A shortcut"},{"question":"What riddle do they solve to get the key?","options":["What is a robot?","What is a candle?","What is a puzzle?","What is time?"],"correct_answer":"What is a candle?"},{"question":"Who chases Oliver and his classmates?","options":["A friendly robot","A time enforcement officer","A teacher","A cat"],"correct_answer":"A time enforcement officer"},{"question":"What do they need the key for?","options":["To open a door","To fix the time machine","To ride in a flying car","To play a game"],"correct_answer":"To fix the time machine"}]},"images":null,"word_count":458,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
