   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_317_11_14","title":"The Clockwork Chronicles","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Time Travel","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Oliver\u2019s heart raced as he stood in front of the enormous, gleaming time machine, its chrome surface reflecting the bright fluorescent lights of the school auditorium. Today was supposed to be an ordinary field trip to the Tech Expo, but Oliver had a surprise in store. With a flick of his wrist, he adjusted the dials on the side of the machine, humming softly to himself. \u201cJust a few tweaks,\u201d he murmured, his eyes sparkling with anticipation.\n\nAva, his best friend and the school's resident tech guru, leaned over his shoulder, her brow furrowed. \"Oliver, are you sure this is a good idea? Last time you messed with the time machine, we ended up with a robotic hamster army!\"\n\n\"It's different this time! I fixed the settings!\" Oliver replied confidently, though inside, he felt a familiar twinge of worry. \"What could possibly go wrong?\"\n\nJust then, Theo burst into the room, a wide grin plastered on his face. \"Hey, guys! What\u2019s happening? Did you finally invent a machine that can make pizza?\"\n\nOliver shot him a look. \u201cNot yet, but I\u2019m working on it!\u201d He turned back to the machine, adjusting a few more switches. \u201cWe\u2019re going to 3023, and it\u2019s going to be amazing!\u201d\n\n\u201c3023? Like, the future?\u201d Theo exclaimed, his eyes lighting up. \u201cCount me in! Can we ride flying cars? Can I see a robot that actually talks?\u201d\n\nBefore Oliver could respond, their teacher, Ms. Hargrove, entered, her eyebrows knitting together as she caught sight of the time machine. \"Oliver, I thought we agreed to stick to the plan. No experiments on field trips.\"\n\n\"But Ms. Hargrove, this is the plan!\" Oliver insisted, his voice a mix of excitement and nerves. \"We can show everyone how time travel works!\"\n\nWith a reluctant sigh, Ms. Hargrove relented, \u201cJust this once, as long as you promise to be careful.\u201d \n\nOliver's face lit up with a grin, and he turned the final dial. The machine hummed to life, lights flashing in a kaleidoscope of colors. \"Here we go! Everyone, grab on tight!\"\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nWith a bright flash and a whirl of sound, the world around them dissolved into a blur of colors and lights. When the colors faded and the noise subsided, the students found themselves standing in the heart of a bustling city, but it was nothing like they had ever seen. Towering buildings shimmered with glass and metal, and above them, flying cars zipped through the air like shooting stars. Talking robots strolled by, engaging in cheerful conversations with each other. \n\n\u201cThis is incredible!\u201d Ava shouted, her eyes wide with wonder. \u201cLook at that! Is that a robot barista?\u201d \n\nBut Oliver didn\u2019t have time to marvel. A shadow loomed over them, and Oliver felt a chill run down his spine. A tall figure in a sharply tailored uniform approached, a stern look on his face. \u201cYou\u2019re not supposed to be here,\u201d the officer said, his voice cold and commanding. \n\n\u201cWhat do you mean? We\u2019re on a field trip!\u201d Theo said, trying to lighten the mood, but his voice trembled slightly. \n\nThe officer didn\u2019t smile. \u201cYou\u2019ve violated the Temporal Travel Code. You\u2019ll need to come with me.\u201d \n\nA sense of dread filled the air. Oliver exchanged glances with Ava and Theo, realizing that their simple field trip had just escalated into a dangerous adventure. They had to fix the time machine and return home before they became part of the future, forever.\n\n\u201cRun!\u201d Oliver shouted, and just like that, their journey began\u2014an epic chase through the vibrant streets of 3023, filled with flying cars, curious robots, and a mystery they had to solve before it was too late.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What year do Oliver and his classmates travel to?","options":["2023","3023","2040","3010"],"correct_answer":"3023"},{"question":"Who is the tech-savvy girl in Oliver's class?","options":["Theo","Ava","Ms. Hargrove","Oliver"],"correct_answer":"Ava"},{"question":"What does the time enforcement officer say to the students?","options":["You\u2019re not supposed to be here.","Welcome to the future!","What are you doing?","I love robots."],"correct_answer":"You\u2019re not supposed to be here."},{"question":"What does Oliver hope to do with the time machine?","options":["Make pizza","Show how time travel works","Escape the future","Fix the future"],"correct_answer":"Show how time travel works"},{"question":"What does Oliver feel when the officer approaches?","options":["Excitement","Bravery","Dread","Joy"],"correct_answer":"Dread"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_317_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_317_ch1_img1.png","plot_317_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":621,"reading_level":"Builder"}
