   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_318_7_10","title":"The Secret of the Starlight Tree","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Time Travel","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"In a quiet town, two twins lived in a cozy little house. Leo was brave and full of ideas. His sister, Lily, was thoughtful and kind. They did everything together, from playing games to exploring the world around them.\n\nOne sunny day, they decided to explore the forest behind their house. The forest was magical, filled with tall trees and colorful flowers. As they walked, Leo spotted something shining through the leaves. \n\n\u201cLook, Lily!\u201d he called, his eyes wide with excitement. \u201cWhat is that?\u201d\n\nLily followed Leo and gasped. \u201cIt looks like a tree made of stars!\u201d \n\nIn front of them stood the Starlight Tree. Its branches sparkled like the night sky. The air around the tree felt warm and inviting.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s beautiful!\u201d said Lily, touching the bark. \"I wonder if it\u2019s magical.\"\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find out!\u201d Leo said with a grin. Together, they stepped closer. As they touched the tree, they heard a soft whisper.\n\n\u201cWelcome, brave explorers,\u201d the tree said. \u201cYou can travel to moments in your family\u2019s history.\u201d\n\n\u201cWow! That sounds amazing!\u201d exclaimed Leo.\n\n\u201cBut be careful,\u201d the tree warned. \u201cYou may discover secrets that could change everything.\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat kind of secrets?\u201d Lily asked, her voice trembling.\n\n\u201cSecrets from the past,\u201d the tree replied. \u201cAre you ready?\u201d\n\n\u201cI am!\u201d Leo shouted.\n\nLily hesitated. \u201cWhat if we see something scary?\u201d\n\nLeo smiled. \u201cWe can face it together! Right, Lily?\u201d\n\n\u201cRight!\u201d she said, feeling brave. They held hands tightly and nodded.\n\nIn a flash of light, they suddenly found themselves in a bustling town square. People were dressed in old-fashioned clothes. A tall woman with kind eyes waved at them. It was Grandma Rose!\n\n\u201cLeo! Lily! I\u2019ve been waiting for you!\u201d she said with a smile. \n\nThey looked at each other, surprised. \u201cYou knew we would come?\u201d asked Lily.\n\n\u201cOf course! There are stories to share and lessons to learn,\u201d Grandma Rose replied. \n\nBut just then, a shadow passed over the square. Leo\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d\n\n\u201cI think we need to find out,\u201d Lily said, her voice shaking a little.\n\nThe tree\u2019s warning echoed in their minds. What secrets would they uncover? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cStay close to me,\u201d Grandma Rose said. They stepped forward, ready to discover the mystery.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Leo and Lily discover in the forest?","options":["A talking animal","A magical tree","A hidden cave","A treasure chest"],"correct_answer":"A magical tree"},{"question":"Who do the twins meet when they travel in time?","options":["Their mother","Grandma Rose","A famous explorer","A talking tree"],"correct_answer":"Grandma Rose"},{"question":"What does the Starlight Tree warn the twins about?","options":["To not touch it","To be careful of secrets","To run away","To tell no one"],"correct_answer":"To be careful of secrets"},{"question":"What feeling does Lily have about exploring?","options":["Excitement","Fear","Anger","Sadness"],"correct_answer":"Fear"},{"question":"What does Leo say to encourage Lily?","options":["Let\u2019s go home","We can face it together","I\u2019m scared too","What if we get lost?"],"correct_answer":"We can face it together"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_318_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_318_ch1_img1.png","plot_318_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":380,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
