   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_318_7_10","title":"The Secret of the Starlight Tree","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Time Travel","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Chapter 3: The Shadow's Secret\n\nThe forest felt alive around Leo and Lily. The leaves whispered secrets, and the wind danced through the branches. Standing in front of the Starlight Tree, they felt a mix of excitement and fear. \n\n\u201cDo you think we can trust Grandma Rose?\u201d Leo asked, scratching his head.\n\n\u201cI think so,\u201d Lily replied softly. \u201cBut that shadow... it looked really scary.\u201d\n\nJust then, as if it heard them, the shadow flickered between the trees. It was tall and dark, like a storm cloud. Leo and Lily exchanged worried glances. \n\n\u201cWe have to find out what it wants,\u201d Leo said bravely. \u201cLet\u2019s go back and ask Grandma Rose.\u201d\n\nThey hurried back to the tree. Grandma Rose was waiting for them, her gentle eyes full of wisdom. \u201cWhat troubles you, my dear twins?\u201d she asked.\n\n\u201cThe shadow is back!\u201d Lily exclaimed. \u201cWhat does it mean?\u201d\n\nGrandma Rose sighed. \u201cIn our family, shadows hold memories. Some are happy, and some are not. But they are all important.\u201d\n\nLeo looked concerned. \u201cWhat if the shadow shows us something bad? Will it break us apart?\u201d\n\n\u201cIt might, but understanding is the key,\u201d Grandma Rose said. \u201cYou must face it together.\u201d\n\nLily took a deep breath. \u201cOkay. Let\u2019s do it.\u201d\n\nThey gathered their courage and held hands. \u201cShow us what you want,\u201d Leo called out. Suddenly, the shadow swirled around them. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe tree began to glow, and they were pulled into a bright light. They landed in a new scene, but it was dark and stormy. In front of them, they saw a younger version of Grandma Rose arguing with a man. \n\n\u201cWhy won\u2019t you listen?\u201d Grandma Rose shouted. \u201cThis is our family\u2019s future!\u201d\n\nThe man shook his head. \u201cYou can\u2019t change the past, Rose!\u201d\n\nLily gasped. \u201cWhat is happening?\u201d \n\nGrandma Rose turned to them, her face serious. \u201cThis is the moment when our family split apart. You must learn why.\u201d\n\nJust then, the shadow loomed closer, wrapping around the scene. Leo felt a chill. \u201cLily, I don\u2019t like this!\u201d\n\nLily squeezed Leo\u2019s hand. \u201cWe can\u2019t leave now. We need to know!\u201d\n\nThe shadow darkened, and a loud voice echoed, \u201cWill you stand together, or will you let the darkness win?\u201d\n\nLeo and Lily looked at each other. They had to decide. \n\n\u201cWe\u2019ll stand together!\u201d they shouted in unison. \n\nBut would it be enough?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Leo and Lily want to learn about?","options":["The shadow","The Starlight Tree","Their family history","The forest"],"correct_answer":"Their family history"},{"question":"What does Grandma Rose say about shadows?","options":["They are scary","They hold memories","They are magical","They are just darkness"],"correct_answer":"They hold memories"},{"question":"What do Leo and Lily decide to do when faced with the shadow?","options":["Run away","Face it together","Ignore it","Go home"],"correct_answer":"Face it together"},{"question":"What does the shadow represent in the story?","options":["Happiness","Family secrets","Adventure","Light"],"correct_answer":"Family secrets"},{"question":"What does Grandma Rose do in the memory they see?","options":["Cooks dinner","Argues with a man","Plays with children","Sings a song"],"correct_answer":"Argues with a man"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_318_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_318_ch3_img1.png","plot_318_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":402,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
