   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_318_7_10","title":"The Secret of the Starlight Tree","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Time Travel","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Leo and Lily stood beneath the shining Starlight Tree. Its branches sparkled like diamonds in the sun. They felt a warm breeze, as if the tree was welcoming them. \n\n\u201cDo you think Grandma Rose will help us understand the shadow?\u201d Leo asked, nervously.\n\nLily nodded. \u201cShe knows all the secrets. Let\u2019s find out!\u201d\n\nThey took a deep breath and reached for the tree\u2019s glowing bark. Instantly, the world around them swirled into a colorful blur. Then, with a gentle thud, they landed in a bright garden filled with flowers. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cWow! Look at all the colors!\u201d Lily exclaimed, her eyes wide with wonder. \n\nJust then, Grandma Rose appeared, her silver hair glimmering in the sunlight. \u201cWelcome! You are here to see a very important moment,\u201d she said, her voice soft but filled with strength. \n\n\u201cWhat moment?\u201d asked Leo, curious. \n\n\u201cFollow me,\u201d Grandma Rose said, leading them through the garden. They walked until they reached a tall, wooden door hidden among the flowers. \n\n\u201cThis door leads to a memory,\u201d Grandma Rose explained. \u201cA memory that changed our family forever.\u201d\n\nLily felt nervous. \u201cWhat if it\u2019s scary?\u201d \n\n\u201cTogether, we can face anything,\u201d Leo said, squeezing her hand.\n\nWith a flick of her wrist, Grandma Rose opened the door. Inside, they saw a room filled with laughter and love. Family members were sharing stories around a big table. \n\nSuddenly, a dark shadow crept into the room. It whispered, \u201cLeave! You don\u2019t belong here!\u201d The family members looked sad and confused. \n\n\u201cNo!\u201d shouted Grandma Rose, stepping forward. \u201cThis is our family! We will not let you break our bond!\u201d\n\nLeo and Lily felt a spark of courage. \u201cWe believe in our family!\u201d they shouted together.\n\nThe shadow flickered, surprised by their voices. Slowly, it began to fade away. The family members looked relieved. \n\n\u201cThank you for believing in us!\u201d Grandma Rose smiled, tears of joy sparkling in her eyes. \n\n\u201cCan we see more?\u201d Leo asked, feeling hopeful. \n\n\u201cOf course! There are more memories to uncover,\u201d Grandma Rose replied.\n\nWith that, they stepped back into the garden, ready for their next adventure.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find the next door,\u201d Lily said, her heart racing with excitement.\n\n\u201cTogether!\u201d Leo cheered, and they set off hand in hand, ready for whatever came next.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Leo and Lily find under the Starlight Tree?","options":["A dark shadow","A glowing door","A big flower","A wooden table"],"correct_answer":"A glowing door"},{"question":"Who helps Leo and Lily understand the shadow?","options":["Their parents","Their friends","Grandma Rose","A fairy"],"correct_answer":"Grandma Rose"},{"question":"What do Leo and Lily shout to confront the shadow?","options":["Leave us alone!","You can\u2019t scare us!","We believe in our family!","Go away, shadow!"],"correct_answer":"We believe in our family!"},{"question":"What feeling do Leo and Lily experience when they see the family members?","options":["Fear","Joy","Anger","Sadness"],"correct_answer":"Joy"},{"question":"What do Leo and Lily decide to do next?","options":["Go home","Find the next door","Leave the garden","Eat lunch"],"correct_answer":"Find the next door"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_318_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_318_ch4_img1.png","plot_318_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":382,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
