   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_318_7_10","title":"The Secret of the Starlight Tree","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Time Travel","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"As the sun began to set, Leo and Lily stood in front of the Starlight Tree. Its branches sparkled with twinkling lights. \"Are you ready for our next adventure?\" Leo asked, his eyes wide with excitement. \n\nLily nodded, feeling a mix of nerves and joy. \"I hope we find something good this time!\" she replied. Grandma Rose stood nearby, her smile warm and reassuring. \"Remember, children, to listen to what the past has to say.\"\n\nWith a deep breath, they stepped closer to the tree. The leaves rustled, and a soft glow enveloped them. In an instant, they were whisked away to a bustling town square filled with people in old-fashioned clothes. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\"Wow! Look at everyone!\" Leo exclaimed, pointing at a group of children playing with wooden toys.\n\n\u201cThose are your great-great-grandparents,\u201d Grandma Rose explained. \u201cBut there\u2019s something important you need to see.\u201d\n\nFollowing Grandma Rose, Leo and Lily walked through the crowd. They noticed a tall man with a serious face arguing with their great-great-grandmother. \u201cWhy is he so angry?\u201d Lily asked quietly.\n\n\u201cBecause he\u2019s hiding something,\u201d Grandma Rose whispered. Just then, the crowd hushed, and all eyes were on the man. \u201cI will not let this family secret break us!\u201d he shouted.\n\nLily grabbed Leo's hand. \u201cWhat secret?\u201d she whispered. Just then, the man motioned to a shiny box beside him. \u201cYou can\u2019t understand! This is our past!\u201d \n\nSuddenly, the man turned and stormed away. The box glimmered in the sunlight. Leo stepped forward, curiosity buzzing in his mind. \u201cWe have to see what\u2019s inside!\u201d \n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, Leo,\u201d Lily said, biting her lip. \u201cWhat if it\u2019s something scary?\u201d \n\n\u201cWe won\u2019t know until we look!\u201d Leo replied, his voice full of bravery. Grandma Rose nodded, encouraging them. \u201cTrust your instincts.\u201d\n\nWith a deep breath, they opened the box together. Inside, they found letters and pictures. Each one told stories of love, bravery, and forgiveness. \n\nLily\u2019s eyes sparkled with tears. \u201cThey faced their fears, just like us!\u201d she exclaimed. Leo smiled, feeling their bond grow stronger. \u201cWe can face anything together, Lily!\u201d \n\nAs their adventure came to an end, Grandma Rose said, \u201cYou\u2019ve learned that family strength comes from honesty. Keep this lesson close to your hearts.\u201d \n\nWith one last look at the bustling town square, Leo and Lily stepped back into the glow of the Starlight Tree, feeling a sense of unity and strength. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe journey had changed them, and they were ready for whatever came next.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who do Leo and Lily meet in the past?","options":["Their great-great-grandparents","Their future selves","A talking animal","A wizard"],"correct_answer":"Their great-great-grandparents"},{"question":"What important lesson do Leo and Lily learn?","options":["To hide secrets","To face their fears","To run away","To ignore the past"],"correct_answer":"To face their fears"},{"question":"What does Grandma Rose encourage Leo and Lily to trust?","options":["Their instincts","Their toys","Their parents","Their friends"],"correct_answer":"Their instincts"},{"question":"What do Leo and Lily find inside the shiny box?","options":["Toys","Food","Letters and pictures","Treasure"],"correct_answer":"Letters and pictures"},{"question":"How do Leo and Lily feel by the end of the chapter?","options":["Scared","Alone","Closer together","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Closer together"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_318_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_318_ch5_img1.png","plot_318_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":422,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
