   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_318_11_14","title":"The Secret of the Starlight Tree","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Time Travel","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"As the sun dipped below the horizon, painting the sky in hues of orange and purple, Leo and Lily stood before the Starlight Tree, its ancient bark shimmering with twinkling lights. They could feel the air thickening with magic, an electric anticipation coursing through them. \u201cThis tree\u2026 it feels like it\u2019s alive,\u201d Leo whispered, his eyes wide with wonder.\n\nLily nodded, running her fingers along the glowing bark. \u201cWhat if it really does show us our past?\u201d She felt both exhilarated and terrified at the thought. \u201cAre we ready for that?\u201d\n\nBefore Leo could respond, a sudden gust of wind rustled the leaves, whispering secrets they couldn\u2019t quite grasp. \u201cLet\u2019s do it,\u201d he said, determination filling his voice. \u201cWe can handle whatever we find.\u201d \n\n\u201cTogether,\u201d Lily added, feeling a surge of courage as she took her brother's hand. With a deep breath, they stepped closer to the tree, where the lights swirled in a mesmerizing dance. Suddenly, the air shimmered, and the world around them began to dissolve into a haze of colors.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe sensation was like floating on a cloud, and in an instant, they were no longer in the forest. The twins found themselves in a bustling village, the sound of laughter and chatter ringing in their ears. They were standing in front of a modest wooden cottage. \u201cThis must be one of our ancestors\u2019 homes!\u201d Leo exclaimed, his heart racing.\n\nAs they wandered through the village, they noticed how vibrant everything was. Children played in the street, their laughter mingling with the aroma of freshly baked bread. But there was something else in the air\u2014tension, as palpable as the warmth of the sun. It made Lily\u2019s stomach twist uncomfortably. \u201cDo you feel that? Something isn\u2019t right.\u201d\n\nLeo shrugged, too captivated by the scene to notice. \u201cLet\u2019s talk to someone!\u201d He spotted a young girl their age, her hair a mess of curls. \u201cHey!\u201d he called. \u201cCan you tell us about this place?\u201d\n\nThe girl turned, her green eyes widening in surprise. \u201cWho are you?\u201d she asked, eyeing them suspiciously.\n\n\u201cI\u2019m Leo, and this is my sister, Lily. We\u2019re\u2026 visiting,\u201d Leo replied, trying to sound casual.\n\n\u201cVisiting?\u201d The girl crossed her arms. \u201cYou\u2019re not from around here, are you? This is Green Hollow, but it\u2019s not safe anymore.\u201d\n\nLily glanced at Leo, alarmed. \u201cWhat do you mean?\u201d\n\n\u201cThe mayor has been acting strange,\u201d the girl explained, lowering her voice as if the very walls were listening. \u201cThere are rumors of a dark secret hidden within our village. People are disappearing, and everyone is afraid.\u201d Her eyes darted around nervously.\n\n\u201cDisappearing?\u201d Lily felt a chill crawl up her spine. \u201cWhat kind of secret?\u201d\n\nBefore the girl could answer, a loud crash echoed from the town square, followed by frantic shouting. Leo and Lily exchanged worried glances. \u201cWe should check that out!\u201d Leo said, excitement mingling with concern.\n\nThey hurried toward the noise, weaving through the crowd. As they reached the square, a tall figure stood in the center, shadowy and imposing, surrounded by villagers who looked both fearful and desperate. Leo felt an unsettling sense of dread creeping into his heart. \n\n\u201cStay close,\u201d he whispered to Lily, gripping her hand tightly. \u201cWe can\u2019t lose each other.\u201d\n\nWith each heartbeat, the tension mounted. What dark secret lay within this village, and how did it relate to their family? As they pressed closer, they knew they were on the brink of a revelation that could alter not just their perception of the past, but their entire future.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Leo urged, just as the crowd erupted into chaos, and the twins were swept along, their hearts pounding in sync with the fear swirling around them.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Leo and Lily discover about the village they visit?","options":["It is peaceful and happy.","There is a dark secret affecting the villagers.","It is a future version of their town.","Everyone knows their family."],"correct_answer":"There is a dark secret affecting the villagers."},{"question":"How does Leo feel about exploring the past?","options":["Excited and brave","Nervous and scared","Uninterested","Confused"],"correct_answer":"Excited and brave"},{"question":"What specific event do Leo and Lily witness in the village?","options":["A celebration","A dark figure causing chaos","A historical reenactment","A family reunion"],"correct_answer":"A dark figure causing chaos"},{"question":"What do Lily and Leo promise each other as they face new challenges?","options":["To run away if things get scary","To stay together no matter what","To find their ancestors","To never come back to the tree"],"correct_answer":"To stay together no matter what"},{"question":"How does Lily feel when she learns about the tension in the village?","options":["Excited","Comfortable","Chilled","Indifferent"],"correct_answer":"Chilled"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_318_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_318_ch2_img1.png","plot_318_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":631,"reading_level":"Builder"}
