   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_318_11_14","title":"The Secret of the Starlight Tree","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Time Travel","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"As the sun dipped low behind the Starlight Tree, casting long shadows across the forest floor, Leo and Lily huddled under the sprawling branches, their hearts racing with anticipation. Memories of the Festival of Truth still buzzed in their minds\u2014whispers of secrets, family rifts, and Grandma Rose\u2019s cryptic warnings. \"We have to figure this out, Leo,\" Lily said, her voice steady but laced with anxiety. \"We can\u2019t let the truth tear us apart.\"\n\nLeo nodded, determination setting his jaw. \u201cBut where do we even start? The villagers were so afraid of what they might uncover. What if we\u2019re not ready for whatever lies ahead?\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a soft glow began to emanate from the tree, illuminating their surroundings with a shimmering light. The air shimmered like stars scattered across the night sky. \"Look!\" Lily exclaimed, her eyes widening. The glow pulsed like a heartbeat, beckoning them closer. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they stepped toward the light, memories of Grandma Rose\u2019s tales flooded back. The stories of courage and sacrifice echoed in Leo\u2019s mind, filling him with hope. \u201cMaybe we can find out more about her past,\u201d he suggested. \u201cShe must have faced similar challenges.\u201d\n\nWith a shared glance, they grasped each other\u2019s hands and stepped into the light, feeling a familiar tug as they were transported through a whirling tunnel of colors. When they landed, they found themselves in a quaint cottage, its walls lined with books and the scent of baking bread wafting through the air. A younger version of Grandma Rose was busy stirring a pot on the stove, her hair a bright chestnut and her laughter ringing like music.\n\n\u201cWho knew Grandma was once so... cheerful!\u201d Leo whispered, a smile creeping onto his face.\n\nLily\u2019s gaze drifted around the room, and she spotted a wooden box tucked in a corner. \u201cWhat do you think is inside?\u201d she asked, her curiosity piqued. \n\nBefore Leo could respond, a loud bang echoed from outside the door. The twins exchanged worried glances as the door swung open to reveal a group of villagers, their faces twisted in fear. \u201cThe rumors are spreading, Rose! They say you\u2019re hiding something!\u201d one of them shouted, his voice trembling.\n\nLily squeezed Leo's hand, her heart pounding. This was the moment they needed. They had to understand what Grandma Rose had faced. Rushing forward, they called out, \u201cWait! We want to help!\u201d\n\nGrandma Rose turned, her eyes widening at the sight of her grandchildren. \u201cLeo! Lily! You shouldn\u2019t be here!\u201d she exclaimed, panic flooding her voice. \n\n\u201cWhy do you care what they say?\u201d Leo shouted, stepping closer. \u201cYou have to tell us the truth!\u201d \n\nThe villagers turned their gazes on the twins, uncertainty flickering in their eyes. The tension in the room thickened, and Lily felt her chest tighten. This was the critical moment\u2014the choice to confront the past or run away from it.\n\nAs Grandma Rose hesitated, the atmosphere tangibly shifted, and the twins braced themselves for whatever revelation lay ahead.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cI never wanted you to know,\u201d Grandma Rose finally confessed, her voice barely above a whisper. \u201cBut there\u2019s a history between our families that could change everything.\u201d\n\n\u201cThen tell us!\u201d Leo urged, his voice steady despite the storm of emotions swirling within him.\n\nAs the room grew silent, it became clear that this was the turning point. The secrets of the Starlight Tree, of their family, were on the brink of being unveiled.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Leo and Lily see when they approach the Starlight Tree?","options":["A dark shadow","A glowing light","A rainbow","A portal"],"correct_answer":"A glowing light"},{"question":"What does Grandma Rose react to when she sees Leo and Lily?","options":["Joy","Panic","Indifference","Anger"],"correct_answer":"Panic"},{"question":"What is the main conflict in this chapter?","options":["Finding the Starlight Tree","Confronting family secrets","Planning a festival","Baking bread"],"correct_answer":"Confronting family secrets"},{"question":"What did Lily want to explore in the cottage?","options":["The attic","A wooden box","The garden","A bookshelf"],"correct_answer":"A wooden box"},{"question":"What do Leo and Lily ask Grandma Rose to do?","options":["Bake with them","Tell them the truth","Leave the cottage","Ignore the villagers"],"correct_answer":"Tell them the truth"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_318_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_318_ch4_img1.png","plot_318_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":581,"reading_level":"Builder"}
