   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_318_15_18","title":"The Secret of the Starlight Tree","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Time Travel","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"The air hung heavy with the scent of damp earth and moss as Leo and Lily stood before the Starlight Tree, its luminescent leaves shimmering in a kaleidoscope of colors. They had returned to the forest\u2014their sanctuary and a portal to the past. The tree's branches swayed gently, as if beckoning them forward. The enchanting glow illuminated their faces, revealing a blend of excitement and trepidation. \n\n\u201cDo you think we\u2019re ready for this?\u201d Leo asked, his voice barely above a whisper.\n\nLily\u2019s gaze was fixed on the tree, her thoughts swirling like the leaves above. \u201cWe have to be. We can\u2019t turn back now\u2014not after what we saw. Grandma Rose needs us.\u201d\n\nWith a shared nod, they took each other\u2019s hands and stepped into the tree\u2019s radiant light. Moments later, they emerged into a vibrant scene from the past, where a younger version of Grandma Rose, radiant and full of life, stood in a quaint garden filled with blooming flowers. Laughter echoed in the air, but the moment quickly turned tense as the shadowy figure from their previous journey lurked at the edge of the scene, hidden yet palpable.\n\n\u201cWho is that?\u201d Leo asked, his heart racing.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but it feels like a warning,\u201d Lily replied, her brow furrowed in concern. \n\nThey approached their grandmother, who was tending to the flowers, her hands gentle yet purposeful. \u201cI\u2019ve seen you, my darlings,\u201d she said suddenly, without turning. \u201cYou must be careful. The truth can be as dangerous as it is enlightening.\u201d\n\nJust then, the shadow stepped forward, revealing a gaunt face twisted with malice. \u201cYou think you can change the past, Rose? You think you will escape the secrets that bind you?\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] \n\nLeo felt an icy shiver run down his spine. The figure\u2019s presence was suffocating, a palpable weight that pressed against the joy of the garden. \u201cWhat does he mean?\u201d he whispered to Lily, who shook her head, her eyes wide with fear.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but we can\u2019t let him intimidate us,\u201d she said resolutely, her voice strengthening with determination. \n\n\u201cGrandma, who is he?\u201d Leo called out, desperate for answers.\n\nThe younger Rose turned toward them, her gaze fierce yet tinged with sadness. \u201cHe is a part of our history, a reflection of what we try to hide. You must uncover his truth, but be warned\u2014some truths can tear families apart.\u201d\n\nAt that moment, the shadow lunged, and the garden twisted. Flowers withered, colors faded, and the vibrant scene morphed into a cold, dark landscape of tangled roots and decay. Leo and Lily stumbled backward, panic flooding their senses. \n\n\u201cFind the heart of the tree!\u201d Rose\u2019s voice echoed around them. \u201cOnly then can you confront what he represents!\u201d\n\nWith a sudden surge of clarity, Leo locked eyes with Lily. \u201cWe need to get to the Starlight Tree! It\u2019s the only way we can save her\u2014and ourselves!\u201d \n\nAs they sprinted through the darkness, the shadow taunted them, its voice echoing like thunder. \u201cYou cannot escape your legacy! It will consume you!\u201d\n\nThey reached the heart of the tree. Its trunk pulsated with a soft glow, almost like a heartbeat. \u201cLeo, grab the light!\u201d Lily shouted, pointing at the shimmering core that seemed to beckon them closer.\n\nAs Leo reached out, the shadow surged forward, a torrent of darkness threatening to engulf them. Just as his fingers brushed the illuminated bark, Leo felt an electric shock surge through him, a connection that transcended time. \n\nIn that instant, flashes of memories filled his mind\u2014his family\u2019s joys, sorrows, and the secrets buried deep beneath their stories. \n\nThe shadow screamed, a sound that reverberated through the air. \u201cYou think you can rewrite history? You will regret this!\u201d\n\nWith a final surge of courage, Leo and Lily grasped the light together, feeling its warmth envelop them. But the shadow\u2019s laughter echoed ominously, promising that this was only the beginning.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAnd as they were pulled back through the shimmering portal of the Starlight Tree, they exchanged a lingering glance, a wordless agreement that the confrontation was far from over. They were bound by blood\u2014and the shadows of their past would not easily let them go.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What warning does Grandma Rose give to Leo and Lily?","options":["The truth can be dangerous","The shadow will protect them","They should ignore the past","They cannot trust each other"],"correct_answer":"The truth can be dangerous"},{"question":"What does the shadow figure represent in the story?","options":["Hope","Fear","Family legacy","Adventure"],"correct_answer":"Family legacy"},{"question":"What do Leo and Lily do to confront the shadow?","options":["Run away","Ignore it","Grab the light of the Starlight Tree","Call for help"],"correct_answer":"Grab the light of the Starlight Tree"},{"question":"How does the environment change when the shadow appears?","options":["Everything becomes colorful","The scene turns dark and twisted","It starts to rain","The forest becomes silent"],"correct_answer":"The scene turns dark and twisted"},{"question":"What is the main decision Leo and Lily must make at the end of the chapter?","options":["To give up their quest","To confront their family's history","To seek help from others","To stay in the past"],"correct_answer":"To confront their family's history"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_318_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_318_ch3_img1.png","plot_318_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":715,"reading_level":"Challenger"}
