eople freeze in mid-motion, unaware of the impending change, highlighting the fragile balance between chaos and control.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_319_ch2_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 14:43:06"}}}
