   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_319_7_10","title":"Robo-Rewind: Adventures in Time","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Time Travel","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Sam loved exploring his grandfather's garage. It was like a treasure chest filled with old toys, rusty tools, and dusty boxes. Today, though, something shiny caught his eye.\n\n\u201cWhoa!\u201d Sam said, rushing toward it. He wiped away the dust and revealed a small robot. It had big, round eyes and a goofy smile. \u201cWhat are you doing here?\u201d he asked.\n\nJust then, the robot's eyes blinked. \u201cHello! I am Sparky!\u201d it said with a cheerful beep. Sam jumped back. \u201cYou can talk?\u201d\n\n\u201cYes! I can also help you with time travel!\u201d Sparky exclaimed, doing a little dance. Sam\u2019s heart raced. Time travel? \u201cCan you really take me back in time?\u201d\n\n\u201cYes! I can rewind time by ten minutes. But you must use it wisely!\u201d Sparky warned, waving its mechanical arms.\n\nSam scratched his head. \u201cWhat kind of trouble could I get into in just ten minutes?\u201d He grinned at the thought. He would test Sparky\u2019s powers.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cOkay, Sparky! Let\u2019s try it!\u201d Sam said. They stood in the garage, buzzing with excitement. \u201cWhat should we do first?\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go to school!\u201d Sparky suggested. Sam remembered the big science project due today. \u201cI forgot to bring my poster!\u201d he shouted.\n\nOn the way to school, Sam tripped over his untied shoelaces and fell. \u201cOuch!\u201d he exclaimed. \u201cI should have tied my shoes!\u201d\n\n\u201cUse my time rewind!\u201d Sparky said. \u201cYou won\u2019t fall if you go back!\u201d Sam nodded eagerly. He hadn\u2019t thought of that!\n\n\u201cAlright, let\u2019s do it!\u201d he shouted. With a quick press of a button on Sparky\u2019s head, everything around him spun. Colors whirled like a crazy rainbow. In a flash, Sam found himself standing in front of his house again.\n\n\u201cWow! It worked!\u201d Sam laughed. He tied his shoes tightly this time and bounced down the street. \u201cThanks, Sparky!\u201d\n\nAs they arrived at school, Sam felt confident. But then he noticed Mia, his best friend, looking worried. \u201cSam, I can\u2019t find my notes for the project! The presentation is in five minutes!\u201d she cried.\n\n\u201cOh no! What can we do?\u201d Sam asked. Sparky beeped excitedly. \u201cTime rewind!\u201d he said. Sam thought for a moment. What if he rewound time for Mia, too?\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s do it!\u201d he declared. Sam pressed the button again, and they whirled back in time. But what would happen next?\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Sparky say he can do?","options":["Fly in the sky","Rewind time","Make ice cream","Turn invisible"],"correct_answer":"Rewind time"},{"question":"What does Sam trip over on the way to school?","options":["A toy","A rock","His shoelaces","A dog"],"correct_answer":"His shoelaces"},{"question":"Who is Sam's best friend?","options":["Tina","Mia","Liam","Ella"],"correct_answer":"Mia"},{"question":"What does Mia lose?","options":["Her lunch","Her notes","Her pencil","Her backpack"],"correct_answer":"Her notes"},{"question":"What does Sam do to help Mia?","options":["He rewinds time","He finds her notes","He gives her a hug","He eats her lunch"],"correct_answer":"He rewinds time"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_319_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_319_ch1_img1.png","plot_319_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":397,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
