   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_319_7_10","title":"Robo-Rewind: Adventures in Time","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Time Travel","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Chapter 2: The Great Project Panic\n\nSam couldn\u2019t wait to help Mia. He rushed over to her house after school. It was a cozy place with a bright blue door and flowers in the garden. Sam found Mia sitting on her porch, looking worried.\n\n\u201cHey, Mia! What\u2019s wrong?\u201d Sam asked.\n\n\u201cI lost my notes for the science project!\u201d Mia cried. \u201cThe report is due tomorrow!\u201d\n\nSam scratched his head. \u201cWhat if we rewind time? We can go back to when you had them!\u201d\n\nMia\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cCan we really? That sounds amazing!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s ask Sparky!\u201d Sam said, grinning. He took Mia to his garage, where Sparky was busy polishing his shiny metal arms.\n\n\u201cHey, Sparky! Mia lost her notes. Can you help us rewind time?\u201d Sam asked excitedly.\n\nSparky\u2019s eyes blinked. \u201cRewind time? I can do that! Just press my shiny button!\u201d\n\nSam pointed to the big red button on Sparky\u2019s chest. With a deep breath, he pressed it. \u201cLet\u2019s go back ten minutes!\u201d\n\nIn a flash, the world swirled around them. The garage faded, and suddenly they were back outside Mia\u2019s house. \u201cDid it work?\u201d Mia asked, looking around.\n\n\u201cYes! Let\u2019s hurry!\u201d Sam said. They dashed to Mia\u2019s backpack. \n\nBut when they opened it\u2014no notes! \u201cOh no! They\u2019re still not here!\u201d Mia exclaimed.\n\nSam felt his heart race. \u201cWhat now?\u201d\n\nSuddenly, Sparky beeped. \u201cRewind again!\u201d\n\n\u201cOkay!\u201d Sam said. He pressed the button again. The world spun once more. \n\nThey landed back at Mia\u2019s house. Sam thought hard. \u201cMaybe we can remember where you last had them. Try your room!\u201d \n\n\u201cRight!\u201d Mia ran inside, and Sam followed. \n\nThere, on her desk, were the glowing notes! \u201cYes!\u201d Mia shouted. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nBut just then, the door creaked open. It was Mia\u2019s little brother, Timmy, holding a jar of glitter. \u201cWhat\u2019s going on?\u201d he asked.\n\n\u201cTimmy! No! Don\u2019t touch that!\u201d Mia warned. \n\nBut it was too late! Timmy tipped the jar, and glitter flew everywhere! \n\n\u201cOh no!\u201d Sam and Mia shouted in unison. \n\nSparky whirred, \u201cRewind again!\u201d \n\n\u201cI can\u2019t keep doing this!\u201d Sam exclaimed. \u201cWhat if we mess things up even more?\u201d\n\nMia took a deep breath. \u201cWe need to think carefully this time. We can\u2019t just keep rewinding!\u201d\n\nAs glitter sparkled in the air, Sam felt a mix of excitement and fear. \u201cOkay, let\u2019s figure this out together!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Mia lose?","options":["Her book","Her notes","Her pencil","Her backpack"],"correct_answer":"Her notes"},{"question":"What can Sparky do?","options":["Fly","Rewind time","Dance","Sing"],"correct_answer":"Rewind time"},{"question":"What spilled everywhere?","options":["Water","Confetti","Glitter","Sand"],"correct_answer":"Glitter"},{"question":"How does Sam feel about rewinding time?","options":["Excited but worried","Bored","Angry","Confused"],"correct_answer":"Excited but worried"},{"question":"What does Sam suggest they do after finding Mia's notes?","options":["Rewind time again","Think carefully","Play outside","Go home"],"correct_answer":"Think carefully"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_319_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_319_ch2_img1.png","plot_319_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":407,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
