   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_319_7_10","title":"Robo-Rewind: Adventures in Time","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Time Travel","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Sam sat on the floor of his garage, staring at Sparky. The old robot whirred softly, its shiny metal arm twitching. \u201cWhat do we do next?\u201d Sam asked, his heart racing. \n\nMia peeked in through the garage door. \u201cAre you ready for the science fair tomorrow?\u201d she asked, her eyes wide with excitement. \u201cI hope no more glitter disasters happen!\u201d\n\n\u201cRight!\u201d Sam nodded. \u201cWe need to make sure Mia's project is safe. Sparky can help us if anything goes wrong.\u201d \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s practice with Sparky again!\u201d Mia suggested. \u201cBut, this time, let\u2019s be extra careful.\u201d \n\nSam took a deep breath. \u201cOkay, Sparky, let\u2019s rewind time by ten minutes. We need to find those project notes!\u201d \n\nSparky's eyes flashed blue. \u201cRewinding\u2026 now!\u201d The world around them spun like a colorful carousel. In an instant, they were back in front of Mia's messy desk.\n\n\u201cQuick! Grab the notes!\u201d Sam shouted. But just then, Mia\u2019s brother, Jake, burst in with a loud, \u201cSurprise!\u201d \n\nMia gasped. \u201cJake! No!\u201d \n\nBut it was too late. Jake tossed a handful of glitter into the air. It sparkled everywhere! The room was filled with glittery chaos. \n\n\u201cOh no! This is worse than before!\u201d Sam yelled, trying to dodge the flying glitter. \n\n\u201cWait! We need to rewind again!\u201d Mia cried, but Sam was already thinking. If they rewound too many times, would they make things worse? \n\n\u201cMaybe we can fix this without rewinding!\u201d Sam said, spotting a broom in the corner. \u201cMia, can you help me?\u201d \n\nTogether, they swept up the glitter as quickly as they could. Just then, Sparky's voice chimed in, \u201cWarning! Time is running out!\u201d \n\nMia looked at Sam, her eyes filled with worry. \u201cWhat if the judges see this?\u201d \n\n\u201cWe can\u2019t let that happen!\u201d Sam shouted, determination in his voice. They worked faster, but soon the time was almost up. \n\nSuddenly, Sam had an idea. \u201cSparky, can you rewind just a little? Just enough for the judges to miss this mess?\u201d \n\n\u201cRewinding\u2026 five\u2026 four\u2026\u201d Sparky counted down. \n\n\u201cGo, go, go!\u201d Sam and Mia shouted, racing against the clock. \n\nThe room spun again. They held their breath, hoping for the best. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nJust as the spinning stopped, Sam's heart sank. He glanced around. The glitter was still everywhere! \n\n\u201cOh no! I can't believe it!\u201d Sam groaned. \u201cWhat if we can\u2019t fix this in time?\u201d \n\n\u201cSam! We need to think fast!\u201d Mia urged, her eyes wide with worry. \n\n\u201cOkay, let\u2019s try one more time,\u201d Sam decided, feeling the weight of the moment. \u201cBut this time, we can\u2019t just rewind. We need a plan.\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cWhat if we ask Jake to help clean up?\u201d Mia suggested. \u201cHe caused this mess, after all!\u201d \n\nSam nodded, feeling a spark of hope. \u201cAlright! Let\u2019s go!\u201d \n\nAs they dashed out of the garage, Sam knew this was their biggest challenge yet. Would they convince Jake to help? \n\nThe clock was ticking, and the science fair was just around the corner!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What happens when Jake throws glitter?","options":["The room gets messy","Everyone laughs","The judges arrive","Sparky turns off"],"correct_answer":"The room gets messy"},{"question":"What do Sam and Mia decide to do to fix the mess?","options":["Rewind time again","Ask Jake to help","Hide the glitter","Leave it alone"],"correct_answer":"Ask Jake to help"},{"question":"How does Sparky help Sam and Mia?","options":["By cleaning the glitter","By rewinding time","By telling jokes","By hiding in the garage"],"correct_answer":"By rewinding time"},{"question":"What is the main feeling Mia has about the science fair?","options":["Excitement","Fear","Boredom","Indifference"],"correct_answer":"Excitement"},{"question":"What does Sam feel when the time rewinds and the mess remains?","options":["Happiness","Disappointment","Surprise","Joy"],"correct_answer":"Disappointment"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_319_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_319_ch3_img1.png","plot_319_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":498,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
