   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_319_7_10","title":"Robo-Rewind: Adventures in Time","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Time Travel","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Sam and Mia stood outside the school, nervously glancing at the gym. It was filled with colorful banners and loud music. The big science fair was just hours away. Sam clutched Sparky, who beeped and whirred quietly. \n\n\u201cWhat if we can\u2019t fix this?\u201d Mia asked, biting her lip.\n\n\u201cWe can! We just need to talk to Jake,\u201d Sam replied, confidence bubbling in his chest.\n\nJake was the smartest kid in their class. If anyone could help them, it was him. They walked toward the gym, their hearts racing. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nInside the gym, the smell of popcorn and cotton candy filled the air. They spotted Jake, surrounded by his project: a rocket that looked like it could really fly. \n\n\u201cHey, Jake!\u201d Sam called. \u201cCan we talk?\u201d\n\n\u201cSure! What\u2019s up?\u201d Jake replied, looking curious.\n\n\u201cWe have a problem,\u201d Mia said, glancing at Sparky. \u201cIt\u2019s about the science fair. We might need a time rewind!\u201d\n\nJake raised an eyebrow. \u201cWhat do you mean?\u201d\n\nSam explained everything. Mia added, \u201cIf we rewind time just a little, we can fix our mistakes and make everything perfect!\u201d\n\nJake thought for a moment. \u201cBut what if it goes wrong again?\u201d \n\n\u201cThen we\u2019ll just rewind again,\u201d Sam insisted.\n\n\u201cOkay, let\u2019s give it a go!\u201d Jake smiled.\n\nThey gathered in a corner, away from prying eyes. Sam pressed a button on Sparky\u2019s shiny head. The robot\u2019s eyes blinked bright blue. \n\n\u201cRewind in three... two... one!\u201d Sparky beeped.\n\nThe world around them blurred and twisted. Suddenly, they were back ten minutes earlier. \n\n\u201cWow, it worked!\u201d Mia exclaimed, her eyes wide.\n\nBut then, they noticed something strange. The gym was now empty, and the music had stopped. \n\n\u201cUh-oh,\u201d Sam said slowly. \u201cWe did it, but what\u2019s next?\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThey glanced at each other, uncertainty creeping in. \u201cWe still need to help everyone!\u201d Mia said. \u201cWe can do this, right?\u201d\n\n\u201cRight!\u201d Sam said, determination shining in his eyes. \u201cLet\u2019s figure out how to make the fair a success!\u201d\n\nTogether, they rushed to grab the supplies they needed. Every choice mattered now.\n\nAs they worked, the excitement of the fair buzzed around them. Sam felt that maybe\u2014just maybe\u2014they could turn everything around.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What event are Sam, Mia, and Jake preparing for?","options":["A dance","A science fair","A sports game","A birthday party"],"correct_answer":"A science fair"},{"question":"What does Sparky do when Sam presses the button?","options":["Makes a loud noise","Rewinds time","Turns off","Dances"],"correct_answer":"Rewinds time"},{"question":"Who do Sam and Mia ask for help?","options":["Their teacher","Jake","Sam's parents","A stranger"],"correct_answer":"Jake"},{"question":"How do Sam and his friends feel about the time rewind?","options":["Scared","Excited","Bored","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"},{"question":"What is the first thing they notice after rewinding time?","options":["The gym is full of people","They are in a different place","The gym is empty","It's time for lunch"],"correct_answer":"The gym is empty"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_319_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_319_ch4_img1.png","plot_319_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":372,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
