       [DEBUG] Checking shared image: {"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A climactic moment during Sams presentation, where he confidently engages the audience. The background shows Jakes contraption sputtering water, while Sam stands tall, inviting the crowd to participate in the experiment with Mias volcano erupting beside him. The expressions of surprise and joy on the audiences faces create an atmosphere of unity and excitement, symbolizing Sams growth and acceptance of his journey.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_319_ch5_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 14:41:00"}
