   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_319_7_10","title":"Robo-Rewind: Adventures in Time","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Time Travel","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Sam stood in the empty gym, feeling nervous. The science fair was a big deal. Mia and Jake were worried too. \"What do we do now?\" Sam asked. \"We can\u2019t just leave!\" \n\nMia looked around. \"Maybe we can build something quick. Sparky could help!\" Sam nodded, excited. \"Good idea! Let\u2019s use the materials over there!\" He pointed to a pile of cardboard and old science kits.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThey rushed to the pile, gathering everything. Sparky buzzed with energy. \"Let\u2019s make a volcano!\" he chirped. Sam grinned. \"That\u2019s perfect! We can make it erupt with baking soda!\"\n\nTogether, they crafted their volcano, adding bright colors and glitter. Mia laughed, \"This will be the best volcano ever!\" But then, she paused. \"Wait! What if we run out of time again?\"\n\nSam thought hard. \"If we rewind ten minutes again, we can fix any mistakes!\" They all looked at Sparky, who blinked his lights brightly. \"Ready to rewind?\" he asked, sounding eager.\n\n\"Let\u2019s do it!\" Mia said. They all huddled around Sparky. Sam pressed the button, and the world whirled around them. In an instant, they were back to the pile of supplies.\n\n\"Okay, no glitter this time!\" Sam said quickly. They worked faster, sticking things together. The volcano took shape. It looked amazing!\n\nJust as they finished, the gym doors swung open. A teacher walked in. Sam\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWhat if she sees the mess?\u201d he whispered. \n\n\u201cQuick! Hide!\u201d Jake said. They ducked behind the volcano. The teacher looked around, puzzled, then left. They sighed in relief. \n\n\"That was close!\" Sam said, grinning. They high-fived each other. \n\nFinally, the science fair began. Their volcano was a hit! It erupted with colorful foam! Everyone cheered. Sam felt proud. He had learned to use Sparky\u2019s power wisely.  \n\n\u201cThanks, Sparky!\u201d Sam said. The little robot beeped happily. \u201cRemember, every choice matters!\u201d he reminded them.  \n\n\u201cYeah, and we did it together!\u201d Mia said, smiling. \n\nSam knew this was just the beginning of their adventures.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Sam, Mia, and Jake create for the science fair?","options":["A robot","A volcano","A spaceship","A house"],"correct_answer":"A volcano"},{"question":"What did they use to make the volcano erupt?","options":["Water","Glitter","Baking soda","Paint"],"correct_answer":"Baking soda"},{"question":"What happened when the teacher walked in?","options":["They showed her the volcano","They hid behind the volcano","They left the gym","They rewound time again"],"correct_answer":"They hid behind the volcano"},{"question":"What lesson did Sam learn?","options":["To rewind time often","To work alone","To use his power wisely","To ignore friends"],"correct_answer":"To use his power wisely"},{"question":"How did everyone react to the volcano at the fair?","options":["They ignored it","They cheered","They laughed","They ran away"],"correct_answer":"They cheered"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_319_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_319_ch5_img1.png","plot_319_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":336,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
