   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_319_11_14","title":"Robo-Rewind: Adventures in Time","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Time Travel","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Sam stared at the cluttered garage, its dim light filtering through dust-filled windows, casting a golden glow on the forgotten treasures hidden within. His grandfather had always been a collector\u2014old bicycles, rusty tools, and boxes filled with memories. But it was the strange, metallic figure in the corner that caught Sam's eye. \u201cWhat\u2019s this?\u201d he muttered, stepping closer. \n\nThe robot stood about three feet tall, covered in patches of faded paint and a layer of dust. Its eyes flickered with a faint blue light, and Sam felt a spark of curiosity ignite within him. \u201cSparky?\u201d he whispered, brushing aside cobwebs. He had heard stories about this old bot\u2014a relic from his grandfather's workshop, said to have a mind of its own.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cHey, are you alive?\u201d Sam asked, half-joking. Suddenly, the robot sputtered to life, whirring and clicking as it stood upright. Sam jumped back, heart racing. \u201cWhoa! You can talk?\u201d\n\n\u201cAffirmative,\u201d the robot replied in a metallic voice. \u201cSparky at your service. Time to play!\u201d\n\n\u201cPlay?\u201d Sam raised an eyebrow, intrigued. \u201cWhat do you mean?\u201d\n\n\u201cI can rewind time\u2014ten minutes, to be precise. Would you like to try?\u201d Sparky\u2019s eyes blinked eagerly, the light dancing as if it were a child excited about a game.\n\nSam's mind raced. What could he change in just ten minutes? The possibilities felt endless. \u201cAlright, let\u2019s see what you can do,\u201d he said, excitement bubbling in his chest.\n\n\u201cInput command,\u201d Sparky instructed, tilting its head.\n\n\u201cWhat should I change?\u201d Sam pondered. The thought of fixing his last math test, where he had accidentally flipped two answers, crossed his mind. \u201cOkay, rewind so I can fix my math test!\u201d he declared.\n\nWith a whir and a flash, everything around him blurred. The garage faded, and in an instant, he found himself back in his classroom, pencils poised and math equations spread before him. It was as if he had just hit the rewind button on a movie.\n\nBut then, something unexpected happened. As he glanced at his friends, he noticed Mia, his best friend, sitting hunched over her desk, visibly upset. \u201cMia? What\u2019s wrong?\u201d he asked, confusion swirling in his gut.\n\n\u201cI messed up the science project. It\u2019s all wrong, and I don\u2019t know how to fix it,\u201d she sighed, her voice heavy with worry.\n\nSam\u2019s heart sank. He could use Sparky\u2019s power to help her too, but then he would have to choose. Could he split time? What if he messed it up even more? The weight of the decision pressed down on him. He took a deep breath, feeling the tension coil within him.\n\n\u201cI\u2019ll help you,\u201d Sam said, determination sparking in his eyes. \u201cLet\u2019s fix it together. I just need\u2014\u201d\n\nSuddenly, the bell rang, cutting his thoughts short. Sam\u2019s head spun as he found himself back in the garage. He looked at Sparky, who was waiting expectantly.\n\n\u201cDid it work?\u201d the robot asked.\n\n\u201cIt worked, but\u2026 I need to be careful. Changing one thing could lead to a whole lot of chaos,\u201d Sam replied, a mix of exhilaration and dread flooding over him. What had he gotten himself into?\n\nAs he contemplated the challenges ahead, he realized that wielding this power wouldn\u2019t be as easy as he had hoped. He needed to think carefully about each decision, or risk creating a disaster even bigger than the one he was trying to avoid.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go, Sparky. We\u2019ve got work to do,\u201d Sam said, feeling a rush of excitement and trepidation as he stepped into the unknown.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What special ability does Sparky the robot have?","options":["To fly","To rewind time","To cook","To clean"],"correct_answer":"To rewind time"},{"question":"How does Sam feel when he first discovers Sparky?","options":["Bored","Fearful","Excited","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"},{"question":"What problem does Mia have in the classroom?","options":["She lost her pencil","She messed up the science project","She forgot her homework","She got in trouble"],"correct_answer":"She messed up the science project"},{"question":"What does Sam realize about using Sparky's power?","options":["It is easy","It has no consequences","It requires careful thought","It is not useful"],"correct_answer":"It requires careful thought"},{"question":"What is the main setting of Chapter 1?","options":["A school","A park","A garage","A robot factory"],"correct_answer":"A garage"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_319_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_319_ch1_img1.png","plot_319_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":602,"reading_level":"Builder"}
