   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_319_11_14","title":"Robo-Rewind: Adventures in Time","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Time Travel","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"As the bell rang to signal the end of lunch, Sam felt a mixture of excitement and dread. The cafeteria buzzed with chatter, but all he could think about was the science fair looming ahead. He had to figure out a way to fix the chaos he'd caused with Sparky, or it would surely ruin his chances at winning. With a determined stride, he marched to his locker, where Mia was already waiting, her arms crossed and a playful smirk on her face.\n\n\u201cWell, that was quite the disaster, wasn\u2019t it?\u201d she teased, raising an eyebrow.\n\nSam sighed, running a hand through his messy hair. \u201cYeah, I think I made things worse this time. First spaghetti, now cupcakes! I just wanted to make everything perfect.\u201d He glanced at Sparky, who was peeking out from his backpack, his shiny metal eyes blinking innocently.\n\n\u201cMaybe it\u2019s time to think bigger,\u201d Mia suggested, her eyes sparkling with mischief. \u201cInstead of just fixing little things, what if we used Sparky to foresee the chaos before it happens?\u201d\n\n\u201cThat could work!\u201d Sam brightened at the idea. \u201cBut how do we do that?\u201d\n\nThey huddled close to Sparky, who suddenly whirred to life, emitting tiny sparks that flickered like fireflies. \u201cWant to rewind to the science fair to see what goes wrong?\u201d Sparky offered in his quirky, mechanical voice.\n\n\u201cExactly!\u201d Sam exclaimed. \u201cLet\u2019s do a trial run. We can use the time rewind to see what we need to change.\u201d\n\nMia clapped her hands together. \u201cOkay, let\u2019s give it a shot! Sparky, rewind us to the science fair!\u201d\n\nWith a whirring sound, Sparky\u2019s gears spun, and in a flash, the world around them blurred before sharpening back into focus. They stood in the bustling gym, decorated with colorful streamers and tables lined with projects. Sam\u2019s heart raced with the electric hum of excitement. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSam and Mia stood in the gym, surrounded by students showcasing their science projects. The room was filled with banners, bright lights, and a palpable energy as they prepared for the fair. Sparky hovered beside them, his metallic frame reflecting the vibrant colors around him.\n\n\u201cOkay, let\u2019s observe,\u201d Sam whispered, scanning the crowd. \n\nBut just as they began to look around, a loud crash echoed through the gym. Sam barely had time to react before a towering stack of cardboard boxes teetered dangerously on a nearby table. Sam\u2019s mouth went dry as they began to topple towards Principal Thompson, who was busy inspecting a volcano project.\n\n\u201cNo! Not again!\u201d Sam shouted, his heart racing. He reached for Sparky, but before he could even think to rewind, the boxes crashed to the floor, sending papers and craft supplies everywhere. A cupcake flew past Sam\u2019s head, splattering against the wall right next to Principal Thompson's shoes.\n\nMia gasped, her eyes wide. \u201cThis is getting out of hand! We need to act fast!\u201d \n\nSam swallowed hard, realizing they had to use Sparky to rewind again. \u201cOkay, Sparky, we need to go back\u2014now!\u201d \n\nSparky\u2019s gears whirred again, and in a blink, they were back at the moment before the stack of boxes fell. Sam took a deep breath, remembering the lessons from his previous attempts. This time, he instructed Sparky to create a distraction instead of just rewinding time. \u201cSparky, can you make a sound to alert everyone about the boxes?\u201d\n\nWith a whir and a beep, Sparky emitted a loud honk that startled every student in the gym, including Principal Thompson. Everyone turned to see what had caused the commotion, allowing Sam to rush over and stabilize the precarious stack. \n\n\u201cNice move!\u201d Mia grinned, nudging Sam with her elbow.\n\nAs they caught their breath, Sam felt a sense of hope rising within him. Perhaps, just perhaps, they could save the science fair without causing a disaster after all.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe moment was electric with tension as Sam steadied the boxes. The gym was alive with students\u2019 excited chatter, yet Sam felt like he was in slow motion, his heart thumping loudly in his chest. Principal Thompson turned, his brow furrowed, as he noticed Sam\u2019s quick thinking.\n\n\u201cGood catch, Sam!\u201d the principal called out, relief washing over his face.\n\nWith a newfound confidence, Sam exchanged a look with Mia, who nodded encouragingly. They were on the right track. Together, they could navigate the chaos of time, and maybe, just maybe, they could save the science fair.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What new plan do Sam and Mia come up with for the science fair?","options":["To hide from the principal","To distract the audience","To rewind time indefinitely","To leave Sparky behind"],"correct_answer":"To distract the audience"},{"question":"What happens when the boxes start to fall?","options":["They land safely on the floor","Sam catches them in time","They spill everywhere","Sam and Mia run away"],"correct_answer":"They spill everywhere"},{"question":"How does Sam feel about using Sparky's powers?","options":["Excited but nervous","Indifferent","Angry","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Excited but nervous"},{"question":"What role does Mia play in this chapter?","options":["She discourages Sam","She helps Sam brainstorm solutions","She ignores Sparky","She leaves the gym"],"correct_answer":"She helps Sam brainstorm solutions"},{"question":"What is the overall theme of this chapter?","options":["Friendship and teamwork","Isolation and fear","Competition and winning","Boredom and apathy"],"correct_answer":"Friendship and teamwork"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_319_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_319_ch4_img1.png","plot_319_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":744,"reading_level":"Builder"}
