   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_320_7_10","title":"A Journey Through Time: The Quest to Save Dinosaurs","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Time Travel","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Ella stood in front of the huge glass building. It was the new science lab, and it sparkled under the sun. \u201cWow! Look at this place!\u201d she exclaimed. Jake, her best friend, adjusted his glasses. \u201cI can\u2019t wait to see the dinosaurs!\u201d\n\nInside the lab, bright colors filled the walls. There were pictures of dinosaurs everywhere. \u201cWelcome, young scientists!\u201d said Dr. Finch. He was a quirky paleontologist with a wild hairstyle and a big smile. \u201cAre you ready for an adventure?\u201d\n\n\u201cYes!\u201d they shouted together. \n\nDr. Finch led them to a room filled with strange machines. \u201cThis,\u201d he said, pointing to a shiny capsule, \u201cis a time capsule. It can take you back to the age of dinosaurs!\u201d \n\n\u201cCan we really go?\u201d Jake asked, his eyes wide with excitement. \n\n\u201cOf course! But remember, we must be careful. Dinosaurs need protection,\u201d Dr. Finch warned. \n\nElla grinned. \u201cI want to see a T-rex!\u201d \n\n\u201cOr a Triceratops!\u201d Jake added. \n\nBefore they knew it, Dr. Finch pushed a big red button. Suddenly, lights flashed, and the ground shook. \u201cWhoa!\u201d Jake shouted. \n\nThen\u2014poof! The world around them changed.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThey found themselves in a lush green forest. Towering trees swayed gently in the breeze. The air smelled fresh and exciting. \u201cLook at those dinosaurs!\u201d Ella gasped, pointing to a group of long-necked Brachiosaurus munching leaves. \n\nBut then, they heard a loud noise. A hunter appeared, sneaking through the bushes. He wore a dark hat and had a net in his hand. \u201cI\u2019ll catch me a dinosaur!\u201d he sneered. \n\n\u201cUh oh,\u201d Jake whispered. He looked worried. \u201cWe have to protect them!\u201d \n\nDr. Finch nodded. \u201cYes! Let\u2019s hide and come up with a plan.\u201d \n\nElla\u2019s heart raced. How could they save the dinosaurs? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThey crouched behind a big rock. \u201cWhat if we distract him?\u201d Ella suggested. \u201cWe could make noise and lead him away!\u201d \n\n\u201cThat\u2019s risky,\u201d Jake replied. \u201cBut it might work!\u201d \n\nJust then, they heard a soft whimper. A baby dinosaur was trapped behind a bush. It looked scared and lost. \u201cWe have to help it!\u201d Ella cried.\n\nThe kids looked at each other. This was just the beginning of their adventure.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What type of scientist is Dr. Finch?","options":["Biologist","Paleontologist","Astronomer","Geologist"],"correct_answer":"Paleontologist"},{"question":"What do Ella and Jake want to see?","options":["A spaceship","A dinosaur","A robot","A whale"],"correct_answer":"A dinosaur"},{"question":"What happens when Dr. Finch pushes the red button?","options":["They go home","They travel back in time","They find treasure","They meet aliens"],"correct_answer":"They travel back in time"},{"question":"What does the poacher want to do?","options":["Catch a dinosaur","Help the dinosaurs","Find treasure","Build a time machine"],"correct_answer":"Catch a dinosaur"},{"question":"What do Ella and Jake plan to do to save the dinosaurs?","options":["Run away","Make noise to distract the poacher","Build a trap","Climb a tree"],"correct_answer":"Make noise to distract the poacher"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_320_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_320_ch1_img1.png","plot_320_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":365,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
