   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_320_7_10","title":"A Journey Through Time: The Quest to Save Dinosaurs","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Time Travel","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"The jungle was alive with sounds. Birds chirped, and leaves rustled. Ella could hardly believe it. \"Look at all these dinosaurs!\" she shouted, her eyes wide with excitement. \n\nDr. Finch adjusted his glasses. \"The Late Cretaceous is full of wonders!\" he replied, grinning. The baby Triceratops, now named Tilly, peered out from behind a large fern. She looked scared but curious. \n\nSuddenly, the ground shook beneath them. \"What was that?\" Jake asked, his voice trembling. The volcano in the distance rumbled loudly. \n\n\"We need to keep Tilly safe!\" Ella said. \"We can't let that poacher find her!\" \n\nJust then, Dr. Finch pointed. \"Look at that path! It might lead us to safety.\" They hurried down the narrow trail, and the trees towered above them like giants. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they walked, Tilly stumbled on a rock and fell over. \"Oh no!\" Jake exclaimed. \"Tilly!\" He rushed to help her up. \n\nElla knelt beside Tilly, brushing leaves from her back. \"You\u2019re okay! We\u2019re here for you!\" Tilly nuzzled Ella\u2019s arm, giving her a gentle nudge. \n\nSuddenly, they heard a loud snapping sound. \"What was that?\" Dr. Finch whispered. \"It could be the poacher!\" \n\nFrom behind the bushes, a tall figure appeared. It was the poacher! He looked fierce with a net slung over his shoulder. \"I\u2019ve got you now, little dinosaur!\" he shouted, grinning wickedly.\n\nElla's heart raced. \"We have to hide!\" she whispered. They quickly ducked behind a large tree. \n\n\"How do we stop him?\" Jake asked, his eyes wide. \n\nDr. Finch thought quickly. \"We need a plan! If we can distract him, we can escape!\" \n\nTilly began to make soft noises. \"Shh, Tilly!\" Ella whispered. But Tilly was too scared. She started to cry out. \n\nThe poacher turned. \"There you are!\" he yelled, rushing toward them. \n\n\"What do we do now?\" Jake asked, panic in his voice. \n\nElla thought hard. \"We have to lead him away from Tilly! On the count of three, we run!\" \n\nDr. Finch nodded. \"One\u2026 Two\u2026 Three!\" \n\nThey dashed through the bushes, with the poacher chasing after them. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWould they be able to save Tilly and find a way back home? The volcano rumbled again, shaking the ground beneath their feet. \n\n\"Run!\" Ella shouted as they sprinted deeper into the jungle.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What are Ella, Jake, and Dr. Finch trying to protect?","options":["A baby Triceratops","A big dinosaur","A time machine","A volcano"],"correct_answer":"A baby Triceratops"},{"question":"What does the volcano do in this chapter?","options":["It erupts","It rumbles","It disappears","It gets bigger"],"correct_answer":"It rumbles"},{"question":"Who chases the kids in the jungle?","options":["A friendly dinosaur","A poacher","Dr. Finch","A volcano"],"correct_answer":"A poacher"},{"question":"What do the kids decide to do to get away?","options":["Climb a tree","Hide behind a rock","Run away","Call for help"],"correct_answer":"Run away"},{"question":"What does Tilly do when she gets scared?","options":["Runs away","Hides","Cries out","Laughs"],"correct_answer":"Cries out"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_320_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_320_ch3_img1.png","plot_320_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":382,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
