   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_320_7_10","title":"A Journey Through Time: The Quest to Save Dinosaurs","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Time Travel","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Chapter 4: A Plan in Action\n\nThe jungle felt alive. Birds chirped, and leaves rustled in the soft breeze. Ella looked around with wide eyes. \u201cWow! This place is amazing!\u201d she said. Jake grinned. \u201cAnd we have to keep Tilly safe!\u201d\n\nDr. Finch adjusted his glasses and nodded. \u201cFirst, we need a plan. The poacher won\u2019t give up easily.\u201d\n\nThey huddled together under a tall fern. Tilly, the baby Triceratops, nibbled on some leaves nearby. Her big eyes watched the kids with trust. \u201cLet\u2019s make a distraction!\u201d Ella suggested. \u201cWe can lure the poacher away.\u201d\n\nJake scratched his chin. \u201cWhat if we make loud noises? He might think there\u2019s something interesting and chase after it.\u201d\n\nDr. Finch smiled. \u201cThat\u2019s a brilliant idea! But we need to be careful. We don\u2019t want Tilly to get scared.\u201d\n\nElla clapped her hands. \u201cLet\u2019s find something to make noise!\u201d The kids split up. Ella spotted a pile of rocks and started stacking them. Jake found some dried branches. \u201cThis will make a great crash!\u201d he said excitedly.\n\nSuddenly, they heard a rustle nearby. \u201cShh! The poacher!\u201d Jake whispered. They quickly crouched behind a bush, their hearts racing. They peeked out and saw a shadowy figure in the distance.\n\nTilly bleated softly, and the kids froze. \u201cNo, Tilly! Be quiet!\u201d Ella whispered urgently. Just then, the sun peeked through the trees, creating sparkles on the ground.\n\n\u201cNow!\u201d Jake shouted. They threw the rocks and branches in different directions. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nCrash! The noise echoed through the jungle. The figure turned, eyes wide. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d It was the poacher! He ran towards the sound, leaving the path clear for Tilly.\n\n\u201cQuick! This way!\u201d Dr. Finch urged. They led Tilly into a cozy hollow between two giant trees. \u201cWe did it!\u201d Ella squealed, feeling proud. \n\n\u201cBut we have to be fast,\u201d Jake reminded them. \u201cHe might come back!\u201d\n\nWith determination, they gathered more leaves and branches to hide Tilly. As they worked, they made a plan to find the time capsule again. \u201cIf we can get Tilly to safety, we can find our way home!\u201d Dr. Finch said.\n\nThe kids nodded, full of hope. They were working together, and it felt powerful. \n\nSuddenly, the ground rumbled again. \u201cIs that the volcano?\u201d Ella gasped. They felt the heat rising around them. \u201cWe must hurry!\u201d \n\nJake pointed. \u201cLook! The path leads away from the volcano. We can take Tilly there!\u201d\n\nElla took a deep breath. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d They moved quickly, hoping they could outsmart the poacher one more time.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith Tilly close behind, they rushed down the path towards safety. What adventures awaited them?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the kids' plan to distract the poacher?","options":["Make loud noises","Hide in a tree","Call for help","Run away"],"correct_answer":"Make loud noises"},{"question":"What animal do they need to protect?","options":["A baby dinosaur","A puppy","A kitten","A bird"],"correct_answer":"A baby dinosaur"},{"question":"How do the kids feel after successfully distracting the poacher?","options":["Scared","Proud","Tired","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Proud"},{"question":"What does Jake find to make noise?","options":["A drum","Dried branches","A rock","A whistle"],"correct_answer":"Dried branches"},{"question":"What happens when the volcano rumbles?","options":["They go to sleep","They must hurry","They sing a song","They play a game"],"correct_answer":"They must hurry"}]},"images":null,"word_count":444,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
