   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_320_11_14","title":"A Journey Through Time: The Quest to Save Dinosaurs","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Time Travel","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"The hum of the futuristic lab buzzed through the air like a swarm of bees. Ella stood in awe, her eyes wide as she took in the sleek machines and glowing screens that filled the space. \u201cI can\u2019t believe we\u2019re actually here!\u201d she exclaimed, clutching her dinosaur encyclopedia to her chest. At twelve years old, she was a self-proclaimed dinosaur enthusiast, and this was like a dream come true.\n\nJake, her best friend since kindergarten, adjusted his glasses and grinned. \u201cThis place is incredible! I heard Dr. Finch has been working on a new project for years.\u201d He looked around, his curiosity palpable. \u201cImagine what we could learn!\u201d\n\nJust then, a door whooshed open, and a whirlwind of energy burst into the room. Dr. Finch was a tall, eccentric man with tousled hair and bright, mismatched socks. \u201cWelcome, welcome! You must be Ella and Jake! I have something extraordinary to show you.\u201d His eyes danced with excitement as he led them deeper into the lab. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThey entered a chamber filled with shimmering devices and a large, metallic cylinder that looked like a giant coffee can. \u201cThis,\u201d Dr. Finch said, his voice lowering to a conspiratorial whisper, \u201cis a time capsule. It can take you back to the Late Cretaceous period. Just imagine\u2014dinosaurs roaming in their natural habitat!\u201d\n\nElla's heart raced at the thought. \u201cCan we really go back in time?\u201d \n\n\u201cOnly if you\u2019re brave enough!\u201d Dr. Finch winked, his enthusiasm infectious. \u201cBut be warned, not everything is safe in the past. There are challenges that await you.\u201d\n\n\u201cChallenges?\u201d Jake echoed, his brow furrowing in concern. \n\nBefore Dr. Finch could elaborate, Ella stepped forward, drawn by the majestic design of the capsule. \u201cLet\u2019s do it!\u201d she declared, her voice filled with determination. \n\n\u201cWait!\u201d Jake shouted, but it was too late. Ella had already pressed a large, red button on the capsule\u2019s control panel. A loud hum filled the room, and lights began to flash as the time capsule whirred to life. \n\nSuddenly, the world around them dissolved into a whirlwind of colors, spinning faster and faster until everything went black. When Ella opened her eyes, she found herself lying on soft, green grass. Above her, the sky was a brilliant shade of blue, dotted with fluffy white clouds. The air was filled with the sounds of rustling leaves and distant roars. \n\n\u201cWhere are we?\u201d Ella asked, scrambling to her feet.\n\nJake stood beside her, his eyes wide with disbelief. \u201cI think\u2026 we\u2019re in the Cretaceous!\u201d \n\nBefore they could fully process their surroundings, a low growl echoed through the trees. They turned, and not far off, a tiny dinosaur peeked out from behind a bush. It had bright green scales and big, curious eyes. \n\n\u201cOh my gosh! A baby dinosaur!\u201d Ella gasped, kneeling to get a closer look. \n\nBut before she could reach for it, a shadow loomed over them. A tall figure, wearing dark glasses and a sneaky grin, stepped into the clearing. \u201cWell, well, what do we have here?\u201d he said, eyeing the baby dinosaur with greedy interest. \n\nElla's heart raced as she realized the danger. \u201cJake, we have to protect it!\u201d \n\nAs fear gripped her, she knew they had just begun an adventure filled with danger and discovery. They had to outsmart this mysterious poacher and find a way back home before history changed forever.\n\n\u201cCome on!\u201d Ella shouted, grabbing Jake\u2019s hand. \u201cWe can\u2019t let him take it!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith determination in their eyes, they raced into the lush forest, the baby dinosaur trailing behind them, unaware of the peril they faced in this prehistoric world.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the main setting of the story in Chapter 1?","options":["A park","A futuristic laboratory","A dinosaur museum","A school"],"correct_answer":"A futuristic laboratory"},{"question":"What accidentally happens when Ella presses the red button?","options":["They start a fire","They activate the time capsule","They get locked inside","They turn into dinosaurs"],"correct_answer":"They activate the time capsule"},{"question":"Who is the character that guides Ella and Jake?","options":["Jake","Dr. Finch","The poacher","A dinosaur"],"correct_answer":"Dr. Finch"},{"question":"What does Ella wish to protect in the Cretaceous period?","options":["A time capsule","A baby dinosaur","A giant tree","A volcano"],"correct_answer":"A baby dinosaur"},{"question":"What does the mysterious figure want to do with the baby dinosaur?","options":["Help it","Capture it","Feed it","Train it"],"correct_answer":"Capture it"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_320_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_320_ch1_img1.png","plot_320_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":609,"reading_level":"Builder"}
