       [DEBUG] Checking shared image: {"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A vibrant, atmospheric scene depicting a lush, prehistoric landscape. Towering ferns sway gently in a warm breeze, with glimmers of sunlight filtering through the leaves. In the foreground, three young scientistsElla, Jake, and Dr. Finchare huddled together, their expressions a mix of determination and anxiety as they prepare a trap for the poacher. The scene captures the urgency of their mission, with the baby dinosaur, Pip, nestled safely beside them.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_320_ch4_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 14:37:48"}
