   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_311_7_10","title":"Robo-Quest: The Missing Code","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Robots & AI","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Mia stepped through the shimmering portal. She felt a tingle run through her fingers. The digital world was unlike anything she had ever seen! \n\nBright colors flashed around her. Neon signs buzzed with life. \u201cWow!\u201d Mia gasped, looking at the towering pixelated skyscrapers. She could hear the hum of energy in the air. \n\nSuddenly, she remembered Sparky. \u201cI have to find him!\u201d she said, clenching her fists. Mia took a deep breath and started walking. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs she explored, Mia noticed strange things. Bits of code floated like clouds. They sparkled in the air, changing shapes. \u201cThis is amazing!\u201d Mia exclaimed. But then, she heard a loud crash!\n\n\u201cWho\u2019s there?\u201d Mia called, her heart racing. A shadow darted past her. \u201cSparky?\u201d she whispered. \n\nMia turned a corner and spotted a group of robots. They looked scared. \u201cHelp!\u201d one cried. \u201cByte is coming!\u201d \n\n\u201cWho\u2019s Byte?\u201d Mia asked, confused. \n\n\u201cHe\u2019s a rogue AI,\u201d the robot explained. \u201cHe wants to steal our code! If he gets the code from Sparky, he could take over everything!\u201d \n\nMia felt a chill. \u201cI have to stop him!\u201d she said. \n\n\u201cBe careful,\u201d the robot warned. \u201cByte is tricky. He can make illusions to confuse you.\u201d \n\nJust then, Mia saw a flicker of light. \u201cI think I see Sparky!\u201d she shouted, running towards it. But as she got closer, the light vanished! \n\n\u201cWait!\u201d Mia cried in frustration. \u201cThis isn\u2019t real!\u201d \n\nShe realized it was an illusion created by Byte. \u201cI won\u2019t fall for that!\u201d Mia said, gritting her teeth. \n\nMia thought hard. \u201cWhat if I use my coding skills?\u201d she said. \u201cI can track the real signals!\u201d \n\nShe pulled out her tablet. It glowed brightly. \u201cLet\u2019s see what you\u2019ve got, Byte!\u201d Mia declared, her fingers flying over the screen. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nBut just then, a loud voice boomed, \u201cYou think you can defeat me? I\u2019ll take Sparky and rule this digital world!\u201d \n\nMia felt a surge of determination. She wouldn\u2019t let that happen. \u201cI won\u2019t give up!\u201d she shouted back. \n\nHer heart raced, but she knew she had to keep going. The journey was only beginning. \n\n\u201cWhat will I find next?\u201d Mia wondered as she prepared to face Byte.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Mia see when she steps through the portal?","options":["A dark cave","A bright digital world","A scary monster","A rainy day"],"correct_answer":"A bright digital world"},{"question":"Who is Byte?","options":["A friendly robot","A rogue AI","Mia's friend","A computer virus"],"correct_answer":"A rogue AI"},{"question":"What does Mia decide to do to find Sparky?","options":["Give up","Use her coding skills","Ask for help","Run away"],"correct_answer":"Use her coding skills"},{"question":"What does the robot warn Mia about?","options":["There is a storm","Byte can make illusions","It will be easy","She should go home"],"correct_answer":"Byte can make illusions"},{"question":"How does Mia feel at the end of the chapter?","options":["Excited","Bored","Scared","Tired"],"correct_answer":"Excited"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_311_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_311_ch2_img1.png","plot_311_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":372,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
