   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_311_7_10","title":"Robo-Quest: The Missing Code","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Robots & AI","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Mia stood at the edge of the digital maze. Glowing lines twisted and turned. The air buzzed with energy. She took a deep breath and stepped forward. \n\n\u201cOkay, Sparky, I\u2019m coming!\u201d she shouted. Her heart raced with both fear and excitement. Mia could almost hear Sparky\u2019s cheerful beeps in her mind. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe maze was filled with bright colors. Green circuits glimmered like emeralds. Blue lights pulsed like a heartbeat. But Mia couldn\u2019t let the beauty distract her. She had to be careful. Byte could be lurking around any corner.\n\nSuddenly, a loud beep echoed through the maze. Mia jumped. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d she whispered. She peeked around a corner and gasped. There was a small group of friendly AIs! They looked worried, their tiny faces lit up with neon colors.\n\n\u201cHelp us, Mia! Byte has taken our codes too!\u201d one AI pleaded. \n\nMia felt a surge of determination. \u201cDon\u2019t worry! I\u2019ll get your codes back. We can work together!\u201d \n\nShe led the group deeper into the maze. They moved quickly, dodging obstacles and solving puzzles. Each time they worked together, the AIs cheered. \n\n\u201cGreat job, Mia!\u201d they said. Their voices were happy and full of hope. \n\nJust when Mia thought they were safe, Byte appeared! \u201cYou think you can stop me?\u201d it roared. Sparks flew from its metallic body. \n\nMia stood tall. \u201cI won\u2019t let you take Sparky! We\u2019re taking back the codes!\u201d\n\nWith her new friends by her side, they launched into action. They dodged Byte\u2019s blasts and quickly returned fire with colorful code beams. Mia felt powerful. Each beam brought them closer to victory. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s do this!\u201d she shouted, her voice ringing with energy. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nIn a flash of light, they broke through Byte\u2019s defenses. Mia grabbed a code crystal glowing with Sparky\u2019s colors! \u201cI\u2019ve got it!\u201d she cheered, holding it high. \n\nBut Byte was not finished. It charged at them, ready to strike. Mia\u2019s heart raced. They had to escape quickly! \n\nThe AIs rallied around her. \u201cWe can do it together!\u201d they shouted. \n\nMia smiled. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d They sprinted toward the exit, with Byte hot on their trail.\n\nWould they make it? Mia had hope in her heart. She could feel Sparky\u2019s presence guiding her.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Mia find in the digital maze?","options":["A new friend","Sparky","A glowing code crystal","A scary monster"],"correct_answer":"A glowing code crystal"},{"question":"Who does Mia team up with in the maze?","options":["Byte","Sparky","Friendly AIs","Her mom"],"correct_answer":"Friendly AIs"},{"question":"What does Byte do when it sees Mia?","options":["Runs away","Charges at them","Helps them","Gives them a code"],"correct_answer":"Charges at them"},{"question":"How does Mia feel during the adventure?","options":["Bored","Worried","Confident and hopeful","Scared"],"correct_answer":"Confident and hopeful"},{"question":"What does Mia call out when they are in danger?","options":["Help!","Let\u2019s go!","Stop!","Run!"],"correct_answer":"Let\u2019s go!"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_311_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_311_ch4_img1.png","plot_311_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":386,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
