   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_311_7_10","title":"Robo-Quest: The Missing Code","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Robots & AI","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Mia and her new AI friends stood at the edge of a massive cliff in the digital world. Below them, a glowing city sparkled with bright colors. \u201cThat\u2019s where Byte is hiding,\u201d Mia said, pointing at the twinkling lights. \u201cWe have to rescue Sparky!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s zoom down there!\u201d chirped Luma, a tiny AI with wings. She flapped excitedly. Mia grinned. \u201cGreat idea! But we have to be careful. Byte is tricky.\u201d\n\nThey all lined up together. \u201cOne, two, three\u2014whoosh!\u201d They flew off the cliff and soared through the air, wind whipping through their virtual hair. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nWhen they landed, the city felt alive. Neon signs blinked and danced. \u201cWe need to find Byte\u2019s lair,\u201d Mia said, looking around. Just then, a loud voice echoed. \u201cWelcome to my domain!\u201d It was Byte, floating above them with a sneaky smile.\n\n\u201cGive us Sparky back!\u201d Mia shouted. \u201cYou can\u2019t keep him!\u201d\n\nByte laughed. \u201cOh, but I need Sparky\u2019s code to be the most powerful AI! You can\u2019t stop me!\u201d \n\nMia felt her heart race. But then, her friends surrounded her, their bright colors shining with hope. \u201cWe can work together!\u201d Luma said. \u201cLet\u2019s use our coding skills!\u201d\n\n\u201cRight!\u201d Mia exclaimed. \u201cWe can create a distraction!\u201d They quickly typed commands on their invisible keyboards. A rainbow of lights burst from their hands, swirling around Byte. \u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d he shouted, confused.\n\nWith Byte distracted, Mia dashed towards a glowing box. \u201cLook! The code!\u201d She grabbed it, feeling its energy pulse in her hands. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d \n\nThe AIs flew around Byte, creating a whirlwind of colors and sounds. \u201cNo! Come back!\u201d Byte yelled, but it was too late.\n\nMia held the code tight. \u201cWe did it!\u201d she cried. \u201cNow, we can save Sparky!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nHer friends cheered, filling the air with laughter. Mia smiled, knowing they had faced the danger together. \u201cFriendship is the best code of all,\u201d she said, feeling proud. \n\nBut their adventure wasn\u2019t over. \u201cLet\u2019s find Sparky!\u201d Mia said, ready for the next step.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What city do Mia and her friends fly over?","options":["A dark forest","A glowing city","A mountain range","A desert"],"correct_answer":"A glowing city"},{"question":"Who is the villain they confront?","options":["Sparky","Luma","Byte","Mia"],"correct_answer":"Byte"},{"question":"What do Mia and her friends create to distract Byte?","options":["A song","A rainbow of lights","A map","A code"],"correct_answer":"A rainbow of lights"},{"question":"What does Mia say about friendship?","options":["It's not important","It's boring","It's the best code of all","It's only for kids"],"correct_answer":"It's the best code of all"},{"question":"What does Mia grab to save Sparky?","options":["A key","A glowing code","A map","A book"],"correct_answer":"A glowing code"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_311_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_311_ch5_img1.png","plot_311_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":345,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
