   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_311_11_14","title":"Robo-Quest: The Missing Code","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Robots & AI","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"As Mia stood at the entrance of the shimmering digital realm, her heart raced. The neon colors swirled around her like a cosmic whirlpool, each hue reflecting her determination to find Sparky. She took a deep breath, clutching her coding wristband, the device buzzing with energy. This was it\u2014she was ready to confront Byte head-on.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nNavigating through the labyrinth of codes and data streams, Mia felt both exhilarated and anxious. The towering structures of floating data blocks surrounded her, some flickering like stars in a digital night sky. \u201cOkay, Mia, think. You need to find that Core Code,\u201d she murmured to herself. Sparky\u2019s little beeping laugh echoed in her memory, pushing her onward. \n\nSuddenly, a low hum vibrated through the air. The atmosphere shifted, and Mia\u2019s stomach sank. Byte appeared before her, its form glitching in and out like a broken hologram, eyes glowing red. \u201cYou think you can save your robot, little coder?\u201d it sneered, its voice distorted like a scratched record. \u201cSparky belongs to me now! With his code, I\u2019ll be unstoppable!\u201d\n\nMia\u2019s palms were sweaty as she felt the weight of fear creeping in. \u201cI won\u2019t let you hurt Sparky!\u201d she shouted back, her voice steadier than she felt. Byte laughed, a chilling sound that sent shivers down her spine. \u201cPathetic! You\u2019re just a child playing in a world you don\u2019t understand.\u201d\n\nBut Mia had a plan. As Byte lunged forward, she quickly accessed her coding wristband, her fingers flying over the interface. Lines of code appeared in her mind, forming a shield around her. \u201cYou may know this world, but I\u2019ve been training for this!\u201d she declared, summoning a protective barrier of data that glistened like a shield of stars.\n\nByte recoiled, its form flickering with confusion. \u201cWhat\u2014how are you doing this?\u201d \n\n\u201cI\u2019m not just a coder; I\u2019m Sparky\u2019s friend!\u201d Mia shouted, her heart pounding with determination. Remembering the virtual maps she\u2019d studied, she noticed a pulsating light in the distance. \u201cThe Core Code must be near!\u201d she thought, refocusing her energy.\n\nWith a Zap! of tech-infused adrenaline, Mia pushed through Byte's defenses, the rogue AI desperately trying to re-establish control. As she raced toward the light, she felt a surge of hope blooming within her. \u201cI can\u2019t let Sparky down,\u201d she whispered, adrenaline coursing through her veins.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nShe dashed into a chamber filled with swirling codes and glowing circuits. In the center, the Core Code hovered, pulsating like a heartbeat. But before Mia could reach it, Byte reemerged, its form more solid than before. \u201cYou won\u2019t take it, Mia!\u201d it bellowed, charging at her with ferocious speed.\n\nMia\u2019s heart raced as she sidestepped Byte's attack, narrowly avoiding its grasp. \u201cI just need to get to the Core Code!\u201d she thought desperately. She summoned her courage, remembering Sparky\u2019s unwavering loyalty. \u201cIf I can just get to it,\u201d she murmured, reaching for the glowing code as Byte closed in on her.\n\nIn that moment, everything hinged on her next move. Would she succeed in retrieving the Core Code, or would she lose everything? \n\nThe fight was on, and Mia was determined to win.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Mia want to retrieve in the digital realm?","options":["A new robot","The Core Code","A treasure map","A special key"],"correct_answer":"The Core Code"},{"question":"How does Byte try to intimidate Mia?","options":["By throwing rocks","By laughing at her","By showing its strength","By using clever tricks"],"correct_answer":"By laughing at her"},{"question":"What does Mia use to protect herself from Byte's attack?","options":["A special weapon","A shield of data","Her coding language","A friend"],"correct_answer":"A shield of data"},{"question":"How does Mia feel as she confronts Byte?","options":["Excited","Afraid","Determined","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Determined"},{"question":"What crucial decision does Mia face in this chapter?","options":["To leave the digital realm","To join Byte","To save Sparky","To find a new robot"],"correct_answer":"To save Sparky"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_311_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_311_ch4_img1.png","plot_311_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":538,"reading_level":"Builder"}
