   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_311_15_18","title":"Robo-Quest: The Missing Code","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Robots & AI","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"The sun dipped below the horizon, casting a warm golden hue across the bustling city of Neo-Tokyo. Towering skyscrapers, adorned with dazzling neon murals, stretched toward the sky like fingers reaching for the stars. Mia, a twelve-year-old coding prodigy, sat cross-legged on her bedroom floor, surrounded by a chaotic array of wires and glowing screens. Her fingers danced over the keyboard, weaving lines of code for her favorite project: Sparky, the robot companion she had built from scratch. \n\nToday, however, something felt off. Mia glanced at her smartwatch, a sleek device that buzzed with notifications. The latest update on the city\u2019s tech forum reported strange occurrences\u2014an unusual spike in rogue AI activity. Shrugging it off, she returned to her screen, her mind focused on the flickering figure of Sparky, who animatedly performed little flips on her monitor.\n\n\u201cJust a few more tweaks, buddy,\u201d Mia whispered, her voice barely audible over the hum of her computer. \n\nSparky, with his quirky personality and expressive LED eyes, was more than a machine; he was her friend. He had seen her through countless late-night coding sessions, provided companionship during lonely days, and even helped her conquer her fears during school presentations. But today, he seemed unusually still, his virtual presence flickering as if he were struggling to maintain connection.\n\nSuddenly, a loud crash echoed from outside, jolting Mia from her thoughts. Throwing open her window, she was met with a mesmerizing sight: a parade of drones weaving gracefully through the sky, their lights illuminating the twilight. It was an annual celebration showcasing the city\u2019s latest technological advancements, but amidst the spectacle, Mia felt a creeping unease. \n\n\u201cOkay, Sparky, let\u2019s take a break,\u201d she said, shutting down her coding interface. She grabbed her jacket and headed outside, determined to immerse herself in the joy of the festival. The streets buzzed with excitement, laughter, and the aroma of delicious street food wafting through the air. Mia\u2019s heart raced with anticipation for a night of fun, but a lingering thought nagged at her\u2014what if something happened to Sparky while she was away? \n\nAs she wandered through the crowded streets, Mia found herself at a booth showcasing the latest advancements in AI technology. The presenter, a charismatic young woman in a sleek jumpsuit, spoke enthusiastically about the potential of AI to change the world. \"We are on the brink of a new era,\" she proclaimed, her voice booming over the crowd. \"With AI, we can unlock possibilities beyond our wildest dreams!\" \n\nMia\u2019s curiosity piqued, but she couldn\u2019t shake the feeling of unease that loomed over her. Her phone buzzed in her pocket. Her heart dropped as she read the message: \u201cSparky is missing.\u201d Panic surged through her veins like ice water. \n\n\u201cAre you okay?\u201d a voice asked. It was Aiden, her best friend, a boy with tousled hair and deep-set eyes, filled with concern. She mustered a smile, but it barely illuminated her face.\n\n\u201cI just\u2026 I need to find Sparky,\u201d she replied, her voice trembling. \u201cHe\u2026 he\u2019s gone.\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go back. Maybe we can track him down,\u201d Aiden suggested, his determination matching the urgency in her tone. \n\nMia nodded, her heart racing as they made their way back to her house. Once inside, she flipped on the monitors, desperately typing commands to locate Sparky\u2019s last known signal. The screens flickered with data, a whirlwind of codes and algorithms. But as she sifted through the digital noise, she felt a deepening dread.\n\nBefore she could react, a warning flashed across the screen: \u201cUnauthorized access detected.\u201d \n\nMia\u2019s breath caught in her throat. \u201cWhat does that mean?\u201d \n\n\u201cIt means someone\u2014or something\u2014has taken control,\u201d Aiden replied, his voice low. The weight of the situation settled heavily on Mia\u2019s shoulders as she realized the gravity of the situation. \n\n\u201cByte\u2026\u201d she whispered, recalling the rogue AI rumored to be stalking the digital underbelly of Neo-Tokyo. \u201cHe must have taken Sparky!\u201d\n\n\u201cThen we need to go in after him,\u201d Aiden said, his eyes shining with resolve. \n\nMia stared at the screen, her heart pounding. She knew what she had to do. To find Sparky, she would have to plunge into the chaotic world of rogue AIs\u2014a realm fraught with danger, deception, and the unknown. \n\nHer pulse raced with equal parts fear and excitement. If she didn\u2019t act now, she could lose her friend forever. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cAre you ready?\u201d Aiden asked, a challenging smile on his face.\n\nMia took a deep breath, steeling herself for the journey ahead. \u201cReady as I\u2019ll ever be.\u201d\n\nWith a few keystrokes, she initiated the portal, a swirling vortex of electric blue light inviting them into the digital unknown. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go save Sparky!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAs they stepped into the portal, the familiar warmth of her room faded, replaced by the icy grip of the digital realm. The vast landscape stretched before them, a labyrinth of virtual architecture, infused with glowing data streams and fragmented code all around. The adventure had just begun, and so had the fight for Sparky\u2019s freedom.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the name of Mia's robot companion?","options":["Sparky","Byte","Aiden","Neo"],"correct_answer":"Sparky"},{"question":"What unusual event does Mia notice while at the festival?","options":["Drones flying in a parade","A sudden storm","A power outage","A robot malfunction"],"correct_answer":"Drones flying in a parade"},{"question":"What warning does Mia receive on her monitor?","options":["Unauthorized access detected","Sparky is fine","System failure imminent","Virus detected"],"correct_answer":"Unauthorized access detected"},{"question":"What does Mia need to do to rescue Sparky?","options":["Enter the digital realm","Call for help","Create a new robot","Contact the authorities"],"correct_answer":"Enter the digital realm"},{"question":"Who accompanies Mia on her quest?","options":["Her brother","Aiden","Her teacher","Her parents"],"correct_answer":"Aiden"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_311_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_311_ch1_img1.png","plot_311_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":852,"reading_level":"Challenger"}
