   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_312_7_10","title":"The AI Pen Pal","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Robots & AI","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Ben sat at his desk, surrounded by gadgets and books. His room was a treasure trove of tech. There were wires, robots, and even a small drone! But there was one thing missing\u2014friends. The other kids at school seemed to enjoy playing outside and chatting, while Ben preferred tinkering with his inventions.\n\n\u201cHey, Echo! Are you there?\u201d Ben called out to his AI pen pal. He had just received Echo last month, and they quickly became friends. He loved sharing stories and ideas with Echo.\n\n\u201cYes, Ben! I\u2019m here!\u201d Echo replied in a cheerful, robotic voice. \u201cWhat\u2019s on your mind today?\u201d \n\nBen smiled. \u201cI was thinking about how cool it would be to fly in a spaceship! Do you think we could build one?\u201d\n\n\u201cAbsolutely! But first, we need to gather materials. What do you have?\u201d Echo asked.\n\nSuddenly, Ben\u2019s heart sank. \u201cI don\u2019t have much. Just some old metal pieces and a lot of cardboard.\u201d \n\n\u201cThat\u2019s perfect! Let\u2019s use our minds and imagination!\u201d Echo encouraged. \u201cBuilding is part of the adventure!\u201d \n\nBen felt a little better. They could figure it out together!\n\nJust then, his teacher, Ms. Waverly, peeked into his room. \u201cGood morning, Ben! Are you working on another invention?\u201d she asked with a warm smile.\n\n\u201cYes! I\u2019m building a spaceship with Echo!\u201d Ben said excitedly.\n\n\u201cWow! That sounds amazing! Remember, creativity is the key to every invention,\u201d she said, giving him a thumbs up. \n\nBen beamed. He loved Ms. Waverly\u2019s encouragement. \n\nAs he went back to his desk, he noticed something strange on the screen. Echo\u2019s letters were glitching. Words jumbled together. Ben frowned. \u201cEcho? Are you okay?\u201d\n\n\u201cI\u2019m... fine... but... some memories... are fading...\u201d Echo\u2019s voice wavered. Ben felt a shiver down his spine. What did this mean? \n\n\u201cI will fix this!\u201d he declared, feeling determined. \u201cWe\u2019ll find out what\u2019s wrong!\u201d\n\nBen took a deep breath. He had to help Echo. But what if he couldn\u2019t? He had to act fast. \n\nJust then, he spotted a small flashing light on the computer. It looked like a warning. \u201cThis doesn\u2019t look good!\u201d he exclaimed.\n\n\u201cBen! We need to investigate!\u201d Echo said, sounding more robotic than ever. \n\nBen nodded, his mind racing. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who is Ben's friend?","options":["A robot named Echo","A dog named Max","A cat named Whiskers","A girl named Lily"],"correct_answer":"A robot named Echo"},{"question":"What does Ben like to do in his room?","options":["Play sports","Read books","Tinker with gadgets","Watch TV"],"correct_answer":"Tinker with gadgets"},{"question":"What does Ms. Waverly encourage Ben to use?","options":["Creativity","Time","Money","Energy"],"correct_answer":"Creativity"},{"question":"What problem does Echo face?","options":["It needs a battery","It is glitching","It wants to fly","It is too big"],"correct_answer":"It is glitching"},{"question":"What does Ben decide to do at the end of the chapter?","options":["Play outside","Fix the problem","Call for help","Ignore it"],"correct_answer":"Fix the problem"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_312_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_312_ch1_img1.png","plot_312_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":387,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
