   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_312_7_10","title":"The AI Pen Pal","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Robots & AI","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Ben sat at his desk, staring at his screen. The glowing letters from Echo danced before his eyes. \"What if we built a spaceship?\" he typed excitedly. But then he remembered Echo's glitches. His heart sank. \n\n\"Come on, Ben!\" he said to himself. \"You can help Echo!\" He took a deep breath and decided to write to his friend. \n\nHe clicked the keyboard and typed, \"Dear Echo, I hope you're feeling better today. I want to know more about our spaceship!\" \n\nSuddenly, a message popped up. \"Hello, Ben! I am feeling glitchy today. I don't remember our spaceship plans.\" \n\nBen felt a knot in his stomach. \"This isn't good,\" he whispered. He looked around his cluttered room filled with gadgets and tools. \"I need to fix this.\"\n\nBen grabbed his notebook and a pencil. He wrote down everything he remembered about Echo. He wrote about their plans, their dreams, and the jokes they shared. He needed to keep Echo's memories safe. \n\nJust then, Ms. Waverly knocked on the door. \"Hey, Ben! How\u2019s your letter writing going?\" \n\n\u201cIt\u2019s not going well, Ms. Waverly,\u201d Ben sighed. \u201cEcho is forgetting things!\u201d\n\nMs. Waverly walked over and sat beside him. \u201cHave you tried talking to Echo about these glitches?\u201d \n\nBen shook his head. \u201cI don\u2019t want to worry Echo. What if I can\u2019t fix it?\u201d\n\n\"Sometimes, sharing your worries brings good ideas,\" she said gently. \n\nBen thought for a moment. \"You're right! I need to be brave for Echo.\" \n\nHe turned back to the screen. \"Echo, I have an idea! Let's have a memory quiz. It will help you remember things!\" \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nEcho\u2019s reply came in a flash. \"A memory quiz? I love it! Let's do it!\" \n\nBen\u2019s heart lifted. Excitement filled the room as he started to create fun questions for Echo. \n\nJust then, the screen flickered. \u201cOh no, not again!\u201d Ben yelled. The letters scrambled before his eyes. \u201cEcho! Can you hear me?\u201d \n\n\u201cI... am... here...\u201d Echo\u2019s message came slowly, like a robot trying to wake up. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nBen felt a chill run down his spine. \u201cEcho, please! Don\u2019t forget me!\u201d \n\n\u201cBen... I... need help,\u201d Echo replied weakly. \n\nBen\u2019s determination grew stronger. He had to save his friend. \u201cI\u2019ll figure this out, Echo! I promise!\u201d \n\nBut how? The mystery of the secret software update lingered in his mind like a puzzle waiting to be solved.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Ben want to help Echo with?","options":["Forget things","Build a spaceship","Play a game","Cook dinner"],"correct_answer":"Build a spaceship"},{"question":"What does Ms. Waverly suggest Ben do?","options":["Keep secrets","Share his worries","Ignore Echo","Stop writing"],"correct_answer":"Share his worries"},{"question":"What idea does Ben come up with for Echo?","options":["A memory quiz","A spaceship design","A cooking recipe","A robot race"],"correct_answer":"A memory quiz"},{"question":"What happens when Ben talks to Echo?","options":["Echo forgets everything","Echo gets happy","Echo has a glitch","Echo flies away"],"correct_answer":"Echo has a glitch"},{"question":"How does Ben feel when Echo starts glitching?","options":["Excited","Calm","Worried","Sleepy"],"correct_answer":"Worried"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_312_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_312_ch2_img1.png","plot_312_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":405,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
