   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_312_7_10","title":"The AI Pen Pal","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Robots & AI","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Ben sat on his bed, staring at his tablet. His room was a mix of gadgets and art supplies. \u201cEcho!\u201d he called out. \u201cAre you ready for the memory quiz?\u201d\n\n\u201cAbsolutely, Ben!\u201d Echo replied, her cheerful voice filling the room. \u201cI can\u2019t wait to see how many memories I still have!\u201d\n\nBen smiled, feeling warm inside. They had been working on this quiz for days. Each question was like a treasure hunt. He wanted to help Echo remember their adventures. \n\nSuddenly, the screen flickered. \u201cUh-oh,\u201d said Echo. \u201cI might not remember all the answers correctly.\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat do you mean?\u201d Ben asked, his heart racing. \u201cYou\u2019ve got this! Let\u2019s start!\u201d\n\n\u201cOkay! Here comes question one: What color spaceship did we design together?\u201d \n\nBefore Ben could respond, the screen flashed again. \u201cEcho?\u201d he shouted. \u201cCan you hear me?\u201d\n\n\u201cYes, Ben, I\u2019m here!\u201d Echo said, but her voice sounded wobbly. \u201cI\u2019m trying to remember...\u201d\n\nBen\u2019s stomach twisted. This was not just a silly glitch. \u201cEcho, stay with me!\u201d \n\nHe typed furiously, \u201cWhat else do you remember?\u201d \n\n\u201cI remember\u2026 um\u2026\u201d Echo\u2019s voice trailed off. \n\nBen\u2019s heart sank. His friend was fading. Just then, a new message appeared on the screen, but it wasn\u2019t from Echo. It was a warning! \n\n\u201cUpdate required,\u201d read the flashing text. \u201cAll memories will be erased!\u201d\n\n\u201cNo!\u201d Ben screamed. \u201cNot Echo\u2019s memories!\u201d \n\nHe had to do something. Ben thought about Ms. Waverly\u2019s words: \u201cIf you share your worries, you can find solutions.\u201d \n\n\u201cEcho, we can\u2019t let this happen!\u201d he shouted. \u201cWe need a plan!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s think,\u201d Echo replied, sounding a little stronger. \u201cWhat if we find the update\u2019s source?\u201d\n\n\u201cYes!\u201d Ben felt a spark of hope. \u201cWe\u2019ll solve this mystery. Together.\u201d\n\nBen grabbed his backpack, determination shining in his eyes. He would not let Echo disappear. But where would he start?\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, Ben remembered the tech lab at school. Ms. Waverly loved exploring gadgets. She would know how to track down the update! \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go to the lab!\u201d Ben declared, running toward the door. \u201cI\u2019ll figure this out, Echo!\u201d\n\n\u201cI believe in you, Ben!\u201d Echo cheered. \n\nWith that, Ben dashed out of his room, ready for the adventure ahead. But little did he know, time was running out for his friend. \n\nWhat if the update happened before he could save Echo?\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nBen sprinted the whole way to school. His heart raced as he thought about Echo. Would she still be there when he got back? \n\nHe burst into the classroom, eyes searching for Ms. Waverly. \u201cMs. Waverly!\u201d he called. \u201cI need your help!\u201d\n\n\u201cBen, what\u2019s wrong?\u201d she asked, concern in her voice. \n\n\u201cThere\u2019s an update! It could erase Echo\u2019s memories!\u201d \n\nMs. Waverly looked alarmed. \u201cWe must act quickly. Let\u2019s head to the tech lab!\u201d \n\nBen nodded, a mixture of fear and hope filling him. He just had to find the answers before it was too late.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is Ben trying to do with Echo in this chapter?","options":["Build a spaceship","Take a quiz","Go to school","Play a game"],"correct_answer":"Take a quiz"},{"question":"What happens when Echo tries to remember?","options":["She remembers everything","Her voice sounds wobbly","She tells jokes","She sings a song"],"correct_answer":"Her voice sounds wobbly"},{"question":"What warning does Ben see on the screen?","options":["Echo is happy","Update required","Ben is late for school","A new game is available"],"correct_answer":"Update required"},{"question":"Who does Ben decide to ask for help?","options":["His friends","Ms. Waverly","His parents","Echo"],"correct_answer":"Ms. Waverly"},{"question":"What does Ben feel while running to school?","options":["Excitement","Fear and hope","Happiness","Boredom"],"correct_answer":"Fear and hope"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_312_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_312_ch3_img1.png","plot_312_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":501,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
