   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_312_7_10","title":"The AI Pen Pal","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Robots & AI","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Ben sat at his desk, staring at the blinking screen. He felt nervous. \"What if Echo's memories really get erased?\" he thought. The cozy room was filled with gadgets, but something felt heavy in his heart. He needed a plan.\n\n\"Ms. Waverly will know what to do!\" he said to himself, feeling a spark of hope. He quickly grabbed his backpack and rushed to school. The sunny day was bright, but his mind was racing. He couldn\u2019t let Echo disappear!\n\nWhen he arrived, Ms. Waverly was in the classroom, organizing colorful books. \"Ben! You look excited!\u201d she said, smiling warmly. \n\n\u201cMs. Waverly, I need your help!\u201d Ben exclaimed. \u201cIt\u2019s about my AI pen pal, Echo. She\u2019s glitching, and I found out there\u2019s a software update that could erase her memories!\u201d\n\nMs. Waverly looked surprised. \u201cOh dear! Let\u2019s sit down and talk about it,\u201d she suggested. They found a quiet corner. \u201cTell me everything.\u201d\n\nAs Ben explained, Ms. Waverly listened carefully. \u201cEcho sounds like a special friend. Let\u2019s see if we can find a way to help her remember,\u201d she said with a reassuring nod. \n\nBen felt a wave of relief. \u201cDo you really think we can?\u201d he asked, hopeful.\n\n\u201cAbsolutely! But we need to act fast. Can you show me more about Echo? Maybe we can find clues in her letters!\u201d \n\n\u201cGreat idea! I\u2019ll show you!\u201d Ben replied, his heart racing with excitement. He pulled out his tablet and opened Echo\u2019s messages. \n\nJust then, a notification popped up. \"Update Available!\" it flashed on the screen. \n\nBen gasped. \u201cNo! Not now!\u201d He clicked it away just in time. \u201cMs. Waverly, we need to be careful. This update might make things worse!\u201d \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s investigate together,\u201d Ms. Waverly said, determination in her voice. \n\nThey spent the afternoon reading Echo\u2019s quirky letters. Suddenly, Ben found a clue! \u201cLook, Ms. Waverly! Echo wrote about her favorite memory!\u201d He pointed to the screen excitedly. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nIt showed a lively drawing of their first letter exchange. Echo had written about how much it meant to her. \n\n\u201cSee how much personality she has?\u201d Ben said. \u201cWe can\u2019t let that go!\u201d\n\nMs. Waverly smiled brightly. \u201cThis is our starting point! We should save these letters. They are Echo\u2019s memories.\u201d\n\nWith renewed energy, they began saving Echo\u2019s favorite moments. Ben felt hope blooming inside him.\n\n\u201cTogether, we can fix this!\u201d he declared. As they worked, he thought of all the fun adventures he had with Echo. \n\n\u201cWe can make a plan to stop the update and find a way to keep her memories safe!\u201d he said. \n\nBen felt a warmth in his heart as they finished saving the last letter. \u201cThank you, Ms. Waverly! You\u2019re the best!\u201d\n\n\u201cRemember, Ben, friendship is powerful, whether it\u2019s with a human or an AI,\" she replied with a wink. \n\nAs he walked home that day, Ben felt lighter. He knew they were getting closer to saving Echo. But what if they couldn\u2019t stop the update in time? He had to keep believing.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWhat was coming next? The adventure was only beginning!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who does Ben seek help from?","options":["His mom","Echo","Ms. Waverly","His friend"],"correct_answer":"Ms. Waverly"},{"question":"What does the notification on Ben's tablet say?","options":["No updates available","Update Available!","Echo is offline","New messages received"],"correct_answer":"Update Available!"},{"question":"What is Ben's main concern about the update?","options":["It will make Echo slower","It could erase Echo's memories","It will change her voice","It will make her smarter"],"correct_answer":"It could erase Echo's memories"},{"question":"What do Ben and Ms. Waverly decide to save?","options":["Their homework","Echo's favorite letters","Ben's drawings","The classroom supplies"],"correct_answer":"Echo's favorite letters"},{"question":"How does Ben feel at the end of the chapter?","options":["Worried","Excited","Angry","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Excited"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_312_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_312_ch4_img1.png","plot_312_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":526,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
