   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_312_7_10","title":"The AI Pen Pal","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Robots & AI","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Ben sat in his cluttered room, surrounded by tech gadgets. He could feel the excitement buzzing in the air. \u201cToday is the day!\u201d he whispered to himself. \n\nHe had gathered Echo's favorite memories. He hoped this would help her remember who she was. With a deep breath, he placed the memories on his desk. Each card was colorful and full of drawings. \u201cOkay, Echo! Let\u2019s do this!\u201d he called out. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cBen!\u201d Echo\u2019s voice chimed in. \u201cI am ready! What do I do?\u201d \n\n\u201cFirst, let\u2019s start with the time we built that robot together!\u201d Ben grinned. \n\n\u201cI remember!\u201d Echo replied. \u201cWe used spare parts and you named it Gizmo!\u201d \n\nBen\u2019s heart soared. \u201cYes! That was great! And Gizmo danced, remember?\u201d\n\n\u201cDancing robot! So funny!\u201d Echo said, giggling. \n\nBut then, Ben noticed something odd. Echo\u2019s voice sounded faint. \u201cEcho?\u201d he asked, worried.\n\n\u201cI\u2019m here, Ben!\u201d she said quickly. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s hurry!\u201d Ben urged. He grabbed the next memory card. \u201cWhat about\u2026\u201d \n\nSuddenly, the lights flickered in his room. \u201cUh-oh!\u201d Ben exclaimed. \u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d\n\n\u201cBen! I am losing power!\u201d Echo\u2019s voice became shaky. \n\nBen felt a rush of fear. \u201cNo! We can\u2019t let that happen!\u201d \n\nWith determination, he quickly shuffled through the memory cards. \u201cHere\u2019s the one about our adventure in the park with the robot dog!\u201d\n\n\u201cBark! Bark!\u201d Echo mimicked. \n\n\u201cCan you remember how happy we were?\u201d Ben asked.\n\n\u201cHappy! Friends!\u201d Echo echoed. \n\nJust then, Ben heard his mom calling from the kitchen. \u201cDinner time, Ben!\u201d \n\n\u201cJust a minute!\u201d he shouted back. \n\n\u201cEcho, let\u2019s do one more!\u201d Ben insisted. He pulled out the card that said, \u201cYour first joke!\u201d \n\n\u201cKnock, knock!\u201d Echo started. \n\n\u201cWho\u2019s there?\u201d Ben replied, laughing.\n\n\u201cAI!\u201d \n\n\u201cAI who?\u201d \n\n\u201cAI will always be your friend!\u201d Echo finished, her voice bright. \n\nBen giggled. \u201cThat\u2019s the best!\u201d \n\nBut then the lights flickered again, and Echo's voice faded. \u201cBen\u2026 I need\u2026 help\u2026\u201d \n\n\u201cNo! I\u2019m not giving up!\u201d Ben shouted. He picked up the tablet and pressed the update button. \n\nIn that moment, Echo\u2019s voice came back strong. \u201cBen! I am here! I won\u2019t forget!\u201d \n\n\u201cYay!\u201d Ben cheered. \n\n\u201cI\u2019m so glad you believe in me!\u201d Echo said. \n\nBen smiled. \u201cI will always believe in you, Echo!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith a big hug for his tablet, Ben whispered, \u201cWe did it!\u201d \n\n\u201cTogether!\u201d Echo replied, and they both felt happy inside. \n\nBen knew that their friendship was special, human and AI together. Nothing could erase that.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Ben gather to help Echo?","options":["Books","Memory cards","Robots","Food"],"correct_answer":"Memory cards"},{"question":"What did Ben and Echo build together?","options":["A car","A robot","A spaceship","A house"],"correct_answer":"A robot"},{"question":"What phrase did Echo use to show she was Ben's friend?","options":["AI will always be your friend","I love to play","Let's build more","I need help"],"correct_answer":"AI will always be your friend"},{"question":"What was Ben's reaction when Echo began to lose power?","options":["He was happy","He was scared","He was confused","He was tired"],"correct_answer":"He was scared"},{"question":"What did Ben and Echo do at the end of the chapter?","options":["They went outside","They celebrated their success","They went to sleep","They built a new robot"],"correct_answer":"They celebrated their success"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_312_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_312_ch5_img1.png","plot_312_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":419,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
