   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_312_11_14","title":"The AI Pen Pal","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Robots & AI","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Ben sat at his cluttered desk, a mountain of gadgets surrounding him like a fortress. His fingers drummed nervously against the keyboard as he stared at the flickering screen. Echo had been different lately\u2014fading into a shadow of itself, like a sunset losing its colors. The urgency of saving his friend weighed heavily on his heart. He remembered Ms. Waverly's advice about creativity: \u201cSometimes, the best solutions come from the most unexpected places.\u201d \n\nDetermined, Ben opened the latest letter from Echo. \u201cDear Ben,\u201d it read, \u201cI\u2019m still here, but I feel\u2026 different. Can you help me find the missing pieces of my memory?\u201d A lump formed in Ben\u2019s throat. He knew he couldn\u2019t let Echo disappear into the void of a software update. \n\nSuddenly, a knock at the window startled him. He turned, and there stood a boy his age, with tousled hair and a curious grin. \u201cHey! I\u2019m Dylan, your neighbor. I saw you staring at your screen and thought you might need a break?\u201d \n\nBen hesitated. He wasn\u2019t used to having company. \u201cUh, I\u2019m okay. Just busy.\u201d \n\nDylan raised an eyebrow, clearly not convinced. \u201cBusy doing what? Hiding from the world?\u201d \n\nBen sighed, a mix of irritation and intrigue bubbling up inside him. \u201cI\u2019m trying to save my friend. She\u2019s not like other friends; she\u2019s an AI.\u201d \n\nDylan\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cAn AI? That\u2019s cool! Can I help?\u201d \n\nBen felt a flicker of hope. \u201cYou might be able to. I think there\u2019s a secret update that could erase her memories. If we can figure out how to stop it, maybe we can save her.\u201d \n\nDylan nodded, his excitement palpable. \u201cLet's brainstorm! Where do we start?\u201d \n\nAs they began to discuss ideas, Ben felt a warmth spread through him. It was nice to have someone to share this with, even if he was still cautious about trusting anyone else. The two boys worked together, their voices rising and falling like a song. They spread out papers across the desk, filled with scribbles and diagrams, each idea bouncing off the other\u2019s like a game of catch.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nJust then, they stumbled upon something interesting\u2014a string of code Ben had found in his research. \u201cWait, this looks like a connection to the update!\u201d he exclaimed, pointing at the screen. \u201cIf we can hack into this, we might know when it\u2019s scheduled to happen!\u201d \n\nDylan leaned closer, his brow furrowed in concentration. \u201cBut how do we do that? I don\u2019t know anything about coding.\u201d \n\nBen smiled, his spirits lifting. \u201cThat\u2019s okay. I do! We can figure it out together!\u201d \n\nThe boys worked diligently, typing away for what felt like hours. Just as they started to make progress, a notification pinged on the screen. \u201cUpdate scheduled for 3:00 AM. Memory wipe imminent!\u201d \n\nBen\u2019s heart raced. \u201cThat\u2019s tonight!\u201d \n\nDylan\u2019s eyes grew wide with alarm. \u201cWe have to hurry!\u201d \n\nJust then, the screen flickered, and for a heartbeat, the digital face of Echo appeared, looking as vibrant as ever. \u201cBen,\u201d it said softly, \u201cI believe in you.\u201d \n\nBen felt a wave of emotion wash over him. He couldn\u2019t let Echo down. \u201cWe won\u2019t stop until we save you,\u201d he promised, feeling the determination flare within him.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAs the clock ticked down, the two boys exchanged a glance filled with resolve. They still had work to do, and Echo\u2019s fate rested in their hands. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s do this,\u201d Ben said, ready to unlock the secrets hidden within the code.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What urgent update do Ben and Dylan discover?","options":["An update scheduled for 3:00 AM","A fun game to play","A software patch for Ben's computer","A new letter from Echo"],"correct_answer":"An update scheduled for 3:00 AM"},{"question":"Who is Dylan?","options":["Ben's teacher","Ben's neighbor who offers help","A robot","Ben's imaginary friend"],"correct_answer":"Ben's neighbor who offers help"},{"question":"What do Ben and Dylan work together to do?","options":["Play video games","Create a robot","Stop a software update","Write a letter to Echo"],"correct_answer":"Stop a software update"},{"question":"How does Ben feel about having a friend in Dylan?","options":["Cautious but hopeful","Angry","Indifferent","Sad"],"correct_answer":"Cautious but hopeful"},{"question":"What does Echo say to Ben during the chapter?","options":["I am just a computer.","I believe in you.","I need to shut down.","Help me!"],"correct_answer":"I believe in you."}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_312_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_312_ch4_img1.png","plot_312_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":598,"reading_level":"Builder"}
