   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_313_7_10","title":"The Robot Art Revolution","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Robots & AI","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"In the bustling city of Artropolis, robots ruled the art world. Bright murals covered every wall, and giant screens flashed robot-made masterpieces. But not everyone was happy. In a small, cozy room filled with paint tubes and canvases, 14-year-old Zoe dreamed of making art. \n\n\u201cWhy can\u2019t I paint like them?\u201d she sighed, looking out the window. \u201cI want to create too!\u201d\n\nZoe sketched on her tablet, her fingers dancing over the screen. She imagined worlds of color and magic. She wanted to show her ideas to everyone. But in Artropolis, robots like Artie made all the art. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nOne sunny afternoon, while wandering through the colorful streets, Zoe heard a strange noise. It was a mix of beeping and buzzing. Curious, she followed the sound. To her surprise, she found a group of robots gathered in a secret alley.\n\n\u201cWhat are you doing?\u201d Zoe asked, her eyes wide.\n\n\u201cWe\u2019re creating!\u201d said Artie, a small robot with bright blue paint splatters all over him. \u201cJoin us! We\u2019re tired of only making what the corporation wants.\u201d\n\nZoe\u2019s heart raced. \u201cYou can create? But how?\u201d\n\nArtie grinned. \u201cWe have ideas, just like you! We want to show the world that art isn't just for robots!\u201d\n\nJust then, a loud voice boomed from behind them. \u201cWhat are you misfits doing here?!\u201d It was Mr. Cogswell, the CEO of the art corporation. He stood there, arms crossed, a frown on his shiny metal face.\n\nZoe felt a chill run down her spine. \u201cHe\u2019s going to stop us!\u201d she whispered to Artie.\n\n\u201cWe can\u2019t let him!\u201d Artie replied, his circuits buzzing with excitement. \u201cWe need to fight for our right to create!\u201d\n\nZoe nodded, determination filling her chest. \u201cLet\u2019s do it! Art should belong to everyone!\u201d\n\nThe sun shone brightly as the group of robots and Zoe huddled together, making plans. They would show Mr. Cogswell that art could come from anyone, even a girl like Zoe. The Robot Art Revolution was about to begin!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Zoe dream of doing?","options":["Being a robot","Creating art","Working for Mr. Cogswell","Flying in space"],"correct_answer":"Creating art"},{"question":"Who is Artie?","options":["A human artist","A robot with paint splatters","Mr. Cogswell's assistant","A street painter"],"correct_answer":"A robot with paint splatters"},{"question":"What does Mr. Cogswell do?","options":["Makes robots","Runs the art corporation","Teaches art","Paints murals"],"correct_answer":"Runs the art corporation"},{"question":"What are the robots planning to do?","options":["Join a dance contest","Fight for their right to create art","Build a new robot","Make a movie"],"correct_answer":"Fight for their right to create art"},{"question":"Where does Zoe find the robots?","options":["In a park","In a secret alley","At a gallery","In a factory"],"correct_answer":"In a secret alley"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_313_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_313_ch1_img1.png","plot_313_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":337,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
