   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_313_7_10","title":"The Robot Art Revolution","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Robots & AI","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Zoe stood in the heart of Artropolis. Bright colors splashed across the walls. Robots zoomed by, carrying giant canvases. She felt small in this bustling city of art. But her dream was big.\n\n\u201cArtie! Are you ready?\u201d Zoe called, looking for her robot friend.\n\n\u201cReady and willing!\u201d Artie whirred, rolling over on his tiny wheels. His metal arms waved excitedly. \u201cWhat\u2019s our plan today?\u201d\n\nZoe took a deep breath. \u201cWe need to make a statement! The art world needs to see that people can create, too!\u201d \n\nArtie nodded, his eyes blinking with enthusiasm. \u201cLet\u2019s show them what we can do!\u201d \n\nThey hurried down a narrow alley. A secret world of colors and creativity lay ahead. Hidden galleries filled the space, each overflowing with paintings. Zoe felt her heart race. This was their chance!\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nIn the distance, the tall building of Cogswell Art Corporation loomed. It was gray and cold, a stark contrast to the vibrant art around them. Zoe shivered. \u201cMr. Cogswell won\u2019t like this. He wants all the art to come from robots.\u201d\n\n\u201cI say, let\u2019s give him a surprise!\u201d Artie chirped, his voice filled with mischief. \n\nAs they turned a corner, they spotted a group of robots. They were painting a massive mural. Zoe\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cLook at them go! They\u2019re actually creating!\u201d \n\nSuddenly, a loud voice boomed. \u201cStop right there!\u201d It was Mr. Cogswell himself, flanked by security robots. \n\nZoe gasped. \u201cThey can\u2019t do this! Art is for everyone!\u201d\n\nMr. Cogswell sneered. \u201cArt belongs to the machines! You cannot stop us!\u201d \n\nThe robots stopped painting, their gears whirring nervously. Zoe felt a surge of courage. \n\n\u201cTogether, we can show them!\u201d Zoe shouted. \u201cWe can create our own art!\u201d\n\nArtie beamed. \u201cLet\u2019s do it, Zoe! Let\u2019s start our own revolution!\u201d\n\nZoe took a step forward, ready to face the challenge. This was just the beginning of their fight. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cArt is in our hearts, not just in circuits!\u201d Zoe declared, her voice strong. She knew they had to act fast. If they didn\u2019t, the art world might never change.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s gather more friends!\u201d Artie suggested, his eyes sparkling. \u201cWe\u2019ll make the biggest mural Artropolis has ever seen!\u201d\n\nZoe nodded, determination shining in her eyes. The battle for creativity had just begun!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What city does Zoe live in?","options":["Artropolis","Roboville","City of Art","Robot Town"],"correct_answer":"Artropolis"},{"question":"Who is Zoe's robot friend?","options":["Cogswell","Artie","Robbie","Pixie"],"correct_answer":"Artie"},{"question":"What does Mr. Cogswell want?","options":["Art for everyone","All art from robots","No art at all","More colors"],"correct_answer":"All art from robots"},{"question":"What do Zoe and Artie plan to create?","options":["A robot","A mural","A song","A story"],"correct_answer":"A mural"},{"question":"How does Zoe feel when she sees the robots painting?","options":["Scared","Excited","Bored","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_313_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_313_ch2_img1.png","plot_313_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":388,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
