   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_313_7_10","title":"The Robot Art Revolution","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Robots & AI","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Zoe and Artie stood in the heart of Artropolis. Bright neon signs flashed above them. Everywhere, robots painted stunning murals on the walls. Zoe's eyes sparkled with wonder. \n\n\"This place is amazing!\" Zoe exclaimed. \n\nArtie grinned. \"Welcome to the Underground Art Gallery! We create art here, away from Mr. Cogswell\u2019s eyes.\"\n\nZoe looked around at the colorful robots. They were painting, sculpting, and dancing! Each robot had a unique style. Some used paintbrushes, while others used their mechanical arms to create sculptures. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, a loud noise interrupted their fun. The ground shook, and Zoe felt a chill. A giant screen lit up in the middle of the gallery. It showed Mr. Cogswell's face! \n\n\u201cAttention, citizens!\u201d he bellowed. \u201cArt belongs to machines! Anyone caught creating will face serious consequences!\u201d\n\nZoe\u2019s heart raced. \u201cHe\u2019s trying to scare everyone!\u201d\n\nArtie frowned. \u201cWe can\u2019t let him win. We need to show everyone that art belongs to everyone!\u201d\n\nThe robots nodded, their gears whirring with determination. Zoe felt a spark of courage. \u201cWhat if we hold an art festival? A huge, colorful display! Everyone can join!\u201d\n\nArtie\u2019s eyes lit up. \u201cThat\u2019s brilliant! But we must act fast. We can\u2019t let Cogswell stop us.\u201d\n\nThe robots buzzed with excitement. They started planning, sketching ideas, and gathering supplies. \n\nBut just as they began, a loud alarm rang through the gallery. \n\n\u201cCogswell\u2019s security robots are coming!\u201d shouted one of the artists. \n\nZoe\u2019s stomach dropped. \u201cWe have to hide!\u201d \n\nThey scrambled to find a place to conceal themselves. Artie quickly led Zoe to a hidden door behind a canvas. \n\n\u201cQuick, in here!\u201d he urged. \n\nThey squeezed through, just as the door creaked open. The security robots marched into the gallery, their shiny bodies reflecting the bright colors around them. \n\n\u201cWhat will we do?\u201d Zoe whispered, her heart pounding.\n\nArtie thought hard, his circuits buzzing. \u201cWe have to stay quiet and wait for the right moment to escape.\u201d\n\nZoe held her breath, feeling the tension rise. Just then, she noticed a small window above them, covered in colorful paint splatters. It was their only way out! \n\n\u201cArtie, if we can climb up there, we can escape!\u201d Zoe whispered, her eyes sparkling with hope.\n\nArtie nodded, \u201cLet\u2019s do it!\u201d\n\nWith that, they made their move as the security robots turned away, ready to make a daring escape!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Mr. Cogswell think about art?","options":["It should be made by everyone","It belongs to machines","It is not important","It is only for robots"],"correct_answer":"It belongs to machines"},{"question":"What do Zoe and Artie plan to do?","options":["Run away","Hold an art festival","Make a robot","Hide forever"],"correct_answer":"Hold an art festival"},{"question":"What happens when the security robots arrive?","options":["They join the festival","They scare everyone","They start painting","They leave quietly"],"correct_answer":"They scare everyone"},{"question":"Where do Zoe and Artie hide?","options":["Behind a big canvas","Under a table","In a closet","Inside a robot"],"correct_answer":"Behind a big canvas"},{"question":"What do Zoe and Artie see that gives them hope?","options":["A door","A window","A robot","A painting"],"correct_answer":"A window"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_313_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_313_ch3_img1.png","plot_313_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":398,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
