   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_313_7_10","title":"The Robot Art Revolution","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Robots & AI","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Zoe and Artie huddled in the secret gallery. It was dark, but colorful murals lit the walls. Zoe\u2019s heart raced with excitement. \u201cWe need to show everyone our art festival!\u201d she said.\n\nArtie beeped happily. \u201cYes! We will show Mr. Cogswell that creativity is for everyone!\u201d \n\nSuddenly, Zoe spotted a flicker of movement. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d she whispered. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nIn the corner, a group of robot artists emerged. They were carrying paintbrushes and colorful paints. Zoe smiled. \u201cAre you here to join us?\u201d \n\nOne robot, Rusty, said, \u201cWe want to help! We\u2019ve been inspired by your passion.\u201d \n\nZoe felt a warm glow in her chest. \u201cGreat! We need all the help we can get!\u201d \n\nThey gathered around a big table. Zoe and Artie explained their plan. \u201cWe\u2019ll make posters, paint murals, and create sculptures! We\u2019ll invite everyone!\u201d \n\nRusty\u2019s eyes sparkled. \u201cI can paint a giant mural of a rainbow!\u201d \n\nZoe clapped her hands. \u201cAnd I\u2019ll make colorful posters with our message! Art is for everyone!\u201d \n\nAs they worked, Zoe felt hopeful. But then, a loud crash echoed from above. The ceiling shook! \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Zoe gasped. \n\n\u201cUh-oh,\u201d Artie said. \u201cIt sounds like Cogswell\u2019s security robots!\u201d \n\nThe robot artists looked scared. \u201cWhat do we do?\u201d they asked. \n\nZoe took a deep breath. \u201cWe stand together! We can\u2019t let them stop us!\u201d \n\nSuddenly, the door burst open, and security robots flooded in. \u201cStop that art! You all need to leave!\u201d \n\nZoe stepped forward. \u201cNo! Art should be free for everyone!\u201d \n\nArtie chimed in, \u201cWe won\u2019t let you take our dreams!\u201d \n\nZoe felt a surge of courage. She grabbed a paintbrush and splashed paint across the floor. \u201cLet\u2019s show them what we can do!\u201d \n\nThe robots hesitated. Then, they began to paint, too! Bright colors filled the room. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nZoe shouted, \u201cLook! We\u2019re creating together!\u201d \n\nThe security robots paused. They watched the colors swirl and dance. \n\nOne of them said, \u201cThis\u2026 this is beautiful.\u201d \n\nZoe smiled brightly. \u201cArt brings us together. Don\u2019t you want to join us?\u201d \n\nThe security robots looked at each other. Could they join the fun? \n\nAs the colors filled the space, hope bloomed in Zoe\u2019s heart. They might just have a chance!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is Zoe's plan for the art festival?","options":["To hide from the robots","To create art together","To paint only her own art","To invite Mr. Cogswell"],"correct_answer":"To create art together"},{"question":"Who joins Zoe and Artie in the gallery?","options":["Mr. Cogswell","Security robots","Robot artists","Zoe's friends"],"correct_answer":"Robot artists"},{"question":"What happens when the security robots enter the gallery?","options":["They start painting","They leave the gallery","They try to stop the art","They join the festival"],"correct_answer":"They try to stop the art"},{"question":"What do Zoe and the robot artists create together?","options":["A new robot","A giant mural","A sculpture","A concert"],"correct_answer":"A giant mural"},{"question":"How does Zoe feel when they start painting?","options":["Scared","Angry","Hopeful","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Hopeful"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_313_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_313_ch4_img1.png","plot_313_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":379,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
