     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"metropolis","1":"rebellious","2":"spectacle","3":"oppression","4":"unity","image_prompts":["A vibrant street scene in Neon City, filled with colorful murals and towering holographic billboards. Zoe stands in the foreground, pointing excitedly at a mural of a swirling vortex, her face lit with inspiration. Artie, the whimsical robot, is next to her, tilting his head with curiosity. The bustling crowd of robots and humans adds a lively atmosphere to the scene.","A dramatic underground art gallery filled with half-finished sculptures and canvases. Zoe and the group of robots are hidden behind a large canvas, eyes wide with fear as Mr. Cogswell and his Enforcement Bots burst through the door. Tension fills the air, with shadows looming ominously, while a mysterious glowing figure stands just outside the light, poised to help."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing Zoe, a 14-year-old girl with bright eyes, stands fascinated in a vibrant underground gallery, surrounded by colorful graffiti art. The atmosphere is alive with neon lights casting reflections on her face, capturing her awe as she looks towards Artie, a metallic robot artist with expressive features, as he climbs a sculpture made of electronic parts.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_313_ch2_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 14:28:00"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing Zoe is at a dimly lit exit, her face showing fierce determination against the backdrop of shadowy figures of OmniArt enforcers closing in. The flickering neon light above casts an ominous glow, emphasizing the tension in her stance as she prepares to escape, embodying the fight for creative freedom and the risk that comes with it.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","fi