     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"sanctuary","1":"emboldened","2":"cacophony","3":"resonated","4":"defiance","image_prompts":["A vibrant underground gallery filled with diverse groups of artists\u2014humans and robots\u2014interacting amidst colorful displays of artwork. The lighting is warm and inviting, illuminating the vivid colors of the murals and canvases. Zoe stands in the foreground, her expression a mix of awe and determination, while Artie playfully splashes paint onto a canvas behind her, embodying the spirit of creativity.","A tense standoff between Zoe, Artie, and the OmniArt enforcers. The gallery's colorful mural, a fusion of robotic and human artistry, serves as a backdrop. Zoe stands resolutely in front of the mural, her eyes fierce with defiance, while the tall enforcer looms threateningly. The atmosphere is charged with emotion, highlighting the clash between oppression and the spirit of artistic freedom."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A vibrant underground gallery filled with diverse groups of artistshumans and robotsinteracting amidst colorful displays of artwork. The lighting is warm and inviting, illuminating the vivid colors of the murals and canvases. Zoe stands in the foreground, her expression a mix of awe and determination, while Artie playfully splashes paint onto a canvas behind her, embodying the spirit of creativity.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_313_ch4_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 14:26:23"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A tense standoff between Zoe, Artie, and the OmniArt enforcers. The gallerys colorful mural, a fusion of robotic and human artistry, serves as a backdrop. Zoe stands resolutely in front of the mural, her eyes fierce with defiance, while the tall enforcer looms threateningly. The atmosphere is ch