       [DEBUG] Checking shared image: {"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A suburban backyard bathed in golden sunlight, littered with open books and historical artifacts. Sam, a curious thirteen-year-old with tousled hair, is kneeling in awe as he gazes at Chrono, a quirky, clumsy robot with bright, blinking eyes and a mishmash of metal and wires. The atmosphere is filled with a sense of wonder and discovery, symbolizing the merging of history and technology.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_314_ch1_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 14:24:58"}
