   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_314_7_10","title":"The Time-Traveling Robot","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Robots & AI","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Sam loved history. He loved reading about knights, ancient Egypt, and pioneers. His room was filled with books, posters, and colorful maps. One sunny afternoon, while exploring his backyard, Sam noticed something strange. \n\n\u201cWhat is that?\u201d he whispered to himself. A shiny metal object lay sprawled on the grass, sparkling under the sunlight. Sam tiptoed closer.\n\nSuddenly, the object beeped! \"Bleep! Bloop!\" it said. Sam jumped back. Then, a little door popped open, and out stepped a robot. \n\n\u201cGreetings, Earthling!\u201d it announced. \u201cI am Chrono, the time-traveling robot!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSam\u2019s eyes grew wide. \u201cA time-traveling robot? Really?\u201d he asked, excitement bubbling in his chest.\n\n\u201cIndeed!\u201d Chrono replied, doing a little spin. \u201cI can take you anywhere in time! But I have a problem. My time machine is broken.\u201d\n\n\u201cBroken?\u201d Sam furrowed his brow. \u201cWhat happened?\u201d\n\n\u201cDr. Vortex, a villain, wants to steal my time machine! If he does, he could change history!\u201d Chrono\u2019s eyes blinked in worry. \n\nSam\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWe need to fix it! What do we do?\u201d\n\nChrono looked thoughtful. \u201cFirst, we need to find the Time Crystal. It powers my machine. Without it, we are stuck!\u201d \n\nSam nodded. \u201cWhere do we find it?\u201d\n\n\u201cIn ancient Egypt! But we must hurry!\u201d Chrono replied, his voice shaky. \u201cDr. Vortex will be after it too!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d shouted Sam. Together, they rushed to the time machine as Chrono pressed buttons with his clumsy metal fingers. Lights flashed and beeps filled the air. \n\n\u201cHold on tight!\u201d Chrono said. \n\nThe ground shook, and suddenly, everything became a blur. Time and space twisted around them. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith a loud pop, they landed in a bright desert. Huge pyramids loomed in front of them.\n\n\u201cWow! We\u2019re in Egypt!\u201d Sam exclaimed. \n\n\u201cRemember, we need to find the Time Crystal before Dr. Vortex does,\u201d Chrono reminded him.\n\nAs they stepped forward, a shadow loomed behind a pyramid. Sam gulped. They weren\u2019t alone.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Sam love?","options":["Science","History","Math","Sports"],"correct_answer":"History"},{"question":"What is the robot's name?","options":["Chrono","Dr. Vortex","Sam","Time Machine"],"correct_answer":"Chrono"},{"question":"Who is the villain in the story?","options":["Sam","Chrono","Dr. Vortex","An Egyptian"],"correct_answer":"Dr. Vortex"},{"question":"Where do they need to go to find the Time Crystal?","options":["The Wild West","Ancient Egypt","Medieval Times","The Future"],"correct_answer":"Ancient Egypt"},{"question":"What happens when they activate the time machine?","options":["They teleport to space","They go to ancient Egypt","They break it more","They meet Dr. Vortex"],"correct_answer":"They go to ancient Egypt"}]},"images":null,"word_count":324,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
