   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_314_7_10","title":"The Time-Traveling Robot","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Robots & AI","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Sam stared at the metallic body of Chrono. The robot blinked his glowing blue eyes. \"We need to find the Time Crystal in ancient Egypt!\" he exclaimed, his voice buzzing with excitement. \n\n\"Ancient Egypt? Like, with pharaohs and pyramids?\" Sam asked, his heart racing. The idea of exploring a real pyramid thrilled him!\n\n\"Yes! But we have a problem,\" Chrono said, his voice wobbling. \"Dr. Vortex knows we're looking for the crystal. He could follow us!\"\n\nSam scratched his head. \"What do we do?\" \n\n\"We must hurry! Activate the time machine!\" Chrono waved his arms, and a small hatch opened. Inside, colorful buttons blinked like stars. \n\nSam jumped in. \"This is so cool!\" He pressed a shiny red button. Suddenly, the machine whirred, and bright lights swirled around them. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nIn a flash, they found themselves standing in the hot sun. The Great Pyramid of Giza loomed before them, its peak touching the clear blue sky. Sam couldn't believe his eyes! \n\n\"Wow, it\u2019s huge!\" he shouted, squinting at the massive stones. \"Can we go inside?\"\n\n\"Of course!\" Chrono replied, giving a clumsy spin. \"But be careful. Dr. Vortex could be anywhere.\"\n\nAs they approached the pyramid, a loud thud echoed behind them. Sam turned around. A shadowy figure lurked in the doorway. \"Well, well, if it isn't the time-traveling duo!\" It was Dr. Vortex, his eyes gleaming with mischief.\n\nSam felt a shiver run down his spine. \"What do you want, Vortex?\" he said, trying to sound brave.\n\n\"I want the Time Crystal!\" he hissed. \"Hand it over, or you'll be trapped in time forever!\"\n\nChrono's gears clicked nervously. \"We won\u2019t let you take it!\" he shouted. \n\nSuddenly, the ground shook! A pile of stones tumbled down, blocking their way. \"Hurry, Sam! We must find the crystal and escape!\" \n\n\"Right!\" Sam said, his heart pounding. He quickly scanned the area. \"Look! There\u2019s a crack in the wall. Maybe we can sneak through!\" \n\nAs they squeezed into the narrow space, Sam felt excitement bubbling inside him. They could do this! They just needed to find the crystal and outsmart Dr. Vortex.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThey crawled through the crack and emerged in a hidden chamber. Ancient hieroglyphs decorated the walls. In the center stood a glowing pedestal. And on it rested a sparkling Time Crystal!\n\n\u201cSam, we found it!\u201d Chrono cheered. \n\nBut before they could celebrate, they heard footsteps approaching. Dr. Vortex was right behind them!\n\n\u201cGrab the crystal and run!\u201d Sam shouted. \n\nThey snatched the crystal just in time. The chase was on!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Where do Sam and Chrono travel to in this chapter?","options":["The Wild West","Ancient Egypt","Medieval Castle","The Future"],"correct_answer":"Ancient Egypt"},{"question":"Who threatens Sam and Chrono in the pyramid?","options":["A pharaoh","Dr. Vortex","An ancient spirit","A friendly robot"],"correct_answer":"Dr. Vortex"},{"question":"What do they need to find in the pyramid?","options":["A treasure map","The Time Crystal","A magic spell","A secret door"],"correct_answer":"The Time Crystal"},{"question":"What does Chrono do when they first arrive in Egypt?","options":["He starts dancing","He spins around","He flies away","He goes to sleep"],"correct_answer":"He spins around"},{"question":"What happens when they try to escape Dr. Vortex?","options":["They find a treasure","The ground shakes","They get lost","They meet a pharaoh"],"correct_answer":"The ground shakes"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_314_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_314_ch2_img1.png","plot_314_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":426,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
