   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_314_7_10","title":"The Time-Traveling Robot","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Robots & AI","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Chapter 3: The Sands of Time\n\nThe bright sun shone over ancient Egypt. Sam blinked as he looked around. \"Wow, it's so sandy!\" he exclaimed. Large pyramids towered above them. They were golden against the blue sky. Chrono spun his head in amazement. \"This is amazing, Sam!\" he said. \"But we need to find the Time Crystal quickly!\"\n\nSam nodded. \"Where should we start?\" \n\nChrono pointed to a bustling market nearby. \"Let\u2019s ask the people there!\" \n\nThey hurried to the market. Colorful stalls filled with fruits and spices surrounded them. Merchants shouted, and people laughed. \"Excuse me!\" Sam called to a merchant with a tall hat. \"Have you seen a glowing crystal?\"\n\nThe merchant tilted his head. \"Ah, yes! The crystal is kept in the Great Pyramid!\" \n\n\"Great! But we need to hurry!\" Chrono said. Suddenly, a shadow loomed over them. \n\nDr. Vortex appeared with a sneer. \"You won\u2019t find the Time Crystal, kids!\" he growled, his cape fluttering dramatically. \n\nSam's heart raced. \"We have to get to the pyramid first!\" he whispered urgently to Chrono. \n\n\"Let\u2019s go!\" Chrono replied. They dashed through the crowd, dodging people and carts. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThey reached the Great Pyramid. It loomed like a giant sandcastle. \"How do we get in?\" Sam asked, panting. \n\nChrono scanned the entrance. \"I can hack the door!\" His eyes flashed with excitement. \n\nDr. Vortex\u2019s voice echoed behind them. \"Think you can escape me?\" he shouted. \n\nSam\u2019s stomach dropped. \"We have to hurry!\" \n\nChrono pressed his metallic fingers against the door. \"Almost\u2026 there!\" He concentrated. A click sounded, and the door creaked open. \n\nJust then, Dr. Vortex lunged forward. \"Stop them!\" \n\nChrono rushed inside. \"Quick, Sam!\" \n\nInside the pyramid, darkness enveloped them. Sam felt the cool air on his skin. \"Where's the crystal?\" he asked. \n\n\u201cOver there!\u201d Chrono pointed to a glowing light deep in the shadows. \n\nAs they moved closer, the ground shook. Sam gasped. \"What\u2019s happening?\" \n\n\"We're running out of time!\" Chrono exclaimed. \n\nThey sprinted toward the light. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nBut just as they reached it, Dr. Vortex blocked their way. \"This is my prize!\" he shouted. \n\nSam and Chrono exchanged worried glances. They had to think fast. \u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d Sam whispered.\n\n\u201cDistract him!\u201d Chrono said. \n\nSam took a deep breath. \u201cLook, Dr. Vortex! A giant sandstorm!\u201d \n\nDr. Vortex turned, eyes wide. \u201cWhat?!\u201d\n\n\u201cNow, Chrono!\u201d Sam yelled. \n\nThe robot dove for the crystal, but would they get caught?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Sam and Chrono need to find in Egypt?","options":["A Time Machine","A Time Crystal","A Golden Pyramid","A Flying Carpet"],"correct_answer":"A Time Crystal"},{"question":"Who appears to stop Sam and Chrono?","options":["A Friendly Merchant","Dr. Vortex","A Giant Sandstorm","A Camel"],"correct_answer":"Dr. Vortex"},{"question":"Where is the crystal located?","options":["In the Market","In the Great Pyramid","In a Castle","In the Desert"],"correct_answer":"In the Great Pyramid"},{"question":"What does Sam suggest to distract Dr. Vortex?","options":["A Dance","A Giant Sandstorm","A Joke","A Song"],"correct_answer":"A Giant Sandstorm"},{"question":"What does Chrono try to do at the pyramid's entrance?","options":["Open the Door","Hide","Take a Break","Run Away"],"correct_answer":"Open the Door"}]},"images":null,"word_count":409,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
