   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_314_7_10","title":"The Time-Traveling Robot","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Robots & AI","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Sam and Chrono stood in front of the Great Pyramid. The ancient stones towered high above them. \"Wow, look at that!\" Sam exclaimed, pointing at the pyramid's golden tip. \"It's amazing!\"\n\nChrono's eyes lit up. \"Indeed! But we must hurry, Sam. Dr. Vortex is close behind!\" His metal fingers fumbled with a shiny tool. \"We need the Time Crystal to fix my time machine!\"\n\nJust then, a shadow loomed over them. It was Dr. Vortex! \"Ha! You think you can escape me so easily?\" he sneered. \"Give me the Time Crystal, or you'll regret it!\"\n\n\"We won\u2019t let you take it!\" Sam shouted. He held the crystal tightly in his hand. \"Chrono, what do we do?\"\n\nChrono thought for a moment. \"We need to create a distraction! Quick, follow me!\" He dashed behind a nearby stone statue. Sam followed, his heart racing.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nBehind the statue, Sam and Chrono peeked out. Dr. Vortex was searching for them, his cape billowing like a dark cloud. \"I can\u2019t believe he\u2019s so close!\" Sam whispered. \"What if he catches us?\"\n\nChrono pulled out a shiny gadget. \"This will make a loud noise! It will confuse him!\" He pressed a button, and the gadget beeped loudly. It sounded like a rooster crowing. The noise echoed through the air.\n\nDr. Vortex turned sharply. \"What was that?\" he growled. He ran toward the noise, leaving Sam and Chrono behind. \"Now's our chance!\" Sam said, feeling a surge of hope.\n\nThey dashed toward the entrance of the pyramid. \"We can find the Time Crystal inside!\" Sam declared. As they entered, they were met with dark, cool air and ancient hieroglyphs on the walls.\n\n\"Look at these drawings!\" Chrono pointed, his voice full of excitement. \"They tell stories of the past!\"\n\nSuddenly, Sam spotted a glimmering light. \"There it is! The Time Crystal!\" he shouted, racing toward the bright glow. It was perched on a golden pedestal, sparkling like a star.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nJust as Sam reached for it, the ground shook. Dr. Vortex had returned! \"You won't get away this time!\" he yelled. Sam grabbed the crystal, clutching it tightly.\n\n\"Run, Sam!\" Chrono shouted. They sprinted deeper into the pyramid, with Dr. Vortex hot on their tails.\n\nAs they turned a corner, Sam felt brave. \"We can do this, Chrono! We just need to get out of here!\" \n\nBut how would they escape? The adventure was far from over!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Sam and Chrono need to fix the time machine?","options":["Time Crystal","Time Gate","Magic Wand","Ancient Map"],"correct_answer":"Time Crystal"},{"question":"Who is chasing Sam and Chrono in the pyramid?","options":["A friendly wizard","Dr. Vortex","An ancient pharaoh","A giant monster"],"correct_answer":"Dr. Vortex"},{"question":"What does Chrono use to create a distraction?","options":["A loud gadget","A magic spell","A pet cat","A drum"],"correct_answer":"A loud gadget"},{"question":"Where do Sam and Chrono find the Time Crystal?","options":["On a tree","In a treasure chest","On a golden pedestal","In the sand"],"correct_answer":"On a golden pedestal"},{"question":"What do they do when they see Dr. Vortex again?","options":["Try to talk to him","Run deeper into the pyramid","Hide in a hole","Make him a friend"],"correct_answer":"Run deeper into the pyramid"}]},"images":null,"word_count":406,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
