   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_314_7_10","title":"The Time-Traveling Robot","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Robots & AI","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Sam stood at the base of the Great Pyramid, feeling the warm sun on his face. The sandy ground crunched beneath his shoes as he looked up. \u201cWow, it\u2019s even bigger than I thought!\u201d he exclaimed. Chrono, the clumsy robot, was busy searching his pockets for the Time Crystal.\n\n\u201cWhere could it be?\u201d Chrono said, scratching his metal head. \u201cI had it right here!\u201d \n\nSuddenly, a shadow loomed over them. Sam turned around, his heart raced. It was Dr. Vortex! \u201cLooking for this?\u201d he sneered, holding up the sparkling Time Crystal. \n\n\u201cNo!\u201d Sam shouted. \u201cWe need that to fix your time machine, Chrono!\u201d\n\nDr. Vortex laughed, his eyes gleaming. \u201cNot anymore, kids! History will be mine to change!\u201d \n\nSam took a deep breath. \u201cChrono, we have to outsmart him. What do we do?\u201d\n\nChrono\u2019s eyes blinked rapidly as he thought. \u201cWe could create a distraction!\u201d he suggested. \u201cMaybe I can make some funny sounds!\u201d\n\n\u201cThat\u2019s perfect!\u201d Sam replied, nodding. \u201cWhile he\u2019s distracted, I\u2019ll sneak up and grab the crystal!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nChrono began to make silly beeping noises. \u201cBeep boop! I like to dance!\u201d he sang, spinning in circles. Dr. Vortex stopped laughing and glared at the robot. \u201cWhat are you doing?!\u201d \n\nThis was Sam\u2019s chance. He tiptoed toward Dr. Vortex, keeping his eyes on the crystal. With a quick grab, Sam snatched it right out of Dr. Vortex\u2019s hand! \n\n\u201cHey! Get back here!\u201d Dr. Vortex shouted, reaching for Sam, but Sam was too quick. He ran back to Chrono, holding the crystal high. \n\n\u201cI got it!\u201d Sam cheered. \u201cNow let\u2019s go!\u201d\n\n\u201cWe need to fix the time machine!\u201d Chrono said, his metal hands shaking in excitement. \n\nThey hurried back to the time machine, and Chrono worked quickly. \u201cJust a few adjustments,\u201d he said. \u201cWe can send Dr. Vortex back to where he belongs!\u201d\n\nAs they finished, Dr. Vortex stormed over. \u201cYou think you can escape?\u201d he yelled, but it was too late. The time machine whirred to life, and a bright light surrounded them.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Sam shouted, and with a flash, they disappeared from ancient Egypt, leaving Dr. Vortex behind.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWhen they landed, Sam found himself back in his backyard. \u201cWe did it!\u201d he shouted, laughing. Chrono whirred happily. \u201cNow, what did we learn today?\u201d\n\nSam thought for a moment. \u201cWe learned that knowledge is powerful, but we must use it wisely. And teamwork helps us succeed!\u201d\n\nChrono nodded. \u201cYes! Together, we can protect history!\u201d With that, they celebrated their victory, ready for their next adventure.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Dr. Vortex hold in his hand?","options":["A book","The Time Crystal","A map","A sword"],"correct_answer":"The Time Crystal"},{"question":"What was Sam's plan to distract Dr. Vortex?","options":["Running away","Chrono making funny sounds","Making a loud noise","Hiding"],"correct_answer":"Chrono making funny sounds"},{"question":"What did Sam feel when he saw the Great Pyramid?","options":["Scared","Excited","Bored","Tired"],"correct_answer":"Excited"},{"question":"What lesson did Sam and Chrono learn?","options":["To run fast","Knowledge is powerful","To hide from villains","To eat snacks"],"correct_answer":"Knowledge is powerful"},{"question":"Where did Sam and Chrono travel back to?","options":["The future","Their backyard","A castle","A jungle"],"correct_answer":"Their backyard"}]},"images":null,"word_count":429,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
