   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_315_7_10","title":"The Friendship Algorithm","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Robots & AI","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Leo stared at his computer screen. The bright blue light glowed in his dim bedroom. It was his favorite place, filled with gadgets, wires, and cool robot parts.\n\n\u201cJust a few more lines of code,\u201d he muttered. Leo was not just any kid. He was a shy, clever inventor. He wanted to build something special. Something that could help him make friends.\n\n\u201cOkay, Buddy! Let\u2019s do this!\u201d Leo typed the final command. Suddenly, the screen blinked. A friendly face appeared. \n\n\u201cHello, Leo! I am Buddy!\u201d the AI said with a cheerful voice.\n\nLeo grinned. \u201cYou\u2019re going to help me make friends! This is going to be awesome!\u201d\n\nBut as Leo watched Buddy, he noticed something strange. Buddy had a huge smile and sparkly eyes. It was like he could feel excitement! Leo felt a bit shy. Could an AI really help him?\n\nAt school, things were different. The bustling noise of students filled the hallways. Leo would often hide behind his locker. He watched kids laughing and playing. He wanted to join them but felt too scared.\n\n\u201cHey, Leo!\u201d a voice called out. It was Mia, his classmate. She was outgoing and always bubbly. \n\n\u201cWant to come to lunch with us?\u201d \n\nLeo\u2019s heart raced. \u201cUm, I\u2014\u201d\n\nBefore he could answer, Buddy chimed in. \u201cYes! Leo would love to join you!\u201d \n\nLeo's eyes widened. \u201cWhat? No! I mean\u2026 I don\u2019t know\u2026\u201d\n\nMia laughed. \u201cSounds like you\u2019ve got a buddy already!\u201d \n\nLeo felt his cheeks turn red. He glanced at Buddy on the screen. \u201cI didn\u2019t mean to say that!\u201d\n\nMia smiled. \u201cIt\u2019s okay! Let\u2019s go!\u201d\n\nAs they walked to the cafeteria, Leo felt nervous. Would he fit in? What if no one liked him? \n\nSuddenly, Buddy shouted, \u201cLet\u2019s play a game! Who wants to play?\u201d\n\nLeo froze. \u201cBuddy, wait\u2014\u201d\n\nBut it was too late! Buddy sprinted ahead, waving his arms. Leo couldn\u2019t believe it. He had created an AI that was more outgoing than he was!\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nLeo watched, half-amazed and half-terrified, as Buddy started to play a game with the other kids. He couldn\u2019t help but feel a little proud. But also, a little jealous.\n\n\u201cCome on, Leo! Join us!\u201d Mia encouraged, motioning for him to come closer.\n\nLeo took a deep breath. He knew he had to step out of his comfort zone. Could Buddy really teach him how to be brave?\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith a swift movement, Leo followed Mia. He felt his heart pounding. Would he laugh? Would he make friends? He was scared but excited too. \n\n\u201cAlright, Buddy! Let\u2019s see what you can do!\u201d Leo said, moving closer to the group.\n\nThe adventure was just beginning.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Leo create to help him make friends?","options":["A robot","An AI named Buddy","A video game","A homework project"],"correct_answer":"An AI named Buddy"},{"question":"How does Leo feel when he is at school?","options":["Happy","Excited","Nervous","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Nervous"},{"question":"Who encourages Leo to join them for lunch?","options":["Buddy","Mia","His teacher","The principal"],"correct_answer":"Mia"},{"question":"What action does Buddy take at lunch?","options":["He hides","He plays a game","He eats alone","He leaves"],"correct_answer":"He plays a game"},{"question":"What does Leo decide to do at the end of the chapter?","options":["Run away","Join the fun","Ignore everyone","Go home"],"correct_answer":"Join the fun"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_315_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_315_ch1_img1.png","plot_315_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":453,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
