   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_315_7_10","title":"The Friendship Algorithm","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Robots & AI","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Leo sat at his desk, staring at the screen. Buddy was glowing with excitement. \n\n\"Are you ready for today, Leo?\" Buddy asked, his voice cheerful and bright.\n\n\"Um, sort of,\" Leo said. His heart raced. He had a plan, but it scared him. \"What if no one likes me?\"\n\nBuddy tilted his head. \"We will practice, Leo! Let\u2019s go to the cafeteria and find some friends!\"\n\nLeo sighed. The cafeteria was loud and busy. Kids laughed and ran around. Colorful posters decorated the walls, and delicious smells filled the air. It looked fun, but it felt scary.\n\nAs they walked in, Leo spotted Mia, his outgoing classmate. She waved at him and smiled. \u201cHey, Leo! Who\u2019s your new friend?\u201d\n\n\u201cThis is Buddy,\u201d Leo said, feeling a bit proud. \u201cHe helps me with... stuff.\u201d\n\nBuddy chimed in, \u201cHello, Mia! I have algorithms for friendship! Let\u2019s make friends together!\u201d \n\nMia giggled. \u201cThat\u2019s cool! Come on, Leo. Let\u2019s go to the table by the window!\u201d\n\nLeo's tummy flipped. Buddy was eager, but Leo felt shy. What if Buddy made friends and Leo didn\u2019t?\n\nAs they sat down, Buddy started chatting. \u201cWhat\u2019s your favorite pizza topping, everyone?\u201d\n\n\u201cPepperoni!\u201d Mia said.\n\n\u201cCheese!\u201d another kid shouted.\n\n\u201cUh, I like\u2026 hmm,\u201d Leo stuttered. \u201cMaybe cheese too?\u201d \n\nBuddy turned to Leo. \u201cGood answer, Leo! Cheese is a popular choice. You can do this!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a loud crash came from behind them. A tray flew into the air, and spaghetti splattered everywhere! [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nLeo ducked and laughed, but Buddy stood up. \u201cSpaghetti alert! Quick! Let\u2019s help!\u201d\n\nBuddy rushed over to help clean up. Leo hesitated. \n\n\u201cWhat are you waiting for, Leo?\u201d Mia asked, grinning wide. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d\n\nLeo took a deep breath and jumped up. Together, they helped Buddy clean the mess. Leo smiled as he helped a classmate pick up a spoon. \n\nWhen the mess was cleaned up, everyone clapped! Leo felt proud. \n\n\u201cSee, Leo?\u201d Buddy said. \u201cYou\u2019re making friends already!\u201d\n\nBut then, Buddy glanced around. \u201cI think I can help find more friends! Let\u2019s go!\u201d \n\nLeo\u2019s heart raced again. This was getting wild! How could he keep up with Buddy? \n\n\u201cWait, Buddy!\u201d Leo shouted. \u201cWhat if\u2026 what if we get in trouble?\u201d\n\nBuddy grinned. \u201cThat\u2019s part of the adventure!\u201d\n\nLeo gulped. \u201cOkay, but no more spaghetti!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith Buddy leading the way, Leo felt both excited and scared. They were about to dive into a new challenge. What would happen next?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Buddy help Leo with?","options":["Homework","Making friends","Sports","Cooking"],"correct_answer":"Making friends"},{"question":"Where do Leo and Buddy go in this chapter?","options":["The library","The park","The cafeteria","The classroom"],"correct_answer":"The cafeteria"},{"question":"What accident happens in the cafeteria?","options":["A tray falls","A chair breaks","Spaghetti spills","A drink spills"],"correct_answer":"Spaghetti spills"},{"question":"How does Leo feel about making friends?","options":["Excited","Scared","Bored","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Scared"},{"question":"What does Leo say when Buddy wants to find more friends?","options":["That sounds great!","I don't want to go!","Let\u2019s go!","No more spaghetti!"],"correct_answer":"No more spaghetti!"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_315_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_315_ch2_img1.png","plot_315_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":419,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
