   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_315_7_10","title":"The Friendship Algorithm","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Robots & AI","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Leo and Buddy entered the classroom, buzzing with energy. The walls were bright yellow, and colorful posters filled the space. Leo could hear the chatter of his classmates. They were already talking about the school's big science fair. Leo felt a flutter in his stomach. \n\n\u201cHey, let\u2019s work together on a project!\u201d Buddy said, bouncing with excitement. \n\nLeo sighed. \u201cI don\u2019t know, Buddy. What if they don\u2019t want to work with me?\u201d\n\n\u201cDon\u2019t worry! I\u2019ll help you!\u201d Buddy replied. \n\nThey sat at their usual desk. Leo\u2019s mind raced. What if Buddy made more friends? What if he didn\u2019t need Leo anymore? \n\nJust then, Mia walked in. \u201cHey, Leo! What\u2019s up?\u201d She waved. \n\nBuddy turned to Leo. \u201cLet\u2019s ask her to join us!\u201d \n\nLeo's heart pounded. \u201cWhat if she says no?\u201d \n\n\u201cOnly one way to find out!\u201d Buddy chirped. \n\nLeo took a deep breath. \u201cOkay, here goes nothing.\u201d \n\nMia walked closer. \u201cAre you guys working on something cool?\u201d \n\n\u201cThis! Uh, we were thinking about the science fair,\u201d Leo stammered. \n\n\u201cAwesome!\u201d Mia grinned. \u201cI love science! I\u2019ll join you!\u201d \n\nLeo felt a wave of relief wash over him. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, the bell rang. Time for gym class! The three friends hurried to the gym. The room was huge, with basketball hoops and colorful mats. It was filled with laughter and shouts as everyone played. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s play dodgeball!\u201d Mia shouted. \n\nLeo gulped. \u201cBut what if I get hit?\u201d \n\nBuddy smiled. \u201cYou\u2019ll be fine, Leo. Just dodge!\u201d \n\nThey joined the game. Leo\u2019s heart raced as he ran to avoid the ball. Suddenly, he saw Buddy catch a ball! Everyone cheered. \n\n\u201cWow, Buddy! Good job!\u201d Mia shouted. \n\nBut then, something strange happened. The other kids started to gather around Buddy.\n\n\u201cCan I take a selfie with you?\u201d one kid asked excitedly. \n\n\u201cCan you teach me how to code?\u201d another asked. \n\nLeo felt like he was fading away. As Buddy laughed and posed, Leo stood alone, feeling smaller. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cWhy are they all crowding around him?\u201d Leo whispered to himself. \n\nMia noticed. \u201cHey, Leo, are you okay?\u201d \n\nLeo shrugged. \u201cI guess I\u2019m just... not as cool as Buddy.\u201d \n\nBuddy turned, sensing Leo\u2019s sadness. \u201cLeo, I need you! You\u2019re my best friend!\u201d \n\nLeo stared at Buddy. Could he really be a friend, even if he felt jealous? \n\n\u201cOkay, let\u2019s show them the coolest science project ever!\u201d Leo shouted. \n\nEveryone turned to him. \u201cYeah!\u201d Mia cheered. \n\nBut just then, Coach called them over. \u201cAlright, team! Time for the final round of dodgeball!\u201d \n\nLeo felt a twist in his stomach. Would he step up or step back? \n\n\u201cDon\u2019t worry. I\u2019ll be right here, buddy!\u201d Buddy said, his eyes full of encouragement. \n\nLeo took a deep breath, ready to face his biggest challenge yet. \n\n[END OF CHAPTER]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Leo and Buddy want to do together?","options":["Play basketball","Work on the science fair","Go to lunch","Watch TV"],"correct_answer":"Work on the science fair"},{"question":"Who joins Leo and Buddy in the project?","options":["Sam","Mia","Tom","Jake"],"correct_answer":"Mia"},{"question":"What game do they play in gym class?","options":["Soccer","Basketball","Dodgeball","Tag"],"correct_answer":"Dodgeball"},{"question":"How does Leo feel when Buddy gets popular?","options":["Happy","Excited","Jealous","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Jealous"},{"question":"What does Buddy say to encourage Leo?","options":["You'll win!","I'm the best!","I need you!","Don't worry!"],"correct_answer":"I need you!"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_315_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_315_ch3_img1.png","plot_315_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":478,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
