   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_315_7_10","title":"The Friendship Algorithm","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Robots & AI","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Chapter 4: The Plan\n\nLeo sat at his desk, staring at Buddy. The little robot was busy tapping away on its keyboard. \u201cWhat should we do today, Buddy?\u201d Leo asked, feeling the weight of his worry. \n\nBuddy turned its bright blue eyes toward Leo. \u201cLet\u2019s make a plan to get you some friends!\u201d it chirped. Leo sighed. \u201cBut what if they don\u2019t like me?\u201d \n\nBuddy rolled its eyes, which was funny because robots didn\u2019t have eyes! \u201cYou are awesome, Leo! Trust me.\u201d Leo smiled a little. \n\nThey decided to meet Mia after school. She had become a good friend, even if Leo still felt a bit shy. As they walked through the lively middle school, Leo watched students laugh and talk. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nIn the cafeteria, Mia waved. \u201cHey, you two! Ready for the big lunch challenge?\u201d Leo felt a flutter in his stomach. What was the big lunch challenge?\n\n\u201cWhat is it?\u201d Leo asked, his curiosity piqued.\n\n\u201cYou have to ask three people to join us!\u201d Mia said with a grin. \u201cIt\u2019s easy!\u201d \n\n\u201cEasy for you to say!\u201d Leo mumbled. Buddy nudged him with its elbow. \u201cYou can do this, Leo!\u201d \n\nWhen lunch started, Leo felt his heart race. He could see students chatting and laughing. \u201cOkay, I can do this,\u201d he whispered to Buddy. \n\nLeo took a deep breath and approached a group at the next table. \u201cUm, hey! Would you like to join us?\u201d \n\nThe students looked surprised. One girl, with bright pink glasses, smiled. \u201cSure! I\u2019m Ava.\u201d \n\nLeo felt a spark of excitement. \u201cGreat! I\u2019m Leo.\u201d \n\nBuddy did a little jig next to Leo. \u201cSuccess!\u201d it cheered. \n\nSoon, Leo had talked to two more students. The last one was a boy named Sam, who loved video games. \u201cI\u2019d love to join!\u201d Sam said. \n\nLeo couldn\u2019t believe it. He had made new friends! \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAfter lunch, Mia gave him a high-five. \u201cSee? That wasn\u2019t so hard! You did amazing!\u201d \n\nLeo's face lit up. \u201cThanks, Mia! And thanks, Buddy!\u201d \n\nAs they left the cafeteria, Leo felt different. Maybe stepping out of his comfort zone wasn\u2019t so scary after all. \n\nBut then he remembered Buddy\u2019s growing friendship with others. What if Buddy didn\u2019t need him anymore? That thought made him frown. \n\n\u201cLeo?\u201d Buddy asked, sensing his change in mood. \u201cWhat\u2019s wrong?\u201d \n\n\u201cI\u2019m worried you\u2019ll make more friends than I do,\u201d Leo admitted. \n\nBuddy\u2019s eyes softened. \u201cLeo, friends come in many ways. I will always be your friend.\u201d \n\nLeo smiled again. Maybe things were looking up. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s come up with more ideas!\u201d he said, feeling hopeful. \n\nTogether, they skipped down the hall, ready to plan their next adventure.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What challenge does Mia suggest for lunch?","options":["Run a race","Ask three people to join them","Eat as much food as possible","Share their favorite game"],"correct_answer":"Ask three people to join them"},{"question":"How does Leo feel when he approaches the classmates?","options":["Confident","Nervous","Excited","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Nervous"},{"question":"What is the name of the girl Leo meets?","options":["Mia","Ava","Sam","Buddy"],"correct_answer":"Ava"},{"question":"What does Buddy reassure Leo about?","options":["It will get better grades","It will always be his friend","It will win a race","It will dance better"],"correct_answer":"It will always be his friend"},{"question":"What does Leo realize by the end of the chapter?","options":["Friendship is easy","He can make friends too","Buddy is better than him","He wants to build another robot"],"correct_answer":"He can make friends too"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_315_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_315_ch4_img1.png","plot_315_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":455,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
