   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_315_7_10","title":"The Friendship Algorithm","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Robots & AI","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Leo and Buddy walked into the bustling cafeteria. The bright lights made everything feel lively. Leo\u2019s heart raced as he spotted Mia sitting with some other kids. They were laughing and chatting. \n\n\u201cLook, there\u2019s Mia!\u201d Leo said, feeling a mix of excitement and nerves.\n\nBuddy chimed in, \u201cLet\u2019s go say hi! I brought my friendship algorithm!\u201d \n\nLeo giggled. \u201cYou mean your charm?\u201d \n\n\u201cExactly!\u201d Buddy replied with a wink.\n\nThey approached the table. Mia waved at Leo. \u201cHey, Leo! Come join us!\u201d \n\nLeo took a deep breath. \u201cOkay, let\u2019s do it!\u201d \n\nAs they walked over, Leo noticed the colorful posters on the walls. They showed school events and fun activities. The cafeteria smelled like pizza and chocolate cake. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nOnce they reached the table, Leo introduced Buddy. \u201cThis is my AI friend, Buddy. He\u2019s really good at making friends!\u201d \n\n\u201cHi, everyone!\u201d Buddy said with a big smile. \u201cDid you know I can calculate the best jokes?\u201d \n\nThe kids laughed. \u201cOh, really? Tell us a joke!\u201d one girl said. \n\n\u201cWhy did the computer go to the doctor?\u201d Buddy asked. \n\n\u201cWhy?\u201d they all replied, curious. \n\n\u201cBecause it had a virus!\u201d Buddy exclaimed. \n\nEveryone erupted in laughter, including Leo. His cheeks turned pink, but this time it felt good.\n\nAs they ate, Leo felt more relaxed. He started to chat with Mia and the others. They talked about their favorite video games and movies. Leo shared his love for building things. \n\nJust then, Leo saw a group of kids playing with a new game. \u201cCan we try that?\u201d he asked, pointing excitedly.\n\n\u201cOf course!\u201d Mia said. \u201cLet's go!\u201d\n\nLeo and Buddy joined the game. They cheered and laughed together. Leo felt a warm glow inside. He realized that making friends wasn\u2019t so scary after all. \n\n\u201cI can\u2019t believe I did it!\u201d Leo said to Buddy later. \n\n\u201cYou did amazing!\u201d Buddy replied. \u201cYou stepped out of your comfort zone!\u201d \n\nLeo smiled wide. \u201cThanks, Buddy. I think I\u2019m starting to get the hang of this friendship thing.\u201d \n\nAs they walked home, Leo felt proud. He knew he still had more to learn, but today was a great start. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s keep practicing tomorrow!\u201d Leo said, feeling excited about new adventures. \n\n\u201cAbsolutely!\u201d Buddy agreed, buzzing with energy. \n\nLeo looked at Buddy and felt grateful. With a friend like Buddy, he knew he could face anything.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who does Leo sit with in the cafeteria?","options":["His teacher","Mia and her friends","Buddy alone","The lunch lady"],"correct_answer":"Mia and her friends"},{"question":"What joke does Buddy tell?","options":["Why did the chicken cross the road?","Why did the computer go to the doctor?","What do you call a bear with no teeth?","Why was the math book sad?"],"correct_answer":"Why did the computer go to the doctor?"},{"question":"How does Leo feel during lunch?","options":["Scared","Bored","Relaxed","Sad"],"correct_answer":"Relaxed"},{"question":"What does Leo learn about friendship?","options":["It\u2019s very hard","It\u2019s boring","It\u2019s not scary","It takes a lot of time"],"correct_answer":"It\u2019s not scary"},{"question":"What does Leo want to do tomorrow?","options":["Stay home","Keep practicing friendship","Play alone","Watch TV"],"correct_answer":"Keep practicing friendship"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_315_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_315_ch5_img1.png","plot_315_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":399,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
