     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"anxiety","1":"encouragement","2":"project","3":"determination","4":"surge","image_prompts":["A vibrant scene in a middle school cafeteria filled with students of varying ages and backgrounds, laughing and chatting. Leo stands nervously at a table covered with colorful lunch trays, with Mia enthusiastically introducing him to her friends. The atmosphere is lively, and Leo\u2019s uncertain expression contrasts with the warm smiles of Mia\u2019s friends.","A close-up of Leo, now more confident, standing at the table with Mia and her friends, animatedly sharing ideas about their project. His face reflects excitement and determination. In the background, the other students are engaged, some glancing over, while the boys from the popular group are seen whispering and laughing, capturing the tension in the scene."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A vibrant cafeteria scene filled with students, laughter, and animated conversations. Leo sits at a corner table, his expression a mix of pride and envy as he watches Buddy engage a group of classmates. The lighting is warm and inviting, emphasizing the chaos of middle school life, with colorful lunch trays and lively decor in the background.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_315_ch4_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 14:17:45"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A cozy kitchen filled with soft, golden light as Leo, Mia, and Buddy work together to bake cookies. Flour dust dances in the air as they mix ingredients, laughter ringing out. Buddy, with a sprig of icing in hand, is humorously adorned with flour on his robotic face. The scene captures warmth, teamwork, and the joy of friendship, with delicious baked goods on the counter, ready to be decorated.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_315_ch4_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 14:17:45"}}}
