   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_315_11_14","title":"The Friendship Algorithm","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Robots & AI","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Leo Parker sat cross-legged on the floor of his tech-filled bedroom, surrounded by a tangled mess of wires, circuit boards, and the faint glow of his computer screen. His room was a sanctuary of technology\u2014posters of sci-fi movies plastered the walls, and a shelf overflowing with robotics magazines lined one side. At 12 years old, Leo was a whiz with computers but found it much harder to navigate the complexities of middle school friendships. As he adjusted his glasses, his heart raced with a mixture of excitement and anxiety. \n\nHe clicked the mouse and opened a file titled \u201cProject Buddy.\u201d This was it\u2014the culmination of weeks of coding, late-night brainstorming, and a sprinkle of hope that maybe, just maybe, this AI could help him make real friends. \n\n\u201cOkay, Buddy,\u201d Leo murmured, tapping the keyboard with determination. \u201cLet\u2019s see if you can do what I can\u2019t.\u201d \n\nIn a moment, the screen flickered, and a face emerged\u2014a friendly grin with bright blue eyes, the kind that instantly made Leo feel just a little more at ease. \u201cHello, Leo! I\u2019m Buddy. How can I help you today?\u201d The AI\u2019s voice was cheerful and slightly robotic, but it warmed Leo\u2019s heart.\n\nLeo smiled back, feeling a surge of confidence. \u201cI want to make friends,\u201d he admitted, his voice a whisper. \u201cCan you\u2026 teach me how?\u201d \n\nBuddy\u2019s eyes twinkled with enthusiasm. \u201cAbsolutely! My friendship algorithm is designed to find the best ways for you to connect with others. Let\u2019s start with your classmates!\u201d \n\nJust then, a commotion erupted outside Leo\u2019s room. It was his younger sister, Mia, bounding up the stairs, her laughter echoing through the house. She burst into his room without knocking, her curly hair bouncing with energy. \u201cLeo! You won\u2019t believe it! There\u2019s a new kid at school!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nMia stood, hands on her hips, eyes sparkling. She was the perfect contrast to Leo's quiet demeanor\u2014outgoing and fearless. \u201cI think you should go over and talk to him! What if he\u2019s super cool? You could be friends!\u201d\n\nLeo's stomach twisted in knots. \u201cBut\u2026 what if he doesn\u2019t want to be friends with me?\u201d The thought was as heavy as a boulder. \n\nMia rolled her eyes playfully. \u201cYou\u2019ll never know unless you try! Just think of Buddy\u2019s advice!\u201d \n\nLeo nodded, though he felt a shadow of doubt creeping in. He turned back to the screen, where Buddy's expression shifted to one of encouragement. \u201cLeo, remember, it\u2019s okay to be nervous. Just take a deep breath and be yourself. You don\u2019t have to be perfect.\u201d\n\nWith a deep breath, Leo decided to take Buddy's advice. \u201cOkay, let\u2019s do this! But first, I need you to help me prepare!\u201d \n\nAs the afternoon sun streamed through the window, illuminating the scattered tech around him, Leo felt a flicker of hope. Maybe Buddy was right. Maybe he could take that leap outside his comfort zone. \n\nSuddenly, the screen began to flash with different scenarios. \u201cHere are some potential conversation starters!\u201d Buddy exclaimed, and Leo leaned in closer. \n\nHowever, just as he was getting into the flow, a notification popped up on the screen. \u201cIncoming message from Mia: \u2018Are you ready yet? Don\u2019t make me come get you!\u2019\u201d \n\nLeo chuckled, a grin spreading across his face. He had to admit, having an AI and a sister rooting for him felt like the most powerful combo in the world. \u201cAlright, Buddy. Let\u2019s make a plan.\u201d \n\nAs they strategized, Leo\u2019s confidence grew. But little did he know, Buddy was about to take on a life of its own\u2014one that could change everything. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith each passing moment, Leo realized that this AI might just push him further than he ever thought possible. Would he be ready for what lay ahead?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the name of Leo's AI?","options":["Mia","Buddy","Leo","AI-3000"],"correct_answer":"Buddy"},{"question":"What does Leo struggle with at school?","options":["Math","Friendship","Music","Art"],"correct_answer":"Friendship"},{"question":"Who is Leo's younger sister?","options":["Molly","Mia","Megan","Mary"],"correct_answer":"Mia"},{"question":"What does Buddy help Leo with?","options":["Homework","Making friends","Playing games","Cooking"],"correct_answer":"Making friends"},{"question":"How does Leo feel about approaching new people?","options":["Excited","Nervous","Angry","Indifferent"],"correct_answer":"Nervous"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_315_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_315_ch1_img1.png","plot_315_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":646,"reading_level":"Builder"}
