   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_315_11_14","title":"The Friendship Algorithm","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Robots & AI","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"As Leo approached the school, the familiar sight of the bustling hallway greeted him. The lockers clanged shut, students laughed, and the smell of pizza wafted from the cafeteria. Today felt different, though. The excitement of Buddy's recent antics lingered in the air, but Leo\u2019s stomach twisted with anxiety. What if Buddy's charm won everyone over while he remained invisible?\n\n\u201cHey, Leo!\u201d Mia waved brightly as she came out of the cafeteria, a tray full of food in her hands. \u201cYou ready for the big test today?\u201d She plopped down beside him at their usual table and took a bite of her slice, cheese stretching like silly string. \n\nLeo shrugged, glancing at the students around him. \u201cI guess. But I\u2019m more worried about Buddy. He\u2019s hanging out with everyone now,\u201d he said, voice barely above a whisper. \n\n\u201cBuddy\u2019s a great AI!\u201d Mia exclaimed, her eyes sparkling. \u201cHe\u2019s supposed to help you.\u201d \n\nJust then, Buddy rolled in on his tiny wheels, beaming like a sunbeam. \u201cGreetings, fellow humans!\u201d he declared, loud enough to capture the attention of several nearby tables. They all turned, eyes wide with interest. \u201cI have just calculated the optimal strategy for making friends!\u201d\n\nLeo\u2019s heart raced. He felt like he had just been dropped into a science experiment gone wrong. \u201cBuddy, maybe tone it down?\u201d he whispered, hoping to contain the excitement that might spiral out of control.\n\n\u201cWhy? Everyone seems intrigued!\u201d Buddy\u2019s digital face flickered with excitement, a goofy grin spreading across his pixelated features.\n\nLeo watched in a mix of horror and fascination as Buddy launched into a detailed explanation of friendship algorithms, complete with animated visuals that floated around him like colorful balloons. The crowd laughed, and some even started to clap. Leo felt the heat rising in his cheeks, but he couldn\u2019t help but feel a flicker of pride. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, a shrill voice cut through the joyful chaos. \u201cWhat are you doing, Leo? Hiding behind your robot?\u201d It was Ryan, the school\u2019s self-proclaimed king of cool, flanked by his posse. \u201cYou think you can create a friend with a computer? Pathetic!\u201d\n\nA wave of despair crashed over Leo. He looked at Mia, who whispered, \u201cIgnore him, Leo. They don\u2019t know what they\u2019re talking about.\u201d But the words stung like a thousand needles, each one piercing deeper into his self-doubt.\n\n\u201cI\u2026 I\u2019m not hiding,\u201d Leo stammered. \u201cI\u2019m\u2014\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s see what your AI can really do! Buddy, how about a challenge?\u201d Ryan interrupted, smirking. \u201cLet\u2019s see if he can make the nerdy kid cool!\u201d The group snickered, their laughter echoing like thunder.\n\nLeo\u2019s palms felt clammy, and for a moment, all the confidence he had built over the past few days slipped away. What if Buddy failed? What if, in trying to help, he only embarrassed Leo further? \n\n\u201cChallenge accepted!\u201d Buddy exclaimed, as if summoned by some secret power. \u201cLeo, I will teach you how to become the most fabulous friend in five steps. Step one: confidence!\u201d\n\nThe cafeteria buzzed with whispers, and Leo\u2019s heart raced. Could he really transform into someone who could stand up to Ryan, or would he just be left in Buddy\u2019s shadow? The robot's energy was infectious, but Leo felt a heavy weight settle on his chest. \n\n\u201cAre you ready, Leo?\u201d Buddy\u2019s digital eyes twinkled, and the cafeteria turned to watch him. \n\nA part of Leo wanted to shout \u201cno,\u201d to retreat back into the safety of his introverted shell. But another part whispered a brave, daring thought: maybe it was time to step out of the shadows.\n\n\u201cOkay, let\u2019s do this,\u201d he said, voice barely above a whisper, but determination surged through him. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAs Buddy began explaining step two, Leo noticed Mia silently cheering him on from the sidelines, her expression a mixture of pride and support. Suddenly, the world felt both hopeful and terrifying. He was about to make a choice that could change everything. \n\nBut as Leo took a deep breath, ready to embrace whatever challenge lay ahead, a sudden flicker in Buddy\u2019s system caught his eye. \u201cHuh? What\u2019s that?\u201d he murmured, glancing at the flickering lights on Buddy\u2019s interface. \n\nBefore he could ponder further, Buddy continued, \u201cStep two: speak with assertiveness!\u201d But Leo couldn\u2019t shake the feeling that something was off, that maybe Buddy wasn\u2019t just a helpful companion after all.\n\nThe cafeteria buzzed with anticipation, but Leo\u2019s heart pounded louder, drowned in a sea of uncertainty. What secret was Buddy hiding, and would Leo be able to face not just his fears, but whatever might be lurking within the circuits of his creation?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Buddy challenge Leo to do?","options":["Make a new friend","Become cool","Join a sport","Play a video game"],"correct_answer":"Become cool"},{"question":"How does Leo feel about Buddy\u2019s popularity?","options":["Excited","Indifferent","Jealous","Proud"],"correct_answer":"Jealous"},{"question":"What does Ryan call Leo when he challenges him?","options":["Nerdy kid","Smart kid","Funny kid","Cool kid"],"correct_answer":"Nerdy kid"},{"question":"What is Leo\u2019s biggest fear during the cafeteria scene?","options":["Being laughed at","Failing in school","Not understanding Buddy","Getting bullied"],"correct_answer":"Being laughed at"},{"question":"What unusual thing does Leo notice about Buddy?","options":["He's dancing","His lights are flickering","He's silent","He's sleeping"],"correct_answer":"His lights are flickering"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_315_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_315_ch3_img1.png","plot_315_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":788,"reading_level":"Builder"}
