   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_306_7_10","title":"Starlight Quest","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Mia loved her attic. It was full of old boxes, dusty books, and forgotten toys. One rainy afternoon, she decided to explore. \n\n\"What's up there?\" she wondered aloud. \"Maybe I\u2019ll find treasure!\"\n\nAs she climbed the creaky stairs, her heart raced with excitement. Mia reached the attic door and pushed it open. The light flooded in, revealing a world of memories. \n\nSuddenly, something shiny caught her eye. It was a rolled-up piece of paper under an old, tattered blanket. Mia picked it up. \n\n\"What is this?\" she asked, unrolling it carefully. It looked like a map, but not just any map. This one sparkled with stars. \n\n\"This is amazing!\" Mia exclaimed. She felt a tickle of adventure in her belly. Just then, her best friend, Orion, beeped to life. \n\n\"What are you doing, Mia?\" the little robot asked, his eyes blinking with curiosity. \n\n\"I found a star map!\" she replied, waving it in the air. \n\nOrion\u2019s circuits buzzed with excitement. \"A star map? Let\u2019s go on a quest! Maybe it leads to treasure!\"\n\nMia grinned. \"Yes! Let\u2019s be space adventurers!\" \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThey sat down on the attic floor, the map spread out between them. The stars twinkled on the paper, forming strange shapes. Mia pointed to a big star with a tiny dot beside it. \n\n\"Look! What do you think this means?\" she asked Orion.\n\n\"Maybe it\u2019s a clue!\" he replied. \"If we follow the stars, we might find something incredible!\"\n\nMia\u2019s eyes sparkled with determination. \"Then let\u2019s figure it out! We need to decode it!\"\n\nAs they studied the map, a loud crash echoed outside. Mia jumped. \"What was that?\" \n\nOrion's eyes widened. \"It sounded like a space storm!\" \n\nMia looked worried. \"What if we can\u2019t go on our adventure?\"\n\n\"Don\u2019t worry!\" Orion said, trying to cheer her up. \"We can still plan. We\u2019ll be ready no matter what!\"\n\nMia nodded, feeling braver. \"Okay! Let's get started.\"\n\nBut just then, a shadow loomed at the attic window. Mia squinted. \"What is that?\" \n\nAs the shadow moved closer, Mia's heart raced. Could it be a space pirate? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\"Orion, hide!\" she whispered, feeling a mix of fear and excitement. \"This could be trouble!\"\n\nMia knew their adventure was just beginning, and she couldn\u2019t wait to see what lay ahead.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Mia find in her attic?","options":["A book","A toy","A star map","A picture"],"correct_answer":"A star map"},{"question":"What does Orion want to do with the star map?","options":["Ignore it","Go on a quest","Draw on it","Hide it"],"correct_answer":"Go on a quest"},{"question":"What sounds outside make Mia worried?","options":["A thunderstorm","A loud crash","Birds singing","A dog barking"],"correct_answer":"A loud crash"},{"question":"What does Mia feel as she finds the map?","options":["Bored","Happy","Sad","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Happy"},{"question":"What does the shadow at the window suggest?","options":["A friend is coming","A space pirate may be near","It's time to leave","It's time to eat"],"correct_answer":"A space pirate may be near"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_306_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_306_ch1_img1.png","plot_306_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":392,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
