   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_306_7_10","title":"Starlight Quest","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Mia stared at the star map, her heart racing. \u201cThis is amazing, Orion! We could find real treasure!\u201d \n\nOrion beeped. \u201cBeep boop! But first, we need to figure out these clues.\u201d \n\nMia nodded. The attic was filled with dusty boxes and old toys, but this star map sparkled like a diamond. It showed strange planets, bright stars, and a big, golden X. \n\n\u201cLook at this, Orion!\u201d Mia pointed at the first clue. It read, \u201cSeek the rainbow planet where the sun sleeps.\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] \n\nSuddenly, a loud crash echoed from outside the attic window. Mia jumped. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d \n\n\u201cLet me check!\u201d Orion zoomed to the window. \n\nMia peeked over his shoulder. Outside, a dark ship hovered in the sky. Black sails flapped like angry wings. \n\n\u201cSpace pirates!\u201d Mia gasped. \u201cWhat do we do?\u201d \n\nOrion\u2019s lights blinked frantically. \u201cWe should hide!\u201d \n\nMia grabbed the star map and stuffed it into her backpack. \u201cQuick! Let\u2019s go!\u201d \n\nThey dashed down the stairs just as the door creaked open. \n\n\u201cDon\u2019t let them find the map!\u201d Mia whispered. \n\n\u201cBeep! I\u2019ll distract them!\u201d Orion zipped ahead, making silly robot sounds. \n\nThe pirates\u2019 leader, Captain Zara, stepped into the attic. She had bright red hair and wore a shiny eye patch. \u201cWhere is that little girl?\u201d she demanded. \n\nMia and Orion ducked behind a couch. They held their breath. \n\n\u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d Mia whispered. \n\n\u201cWe need to leave!\u201d Orion replied. \u201cThe map is too important.\u201d \n\nJust then, Mia's backpack began to glow. \u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d she squeaked. \n\nThe map started to hum. A bright light shone from it, filling the dark room. \n\n\u201cWhoa!\u201d Orion\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cIt\u2019s reacting to the pirates!\u201d \n\nCaptain Zara turned, her eyes wide with surprise. \u201cWhat kind of magic is this?\u201d \n\nMia knew they had to escape, but how? She looked at Orion, who was bouncing nervously. \n\n\u201cReady, set, go!\u201d Mia shouted. \n\nThey sprinted out of the attic and into the night, the map lighting their way. \n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s next?\u201d Mia asked, breathing hard. \n\nOrion\u2019s voice trembled. \u201cWe have to find the rainbow planet!\u201d \n\nMia grinned. \u201cThen let\u2019s get to it! Adventure awaits!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2] \n\nMia and Orion ran towards the star-filled sky, ready for whatever came next.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does the star map show?","options":["A treasure","A spaceship","A planet","A city"],"correct_answer":"A treasure"},{"question":"Who are the main characters in this chapter?","options":["Mia and Captain Zara","Mia and Orion","Orion and the pirates","Captain Zara and the pirates"],"correct_answer":"Mia and Orion"},{"question":"What does Captain Zara want?","options":["A map","A spaceship","A treasure","A robot"],"correct_answer":"A map"},{"question":"How does Mia feel about the adventure?","options":["Scared","Excited","Bored","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"},{"question":"What is Orion's role in the adventure?","options":["A pirate","A helper","A treasure seeker","A map maker"],"correct_answer":"A helper"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_306_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_306_ch2_img1.png","plot_306_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":376,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
