   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_306_7_10","title":"Starlight Quest","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Mia stood on the deck of the spaceship, looking out at the swirling colors of the Nebula Planet. It was a breathtaking sight\u2014clouds of purple, green, and blue danced in the sky. \u201cWow, Orion! This place is amazing!\u201d she exclaimed, her eyes wide with wonder.\n\nOrion buzzed happily. \u201cIt really is! But remember, we have to find the next clue on the map!\u201d His metal fingers pointed to the star map, which shimmered in the sunlight. They had deciphered the first clue, leading them here, but Mia felt a flutter of worry in her stomach.\n\nSuddenly, a loud bang echoed through the air. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Mia gasped. Orion\u2019s eyes blinked red. \u201cSpace pirates are here! We need to hide!\u201d \n\nThey ducked behind a large rock as shadows crept closer. Mia held her breath, her heart racing. \u201cWhat if they find us?\u201d she whispered.\n\nOrion scanned the area. \u201cI can distract them! Just stay quiet.\u201d He rolled away, making beeping noises. The pirates turned, laughing. \u201cLook at that silly robot!\u201d one of them shouted. \n\nMia watched as Orion zapped a spark from his arm, creating a flash of light. The pirates chased after him, yelling and laughing. \u201cGo, Orion!\u201d Mia cheered silently, feeling a surge of hope.\n\nJust then, the map lit up! It showed a new star\u2014the location of the next clue! \u201cYes! We need to go there!\u201d Mia said, her voice full of excitement. But as she looked back at the pirates, terror filled her. They were heading straight for her!\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nMia took a deep breath, her mind racing. \u201cOrion! Come back!\u201d She waved her arms to get his attention. But the pirates were closing in. \u201cOh no!\u201d she cried. How could they escape now?\n\nOrion zoomed back to her side. \u201cWe have to make a run for it!\u201d he said. Together, they dashed down a narrow path, dodging rocks and avoiding the glowing plants that seemed to grab at their feet. The pirates were not far behind, shouting and crashing through the bushes.\n\nMia\u2019s heart pounded louder than the pirate footsteps. \u201cKeep going, Orion!\u201d she yelled. Just when they thought they were safe, Mia stumbled and fell. She groaned, looking up at Orion. \u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d\n\n\u201cFollow me!\u201d Orion shouted, his voice filled with urgency. He zipped around to help Mia up. \u201cWe can't stop now!\u201d\n\nAs they sprinted away, Mia spotted a shimmering gate made of stars. \u201cThere! We can escape through there!\u201d she pointed. They raced toward the gate, but the pirates were hot on their heels. \n\nJust as they reached the gate, it flickered, unsure if it would open. \u201cPlease, open!\u201d Mia pleaded. The pirates laughed, thinking they would catch them. \u201cYou can\u2019t escape!\u201d they taunted.\n\nMia closed her eyes, wishing with all her heart for the gate to open. Suddenly, a bright light flashed, and the gate opened wide!\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nMia and Orion dove through just as the pirates shouted, \u201cNo!\u201d They landed on the other side, panting and trembling. \u201cThat was close!\u201d Orion gasped.\n\nMia stared back at the gate, feeling a rush of relief mixed with fear. \u201cWhat if they come after us?\u201d But before they could worry more, the map glowed again. It was pointing out their next destination.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go, Mia! Adventure awaits!\u201d Orion said, full of excitement. Mia nodded, but a shadow of doubt lingered in her mind. What other dangers lay ahead in the galaxy?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Mia and Orion find on Nebula Planet?","options":["A treasure","A new clue","A space pirate","A spaceship"],"correct_answer":"A new clue"},{"question":"Who chased Mia and Orion?","options":["Space aliens","Space pirates","Friendly creatures","A robot army"],"correct_answer":"Space pirates"},{"question":"What did Orion do to distract the pirates?","options":["He sang a song","He made beeping noises","He flew away","He hid"],"correct_answer":"He made beeping noises"},{"question":"What did the gate look like that Mia and Orion found?","options":["A big rock","A shimmering star gate","A dark tunnel","A tree"],"correct_answer":"A shimmering star gate"},{"question":"How did Mia feel when they escaped through the gate?","options":["Excited and happy","Scared and alone","Bored and tired","Angry and upset"],"correct_answer":"Excited and happy"}]},"images":null,"word_count":579,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
