   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_306_7_10","title":"Starlight Quest","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Mia and Orion floated through space in their shiny spaceship, the Star Glider. It zipped past colorful planets and twinkling stars. \u201cLook at that!\u201d Mia pointed at a giant comet streaking by. Its tail shone bright pink against the dark sky.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cWe\u2019re getting closer, Orion!\u201d Mia said, excitement bubbling in her voice. She held the star map tightly. \u201cThe next clue is on Gleeza, the music planet!\u201d\n\n\u201cGleeza? Ooh, I love music! Let\u2019s go!\u201d Orion replied, his eyes glowing with joy. \n\nThey zoomed toward Gleeza, where the air was filled with cheerful tunes. The trees danced to the rhythm, and the flowers bounced like they were having a party. Mia giggled. \u201cThis place is amazing!\u201d\n\nAs they landed, a group of colorful creatures bounced over. They had big eyes and fluffy tails. \u201cWelcome to Gleeza!\u201d they sang in harmony. \u201cJoin our dance!\u201d\n\nMia laughed and twirled around with them. But soon, she remembered their mission. \u201cThank you! But we need to find a clue!\u201d \n\nThe creatures nodded. \u201cThe clue is hidden near the Great Singing Rock. Follow us!\u201d\n\nMia and Orion followed the joyful creatures through the vibrant landscape. Suddenly, a loud noise rumbled behind them. \u201cUh-oh, sounds like trouble!\u201d Orion exclaimed. \n\nMia turned to see the space pirates chasing them again. Captain Zara was leading the pack, her fierce expression making Mia\u2019s heart race. \u201cCatch them!\u201d she shouted, waving her sword.\n\n\u201cQuick! We need to find that clue before they catch us!\u201d Mia said, her determination shining through. They dashed toward the Great Singing Rock, the creatures hopping beside them. \n\nWhen they arrived, the rock glimmered in the sunlight. \u201cThe clue is somewhere here,\u201d Mia said, looking around. Suddenly, she spotted a shimmering object in a crack of the rock. \u201cThere it is!\u201d\n\nJust as she reached for it, Captain Zara appeared. \u201cStop right there!\u201d she yelled. \n\nMia stood firm. \u201cWe\u2019re not afraid of you!\u201d\n\nZara paused, her eyes narrowing. \u201cYou\u2019re brave, kid. But I need that treasure too!\u201d \n\nMia thought fast. \u201cWhat if we work together? You can join us on this treasure hunt!\u201d \n\nZara frowned, considering. \u201cHmm. Maybe...\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe creatures cheered, and Mia felt a glimmer of hope. Perhaps they could find the treasure together! \u201cLet\u2019s be friends and find the treasure!\u201d she said, smiling bravely.\n\nCaptain Zara smirked, her fierce face softening. \u201cAlright, but you better watch your back!\u201d \n\nMia and Orion exchanged excited glances. They had made progress and turned a foe into a friend. The adventure was not over. It was just beginning!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What planet do Mia and Orion visit in this chapter?","options":["Nebula Planet","Gleeza","Treasure Planet","Rocket Planet"],"correct_answer":"Gleeza"},{"question":"What do the creatures on Gleeza love to do?","options":["Dance","Hide","Fight","Sleep"],"correct_answer":"Dance"},{"question":"Who chases Mia and Orion on Gleeza?","options":["Space fairies","Captain Zara","Friendly aliens","Space robots"],"correct_answer":"Captain Zara"},{"question":"What does Mia suggest to Captain Zara?","options":["To run away","To work together","To fight","To sing songs"],"correct_answer":"To work together"},{"question":"How does Captain Zara react to Mia's suggestion?","options":["She laughs","She agrees","She gets angry","She runs away"],"correct_answer":"She agrees"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_306_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_306_ch4_img1.png","plot_306_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":429,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
