   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_306_7_10","title":"Starlight Quest","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Mia stood on the colorful surface of Gleeza. The ground sparkled like glitter, and strange plants danced in the soft breeze. \"Wow, Orion! Look at all these colors!\" she exclaimed. The bright purple trees swayed gently, and furry blue creatures peeked out from behind them.  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]  \n\nSuddenly, a shadow loomed above them. It was Captain Zara, the fierce space pirate! \"What are you two doing on my planet?\" she asked, crossing her arms. Mia felt a flutter of fear. \"We\u2019re just looking for treasure,\" she replied bravely.  \n\nCaptain Zara\u2019s expression softened. \u201cTreasure? I know a thing or two about that.\u201d Orion\u2019s eyes blinked rapidly. \u201cAre you saying you\u2019ll help us?\u201d  \n\nZara nodded slowly. \u201cBut first, you must prove your worth. You\u2019ll face the Crystal Beasts of Gleeza!\u201d She pointed to a path leading deeper into the forest.  \n\n\u201cCrystal Beasts?\u201d Mia asked, curious but nervous. \u201cWhat are they?\u201d  \n\n\u201cThey guard the treasure,\u201d Zara explained. \u201cBut they\u2019re not all bad. If you show kindness, they may help you.\u201d  \n\nMia took a deep breath. \u201cWe can do it!\u201d She looked at Orion, who gave her a thumbs-up. They followed Zara along the path.  \n\nSoon they arrived at a clearing filled with dazzling crystals. Suddenly, three Crystal Beasts appeared! They were tall and shimmering, with friendly eyes. \u201cWho dares enter our domain?\u201d one asked in a gentle voice.  \n\nMia gulped but stepped forward. \u201cWe\u2019re not here to fight. We want to find treasure and learn from you.\u201d  \n\nThe beasts exchanged glances. \u201cMany come for treasure, but few seek friendship,\u201d said another beast. \u201cWhat will you give us in return?\u201d  \n\nMia thought about it. \u201cWe can share stories from Earth!\u201d She remembered her favorite tales. \u201cOr we can help you clean this area!\u201d  \n\nThe Crystal Beasts smiled. \u201cVery well. Share your stories!\u201d  \n\nMia shared tales of her adventures on Earth. The beasts listened intently, their eyes sparkling like the crystals around them. After her stories, the beasts clapped their hands together. \u201cYou have shown kindness, Mia. The treasure is yours!\u201d  \n\nA secret door in the ground opened, revealing golden stars and shimmering jewels. Mia\u2019s heart raced with joy! \u201cThank you!\u201d she shouted.  \n\nCaptain Zara grinned. \u201cYou did it, Mia! And you made a friend.\u201d  \n\nMia felt proud. \u201cI couldn\u2019t have done it without you, Orion, and you, Captain Zara.\u201d She turned to the Crystal Beasts. \u201cCan we visit you again?\u201d  \n\n\u201cOf course!\u201d they replied, their voices like music.  \n\nWith treasure in hand and new friends made, Mia, Orion, and Captain Zara prepared to leave Gleeza. \u201cNext stop, the next clue!\u201d Mia said, excitement bubbling in her chest.  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]  \n\nAs they blasted off into the stars, Mia knew this was just the beginning of their incredible journey.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do the Crystal Beasts guard?","options":["Food","Treasure","Spaceships","Friends"],"correct_answer":"Treasure"},{"question":"What does Mia offer the Crystal Beasts?","options":["Stories from Earth","A spaceship","Gold coins","Magic spells"],"correct_answer":"Stories from Earth"},{"question":"Who helps Mia and Orion on Gleeza?","options":["A robot","A pirate","A wizard","A dinosaur"],"correct_answer":"A pirate"},{"question":"What do the Crystal Beasts do after hearing Mia's stories?","options":["They leave","They get angry","They clap and give treasure","They fall asleep"],"correct_answer":"They clap and give treasure"},{"question":"What does Mia feel as they prepare to leave Gleeza?","options":["Bored","Excited","Scared","Tired"],"correct_answer":"Excited"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_306_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_306_ch5_img1.png","plot_306_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":462,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
