   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_306_11_14","title":"Starlight Quest","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"As dawn broke over the distant planet of Garvonia, Mia\u2019s heart raced with a mixture of excitement and fear. The sky shimmered with hues of purple and orange, casting an ethereal glow on the ancient ruins that towered before her. \u201cOrion, are you sure this is the right place?\u201d she asked, glancing at the star map spread out on a makeshift table made of driftwood.\n\n\u201cAbsolutely, Mia! According to the map, the first clue is hidden somewhere among these ruins,\u201d Orion replied with a cheerful beep, his metallic eyes scanning the towering stone structures. His voice was as trusty as a compass, always guiding her through the unknown.\n\nMia wiped the sweat from her brow, the humid air thickening around her. Her fingers trembled slightly as they traced the intricate designs etched on the map. \u201cIf we don\u2019t find it soon, those pirates will have us for breakfast,\u201d she said, her voice low and serious. The memory of Captain Zara and her men loomed over them like a storm cloud.\n\nDetermined, Mia stood up and took a deep breath, feeling the weight of the adventure ahead. \u201cLet\u2019s split up. You check the left side, and I\u2019ll investigate the right,\u201d she suggested, her heart thumping like a drum in her chest. \n\n\u201cCopy that,\u201d Orion chirped, rolling away on his wheels with a swipe of his metallic arm.\n\nAs Mia ventured deeper into the ruins, she felt a shiver of anticipation. The walls were adorned with strange symbols and vines creeping like fingers. Suddenly, she stumbled upon a hidden alcove, its entrance draped with thick, leafy tendrils. \u201cWhat\u2019s this?\u201d she murmured, pushing aside the greenery.\n\nInside, the air was cool and smelled of ancient secrets. Mia\u2019s eyes widened as she spotted a small pedestal in the center of the room. On it lay a shimmering crystal orb, swirling with colors that danced like stars. \u201cOrion! You have to see this!\u201d she shouted, her heart soaring with excitement and dread. She reached out to touch the orb, the moment feeling as significant as placing a final piece in a puzzle.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cWait, Mia!\u201d Orion's voice blared from the entrance, panic lacing his tone. \u201cWe have company!\u201d\n\nMia froze, her hand inches from the orb. She turned around to see a shadowy figure emerging from the entrance\u2014a silhouette with a wide-brimmed hat and a glinting sword. \u201cWell, well, what do we have here?\u201d the figure smirked, revealing a familiar face. Captain Zara stood before her, flanked by two rugged pirates.\n\n\u201cI should have known you\u2019d be after this treasure, little girl,\u201d Zara sneered, her eyes narrowing. \u201cStep away from the orb, and I might let you live.\u201d\n\nMia\u2019s heart raced. \u201cYou won\u2019t take it! It\u2019s mine!\u201d she shouted, her voice steady despite the fear surging through her veins. \n\n\u201cSuch bravery,\u201d Zara mocked, tilting her head. \u201cBut bravery won\u2019t save you from my crew.\u201d The pirates advanced, their intentions clear.\n\nMia's mind raced as she weighed her options\u2014fight or flee? She could distract Zara with a trick, but would Orion have enough time to find help? \n\n\u201cOrion, go! Get to the ship and alert the Galactic Patrol!\u201d Mia commanded, her voice a mix of urgency and determination.\n\n\u201cOn it!\u201d Orion replied, turning to make a hasty retreat.\n\nAs the pirates closed in, the orb glowed brighter, illuminating the room with an otherworldly light. \u201cYou won\u2019t get away that easily!\u201d Mia yelled, her hands balling into fists. She could feel the pulse of the orb resonating with her heartbeat, urging her to act.\n\nAnd just like that, with one swift motion, she lunged for the orb, ready to unleash its power against the danger closing in.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Mia discover in the ruins of Garvonia?","options":["A treasure chest","A crystal orb","A spaceship","A hidden diary"],"correct_answer":"A crystal orb"},{"question":"Who confronts Mia and Orion in the ruins?","options":["A friendly alien","Captain Zara","A Galactic Patrol officer","Another robot"],"correct_answer":"Captain Zara"},{"question":"What does Mia command Orion to do when pirates arrive?","options":["Stay and fight","Find help","Search for more treasures","Run away"],"correct_answer":"Find help"},{"question":"What emotion does Mia feel when she sees the orb?","options":["Fear","Excitement","Boredom","Disinterest"],"correct_answer":"Excitement"},{"question":"What does the orb symbolize in this chapter?","options":["Danger","Friendship","Hope","Adventure"],"correct_answer":"Adventure"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_306_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_306_ch2_img1.png","plot_306_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":627,"reading_level":"Builder"}
