   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_306_11_14","title":"Starlight Quest","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"The cave was dark, the air thick with an unseen tension as Mia and Orion crept deeper inside. The flickering light from Orion's chest illuminated the cave's jagged walls, revealing shimmering minerals that seemed to pulse with energy. Mia's heart raced as she thought about the treasure that waited somewhere in the galaxy, just out of reach. She clutched the star map tightly, the ancient parchment feeling like a piece of a puzzle she needed to solve.\n\n\u201cMia, I detect movement ahead!\u201d Orion whispered, his voice barely above a hum, yet it sent a shiver down Mia's spine. They paused, straining to hear any sounds beyond the soft echo of their own breathing.\n\nSuddenly, a low growl filled the air, resonating throughout the cave. Mia's eyes widened, and she took a step back. \u201cWhat do you think it is?\u201d she asked, her voice trembling slightly.\n\n\u201cMost likely a cave beast,\u201d Orion replied, his circuits buzzing with excitement. \u201cBut if we\u2019re quick, we can sneak past it.\u201d\n\nWith a nod, Mia and Orion stealthily advanced. As they rounded a bend, they stumbled upon a hidden chamber bathed in ethereal light. The source was a giant crystal, even more magnificent than the orb they had found on Garvonia. The hues of blue and green danced across the walls, casting intricate shadows that looked like ancient star patterns.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cJust look at that!\u201d Mia exclaimed, her eyes sparkling with awe. \u201cIt\u2019s beautiful!\u201d\n\nBut before they could fully take it in, a figure emerged from the shadows. It was Captain Zara, her silhouette outlined against the brilliant glow of the crystal. \u201cI see you\u2019ve discovered my little secret,\u201d she said, her voice smooth yet laced with an edge of danger.\n\nMia's heart pounded in her chest. \u201cWe didn\u2019t mean to intrude! We\u2019re just looking for\u2014\u201d\n\n\u201cTreasure?\u201d Captain Zara interrupted, stepping closer, her eyes glinting like the stars. \u201cTreasure that doesn\u2019t belong to you.\u201d\n\n\u201cBut the map,\u201d Mia protested, holding it out for Zara to see. \u201cIt led us here. We didn\u2019t know you were guarding it.\u201d\n\nZara\u2019s expression shifted, a glimmer of something softer crossing her face. \u201cYou\u2019re brave, I\u2019ll give you that. But bravery will only get you so far. You need to understand the risks of this quest.\u201d\n\nMia took a deep breath, her determination solidifying. \u201cI can handle the risks. I want to find the treasure, not just for me, but to bring hope to my planet. We\u2019re facing storm pirates, and we need help. Will you join us?\u201d\n\nSilence enveloped the chamber as Zara considered the proposal. The tension in the air thickened, almost palpable, as Mia\u2019s words lingered between them. Finally, Captain Zara sighed, her fierce demeanor softening. \u201cPerhaps there\u2019s more to you than meets the eye, Mia. The treasure you seek is not just gold or jewels; it\u2019s something much greater.\u201d\n\nA flicker of hope sparked within Mia. \u201cSo, you\u2019ll help us?\u201d she asked, her voice barely above a whisper.\n\nZara nodded slowly, a hint of a smile breaking through. \u201cVery well. But know this\u2014my help does not come without a price. Trust must be earned.\u201d\n\nJust then, a loud crash echoed outside the cave, causing all three of them to jump. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Mia exclaimed, her heart racing again.\n\n\u201cSpace pirates,\u201d Captain Zara said, her expression hardening once more. \u201cThey\u2019ve found us.\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith adrenaline coursing through her veins, Mia glanced at Orion, who was already calculating their escape route. \u201cWe need to get out of here, now!\u201d she shouted, as they sprinted toward the cave's entrance, the thrill of danger mingling with the hope of newfound alliances.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Mia and Orion discover in the cave?","options":["A hidden treasure chest","A giant crystal","A space shuttle","A map to another planet"],"correct_answer":"A giant crystal"},{"question":"What does Captain Zara initially think of Mia and Orion?","options":["She wants to help them","She sees them as intruders","She thinks they are lost","She wants to fight them"],"correct_answer":"She sees them as intruders"},{"question":"What does Mia want to achieve with the treasure?","options":["To become rich","To save her planet","To defeat space pirates","To travel the galaxy"],"correct_answer":"To save her planet"},{"question":"What does Captain Zara say must be earned?","options":["Trust","Respect","Treasure","Friendship"],"correct_answer":"Trust"},{"question":"What causes Mia and her friends to feel urgency towards the end of the chapter?","options":["A cosmic storm","Space pirates outside the cave","An earthquake","A creature approaching them"],"correct_answer":"Space pirates outside the cave"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_306_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_306_ch4_img1.png","plot_306_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":621,"reading_level":"Builder"}
