   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_307_7_10","title":"The Last Seed of Earth","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"On a bright and starry night, twelve-year-old Leo stared out of the big window of The Voyager. He felt excited and nervous at the same time. He was chosen to help save Earth! \n\n\u201cLeo! Come look at this!\u201d Ava, his younger sister, shouted from the control room. She was always full of energy and ideas. \n\nLeo rushed to her side. Ava was pointing at a screen filled with colorful planets. Each planet was different, like a box of crayons. \u201cWhich one do you think is our new home?\u201d she asked, her blue eyes sparkling.\n\n\u201cI hope it\u2019s the green one,\u201d Leo said. \u201cIt looks like it has trees!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] \n\nSuddenly, the ship jolted. Leo grabbed the edge of the control panel. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d he asked, his heart racing.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know!\u201d Ava replied, typing quickly on her keyboard. \u201cBut something is wrong with the engines!\u201d\n\nJust then, an alien appeared on the screen. He had green skin and big, friendly eyes. \u201cHello! I am Zile, the botanist,\u201d he said. \u201cI am here to help you!\u201d\n\n\u201cHelp us? How?\u201d Leo asked.\n\nZile\u2019s eyes glimmered. \u201cYou carry the last seed of Earth. It is very special. We must protect it!\u201d\n\nAva cheered, \u201cWe will protect it! Right, Leo?\u201d\n\n\u201cOf course!\u201d Leo replied. But deep down, he felt a worry. What if someone tried to take the seed?\n\nJust then, an alarm blared. \u201cWarning! Another ship is approaching!\u201d Zile exclaimed.\n\n\u201cWhat? Who?\u201d Leo shouted.\n\nAva looked scared. \u201cWhat if they want the seed?\u201d \n\nLeo clenched his fists. \u201cWe need to be ready!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2] \n\nThe ship shook again as the other ship drew closer. Leo and Ava exchanged worried glances. Leo knew they had to be brave, but the danger felt real. \n\n\u201cZile, what do we do?\u201d Ava asked, her voice trembling.\n\nZile smiled reassuringly. \u201cWe will work together. We will keep the seed safe!\u201d\n\nLeo took a deep breath. \u201cLet\u2019s protect the last seed of Earth!\u201d \n\nWith courage in their hearts, Leo and Ava prepared for the challenge ahead. Little did they know, the adventure was just beginning.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who are the main characters in this chapter?","options":["Leo and Ava","Zile and Ava","Leo and Zile","The other ship's crew"],"correct_answer":"Leo and Ava"},{"question":"What is the special thing Leo and Ava are carrying?","options":["A treasure","The last seed of Earth","A spaceship","An alien"],"correct_answer":"The last seed of Earth"},{"question":"Who helps Leo and Ava on their journey?","options":["An alien botanist named Zile","Their parents","A robot","A friend from school"],"correct_answer":"An alien botanist named Zile"},{"question":"What happens when another ship approaches?","options":["The ship lands","An alarm blares","They make new friends","They fly away"],"correct_answer":"An alarm blares"},{"question":"What do Leo and Ava decide to do?","options":["Give up","Run away","Protect the seed","Ignore the alarm"],"correct_answer":"Protect the seed"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_307_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_307_ch1_img1.png","plot_307_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":352,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
