   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_307_7_10","title":"The Last Seed of Earth","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"The Voyager hummed softly as it soared through the stars. Leo and Ava peered out of a large window. They could see the glowing colors of distant planets. \"Wow! Look at that one!\" Ava exclaimed, pointing at a blue and green planet. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nZile floated nearby, adjusting his glasses. \u201cThat\u2019s Planet Verdantia. It's filled with rare plants!\u201d His eyes sparkled with excitement. \u201cBut we must protect the last seed!\u201d \n\nJust then, an alarm blared. \u201cWarning! Incoming ship!\u201d Leo\u2019s heart raced. \u201cIt must be the rival colony!\u201d Ava gasped. \u201cWhat do we do?\u201d \n\nZile's expression turned serious. \u201cWe must hide the seed!\u201d Together, they rushed to the seed\u2019s special chamber. Leo checked the lock. \u201cIt\u2019s secure, but we need a plan.\u201d \n\nSuddenly, the ship shook as a loud bang echoed through the hull. \u201cThey\u2019ve hit us!\u201d Leo shouted. Ava clutched the edge of her seat. \u201cWhat now?\u201d\n\nZile pointed to the control panel. \u201cWe need to increase our speed!\u201d Leo hit buttons quickly, and the ship sped up. But the rival ship was right behind them. \u201cThey\u2019re gaining on us!\u201d Ava said nervously.\n\nLeo thought fast. \u201cWe can use the asteroid belt ahead for cover. Zile, can we navigate it?\u201d \n\nZile nodded. \u201cYes! But it will be tricky!\u201d \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Leo shouted. They pulled the levers. The Voyager swerved toward the asteroids. \n\n\u201cHold on!\u201d Ava yelled as the ship zipped and zigged through the rocky field. They dodged a big rock, but suddenly, a smaller asteroid smashed into their side! \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe ship rattled violently. \u201cWe\u2019re losing power!\u201d Zile cried. Leo gripped the controls tightly. \u201cWe have to keep going!\u201d \n\nWith a deep breath, Leo focused. \u201cAva, can you check the power systems?\u201d Ava rushed to the back, her small hands working quickly. \n\n\u201cI think I can fix it!\u201d she shouted over the noise. Leo felt worried but trusted Ava. The ship spun wildly. The rival ship was still chasing them! \n\nSuddenly, Ava shouted, \u201cGot it!\u201d The lights flickered back on. \u201cPower restored!\u201d\n\nLeo smiled, hoping they could escape. \u201cLet\u2019s get out of here!\u201d He steered the ship harder. But just when he thought they were safe, they heard a loud voice crackle over the ship\u2019s intercom. \n\n\u201cHand over the seed, or we\u2019ll take it by force!\u201d \n\nLeo gulped. \u201cWe\u2019re not giving it up!\u201d \n\nWith adrenaline pumping, they prepared to face whatever was next.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the name of the spaceship?","options":["The Voyager","The Explorer","The Adventurer","The Seeker"],"correct_answer":"The Voyager"},{"question":"What do they see through the spaceship window?","options":["A blue and green planet","A red star","A black hole","An alien city"],"correct_answer":"A blue and green planet"},{"question":"What happens when the rival ship attacks?","options":["They lose the seed","The ship shakes","They find a treasure","They reach their destination"],"correct_answer":"The ship shakes"},{"question":"Who helps Leo and Ava understand the seed?","options":["A robot","Zile","Their parents","An alien"],"correct_answer":"Zile"},{"question":"What do Leo and Ava decide to do when the rival ship demands the seed?","options":["Give it up","Run away","Hand it over","Not give it up"],"correct_answer":"Not give it up"}]},"images":null,"word_count":407,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
