   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_307_7_10","title":"The Last Seed of Earth","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Leo and Ava stood in the control room of The Voyager. The ship hummed softly, the screens glowing with colorful maps of the stars. Zile, the friendly alien botanist, adjusted his glasses. \"We must be careful. The rival ship is close!\"\n\nSuddenly, an alarm blared. \u201cWarning! Warning! Intruder alert!\u201d shouted the ship\u2019s computer. Leo\u2019s heart raced. \u201cThey\u2019re here!\u201d he yelled, gripping the edge of the console.\n\nAva looked worried. \u201cWhat do we do, Leo?\u201d She glanced at the glowing seed in its safe compartment. \u201cWe can\u2019t let them take the seed!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s navigate through the asteroid field!\u201d Leo suggested. \u201cThat will slow them down.\u201d He quickly punched in the coordinates. \n\n\u201cAre you sure that\u2019s safe?\u201d Ava asked. \n\n\u201cSafer than letting them steal the seed!\u201d Leo replied. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs The Voyager zoomed toward the swirling asteroids, the ship shook. Ava grabbed a seat, and Zile steadied himself. \u201cHold on tight!\u201d he said, his voice firm.\n\nThe ship weaved between the giant rocks, bumping and swaying. Suddenly, a loud crash echoed from the back of the ship. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Ava screamed.\n\nZile\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cThey\u2019ve boarded us!\u201d \n\nLeo felt a wave of panic. \u201cWe need a plan!\u201d He quickly thought. \u201cLet\u2019s split up! I\u2019ll distract them, and you and Zile protect the seed.\u201d\n\n\u201cAre you crazy?\u201d Ava exclaimed. \u201cWhat if they catch you?\u201d\n\n\u201cI\u2019ll be fine! Trust me!\u201d Leo insisted. \n\nWith a nod, Ava agreed. \u201cOkay, let\u2019s do it!\u201d They moved quickly, ready to face their biggest challenge yet.\n\nAs Leo dashed down the corridor, he heard footsteps behind him. The rival crew was close! He thought about the last seed of Earth. It had to be protected!\n\nJust then, Leo spotted a hatch leading to the engine room. \u201cMaybe I can trap them!\u201d he whispered. He slipped inside, holding his breath. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nMeanwhile, Ava and Zile hurried to the seed\u2019s compartment. They turned to a small screen showing the ship\u2019s security feeds. \u201cWe need to keep an eye on Leo!\u201d Ava said.\n\nSuddenly, the screen flickered. A figure appeared! It was a tall, shadowy figure from the rival ship. \u201cWhere is the seed?\u201d the figure demanded.\n\nAva felt her heart thump. \u201cOh no! We can\u2019t let them find it!\u201d \n\nJust then, the entire ship jolted. Leo\u2019s voice crackled over the intercom. \u201cAva! I\u2019m trapped! You have to make a choice! Do you protect the seed, or do you come to help me?\u201d","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who helps Leo and Ava with the seed?","options":["A robot","An alien botanist","A pirate","A dog"],"correct_answer":"An alien botanist"},{"question":"What happens when the alarm blares?","options":["A fire starts","They find treasure","The rival ship is nearby","It's a party"],"correct_answer":"The rival ship is nearby"},{"question":"What does Leo want to do to escape the rival ship?","options":["Fly to the moon","Navigate through the asteroid field","Play a game","Go to sleep"],"correct_answer":"Navigate through the asteroid field"},{"question":"What choice does Leo give Ava?","options":["Help him or protect the seed","Play a game","Leave the ship","Change the music"],"correct_answer":"Help him or protect the seed"},{"question":"What does Ava do while Leo is distracting the intruders?","options":["Plays a game","Dances","Protects the seed","Sleeps"],"correct_answer":"Protects the seed"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_307_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_307_ch3_img1.png","plot_307_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":421,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
