   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_307_7_10","title":"The Last Seed of Earth","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Leo\u2019s heart raced as he dangled from the edge of The Voyager. The ship shook violently. He could hear Ava\u2019s voice calling out, \u201cLeo! Hold on!\u201d \n\n\u201cDon\u2019t let go!\u201d Leo yelled back. He looked at the glowing seed in Ava\u2019s hands. \u201cYou have to protect it!\u201d \n\nAva gritted her teeth. \u201cI won\u2019t let anything happen to it!\u201d \n\nJust then, a loud crash rattled the ship. \u201cThey\u2019re trying to break in!\u201d Zile shouted. The alien botanist stood at the control panel, his green tentacles waving in alarm. \n\nLeo pulled himself up with a grunt. \u201cWe need to get somewhere safe!\u201d \n\nThey rushed to the control room. Zile quickly activated the ship\u2019s shields. \u201cWe must hide the seed! It\u2019s vital for the future of Earth,\u201d he said. \n\n\u201cBut how?\u201d Ava asked, her eyes wide. \n\nLeo thought hard. \u201cWe can use the cargo bay. It\u2019s big and dark!\u201d He turned to Zile. \u201cCan you create a distraction?\u201d \n\nZile nodded. \u201cLeave it to me!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nZile pressed buttons, and colorful lights flickered across the ship. The lights flashed like a carnival. It was bright and dazzling! The enemy ship was confused. \n\n\u201cThis is our chance!\u201d Leo said. \u201cAva, let\u2019s go!\u201d \n\nAva held the seed tightly as they raced to the cargo bay. They carefully placed the seed inside a small, hidden nook. \u201cThis should keep it safe,\u201d Ava said, breathing a sigh of relief. \n\nSuddenly, a loud boom echoed through the ship. \u201cThey\u2019re boarding!\u201d Leo shouted. \u201cWe have to hurry!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nJust then, the door burst open! A group of rival space pirates stormed in, their eyes wild with greed. \u201cWhere\u2019s the seed?!\u201d their leader barked. \n\nAva stepped forward, shaking her head. \u201cYou\u2019ll never get it!\u201d \n\nLeo stood beside her. \u201cWe won\u2019t let you take it!\u201d \n\nThe pirates laughed. \u201cWhat are two kids and a green squishy doing against us?\u201d \n\nZile jumped in front of them. \u201cYou do not want to mess with my young friends!\u201d \n\nThe pirates hesitated, looking at Zile\u2019s fierce expression. Leo knew this was their moment. They had to act fast!\n\n\u201cNow!\u201d Leo shouted. \n\nWith a swift move, Ava pressed a button. The ship\u2019s shields flared, blocking the pirates\u2019 way. \n\n\u201cRun!\u201d Leo yelled. \n\nTogether, they dashed away, leaving the pirates behind, wondering what would happen next. \n\nAs they ran, Leo felt hope spark inside him. \u201cWe can do this!\u201d he said. \u201cWe just have to keep the seed safe!\u201d","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Leo and Ava need to protect?","options":["A toy","A piece of candy","The last seed of Earth","A book"],"correct_answer":"The last seed of Earth"},{"question":"What does Zile create to distract the pirates?","options":["A loud noise","Colorful lights","A smoke screen","A big robot"],"correct_answer":"Colorful lights"},{"question":"Where do Leo and Ava hide the seed?","options":["In a closet","In the cargo bay","In their backpacks","In the control room"],"correct_answer":"In the cargo bay"},{"question":"How do the pirates react to Zile?","options":["They run away","They laugh","They help him","They get scared"],"correct_answer":"They get scared"},{"question":"What do Leo and Ava feel at the end of the chapter?","options":["Fear","Hope","Sadness","Anger"],"correct_answer":"Hope"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_307_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_307_ch4_img1.png","plot_307_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":417,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
