   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_307_7_10","title":"The Last Seed of Earth","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"As the Voyager sailed through the vastness of space, Leo and Ava felt a mix of excitement and worry. The seed was safe, but they could not shake the feeling that danger was still out there. Suddenly, Zile appeared in the doorway, her green skin glowing under the ship's lights. \n\n\u201cListen closely,\u201d Zile said, her voice steady. \u201cThe seed is more than just a plant. It holds the power to bring life back to Earth.\u201d\n\nLeo narrowed his eyes. \u201cBut how do we protect it?\u201d\n\nZile smiled. \u201cTogether, we will use our skills.\u201d \n\nAnd with that, they gathered around a table. Ava pulled out her trusty toolbox. \u201cI\u2019ve got some ideas!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAva showed them a small gadget. \u201cThis is a shield generator! It can hide the seed from anyone who tries to find it.\u201d \n\nLeo nodded. \u201cThat\u2019s brilliant, Ava! But we need to test it.\u201d\n\nJust then, an alarm rang through the ship. \u201cIncoming ship!\u201d shouted Leo. \n\n\u201cThey\u2019re back!\u201d Ava cried. \n\nZile pointed to the screen. \u201cIt\u2019s the rival colony ship! They want the seed!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s move!\u201d Leo shouted. He led Ava and Zile to the control panel. \n\nAs they sped up, the other ship fired a warning shot. Leo gripped the controls. \u201cAva, activate the shield!\u201d\n\n\u201cI\u2019m on it!\u201d Ava tapped buttons wildly, and the ship shimmered with energy.\n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s next?\u201d Zile asked, her eyes wide.\n\n\u201cWe need to outsmart them!\u201d Leo exclaimed. \u201cAva, can you use the asteroid field?\u201d\n\n\u201cYes! It\u2019ll be like a maze!\u201d Ava cheered.\n\nThey zoomed toward the rocks, dodging and weaving. The rival ship followed closely, but Ava activated the shield just in time. \n\n\u201cHere goes nothing!\u201d Leo took a deep breath and steered hard to the right. The Voyager darted into the field, and the rival ship struggled to keep up.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWith quick thinking and teamwork, they navigated through the asteroids. \u201cWe did it!\u201d Ava shouted as the rival ship got tangled in the rocks. \n\nZile clapped her hands. \u201cYou two are incredible! The seed is safe!\u201d\n\nLeo smiled, his heart racing. \u201cAs long as we stick together, we can face anything.\u201d \n\nAva grinned. \u201cAnd we can take the seed to the new world!\u201d\n\nThey cheered, knowing they had protected not just the seed, but the hope for a brighter future.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does the seed hold the power to do?","options":["Bring life back to Earth","Create a spaceship","Turn into a monster","Grow bigger than the ship"],"correct_answer":"Bring life back to Earth"},{"question":"What does Ava invent to protect the seed?","options":["A spaceship","A shield generator","A time machine","A robot"],"correct_answer":"A shield generator"},{"question":"Who helps Leo and Ava understand the seed's importance?","options":["A robot","Zile the alien botanist","Their parents","A dog"],"correct_answer":"Zile the alien botanist"},{"question":"What do Leo and Ava have to navigate through to escape the rival ship?","options":["A forest","An ocean","An asteroid field","A city"],"correct_answer":"An asteroid field"},{"question":"What is the main theme of this chapter?","options":["Friendship and teamwork","Winning races","Cooking food","Building houses"],"correct_answer":"Friendship and teamwork"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_307_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_307_ch5_img1.png","plot_307_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":390,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
