     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"gravitational","1":"ecosystem","2":"diversion","3":"urgency","4":"secure","image_prompts":["A bustling control room of a futuristic spaceship, filled with glowing screens and flashing lights. Leo is pacing anxiously, while Ava works on a small device, her expression serious and focused. Zile, an alien botanist, stands nearby, his shimmering green skin reflecting the console's lights, creating an ethereal atmosphere.","A tense scene inside a spaceship's storage chamber, with Leo gripping a small, glowing seed in his hands, its warmth evident. Ava is animatedly programming a device, her face lit with determination. The ship is shaking, and the alarms are blaring, adding a sense of urgency and suspense to the moment."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A panoramic view of the observation deck, showcasing Leo gazing out at the vibrant nebulae, with Ava tinkering on a gadget beside him. The light from the nebulae casts a dreamlike glow on their faces, symbolizing hope and the unknown journey ahead.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_307_ch4_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 14:10:08"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dramatic scene of The Voyager shaking with the impact of an explosion, Leo frantically working at the control panel while Zile and Ava brace themselves against the console. The tension is palpable, with bright lights flashing and debris scattering around them, symbolizing the chaos of the moment and the urgency of their mission.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_307_ch4_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 14:10:08"}}}
