     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"luminous","1":"stabilize","2":"maneuver","3":"camouflage","4":"perimeter","image_prompts":["A dynamic scene showcasing Leo and Ava in the control room of The Voyager, their faces illuminated by the glow of the screens, filled with excitement and determination. The distant view of the vibrant planet Veridion can be seen through the windows, with bright colors hinting at the lush ecosystem that awaits them.","An intense moment where Leo and Ava are on the alien planet, surrounded by exotic plants. The tension is palpable as they prepare to hide the seed, their expressions focused and alert. Glimmers of light from the plants create an otherworldly atmosphere, while shadows loom in the background, suggesting the approach of danger."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing The interior of The Voyager is illuminated with soft, ambient lights, showcasing Leo and Avas expressions of determination. In the background, the holographic image of The Reavers menacing figure looms, casting an ominous shadow over the siblings. The scene captures the tension of the moment, with Ava focused on her gadget and Leos fierce gaze locked on the threat ahead.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_307_ch5_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 14:09:24"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dynamic image capturing the moment when the seed glows brightly within its containment, radiating energy that envelops Leo, Ava, and Zile. The cockpit is awash in brilliant light, casting dramatic shadows on their determined faces. The tension is palpable, symbolizing their unity and the seeds potential to restore life.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_307_ch5_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 14:09:24"}}}
