   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_307_11_14","title":"The Last Seed of Earth","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"The sleek spaceship, The Voyager, glided silently through the velvet darkness of space, its metallic surface gleaming under the light of distant stars. Inside, twelve-year-old Leo was pacing the narrow corridor, the hum of the engines a constant reminder of their mission. His mind raced with thoughts of the seed they carried\u2014Earth's last chance for survival. \n\n\u201cAre you sure you packed everything?\u201d Ava\u2019s voice broke through his concentration. She was standing in their small cabin, surrounded by an assortment of gadgets and tools she had scattered around. At ten, Ava was always tinkering, her dark curls bouncing as she bounced on her toes with excitement. \n\n\u201cOf course! We can\u2019t lose the seed,\u201d Leo replied, his eyes narrowing. \u201cIt\u2019s all we have left of Earth. Without it, everything goes extinct.\u201d \n\nAva frowned, her brow furrowing. \u201cI know, but what if something goes wrong?\u201d She picked up a small, glowing device\u2014the Seed Guardian\u2014a high-tech security tool she had designed to protect the seed. \u201cWhat if someone tries to take it from us?\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs Ava spoke, Leo\u2019s stomach knotted. He could feel the weight of the mission pressing down on him like an iron anchor. It wasn\u2019t just about delivering the seed; it was about hope, about reviving the world they had lost. But with rumors of rival colony ships flying about, he knew they couldn't trust anyone.\n\n\u201cZile said we can expect trouble,\u201d Leo reminded her, remembering the wise alien botanist who had helped them understand the importance of the seed. Zile had described it as a \u201clifetime of hope encased in a fragile shell.\u201d \n\nSuddenly, the lights dimmed, and a warning beep echoed through the ship. Ava\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d\n\nLeo rushed to the control panel, his fingers darting over the buttons. \u201cWe\u2019re being scanned! Someone\u2019s out there!\u201d \n\n\u201cI\u2019ll activate the Seed Guardian!\u201d Ava exclaimed, her voice a mix of fear and determination. \n\nThey both reached for the device, their hands brushing together. \u201cOn three,\u201d Leo said, adrenaline pumping through him. \u201cOne\u2026 two\u2026 three!\u201d \n\nAva pressed the button, and the Seed Guardian emitted a bright blue light, creating a protective bubble around the small secure compartment where the last seed was stored. Leo felt a rush of relief. \n\nBut just as they began to breathe easier, a jarring impact rocked the ship. Alarms blared, and the lights flashed crimson. \u201cWhat was that?!\u201d Ava shouted, her eyes wide with panic.\n\n\u201cIt came from the aft section!\u201d Leo yelled, his heart racing. He dashed toward the back of the ship, Ava close behind. The air was thick with tension as they pushed open the hatch to find a dark figure silhouetted against the emergency lights.\n\n\u201cGet away from the seed!\u201d Leo cried, stepping forward bravely.\n\nBut the figure turned, and Leo recognized the face from the propaganda broadcasts. \u201cYou must have the seed,\u201d the intruder sneered, pulling out a sleek weapon that hummed ominously in the dim light. \u201cAnd I\u2019m here to take it.\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nLeo\u2019s heart pounded. This was not just a mission anymore; it was a life-or-death struggle for the future of their world. \n\n\u201cStay back!\u201d Ava shouted, positioning herself between Leo and the intruder. Leo felt a surge of pride for his sister\u2019s bravery, but they both knew they were in deep trouble.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s see if you\u2019re willing to fight for it!\u201d the figure taunted, stepping closer.\n\nLeo gritted his teeth. They needed to protect the seed and each other, no matter the cost.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the main mission of Leo and Ava?","options":["To explore new planets","To deliver the last seed of Earth","To find new allies","To escape from a rival colony"],"correct_answer":"To deliver the last seed of Earth"},{"question":"Who helps Leo and Ava understand the significance of the seed?","options":["A robot","Their mother","An alien botanist named Zile","A teacher"],"correct_answer":"An alien botanist named Zile"},{"question":"What does the Seed Guardian do?","options":["It repairs the ship","It creates a protective bubble around the seed","It powers the spaceship","It provides food"],"correct_answer":"It creates a protective bubble around the seed"},{"question":"How does Leo feel as they embark on their mission?","options":["Excited and carefree","Anxious and determined","Bored and sleepy","Confused and lost"],"correct_answer":"Anxious and determined"},{"question":"What happens when the intruder appears?","options":["They find a new friend","They feel relieved","They face immediate danger","They laugh"],"correct_answer":"They face immediate danger"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_307_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_307_ch1_img1.png","plot_307_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":596,"reading_level":"Builder"}
