   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_307_11_14","title":"The Last Seed of Earth","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Chapter 3: Shadows Among the Stars\n\nThe Voyager glided through the vastness of space, a sleek silver dart against the backdrop of twinkling stars. Inside, Leo stood in the control room, his heart racing. The soft hum of the ship's engines surrounded him, but it couldn\u2019t drown out the feeling that something was brewing\u2014something dangerous. Ava was busy tinkering with her latest invention, a small device meant to track the energy signals from other ships. She turned to Leo, her brow furrowed.\n\n\u201cDo you think they\u2019ll come after us again?\u201d she asked, her voice a whisper.\n\nLeo shrugged, trying to stay brave. \u201cIf they do, we\u2019ll be ready.\u201d \n\nThe thought of the rival colony ship, The Luminous, sent a shiver down his spine. He had never been so afraid. Suddenly, the ship's alarm blared, slicing through the tension like a knife. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nA flickering light on the control panel caught Leo\u2019s eye. \u201cAva! The energy signature\u2014it\u2019s changing!\u201d \n\n\u201cChanging how? Is it them?\u201d Ava\u2019s fingers danced over the controls, her eyes wide with worry.\n\nLeo squinted at the screen. \u201cIt looks like they\u2019re powering up their engines. We need to take evasive action!\u201d\n\nJust as he reached for the controls, a jolt rocked The Voyager. Leo stumbled, grasping the console to steady himself. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Ava exclaimed, her voice rising in panic.\n\n\u201cSabotage! We\u2019re being hit!\u201d Leo shouted, his heart pounding like a drum. He glanced out of the viewport, where bright flashes erupted in the darkness. The Luminous was firing at them.\n\nAva\u2019s eyes sparkled with determination. \u201cI can help! If I can just redirect the power from the shields\u2014\u201d\n\n\u201cNo! We can\u2019t risk it!\u201d Leo interrupted, but Ava was already working on a solution. \n\nWith deft movements, she adjusted the dials. \u201cIf we can keep our shields up, we might have a chance to escape!\u201d\n\nThe ship lurched again, sending Ava sprawling against the floor. She winced but quickly scrambled back to her feet. \u201cI\u2019m almost there!\u201d \n\nThe screen flickered, showing the enemy ship closing in on them, and Leo felt the weight of the world on his shoulders. \u201cAva, we need to go now! Can you\u2014\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a loud crash echoed through the ship, and the lights flickered ominously. Leo\u2019s breath caught in his throat as the door to the control room burst open. A figure cloaked in shadow stood there, a malicious grin on their face.\n\n\u201cLooking for this?\u201d They held up a small, glowing orb\u2014the seed. \n\n\u201cNo!\u201d Leo shouted, rushing forward. But the intruder was too quick, darting away towards the main cargo hold.\n\n\u201cAva, after them!\u201d Leo yelled, adrenaline pumping through his veins. \n\nAs they sprinted after the thief, Leo felt the ground shake beneath them. The ship\u2019s systems began to fail, alarms blaring louder. \u201cWe have to get the seed back! It\u2019s our only chance!\u201d\n\nThey cornered the figure near the cargo hold, where the precious seed was now dangerously close to the edge of the ship\u2019s opening hatch. Leo\u2019s heart raced as he realized the risk\u2014the seed could be lost forever.\n\n\u201cStop!\u201d Leo yelled, but the figure just laughed, their voice echoing against the metal walls. \n\nAva, thinking fast, activated her device with a flick of her wrist. A laser-like beam shot out, striking the intruder\u2019s foot. They stumbled, giving Leo the opening he needed. \n\n\u201cGrab it!\u201d he shouted, reaching for the seed, but just then, the ship lurched again with a violent shake, sending everything into chaos. \n\nThe intruder, now flailing to keep their balance, teetered dangerously close to the edge. Leo\u2019s mind raced\u2014this was more than just a seed; it was the last hope for Earth. He had to make a choice.\n\nWould he save the seed or risk everything to save Ava?\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Ava try to do to help during the attack?","options":["Fire weapons","Redirect power from the shields","Contact Earth","Pilot the ship"],"correct_answer":"Redirect power from the shields"},{"question":"What does the intruder hold that Leo and Ava are trying to protect?","options":["A weapon","The last seed","A map","A communication device"],"correct_answer":"The last seed"},{"question":"What does Leo feel he must choose between during the confrontation?","options":["Saving the ship or the intruder","Saving the seed or saving Ava","Saving himself or Ava","Fighting or fleeing"],"correct_answer":"Saving the seed or saving Ava"},{"question":"What happens to the ship during the attack?","options":["It begins to malfunction","It lands on a planet","It gets captured","It disappears into another dimension"],"correct_answer":"It begins to malfunction"},{"question":"How does the chapter end?","options":["With a peaceful moment","With a cliffhanger","With the ship landing","With the seed being lost"],"correct_answer":"With a cliffhanger"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_307_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_307_ch3_img1.png","plot_307_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":648,"reading_level":"Builder"}
