   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_308_7_10","title":"Galactic Pen Pals","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Sam sat at his small desk, staring at the blank page in front of him. The sunlight peeked through his window, warming his face. Today was the day he would write his first letter to an alien!\n\n\u201cDear Alien,\u201d he wrote, feeling a mix of excitement and fear. \u201cMy name is Sam. I want to be your pen pal.\u201d He imagined what an alien might look like. Would it be green with three eyes? Or would it have colorful skin and funny ears?\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSam took a deep breath and imagined the alien reading his letter. He added, \u201cI live in a small town. It is quiet here. What is your planet like?\u201d He folded the letter and put it in an envelope. He even drew a little rocket on the front. \n\nAfter school, Sam raced to the mailbox. He felt a flutter in his stomach. \u201cWhat if I never hear back?\u201d he wondered. But he pushed the envelope inside the mailbox anyway. \u201cI hope you like it!\u201d he whispered.\n\nThe next day, Sam woke up to a strange sound. It was a soft beeping noise. He looked out the window and saw a bright light in the sky. \u201cWow!\u201d he whispered. The light got bigger and bigger until it landed right in his backyard!\n\n\u201cIs this part of the adventure?\u201d he asked himself, his heart racing. He ran outside and found a small, colorful creature standing next to a shiny spaceship. It had big eyes and a smile that stretched from ear to ear.\n\n\u201cHello, Sam!\u201d the creature said with a giggle. \u201cI am Qel from the planet Glimmera! Your letter made me so happy!\u201d \n\nSam couldn't believe it. \u201cYou got my letter?\u201d he stammered. \n\n\u201cYes! And I need your help!\u201d Qel exclaimed, bouncing up and down. \u201cMy planet is in danger. The Light Crystal is missing!\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s the Light Crystal?\u201d Sam asked, feeling brave but also a bit scared.\n\n\u201cIt keeps my home bright and alive!\u201d Qel said, his eyes wide. \u201cWithout it, everything goes dark! Will you help me find it?\u201d\n\nSam took a deep breath. He had always been shy. But could he really help save an entire planet? \u201cI will!\u201d he said, surprising himself. \n\nJust then, a group of strange-looking bullies appeared. They had wild hair and smirks on their faces. Their leader, Grix, stood tall and pointed at Sam. \u201cLook! A human and a silly alien! They must have something fun!\u201d\n\nSam felt his heart race. He knew he had to be brave. \u201cCome on, Qel!\u201d he said, ready for the adventure ahead.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nTogether, Sam and Qel ran towards the spaceship. They had to escape Grix and his gang. The adventure was just beginning!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Sam want to do?","options":["Write to an alien","Draw a picture","Go to school","Play outside"],"correct_answer":"Write to an alien"},{"question":"What is the name of the alien Sam writes to?","options":["Grix","Zor","Qel","Blinky"],"correct_answer":"Qel"},{"question":"What does Qel need help with?","options":["Finding a lost pet","Building a spaceship","Finding the Light Crystal","Making friends"],"correct_answer":"Finding the Light Crystal"},{"question":"Who are the bullies in the story?","options":["Sam's friends","Grix and his gang","Aliens from another planet","Teachers at school"],"correct_answer":"Grix and his gang"},{"question":"How does Sam feel at the beginning of the chapter?","options":["Excited","Scared","Hungry","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Excited"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_308_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_308_ch1_img1.png","plot_308_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":454,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
