       [DEBUG] Checking shared image: {"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing An atmospheric image of Sams cluttered room, filled with sketches and crumpled papers, illuminated by a warm desk lamp. The walls are adorned with posters of galaxies, and the soft glow creates a sense of wonder as Sam reads Qels letter, his expression a mix of fear and determination.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_308_ch2_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 14:07:51"}
