   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_308_7_10","title":"Galactic Pen Pals","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Sam sat in his room, staring at the letter from Qel. His heart raced. \u201cWhat if we get caught?\u201d he thought. He imagined the bullies, led by Grix, sneering at him. Sam bit his lip. \u201cI can\u2019t let them stop me,\u201d he whispered.\n\nSuddenly, a bright flash of light filled his room. Qel appeared, shimmering like a rainbow. \u201cLet\u2019s go, Sam!\u201d he cheered, his eyes sparkling. \u201cWe must find the Light Crystal before Grix does!\u201d\n\nSam nodded, feeling a mix of excitement and fear. \u201cWhere do we start?\u201d he asked.\n\n\u201cFollow me!\u201d Qel said and twirled around. \u201cWe will travel to my planet!\u201d\n\nWith a whoosh, Sam felt himself lift off the ground. Before he knew it, he was floating through a tunnel of stars. Colors swirled around him. \u201cThis is amazing!\u201d he shouted, laughing. \n\nJust then, they landed softly on Qel's planet, which looked like a giant candy world. Bright trees grew in strange shapes, and clouds sparkled like glitter. Sam\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cIt\u2019s like a dream!\u201d he exclaimed.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nBut soon, Sam heard a loud voice. \u201cThere they are! Get them!\u201d It was Grix! Sam\u2019s heart dropped. He had to think fast. \u201cQel, we need a plan!\u201d \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s hide!\u201d Qel suggested, pointing to a shiny blue bush. They squeezed behind it just in time. Sam could see Grix and his gang stomping around, looking for them. \n\n\u201cI want that Light Crystal!\u201d Grix growled. \u201cNo one can stop me!\u201d Sam felt a chill. How could they outsmart someone so mean?\n\n\u201cWe need to be brave, Sam,\u201d Qel said, bouncing nearby. \u201cIf we keep quiet, they will wander off!\u201d \n\nSam took a deep breath. \u201cYou\u2019re right. We can do this!\u201d He felt more confident. \n\nAs Grix and his friends searched, Sam noticed a glimmer in the distance. \u201cLook! Over there!\u201d He pointed. \u201cIs that the Light Crystal?\u201d\n\nQel\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cYes! But it\u2019s in Grix\u2019s way. We need to distract them!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nSam nodded. \u201cWhat if we make a noise?\u201d \n\nThey both thought hard. Suddenly, Qel had an idea. \u201cI can make a sound like a giant space animal!\u201d\n\nSam grinned. \u201cThat\u2019s perfect! Let\u2019s do it!\u201d \n\nQel took a deep breath and let out a loud roar that echoed across the landscape. Grix jumped and turned. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d he shouted. \n\nThis was their chance! \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d Sam urged, and they dashed towards the shiny glimmer, ready for their next move.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Qel want to find?","options":["A spaceship","The Light Crystal","A treasure chest","A magic wand"],"correct_answer":"The Light Crystal"},{"question":"Who is leading the bullies?","options":["Sam","Qel","Grix","A giant"],"correct_answer":"Grix"},{"question":"What does Sam feel when he first sees Qel's planet?","options":["Bored","Scared","Excited","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"},{"question":"What plan do Sam and Qel come up with?","options":["To run away","To fly high","To make a noise","To hide forever"],"correct_answer":"To make a noise"},{"question":"How does Qel distract the bullies?","options":["By singing","By roaring","By dancing","By laughing"],"correct_answer":"By roaring"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_308_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_308_ch2_img1.png","plot_308_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":416,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
