   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_308_7_10","title":"Galactic Pen Pals","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Chapter 3: The Great Escape\n\nThe sky above Qel\u2019s colorful planet was bright purple. Sam looked around, amazed by the swaying trees and sparkling rivers. \u201cIt\u2019s so beautiful here!\u201d he exclaimed. \n\nQel smiled, his bright blue eyes twinkling. \u201cYou\u2019re going to help save it, Sam! We need to find the Light Crystal!\u201d \n\nSuddenly, a loud voice echoed through the trees. \u201cThere they are!\u201d It was Grix, the bully! Sam\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWhat do we do?\u201d he whispered, trembling.\n\nQel looked serious. \u201cWe have to hurry! The crystal is hidden in the Crystal Cave. We can\u2019t let Grix find it first!\u201d\n\nSam nodded, feeling the weight of his fear. \u201cBut what if Grix catches us?\u201d \n\nQel grabbed Sam\u2019s hand. \u201cTogether we can do it! Let\u2019s go!\u201d They dashed through the jungle, dodging strange plants and colorful creatures. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they ran, Sam spotted a shiny object on the ground. \u201cWhat\u2019s that?\u201d he asked, slowing down. It was a glowing map! \u201cIt must show us the way to the cave!\u201d he said excitedly.\n\n\u201cGreat find!\u201d Qel cheered. \u201cLet\u2019s see where it leads!\u201d\n\nBut just then, Grix and his friends appeared from behind a tree. \u201cYou think you can escape us?\u201d Grix shouted, grinning wickedly. \u201cHand over the map!\u201d\n\nSam froze. Grix was big, and his friends looked tough. \u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d he whispered to Qel, his voice shaky.\n\n\u201cRun!\u201d Qel shouted as they dashed deeper into the jungle. The sound of footsteps chased them, getting closer and closer.\n\n\u201cOver there!\u201d Qel pointed to a big rock. \u201cWe can hide!\u201d They squeezed behind it, holding their breath. \n\nThey heard Grix stomp past them. \u201cWhere are they?\u201d he growled. Sam felt his heart pound in his chest. Would they be caught?\n\nSuddenly, Qel\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cLook!\u201d He pointed at a beam of light shining from a nearby cave. \u201cThe Crystal Cave! We have to go now!\u201d\n\n\u201cOkay! Let\u2019s go!\u201d Sam said, feeling brave. They rushed toward the light, ready to face whatever was inside.\n\nBut just as they reached the entrance, Grix yelled, \u201cThere they are!\u201d \n\nSam turned to Qel, breathing hard. \u201cWe have to decide! Go in or fight?\u201d \n\nQel looked at Sam with determination. \u201cLet\u2019s save my planet!\u201d \n\nWith a deep breath, Sam stepped forward, ready for the adventure ahead.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Qel want to find?","options":["A map","A Light Crystal","A spaceship","A treasure"],"correct_answer":"A Light Crystal"},{"question":"Who is chasing Sam and Qel?","options":["Friendly aliens","Grix and his bullies","Qel's family","Sam's friends"],"correct_answer":"Grix and his bullies"},{"question":"What do Sam and Qel find on the ground?","options":["An alien","A glowing map","A treasure chest","A book"],"correct_answer":"A glowing map"},{"question":"What do Sam and Qel decide to do at the cave?","options":["Run away","Hide","Go inside","Fight Grix"],"correct_answer":"Go inside"},{"question":"What does Sam feel when he sees Grix?","options":["Brave","Shy","Fearful","Excited"],"correct_answer":"Fearful"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_308_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_308_ch3_img1.png","plot_308_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":392,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
