   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_308_7_10","title":"Galactic Pen Pals","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Chapter 4: The Crystal Cave\n\nSam and Qel stood in front of the Crystal Cave, where colorful lights danced on the walls. \"This is it, Sam!\" Qel said, his bright eyes sparkling. \"But we need to be careful. Grix and his friends are close behind!\"\n\nSam gulped. \u201cWhat if they catch us?\u201d \n\nQel smiled, his tentacles waving with excitement. \u201cWe will outsmart them! Remember the map? It shows us how to find the Light Crystal!\u201d\n\nThey took a deep breath and stepped into the cave. The air was cool and smelled sweet, like candy. Inside, the walls sparkled with crystals of all colors\u2014red, blue, and green\u2014just like a rainbow. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cWow!\u201d Sam whispered. \u201cThis place is amazing!\u201d\n\n\u201cSee that glowing light?\u201d Qel pointed to a shimmer far inside the cave. \u201cThat\u2019s where the Light Crystal is!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, they heard loud footsteps echoing behind them. Sam shivered. \u201cIt\u2019s Grix!\u201d \n\n\u201cWe have to hurry!\u201d Qel said. They rushed deeper into the cave, dodging large crystals. \n\nAs they ran, Sam spotted something strange. \u201cLook over there!\u201d he shouted, pointing to a glowing path. \u201cIs that part of the map?\u201d\n\n\u201cYes! Let\u2019s follow it!\u201d Qel encouraged. They dashed toward the light, feeling hopeful. \n\nBut just then, Grix appeared at the cave entrance, grinning with his gang. \u201cYou two are trapped!\u201d he laughed. \n\nSam felt a wave of fear wash over him. But then he thought of Qel, the alien friend who believed in him. \u201cNo! We can do this!\u201d Sam yelled. \n\n\u201cI have an idea!\u201d Qel whispered, looking at Sam. \u201cWe can use the crystals to create a distraction!\u201d\n\nSam nodded. \u201cLet\u2019s do it!\u201d Together, they grabbed some small crystals and threw them toward Grix. The bright colors flashed and sparkled. \n\nGrix and his gang were distracted, staring at the flying crystals. \u201cWhat is happening?\u201d Grix shouted, confused.\n\n\u201cThis way!\u201d Qel said, grabbing Sam's hand. They raced down the glowing path, heartbeats racing with excitement and fear. \n\n\u201cDo you think we can find the Light Crystal?\u201d Sam asked, feeling brave. \n\n\u201cYes! With friendship, we can do anything!\u201d Qel replied, his voice filled with hope.\n\nThey continued running, ready to face whatever challenges lay ahead. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cSam, are you ready?\u201d Qel asked as they neared the shining light.\n\n\u201cI am!\u201d Sam replied, filled with determination. \n\nTogether, they stepped into the light, ready for the next adventure.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Sam and Qel see inside the Crystal Cave?","options":["Dark shadows","Colorful crystals","Waterfalls","Aliens"],"correct_answer":"Colorful crystals"},{"question":"What do Sam and Qel use to distract Grix?","options":["Rocks","Food","Crystals","Light"],"correct_answer":"Crystals"},{"question":"What feeling does Sam have when he sees Grix?","options":["Excitement","Fear","Happiness","Boredom"],"correct_answer":"Fear"},{"question":"What does Qel tell Sam about friendship?","options":["It is not important.","It can help them.","It is boring.","It is scary."],"correct_answer":"It can help them."},{"question":"What do Sam and Qel try to find in the cave?","options":["Light Crystal","Treasure","Another alien","A map"],"correct_answer":"Light Crystal"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_308_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_308_ch4_img1.png","plot_308_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":398,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
