   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_308_7_10","title":"Galactic Pen Pals","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Sam and Qel stepped into the Crystal Cave. It was dark and cool inside. The walls sparkled like stars. Sam felt a shiver of excitement. \"Are you ready, Qel?\" he asked.\n\n\"Ready! Let's find the Light Crystal!\" Qel replied, wiggling his colorful antennae. They moved further into the cave, their hearts racing.\n\nSuddenly, a loud voice echoed. \"Stop right there!\" It was Grix and his group of bullies. They blocked the path, looking mean and ready to fight. Sam felt a lump in his throat. He wanted to run away!\n\n\"Don't be scared, Sam,\" Qel whispered. \"We can outsmart them!\"\n\nSam took a deep breath. \"Okay, let's do this!\" He looked around and saw a narrow tunnel to their left. \"This way!\" he shouted. They dashed into the tunnel just as Grix lunged forward.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe tunnel was tight and twisty. Sam and Qel squeezed through, giggling nervously. \"I hope we lose them!\" Sam said, trying to be brave.\n\nFinally, they came to a large room filled with glowing crystals. \"Look at all the colors!\" Qel exclaimed. \"But where is the Light Crystal?\" \n\nJust then, they spotted it in the center of the room. It pulsed with a warm, golden light. \"There it is!\" Sam shouted, pointing. \n\nAs they approached the crystal, Grix and his friends appeared at the entrance. \"You won't get the Light Crystal!\" Grix yelled.\n\n\"Think fast, Sam!\" Qel urged. Sam grabbed a small crystal and tossed it to the floor. It shattered into a million sparkles!\n\nGrix and the bullies were distracted. They stumbled back, their eyes wide. \"What happened?\" Grix blurted.\n\n\"This way!\" Sam shouted, and they rushed to the Light Crystal. Together, they lifted it high. The warm light surrounded them. Sam felt brave and free. \n\n\"We did it, Qel!\" Sam cheered. They had saved the crystal. Grix and the bullies were no longer a threat. \n\nWith the Light Crystal in hand, Sam and Qel prepared to leave the cave. \"Let\u2019s bring it home!\" Sam said, smiling. He felt proud. Maybe he wasn\u2019t so shy after all.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAs they left the cave, a soft light filled the entrance. \"Onward to adventure!\" Qel laughed. Sam grinned back. He knew this was just the beginning.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Sam and Qel find in the cave?","options":["A treasure chest","The Light Crystal","A spaceship","A giant monster"],"correct_answer":"The Light Crystal"},{"question":"Who tries to stop Sam and Qel?","options":["Their friends","Grix and his bullies","Qel's family","Space aliens"],"correct_answer":"Grix and his bullies"},{"question":"What does Sam throw to distract Grix?","options":["A rock","A crystal","A toy","A letter"],"correct_answer":"A crystal"},{"question":"How does Sam feel at the end of the chapter?","options":["Sad","Scared","Brave","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Brave"},{"question":"What is the main lesson in this chapter?","options":["It's okay to be shy","Friends can help us be brave","Caves are scary","Always run from bullies"],"correct_answer":"Friends can help us be brave"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_308_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_308_ch5_img1.png","plot_308_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":374,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
