     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"mysterious","1":"courage","2":"bravery","3":"bully","4":"determination","image_prompts":["A colorful, vibrant room filled with scattered papers and glowing crystals. Sam, an eleven-year-old boy with tousled hair and wide eyes, sits cross-legged on the floor, deep in thought, with his communicator glowing beside him. The walls are adorned with posters of stars and space, giving a sense of imagination and creativity.","Sam stands outside in front of a playground, confronting Grix, a tall, muscular bully with a sinister smile. Sam looks determined, fists clenched, while Grix\u2019s gang looms behind him, smirking. The younger kid, Tommy, watches in awe from the swings, a mix of fear and hope in his eyes. The setting sun casts long shadows, heightening the tension of the moment."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A vibrant landscape of Vexalon filled with iridescent flora. The scene captures the enchanting colors of the plants, juxtaposed with Sam and Qel as they hover near the entrance of the Great Glimmering Cave. The atmosphere is filled with wonder and a hint of danger, with sunlight filtering through the colorful foliage.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_308_ch5_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 14:04:50"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing An intense moment in the vast crystal chamber as Sam stands defiantly before Grix, who is lunging for the Light Crystal. The room is illuminated by the crystals radiant glow, casting dramatic shadows. Sams expression is one of determination, while Grixs face reflects surprise and anger, creating a tense atmosphere filled with anticipation.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_308_ch5_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 14:04:50"}}}
