   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_309_7_10","title":"The Cosmic Racing League","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"In the year 3023, the stars twinkled over Planet Zarnok. This was no ordinary planet. It had swirling pink clouds and sparkling purple mountains. Every year, the Cosmic Racing League held a thrilling race here. Kids from all over the galaxy came to watch.\n\n\u201cAre you ready, Alex?\u201d called Mira, her glasses flashing with lights. She was busy adjusting the tools on her spaceship.\n\n\u201cReady as a comet!\u201d Alex grinned. He adjusted his racing helmet, feeling the excitement buzz in his chest. Today was the day he would show everyone what he could do.\n\n\u201cDon\u2019t forget what Captain Jax taught you!\u201d Mira said, fixing a patch on his racing suit. \u201cFocus on the track and dodge those asteroids!\u201d\n\n\u201cI know! I can do this!\u201d Alex said, determination filling his voice.\n\nSuddenly, a loud roar echoed from the crowd. Alex turned to see his biggest rival, Rex Vortex, leaning against his shiny red ship. \u201cLook who thinks he can race!\u201d Rex sneered. He had a mean smile and a helmet with spikes. Alex felt a flutter of nerves, but he stood tall.\n\n\u201cThat\u2019s right! I\u2019m going to win!\u201d Alex shouted back.\n\n\u201cNot if I can help it!\u201d Rex shot back, crossing his arms. The crowd buzzed with excitement.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe announcer\u2019s voice boomed, \u201cWelcome to the Cosmic Racing League! Prepare for the most thrilling race of the year!\u201d The crowd cheered as colorful banners waved. Alex\u2019s heart raced with the crowd.\n\n\u201cHere we go!\u201d Mira said, giving Alex a thumbs-up as he climbed into his ship. It was small and blue, with a star-shaped tail. Alex had worked hard on it, and he was proud.\n\nAs the race countdown began, Alex took a deep breath. \u201cI can do this,\u201d he whispered to himself. \u201cI have to do this.\u201d\n\nThree\u2026Two\u2026One\u2026Go! The ships zoomed off the starting line. Alex felt the wind rush past him. He focused on the track ahead. Asteroids floated like giant rocks, and he had to dodge them fast. \n\nSuddenly, Alex saw something strange. Rex\u2019s ship flashed with a bright light. \u201cWhat\u2019s that?\u201d he wondered. A feeling of unease crept into his mind. Was Rex cheating? He needed to find out.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cAlex, watch out!\u201d Mira shouted through the comms. Alex quickly swerved left, just in time to avoid a big asteroid. \u201cStay sharp and keep your eyes on the prize!\u201d \n\n\u201cI will!\u201d Alex promised, determination surging through him. He raced forward, ready to face any challenge that came his way. But he couldn\u2019t shake the feeling that Rex was up to something.\n\nThe race was just beginning, and Alex had a long way to go. Could he really become a champion?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Alex dream of becoming?","options":["A pilot","A chef","A champion space racer","A scientist"],"correct_answer":"A champion space racer"},{"question":"Who is Alex's biggest rival?","options":["Captain Jax","Mira","Rex Vortex","His dad"],"correct_answer":"Rex Vortex"},{"question":"What does Mira do for Alex?","options":["She races for him","She designs his racing gear","She builds his spaceship","She is his enemy"],"correct_answer":"She designs his racing gear"},{"question":"What strange thing does Alex notice during the race?","options":["A big asteroid","Rex's ship flashing a bright light","His helmet is broken","Mira is missing"],"correct_answer":"Rex's ship flashing a bright light"},{"question":"How does Alex feel as he races?","options":["Nervous","Excited","Angry","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Excited"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_309_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_309_ch1_img1.png","plot_309_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":455,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
