   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_309_7_10","title":"The Cosmic Racing League","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Alex stood at the edge of the racetrack on Planet Zarnok. The colors of the crowd swirled around him, bright and lively. People waved banners and cheered for their favorite racers. Alex felt excitement buzzing in the air.\n\n\u201cWow, look at that ship!\u201d he said, pointing to a shiny blue racer zooming by. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nMira, his friend and tech genius, grinned. \u201cThat\u2019s Rex Vortex! He\u2019s the best racer here. But I think he has some tricks up his sleeve.\u201d\n\nAlex frowned. \u201cTricks? Like cheating?\u201d\n\nMira nodded. \u201cYeah! I heard he has a secret weapon. We need to watch him closely.\u201d\n\nJust then, Captain Jax appeared. He was Alex\u2019s mentor. Jax had gray hair and a friendly smile. \u201cAre you ready for your big race, Alex?\u201d he asked.\n\n\u201cI think so!\u201d Alex replied. \u201cBut what if Rex cheats?\u201d\n\n\u201cRemember, the best racers don\u2019t just drive fast. They race smart,\u201d Jax said. \u201cFocus on your skills and don\u2019t let his tricks distract you.\u201d\n\nAs the crowd roared, Alex took a deep breath. He felt his heart thumping with excitement and worry. \u201cI\u2019ll do my best,\u201d he promised.\n\nThe announcer\u2019s voice echoed. \u201cRacers, to your ships!\u201d The call sent chills down Alex\u2019s spine. He raced to his ship, the Star Flyer. Its sleek design sparkled under the sun. Mira gave him a thumbs-up as he climbed inside.\n\nSuddenly, lights flashed on Rex\u2019s ship. It emitted a strange glow. \u201cWhat is that?\u201d Alex exclaimed, his eyes wide. Mira pulled out her tablet. \u201cI can track the energy levels!\u201d she said.\n\nJust then, a loud explosion echoed across the track. Rex\u2019s ship shook. \u201cUh-oh, did he just blow something up?\u201d Alex asked.\n\nMira looked worried. \u201cWe need to find out what\u2019s happening!\u201d They both stared at the chaotic scene unfolding. \u201cThis isn\u2019t just about racing anymore!\u201d Alex said, determination filling his voice. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d they shouted together. Alex took a deep breath and prepared for the biggest challenge of his life. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe countdown began. \u201cThree, two, one\u2026 Go!\u201d\n\nThe race was on!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What planet is the race taking place on?","options":["Earth","Mars","Zarnok","Venus"],"correct_answer":"Zarnok"},{"question":"Who is Alex's mentor?","options":["Rex Vortex","Captain Jax","Mira","The Announcer"],"correct_answer":"Captain Jax"},{"question":"What does Mira use to track energy levels?","options":["A tablet","A spaceship","A computer","A phone"],"correct_answer":"A tablet"},{"question":"What does Alex feel before the race begins?","options":["Excitement and worry","Boredom","Fear and sadness","Anger"],"correct_answer":"Excitement and worry"},{"question":"What does Captain Jax advise Alex to focus on?","options":["Winning fast","Cheating clever","Racing smart","Ignoring rivals"],"correct_answer":"Racing smart"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_309_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_309_ch2_img1.png","plot_309_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":353,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
