   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_309_7_10","title":"The Cosmic Racing League","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"The sun was rising over Planet Zarnok, casting golden rays across the colorful racing track. Alex stood at the starting line, his heart racing faster than a shooting star. \u201cThis is it, Alex! Your big chance!\u201d Mira cheered, jumping up and down. Captain Jax adjusted his cap and nodded with a grin. \u201cJust remember what I taught you. Focus on the race, not the noise.\u201d\n\nAs the crowd erupted in cheers, Alex glanced at his rival, Rex. He was leaning against his sleek, black ship, a sneer on his face. \u201cYou think you can win, Alex? You don\u2019t stand a chance!\u201d Rex laughed, and his gang of friends joined in. Alex felt a spark of determination. \u201cWe\u2019ll see about that!\u201d\n\nThe countdown began. \u201cThree\u2026 two\u2026 one\u2026 go!\u201d The engines roared to life, and Alex shot off the line, zooming into the dazzling cosmos. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] \n\nAsteroids and colorful space debris whizzed by. Alex had to dodge left and right, his hands gripping the controls tightly. \u201cYou got this, Alex!\u201d Mira shouted through the comms. \u201cJust stay steady!\u201d\n\nBut as they raced, Alex noticed something strange. Rex\u2019s ship was swerving oddly. \u201cWhat\u2019s he doing?\u201d Alex wondered aloud. Suddenly, an explosion of sparks erupted from Rex\u2019s ship! His engine was overheating! \n\nWith a burst of speed, Alex zoomed past Rex, but then he heard a voice crackle in his ear. \u201cAlex! Look out for the trap!\u201d Captain Jax warned. Alex felt a chill. A trap? What was happening? He glanced back and saw Rex throwing something shiny from his ship. It glinted in the sunlight.\n\n\u201cWhat is that?\u201d Alex whispered, eyes wide. Mira\u2019s voice broke in. \u201cIt\u2019s a cheating device! He\u2019s trying to take you out!\u201d \n\nIn a flash, Alex made a quick decision. He had to warn the others. But just as he turned to call out, a blinding light flashed before him! He was caught in the path of Rex\u2019s trap! \n\n\u201cHold on, Alex!\u201d Mira yelled. Alex gripped the controls tighter as his ship spun wildly. He had to think fast. Was he going to crash, or could he outsmart Rex? \n\nHis heart raced as he remembered Captain Jax\u2019s lessons. \u201cUse your surroundings!\u201d he shouted. With a twist of the steering wheel, Alex aimed his ship toward a nearby asteroid field. \n\n\u201cGet ready!\u201d he called to Mira. \u201cWe\u2019re going to dodge and weave!\u201d \n\nThe ship darted around the asteroids, and Alex could feel the thrill of danger. Would he escape Rex\u2019s trap? The tension was high, and the finish line was getting closer. \n\nWhat would Alex decide next? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cStay with me, Alex!\u201d Mira urged. \n\n\u201cI'm trying!\u201d he shouted, determination filling his voice. \n\nCould he outmaneuver Rex before it was too late?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Alex discover about Rex during the race?","options":["Rex is sick","Rex is cheating","Rex is helping him","Rex won the race"],"correct_answer":"Rex is cheating"},{"question":"What do Alex and Mira see Rex throwing from his ship?","options":["A map","A shiny object","A water bottle","A trophy"],"correct_answer":"A shiny object"},{"question":"What does Captain Jax tell Alex to use to escape danger?","options":["His speed","His friends","His surroundings","His ship"],"correct_answer":"His surroundings"},{"question":"How does Alex react when Rex's ship has an explosion?","options":["He laughs","He feels scared","He speeds up","He helps Rex"],"correct_answer":"He speeds up"},{"question":"What is the setting of this chapter?","options":["Planet Earth","Planet Zarnok","Planet Mars","Planet Venus"],"correct_answer":"Planet Zarnok"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_309_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_309_ch3_img1.png","plot_309_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":465,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
