   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_309_7_10","title":"The Cosmic Racing League","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Chapter 4: The Racing Challenge\n\nThe crowd on Planet Zarnok was buzzing with excitement. Bright lights flashed everywhere. Colorful banners waved in the air. Alex tightened his grip on the control panel of his spaceship, the \"Star Blazer.\" \n\n\u201cReady for the next race, Alex?\u201d Captain Jax asked, his voice steady.\n\n\u201cReady as I\u2019ll ever be!\u201d Alex replied, his heart pounding.\n\nSuddenly, Mira appeared, her hands full of tools. \u201cI made some adjustments to your gear,\u201d she said, grinning. \u201cYou\u2019ll be faster than ever!\u201d\n\n\u201cThanks, Mira! You\u2019re the best!\u201d Alex beamed. He felt hopeful. Maybe this was his chance to beat Rex.\n\nAs they prepped for the race, Alex spotted Rex across the track. Rex sneered and adjusted a strange device on his wrist. \u201cYou think you can win, Alex? Dream on!\u201d Rex shouted.\n\nAlex frowned. \u201cI won\u2019t let you cheat this time, Rex!\u201d \n\nThe announcer\u2019s voice boomed over the loudspeakers. \u201cRacers, to your ships! The race is about to begin!\u201d\n\nThe countdown started. 3\u2026 2\u2026 1\u2026 Go! With a blast, Alex shot forward, the cosmos swirling around him. He focused hard, dodging asteroids and jumping over space debris.\n\nJust then, he saw Rex zoom ahead, using his wrist device. A bright bolt of light shot from it, aiming right at Alex! \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAlex swerved left, narrowly avoiding the blast. \u201cNo way am I letting you win like this, Rex!\u201d he shouted.\n\nCaptain Jax\u2019s voice echoed in Alex\u2019s earpiece. \u201cStay calm, Alex! Use your skills! Look for the shortcut through the asteroid field!\u201d\n\n\u201cGot it!\u201d Alex replied. He spotted a narrow gap between two large asteroids. It was risky, but he had to try. \n\nWith all his courage, Alex steered the Star Blazer into the gap. The ship shook as the asteroids whizzed by. \u201cWoah!\u201d he gasped, but he held steady. \n\nHe emerged on the other side, faster than ever! The cheers of the crowd filled his ears. \u201cI did it!\u201d he yelled, feeling hopeful.\n\nBut Rex was still close behind. \u201cNot for long, Alex!\u201d he shouted, activating the device again. \n\nThis time, the blast was even bigger. Alex had to think fast. He remembered Jax\u2019s advice. \u201cStay calm!\u201d\n\nHe flipped a switch in his ship. \u201cTime for a boost!\u201d he shouted, feeling a jolt of speed. Alex raced forward, determined to win.\n\nAs he approached the finish line, he glanced back and saw Rex fuming with frustration. \u201cYou can\u2019t outrun me forever!\u201d Rex yelled, but Alex was ready for him.\n\n\u201cI can and I will!\u201d Alex replied, crossing the finish line with a triumphant cheer. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cI did it! I won!\u201d he shouted, joy filling his heart. Captain Jax and Mira rushed to him, cheering loudly.\n\n\u201cWe knew you could do it, Alex!\u201d Mira exclaimed, jumping up and down.\n\nBut Alex\u2019s smile faded. Rex was sneaking away, his cheating device still buzzing. \u201cWe need to find out what he\u2019s up to for the final race,\u201d Alex said, his voice serious. \n\n\u201cWe will,\u201d Captain Jax said. \u201cTogether, we will stop Rex!\u201d","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Alex use to avoid Rex's cheating device?","options":["A boost","A shield","A shortcut","A weapon"],"correct_answer":"A boost"},{"question":"Who helped Alex prepare for the race?","options":["Captain Jax","Rex","The announcer","The crowd"],"correct_answer":"Captain Jax"},{"question":"What device did Rex use during the race?","options":["A control panel","A cheating device","A navigation tool","A speed booster"],"correct_answer":"A cheating device"},{"question":"What did Alex feel when he crossed the finish line?","options":["Fear","Joy","Sadness","Anger"],"correct_answer":"Joy"},{"question":"What must Alex do before the final race?","options":["Take a break","Expose Rex's cheating","Change his spaceship","Ask for help"],"correct_answer":"Expose Rex's cheating"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_309_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_309_ch4_img1.png","plot_309_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":509,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
