   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_309_7_10","title":"The Cosmic Racing League","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Alex stared at the dazzling lights of Planet Zarnok. The sky was a swirl of purple and orange. He could hear the cheers of the crowd as they filled the stands. His heart raced with excitement. \n\n\u201cToday\u2019s the day, Alex!\u201d Captain Jax said. \u201cYou\u2019ve got to be sharp and fast!\u201d \n\n\u201cI\u2019m ready, Captain!\u201d Alex replied, tightening his helmet. Mira adjusted his racing gear, adding a shiny new badge. \u201cThis will make you look like a champion!\u201d she giggled. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they walked to the starting line, Rex appeared with a sly grin. \u201cYou think you can win without cheating this time?\u201d he taunted. Alex clenched his fists. He had to prove Rex was a cheat, once and for all. \n\n\u201cJust wait and see, Rex,\u201d Alex said confidently. \u201cI\u2019ll win fair and square!\u201d \n\nThe countdown began. Three, two, one... BOOM! The race started! Alex shot forward, dodging asteroids and colorful nebulae. His heart pounded with every turn. \n\nSuddenly, a flash caught his eye. Rex was using a strange device! \u201cMira, you won't believe it! I think Rex is cheating again!\u201d Alex shouted over the roar of the engines. \n\n\u201cI\u2019ll hack into the race monitors!\u201d Mira replied, typing furiously on her portable screen. \u201cI\u2019ll expose him!\u201d \n\nAlex focused on the track. He zoomed past other racers, feeling the wind rush by. But Rex was close, tailing him like a shadow. \n\n\u201cNot today!\u201d Alex said to himself. He swerved left, then right, and sped ahead. Just as he turned a corner, he saw Rex\u2019s device spark and fizzle. \u201cYes! It\u2019s breaking!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nRex's eyes widened. \u201cNo! This can\u2019t be happening!\u201d He slammed his controls, but it was too late. Alex raced across the finish line first, the crowd cheering wildly. \n\n\u201cI did it!\u201d Alex shouted, pumping his fist in victory. Mira rushed up, her face glowing with pride. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s show everyone that Rex cheated!\u201d she said, pulling up the video feed. The crowd gasped as they watched Rex\u2019s device malfunction. \n\n\u201cThanks for believing in me, Mira!\u201d Alex smiled. \u201cTogether, we made it happen!\u201d \n\n\u201cAlways!\u201d Mira grinned. \n\nAs they celebrated, Captain Jax appeared, clapping with a proud smile. \u201cYou\u2019ve not only raced well, but you\u2019ve shown everyone that winning isn\u2019t just about speed. It\u2019s about being true to yourself.\u201d \n\nAlex nodded, feeling a warmth in his heart. He learned that honesty and friendship matter more than trophies. \n\n\u201cNow, onto the championship!\u201d he declared, ready for the next adventure.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What planet does Alex race on in this chapter?","options":["Planet Zarnok","Planet Mars","Planet Earth","Planet Jupiter"],"correct_answer":"Planet Zarnok"},{"question":"Who helps Alex expose Rex's cheating?","options":["Captain Jax","Mira","Rex","The crowd"],"correct_answer":"Mira"},{"question":"What happens to Rex's cheating device during the race?","options":["It works perfectly","It turns invisible","It breaks","It helps him win"],"correct_answer":"It breaks"},{"question":"What lesson does Alex learn in this chapter?","options":["Winning is everything","Cheating is fun","Honesty and friendship matter","Racing is easy"],"correct_answer":"Honesty and friendship matter"},{"question":"How does Alex feel when he crosses the finish line?","options":["Sad","Angry","Excited","Scared"],"correct_answer":"Excited"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_309_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_309_ch5_img1.png","plot_309_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":421,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
