   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_309_11_14","title":"The Cosmic Racing League","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"As the bright neon lights of the training facility flickered overhead, Alex adjusted the straps of his racing simulator helmet. He could hear the hum of excited voices from other trainees, but his focus was zeroed in on the virtual racetrack ahead. This simulator, a state-of-the-art model designed by Mira, felt more real than anything he had ever experienced. The vivid colors of the asteroid belt racing past him made his heart race in anticipation. \n\n\u201cAre you ready, champ?\u201d Captain Jax asked, a grin spreading across his weathered face. The retired champion\u2019s presence was as steady as the stars in the night sky. \n\n\u201cYou bet!\u201d Alex exclaimed, gripping the control sticks tightly. \n\n\u201cRemember, speed is nothing without control,\u201d Jax advised, his voice steady with authority. \u201cThis is where you learn to navigate not just the track, but your rivals too.\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs the simulation began, Alex maneuvered through the asteroid fields with a mix of excitement and fear. The thrill surged through him as he dodged a particularly large asteroid, the simulator shaking as he barely avoided a collision. But as he pushed the speed limits, a familiar name echoed in his mind\u2014Dante. The memory of the sneer on Dante's face from their last encounter fueled Alex's determination. This wasn't just about racing; it was about proving himself.\n\nJust then, the simulator\u2019s screen flickered, and a garbled message appeared: \u201cDante schematics 7B.\u201d Alex frowned, his heart pounding. What did that mean? Was this a glitch, or was Dante hiding something more sinister? \n\n\u201cDid you see that?\u201d he shouted to Jax, who was watching intently. \n\n\u201cSee what?\u201d Jax asked, raising an eyebrow.\n\n\u201cThat message! It\u2019s something about schematics! I think\u2014\u201d \n\nBefore he could finish, the lights in the facility dimmed, and the simulation shut down. A wave of panic washed over Alex. \u201cWhat just happened?\u201d\n\nJax moved quickly to the control panel, his expression serious. \u201cStay calm. Let's find out.\u201d \n\nAs they worked to restore the system, Mira rushed in, her eyes wide with concern. \u201cI just received a warning from the central control! There\u2019s been a security breach! We might be in danger!\u201d \n\nAlex\u2019s heart raced. This was more than just a glitch; something was wrong. \u201cDante\u2026 he\u2019s up to something!\u201d \n\n\u201cWe need to investigate,\u201d Jax declared, his tone setting a serious mood. \u201cIf he\u2019s cheating, we need proof. But it won\u2019t be easy; he\u2019ll have eyes everywhere. Are you ready to take the risk?\u201d\n\nAlex nodded, determination washing over him. \u201cI won\u2019t let him win, not like this.\u201d But just as he spoke, a loud crash echoed from above, followed by the sound of metal scraping against metal. The lights flickered again, and Alex's stomach dropped. \n\n\u201cGo!\u201d Mira shouted, pulling him towards the exit. \u201cWe need to get out before\u2014\u201d\n\nSuddenly, the doors slammed shut, trapping them inside. Alex\u2019s mind raced. They had to escape, and they had to expose Dante before it was too late. \n\n\u201cAlex, what do we do?!\u201d Mira cried, her voice a mix of fear and urgency. \n\nHe took a deep breath, his mind racing. \u201cWe find a way out, and we uncover Dante's scheme. It\u2019s time to fight back.\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nJust as they worked towards the emergency exit, Alex felt a strange energy coursing through him, a sense of purpose igniting his spirit. They were up against more than just a rival; the future of racing\u2014and maybe even their safety\u2014depended on them. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d he shouted, determination fueling his every step as they plunged into the unknown.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Alex discover during his training session?","options":["A glitch in the simulator","A new racing technique","A secret message about Dante","A hidden talent for racing"],"correct_answer":"A secret message about Dante"},{"question":"What happens to the training facility during the chapter?","options":["It experiences a power outage","It is attacked by space pirates","It gets hit by an asteroid","It has a security breach"],"correct_answer":"It has a security breach"},{"question":"How does Mira react when she learns about the security breach?","options":["She stays calm","She panics and runs away","She rushes in with concern","She laughs it off"],"correct_answer":"She rushes in with concern"},{"question":"What is Captain Jax's advice to Alex during training?","options":["Speed is everything","Focus on your rivals","Speed is nothing without control","Practice makes perfect"],"correct_answer":"Speed is nothing without control"},{"question":"What decision does Alex make at the end of the chapter?","options":["To give up racing","To expose Dante's cheating","To leave the facility","To train harder"],"correct_answer":"To expose Dante's cheating"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_309_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_309_ch3_img1.png","plot_309_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":601,"reading_level":"Builder"}
