   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_309_11_14","title":"The Cosmic Racing League","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"As the morning sun peeked over the shimmering surface of the Celestia Training Facility, Alex felt the familiar thrill of anticipation buzzing in his veins. Today was the day he and Mira would unveil their secret weapon\u2014a new racing suit designed specifically for him. Captain Jax had been unusually quiet, a storm brewing behind his calm demeanor. \n\n\u201cAre you ready for this, Alex?\u201d Mira asked, her eyes sparkling with excitement as she adjusted the holographic display on her wrist. \u201cThis suit is going to take your racing to a whole new level!\u201d\n\n\u201cReady as I\u2019ll ever be,\u201d Alex replied, although a sliver of doubt twisted in his stomach. He had faced countless challenges already, but this felt different. The final race loomed closer, and so did the threat posed by Dante.\n\nMira led him to the testing chamber\u2014a sleek, high-tech room filled with blinking lights and the aroma of fresh plasma. The walls were adorned with images of legendary racers, heroes of the Cosmic Racing League. It felt like stepping into a shrine of dreams.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cHere we go! Activate the suit!\u201d she commanded, and as the suit unfolded, Alex felt a rush of adrenaline. It shimmered with a metallic blue finish, embedded with circuits that glowed like stars against the night sky. \n\n\u201cThis is not just for show,\u201d Mira said, her voice steady. \u201cThe suit will enhance your reaction time and give you a boost in speed. Plus, if we add the stealth mode you designed, you\u2019ll be able to sneak past those cheaters.\u201d\n\nAlex grinned. \u201cLet\u2019s see what this baby can do!\u201d\n\nThey began the trial run, and as Alex zipped through the course, the suit responded to his every move. He glided through sharp turns and soared over ramps, the world around him a blur. But with each twist and turn, a shadow loomed at the back of his mind \u2013 Dante.\n\nSuddenly, the simulation sputtered. Alarms blared. Alex\u2019s heart raced, not from the thrill of racing, but from the abrupt chaos. \u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d he shouted.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know! The system is crashing,\u201d Mira replied, her fingers flying over the control panel. \u201cIt\u2019s like someone is hacking into the system!\u201d\n\nBefore Alex could respond, the lights flickered and then went dark. Panic surged through him. \u201cWe need to get out!\u201d he yelled, but the door was locked. \u201cMira!\u201d\n\n\u201cI\u2019m working on it!\u201d she shouted back, her voice strained. \n\nThen, just like that, the lights returned, and the door slid open. But as they stepped out, Alex\u2019s heart dropped. There, leaning against the wall, was Dante, a smirk plastered across his face, flanked by two hulking friends. \n\n\u201cDid you think I wouldn\u2019t find out?\u201d Dante taunted, his voice dripping with malice. \u201cYou think you can beat me without my help?\u201d The underlying threat in his words sent chills down Alex\u2019s spine.\n\n\u201cYou'll pay for this,\u201d Alex said, stepping forward defiantly. \n\nDante chuckled, a dark sound echoing against the steel walls. \u201cOh, I\u2019m not the one you need to worry about. The league doesn\u2019t care about cheaters; they care about winners.\u201d\n\nIn that moment, Alex realized he had to be braver than ever before. He had to protect not only his dreams but also the integrity of the league. \u201cI\u2019ll expose you, Dante,\u201d he declared. \n\nDante\u2019s laughter faded as he swaggered away, leaving a lingering sense of dread. But Alex knew he wouldn\u2019t let fear stop him. With Mira and Jax by his side, he had a chance to fight back.\n\nAs they returned to their training schedule, Alex felt a new fire igniting within him. He wasn\u2019t just racing for himself anymore; he was racing for everyone who believed in fairness and honor. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s make a plan,\u201d he said, determination etched in his voice. \u201cWe won\u2019t let Dante win.\u201d","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the main function of the new racing suit?","options":["To look cool","To enhance Alex's speed and reaction time","To make Alex invisible","To help Alex cheat"],"correct_answer":"To enhance Alex's speed and reaction time"},{"question":"Who is Alex's main rival?","options":["Captain Jax","Mira","Dante","The League"],"correct_answer":"Dante"},{"question":"What unexpected event occurs during the training session?","options":["The suit breaks","The lights go out","An explosion happens","A monster appears"],"correct_answer":"The lights go out"},{"question":"How does Alex feel about confronting Dante?","options":["Excited","Nervous","Indifferent","Fearful"],"correct_answer":"Nervous"},{"question":"What does Alex vow to do at the end of the chapter?","options":["To quit racing","To expose Dante's cheating","To find a new mentor","To redesign the suit"],"correct_answer":"To expose Dante's cheating"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_309_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_309_ch5_img1.png","plot_309_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":652,"reading_level":"Builder"}
