     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"meteor","1":"gift","2":"powers","3":"spirit","4":"adventure","image_prompts":["A night sky filled with bright, twinkling stars over a grassy hill where Kira and Leo are sitting. Kira has long, dark hair and is wearing a colorful t-shirt. Leo, with short, curly hair, is smiling widely. The scene is peaceful, with a hint of magic in the air.","A close-up of Kira's surprised face as a meteor crashes nearby, with sparks flying around. In the background, the bright meteor is streaking across the sky. Kira's expression reflects excitement and fear, while Leo looks astonished, showcasing their adventure's intensity."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A sweeping view of the village of Celestia as dusk falls, with rooftops glowing softly in the twilight. Kira stands on the hill overlooking the village, her hair blowing in the wind, her expression thoughtful and full of wonder as she gazes at the first stars appearing in the sky.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_310_ch1_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 13:59:47"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A dramatic moment where Kira is enveloped in a glowing cocoon of starlight as she feels her powers awakening. Celestial reflections dance in her wide eyes, filled with awe and fear, as a radiant figure, Celestia, looms before her, surrounded by a backdrop of swirling stars and cosmic energy.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_310_ch1_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 13:59:47"}}}
