   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_310_7_10","title":"The Stars That Bind Us","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Kira stared at the night sky from her small village. The stars twinkled like tiny diamonds scattered on a dark blue blanket. She loved looking at them. Each night, she would whisper her dreams to the stars.\n\n\"Do you think they can hear me?\" Kira asked her best friend, Leo. He was sitting beside her on the grassy hill.\n\n\"Of course!\" Leo replied, grinning. \"Maybe they even know your name!\"\n\nJust then, a bright flash lit up the sky. Kira and Leo gasped. A meteor shower was coming! Kira felt a strange tingle in her fingers. The air around them shimmered with energy.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nKira watched as a big meteor streaked across the sky. It was glowing and bright, like nothing she had ever seen before. Suddenly, a soft voice broke through the whispers of the night.\n\n\"Kira,\" it said, \"I am Celestia, the star spirit.\"\n\nKira looked around in surprise. \"Who said that?\" she asked, her heart racing.\n\n\"It was me!\" The voice giggled. \"You can hear me because of the meteors. You have a special gift!\"\n\nKira felt a mix of excitement and fear. \"A gift? What does that mean?\"\n\n\"It means you can talk to the stars,\" Celestia explained. \"But you must learn to control your powers. Something big is coming, and you need to stop it!\"\n\nLeo's eyes widened. \"What do you mean? What\u2019s coming?\"\n\n\"The stars are in danger,\" Celestia said, her voice serious. \"You must help them, Kira!\"\n\nKira's heart pounded. What kind of danger? She glanced at Leo, who looked just as worried. \"But how? I don\u2019t know what to do.\"\n\n\"You must trust yourself,\" Celestia encouraged. \"And you must practice. I will guide you!\"\n\nKira took a deep breath. \"Okay! I\u2019m ready!\"\n\nBut inside, she felt a storm of doubts. What if she failed? Just then, a meteor crashed nearby, sending sparks flying. Kira jumped back, nearly tumbling over. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cWhoa!\u201d Leo exclaimed. \u201cThat was close!\u201d\n\nKira swallowed hard. \"This is just the beginning, isn\u2019t it?\"\n\nCelestia\u2019s laughter twinkled like the stars. \"Yes, but together, you can do it!\"\n\nKira stood tall and nodded. It was time for an adventure. She could feel the stars calling her, and she was ready to answer.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Kira love to do at night?","options":["Play games","Talk to the stars","Read books","Fly a kite"],"correct_answer":"Talk to the stars"},{"question":"What happens during the meteor shower?","options":["It rains","Kira discovers her powers","The village lights go out","A party starts"],"correct_answer":"Kira discovers her powers"},{"question":"Who does Kira meet during the meteor shower?","options":["A dragon","Celestia the star spirit","A talking cat","An alien"],"correct_answer":"Celestia the star spirit"},{"question":"What does Celestia want Kira to do?","options":["Go to sleep","Find treasure","Learn to control her powers","Make a wish"],"correct_answer":"Learn to control her powers"},{"question":"How does Kira feel about her new powers?","options":["Excited and scared","Bored","Angry","Confused but happy"],"correct_answer":"Excited and scared"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_310_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_310_ch1_img1.png","plot_310_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":378,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
