   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_310_7_10","title":"The Stars That Bind Us","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Kira woke up with the sun shining through her window. The mysterious words from Celestia floated in her mind. \u201cYou must learn to control your powers.\u201d\n\nKira quickly got out of bed. She slipped on her favorite blue sneakers. \u201cI can do this!\u201d she said to herself. She raced outside, ready to tell Leo.\n\n\u201cHey, Kira!\u201d Leo waved from the big oak tree. He climbed down with a big smile. \u201cWhat\u2019s up?\u201d\n\n\u201cI can hear Celestia! She says I have powers!\u201d Kira said, her eyes sparkling.\n\n\u201cPowers? Like superhero powers?\u201d Leo asked, his curiosity growing.\n\n\u201cYes! But I have to learn how to use them. There\u2019s danger coming!\u201d Kira explained.\n\n\u201cDanger? What kind of danger?\u201d Leo\u2019s voice dropped to a whisper.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know yet, but it\u2019s from the stars!\u201d Kira replied, feeling a mix of excitement and fear.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find out!\u201d Leo said. \u201cYou can show me how to communicate with the stars!\u201d\n\nKira nodded, feeling thankful to have Leo by her side. They walked to the grassy hill outside the village. The sky was clear, with twinkling stars waiting for nightfall.\n\nAs they sat down, Kira closed her eyes. \u201cCelestia, can you hear me?\u201d she called out softly.\n\nA gentle breeze rustled the leaves. Suddenly, a warm glow appeared above them. It sparkled like stardust. Kira gasped. \u201cLeo, look!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cWow! What is that?\u201d Leo exclaimed, his mouth wide open.\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s Celestia! I think she\u2019s trying to talk to us!\u201d Kira said, feeling a thrill of hope.\n\nThe glow brightened, and Celestia's voice filled the air. \u201cKira, you must learn quickly. The celestial event is near. It will be powerful and chaotic.\u201d\n\nKira\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWhat do I need to do?\u201d she asked, feeling nervous.\n\n\u201cFocus! You must connect with the stars. They hold the key to your powers,\u201d Celestia said, her tone serious.\n\nKira took a deep breath. She raised her hands toward the stars. \u201cI\u2019ll try!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a flash of light burst from her fingertips! Kira jumped back, startled. \u201cWhat was that?!\u201d\n\nLeo laughed, but then his face grew serious. \u201cKira, are you okay?\u201d\n\n\u201cI think so. But what if I can\u2019t control this?\u201d Kira said, worry creeping into her voice.\n\nJust then, the sky darkened. A rumble echoed through the air. Kira and Leo looked at each other, eyes wide. \u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d they whispered.\n\n\u201cWe need to hurry! Celestia said we have to prepare!\u201d Leo shouted.\n\nKira nodded, determination filling her heart. \u201cLet\u2019s do this together!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nBut just as they stood up, a shadow fell over the hill. Kira gasped. \u201cLeo, look!\u201d \n\nA giant, swirling cloud loomed in the sky, crackling with energy. \u201cThis is just the beginning!\u201d Kira realized.\n\nShe knew they had to act fast. Their adventure was only starting, and they had no time to waste.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What powers does Kira discover she has?","options":["She can fly","She can communicate with the stars","She can time travel","She can become invisible"],"correct_answer":"She can communicate with the stars"},{"question":"Who is Kira's best friend?","options":["Mia","Leo","Sam","Celestia"],"correct_answer":"Leo"},{"question":"What does Celestia warn Kira about?","options":["A party","A test","A celestial event","A storm"],"correct_answer":"A celestial event"},{"question":"How does Kira feel about her powers?","options":["Excited and scared","Bored","Happy","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited and scared"},{"question":"What appears in the sky at the end of the chapter?","options":["A rainbow","A giant cloud","A spaceship","A bird"],"correct_answer":"A giant cloud"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_310_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_310_ch2_img1.png","plot_310_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":480,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
