   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_310_7_10","title":"The Stars That Bind Us","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Kira and Leo stood on the edge of their village, gazing up at the night sky. The stars twinkled brightly, but something felt off. A dark cloud rolled in, blocking the stars' light. \n\n\u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d Leo asked, scratching his head. Kira felt a shiver run down her spine. \u201cI don\u2019t know, but Celestia said we need to figure out my powers quickly!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nKira closed her eyes and listened. \u201cCelestia, can you hear me?\u201d she whispered. The wind rustled through the trees, and suddenly, Kira heard Celestia\u2019s soft voice. \u201cKira, the stars are in danger. You must reach out to them.\u201d\n\nKira sighed, feeling the weight of the world on her shoulders. \u201cBut how? What if I can\u2019t control it?\u201d \n\n\u201cJust try!\u201d Leo encouraged. \u201cWe won\u2019t know until we do!\u201d \n\nTaking a deep breath, Kira lifted her arms. She focused on the twinkling stars. \u201cI can do this,\u201d she told herself. \u201cI must save them!\u201d\n\nAs she concentrated, a bright light surrounded her. \u201cFeel the energy!\u201d Celestia urged. Suddenly, the dark cloud crackled. \u201cKira! You\u2019re losing control!\u201d \n\nKira panicked. \u201cWhat do I do?\u201d \n\n\u201cCalm your mind! Focus on the brightest star!\u201d \n\nKira squinted at a glowing star. She imagined it shining down on her, warm and full of hope. \u201cI can do this!\u201d she shouted. \n\nJust then, the dark cloud swirled and a bolt of energy shot out. Kira gasped. \u201cIt\u2019s too strong!\u201d \n\nLeo jumped back, eyes wide. \u201cKira! Do something!\u201d\n\nKira closed her eyes tight, remembering Celestia\u2019s words. \u201cI can\u2019t let this happen!\u201d She reached for the star once more. \u201cHelp me!\u201d \n\nIn that moment, she felt a warm pulse. A beam of light shot from her hands, connecting her to the star. The cloud began to dissipate, but then, the sky trembled. \u201cKira, look out!\u201d Leo screamed.\n\nThe ground shook beneath them, and Kira opened her eyes to see the dark cloud forming again, larger this time. \u201cWe need to leave!\u201d Leo shouted. \n\nBut Kira couldn\u2019t move. She felt a connection to the stars like never before. \u201cNo! I won\u2019t let them down!\u201d \n\nWith a final burst of energy, she shouted, \u201cCelestia, I\u2019m ready!\u201d But just then, a strange shape appeared in the cloud. It was a shadowy figure, and it was coming toward them! \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cWhat is that?\u201d Leo trembled. \n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know!\u201d Kira whispered, heart racing. \u201cBut we have to stop it!\u201d\n\nKira's heart raced as she stood her ground. Would she face the figure and unlock her true power?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Kira and Leo see in the sky?","options":["A bright sun","Twinkling stars","A rainbow","A dark storm"],"correct_answer":"Twinkling stars"},{"question":"What does Kira try to do to control her powers?","options":["Close her eyes","Dance","Shout","Run away"],"correct_answer":"Close her eyes"},{"question":"What happens when Kira connects with the star?","options":["The stars disappear","The dark cloud dissolves","She loses her powers","A shadowy figure appears"],"correct_answer":"A shadowy figure appears"},{"question":"Who encourages Kira to try using her powers?","options":["Celestia","Her mom","Leo","A teacher"],"correct_answer":"Leo"},{"question":"What does Kira shout when she feels ready?","options":["I'm scared!","I need help!","Celestia, I'm ready!","Let's go!"],"correct_answer":"Celestia, I'm ready!"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_310_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_310_ch3_img1.png","plot_310_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":431,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
