   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_310_7_10","title":"The Stars That Bind Us","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Kira and Leo stood outside their favorite spot on the hill. The stars twinkled above them like diamonds in a dark velvet sky. \"Look,\" Kira said, pointing upwards. \"Can you see that big one? It feels different tonight.\"\n\nLeo squinted at the stars. \"Yeah! It looks like it's winking at us!\" he said, laughing.\n\nSuddenly, a dark cloud rolled in, blocking the light from the stars. Kira felt a chill run down her spine. \"What is that cloud doing here?\" she wondered aloud. \n\nJust then, a soft, glowing figure appeared next to them. It was Celestia, the star spirit. Her shining hair flowed like a comet. \"Kira, Leo,\" she said, her voice like music. \"The stars need your help!\"\n\nKira's heart raced. \"What do we need to do?\" \n\n\"We must gather the light that has been trapped by the dark cloud,\" Celestia explained. \"You can speak to the stars, Kira. They will guide you.\"\n\nKira took a deep breath. \"Okay, let's do it!\" she said boldly.\n\nAs they began to climb the hill, Kira closed her eyes. She reached out with her mind, listening to the stars. \"Shining Star, can you help us?\"\n\nA gentle voice filled her head. \"Follow the twinkling path, Kira. It will lead you to the light.\"\n\nKira opened her eyes and saw sparkling lights floating through the dark cloud. \"This way!\" she shouted, pointing. \n\nLeo cheered, \"You did it, Kira!\" \n\nThey raced toward the twinkling path. As they ran, Kira's heart filled with hope. Maybe they could save the stars after all!\n\nSuddenly, the dark cloud began to swirl around them. \"Stay close!\" Celestia warned. The cloud tried to push them back, but Kira held Leo's hand tightly. \"We can do this!\" she shouted, her voice strong and clear.\n\nTogether, they climbed higher and higher, facing the storm. Kira could feel the warmth of the stars shining down on her. She focused on the twinkling lights, guiding her through the darkness. \n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Leo exclaimed, pointing ahead. \u201cThere\u2019s a bright spot!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nKira's eyes widened as they reached the bright spot. It shimmered with colors of pink, blue, and gold. They had found the heart of the light!\n\nJust then, the dark cloud let out a rumble. \"We need to hurry!\" Celestia urged. \"The stars are counting on you!\"\n\nKira reached out toward the glowing heart. \"Everyone, hold on tight!\" she called. With one brave push, she gathered the light and sent it into the sky. \n\nThe dark cloud began to fade. The stars sparkled brightly again, filling the night with their glow. Kira felt a rush of joy. They had done it!\n\nBut just as she began to celebrate, a shadow loomed overhead. Kira looked up, a mix of excitement and fear. \"What now?\" she whispered.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Kira and Leo try to save in this chapter?","options":["The stars","The dark cloud","Their village","A comet"],"correct_answer":"The stars"},{"question":"Who guides Kira and Leo?","options":["A wise old man","Their teacher","Celestia","A talking animal"],"correct_answer":"Celestia"},{"question":"What happens when Kira gathers the light?","options":["The dark cloud fades","It starts to rain","They find a treasure","The stars disappear"],"correct_answer":"The dark cloud fades"},{"question":"What does Kira feel when she reaches out to the stars?","options":["Fear","Joy","Confusion","Anger"],"correct_answer":"Joy"},{"question":"What do Kira and Leo see at the end of the chapter?","options":["A new star","A shadow looming overhead","A rainbow","A spaceship"],"correct_answer":"A shadow looming overhead"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_310_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_310_ch4_img1.png","plot_310_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":465,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
