   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_310_7_10","title":"The Stars That Bind Us","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Kira and Leo stood in the cool night air. The dark cloud loomed above them, blocking the twinkling stars. Kira took a deep breath. \u201cI can feel Celestia\u2019s light. We need to push through this cloud!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s do it!\u201d Leo cheered, gripping her hand. They both looked up, determination in their eyes. The cloud swirled and flickered like a huge shadowy monster.\n\nKira closed her eyes and focused. \u201cCelestia, guide us!\u201d she whispered. Suddenly, a soft glow appeared. Kira felt warmth radiating from her heart. It was as if the stars had heard her call.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe glow expanded around them, illuminating the darkness. Kira opened her eyes, amazed. \u201cLook, Leo! It\u2019s working!\u201d\n\n\u201cI see it! We\u2019re making our own light!\u201d Leo shouted, his face beaming with excitement. With their hands raised, they pushed the light toward the dark cloud. \n\nBut the shadow grew bigger. \u201cWhat if it doesn\u2019t work?\u201d Leo asked, his voice trembling.\n\nKira felt a wave of doubt wash over her. \u201cWhat if it does? We can\u2019t stop now!\u201d She took a step forward, ready to face the darkness. \u201cCelestia, we believe in you!\u201d\n\nAs they focused, the light burst forth like a thousand shooting stars. The cloud shimmered and shook. With each pulse of light, Kira felt stronger. Suddenly, the shadow began to fade. \n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Leo pointed. \u201cIt\u2019s breaking apart!\u201d\n\nWith one final push, the cloud vanished, revealing the vast, starry sky. Kira gasped. Celestia appeared, dancing among the stars. \u201cYou did it, Kira! You found your strength!\u201d \n\n\u201cI couldn\u2019t have done it without Leo,\u201d Kira replied, smiling at her friend. \n\n\u201cFriends stick together!\u201d Leo grinned. They both laughed, their hearts filled with joy.\n\nKira looked up at the stars, feeling a deep connection. \u201cThe stars do bind us, Leo. They\u2019re our friends, too!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s keep exploring!\u201d Leo said, his eyes sparkling with wonder. \n\nAs they headed deeper into the night, Kira knew they were ready for whatever came next. Together, they would shine bright like the stars.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Kira and Leo first see when they look up?","options":["A bright sun","A dark cloud","A shooting star","A rainbow"],"correct_answer":"A dark cloud"},{"question":"What does Kira call to guide her?","options":["Her friends","The moon","Celestia","The sun"],"correct_answer":"Celestia"},{"question":"What happens to the dark cloud when Kira and Leo use their light?","options":["It gets bigger","It disappears","It rains","It turns to ice"],"correct_answer":"It disappears"},{"question":"How do Kira and Leo feel at the end of the chapter?","options":["Sad","Angry","Joyful","Scared"],"correct_answer":"Joyful"},{"question":"What do Kira and Leo plan to do next?","options":["Go home","Find more stars","Stop exploring","Avoid the night"],"correct_answer":"Find more stars"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_310_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_310_ch5_img1.png","plot_310_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":343,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
