   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"sci-fi_310_11_14","title":"The Stars That Bind Us","genre":"Sci-Fi","sub_genre":"Space Travel","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"The dawn light broke over Kira\u2019s village, spilling soft rays that danced across the rooftops. Kira sat on her favorite rock at the cliff's edge, her heart racing with thoughts of the night before. The stars had whispered to her, and now she felt an inexplicable pull towards the sky. Leo, her ever-curious friend, plopped down beside her, his messy hair tousled by the wind. \n\n\u201cWhat are you thinking about?\u201d he asked, peering at her with wide, inquisitive eyes.\n\nKira sighed. \u201cI\u2019m just... trying to understand what happened last night. Who is Celestia? And what does she want from me?\u201d\n\nLeo chuckled, breaking the tension. \u201cMaybe she just wants you to be the universe\u2019s superhero. You know, like in the comics!\u201d \n\nKira couldn\u2019t help but smile at that. But her smile faded as she recalled the urgency in Celestia\u2019s voice. \u201cBut what if I can\u2019t do it? What if I fail?\u201d\n\n\u201cHey, we\u2019re in this together, remember?\u201d Leo nudged her shoulder. \u201cWe\u2019ll figure it out. And besides, you can talk to stars now! That\u2019s pretty cool.\u201d\n\nJust then, a shimmering light flickered in the sky, and both kids looked up. Kira\u2019s breath caught in her throat as she saw a cluster of stars shift and align, forming a swirling pattern. It was mesmerizing, almost like they were alive. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s beautiful,\u201d Kira whispered, her worries momentarily forgotten. \n\nBut then, without warning, the swirling pattern turned chaotic, the stars blinking out one by one. Kira felt a pang in her chest, a sense of dread washing over her. \u201cLeo, something\u2019s wrong!\u201d\n\nAs if in response, a low rumble echoed from the sky. \u201cKira!\u201d Celestia\u2019s voice rang out in her mind, urgent and clear. \u201cYou must hurry! The stars are in danger, and so is your world!\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat does that mean?\u201d Kira gasped, feeling the weight of her responsibility settle like a heavy cloak around her shoulders. \n\n\u201cBefore the Cosmic Alignment, a force threatens to disrupt the balance. You must learn to control your powers and communicate with the stars before it\u2019s too late!\u201d The voice faded, leaving only an echo of urgency behind.\n\nLeo\u2019s eyes darted between Kira and the sky, panic flickering across his face. \u201cWhat do we do?\u201d\n\nKira took a deep breath, trying to steady herself. \u201cWe need to find out what this Cosmic Alignment is and how I can help.\u201d She felt an unfamiliar determination rise within her. \u201cWe can\u2019t let whatever this is destroy our home.\u201d\n\nLeo nodded, his expression shifting from fear to resolve. \u201cLet\u2019s start at the library. There has to be something in the old texts about it.\u201d\n\nAs they raced down the cliff path, a sudden chill swept through the air. Kira glanced back to the sky, where the last twinkling star faded, leaving only darkness behind. \n\n\u201cDo you think it\u2019s too late?\u201d Leo asked hesitantly, his voice barely a whisper.\n\nKira swallowed hard, uncertainty gnawing at her bravery. \u201cWe won\u2019t know unless we try.\u201d The challenge ahead loomed larger than ever, but she couldn\u2019t let fear hold her back. Not now.\n\nWith their hearts pounding in unison, the duo dashed toward the village, ready to uncover the truth about the stars and save their world from an impending disaster.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Kira and Leo decide to do after the cosmic chaos in the sky?","options":["Go home","Visit the library","Talk to Celestia","Ignore it"],"correct_answer":"Visit the library"},{"question":"How does Kira feel about her new abilities?","options":["Excited","Confused","Indifferent","Scared"],"correct_answer":"Scared"},{"question":"What warning does Celestia give Kira?","options":["To stay away from the stars","To hurry before the Cosmic Alignment","To forget her powers","To find a new planet"],"correct_answer":"To hurry before the Cosmic Alignment"},{"question":"What emotion does Leo display when the stars begin to fade?","options":["Excitement","Panic","Joy","Anger"],"correct_answer":"Panic"},{"question":"What drives Kira to overcome her fears?","options":["Her desire to save her home","Her curiosity","Her friendship with Leo","Her powers"],"correct_answer":"Her desire to save her home"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_310_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_310_ch2_img1.png","plot_310_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":559,"reading_level":"Builder"}
