   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_305_7_10","title":"The Library Rivalry","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Classroom Rivalries","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Lucy and Ethan stood in the cozy school library. The smell of old books filled the air. Brightly colored posters hung on the walls, encouraging everyone to read. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s look at the map again,\u201d Lucy said, her eyes sparkling with excitement. She spread the treasure map out on the table. \u201cIt says we need to find the \u2018Book of Secrets\u2019!\u201d\n\nEthan squinted at the map. \u201cWhere do we start?\u201d he asked, nervously tapping his fingers on the table. He wanted to impress his friends, but this treasure hunt was starting to feel serious.\n\n\u201cMrs. Finch said the Book of Secrets is in the deepest corner of the library,\u201d Lucy replied, her heart racing. \u201cThat\u2019s where we need to go!\u201d\n\nThey rushed past tall bookshelves filled with colorful covers. The sound of their footsteps echoed in the quiet library. Suddenly, Ethan stopped. \u201cWait, what if there are scary books there?\u201d he said, his bravado melting away.\n\nLucy laughed. \u201cBooks can\u2019t be scary! They\u2019re full of adventures!\u201d She took a deep breath and led the way.\n\nAfter what felt like forever, they reached a dusty corner. The dim light barely reached the shelves. \u201cIs this it?\u201d Ethan whispered, peering into the shadows.\n\nLucy nodded. \u201cLook!\u201d She pointed at a thick book with a shiny cover. \u201cThe Book of Secrets!\u201d \n\nJust as she reached for it, the floor creaked loudly. Ethan jumped back. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d he squeaked.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s just grab the book quickly!\u201d Lucy said, her heart pounding. They both pulled the book off the shelf. Suddenly, it made a loud CLICK! The wall behind them began to move, revealing a hidden door.\n\n\u201cWhoa! A secret door!\u201d Ethan shouted, his eyes wide with wonder. They exchanged glances, excitement and fear swirling inside them. \u201cShould we go in?\u201d \n\nLucy hesitated. \u201cBut what if it\u2019s dangerous?\u201d \n\nEthan grinned. \u201cWe\u2019re already in this together! Besides, we can\u2019t let the other class win without exploring!\u201d\n\nWith a deep breath, they stepped toward the door. They could feel the excitement buzzing in the air. What would they find inside? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2] \n\nAs they entered, the door creaked shut behind them. They were in a small room filled with strange old books and a glowing chest in the center. What could be inside? \n\n\u201cWe need to find out!\u201d Lucy said, her heart racing even faster. \n\nBut they were not alone. Shadows danced around them, and Lucy and Ethan looked at each other, wide-eyed. \n\nWhat had they discovered?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Lucy and Ethan find in the library?","options":["A treasure map","A scary book","A giant monster","A treasure chest"],"correct_answer":"A treasure map"},{"question":"What is the Book of Secrets?","options":["A regular book","A book full of jokes","A treasure map","A special book they discover"],"correct_answer":"A special book they discover"},{"question":"What happens when they pull the Book of Secrets off the shelf?","options":["A secret door opens","They find a spy","The library gets dark","They hear a loud noise"],"correct_answer":"A secret door opens"},{"question":"How do Lucy and Ethan feel about the hidden door?","options":["Excited and scared","Bored and tired","Happy and relaxed","Angry and confused"],"correct_answer":"Excited and scared"},{"question":"What do they see when they enter the hidden room?","options":["Bright lights","Shadows and a glowing chest","A giant monster","A picnic table"],"correct_answer":"Shadows and a glowing chest"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_305_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_305_ch3_img1.png","plot_305_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":419,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
