   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_305_7_10","title":"The Library Rivalry","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Classroom Rivalries","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Lucy and Ethan stood in front of the hidden door. The thick wooden door looked old and mysterious. \u201cWhat do you think is behind it?\u201d Lucy asked, her eyes shining with excitement.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know,\u201d Ethan replied. \u201cBut we should find out!\u201d \n\nWith a deep breath, they pushed the door open. A soft creak echoed in the room. Inside, they found shelves filled with ancient books. Dust danced like tiny fairies in the sunlight streaming through the windows. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cWow! Look at all these books!\u201d Lucy exclaimed, her voice filled with awe. \u201cWe could read these for the contest!\u201d\n\n\u201cYeah, but there\u2019s something else here,\u201d Ethan said, pointing to a chest in the corner. It glowed a soft blue, making the room sparkle. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s check it out!\u201d Lucy's heart raced. They hurried over, their footsteps echoing in the quiet room. \n\nAs they reached the chest, Ethan asked, \u201cDo you think it\u2019s locked?\u201d \n\nLucy shrugged. \u201cOnly one way to find out!\u201d \n\nThey carefully opened the chest. Inside, they found scrolls with golden letters and a note. \u201cThis is the Book of Secrets,\u201d Lucy read aloud. \u201cIt has stories from long ago!\u201d \n\n\u201cStories? We need to read these!\u201d Ethan said, bouncing on his feet. \n\n\u201cBut wait,\u201d Lucy said, her eyes bright with a new idea. \u201cWhat if we read these together? Our classes can help each other.\u201d\n\nEthan frowned. \u201cBut we\u2019re supposed to be rivals!\u201d\n\n\u201cI know,\u201d Lucy said, \u201cbut this is about more than winning. Imagine if we shared these stories with everyone!\u201d\n\nEthan thought for a moment. \u201cYou\u2019re right. Plus, it could be fun!\u201d\n\nThey both grinned and began to gather the scrolls. Just as they turned to leave, the door creaked shut behind them. \n\n\u201cUh-oh! Now what?\u201d Ethan asked nervously. \n\n\u201cDon\u2019t worry! We\u2019ll find a way out,\u201d Lucy said with determination. \u201cAnd we\u2019ll show everyone the true treasure of this library: friendship!\u201d\n\nAs they worked together to open the door, they felt a spark of hope. Maybe this rivalry was turning into something even better.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cOkay, on three!\u201d Lucy said. \u201cOne, two, three!\u201d\n\nWith a big push, the door swung open. They laughed, knowing they were ready to change the competition for good.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Lucy and Ethan find inside the hidden door?","options":["A treasure map","Ancient books","A video game","A box of toys"],"correct_answer":"Ancient books"},{"question":"What did the glowing chest contain?","options":["A treasure","The Book of Secrets","A key","A picture"],"correct_answer":"The Book of Secrets"},{"question":"What idea did Lucy suggest?","options":["To read alone","To stop the contest","To read together","To play games"],"correct_answer":"To read together"},{"question":"What did Ethan initially think about working together?","options":["It was a good idea","He was excited","He was unsure","He wanted to quit"],"correct_answer":"He was unsure"},{"question":"What did Lucy and Ethan feel at the end of the chapter?","options":["Nervous","Happy","Angry","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Happy"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_305_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_305_ch4_img1.png","plot_305_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":376,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
