   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_305_7_10","title":"The Library Rivalry","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Classroom Rivalries","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Lucy and Ethan stood in the center of the library, excitement bubbling inside them. The wooden shelves towered high, filled with colorful books. Mrs. Finch had just told them about the Book of Secrets. \n\n\u201cWhat do you think it is?\u201d Lucy asked, her eyes shining. \n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know,\u201d Ethan replied, scratching his head. \u201cBut it sounds cool!\u201d\n\nThey decided to search for it together. Lucy grabbed a flashlight. \u201cLet\u2019s check the nooks first!\u201d she suggested. \n\n\u201cGood idea!\u201d Ethan grinned. They hurried to the first nook, where the shadows danced. \n\n\u201cDo you see anything?\u201d Lucy asked, shining the light around. \n\n\u201cJust old books,\u201d Ethan said with a frown. \n\nSuddenly, Lucy noticed something shiny on the floor. \u201cWhat\u2019s that?\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nIt was a tiny key! Lucy picked it up. \u201cMaybe it opens the Book of Secrets!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find out!\u201d Ethan said, his eyes brightening. They raced to the center of the library where Mrs. Finch kept the special books. \n\n\u201cMrs. Finch!\u201d Lucy called. \u201cDo you know where the Book of Secrets is?\u201d \n\nMrs. Finch smiled. \u201cAh, the Book of Secrets! It\u2019s in the locked cabinet over there,\u201d she said, pointing. \n\nEthan and Lucy ran to the cabinet. \u201cBut how do we open it?\u201d Ethan asked. \n\nLucy held up the tiny key. \u201cMaybe this will work!\u201d She inserted the key into the lock. Click! The cabinet door swung open. \n\nInside, they found the Book of Secrets, its cover sparkled with gold. \u201cWow!\u201d they exclaimed together. \n\nThey carefully opened the book and gasped. It was full of stories about friendship, bravery, and adventure. \n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Lucy said, pointing to a story about two rivals who became friends. \n\nEthan nodded. \u201cJust like us!\u201d\n\nThey spent the whole afternoon reading together. They laughed, discussed characters, and even acted out some silly scenes. \n\nAs the day ended, Lucy looked at Ethan. \u201cI\u2019m glad we teamed up. This is way more fun than competing.\u201d \n\n\u201cMe too!\u201d Ethan replied, with a big smile. \u201cFriends?\u201d \n\n\u201cFriends!\u201d Lucy said, and they shook hands, sealing their new friendship. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThey left the library together, excited about their next adventure. \n\n\u201cWhat should we read next?\u201d Ethan asked. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s explore more treasure maps!\u201d Lucy suggested, her smile wide. \n\nAnd with that, they planned their next reading quest. Who knew what other treasures awaited them in the library?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Lucy and Ethan find in the library?","options":["A treasure chest","The Book of Secrets","A lost cat","A magic wand"],"correct_answer":"The Book of Secrets"},{"question":"What does Lucy hold to help them see in the nook?","options":["A lantern","A flashlight","A candle","A torch"],"correct_answer":"A flashlight"},{"question":"What do they realize about their rivalry?","options":["It's more fun to compete","They should stop reading","They can be friends","Rivalry is the best"],"correct_answer":"They can be friends"},{"question":"What do Lucy and Ethan act out while reading?","options":["A race","A treasure hunt","Characters from stories","A sports game"],"correct_answer":"Characters from stories"},{"question":"What do they plan to do next?","options":["Go home","Explore more treasure maps","Start a new contest","Take a nap"],"correct_answer":"Explore more treasure maps"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_305_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_305_ch5_img1.png","plot_305_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":391,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
