     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"exhilarating","1":"strategy","2":"determination","3":"rivalry","4":"taunted","image_prompts":["The image captures the vibrant atmosphere of Crestwood Middle School\u2019s library, with colorful posters of the science fair plastered on the walls. Sam, with his curly hair, is energetically sketching a creative invention, while Mia, wearing glasses, is focused on her notes, her brow furrowed in concentration. The scene is alive with books and science projects, embodying the excitement and hustle of students preparing for the fair.","In a moment of confrontation, Mia and Sam stand in the library, facing Derek, a rival student. The tension is palpable, with Sam\u2019s fists clenched and Mia looking worried. The background shows the library\u2019s chaos, with books scattered and students whispering. Derek smirks confidently, adding to the dramatic atmosphere, while a clock on the wall hints at the looming deadline of the science fair."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A cluttered science workshop filled with tools, half-finished projects, and a large window providing natural light. In the foreground, Sam stands excitedly, blueprints in hand, while Mia looks skeptical, her brow slightly knitted as she studies the chaos around her. The mood is charged, with a soft golden glow highlighting their expressive faces, symbolizing their contrasting approaches to the project.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_301_ch1_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 13:51:28"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing An intense scene depicting Sam and Mia amidst a chaotic burst of sparks from their experimental prototype. Mias expression is one of shock and frustration, while Sam appears alarmed yet determined. The background is filled with smoke and scattered materials, creating a dramatic atmosphere that captures the heightened stakes they face in both the competition and their friendship.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_301_ch1_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 13:51:28"}}}
