   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_302_7_10","title":"Art Class Antics","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Classroom Rivalries","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"The sun was shining bright when Miss Patel\u2019s art class began. Lila, the leader of the Color Crushers, was excited. \u201cToday is the day we show our colors!\u201d she exclaimed, her yellow paintbrush waving in the air.\n\n\u201cNot if the Paint Defenders have anything to say about it!\u201d Jake declared with a smirk. He was ready to outsmart Lila and her team. \n\nThe classroom was alive with colors. Canvases stood tall, covered in paint splatters. The walls were lined with student art, bursting with creativity. It was a place where imagination came alive! \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nLila gathered her team, Mia and Sam. \u201cWe have to win! Let\u2019s use every color we can find!\u201d she said, her eyes sparkling with determination.\n\nJake overheard. \u201cWe need a clever plan,\u201d he whispered to his team, Ava and Ben. \u201cLet\u2019s distract them while we work on our masterpiece.\u201d \n\nAs Lila painted, she heard laughter behind her. \u201cWhat are they up to?\u201d she wondered. Just then, she spotted Jake sneaking a bucket of bright blue paint behind the shelves. \u201cHey! What are you doing?\u201d she shouted, pointing her brush.\n\nJake grinned and waved. \u201cJust working on my strategy!\u201d\n\nBut before Lila could run over, Sam yelled, \u201cLook out!\u201d A big canvas wobbled and swayed. It was about to fall! Lila rushed to save it. Instead, her brush accidentally swiped across Jake\u2019s canvas, leaving a bright yellow streak!\n\n\u201cNo!\u201d Jake yelled, eyes wide. \n\n\u201cWhat did you do?\u201d shouted Jake, but Lila just gasped. \n\nSuddenly, a loud crash! A shelf of paint jars toppled over, splattering colors everywhere. Miss Patel rushed in, hands on her hips. \u201cWhat is going on here?\u201d\n\n\u201cUm, just a little... accident?\u201d Lila said, giggling nervously. \n\nMiss Patel sighed but then smiled. \u201cArt can be messy, but remember, we\u2019re here to create, not to destroy. Work together, and you might surprise yourselves!\u201d\n\nThe teams exchanged glances. Maybe they could work together? But before they could decide, Miss Patel announced, \u201cYour next challenge: create a mural together!\u201d\n\nLila and Jake looked at each other. Could they work side by side? What would happen next?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Who is the leader of the Color Crushers?","options":["Jake","Mia","Lila","Ben"],"correct_answer":"Lila"},{"question":"What does Miss Patel want the teams to create together?","options":["A painting","A mural","A sculpture","A collage"],"correct_answer":"A mural"},{"question":"What color paint does Lila accidentally swipe on Jake's canvas?","options":["Blue","Red","Yellow","Green"],"correct_answer":"Yellow"},{"question":"What happens after the paint disaster?","options":["They give up","They collaborate","They run away","They switch teams"],"correct_answer":"They collaborate"},{"question":"What does Jake try to do behind the shelves?","options":["Paint a picture","Distract Lila","Help Lila","Clean up mess"],"correct_answer":"Distract Lila"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_302_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_302_ch2_img1.png","plot_302_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":355,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
