   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_302_7_10","title":"Art Class Antics","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Classroom Rivalries","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"The art classroom buzzed with excitement. Lila and Jake stood at their tables, ready for today\u2019s challenge. Miss Patel smiled at her students. \u201cToday, we need to solve the mystery of the missing blue paint!\u201d \n\nLila crossed her arms, her eyes wide. \u201cWho would take it? It\u2019s our most important color!\u201d \n\nJake grinned, his eyes sparkling with ideas. \u201cMaybe we can work together to find it!\u201d \n\n\u201cTogether?\u201d Lila frowned. \u201cBut we\u2019re rivals!\u201d\n\n\u201cYes, but if we don\u2019t find the blue paint, we\u2019ll both lose,\u201d Jake said, tilting his head. \n\nLila thought for a moment. \u201cAlright! Let\u2019s split into teams to search the room.\u201d \n\n\u201cGreat idea!\u201d Jake said, ready to dive in. \n\nAs they searched, they peeked behind easels and under tables. The room was filled with laughter, splashes of color, and the sound of brushes gliding over canvas. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cLook!\u201d Jake shouted from the corner. \u201cI found something!\u201d \n\nLila rushed over. \u201cWhat is it?\u201d \n\nJake held up a small jar. It was empty! \u201cNo blue paint here.\u201d \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s check the supply closet!\u201d Lila suggested, her heart racing. \n\nWhen they reached the closet, they opened the door. \u201cWhoa!\u201d They both gasped. The shelves were a mess! \n\n\u201cWhere could it be?\u201d Jake asked, scratching his head. \n\nSuddenly, Lila's eyes sparkled with an idea. \u201cWhat if someone put it in the wrong place?\u201d \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s look carefully,\u201d Jake replied, determined. \n\nAs they rummaged around, Lila found a blue paintbrush behind some old paper. \u201cThis could be a clue!\u201d \n\nJust then, a loud crash echoed through the room! The door burst open, and Miss Patel stood there with a smile. \u201cWhat\u2019s all this commotion?\u201d \n\n\u201cWe\u2019re on a blue paint hunt!\u201d Lila explained, holding the brush high. \n\nMiss Patel clapped her hands. \u201cI love your teamwork! Keep it up! The mural depends on it!\u201d \n\nFeeling hopeful, Lila and Jake exchanged smiles. Maybe they could be friends after all. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s keep searching!\u201d Lila cheered. \n\nAs they worked together, they laughed, shared ideas, and even discovered new colors hidden away. Their rivalry slowly faded, replaced by a bright friendship. \n\nWhat would they find next? The excitement of the mural was just around the corner!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What are Lila and Jake searching for?","options":["Red paint","Green paint","Blue paint","Yellow paint"],"correct_answer":"Blue paint"},{"question":"What did Lila find in the supply closet?","options":["A red paintbrush","An empty jar","A blue paintbrush","A yellow paintbrush"],"correct_answer":"A blue paintbrush"},{"question":"How do Lila and Jake feel about working together at first?","options":["Excited","Nervous","Annoyed","Indifferent"],"correct_answer":"Nervous"},{"question":"What did Miss Patel encourage them to do?","options":["Compete harder","Work together","Give up","Paint separately"],"correct_answer":"Work together"},{"question":"What is the main theme of this chapter?","options":["Friendship","Competition","Mystery","Painting"],"correct_answer":"Friendship"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_302_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_302_ch4_img1.png","plot_302_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":368,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
