   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_302_11_14","title":"Art Class Antics","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Classroom Rivalries","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"The bell rang, echoing through the bright halls of Maplewood Middle School, signaling the start of art class. Lila rushed in, her heart racing with excitement. The air was thick with the smell of paint, and the sound of brushes dancing across canvases filled the room. Miss Patel, with her kind smile and vibrant headscarf, stood at the front, her easel loaded with fresh white canvases ready for creativity.\n\n\u201cWelcome, artists!\u201d Miss Patel announced, her voice warm like a sunny afternoon. \u201cToday, we embark on our journey to create masterpieces for the Art Championship. Let\u2019s see who will take home the title of \u2018Art Champions\u2019!\u201d \n\nLila glanced around the room. The Color Crushers, her team, were already setting up their stations, armed with bright acrylics and determination. She could feel the electric energy in the air. Across the room, Jake and the Paint Defenders were busy plotting their strategy, whispering and smirking. Lila narrowed her eyes. Their rivalry had become legendary, and she was not about to let them outshine her team.\n\nJust as she was about to rally her friends, she noticed a vibrant green canvas being lifted toward her. \u201cHey, Lila! What do you think of my preliminary sketch?\u201d called out Sam, her best friend, holding up his work.\n\n\u201cIt looks awesome! But we need a bolder idea!\u201d Lila replied, bouncing on her toes, her mind racing with possibilities. \n\n\u201cColor Crushers, let\u2019s brainstorm!\u201d she announced, as her team gathered around her. They tossed around ideas like paint splatters, images of dragons and galactic landscapes swirling in their heads. They were ready to unleash their creativity.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe classroom buzzed with excitement, each group carving out their identities in strokes of color. Yet, just behind the chatter, an undercurrent of tension stirred. Lila caught Jake\u2019s eye across the room. He smirked, a glimmer of mischief in his gaze. She knew he was up to something, and the thrill of competition wrapped around her like a tight canvas.\n\nHours passed with laughter and splashes of color, but as the clock ticked closer to the end of the period, Lila spotted Jake sneaking up to their table. \u201cWhat do you want, Jake?\u201d she challenged, her hands on her hips.\n\n\u201cJust admiring your... *masterpiece*,\u201d he said, his voice dripping with sarcasm. \u201cHope it doesn\u2019t get ruined before the competition.\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat are you planning?\u201d Lila asked, narrowing her eyes. Tension crackled in the air like static electricity.\n\n\u201cOh, nothing much\u2026 just a little brush with destiny,\u201d Jake replied, before dashing away with a wink.\n\nLila\u2019s stomach twisted. \u201cDid you see that?\u201d she turned to Sam and the others. \u201cWe need to keep an eye on him. He\u2019s up to no good.\u201d\n\nAs the class ended and students filed out, Lila felt a mix of determination and unease. Despite their rivalry, she couldn\u2019t shake the feeling that something deeper was brewing between their teams. Could a paintbrush truly bring out the best in rivals? \n\nWith her heart set on victory, Lila knew this was just the beginning of an artistic battle unlike any other.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the main goal of Miss Patel's art class?","options":["To create a mural","To hold an Art Championship","To learn about art history","To paint a large canvas"],"correct_answer":"To hold an Art Championship"},{"question":"Who is the leader of the Color Crushers?","options":["Miss Patel","Jake","Sam","Lila"],"correct_answer":"Lila"},{"question":"What does Lila feel when she confronts Jake?","options":["Joy","Fear","Determination","Indifference"],"correct_answer":"Determination"},{"question":"What type of atmosphere does the art classroom have?","options":["Quiet and dull","Chaotic and loud","Bright and creative","Dark and gloomy"],"correct_answer":"Bright and creative"},{"question":"What does Jake do that makes Lila suspicious?","options":["He admires her artwork","He laughs at her ideas","He sneaks around their table","He paints over her canvas"],"correct_answer":"He sneaks around their table"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_302_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_302_ch1_img1.png","plot_302_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":518,"reading_level":"Builder"}
