   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_303_11_14","title":"Mathletes in Mayhem","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Classroom Rivalries","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"The halls of Maplewood Middle School buzzed with excitement as the annual Mathletes Challenge approached. Posters decorated with equations and colorful charts hung on the walls, creating a vibrant backdrop for the upcoming competition. Among the throngs of students, Alex Chen, captain of the Number Ninjas, paced back and forth in front of his team. His glasses glinted in the fluorescent lights as he adjusted his blue hoodie, which was emblazoned with a fierce ninja graphic.\n\n\u201cOkay, team! We have just a week to prepare!\u201d Alex declared, his voice rising above the chatter. His determination was as palpable as the smell of chalk dust lingering in the air. He was focused, laser-focused, like a hawk ready to swoop down on its prey. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAcross the room, Zoe Martinez, the fearless leader of the Equation Eagles, was rallying her own team. With her curly hair bouncing as she animatedly spoke, she laid out their strategy. \u201cWe need to master every type of puzzle they throw at us! Let's practice until we can solve them in our sleep!\u201d Her eyes shone with determination, and her teammates nodded, ready to rise to the challenge.\n\nAs the two teams exchanged friendly jabs, a sudden hush fell over the crowd. Mr. Kim, their quirky math teacher with his bowtie and oversized glasses, had entered the room. \u201cAttention, mathletes!\u201d he exclaimed, excitement bubbling in his voice. \u201cThis year\u2019s challenge will not just be about solving problems\u2014it will also include a scavenger hunt!\u201d\n\nGasps filled the classroom. Alex raised his hand. \u201cMr. Kim, how does that work?\u201d \n\nMr. Kim grinned, his eyes twinkling like stars. \u201cYou will solve riddles that will lead you to various locations around the school! Each location holds a challenge, and each challenge will test your wits and teamwork!\u201d \n\nAlex exchanged a glance with Zoe, both realizing the implications. If they wanted to win, they would need to work together, but the rivalry was too deep-rooted for that to happen smoothly. \n\nAs the bell rang, signaling the end of the meeting, Alex felt a knot of anxiety twist in his stomach. It was daunting to think of the challenges ahead, especially with Zoe as his rival. Would they be able to set their differences aside for the sake of the competition? \n\nZoe, overhearing him mumble to himself, shot back, \u201cHey, Ninja, don't think you can outsmart us! We\u2019ll figure out those riddles before you even start.\u201d \n\n\u201cBring it on, Eagle!\u201d Alex retorted, a smile creeping onto his face despite the tension. \n\nWith the challenge looming, both teams left the classroom, determination etched on their faces. Little did they know, the first clue had already been hidden somewhere in the school. The thrill of competition pulsed through Alex\u2019s veins; he was ready for whatever came next.\n\nAs he stepped into the hallway, he felt a shift in the air. The scavenger hunt was going to be more than just math\u2014it was going to test their very identities, friendships, and teamwork. \n\n\u201cLet the games begin,\u201d he whispered to himself, feeling the weight of anticipation settle over him.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe journey of the Mathletes Challenge had just begun, and with it, a whirlwind of unexpected twists and turns awaited.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the Mathletes Challenge about?","options":["Only solving math problems","A scavenger hunt with math puzzles","A sports competition","Art and music contests"],"correct_answer":"A scavenger hunt with math puzzles"},{"question":"Who is the captain of the Number Ninjas?","options":["Zoe Martinez","Mr. Kim","Alex Chen","John Smith"],"correct_answer":"Alex Chen"},{"question":"What does Zoe want her team to master?","options":["Art skills","Math puzzles","Sports techniques","History facts"],"correct_answer":"Math puzzles"},{"question":"What is Mr. Kim's role in the story?","options":["A student","The principal","A math teacher","The janitor"],"correct_answer":"A math teacher"},{"question":"What feeling does Alex experience as the challenge approaches?","options":["Excitement and anxiety","Indifference","Boredom","Fear of failure"],"correct_answer":"Excitement and anxiety"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_303_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_303_ch1_img1.png","plot_303_ch1_img2.png"]},"word_count":540,"reading_level":"Builder"}
