   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_304_7_10","title":"Debate Duel: Words at War","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Classroom Rivalries","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"The day of the big debate had finally arrived! The school auditorium buzzed with excitement. Students filled the seats, wearing colorful shirts and waving banners. They cheered for their favorite debaters. Leo stood excitedly backstage, his heart racing. \u201cI can\u2019t wait to show everyone my speech!\u201d he said to Mrs. Harper.  \n\nMrs. Harper smiled. \u201cRemember, Leo, it\u2019s not just about winning. It\u2019s about understanding.\u201d  \n\nLeo nodded, but his eyes sparkled with determination. \u201cI know, but I really want to win!\u201d  \n\nMeanwhile, Yasmin practiced her notes. \u201cI believe we need to listen to each other,\u201d she said softly. \u201cIt\u2019s important to share ideas.\u201d  \n\nAs she stepped onto the stage, Yasmin felt her palms sweaty. She took a deep breath, looked at Leo, and said, \u201cMay the best speaker win!\u201d  \n\n\u201cBring it on!\u201d Leo replied, grinning.  \n\nThe debate began. The first question was tough: \u201cHow can we help others in our community?\u201d  \n\nLeo launched into his speech, \u201cWe can absolutely help by volunteering! Teamwork makes us stronger!\u201d The audience cheered.  \n\nYasmin took her turn. \u201cVolunteering is great, but we must also understand what others need. Listening is key!\u201d The crowd applauded.  \n\nAs the debate continued, Leo and Yasmin realized their rivalry was heating up. Each wanted to outshine the other. But then, something unexpected happened.  \n\nMidway through, Yasmin paused. \u201cLeo, I think you have great ideas,\u201d she said. \u201cBut what about those who can't volunteer?\u201d  \n\nLeo froze. He hadn\u2019t thought about that. Suddenly, he felt a wave of uncertainty. \u201cYou're right, Yasmin. I just thought... well, I thought everyone could volunteer!\u201d  \n\nThe audience was silent, hanging on their words. Leo looked worried. He felt like they were in a real battle of ideas. \u201cMaybe... maybe we need to find a way to help everyone,\u201d he said slowly.  \n\nYasmin nodded. This was a turning point. \u201cWe could create a plan together! A plan that includes everyone!\u201d  \n\nJust then, the lights flickered. The auditorium went dark! Gasps filled the room. \u201cUh-oh,\u201d whispered Leo. \u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d  \n\nYasmin took a deep breath. \u201cLet\u2019s stick together and come up with a solution!\u201d  \n\nBut just as they began to discuss, the lights flickered back on! The crowd erupted into cheers. They were ready to hear more.  \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s continue!\u201d Leo shouted, filled with energy. But would they work together this time, or would they fall back into rivalry?  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the main question of the debate?","options":["How can we have fun?","How can we help others in our community?","What is the best food?","Why is school important?"],"correct_answer":"How can we help others in our community?"},{"question":"What does Leo want to do during the debate?","options":["Win and show his speech.","Make friends.","Help Yasmin.","Be quiet."],"correct_answer":"Win and show his speech."},{"question":"What surprising idea does Yasmin share?","options":["Everyone can volunteer.","We should listen to each other.","Debating is easy.","Leo is the best."],"correct_answer":"We should listen to each other."},{"question":"What happens when the lights go out?","options":["Everyone leaves.","They continue the debate.","They panic.","They start singing."],"correct_answer":"They continue the debate."},{"question":"What do Leo and Yasmin decide to do together?","options":["Create a plan that includes everyone.","Argue more.","Leave the stage.","Stop the debate."],"correct_answer":"Create a plan that includes everyone."}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_304_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_304_ch3_img1.png","plot_304_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":403,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
