   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_304_7_10","title":"Debate Duel: Words at War","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Classroom Rivalries","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"The school auditorium buzzed with excitement. Leo stood on one side, his heart racing. Yasmin stood on the other side, her brow furrowed in concentration. They were ready for the big debate!\n\nMrs. Harper clapped her hands. \u201cWelcome, everyone! Today, our debaters will discuss teamwork. Let\u2019s cheer them on!\u201d\n\nAs the lights flickered, Leo called out, \u201cTeamwork is all about winning together!\u201d He flashed a confident smile. Yasmin replied, \u201cBut what if winning means ignoring others? Teamwork is about listening!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, the lights went out! A chorus of gasps filled the room. The auditorium was pitch black. Leo felt a knot in his stomach. \u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d he whispered to Yasmin.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know,\u201d she replied, her voice shaky. \u201cBut we can\u2019t just stop!\u201d\n\nLeo took a deep breath. \u201cLet\u2019s talk! We can figure this out together.\u201d He felt a spark of hope. They stood close, listening intently to each other\u2019s voices in the dark.\n\n\u201cWe both care about teamwork,\u201d Yasmin said slowly. \u201cWhat if we combined our ideas?\u201d\n\n\u201cGood idea!\u201d Leo exclaimed. \u201cTeamwork can be about listening AND winning!\u201d He felt lighter, as if the darkness was lifting.\n\nThen, the lights flickered back on! The crowd erupted in cheers. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] \n\nLeo and Yasmin exchanged looks of relief. \u201cWe can do this as a team,\u201d Leo said, his eyes shining. Yasmin nodded. \u201cLet\u2019s show everyone what true teamwork means!\u201d\n\nThey stepped forward, ready to share their newfound understanding. The crowd hushed in anticipation as they prepared to present their united message.\n\nYasmin smiled at Leo. \u201cTogether, we can change the rules!\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s do it!\u201d he shouted. They stepped up to the podium, hearts filled with hope.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What happens when the lights go out?","options":["They stop the debate","They keep talking","They leave the stage","They get scared"],"correct_answer":"They keep talking"},{"question":"What do Leo and Yasmin decide to do?","options":["Compete harder","Work together","Give up","Leave the stage"],"correct_answer":"Work together"},{"question":"Who is the debate coach?","options":["Mr. Smith","Mrs. Harper","Ms. Jones","Mr. Brown"],"correct_answer":"Mrs. Harper"},{"question":"What does Leo believe about teamwork?","options":["It\u2019s only about winning","It\u2019s about listening","It\u2019s about helping each other","It\u2019s about both winning and listening"],"correct_answer":"It\u2019s about both winning and listening"},{"question":"How do Leo and Yasmin feel at the end of the chapter?","options":["Defeated","Excited","Bored","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_304_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_304_ch4_img1.png","plot_304_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":286,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
