ons a blend of trepidation and determination, ready to face the unknown challenges posed by the bracelet and the revelations it promises.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_296_ch4_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 13:33:40"}}}
