   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_296_7_10","title":"The Secret of the Friendship Bracelet","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Friend Drama","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Mia loved her school. The bright yellow walls, the big playground, and the friendly teachers made it special. But there was one place Mia had never been: the attic.\n\n\u201cMia! Are you ready for the treasure hunt?\u201d Zoe called. She was Mia's best friend. Zoe had curly hair and wore colorful clothes. She loved art and always had a sketchbook with her.\n\n\u201cAlmost!\u201d Mia replied. She raced down the hall. \u201cLet\u2019s explore the attic! I heard it\u2019s filled with cool stuff!\u201d\n\nThe two friends climbed the stairs to the attic. Dust swirled in the sunlight as they pushed open the heavy door. Inside, old boxes were stacked high. Cobwebs hung like decorations. \n\n\u201cWow!\u201d Zoe exclaimed. \u201cLook at all this junk!\u201d\n\nMia giggled, \u201cIt\u2019s treasure! Help me look!\u201d They dug through the boxes, finding old books, toys, and strange trinkets. \n\nThen, Mia spotted something shiny in a corner. \u201cZoe, look!\u201d She reached for the object. It was a friendship bracelet, sparkling with different colors. \n\n\u201cCool!\u201d Zoe said. \u201cLet\u2019s wear it!\u201d\n\nAs Mia put the bracelet on her wrist, a chill ran through the room. Suddenly, a gust of wind blew, scattering papers everywhere. \n\n\u201cDid you feel that?\u201d Mia asked, wide-eyed.\n\n\u201cYeah, it\u2019s a bit spooky,\u201d Zoe admitted, her voice trembling. \n\nThen, they heard a tiny laugh. \u201cBoo!\u201d a friendly ghost appeared! He floated just above the boxes, his face mischievous.\n\n\u201cWho are you?\u201d Mia asked.\n\n\u201cI\u2019m Casper! I love to play!\u201d he said, grinning. \n\n\u201cCan you help us?\u201d Zoe asked, frowning. \u201cWe found this bracelet!\u201d\n\n\u201cAh, the bracelet!\u201d Casper floated closer. \u201cIt holds secrets! But be careful. It can bring friends closer... or tear them apart!\u201d\n\nMia and Zoe exchanged worried glances. What did he mean? \n\n\u201cWe\u2019ll figure it out,\u201d Mia said. She took a deep breath. \u201cFriends stick together, right?\u201d \n\n\u201cRight!\u201d Zoe agreed. But deep down, she felt a twinge of jealousy.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe girls felt excited but nervous. What adventures awaited them? \n\nAs they turned back to Casper, he winked and said, \u201cLet the fun begin!\u201d","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the name of Mia's best friend?","options":["Zoe","Anna","Lily","Sara"],"correct_answer":"Zoe"},{"question":"What did Mia and Zoe find in the attic?","options":["A book","A friendship bracelet","A toy","A picture"],"correct_answer":"A friendship bracelet"},{"question":"What is the name of the ghost they met?","options":["Boo","Casper","Spooky","Phantom"],"correct_answer":"Casper"},{"question":"What does Casper say about the bracelet?","options":["It is just a toy","It can bring friends closer or tear them apart","It is very old","It is magical"],"correct_answer":"It can bring friends closer or tear them apart"},{"question":"How do Mia and Zoe feel about the adventure?","options":["Excited and nervous","Bored and tired","Angry and sad","Confused and lost"],"correct_answer":"Excited and nervous"}]},"images":null,"word_count":345,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
