   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_296_7_10","title":"The Secret of the Friendship Bracelet","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Friend Drama","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Mia and Zoe stood in the dusty attic, holding the sparkling bracelet. Sunlight peeked through a small window, making the bracelet sparkle like a thousand stars. \n\n\u201cDo you think it really has special powers?\u201d Mia asked, her eyes wide with wonder.\n\nZoe tilted her head. \u201cMaybe! But what kind of powers?\u201d\n\nJust then, a gentle breeze made the old wooden beams creak. Casper, the friendly ghost, floated in with a grin. \u201cIt can show the truth about friendship!\u201d\n\nZoe giggled. \u201cA friendship truth? Like how many cookies we can eat together?\u201d\n\nCasper chuckled. \u201cNot quite, but close! You will see!\u201d \n\nMia slipped the bracelet onto her wrist. It felt warm, almost alive. \u201cLet\u2019s go show it to everyone!\u201d\n\nAs they left the attic, Mia felt a strange excitement. But Zoe frowned. \u201cWhat if it only works for you, Mia?\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat do you mean?\u201d Mia asked, puzzled.\n\n\u201cWell, what if it makes you super popular? Then you won\u2019t need me anymore,\u201d Zoe said, crossing her arms.\n\nMia\u2019s heart sank. \u201cThat\u2019s not true! You\u2019re my best friend. I\u2019d never ditch you!\u201d\n\nZoe sighed. \u201cI know, but I can\u2019t help feeling weird about this.\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThey walked down the hall, trying to shake off the tension. Suddenly, the lights flickered. A loud BOOM echoed through the school!\n\n\u201cDid you hear that?\u201d Zoe shouted, her eyes wide.\n\n\u201cYeah! It sounded like it came from the classroom!\u201d Mia yelled. They rushed forward, curious but nervous.\n\nWhen they reached the classroom, they found desks overturned and papers scattered everywhere. \u201cWhat happened?\u201d Mia gasped.\n\nCasper floated beside them, looking worried. \u201cThe bracelet doesn\u2019t just show truth. It can stir up feelings too.\u201d\n\nZoe looked at Mia. \u201cWhat if it\u2019s getting jealous? Like me!\u201d\n\nMia shook her head. \u201cWe can\u2019t let it tear us apart! We need to find out what\u2019s going on.\u201d\n\nJust then, a loud crash came from the supply closet. Mia and Zoe exchanged worried glances.\n\n\u201cShould we check it out?\u201d Zoe whispered.\n\n\u201cTogether,\u201d Mia replied, holding out her hand.\n\nThey stepped toward the closet, hearts racing. What would they find inside?\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does the friendship bracelet do?","options":["It shows the truth about friendship.","It makes you fly.","It turns you invisible.","It gives you super strength."],"correct_answer":"It shows the truth about friendship."},{"question":"Why does Zoe feel worried about the bracelet?","options":["She thinks it will break.","She feels it will make Mia popular and leave her behind.","She fears it will disappear.","She is afraid of ghosts."],"correct_answer":"She feels it will make Mia popular and leave her behind."},{"question":"What happens when Mia and Zoe go to the classroom?","options":["It is empty.","Desks are overturned and papers are scattered.","They find a treasure.","They meet a teacher."],"correct_answer":"Desks are overturned and papers are scattered."},{"question":"What do Mia and Zoe decide to do after hearing the crash?","options":["Run away.","Check it out together.","Ignore it.","Call for help."],"correct_answer":"Check it out together."},{"question":"Who is the friendly ghost that helps them?","options":["Ghosty.","Casper.","Boo.","Spooky."],"correct_answer":"Casper."}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_296_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_296_ch2_img1.png","plot_296_ch2_img2.png"]},"word_count":361,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
