   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_296_7_10","title":"The Secret of the Friendship Bracelet","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Friend Drama","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Chapter 3: The Crashing Sound\n\nMia and Zoe sat in the attic, looking at the friendship bracelet. \"What do you think it does?\" Mia asked, twisting it in her fingers.\n\n\"I don't know,\" Zoe replied. \"But it feels special.\" \n\nSuddenly, a loud crash echoed through the attic! They both jumped. \"What was that?\" Mia whispered, her eyes wide.\n\n\"I... I don't know!\" Zoe stammered. They peeked out from behind an old trunk. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe attic was filled with dusty boxes and strange shadows. A single beam of light came through a tiny window, making the dust sparkle like stars. They could see old drawings and forgotten toys all around them. It felt like a secret world.\n\n\"Maybe it's the ghost!\" Zoe said, her voice shaking. \"Casper told us this place is full of surprises.\"\n\nJust then, a flicker of movement caught Mia\u2019s eye. \"Look!\" she pointed. A shadow darted past them. \n\n\"Did you see that?\" Zoe squeaked. \n\n\"I did! Let\u2019s follow it!\" Mia exclaimed, feeling brave. \n\nThey tiptoed forward, the floor creaking under their feet. Mia felt a twinge of jealousy. Zoe was always better at art and made everything so beautiful. Why did the bracelet seem to like her more? \n\nSuddenly, another loud crash shook the attic! Boxes tumbled down, spilling old toys everywhere. Mia gasped as a picture frame hit the floor and shattered. \"What is going on?\" she cried.\n\nThe shadow reappeared, glowing faintly. It was Casper!\n\n\"Mia! Zoe! You need to be careful!\" Casper warned, floating above the mess. \"The bracelet has powers, but it can bring out feelings\u2014good or bad.\"\n\n\"What do you mean?\" Zoe asked, confused.\n\n\"It makes you see things differently,\" Casper said. \"If you\u2019re jealous, you might see something that isn\u2019t there.\"\n\nMia\u2019s heart raced. \"What do you mean, Casper? What will happen?\"\n\n\"You have to work together. Or the bracelet will tear you apart!\" Casper said, his eyes wide. \n\nSuddenly, the bracelet glowed bright. Mia and Zoe felt a pull between them. The attic began to spin! \"Help!\" Zoe shouted. \n\nAs everything turned dark, Mia squeezed Zoe\u2019s hand. \"We have to stick together!\" \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nJust when it seemed like they would fall, the spinning stopped. They found themselves in a different part of the attic, surrounded by glowing letters. They spelled out one word\u2014FRIENDSHIP.\n\nMia and Zoe looked at each other, breathless. \"What does this mean?\" Zoe asked.\n\n\"I think we have to decide,\" Mia said, feeling the weight of the bracelet. \"Can we trust each other?\"\n\nThe air crackled with tension. They had to make a choice before it was too late.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What event surprised Mia and Zoe in the attic?","options":["A loud crash","A funny smell","A bright light","A singing bird"],"correct_answer":"A loud crash"},{"question":"What does Casper warn them about?","options":["The bracelet only works at night","The bracelet can reveal feelings","The attic is haunted","They should leave the attic"],"correct_answer":"The bracelet can reveal feelings"},{"question":"What did Mia and Zoe see that spelled out 'FRIENDSHIP'?","options":["A shadow","Glowing letters","A picture frame","The bracelet"],"correct_answer":"Glowing letters"},{"question":"What feeling does Mia experience towards Zoe?","options":["Happiness","Excitement","Jealousy","Fear"],"correct_answer":"Jealousy"},{"question":"What do Mia and Zoe realize they must do?","options":["Find more treasures","Trust each other","Escape the attic","Make a new bracelet"],"correct_answer":"Trust each other"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_296_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_296_ch3_img1.png","plot_296_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":441,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
