   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_296_7_10","title":"The Secret of the Friendship Bracelet","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Friend Drama","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Mia and Zoe stood in the attic, the dusty sunlight streaming through the window. They felt nervous but excited. The ancient bracelet sparkled in Mia's hand. \n\n\"This is it, Zoe! The bracelet can show us the real meaning of friendship!\" Mia exclaimed. Zoe nodded, but her smile faded quickly. \n\n\"Do you think it will really help us?\" Zoe asked quietly. \n\nMia tried to sound confident. \"Of course! We just have to believe in it!\"\n\nSuddenly, there was a loud crash. A stack of old books toppled over behind them. They both jumped. \"Casper, is that you?\" Mia shouted. \n\nThe friendly ghost floated into view, his eyes wide. \"I think the bracelet is becoming too powerful! You must be careful!\"\n\nMia and Zoe exchanged worried glances. \"What do we do?\u201d Zoe asked. \n\nCasper floated closer. \"You need to see the word on the bracelet. It might help you understand.\"\n\nThey held the bracelet between them and the word \u201cFRIENDSHIP\u201d glowed bright. \"What does it mean?\" Mia wondered aloud.\n\n\"It means you must trust each other,\" Casper replied. \"You can't let jealousy tear you apart.\"\n\nMia took a deep breath. \u201cZoe, I\u2019m sorry if I made you feel less important. That wasn\u2019t my intention.\u201d \n\nZoe smiled softly. \u201cI\u2019m sorry too. I was jealous of the bracelet. I should have trusted you.\u201d\n\nJust then, the bracelet shimmered, and a burst of colorful light surrounded them. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe light filled the attic with warmth. They felt their hearts lighten. \u201cLook! The bracelet is happy!\u201d Mia shouted with glee.\n\n\u201cMaybe it knows we are best friends again!\u201d Zoe added, her eyes sparkling.\n\nAs they celebrated, Casper warned, \u201cBut beware! Not all moments will be easy. You still have challenges ahead.\u201d\n\nMia and Zoe nodded, their spirits high. The bracelet was a reminder of their strong bond. \u201cTogether, we can face anything!\u201d Mia said.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s explore more about the bracelet!\u201d Zoe suggested eagerly. \n\nWith renewed hope, they decided to search for answers, knowing they would always have each other. \n\n\u201cOnward, friends!\u201d Mia cheered, and together they left the attic, ready for their next adventure. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Mia and Zoe find in the attic?","options":["A friendship bracelet","A treasure map","A magic book","An old toy"],"correct_answer":"A friendship bracelet"},{"question":"What word does the bracelet glow with?","options":["LOVE","FRIENDSHIP","MAGIC","TRUST"],"correct_answer":"FRIENDSHIP"},{"question":"What does Casper warn Mia and Zoe about?","options":["To keep the bracelet safe","That the bracelet is dangerous","Not to break the bracelet","That they must trust each other"],"correct_answer":"That they must trust each other"},{"question":"How do Mia and Zoe feel after apologizing to each other?","options":["Angry","Confused","Happy","Sad"],"correct_answer":"Happy"},{"question":"What do Mia and Zoe decide to do at the end of the chapter?","options":["Leave school","Explore more about the bracelet","Forget about the bracelet","Go home"],"correct_answer":"Explore more about the bracelet"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_296_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_296_ch4_img1.png","plot_296_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":355,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
