   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_296_7_10","title":"The Secret of the Friendship Bracelet","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Friend Drama","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Mia and Zoe stood in the school attic, the dusty light streaming in through the small window. They looked at the ancient friendship bracelet in Mia's hand. It sparkled with a magical glow. \n\n\u201cThis is amazing!\u201d Mia said, grinning. \n\nZoe nodded, her eyes bright. \u201cBut we have to be careful. You know, strange things have been happening.\u201d\n\nMia sighed. \u201cI know. But look! It says \u2018FRIENDSHIP\u2019 on it.\u201d \n\nSuddenly, they heard a soft giggle. It was Casper, the friendly ghost. He floated in with a cheeky smile. \u201cSo, what have you girls discovered?\u201d\n\n\u201cWe found this bracelet!\u201d Zoe pointed, excitement bubbling in her voice. \n\nCasper floated closer, his ghostly form glowing softly. \u201cThat bracelet is special. It shows your true friendship.\u201d \n\nJust then, Mia\u2019s face twisted with worry. \u201cBut why do we keep fighting?\u201d \n\nCasper chuckled lightly. \u201cSometimes, true friends need to trust each other more, especially when magic is involved.\u201d\n\nMia looked at Zoe, her heart racing. \u201cDo you think it can help us?\u201d\n\nZoe nodded, determination shining in her eyes. \u201cLet\u2019s try it.\u201d \n\nThey clasped the bracelet together, and suddenly, the attic filled with colorful sparkles! The air was warm and cozy, like a big hug. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cWow!\u201d Mia exclaimed. \u201cLook at the colors! It\u2019s beautiful!\u201d\n\nZoe smiled brightly. \u201cIt feels like a rainbow around us!\u201d\n\nAs they enjoyed the magic, they remembered their fights and misunderstandings. They had let jealousy creep in. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s promise to always talk,\u201d Zoe said softly. \n\nMia nodded. \u201cAnd to support each other in everything!\u201d\n\nThe bracelet glowed even brighter as if it understood their promise. Suddenly, Casper clapped his hands. \u201cGreat! Now, let\u2019s test your bond!\u201d \n\nWith that, the attic began to shake slightly, and books flew off the shelves. \u201cUh-oh! What\u2019s happening?\u201d Mia shouted. \n\n\u201cI think the bracelet wants to see how well you work together!\u201d Casper said, laughing.\n\nThe girls held hands, shouting, \u201cWe can do this!\u201d Together, they dodged books, giggling like crazy. \n\nFinally, the shaking stopped. The attic was still again. Zoe turned to Mia, her eyes wide. \u201cWe did it!\u201d \n\nMia grinned. \u201cTogether. Just like the bracelet said.\u201d\n\nThey hugged tightly. \u201cWe\u2019re best friends forever!\u201d Zoe declared.\n\nCasper cheered. \u201cAnd that\u2019s the magic of friendship!\u201d\n\nThey left the attic, their hearts full of joy, ready to face anything together. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAs they walked back to class, Mia whispered, \u201cI\u2019m glad we found the bracelet.\u201d\n\n\u201cMe too,\u201d Zoe replied. \u201cBut I\u2019m even gladder we have each other!\u201d","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Mia and Zoe find in the attic?","options":["A magical book","A friendship bracelet","A treasure chest","A ghost"],"correct_answer":"A friendship bracelet"},{"question":"What does the bracelet say?","options":["LOVE","FRIENDSHIP","MAGIC","TRUST"],"correct_answer":"FRIENDSHIP"},{"question":"Who is the friendly ghost?","options":["Zoe","Mia","Casper","The teacher"],"correct_answer":"Casper"},{"question":"What do Mia and Zoe promise each other?","options":["To always fight","To never talk","To always talk","To hide the bracelet"],"correct_answer":"To always talk"},{"question":"What happens when they hold the bracelet together?","options":["The attic shakes","Books fly off the shelves","A rainbow appears","They find more treasures"],"correct_answer":"Books fly off the shelves"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_296_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_296_ch5_img1.png","plot_296_ch5_img2.png"]},"word_count":421,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
