   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_296_11_14","title":"The Secret of the Friendship Bracelet","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Friend Drama","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Mia had never thought of her school as a treasure trove, but as she stood at the foot of the old wooden ladder leading to the attic, excitement bubbled in her chest like a fizzy soda. The quaint building, with its ivy-covered walls and creaky floors, held secrets in every corner, and today she was determined to uncover one of them. \n\n\"Mia, are you really going up there?\" Zoe\u2019s voice broke through her thoughts. Zoe was perched on the edge of a nearby desk, sketching a scene from their favorite fantasy novel. Her big brown eyes sparkled with curiosity, but there was also a hint of caution in her tone. \"What if you find a ghost?\"\n\nMia laughed, pushing back a strand of hair that had escaped her ponytail. \"Ghosts don\u2019t scare me! Besides, think of the cool stuff we might find!\" She climbed the ladder, each creak echoing in the attic's silence. Dust motes danced in the slivers of sunlight peeking through the small window, creating a magical atmosphere that filled Mia with wonder. \n\nOnce at the top, she pushed open the trapdoor. The attic was a labyrinth of forgotten treasures: boxes of old yearbooks, a mismatched collection of furniture, and a pile of costumes that looked like they had survived decades of Halloween parties. But what caught her attention was a small, glimmering object half-buried beneath a tattered quilt.\n\nMia reached for it, her fingers brushing against the cool surface of a delicate friendship bracelet. It was unlike anything she had ever seen\u2014woven with shimmering threads in vibrant colors, adorned with tiny charms shaped like stars and hearts. \"Zoe, come look!\" she called out, her voice a mix of awe and excitement.\n\nAs Zoe climbed up the ladder, Mia couldn\u2019t shake the feeling that this bracelet was special. \"Wow, it\u2019s beautiful!\" Zoe exclaimed, her eyes widening as she took it from Mia\u2019s hands. She turned it over, examining the charms. \"Where did you find it?\"\n\n\"Under that quilt. I think it might be ancient or something!\" Mia said, her imagination igniting like fireworks. They both admired the bracelet, feeling as if they had stumbled upon a piece of history. \n\nBut then, a sudden chill swept through the attic, causing the girls to shiver. The air thickened, and shadows seemed to stretch and curl around them. \"Did you feel that?\" Zoe whispered, glancing around nervously. \n\nMia nodded, her heart pounding. \"Maybe it is haunted.\" \n\nSuddenly, a loud crash echoed from the other side of the attic, making both girls jump. \"What was that?\" Zoe gasped, her eyes wide with fear.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s check it out,\u201d Mia said, trying to sound braver than she felt. As they walked toward the noise, their footsteps echoed in the dusty silence. Just as they reached the other side of the room, the candle on the window sill flickered wildly, as if responding to an invisible breeze.\n\n\"Mia, I don\u2019t like this,\" Zoe said, her hands trembling as she clutched the bracelet tighter. \n\n\u201cNeither do I, but we need to find out what\u2019s going on. We\u2019re in this together, remember?\u201d Mia said, gathering her courage. \n\nThey turned to leave, but the bracelet slipped from Zoe's fingers, landing with a soft thud on the attic floor, glowing faintly in the dim light. The glow pulsed like a heartbeat, filling the space around them with an eerie warmth. \n\n\u201cWhat the\u2014?\u201d Mia started, but before she could finish, the attic door slammed shut behind them, trapping them inside. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cZoe!\u201d Mia cried, panic rising in her chest. \u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Mia find in the attic?","options":["A ghost","An ancient friendship bracelet","A treasure map","A costume"],"correct_answer":"An ancient friendship bracelet"},{"question":"How does Zoe feel about going to the attic?","options":["Excited","Scared","Bored","Indifferent"],"correct_answer":"Scared"},{"question":"What happens when Zoe drops the bracelet?","options":["It disappears","It glows faintly","It breaks","It flies away"],"correct_answer":"It glows faintly"},{"question":"What does the atmosphere in the attic feel like?","options":["Warm and welcoming","Bright and cheerful","Eerie and tense","Dark and gloomy"],"correct_answer":"Eerie and tense"},{"question":"What do Mia and Zoe decide to do at the end of the chapter?","options":["Leave the attic","Investigate the noise","Go home","Ignore the bracelet"],"correct_answer":"Investigate the noise"}]},"images":null,"word_count":607,"reading_level":"Builder"}
