       [DEBUG] Checking shared image: {"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A ghostly figure, glowing softly, hovers in front of Mia and Zoe in the attic. The atmosphere is charged with tension and intrigue, the dim light casting long shadows around them. The ghost has a mischievous smile, its eyes sparkling with wisdom and playfulness. Mia and Zoe stand close together, their expressions a blend of trepidation and determination, ready to face the unknown challenges posed by the bracelet and the revelations it promises.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_296_ch4_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 13:33:40"}
