   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_296_11_14","title":"The Secret of the Friendship Bracelet","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Friend Drama","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Mia and Zoe stood in the dim attic, the air thick with dust and memories. Sunlight streamed through a small, grimy window, casting shadows that danced along the walls. The old trunk lay open before them, revealing treasures from another time. Mia\u2019s heart raced with anticipation as she rummaged through the forgotten items. \"Can you believe we found this up here?\" she exclaimed, holding up a faded photograph of two girls wearing matching friendship bracelets. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nZoe leaned closer, her eyes sparkling with excitement. \"It\u2019s like we\u2019re unearthing a piece of history!\" But as they continued to explore, an unsettling chill swept through the room, and they exchanged nervous glances. \n\n\"I know we said we\u2019d face whatever comes our way,\" Mia said, trying to sound brave, \"but what if that bracelet is really dangerous?\" \n\nZoe tucked a strand of hair behind her ear, frowning. \"I don\u2019t want to lose you, Mia. Ever.\" \n\nMia felt a rush of warmth at the sincerity in her friend's voice. \"You won\u2019t,\" she assured her, though doubt crept into her mind. \n\nThey had agreed to meet again after school to discuss their plan. But when the day finally arrived, Mia found herself filled with unease. The hallway buzzed with chatter, students rushing past with their backpacks, but all she could think about was what the ghost had said: jealousy could unravel everything they had.\n\nWhen they met at the park after school, the clouds hung low, darkening the sky, mirroring Mia\u2019s swirling thoughts. \"I brought the bracelet,\" Mia said, pulling it from her pocket. It sparkled ominously in the dim light. \n\nZoe's eyes widened. \"Are you sure we should? What if it... what if it causes more problems?\" \n\nMia hesitated, feeling the weight of the bracelet in her hand. \"But what if it can help us? We need to show it that we\u2019re friends, that we can work together.\"\n\nAs she slipped the bracelet onto her wrist, the air around them shimmered. Suddenly, a gust of wind swept through the park, swirling leaves around them like a tornado. \"Mia!\" Zoe shouted, but the wind seemed to drown out her voice.\n\nThen, from behind them, a familiar giggle echoed. The ghost appeared, her translucent form swirling with the breeze. \"Looks like you\u2019ve activated the magic! But remember, you must believe in each other. If jealousy creeps in, the bond will break!\" \n\nZoe\u2019s face paled, and she took a step back. \"I don\u2019t want to lose you to this... thing!\" \n\n\"Mia!\" the ghost called, urgency in her voice. \"Do you really trust Zoe? If you do, hold onto that trust, even in your darkest moments.\"\n\nMia glanced at Zoe, seeing the fear in her eyes. \"I do trust you, Zoe. We can figure this out together!\" \n\nAs if the words had unlocked a secret power, the wind calmed, and the leaves danced playfully back to the ground. The ghost smiled, a hint of warmth in her gaze. \"Remember, friendship is stronger than jealousy. Use that power wisely.\"\n\nThey stood silently, the weight of the bracelet between them now feeling lighter, filled with hope instead of dread. \n\n\"I guess we\u2019re in this together,\" Zoe said, a tentative smile breaking through her earlier fear. \n\n\"Always,\" Mia replied, and for the first time since discovering the bracelet, she felt a sense of clarity. They had a mission, and together they could face anything. \n\nBut as the sky darkened further, Mia couldn't shake the feeling that a storm was brewing, one that could test their bond more than they ever imagined.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Mia and Zoe find in the attic?","options":["A book","A friendship bracelet","A treasure chest","A ghost"],"correct_answer":"A friendship bracelet"},{"question":"What does the ghost warn Mia and Zoe about?","options":["The bracelet is cursed","Jealousy can unravel their friendship","They need to keep the bracelet hidden","They should never tell anyone"],"correct_answer":"Jealousy can unravel their friendship"},{"question":"Where do Mia and Zoe meet to discuss their plan?","options":["At school","In the attic","At the park","At the library"],"correct_answer":"At the park"},{"question":"What happens when Mia puts on the bracelet?","options":["It glows brightly","The wind picks up","It breaks","Nothing happens"],"correct_answer":"The wind picks up"},{"question":"What do Mia and Zoe reaffirm during their meeting?","options":["Their love for art","Their trust in each other","Their desire to find more treasures","Their fear of the ghost"],"correct_answer":"Their trust in each other"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_296_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_296_ch4_img1.png","plot_296_ch4_img2.png"]},"word_count":603,"reading_level":"Builder"}
