     [DEBUG] Vocabulary: {"0":"betray","1":"ethereal","2":"camaraderie","3":"reveal","4":"anticipation","image_prompts":["The attic of Maplewood Middle School, bathed in the warm glow of the setting sun. Dust motes dance in the air, illuminated by a shaft of light piercing through the small window. Amidst the clutter of forgotten treasures, the ancient friendship bracelet lies at the center, shimmering subtly, hinting at the magic and mystery it holds. Mia stands in the foreground, her expression a mixture of curiosity and concern, while Zoe peers over her shoulder, excitement flickering in her eyes.","A ghostly figure, glowing softly, hovers in front of Mia and Zoe in the attic. The atmosphere is charged with tension and intrigue, the dim light casting long shadows around them. The ghost has a mischievous smile, its eyes sparkling with wisdom and playfulness. Mia and Zoe stand close together, their expressions a blend of trepidation and determination, ready to face the unknown challenges posed by the bracelet and the revelations it promises."],"shared_images":{"1":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing The attic of Maplewood Middle School, bathed in the warm glow of the setting sun. Dust motes dance in the air, illuminated by a shaft of light piercing through the small window. Amidst the clutter of forgotten treasures, the ancient friendship bracelet lies at the center, shimmering subtly, hinting at the magic and mystery it holds. Mia stands in the foreground, her expression a mixture of curiosity and concern, while Zoe peers over her shoulder, excitement flickering in her eyes.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_296_ch4_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 13:33:40"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A ghostly figure, glowing softly, hovers in front of Mia and Zoe in the attic. The atmos