       [DEBUG] Checking shared image: {"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing Mia and Zoe stand in the attic, flanked by dusty boxes and old trophies, their expressions a mix of excitement and anxiety as they hold the shimmering friendship bracelet. The light from the attic window creates a halo effect around them, emphasizing the mystical quality of their discovery.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_296_ch1_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 13:35:56"}
