   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_296_15_18","title":"The Secret of the Friendship Bracelet","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Friend Drama","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Mia always believed there was magic hidden within the walls of Maplewood Middle School. Perhaps it was the creaking floorboards that whispered secrets, or the dust motes that danced in the shafts of light streaming through the tall windows. Today, however, her curiosity was about to take her to a place she had only ever dreamt of: the attic. \n\n\u201cAre you sure we should be up here?\u201d Zoe asked, her voice a mix of excitement and trepidation as they climbed the narrow staircase that led to the school's forgotten treasure trove. Zoe was the artistic one, with a flair for the dramatic. Her wild curls bounced as she glanced nervously around the dimly lit attic, where old furniture lay shrouded in white sheets like ghosts waiting to tell their stories.\n\n\u201cC\u2019mon, Zoe! Think of all the cool stuff we might find!\u201d Mia replied, her eyes sparkling with the thrill of adventure. As she reached for the rickety doorknob, a shiver of anticipation coursed through her. This was the moment she craved\u2014the start of an adventure that might just bring her and Zoe closer than ever. She pushed the door open, and a musty scent enveloped them.\n\nThe attic was cluttered with boxes, forgotten trophies, and old yearbooks. Mia\u2019s heart raced as she scanned the dust-covered surfaces. \u201cLook at this!\u201d she exclaimed, pulling a weathered box from beneath a pile of books. It slid open with a soft creak, revealing an ornate friendship bracelet, glinting in the dim light. \n\n\u201cWow, that\u2019s beautiful!\u201d Zoe said, her eyes widening as she leaned closer. It was intricately woven, with threads of silver and azure that shimmered like the midnight sky. \u201cDo you think it belonged to someone famous?\u201d\n\nMia shrugged, captivated by the bracelet\u2019s elegance. \u201cWho knows? Maybe it has a story to tell.\u201d She slipped it onto her wrist, feeling a sudden rush of warmth. The bracelet felt alive, as if it were waiting for something. \n\n\u201cHey, what if it\u2019s magical?\u201d Zoe teased, a playful grin spreading across her face. \u201cLike it can grant wishes or something?\u201d\n\n\u201cThat would be awesome,\u201d Mia replied, though part of her wondered if there was more to it than just a simple trinket. She felt a thrill course through her, as if the bracelet had awakened something deep within her. \n\nSuddenly, a chill swept through the attic, causing the dust motes to scatter like startled fireflies. \u201cDid you feel that?\u201d Mia asked, glancing nervously at Zoe. \n\nZoe nodded, her playful demeanor fading. \u201cYeah. It felt\u2026 weird.\u201d \n\nJust then, a flicker of movement caught Mia\u2019s eye. She turned to see a shadow dart across the far wall, flickering in and out of sight. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d \n\nZoe whipped her head around, her face pale. \u201cMia, I think we should go. This place feels haunted.\u201d \n\nBut Mia\u2019s curiosity outweighed her fear. \u201cNo, wait! Let\u2019s just check it out,\u201d she insisted, stepping cautiously toward the source of the movement. The bracelet pulsed against her wrist, a soft thrum echoing in her ears.\n\nAs they approached, the shadow coalesced into a transparent figure\u2014a mischievous grin stretched across its face. \u201cWelcome to my domain,\u201d it said, its voice echoing like the wind through the trees. \u201cYou\u2019ve found my bracelet! It holds the power to reveal your friendship\u2019s true colors.\u201d\n\nMia\u2019s heart raced, caught between wonder and dread. \u201cWhat do you mean?\u201d\n\nThe ghost chuckled, a sound like rustling leaves. \u201cEvery friendship has its secrets, its hidden depths. This bracelet will test the strength of yours. Are you ready to face what lies beneath?\u201d\n\nZoe glanced at Mia, uncertainty swirling in her eyes. \u201cMia, maybe we should just leave.\u201d\n\nBut before Mia could respond, the ghost\u2019s laughter filled the attic, enveloping them like a spell. \u201cYou cannot leave until you uncover the truth,\u201d it declared, its figure shimmering as if it were fading away. \n\nAs the ghost disappeared, Mia felt the weight of the bracelet on her wrist grow heavier, and an unsettling realization settled in her stomach. \u201cWhat have we gotten ourselves into?\u201d she whispered, glancing at Zoe, whose apprehensive expression mirrored her own.\n\n\u201cWe need to figure it out,\u201d Zoe replied, determination creeping back into her voice.\n\nWith that, the two friends stood on the threshold of a mystery that could either forge their bond stronger than ever or unravel it completely, the shadows of the attic looming ominously over them.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] would depict Mia and Zoe standing in the attic, surrounded by dusty boxes and old school memorabilia. The light is dim, with rays filtering in through the small attic windows, casting a magical glow on the ancient friendship bracelet that Mia holds. The expressions on their faces should convey a mix of thrill and apprehension, hinting at the adventure to come.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2] captures the ghostly figure in the attic, a spectral presence with a playful grin. The setting should be shadowy yet ethereal, with the bracelet glowing faintly on Mia\u2019s wrist, suggesting its mysterious powers. The atmosphere should evoke a sense of wonder, danger, and the unknown, reflecting the tension of the moment.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Mia and Zoe discover in the attic?","options":["A treasure map","An ancient friendship bracelet","A ghost","An old yearbook"],"correct_answer":"An ancient friendship bracelet"},{"question":"What did the ghost say about the bracelet?","options":["It was cursed","It granted wishes","It revealed friendship\u2019s true colors","It belonged to a famous person"],"correct_answer":"It revealed friendship\u2019s true colors"},{"question":"How did Mia feel when she first put on the bracelet?","options":["Cold","Excited and warm","Indifferent","Fearful"],"correct_answer":"Excited and warm"},{"question":"What is Zoe's personality like?","options":["Cautious and artistic","Brave and reckless","Indifferent and aloof","Skeptical and sarcastic"],"correct_answer":"Cautious and artistic"},{"question":"What does the ghost imply about the challenges Mia and Zoe will face?","options":["They will find treasure","They will become famous","They will reveal their friendship\u2019s secrets","They will face a monster"],"correct_answer":"They will reveal their friendship\u2019s secrets"}]},"images":null,"word_count":865,"reading_level":"Challenger"}
