   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_296_15_18","title":"The Secret of the Friendship Bracelet","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Friend Drama","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Mia stared at the old friendship bracelet, its intricate patterns glinting in the dim light of the attic. Dust motes danced around her, illuminated by a feeble beam of sunlight filtering through a small window. Zoe leaned against a stack of forgotten boxes, her brow furrowed as she scrutinized the bracelet, a twinge of uncertainty in her eyes.\n\n\u201cDo you really think this thing has powers?\u201d Zoe asked, her voice laced with skepticism. It was a question Mia had been grappling with ever since the ghost had appeared\u2014an ethereal boy who claimed the bracelet could amplify friendship but at a cost.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, but I feel like we should at least try it,\u201d Mia replied, her adventurous spirit igniting at the thought of uncovering a hidden treasure that could bind them together even more tightly. \u201cWhat if it really does strengthen our friendship?\u201d\n\nZoe crossed her arms, a shadow of doubt flickering in her gaze. \u201cOr what if it tears us apart? What if we end up like\u2026\u201d she hesitated, \u201clike those girls in the stories who let jealousy ruin everything?\u201d \n\nMia felt a sharp pang in her chest. She had sensed the undercurrents of jealousy between them lately, particularly after Zoe\u2019s art piece received acclaim in school. But the idea of letting something so trivial come between them felt absurd. \u201cWe\u2019re not them. We\u2019re stronger,\u201d she declared, the words spilling from her mouth with a confidence she didn\u2019t entirely feel.\n\nBut as they stood together in the attic, the air thick with anticipation, Mia could sense the ghost\u2019s disapproval lurking just out of sight. \u201cOkay, let\u2019s make a pact,\u201d she said suddenly, her heart racing. \u201cWe\u2019ll wear the bracelet together and promise to communicate. No secrets, no jealousy.\u201d\n\nZoe hesitated, biting her lip as if weighing the gravity of the promise. Finally, she nodded, albeit reluctantly. \u201cFine, but if things get weird\u2014\u201d\n\n\u201cThey won\u2019t,\u201d Mia interrupted, slipping the bracelet onto her wrist. It felt cool and alive against her skin, like a pulse of energy at her fingertips. Zoe followed suit, her fingers trembling slightly as she secured it around her wrist.\n\nAs they descended the attic stairs, a chill slithered down Mia's spine, and the lights flickered ominously. \u201cDid you feel that?\u201d she asked, glancing over her shoulder, but Zoe remained silent, lost in thought.\n\nThe next day at school, awkwardness hung between them like a thick fog. Zoe's art project was on display, a beautiful painting that captured the essence of friendship, but instead of pride, Mia felt a stab of envy. What had started as admiration morphed into an internal struggle she didn\u2019t want to confront.\n\nDuring lunch, Mia watched as Zoe chatted animatedly with a group of students, her laughter ringing like music. Mia\u2019s heart sank as she felt like a ghost herself, standing on the sidelines. The bracelet\u2019s power was supposed to strengthen their bond, yet it seemed to highlight their differences instead. She could feel the bracelet tightening on her wrist, a physical reminder of the emotional chasm growing between them.\n\nJust then, an unexpected commotion drew Mia\u2019s attention. A loud crash echoed from the art room, followed by a flurry of whispers. The ghost materialized beside her, his expression mischievous. \u201cBrace yourself,\u201d he warned, his voice barely a whisper. \u201cThe bracelet has awakened something.\"\n\nBefore Mia could process his words, a flurry of paintbrushes flew across the room, swirling in a chaotic dance. Gasps erupted from the students as they ducked for cover. \u201cZoe!\u201d Mia shouted, dashing toward the art room, where she found Zoe staring wide-eyed at the chaos.\n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s happening?\u201d Zoe yelled, trying to shield her artwork with her body.\n\n\u201cTry to control it!\u201d Mia urged, but the more Zoe focused, the more the brushes seemed to rebel, swirling in a tempestuous frenzy. \n\nMia\u2019s heart raced as she reached for her friend. \u201cZoe, we have to work together! Focus on our promise!\u201d\n\nAs they clasped their wrists together, the bracelet shimmered ominously. Bright light enveloped them, creating a barrier against the chaos. In that moment, a rush of emotions surged through Mia\u2014fear, jealousy, love\u2014all coalescing into a single realization.\n\nBut before she could voice it, the light exploded in a brilliant flash, sending both girls crashing to the floor, separated from one another. The room echoed with silence except for the distant laughter of the ghost, who hovered just out of reach. \n\nMia scrambled to her feet, panic clawing at her throat. \u201cZoe!\u201d \n\nThe ghost smirked, his eyes glinting like stars. \u201cDo you truly understand the power of that bracelet now?\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs the dust settled, Mia turned to the ghost, her resolve hardening. \u201cWhat do you want from us?\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cOnly to show you what your friendship is made of,\u201d he replied cryptically, his form wavering like a flickering candle. \u201cEmbrace the truth, or watch it unravel.\u201d\n\nMia\u2019s mind raced. With the bracelet's power unleashed, she knew they had to confront their emotions head-on. What was at stake was not just the bracelet but the very fabric of their friendship.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What major event occurs in the art room?","options":["A painting is completed","Paintbrushes fly around chaotically","A new student arrives","A film is shown"],"correct_answer":"Paintbrushes fly around chaotically"},{"question":"What does Mia urge Zoe to do during the chaos?","options":["Run away","Focus on their promise","Laugh it off","Ignore the ghost"],"correct_answer":"Focus on their promise"},{"question":"What does the ghost challenge Mia and Zoe to embrace?","options":["Their differences","The truth of their friendship","The powers of the bracelet","Their jealousy"],"correct_answer":"The truth of their friendship"},{"question":"How does Mia feel as she watches Zoe interact with other students?","options":["Proud","Indifferent","Jealous","Happy"],"correct_answer":"Jealous"},{"question":"What promise do Mia and Zoe make regarding the bracelet?","options":["To keep it a secret","To wear it only at school","To communicate openly","To show it off to others"],"correct_answer":"To communicate openly"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_296_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_296_ch3_img1.png","plot_296_ch3_img2.png"]},"word_count":863,"reading_level":"Challenger"}
