   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_298_7_10","title":"The Mystery of the Vanishing Lunch","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Friend Drama","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Sarah sat at her usual spot in the Crestview Elementary cafeteria. The rows of tables were filled with students laughing and sharing their lunches. She could smell the delicious pizza that everyone else was eating. \n\n\"Hey, Sarah! You\u2019re going to eat that apple, right?\" Lily asked, sliding into the seat beside her. Lily had curly brown hair and wore a bright yellow dress that matched her sunny personality. \n\nSarah nodded, smiling. \"Of course! I love apples.\" But she had a sinking feeling. This was the third time this week that her lunch had disappeared.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs the lunch bell rang, Sarah spotted Raj at the next table. He was the smartest kid in class, with glasses that slid down his nose. Sarah waved. \"Hey, Raj! Have you seen my lunch today?\"\n\nRaj looked up, nibbling on a slice of pizza. \"Not today. But I have a feeling it\u2019s the same lunch thief again!\"\n\nLily giggled, but Sarah felt uneasy. \"What if it\u2019s you, Lily?\" she teased, trying to keep it light. But deep down, she wondered if her best friend could be behind the vanishing food.\n\n\"Me? Never!\" Lily laughed, but her eyes seemed sad for a moment. Sarah noticed that.\n\nAfter lunch, Sarah decided to investigate. She followed Lily through the noisy hallways. \"I have to find out what\u2019s really happening,\" Sarah murmured to herself. \n\nSuddenly, she spotted Lily looking into her backpack. Sarah crept closer. Lily had a small bag of cookies, her favorite! \"Why didn't you share those?\" Sarah blurted out.\n\nLily jumped. \"I was saving them! I thought you wouldn\u2019t want any,\" she replied. Her cheeks turned pink.\n\n\"Of course, I love cookies!\" Sarah exclaimed, feeling a little guilty. She didn\u2019t want to blame Lily if something was wrong. \n\nCould there be more to this mystery? Sarah's heart raced. She had to get to the bottom of it, or she might lose her best friend.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\"Let\u2019s meet after school,\" Sarah said, determination in her voice. \"We can figure this out together.\"\n\n\"Okay!\" Lily smiled, but Sarah could still see a shadow of worry on her face. What if Lily needed help? What if she needed a friend?\n\nAs the bell rang, signaling the end of lunch, Sarah knew she had a big decision to make. \n\nWould she confront Lily or help her through her struggles? \n\nShe took a deep breath. \"I\u2019ll find out the truth,\" she whispered, feeling a sense of adventure rising inside her.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Where does Sarah sit during lunch?","options":["At home","In the library","In the cafeteria","In the classroom"],"correct_answer":"In the cafeteria"},{"question":"What did Lily wear to school?","options":["A red dress","A blue shirt","A bright yellow dress","A green hat"],"correct_answer":"A bright yellow dress"},{"question":"What is missing from Sarah's lunch?","options":["Her apple","Her sandwich","Her lunch","Her juice"],"correct_answer":"Her lunch"},{"question":"Who did Sarah ask about her lunch?","options":["Raj","Lily","Her teacher","No one"],"correct_answer":"Raj"},{"question":"What does Sarah decide to do at the end of the chapter?","options":["Ignore the problem","Tell a teacher","Investigate the mystery","Give up"],"correct_answer":"Investigate the mystery"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_298_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_298_ch1_img1.png","plot_298_ch1_img2.png","story_298_7-10_ch1_img1_1751270975.png","story_298_7-10_ch1_img2_1751270991.png"]},"word_count":420,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
