   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_298_7_10","title":"The Mystery of the Vanishing Lunch","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Friend Drama","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Chapter 2: The Secret of the Cafeteria\n\nThe next day, Sarah sat at her usual spot in the cafeteria. The bright lights shone down on the tables, and the buzz of laughter filled the air. But Sarah's heart felt heavy. She opened her lunchbox, and her favorite peanut butter sandwich was gone! \n\n\"Where is it?\" she whispered to herself. \n\nLily rushed over with a smile, her hair bouncing as she walked. \"Hey, Sarah! Ready for lunch?\" \n\n\"Um, I guess,\" Sarah replied, trying to sound cheerful. She looked at Lily closely. Did her best friend look different? \n\nJust then, Raj, their clever classmate, approached. \"Hey, Sarah! What\u2019s wrong?\" \n\n\"My lunch keeps disappearing!\" Sarah exclaimed. \"I think it\u2019s Lily!\" \n\nLily's smile faded. \"What? Why would I take your lunch?\" \n\nSarah felt a twinge of guilt. \"I don\u2019t know, but I need to find out!\" \n\nRaj thought for a moment. \"Maybe we can set a trap! Like a lunch bait!\" \n\n\"That\u2019s a great idea!\" exclaimed Sarah, her eyes lighting up. \n\nThey gathered chocolate cookies, Sarah\u2019s favorite, to lure the lunch thief. Raj grinned. \"Let\u2019s hide the cookies in your lunchbox and watch.\" \n\nAs they plotted, Sarah felt a mix of excitement and worry. What if Lily really was the thief? And if she was, why would she do it?\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAfter school, they hid behind a big plant near the cafeteria window. They could see Lily sitting at a table, looking sad. \n\n\"Look!\" whispered Raj, pointing. \"She looks like she\u2019s waiting for someone.\" \n\nSarah squinted. Lily kept glancing at a lunchbox on the table next to her. \"What if she needs lunch?\" \n\nJust then, a small boy approached Lily. \"I\u2019m hungry! Can I have some of your lunch?\" \n\nSarah\u2019s heart sank as she watched Lily nod, sharing her food without another thought. \n\n\"She\u2019s giving away her lunch? What\u2019s going on?\" Sarah whispered, feeling confused. \n\nWhen the boy left, Sarah felt a new wave of emotion. Maybe Lily wasn\u2019t taking her lunch after all. \n\n\"Should we talk to her?\" Raj suggested. \n\n\"I think we should,\" Sarah replied, her voice steady. \n\nAs they approached, Sarah felt nervous. What would she say? \n\n\"Hey, Lily!\" Sarah called out, her heart racing. \n\nLily looked up, her eyes wide. \"Sarah! Raj! What are you doing here?\" \n\n\"We saw you share your lunch,\" Sarah said softly. \"Are you okay?\" \n\nLily\u2019s face fell. \"I just wanted to help him. He\u2019s always hungry.\" \n\nNow, Sarah understood. The mystery was deeper than she thought. But how could she help Lily while still being upset about her missing lunches? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\"Lily, we can figure this out together,\" Sarah said. \"Maybe we can share our lunches with him too.\" \n\nLily smiled, relief washing over her face. \"Really? You\u2019d do that?\" \n\n\"Of course!\" Sarah replied, feeling the warmth of friendship return. \n\nBut just then, a thought struck her. \"Wait! What if we do a lunch swap? We can help each other!\" \n\nLily\u2019s eyes sparkled. \"That sounds perfect!\" \n\nThey both laughed, and for a moment, the mystery of the vanishing lunches faded away. But Sarah knew they still had challenges ahead. Would sharing lunches help? \n\nAs they walked home, Sarah felt a new sense of hope. Maybe together, they could make things better.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Sarah notice about her lunch at the beginning of the chapter?","options":["It's missing","It's too big","It tastes bad","It's exciting"],"correct_answer":"It's missing"},{"question":"Who helps Sarah come up with a plan?","options":["Raj","Lily","The teacher","The lunch lady"],"correct_answer":"Raj"},{"question":"What does Lily do with her lunch?","options":["She eats it all","She gives it to a hungry boy","She hides it","She throws it away"],"correct_answer":"She gives it to a hungry boy"},{"question":"How does Sarah feel when she sees Lily sharing her lunch?","options":["Angry","Confused","Happy","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Confused"},{"question":"What do Sarah and Lily decide to do together?","options":["Make a lunch swap","Fight over lunch","Ignore each other","Tell the teacher"],"correct_answer":"Make a lunch swap"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_298_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_298_ch2_img1.png","plot_298_ch2_img2.png","story_298_7-10_ch2_img1_1751270939.png","story_298_7-10_ch2_img2_1751270959.png"]},"word_count":553,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
