   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_298_7_10","title":"The Mystery of the Vanishing Lunch","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Friend Drama","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Sarah stood in the bustling cafeteria, her eyes darting from table to table. The bright colors of students\u2019 lunches made her belly rumble. She spotted Lily sitting with Raj, giggling as they shared a pizza slice. \u201cWhy does Lily look so happy?\u201d Sarah wondered. \n\n\u201cHey, Sarah!\u201d Raj waved, his smile wide. \u201cCome join us!\u201d\n\nSarah grabbed her lunchbox and walked over. \u201cDid you see? My lunch is gone again!\u201d She tried to sound cheerful, but her voice wobbled.\n\n\u201cMaybe it\u2019s a ghost!\u201d Raj joked, laughing. But Sarah frowned. It wasn\u2019t funny. \n\nLily\u2019s face turned serious. \u201cI\u2019m so sorry, Sarah. I really wish I could help.\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSarah's heart sank. \u201cHelp with what?\u201d she asked, confused. \n\n\u201cIt's just... at home, things are tough,\u201d Lily whispered, looking down. \u201cSometimes I can\u2019t bring food. I see kids who really need it. I thought... maybe it wouldn\u2019t hurt to share.\u201d \n\nSarah felt a knot in her stomach. \u201cBut what about me? I need my lunch too!\u201d\n\n\u201cI know,\u201d Lily said softly, her eyes filling with tears. \u201cI thought we could share lunch together. Some days, I don\u2019t have enough. I'm just trying to help.\u201d\n\nA silence filled the air, heavy and thick. Sarah looked at Raj, who seemed just as puzzled. \u201cYou could have told me,\u201d Sarah muttered, feeling hurt and worried. \n\nLily nodded. \u201cI\u2019m sorry, Sarah. I didn\u2019t want you to worry. I didn\u2019t mean for it to be a secret.\u201d\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s help each other,\u201d Raj suggested, breaking the tension. \u201cWe can all share! But we need to find a solution.\u201d\n\n\u201cYeah! We can take turns bringing snacks!\u201d Sarah's face brightened. \u201cI could bring my special cookies!\u201d\n\nLily smiled through her tears. \u201cThat sounds yummy!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, the lunch bell rang loudly, echoing through the cafeteria. \u201cUh-oh! Time for class!\u201d Raj exclaimed, grabbing his tray. \n\n\u201cNo!\u201d Sarah groaned. \u201cWhat do we do now?\u201d\n\nAs they rushed to the door, Sarah felt a rush of hope. Maybe this mystery was about more than just missing lunches. Maybe it was about being true friends. But did she have the courage to talk to Lily again? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nWhat if there were more secrets to uncover? Sarah\u2019s heart raced. She needed to decide fast.\n\n\u201cWait!\u201d Sarah shouted. \u201cI\u2019ll meet you guys after class!\u201d \n\nShe turned back, staring at Lily. \u201cWe need to talk more, okay?\u201d \n\nLily nodded, her eyes wide with understanding. \n\nAs Sarah hurried to class, she wondered what other surprises lay ahead. Could uncovering the truth save their friendship?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Sarah keep losing?","options":["Her pencil","Her lunch","Her book","Her backpack"],"correct_answer":"Her lunch"},{"question":"What does Lily do with her lunch?","options":["Eats it all","Shares it with others","Hides it","Throws it away"],"correct_answer":"Shares it with others"},{"question":"Who helps Sarah with her mystery?","options":["Lily","Raj","Tom","Mrs. Smith"],"correct_answer":"Raj"},{"question":"What new plan do the friends come up with?","options":["To stop eating","To eat alone","To share snacks","To bring more food"],"correct_answer":"To share snacks"},{"question":"What does Sarah want to talk to Lily about?","options":["Schoolwork","Lunch recipes","Their friendship","Her new toy"],"correct_answer":"Their friendship"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_298_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_298_ch3_img1.png","plot_298_ch3_img2.png","story_298_7-10_ch3_img1_1751270898.png","story_298_7-10_ch3_img2_1751270918.png"]},"word_count":428,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
