   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_298_7_10","title":"The Mystery of the Vanishing Lunch","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Friend Drama","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Chapter 5: The Big Reveal\n\nThe cafeteria buzzed with laughter and chatter. Sarah felt excited but also a little nervous. Today was the day she would talk to Lily. She took a deep breath and walked over to her friend.\n\n\u201cLily, can we talk?\u201d Sarah asked. Her voice was steady, but her heart raced.\n\n\u201cSure!\u201d Lily replied, her eyes shining. \u201cWhat\u2019s on your mind?\u201d\n\nSarah glanced around to make sure no one was listening. \u201cI know you\u2019ve been sharing my lunch. I want to help, but I also want to understand why.\u201d\n\nLily looked down at her feet. \u201cI... I didn\u2019t want to tell you,\u201d she whispered. \u201cThere\u2019s a new girl in our class, Mia. She didn\u2019t have lunch yesterday. I felt bad.\u201d\n\nSarah\u2019s heart softened. \u201cOh, Lily! I didn\u2019t know that.\u201d\n\nJust then, Raj joined them. \u201cWhat\u2019s going on?\u201d he asked, sensing the seriousness.\n\n\u201cLily has been sharing my lunch with Mia,\u201d Sarah explained. \u201cI thought she was stealing it!\u201d\n\nLily nodded, her cheeks flushed. \u201cI felt like I had to help her. I didn\u2019t mean to hurt you, Sarah.\u201d\n\nSarah smiled gently. \u201cYou\u2019re such a good friend. But we can help Mia together!\u201d\n\nLily\u2019s eyes lit up. \u201cReally? You would do that with me?\u201d\n\n\u201cOf course! Let\u2019s make extra snack packs!\u201d Sarah exclaimed.\n\nThe three friends huddled together, brainstorming ideas. They decided to create a lunch club. Each week, they would bring extra snacks for anyone who needed them.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSarah, Lily, and Raj started making colorful snack packs. They filled them with fruits, crackers, and cookies. Laughter filled the air as they shared their favorite treats.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s call it the \u2018Snack Squad!\u2019\u201d Raj suggested, grinning.\n\n\u201cI love it!\u201d Sarah and Lily cheered.\n\nAs they packed the last few snacks, Sarah felt proud. \u201cWe\u2019re building a friendship, not just for us, but for Mia too.\u201d\n\n\u201cThank you for understanding, Sarah,\u201d Lily said softly. \u201cYou mean a lot to me.\u201d\n\n\u201cI care about you, Lily. Friends help each other,\u201d Sarah replied. \n\nThey finished their project just in time for lunch. The cafeteria was full of hungry kids. Sarah looked around and saw Mia sitting alone. She felt a little nervous, but she knew what to do.\n\n\u201cCome on!\u201d Sarah said, waving Mia over. \u201cJoin the Snack Squad!\u201d\n\nMia\u2019s eyes widened with surprise. \u201cReally? Are you sure?\u201d\n\n\u201cOf course! Everyone is welcome!\u201d Lily added, smiling brightly.\n\nMia smiled and sat down with them. Sarah felt a warm glow in her heart. They were helping each other, and it felt wonderful.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAs they shared their snacks, laughter and joy filled the table. Sarah realized that food could be more than just lunch. It could bring friends together. \n\n\u201cThank you, Sarah and Lily,\u201d Mia said, munching on a cookie. \u201cYou\u2019re the best!\u201d\n\nThe three girls grinned at each other. Sarah thought about how the missing lunches had led to something special. \n\n\u201cMaybe we can invite even more friends next week!\u201d Raj suggested.\n\n\u201cYes!\u201d Sarah agreed. \u201cLet\u2019s spread the Snack Squad joy!\u201d\n\nAnd with that, Sarah felt excited about their new adventure. She knew that this was just the beginning of something wonderful.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Lily do with Sarah's lunch?","options":["A. Gave it away","B. Ate it","C. Threw it away","D. Hid it"],"correct_answer":"A. Gave it away"},{"question":"What is the name of the lunch club they created?","options":["A. Snack Squad","B. Lunch Bunch","C. Food Friends","D. Yummy Club"],"correct_answer":"A. Snack Squad"},{"question":"How did Mia feel when invited to join the group?","options":["A. Angry","B. Surprised","C. Sad","D. Confused"],"correct_answer":"B. Surprised"},{"question":"What did Sarah want to do for Mia?","options":["A. Ignore her","B. Help her","C. Take her lunch","D. Leave her alone"],"correct_answer":"B. Help her"},{"question":"What emotion did Sarah feel at the end of the chapter?","options":["A. Anger","B. Sadness","C. Excitement","D. Fear"],"correct_answer":"C. Excitement"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_298_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_298_ch5_img1.png","plot_298_ch5_img2.png","story_298_7-10_ch5_img1_1751270832.png","story_298_7-10_ch5_img2_1751270848.png"]},"word_count":539,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
