   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_299_7_10","title":"The BFF Band Break-Up","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Friend Drama","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Ellie and Maya were best friends. They did everything together, especially when it came to music. Ellie was a passionate guitarist. She loved to strum her guitar and create new songs. Maya was a shy but talented singer. Her voice was like a soft breeze, sweet and calming. Together, they made a great team.  \n\nOne sunny morning, they rushed into the school\u2019s music room. It was filled with colorful instruments. Drums, violins, and trumpets were everywhere! The walls were painted bright yellow and blue. Ellie shouted, \u201cI can\u2019t believe we got into the music festival!\u201d  \n\n\u201cMe too!\u201d Maya replied, her eyes sparkling. \u201cThis is our chance!\u201d  \n\nJust then, Jake, their quirky drummer, burst through the door. He wore a bright red hat that was way too big. \u201cHey, bandmates! Ready to rock?\u201d he said, bouncing up and down.  \n\n\u201cYes!\u201d Ellie and Maya cheered. They grabbed their instruments. Ellie picked up her guitar, and Maya grabbed the microphone.  \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]  \n\nThe music room filled with sounds. Ellie strummed her guitar while Maya sang softly. They felt the rhythm. Everything was perfect until Ellie said, \u201cLet\u2019s make our song faster! It will be exciting!\u201d  \n\nMaya frowned, \u201cBut I like it slow. It\u2019s more beautiful that way.\u201d  \n\nEllie\u2019s smile faded. \u201cBut we need to get the crowd moving!\u201d  \n\nMaya crossed her arms. \u201cYou just want it your way!\u201d  \n\nEllie sighed. \u201cAnd you\u2019re being too shy!\u201d  \n\nTension hung in the air. Jake tried to break the silence. \u201cHey, let\u2019s take a break! How about some cookies?\u201d  \n\n\u201cCookies won\u2019t help us!\u201d Ellie snapped.  \n\n\u201cYeah, we need to figure this out!\u201d Maya added, her voice shaky.  \n\nThe band was in trouble. With the festival just days away, their friendship felt shaky too. Could they find a way to make their music and friendship work?  \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s practice again tomorrow,\u201d Maya suggested quietly.  \n\n\u201cOkay,\u201d Ellie said, but her heart felt heavy.  \n\nHow could they find their rhythm again?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What instrument does Ellie play?","options":["Piano","Guitar","Drums","Violin"],"correct_answer":"Guitar"},{"question":"How does Maya feel about the song's speed?","options":["She wants it faster","She likes it slow","She wants to change it completely","She doesn't care"],"correct_answer":"She likes it slow"},{"question":"What is Jake's role in the band?","options":["Guitarist","Drummer","Singer","Pianist"],"correct_answer":"Drummer"},{"question":"What do Ellie and Maya argue about?","options":["Their friendship","The weather","The song's speed","The festival location"],"correct_answer":"The song's speed"},{"question":"What does Jake suggest to lighten the mood?","options":["Playing a different song","Taking a break","Eating cookies","Practicing harder"],"correct_answer":"Eating cookies"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_299_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_299_ch1_img1.png","plot_299_ch1_img2.png","story_299_7-10_ch1_img1_1751270402.png","story_299_7-10_ch1_img2_1751270423.png"]},"word_count":329,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
