   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_299_7_10","title":"The BFF Band Break-Up","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Friend Drama","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Ellie and Maya sat in the music room, surrounded by instruments. The sun shone through the windows, lighting up the colorful posters of famous bands. Jake, their quirky drummer, bounced in place, his drumsticks in hand.\n\n\u201cThis is going to be awesome!\u201d Jake shouted. \u201cI can\u2019t wait for the festival!\u201d\n\nEllie strummed her guitar, feeling the excitement. \u201cMe too! Let\u2019s play our song again!\u201d\n\nMaya took a deep breath. \u201cOkay, but can we change the tempo a little? It feels too fast.\u201d\n\nEllie\u2019s smile faded. \u201cBut I like it fast! It sounds more fun!\u201d\n\nMaya frowned. \u201cI don\u2019t know. It makes me nervous.\u201d\n\nJake looked between them. \u201cHey! Let\u2019s just try both ways. We can decide together!\u201d\n\n\u201cFine,\u201d Ellie said, crossing her arms. \u201cBut my way is better!\u201d\n\nMaya sighed. \u201cMaybe we should just practice alone.\u201d\n\nEllie felt a twist in her stomach. \u201cWhat? Are we really going to do this?\u201d\n\nThe tension grew as they each picked up their instruments. They started to play, but it didn\u2019t feel right. The notes clashed instead of dancing together. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cStop!\u201d Ellie yelled. \u201cThis isn\u2019t working!\u201d\n\n\u201cMaybe we need a break,\u201d Maya suggested, her voice barely above a whisper.\n\nJust then, the door swung open. Mr. Thompson, their music teacher, peeked in. \u201cWhat\u2019s going on here?\u201d\n\n\u201cWe\u2019re having\u2026 a disagreement,\u201d Jake said, scratching his head.\n\nMr. Thompson smiled gently. \u201cMusic is like a puzzle. Sometimes, you need to try different pieces. Work together to find the melody.\u201d\n\nEllie and Maya exchanged glances. \u201cWe need to fix this,\u201d Ellie said firmly.\n\n\u201cOkay,\u201d Maya replied. \u201cLet\u2019s try the slow version together.\u201d\n\nAs they played, something amazing happened. The slower tempo felt peaceful. Their voices blended like colors in the sky. \n\nSuddenly, a loud crash sounded from the back of the room. A stack of music books had toppled over! Ellie, Maya, and Jake jumped up, startled.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cWhat was that?\u201d Maya gasped, her heart racing.\n\nJake rushed to see. \u201cIt\u2019s just some books. But look!\u201d He pointed. \u201cThey fell open to a song! It\u2019s perfect for us!\u201d\n\nEllie\u2019s eyes sparkled. \u201cMaybe it\u2019s a sign!\u201d\n\n\u201cMaybe we can put our song together with this one!\u201d Maya said, her excitement returning.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s do it!\u201d Jake cheered.\n\nWith renewed energy, they gathered the books and started to experiment with new sounds. They were back on track, but the challenge wasn\u2019t over yet.\n\nCould they really create a new song that combined their ideas?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Ellie and Maya disagree about?","options":["The tempo of the song","The name of the band","Jake's drumming","The music room color"],"correct_answer":"The tempo of the song"},{"question":"Who gives advice to Ellie and Maya?","options":["Mr. Thompson","Jake","Their parents","The principal"],"correct_answer":"Mr. Thompson"},{"question":"What falls over in the music room?","options":["A guitar","A stack of music books","A drum set","A microphone"],"correct_answer":"A stack of music books"},{"question":"What do Ellie and Maya decide to do after the books fall?","options":["Take a break","Practice alone","Combine their ideas","Quit the band"],"correct_answer":"Combine their ideas"},{"question":"How do Ellie and Maya feel at the end of the chapter?","options":["Excited and hopeful","Angry and upset","Tired and bored","Confused and lost"],"correct_answer":"Excited and hopeful"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_299_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_299_ch2_img1.png","plot_299_ch2_img2.png","story_299_7-10_ch2_img1_1751270371.png","story_299_7-10_ch2_img2_1751270387.png"]},"word_count":424,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
