   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_299_7_10","title":"The BFF Band Break-Up","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Friend Drama","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"The music room was alive with sounds of laughter and chatter. Ellie strummed her guitar softly, trying to find the right notes. Maya sat beside her, tapping her fingers nervously on the table. Jake, their quirky drummer, entered with a big smile.\n\n\u201cHey, bandmates! Ready to rock?\u201d Jake exclaimed. He wore a bright yellow headband that made Ellie giggle.\n\n\u201cSure! But we need to talk about the song first,\u201d Maya said, her voice quiet but firm. She looked at Ellie with a hint of worry.\n\nEllie took a deep breath. \u201cOkay. Let\u2019s make it great together!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] \n\nThe music room was colorful, with posters of famous bands on the walls and a big window letting in the sunlight. Instruments were scattered everywhere. It was their happy place, but today felt different. \n\nAs they started to play, Ellie noticed that Maya hesitated. \u201cWhat\u2019s wrong?\u201d Ellie asked, pausing.\n\n\u201cI just\u2026 I\u2019m not sure about the lyrics,\u201d Maya whispered, looking down. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s change them! We need them to match our style,\u201d Ellie suggested, feeling hopeful. \n\nMaya nodded slowly. \u201cOkay, but I want to make sure it\u2019s soft and sweet. Like a lullaby.\u201d\n\n\u201cBut we need some energy! We need to get the crowd clapping!\u201d Ellie replied, her fingers tapping impatiently on her guitar. \n\nJust then, Jake chimed in, \u201cHow about we mix both ideas? A soft verse and a loud chorus! It could be fun!\u201d\n\nEllie and Maya exchanged glances. \u201cThat could work!\u201d they said together, their eyes lighting up.\n\nAs they practiced, they felt their friendship start to heal. Every note they played brought them a little closer. They laughed together when they messed up, and they cheered when they got it right.\n\nSuddenly, Maya had an idea. \u201cWhat if we add a dance move? It will be fun!\u201d\n\n\u201cGreat idea! Let\u2019s try it!\u201d Ellie exclaimed, her excitement bubbling over.\n\nThey worked hard, and soon they were giggling and dancing along with the music. It felt like they had found their rhythm again. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nBut just as they were about to finish, Maya looked serious. \u201cEllie, what if we still can\u2019t get it right before the festival?\u201d\n\nEllie smiled gently. \u201cWe will. We have each other. We\u2019re the BFF Band, remember? No matter what happens, we\u2019ll do this together!\u201d\n\nThe two friends smiled, feeling a rush of hope. They gathered their instruments, ready to practice again. Together, they could conquer anything. \n\nAs they packed up, Ellie thought about the festival. \u201cI can\u2019t wait to see everyone\u2019s faces when we play!\u201d\n\n\u201cMe too!\u201d Maya replied, her voice filled with excitement. \n\nThey walked out of the music room side by side, ready for whatever came next.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Jake wear that makes Ellie giggle?","options":["A blue hat","A red t-shirt","A bright yellow headband","A green scarf"],"correct_answer":"A bright yellow headband"},{"question":"What is Maya unsure about?","options":["The dance moves","The lyrics","The instruments","The audience"],"correct_answer":"The lyrics"},{"question":"What idea does Jake suggest for the song?","options":["A loud verse","A soft chorus","Mixing both ideas","Adding more instruments"],"correct_answer":"Mixing both ideas"},{"question":"What do Ellie and Maya feel as they practice together?","options":["Angry","Sad","Hopeful","Tired"],"correct_answer":"Hopeful"},{"question":"What is the name of their band?","options":["The Music Makers","The BFF Band","The Festival Stars","The Rock Stars"],"correct_answer":"The BFF Band"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_299_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_299_ch4_img1.png","plot_299_ch4_img2.png","story_299_7-10_ch4_img1_1751270297.png","story_299_7-10_ch4_img2_1751270318.png"]},"word_count":455,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
