   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_299_7_10","title":"The BFF Band Break-Up","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Friend Drama","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Ellie and Maya stood in the music room. The walls were filled with colorful posters of famous bands. Instruments were everywhere\u2014guitars, drums, and even a shiny piano. The air buzzed with excitement for the upcoming music festival. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s make our song amazing!\u201d Ellie said, her eyes sparkling.\n\nMaya smiled shyly. \u201cYes! But we need to agree on the parts.\u201d\n\nThey had been creative rivals lately. Ellie loved loud, fast guitar riffs. Maya preferred soft, gentle melodies. They had to find a way to mix their styles. \n\n\u201cMaybe we can try something new together?\u201d Jake suggested, tapping his drumsticks on a chair. He wore a big grin. \u201cLet\u2019s brainstorm ideas!\u201d\n\n\u201cGood idea!\u201d Ellie said. \u201cHow about we start with the melody?\u201d\n\n\u201cI love that!\u201d Maya replied. \u201cBut can we make it a little slower?\u201d\n\nEllie frowned. \u201cSlower? But that\u2019s not like me.\u201d\n\nMaya looked down. \u201cI just want to make sure everyone can sing along.\u201d\n\nEllie took a deep breath. \u201cOkay, let\u2019s try it your way first. Then we can add my guitar later.\u201d\n\nThey began to play. Ellie strummed softly, and Maya sang gently. But something was still off. They exchanged glances, feeling frustrated. \n\nSuddenly, Ellie had an idea. \u201cWhat if we have a fun chorus? Something everyone can dance to?\u201d\n\nMaya\u2019s face lit up. \u201cThat sounds great! We can combine our styles!\u201d\n\nWith renewed energy, they worked together. Ellie played a catchy riff, and Maya sang bright lyrics. Jake kept the beat, adding excitement. \n\nBefore long, they created a song that made them all smile. \"This is it!\" Ellie shouted, jumping up. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s perfect!\u201d Maya said, clapping her hands. \u201cWe did it!\u201d\n\n\u201cI knew we could!\u201d Jake cheered. \n\nFinally, they were ready. They practiced over and over, laughing and encouraging each other. The music room echoed with their new song. \n\nAs they finished, they hugged tightly. \u201cI\u2019m so glad we\u2019re friends,\u201d Ellie said.\n\n\u201cMe too,\u201d Maya replied, her voice filled with joy. \u201cNow let's show everyone at the festival!\u201d \n\nThey left the music room, ready for the big day. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Ellie and Maya need to agree on?","options":["The lyrics","The parts of the song","The instruments","The music room"],"correct_answer":"The parts of the song"},{"question":"What instrument does Ellie play?","options":["Piano","Drums","Guitar","Violin"],"correct_answer":"Guitar"},{"question":"What suggestion does Jake make?","options":["To sing louder","To brainstorm ideas","To stop playing","To change instruments"],"correct_answer":"To brainstorm ideas"},{"question":"What do Ellie and Maya combine in their new song?","options":["Their styles","Their friends","Their instruments","Their voices"],"correct_answer":"Their styles"},{"question":"How do Ellie and Maya feel at the end of the chapter?","options":["Frustrated","Angry","Happy","Sad"],"correct_answer":"Happy"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_299_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_299_ch5_img1.png","plot_299_ch5_img2.png","story_299_7-10_ch5_img1_1751270266.png","story_299_7-10_ch5_img2_1751270281.png"]},"word_count":353,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
