":"plot_300_ch5_img1.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 08:32:20"},"2":{"size":"1024x1024","format":"png","prompt":"A beautiful childrens story illustration showing A climactic moment of reconciliation, showcasing Jamie and Kira standing shoulder to shoulder, their expressions conveying mutual understanding and renewed friendship. The light is warm and inviting, symbolizing hope amidst the busy cafeteria backdrop, where their peers observe the shift in their dynamic.. Bright colors, friendly characters, safe for children, engaging for all ages.","filename":"plot_300_ch5_img2.png","generatedAt":"2025-06-30 08:32:20"}}}
