   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_300_7_10","title":"The Social Media Showdown","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Friend Drama","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Jamie loved school. Riverdale High was bright and full of excitement. Students buzzed around, chatting and sharing their favorite apps. Jamie\u2019s best friend, Kira, was always by her side. They laughed together and shared secrets.\n\nOne sunny morning, Jamie had a big surprise. \u201cGuess what, Kira?\u201d Jamie said, bouncing on her toes. \u201cI just posted that funny video of us dancing!\u201d\n\nKira smiled but felt a little strange. \u201cThat\u2019s awesome, Jamie! I hope it gets lots of likes!\u201d \n\nJamie\u2019s video started gaining popularity. It went viral! Everyone in school was talking about it. \u201cLook at Jamie!\u201d they said. \u201cShe\u2019s so funny!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs Jamie walked down the hall, students waved and cheered. \u201cYou\u2019re the dancing queen!\u201d shouted Jordan, a tech-savvy classmate. Jamie grinned, soaking up the attention. But Kira felt a knot in her stomach. \n\n\u201cWhy does everyone like Jamie so much?\u201d Kira thought. \u201cWhat about me?\u201d \n\nAt lunch, things got awkward. Jamie shared the video with everyone. \u201cWatch this part! It\u2019s hilarious!\u201d She laughed, but Kira didn\u2019t join in. Instead, she poked at her salad. \n\n\u201cAre you okay, Kira?\u201d Jamie asked, noticing her friend\u2019s quietness. \n\n\u201cYeah, I\u2019m fine,\u201d Kira replied, forcing a smile. But deep down, she felt invisible. \n\nLater, Kira sat alone, scrolling through social media. Jamie\u2019s video had thousands of views, while her own posts barely got any likes. \u201cWhat\u2019s wrong with me?\u201d Kira sighed. \n\nJordan sat next to her. \u201cHey, Kira! Don\u2019t worry about the likes. You\u2019re amazing just the way you are!\u201d \n\nKira appreciated Jordan\u2019s kind words, but they didn\u2019t erase her feelings. As Jamie\u2019s fame grew, Kira felt left behind. \n\n\u201cUgh! This is so unfair!\u201d Kira said to herself. \u201cWhy can\u2019t I be like Jamie?\u201d \n\nAs the day went on, Jamie noticed Kira\u2019s silence. \u201cI hope Kira\u2019s not upset with me,\u201d Jamie thought, feeling worried. \n\nLittle did they know, this was just the beginning of their social media showdown. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cTomorrow, we\u2019ll talk,\u201d Jamie promised herself. \u201cWe need to fix this.\u201d","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Jamie post that went viral?","options":["A picture of Kira","A funny video of them dancing","A poem","A drawing"],"correct_answer":"A funny video of them dancing"},{"question":"How does Kira feel about Jamie's fame?","options":["Happy and excited","Jealous and left out","Indifferent","Proud"],"correct_answer":"Jealous and left out"},{"question":"Who is the tech-savvy classmate that talks to Kira?","options":["Jamie","Jordan","Kira's brother","The teacher"],"correct_answer":"Jordan"},{"question":"What does Kira do during lunch?","options":["Laughs with friends","Scrolls through social media","Helps Jamie","Tries to dance"],"correct_answer":"Scrolls through social media"},{"question":"What does Jamie promise herself at the end of the chapter?","options":["To make more videos","To talk to Kira about their problems","To be a star","To ignore Kira"],"correct_answer":"To talk to Kira about their problems"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_300_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_300_ch1_img1.png","plot_300_ch1_img2.png","story_300_7-10_ch1_img1_1751269838.png","story_300_7-10_ch1_img2_1751269858.png"]},"word_count":349,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
