   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_300_7_10","title":"The Social Media Showdown","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Friend Drama","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Jamie strolled through the bright halls of Riverdale High. Students buzzed around her, phones in hand. \u201cLook, it\u2019s Jamie the Star!\u201d someone shouted. Jamie giggled. She liked the attention. But she could feel Kira\u2019s silence beside her.\n\n\u201cAre you okay, Kira?\u201d Jamie asked, glancing at her friend. Kira shrugged, her eyes on the floor. \u201cI\u2019m fine,\u201d she mumbled. But Jamie could see the frown on her face.\n\nSuddenly, Jordan, their tech-savvy classmate, appeared. \u201cHey, Jamie! You\u2019re famous! Can I film a behind-the-scenes for my channel?\u201d Jamie\u2019s heart raced. She wanted to say yes! \u201cSure, that sounds fun!\u201d she chirped.\n\nKira crossed her arms. \u201cYou don\u2019t need more fame, Jamie,\u201d she said, her voice sharp. Jamie felt a pang in her chest. \u201cI\u2019m just having fun,\u201d she replied softly.\n\nAfter school, Jamie sat down with her phone. She checked her video. It had over a thousand likes! \u201cWow!\u201d she gasped. But as she looked closer, she noticed Kira\u2019s name was missing from the comments. \u201cWhat\u2019s wrong with them?\u201d Jamie whispered to herself.\n\nShe rushed to find Kira. \u201cLet\u2019s celebrate my video!\u201d she suggested. But Kira shook her head. \u201cI\u2019m busy,\u201d she said, turning away. Jamie\u2019s heart sank. \u201cWe used to celebrate everything together,\u201d she thought, feeling a knot in her stomach.\n\nAs the days went by, the tension grew. Kira started spending time with other friends. Jamie missed her. She tried to reach out, but Kira always seemed busy. One day, Jamie found Kira in the library, surrounded by a new group.\n\n\u201cWhy are you ignoring me?\u201d Jamie asked, feeling frustrated. Kira looked up, surprised. \u201cI\u2019m not ignoring you,\u201d she snapped. \u201cYou just don\u2019t see me anymore!\u201d \n\nJamie felt tears sting her eyes. \u201cBut I want to be your friend!\u201d she cried. \n\nKira sighed, rubbing her temples. \u201cIt\u2019s hard when everyone talks about you but not us. I feel left out.\u201d Jamie\u2019s heart ached. She hadn\u2019t meant to push her friend away. \n\n\u201cI didn\u2019t know you felt that way,\u201d Jamie said softly. She reached for Kira\u2019s hand. \u201cCan we talk?\u201d \n\nKira glanced at Jamie\u2019s hand and then nodded slowly. \u201cOkay.\u201d\n\nJust then, Jordan walked in. \u201cHey, what\u2019s going on?\u201d he asked, looking concerned. Kira and Jamie exchanged glances. They both wanted to be friends again. But how?\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Jamie want to film with Jordan?","options":["A dance video","A behind-the-scenes video","A cooking show","A science project"],"correct_answer":"A behind-the-scenes video"},{"question":"How does Kira feel about Jamie's fame?","options":["Happy","Excited","Left out","Indifferent"],"correct_answer":"Left out"},{"question":"What do Jamie and Kira do at the library?","options":["They play games","They study alone","They talk about their feelings","They ignore each other"],"correct_answer":"They talk about their feelings"},{"question":"How does Jamie react when Kira says she feels ignored?","options":["She laughs","She gets angry","She feels sad","She ignores her"],"correct_answer":"She feels sad"},{"question":"What do Jamie and Kira want to do at the end of the chapter?","options":["Fight","Celebrate","Talk about their feelings","Leave the library"],"correct_answer":"Talk about their feelings"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_300_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_300_ch2_img1.png","plot_300_ch2_img2.png","story_300_7-10_ch2_img1_1751269802.png","story_300_7-10_ch2_img2_1751269818.png"]},"word_count":401,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
