   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_300_7_10","title":"The Social Media Showdown","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Friend Drama","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"The halls of Riverdale High buzzed like a beehive. Students laughed and shared stories on their phones. Jamie and Kira walked together, but things felt different. Jamie smiled brightly, but Kira\u2019s smile was small.\n\n\u201cDid you see the likes on my video, Kira?\u201d Jamie exclaimed, her eyes sparkling. \u201cI\u2019m almost at a thousand!\u201d\n\n\u201cYeah, awesome,\u201d Kira replied, her voice quieter than usual. She stared at her shoes, feeling a knot in her stomach.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cCome on! Let\u2019s celebrate!\u201d Jamie said, clapping her hands. \u201cLet\u2019s get ice cream after school!\u201d\n\nKira hesitated, her heart sinking. \u201cThat sounds fun, but\u2026 what about your fans? Aren\u2019t they more important?\u201d\n\nJamie's smile faded. \u201cWhat do you mean?\u201d\n\nKira looked away, her cheeks turning pink. \u201cI just feel\u2026 left out. You\u2019re like a star now, and I\u2019m just\u2026 me.\u201d\n\nJamie felt a sting in her chest. \u201cI didn\u2019t mean to make you feel that way! You\u2019re my best friend!\u201d\n\n\u201cAre you sure? Because it seems like you don\u2019t need me anymore,\u201d Kira said, crossing her arms.\n\nSuddenly, Jordan, their tech-savvy classmate, popped up. \u201cHey, what\u2019s going on?\u201d he asked, his eyebrows raised.\n\n\u201cKira thinks I don\u2019t need her anymore,\u201d Jamie explained, her voice shaky.\n\nJordan scratched his head. \u201cThat\u2019s not true! You both need each other. Why don\u2019t we make a video together?\u201d\n\nKira\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cA video together?\u201d\n\n\u201cYeah! It\u2019ll show that you\u2019re still best friends!\u201d Jordan said, a big grin on his face.\n\nJamie clapped her hands again. \u201cYes! Let\u2019s do it!\u201d\n\nKira hesitated. \u201cBut\u2026 what if it doesn\u2019t go viral?\u201d\n\n\u201cWho cares?\u201d Jamie said, her voice full of excitement. \u201cAs long as we have fun!\u201d\n\nKira smiled slightly. Maybe this could work. \u201cOkay, let\u2019s try!\u201d\n\nThey all gathered in the school\u2019s courtyard after lunch. Jamie set up the camera while Kira practiced her funny faces. Jordan watched and cheered them on.\n\n\u201cReady? Three, two, one, action!\u201d Jamie shouted.\n\nThey started goofing off, laughing and making silly faces. Kira felt lighter. Suddenly, she felt free. She was having fun!\n\nBut just then, a loud noise interrupted them. A group of students rushed by, bumping into the camera. It fell over, and the recording stopped. \n\n\u201cOh no!\u201d Jamie yelled, rushing to check the camera. \u201cIs it broken?\u201d\n\nKira\u2019s heart raced. \u201cWhat if we lost everything?\u201d\n\nThey all stared at the camera. A silence filled the air. Then, Jordan spoke up. \u201cLet\u2019s check it! It might still be okay!\u201d\n\nKira felt a mix of hope and fear. What if everything was lost? Or was this the moment that brought them back together? \n\nKira took a deep breath. \u201cLet\u2019s see!\u201d","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Jamie's viral video make her feel?","options":["Happy","Sad","Angry","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Happy"},{"question":"What does Kira want to do after school?","options":["Go home","Get ice cream","Play soccer","Watch TV"],"correct_answer":"Get ice cream"},{"question":"Who suggests making a video together?","options":["Jamie","Kira","Jordan","A teacher"],"correct_answer":"Jordan"},{"question":"What happens to the camera during the video?","options":["It breaks","It falls over","It runs out of battery","It gets stolen"],"correct_answer":"It falls over"},{"question":"How does Kira feel when she starts filming with Jamie?","options":["Excited","Scared","Nervous","Free"],"correct_answer":"Free"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_300_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_300_ch3_img1.png","plot_300_ch3_img2.png","story_300_7-10_ch3_img1_1751269764.png","story_300_7-10_ch3_img2_1751269781.png"]},"word_count":459,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
