   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_300_7_10","title":"The Social Media Showdown","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Friend Drama","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Jamie and Kira stood in the bright halls of Riverdale High. Students rushed around, chatting and laughing. The colorful lockers shone under the buzzing lights. Jamie smiled, holding her phone. \"Are you ready for our new video, Kira?\" \n\nKira shrugged, her eyes downcast. \"Yeah, I guess.\" Jamie noticed Kira's frown. Something was off. \n\n\"Come on! It will be fun!\" Jamie cheered, bouncing on her toes. Kira sighed, \"I just don't feel like it.\" \n\nJamie\u2019s heart sank. \"But we are a team! We can make it awesome together!\" Kira looked up. \"What if I mess up again?\" \n\n\"Everyone makes mistakes. Just be yourself!\" Jamie said, hoping to cheer her friend. \n\nAs they began to brainstorm ideas, Jamie suddenly dropped her phone. It bounced and landed on the floor with a crack. \"Oh no!\" Jamie cried. \"My video!\" \n\nKira gasped. \"What if it won\u2019t work? What will we do?\" Jamie knelt down, her heart racing. \"We\u2019ll fix it together!\" \n\nThey both looked at the phone. Kira reached out, touching Jamie's shoulder. \"I\u2019m sorry. I\u2019ve been jealous.\" \n\nJamie smiled softly. \"I miss our fun times. Let\u2019s just be us again.\" \n\nKira nodded, her smile returning. \"Let\u2019s make a silly dance video! Like we used to!\" \n\n\"Great idea!\" Jamie said, excitement bubbling inside. They practiced their dance moves, laughter filling the air. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nSuddenly, Jordan appeared. \"Hey, what\u2019s going on?\" He watched them dance, his eyes wide. \"I want in!\" \n\nJamie laughed. \"Join us! We need all the help we can get!\" Kira grinned at Jordan. \n\nThey danced together, arms flailing and feet tapping. Jamie felt the weight lift off her shoulders. \n\nAfter a few tries, they created a funny routine. \"This is amazing!\" Kira shouted, her eyes sparkling. \n\nJamie couldn\u2019t stop smiling. \"Let\u2019s record it!\" They set up the camera and started to dance. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe three of them moved in sync, giggling at their silly steps. They forgot about likes and shares. It was just fun! \n\nWhen they finished, Jordan said, \"That was awesome! You guys are great!\" Kira beamed at Jamie. \"Thank you for being patient with me.\" \n\n\"Always!\" Jamie replied, feeling closer to her friend. They watched the video and laughed. \"This will be even better than my last one!\" Jamie said. \n\nKira smiled, \"I can\u2019t wait to share it!\" They were back to their old selves. \n\nBut deep down, Jamie wondered, would this video change everything again?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Jamie want to do with Kira?","options":["Make a silly dance video","Play a game","Go shopping","Do homework"],"correct_answer":"Make a silly dance video"},{"question":"How did Kira feel at the beginning of the chapter?","options":["Happy","Excited","Jealous","Confused"],"correct_answer":"Jealous"},{"question":"What happened to Jamie's phone?","options":["It got lost","It cracked on the floor","It was stolen","It ran out of battery"],"correct_answer":"It cracked on the floor"},{"question":"Who joined Jamie and Kira in their dance video?","options":["Jordan","A teacher","A stranger","Kira's mom"],"correct_answer":"Jordan"},{"question":"What did Jamie and Kira learn by the end of the chapter?","options":["To dance better","The importance of friendship","How to make videos","To ignore each other"],"correct_answer":"The importance of friendship"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_300_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_300_ch4_img1.png","plot_300_ch4_img2.png","story_300_7-10_ch4_img1_1751269728.png","story_300_7-10_ch4_img2_1751269749.png"]},"word_count":411,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
