   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_300_7_10","title":"The Social Media Showdown","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Friend Drama","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"The sun shone brightly in the halls of Riverdale High. Jamie and Kira walked side by side, their laughter echoing off the walls. They had worked hard on their dance video, and today was the big day. It was finally time to share it with the world!\n\n\"Are you ready?\" Jamie asked, her eyes sparkling with excitement.\n\nKira nodded but felt a little nervous. She glanced at her phone. \u201cWhat if nobody likes it as much as your last video?\u201d\n\n\u201cDon\u2019t worry! We\u2019re a team! Together, we can do anything!\u201d Jamie flashed her a bright smile. \n\nJust then, Jordan came running up. \u201cHey, guys! Did you hear? The dance showdown is happening next week! We have to sign up!\u201d\n\n\u201cSounds fun! Let\u2019s do it!\u201d Jamie replied, jumping with joy. \n\nKira felt a twinge in her heart. \u201cBut what if everyone is more interested in Jamie again?\u201d she whispered to herself.\n\nAs they prepared to film, Jamie\u2019s excitement filled the air. \u201cLet\u2019s show everyone our moves!\u201d She danced like nobody was watching. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nKira joined in, and they twirled and spun. The fun spread like warm sunshine. They finished the video, giggling and out of breath. \n\n\u201cI can\u2019t wait to post it!\u201d Jamie said, grinning from ear to ear. \n\n\u201cMe too,\u201d Kira said, but she felt a little left out. \n\nLater, they gathered with their classmates to watch the video together. The crowd cheered! \u201cWow, look at those moves!\u201d Jordan exclaimed. Kira could see Jamie glowing with happiness. \n\nBut then, Kira noticed something strange. A group started talking about Jamie\u2019s last video. \u201cDid you see how many likes Jamie got? She\u2019s so popular!\u201d \n\nKira\u2019s heart sank. She felt small and forgotten. \n\n\u201cHey, Kira! You were amazing too!\u201d Jordan called out, noticing her silence. \n\n\u201cYeah, Kira! You totally rocked it!\u201d Jamie added, looking directly at her. \n\nSuddenly, Kira felt a warmth spread through her. \u201cThanks, guys! You both helped me a lot!\u201d she said, smiling shyly.\n\nJamie took Kira's hand. \u201cWe\u2019re best friends. We shine together, not alone!\u201d \n\nKira smiled brighter than ever. \u201cYou\u2019re right! Let\u2019s keep dancing!\u201d \n\nThey high-fived, and the room filled with cheers again. The envy melted away. They learned that friendship was more important than likes and shares.\n\nAs they danced again, Kira felt happy. Not just for herself, but for Jamie too. Together, they were unstoppable.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe next week, at the showdown, they performed side by side. The audience loved it. Kira felt proud. Jamie and Kira had each other\u2019s backs, and that made all the difference.\n\n\u201cI\u2019m glad we\u2019re friends,\u201d Kira whispered to Jamie as they took their bow.\n\n\u201cMe too!\u201d Jamie replied. \n\nAnd with that, they made a promise to always support each other, no matter what.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Jamie and Kira prepare for in this chapter?","options":["A dance video","A race","A cooking contest","A science project"],"correct_answer":"A dance video"},{"question":"Who encourages Kira during the video screening?","options":["Jamie","Jordan","The teacher","A stranger"],"correct_answer":"Jordan"},{"question":"What do Jamie and Kira promise to support each other with?","options":["Schoolwork","Friendship","Sports","Fashion"],"correct_answer":"Friendship"},{"question":"What feeling does Kira have when Jamie becomes famous?","options":["Joy","Envy","Surprise","Indifference"],"correct_answer":"Envy"},{"question":"What important lesson do Jamie and Kira learn?","options":["To be popular","To dance better","To work alone","To value friendship"],"correct_answer":"To value friendship"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_300_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_300_ch5_img1.png","plot_300_ch5_img2.png","story_300_7-10_ch5_img1_1751269696.png","story_300_7-10_ch5_img2_1751269712.png"]},"word_count":470,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
