   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_300_11_14","title":"The Social Media Showdown","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Friend Drama","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"The next day, the halls of Riverdale High buzzed with a mix of excitement and tension. Jamie walked through the corridor, her head held high, greeted by classmates who were eager to share the latest gossip about her viral video. She felt like a superstar, yet a knot of unease twisted in her stomach. Kira trailed behind, her shoulders slumped, the glow of Jamie's fame casting a shadow over her own feelings.\n\nAs they reached their lockers, Jamie opened hers to find a beautiful bouquet of flowers from her fan club. \u201cWow! Look at this!\u201d she squealed, holding the flowers up like a trophy. Kira forced a smile, the scent of the flowers mixing with the bitterness already brewing inside her. \n\n\u201cNice\u2026,\u201d she replied, trying to keep her tone light, but the words felt heavy on her tongue. \n\nKira glanced across the hall, where a group of students were gathered around a phone, laughing and whispering, the screen lit up with Jamie\u2019s face. It was a painful reminder of the divide that had crept into their friendship. Just then, Kira noticed Jordan, their tech-savvy classmate, approaching them with his usual grin. \u201cHey, guys! I just got an idea for a new project! What do you think about doing a collab video?\u201d\n\nJamie\u2019s eyes sparkled with excitement. \u201cThat could be amazing! We could showcase our school spirit!\u201d \n\nKira\u2019s heart sank. \u201cYeah, that sounds fun\u2026\u201d she said, her voice trailing off. She could feel the walls of their friendship closing in around her. \n\nLater, as they settled into a quiet corner of the library for lunch, tension hung thick between them. Jamie animatedly described her thoughts for the video while Kira picked at her sandwich, the silence growing heavier. Finally, Kira couldn\u2019t hold back any longer. \u201cJamie, can we talk about the video?\u201d \n\n\u201cWhat about it?\u201d Jamie asked, slightly confused.\n\n\u201cI feel like\u2026 like you\u2019re leaving me behind. You\u2019re getting all this attention, and I\u2019m just\u2026 here,\u201d Kira admitted, her voice shaky. \n\nA flicker of realization crossed Jamie's face. \u201cKira, I didn\u2019t mean to make you feel that way. You\u2019re my best friend\u2014\u201d\n\n\u201cAnd what about that account mocking you? I thought about not telling you because I didn\u2019t want to make things worse,\u201d Kira interrupted, feeling the weight of her secret spill out.\n\nAt that moment, the realization hit Jamie like a sudden gust of wind\u2014the mocking account was a threat, one that could drive a wedge deeper between them if they didn\u2019t confront it. \u201cWait, you knew about it? Why didn\u2019t you tell me?\u201d\n\n\u201cI didn\u2019t want you to think I was jealous or anything,\u201d Kira replied, her eyes glistening with unshed tears.\n\nIn that moment, Jamie reached across the table and took Kira\u2019s hand. \u201cI need you by my side. We can deal with this together. Let\u2019s figure out who\u2019s behind that account and take a stand. Friends, right?\u201d\n\nKira felt a wave of relief wash over her. \u201cFriends,\u201d she echoed, squeezing Jamie\u2019s hand tightly. \n\nJust then, they heard hushed whispers from a nearby table, and Kira\u2019s heart raced again. Could the rumors be getting worse? \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThey shared a determined look, a silent agreement that their friendship was worth fighting for, no matter how hard it got. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAs they stood up to leave, Jamie felt a new sense of hope blossom between them. Maybe they could turn the tide together, but first, they needed to confront the threat lurking in the shadows of their school.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Kira feel overshadowed by?","options":["Jamie\u2019s popularity","Jordan\u2019s project","A new club","The school mascot"],"correct_answer":"Jamie\u2019s popularity"},{"question":"What suggestion does Jordan make to Jamie and Kira?","options":["To do a dance challenge","To create a collab video","To start a podcast","To join the cheer team"],"correct_answer":"To create a collab video"},{"question":"What secret does Kira reveal to Jamie?","options":["She hates social media","She knows about the mocking account","She has a crush on Jordan","She wants to quit school"],"correct_answer":"She knows about the mocking account"},{"question":"How does Jamie react to Kira's feelings of jealousy?","options":["She ignores her","She gets angry","She is confused","She reassures her"],"correct_answer":"She reassures her"},{"question":"What emotion do Jamie and Kira share at the end of the chapter?","options":["Fear","Joy","Hope","Anger"],"correct_answer":"Hope"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_300_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_300_ch4_img1.png","plot_300_ch4_img2.png","story_300_11-14_ch4_img1_1751269507.png","story_300_11-14_ch4_img2_1751269524.png"]},"word_count":599,"reading_level":"Builder"}
