   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_300_15_18","title":"The Social Media Showdown","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Friend Drama","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"As the fluorescent lights flickered above the bustling hallways of Riverdale High, Jamie felt an electric thrill coursing through her veins. The chatter of students and the clatter of shoes against linoleum molded into a vibrant symphony of teenage life. Yet amidst the excitement, a shadow loomed over her elation\u2014Kira\u2019s silence was palpable as they navigated through the throngs of students, their shoulders brushing but their hearts miles apart. \n\n\u201cDid you see the likes on my latest post? I can\u2019t believe it!\u201d Jamie exclaimed, her enthusiasm bubbling over. She was buoyed by the attention, but she caught the fleeting frown on Kira's face. The contrast felt sharp, like ice on a summer day. \n\n\u201cIt\u2019s great, Jamie. Really,\u201d Kira replied, her voice a mere whisper, lacking the warmth it once held. Jamie\u2019s heart sank at Kira\u2019s tone. The words were polite, but the underlying tension was unmistakable. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they turned the corner, Jamie\u2019s eyes danced over the array of colorful lockers, each one a testament to the lives lived behind them. She spotted Jordan, the tech-savvy classmate with a flair for gadgets and a talent for mediating conflicts. He was engrossed in his phone, his brows furrowed in concentration. Jamie approached him, hoping for a moment of respite from Kira\u2019s coldness. \n\n\u201cHey, Jordan! Did you catch the video?\u201d Jamie asked with a grin, her excitement bubbling over once again. \n\n\u201cYeah, it\u2019s blowing up! You\u2019re like a celebrity around here,\u201d he said, glancing up with a smile that didn\u2019t quite reach his eyes. \u201cBut\u2026 how\u2019s Kira handling it?\u201d\n\nJamie\u2019s smile faltered. \u201cI don\u2019t know. I think she\u2019s just feeling a bit left out.\u201d \n\nJordan nodded, his expression turning serious. \u201cYou need to talk to her. Open communication is crucial. You don\u2019t want this to ruin your friendship.\u201d\n\nThat evening, Jamie lay awake in bed, her phone illuminating the dim room as notifications pinged incessantly. Each ping felt like a reminder of Kira\u2019s growing distance. She finally mustered the courage to text Kira.\n\n*Can we talk tomorrow? I miss you.*\n\nWhen the next day arrived, the air was thick with unspoken words as the two girls met in their favorite caf\u00e9, a quaint little spot filled with the aroma of coffee and freshly baked pastries. Jamie's stomach churned with anxiety, but she wore a brave face as they settled into a corner booth.\n\n\u201cI just wanted to say\u2026 I\u2019ve noticed you\u2019ve been quiet,\u201d Jamie began, her voice steady despite the chaos in her mind. \n\nKira\u2019s gaze flickered across the caf\u00e9 before landing back on Jamie. \u201cI don\u2019t want to rain on your parade, Jamie, but it\u2019s hard watching you become this\u2026 star. I feel invisible,\u201d Kira confessed, her voice barely a whisper. \n\nJamie felt her heart drop at Kira\u2019s words. \u201cBut you\u2019re not invisible to me! You\u2019re my best friend!\u201d \n\nA heavy silence enveloped them, thick with the weight of their unsaid fears. Jamie reached across the table, her hand hovering uncertainly before finally finding Kira\u2019s. \u201cI\u2019m still the same person, Kira. Can\u2019t we face this together?\u201d\n\nKira\u2019s eyes shimmered with unshed tears. \u201cDo you even realize how many people are talking about you, Jamie? It feels like I\u2019m fading into the background.\u201d \n\nJamie opened her mouth to respond, but just then, her phone buzzed loudly on the table. It was a message from a popular influencer, tagging her in a post that read, \u201cThe next big thing in dance! Are you ready to see Jamie shine?\u201d \n\nKira\u2019s expression twisted, a mixture of hurt and anger flashing behind her eyes. \u201cMaybe you should just embrace it then. Why hide what you\u2019ve become?\u201d \n\nThe air crackled with tension as they both recoiled from the truth laid bare between them. Just as Jamie began to respond, Kira stood abruptly, her chair screeching against the floor. \u201cYou know what? I can\u2019t do this right now.\u201d\n\nAs Kira stormed out, Jamie felt the weight of her friend\u2019s departure like a lead weight pulling her down. What had started as a celebration of friendship had spiraled into a chaotic chasm of misunderstanding. A storm brewed inside her, leaving her wondering if her fame was truly worth losing the one person who understood her.\n\nWith her heart racing, Jamie grabbed her phone, a sudden realization striking her. She would not let this moment define her friendship. Determined, she pressed the buttons that would change everything.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nA video began recording, her voice trembling but resolute as she spoke directly to Kira, \u201cI want to fix this. You mean too much to me. Let\u2019s talk. I\u2019m not just Jamie the star; I\u2019m Jamie your friend. Always.\u201d \n\nThe video ended with a shaky breath, and she hit send, praying it wasn\u2019t too late.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"How does Kira feel about Jamie's sudden fame?","options":["She is fully supportive.","She feels overshadowed.","She is indifferent.","She is angry."],"correct_answer":"She feels overshadowed."},{"question":"What advice does Jordan give Jamie regarding her friendship with Kira?","options":["To ignore Kira's feelings.","To communicate openly with Kira.","To compete with Kira.","To make more videos."],"correct_answer":"To communicate openly with Kira."},{"question":"What does Jamie do to try to resolve her conflict with Kira?","options":["She writes a letter.","She records a video message.","She tries to ignore the issue.","She confronts Kira harshly."],"correct_answer":"She records a video message."},{"question":"What symbolizes the tension in Jamie and Kira's relationship during their caf\u00e9 meeting?","options":["The coffee shop ambiance.","Jamie\u2019s phone notifications.","The empty chairs around them.","The dessert they ordered."],"correct_answer":"Jamie\u2019s phone notifications."},{"question":"What is the climax of this chapter?","options":["Jamie\u2019s viral video goes live.","Kira storms out of the caf\u00e9.","Jordan gives advice.","Jamie receives a message from an influencer."],"correct_answer":"Kira storms out of the caf\u00e9."}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_300_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_300_ch3_img1.png","plot_300_ch3_img2.png","story_300_15-18_ch3_img1_1751269046.png","story_300_15-18_ch3_img2_1751269068.png"]},"word_count":823,"reading_level":"Challenger"}
