   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_291_7_10","title":"The Great Test Treasure Hunt","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Test Stress","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Mia loved school. Each day was full of surprises. But today felt different. Today, the sun shone bright, and Mia had a funny feeling in her tummy.\n\n\u201cHey, Mia! Are you ready for the big test week?\u201d Leo asked, tapping on his tablet.\n\nMia frowned. \u201cI\u2019m excited but also nervous. We have to study a lot!\u201d\n\nLeo nodded. \u201cYeah, but what if we find a way to make studying fun?\u201d\n\nAva joined them, her arms full of books. \u201cWhat do you mean?\u201d she asked, adjusting her glasses.\n\nMia grinned. \u201cWhat if we could go on a treasure hunt? That could help us think!\u201d\n\nLeo\u2019s eyes lit up. \u201cA treasure hunt? Like in those adventure stories?\u201d\n\nMia nodded eagerly. \u201cYes! There\u2019s a library in our school. Maybe we could find a treasure map!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe school library was full of tall shelves. Books were stacked high, and the smell of paper filled the air. Mia, Leo, and Ava hurried inside. The library was their favorite place.\n\n\u201cLook over there!\u201d Mia pointed. A dusty old book sat on a table. It seemed to call her over.\n\n\u201cWhat if it has clues?\u201d Ava whispered, her eyes wide with excitement.\n\nMia opened the book carefully. To her surprise, a folded piece of paper fell out. It was a treasure map!\n\n\u201cWow! This is amazing!\u201d Leo exclaimed. \u201cBut it looks really old.\u201d\n\nMia unfolded the map. \u201cLet\u2019s see what it says.\u201d The map had strange symbols and arrows pointing to different places around the school. \n\nAva peered over Mia\u2019s shoulder. \u201cThere\u2019s a big \u2018X\u2019! That must be where the treasure is!\u201d\n\nJust then, the school bell rang. \u201cOh no! We have to get to class!\u201d Mia said, stuffing the map into her backpack.\n\n\u201cBut what about the treasure?\u201d Leo asked, looking worried.\n\n\u201cWe will figure it out later,\u201d Mia promised. \u201cWe just need to balance studying and the treasure hunt.\u201d\n\nMia and her friends hurried to class, but her heart raced with excitement. Could they really find the treasure before the tests?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Mia, Leo, and Ava find in the library?","options":["A treasure map","A new book","A puzzle","A computer"],"correct_answer":"A treasure map"},{"question":"What do the friends need to balance with the treasure hunt?","options":["Playing games","Studying for tests","Going to the park","Eating lunch"],"correct_answer":"Studying for tests"},{"question":"How does Mia feel about the upcoming test week?","options":["Excited","Nervous","Angry","Bored"],"correct_answer":"Nervous"},{"question":"What does Leo use to check information?","options":["A map","A pencil","A tablet","A book"],"correct_answer":"A tablet"},{"question":"What does the 'X' on the map likely represent?","options":["A library","A treasure","A classroom","A playground"],"correct_answer":"A treasure"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_291_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_291_ch1_img1.png","plot_291_ch1_img2.png","story_291_7-10_ch1_img1_1751268946.png","story_291_7-10_ch1_img2_1751268962.png"]},"word_count":344,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
