   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_291_7_10","title":"The Great Test Treasure Hunt","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Test Stress","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Mia, Leo, and Ava met at their favorite spot in the schoolyard. The sun shone brightly, making everything glow. Mia held the treasure map tightly. \u201cOkay, team! Let\u2019s look at our first clue!\u201d \n\n\u201cI can\u2019t believe we found a treasure map!\u201d Ava exclaimed, her glasses slipping down her nose. \u201cBut we have tests next week!\u201d \n\n\u201cI know,\u201d said Leo, tapping his tablet. \u201cBut we can solve the clues during breaks. It\u2019ll help us relax!\u201d \n\nMia nodded. \u201cLet\u2019s be smart about it. We can study and still go on our adventure!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they studied the map, they noticed a riddle written in curly letters. It said, \u201cTo find the treasure, look under the place where you learn and play, next to the ball that rolls away.\u201d \n\n\u201cWhat could that mean?\u201d asked Ava. \n\n\u201cHmm,\u201d said Leo, scratching his head. \u201cIt sounds like the playground! But where on the playground?\u201d \n\nMia looked around. \u201cWhat rolls away? The soccer ball!\u201d \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s hurry!\u201d shouted Leo. They dashed across the grass, excitement bubbling in their bellies. \n\nWhen they reached the playground, Mia pointed to the big orange soccer ball. \u201cIt has to be here!\u201d \n\nThey searched under the ball. Suddenly, Ava squealed. \u201cLook! There\u2019s something shiny!\u201d \n\nThey uncovered a small, glittering key. \n\n\u201cWow! What does it open?\u201d Mia wondered, holding it carefully. \n\nBut just then, the school bell rang loudly. \u201cOh no! We\u2019re going to be late for class!\u201d Leo cried. \n\nMia frowned. \u201cWe have to study! But we just found a key! What if it leads to the treasure?\u201d \n\nAva sighed. \u201cWe need to focus. The tests are super important!\u201d \n\nMia felt torn. The treasure hunt was so much fun, but the tests were scary. \u201cLet\u2019s study hard tonight. Then, we\u2019ll meet again tomorrow for more treasure hunting!\u201d \n\n\u201cAgreed!\u201d said Leo. \u201cLet\u2019s make a study plan.\u201d \n\nThey sat down on the grass, ready to jot down their study topics. But Mia couldn\u2019t stop thinking about the treasure map and the mysterious key. \n\nWhat would it unlock? Would they find the treasure before the tests? \n\nWith these questions swirling in her mind, Mia knew their adventure was just beginning. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s meet after school!\u201d she smiled, her eyes sparkling with excitement.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Mia and her friends find in the playground?","options":["A soccer ball","A treasure chest","A shiny key","A map"],"correct_answer":"A shiny key"},{"question":"What does the treasure map lead them to?","options":["A hidden place","A riddle","A test","A book"],"correct_answer":"A riddle"},{"question":"What is Ava worried about?","options":["Finding the treasure","The upcoming tests","Playing games","Studying at home"],"correct_answer":"The upcoming tests"},{"question":"What do the friends decide to do at the end of the chapter?","options":["Go home","Meet again tomorrow","Stop the treasure hunt","Give up studying"],"correct_answer":"Meet again tomorrow"},{"question":"How does Mia feel about the treasure hunt?","options":["Bored","Excited","Nervous","Angry"],"correct_answer":"Excited"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_291_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_291_ch2_img1.png","plot_291_ch2_img2.png","story_291_7-10_ch2_img1_1751268901.png"]},"word_count":380,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
