   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_291_7_10","title":"The Great Test Treasure Hunt","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Test Stress","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Mia, Leo, and Ava were back at the playground. They gathered under the big oak tree, their treasure map spread out before them. \n\n\"This is where the key led us!\" Mia exclaimed. Her eyes sparkled with excitement. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] \n\nLeo pulled out his tablet. \"Let\u2019s scan the map. Maybe there\u2019s a clue we missed!\" \n\nAva leaned in, her nose almost touching the paper. \"Look! It says we need to find the \u2018hidden slide\u2019 to move forward.\" \n\nMia frowned. \"But there are so many slides! How will we know which one it is?\" \n\nLeo thought hard. \"What if we look for a slide that\u2019s not being used? The treasure could be hidden somewhere quiet!\" \n\nThey hurried towards the empty swings. As they walked, they studied the map. \n\nSuddenly, Ava stopped. \"Wait! Look over there!\" She pointed to the far corner of the playground. \n\nA tall slide stood under the shade of a tree. It looked old and forgotten. \"That must be the hidden slide!\" Mia shouted. \n\nThey raced over, hearts pounding with excitement. But as they reached the slide, they spotted something shiny at the base. \n\n\"Is that...?\" Leo knelt down and pulled out a small, golden key. \n\nAva jumped up and down. \"We found it! This must unlock the treasure!\" \n\nThey cheered, their worries about the tests fading away. But Mia took a deep breath. \"We need to study too. We can\u2019t forget about our exams!\" \n\nLeo nodded. \"Let\u2019s take turns. We\u2019ll study for an hour, then search for the next clue.\" \n\nAva smiled. \"That\u2019s a great idea! We can do both!\" \n\nThe friends sat down on the grass, books open and notes spread out. They focused hard but kept glancing at the map. \n\nAfter studying, they looked at the treasure map again. \"The next clue says to go to the library,\" Mia read aloud. \n\n\"Let\u2019s go!\" Leo said, jumping up. \n\nWith renewed energy, they dashed back to the school. They knew they had to balance their adventure with studying. They could do both. \n\nThe treasure hunt was fun, but so was learning. Together, they could tackle anything! \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2] \n\nAs they entered the library, Mia felt ready. \"Let\u2019s find that treasure!\"","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"Where did Mia and her friends find the golden key?","options":["In the library","At the bottom of a slide","In the classroom","In the swings"],"correct_answer":"At the bottom of a slide"},{"question":"What do they decide to do after finding the key?","options":["Go home","Study and search for the next clue","Play on the swings","Ignore their tests"],"correct_answer":"Study and search for the next clue"},{"question":"What did Ava suggest they look for?","options":["A hidden treasure","A hidden slide","A lost book","A secret garden"],"correct_answer":"A hidden slide"},{"question":"How did Mia feel about the tests?","options":["Excited","Nervous","Indifferent","Happy"],"correct_answer":"Nervous"},{"question":"What did the friends do after studying?","options":["Went home","Went to the library","Played games","Took a nap"],"correct_answer":"Went to the library"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_291_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_291_ch5_img1.png","plot_291_ch5_img2.png","story_291_7-10_ch5_img1_1751268799.png","story_291_7-10_ch5_img2_1751268814.png"]},"word_count":371,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
