   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_291_11_14","title":"The Great Test Treasure Hunt","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Test Stress","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Mia pushed open the heavy wooden door of Maplewood Middle School, her heart racing with anticipation. It was the start of test week, the time of year when students felt the weight of the world in their backpacks. But today, she had something else on her mind \u2013 an adventure.\n\n\u201cHey, Mia! You ready for the math test?\u201d Leo called out, jogging to catch up with her. His messy hair bounced with every step, and his glasses slipped down his nose.\n\n\u201cUgh, not really,\u201d Mia replied, rolling her eyes. \u201cBut I found something in the library that might help us forget about all that for a while.\u201d\n\nLeo\u2019s eyes lit up. \u201cWhat did you find? A secret formula for passing tests?\u201d\n\nMia grinned, leading him toward the library, which always smelled like old books and polished wood. It was her favorite place to escape the chaos of school life. As they stepped inside, the towering shelves seemed to whisper secrets. That\u2019s when she spotted Ava, buried in a thick volume about ancient civilizations.\n\n\u201cHey, Ava! You won\u2019t believe what I found!\u201d Mia exclaimed, waving a crumpled piece of parchment.\n\nAva looked up, adjusting her glasses. \u201cWhat is it? Is it a new book? I hope it\u2019s not another one of those weird history projects.\u201d\n\n\u201cNope! It\u2019s a treasure map!\u201d Mia said, her eyes sparkling with excitement.\n\nAva\u2019s eyebrows shot up. \u201cA treasure map? Like, for real?\u201d\n\n\u201cTotally! I found it tucked between some dusty encyclopedias. I think it leads to a hidden treasure on school grounds!\u201d Mia explained, holding the map up like a trophy. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAva leaned in closer, squinting at the faded ink. \u201cThis is incredible! But\u2026 what kind of treasure?\u201d\n\n\u201cMaybe it\u2019s something cool! Like a stash of candy or a special prize for the best students!\u201d Leo winked.\n\nAs they gathered around a table, Mia traced the route with her finger. Her excitement was infectious, but so was the gnawing tension of looming tests. \u201cWe need to solve these clues, but we also have to study. It\u2019s test week, remember?\u201d \n\nLeo nodded, tapping away on his tablet. \u201cI\u2019ll research the history of treasure maps. It might help us figure out what the symbols mean.\u201d\n\n\u201cGood idea!\u201d Ava replied, already flipping through her book. \u201cBut we have to balance it with studying. I can\u2019t afford to fail the science test.\u201d\n\nMia sighed, a mixture of thrill and anxiety swirling inside her. \u201cWhat if we set a time limit? We can dedicate an hour a day to treasure hunting, and the rest to studying. Just think, if we find the treasure, it might give us the motivation we need!\u201d\n\nThey all agreed, excitement bubbling up again as they started to decipher the first clue. But as they dug deeper into the map, Mia couldn\u2019t shake the feeling that this adventure might just be the distraction they all needed. \n\nAs they worked, the library was filled with whispered ideas and laughter, but in the back of Mia\u2019s mind, the shadow of their upcoming tests loomed larger. Would they be able to juggle both their quest and their studies? \n\nSuddenly, Ava pointed at the map with urgency. \u201cWait! I think I see something here! If we follow this path\u2026 it could lead us to the playground!\u201d\n\nMia\u2019s heart raced. \u201cLet\u2019s check it out! But we have to be quick!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe three friends exchanged determined glances, the thrill of the hunt lighting a fire within them. Together, they ventured out of the library, excitement tangling with worry as they stepped into the unknown.\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s find that treasure!\u201d Mia declared, her voice filled with resolve.\n\nBut as they moved towards the playground, the weight of their tests clung closely to them. Could they truly balance their studies with this treasure hunt? Only time would tell if they could uncover the prize before the final bell rang.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Mia discover in the library?","options":["A treasure map","A new book","An old test","A secret passage"],"correct_answer":"A treasure map"},{"question":"Who are Mia's friends that she enlists to help with the treasure hunt?","options":["Leo and Ava","Sam and Ben","Ella and Zoe","Josh and Mike"],"correct_answer":"Leo and Ava"},{"question":"What is the main conflict in this chapter?","options":["Finding the treasure","Studying for tests","Deciding what to do for fun","Choosing the best lunch"],"correct_answer":"Studying for tests"},{"question":"What is Leo's role in the treasure hunt?","options":["The bookworm","The treasure seeker","The tech-savvy friend","The prankster"],"correct_answer":"The tech-savvy friend"},{"question":"What does Mia suggest to balance studying and the treasure hunt?","options":["Only focus on the treasure","Take a break from studying","Set a time limit for each activity","Forget about the treasure"],"correct_answer":"Set a time limit for each activity"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_291_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_291_ch1_img1.png","plot_291_ch1_img2.png","story_291_11-14_ch1_img1_1751268759.png","story_291_11-14_ch1_img2_1751268782.png"]},"word_count":661,"reading_level":"Builder"}
