   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_291_11_14","title":"The Great Test Treasure Hunt","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Test Stress","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"As the sun peeked through the classroom windows, Mia, Leo, and Ava huddled around a small table in the library, their excitement bubbling like a fizzy soda. The school buzzed with the usual pre-test jitters, but their treasure hunt had taken on a life of its own. The library\u2019s whispering shelves stood like silent sentinels around them, guarding secrets of their own. \n\n\u201cAlright, Team Treasure,\u201d Mia said, her voice barely above a whisper, the thrill of the hunt dancing in her eyes. \u201cLet\u2019s decode the next clue before we get overwhelmed with all this studying.\u201d\n\nLeo, pulling up the latest clue on his tablet, squinted at the screen. \u201cIt says something about the oldest tree in the playground. We need to get there, but we also have to study for math. Do you think we can handle both?\u201d\n\n\u201cWe have to,\u201d Ava replied, her brow furrowed in concentration as she flipped through an enormous book on riddles. \u201cThe treasure could be anything! Plus, we\u2019ll need something to look forward to after all this studying.\u201d \n\nMia nodded, her heart pounding in a mix of excitement and anxiety. \u201cLet\u2019s split our time. Thirty minutes on the next clue, and then we hit the books hard.\u201d\n\nThe trio agreed, their determination solidifying as they gathered their things. They dashed out of the library, the thrill of the hunt overtaking the looming pressure of exams. As they reached the playground, they spotted the massive oak tree that had stood for decades, its branches reaching out like welcoming arms. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nWith a deep breath, Mia approached the tree, her fingers brushing against its rough bark. \u201cThis has to be it! The clue said that we need to look beneath the roots for the next piece.\u201d \n\nSuddenly, a shadow loomed behind them. It was Eric, the school bully, a smirk plastered on his face. \u201cWhat are you losers doing? Digging for gold?\u201d \n\nLeo shot him a glare, his fingers twitching nervously. \u201cWe\u2019re not digging. We just\u2014\u201d\n\n\u201cJust what? Going on some silly treasure hunt?\u201d Eric interrupted, stepping closer, the tension thickening the air around them. \u201cYou think you can find anything worth your time?\u201d \n\nMia stepped forward, her heart racing. \u201cWe can, Eric. We\u2019re not afraid of you or your comments. We know what we\u2019re doing!\u201d \n\nBut as she spoke, doubt flickered in her mind. Could they really manage both the treasure hunt and their studies? Just then, a rustle from the tree roots caught her attention. She knelt down, brushing aside leaves, and gasped as her fingers brushed against something smooth. \n\n\u201cGuys! I think I found it!\u201d she shouted, pulling out a small, weathered box that sparkled in the sunlight. \n\nEric\u2019s smirk faltered, replaced by a glimmer of uncertainty. \u201cWhat\u2019s that?\u201d he asked, genuine curiosity mixing with his usual bravado.\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s our next clue,\u201d Ava replied, breathless. \u201cWe\u2019re going to solve this!\u201d \n\nWith determination shining in their eyes, the trio opened the box, revealing a golden compass inside, its needle spinning wildly. \n\n\u201cWe might just be onto something!\u201d Mia exclaimed with newfound hope. \n\nBut as the compass settled, pointing towards the school\u2019s east wing, Mia couldn\u2019t shake the feeling that their adventure was only beginning. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s hurry! We have to find out where this leads before we have to study!\u201d Leo urged, his energy infectious.\n\nWith the compass in hand and a fire ignited in their hearts, they raced back toward the school, ready for the next challenge that awaited them.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does the treasure map lead the characters to find?","options":["A golden compass","A bag of gold","A treasure chest","A secret door"],"correct_answer":"A golden compass"},{"question":"What is the main conflict in this chapter?","options":["Finding the treasure","Studying for tests","Dealing with Eric","Decoding clues"],"correct_answer":"Studying for tests"},{"question":"How does Mia feel about confronting Eric?","options":["Fearful","Excited","Confident","Indifferent"],"correct_answer":"Confident"},{"question":"What do Leo and Ava suggest they should do after finding the compass?","options":["Dig for more treasure","Go back to studying","Follow the compass","Meet with Eric"],"correct_answer":"Follow the compass"},{"question":"What does the compass represent for the characters?","options":["A tool for studying","A source of conflict","A guide for their adventure","A prize"],"correct_answer":"A guide for their adventure"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_291_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_291_ch4_img1.png","plot_291_ch4_img2.png","story_291_11-14_ch4_img1_1751268647.png","story_291_11-14_ch4_img2_1751268666.png"]},"word_count":591,"reading_level":"Builder"}
