   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_291_11_14","title":"The Great Test Treasure Hunt","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Test Stress","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"As the sun rose over Westwood Middle School, Mia stood in front of the entrance, the weight of the treasure map tucked safely in her backpack. The air was thick with the scent of sharpened pencils and chalk dust, a reminder that test week had finally arrived. \"We can do this, right, Leo?\" she asked, determination etched on her face.\n\n\"Absolutely! But first, let\u2019s crack that next clue,\" Leo replied, adjusting his glasses with an eager smile. His fingers tapped a rhythm against the side of his backpack, the excitement palpable. \n\nAva, who had been rifling through her notes, looked up. \"What if we try the clue from the compass? It mentioned something about finding the \u2018heart of the school\u2019,\" she said, her voice brimming with enthusiasm. \"That could mean the library!\"\n\nMia felt her stomach flutter with a mix of anticipation and anxiety. Could they really find the treasure while also preparing for the most important tests of the year? With a deep breath, she nodded. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d\n\nThey made their way through the bustling halls, students buzzing with last-minute study sessions and nervous chatter. The vibrant murals painted on the walls seemed to cheer them on as they approached the library, its tall shelves standing like sentinels guarding ancient knowledge.\n\nAs they stepped inside, a hush fell over them. The library was dimly lit, with golden shafts of sunlight filtering through the large windows, illuminating dust motes dancing in the air. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] The atmosphere was thick with mystery, and Mia felt a thrill run down her spine. \n\n\u201cOkay, where do we start?\u201d Leo whispered, glancing around. \n\nAva pulled out the map, her finger tracing the path they had already taken. \u201cWe need to find something that corresponds with the next clue,\u201d she said, her brow furrowing in concentration. \u201cThe book we found last time... it mentioned the old oak tree.\u201d\n\nSuddenly, a loud crash echoed from the back of the library. The trio jumped, hearts racing. \u201cWhat was that?\u201d Mia asked, her voice barely above a whisper. \n\nThey crept toward the noise, peering around a shelf. There, sprawled on the floor, was Eric\u2014the school\u2019s notorious prankster\u2014surrounded by a mess of books and papers. \u201cUh, hey guys,\u201d Eric said sheepishly, brushing dust off his jeans. \u201cJust doing some... research.\u201d\n\n\u201cWhat are you really up to, Eric?\u201d Mia asked, narrowing her eyes. \n\n\u201cI swear, just trying to find a book for my history project!\u201d he defended, his grin making it hard for Mia to stay mad.\n\n\u201cWe\u2019re on a treasure hunt,\u201d Leo said, crossing his arms. \u201cAnd we can\u2019t let you mess it up!\u201d\n\nEric\u2019s eyes sparkled with mischief. \u201cA treasure hunt, huh? Mind if I tag along? I\u2019m pretty good at solving puzzles.\u201d\n\nMia and Ava exchanged glances. Could they trust Eric? They needed all the help they could get, but there was no telling what he might do. \u201cFine,\u201d Mia said, finally relenting. \u201cBut you have to help us with the next clue.\u201d\n\nTogether, they scoured the library for more hints, their voices blending into the soft rustle of pages turning and whispers echoing off the walls. Each clue they deciphered brought them closer to the treasure, but with every solved riddle, the weight of the upcoming tests loomed larger.\n\nLater, as they caught their breath surrounded by books, Ava exclaimed, \u201cLook! The next clue is right here in this book!\u201d She pointed at a dusty old volume titled \"Legends of Westwood.\" \n\nMia felt a rush of excitement, but that quickly transformed into anxiety. \u201cWhat if we don\u2019t have time to study?\u201d she voiced her concern, biting her lip. \n\nLeo placed a reassuring hand on her shoulder. \u201cWe can balance this. We\u2019ll study after each clue. We\u2019ll find the treasure and ace our tests!\u201d His confidence sparked a sense of hope in Mia\u2019s heart.\n\nWith renewed determination, they dove into the book, ready to uncover the next step of their adventure. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2] \n\nThe clock ticked ominously, reminding them how little time they had left. The treasure wasn\u2019t the only prize at stake; they needed to succeed in their tests as well. As Mia turned the pages, she couldn\u2019t shake the feeling that the real treasure wasn\u2019t just gold or silver, but the friendship and memories they were creating along the way.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What was the main setting of this chapter?","options":["The playground","The library","The cafeteria","The gym"],"correct_answer":"The library"},{"question":"What did Mia and her friends find in the library?","options":["A treasure chest","An old book","A hidden door","A secret passage"],"correct_answer":"An old book"},{"question":"Who joins Mia, Leo, and Ava on their treasure hunt?","options":["Eric","Mr. Thompson","Ava's sister","The librarian"],"correct_answer":"Eric"},{"question":"What is the main conflict in this chapter?","options":["Finding the treasure","Preparing for tests","Trusting Eric","Studying in the library"],"correct_answer":"Preparing for tests"},{"question":"What lesson do Mia and her friends learn in this chapter?","options":["Treasure is more important than tests","Friendship is valuable","Studying is overrated","Secrets should be kept"],"correct_answer":"Friendship is valuable"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_291_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_291_ch5_img1.png","plot_291_ch5_img2.png","story_291_11-14_ch5_img1_1751268608.png","story_291_11-14_ch5_img2_1751268630.png"]},"word_count":731,"reading_level":"Builder"}
