   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_291_15_18","title":"The Great Test Treasure Hunt","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Test Stress","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Mia stood in the library, the scent of old books surrounding her like a comforting blanket. The afternoon sun poured through the tall windows, casting golden rays that illuminated the dust motes swirling in the air. She could almost hear the whispers of past students who had wandered through these aisles, their secrets intertwined with the pages of history. Excitement bubbled inside her as she unfolded the treasure map once more, the inked lines and cryptic symbols teasing her intellect. \n\n\u201cAlright, team,\u201d she said, glancing at Leo and Ava, who were seated across the ancient oak table, their expressions a mix of curiosity and skepticism. \u201cWe need to figure out the first clue.\u201d\n\nLeo adjusted his glasses, tapping away on his phone. \u201cIf I could just scan this map, maybe there\u2019s something in the metadata we can use.\u201d\n\nAva, flipping through a dusty book on cryptography, narrowed her eyes. \u201cI think it\u2019s more about the story behind the clues. Every treasure has a legend, right? This map must be connected to something in our school.\u201d\n\nMia felt a surge of hope. \u201cThen let\u2019s explore. We need to balance our study time, but we can\u2019t let this treasure slip away!\u201d\n\nThe next day, as the weight of impending exams loomed over them, Mia felt the tension in the air. Sitting in math class, she scribbled equations in her notebook, but her mind drifted to the map hidden beneath her desk. Her heart raced with the thought of what lay ahead.\n\nAt lunch, they huddled together, Leo\u2019s phone illuminating their faces with a blue glow as he navigated through the digital version of the map. \u201cThis first clue is supposed to take us to the playground near the old oak tree,\u201d he said, his voice a mere whisper amidst the cafeteria's chaos. \u201cBut we need to be careful. If we don\u2019t keep up with our studies, we could fail.\u201d\n\nAva nodded, her brow furrowed. \u201cExactly. I can\u2019t afford to let my grades slip. But how can we resist this adventure?\u201d\n\nMia felt torn, the thrill of the hunt battling against her fear of failure. \u201cWe can do both. We just have to be smart about it.\u201d\n\nThey agreed to meet after school, their hearts racing with anticipation. As they approached the playground, the sun hung low, casting long shadows across the grass. The oak tree stood majestic, its gnarled branches reaching out like welcoming arms. \n\n\u201cHere we are,\u201d Mia said, her voice laced with excitement. \u201cWhat\u2019s the first clue?\u201d\n\nLeo scanned the area, and his eyes widened. \u201cLook, over there!\u201d He pointed to a small, engraved plate embedded in the trunk of the tree, barely visible beneath the creeping vines. \n\nThey hurried over, brushing aside the foliage. A riddle was etched into the metal, its letters worn but legible. \u201cTo find what you seek, look where you play, beneath the bright lights, your treasure awaits at the end of the day.\u201d\n\nAva chewed her lip. \u201cThat sounds like the gym. But\u2026 isn\u2019t there a game tonight?\u201d\n\nMia\u2019s stomach dropped as the implications hit her. The gym would be filled with students, and they would have to sneak in unnoticed. \u201cWe can\u2019t let anyone see us,\u201d she whispered.\n\nSuddenly, they heard footsteps approaching, and Mia's heart raced. They ducked behind the oak tree just as a group of students passed by, laughing and chatting animatedly about the game. As they waited for them to leave, Mia felt a wave of frustration wash over her. The thrill of the treasure hunt was still present, but the pressure of exams weighed heavily on her conscience.\n\n\u201cOkay, we can do this,\u201d she said finally, determination creeping back into her voice. \u201cWe\u2019ll go after the game ends. It\u2019ll be quieter then.\u201d\n\nJust as they emerged from hiding, Mia felt a sharp pang of anxiety. Could they really do both? Would they be able to balance their treasure hunt with their studies? They stood there, the weight of their decision pressing down on them, uncertainty swirling in the air.\n\nAs they walked back, a sense of looming dread accompanied them, mingling with the excitement of the hunt. Mia knew the stakes had risen; they had to tread carefully, for one misstep could lead to failure, either in the search for treasure or their academic responsibilities.\n\nIn the distance, the school bell rang, echoing through the hallways like a siren, calling them back to reality. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nMia\u2019s heart raced as she glanced back at the playground, the oak tree silhouetted against the vibrant twilight sky. She could feel the weight of the treasure map in her pocket, a reminder of the adventure that awaited them but also a marker of the choices they had to make.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s meet here after school tomorrow,\u201d Leo suggested as they stepped back into the fluorescent glow of the school hallways. \u201cWe\u2019ll figure this out together.\u201d\n\nMia nodded, but deep down, she felt the tension mounting with each passing hour. The balance between the treasure hunt and their studies was a tightrope walk, and she feared that one slip could lead to a fall.\n\nAs she made her way home, the riddle played over and over in her mind, a persistent whisper reminding her of the treasure that lay ahead. But the growing pressure of the upcoming exams loomed like a dark cloud, overshadowing her excitement. Would they uncover the treasure before the tests took their toll?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Mia find in the library?","options":["A treasure map","An ancient book","A riddle","A history project"],"correct_answer":"A treasure map"},{"question":"What is the first clue about?","options":["A hidden treasure","A math problem","A riddle about the gym","A secret book"],"correct_answer":"A riddle about the gym"},{"question":"What dilemma do the characters face in this chapter?","options":["Whether to study for exams or go on a treasure hunt","Whether to tell their parents","How to keep the map safe","Where to find more clues"],"correct_answer":"Whether to study for exams or go on a treasure hunt"},{"question":"What do Mia and her friends plan to do after the game?","options":["Go home","Meet in the gym","Retrieve the treasure","Study together"],"correct_answer":"Retrieve the treasure"},{"question":"How does Mia feel about the treasure hunt and exams?","options":["Excited and carefree","Overwhelmed and anxious","Indifferent","Confident and relaxed"],"correct_answer":"Overwhelmed and anxious"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_291_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_291_ch2_img1.png","plot_291_ch2_img2.png","story_291_15-18_ch2_img1_1751268535.png","story_291_15-18_ch2_img2_1751268552.png"]},"word_count":922,"reading_level":"Challenger"}
