   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_291_15_18","title":"The Great Test Treasure Hunt","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Test Stress","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"As the golden morning sunlight streamed through the high windows of Crestwood Middle School, Mia sat on the steps of the library, her fingers tracing the edges of the now crumpled treasure map. The library was her sanctuary, a place where countless stories and secrets resided among the towering shelves of books. But today, it felt different. Today, it felt like the beginning of an adventure that could change everything. \n\n\u201cMia, are you sure you want to go through with this?\u201d Leo asked, his brow furrowed with concern as he perched beside her. His blue hoodie hung loosely around his slender frame, a stark contrast to his bright, inquisitive eyes. \u201cWe have finals next week. Shouldn\u2019t we focus on studying?\u201d\n\nMia sighed, knowing he had a point. \u201cI know, Leo, but this treasure hunt is more than just finding some hidden prize. It\u2019s about making memories, about breaking free from the pressure.\u201d She glanced towards the sprawling playground outside, where students were laughing and running, seemingly carefree. \u201cBesides, what if we can pull this off and still do well on our tests? We\u2019d be legends!\u201d\n\nAva appeared at the top of the steps, clutching a large, worn book that looked as if it had seen better centuries. \u201cI found some information about the great oak. It\u2019s older than the school itself, possibly a hundred years!\u201d Her excitement lit up her green eyes, a spark that ignited Mia\u2019s enthusiasm all over again.\n\n\u201cThen we need to start there,\u201d Mia declared, standing up and brushing off her jeans. \u201cLet\u2019s go!\u201d\n\nThe trio headed out, a palpable mix of exhilaration and anxiety hanging in the air. As they made their way to the playground, Mia\u2019s thoughts swirled. Would they be able to decipher the next clue and still make time for their studies? The balancing act felt daunting, the stakes higher than she had anticipated. \n\nThey reached the great oak, its gnarled branches reaching like ancient arms into the sky. Sunlight dappling through the leaves cast playful shadows on the ground. \u201cOkay, let\u2019s see what we can find,\u201d Mia said, her heart racing with both anticipation and fear.\n\nLeo pulled out his phone, firing up an app that could scan the area for hidden messages. \u201cThis should help us locate anything unusual,\u201d he said, tapping the screen. Just then, the device buzzed, and a little green dot appeared on the map. \u201cIt\u2019s picking up something!\u201d \n\nMia felt a rush of hope. \u201cLet\u2019s go check it out!\u201d\n\nThey moved to where the dot indicated, and to their surprise, a small metal box was half-buried beneath the roots of the oak. The treasure was real! As they unearthed the box, a mixture of triumph and anxiety washed over Mia. What if this discovery meant they would have to choose between this adventure and their studies?\n\n\u201cDo you think we should open it now?\u201d Ava asked, her voice barely above a whisper.\n\nMia hesitated. \u201cWhat if it\u2019s something that takes a lot of time to figure out? We need to be prepared for our tests.\u201d\n\n\u201cThen let\u2019s take it with us,\u201d Leo suggested. \u201cWe can study and work on this together. We can make it a study break!\u201d\n\nMia nodded, feeling a surge of determination. \u201cOkay, let\u2019s do that.\u201d\n\nThey opened the box together, revealing a collection of old coins and a new clue, beautifully handwritten on aged parchment. \u201cThe next clue is in the place where knowledge flows like a river,\u201d Ava read aloud. \u201cWhat do you think it means?\u201d\n\n\u201cA library,\u201d Mia said instantly. \u201cIt has to be\u2014the library is the heart of our school!\u201d\n\nThe three friends exchanged excited glances, a newfound resolve settling among them. They would go to the library, but first, they had to strategize their studying schedule. \u201cLet\u2019s meet here tomorrow morning, early before school,\u201d Mia proposed. \u201cThat way, we can tackle the next clue and still have time to study.\u201d\n\nJust then, a group of older students walked past, casting smirks in their direction. \u201cLook at those nerds, still on their treasure hunt. You\u2019re seriously going to fail your tests,\u201d one of them jeered.\n\nMia felt her heart sink. \u201cThey\u2019re right,\u201d she muttered, her confidence wavering. But Leo placed a reassuring hand on her shoulder. \u201cWe\u2019ll show them. Let\u2019s prove that we can do both!\u201d\n\nAs they walked back towards school, a sense of camaraderie bolstered their spirits. The treasure hunt had ignited a fire within them, and Mia knew they would keep pushing forward, balancing their passion with their responsibilities. \n\nBut deep down, she wondered if they could truly manage both the treasure and their exams\u2014or if they were setting themselves up for failure.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThe image captures the moment when Mia, Leo, and Ava stand in front of the grand oak, sunlight filtering through the leaves. Mia's expression is determined, with a hint of worry; Leo is focused on his phone, while Ava clutches her book tightly, eyes gleaming with excitement. The setting conveys a sense of adventure, imbued with the weight of their upcoming exams.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nThe image depicts the trio as they reach for the metal box nestled among the roots of the great oak. Their faces are a mix of anxious anticipation and thrill, the surroundings rich with earthy tones and dappled sunlight creating a magical atmosphere. The box itself is intricately detailed, hinting at the mysteries contained within, symbolizing both challenge and reward.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What is the main discovery made by Mia and her friends in this chapter?","options":["A treasure chest","A metal box with coins and a clue","A hidden library","An old map"],"correct_answer":"A metal box with coins and a clue"},{"question":"What does Mia want to balance with the treasure hunt?","options":["Her friendships","Her studies and upcoming tests","Her hobbies","Her family obligations"],"correct_answer":"Her studies and upcoming tests"},{"question":"How does Leo contribute to the group during their treasure hunt?","options":["By solving puzzles","By using technology to scan for hidden messages","By finding the treasure","By keeping the mood light"],"correct_answer":"By using technology to scan for hidden messages"},{"question":"What is Ava's role in the group?","options":["She is the mastermind of the hunt","She provides the clues","She is the bookworm with a knack for solving puzzles","She doubts their abilities"],"correct_answer":"She is the bookworm with a knack for solving puzzles"},{"question":"What emotion does Mia feel when older students mock them?","options":["Anger","Happiness","Worry","Indifference"],"correct_answer":"Worry"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_291_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_291_ch4_img1.png","plot_291_ch4_img2.png","story_291_15-18_ch4_img1_1751268468.png","story_291_15-18_ch4_img2_1751268482.png"]},"word_count":923,"reading_level":"Challenger"}
