   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_292_7_10","title":"The Test of Friendship","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Test Stress","chapter_number":1,"chapter_name":"Chapter 1","content":"Jaden strolled into the cozy study room, his backpack bouncing with each step. Colorful posters filled the walls, showing planets, animals, and funny quotes. He loved this place! His best friend, Leo, was already at their favorite table. Leo\u2019s books were neatly stacked, and his pencil was sharp and ready. \n\n\"Hey, Leo!\" Jaden called out, grinning. \u201cYou ready to ace this science test?\u201d\n\n\u201cOf course!\u201d Leo replied, adjusting his glasses. \u201cI have a study plan all set.\u201d\n\nJaden chuckled, \u201cA study plan? That sounds serious! I was thinking we could just quiz each other.\u201d\n\nLeo frowned. \u201cBut we need to focus! I made flashcards, and we should stick to them!\u201d\n\nJaden shrugged. \u201cFlashcards are boring! Let\u2019s have some fun.\u201d \n\nLeo sighed. \u201cFun won\u2019t help us if we don\u2019t pass!\u201d \n\nJust then, Ms. Wong walked in. She was their science teacher, always ready to help. \u201cGood afternoon, boys! Are you prepared for the big test?\u201d\n\n\u201cYep!\u201d Jaden said, giving a thumbs up. Leo nodded, but looked nervous. \n\nMs. Wong smiled. \u201cRemember, studying together can be helpful. Make sure to support each other.\u201d\n\nJaden rolled his eyes playfully. \u201cI\u2019ll support Leo, but he has to lighten up!\u201d\n\nLeo crossed his arms. \u201cAnd Jaden needs to focus!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nAs they began to study, Jaden tried to joke about the planets. \u201cWhat did Earth say to the other planets? \u2018You\u2019re all out of this world!\u2019\u201d He laughed, but Leo didn\u2019t smile.\n\n\u201cCome on, Jaden,\u201d Leo said, tapping his flashcards. \u201cWe need to learn facts, not tell jokes!\u201d\n\nJaden sat back, arms crossed. \u201cThis isn\u2019t fun at all. I bet we\u2019ll fail if we don\u2019t change things up!\u201d\n\nLeo\u2019s face turned serious. \u201cI don\u2019t want to fail. This is important!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, Jaden had an idea. \u201cHow about this? We can mix it! A fun quiz game with your cards. It\u2019ll be awesome!\u201d\n\nLeo\u2019s eyes sparkled. \u201cThat could work! But we need to follow my rules.\u201d\n\n\u201cDeal!\u201d Jaden replied, smiling again. They began to create their game, laughing while studying. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nBut just as they were getting into it, Jaden accidentally knocked over a stack of Leo\u2019s flashcards. They scattered across the table and fell to the floor.\n\n\u201cJaden!\u201d Leo shouted, his face turning red. \u201cYou have to be more careful!\u201d\n\nJaden felt a knot in his stomach. \u201cI\u2019m sorry, Leo! Let\u2019s fix this together.\u201d\n\nAs they gathered the cards, the tension hung in the air. Would they find a way to work together? Could their friendship survive this test?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Jaden want to do to study?","options":["Make flashcards","Have fun and joke","Read quietly","Write a story"],"correct_answer":"Have fun and joke"},{"question":"Who is their science teacher?","options":["Ms. Kim","Ms. Wong","Mr. Lee","Mrs. Smith"],"correct_answer":"Ms. Wong"},{"question":"How does Leo feel about Jaden's jokes?","options":["He loves them","He thinks they are funny","He doesn\u2019t smile","He wants to tell more"],"correct_answer":"He doesn\u2019t smile"},{"question":"What happens when Jaden knocks over the flashcards?","options":["They laugh","They start a game","They get upset","They give up"],"correct_answer":"They get upset"},{"question":"What do Jaden and Leo decide to do at the end of the chapter?","options":["Study separately","Make a fun quiz game","Give up studying","Ask Ms. Wong for help"],"correct_answer":"Make a fun quiz game"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_292_ch1_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_292_ch1_img1.png","plot_292_ch1_img2.png","story_292_7-10_ch1_img1_1751268400.png","story_292_7-10_ch1_img2_1751268421.png"]},"word_count":433,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
