   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_292_7_10","title":"The Test of Friendship","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Test Stress","chapter_number":2,"chapter_name":"Chapter 2","content":"Jaden and Leo sat side by side in the cozy study room. The walls were filled with colorful science posters. Other students were busy studying, but Jaden couldn\u2019t sit still. \n\n\u201cHey, Leo! How about we play a game instead?\u201d Jaden asked with a grin.\n\nLeo looked up, his brow furrowed. \u201cWe have to study, Jaden! The test is in three days!\u201d\n\n\u201cI know, I know,\u201d Jaden said, trying to keep the mood light. \u201cBut studying can be fun!\u201d\n\nLeo shook his head. \u201cFun is not what I need right now. I need to be organized!\u201d \n\nJust then, Ms. Wong walked into the room. She smiled, her glasses perched on her nose. \u201cGood afternoon, boys! How is studying going?\u201d\n\n\u201cGreat!\u201d Jaden said, raising his hand. \u201cI was just about to teach Leo how to have fun!\u201d\n\nMs. Wong chuckled. \u201cStudying can be fun, Jaden. But remember, you both have different styles. That\u2019s okay!\u201d\n\nJaden sighed. \u201cBut it\u2019s hard!\u201d\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cI\u2019m too serious,\u201d Leo said, crossing his arms. \u201cAnd you\u2019re too\u2026 silly!\u201d\n\nJaden\u2019s face lit up with a joke. \u201cI\u2019m like a joke book, and you\u2019re like an encyclopedia!\u201d \n\nLeo laughed despite himself. \u201cThat\u2019s true! But we need to focus.\u201d\n\nAs they tried to study again, Jaden suggested, \u201cLet\u2019s make a quiz! It can be silly!\u201d\n\n\u201cA silly quiz?\u201d Leo asked, raising an eyebrow. \u201cHow will that help?\u201d\n\n\u201cEasy! Quizzes make us remember things!\u201d Jaden replied.\n\n\u201cOkay, but let\u2019s do it my way,\u201d said Leo, pulling out his colorful study notes. \n\nSuddenly, their papers flew everywhere as a gust of wind blew through the open window! \n\n\u201cLook out!\u201d Leo shouted as they scrambled to catch the papers.\n\nJaden started tossing the papers back at Leo. \u201cCatch! It\u2019s a paper parade!\u201d\n\nLeo laughed, but then stopped. \u201cWait! We\u2019re going to lose our notes!\u201d\n\nThey both lunged for the last piece of paper, but Jaden slipped, falling into a pile of books. \n\n\u201cWhoa!\u201d he exclaimed, laughing.\n\nLeo shook his head, trying to be serious. \u201cWe need to work together, Jaden!\u201d\n\nJaden smiled. \u201cYou\u2019re right! Let\u2019s combine our styles.\u201d\n\nThey gathered their papers and settled down again. \u201cOkay, let\u2019s make a quiz! But this time, we mix facts with funny questions!\u201d Jaden suggested.\n\n\u201cDeal!\u201d Leo agreed, finally feeling excited.\n\nJust as they began, Ms. Wong came back into the room. \u201cBoys, are you on track?\u201d\n\n\u201cYes, Ms. Wong! We\u2019re figuring it out!\u201d Jaden said, giving Leo a thumbs up.\n\nBut then, Ms. Wong looked at the clock. \u201cJust a reminder, the science fair project is also due next week.\u201d\n\nJaden and Leo exchanged worried glances. \u201cWait, what?\u201d they said together. \n\nNow they had two big challenges to face!","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What do Jaden and Leo struggle with while studying?","options":["Too much fun","Different studying styles","Too many snacks","Not enough time"],"correct_answer":"Different studying styles"},{"question":"What does Jaden suggest to make studying more fun?","options":["A dance party","A silly quiz","Playing video games","Drawing pictures"],"correct_answer":"A silly quiz"},{"question":"What happens when the wind blows in the study room?","options":["They win a prize","Their papers fly everywhere","They take a break","They start singing"],"correct_answer":"Their papers fly everywhere"},{"question":"What do Jaden and Leo decide to do after the wind incident?","options":["Give up studying","Combine their studying styles","Play outside","Read comic books"],"correct_answer":"Combine their studying styles"},{"question":"What new challenge do Jaden and Leo face at the end of the chapter?","options":["A science fair project","A big test","A game night","A new school"],"correct_answer":"A science fair project"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_292_ch2_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_292_ch2_img1.png","plot_292_ch2_img2.png","story_292_7-10_ch2_img1_1751268372.png","story_292_7-10_ch2_img2_1751268386.png"]},"word_count":461,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
