   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_292_7_10","title":"The Test of Friendship","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Test Stress","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"Jaden and Leo sat in the cozy study room. The air buzzed with the sounds of students studying. Colorful posters of science facts decorated the walls. Jaden leaned back in his chair. \u201cThis test is going to be easy-peasy!\u201d he said with a grin. \n\nLeo frowned. \u201cEasy for you! I can\u2019t afford to mess this up!\u201d He pulled out his neatly organized notes. \u201cWe need to focus, Jaden!\u201d \n\nJaden rolled his eyes. \u201cRelax, Leo! We\u2019ve got this!\u201d \n\nJust then, Ms. Wong walked in. \u201cOkay, team! I want you all to work hard for the science fair.\u201d She smiled but then added, \u201cAnd remember, your test is just as important!\u201d \n\nJaden\u2019s heart sank. The science fair and the test? It felt like too much. He glanced at Leo\u2019s worried face. They had no time to argue anymore.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n\u201cLet\u2019s just study together!\u201d Leo suggested, looking serious. \n\n\u201cTogether?\u201d Jaden raised an eyebrow. \u201cYou mean my fun way?\u201d \n\n\u201cOr my organized way!\u201d Leo shot back. \n\nThey both stared at each other. \u201cWhat if we try mixing our styles?\u201d Jaden said. \u201cA little fun and a little order?\u201d\n\nLeo nodded, but his eyes were still darting around nervously. \u201cOkay. But no silly jokes!\u201d \n\nJaden took a deep breath. \u201cFine! Let\u2019s start with the human body. What do we need to know?\u201d \n\n\u201cI have a diagram!\u201d Leo exclaimed, pulling it out. \u201cAnd I have flashcards!\u201d \n\n\u201cWhoa, Leo! You\u2019re ready!\u201d Jaden chuckled. \u201cHow about I draw some funny cartoons to remember these?\u201d\n\nAs Jaden doodled a silly heart with legs, Leo giggled despite himself. \u201cIt looks like it\u2019s running to the doctor!\u201d \n\nBut then, the door swung open again. It was Ms. Wong. \u201cI hope you are not wasting time!\u201d \n\n\u201cUh-oh!\u201d Jaden whispered, quickly hiding his drawings. \n\nMs. Wong noticed Leo\u2019s flashcards. \u201cThese are excellent! But remember, teamwork is key.\u201d \n\nJaden felt the pressure building again. \u201cWhat if I can\u2019t remember anything?\u201d \n\nLeo looked serious. \u201cWe just need to focus. No more distractions.\u201d \n\nJaden sighed, \u201cOkay, okay.\u201d But as Leo turned back to his notes, Jaden felt a twist in his stomach. \n\nSuddenly, Leo\u2019s voice broke the silence. \u201cJaden, I need to tell you something\u2026 about the test.\u201d \n\n\u201cWhat is it?\u201d Jaden asked, his heart racing. \n\n\u201cI heard from Mia that there\u2019s a surprise question. And it might be about\u2026\u201d Leo hesitated. \u201cAbout our science fair project!\u201d\n\nJaden gasped. \u201cWait, the one we haven\u2019t even started?\u201d \n\nLeo nodded. \u201cWe have to decide now. Do we focus on the test, or do we dive into the project?\u201d \n\nJaden felt torn. \u201cI don\u2019t know! Can we do both?\u201d\n\nThe tension hung in the air. They had to make a choice, and time was running out.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What does Ms. Wong remind the students about?","options":["The science fair","The math test","The science test","The art project"],"correct_answer":"The science test"},{"question":"What study method does Jaden prefer?","options":["Fun and silly","Serious and organized","Flashcards","Diagrams"],"correct_answer":"Fun and silly"},{"question":"What does Leo say they need to work on together?","options":["The test","Their lunch","The science fair project","Their friendship"],"correct_answer":"The test"},{"question":"What surprise does Leo reveal?","options":["A surprise party","A surprise question on the test","A surprise snack","A surprise game"],"correct_answer":"A surprise question on the test"},{"question":"How does Jaden feel about studying?","options":["Excited","Bored","Stressed","Confused"],"correct_answer":"Excited"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_292_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_292_ch3_img1.png","plot_292_ch3_img2.png","story_292_7-10_ch3_img1_1751268332.png","story_292_7-10_ch3_img2_1751268348.png"]},"word_count":464,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
