   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_292_7_10","title":"The Test of Friendship","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Test Stress","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Jaden and Leo sat in the cozy study room. The walls were filled with colorful posters of planets and animals. Students buzzed around them, chatting and flipping through books. Jaden tossed a pencil in the air. \u201cHey, Leo! Want to try my way of studying today?\u201d\n\nLeo shook his head. \u201cNo way! We have to organize our notes first. Look at this mess!\u201d He pointed to the stack of papers on the table.\n\nJaden laughed. \u201cIt\u2019s not a mess; it\u2019s a creative chaos! Besides, we need to focus on the test.\u201d \n\nThey both paused. \u201cOkay, let\u2019s find a middle ground,\u201d Leo said, adjusting his glasses. \n\n\u201cHow about this?\u201d Jaden suggested. \u201cWe can make flashcards together, but I get to pick the colors!\u201d \n\n\u201cFine! But, I want to write down all the facts on them,\u201d Leo replied, smiling a little. \n\nThey grabbed colorful markers and started working together. Jaden made a bright green card for \u201cPhotosynthesis,\u201d and Leo carefully wrote down the definition. \n\n\u201cThis is fun!\u201d Jaden said, giggling as he added a doodle of a plant. \u201cLook, it\u2019s a happy plant!\u201d\n\nLeo chuckled. \u201cOkay, I admit it\u2019s not bad. But we still need to analyze the project details.\u201d\n\nJust then, Ms. Wong walked in. \u201cBoys, how\u2019s the studying going?\u201d she asked with a warm smile. \n\n\u201cWe\u2019re blending our styles, Ms. Wong!\u201d Jaden announced proudly.\n\n\u201cThat\u2019s great to hear! Remember, teamwork is key,\u201d she said, giving them a thumbs-up. \n\nFeeling encouraged, they continued. \u201cLet\u2019s make a card for our project too!\u201d Jaden said. Leo agreed, \u201cThat will help us for both the test and the project.\u201d\n\nThe two friends worked side by side. They laughed, sharing silly jokes and creating cards that were bright and fun. Their friendship began to feel strong again. \n\nSuddenly, Jaden shouted, \u201cI just thought of a great idea! We could make a poster for the project!\u201d\n\n\u201cWe can use our flashcards to help!\u201d Leo replied, his eyes sparkling. \n\nThey started brainstorming ideas for the poster. \u201cWhat if we make it a giant tree with all the steps of photosynthesis?\u201d Jaden suggested. \n\n\u201cYes! We can hang it in class for everyone to see!\u201d Leo said excitedly.\n\nWith a plan in place, they both felt hopeful. As they cleaned up, Jaden smiled. \u201cI\u2019m glad we\u2019re back on track.\u201d \n\n\u201cMe too, buddy. We just needed to listen to each other,\u201d Leo responded, patting Jaden on the back.\n\nAs they left the study room, they were ready for the test and their project. They realized that perhaps, the real test was their friendship.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Jaden want to try during their study session?","options":["Organizing notes","Making flashcards","Reading a book","Tossing pencils"],"correct_answer":"Making flashcards"},{"question":"What did Leo write on the flashcards?","options":["Doodles","Definitions","Jokes","Tests"],"correct_answer":"Definitions"},{"question":"How did Ms. Wong feel about their studying?","options":["She was angry","She was confused","She was supportive","She was sleepy"],"correct_answer":"She was supportive"},{"question":"What idea did Jaden have for their project?","options":["A giant tree","A flying rocket","A colorful poster","A science book"],"correct_answer":"A giant tree"},{"question":"What was the real test for Jaden and Leo?","options":["Their science test","Their friendship","Their project","Their study methods"],"correct_answer":"Their friendship"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_292_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_292_ch4_img1.png","plot_292_ch4_img2.png","story_292_7-10_ch4_img1_1751268295.png","story_292_7-10_ch4_img2_1751268316.png"]},"word_count":438,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
