   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_292_7_10","title":"The Test of Friendship","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Test Stress","chapter_number":5,"chapter_name":"Chapter 5","content":"Jaden and Leo sat at a big table in the study room. Colorful posters of science facts covered the walls. Other students were busy learning. Jaden leaned back in his chair. \"Why do we need to study? The test is just a piece of paper!\" \n\nLeo frowned. \u201cIt\u2019s not just a piece of paper! We have to do well!\u201d He spread out their flashcards all over the table. \n\nJaden chuckled, \u201cOkay, Mr. Perfect! Let\u2019s make studying fun!\u201d \n\nThey decided to combine their styles. Jaden grabbed a bright red marker. \u201cLet\u2019s draw pictures on these cards! It will help us remember!\u201d \n\nLeo smiled a little. \u201cThat could work. But we should also write important facts.\u201d \n\nAs they worked, Jaden doodled silly drawings of a dancing plant cell. \u201cLook, Leo! This plant cell loves to dance!\u201d \n\nLeo giggled. \u201cThat\u2019s funny! But don\u2019t forget about the mitochondria!\u201d \n\nSuddenly, Ms. Wong walked by. She stopped and looked at their cards. \u201cThis is wonderful teamwork, Jaden and Leo! Keep it up!\u201d \n\nJaden felt proud. \u201cThanks, Ms. Wong! We\u2019re working together!\u201d \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\nThey continued studying, mixing fun with learning. Leo focused on the words, while Jaden added colorful doodles. They shared jokes and laughed. \n\n\u201cWhy did the mushroom go to the party?\u201d Jaden asked. \n\n\u201cWhy?\u201d Leo replied, curious. \n\n\u201cBecause he was a fungi!\u201d Jaden said, bursting into laughter. \n\nLeo shook his head, smiling. \u201cThat was terrible, but funny!\u201d \n\nAs they finished their flashcards, Leo looked at their colorful poster. \u201cWe did it, Jaden! We mixed our styles!\u201d \n\nJaden nodded. \u201cYeah! And it was fun! I really like how we worked together.\u201d \n\nJust then, Leo\u2019s eyes lit up. \u201cLet\u2019s practice explaining everything! You go first!\u201d \n\nJaden took a deep breath. He began to explain the photosynthesis process. He used hand gestures and his silly drawings to help Leo understand. \n\nLeo listened carefully and smiled. \u201cYou made it easy to follow! Now, my turn!\u201d \n\nThey practiced back and forth, supporting each other. By the time the sun started to set, they felt ready for the test. \n\n\u201cI think we can do this!\u201d Jaden said, feeling excited. \n\nLeo grinned widely. \u201cMe too! We\u2019re going to ace it together!\u201d \n\nTheir friendship felt stronger, too. They learned that working together was even better than studying alone. \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s promise to always help each other,\u201d Leo said. \n\n\u201cDeal!\u201d Jaden replied, holding out his pinky. They linked pinkies and burst into laughter, feeling proud of their teamwork.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\nAs they packed up their things, they both knew one thing: friendship was the best study tool.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Jaden and Leo do to study?","options":["They played video games.","They made flashcards and a poster.","They took a nap.","They watched a movie."],"correct_answer":"They made flashcards and a poster."},{"question":"Who encouraged Jaden and Leo while they studied?","options":["Ms. Wong","Mr. Smith","Their parents","No one"],"correct_answer":"Ms. Wong"},{"question":"What was one of Jaden's silly drawings?","options":["A dancing plant cell","A flying car","A swimming fish","A talking dog"],"correct_answer":"A dancing plant cell"},{"question":"What promise did Jaden and Leo make at the end of the chapter?","options":["To always help each other","To never study again","To play more games","To keep secrets"],"correct_answer":"To always help each other"},{"question":"What did they learn about studying together?","options":["It\u2019s more fun and helpful","It\u2019s boring","It\u2019s too hard","It doesn\u2019t work"],"correct_answer":"It\u2019s more fun and helpful"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_292_ch5_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_292_ch5_img1.png","plot_292_ch5_img2.png","story_292_7-10_ch5_img1_1751268260.png","story_292_7-10_ch5_img2_1751268275.png"]},"word_count":433,"reading_level":"Explorer"}
