   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_292_11_14","title":"The Test of Friendship","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Test Stress","chapter_number":3,"chapter_name":"Chapter 3","content":"The study room buzzed with anticipation as Jaden sat at a table stacked high with textbooks and loose papers. Colorful science posters adorned the walls, but his focus drifted as he watched Leo meticulously organize his notes across from him. Jaden\u2019s fingertips tapped unwittingly against the table, a rhythmic echo of his impatience. \n\n\u201cWhy do you have to make everything so complicated?\u201d Jaden quipped, trying to inject some humor into the tense air. \u201cIt\u2019s just science, not rocket science!\u201d\n\nLeo shot him a look that was equal parts irritation and disbelief. \u201cIt\u2019s all about understanding the concepts, Jaden! If you just wing it, you\u2019ll blow it.\u201d\n\nJaden rolled his eyes, leaning back in his chair, the wood creaking beneath him. \u201cRelax! You\u2019re going to stress yourself into a science black hole.\u201d\n\nMs. Wong\u2019s sharp voice cut through their bickering like a scalpel. \u201cBoys!\u201d Her presence, while supportive, held a strictness that made their banter feel childish. \u201cFocus! You have three days until the test. Remember, you\u2019ll be working as a team.\u201d\n\nJaden exchanged a glance with Leo; the tension between them crackled like static electricity. They had been inseparable since kindergarten, but now they seemed more like rivals than friends.\n\nAs the hours passed, the air thickened with frustration. Jaden stood to pace, the weight of impending failure pressing down on him. He glanced at Leo, who was furiously scribbling diagrams, lost in a world of calculations. \n\n\u201cLeo, we need to actually study together. Your notes are great, but I can\u2019t even follow half of this!\u201d Jaden exclaimed, frustration bubbling over.\n\nLeo\u2019s face flushed with indignation. \u201cMaybe if you took things seriously, I wouldn\u2019t have to turn my notes into a treasure map for you!\u201d\n\nTheir voices rose, drawing the attention of the students around them. Jaden clenched his fists, feeling the sting of betrayal in Leo\u2019s words. \u201cYou\u2019re missing the point! It\u2019s about teamwork, not perfection!\u201d\n\nSuddenly, Ms. Wong approached, her expression a mixture of concern and authority. \u201cWhat\u2019s going on here?\u201d she asked, folding her arms. The other students paused to listen, eyes darting between the boys.\n\n\u201cNothing, Ms. Wong. Just a little disagreement,\u201d Leo replied, his voice tight.\n\n\u201cDisagreement or not, I expect you both to support each other,\u201d she said softly. \u201cFriendship means lifting each other up, not tearing each other down. Now, I want you two to take a break and think about how to approach this together.\u201d\n\nAs Ms. Wong walked away, Jaden felt a knot tightening in his chest. Was their friendship really worth risking over one science test? He didn\u2019t want to lose Leo, but how could he bridge the gap between their study methods?\n\n\u201cI\u2019m sorry,\u201d Jaden mumbled, surprising even himself. \u201cI didn\u2019t mean to...\u201d\n\nLeo\u2019s expression softened, but it was short-lived. \u201cI just want to do well, Jaden. I can\u2019t afford to fail.\u201d\n\nJaden nodded; he understood the pressure. \u201cMe too. Maybe we can blend our styles? I mean, I could use a little more structure.\u201d\n\n\u201cOkay,\u201d Leo said hesitantly, his brows furrowing as if he were weighing the options. \u201cBut you have to promise to stop joking about everything. This is serious.\u201d\n\nJust then, a loud crash echoed from behind the bookshelves, startling both boys. They turned to see a group of students frantically gathering spilled supplies, but Jaden\u2019s heart raced for another reason. What if something important had just fallen? \n\n\u201cLet\u2019s check it out,\u201d Jaden suggested, suddenly curious.\n\nThey edged closer, but as they did, Leo whispered, \u201cWhat if it\u2019s something we need for the test?\u201d\n\n\u201cThen we\u2019ll figure it out,\u201d Jaden replied, bracing himself for whatever mystery lay ahead. \n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] would depict Jaden and Leo in the vibrant study room, surrounded by colorful science posters, with Jaden looking relaxed and joking while Leo appears focused and determined, surrounded by neatly organized notes and textbooks.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2]\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2] would capture the moment of tension as Jaden and Leo stand at the edge of the group of students who have spilled their supplies. The expressions on their faces should convey a mix of curiosity and concern as they lean in to see what happened.","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What contrasts Jaden and Leo in their study methods?","options":["Jaden is organized while Leo is chaotic","Jaden is laid-back while Leo is meticulous","Jaden is serious while Leo is relaxed","Jaden is focused while Leo is distracted"],"correct_answer":"Jaden is laid-back while Leo is meticulous"},{"question":"What does Ms. Wong remind Jaden and Leo about friendship?","options":["Friendship is about competition","Friendship means trusting each other","Friendship means lifting each other up","Friendship is secondary to grades"],"correct_answer":"Friendship means lifting each other up"},{"question":"What incident occurs in the study room?","options":["A fight breaks out","Books fall from the shelf","Supplies spill on the floor","A student faints"],"correct_answer":"Supplies spill on the floor"},{"question":"How does Jaden feel about the possibility of failing the test?","options":["He is indifferent","He is overly confident","He is anxious and pressured","He is excited"],"correct_answer":"He is anxious and pressured"},{"question":"What do Jaden and Leo decide to do at the end of the chapter?","options":["Continue studying separately","Check out the noise from the supplies","Argue more about their methods","Leave the study room"],"correct_answer":"Check out the noise from the supplies"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_292_ch3_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_292_ch3_img1.png","plot_292_ch3_img2.png","story_292_11-14_ch3_img1_1751268158.png","story_292_11-14_ch3_img2_1751268173.png"]},"word_count":712,"reading_level":"Builder"}
