   [DEBUG] 📸 Book data: {"book_id":"school_life_292_11_14","title":"The Test of Friendship","genre":"School Life","sub_genre":"Test Stress","chapter_number":4,"chapter_name":"Chapter 4","content":"Jaden stepped into the study room, the familiar scent of fresh paper and markers wrapping around him like a cozy blanket. The walls, adorned with vibrant science posters, felt alive with the hum of students preparing for their big test. He spotted Leo at their usual table, meticulously laying out his color-coded notes. Jaden couldn\u2019t help but grin. Leo looked like a general preparing for battle, and as much as he loved his best friend, he knew this wasn\u2019t going to be easy.\n\n\u201cReady to crush this test?\u201d Jaden called out, his tone light, trying to peel away the tension that still hung between them like a dense fog. Leo glanced up, his brows furrowing as he adjusted his glasses.\n\n\u201cI don\u2019t know, Jaden. Are you ready to actually study this time?\u201d Leo replied, his voice laced with a mix of concern and frustration.\n\nJaden rolled his eyes, but his heart sank a little. He didn\u2019t want to argue again. \u201cCome on, I can still do it my way! I can make it fun! Remember the physics project? We got an A because I made that model of the solar system with all the planets made of balloons!\u201d\n\nLeo sighed, opening his folder with a sigh. \u201cThat was different. This test is serious. We need to focus more on the concepts than just making jokes.\u201d\n\nAs they began reviewing the material, Jaden noticed out of the corner of his eye that another group in the room was huddled around a strange contraption with flashing lights. Curiosity piqued, he leaned over to Leo. \u201cHey, do you think they\u2019re building a time machine or something?\u201d\n\n\u201cI doubt it,\u201d Leo muttered, scribbling down notes. \u201cFocus, Jaden.\u201d\n\nJust then, a loud bang echoed from the other side of the room, drawing everyone\u2019s attention. [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_1] A cloud of colorful smoke suddenly erupted, filling the air with a haze of purple and green. Students gasped and started to laugh nervously. Jaden\u2019s eyes widened, excitement bubbling up in his chest. This was the kind of distraction he loved.\n\n\u201cOkay, maybe we could take a short break?\u201d Jaden suggested, grinning at Leo, who looked utterly bewildered. \n\n\u201cDo you think this is some kind of experiment gone wrong?\u201d Leo asked, his eyes now sparkling with curiosity. \n\n\u201cOnly one way to find out!\u201d Jaden declared, and before Leo could protest, he was pulling him toward the commotion.\n\nAs they approached the group, they overheard snippets of chatter. \u201cI didn\u2019t think it would explode!\u201d and \u201cLook at the colors!\u201d filled the air. Jaden felt a surge of camaraderie with the other students, an unexpected reminder that everyone was feeling the pressure of the test.\n\n\u201cI think they\u2019re using some kind of chemical reaction,\u201d Leo mused, peering through the crowd. \u201cIf we could somehow understand how they did that, maybe we could relate it back to our study material.\u201d\n\nJaden\u2019s eyes lit up. \u201cSee, that\u2019s the spirit! If we can figure this out, it could help us with the test. Plus, it might be fun!\u201d\n\nThey squeezed through the crowd and found themselves in front of a group of classmates gathered around a table covered in bubbling beakers and scribbled notes. Leo\u2019s analytical mind kicked into gear, and he began asking questions. Jaden couldn\u2019t help but feel that their friendship was starting to shift back into a more comfortable rhythm.\n\nAfter a while, as they pieced together the experiment, Jaden felt a sense of hope blossoming between them. Maybe they could strike a balance between fun and focus. Leo even cracked a smile, and Jaden chuckled. \u201cWho knew chemistry could be this explosive?\u201d\n\nAs the laughter faded, Leo nudged Jaden. \u201cLet\u2019s get back to our study. Maybe we can incorporate some of this into our review.\u201d\n\n\u201cDeal,\u201d Jaden replied, feeling lighter than he had all week. They turned to head back when Leo suddenly stopped. \u201cWait! What if we combined our study styles? I can teach you the concepts, and you can make it engaging. Like a science comedy show!\u201d\n\nJaden laughed, excitement bubbling in his chest. \u201cThe Science Showdown it is! Let\u2019s make it a blast!\u201d \n\nAs they returned to their table, the tension that had clouded their friendship began to dissolve. They were two best friends, ready to tackle the test together, one joke at a time.\n\n[IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER_2] \n\nBut as they settled back down, a shadow flickered through the corner of Jaden\u2019s eye, a glimpse of something not quite right. He turned sharply, but nothing was there. A chill crept up his spine\u2014was there more to this day than just studying and laughter?","quiz":{"questions":[{"question":"What did Jaden and Leo discover in the study room?","options":["A new study method","A chaotic science experiment","A hidden classroom","A time machine"],"correct_answer":"A chaotic science experiment"},{"question":"How does Jaden attempt to lighten the mood with Leo?","options":["By telling jokes","By arguing","By studying harder","By ignoring him"],"correct_answer":"By telling jokes"},{"question":"What idea do Jaden and Leo come up with for studying?","options":["A science comedy show","A study group","An online quiz","A science fair project"],"correct_answer":"A science comedy show"},{"question":"What emotion does Jaden feel when they work together on the experiment?","options":["Frustration","Hope","Anger","Sadness"],"correct_answer":"Hope"},{"question":"What does Jaden notice that brings a sense of mystery at the end of the chapter?","options":["A strange sound","A flicker of shadow","A new student","An unexpected visitor"],"correct_answer":"A flicker of shadow"}]},"images":{"chapter_cover":"plot_292_ch4_img1.png","illustrations":["plot_292_ch4_img1.png","plot_292_ch4_img2.png","story_292_11-14_ch4_img1_1751268120.png","story_292_11-14_ch4_img2_1751268142.png"]},"word_count":782,"reading_level":"Builder"}
